#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The tethering view allows you to capture images directly into darktable from a connected camera.\n"
msgstr "ໂໝດ tethering ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຖ່າຍຮູບຈາກກ້ອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ ລົງໃນ darktable ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use the tethering feature you first need to connect your camera to your PC using a USB cable. Your computer might ask to mount or view the connected camera. _Do not mount or view the camera_. If your camera is mounted or viewed automatically, you will need to “unmount/eject” the camera before darktable can access it. This unlocks the camera so that darktable can take control of it -- darktable will then re-lock the camera so that it cannot be used by other applications.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖ່າຍຮູບ (tethering), ທຳອິດທ່ານຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານກັບ PC ດ້ວຍສາຍ "
"USB. ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານອາດຈະຖາມເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ (mount) ຫຼື ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໃນກ້ອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. _ຫ້າມຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ເບິ່ງ"
"ຂໍ້ມູນໃນກ້ອງ_. ຖ້າກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງ “ຖອດການຕິດຕັ້ງ/ເອົາອອ"
"ກ (unmount/eject)” ກ້ອງກ່ອນທີ່ darktable ຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງມັນໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປົດລັອກກ້ອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ "
"darktable ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມມັນໄດ້ -- ຈາກນັ້ນ darktable ຈະລັອກກ້ອງຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໃຊ້ງາ"
"ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the USB cable is connected, go to the [import](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md) module in the [lighttable](../lighttable/_index.md) view. If your camera is available for use, a new section should appear in the import module containing the name of your camera and a \"mount camera\" button. Click this button to connect your camera and three additional buttons will appear: “copy & import from camera”, “tethered shoot” and \"unmount camera\". Click “tethered shoot” to enter the tethering view. When you are finished, press the \"unmount camera\" button before physically disconnecting it.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼັງຈາກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສາຍ USB ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໂມດູນ [ນຳເຂົ້າ](../module-reference/utility-modules/"
"lighttable/import.md) ໃນໜ້າ [ແຜງຮູບ (lighttable)](../lighttable/_index.md). ຖ້າກ້"
"ອງຂອງທ່ານພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະມີສ່ວນໃໝ່ປາກົດຂຶ້ນໃນໂມດູນນຳເຂົ້າ ເຊິ່ງມີຊື່ກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ປຸ່ມ \"ຕິດຕັ້ງກ້ອງ "
"(mount camera)\". ຄລິກປຸ່ມນີ້ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ້ອງ ແລະ ຈະມີສາມປຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມປາກົດຂຶ້ນ: “ສຳເນົາ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້"
"າຈາກກ້ອງ”, “ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖ່າຍຮູບ (tethered shoot)” ແລະ \"ຖອດການຕິດຕັ້ງກ້ອງ (unmount camera)"
"\". ຄລິກ “ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖ່າຍຮູບ (tethered shoot)” ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ໜ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖ່າຍຮູບ. ເມື່ອທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້"
"ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ \"ຖອດການຕິດຕັ້ງກ້ອງ (unmount camera)\" ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖອດສາຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອອກແທ້ໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable uses [gphoto2](https://github.com/gphoto/gphoto2) to interface with your camera. If you have problems finding the connected camera as described above, check the [troubleshooting](./troubleshooting.md) section in this chapter to verify that your camera has tethering support.\n"
msgstr "darktable ໃຊ້ [gphoto2](https://github.com/gphoto/gphoto2) ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບກ້ອງ. ຖ້າພົບບັນຫາ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງພາກ [ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ](./troubleshooting.md) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບຫຼືບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the center view, images are shown while you capture them. You can capture an image by either using darktable's user interface or by manually triggering a capture with your camera. If you are using Live View the image will be shown in darktable's center view.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບທີ່ຖ່າຍຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກາງໜ້າຈໍ. ທ່ານສາມາດກົດຖ່າຍຈາກໜ້າຈໍ darktable ຫຼື ກົດຈາກກ້ອງໂດຍກົງກໍໄດ້. ຖ້າເປີດ Live View, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນພາບເຄື່ອນໄຫວຈາກກ້ອງໃນໜ້າຈໍ darktable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When entering tethering view, a film roll will be created using the same structure as defined for camera import (see [preferences > import > session options](../preferences-settings/import.md)). The job code will be predefined as “capture”.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖ່າຍຮູບ, ມ້ວນຟິມຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ໂຄງສ້າງດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບການນຳເຂົ້າກ້ອງ "
"(ເບິ່ງ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ນຳເຂົ້າ > ຕົວເລືອກເຊດຊັນ](../preferences-settings/import.md)). ລະຫັ"
"ດວຽກ (job code) ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເປັນ “capture”.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to group your captures into different film rolls, you should use the [session](../module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md) module in the right-hand panel to set a different job code. When entering a new name and pressing Enter, a new film roll will be created and newly-captured images will be added into this new film roll.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າຕ້ອງການແຍກຮູບເປັນຫຼາຍມ້ວນຟິມ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ເຊດຊັນ (session)](../module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md) ຢູ່ແຖບດ້ານຂວາ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຊື່ວຽກໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable provides some useful tools to set up an image capture in the user interface. You can set up timelapse captures, brackets for HDR and even sequential captures of bracketed images. For more information read the documentation on the [camera settings](../module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/camera-settings.md) module and the [examples](./examples.md) later in this chapter.\n"
msgstr "darktable ມີເຄື່ອງມືຫຼາຍຢ່າງສຳລັບການຖ່າຍຮູບ ເຊັ່ນ ໄທມ໌ແລບ ຫຼື ການຖ່າຍແບບຄ່ອມແສງ (bracketing) ສຳລັບ HDR.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#: content/special-topics/ai/performance-and-troubleshooting.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "troubleshooting"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This troubleshooting guide can be used to verify whether or not your camera can be used with tethering. This is done using the same ([gphoto2](https://github.com/gphoto/gphoto2)) tool that darktable uses to interface with your camera.\n"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອທົດສອບວ່າກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານຮອງຮັບການຖ່າຍຮູບຜ່ານສາຍຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື gphoto2.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you start, you first need to find your camera port name. Usually the port \"`usb:`\" is sufficient and is therefore used in the following guide.\n"
msgstr "ກ່ອນອື່ນ ທ່ານຕ້ອງຮູ້ຊື່ພອດ (port) ຂອງກ້ອງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວການໃຊ້ \"`usb:`\" ກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "is your camera detected?"
msgstr "ກວດພົບກ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following command will verify that your camera is connected to the computer and detected by gphoto2. \n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າກ້ອງຖືກກວດພົບໂດຍ gphoto2 ຫຼື ບໍ່. \n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "env LANG=C gphoto2 --auto-detect\n"
msgstr "env LANG=C gphoto2 --auto-detect\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "check the camera's driver abilities"
msgstr "ກວດສອບຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໄດຣເວີກ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute the following command and ensure that the \"capture choices\" ability supports “Image” and configuration support is “yes” -- darktable will check these two abilities to decide whether to show the “tethered shoot” button.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ແລະ ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຄວາມສາມາດ \"capture choices\" ຮອງຮັບ “Image” ແລ"
"ະ ການຮອງຮັບການກຳນົດຄ່າແມ່ນ “yes” -- darktable ຈະກວດສອບຄວາມສາມາດທັງສອງຢ່າງນີ້ເພື່ອຕັດສິນໃຈ"
"ວ່າຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມ “ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຖ່າຍຮູບ (tethered shoot)” ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "env LANG=C gphoto2 --port usb: --abilities\n"
msgstr "env LANG=C gphoto2 --port usb: --abilities\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "remote capture"
msgstr "ການສັ່ງຖ່າຍຮູບຈາກໄລຍະໄກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This step will verify that your camera can be remotely controlled -- i.e. that it can capture an image, download it to your computer and display it within darktable.\n"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະທົດສອບວ່າສາມາດສັ່ງໃຫ້ກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ ແລະ ສົ່ງໄຟລ໌ລົງຄອມພິວເຕີໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "env LANG=C gphoto2 --port usb: --capture-image-and-download\n"
msgstr "env LANG=C gphoto2 --port usb: --capture-image-and-download\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tethered capture"
msgstr "ການຖ່າຍຮູບແບບ tethered"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This last step tests if your camera supports \"events\", are heavily used by darktable. Running this command will make the gphoto2 process wait for an image capture event which you must manually trigger on your camera. If successful, the image will be downloaded to your computer.\n"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນການທົດສອບ \"events\". ເມື່ອພິມຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ແລ້ວ ໃຫ້ທ່ານກົດຖ່າຍຮູບຈາກກ້ອງ ຖ້າສຳເລັດ ຮູບຈະຖືກດາວໂຫລດລົງຄອມພິວເຕີທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "env LANG=C gphoto2 --port usb: --capture-tethered\n"
msgstr "env LANG=C gphoto2 --port usb: --capture-tethered\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "now what?"
msgstr "ແລ້ວເຮັດຫຍັງຕໍ່?"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If any of the above steps failed, there are problems with your specific camera and driver. Please file an issue on the [gphoto2 github page](https://github.com/gphoto/gphoto2/issues). Add the following flags to the failed command for better support and attach the log output to your issue:\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າຂັ້ນຕອນໃດໜຶ່ງຜິດພາດ, ສະແດງວ່າມີບັນຫາກັບກ້ອງ ຫຼື ໄດຣເວີ. ໃຫ້ແຈ້ງບັນຫາທີ່ GitHub ຂອງ gphoto2.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "--debug --debug-file gphoto2_debug.log\n"
msgstr "--debug --debug-file gphoto2_debug.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you successfully completed all of the above tests, your camera is probably supported by darktable. If these tests were successful but you nevertheless stumble upon a problem in darktable, please file an issue on the [darktable github page](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/issues). Please attach the log output from the commands above and the log file output produced by starting darktable with the following command:\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງຜ່ານໝົດ ແຕ່ darktable ຍັງໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້, ໃຫ້ແຈ້ງບັນຫາທີ່ GitHub ຂອງ darktable ພ້ອມແນບບັນທຶກຂໍ້ຄວາມ (log) ຈາກຄຳສັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/tethering/troubleshooting.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable -d camctl 2>&1 >camctl.log\n"
msgstr "darktable -d camctl 2>&1 >camctl.log\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/tethering/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tethering"
msgstr "ການຖ່າຍຮູບຜ່ານສາຍ (Tethering)"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following sections show two typical use cases for the tethering view.\n"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ 2 ກໍລະນີຕົວຢ່າງໃນການໃຊ້ງານໂໝດ tethering.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "studio setup with screening"
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງໃນສະຕູດິໂອພ້ອມການສະແດງພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is a pretty common use case. You have your studio and subject set up, the camera is connected to your computer and tethering view is active in darktable. You work at the camera and take images. Whenever you like, you can review the images directly on your computer monitor instead of using the camera LCD.\n"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີໃຊ້ທີ່ພົບໄດ້ທົ່ວໄປ. ທ່ານຈັດສະຕູດິໂອ ແລະ ຕົວແບບໄວ້, ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ້ອງກັບຄອມພິວເຕີ ແລ້ວເປີດໂໝດ tethering ໃນ darktable. ເມື່ອທ່ານກົດຖ່າຍຮູບ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດເບິ່ງຮູບໄດ້ທັນທີ ຜ່ານຈໍຄອມພິວເຕີ ແທນທີ່ຈະເບິ່ງຜ່ານຈໍ LCD ນ້ອຍໆຂອງກ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This workflow is efficient and effective, since you can immediately review your captures instead of waiting until after the shoot when everyone is gone. If you're shooting with a model this is a nice way to preview the captures with the client instead of fumbling around with your camera.\n"
msgstr "ວິທີການນີ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍ ເພາະທ່ານສາມາດກວດເບິ່ງພາບໄດ້ທັນທີ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າຈົນຈົບການຖ່າຍ. ຖ້າທ່ານຖ່າຍພາບຕົວແບບ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າເຫັນພາບຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Working in the tethering view can save you time and aggravation. Set a [session](../module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md) name, shoot your images, and they will be saved to the correct film roll for the session, for easy on-site review. \n"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ tethering ຊ່ວຍປະຢັດເວລາໄດ້ຫຼາຍ. ພຽງແຕ່ຕັ້ງຊື່ [ເຊດຊັນ (session)](../module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md), ແລ້ວຮູບທີ່ຖ່າຍຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນມ້ວນຟິມທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເຮັດໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງພາບໄດ້ງ່າຍ. \n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "capturing a timelapse"
msgstr "ການຖ່າຍພາບໄທມ໌ແລບ (timelapse)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A timelapse is a video clip composed of images taken in a timed sequence. A typical example is to take a timelapse of a cityscape to capture the movement of the clouds and traffic etc.\n"
msgstr "ໄທມ໌ແລບ ແມ່ນວິດີໂອທີ່ສ້າງມາຈາກຮູບພາບທີ່ຖ່າຍຕໍ່ເນື່ອງກັນຕາມຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍແມ່ນການຖ່າຍພາບເມືອງເພື່ອເບິ່ງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງກ້ອນເມກ ຫຼື ການຈະລາຈອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set up a timelapse capture, create a new [session](../module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md). Now decide whether you want to shoot in manual or auto mode. It is recommended that you only use auto mode in situations where the ambient light will change significantly during the time of the shoot, for example, when shooting a timelapse over 24 hours.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຖ່າຍໄທມ໌ແລບ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ [ເຊດຊັນ (session)](../module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md) ໃໝ່. ເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະຖ່າຍແບບ manual ຫຼື auto. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດ auto ສະເພາະຕອນທີ່ແສງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍ ເຊັ່ນ ການຖ່າຍຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຕະຫຼອດ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [camera settings](../module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/camera-settings.md) module can be used to define the delay (the number of seconds between capture) and sequence (the number of images to capture) of your timelapse.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າກ້ອງ](../module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/camera-settings.md) ເພື່ອກຳນົດ ໄລຍະຫ່າງ (ວິນາທີລະຫວ່າງການຖ່າຍ) ແລະ ຈຳນວນຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະຖ່າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To start the timelapse click the capture button in the same panel and watch the [filmstrip](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) fill up with images. The last captured image is always displayed in the center view. \n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມຖ່າຍຮູບເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແລ້ວທ່ານຈະເຫັນຮູບພາບຄ່ອຍໆເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໃນ [filmstrip](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md). ຮູບຫຼ້າສຸດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ກາງໜ້າຈໍສະເໝີ. \n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "storing images on the camera and computer"
msgstr "ການເກັບຮູບພາບໄວ້ທັງໃນກ້ອງ ແລະ ຄອມພິວເຕີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, the gphoto2 framework (used by darktable's tethering feature) will only download images to your computer, and will not store them on the camera's memory card. This setting can be changed outside of darktable by using the `gphoto2` command line interface. However, there are cases where this method fails, as it requires that darktable use the same configuration file as the gphoto2 command line tool. In particular, if darktable or gphoto2 are installed within a sandbox or container that hides user account settings, you may face this issue (for example, with `snap` packages and similar).\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ລະບົບ gphoto2 (ທີ່ darktable ໃຊ້) ຈະດາວໂຫລດຮູບພາບລົງຄອມພິວເຕີເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນກາດຄວາມຈຳຂອງກ້ອງ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໄດ້ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ `gphoto2`. ແຕ່ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະມີບັນຫາຖ້າ darktable ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຮູບແບບ sandbox ເຊັ່ນ snap ທີ່ແຍກການຕັ້ງຄ່າອອກຈາກລະບົບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/tethering/examples.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To allow captured images to be retained on the camera's memory card, connect the camera to your computer for a tethering session, but close darktable. Enter `gphoto2 --set-config capturetarget=1` on the command line. If this command is successful, start darktable again. Thereafter, images should be stored (duplicated) on the camera's memory card during a tethered capture.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນກ້ອງນຳ, ໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ້ອງແລ້ວປິດ darktable ກ່ອນ. ຈາກນັ້ນພິມຄຳສັ່ງ `gphoto2 --set-config capturetarget=1` ໃນເທີມິນໍ. ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເປີດ darktable, ຮູບທີ່ຖ່າຍຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ທັງໃນກ້ອງ ແລະ ຄອມພິວເຕີ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar-import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "importing sidecar files generated by other applications"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar-import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid " When importing an image, darktable automatically checks if it is accompanied by a sidecar file. As well as looking for files named `<basename>.<extension>.xmp` and `<basename>_<number>.<extension>.xmp` (darktable's XMP file naming formats) darktable also checks for the presence of a file in the form `<basename>.xmp` (the naming format for Lightroom's XMP sidecar files). Files with the latter naming format will be read by darktable but will not be written to. Once the image has been imported, darktable will generate an additional XMP file using its own naming convention.\n"
msgstr " ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບ, darktable ຈະກວດສອບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດວ່າມີໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາຕິດມານຳຫຼືບໍ່. ນອກຈາກການຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຊື່ `<basename>.<extension>.xmp` ແລະ `<basename>_<number>.<extension>.xmp` (ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ XMP ຂອງ darktable) ແລ້ວ, darktable ຍັງກວດສອບວ່າມີໄຟລ໌ໃນຮູບແບບ `<basename>.xmp` (ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ XMP ຂອງ Lightroom) ຫຼື ບໍ່. ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ແບບຫຼັງນີ້ ຈະຖືກອ່ານໂດຍ darktable ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ມີການຂຽນທັບລົງໄປ. ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບແລ້ວ, darktable ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ XMP ເພີ່ມເຕີມໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ຂອງມັນເອງ.\n"

