#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sidecar files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ (sidecar files)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable is a non-destructive image editor and opens all images in read-only mode. Most data created within darktable (metadata, tags, and image processing steps) is stored in separate `.XMP` _sidecar_ files. These files are stored alongside the original Raw files and allow darktable to store information about the images as well as the full editing history without touching the original raw files. When you import an image into darktable for the first time, an XMP file is automatically generated. The generation of XMP files can be disabled in [preferences > storage > XMP sidecar files](../../preferences-settings/storage.md#xmp-sidecar-files) but this is not recommended in normal use.\n"
msgstr "darktable ແມ່ນໂປຣແກຣມແຕ່ງຮູບແບບບໍ່ທຳລາຍຕົ້ນສະບັບ (non-destructive) ແລະ ຈະເປີດທຸກຮູບພາບໃນໂໝດອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ. ຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນພາຍໃນ darktable (ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາດາຕາ, ແທັກ, ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບ) ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ _ຊາຍຄາ (sidecar)_ ນາມສະກຸນ `.XMP` ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຄຽງຂ້າງກັບໄຟລ໌ Raw ຕົ້ນສະບັບ ເຮັດໃຫ້ darktable ສາມາດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຮູບພາບ ລວມທັງປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດໄດ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງແຕະຕ້ອງໄຟລ໌ Raw ຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ເມື່ອທ່ານນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໃນ darktable ເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, ໄຟລ໌ XMP ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ XMP ໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການຈັດເກັບ > ໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ XMP](../../preferences-settings/storage.md#xmp-sidecar-files), ແຕ່ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດໃນການໃຊ້ງານປົກກະຕິ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** [custom sort](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) sequence numbers are not stored in sidecar files. This could be destructive if imported into another darktable image library -- including their orginal library -- after import, duplication, or image resequencing.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ລຳດັບການ [ຈັດລຽງແບບກຳນົດເອງ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ. ນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລຳດັບທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ຫາຍໄປ ຖ້ານຳເຂົ້າໄປຍັງຄັງຮູບພາບ darktable ອື່ນ -- ລວມເຖິງຄັງຮູບພາບເດີມ -- ຫຼັງຈາກການນຳເຂົ້າ, ການເຮັດສຳເນົາ, ຫຼື ການຈັດລຳດັບຮູບພາບໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a given source image, multiple editing versions, called _duplicates_, can co-exist, sharing the same input image data but each having their own metadata, tags and processing steps. Each duplicate of a given image (named `<basename>.<extension`) is represented by a separate XMP sidecar file (with a filename constructed in the form `<basename>_<number>.<extension>.xmp`, where `<number>` represents the version number of that edit). Information for the initial edit -- the “duplicate” with version number zero -- is stored in the sidecar file named `<basename>.<extension>.xmp`. The version number of each duplicate is displayed in the [image information](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md) module in each of darktable's views.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບໃດໜຶ່ງ, ສາມາດມີເວີຊັນການແກ້ໄຂຫຼາຍເວີຊັນທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ _ຮູບຈຳລອງ (duplicates)_ ຊ້ອ"
"ນກັນຢູ່ໄດ້, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບນຳເຂົ້າອັນດຽວກັນ ແຕ່ແຕ່ລະອັນມີຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ (metadata), ແທັກ (tags) ແລ"
"ະ ຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ. ແຕ່ລະຮູບຈຳລອງຂອງຮູບພາບໃດໜຶ່ງ (ຊື່ `<basename>"
".<extension>`) ຈະຖືກແທນດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ XMP ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ (ທີ່ມີຊື່ໄຟລ໌ສ້າງໃນຮູບແບບ `<basename>"
"_<number>.<extension>.xmp`, ບ່ອນທີ່ `<number>` ແທນເລກເວີຊັນຂອງການແກ້ໄຂນັ້ນ). ຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບກ"
"ານແກ້ໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ -- “ຮູບຈຳລອງ” ທີ່ມີເລກເວີຊັນສູນ -- ແມ່ນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ sidecar ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ "
"`<basename>.<extension>.xmp`. ເລກເວີຊັນຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບຈຳລອງຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໂມດູນ [ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາ"
"ບ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md) ໃນແຕ່ລະ"
"ໜ້າຂອງ darktable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your work is automatically synchronised to the sidecar files without the need to press a “save” button. When backing up your data, make sure that you also retain copies of the XMP files, as these are required to fully reconstruct your work in case of a disaster.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວຽກຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ (synchronised) ກັບໄຟລ໌ sidecar ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົດປຸ່"
"ມ “ບັນທຶກ”. ເມື່ອສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ເກັບສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ XMP ໄວ້ນຳ, ເພາະໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຳ"
"ເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງວຽກຂອງທ່ານຄືນໃໝ່ທັງໝົດໃນກໍລະນີເກີດຄວາມເສຍຫາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to the sidecar files, darktable keeps all image-related data in its library database for fast access. An image can only be viewed and edited from within darktable if its data has first been loaded into the library database. This happens automatically when you first [import](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md) an image. If an image is subsequently re-imported, the database will be updated from the contents of its XMP file.\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາແລ້ວ, darktable ຍັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບຮູບພາບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບພາບ ເພື່ອການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ໄວຂຶ້ນ. ຮູບພາບຈະສາມາດເບິ່ງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂພາຍໃນ darktable ໄດ້ກໍ່ຕໍ່ເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນຂອງມັນຖືກໂຫຼດເຂົ້າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບພາບກ່ອນ. ນີ້ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານ [ນຳເຂົ້າ (import)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md) ຮູບພາບເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ຖ້າມີການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບນັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກອັບເດດຈາກເນື້ອຫາໃນໄຟລ໌ XMP ຂອງມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once an image has been imported into darktable, the database entries take precedence over the XMP file. Subsequent changes to the XMP file by any other software are not visible to darktable -- such changes will be overwritten the next time darktable synchronizes the file. On request, darktable can be configured to search for updated XMP files at startup, offering a choice to update the database or overwrite the XMP file where changes are identified. This configuration can be changed in [preferences > storage > XMP sidecar files](../../preferences-settings/storage.md#xmp-sidecar-files).\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໃນ darktable ແລ້ວ, ຂໍ້ມູນໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນກວ່າໄຟລ໌ XMP. ການປ່ຽນແປງໄຟລ໌ XMP ໂດຍຊອບແວອື່ນໃນພາຍຫຼັງ ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນ darktable -- ການປ່ຽນແປງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກຂຽນທັບໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ darktable ຊິງຄ໌ໄຟລ໌. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ darktable ຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ XMP ທີ່ຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອເປີດໂປຣແກຣມໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌ XMP ເມື່ອກວດພົບການປ່ຽນແປງ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການຈັດເກັບ > ໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ XMP](../../preferences-settings/storage.md#xmp-sidecar-files).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To import sidecar files created by other applications, see [importing sidecar files generated by other applications](./sidecar-import.md).\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [ການນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນ](./sidecar-import.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To load a sidecar file (e.g. one received from another darktable user), see [load sidecar file](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md).\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ (ເຊັ່ນ: ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ darktable ຄົນອື່ນ), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [ໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ (load sidecar file)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/local-copies.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "local copies"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ (local copies)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/local-copies.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Many users have huge image collections stored on extra hard drives in their desktop computer, or on an external storage medium (RAID NAS, external hard drives etc.).\n"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຄົນມີຄັງຮູບພາບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຮາດດິດເສີມໃນຄອມພິວເຕີ, ຫຼື ໃນອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກ (ເຊັ່ນ RAID NAS, ຮາດດິດພາຍນອກ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/local-copies.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is a common requirement to develop a number of images while travelling using a laptop and then later synchronize them back to the original storage medium. However, copying images manually from the main storage to the laptop and back is cumbersome and prone to errors. The “local copies” feature of darktable has been designed to directly support these use cases. \n"
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນຄວາມຕ້ອງການທົ່ວໄປທີ່ຈະແຕ່ງຮູບຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງໃນຂະນະທີ່ເດີນທາງໂດຍໃຊ້ແລັບທັອບ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍຊິງໂຄໄນຊ໌ພ"
"ວກມັນກັບຄືນສູ່ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຕົ້ນສະບັບໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ການສຳເນົາຮູບພາບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຈາກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"
"ຫຼັກໄປຫາແລັບທັອບ ແລະ ກັບຄືນໄປມານັ້ນເປັນເລື່ອງທີ່ຫຍຸ້ງຍາກ ແລະ ອາດເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໄດ້ງ່າຍ. ຄຸນສົມບັດ “ສຳເນົ"
"າໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງ (local copies)” ຂອງ darktable ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຮອງຮັບກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂ"
"ດຍກົງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/local-copies.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can create local copies of selected images from within the lighttable. Local copies are always used when present, giving continued access to images even if the external storage is no longer connected. At a later point, when your primary storage medium has been reconnected, you can synchronize the XMP sidecar files back to this storage, deleting any local copies. These operations can be found in the [actions on selection](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md) module in the lighttable.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສຳເນົາພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ຈາກພາຍໃນໂຕະແສງ (lighttable). ສຳເນົາພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ສະເໝີເມື່ອມີຢູ່, ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຮູບພາບໄດ້ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ກໍ່ຕາມ. ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ ເມື່ອທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກຄືນໃໝ່, ທ່ານສາມາດຊິງຄ໌ໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ XMP ກັບຄືນໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນ ແລະ ລຶບສຳເນົາພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງອອກໄດ້. ການດຳເນີນການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ [ການຈັດການກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md) ໃນໜ້າໂຕະແສງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/local-copies.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For safety reasons, if local copies exist and the external storage is available, the local XMP sidecars are automatically synchronized at start up.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ, ຖ້າມີສຳເນົາພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ ແລະ ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກໄດ້, ໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ XMP ຈະຖືກຊິງຄ໌ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເປີດໂປຣແກຣມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/local-copies.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local copies are stored within the `$HOME/.cache/darktable` directory and named `img-<SIGNATURE>.<EXT>` (where `SIGNATURE` is a hash signature (MD5) of the full pathname, and `EXT` is the original filename extension).\n"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ `$HOME/.cache/darktable` ແລະ ຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ເປັນ `img-<SIGNATURE>.<EXT>` (ໂດຍທີ່ `SIGNATURE` ແມ່ນລະຫັດແຮຊ (MD5) ຂອງທີ່ຢູ່ໄຟລ໌ເຕັມ, ແລະ `EXT` ແມ່ນນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/local-copies.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local copies can be identified in the lighttable view by a white marker on the top right of the thumbnail. In addition, all local copies carry the `darktable|local-copy` tag to allow them to be easily selected.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສັງເກດສຳເນົາພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ ໂດຍຈະມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍສີຂາວຢູ່ທາງຂວາເທິງຂອງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnail). ນອກຈາກນີ້, ສຳເນົາພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງທັງໝົດຈະມີແທັກ `darktable|local-copy` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກພວກມັນໄດ້ງ່າຍ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/sidecar-files/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sidecar files & non-destructive editing"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ (sidecar) & ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ບໍ່ທຳລາຍຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "views"
msgstr "ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ (views)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The functionality in darktable is separated into six different views:\n"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນການເຮັດວຽກໃນ darktable ຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນ 6 ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[lighttable](../../lighttable/_index.md)\n"
": Manage images and collections.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ໂຕະແສງ (lighttable)](../../lighttable/_index.md)\n"
": ຈັດການຮູບພາບ ແລະ ກຸ່ມຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[darkroom](../../darkroom/_index.md)\n"
": Develop a single image.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom)](../../darkroom/_index.md)\n"
": ປັບແຕ່ງຮູບພາບແຕ່ລະໃບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[map](../../map/_index.md)\n"
": Show geo-tagged images on a map and manually geo-tag new images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ແຜນທີ່ (map)](../../map/_index.md)\n"
": ສະແດງຮູບພາບທີ່ມີແທັກພິກັດພູມສາດເທິງແຜນທີ່ ແລະ ຕິດແທັກພິກັດໃຫ້ຮູບໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[print](../../print/_index.md)\n"
": Send images to a printer.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ພິມ (print)](../../print/_index.md)\n"
": ສົ່ງຮູບພາບໄປຍັງເຄື່ອງພິມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[slideshow](../../slideshow/_index.md)\n"
": Display images as a slideshow, processing them on-the-fly.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ສະໄລດ໌ໂຊ (slideshow)](../../slideshow/_index.md)\n"
": ສະແດງຮູບພາບແບບສະໄລດ໌ໂຊ ໂດຍມີການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບໃນຂະນະທີ່ສະແດງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[tethering](../../tethering/_index.md)\n"
": Remotely capture and save images taken with a connected camera.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການຖ່າຍຮູບຜ່ານສາຍ (tethering)](../../tethering/_index.md)\n"
": ຄວບຄຸມການຖ່າຍຮູບ ແລະ ບັນທຶກຮູບຈາກກ້ອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ທາງໄກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can switch between views by clicking the view name at the top of the right-hand panel (the currently active view is highlighted) or by using one of the following keyboard shortcuts:\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຕ່າງໆໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂອງແຜງດ້ານຂວາ (ສ່ວນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ຈະມີແຖບສີເນັ້ນ) ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`L` switches to lighttable\n"
msgstr "`L` ສະຫຼັບໄປໜ້າໂຕະແສງ\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`D` switches to darkroom\n"
msgstr "`D` ສະຫຼັບໄປໜ້າຫ້ອງມືດ\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`M` switches to map\n"
msgstr "`M` ສະຫຼັບໄປໜ້າແຜນທີ່\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`P` switches to print\n"
msgstr "`P` ສະຫຼັບໄປໜ້າການພິມ\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`S` switches to slideshow\n"
msgstr "`S` ສະຫຼັບໄປໜ້າສະໄລດ໌ໂຊ\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/views.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`T` switches to tethering\n"
msgstr "`T` ສະຫຼັບໄປໜ້າການຖ່າຍຮູບຜ່ານສາຍ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/bottom-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bottom panel appears in all darktable views. Common controls are described here. View-specific controls are described in the appropriate pages:\n"
msgstr "ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນທຸກສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຂອງ darktable. ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມທົ່ວໄປຈະຖືກອະທິບາຍຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມສະເພາະແຕ່ລະສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ ຈະມີລາຍລະອຽດໃນໜ້າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/overview/user-interface/bottom-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[lighttable view](../../../lighttable/lighttable-view-layout/#bottom-panel)\n"
msgstr "[ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ](../../../lighttable/lighttable-view-layout/#bottom-panel)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/overview/user-interface/bottom-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[darkroom view](../../../darkroom/darkroom-view-layout/#bottom-panel)\n"
msgstr "[ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຫ້ອງມືດ](../../../darkroom/darkroom-view-layout/#bottom-panel)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/overview/user-interface/bottom-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[map view](../../../map/map-view-layout/#bottom-panel)\n"
msgstr "[ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນແຜນທີ່](../../../map/map-view-layout/#bottom-panel)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/overview/user-interface/bottom-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[tethering view](../../../tethering/tethering-view-layout/#bottom-panel)\n"
msgstr "[ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນການຖ່າຍຮູບຜ່ານສາຍ](../../../tethering/tethering-view-layout/#bottom-panel)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/user-interface/bottom-panel.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "common controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/bottom-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![view-log-history icon](./bottom-panel/view-log-history.png#icon) view log history\n"
": Display a scrollable popover showing stored log messages with timestamps. The log history viewer provides a persistent record of application log messages (e.g., export/import progress, library operations, warnings, and errors).\n"
"The key features are:\n"
": - Messages are stored in a circular buffer; when the buffer is full, older entries are removed as new ones arrive\n"
": - Consecutive identical messages are automatically deduplicated (e.g., repeated \"exporting image\" updates)\n"
": - Entries are displayed in monospace format with HH:MM:SS timestamps\n"
": - Individual entries are selectable and can be copied to the clipboard with Ctrl+C\n"
": - the viewer is closed by clicking anywhere outside the popover\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນເບິ່ງປະຫວັດບັນທຶກ](./bottom-panel/view-log-history.png#icon) ເບິ່ງປະຫວັດບັນທຶກ (view log history)\n"
": ສະແດງປັອບອັບທີ່ເລື່ອນໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມບັນທຶກ (log) ພ້ອມກັບເວລາ. ສ່ວນເບິ່ງປະຫວັດບັນທຶກ ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນບັນທຶກຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າການສົ່ງອອກ/ນຳເຂົ້າ, ການຈັດການຄັງຮູບພາບ, ຄຳເຕືອນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ).\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
": - ຂໍ້ຄວາມຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນບັບເຟີແບບວົງມົນ; ເມື່ອບັບເຟີເຕັມ, ລາຍການເກົ່າຈະຖືກລຶບອອກເມື່ອມີລາຍການໃໝ່ເຂົ້າມາ\n"
": - ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄືກັນທີ່ມາລຽງກັນ ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ \"ກຳລັງສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບ\" ທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ)\n"
": - ລາຍການຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນຮູບແບບຕົວອັກສອນ monospace ພ້ອມກັບເວລາ (ຊົ່ວໂມງ:ນາທີ:ວິນາທີ)\n"
": - ສາມາດເລືອກແຕ່ລະລາຍການ ແລະ ສຳເນົາໄປໄວ້ໃນຄລິບບອດໄດ້ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ Ctrl+C\n"
": - ປິດສ່ວນເບິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ບ່ອນໃດກໍ່ໄດ້ນອກປັອບອັບ\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/user-interface/keyboard-shortcuts.md
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "ຄີລັດ (keyboard shortcuts)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/keyboard-shortcuts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Much of the functionality in darktable can be controlled via keyboard shortcuts, which can be customised in [preferences > shortcuts](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md).\n"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນ darktable ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ຜ່ານປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ປຸ່ມລັດ](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/keyboard-shortcuts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press the H key (for help) in any darktable view to show a list of all shortcuts that are applicable to the current view.\n"
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ H (ສຳລັບ Help) ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໃດກໍ່ໄດ້ຂອງ darktable ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ປຸ່ມລັດທັງໝົດທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "top panel"
msgstr "ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The top panel appears in all darktable views and provides access to common functions.\n"
msgstr "ແຜງດ້ານເທິງຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນທຸກສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຂອງ darktable ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຟັງຊັນທົ່ວໄປໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![top-panel](./top-panel/top-panel.png#w100)\n"
msgstr "![ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ](./top-panel/top-panel.png#w100)\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the left-hand-side"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![top-panel_filter-preferences icon](./top-panel/top-panel_filter-preferences.png#icon) filter\n"
": Choose which of a [collection's](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md) images are displayed, making them available to different [views](../..//overview/user-interface/views.md) for selection and [action](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md). Criteria can be altered in the [collection filters](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md) module or by clicking the icon.\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວກັ່ນຕອງ](./top-panel/top-panel_filter-preferences.png#icon) ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງ (filter)\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຮູບພາບໃດໃນ [ກຸ່ມຮູບພາບ (collection)](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md) ທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກ ແລະ [ດຳເນີນການ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md) ໃນ [ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ (views)](../..//overview/user-interface/views.md) ຕ່າງໆໄດ້. ເກນໃນການກັ່ນຕອງສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ [ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງກຸ່ມຮູບພາບ (collection filters)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md) ຫຼື ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sort by\n"
": Choose the property that orders the displayed [image sequence](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈັດລຽງຕາມ\n"
": ເລືອກຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການຈັດລຳດັບ [ລຳດັບຮູບພາບ](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence) ທີ່ສະແດງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![top-panel_sort-order icon](./top-panel/top-panel_sort-order.png#icon) sort order\n"
": Switch the sort order (ascending / descending).\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງ](./top-panel/top-panel_sort-order.png#icon) ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງ\n"
": ສະຫຼັບລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງ (ຈາກໜ້ອຍໄປຫາຫຼາຍ / ຈາກຫຼາຍໄປຫາໜ້ອຍ).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the right-hand-side"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![top panel_grouping icon](./top-panel/top-panel_grouping.png#icon) grouping\n"
": Expand or collapse [grouped images](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນການຈັດກຸ່ມ](./top-panel/top-panel_grouping.png#icon) ການຈັດກຸ່ມ\n"
": ຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ຫຍໍ້ [ຮູບພາບທີ່ຈັດກຸ່ມໄວ້](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![top panel_overlays icon](./top-panel/top-panel_overlays.png#icon) thumbnail overlays\n"
": Define what information is overlaid on to thumbnails in the lighttable/filmstrip.\n"
": You can define different settings depending on the thumbnail size. See [preferences > lighttable](../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md#thumbnails) for details of how size delimiters are set.\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນການສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທັບຊ້ອນ](./top-panel/top-panel_overlays.png#icon) ຂໍ້ມູນທັບຊ້ອນເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃດທີ່ຈະສະແດງທັບຊ້ອນເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃນໜ້າໂຕະແສງ/ແຖບຟິມ.\n"
": ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້ຂຶ້ນກັບຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ. ເບິ່ງ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ໂຕະແສງ](../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md#thumbnails) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການກຳນົດຂະໜາດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![top panel_help icon](./top-panel/top-panel_help.png#icon) context-sensitive help\n"
": Click this icon and then click on a control element to be directed to the appropriate online help page.\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ](./top-panel/top-panel_help.png#icon) ຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຕາມບໍລິບົດ\n"
": ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນນີ້ ແລ້ວຄລິກໃສ່ອົງປະກອບຄວບຄຸມໃດໜຶ່ງ ເພື່ອໄປຍັງໜ້າຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອອອນລາຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![top panel shortcut mapping icon](./top-panel/top-panel_shortcut.png#icon) shortcut mapping\n"
": Click this icon to enter the [visual shortcut mapping](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md#visual-shortcut-mapping) mode to create keyboard/mouse shortcuts.\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນການກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດ](./top-panel/top-panel_shortcut.png#icon) ການກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດ\n"
": ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນນີ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດ [ການກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດແບບສາຍຕາ](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md#visual-shortcut-mapping) ເພື່ອສ້າງປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ/ເມົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/top-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![top panel_preferences icon](./top-panel/top-panel_preferences.png#icon) preferences\n"
": View and amend darktable's [preferences & settings](../../preferences-settings/_index.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ](./top-panel/top-panel_preferences.png#icon) ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ\n"
": ເບິ່ງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ darktable](../../preferences-settings/_index.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "screen layout"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໜ້າຈໍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The layout of all darktable views is similar and consists of a center area with panels at the edges: \n"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງທຸກສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໃນ darktable ແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັນ ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນກາງ ແລະ ແຜງຕ່າງໆຢູ່ບໍລິເວນຂອບ: \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![screen-layout](./screen-layout/screen-layout.png#w100)\n"
msgstr "![ຮູບແບບໜ້າຈໍ](./screen-layout/screen-layout.png#w100)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. center area\n"
": Contains information and functionality specific to the current view.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. ພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນກາງ\n"
": ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນສະເພາະຂອງສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນນັ້ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. left panel\n"
": Contains modules primarily used to provide information.\n"
msgstr ""
"2. ແຜງດ້ານຊ້າຍ\n"
": ປະກອບດ້ວຍໂມດູນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເປັນຫຼັກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. right panel\n"
": Contains modules primarily used for image processing.\n"
msgstr ""
"3. ແຜງດ້ານຂວາ\n"
": ປະກອບດ້ວຍໂມດູນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບເປັນຫຼັກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. top banner\n"
": Contains information about the current darktable version and allows you to switch between views. Also used by some modules to show additional hints and messages.\n"
msgstr ""
"4. ແຖບດ້ານເທິງສຸດ (top banner)\n"
": ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບເວີຊັນຂອງ darktable ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຕ່າງໆ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງໃຊ້ໂດຍບາງໂມດູນເພື່ອສະແດງຄຳແນະນຳ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. [top panel](./top-panel.md)\n"
": Provides access to global settings and shortcuts.\n"
msgstr ""
"5. [ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ](./top-panel.md)\n"
": ເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ປຸ່ມລັດຕ່າງໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"6. [bottom panel](./bottom-panel.md)\n"
": Provides access to mostly view-specific settings and shortcuts.\n"
msgstr ""
"6. [ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ](./bottom-panel.md)\n"
": ເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ປຸ່ມລັດທີ່ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ເປັນຂອງສະເພາະແຕ່ລະສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"7. [filmstrip](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md)/[timeline](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md) panel\n"
": An optional panel that can be enabled at the bottom of the screen to display a timeline (in the lighttable view) or a filmstrip (in other views) of images in the current collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"7. ແຜງ [ແຖບຟິມ (filmstrip)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md)/[ເສັ້ນເວລາ (timeline)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md)\n"
": ແຜງເສີມທີ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ເພື່ອສະແດງເສັ້ນເວລາ (ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ) ຫຼື ແຖບຟິມ (ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນອື່ນໆ) ຂອງຮູບພາບໃນກຸ່ມຮູບພາບປະຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See screen layouts specific to the [lighttable view](../../lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md) or [darkroom view](../../darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md).\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຮູບແບບໜ້າຈໍສະເພາະຂອງ [ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ](../../lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md) ຫຼື [ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຫ້ອງມືດ](../../darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "panel size and visibility"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງແຜງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The left, right and filmstrip/timeline panels can be resized by dragging their inner borders. \n"
msgstr "ແຜງດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ຂວາ ແລະ ແຜງແຖບຟິມ/ເສັ້ນເວລາ ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກຂອບດ້ານໃນຂອງພວກມັນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each of the panels can be expanded or collapsed by pressing the triangle located at the outside edge of the panels. Panel visibility can also be adjusted using keyboard shortcuts, as follows:\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະແຜງສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ຫຍໍ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດທີ່ຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມທີ່ຢູ່ຂອບດ້ານນອກຂອງແຜງ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປັບການສະແດງຜົນຂອງແຜງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`TAB` temporarily expands the centre view to fill the whole window. Press again to return to the previous view.\n"
msgstr "`TAB` ຂະຫຍາຍສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນກາງໃຫ້ເຕັມໜ້າຕ່າງຊົ່ວຄາວ. ກົດອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອກັບຄືນສູ່ຮູບແບບເດີມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`F11` toggles fullscreen mode\n"
msgstr "`F11` ເປີດ/ປິດ ໂໝດເຕັມໜ້າຈໍ\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Shift+Ctrl+t` toggles the top panel (between the image and the top banner)\n"
msgstr "`Shift+Ctrl+t` ເປີດ/ປິດ ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ (ລະຫວ່າງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ແຖບດ້ານເທິງສຸດ)\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Shift+Ctrl+b` toggles the bottom panel (between the image and the filmstrip/timeline, if shown)\n"
msgstr "`Shift+Ctrl+b` ເປີດ/ປິດ ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ (ລະຫວ່າງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ແຖບຟິມ/ເສັ້ນເວລາ ຖ້າມີການສະແດງຢູ່)\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Shift+Ctrl+l` toggles the left panel\n"
msgstr "`Shift+Ctrl+l` ເປີດ/ປິດ ແຜງດ້ານຊ້າຍ\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Shift+Ctrl+r` toggles the right panel\n"
msgstr "`Shift+Ctrl+r` ເປີດ/ປິດ ແຜງດ້ານຂວາ\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+f` toggles the filmstrip/timeline\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+f` ເປີດ/ປິດ ແຖບຟິມ/ເສັ້ນເວລາ\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+h` toggles the top banner\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+h` ເປີດ/ປິດ ແຖບດ້ານເທິງສຸດ (top banner)\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`b` toggles all borders and panel-collapse controls\n"
msgstr "`b` ເປີດ/ປິດ ເສັ້ນຂອບທັງໝົດ ແລະ ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມການຫຍໍ້ແຜງ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/screen-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The size and visibility of the panels are stored independently for each view.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ຂະໜາດ ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງແຜງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກແຍກກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/user-interface/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "user interface"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/user-interface/filmstrip.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "filmstrip"
msgstr "ແຖບຟິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The filmstrip, when enabled, is shown at the bottom of the screen (except in the lighttable view, where it is replaced with the [timeline](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md) module) and displays the images from the current [collection](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md) (set in the lighttable view). You can navigate the filmstrip by scrolling with the mouse wheel.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບຟິມ (filmstrip), ເມື່ອຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຈໍ (ຍົກເວັ້ນໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍໂມດູນ [ເສັ້ນເວລາ (timeline)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md)) ແລະ ຈະສະແດງຮູບພາບຈາກ [ກຸ່ມຮູບພາບ (collection)](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md) ປະຈຸບັນ (ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນໜ້າໂຕະແສງ). ທ່ານສາມາດເລື່ອນເບິ່ງແຖບຟິມໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນລໍ້ເມົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/user-interface/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The filmstrip allows you to interact with images while you are not in the lighttable view. For example, while developing an image in darkroom mode, you can switch to another image by double-clicking its thumbnail in the filmstrip. You can also rate and color-classify the images as you do in lighttable, as well as copy & paste the history stack using keyboard shortcuts. As as in the lighttable view, you can drag and drop thumbnail images to change images' sequence when using a [custom sort](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) order.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບຟິມຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການກັບຮູບພາບໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງແຕ່ງຮູບໃນໂໝດຫ້ອງມືດ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນໄປຫາຮູບອື່ນໄດ້ໂດຍການດັບເບິລຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃນແຖບຟິມ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຫ້ຄະແນນ ແລະ ໃສ່ປ້າຍສີໃຫ້ຮູບພາບໄດ້ຄືກັນກັບໃນໜ້າໂຕະແສງ, ລວມທັງການສຳເນົາ ແລະ ວາງລຳດັບປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດ. ຄືກັນກັບໃນໜ້າໂຕະແສງ, ທ່ານສາມາດລາກ ແລະ ວາງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອປ່ຽນລຳດັບຮູບພາບໄດ້ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການ [ຈັດລຽງແບບກຳນົດເອງ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort).\n"

