#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [filmstrip](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) module documentation for more information.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ [ແຖບຟິມ (filmstrip)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "process"
msgstr "ປະມວນຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section is intended to get you comfortable processing images in the darkroom view using a _scene-referred_ workflow. You are advised to follow the guidelines provided below, up to the end of the [_image processing in 3 modules_](#image-processing-in-3-modules) section and then choose other areas to learn as-and-when you need to use those techniques in your images. \n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຫ້ອງມືດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ _ອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred)_. ທ່ານຄວນປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ ຈົນເຖິງຕອນທ້າຍຂອງສ່ວນ [_ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບໃນ 3 ໂມດູນ_](#image-processing-in-3-modules) ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເລືອກຮຽນຮູ້ສ່ວນອື່ນໆ ຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນກັບຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ. \n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "getting started"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການໃຊ້ງານ"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "take a well-exposed photograph"
msgstr "ການຖ່າຍຮູບໃຫ້ມີແສງທີ່ພໍດີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Good image processing techniques start in the camera -- a well-exposed image (without blown highlights or heavily crushed blacks) will always make post-processing much more straightforward. Under- or over-exposure can be \"fixed\" by darktable to some extent but no software can recover information that is not present in the Raw image (clipped highlights). Where possible, you are advised to use [exposure to-the-right (ETTR)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exposing_to_the_right) techniques to maximize the amount of data available for processing while avoiding clipping. As a general rule of thumb, in cases where the scene-dynamic-range exceeds that of your camera, it is safe to underexpose all images by 0.5 to 1 EV (by reducing the ISO sensitivity if possible) even if the in-camera preview looks darker than expected (the preview is not the raw data). If the scene dynamic range is lower than that of your camera, you may wish to dial in some over-exposure (decrease shutter speed or increase aperture) to capture more light and reduce noise.\n"
msgstr "ເຕັກນິກການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບທີ່ດີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມາແຕ່ໃນກ້ອງ -- ຮູບພາບທີ່ມີແສງພໍດີ (ໂດຍທີ່ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງບໍ່ຂາວໂພນ ຫຼື ສ່ວນມືດບໍ່ດຳສະໜິດຈົນເກີນໄປ) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການປັບແຕ່ງໃນພາຍຫຼັງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນສະເໝີ. ການຖ່າຍຮູບທີ່ມືດເກີນໄປ ຫຼື ແຈ້ງເກີນໄປ ສາມາດ \"ແກ້ໄຂ\" ໄດ້ໃນ darktable ໃນລະດັບໜຶ່ງ ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີຊອບແວໃດສາມາດກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ Raw ໄດ້ (ສ່ວນທີ່ແສງຫຼຸດ (clipped highlights)). ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້, ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກ [ການໃຫ້ແສງໄປທາງຂວາ (ETTR)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exposing_to_the_right) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນ ໂດຍທີ່ແສງບໍ່ຫຼຸດ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະດັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແສງໃນສາກ (dynamic range) ສູງກວ່າຄວາມສາມາດຂອງກ້ອງ, ການຖ່າຍໃຫ້ມືດກວ່າປົກກະຕິປະມານ 0.5 ຫາ 1 EV (ໂດຍການຫຼຸດ ISO ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້) ຈະປອດໄພກວ່າ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃນກ້ອງຈະເບິ່ງມືດກວ່າທີ່ຄິດ (ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ມູນ raw ແທ້). ຖ້າລະດັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແສງໃນສາກຕ່ຳກວ່າຄວາມສາມາດຂອງກ້ອງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຖ່າຍໃຫ້ແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນເລັກໜ້ອຍ (ຫຼຸດຄວາມໄວຊັດເຕີ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຮູຮັບແສງ) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ແສງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນ (noise).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "scene-referred workflow: a new approach"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອີງຕາມສາກ: ແນວທາງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have used other Raw software in the past (or darktable prior to version 3.0) you may notice some significant differences from what you are used to -- darktable now uses a _scene-referred_ approach for most of its processing modules. This approach is used extensively in cinematography and is known to be much more robust than the traditional _display-referred_ approach.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານເຄີຍໃຊ້ຊອບແວ Raw ອື່ນໆມາກ່ອນ (ຫຼື darktable ເວີຊັນກ່ອນ 3.0), ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ສຳຄັນ -- ປະຈຸບັນ darktable ໃຊ້ແນວທາງແບບ _ອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred)_ ສຳລັບໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ແນວທາງນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາງໃນວົງການຮູບເງົາ ແລະ ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ກັນວ່າມີຄວາມໝັ້ນຄົງກວ່າແນວທາງແບບ _ອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ (display-referred)_ ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In _display-referred processing_ the data from your Raw file is initially compressed into a range that represents pure black as 0 and pure white as 1, fixing mid-gray at 0.5. A tone curve is automatically (and irreversibly) applied to this data to make the image look \"good\" on your display and subsequent edits are carried out on top of this already highly-modified image data. The cost of _display-referred_ is an early loss of the relationship between pixel luminosity and saturation (usually also involving hue shifts), which is responsible for the infamous \"HDR look\" when the dynamic range increases.\n"
msgstr "ໃນ _ການປະມວນຜົນແບບອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ (display-referred)_, ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໄຟລ໌ Raw ຂອງທ່ານຈະຖືກບີບອັດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ແທນຄ່າສີດຳບໍລິສຸດເປັນ 0 ແລະ ສີຂາວບໍລິສຸດເປັນ 1, ໂດຍກຳນົດຄ່າສີເທົາກາງໄວ້ທີ່ 0.5. ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ (tone curve) ຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບໄດ້) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບເບິ່ງ \"ດີ\" ເທິງໜ້າຈໍຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂຕໍ່ໆໄປຈະເຮັດຢູ່ເທິງຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໄປຫຼາຍແລ້ວ. ຂໍ້ເສຍຂອງແບບ _display-referred_ ແມ່ນການສູນເສຍຄວາມສຳພັນລະຫວ່າງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊວ ແລະ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ (ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສີພ້ຽນນຳ), ເຊິ່ງເປັນສາເຫດຂອງການເກີດ \"ຮູບແບບ HDR\" ທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດເມື່ອລະດັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແສງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the real world, \"pure black\" does not really exist (there is always _some_ light) and there is no limit to how bright things can be (so no \"pure white\" either). _Scene-referred processing_ attempts to retain the physical properties of the scene for as long as possible by placing the Raw data on an unbounded linear scale and only compressing the data to the dynamic range of your display after image processing is complete.\n"
msgstr "ໃນໂລກຕົວຈິງ, \"ສີດຳບໍລິສຸດ\" ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ແທ້ (ເພາະຈະມີແສງຢູ່ສະເໝີ) ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຂີດຈຳກັດວ່າສິ່ງຕ່າງໆຈະສະຫວ່າງໄດ້ສຳໃດ (ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີ \"ສີຂາວບໍລິສຸດ\" ເຊັ່ນກັນ). _ການປະມວນຜົນແບບອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred)_ ພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄຸນສົມບັດທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງສາກໄວ້ໃຫ້ດົນທີ່ສຸດ ເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ ໂດຍການວາງຂໍ້ມູນ Raw ໄວ້ໃນມາດຕາສ່ວນແບບເສັ້ນ (linear) ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂີດຈຳກັດ ແລະ ຈະບີບອັດຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບລະດັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແສງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບສຳເລັດແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In a scene-referred workflow many common tools (tone curves and levels, for example) are no longer useful ways to manipulate the image, since they rely on now-invalid definitions of black, white and gray. Experienced users may need to learn new techniques and discard old ones, but will be rewarded with much more robust and predictable outputs.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອີງຕາມສາກ, ເຄື່ອງມືທົ່ວໄປຫຼາຍຢ່າງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ ແລະ ເລເວລ) ຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບໃນການປັບແຕ່ງຮູບພາບອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ເພາະພວກມັນອີງຕາມການກຳນົດຄ່າສີດຳ, ສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີເທົາ ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກການໃໝ່ນີ້. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີປະສົບການອາດຈະຕ້ອງຮຽນຮູ້ເຕັກນິກໃໝ່ ແລະ ປະຖິ້ມເຕັກນິກເກົ່າບາງຢ່າງ, ແຕ່ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈະແມ່ນຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ມີຄວາມໝັ້ນຄົງ ແລະ ຄາດການໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The scene-referred workflow in darktable enables the [filmic rgb](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) and [exposure](../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) modules by default when you open new images in the darkroom view.\n"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອີງຕາມສາກໃນ darktable ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [filmic rgb](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) ແລະ [exposure](../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດຮູບພາບໃໝ່ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຫ້ອງມືດ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "white balance and color calibration"
msgstr "ໄວທ໌ບາລານ (white balance) ແລະ ການຄາລິເບຣດສີ (color calibration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most processing software uses a traditional temperature/tint model for adjusting the white balance of an image. In darktable, the [color calibration module](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md) provides a much more robust and flexible approach, allowing you to explicitly define the color of the light source. This is particularly useful for scenes illuminated by artificial lighting.\n"
msgstr "ຊອບແວປະມວນຜົນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ ອຸນຫະພູມ/ສີ (temperature/tint) ແບບດັ້ງເດີມໃນການປັບໄວທ໌ບາລານຂອງຮູບພາບ. ໃນ darktable, ໂມດູນ [ການຄາລິເບຣດສີ (color calibration)](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md) ຈະໃຫ້ແນວທາງທີ່ມີຄວາມໝັ້ນຄົງ ແລະ ຢືດຢຸ່ນກວ່າ ໂດຍຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດສີຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບສາກທີ່ໃຊ້ແສງປະດິດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please note that the [white balance](../../module-reference/processing-modules/white-balance.md) module is still enabled in this approach, but its settings normally should not be altered.\n"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ໂມດູນ [ໄວທ໌ບາລານ (white balance)](../../module-reference/processing-modules/white-balance.md) ຍັງຄົງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່, ແຕ່ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ບໍ່ຄວນໄປປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set [preferences > processing > auto-apply pixel workflow defaults](../../preferences-settings/processing.md) to \"scene-referred (filmic)\" now.\n"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ > ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ pixel workflow ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ](../../preferences-settings/processing.md) ເປັນ \"ອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred (filmic))\" ດຽວນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Enter preferences by clicking on the gear icon in the [top panel](../user-interface/top-panel.md)_. \n"
msgstr "_ເຂົ້າສູ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນຮູບຟັນເຟືອນໃນ [ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ](../user-interface/top-panel.md)_. \n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "edit in a controlled environment"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂຮູບໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຄວບຄຸມໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image processing should be performed in a controlled environment, lit by a white light source against a background approximating mid-gray, and on a monitor that has been properly calibrated.\n"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຄວນເຮັດໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຄວບຄຸມໄດ້, ມີແສງສະຫວ່າງຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງສີຂາວ ໂດຍມີພື້ນຫຼັງເປັນສີເທົາກາງ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ຈໍພາບທີ່ຜ່ານການຄາລິເບຣດຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While this may not be practical in many home editing environments you _can_ control the background colors on your monitor's display. You should set the darktable color scheme to use one of the \"grey\" themes and use the [color assessment mode](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md) when altering tones and colors in your image. Dark themes might look good but, unless you are processing images to be viewed on a cinema screen in a darkened room, they should not be used for photo processing.\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໄດ້ຍາກໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເຮືອນ, ແຕ່ທ່ານ _ສາມາດ_ ຄວບຄຸມສີພື້ນຫຼັງໃນຈໍພາບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ທ່ານຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບສີຂອງ darktable ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທີມ (theme) ສີເທົາ (\"grey\") ແລະ ໃຊ້ [ໂໝດການປະເມີນສີ (color assessment mode)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md) ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງໂທນສີ ແລະ ສີໃນຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ. ທີມສີເຂັ້ມອາດຈະເບິ່ງສວຍງາມ, ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ແຕ່ງຮູບເພື່ອໄປສະແດງໃນໂຮງຮູບເງົາທີ່ມີຫ້ອງມືດ, ທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ທີມສີເຂັ້ມໃນການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set [preferences > general > theme](../../preferences-settings/general.md) to \"darktable-elegant-grey\" or \"darktable-icons-grey\" now.\n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ທົ່ວໄປ > ທີມ (theme)](../../preferences-settings/general.md) ເປັນ \"darktable-elegant-grey\" ຫຼື \"darktable-icons-grey\" ດຽວນີ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "enter the darkroom"
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose an image to edit from the lighttable view and double-click to load that image into the darkroom view. For now try to choose an image that is well exposed -- we will discuss some techniques to recover badly-exposed images later.\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂຈາກສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ ແລະ ດັບເບິລຄລິກເພື່ອໂຫຼດຮູບນັ້ນເຂົ້າໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຫ້ອງມືດ. ສຳລັບຕອນນີ້ ໃຫ້ລອງເລືອກຮູບທີ່ມີແສງພໍດີ -- ພວກເຮົາຈະເວົ້າເຖິງເຕັກນິກການກູ້ຄືນຮູບທີ່ມີແສງບໍ່ພໍດີໃນພາຍຫຼັງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the darkroom view, you will see a list of [processing modules](../../darkroom/processing-modules/_index.md) to the right of your image. Each module performs its own processing on the image, in the order shown in the module list, starting at the bottom of the list and moving up to the top. You can think of this like a stack of building blocks where each block builds on the processing performed by the modules below it.\n"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຫ້ອງມືດ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນລາຍຊື່ຂອງ [ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/_index.md) ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຮູບພາບ. ແຕ່ລະໂມດູນຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່, ໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກລຸ່ມສຸດຂຶ້ນໄປຫາເທິງສຸດ. ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດພາບວ່າມັນຄືກັບການວາງບລັອກຊ້ອນກັນ ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະບລັອກຈະສ້າງຂຶ້ນເທິງຜົນການປະມວນຜົນຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ຢູ່ກຸ່ມລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the left hand side is the [history stack](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md) (you may need to expand the module), which shows the order in which adjustments were made to the controls of the various modules. This allows you to undo changes by reverting to an earlier step in the history stack. You will see that a number of modules are applied automatically -- these are needed in order to generate a legible image from the Raw data.\n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍແມ່ນ [ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ (history stack)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md) (ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຂະຫຍາຍໂມດູນອອກ), ເຊິ່ງສະແດງລຳດັບການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດ. ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການຍ້ອນກັບໄປຍັງຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້າໃນລຳດັບປະຫວັດ. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່າມີຫຼາຍໂມດູນທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ -- ເຊິ່ງຈຳເປັນເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບພາບທີ່ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Raw.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is important to understand the distinction between the order of the modules on the right-hand-side of the screen (which represents the order in which modules are _executed_) and the order of the modules in the history stack (which represents the order in which modules were _modified_).\n"
msgstr "ມັນສຳຄັນທີ່ຕ້ອງເຂົ້າໃຈຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ ລຳດັບຂອງໂມດູນຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງໜ້າຈໍ (ເຊິ່ງແທນລຳດັບການ _ປະມວນຜົນ_ ຂອງໂມດູນ) ແລະ ລຳດັບຂອງໂມດູນໃນລຳດັບປະຫວັດ (ເຊິ່ງແທນລຳດັບທີ່ໂມດູນຖືກ _ແກ້ໄຂ_).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To the top right is the [scopes](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md) module, which shows the spread of tones/colors in your image.\n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ທາງຂວາເທິງແມ່ນໂມດູນ [ກຣາຟວັດຄ່າ (scopes)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md), ເຊິ່ງສະແດງການກະຈາຍຂອງໂທນສີ/ສີ ໃນຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have previously viewed or edited the image in the darkroom view, start by _discarding history_ (click the _reset_ button in the [_history stack_](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md)). This will reapply defaults using your new settings and provide a clean starting point for editing.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານເຄີຍເບິ່ງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຮູບພາບໃນສ່ວນຫ້ອງມືດມາກ່ອນ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍການ _ລຶບປະຫວັດ (discard history)_ (ຄລິກປຸ່ມ _ຣີເຊັດ (reset)_ ໃນ [_ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ_](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md)). ນີ້ຈະເປັນການນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສະອາດສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "why doesn't the raw image look like the JPEG?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງຮູບ Raw ຈຶ່ງເບິ່ງບໍ່ຄືກັບຮູບ JPEG?"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_...because you haven't processed it yet_\n"
msgstr "_...ເພາະວ່າທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ປະມວນຜົນມັນເທື່ອ_\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "One of the first things people notice when switching from lighttable to darkroom view is that the image looks different -- often flatter and less saturated than that shown in the lighttable view. This is because the darkroom view displays the (mostly unprocessed) Raw image, but the lighttable view initially displays the (in-camera) JPEG preview. Now that you have opened the image in the darkroom view, the lighttable view will update to show the edited version.\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທຳອິດທີ່ຄົນມັກສັງເກດເຫັນເມື່ອສະຫຼັບຈາກສ່ວນໂຕະແສງໄປຫາສ່ວນຫ້ອງມືດແມ່ນ ຮູບພາບເບິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງໄປ -- ມັກຈະເບິ່ງແບນກວ່າ ແລະ ສີຈາງກວ່າຮູບທີ່ເຫັນໃນສ່ວນໂຕະແສງ. ນີ້ເປັນຍ້ອນວ່າສ່ວນຫ້ອງມືດສະແດງຮູບພາບ Raw (ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ປະມວນຜົນ), ແຕ່ສ່ວນໂຕະແສງໃນຕອນທຳອິດຈະສະແດງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ JPEG (ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍກ້ອງ). ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດຮູບພາບໃນສ່ວນຫ້ອງມືດແລ້ວ, ສ່ວນໂຕະແສງຈະອັບເດດເພື່ອສະແດງເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most Raw software goes to great lengths to reproduce the look of standard camera JPEGs out of the box. While this can be useful (if you only want to make very minor adjustments to the camera's rendition of an image) we assume that you are using a Raw editor to make the image your own, and that the camera does not know how to do this. Certainly, if you are using the ETTR techniques mentioned above, the camera JPEG will rarely be close to how you want the final image to look. \n"
msgstr "ຊອບແວ Raw ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ພະຍາຍາມຢ່າງຫຼາຍເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບເບິ່ງຄືກັບ JPEG ມາດຕະຖານຈາກກ້ອງໃນທັນທີ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່ານີ້ອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດ (ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງພຽງເລັກໜ້ອຍຈາກສິ່ງທີ່ກ້ອງເຮັດໃຫ້), ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາຄິດວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມແຕ່ງຮູບ Raw ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບໃນແບບຂອງທ່ານເອງ ເຊິ່ງກ້ອງບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດແທນໄດ້. ແນ່ນອນວ່າ ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກ ETTR ທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ, ຮູບ JPEG ຈາກກ້ອງຈະບໍ່ຄ່ອຍໃກ້ຄຽງກັບສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃນຮູບສຸດທ້າຍ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The default settings in darktable are therefore intended to provide you with a neutral _starting point_ for further editing and nothing more. _We do not intend to change this_.\n"
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນ darktable ຈຶ່ງມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ _ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ_ ທີ່ເປັນກາງສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂເພີ່ມເຕີມເທົ່ານັ້ນ. _ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ມີເຈດຕະນາທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແປງສິ່ງນີ້_.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module groups"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below the scopes module, at the top right of the screen, is a set of tabs into which darktable's modules are [grouped](../../darkroom/organization/module-groups.md). If you cannot find a module in one of the tabs you can use the search feature to locate it. \n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ລຸ່ມໂມດູນກຣາຟວັດຄ່າ, ທາງຂວາເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ, ຈະມີກຸ່ມແທັບເຊິ່ງໂມດູນຂອງ darktable ຖືກ [ຈັດກຸ່ມ](../../darkroom/organization/module-groups.md) ໄວ້. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ເຫັນໂມດູນໃນແທັບໃດໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການຄົ້ນຫາເພື່ອຊອກຫາໄດ້. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the purposes of this guide, click on the hamburger icon (to the right of the tabs) and select the \"workflow: scene-referred\" preset now.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄູ່ມືນີ້, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນແຮມເບີເກີ (ທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງແທັບ) ແລະ ເລືອກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ \"workflow: scene-referred\" ດຽວນີ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "image processing in 3 modules"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບດ້ວຍ 3 ໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following basic adjustments are fundamental to scene-referred editing and will be required, to some extent, on the majority of images. You can usually produce a good-looking image with these steps alone.\n"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງພື້ນຖານຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງສຳຄັນສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂແບບອີງຕາມສາກ ແລະ ຈະຈຳເປັນໃນລະດັບໜຶ່ງສຳລັບຮູບພາບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຮູບທີ່ສວຍງາມໄດ້ດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As you will be adjusting the tones and colors of the image, start by enabling [color assessment mode](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md) (press Ctrl+B) and perform the following edits on the zoomed-out image while in this mode.\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກທ່ານຈະມີການປັບໂທນສີ ແລະ ສີຂອງຮູບພາບ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການເປີດ [ໂໝດການປະເມີນສີ (color assessment mode)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md) (ກົດ Ctrl+B) ແລະ ດຳເນີນການແກ້ໄຂຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເບິ່ງຮູບແບບເຕັມໃບ (ຊູມອອກ) ໃນໂໝດນີ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Set overall image brightness**: First, set the overall (average) brightness of the image (the mid-gray point) by adjusting the _exposure_ slider in the [_exposure_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) module. This is a purely artistic setting and should be defined based on your intent -- for example, for a high-key image you will set the average brightness to be lighter than for a low-key image. The color assessment mode provides you with two reference points to assist with this by surrounding the image with a white frame against a middle-gray background. \n"
msgstr "**ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍລວມຂອງຮູບ**: ກ່ອນອື່ນ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍລວມ (ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ) ຂອງຮູບ (ຈຸດສີເທົາກາງ) ໂດຍການປັບແຖບເລື່ອນ _ການຊົດເຊີຍແສງ (exposure)_ ໃນໂມດູນ [_exposure_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md). ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມຄວາມມັກທາງສິລະປະ ແລະ ຄວນກຳນົດຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທ່ານ -- ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສຳລັບຮູບແບບ high-key ທ່ານຈະຕັ້ງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສະເລ່ຍໃຫ້ແຈ້ງກວ່າຮູບແບບ low-key. ໂໝດການປະເມີນສີຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີຈຸດອ້າງອີງສອງຈຸດ ໂດຍການໃສ່ຂອບສີຂາວອ້ອມຮູບພາບເທິງພື້ນຫຼັງສີເທົາກາງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "   At this point, don't worry if the brightest parts of your image lose detail -- this can be recovered in the next step.\n"
msgstr "   ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ບໍ່ຕ້ອງກັງວົນຖ້າສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງທີ່ສຸດຂອງຮູບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ -- ມັນສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "   _**Note:** The [lens correction](#correct-lens-distortions) module can also affect the image brightness so you may want to consider enabling it before adjusting exposure._\n"
msgstr "   _**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ໂມດູນ [ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ (lens correction)](#correct-lens-distortions) ກໍ່ສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຮູບໄດ້ ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານອາດຈະພິຈາລະນາເປີດໃຊ້ມັນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປັບການຊົດເຊີຍແສງ._\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Set white and black points**: The next two steps use the [_filmic rgb_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) module to define how the tones in your image will be mapped to the dynamic range of your display. Start by setting the _white_ and _black_ relative exposure sliders in the [_scene tab_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#scene). These are purely technical settings, defining white and black relative to the mid-gray point you set in the previous step. If your image contains tones you want to treat as pure white or pure black you can use the [pickers](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) beside the sliders to set these values (using the maximum and minimum brightness of the image). Otherwise set the values manually using the color assessment frames as a reference.\n"
msgstr "**ຕັ້ງຈຸດສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີດຳ**: ສອງຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປຈະໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_filmic rgb_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) ເພື່ອກຳນົດວິທີການຈັບຄູ່ໂທນສີໃນຮູບພາບເຂົ້າກັບລະດັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແສງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍການຕັ້ງແຖບເລື່ອນການຊົດເຊີຍແສງສຳພັນສຳລັບ _ສີຂາວ_ ແລະ _ສີດຳ_ ໃນ [_ແທັບສາກ (scene tab)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#scene). ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທາງເຕັກນິກລ້ວນໆ, ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີດຳ ໂດຍທຽບໃສ່ຈຸດສີເທົາກາງທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້າ. ຖ້າຮູບຂອງທ່ານມີໂທນສີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປັນສີຂາວບໍລິສຸດ ຫຼື ສີດຳບໍລິສຸດ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [ເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີ (pickers)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ຂ້າງແຖບເລື່ອນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດ ແລະ ຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງຮູບ). ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ຂອບການປະເມີນສີເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Adjust the contrast**: Now move to the [_look tab_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#look) in _filmic rgb_ (for now we will skip the [_reconstruct tab_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb#reconstruct)). Enable the [_look only_ view](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#graphic-display) at the top of the module to see a representation of the filmic tone curve, which consists of a straight section in the middle (used to set the contrast of the mid-tones) and curved sections at the top and bottom (where the shadows and highlights are compressed to fit the dynamic range of the display). \n"
msgstr "**ປັບຄອນທຣາສ (ຄວາມຕ່າງສີ)**: ບັດນີ້ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ [_ແທັບຮູບລັກສະນະ (look tab)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#look) ໃນ _filmic rgb_ (ສຳລັບຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຈະຂ້າມ [_ແທັບການສ້າງໃໝ່ (reconstruct tab)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb#reconstruct) ໄປກ່ອນ). ເປີດໃຊ້ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນ [_look only_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#graphic-display) ຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂອງໂມດູນ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ filmic, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍສ່ວນຊື່ຢູ່ກາງ (ໃຊ້ຕັ້ງຄອນທຣາສຂອງໂທນສີກາງ) ແລະ ສ່ວນໂຄ້ງຢູ່ທາງເທິງ ແລະ ລຸ່ມ (ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ສ່ວນເງົາ ແລະ ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງຖືກບີບອັດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບລະດັບຂອງໜ້າຈໍ). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "   The _contrast_ slider changes the slope of the straight section (the mid-tone image contrast), the _linear region_ slider changes its length and the _shadows/highlights balance_ slider changes its position. There is a lot of give-and-take involved here -- if you want to increase the contrast of the mid-tones, you must sacrifice contrast in the shadows/highlights and vice versa. The default settings of this module are tuned to work for the majority of images but you should experiment with these sliders to understand how they affect the image.\n"
msgstr "   ແຖບເລື່ອນ _ຄອນທຣາສ (contrast)_ ຈະປ່ຽນຄວາມຊັນຂອງສ່ວນຊື່ (ຄອນທຣາສຂອງໂທນສີກາງ), ແຖບເລື່ອນ _ເຂດເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear region)_ ຈະປ່ຽນຄວາມຍາວຂອງມັນ ແລະ ແຖບເລື່ອນ _ຄວາມສົມດຸນເງົາ/ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ (shadows/highlights balance)_ ຈະປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນ. ມັນມີການໄດ້ຢ່າງເສຍຢ່າງຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ -- ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສໃນໂທນສີກາງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຍອມເສຍຄອນທຣາສໃນສ່ວນເງົາ/ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູນນີ້ຖືກປັບມາໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຮູບພາບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ແຕ່ທ່ານຄວນທົດລອງປັບແຖບເລື່ອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າພວກມັນສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຮູບແນວໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "   _**Note:** The highlight compression in the filmic rgb module can cause detail to be lost in the highlights. You can mitigate this to some extent by reducing the _white relative exposure_, adjusting the _shadows/highlights balance_ or changing the _contrast in highlights_ setting in the [options tab](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#options). The [tone equalizer](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md) module can also be used to reduce the relative brightness of the sky._\n"
msgstr "   _**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ການບີບອັດສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງໃນໂມດູນ filmic rgb ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງຫາຍໄປ. ທ່ານສາມາດຫຼຸດຜ່ອນບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ໃນລະດັບໜຶ່ງ ໂດຍການຫຼຸດ _ການຊົດເຊີຍແສງສຳພັນສີຂາວ_, ປັບ _ຄວາມສົມດຸນເງົາ/ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ_ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ຄອນທຣາສໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ_ ໃນ [ແທັບຕົວເລືອກ (options tab)](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#options). ໂມດູນ [ຕົວປັບໂທນສີ (tone equalizer)](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md) ກໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າໄດ້ຄືກັນ._\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Color preservation**: The tone mapping in the filmic rgb module attempts to redistribute the tones in your image without affecting color reproduction. While the default color preservation algorithm works for most images, you can experiment with the _highlights saturation mix_ setting in the [_look tab_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#look) if you do not like how the colors appear. \n"
msgstr "**ການຮັກສາສີ**: ການຈັບຄູ່ໂທນສີໃນໂມດູນ filmic rgb ພະຍາຍາມຈັດແຈງໂທນສີໃໝ່ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ກະທົບຕໍ່ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງສີ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າອັນກໍຣິທຶມການຮັກສາສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີກັບຮູບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດທົດລອງກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ການປະສົມຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ (highlights saturation mix)_ ໃນ [_ແທັບຮູບລັກສະນະ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#look) ໄດ້ ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ມັກວິທີທີ່ສີສະແດງອອກມາ. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Saturation**: Your image will probably not look very colorful at this point. You can adjust the global saturation of the image using the [color balance rgb](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-balance-rgb.md) module. The \"basic colorfulness\" [preset](../../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md) should provide you with generally-reasonable defaults, but you are encouraged to experiment further with these settings as required. \n"
msgstr "**ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ**: ຮູບຂອງທ່ານອາດຈະຍັງເບິ່ງບໍ່ຄ່ອຍມີສີສັນປານໃດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໂດຍລວມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີ (color balance rgb)](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-balance-rgb.md). ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ \"basic colorfulness\" [preset](../../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md) ຈະໃຫ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດທົດລອງປັບຕື່ມໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "   _**Note:** This guide assumes that the white balance of the image has been correctly captured by your camera. If this is not the case, you may need to make some corrections in the [color calibration](#color-calibration) module first._\n"
msgstr "   _**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ຄູ່ມືນີ້ສົມມຸດວ່າໄວທ໌ບາລານຂອງຮູບຖືກຕັ້ງມາຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຈາກກ້ອງແລ້ວ. ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບນັ້ນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເຮັດການແກ້ໄຂໃນໂມດູນ [ການຄາລິເບຣດສີ](#color-calibration) ກ່ອນ._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can now switch off _color assessment mode_ by pressing Ctrl+B again.\n"
msgstr "ບັດນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດປິດ _ໂໝດການປະເມີນສີ_ ໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ Ctrl+B ອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "other processing techniques"
msgstr "ເຕັກນິກການປະມວນຜົນອື່ນໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "With practice the above workflow can quickly provide you with a reasonable-looking image, though most will need some additional work before they are ready for export. The following sections are intended to provide a brief outline of some more image processing techniques in darktable, with links to the relevant reference sections for more information.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຝຶກຝົນຈົນຊຳນານ, ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກຂ້າງເທິງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໄດ້ຮູບທີ່ເບິ່ງດີໄດ້ຢ່າງໄວວາ, ແຕ່ຮູບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຍັງຕ້ອງການການປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກ. ສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ບົດສະຫຼຸບໂດຍຫຍໍ້ກ່ຽວກັບເຕັກນິກການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບອື່ນໆໃນ darktable ພ້ອມກັບລິ້ງໄປຫາສ່ວນອ້າງອີງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As a general rule, you should begin with the basic steps outlined in the previous section, then perform [_corrections_](#corrections) and finish with [_creative adjustments_](#creative-adjustments).\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຄວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຂັ້ນຕອນພື້ນຖານທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວມາ, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເຮັດ [_ການແກ້ໄຂ (corrections)_](#corrections) ແລະ ປິດທ້າຍດ້ວຍ [_ການປັບແຕ່ງເພື່ອຄວາມສ້າງສັນ (creative adjustments)_](#creative-adjustments).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "corrections"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "color calibration"
msgstr "ການຄາລິເບຣດສີ (color calibration)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traditional white balance correction attempts to ensure that whites and grays are really neutral (R = G = B) and doesn’t really try to manage the impact on other colors. The [_CAT tab of the color calibration module_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md#white-balance-in-the-chromatic-adaptation-transformation-cat-tab) extends this treatment to handle the remainder of the color range and works in a color space designed specifically for chromatic (color) adaptation. As with traditional white balance controls you can select a patch of neutral gray in your image to calculate the white balance, or use a selection of other automatic and manual methods. The default settings use the white balance from the image's Exif data and are usually sufficient.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປັບແກ້ໄວ້ບາລານ (white balance) ແບບດັ້ງເດີມພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີເທົາເປັນກາງແທ້ໆ (R "
"= G = B) ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ພະຍາຍາມຈັດການກັບຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ສີອື່ນໆແທ້ໆ. [_ແຖບ CAT ຂອງໂມດູນການປັບທຽບສີ_]"
"(../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md#white-"
"balance-in-the-chromatic-adaptation-transformation-cat-tab) ໄດ້ຂະຫຍາຍການຈັດການນີ້"
"ເພື່ອຮັບມືກັບຊ່ວງສີທີ່ເຫຼືອ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ (color space) ທີ່ອອກແບບມາສະເພາະສຳລັບການປັບຕົວຂອງ"
"ສີ (chromatic adaptation). ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບການຄວບຄຸມໄວ້ບາລານແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ສີ"
"ເທົາທີ່ເປັນກາງໃນຮູບຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຄຳນວນໄວ້ບາລານ, ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກວິທີການອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ວິທີປັບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"
"ອື່ນໆ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະໃຊ້ໄວ້ບາລານຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ປົກກະຕິກໍພຽງພໍແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you need to make adjustments in the _color calibration_ module, you may want to also revisit any saturation corrections you made earlier in the _color balance rgb_ module.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງໃນໂມດູນ _ການຄາລິເບຣດສີ_, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງກັບໄປກວດເບິ່ງການປັບຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃນໂມດູນ _ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີ_ ອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "correct lens distortions"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຂອງເລນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All lenses introduce some artifacts (distortion, chromatic aberrations, vignetting) to the image. The [_lens correction_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md) module can correct many of these issues for a wide variety of lenses. The [_chromatic aberrations_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/chromatic-aberrations.md) and [_raw chromatic aberrations_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/raw-chromatic-aberrations.md) modules can also be used to handle chromatic aberrations for lenses that are not (or only partially) supported by _lens correction_. In most cases simply enabling the _lens correction_ module will auto-detect your lens and auto-apply all available corrections.\n"
msgstr "ເລນທຸກອັນຈະສ້າງສິ່ງແປກປອມ (ຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນ, ຂອບສີພ້ຽນ, ຂອບມືດ) ໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບ. ໂມດູນ [_ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ (lens correction)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md) ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ສຳລັບເລນຫຼາກຫຼາຍຊະນິດ. ໂມດູນ [_ຂອບສີພ້ຽນ (chromatic aberrations)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/chromatic-aberrations.md) ແລະ [_raw chromatic aberrations_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/raw-chromatic-aberrations.md) ກໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຈັດການກັບຂອບສີພ້ຽນສຳລັບເລນທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ (ຫຼື ຮອງຮັບບາງສ່ວນ) ໃນໂມດູນ _ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ_. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ພຽງແຕ່ເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ _ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ_ ລະບົບກໍ່ຈະກວດພົບເລນຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ມີທັງໝົດໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you decide to use the _lens correction_ module, it should be enabled at the start of your edit, before you adjust exposure, since vignetting correction can alter the overall brightness of your image.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕັດສິນໃຈໃຊ້ໂມດູນ _ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ_, ທ່ານຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ມັນຕັ້ງແຕ່ຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການແກ້ໄຂ, ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປັບການຊົດເຊີຍແສງ ເພາະການແກ້ໄຂຂອບມືດອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍລວມຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reduce noise / retain detail"
msgstr "ຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນ (noise) / ຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At a pixel level there is a trade-off to be made between the retention of fine details and the reduction/removal of sensor noise. In most situations, a small amount of noise is perfectly acceptable and will not be noticeable except when you zoom in to 100%. At this scale you are not viewing the image at a realistic size -- even when represented on a large monitor or print, noise that is obvious at high zoom factors will be virtually invisible on the final image. However, some modules further along the image pipeline (especially those that increase local contrast) may end up exaggerating any noise that is present so, again, there are trade-offs to be made.\n"
msgstr "ໃນລະດັບພິກເຊວ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກລະຫວ່າງການຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນ ແລະ ການຫຼຸດ/ລຶບສິ່ງລົບກວນ (noise) ຂອງເຊັນເຊີ. ໃນສະຖານະການສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ສິ່ງລົບກວນເລັກໜ້ອຍແມ່ນເປັນທີ່ຍອມຮັບໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ ຍົກເວັ້ນເວລາທ່ານຊູມເບິ່ງທີ່ 100%. ໃນລະດັບການຊູມນີ້ ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ເບິ່ງຮູບໃນຂະໜາດທີ່ສົມຈິງ -- ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເບິ່ງເທິງຈໍພາບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ຫຼື ພິມອອກມາ, ສິ່ງລົບກວນທີ່ເຫັນຊັດເຈນຕອນຊູມຫຼາຍໆ ຈະແທບເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນເລີຍໃນຮູບສຸດທ້າຍ. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ບາງໂມດູນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໆໄປ (ໂດຍສະເພາະໂມດູນທີ່ເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ) ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສິ່ງລົບກວນເຫັນຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນ ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງມີການຊັ່ງຊາໃຫ້ດີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first module you can use to manage this is [_demosaic_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md), which controls how the single-color (R, G or B) pixels in your Raw file are converted to image pixels combining all three colors. Each demosaic algorithm has its own trade-offs between retaining fine detail and reducing noise. The default demosaic algorithm (RCD) usually provides a reasonable compromise.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຈັດການເລື່ອງນີ້ຄື [_ການຖອດລະຫັດສີ (demosaic)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md), ເຊິ່ງຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ພິກເຊວສີດ່ຽວ (R, G ຫຼື B) ໃນໄຟລ໌ Raw ຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນພິກເຊວຮູບພາບທີ່ລວມທັງສາມສີ. ແຕ່ລະອັນກໍຣິທຶມການ demosaic ມີການໄດ້ຢ່າງເສຍຢ່າງລະຫວ່າງການຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ການຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນ. ອັນກໍຣິທຶມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (RCD) ມັກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ສົມດຸນດີແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Demosaic algorithms can only do so much to manage noise in your image. The [_denoise (profiled)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md) module is individually tuned for a number of common camera sensors and can be used to reduce or remove pixel noise. As with demosaic you should alter the settings until you are happy with the balance of denoising vs fine-detail reproduction. The default settings are usually sufficient.\n"
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ Demosaic ສາມາດຈັດການສິ່ງລົບກວນໄດ້ໃນລະດັບໜຶ່ງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໂມດູນ [_ການຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌ (denoise profiled)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md) ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງມາສະເພາະສຳລັບເຊັນເຊີກ້ອງຍອດນິຍົມຫຼາຍລຸ້ນ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດ ຫຼື ລຶບສິ່ງລົບກວນໃນລະດັບພິກເຊວໄດ້. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ demosaic, ທ່ານຄວນປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈົນກວ່າຈະພໍໃຈກັບຄວາມສົມດຸນລະຫວ່າງການຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນ ແລະ ການຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນມັກຈະພຽງພໍແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sharpness and local contrast"
msgstr "ຄວາມຄົມຊັດ ແລະ ຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A number of modules can be used to adjust the local contrast and sharpness of your image. Most of these modules aim to enhance the apparent contrast of edges and do not add \"real\" sharpness (they are not the same as lens deconvolution). You should take care when using these modules as most of them can introduce artifacts (such as halos) when settings are pushed too far:\n"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍໂມດູນທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ (local contrast) ແລະ ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງຮູບພາບ. ໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສບໍລິເວນຂອບໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດ \"ແທ້ໆ\" (ພວກມັນບໍ່ຄືກັບການເຮັດ lens deconvolution). ທ່ານຄວນລະມັດລະວັງໃນການໃຊ້ໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ເພາະສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ອາດສ້າງສິ່ງແປກປອມ (ເຊັ່ນ: ແສງຟຸ້ງອ້ອມຂອບ ຫຼື halos) ຖ້າປັບຄ່າຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [_contrast equalizer_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md) module allows you to adjust contrast, limiting the effect to certain feature sizes. For example you can use it to increase the contrast of fine details without impacting larger-scale objects, or vice versa\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [_ຕົວປັບຄອນທຣາສ (contrast equalizer)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບຄອນທຣາສໄດ້ ໂດຍຈຳກັດຜົນກະທົບຕາມຂະໜາດຂອງລາຍລະອຽດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສຂອງລາຍລະອຽດນ້ອຍໆ ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ກະທົບຕໍ່ວັດຖຸຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ຫຼື ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [_diffuse or sharpen_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md) module offers a number of presets for sharpening, lens deblurring and the addition of local contrast\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [_ກະຈາຍ ຫຼື ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົມ (diffuse or sharpen)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md) ມີຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ຫຼາຍແບບສຳລັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຄົມຊັດ, ການຫຼຸດຄວາມເບຼີຂອງເລນ ແລະ ການເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [_local contrast_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md) module provides a simpler interface for quickly adding local contrast to your images -- just enabling the module or selecting one of the presets is often all that is required\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [_ຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ (local contrast)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md) ມີສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າສຳລັບການເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ -- ພຽງແຕ່ເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ ຫຼື ເລືອກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ແບບໃດໜຶ່ງກໍ່ມັກຈະພຽງພໍແລ້ວ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the [_sharpen_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/sharpen.md) module is intended to re-introduce sharpness that was removed by your camera's anti-alias filter (if present) and can be enabled by default in [preferences > processing](../../preferences-settings/processing.md). The methods listed above are usually preferred to this legacy module.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [_ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົມ (sharpen)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/sharpen.md) ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດທີ່ຖືກຫຼຸດອອກໂດຍຟິວເຕີ anti-alias ຂອງກ້ອງ (ຖ້າມີ) ແລະ ສາມາດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ](../../preferences-settings/processing.md). ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ ວິທີການທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງມັກຈະໄດ້ຜົນດີກວ່າໂມດູນເກົ່ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As with the modules mentioned in the previous section, you should take care when adding contrast to small-scale objects -- an image viewed at 100% is not a realistic representation of your final edit and local contrast adjustments are usually better judged when zoomed out.\n"
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບໂມດູນທີ່ກ່າວໄວ້ໃນພາກກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ເຈົ້າຄວນລະມັດລະວັງໃນເວລາເພີ່ມຄວາມຕ່າງລະດັບສີ (contrast) ໃຫ້ກັບວັດຖຸຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ -- ຮູບພາບທີ່ເບິ່ງໃນລະດັບ 100% ບໍ່ແມ່ນການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ສົມຈິງຂອງການປັບແຕ່ງຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ ແລະ ການປັບຄວາມຕ່າງລະດັບສີສະເພາະສ່ວນ (local contrast) ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຕັດສິນໄດ້ດີກວ່າເມື່ອຊູມອອກ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reconstruct blown highlights"
msgstr "ກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງທີ່ເກີນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While a well-exposed image will make post-processing much easier, darktable does provide a few tools to handle blown highlights.\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຮູບພາບທີ່ມີການຮັບແສງທີ່ດີຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການປັບແຕ່ງພາຍຫຼັງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ darktable ກໍມີເຄື່ອງມືບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອຈັດການກັບສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງທີ່ເກີນ (blown highlights).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [_highlight reconstruction_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md) module attempts to reconstruct blown highlights (colors and structure) using adjacent pixels. A number of different approaches are provided, some of which may be better on certain images, however, the default algorithm produces good results in most cases.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [_ການກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md) ພະຍາຍາມກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງທີ່ເກີນ (ທັງສີ ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງ) ໂດຍໃຊ້ພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ຕິດກັນ. ມີຫຼາຍວິທີການທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້, ເຊິ່ງບາງວິທີອາດຈະດີກວ່າໃນບາງຮູບພາບ, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ອັລກໍຣິທຶມມາດຕະຖານກໍໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Even well-reconstructed highlights can show color and edge artifacts, some of which may be exacerbated by subsequent modules in the pipe. In this case the [_reconstruct tab on the filmic rgb module_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#reconstruct) provides additional methods to further smooth/correct highlights at the end of the processing pipeline.\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງທີ່ກູ້ຄືນມາໄດ້ດີແລ້ວກໍຍັງສາມາດສະແດງສີ ແລະ ຮອຍຢັກຕາມຂອບທີ່ຜິດພ້ຽນໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງບາງຢ່າງອາດຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໂມດູນອື່ນໆໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ມາ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ [_ແຖບກູ້ຄືນ (reconstruct) ໃນໂມດູນ filmic rgb_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md#reconstruct) ໄດ້ມີວິທີການເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງມີຄວາມນຸ່ມນວນ/ຖືກຕ້ອງຂຶ້ນໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "adjust angle and perspective"
msgstr "ປັບມຸມ ແລະ ເປີສະເປັກທິບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [_rotate and perspective_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md) module can be used to adjust the angle of the image or to simulate the functionality of a tilt/shift lens by altering the perspective, making converging horizontal and/or vertical lines parallel (keystone correction). This latter technique is most commonly used for architectural photography. If you just want to correct the angle of the horizon you can do this by right-clicking and dragging along the horizon line.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [_ໝູນ ແລະ ເປີສະເປັກທິບ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md) ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບມຸມຂອງຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ເພື່ອຈຳລອງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເລນ tilt/shift ໂດຍການປ່ຽນເປີສະເປັກທິບ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນນອນ ແລະ/ຫຼື ເສັ້ນຕັ້ງ ທີ່ລູ່ເຂົ້າຫາກັນກາຍເປັນເສັ້ນຂະໜານ (ການແກ້ໄຂ keystone). ເຕັກນິກນີ້ມັກໃຊ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບການຖ່າຍຮູບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂມຸມຂອງເສັ້ນຂອບຟ້າ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາ ແລ້ວລາກໄປຕາມເສັ້ນຂອບຟ້າ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "remove spots and unwanted objects"
msgstr "ລຶບຈຸດ ແລະ ວັດຖຸທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [_retouch_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md) module to remove unwanted objects by replacing pixels with detail from elsewhere in the image. This module also offers powerful techniques for removing large-scale objects (such as spots or blemishes) while leaving fine-scale details (like hairs and follicles) intact. The most common use for this module is to remove dust spots from images or blemishes from skin.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ຕົບແຕ່ງ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md) ເພື່ອລຶບວັດຖຸທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການອອກ ໂດຍການປ່ຽນແທນພິກເຊວດ້ວຍລາຍລະອຽດຈາກສ່ວນອື່ນຂອງຮູບພາບ. ໂມດູນນີ້ຍັງມີເຕັກນິກທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສຳລັບການລຶບວັດຖຸຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຈຸດ ຫຼື ຮອຍຕຳໜິ) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເສັ້ນຜົມ ແລະ ຮູຂຸມຂົນ) ໃຫ້ຄືເກົ່າ. ການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບໂມດູນນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອລຶບຈຸດຝຸ່ນອອກຈາກຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ລຶບຮອຍຕຳໜິອອກຈາກຜິວໜັງ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "remove atmospheric haze"
msgstr "ລຶບໝອກຄວັນໃນບັນຍາກາດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two methods for removing atmospheric haze in darktable. The [haze removal](../../module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md) module provides a much simpler interface, but the \"dehaze\" preset in the [_diffuse or sharpen_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md) module can provide more flexibility when needed.\n"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການລຶບໝອກຄວັນໃນບັນຍາກາດໃນ darktable. ໂມດູນ [ລຶບໝອກຄວັນ](../../module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md) ມີໜ້າຕ່າງການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ \"dehaze\" ໃນໂມດູນ [_ຟຸ້ງ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md) ສາມາດໃຫ້ຄວາມຍືດຫຍຸ່ນໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າເມື່ອຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "creative adjustments"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງແບບສ້າງສັນ"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "crop and frame"
msgstr "ຕັດຂອບ ແລະ ໃສ່ກອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [_crop_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md) module to crop your image and the [_framing_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md) module to surround your image with a colored frame. Both modules can be set to use a predefined or custom aspect ratio -- for example, you could place a square-cropped image into a 3:2 frame.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ຕັດຂອບ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md) ເພື່ອຕັດຮູບພາບຂອງເຈົ້າ ແລະ ໂມດູນ [_ການໃສ່ກອບ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md) ເພື່ອໃສ່ກອບສີໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບ. ທັງສອງໂມດູນສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ຫຼື ກຳນົດເອງ -- ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າສາມາດວາງຮູບພາບທີ່ຕັດເປັນຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມມົນທົນລົງໃນກອບອັດຕາສ່ວນ 3:2 ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "dodge and burn"
msgstr "ເລັ່ງແສງ ແລະ ເເລັ່ງເງົາ (dodge and burn)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dodging and burning is a traditional darkroom technique to add and remove brightness from an image. There are two recommended ways to achieve this\n"
msgstr "ການເລັ່ງແສງ (dodging) ແລະ ເລັ່ງເງົາ (burning) ແມ່ນເຕັກນິກຫ້ອງມືດແບບດັ້ງເດີມເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຈາກຮູບພາບ. ມີສອງວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to selectively dodge or burn only certain objects you can apply a [new instance](../../darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md) of the [_exposure_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) module using a [drawn mask](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) to isolate the effect to the required area of the image (see also the [mask refinement](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md) section for more information). Move the exposure slider to alter the brightness of the masked area.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເລັ່ງແສງ ຫຼື ເລັ່ງເງົາສະເພາະບາງວັດຖຸ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [ການສ້າງຊ້ຳໃໝ່](../../darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md) ຂອງໂມດູນ [_ການຮັບແສງ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) ໂດຍໃຊ້ [ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) ເພື່ອແຍກຜົນກະທົບໃຫ້ຢູ່ສະເພາະພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຂອງຮູບພາບ (ເບິ່ງພາກ [ການປັບແຕ່ງໜ້າກາກ](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ). ເລື່ອນແຖບການຮັບແສງເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ໃສ່ໜ້າກາກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you wish to dodge or burn areas with a similar brightness (for example, to brighten the shadows or darken the highlights) you should use the [_tone equalizer_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເລັ່ງແສງ ຫຼື ເລັ່ງເງົາໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງມືດລົງ) ເຈົ້າຄວນໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນສີ (tone equalizer)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "convert to monochrome"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເປັນພາບຂາວດຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable provides a number of ways to remove the color from your image. The most flexible method is to use the [_gray tab of the color calibration module_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md#gray-tab). A number of film emulation presets are available in this module to provide you with a starting point.\n"
msgstr "darktable ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການລຶບສີອອກຈາກຮູບພາບຂອງເຈົ້າ. ວິທີທີ່ຍືດຫຍຸ່ນທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການໃຊ້ [_ແຖບສີເທົາຂອງໂມດູນການປັບທຽບສີ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md#gray-tab). ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳລອງຟີມຫຼາຍແບບໃນໂມດູນນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າໃຊ້ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [developing monochrome images](../../guides-tutorials/monochrome.md) section for details of other techniques.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງພາກ [ການລ້າງຮູບພາບຂາວດຳ](../../guides-tutorials/monochrome.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເຕັກນິກອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "color grading"
msgstr "ການເກຣດສີ (color grading)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [_color balance rgb_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-balance-rgb.md) module is your one-stop-shop for controlling the colors in your image. Adjustments can be isolated to the shadows, highlights and mid-tones, or applied at a global level.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [_ສົມດຸນສີ rgb_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-balance-rgb.md) ແມ່ນຈຸດບໍລິການດຽວສຳລັບການຄວບຄຸມສີໃນຮູບພາບຂອງເຈົ້າ. ການປັບແຕ່ງສາມາດແຍກສ່ວນໄປຍັງເງົາ (shadows), ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ (highlights) ແລະ ໂທນສີກາງ (mid-tones), ຫຼື ປັບໃຊ້ໃນລະດັບລວມທັງໝົດ (global).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "other important topics"
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ສຳຄັນອື່ນໆ"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reuse common module settings"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນທົ່ວໄປຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you find yourself using the same module parameters repeatedly, you can create [presets](../../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md) containing your favorite settings. If you use the same settings on every image, you can also make presets apply automatically to new images. For example, you may find yourself adding the same exposure settings to every image taken by a certain camera -- in this case you can create a preset that automatically applies those corrections only to images from that camera.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າພົບວ່າຕົນເອງໃຊ້ຄ່າພານາມິເຕີຂອງໂມດູນເດີມຊ້ຳໆ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງ [ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (presets)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md) ທີ່ລວມເອົາການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເຈົ້າມັກ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບທຸກຮູບພາບ, ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້ານັ້ນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດກັບຮູບພາບໃໝ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພົບວ່າຕົນເອງເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮັບແສງດຽວກັນກັບທຸກຮູບທີ່ຖ່າຍໂດຍກ້ອງໃດໜຶ່ງ -- ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເຊິ່ງຈະນຳໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສະເພາະກັບຮູບພາບຈາກກ້ອງນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You may also have groups of module settings that you commonly apply only to certain types of image. You can use [styles](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md) to apply multiple module settings at once to a selection of images.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າອາດຈະມີກຸ່ມຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນທີ່ເຈົ້າມັກໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບຮູບພາບ ບາງປະເພດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [ສະໄຕລ໌ (styles)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md) ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງຫຼາຍໂມດູນພ້ອມກັນກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "perform adjustments locally"
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງສະເພາະສ່ວນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most darktable modules can either be applied to the whole image, or restricted to parts of the image using [drawn and parametric masks](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md).\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ darktable ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທັງຮູບພາບ, ຫຼື ຈຳກັດສະເພາະບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ [ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ ແລະ ແບບພານາມິເຕີ](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "control darktable with other input methods"
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມ darktable ດ້ວຍວິທີການນຳເຂົ້າອື່ນໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You don't need to use the darktable UI to make adjustments to your images. Most of the functionality in darktable can also be controlled using shortcuts defined with your keyboard/mouse and even with other input devices such as game controllers and MIDI devices. See the [shortcuts](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md) section for details.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ UI ຂອງ darktable ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຮູບພາບຂອງເຈົ້າ. ຟັງຊັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນ darktable ຍັງສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດທີ່ກຳນົດດ້ວຍຄີບອດ/ເມົ້າ ແລະ ແມ່ນແຕ່ກັບອຸປະກອນນຳເຂົ້າອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ຈອຍເກມ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນ MIDI. ເບິ່ງພາກ [ປຸ່ມລັດ](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/workflow/export.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "export"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable is a non-destructive editor, which means that all changes are recorded in the library database (with a backup stored in an XMP sidecar file), and the original Raw file is left untouched. You therefore need to [export](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md) images in order to bake your edits into an output file that can be distributed outside of darktable.\n"
msgstr "darktable ແມ່ນໂປຣແກຣມແກ້ໄຂຮູບແບບບໍ່ທຳລາຍຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບພາບ (ໂດຍມີການສຳຮອງໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ XMP), ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ Raw ຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຕະຕ້ອງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ [ສົ່ງອອກ (export)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md) ຮູບພາບ ເພື່ອລວມການແກ້ໄຂຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ພາຍນອກ darktable ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/overview/workflow/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose an export scenario.\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "    The export module offers many options, but by far the most common use is to “save a developed raw image as a JPEG”. You can either export the currently-edited image directly from the darkroom view or select one or more images from the lighttable view and export them all at once.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ໂມດູນການສົ່ງອອກມີຫຼາຍຕົວເລືອກ, ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ “ບັນທຶກຮູບພາບ raw ທີ່ແຕ່ງແລ້ວເປັ"
"ນ JPEG”. ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກໜ້າຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom) ຫຼື ເລືອກຮູບພາບ"
"ໜຶ່ງຮູບ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຮູບຈາກໜ້າແຜງຮູບ (lighttable) ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກທັງໝົດໃນຄັ້ງດຽວ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/overview/workflow/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select which images to export (if you are in the lighttable view), open the export module, set _target storage_ to \"file on disk\" and select a location to save your images -- by default, they will be exported to a \"darktable_exported\" directory within the directory that contains your Raw file(s). Choose a \"file format\" of JPEG and keep the default settings.\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກ (ຖ້າທ່ານຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ), ເປີດໂມດູນການສົ່ງອອກ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປາຍທາງ_ ເປັນ \"ໄຟລ໌ໃນດິສກ໌ (file on disk)\" ແລະ ເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຈະບັນທຶກຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ -- ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ \"darktable_exported\" ພາຍໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ເກັບໄຟລ໌ Raw ຂອງທ່ານ. ເລືອກ \"ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌\" ເປັນ JPEG ແລະ ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/overview/workflow/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the exported collection's [image sequence](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md) is important (e.g. a slideshow or to merge photos into a document) and not reflected by file names, select the appropriate \"sort by\" criteria and include `$(SEQUENCE)` in the export file name template.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າ [ລຳດັບຮູບພາບ](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md) ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກມີຄວາມສຳຄັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ສຳລັບສະໄລດ໌ໂຊ ຫຼື ເພື່ອລວມຮູບເຂົ້າໃນເອກະສານ) ແລະ ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະທ້ອນລຳດັບນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເກນ \"ຈັດລຽງຕາມ\" ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແລະ ໃສ່ `$(SEQUENCE)` ໃນຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/overview/workflow/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the \"export\" button to save your processed images in the selected location.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"ສົ່ງອອກ (export)\" ເພື່ອບັນທຶກຮູບພາບທີ່ປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** While JPEG is useful for most purposes, if you wish to perform further edits in a raster editor like GIMP or Krita, it is normally better to export in TIFF format.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ JPEG ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ, ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນໂປຣແກຣມແຕ່ງຮູບແບບຣາສເຕີ (raster editor) ເຊັ່ນ GIMP ຫຼື Krita, ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວການສົ່ງອອກໃນຮູບແບບ TIFF ຈະດີກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/workflow/import-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "import & review"
msgstr "ການນຳເຂົ້າ & ການກວດສອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/import-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you can do anything in darktable you must first add some images files to the library using the [import](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md) module in the [lighttable view](../../lighttable/_index.md). This will create entries for your images in darktable's library database so that it can keep track of the changes you make. There are three ways to import images, each accessible through buttons in the import module:\n"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເຮັດຫຍັງໄດ້ໃນ darktable, ກ່ອນອື່ນໝົດທ່ານຕ້ອງເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໃນຄັງຮູບພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ນຳເຂົ້າ (import)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md) ໃນ [ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ](../../lighttable/_index.md). ນີ້ຈະສ້າງລາຍການສຳລັບຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບພາບຂອງ darktable ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສາມາດຕິດຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດໄດ້. ມີ 3 ວິທີໃນການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບ, ແຕ່ລະວິທີສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆໃນໂມດູນການນຳເຂົ້າ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/import-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"add to library\n"
": This option adds images to the library without copying or moving -- your original files will stay in their current location and will not be altered. On import, darktable will read the metadata from the image files and any accompanying [XMP sidecar file](../../overview/sidecar-files/_index.md). If an image has already been added to the database, any updates you have made to the sidecar file will be loaded.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າຄັງຮູບພາບ (add to library)\n"
": ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໃນຄັງຮູບພາບໂດຍບໍ່ມີການກັອບປີ້ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ -- ໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງທ່ານຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງເດີມ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ, darktable ຈະອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາດາຕາຈາກໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ແລະ [ໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ XMP](../../overview/sidecar-files/_index.md) ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຖ້າຮູບພາບນັ້ນຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນແລ້ວ, ການອັບເດດໃດໆທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດໃນໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຂຶ້ນມາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/import-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"copy & import\n"
": Copies the images to the storage location (following the file naming pattern defined in [preferences > import](../../preferences-settings/import.md)), then adds the _copied_ images to the library -- the original images are not changed or moved. Only the images are copied and if an existing XMP sidecar file is available for the image, it will *not* be read, copied or used.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກັອບປີ້ & ນຳເຂົ້າ (copy & import)\n"
": ກັອບປີ້ຮູບພາບໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (ຕາມຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ນຳເຂົ້າ](../../preferences-settings/import.md)), ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເພີ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ _ກັອບປີ້ມາ_ ເຂົ້າໃນຄັງຮູບພາບ -- ຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍ. ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຮູບພາບເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກກັອບປີ້ ແລະ ຖ້າມີໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ XMP ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະ *ບໍ່* ຖືກອ່ານ, ກັອບປີ້ ຫຼື ນຳມາໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/import-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"copy & import from camera\n"
": Connect the camera to your system with a USB cable (if your camera is auto-mounted by your system, you will need to un-mount it before it can be accessed by darktable). If you don't see your camera listed in the import module, press the \"scan for devices\" button. Once your camera is detected the import module should offer the ability to _copy & import_ images from the camera. Clicking the \"copy & import\" button physically copies the selected images from the camera into a specified directory (following the file naming pattern defined in [preferences > import](../../preferences-settings/import.md)) and then adds the copied images to the library.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກັອບປີ້ & ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກກ້ອງ (copy & import from camera)\n"
": ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ້ອງກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍສາຍ USB (ຖ້າກ້ອງຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍລະບົບ, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຍົກເລີກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື un-mount ມັນກ່ອນ ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍ darktable). ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ເຫັນລາຍຊື່ກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານໃນໂມດູນການນຳເຂົ້າ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ \"ສະແກນຫາອຸປະກອນ (scan for devices)\". ເມື່ອກວດພົບກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ, ໂມດູນການນຳເຂົ້າຈະສະແດງຕົວເລືອກ _ກັອບປີ້ & ນຳເຂົ້າ_ ຮູບພາບຈາກກ້ອງ. ການຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"ກັອບປີ້ & ນຳເຂົ້າ\" ຈະເປັນການກັອບປີ້ຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກຈາກກ້ອງໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ (ຕາມຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ນຳເຂົ້າ](../../preferences-settings/import.md)) ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງເພີ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ກັອບປີ້ມາເຂົ້າໃນຄັງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/import-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once images have been imported, their thumbnails are displayed in the lighttable view, within which you can organize and catalog your imported images -- please refer to the [digital asset management](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/_index.md) section for more information.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບແລ້ວ, ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງ, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຈັດລະບຽບ ແລະ ແຍກປະເພດຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ -- ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນສ່ວນ [ການຈັດການຊັບສິນດິຈິຕອນ (digital asset management)](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/_index.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/import-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The primary use for the lighttable view is to review your images and decide which you would like to edit further and which to discard. The following is a possible culling process to choose which images to edit/delete:\n"
"1. Set the lighttable view to only show images with a rating of exactly 1 star using the _view_ setting on the [top panel](../user-interface/top-panel.md). Since darktable assigns a 1 star rating to newly-imported images by default, this will show all of the images you have just imported. You can use the [collections](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md) module to further refine your selection if needed.\n"
"2. Perform a quick first-level screening of your images: If any images are badly out-of-focus or otherwise unwanted, _reject_ them or give them a 0-star rating (by pressing the \"R\" or \"0\" keys, respectively, while hovering over the image with your mouse). If you would like an image to pass to the next review phase, press 2 to give it a 2 star rating. Any images that no longer have a 1 star rating will automatically disappear from view. Continue in this manner until no more images remain visible in the lighttable view.\n"
"3. Alter the lighttable view to only show images with 2 stars. Go through these images more carefully, and decide whether to promote them to a 3 star rating, or put them back down to a lower rating. Again, proceed until no more images remain in the lighttable view.\n"
"4. Alter the lighttable view to only show images with 3 stars. Perform quick edits and experiments on those images in the [darkroom view](../../darkroom/_index.md) to decide if they are worthy of further effort. If you are happy with the results of those edits, promote that image to a 4 star rating for final editing.\n"
"5. Go through your 4 star images, perform any final edits on them and then [export](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md) to see the final result. Increase the rating a final time to 5 stars to indicate that processing is complete.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການໃຊ້ງານຫຼັກຂອງສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງແມ່ນເພື່ອມາກວດສອບຮູບພາບ ແລະ ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຮູບໃດທີ່ຕ້ອງການແຕ່ງຕໍ່ ແລະ ຮູບໃດທີ່ຈະຄັດອອກ. ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຂະບວນການຄັດເລືອກຮູບພາບ (culling process) ທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້:\n"
"1. ຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງໃຫ້ສະແດງສະເພາະຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຄະແນນ 1 ດາວ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ມຸມເບິ່ງ (view)_ ໃນ [ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ](../user-interface/top-panel.md). ເນື່ອງຈາກ darktable ຈະໃຫ້ຄະແນນ 1 ດາວແກ່ຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ວິທີນີ້ຈະສະແດງທຸກຮູບທີ່ທ່ານຫາຜ່ານຳເຂົ້າ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ກຸ່ມຮູບພາບ (collections)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md) ເພື່ອຄັດເລືອກໃຫ້ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນຖ້າຈຳເປັນ.\n"
"2. ກວດສອບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຢ່າງໄວວາ: ຖ້າຮູບໃດຫຼຸດໂຟກັດຢ່າງໜັກ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ, ໃຫ້ _ປະຕິເສດ (reject)_ ຫຼື ໃຫ້ 0 ດາວ (ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ \"R\" ຫຼື \"0\" ຕາມລຳດັບ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວາງເມົ້າໄວ້ເທິງຮູບ). ຖ້າຮູບໃດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຜ່ານໄປຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ, ໃຫ້ກົດ \"2\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ 2 ດາວ. ຮູບໃດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີ 1 ດາວແລ້ວ ຈະຫາຍໄປຈາກໜ້າຈໍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເຮັດແບບນີ້ຕໍ່ໄປຈົນກວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີຮູບເຫຼືອໃນໜ້າໂຕະແສງ.\n"
"3. ປ່ຽນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງໃຫ້ສະແດງສະເພາະຮູບທີ່ມີ 2 ດາວ. ກວດເບິ່ງຮູບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ຕັດສິນໃຈວ່າຈະໃຫ້ 3 ດາວ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄະແນນລົງ. ເຮັດແບບເດີມຈົນກວ່າຮູບຈະໝົດໄປ.\n"
"4. ປ່ຽນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນໂຕະແສງໃຫ້ສະແດງສະເພາະຮູບທີ່ມີ 3 ດາວ. ລອງແຕ່ງຮູບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແບບໄວໆໃນ [ສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຫ້ອງມືດ](../../darkroom/_index.md) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າຮູບໃດຄຸ້ມຄ່າທີ່ຈະແຕ່ງຕໍ່. ຖ້າພໍໃຈກັບຜົນການແຕ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເປັນ 4 ດາວສຳລັບການແຕ່ງຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"
"5. ກວດເບິ່ງຮູບ 4 ດາວຂອງທ່ານ, ແຕ່ງຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍໃຫ້ຮຽບຮ້ອຍ ແລ້ວ [ສົ່ງອອກ (export)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ. ສຸດທ້າຍໃຫ້ເພີ່ມເປັນ 5 ດາວເພື່ອບອກວ່າການປະມວນຜົນຮູບນີ້ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/import-review.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_If space is at a premium you might consider permanently deleting your rejected or 0-star images. Select these images in the lighttable view and use the 'trash/delete' option in the [actions on selection](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md) module. You should only do this for images you are certain you will never need again._\n"
msgstr "_ຖ້າພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານມີຈຳກັດ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພິຈາລະນາລຶບຮູບທີ່ຖືກປະຕິເສດ ຫຼື ຮູບ 0 ດາວ ອອກຢ່າງຖາວອນ. ເລືອກຮູບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນໜ້າໂຕະແສງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ 'ຖິ້ມລົງຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ/ລຶບ (trash/delete)' ໃນໂມດູນ [ການຈັດການກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md). ທ່ານຄວນເຮັດແບບນີ້ກັບຮູບທີ່ທ່ານໝັ້ນໃຈແລ້ວວ່າຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານອີກແທ້ໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ._\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/workflow/introduction.md
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-balance-rgb.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "introduction"
msgstr "ບົດນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/introduction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section is intended to provide you with a flavor of what darktable can do and offer a suggested end-to-end processing workflow. New users should start by working through this introduction and following the links provided for further details.\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງສິ່ງທີ່ darktable ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ແລະ ແນະນຳຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈົນຈົບ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ຄວນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກບົດນຳນີ້ ແລະ ເຂົ້າເບິ່ງລິ້ງຕ່າງໆທີ່ໃຫ້ໄວ້ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/introduction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please note that this is not an exhaustive guide and many useful topics are not covered. You are advised to read through the reference sections of this manual once you are familiar with the basics.\n"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄູ່ມືທີ່ລວມທຸກຢ່າງໄວ້ ແລະ ຍັງມີຫຼາຍຫົວຂໍ້ທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່າວເຖິງຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ທ່ານຄວນອ່ານສ່ວນອ້າງອີງຂອງຄູ່ມືນີ້ເມື່ອທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບພື້ນຖານແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/workflow/introduction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Further information on most of the subjects in this guide are also covered in the [other resources](../../guides-tutorials/other-resources.md) section.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຫົວຂໍ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນຄູ່ມືນີ້ ຍັງມີລາຍລະອຽດໃນສ່ວນ [ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ](../../guides-tutorials/other-resources.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/workflow/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "an introduction to darktable's workflow"
msgstr "ບົດນຳກ່ຽວກັບຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ darktable"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "supported file formats"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable supports a huge number of file formats from various camera manufacturers. In addition darktable can read a wide range of low- and high-dynamic-range images -- mainly for data exchange between darktable and other software.\n"
msgstr "darktable ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຈຳນວນມະຫາສານຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດກ້ອງຕ່າງໆ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ darktable ຍັງສາມາດອ່ານຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຕ່ຳ ແລະ ສູງ (low- and high-dynamic-range) ໄດ້ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ -- ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນເພື່ອການແລກປ່ຽນຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງ darktable ແລະ ຊອບແວອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order for darktable to consider a file for import, it must have one of the following extensions (case independent): `3FR, ARI, ARW, BAY, BMQ, CAP, CINE, CR2, CR3, CRW, CS1, DC2, DCR, DNG, GPR, ERF, FFF, EXR, IA, IIQ, JPEG, JPG, JXL, K25, KC2, KDC, MDC, MEF, MOS, MRW, NEF, NRW, ORF, PEF, PFM, PNG, PXN, QTK, RAF, RAW, RDC, RW1, RW2, SR2, SRF, SRW, STI, TIF, TIFF, X3F`\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ darktable ພິຈາລະນາໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບການນຳເຂົ້າ, ມັນຕ້ອງມີນາມສະກຸນໃດໜຶ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ (ບໍ່ແຍກຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່ພິມນ້ອຍ): `3FR, ARI, ARW, BAY, BMQ, CAP, CINE, CR2, CR3, CRW, CS1, DC2, DCR, DNG, GPR, ERF, FFF, EXR, IA, IIQ, JPEG, JPG, JXL, K25, KC2, KDC, MDC, MEF, MOS, MRW, NEF, NRW, ORF, PEF, PFM, PNG, PXN, QTK, RAF, RAW, RDC, RW1, RW2, SR2, SRF, SRW, STI, TIF, TIFF, X3F`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If darktable was compiled with JPEG2000 support, the following extensions are also recognized: `J2C, J2K, JP2, JPC, JPF, JPX`.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າ darktable ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ (compile) ດ້ວຍການຮອງຮັບ JPEG2000, ນາມສະກຸນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ກໍຈະຖືກຮັບຮູ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ: `J2C, J2K, JP2, JPC, JPF, JPX`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If darktable was compiled with GraphicsMagick support, the following extensions are also recognized: `BMP, CIN, DCM, DPX, GIF, JNG, JPC, JP2, JPF, JPX, MIFF, MNG, PBM, PGM, PNM, PPM, WEBP`.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າ darktable ຖືກຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍການຮອງຮັບ GraphicsMagick, ນາມສະກຸນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ກໍຈະຖືກຮັບຮູ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ: `BMP, CIN, DCM, DPX, GIF, JNG, JPC, JP2, JPF, JPX, MIFF, MNG, PBM, PGM, PNM, PPM, WEBP`.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "camera raw files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ raw ຂອງກ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable reads raw files using the open source library [RawSpeed](https://github.com/darktable-org/rawspeed), originally developed by Klaus Post and now maintained as part of the darktable project. The number of supported cameras and file formats is constantly increasing. Most modern camera models are supported, and new ones tend to get added very quickly. It is beyond the scope of this manual to give an exhaustive list.\n"
msgstr "darktable ອ່ານໄຟລ໌ raw ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີໂອເພນຊອດ [RawSpeed](https://github.com/darktable-org/rawspeed), ເຊິ່ງພັດທະນາໂດຍ Klaus Post ໃນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຕອນນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການເບິ່ງແຍງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໂຄງການ darktable. ຈຳນວນຂອງກ້ອງ ແລະ ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍໆ. ກ້ອງລຸ້ນໃໝ່ໆສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ, ແລະ ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ໆກໍມັກຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າຢ່າງໄວວາ. ມັນເກີນຂອບເຂດຂອງຄູ່ມືນີ້ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the exception of Fujifilm X-Trans cameras, darktable does not decode images from cameras with non-Bayer sensors (e.g. Sigma cameras with the Foveon X3 sensor).\n"
msgstr "ຍົກເວັ້ນກ້ອງ Fujifilm X-Trans, darktable ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖອດລະຫັດຮູບພາບຈາກກ້ອງທີ່ມີເຊັນເຊີທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບ Bayer (ເຊັ່ນ: ກ້ອງ Sigma ທີ່ມີເຊັນເຊີ Foveon X3).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "other image files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບອື່ນໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable natively reads “ordinary” images in JPEG, 8-bit/16-bit PNG and 8-bit/16-bit TIFF format, as well as 16-bit/32-bit floating point TIFF formats.\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable ສາມາດອ່ານຮູບພາບ “ທົ່ວໄປ” ໃນຮູບແບບ JPEG, 8-bit/16-bit PNG ແລະ 8-bit/16-"
"bit TIFF, ລວມທັງຮູບແບບ 16-bit/32-bit floating point TIFF ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/overview/supported-file-formats.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable also reads high dynamic range images in OpenEXR, RGBE and PFM formats.\n"
msgstr "darktable ຍັງອ່ານຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກສູງໃນຮູບແບບ OpenEXR, RGBE ແລະ PFM.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/overview/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "collections & film rolls"
msgstr "ຊຸດຮູບພາບ ແລະ ມ້ວນຟິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A collection is a group of images matching a given set of selection criteria.\n"
msgstr "ຊຸດຮູບພາບ (collection) ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ກົງກັບເກນການເລືອກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most basic kind of collection is a film roll, which contains all of the images that have been imported from a specific folder on disk -- whenever you [import](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md) images from the filesystem, those images are organized in a film roll whose name is derived from that of their parent folder.\n"
msgstr "ຊຸດຮູບພາບພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຸດຄື ມ້ວນຟິມ (film roll), ເຊິ່ງລວມເອົາຮູບທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າມາຈາກໂຟນເດີໃດໜຶ່ງໃນດິດ -- ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານ [ນຳເຂົ້າ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md) ຮູບພາບຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ຮູບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກຈັດຢູ່ໃນມ້ວນຟິມທີ່ມີຊື່ຕາມຊື່ຂອງໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can easily construct other kinds of collection in the [collections](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md) module based on one or more image attributes (e.g. Exif data, filename, tags). The [collection filters](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md) module allows you to refine a collection by setting additional selection and exclusion criteria.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊຸດຮູບພາບປະເພດອື່ນໆໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍໃນໂມດູນ [ຊຸດຮູບພາບ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md) ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງຮູບພາບ (ເຊັ່ນ ຂໍ້ມູນ Exif, ຊື່ໄຟລ໌, ແທັກ). ໂມດູນ [ຕົວກອງຊຸດຮູບພາບ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບແຕ່ງຊຸດຮູບພາບໃຫ້ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນໂດຍການກຳນົດເກນການເລືອກ ແລະ ການຍົກເວັ້ນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A list of the most recently used collections is retained for quick access. These can be accessed from the [recent collections](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ຊຸດຮູບພາບທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໄວ. ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງພວກມັນໄດ້ຈາກໂມດູນ [ຊຸດຮູບພາບຫຼ້າສຸດ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#: content/preferences-settings/lighttable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "thumbnails"
msgstr "ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnails)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each image in the current collection is represented by a thumbnail in the lighttable view and filmstrip module. A cache of the most recently used thumbnails is stored in a file on disk and loaded into memory at startup.\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຮູບພາບໃນຊຸດຮູບພາບປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnail) ໃນມຸມເບິ່ງ lighttable ແລະ ໂມດູນແຖບຟິມ. ແຄຊ (cache) ຂອງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ເທິງດິດ ແລະ ຖືກໂຫຼດເຂົ້າໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂປຣແກຣມ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "thumbnail creation"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A thumbnail is created when an image is imported into darktable for the first time, after an image has been modified in the darkroom, or when revisiting an image whose thumbnail is no longer available.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໃນ darktable ເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງຮູບພາບໃນຫ້ອງມືດ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອເປີດເບິ່ງຮູບພາບທີ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງມັນບໍ່ມີແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When an image is imported for the first time darktable can either try to extract an embedded thumbnail from the input image (most raw files contain these, usually in JPEG format) or process the raw image itself using default settings. You can define how darktable obtains its thumbnails in [preferences > lighttable > thumbnails](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md#thumbnails).\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, darktable ສາມາດພະຍາຍາມດຶງເອົາຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຝັງມາໃນໄຟລ໌ (ໄຟລ໌ Raw ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະມີຮູບເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ມັກຈະເປັນແບບ JPEG) ຫຼື ປະມວນຜົນໄຟລ໌ Raw ເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດວິທີທີ່ darktable ສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > lighttable > ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md#thumbnails).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extracting an embedded thumbnail from the input image is usually very fast. However, these thumbnails have been generated by the raw converter of the camera and do not represent darktable's “view” of that image. You will notice the difference as soon as you open the image in the darkroom mode, at which point darktable replaces the thumbnail with its own internally processed version.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການດຶງເອົາຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnail) ທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ໃນຮູບພາບນຳເຂົ້າມັກຈະໄວຫຼາຍ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້"
"ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍຕົວແປງໄຟລ໌ raw ຂອງກ້ອງ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະແດງເຖິງ “ມຸມມອງ” ຂອງ darktable ຕໍ່ຮູບພາບນັ້"
"ນ. ທ່ານຈະສັງເກດເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທັນທີທີ່ທ່ານເປີດຮູບພາບໃນໂໝດຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom), ເຊິ່ງໃນຈຸດນັ້ນ "
"darktable ຈະປ່ຽນຮູບຕົວຢ່າງດ້ວຍເວີຊັນທີ່ປະມວນຜົນພາຍໃນຂອງມັນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "After import darktable automatically generates thumbnails for new images as they are needed. When importing a large set of new images, thumbnail generation can slow down navigation in the lighttable view. Alternatively you may terminate darktable and generate the thumbnail cache separately by running [`darktable-generate-cache`](../../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md). This program will generate all missing thumbnails in one go.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນຳເຂົ້າ, darktable ຈະສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບຮູບໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ. ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ການສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການນຳທາງໃນ lighttable ຊ້າລົງ. ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ ທ່ານສາມາດປິດ darktable ແລ້ວສ້າງແຄຊຮູບຕົວຢ່າງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໂດຍການລັນໂປຣແກຣມ [`darktable-generate-cache`](../../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md). ໂປຣແກຣມນີ້ຈະສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ມີທັງໝົດໃນຄັ້ງດຽວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the thumbnail cache has a pre-defined maximum size it will eventually get filled up. If new thumbnails are subsequently added, old thumbnails are dropped from the cache. However, darktable will keep all thumbnails on disk if the corresponding disk backend option is activated in [preferences > lighttable > thumbnails](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md#thumbnails). Access to the thumbnails in this secondary cache is slower than the primary cache, but still much faster than reprocessing thumbnails from scratch. The size of the secondary cache is limited only by the available disk space.\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກແຄຊຮູບຕົວຢ່າງມີການກຳນົດຂະໜາດສູງສຸດໄວ້, ໃນທີ່ສຸດມັນກໍຈະເຕັມ. ຫາກມີການເພີ່ມຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃໝ່, ຮູບເກົ່າຈະຖືກລົບອອກຈາກແຄຊ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, darktable ຈະເກັບຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທັງໝົດໄວ້ໃນດິດ ຫາກທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກການເກັບໄວ້ໃນດິດໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > lighttable > ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md#thumbnails). ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃນແຄຊສຳຮອງນີ້ຈະຊ້າກວ່າແຄຊຫຼັກ, ແຕ່ກໍຍັງໄວຫຼາຍກວ່າການສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ. ຂະໜາດຂອງແຄຊສຳຮອງນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳກັດພຽງແຕ່ພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງໃນດິດຂອງທ່ານເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thumbnails are never removed from the secondary cache. You can manually clean the secondary cache by recursively deleting all images in the `$HOME/.cache/darktable/mipmaps-xyz.d` folder (where `xyz` denotes an alphanumeric identifier of the cache). After clearing the secondary cache you can simply allow darktable to re-generate thumbnails as needed, or you can generate all thumbnails in one go with [`darktable-generate-cache`](../../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md).\n"
msgstr "ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຈະບໍ່ຖືກລົບອອກຈາກແຄຊສຳຮອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດລ້າງແຄຊສຳຮອງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍການລຶບຮູບທັງໝົດໃນໂຟນເດີ `$HOME/.cache/darktable/mipmaps-xyz.d` (ບ່ອນທີ່ `xyz` ແມ່ນລະຫັດຂອງແຄຊ). ຫຼັງຈາກລ້າງແຄຊສຳຮອງແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ອຍໃຫ້ darktable ສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃໝ່ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ, ຫຼື ສ້າງທັງໝົດໃໝ່ໃນຄັ້ງດຽວດ້ວຍ [`darktable-generate-cache`](../../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you choose not to activate the disk backend and select too small a cache size, darktable may become unresponsive, you may experience continuous regeneration of thumbnails when you navigate your collection or flickering of thumbnail images. A good choice of cache size is 512MB or higher (see [memory & performance tuning](../../../special-topics/mem-performance.md) for more information).\n"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເລືອກທີ່ຈະບໍ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນດິດ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດແຄຊນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ, darktable ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກຊ້າ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບກັບການສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃໝ່ຕະຫຼອດເວລາເມື່ອນຳທາງໃນຊຸດຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ເຫັນຮູບຕົວຢ່າງກະພິບ. ຂະໜາດແຄຊທີ່ເໝາະສົມຄື 512MB ຫຼື ສູງກວ່າ (ເບິ່ງ [ການປັບແຕ່ງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ປະສິດທິພາບ](../../../special-topics/mem-performance.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All thumbnails are fully color managed. Colors are rendered accurately on screen as long as your system is properly set up to hand over the right monitor profile to darktable. For more information see the [color management](../../../special-topics/color-management/_index.md) section.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຈັດການສີຢ່າງສົມບູນ. ສີຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງເທິງໜ້າຈໍ ຕາບໃດທີ່ລະບົບຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສົ່ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ກັບ darktable. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໃນພາກ [ການຈັດການສີ](../../../special-topics/color-management/_index.md).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "skulls, question marks, and warning triangles"
msgstr "ຮູບກະໂຫຼກ, ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳຖາມ ແລະ ສາມແຈເຕືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If for some reason darktable is unable to generate a thumbnail, it displays one of three placeholder images to indicate the type of error preventing it from doing so.\n"
msgstr "ຫາກ darktable ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງ, ມັນຈະສະແດງຮູບແທນທີ່ໜຶ່ງໃນສາມແບບ ເພື່ອບົ່ງບອກເຖິງປະເພດຂອງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are three main reasons this could happen:\n"
msgstr "ມີສາມສາເຫດຫຼັກທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Missing image file_: If the file could not be found at the location recorded in the database, a skull ![skull icon](./thumbnails/skull.png#icon) will be displayed in place of the image. You are advised to remove images from the database using the [actions on selection](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md) module before physically removing them from disk. Alternatively you may occasionally run the [purge](../../../special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md) script from darktable's toolset to clean-up your database.\n"
msgstr "- _ໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບຫາຍ_: ຫາກບໍ່ພົບໄຟລ໌ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ຮູບກະໂຫຼກ ![skull icon](./thumbnails/skull.png#icon) ຈະຖືກສະແດງແທນຮູບ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານລົບຮູບອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ການຈັດການກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md) ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລົບໄຟລ໌ອອກຈາກດິດແທ້ໆ. ຫຼື ທ່ານອາດຈະລັນສະຄຣິບ [purge](../../../special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md) ເປັນຄັ້ງຄາວເພື່ອລ້າງຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Invalid image format_: While darktable will attempt to import all supported file extensions, the extension is not a guarantee that darktable will be able to interpret the file's contents. If the file format (or an option within that format, such as compressed mode) is unsupported, darktable will display a question mark ![unsupported](./thumbnails/unsupported.png#icon) in place of the image. If the file appears to be corrupted, darktable will display a warning triangle ![error warning](./thumbnails/corrupt.png#icon) in place of the image.\n"
msgstr "- _ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ_: ເຖິງວ່າ darktable ຈະພະຍາຍາມນຳເຂົ້ານາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ແຕ່ນາມສະກຸນບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງຮັບປະກັນວ່າ darktable ຈະສາມາດອ່ານເນື້ອຫາພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ໄດ້. ຫາກຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ (ຫຼື ຕົວເລືອກພາຍໃນນັ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ ໂໝດບີບອັດ) ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ, darktable ຈະສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳຖາມ ![unsupported](./thumbnails/unsupported.png#icon) ແທນຮູບ. ຫາກໄຟລ໌ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເສຍຫາຍ, darktable ຈະສະແດງຮູບສາມແຈເຕືອນ ![error warning](./thumbnails/corrupt.png#icon) ແທນຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Low memory_: In the rare event that darktable runs out of memory while generating a thumbnail, it will warn you and display a skull. This can happen if darktable is run with sub-optimal settings, especially on a 32-bit system. See [memory & performance tuning](../../../special-topics/mem-performance.md) for more information.\n"
msgstr "- _ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຕ່ຳ_: ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຍາກ ຫາກ darktable ມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳບໍ່ພຽງພໍໃນຂະນະສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ, ມັນຈະເຕືອນທ່ານ ແລະ ສະແດງຮູບກະໂຫຼກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນຫາກ darktable ຖືກລັນດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນລະບົບ 32 ບິດ. ເບິ່ງ [ການປັບແຕ່ງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ປະສິດທິພາບ](../../../special-topics/mem-performance.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "thumbnail icons"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following icons may be displayed over the top of thumbnails to provide additional information:\n"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກສະແດງຊ້ອນເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images that are members of a group are denoted by a light ![light group icon](./thumbnails/Group-icon-light.png#icon) or dark ![dark group icon](./thumbnails/Group-icon-black.png#icon) group icon, where the darker icon identifies the lead image in that group.  See [image grouping](./grouping.md) for details\n"
msgstr "- ຮູບພາບທີ່ເປັນສະມາຊິກຂອງກຸ່ມຈະຖືກໝາຍດ້ວຍໄອຄອນກຸ່ມສີອ່ອນ ![light group icon](./thumbnails/Group-icon-light.png#icon) ຫຼື ສີເຂັ້ມ ![dark group icon](./thumbnails/Group-icon-black.png#icon), ໂດຍໄອຄອນທີ່ເຂັ້ມກວ່າຈະລະບຸວ່າເປັນຮູບຫົວໜ້າກຸ່ມ. ເບິ່ງ [ການຈັດກຸ່ມຮູບພາບ](./grouping.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A ![tags](./thumbnails/Tag-icon.png#icon) icon identifies that tags have been added to the image. Hover over the icon to see a list of the applied tags.\n"
msgstr "- ໄອຄອນ ![tags](./thumbnails/Tag-icon.png#icon) ບົ່ງບອກວ່າມີການຕິດແທັກໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບ. ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໄອຄອນເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ແທັກທີ່ໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/thumbnails.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A ![history](./thumbnails/History-icon.png#icon) icon identifies that the image has been processed. Hover over the icon to see a list of the processing modules that have been applied.\n"
msgstr "- ໄອຄອນ ![history](./thumbnails/History-icon.png#icon) ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຍັງຮູບພາບນັ້ນໄດ້ຖືກປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ. ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໄອຄອນເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຖືກປັບໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/metadata-tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "metadata and tagging"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເສີມ ແລະ ການຕິດແທັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/metadata-tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable allows you to store additional information about your images to allow them to be more easily searched and grouped. This information is stored in darktable's database and XMP sidecar files and can also be included within exported images.\n"
msgstr "darktable ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຈັດກຸ່ມໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ darktable ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ XMP ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັນ ແລະ ຍັງສາມາດລວມເຂົ້າໃນຮູບພາບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ນຳ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/metadata-tagging.md
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#: content/special-topics/variables.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "metadata"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເສີມ (metadata)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/metadata-tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Metadata (e.g. title, description) is free-format text that usually differs for each image. You can add metadata to images in the [metadata editor](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນເສີມ (ເຊັ່ນ ຊື່ເລື່ອງ, ຄຳອະທິບາຍ) ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມຮູບແບບອິດສະຫຼະທີ່ມັກຈະຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະຮູບ. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນເສີມໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ [ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນເສີມ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/metadata-tagging.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tagging"
msgstr "ການຕິດແທັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/metadata-tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tags are usually shared between multiple images and are used to categorise, group, and/or [sequence](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md) them. You can add tags to images in the [tagging](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ແທັກ (Tags) ມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໃນຫຼາຍຮູບພາບ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດໝວດໝູ່, ຈັດກຸ່ມ ແລະ/ຫຼື [ຈັດລຳດັບ](../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md) ພວກມັນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແທັກໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ [ການຕິດແທັກ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "image sequence"
msgstr "ລຳດັບຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A collection of images is always presented in a specific _sort by_ sequence that determines the order of their display, processing, and export. It is often convenient to be able to control this sequence (e.g. for a slideshow or document).\n"
msgstr "ຊຸດຮູບພາບຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນລຳດັບ _ຈັດລຽງຕາມ_ ທີ່ແນ່ນອນ ເຊິ່ງເປັນຕົວກຳນົດລຳດັບການສະແດງຜົນ, ການປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ການສົ່ງອອກ. ມັນມັກຈະສະດວກຫາກພວກເຮົາສາມາດຄວບຄຸມລຳດັບນີ້ໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ ສຳລັບການສະແດງສະໄລ້ ຫຼື ເອກະສານ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You may choose to sort by an [image attribute](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections/#filtering-attributes) (filename, capture time, rating, title, etc.) using the _sort by_ drop-down menu at the left-hand-side of darktable's [top panel](../../../overview/user-interface/top-panel/) or combine multiple sort criteria by clicking on _new sort_ in the left panel at the bottom of the [collection filters](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters/#sorting) module.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຈັດລຽງຕາມ [ຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງຮູບພາບ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections/#filtering-attributes) (ຊື່ໄຟລ໌, ເວລາຖ່າຍພາບ, ຄະແນນ, ຊື່ເລື່ອງ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມນູແບບເລື່ອນລົງ _ຈັດລຽງຕາມ_ ທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງ [ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ](../../../overview/user-interface/top-panel/) ຫຼື ລວມຫຼາຍເກນການຈັດລຽງໂດຍການຄລິກ \"ຈັດລຽງໃໝ່\" ໃນແຜງດ້ານຊ້າຍຢູ່ລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງໂມດູນ [ຕົວກອງຊຸດຮູບພາບ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters/#sorting).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Whatever _sort by_ criterion is chosen, a collection may contain some images you need to present in a different order. In such cases, darktable's [custom sort](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) allows you to alter image sequence directly by dragging and dropping thumbnails in lighttable's [filemangager](../lighttable-modes/filemanager.md) mode or the [filmstrip](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) panel.\n"
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເລືອກເກນ _ຈັດລຽງຕາມ_ ແບບໃດ, ໃນຊຸດຮູບພາບອາດຈະມີບາງຮູບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະແດງໃນລຳດັບທີ່ຕ່າງອອກໄປ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, [ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) ຂອງ darktable ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານປ່ຽນລຳດັບຮູບພາບໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃນໂໝດ [ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌](../lighttable-modes/filemanager.md) ຂອງ lighttable ຫຼື ໃນແຜງ [ແຖບຟິມ (filmstrip)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two distinct \"custom sort\" sequencing regimes:\n"
msgstr "ມີຮູບແບບການຈັດລຳດັບ \"ຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ຢູ່ສອງແບບ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "One _global sequence_ over every image in a darktable library.\n"
msgstr "- _ລຳດັບທົ່ວໄປ (global sequence)_ ພຽງອັນດຽວສຳລັບທຸກຮູບໃນຄັງ darktable.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Multiple _tag-based_ sequences, one for each tag associated with one or more images.\n"
msgstr "- _ລຳດັບຕາມແທັກ (tag-based)_ ຫຼາຍອັນ, ໜຶ່ງລຳດັບສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແທັກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When an image is imported into your darktable library, it is automatically positioned in the global sequence after all previously-imported images. A duplicated image is initially positioned in the global sequence immediately after its original, regardless of intervening image imports.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໃນຄັງ darktable, ມັນຈະຖືກຈັດໄວ້ໃນລຳດັບທົ່ວໄປຕໍ່ຈາກຮູບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນທັງໝົດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຮູບທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາຈະຖືກຈັດໄວ້ຖັດຈາກຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບທັນທີໃນລຳດັບທົ່ວໄປ, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈວ່າຈະມີການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບອື່ນມາແຊກຫຼືບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tagged images are sequenced within each attached tag in the order that the tag is attached. Selected sets of images are tagged in order of the _sort by_ setting in effect at the moment the tag is attached. Newly-tagged images are initially positioned after all images previously associated with that tag. A duplicated image inherits all of its original's tags and is positioned within each as a newly-tagged image.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບທີ່ຕິດແທັກຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບພາຍໃນແຕ່ລະແທັກຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ຕິດແທັກນັ້ນ. ຊຸດຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກຕິດແທັກຕາມລຳດັບຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ຈັດລຽງຕາມ_ ທີ່ມີຜົນຢູ່ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕິດແທັກ. ຮູບທີ່ຫາກໍຕິດແທັກໃໝ່ຈະຖືກຈັດໄວ້ຕໍ່ທ້າຍຮູບທັງໝົດທີ່ເຄີຍມີແທັກນັ້ນມາກ່ອນ. ຮູບທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາຈະໄດ້ຮັບແທັກທັງໝົດຈາກຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຖືກຈັດລຳດັບຄືກັບຮູບທີ່ຫາກໍຕິດແທັກໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A collection's selection criteria determines which sequence drag-and-drop alters while working in lighttable filemanager or the filmstrip. Dragging-and-dropping within a tag-based collection alters a designated tag's sequence. Otherwise, drag-and-drop alters the global sequence of all images in the library.\n"
msgstr "ເກນການເລືອກຂອງຊຸດຮູບພາບຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດວ່າການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ຈະໄປປ່ຽນລຳດັບໃດໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນ lighttable ຫຼື ແຖບຟິມ. ການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ພາຍໃນຊຸດຮູບພາບທີ່ກອງຕາມແທັກ ຈະເປັນການປ່ຽນລຳດັບຂອງແທັກນັ້ນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ຈະເປັນການປ່ຽນລຳດັບທົ່ວໄປຂອງທຸກຮູບໃນຄັງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [custom sort](../../module-reference//utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) section for information on how to efficiently and safely use drag-and-drop image resequencing.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງພາກ [ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການໃຊ້ການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ເພື່ອຈັດລຳດັບຮູບພາບໃໝ່ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ ປອດໄພ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "digital asset management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຊັບສິນດິຈິຕອນ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "image grouping"
msgstr "ການຈັດກຸ່ມຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grouping images helps to improve the structure and clarity of your image collection when displayed in the lighttable view.\n"
msgstr "ການຈັດກຸ່ມຮູບພາບຊ່ວຍປັບປຸງໂຄງສ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມຊັດເຈນຂອງຊຸດຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ ເມື່ອສະແດງໃນມຸມເບິ່ງ lighttable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can combine images into a group by selecting them and clicking the “group” button in the [actions on selection](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md) module, or by pressing Ctrl+G. Likewise, you can remove selected images from a group by clicking the “ungroup” button, or pressing Ctrl+Shift+G. \n"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຮວມຮູບພາບເຂົ້າເປັນກຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກພວກມັນ ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ “ຈັດກຸ່ມ” ໃນໂມດູນ [ການດຳເນີນກາ"
"ນກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-"
"image.md), ຫຼື ໂດຍການກົດ Ctrl+G. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເອົາຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກອອກຈາກກຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍການ"
"ຄລິກປຸ່ມ “ຍົກເລີກການຈັດກຸ່ມ”, ຫຼື ກົດ Ctrl+Shift+G. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Duplicated images are automatically grouped together. Similarly, if you import multiple images from the same directory, having the same base name, but different extensions (eg. `IMG_1234.CR2` and `IMG_1234.JPG`), those images automatically form a group.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບທີ່ເຮັດສຳເນົາ (duplicate) ຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມເຂົ້າກັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນ, ຫາກທ່ານນຳເຂົ້າຫຼາຍຮູບຈາກໂຟນເດີດຽວກັນ ທີ່ມີຊື່ຫຼັກຄືກັນແຕ່ມີນາມສະກຸນຕ່າງກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ `IMG_1234.CR2` ແລະ `IMG_1234.JPG`), ຮູບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະສ້າງເປັນກຸ່ມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images that are members of a group are denoted by a group icon ![top panel_grouping icon](./grouping/top-panel_grouping.png#icon) in their thumbnails. Note that this icon is only shown when \"overlays\" are displayed on image thumbnails. Thumbnail overlays can be enabled by selecting the star icon in the [top panel](../../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md).\n"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບທີ່ເປັນສະມາຊິກຂອງກຸ່ມຈະຖືກໝາຍດ້ວຍໄອຄອນກຸ່ມ ![top panel_grouping icon](./grouping/top-panel_grouping.png#icon) ໃນຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າໄອຄອນນີ້ຈະສະແດງສະເພາະເມື່ອມີການເປີດໃຊ້ \"ການສະແດງຊ້ອນກັນ (overlays)\" ເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກໄອຄອນຮູບດາວໃນ [ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ](../../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This icon also appears as a button, in the top panel of the lighttable view, that can be used to toggle grouping on and off. If grouping is off, all images are displayed as individual thumbnails. If grouping is on, the images in a group are represented by a single thumbnail image (the group leader). If you press the group icon in the group leader's thumbnail, that group is expanded (click a second time to collapse). If you then expand another group, the first group collapses. \n"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນນີ້ຍັງປາກົດເປັນປຸ່ມໃນແຜງດ້ານເທິງຂອງມຸມເບິ່ງ lighttable ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດການສະແດງແບບກຸ່ມ. ຫາກປິດການຈັດກຸ່ມ, ຮູບທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງເປັນຮູບຕົວຢ່າງແຍກແຕ່ລະໃບ. ຫາກເປີດການຈັດກຸ່ມ, ຮູບໃນກຸ່ມຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບຕົວຢ່າງດຽວ (ຫົວໜ້າກຸ່ມ). ຫາກທ່ານກົດໄອຄອນກຸ່ມໃນຮູບຫົວໜ້າກຸ່ມ, ກຸ່ມນັ້ນຈະຂະຫຍາຍອອກ (ຄລິກອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອຫຍໍ້ເຂົ້າ). ຫາກທ່ານຂະຫຍາຍກຸ່ມອື່ນ, ກຸ່ມທຳອິດຈະຫຍໍ້ເຂົ້າເອງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An expanded group in the filemanager mode of lighttable view is indicated by an orange frame that appears as soon as your mouse pointer hovers over one of the images. This frame surrounds all images in the group.\n"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນໂໝດຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຂອງ lighttable ຈະຖືກບົ່ງບອກດ້ວຍຂອບສີສົ້ມ ທີ່ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອທ່ານວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງຮູບໃດໜຶ່ງໃນກຸ່ມ. ຂອບນີ້ຈະລ້ອມຮູບທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can define which image is considered to be the group leader by clicking on the group icon of the desired image while that group is expanded. The group icon is shown only if grouping mode is enabled, so to change the group leader, you need to first enable grouping, expand the appropriate group and finally click the group icon of the desired \"group leader\" image. The current group leader is shown in a tooltip when you hover over the group icon of an image.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດວ່າຮູບໃດຈະເປັນຫົວໜ້າກຸ່ມ ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນກຸ່ມຂອງຮູບທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຸ່ມນັ້ນຂະຫຍາຍອອກ. ໄອຄອນກຸ່ມຈະສະແດງສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໂໝດຈັດກຸ່ມ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃນການປ່ຽນຫົວໜ້າກຸ່ມ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດການຈັດກຸ່ມກ່ອນ, ຂະຫຍາຍກຸ່ມນັ້ນອອກ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງຄລິກໄອຄອນກຸ່ມຂອງຮູບທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປັນ \"ຫົວໜ້າກຸ່ມ\". ຫົວໜ້າກຸ່ມປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນ Tooltip ເມື່ອທ່ານວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໄອຄອນກຸ່ມຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you collapse an image group and then enter darkroom mode (e.g. by double-clicking on the thumbnail), the group leader image will be opened for developing.\n"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຫຍໍ້ກຸ່ມຮູບເຂົ້າ ແລ້ວເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດຫ້ອງມືດ (ເຊັ່ນ ໂດຍການດັບເບິລຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ), ຮູບທີ່ເປັນຫົວໜ້າກຸ່ມຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image groups are also a convenient way to protect an existing history stack against unintentional changes. If you have just finalized an image and want to protect its current version, simply select the image, click “duplicate” in the actions on selection panel, and make sure that grouping is switched on and that the group is collapsed. Now, whenever you open the image group again in the darkroom, only the group leader will be altered. The underlying duplicate will remain unchanged.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມຮູບພາບຍັງເປັນວິທີທີ່ສະດວກໃນການປົກປ້ອງປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂ (history stack) ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງ"
"ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ. ຖ້າທ່ານຫາກກໍແກ້ໄຂຮູບສຳເລັດ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການປົກປ້ອງເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນຂອງມັນ, ພຽງແຕ່ເລືອກຮູບນັ້ນ, "
"ຄລິກ “ສ້າງຮູບຈຳລອງ (duplicate)” ໃນແຖບການດຳເນີນການກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ, ແລະ ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການ"
"ຈັດກຸ່ມຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ກຸ່ມຖືກພັບໄວ້. ຕອນນີ້, ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານເປີດກຸ່ມຮູບພາບອີກຄັ້ງໃນຫ້ອງມືດ, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຮູບຫຼັ"
"ກຂອງກຸ່ມເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ຮູບຈຳລອງທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງຈະຍັງຄົງບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** “duplicating images” only generates a copy of an image's history stack, stored in another small XMP file. There is still only one raw file.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ໝາຍເຫດ:** “ການສ້າງຮູບຈຳລອງ” ພຽງແຕ່ສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂຮູບພາບ, ເຊິ່ງເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ "
"XMP ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍອີກໄຟລ໌ໜຶ່ງ. ມັນຍັງຄົງມີໄຟລ໌ raw ພຽງແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "star ratings & color labels"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ດາວ ແລະ ປ້າຍສີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Star ratings and color labels help you to sort and rank images according to your own criteria. An image's star rating and color labels can be displayed over thumbnails in the lighttable view and filmstrip module.\n"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນເປັນດາວ ແລະ ປ້າຍສີ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດລຽງ ແລະ ຈັດອັນດັບຮູບພາບຕາມເກນຂອງທ່ານເອງ. ຄະແນນດາວ ແລະ ປ້າຍສີຂອງຮູບພາບສາມາດສະແດງຊ້ອນເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃນມຸມເບິ່ງ lighttable ແລະ ໂມດູນແຖບຟິມ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "star ratings"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນດາວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can give an image a rating from zero to five stars. Whenever you import images, each image receives a default rating which you can define in the [import](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md) module.  You can also mark an image as “rejected”.\n"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຫ້ຄະແນນຮູບພາບໄດ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ສູນຫາຫ້າດາວ. ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບ, ແຕ່ລະຮູບຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄະແນນເລີ່ມ"
"ຕົ້ນເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ [ນຳເຂົ້າ](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/"
"lighttable/import.md). ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໝາຍຮູບພາບວ່າເປັນ “ຖືກປະຕິເສດ (rejected)” ໄດ້ນຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to change a rating. While hovering the cursor over an image thumbnail, you can press a number key 0 – 5 to define the number of stars, or press R to “reject” an image. This is probably the fastest way to rate your images on first inspection of a film roll.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການປ່ຽນຄະແນນ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີ (cursor) ໄປໃສ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານສາມາດກົດປຸ່ມຕົວເລກ "
"0 – 5 ເພື່ອກຳນົດຈຳນວນດາວ, ຫຼື ກົດ R ເພື່ອ “ປະຕິເສດ” ຮູບພາບ. ນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນວິທີທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດໃນການໃຫ້ຄະແ"
"ນນຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານໃນການກວດສອບມ້ວນຟິມຄັ້ງທຳອິດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also directly click on the star icons that are overlaid on the thumbnails or in the bottom panel. Click the x to reject. \n"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຄລິກໂດຍກົງໃສ່ໄອຄອນຮູບດາວທີ່ຊ້ອນຢູ່ເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ ຫຼື ໃນແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ. ຄລິກ x ເພື່ອປະຕິເສດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As rejecting an image removes the currently-applied star rating, you can undo the rejection by clicking x or pressing R again.\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກການປະຕິເສດຮູບພາບຈະເປັນການລ້າງຄະແນນດາວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບໃນປັດຈຸບັນອອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເລີກການປະຕິເສດໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກ x ຫຼື ກົດ R ອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Similarly you can click the first star for a second time to reset the image rating to unranked, or zero stars. This behavior can be changed in [preferences > lighttable](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md).\n"
msgstr "ໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກທີ່ດາວດວງທຳອິດເປັນຄັ້ງທີສອງ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄະແນນຮູບພາບຄືນໃໝ່ເປັນ \"ບໍ່ມີອັນດັບ\" ຫຼື ສູນດາວ. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > lighttable](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To rate multiple images at once, select those images in the lighttable or filmstrip and then press the appropriate shortcut key, or click the desired star rating in the bottom panel of the lighttable view. \t\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄະແນນຫຼາຍຮູບພ້ອມກັນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຮູບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃນ lighttable ຫຼື ແຖບຟິມ ແລ້ວກົດປຸ່ມລັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ຫຼື ຄລິກຄະແນນດາວທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງມຸມເບິ່ງ lighttable. \t\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can filter images by star rating in the [top panel](../../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md).\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກອງຮູບພາບຕາມຄະແນນດາວໄດ້ໃນ [ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ](../../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "color labels"
msgstr "ປ້າຍສີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Color labels are another way to classify images, and can be used as an alternative to star ratings or to work alongside them. Each image can carry any combination of one or more color labels (red, yellow, green, blue, or purple).\n"
msgstr "ປ້າຍສີແມ່ນອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການຈັດໝວດໝູ່ຮູບພາບ, ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກແທນການໃຫ້ດາວ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນກໍໄດ້. ແຕ່ລະຮູບພາບສາມາດມີປ້າຍສີໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍສີປະສົມກັນ (ແດງ, ເຫຼືອງ, ຂຽວ, ຟ້າ ຫຼື ມ່ວງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can set the color labels for a single image by hovering your cursor over the thumbnail and pressing the function keys F1 – F5, which correspond with the labels in the order given above.\n"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງປ້າຍສີ (color labels) ສຳລັບຮູບພາບດຽວໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີໄປໃສ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ກົດປຸ່"
"ມຟັງຊັນ F1 – F5, ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບປ້າຍສີຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ໃຫ້ໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the color labels of one or more images, select the desired images in the lighttable or filmstrip and then press the appropriate shortcut key or click the corresponding color button in the bottom panel. A color label will be added to all selected images if **any** of them do not currently have the label; otherwise the label will be removed from all selected images. To remove all labels (of any color) from the selected images, press the gray button.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງປ້າຍສີໃຫ້ກັບຫຼາຍຮູບ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຮູບທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນ lighttable ຫຼື ແຖບຟິມ ແລ້ວກົດປຸ່ມລັດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມສີທີ່ກົງກັນໃນແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ. ປ້າຍສີຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ກັບທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ ຫາກມີ **ບາງຮູບ** ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ມີປ້າຍສີນັ້ນ; ແຕ່ຖ້າມີປ້າຍສີນັ້ນຢູ່ແລ້ວ ມັນຈະຖືກລົບອອກຈາກທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ. ເພື່ອລົບປ້າຍສີທັງໝົດ (ທຸກສີ) ອອກຈາກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມສີເທົາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/digital-asset-management/star-color.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can filter images by color label in the [collections](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກອງຮູບພາບຕາມປ້າຍສີໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ [ຊຸດຮູບພາບ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "lighttable view layout"
msgstr "ເຄົ້າໂຄງມຸມມອງແຜງແສງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[import](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md)\n"
": Import images from the filesystem or a connected camera.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ນຳເຂົ້າ](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md)\n"
": ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[collections](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md)\n"
": Filter the images displayed in the lighttable center panel -- also used to control the images displayed in the [filmstrip](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) and [timeline](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md) modules.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ຄໍເລັກຊັນ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md)\n"
": ກອງຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງໃນແຜງກາງຂອງແຜງແສງ -- ຍັງໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງໃນໂມດູນ [ແຖບຟິມ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) ແລະ [ທາມລາຍ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[recently used collections](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md)\n"
": View recently used collections of images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ຄໍເລັກຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ຫວ່າງມໍ່ໆນີ້](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md)\n"
": ເບິ່ງຄໍເລັກຊັນຮູບພາບທີ່ໃຊ້ຫວ່າງມໍ່ໆນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[lua scripts installer](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md) (optional)\n"
": Install lua scripts.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບ lua](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md) (ທາງເລືອກ)\n"
": ຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບ lua.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[selection](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/select.md)\n"
": Select images in the lighttable using simple criteria.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການເລືອກ](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/select.md)\n"
": ເລືອກຮູບພາບໃນແຜງແສງໂດຍໃຊ້ເກນງ່າຍໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[actions on selection](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md)\n"
": Perform actions on selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການກະທຳກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md)\n"
": ດຳເນີນການກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[history stack](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md)\n"
": Manipulate the history stack of selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md)\n"
": ຈັດການລຳດັບປະຫວັດຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[styles](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md)\n"
": Store an image's history stack as a named style and apply it to other images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ສະໄຕລ໌](../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md)\n"
": ເກັບຮັກສາລຳດັບປະຫວັດຂອງຮູບພາບເປັນສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ຕັ້ງຊື່ໄວ້ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[geotagging](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md)\n"
": Import and apply GPX track data to selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການຕິດແທັກພິກັດພູມສາດ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md)\n"
": ນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນແທຣັກ GPX ກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[export](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md)\n"
": Export selected images to local files or external services.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ສົ່ງອອກ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md)\n"
": ສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກໄປຍັງໄຟລ໌ໃນເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ບໍລິການພາຍນອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[neural restore](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md)\n"
": Apply AI-powered raw denoise, RGB denoise, or upscaling to selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການກູ້ຄືນດ້ວຍນິວຣອນ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md)\n"
": ປັບໃຊ້ການລົບສິ່ງລົບກວນ Raw, ລົບສິ່ງລົບກວນ RGB ດ້ວຍ AI, ຫຼື ການຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດຮູບ (upscaling) ໃຫ້ກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![lighttable-bottom-panel](./lighttable-view-layout/lighttable-bottom-panel.png#w100)\n"
msgstr "![lighttable-bottom-panel](./lighttable-view-layout/lighttable-bottom-panel.png#w100)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[star ratings](./digital-asset-management/star-color.md)\n"
": Apply star ratings to images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນຮູບດາວ](./digital-asset-management/star-color.md)\n"
": ໃຫ້ຄະແນນຮູບດາວແກ່ຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[color labels](./digital-asset-management/star-color.md)\n"
": Apply color labels to images. Right-click to assign a descriptive name to any color label. The description is displayed only in the tooltip that appears when hovering over the color label (and not in collection filters or any other UI element).\n"
msgstr ""
"[ປ້າຍສີ](./digital-asset-management/star-color.md)\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ປ້າຍສີໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບ. ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອຕັ້ງຊື່ອະທິບາຍໃຫ້ກັບປ້າຍສີໃດໜຶ່ງ. ຄຳອະທິບາຍຈະສະແດງສະເພາະໃນຄຳແນະນຳເຄື່ອງມື (tooltip) ທີ່ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອວາງເມົາສ໌ເທິງປ້າຍສີ (ແລະ ບໍ່ສະແດງໃນຕົວຕອງຄໍເລັກຊັນ ຫຼື ອົງປະກອບ UI ອື່ນໆ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[mode selector](./lighttable-modes/_index.md)\n"
": Choose a lighttable mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ຕົວເລືອກໂໝດ](./lighttable-modes/_index.md)\n"
": ເລືອກໂໝດແຜງແສງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[zoom](./lighttable-modes/filemanager.md)\n"
": Adjust the number of thumbnails displayed in each row of the file manager view.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ຊູມ](./lighttable-modes/filemanager.md)\n"
": ປັບຈຳນວນຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ສະແດງໃນແຕ່ລະແຖວຂອງມຸມມອງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![focus icon](./lighttable-view-layout/lighttable-bottom-panel_focus.png#icon) enable [focus-peaking](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md) mode\n"
": Highlight the parts of the image that are in focus.\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນໂຟກັດ](./lighttable-view-layout/lighttable-bottom-panel_focus.png#icon) ເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດ [focus-peaking](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md)\n"
": ເນັ້ນສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂຟກັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![display icon](./lighttable-view-layout/lighttable-bottom-panel_display.png#icon) [set display profile](../special-topics/color-management/display-profile.md)\n"
": Set the display profile of your monitor(s).\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນຈໍສະແດງຜົນ](./lighttable-view-layout/lighttable-bottom-panel_display.png#icon) [ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສະແດງຜົນ](../special-topics/color-management/display-profile.md)\n"
": ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງຈໍພາບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The lighttable view allows you to view and manage your image collection.\n"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງແຜງແສງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການຄໍເລັກຊັນຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The centre view contains thumbnails of your images -- how they are displayed depends on which [mode](./lighttable-modes/_index.md) you are working in.\n"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງກາງປະກອບດ້ວຍຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ -- ການສະແດງຜົນຈະຂຶ້ນກັບ [ໂໝດ](./lighttable-modes/_index.md) ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While the mouse is over an image thumbnail or images are selected, there are a number of actions you can perform:\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເມົາສ໌ຢູ່ເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ ຫຼື ຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໄວ້, ມີການກະທຳຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following keyboard shortcuts are enabled by default in the lighttable view:\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນມຸມມອງແຜງແສງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`F1, F2, F3, F4, F5` adds or removes a color label (red, yellow, green, blue, purple, respectively). A color label will be added if _any_ selected image does not currently have the label; otherwise the label will be removed\n"
msgstr ""
"`F1, F2, F3, F4, F5` ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບປ້າຍສີ (ສີແດງ, ສີເຫຼືອງ, ສີຂຽວ, ສີຟ້າ, ສີມ່ວງ, ຕາມລຳດັບ). ປ້າ"
"ຍສີຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ ຖ້າຫາກຮູບພາບ _ໃດໜຶ່ງ_ ທີ່ຖືກເລືອກຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີປ້າຍສີນັ້ນ; ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ປ້າຍສີຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5` sets the star rating\n"
msgstr "`0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5` ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄະແນນຮູບດາວ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`R` rejects the image(s)\n"
msgstr "`R` ປະຕິເສດຮູບພາບ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+D` duplicates the image(s)\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+D` ເຮັດສຳເນົາຮູບພາບ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+C` copies the full history stack\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+C` ຄັດລອກລຳດັບປະຫວັດທັງໝົດ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+V` pastes all of the copied history stack\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+V` ວາງລຳດັບປະຫວັດທີ່ຄັດລອກມາທັງໝົດ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+Shift+C` selectively copies the history stack\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+Shift+C` ເລືອກຄັດລອກລຳດັບປະຫວັດ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+Shift+V` selectively pastes from the copied history stack\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+Shift+V` ເລືອກວາງຈາກລຳດັບປະຫວັດທີ່ຄັດລອກມາ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`D` opens the image in the darkroom view for developing\n"
msgstr "`D` ເປີດຮູບພາບໃນມຸມມອງຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom) ເພື່ອລ້າງຮູບ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`W ` fully zooms into the current image while the key is pressed\n"
msgstr "`W ` ຊູມຮູບປັດຈຸບັນເຕັມໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+W ` fully zooms into the current image and show areas in focus\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+W ` ຊູມຮູບປັດຈຸບັນເຕັມ ແລະ ສະແດງບໍລິເວນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂຟກັດ\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "drag-and-drop"
msgstr "ການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You may change the sequence of images displayed, processed, or exported when _sort by_ is set to [custom sort](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) by dragging and dropping their thumbnails.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນລຳດັບຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງ, ປະມວນຜົນ ຫຼື ສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ ເມື່ອ _ຈັດລຽງໂດຍ_ ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [ການຈັດລຽງແບບກຳນົດເອງ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) ໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/lighttable/overview.md content/darkroom/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "touchpad"
msgstr "ທັດສ໌ແພດ (touchpad)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In lighttable culling layouts, touchpad zooming and panning gestures can be used:\n"
msgstr "ໃນເຄົ້າໂຄງການຄັດເລືອກຂອງແຜງແສງ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ທ່າທາງການຊູມ ແລະ ເລື່ອນເທິງທັດຊ໌ແພດ (touchpad) ໄດ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md content/darkroom/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "pinch with two fingers to zoom\n"
msgstr "* ຈີບສອງນິ້ວເພື່ອຊູມ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/lighttable/overview.md content/darkroom/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "scroll with two fingers to pan\n"
msgstr "* ເລື່ອນສອງນິ້ວເພື່ອເລື່ອນເບິ່ງຮູບ (pan)\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/lighttable/undo-redo.md content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "undo/redo"
msgstr "ເລີກເຮັດ/ເຮັດຄືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/undo-redo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most changes made within the lighttable are recorded and can be reverted to a previous state. This includes modifications to color labels, ratings, geo-localization, tags, metadata, orientation, copy/paste of history, image duplication, or application of a style. Note that the facility to undo/redo actions is unlimited in the number of steps while in the lighttable view, but it is reset each time you switch to a different view.\n"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ພາຍໃນແຜງແສງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບໄປສູ່ສະຖານະກ່ອນໜ້າໄດ້. ອັນນີ້ລວມເຖິງການແກ້ໄຂປ້າຍສີ, ຄະແນນ, ພິກັດພູມສາດ, ແທັກ, ເມຕາເດຕາ, ທິດທາງ, ການຄັດລອກ/ວາງປະຫວັດ, ການເຮັດສຳເນົາຮູບ ຫຼື ການນຳໃຊ້ສະໄຕລ໌. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄວາມສາມາດໃນການເລີກເຮັດ/ເຮັດຄືນການກະທຳແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຕອນໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນມຸມມອງແຜງແສງ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະຖືກລ້າງໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານປ່ຽນໄປມຸມມອງອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/undo-redo.md content/darkroom/pixelpipe/undo-redo.md
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Ctrl+Z to undo the last modification and Ctrl+Y to redo the last undone modification (if any).\n"
msgstr "ກົດ Ctrl+Z ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການແກ້ໄຂຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ Ctrl+Y ເພື່ອເຮັດຊ້ຳການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຖືກຍົກເລີກໄປ (ຖ້າມີ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/undo-redo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** \"Undo\" cannot reverse changes made to the [custom sort](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) order by dragging-and-dropping thumbnails in lighttable filemanager and the filmstrip.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** \"ເລີກເຮັດ\" ບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເກີດຈາກ [ການຈັດລຽງແບບກຳນົດເອງ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) ໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ແຜງແສງ ແລະ ແຖບຟິມ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/filemanager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "filemanager"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/filemanager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the default mode images are displayed in a grid with an adjustable number of images per row.\n"
msgstr "ໃນໂໝດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນຕາຕະລາງ ໂດຍສາມາດປັບຈຳນວນຮູບຕໍ່ແຖວໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/filemanager.md
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/zoomable-lighttable.md
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/filemanager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zoom\n"
": The number of images in each row can be altered using the numeric input in the bottom panel, or by holding Ctrl while scrolling over the center view with your mouse.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊູມ\n"
": ຈຳນວນຮູບໃນແຕ່ລະແຖວສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການປ້ອນຕົວເລກຢູ່ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ, ຫຼື ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ເທິງມຸມມອງກາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/filemanager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"navigate\n"
": You can navigate through the images using the arrow keys (←/→/↑/↓) or by scrolling with your mouse. Press the Home key to scroll to the top of the collection, the End key to scroll to the bottom, and PageUp/PageDown to scroll up/down by a page.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳທາງ\n"
": ທ່ານສາມາດນຳທາງຜ່ານຮູບພາບຕ່າງໆໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ (←/→/↑/↓) ຫຼື ໂດຍການເລື່ອນດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌ຂອງທ່າ"
"ນ. ກົດປຸ່ມ Home ເພື່ອເລື່ອນໄປເທິງສຸດຂອງຄໍເລັກຊັນ, ປຸ່ມ End ເພື່ອເລື່ອນລົງລຸ່ມສຸດ, ແລະ PageUp/"
"PageDown ເພື່ອເລື່ອນຂຶ້ນ/ລົງເທື່ອລະໜ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/filemanager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select\n"
": You can select the image under the pointer by clicking on its thumbnail or by pressing Enter. To select a range of images, click on the first image and then Shift+click on the last one. To add or remove images in a selection, Ctrl+click on a thumbnail or hover over a thumbnail and press Spacebar.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ\n"
": ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຮູບທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງຕົວຊີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ ຫຼື ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Enter. ເພື່ອເລືອກຮູບຫຼາຍຮູບຕໍ່ກັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບທຳອິດແລ້ວ Shift+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ຮູບສຸດທ້າຍ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ເອົາຮູບອອກຈາກການເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ ຫຼື ເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງແລ້ວກົດ Spacebar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/filemanager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hover\n"
": When the pointer hovers over any image's thumbnail, it is highlighted and its image implicitly selected for keyboard shortcuts. If that thumbnail is part of a currently-selected set, certain shortcuts will be applied to _all_ images of the set (for example, a numeric digit star rating).\n"
msgstr ""
"ວາງເມົາສ໌ຄ້າງ\n"
": ເມື່ອຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ວາງຢູ່ເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໃດໜຶ່ງ, ຮູບນັ້ນຈະຖືກເນັ້ນ ແລະ ຖືວ່າຖືກເລືອກໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດ. ຖ້າຮູບຕົວຢ່າງນັ້ນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງກຸ່ມຮູບທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່, ປຸ່ມລັດບາງອັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບ _ທັງໝົດ_ ໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນຮູບດາວດ້ວຍຕົວເລກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/filemanager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"drag\n"
": You can drag a thumbnail (**along with any selected set** to which it may belong) to set its [custom sort](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) position just before or after the image it's dropped upon.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາກ\n"
": ທ່ານສາມາດລາກຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (**ພ້ອມກັບກຸ່ມຮູບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້**) ເພື່ອກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງ [ການຈັດລຽງແບບກຳນົດເອງ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) ກ່ອນ ຫຼື ຫຼັງຮູບທີ່ທ່ານເອົາໄປວາງໃສ່.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "culling"
msgstr "ການຄັດເລືອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Culling mode allows you to display images side by side for easy comparison.\n"
msgstr "ໂໝດການຄັດເລືອກ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສະແດງຮູບພາບຄຽງຂ້າງກັນເພື່ອການປຽບທຽບທີ່ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thumbnail overlays can be controlled by selecting the star icon in the [top panel](../../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md) and changing the \"culling overlays\" setting. If \"no overlays\" is selected, then the overlay can be shown on-demand by pressing the \"I\" key.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຂໍ້ມູນທັບຊ້ອນເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ ໂດຍການເລືອກໄອຄອນຮູບດາວໃນ [ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ](../../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md) ແລະ ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"ຂໍ້ມູນທັບຊ້ອນການຄັດເລືອກ\". ຖ້າເລືອກ \"ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນທັບຊ້ອນ\", ຂໍ້ມູນທັບຊ້ອນສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ \"I\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zoom\n"
": In culling mode, you can zoom into images (up to 100%) by holding Ctrl while scrolling with the mouse wheel.\n"
": Pan within zoomed images with click+drag.\n"
": By default, zooming and panning are synchronized between all visible images. If you want to zoom or pan only a specific image, add the Shift modifier to the above actions.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊູມ\n"
": ໃນໂໝດການຄັດເລືອກ, ທ່ານສາມາດຊູມເຂົ້າໃນຮູບພາບ (ສູງສຸດ 100%) ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌.\n"
": ເລື່ອນເບິ່ງພາຍໃນຮູບທີ່ຊູມດ້ວຍການ ຄລິກ+ລາກ.\n"
": ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການຊູມ ແລະ ການເລື່ອນເບິ່ງຈະຖືກຊິງໂຄຣໄນລະຫວ່າງທຸກຮູບທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຊູມ ຫຼື ເລື່ອນເບິ່ງສະເພາະຮູບໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ Shift ຮ່ວມກັບການກະທຳຂ້າງເທິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"navigate\n"
": Use the mouse wheel or arrow keys (←/→) to scroll through your collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳທາງ\n"
": ໃຊ້ລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ (←/→) ເພື່ອເລື່ອນຜ່ານຄໍເລັກຊັນຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດຕ່າງໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two different culling modes, which define how many images are shown at the same time: “fixed” and “dynamic”. Switch between these while in culling mode by pressing the \"<\" key.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມີສອງໂໝດຄັດເລືອກ (culling) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດວ່າຈະສະແດງຮູບພາບຈັກຮູບພ້ອມກັນ: “ຄົງທີ່ "
"(fixed)” ແລະ “ໄດນາມິກ (dynamic)”. ປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງໂໝດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດຄັດເລືອກໂດຍການກົດປຸ່"
"ມ \"<\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"fixed mode\n"
": The number of images displayed is always the same, independent of the selection length. This number can be set with a slider on the bottom panel.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຄົງທີ່\n"
": ຈຳນວນຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງຈະເທົ່າເດີມສະເໝີ, ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຈຳນວນນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ດ້ວຍແຖບເລື່ອນຢູ່ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": In this mode, you will navigate through all selected images. If no selection is set (or if only one image is selected), you will navigate through all images.\n"
msgstr ": ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ທ່ານຈະນຳທາງຜ່ານທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການເລືອກ (ຫຼື ຖ້າເລືອກພຽງຮູບດຽວ), ທ່ານຈະນຳທາງຜ່ານທຸກຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The default keyboard shortcut to enter culling in fixed mode is \"X\".\n"
msgstr ": ປຸ່ມລັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ການຄັດເລືອກໃນໂໝດຄົງທີ່ແມ່ນ \"X\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"dynamic mode\n"
": All of the selected images are shown. If no selection is set (or if only one image is selected) the last value from fixed mode is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດໄດນາມິກ\n"
": ຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສະແດງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການເລືອກ (ຫຼື ຖ້າເລືອກພຽງຮູບດຽວ) ຄ່າສຸດທ້າຍຈາກໂໝດຄົງທີ່ຊິຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The default keyboard shortcut to enter culling in dynamic mode is Ctrl+X.\n"
msgstr ": ປຸ່ມລັດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ການຄັດເລືອກໃນໂໝດໄດນາມິກແມ່ນ Ctrl+X.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/culling.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Hint:** To enhance performance when loading zoomed images, you can enable ([preferences > lighttable > thumbnails > enable disk backend for full preview cache](../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md#thumbnails)). Bear in mind that this can occupy a lot of disk space.\n"
msgstr "**ຄຳແນະນຳ:** ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບເມື່ອໂຫຼດຮູບທີ່ຊູມ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ ([ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ແຜງແສງ > ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ > ເປີດໃຊ້ພື້ນຫຼັງດິສກ໌ສຳລັບແຄຊ໌ການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງເຕັມ](../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md#thumbnails)). ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າອັນນີ້ອາດຈະກິນພື້ນທີ່ດິສກ໌ຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/zoomable-lighttable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "zoomable lighttable"
msgstr "ແຜງແສງແບບຊູມໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/zoomable-lighttable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _zoomable lighttable_ mode provides an alternative way to navigate large collections of images, but with some similarities to the filemanager mode (described below).\n"
msgstr "ໂໝດ _ແຜງແສງແບບຊູມໄດ້_ ເປັນອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການນຳທາງຄໍເລັກຊັນຮູບພາບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ແຕ່ມີຄວາມຄ້າຍຄືກັນບາງຢ່າງກັບໂໝດຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ (ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/zoomable-lighttable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"zoom\n"
": Scroll with the mouse wheel to zoom in and out of the lighttable (compared to Ctrl+scroll in [filemanager](./filemanager.md) mode).\n"
": Zooming the thumbnails does not change the number of thumbnails per row, so the lighttable can exceed the visible area on all sides.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊູມ\n"
": ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອຊູມເຂົ້າ ແລະ ອອກຈາກແຜງແສງ (ປຽບທຽບກັບ Ctrl+ເລື່ອນ ໃນໂໝດ [ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌](./filemanager.md)).\n"
": ການຊູມຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນຈຳນວນຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ແຖວ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນແຜງແສງສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍກາຍພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໃນທຸກດ້ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/zoomable-lighttable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"navigate\n"
": Hold down the left mouse button and drag to move the lighttable around and navigate through your collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳທາງ\n"
": ກົດປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ຊ້າຍຄ້າງໄວ້ແລ້ວລາກເພື່ອຍ້າຍແຜງແສງໄປມາ ແລະ ນຳທາງຜ່ານຄໍເລັກຊັນຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/zoomable-lighttable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select\n"
": As with the filemanager mode, you can select the image under the pointer by clicking on its thumbnail or by pressing Enter. To select a range of images, click on the first image and then Shift+click on the last one. To add or remove images in a selection, Ctrl+click on a thumbnail or hover over a thumbnail and press Spacebar.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກ\n"
": ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບໂໝດຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຮູບທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງຕົວຊີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ ຫຼື ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Enter. ເພື່ອເລືອກຮູບຫຼາຍຮູບຕໍ່ກັນ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບທຳອິດແລ້ວ Shift+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ຮູບສຸດທ້າຍ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ເອົາຮູບອອກຈາກການເລືອກ, ໃຫ້ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ ຫຼື ເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງແລ້ວກົດ Spacebar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/zoomable-lighttable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hover\n"
": Hovering over a thumbnail highlights and impicitly selects it for keyboard shortcuts as in filemanager mode. However, dragging pans the entire thumbnail display, so you cannot change images' [custom sort](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) order in this mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວາງເມົາສ໌ຄ້າງ\n"
": ການວາງເມົາສ໌ເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຈະເນັ້ນ ແລະ ຖືວ່າເລືອກຮູບນັ້ນສຳລັບປຸ່ມລັດ ຄືກັນກັບໃນໂໝດຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ການລາກຈະເປັນການເລື່ອນການສະແດງຜົນຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທັງໝົດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນລຳດັບ [ການຈັດລຽງແບບກຳນົດເອງ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md#custom-sort) ຂອງຮູບພາບໃນໂໝດນີ້ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/zoomable-lighttable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Hint:** you may find that image thumbnails are slow to load when zooming quickly through a large collection. One way to speed up the navigation is to generate a cache containing all the thumbnails using the [`darktable-generate-cache`](../../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md) command.\n"
msgstr "**ຄຳແນະນຳ:** ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບວ່າຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໂຫຼດຊ້າໃນເວລາດຽວກັນທີ່ຊູມຜ່ານຄໍເລັກຊັນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຢ່າງໄວວາ. ວິທີໜຶ່ງທີ່ຈະເລັ່ງການນຳທາງແມ່ນການສ້າງແຄຊ໌ທີ່ມີຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທັງໝົດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [`darktable-generate-cache`](../../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/full-preview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "full preview"
msgstr "ການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງເຕັມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/full-preview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "From any of the lighttable modes, you can display a fully-zoomed preview of the image that is currently under the mouse pointer by pressing and holding down W. This is useful to more closely inspect an image while rating and selecting images.\n"
msgstr "ຈາກໂໝດແຜງແສງໃດກໍໄດ້, ທ່ານສາມາດສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຊູມເຕັມຂອງຮູບທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ W ຄ້າງໄວ້. ອັນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການກວດສອບຮູບພາບຢ່າງລະອຽດໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃຫ້ຄະແນນ ແລະ ເລືອກຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/full-preview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pressing and holding Ctrl+W fully zooms into the image and also identifies any regions of sharpness in the image that may indicate image focus. For this tool to work the input image needs to hold an embedded JPEG thumbnail, which is the case for most raw files.\n"
msgstr "ການກົດ Ctrl+W ຄ້າງໄວ້ ຈະຊູມຮູບພາບເຕັມ ແລະ ຍັງລະບຸບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃນຮູບພາບ ເຊິ່ງອາດບົ່ງບອກເຖິງຈຸດໂຟກັດຂອງຮູບ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າຕ້ອງມີຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ JPEG ຝັງຢູ່, ເຊິ່ງເປັນກໍລະນີຂອງໄຟລ໌ raw ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/full-preview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regions in the image with a high level of sharpness are indicated with red borders. If no such regions are found, any regions of moderate sharpness are identified with a blue border. Note that this is not the same as the [focus peaking](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md) indicator, which is another way to identifying areas of sharpness within an image.\n"
msgstr "ບໍລິເວນໃນຮູບທີ່ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດສູງຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍຂອບສີແດງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ພົບບໍລິເວນດັ່ງກ່າວ, ບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດປານກາງຈະຖືກລະບຸດ້ວຍຂອບສີຟ້າ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າອັນນີ້ບໍ່ຄືກັນກັບຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ [focus peaking](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md), ເຊິ່ງເປັນອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການລະບຸພື້ນທີ່ຄົມຊັດພາຍໃນຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/full-preview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sometimes pressing W or Ctrl+W may not appear to have any effect -- in such cases, click on the image thumbnail and press the corresponding key again.\n"
msgstr "ບາງຄັ້ງການກົດ W ຫຼື Ctrl+W ອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງ -- ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງແລ້ວກົດປຸ່ມນັ້ນອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lighttable/lighttable-modes/full-preview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want the full preview to stay in place without having to hold the W key, you can enable sticky preview mode by pressing F. In sticky preview mode, you can zoom and pan within the image in a similar way to the [culling](./culling.md) mode. Press F or ESC to return to the original view.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງເຕັມຄ້າງໄວ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງກົດປຸ່ມ W ຄ້າງໄວ້, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງແບບຄ້າງໄວ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ F. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ທ່ານສາມາດຊູມ ແລະ ເລື່ອນເບິ່ງພາຍໃນຮູບພາບໄດ້ໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນກັບໂໝດ [ການຄັດເລືອກ](./culling.md). ກົດ F ຫຼື ESC ເພື່ອກັບຄືນສູ່ມຸມມອງເດີມ.\n"

