#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "styles & conventions"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ (styles & conventions)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following details the writing style and documentation conventions used in this manual.\n"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຮູບແບບການຂຽນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງເອກະສານທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຄູ່ມືນີ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ (format)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This website is authored in pure markdown, using some extensions. It is initially designed to work with the Hugo SSG but intended to be portable enough that it can be easily rendered with another application if required.\n"
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ markdown ແທ້ໆ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ບາງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ. ໃນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຊ້ກັບ Hugo SSG ແຕ່ກໍຕັ້ງໃຈໃຫ້ມັນສາມາດພົກພາໄດ້ງ່າຍ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໄດ້ຫາກຈຳເປັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Files should be rendered in UTF-8 and should not include any column wrapping.\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຄວນຖືກສະແດງຜົນໃນຮູບແບບ UTF-8 ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນມີການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ (column wrapping) ພາຍໃນປະໂຫຍກ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "structure"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following shows the structure of an example main chapter with subsections in the dtdocs website.\n"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງໂຄງສ້າງຂອງບົດຫຼັກທີ່ມີບົດຍ່ອຍໃນເວັບໄຊ dtdocs.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"example-chapter/\n"
"   _index.md\n"
"   section1-with-subsections/\n"
"      subsection1/\n"
"         image.png\n"
"      _index.md\n"
"      subsection1.md\n"
"      subsection2.md\n"
"   section2.md\n"
"   section3.md\n"
msgstr ""
"example-chapter/\n"
"   _index.md\n"
"   section1-with-subsections/\n"
"      subsection1/\n"
"         image.png\n"
"      _index.md\n"
"      subsection1.md\n"
"      subsection2.md\n"
"   section2.md\n"
"   section3.md\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A couple of notes on the above structure:\n"
msgstr "ບາງຂໍ້ສັງເກດກ່ຽວກັບໂຄງສ້າງຂ້າງເທິງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`_index.md` files do not contain any content (they contain metadata only) and are used to render section headers and ToC entries. In the above example `example-chapter/_index.md` defines the title of the example chapter and the order in which it appears in the main table of contents. Similarly `example-chapter/section1-with-subsections/_index.md` defines metadata for the first section of the chapter.\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ `_index.md` ຈະບໍ່ມີເນື້ອຫາໃດໆ (ມີພຽງແຕ່ metadata ເທົ່ານັ້ນ) ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງຫົວຂໍ້ພາກສ່ວນ ແລະ ລາຍການໃນສານບານ (ToC). ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ `example-chapter/_index.md` ກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງບົດຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ລຳດັບທີ່ຈະປາກົດໃນສານບານຫຼັກ. ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ `example-chapter/section1-with-subsections/_index.md` ກໍກຳນົດ metadata ສຳລັບພາກສ່ວນທຳອິດຂອງບົດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Media files should be contained in a directory with the same name as the page to which they relate. In this example, `example-chapter/section1-with-subsections/subsection1` contains media related to the `subsection1.md` page.\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ສື່ (Media files) ຄວນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບ ໜ້າທີ່ມັນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, `example-chapter/section1-with-subsections/subsection1` ມີສື່ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໜ້າ `subsection1.md`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Metadata for the markdown files is presented at the head of the page using yaml. Any metadata may be defined -- the module reference sections contain quite a lot of specific metadata -- however the following defines some minimal metadata for the example page `example-chapter/section1-with-subsections/subsection1.md`.\n"
msgstr "Metadata ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ markdown ແມ່ນຢູ່ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໜ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ yaml. ສາມາດກຳນົດ metadata ໃດໆກໍໄດ້ -- ສ່ວນການອ້າງອີງໂມດູນຈະມີ metadata ສະເພາະຂ້ອນຂ້າງຫຼາຍ -- ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ ຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນ metadata ພື້ນຖານສຳລັບໜ້າ `example-chapter/section1-with-subsections/subsection1.md`.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"---\n"
"title: Sub Section 1 Title\n"
"id: subsection1\n"
"weight: 10\n"
"include_toc: true\n"
"---\n"
msgstr ""
"---\n"
"title: Sub Section 1 Title\n"
"id: subsection1\n"
"weight: 10\n"
"include_toc: true\n"
"---\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"title\n"
": This should contain the rendered title of your page. To include a colon within a title, enclose the title in double-quotes.\n"
msgstr ""
"title\n"
": ສ່ວນນີ້ຄວນມີຊື່ຂອງໜ້າທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈ້ຳສອງ (:) ໃນຊື່, ໃຫ້ຂຽນຊື່ໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ (\"\").\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"id\n"
": This is the id used to identify the page by Hugo. It should usually be the same name as the file (for content files) or the parent directory (for `_index.md` files).\n"
msgstr ""
"id\n"
": ນີ້ຄື id ທີ່ Hugo ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸໜ້າເວັບ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຄວນເປັນຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຊື່ໄຟລ໌ (ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ເນື້ອຫາ) ຫຼື ຊື່ໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ (ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ `_index.md`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"weight\n"
": This is an optional metadata field used to define the order in which sections are presented in the Table of Contents. If the _weight_ field is not included, pages will be rendered in alphabetic order by default. For example, to define the sections and subsections of the above example in reverse order, the following metadata would need to be set:\n"
msgstr ""
"weight\n"
": ນີ້ແມ່ນຟິລ metadata ທາງເລືອກທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລຳດັບການສະແດງຜົນໃນສານບານ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃສ່ _weight_, ໜ້າເວັບຈະຖືກລຽງຕາມລຳດັບຕົວອັກສອນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າຕ້ອງການລຽງພາກສ່ວນ ແລະ ພາກສ່ວນຍ່ອຍໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງແບບຢ້ອນກັບ, ຈະຕ້ອງກຳນົດ metadata ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   example-chapter/\n"
"      section1-with-subsections/\n"
"         _index.md               # weight: 30 (place section1 page at the end of example-chapter)\n"
"         subsection1.md             # weight: 20 (place subsection1 page at the end of section1)\n"
"         subsection2.md             # weight: 10 (place subsection2 page at the start of section1)\n"
"      section2.md                # weight: 20 (place section2 in the middle of example-chapter)\n"
"      section3.md                # weight: 10 (place section3 at the start of example-chapter)\n"
msgstr ""
"   example-chapter/\n"
"      section1-with-subsections/\n"
"         _index.md               # weight: 30 (ວາງໜ້າ section1 ໄວ້ທ້າຍສຸດຂອງ example-chapter)\n"
"         subsection1.md             # weight: 20 (ວາງໜ້າ subsection1 ໄວ້ທ້າຍສຸດຂອງ section1)\n"
"         subsection2.md             # weight: 10 (ວາງໜ້າ subsection2 ໄວ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ section1)\n"
"      section2.md                # weight: 20 (ວາງ section2 ໄວ້ກາງຂອງ example-chapter)\n"
"      section3.md                # weight: 10 (ວາງ section3 ໄວ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ example-chapter)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"include_toc\n"
": Optional; enables or disables the collapsible table of contents. Should only be used on large, complex pages. \n"
msgstr ""
"include_toc\n"
": ທາງເລືອກ; ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດສານບານແບບພັບໄດ້. ຄວນໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນໜ້າທີ່ມີເນື້ອຫາຫຼາຍ ແລະ ຊັບຊ້ອນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "content"
msgstr "ເນື້ອຫາ (content)"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "general style guidance"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳຮູບແບບທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All content should be authored in plain markdown without shortcodes and HTML should be kept to an absolute minimum, if used at all\n"
msgstr "ເນື້ອຫາທັງໝົດຄວນຂຽນດ້ວຍ markdown ທຳມະດາໂດຍບໍ່ໃຊ້ shortcodes ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ HTML ໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເຮັດໄດ້\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minimalism is an absolute must. Fewer words are preferred\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມລຽບງ່າຍ (Minimalism) ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນທີ່ສຸດ. ຄວນໃຊ້ຄຳສັບໃຫ້ໜ້ອຍແຕ່ໄດ້ໃຈຄວາມ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Markdown files should be as short as possible\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ Markdown ຄວນມີຄວາມຍາວສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເຮັດໄດ້\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the naming and capitalization norms present in the GUI of the application -- namely all headers and titles are in lower case, except for the very top-level chapter names. Similarly, use all lower case when referencing module names and controls.\n"
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມການຕັ້ງຊື່ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່/ນ້ອຍ ຕາມທີ່ປາກົດໃນ GUI ຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ -- ນັ້ນຄື ຫົວຂໍ້ ແລະ ຊື່ທັງໝົດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ, ຍົກເວັ້ນຊື່ບົດໃນລະດັບສູງສຸດ. ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວພິມນ້ອຍທັງໝົດເມື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງຊື່ໂມດູນ ແລະ ປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Headers in a file should not exceed level three (###)\n"
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ຄວນເກີນລະດັບສາມ (###)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The primary authoring language is English. Avoid idiomatic language where possible as the English version of the documentation may be read by people for whom English is not their native language\n"
msgstr "ພາສາຫຼັກໃນການຂຽນແມ່ນພາສາອັງກິດ. ຫຼີກເວັ້ນການໃຊ້ສຳນວນພາສາຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກເອກະສານພາກພາສາອັງກິດອາດຈະຖືກອ່ານໂດຍຜູ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ພາສາອັງກິດເປັນພາສາແມ່\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assume the reader has the application open while reading the user manual and only include images where they contribute to the explanation of complex functionality\n"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ຄິດສະເໝີວ່າຜູ້ອ່ານກຳລັງເປີດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຢູ່ຂະນະທີ່ອ່ານຄູ່ມື ແລະ ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຮູບພາບສະເພາະບ່ອນທີ່ມັນຊ່ວຍອະທິບາຍຟັງຊັນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນເທົ່ານັ້ນ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use image callouts if you need to annotate an image (i.e. mark parts of the image with a letter or number and then explain the meaning in some text following the image). Do not place words directly into the image for annotations, as this makes localization difficult. See [this page](../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md) for an example.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ image callouts ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການອະທິບາຍຮູບພາບ (ເຊັ່ນ: ໝາຍສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງຮູບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນ ຫຼື ຕົວເລກ ແລ້ວອະທິບາຍຄວາມໝາຍໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫຼັງຮູບ). ຫ້າມໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມລົງໃນຮູບໂດຍກົງ ເພາະຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການແປພາສາເຮັດໄດ້ຍາກ. ເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ທີ່ [ໜ້ານີ້](../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Changes to the content should be proposed via pull request or a similar mechanism\n"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນແປງເນື້ອຫາຄວນຖືກສະເໜີຜ່ານ pull request ຫຼື ວິທີການທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your submissions will be copy-edited -- don't take it personally\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າສົ່ງມາຈະຖືກກວດແກ້ຮູບແບບ (copy-edited) -- ຂໍຢ່າຖືສາກັນ\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "technical information for processing modules"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນທາງເຕັກນິກສຳລັບໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each of the processing modules there is a special (collapsible) block of technical information at the top:\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ ຈະມີບລັອກຂໍ້ມູນທາງເຕັກນິກພິເສດ (ແບບພັບໄດ້) ຢູ່ທາງເທິງ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{{</* details summary=\"Technical information\" class=\"technical-info\" */>}}\n"
"\n"
"description\n"
": applies a tone mapping curve. inspired by Blender's AgX tone mapper.\n"
"\n"
"purpose\n"
": corrective and creative.\n"
"\n"
"input\n"
": linear, RGB, scene-referred.\n"
"\n"
"processing\n"
": non-linear, RGB.\n"
"\n"
"output\n"
": linear, RGB, display-referred\n"
"\n"
"{{</* /details */>}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{{</* details summary=\"Technical information\" class=\"technical-info\" */>}}\n"
"\n"
"description\n"
": applies a tone mapping curve. inspired by Blender's AgX tone mapper.\n"
"\n"
"purpose\n"
": corrective and creative.\n"
"\n"
"input\n"
": linear, RGB, scene-referred.\n"
"\n"
"processing\n"
": non-linear, RGB.\n"
"\n"
"output\n"
": linear, RGB, display-referred\n"
"\n"
"{{</* /details */>}}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This should mirror the information available as tooltip upon hovering the mouse over a processing module.  \n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຄວນສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ກົງກັບ tooltip ທີ່ປາກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ.  \n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "keyboard and mouse shortcuts"
msgstr "ທາງລັດຄີບອດ ແລະ ເມົ້າ"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reference named keyboard keys using CamelCase (Ctrl, Shift, Alt, Esc, AltGr, CapsLock, PageUp, PageDown)\n"
msgstr "ອ້າງອີງເຖິງປຸ່ມຄີບອດໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ CamelCase (Ctrl, Shift, Alt, Esc, AltGr, CapsLock, PageUp, PageDown)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reference single letter keys in upper case. Quotation marks might help with clarification (press \"H\" to see a list of active shortcuts)\n"
msgstr "ອ້າງອີງເຖິງປຸ່ມຕົວອັກສອນດຽວດ້ວຍຕົວພິມໃຫຍ່. ການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າອາດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນ (ກົດ \"H\" ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການທາງລັດທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reference mouse actions using lower case, with multiple words joined by a hyphen (scroll, click, single-click, double-click, right-click)\n"
msgstr "ອ້າງອີງເຖິງການກະທຳຂອງເມົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວພິມນ້ອຍ, ຖ້າມີຫຼາຍຄຳໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກາງ (scroll, click, single-click, double-click, right-click)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect combinations of keys/actions with a plus sign (Ctrl+Shift+H, Shift+double-click)\n"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ການກົດປຸ່ມ ຫຼື ການກະທຳທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍບວກ (Ctrl+Shift+H, Shift+double-click)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "definition lists"
msgstr "ລາຍການຄຳຈຳກັດຄວາມ (definition lists)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The standard method of presenting information about darktable module controls is with the use of definition lists.\n"
msgstr "ວິທີການມາດຕະຖານໃນການສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມໂມດູນຂອງ darktable ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ລາຍການຄຳຈຳກັດຄວາມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gui control name\n"
": A declaration of what the control does. For example \"Set the exposure in EV units\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມໃນ GUI\n"
": ຄຳອະທິບາຍວ່າປຸ່ມນັ້ນເຮັດຫຍັງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ \"ກຳນົດຄ່າການຮັບແສງ (exposure) ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ EV\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You can include as many paragraphs as you like, but try to limit to 2 or 3 where possible.\n"
msgstr ": ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃສ່ຫຼາຍຫຍໍ້ໜ້າໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ, ແຕ່ພະຍາຍາມຈຳກັດໄວ້ພຽງ 2 ຫຼື 3 ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າຫາກເປັນໄປໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![active-icon](./styles-conventions/active-icon.png#icon) a control accessed through a button with an icon\n"
": When a control is activated using an icon, take a screenshot of the icon using the standard darktable theme (darktable-elegant-grey) and add it before the name of the control\n"
msgstr ""
"![active-icon](./styles-conventions/active-icon.png#icon) ປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜ່ານປຸ່ມທີ່ມີໄອຄອນ\n"
": ເມື່ອປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ດ້ວຍໄອຄອນ, ໃຫ້ຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍຂອງໄອຄອນນັ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ທີມມາດຕະຖານຂອງ darktable (darktable-elegant-grey) ແລະ ເພີ່ມມັນໄວ້ກ່ອນຊື່ຂອງປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gui combobox name\n"
": Comboboxes often have multiple options that all need to be displayed with separate definitions. Use bulleted lists with _italics_ for the combobox values.\n"
": - _the first value_: What the first value means\n"
": - _the second value_: What the second value means\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ combobox ໃນ GUI\n"
": Combobox ມັກຈະມີຫຼາຍຕົວເລືອກ ເຊິ່ງທັງໝົດຕ້ອງຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍຄຳຈຳກັດຄວາມແຍກກັນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລາຍການແບບຈ້ຳ (bulleted lists) ພ້ອມດ້ວຍ _ຕົວອຽງ_ ສຳລັບຄ່າໃນ combobox.\n"
": - _ຄ່າທຳອິດ_: ຄວາມໝາຍຂອງຄ່າທຳອິດ\n"
": - _ຄ່າທີສອງ_: ຄວາມໝາຍຂອງຄ່າທີສອງ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Definition lists are also used throughout the document, wherever a named piece of functionality needs to be defined. See, for example, [darktable-cli](../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md).\n"
msgstr "ລາຍການຄຳຈຳກັດຄວາມຍັງຖືກໃຊ້ທົ່ວທັງເອກະສານ ໃນບ່ອນໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງຟັງຊັນ. ເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ທີ່ [darktable-cli](../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "notes"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ (notes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you wish to present an important note to the user, use the following format:\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສະແດງໝາຍເຫດທີ່ສຳຄັນໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: This is an important note.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ນີ້ຄືໝາຍເຫດທີ່ສຳຄັນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "fixed-width fonts and code blocks"
msgstr "ຟອນແບບຄວາມກວ້າງຄົງທີ່ (fixed-width) ແລະ ບລັອກໂຄດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fixed width fonts (using the \\` character) should normally only be used for code blocks and when referencing file names and command line parameters.\n"
msgstr "ຟອນແບບຄວາມກວ້າງຄົງທີ່ (ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ \\`) ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຄວນໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບບລັອກໂຄດ ແລະ ເມື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ພາຣາມິເຕີຄຳສັ່ງ (command line parameters) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "links"
msgstr "ລິ້ງ (links)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal links must be relative to the current file and must point to a valid markdown (.md) file. Start links with either `./` to represent the current directory or `../` to represent the parent directory.\n"
msgstr "ລິ້ງພາຍໃນຕ້ອງເປັນລິ້ງແບບ relative ທີ່ອ້າງອີງຈາກໄຟລ໌ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ markdown (.md) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລິ້ງດ້ວຍ `./` ເພື່ອແທນໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ ຫຼື `../` ເພື່ອແທນໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Links to a processing module should be in italics, e.g. [_exposure_](../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md)\n"
msgstr "ລິ້ງທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນຄວນເປັນຕົວອຽງ, ເຊັ່ນ [_exposure_](../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Links to a utility module should be in plaintext, e.g. [history stack](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md)\n"
msgstr "ລິ້ງທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາໂມດູນອັດຖະປະໂຫຍດ (utility module) ຄວນເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາ, ເຊັ່ນ [history stack](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Link to a top level section by referencing the `_index.md` file, e.g. [module reference](../module-reference/_index.md)\n"
msgstr "ລິ້ງໄປຫາພາກສ່ວນລະດັບສູງສຸດໂດຍການອ້າງອີງໄຟລ໌ `_index.md`, ເຊັ່ນ [module reference](../module-reference/_index.md)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Link to a tab in the preferences dialog: [preferences > general](../preferences-settings/general.md)\n"
msgstr "ລິ້ງໄປຫາແທັບໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ: [preferences > general](../preferences-settings/general.md)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Link to a specific preference setting: [preferences > general > interface language](../preferences-settings/general.md)\n"
msgstr "ລິ້ງໄປຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະ: [preferences > general > interface language](../preferences-settings/general.md)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each header within a page can be linked to directly with an anchor link: [contributing/notes](#notes)\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຫົວຂໍ້ພາຍໃນໜ້າສາມາດລິ້ງໄປຫາໄດ້ໂດຍກົງດ້ວຍ anchor link: [contributing/notes](#notes)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "images"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບ (images)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When taking screenshots from the darktable application itself, use the default darktable theme (darktable-elegant-grey).\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍຈາກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ darktable, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ທີມມາດຕະຖານ (darktable-elegant-grey).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Several filename suffixes can be used to control how an image is rendered.\n"
msgstr "ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳຕໍ່ທ້າຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຫຼາຍແບບເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການສະແດງຜົນຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"icon\n"
": To insert an image as an icon, include `#icon` after the image name in the link. The markdown `![squirrel icon](./styles-conventions/contributing.png#icon)` outputs the following: ![squirrel icon](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#icon)\n"
msgstr ""
"icon\n"
": ເພື່ອແຊກຮູບພາບເປັນໄອຄອນ, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ `#icon` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍຊື່ຮູບໃນລິ້ງ. ໂຄ້ດ markdown `![squirrel icon](./styles-conventions/contributing.png#icon)` ຈະສະແດງຜົນດັ່ງນີ້: ![squirrel icon](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#icon)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"image width\n"
": You can set the image width to 25, 33, 50, 66, 75 or 100 per cent of the rendered page width by including `#wxx` after the image name in the link, where `xx` is the desired width. For example:\n"
": `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w25)` outputs\n"
": ![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w25)\n"
": `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w75)` outputs\n"
": ![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w75)\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຮູບ\n"
": ເຈົ້າສາມາດກຳນົດຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຮູບເປັນ 25, 33, 50, 66, 75 ຫຼື 100 ເປີເຊັນ ຂອງຄວາມກວ້າງໜ້າເວັບ ໂດຍການໃສ່ `#wxx` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍຊື່ຮູບໃນລິ້ງ, ເຊິ່ງ `xx` ແມ່ນຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"
": `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w25)` ຈະສະແດງຜົນ\n"
": ![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w25)\n"
": `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w75)` ຈະສະແດງຜົນ\n"
": ![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"inline\n"
": With the exception of icons, images are included as block elements by default. You can override this by including `#inline` after the image name. This can be combined with the width setting as follows.\n"
": `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w25#inline)` outputs ![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w25#inline)\n"
msgstr ""
"inline\n"
": ຍົກເວັ້ນໄອຄອນ, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຮູບພາບຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນບລັອກ (block elements). ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃສ່ `#inline` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍຊື່ຮູບ. ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບການກຳນົດຄວາມກວ້າງໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້.\n"
": `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w25#inline)` ຈະສະແດງຜົນ ![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w25#inline)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/styles-conventions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"default\n"
": By default images are presented as block elements with 100% width. So `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w100)` and `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png)` are equivalent and both output the following:\n"
": ![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ (default)\n"
": ໂດຍຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນບລັອກທີ່ມີຄວາມກວ້າງ 100%. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png#w100)` ແລະ `![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png)` ຈຶ່ງມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັນ ແລະ ທັງສອງຈະສະແດງຜົນດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
": ![squirrel](./styles-conventions/squirrel.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This page defines the style guide for dtdocs and information about how to contribute to the project.\n"
msgstr "ໜ້ານີ້ກຳນົດແນວທາງຮູບແບບ (style guide) ສຳລັບ dtdocs ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີ ການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມໃນໂຄງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is included in the user manual so that you can see how the page is rendered as well as how it is written. Please go to [GitHub](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/master/content/contributing/overview.md) to see the source for this page.\n"
msgstr "ມັນຖືກລວມໄວ້ໃນຄູ່ມືຜູ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຫັນວິທີການສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ວິທີການຂຽນ. ກະລຸນາໄປທີ່ [GitHub](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/master/content/contributing/overview.md) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊອດໂຄດຂອງໜ້ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The manual structure and content have been carefully considered based on the following criteria:\n"
"1. The manual should be comprehensive -- it should describe all of the functionality available in darktable\n"
"1. It should have a consistent and logical structure and every piece of functionality should have its own logical place within that structure\n"
"1. It should be as long as necessary but as short as possible -- brevity is a must\n"
"1. It should be objective\n"
"1. Functionality should be explained once and only once (with the exception of the basic workflow guidelines in the overview section)\n"
"1. Images should be included only where necessary to improve understanding of key principles and should not contain text unless it is unavoidable\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງສ້າງ ແລະ ເນື້ອຫາຂອງຄູ່ມືໄດ້ຖືກພິຈາລະນາຢ່າງລະອຽດໂດຍອີງຕາມເກນດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"1. ຄູ່ມືຄວນຈະຄົບຖ້ວນ -- ມັນຄວນຈະອະທິບາຍທຸກຟັງຊັນທີ່ມີໃນ darktable\n"
"1. ມັນຄວນມີໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງ ແລະ ເປັນເຫດເປັນຜົນ, ແລະ ທຸກໆຟັງຊັນຄວນມີບ່ອນຢູ່ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນໂຄງສ້າງນັ້ນ\n"
"1. ມັນຄວນຈະຍາວເທົ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ແຕ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ -- ຄວາມກະຊັບແມ່ນສິ່ງສຳຄັນ\n"
"1. ມັນຄວນຈະເປັນກາງ (objective)\n"
"1. ຟັງຊັນຄວນຖືກອະທິບາຍພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ຍົກເວັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກພື້ນຖານໃນສ່ວນພາບລວມ)\n"
"1. ຄວນໃສ່ຮູບພາບສະເພາະບ່ອນທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈຫຼັກການສຳຄັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນມີຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຮູບ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ຫຼີກເວັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We are generally **not** interested in:\n"
"1. Restructuring the manual\n"
"1. Switching markup languages\n"
"1. Detailed workflow tutorials (though we are interested in publishing those on the blogs of either darktable.org or pixls.us)\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ພວກເຮົາ **ບໍ່** ສົນໃຈກ່ຽວກັບ:\n"
"1. ການປັບປ່ຽນໂຄງສ້າງຄູ່ມືໃໝ່\n"
"1. ການປ່ຽນພາສາ markup\n"
"1. ບົດຮຽນສອນວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຢ່າງລະອຽດ (ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາສົນໃຈທີ່ຈະເຜີຍແຜ່ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃນບລັອກຂອງ darktable.org ຫຼື pixls.us)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We **are** interested in\n"
"1. Spelling and grammar corrections\n"
"1. Clarification of text\n"
"1. [Documentation for new features](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/pulls?q=is%3Apr+is%3Aclosed+label%3A%22documentation:%20pending%22)\n"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາ **ສົນໃຈ** ກ່ຽວກັບ\n"
"1. ການແກ້ໄຂການສະກົດຄຳ ແລະ ໄວຍາກອນ\n"
"1. ການປັບປຸງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນ\n"
"1. [ເອກະສານສຳລັບຟີເຈີໃໝ່](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/pulls?q=is%3Apr+is%3Aclosed+label%3A%22documentation:%20pending%22)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "We are always extremely interested in hearing about which sections of the manual did not make sense to you and *why*, so that we can improve the documentation.\n"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາມີຄວາມຍິນດີສະເໝີທີ່ຈະຮັບຟັງວ່າສ່ວນໃດຂອງຄູ່ມືທີ່ເຈົ້າອ່ານແລ້ວບໍ່ເຂົ້າໃຈ ແລະ *ຍ້ອນຫຍັງ*, ເພື່ອທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະໄດ້ປັບປຸງເອກະສານໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In general, if you wish to make a major change, please open an issue and discuss it with the maintainers first. This is to avoid doing work that wouldn't be accepted.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງຄັ້ງໃຫຍ່, ກະລຸນາເປີດ issue ແລະ ປຶກສາກັບຜູ້ເກັບຮັກສາລະບົບກ່ອນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຍອມຮັບ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "modality"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການສົ່ງ (modality)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preferred way is to create a pull request. See the [workflow](workflow.md) for a detailed step-by-step guide.\n"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການສ້າງ pull request. ເບິ່ງ [workflow](workflow.md) ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳລະອຽດເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນຕອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you do not know what that is or don't feel comfortable doing it, feel free to suggest minor improvements to the docs by opening [a new issue](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/issues/new) on github.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າມັນແມ່ນຫຍັງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສະດວກທີ່ຈະເຮັດ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດແນະນຳການປັບປຸງເລັກໆນ້ອຍໆ ໂດຍການເປີດ [issue ໃໝ່](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/issues/new) ໃນ github ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "translators guide"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືສຳລັບຜູ້ແປພາສາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You are welcome to help translate darktable's docs. Please read through this guide to learn the conventions and requirements for translation work.\n"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບເຈົ້າເຂົ້າສູ່ການຊ່ວຍແປເອກະສານຂອງ darktable. ກະລຸນາອ່ານຄູ່ມືນີ້ໃຫ້ລະອຽດເພື່ອສຶກສາຂໍ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ຄວາມຕ້ອງການສຳລັບວຽກງານການແປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations are maintained through [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/darktable-documentation/). Unregistered users can add suggestions for translations. To contribute to the translations you need to [register with Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/accounts/register/).\n"
msgstr "ການແປພາສາແມ່ນຖືກຈັດການຜ່ານ [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/darktable-documentation/). ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນສາມາດເພີ່ມຄຳແນະນຳໃນການແປໄດ້. ຫາກຕ້ອງການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມໃນການແປ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງ [ລົງທະບຽນກັບ Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/accounts/register/) ກ່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "We do __not__ accept automated AI translations without human review and quality control. \n"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາ __ບໍ່__ ຍອມຮັບການແປດ້ວຍ AI ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍບໍ່ຜ່ານການກວດສອບ ແລະ ຄວບຄຸມຄຸນນະພາບໂດ"
"ຍມະນຸດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended reading:\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນອ່ານ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Guide for [styles and conventions](styles-conventions.md): Formalities and conventions on how dtdocs should be done\n"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືສຳລັບ [styles and conventions](styles-conventions.md): ລະບຽບການ ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເຮັດ dtdocs\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Translations setup](translations-setup.md) contains information on how data flows between the [dtdocs github repository](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs) and Weblate\n"
msgstr "[Translations setup](translations-setup.md) ປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໄຫຼຂອງຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງ [ຄັງເກັບ dtdocs ໃນ github](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs) ແລະ Weblate\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Documentation on how to [use weblate](https://docs.weblate.org/en/latest/user/translating.html)\n"
msgstr "ເອກະສານກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການ [ໃຊ້ weblate](https://docs.weblate.org/en/latest/user/translating.html)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visit the [projects page](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/darktable-documentation/) to see which languages need work and select one you are fluent in. You can then dive into translation work by picking one of the categories (e.g. \"Untranslated strings\").\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ [projects page](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/darktable-documentation/) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າພາສາໃດທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ ແລະ ເລືອກພາສາທີ່ເຈົ້າຊຳນານ. ຈາກນັ້ນເຈົ້າສາມາດເລີ່ມວຽກການແປໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກໝວດໝູ່ໃດໜຶ່ງ (ເຊັ່ນ \"Untranslated strings\").\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to know where a translatable string is located in the docs, you can check the *string information* and then *details* on the right side.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຮູ້ວ່າຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປໄດ້ນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນໃດຂອງເອກະສານ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ທີ່ *string information* ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ *details* ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາມື.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When translating, always preserve the original Markdown formatting — bold, italics, links, and shortcodes must appear in the translated string exactly as they do in the source.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອແປ, ໃຫ້ຮັກສາຮູບແບບ Markdown ຕົ້ນສະບັບສະເໝີ — ຕົວໜາ, ຕົວອຽງ, ລິ້ງ (links), ແລະ ລະຫັດສັ້ນ "
"(shortcodes) ຕ້ອງປາກົດຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ແປຄືກັນກັບໃນຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "translating a specific section of the docs"
msgstr "ການແປພາກສ່ວນໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງເອກະສານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to translate a specific page, you need to use Weblate's search function as there is no direct way of selecting e.g. \"translate filmic.md\". But if you either open \"all strings\" or \"untranslated strings\" and use the filter-search box at the top to look for the strings *location*: E.g. by entering `location:\"filmic\" or `location:translators-guide`. Here you can also search for specific strings like `\"You are welcome to help translate darktable's docs\"`. Note: If the searched string contains spaces use quotation marks. If the searched string contains markdown-formatting this needs to be included in the searched string exactly as well. \n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແປໜ້າໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການຄົ້ນຫາຂອງ Weblate ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ມີວິທີເລືອກໂດຍກົງ ເຊັ່ນ \"ແປ filmic.md\". ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດ \"all strings\" ຫຼື \"untranslated strings\" ແລ້ວໃຊ້ຊ່ອງ filter-search ຢູ່ທາງເທິງເພື່ອຊອກຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມຕາມ *location*: ເຊັ່ນ: ໂດຍການປ້ອນ `location:\"filmic\"` ຫຼື `location:translators-guide`. ຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມສະເພາະໄດ້ ເຊັ່ນ `\"You are welcome to help translate darktable's docs\"`. ໝາຍເຫດ: ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄົ້ນຫາມີຍະຫວ່າງ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າ. ຖ້າຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄົ້ນຫາມີຮູບແບບ markdown ກໍຕ້ອງໃສ່ໃຫ້ຄືກັນທຸກປະການນຳ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "After translating a string you can click \"Save and continue\" to go through the translatable strings in order.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກແປຂໍ້ຄວາມແລ້ວ ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄລິກ \"Save and continue\" ເພື່ອແປຂໍ້ຄວາມຕໍ່ໄປຕາມລຳດັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is helpful to open the page you are currently working on in a second window (e.g. using split view) to better see the context of the translatable strings. \n"
msgstr "ມັນຈະເປັນປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ ຖ້າເຈົ້າເປີດໜ້າທີ່ກຳລັງແປຢູ່ນັ້ນໄວ້ອີກໜ້າຕ່າງໜຶ່ງ (ເຊັ່ນ ການແຍກໜ້າຈໍ) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນບໍລິບົດຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກຳລັງແປໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "technical information sections"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຂໍ້ມູນທາງເຕັກນິກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translators-guide.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At the top of each processing module's page there is a collapsible \"Technical information\" section that needs special formatting and is supposed to exactly mirror the descriptions available as tooltips in darktable. All languages were seeded with the exact translations from darktables program code/translations with \"needs edit\" to ensure human oversight.\n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ສ່ວນເທິງຂອງແຕ່ລະໜ້າໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ ຈະມີພາກສ່ວນ \"Technical information\" ແບບພັບໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຮູບແບບພິເສດ ແລະ ຄວນມີຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກົງກັບ tooltip ໃນ darktable ທຸກປະການ. ທຸກໆພາສາໄດ້ຖືກໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຄຳແປທີ່ກົງກັບຊອດໂຄດຂອງ darktable ພ້ອມຕິດປ້າຍ \"needs edit\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີການກວດສອບໂດຍມະນຸດຄືນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "translations setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແປພາສາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations of darktable's documentation are maintained via [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/darktable-documentation/). \n"
msgstr "ການແປເອກະສານຂອງ darktable ແມ່ນຖືກຈັດການຜ່ານ [Weblate](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/darktable-documentation/). \n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of the setup and flow of information for translations using Weblate"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ການໄຫຼຂອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບການແປໂດຍໃຊ້ Weblate"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In short: \n"
"1. The docs are primarily maintained in English in the .md files present in `content/*.md`. \n"
"2. From there a POT file (`po/content.pot`) of all *translatable* strings is maintained. \n"
"3. Weblate maintains each language's individual PO files (`po/content.{lang}.po`) which contain the *translated* strings. \n"
"4. Upon deployment of the docs, language-specific .md-files are generated using `generate-translations.sh` which hugo then renders to .html files and the EPUB and PDF variants. \n"
msgstr ""
"ສະຫຼຸບໂດຍຫຍໍ້: \n"
"1. ເອກະສານຫຼັກແມ່ນເປັນພາສາອັງກິດໃນໄຟລ໌ .md ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ `content/*.md`. \n"
"2. ຈາກນັ້ນ ໄຟລ໌ POT (`po/content.pot`) ທີ່ລວມເອົາຂໍ້ຄວາມ *ທີ່ສາມາດແປໄດ້* ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. \n"
"3. Weblate ຈະຈັດການໄຟລ໌ PO ຂອງແຕ່ລະພາສາ (`po/content.{lang}.po`) ເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸຂໍ້ຄວາມ *ທີ່ແປແລ້ວ*. \n"
"4. ເມື່ອນຳເອກະສານໄປໃຊ້, ໄຟລ໌ .md ສະເພາະແຕ່ລະພາສາຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ `generate-translations.sh` ເຊິ່ງ Hugo ຈະນຳໄປສະແດງຜົນເປັນໄຟລ໌ .html, EPUB ແລະ PDF ຕໍ່ໄປ. \n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitHub to Weblate: source string synchronisation"
msgstr "ຈາກ GitHub ຫາ Weblate: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The original English files (`content/*.md`) are changed through a pull request on GitHub (see [workflow](workflow.md)).\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ພາສາອັງກິດຕົ້ນສະບັບ (`content/*.md`) ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງຜ່ານ pull request ໃນ GitHub (ເບິ່ງ [workflow](workflow.md)).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A nightly GitHub action updates the POT file (`po/content.pot`) housing all translatable strings with `generate-translations.sh --no-translations`. Note: The script updates POT and PO files but we don't commit the updated PO files to the repository as in our setup the PO files are entirely managed by Weblate to avoid merge conflicts.\n"
msgstr "GitHub action ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທຸກຄືນຈະອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ POT (`po/content.pot`) ທີ່ລວມຂໍ້ຄວາມທັງໝົດດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ວ `generate-translations.sh --no-translations`. ໝາຍເຫດ: ສະຄຣິບຈະອັບເດດທັງໄຟລ໌ POT ແລະ PO ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາຈະບໍ່ commit ໄຟລ໌ PO ທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວລົງໃນຄັງເກັບ ເນື່ອງຈາກໄຟລ໌ PO ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ Weblate ທັງໝົດເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາ merge conflicts.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Weblate automatically pulls the updated POT file (triggered by the Weblate GitHub app) and internally populates the PO file of each translated language with new/updated strings\n"
msgstr "Weblate ຈະ pull ໄຟລ໌ POT ທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຜ່ານ Weblate GitHub app) ແລະ ຈະເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ອັບເດດລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ PO ຂອງແຕ່ລະພາສາພາຍໃນລະບົບ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Weblate commits the changes to GitHub by opening a pull request.\n"
msgstr "Weblate ຈະ commit ການປ່ຽນແປງໄປທີ່ GitHub ໂດຍການເປີດ pull request.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pull request gets merged after review.\n"
msgstr "Pull request ຈະຖືກ merge ຫຼັງຈາກຜ່ານການກວດສອບ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Weblate to GitHub: translation synchronisation"
msgstr "ຈາກ Weblate ຫາ GitHub: ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນການແປພາສາ"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translations happen on Weblate. See [translators guide](translators-guide.md) for a guide on how to translate.\n"
msgstr "ການແປພາສາແມ່ນເຮັດໃນ Weblate. ເບິ່ງ [translators guide](translators-guide.md) ສຳລັບວິທີການແປ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Weblate internally updates each language's PO file and commits them to GitHub via pull request. To keep the number of pull requests at bay this happens in batches.\n"
msgstr "Weblate ຈະອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ PO ຂອງແຕ່ລະພາສາພາຍໃນລະບົບ ແລະ commit ໄປຍັງ GitHub ຜ່ານ pull request. ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີ pull request ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ, ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະເຮັດເປັນຊຸດ (batches).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment of translations"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ການແປພາສາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upon deployment at [docs.darktable.org](https://docs.darktable.org) translated .md-files are generated from the PO files in `/po/` using `generate-translations.sh --no-update`. This step is disabled for the auto-build [GitHub Pages](https://darktable-org.github.io/dtdocs/).\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໄປໃຊ້ທີ່ [docs.darktable.org](https://docs.darktable.org) ໄຟລ໌ .md ທີ່ແປແລ້ວຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກໄຟລ໌ PO ໃນ `/po/` ໂດຍໃຊ້ `generate-translations.sh --no-update`. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກປິດໄວ້ສຳລັບການ auto-build ໃນ [GitHub Pages](https://darktable-org.github.io/dtdocs/).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adding a new language"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມພາສາໃໝ່"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add a new language to Weblate. See [Weblate's documentation](https://docs.weblate.org/en/latest/devel/translations.html#adding-new-translations) for how to do this. Make sure the newly created PO file is committed to the dtdocs repository.\n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມພາສາໃໝ່ໃນ Weblate. ເບິ່ງ [Weblate's documentation](https://docs.weblate.org/en/latest/devel/translations.html#adding-new-translations) ສຳລັບວິທີການເຮັດ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຟລ໌ PO ທີ່ສ້າງໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖືກ commit ລົງໃນຄັງເກັບ dtdocs ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the files `config.yaml`, `config-pdf.yaml` and `config-epub.yaml`, locate the `languages:` line.\n"
msgstr "ໃນໄຟລ໌ `config.yaml`, `config-pdf.yaml` ແລະ `config-epub.yaml`, ໃຫ້ຊອກຫາແຖວ `languages:`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the language you wish to translate. For example, the English entry looks like this:\n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມພາສາທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແປ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ລາຍການພາສາອັງກິດຈະເປັນແບບນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     en-us:\n"
"       title: darktable user manual\n"
"       weight: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"     en-us:\n"
"       title: darktable user manual\n"
"       weight: 1\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enabling and disabling languages"
msgstr "ການເປີດ ແລະ ປິດການໃຊ້ງານພາສາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Languages are controlled by two independent systems that must be manually kept in sync:\n"
msgstr "ພາສາຕ່າງໆແມ່ນຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍສອງລະບົບທີ່ແຍກກັນ ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງຄອຍອັບເດດໃຫ້ກົງກັນດ້ວຍຕົວເອງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`config.yaml` and `config-pdf.yaml`** — hugo's configuration. Languages listed here get their own section of the built website or PDF.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`config.yaml` ແລະ `config-pdf.yaml`** — ການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ hugo. ພາສາທີ່ລະບຸຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ຈະມີສ່ວ"
"ນຂອງຕົນເອງໃນເວັບໄຊ ຫຼື PDF ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`disable-languages`** — A space-separated list of language codes in the repository's base directory. `generate-translations.sh` reads this file and skips generating `.{lang}.md` files for any language listed here, regardless of whether a PO file exists for it.\n"
msgstr ""
"**`disable-languages`** — ລາຍຊື່ລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. "
"`generate-translations.sh` ຈະອ່ານໄຟລ໌ນີ້ ແລະ ຂ້າມການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ `.{lang}.md` ສຳລັບພາສາໃດ"
"ໆທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ທີ່ນີ້, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າຈະມີໄຟລ໌ PO ສຳລັບພາສານັ້ນຫຼືບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The language switcher in the theme only lists a language when translated `.{lang}.md` files exist for the current page — it uses Hugo's `.IsTranslated` and `.Translations` variables, which reflect actual files on disk, not `config.yaml` entries. A language present in `config.yaml` but listed in `disable-languages` will therefore not appear in the switcher, as no translated files are generated for it. Its `config.yaml` entry is dormant until it is removed from `disable-languages`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວປ່ຽນພາສາໃນທິມ (theme) ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ພາສາກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີໄຟລ໌ `.{lang}.md` ທີ່ແປແລ້ວສຳລັບໜ້າປັດຈຸບັ"
"ນ — ມັນໃຊ້ຕົວແປ `.IsTranslated` ແລະ `.Translations` ຂອງ Hugo, ເຊິ່ງສະທ້ອນເຖິງໄຟລ໌ແທ້ໃນ"
"ດິສກ໌, ບໍ່ແມ່ນລາຍການໃນ `config.yaml`. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ພາສາທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ `config.yaml` ແຕ່ຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ "
"`disable-languages` ຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນຕົວປ່ຽນພາສາ, ເພາະບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແປແລ້ວຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ລາຍການໃນ "
"`config.yaml` ຂອງມັນຈະຍັງບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຈົນກ່ວາມັນຈະຖືກເອົາອອກຈາກ `disable-languages`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To enable a language, it should be present in `config.yaml`, `config-pdf.yaml` and `config-epub.yaml` and absent from `disable-languages`.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານພາສາ, ພາສານັ້ນຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນ `config.yaml`, `config-pdf.yaml` ແລະ `config-epub.yaml` ແລະ ຕ້ອງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ `disable-languages`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To disable a language, it should be listed in `disable-languages`. The `config.yaml`, `config-pdf.yaml` and `config-epub.yaml` entries can remain in place for when the language is re-enabled.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານພາສາ, ພາສານັ້ນຄວນຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ `disable-languages`. ສ່ວນລາຍການໃນ `config.yaml`, `config-pdf.yaml` ແລະ `config-epub.yaml` ສາມາດປະໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າໄດ້ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງການເປີດໃຊ້ງານພາສານັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translating theme strings for website, EPUB, and PDF"
msgstr "ການແປຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງທີມ (theme strings) ສຳລັບເວັບໄຊ, EPUB ແລະ PDF"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are three themes for the darktable documentation: one for the HTML website, one for EPUB, and one for the PDF. Each has a small set of UI strings (e.g. \"Table of Contents\", \"Copyright\", \"Search\") that must be translated manually — these strings are **not** managed by Weblate.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມີສາມທິມສຳລັບຄູ່ມື darktable: ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບເວັບໄຊ HTML, ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ EPUB, ແລະ ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ PDF. "
"ແຕ່ລະອັນມີຊຸດຂໍ້ຄວາມ UI ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"ສາລະບານ\", \"ລິຂະສິດ\", \"ຄົ້ນຫາ\") ທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ແປດ້ວ"
"ຍຕົນເອງ — ຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ **ບໍ່ໄດ້** ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ Weblate.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to `themes/hugo-darktable-docs-theme/i18n`.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ `themes/hugo-darktable-docs-theme/i18n`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Copy the file `en-us.yaml` and name the new file after your language using a locale code with a dash (e.g. `de-de.yaml`, `fr-fr.yaml`).\n"
msgstr "ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ `en-us.yaml` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ຕາມລະຫັດພາສາຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດກາງ (ເຊັ່ນ `de-de.yaml`, `fr-fr.yaml`).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Translate the strings in the new yaml file.\n"
msgstr "ແປຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນໄຟລ໌ yaml ໃໝ່ນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the translated yaml file into git, push it to GitHub, and open a pull request to have your changes accepted.\n"
msgstr "Check-in ໄຟລ໌ yaml ທີ່ແປແລ້ວລົງໃນ git, push ໄປທີ່ GitHub ແລະ ເປີດ pull request ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງຖືກຍອມຮັບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repeat for `themes/hugo-darktable-docs-epub-theme/i18n` and `themes/hugo-darktable-docs-pdf-theme/i18n`. These themes use shorter locale codes, using only the language code (e.g. `de.yaml`) or an underscore for regional variants (e.g. `pt_br.yaml`).\n"
msgstr "ເຮັດແບບດຽວກັນສຳລັບ `themes/hugo-darktable-docs-epub-theme/i18n` ແລະ `themes/hugo-darktable-docs-pdf-theme/i18n`. ທີມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ສັ້ນກວ່າ ໂດຍໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ລະຫັດພາສາ (ເຊັ່ນ `de.yaml`) ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດລຸ່ມສຳລັບພາສາສະເພາະທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (ເຊັ່ນ `pt_br.yaml`).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "generate-translations.sh"
msgstr "generate-translations.sh"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This script is used by the nightly GitHub action and can also be run locally by maintainers who need to update translations manually or debug the build.\n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍ GitHub action ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທຸກຄືນ ແລະ ຍັງສາມາດລັນໃນເຄື່ອງໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ເກັບຮັກສາລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງການອັບເດດການແປພາສາດ້ວຍຕົວເອງ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (debug) ໃນການສ້າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The script is a wrapper around `po4a` to orchestrate the interplay between the original .md files and the translations. The script reads the `disable-languages` file in the repository's base directory, filters out disabled languages, builds a temporary `po4a` config file containing all `content/**/*.md` files, and then calls `po4a $1 --verbose $po4a_conf` — the flag is passed through directly to `po4a`.\n"
"It requires one of the three arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບ (script) ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຫຸ້ມ (wrapper) ຮອບ `po4a` ເພື່ອຈັດການການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງໄຟລ໌ "
".md ຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ບົດແປ. ສະຄຣິບຈະອ່ານໄຟລ໌ `disable-languages` ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູ"
"ນ, ຄັດກອງພາສາທີ່ຖືກປິດຕົວອອກ, ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າ `po4a` ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ມີໄຟລ໌ `content/**/*.md` ທັງໝົ"
"ດ, ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍເອີ້ນໃຊ້ `po4a $1 --verbose $po4a_conf` — ແຟລັກ (flag) ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ "
"`po4a` ໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"ມັນຕ້ອງການໜຶ່ງໃນສາມອາກິວເມັນ (arguments).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--no-translations`\n"
": Generates POT and PO files (`po/content.pot` and `po/content.{lang}.po`) from the source .md files (`content/*.md`). Does *not* produce any translated output files. New or changed strings from the source files are pulled into the POT/PO files, but no `*.{lang}.md` files are created. This is used after updates to the English source files to prepare the POT and PO files for Weblate.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--no-translations`\n"
": ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ POT ແລະ PO (`po/content.pot` ແລະ `po/content.{lang}.po`) ຈາກໄຟລ໌ .md ຕົ້ນສະບັບ (`content/*.md`). ແຕ່ຈະ *ບໍ່* ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ແປແລ້ວ. ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງຈາກໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະຖືກດຶງເຂົ້າໄປໃນໄຟລ໌ POT/PO, ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ມີການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ `*.{lang}.md`. ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກມີການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບພາສາອັງກິດ ເພື່ອຕຽມໄຟລ໌ POT ແລະ PO ສຳລັບ Weblate.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--no-update`\n"
": Generates the translated Markdown files from the existing PO files, without updating the POT/PO files. This means the source files (`content/*.md`) are not re-read; existing translations are rendered directly into localized `.{lang}.md` files.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--no-update`\n"
": ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ Markdown ທີ່ແປແລ້ວຈາກໄຟລ໌ PO ທີ່ມີຢູ່, ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ POT/PO. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການອ່ານໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ (`content/*.md`) ຄືນໃໝ່; ການແປທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຈະຖືກນຳໄປສ້າງເປັນໄຟລ໌ `.{lang}.md` ໂດຍກົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/translations-setup.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--rm-translations`\n"
": Removes the generated translated files. `po4a` deletes the localized `*.{lang}.md` output files previously created by `--no-update`. The PO/POT files are left untouched.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--rm-translations`\n"
": ລຶບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແປແລ້ວທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. `po4a` ຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ `*.{lang}.md` ທີ່ເຄີຍສ້າງດ້ວຍ `--no-update`. ສ່ວນໄຟລ໌ PO/POT ຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຕະຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/contributing/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Contributing to the Docs"
msgstr "ການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມໃນເອກະສານ"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/censorize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "workflow"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These instructions assume that you already have a github account and have installed **Git** as well. Make sure that git is in your PATH by executing the command `git` in any terminal or cmd and checking that it doesn't output an error such as \"command not found\". If you don't have git installed, [follow these instructions](https://git-scm.com/book/en/v2/Getting-Started-Installing-Git).\n"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືວ່າເຈົ້າມີບັນຊີ github ຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ **Git** ແລ້ວນຳ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ git ຢູ່ໃນ PATH ຂອງເຈົ້າ ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງ `git` ໃນ terminal ຫຼື cmd ແລະ ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ແຈ້ງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເຊັ່ນ \"command not found\". ຖ້າເຈົ້າຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ git, [ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳນີ້](https://git-scm.com/book/en/v2/Getting-Started-Installing-Git).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Documenting undocumented features"
msgstr "ການຂຽນເອກະສານສຳລັບຟີເຈີທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "We are particularly interested in documenting closed pull requests that require additions or changes to this manual. Pull requests that require documentation are cataloged with a GitHub label `documentation: pending`.\n"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາມີຄວາມສົນໃຈເປັນພິເສດໃນການຂຽນເອກະສານສຳລັບ pull request ທີ່ຖືກປິດແລ້ວ ເຊິ່ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ມູນໃນຄູ່ມືນີ້. Pull request ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເອກະສານຈະຖືກຕິດປ້າຍ label ໃນ GitHub ວ່າ `documentation: pending`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The high-level steps to do this are:\n"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນຫຼັກໆໃນການເຮັດມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "View the list of [Pull Requests that need documentation](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/pulls?q=is%3Apr+is%3Aclosed+label%3A%22documentation:%20pending%22).\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງລາຍການຂອງ [Pull Requests ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເອກະສານ](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/pulls?q=is%3Apr+is%3Aclosed+label%3A%22documentation:%20pending%22).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select a Pull Request where you understand what has changed.\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກ Pull Request ທີ່ເຈົ້າເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງນັ້ນແມ່ນຫຍັງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Author the change as detailed in the workflow below.\n"
msgstr "ຂຽນການປ່ຽນແປງຕາມລາຍລະອຽດໃນ workflow ດ້ານລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you make the Pull Request, include a link to the pull request from Step 1.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າສ້າງ Pull Request, ໃຫ້ໃສ່ລິ້ງໄປຫາ pull request ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1 ນຳ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The documentation workflow"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເອກະສານ"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "One-time setup"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັ້ງທຳອິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not already configured git locally, use these two commands to configure your identity before committing:\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ git ໃນເຄື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສອງຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຕົນຂອງເຈົ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ commit:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`git config --global user.email \"you@example.com\"`\n"
msgstr "`git config --global user.email \"you@example.com\"`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`git config --global user.name \"Your Name\"`\n"
msgstr "`git config --global user.name \"Your Name\"`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "And if you have not yet authenticated your local git instance with github, follow the instructions for **GitHub CLI** [here](https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/caching-your-github-credentials-in-git). This will ensure that you have your keys and credentials set up correctly.\n"
msgstr "ແລະ ຖ້າເຈົ້າຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ git ໃນເຄື່ອງກັບ github, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບ **GitHub CLI** [ທີ່ນີ້](https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/caching-your-github-credentials-in-git). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ keys ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then you can clone a copy of dtdocs to your computer.\n"
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນ ເຈົ້າສາມາດ clone ສຳເນົາຂອງ dtdocs ລົງໃນຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to `https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs`.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ `https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press the `Fork` button and then the `Create fork` button.\n"
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ `Fork` ແລ້ວຕາມດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ `Create fork`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You will be redirected to a page with your fork of the darktable documentation. Press the `Code` button and copy the link under **HTTPS**.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາໜ້າ fork ຂອງເອກະສານ darktable ທີ່ເປັນຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ. ກົດປຸ່ມ `Code` ແລ້ວກັອບປີ້ລິ້ງພາຍໃຕ້ **HTTPS**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open a terminal or cmd in your desired directory where the darktable documentation repository will reside. Something like 'C:\\Users\\YourUser\\Documents\\' or '/home/youruser/Documents/builds'. Both on windows and macOS/Linux you can use the following command to navigate to your desired directory: `cd C:\\Users\\YourUser\\Documents\\` replacing the example directory for yours.\n"
msgstr "ເປີດ terminal ຫຼື cmd ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄັງເກັບເອກະສານ darktable ຢູ່. ເຊັ່ນ 'C:\\Users\\YourUser\\Documents\\' ຫຼື '/home/youruser/Documents/builds'. ທັງໃນ windows ແລະ macOS/Linux ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອໄປຍັງໂຟນເດີທີ່ຕ້ອງການ: `cd C:\\Users\\YourUser\\Documents\\` ໂດຍປ່ຽນເປັນຊື່ໂຟນເດີຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone the dtdocs repository by executing: `git clone https://github.com/<your username>/dtdocs.git` Change the URL to the one you copied in step 3.\n"
msgstr "Clone ຄັງເກັບ dtdocs ໂດຍການລັນ: `git clone https://github.com/<your username>/dtdocs.git` ໂດຍປ່ຽນ URL ເປັນລິ້ງທີ່ເຈົ້າກັອບປີ້ມາໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 3.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now you have a copy of the dtdocs repository on your PC. Some further setup will follow before you can start editing files.\n"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ເຈົ້າມີສຳເນົາຂອງຄັງເກັບ dtdocs ໃນ PC ແລ້ວ. ຈະມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີກເລັກນ້ອຍກ່ອນທີ່ເຈົ້າຈະເລີ່ມແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Syncing changes"
msgstr "ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນການປ່ຽນແປງ"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to your repositories on github and select your darktable fork.\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ repositories ຂອງເຈົ້າໃນ github ແລ້ວເລືອກ darktable ທີ່ເຈົ້າ fork ມາ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press the `Sync fork`.\n"
msgstr "ກົດ `Sync fork`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open a terminal or cmd in your darktable repository directory.\n"
msgstr "ເປີດ terminal ຫຼື cmd ໃນໂຟນເດີຄັງເກັບ darktable ຂອງເຈົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure you have no local pending changes by executing `git status` and then execute `git checkout master` (if you followed this guide for the first time you will already be on master).\n"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ໂດຍການລັນ `git status` ແລ້ວລັນ `git checkout master` (ຖ້າເຈົ້າເຮັດຕາມຄູ່ມືນີ້ເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ເຈົ້າຈະຢູ່ທີ່ master ຢູ່ແລ້ວ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute `git pull` (this ensures your local copy is up to date with your fork on github).\n"
msgstr "ລັນ `git pull` (ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສຳເນົາໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງເຈົ້າອັບເດດໃຫ້ກົງກັບ fork ໃນ github).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively you can sync your fork and local copy via terminal:\n"
msgstr "ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດຊິງໂຄຣໄນ fork ແລະ ສຳເນົາໃນເຄື່ອງຜ່ານ terminal ກໍໄດ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure you have no local pending changes by executing `git status` and then execute `git checkout master`.\n"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ໂດຍການລັນ `git status` ແລ້ວລັນ `git checkout master`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check your remote repositories: `git remote -v`. You should at least see `origin` (your fork). If `upstream` is missing, add it in the next step. \n"
msgstr "ກວດເບິ່ງ remote repositories ຂອງເຈົ້າ: `git remote -v`. ເຈົ້າຄວນເຫັນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ `origin` (fork ຂອງເຈົ້າ). ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ `upstream`, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມມັນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the dtdocs repository as upstream (only once): `git remote add upstream https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs.git`. \n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບ dtdocs ເປັນ upstream (ເຮັດພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ): `git remote add upstream https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs.git`. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pull the current state from the main repository to your local copy: `git pull upstream master`. \n"
msgstr "Pull ສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຈາກຄັງເກັບຫຼັກມາຍັງສຳເນົາໃນເຄື່ອງ: `git pull upstream master`. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Push your now synced local copy to your fork: `git push origin master`.\n"
msgstr "Push ສຳເນົາໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ຊິງໂຄຣໄນແລ້ວໄປທີ່ fork ຂອງເຈົ້າ: `git push origin master`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch, edit and create a pull request"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ Branch, ແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ສ້າງ pull request"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open a terminal or cmd in your darktable documentation repository directory.\n"
msgstr "ເປີດ terminal ຫຼື cmd ໃນໂຟນເດີຄັງເກັບເອກະສານ darktable ຂອງເຈົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute `git pull origin master` to get the latest changes from GitHub.\n"
msgstr "ລັນ `git pull origin master` ເພື່ອດຶງການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼ້າສຸດຈາກ GitHub.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute `git checkout -b branch-name` change `branch-name` for your desired branch name. This is often related to the work you're doing. For example, for this PR https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/pull/17589 you could call it `dt-synch-edit-docs`.\n"
msgstr "ລັນ `git checkout -b branch-name` ໂດຍປ່ຽນ `branch-name` ເປັນຊື່ branch ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຄວນຕັ້ງຊື່ໃຫ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບວຽກທີ່ເຈົ້າເຮັດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ສຳລັບ PR ນີ້ https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/pull/17589 ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ວ່າ `dt-synch-edit-docs`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do the documentation work.\n"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກກ່ຽວກັບເອກະສານ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify your changed files with `git status`. If you have more files modified than the ones you intend to submit, you can do `git restore path/to/file/` to revert your changes.\n"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເຈົ້າປ່ຽນແປງດ້ວຍ `git status`. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໃຈຈະສົ່ງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ `git restore path/to/file/` ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute `git add -A`. This will stage all changed files.\n"
msgstr "ລັນ `git add -A`. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະ stage ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute `git commit -m \"Added documentation for yada yada\"`. Inside the \"\" you will put a small message about the work you did.\n"
msgstr "ລັນ `git commit -m \"Added documentation for yada yada\"`. ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງໝາຍ \"\" ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບວຽກທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ເຮັດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '8. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute `git push --set-upstream origin branch-name` Replace branch-name with the one you picked earlier.\n"
msgstr "ລັນ `git push --set-upstream origin branch-name` ໂດຍປ່ຽນ branch-name ເປັນຊື່ທີ່ເຈົ້າເລືອກໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '9. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create your pull request by following the instructions below.\n"
msgstr "ສ້າງ pull request ຂອງເຈົ້າໂດຍປະຕິບັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳດ້ານລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '10. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you need to make further corrections using the current branch, simply repeat 3-8. For the command in step 3 you can omit `-b` and in step 8 you can just do `git push`.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ branch ເດີມ, ໃຫ້ເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນ 3-8 ຊ້ຳຄືນ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 3 ເຈົ້າສາມາດຂ້າມ `-b` ໄປໄດ້ ແລະ ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 8 ເຈົ້າສາມາດລັນພຽງແຕ່ `git push`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '11. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "After you are done and your pull request is merged or you are finished with your work for this specific pull request, execute `git checkout master` to return to the master branch. I recommend working on only one branch/pr at a time if you don't know how git works.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເຈົ້າເຮັດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ແລະ pull request ຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກ merge ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສຳເລັດວຽກສຳລັບ pull request ນັ້ນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລັນ `git checkout master` ເພື່ອກັບໄປທີ່ master branch. ຂ້ອຍແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກພຽງເທື່ອລະ branch/pr ຖ້າເຈົ້າຍັງບໍ່ຊຳນານໃນການໃຊ້ git.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running `hugo` locally to see changes"
msgstr "ການລັນ `hugo` ໃນເຄື່ອງເພື່ອເບິ່ງການປ່ຽນແປງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[hugo](https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo) can also be executed locally to create a local live preview of the docs. This is useful to check for formatting, links etc. \n"
msgstr "[hugo](https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo) ສາມາດລັນໃນເຄື່ອງໄດ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຢ່າງການສະແດງຜົນ (preview) ຂອງເອກະສານ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການກວດສອບຮູບແບບ, ລິ້ງ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execute `hugo server -D --disableFastRender` from the base directory of your local repository. When no errors are encountered, the terminal will report: `Web Server is available at http://localhost:1313/usermanual/development/ (bind address 127.0.0.1)` and the site should be available at the URL. Hugo will monitor the directory for changes and redeploy upon changing files automatically. When you have a specific page open and make changes to the corresponding .md file the browser should also reload the page after hugo has automatically redeployed. \n"
msgstr "ລັນ `hugo server -D --disableFastRender` ຈາກໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງຄັງເກັບໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງເຈົ້າ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, terminal ຈະແຈ້ງວ່າ: `Web Server is available at http://localhost:1313/usermanual/development/ (bind address 127.0.0.1)` ແລະ ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງເວັບໄຊໄດ້ຕາມ URL ນັ້ນ. Hugo ຈະຄອຍກວດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງໃນໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ຈະອັບເດດໜ້າເວັບໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເປີດໜ້າໃດໜຶ່ງໄວ້ ແລະ ມີການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ .md ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ບຣາວເຊີກໍຈະໂຫຼດໜ້ານັ້ນໃໝ່ໃຫ້ເອງຫຼັງຈາກ Hugo ອັບເດດແລ້ວ. \n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pull request"
msgstr "Pull request"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/compare\n"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/compare\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press `compare across forks`. Select your repository, and then the branch you just worked on.\n"
msgstr "ກົດ `compare across forks`. ເລືອກ repository ຂອງເຈົ້າ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ branch ທີ່ເຈົ້າຫາພ້ອມແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/contributing/workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press `Create Pull Request`\n"
msgstr "ກົດ `Create Pull Request`\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "development & deployment"
msgstr "ການພັດທະນາ ແລະ ການນຳໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable's documentation is maintained in the [dtdocs repository](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs). Changes are introduced through pull requests (see [workflow](workflow.md)). Translations are maintained through weblate; see [translations](translations-setup.md). \n"
msgstr "ເອກະສານຂອງ darktable ແມ່ນຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ໃນ [ຄັງເກັບ dtdocs](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs). ການປ່ຽນແປງຕ່າງໆແມ່ນເຮັດຜ່ານ pull requests (ເບິ່ງ [workflow](workflow.md)). ສ່ວນການແປພາສາແມ່ນຈັດການຜ່ານ weblate; ເບິ່ງ [translations](translations-setup.md). \n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Building"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ (Building)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The full set of outputs (HTML site, EPUB, and per-language PDFs) is built by `./tools/build-all.sh <base_url>`\n"
msgstr "ຊຸດຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທັງໝົດ (ເວັບໄຊ HTML, EPUB, ແລະ PDF ແຕ່ລະພາສາ) ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ `./tools/build-all.sh <base_url>`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This generates the translated content from the PO files, then builds the\n"
"HTML site, the EPUB, and one PDF per enabled language. Outputs are written\n"
"under `public/`, with PDFs at `public/<lang>/darktable_user_manual.pdf`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ແປແລ້ວຈາກໄຟລ໌ PO, ຈາກນັ້ນກໍສ້າງເວັບໄຊ\n"
"HTML, EPUB, ແລະ PDF ຫນຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ຕໍ່ພາສາທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກບັນທຶກ\n"
"ໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ `public/`, ໂດຍ PDF ຈະຢູ່ທີ່ `public/<lang>/darktable_user_manual.pdf`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Requirements: Hugo (extended), `weasyprint`, and `po4a` for the\n"
"translation step. \n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ: Hugo (ຮຸ່ນ extended), `weasyprint`, ແລະ `po4a` ສຳລັບ\n"
"ຂັ້ນຕອນການແປ. \n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitHub Pages deployment (for development)"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ GitHub Pages (ສຳລັບການພັດທະນາ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For development purposes, the docs are deployed to GitHub Pages on every push: A GitHub Action runs `tools/build-all.sh`, which generates HTML, EPUB and PDF outputs. These are committed to the repository's [gh-pages](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/tree/gh-pages) branch and served via GitHub Pages at https://darktable-org.github.io/dtdocs/. Generation of translated pages is disabled in the GitHub pages deployment.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການພັດທະນາ, ເອກະສານຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໃນ GitHub Pages ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການ push: GitHub Action ຈະລັນ `tools/build-all.sh` ເພື່ອສ້າງ HTML, EPUB ແລະ PDF. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກ commit ໄປທີ່ branch [gh-pages](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/tree/gh-pages) ຂອງຄັງເກັບ ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ຜ່ານ GitHub Pages ທີ່ https://darktable-org.github.io/dtdocs/. ການສ້າງໜ້າເວັບທີ່ແປພາສາແມ່ນຖືກປິດໄວ້ໃນການນຳໃຊ້ຜ່ານ GitHub pages.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Official deployment to darktable.org"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງເປັນທາງການໃນ darktable.org"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The official home of the docs is the pixls.us server infrastructure at https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/development/. There, the repository is pulled regularly and the documentation is built with Hugo, including translations as well as EPUB and PDF outputs. The build log can be found [here](https://docs.darktable.org/buildlog.txt).\n"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັກຢ່າງເປັນທາງການຂອງເອກະສານແມ່ນໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານເຊີເວີ pixls.us ທີ່ https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/development/. ຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ, ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກ pull ເປັນປະຈຳ ແລະ ເອກະສານຈະຖືກສ້າງດ້ວຍ Hugo, ລວມທັງການແປພາສາ, EPUB ແລະ PDF. ສາມາດເບິ່ງບັນທຶກການສ້າງ (build log) ໄດ້ [ທີ່ນີ້](https://docs.darktable.org/buildlog.txt).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Versioning of the docs "
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຮຸ່ນຂອງເອກະສານ "

#. type: Plain text
#: content/contributing/development-deployment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Up to 4.6 versioned copies of the docs were maintained (e.g. [.../usermanual/4.6/](https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/4.6/)). From there on only one version documenting the current development version is maintained ([.../usermanual/development/](https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/development/)). Links to the released versions following 4.6 are linked to the development version (e.g. [.../usermanual/5.4/](https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/5.4/) links to [.../usermanual/development/](https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/development/)).\n"
msgstr "ຈົນຮອດຮຸ່ນ 4.6, ເອກະສານແຍກຕາມຮຸ່ນແມ່ນໄດ້ຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ (ເຊັ່ນ [.../usermanual/4.6/](https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/4.6/)). ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ຮຸ່ນດຽວທີ່ບັນທຶກຮຸ່ນກຳລັງພັດທະນາປັດຈຸບັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ([.../usermanual/development/](https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/development/)). ລິ້ງສຳລັບຮຸ່ນທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ຫຼັງຈາກ 4.6 ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄປຫາຮຸ່ນພັດທະນາ (ເຊັ່ນ [.../usermanual/5.4/](https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/5.4/) ຈະລິ້ງໄປຫາ [.../usermanual/development/](https://docs.darktable.org/usermanual/development/)).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "storage"
msgstr "ການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following options are related to darktable's library database and [XMP sidecar files](../overview/sidecar-files/_index.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບພາບຂອງ darktable ແລະ [ໄຟລ໌ XMP sidecar](../"
"overview/sidecar-files/_index.md).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "database"
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"allow for multiple workspaces\n"
": Allows for multiple workspaces that can be selected via a popup window at startup. In the popup, it is possible to create a new workspace, delete workspaces, set a workspace as the default (used on startup until changed again), or to work from memory (no database). If **remember selection and don't ask again** is checked when confirming a workspace, that selection is kept for the next launch without showing the popup, and **allow for multiple workspaces** is turned off so the popup stays hidden until you enable **allow for multiple workspaces** again here. A workspace is a combination of a library database and a `darktablerc` configuration file using the same shared configuration folder settings (data database and shortcuts). New workspaces can optionally be created by copying an existing workspace as a template; workspace-specific configuration is duplicated while paths, labels, collection history and similar keys are cleared so the new workspace keeps its own library database. See [darktable invocation](../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md) for more details around `library.db`, `data.db` and `darktablerc`. (default off)\n"
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີຫຼາຍພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ (workspaces)\n"
": ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີຫຼາຍພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເຊິ່ງສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ຜ່ານໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບຕອນເລີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມ. ໃນປັອບອັບນັ້ນ, ສາມາດສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃໝ່, ລຶບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ, ຕັ້ງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ໃຊ້ຕອນເລີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງອີກ), ຫຼື ເຮັດວຽກຈາກໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ (ບໍ່ມີຖານຂໍ້ມູນ). ຖ້າເລືອກ **ຈື່ການເລືອກ ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຖາມອີກ** ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ, ການເລືອກນັ້ນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ສຳລັບການເປີດຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປໂດຍບໍ່ສະແດງປັອບອັບ, ແລະ **ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີຫຼາຍພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ** ຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ປັອບອັບບໍ່ສະແດງ ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະມາເປີດ **ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີຫຼາຍພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ** ອີກຄັ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້. ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກແມ່ນການລວມກັນຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ຕັ້ງຄ່າ `darktablerc` ໂດຍໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຟນເດີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮ່ວມກັນ (ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຄີລັດ). ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃໝ່ສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການສຳເນົາພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທີ່ມີຢູ່ມາເປັນແບບຢ່າງ; ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະຂອງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຈະຖືກສຳເນົາໄປ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌, ປ້າຍຊື່, ປະຫວັດການສະສົມ ແລະ ຄີທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກເພື່ອໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃໝ່ມີຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ. ເບິ່ງ [ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ darktable](../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ `library.db`, `data.db` ແລະ `darktablerc`. (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນປິດ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"create database snapshot\n"
": Specifies how often darktable should create database snapshots. Options are \"never\", \"once a month\", \"once a week\", \"once a day\" and \"on close\" (default \"once a week\")\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສະແນັບຊອດ (snapshot) ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
": ລະບຸວ່າ darktable ຄວນສ້າງສະແນັບຊອດຖານຂໍ້ມູນເລື້ອຍປານໃດ. ຕົວເລືອກແມ່ນ \"never\" (ບໍ່ເຄີຍ), \"once a month\" (ເດືອນລະຄັ້ງ), \"once a week\" (ອາທິດລະຄັ້ງ), \"once a day\" (ມື້ລະຄັ້ງ) ແລະ \"on close\" (ເມື່ອປິດໂປຣແກຣມ) (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ \"once a week\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"how many snapshots to keep\n"
": Number of snapshots to keep after creating a new snapshot, not counting database backups taken when moving between darktable versions. Enter \"-1\" to store an unlimited number of snapshots. (default 10)\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນສະແນັບຊອດທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້\n"
": ຈຳນວນສະແນັບຊອດທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງສະແນັບຊອດໃໝ່, ໂດຍບໍ່ນັບລວມການສຳຮອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຮັດຕອນປ່ຽນເວີຊັນຂອງ darktable. ປ້ອນ \"-1\" ເພື່ອເກັບສະແນັບຊອດແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນ. (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10)\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "XMP sidecar files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ຂະໜານ XMP"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"create XMP files\n"
": XMP sidecar files provide a redundant method of saving the changes that you have made to an image, in addition to the changes saved to darktable's database. This option allows you to choose when files will _first be written_. Once written, they will subsequently be updated each time you edit or add a tag to the image. Choose from:\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ XMP\n"
": ໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ຂະໜານ XMP ເປັນວິທີການສຳຮອງໃນການບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດກັບຮູບພາບ, ນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ darktable. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ຖືກ _ຂຽນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ_ ເມື່ອໃດ. ເມື່ອຖືກຂຽນແລ້ວ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກອັບເດດທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມແທັກໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບ. ເລືອກຈາກ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - _never_: Don't write sidecar files. This can be useful if you are running multiple version of darktable for development/testing purposes but is not normally recommended,\n"
": - _on import_: A sidecar file will be written as soon as you add an image to darktable's library,\n"
": - _after edit_: A sidecar will not be written until the first time you edit or add a tag to an image.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _never_ (ບໍ່ເຄີຍ): ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຂຽນໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ຂະໜານ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ darktable ຫຼາຍເວີຊັນເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງການພັດທະນາ/ທົດສອບ ແຕ່ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນບໍ່ແນະນຳ,\n"
": - _on import_ (ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າ): ໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ຂະໜານຈະຖືກຂຽນທັນທີທີ່ທ່ານເພີ່ມຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໃນຄັງຮູບຂອງ darktable,\n"
": - _after edit_ (ຫຼັງການແກ້ໄຂ): ໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ຂະໜານຈະບໍ່ຖືກຂຽນຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມແທັກໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": It's strongly recommended that you choose either \"on import\" or \"after edit\". Sidecar files provide a useful fail-safe to prevent data loss if your database becomes corrupted. Backing up your raw file plus the accompanying sidecar file will allow you to fully restore your work at a later date by re-importing your edit history back into darktable (default \"on import\").\n"
msgstr ": ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກ \"on import\" ຫຼື \"after edit\". ໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ຂະໜານເປັນລະບົບປ້ອງກັນຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ມູນສູນຫາຍຫາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານເພ. ການສຳຮອງໄຟລ໌ raw ຂອງທ່ານພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ຂະໜານທີ່ມາກັບມັນ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄືນຄ່າວຽກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນໃນພາຍຫຼັງ ໂດຍການນຳເຂົ້າປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂກັບເຂົ້າໄປໃນ darktable ຄືນໃໝ່ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ \"on import\").\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"store XMP tags in compressed format\n"
": Entries in XMP tags can get rather large and may exceed the available space to store the history stack in some output files on export. This option allows binary XMP tags to be compressed in order to save space. Available options are “never”, “always”, and “only large entries” (default).\n"
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຮັກສາແທັກ XMP ໃນຮູບແບບບີບອັດ\n"
": ລາຍການໃນແທັກ XMP ອາດມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ສົມຄວນ ແລະ ອາດຈະເກີນພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງທີ່ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບເກັບຮັກສາປະຫວັດການ"
"ປັບແຕ່ງ (history stack) ໃນບາງໄຟລ໌ຜົນອອກຕອນສົ່ງອອກ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ບີບອັດແທັກ XMP ແບບໄບ"
"ນາຣີເພື່ອປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່. ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີແມ່ນ “ບໍ່ເຄີຍ”, “ສະເໝີ”, ແລະ “ສະເພາະລາຍການທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່” (ຄ່າເລີ່"
"ມຕົ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"auto-save interval\n"
": This preference sets the interval (in seconds) after which the processing history for an image will be automatically saved (while in the darkroom view). Set to zero to disable auto-saving. Note that this option might be ignored for slow drives (default 10s).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະເວລາການບັນທຶກອັດຕະໂນມັດ\n"
": ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ບັນທຶກປະຫວັດການປະມວນຜົນຂອງຮູບພາບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນມຸມມອງ darkroom). ຕັ້ງເປັນສູນເພື່ອປິດການບັນທຶກອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກລະເວັ້ນສຳລັບໄດຣຟ໌ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຊ້າ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10 ວິນາທີ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/storage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"look for updated XMP files on startup\n"
": Scan all XMP files on startup and check if any have been updated in the meantime by some other software. If updated XMP files are found, a menu is opened for the user to choose which of the XMP files to reload (replacing darktable's database entries by the XMP file contents) and which of the XMP to overwrite from darktable's database. Activating this option also causes darktable to check for text sidecar files that have been added after import time (default off).\n"
msgstr ""
"ກວດຫາໄຟລ໌ XMP ທີ່ຖືກອັບເດດຕອນເລີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມ\n"
": ສະແກນໄຟລ໌ XMP ທັງໝົດຕອນເລີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມ ແລະ ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າມີໄຟລ໌ໃດຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍຊອບແວອື່ນໃນລະຫວ່າງນັ້ນຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າພົບໄຟລ໌ XMP ທີ່ຖືກອັບເດດ, ເມນູຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກວ່າຈະໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ XMP ໃດຄືນໃໝ່ (ແທນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ darktable ດ້ວຍເນື້ອໃນຂອງໄຟລ໌ XMP) ແລະ ຈະໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ XMP ໃດຖືກຂຽນທັບຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ darktable. ການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຍັງເຮັດໃຫ້ darktable ກວດຫາໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ຂະໜານແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າຫຼັງຈາກເວລານຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນປິດ).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI"
msgstr "AI"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Control darktable's AI features: enable or disable them, choose a hardware accelerator for model inference, point darktable at an ONNX Runtime library, and manage the AI models available on disk.\n"
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ຂອງ darktable: ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ເລືອກຕົວເລັ່ງຮາດແວສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນໂມເດວ (model inference), ຊີ້ darktable ໄປຫາໄລບຣາຣີ ONNX Runtime, ແລະ ຈັດການໂມເດວ AI ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນດິສກ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI features are powered by [ONNX Runtime](https://onnxruntime.ai/). What runs out of the box and what GPU acceleration can be added on each platform:\n"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ຖືກຂັບເຄື່ອນໂດຍ [ONNX Runtime](https://onnxruntime.ai/). ສິ່ງທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ທັນທີ ແລະ ການເລັ່ງ GPU ທີ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຕ່ລະແພລັດຟອມມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| OS      | Bundled                                    | Optional GPU acceleration                  |\n"
"|---------|--------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Linux   | CPU only                                   | NVIDIA CUDA, AMD ROCm/MIGraphX, Intel OpenVINO |\n"
"| Windows | DirectML (any DirectX 12 GPU)              | NVIDIA CUDA, Intel OpenVINO                |\n"
"| macOS   | CoreML (Apple Silicon, integrated GPU)     | –                                          |\n"
msgstr ""
"| ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ | ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບແອັບ | ການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວ GPU ທາງເລືອກ |\n"
"|---------|--------------------------------------------"
"|--------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Linux   | CPU ເທົ່ານັ້ນ | NVIDIA CUDA, AMD ROCm/MIGraphX, Intel OpenVINO |\n"
"| Windows | DirectML (GPU DirectX 12 ໃດກໍໄດ້) | NVIDIA CUDA, Intel OpenVINO |\n"
"| macOS   | CoreML (Apple Silicon, GPU ໃນຕົວ) | – |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install scripts for the GPU runtimes are described below; see [GPU acceleration](../special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md) for the full instructions.\n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບຕິດຕັ້ງສຳລັບ GPU runtimes ແມ່ນມີຄຳອະທິບາຍຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້; ເບິ່ງ [ການເລັ່ງ GPU](../special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md) ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a deeper explanation of how AI features work – the inference runtime, execution providers, model layout, GPU acceleration, and troubleshooting – see the [AI features](../special-topics/ai/) special topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍຢ່າງລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດ AI – ສ່ວນການລັນ (inference "
"runtime), ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການການປະມວນຜົນ (execution providers), ໂຄງສ້າງໂມເດວ, ການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄ"
"ວ GPU, ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ – ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຫົວຂໍ້ພິເສດ [ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI](../special-topics/ai/).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#: content/preferences-settings/lighttable.md
#: content/preferences-settings/darkroom.md
#: content/preferences-settings/security.md
#: content/preferences-settings/general.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-equalizer.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "general"
msgstr "ທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"enable AI features\n"
": Master switch for all AI features. When disabled, no ONNX Runtime is loaded, no model directories are scanned, and AI-dependent modules hide themselves. Turn this off to eliminate AI-related memory and startup cost when you don't need it (default off).\n"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດ AI\n"
": ປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມຫຼັກສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ທັງໝົດ. ເມື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການໂຫຼດ ONNX Runtime, ບໍ່ມີການສະແກນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໂມເດວ, ແລະ ໂມດູນທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບ AI ຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້. ປິດສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ AI ເມື່ອເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນປິດ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"AI acceleration\n"
": The hardware accelerator used for model inference. The list only shows the currently available providers as supported by the loaded ONNX Runtime. Installing a different ONNX Runtime updates the list.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເລັ່ງ AI\n"
": ຕົວເລັ່ງຮາດແວທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນໂມເດວ (model inference). ລາຍການຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຕາມທີ່ຮອງຮັບໂດຍ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ໂຫຼດມາ. ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ONNX Runtime ອື່ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍການນີ້ອັບເດດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - _auto_ picks the best available provider for the loaded library, falling back to CPU if no accelerator initialises.\n"
": - _CPU_ runs inference on the processor. Always available.\n"
": - _NVIDIA CUDA_ uses NVIDIA GPUs via cuDNN (Linux, Windows; requires installing a CUDA-enabled ONNX Runtime).\n"
": - _AMD MIGraphX_ uses AMD GPUs via ROCm (Linux only; requires installing a MIGraphX-enabled ONNX Runtime).\n"
": - _Intel OpenVINO_ uses Intel GPUs and iGPUs via OpenVINO (Linux, Windows; requires installing an OpenVINO-enabled ONNX Runtime).\n"
": - _Windows DirectML_ uses any DirectX 12 capable GPU (Windows; bundled by default).\n"
": - _Apple CoreML_ uses the Apple Neural Engine and integrated GPU (macOS; bundled by default).\n"
msgstr ""
": - _auto_ ເລືອກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ສຳລັບໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ໂຫຼດມາ, ໂດຍຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ CPU ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຕົວເລັ່ງໃດເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
": - _CPU_ ປະມວນຜົນໃນຊີພີຢູ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເໝີ.\n"
": - _NVIDIA CUDA_ ໃຊ້ NVIDIA GPUs ຜ່ານ cuDNN (Linux, Windows; ຕ້ອງການການຕິດຕັ້ງ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ CUDA).\n"
": - _AMD MIGraphX_ ໃຊ້ AMD GPUs ຜ່ານ ROCm (Linux ເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ຕ້ອງການການຕິດຕັ້ງ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MIGraphX).\n"
": - _Intel OpenVINO_ ໃຊ້ Intel GPUs ແລະ iGPUs ຜ່ານ OpenVINO (Linux, Windows; ຕ້ອງການການຕິດຕັ້ງ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ OpenVINO).\n"
": - _Windows DirectML_ ໃຊ້ GPU ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ DirectX 12 ໃດໜຶ່ງ (Windows; ແຖມມາໃຫ້ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ).\n"
": - _Apple CoreML_ ໃຊ້ Apple Neural Engine ແລະ GPU ໃນຕົວ (macOS; ແຖມມາໃຫ້ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Double-click the label to reset to the default. If the selected provider cannot be initialised with the currently-loaded ONNX Runtime (for example, if the library was built without that provider) a _not available, will fall back to CPU_ notice appears next to the combo box. After swapping the ONNX Runtime library, the notice becomes _restart to apply_ until darktable is restarted.\n"
msgstr ": ຄລິກສອງຄັ້ງທີ່ປ້າຍຊື່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າກັບເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການທີ່ເລືອກບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກກັບ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ໂຫຼດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າໄລບຣາຣີຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການນັ້ນ) ຂໍ້ຄວາມ _ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້, ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ CPU_ ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນຖັດຈາກກ່ອງເລືອກ. ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນໄລບຣາຣີ ONNX Runtime, ຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະປ່ຽນເປັນ _ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ເພື່ອປັບໃຊ້_ ຈົນກວ່າ darktable ຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ONNX Runtime library\n"
": Path to a shared library (`libonnxruntime.so*` on Linux, `onnxruntime.dll` on Windows) that darktable should load in place of the bundled one. Leave empty to use the bundled library (see the table above for what that is per OS). To use a GPU runtime, install one via the scripts described below and point this field at it. Double-click the label to reset to empty. Changes take effect after restarting darktable. _Hidden on macOS_, where ONNX Runtime is statically linked with CoreML support.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄລບຣາຣີ ONNX Runtime\n"
": ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ (`libonnxruntime.so*` ໃນ Linux, `onnxruntime.dll` ໃນ Windows) ທີ່ darktable ຄວນໂຫຼດແທນອັນທີ່ແຖມມາໃຫ້. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ແຖມມາໃຫ້ (ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງຂ້າງເທິງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ OS). ເພື່ອໃຊ້ GPU runtime, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງອັນໜຶ່ງຜ່ານສະຄຣິບທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ ແລະ ຊີ້ມາທີ່ຊ່ອງນີ້. ຄລິກສອງຄັ້ງທີ່ປ້າຍຊື່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງ. ການປ່ຽນແປງຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ darktable ໃໝ່. _ເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໃນ macOS_, ເຊິ່ງ ONNX Runtime ຖືກເຊື່ອມໂຍງແບບສະແຕຕິກກັບການຮອງຮັບ CoreML.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": To the right of the path field are two buttons:\n"
msgstr ": ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງຊ່ອງເສັ້ນທາງມີສອງປຸ່ມ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _browse_ (folder icon) – open a file chooser to pick a custom ONNX Runtime library. Selection is validated by loading the library and probing its version and available execution providers; if the file is not a valid ONNX Runtime build it is rejected and the previous path is restored.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _browse_ (ໄອຄອນໂຟນເດີ) – ເປີດຕົວເລືອກໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເລືອກໄລບຣາຣີ (library) ONNX Runtime "
"ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. ການເລືອກຈະຖືກກວດສອບໂດຍການໂຫຼດໄລບຣາຣີ ແລະ ກວດສອບເວີຊັນ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການການປະມວ"
"ນຜົນທີ່ມີຢູ່; ຖ້າໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ແມ່ນການສ້າງ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ມັນຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດ ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງເດີມຈະຖືກກູ້ຄືນ"
"ມາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _detect_ – scan standard system locations for an ONNX Runtime library (package-manager installs, `/usr/lib`, `/usr/local/lib`, `~/.local/lib`). If multiple candidates are found you will be asked to choose; if exactly one is found it is applied automatically. Useful when you have installed ONNX Runtime via your distribution's package manager or via the install script described below.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _detect_ – ສະແກນຕຳແໜ່ງມາດຕະຖານຂອງລະບົບເພື່ອຫາໄລບຣາຣີ ONNX Runtime (ການຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານຕົ"
"ວຈັດການແພັກເກັດ, `/usr/lib`, `/usr/local/lib`, `~/.local/lib`). ຖ້າພົບຫຼາຍອັນ ທ່ານຈະຖື"
"ກຖາມໃຫ້ເລືອກ; ຖ້າພົບອັນດຽວມັນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ ONNX Runtime "
"ຜ່ານຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດຂອງລະບົບ ຫຼື ຜ່ານສະຄຣິບຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "installing a GPU ONNX Runtime"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ GPU ONNX Runtime"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPU acceleration on Linux and Windows (NVIDIA CUDA, AMD MIGraphX, Intel OpenVINO) requires a GPU-enabled ONNX Runtime build, which darktable does not ship in-app. Install scripts handle this end-to-end – detecting your GPU, downloading the matching runtime, verifying it, and installing under your user account.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວ GPU ໃນ Linux ແລະ Windows (NVIDIA CUDA, AMD MIGraphX, Intel "
"OpenVINO) ຕ້ອງການການສ້າງ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ GPU, ເຊິ່ງ darktable ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ມາໃນຕົວແອັ"
"ບ. ສະຄຣິບຕິດຕັ້ງຈະຈັດການເລື່ອງນີ້ແບບຄົບວົງຈອນ – ກວດສອບ GPU ຂອງທ່ານ, ດາວໂຫຼດ runtime ທີ່ກົງກັ"
"ນ, ກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃຕ້ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See [GPU acceleration](../special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md) for the full instructions: one-line installers for Linux and Windows, prerequisites, GPU and driver requirements, alternative manual installation, building AMD ONNX Runtime from source, and troubleshooting.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ [ການເລັ່ງ GPU](../special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md) ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳທັງໝົດ: ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງແບບແຖວດຽວສຳລັບ Linux ແລະ Windows, ເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ, ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ GPU ແລະ ໄດເວີ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບກຳນົດເອງ, ການສ້າງ AMD ONNX Runtime ຈາກຊອດໂຄ້ດ (source), ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "After installation, restart darktable, then use the _detect_ button above to point darktable at the newly-installed library (or pick the file manually with the browse button).\n"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ darktable ໃໝ່, ຈາກນັ້ນໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ _detect_ ຂ້າງເທິງເພື່ອຊີ້ darktable ໄປຫາໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ (ຫຼື ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ browse).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "models"
msgstr "ໂມເດວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The lower half of the tab lists AI models known to darktable – both already-downloaded ones and those available from the [darktable-ai](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable-ai) model repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຄິ່ງລຸ່ມຂອງແຖບຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໂມເດວ AI ທີ່ darktable ຮູ້ຈັກ – ທັງອັນທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາແລ້ວ ແລະ ອັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ຈ"
"າກຄັງເກັບໂມເດວ [darktable-ai](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable-ai).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"model list\n"
": Each row has the following columns:\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ໂມເດວ\n"
": ແຕ່ລະແຖວມີຄໍລຳດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - _select_ (leftmost checkbox) – include the model in bulk operations (_download selected_, _delete selected_). Independent of the enabled state. The header checkbox toggles all rows at once.\n"
": - _name_ – model name.\n"
": - info button (_i_ icon) – click to open the model card with full metadata: scope, author, source, paper, license, training data, data license, notes.\n"
": - _version_ – model version string from the repository manifest.\n"
": - _task_ – which task this model serves: _mask_, _denoise_, _rawdenoise_, _upscale_.\n"
": - _enabled_ – marks the model as the active model for its task. Only one model can be active per task at a time: ticking it on a second model of the same task automatically un-ticks the previously active one, like a radio button. Un-ticking the active model leaves the task with no active model until another is picked. AI-dependent modules use whichever model is currently active for their task.\n"
": - _status_ – _downloaded_, _not downloaded_, _update available_, or _update required_.\n"
": - _default_ – _yes_ if the model is in the developer-recommended default set (selected by _download default_), _no_ otherwise.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _select_ (ຊ່ອງໝາຍຊ້າຍສຸດ) – ຮວມໂມເດວເຂົ້າໃນການດຳເນີນການແບບກຸ່ມ (_ດາວໂຫຼດອັນທີ່ເລືອກ_, "
"_ລຶບອັນທີ່ເລືອກ_). ບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບສະຖານະການເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. ຊ່ອງໝາຍຢູ່ສ່ວນຫົວຈະປ່ຽນທຸກແຖວພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
": - _name_ – ຊື່ໂມເດວ.\n"
": - ປຸ່ມຂໍ້ມູນ (ໄອຄອນ _i_) – ຄລິກເພື່ອເປີດບັດໂມເດວທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຄົບຖ້ວນ: ຂອບເຂດ, ຜູ້ສ້າງ, ແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມ"
"າ, ເອກະສານອ້າງອີງ, ໃບອະນຸຍາດ, ຂໍ້ມູນການຝຶກອົບຮົມ, ໃບອະນຸຍາດຂໍ້ມູນ, ໝາຍເຫດ.\n"
": - _version_ – ຂໍ້ຄວາມເວີຊັນຂອງໂມເດວຈາກລາຍການໃນຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
": - _task_ – ໜ້າທີ່ທີ່ໂມເດວນີ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ: _mask_ (ໜ້າກາກ), _denoise_ (ຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບກວນ), "
"_rawdenoise_ (ຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບກວນ raw), _upscale_ (ຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດ).\n"
": - _enabled_ – ໝາຍໂມເດວວ່າເປັນໂມເດວທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ສຳລັບໜ້າທີ່ນັ້ນ. ສາມາດມີໂມເດວທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໄດ້ພຽງອັນ"
"ດຽວຕໍ່ໜ້າທີ່ໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ: ການໝາຍໃນໂມເດວທີສອງຂອງໜ້າທີ່ດຽວກັນຈະຍົກເລີກການໝາຍໂມເດວທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ງານກ່ອນໜ້າ"
"ນັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຄືກັບປຸ່ມວິທະຍຸ (radio button). ການຍົກເລີກການໝາຍໂມເດວທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າທີ່"
"ນັ້ນບໍ່ມີໂມເດວທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຈົນກ່ວາຈະເລືອກອັນອື່ນ. ໂມດູນທີ່ຂຶ້ນກັບ AI ຈະໃຊ້ໂມເດວໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັ"
"ນສຳລັບໜ້າທີ່ຂອງພວກເຂົາ.\n"
": - _status_ – _ດາວໂຫຼດແລ້ວ_, _ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ດາວໂຫຼດ_, _ມີເວີຊັນໃໝ່ໃຫ້ອັບເດດ_, ຫຼື _ຕ້ອງໄດ້ອັບເດ"
"ດ_.\n"
": - _default_ – _yes_ ຖ້າໂມເດວຢູ່ໃນຊຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຜູ້ພັດທະນາແນະນຳ (ເລືອກໂດຍ _ດາວໂຫຼດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້"
"ນ_), _no_ ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"download / update default\n"
": Download or update the subset of models the darktable developers recommend as defaults for each task. Useful to get going quickly with a fresh install, and to pull in any newer versions of those models that the repository has published since.\n"
msgstr ""
"ດາວໂຫຼດ / ອັບເດດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
": ດາວໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ອັບເດດຊຸດໂມເດວທີ່ນັກພັດທະນາ darktable ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໜ້າທີ່. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢ່າງໄວວາເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່, ແລະ ເພື່ອດຶງເອົາເວີຊັນໃໝ່ຂອງໂມເດວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຄັງເກັບໄດ້ເຜີຍແຜ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"download / update selected\n"
": Download or update the models whose _select_ checkbox is ticked. Use this when you've ticked one or a few specific models in the list and only want to operate on those.\n"
msgstr ""
"ດາວໂຫຼດ / ອັບເດດອັນທີ່ເລືອກ\n"
": ດາວໂຫຼດ ຫຼື ອັບເດດໂມເດວທີ່ຖືກໝາຍໃນກ່ອງໝາຍ _select_. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເມື່ອເຈົ້າໄດ້ໝາຍບາງໂມເດວໃນລາຍການ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການຈັດການສະເພາະໂມເດວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"import from file…\n"
": Install a model from a local `.dtmodel` archive. The file chooser is filtered to `*.dtmodel`; once imported, the model immediately becomes available. Use this for models you've been given by hand, models you've built yourself, or extra per-task alternatives from the [darktable-ai](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable-ai) repository – the in-app list shows only one or two models per task, but the repository may publish additional alternatives for the same task (different denoise model trained on a different dataset, alternative segmentation backbone, etc.). Download the `.dtmodel` from the repository's GitHub releases and import it here.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກໄຟລ໌…\n"
": ຕິດຕັ້ງໂມເດວຈາກໄຟລ໌ເກັບ `.dtmodel` ໃນເຄື່ອງ. ຕົວເລືອກໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກຄັດກອງໃຫ້ເຫັນແຕ່ "
"`*.dtmodel`; ເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າແລ້ວ, ໂມເດວຈະພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານທັນທີ. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳລັບໂມເດວທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບມາໂດຍກົງ, "
"ໂມເດວທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງເອງ, ຫຼື ທາງເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມຕໍ່ໜ້າທີ່ຈາກຄັງເກັບ [darktable-ai](https://"
"github.com/darktable-org/darktable-ai) – ລາຍຊື່ໃນແອັບຈະສະແດງພຽງໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ສອງໂມເດວຕໍ່ໜ້າ"
"ທີ່, ແຕ່ໃນຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນອາດຈະມີການເຜີຍແຜ່ທາງເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບໜ້າທີ່ດຽວກັນ (ໂມເດວ denoise ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງ"
"ກັນເຊິ່ງຝຶກດ້ວຍຊຸດຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນ, ໂຄງສ້າງການແຍກສ່ວນທາງເລືອກ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ). ດາວໂຫຼດ `.dtmodel` ຈາກສ່ວນ "
"releases ໃນ GitHub ຂອງຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າມັນຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"delete selected\n"
": Remove the models whose _select_ checkbox is ticked from disk. Models that were bundled with darktable cannot be deleted.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລຶບອັນທີ່ເລືອກ\n"
": ລຶບໂມເດວທີ່ຖືກໝາຍໃນກ່ອງໝາຍ _select_ ອອກຈາກດິສກ໌. ໂມເດວທີ່ແຖມມານຳ darktable ບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບອອກໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/ai.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Downloads run in the background with a progress dialog and can be cancelled. Failed downloads are reported and the affected models remain in their previous state.\n"
msgstr "ການດາວໂຫຼດຈະເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງພ້ອມກັບໜ້າຕ່າງສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ ແລະ ສາມາດຍົກເລີກໄດ້. ການດາວໂຫຼດທີ່ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຈະຖືກລາຍງານ ແລະ ໂມເດວທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະເດີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable comes with a number of user-configurable preferences. These can be adjusted in the preferences dialog, which can be reached by clicking the gear icon on the right of the [top panel](../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md). Preferences are separated into tabs, each of which is described in more detail in the following sections.\n"
msgstr "darktable ມາພ້ອມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມມັກທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຄວາມມັກ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໄອຄອນເຟືອງຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງ [ແຖບດ້ານເທິງ](../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md). ຄວາມມັກຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນແຖບຕ່າງໆ, ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະແຖບມີລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When opened from within the lighttable or darkroom views, the appropriate tab will be loaded by default to allow you to modify that view's settings.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດຈາກພາຍໃນມຸມມອງ lighttable ຫຼື darkroom, ແຖບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຂຶ້ນໂດຍມາດຕະຖານເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງມຸມມອງນັ້ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Any altered settings (i.e. those that differ from their default state) are highlighted with a bullet beside them. If you change a setting that needs a restart to take effect, a message will appear as a reminder after you exit the preferences dialog.\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດໆທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ (ຄືອັນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ຈະຖືກເນັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດຢູ່ທາງຂ້າງ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ຈຶ່ງຈະມີຜົນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກເຈົ້າອອກຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງຄວາມມັກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Double click on a setting's label to reset to its default value.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກສອງຄັ້ງທີ່ປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The preferences dialog can be closed by clicking on the close button in your window manager or pressing the Escape key.\n"
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງຄວາມມັກສາມາດປິດໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມປິດໃນຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງເຈົ້າ ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມ Escape.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/preferences-settings/config-directory.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "configuration directory"
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/preferences-settings/config-directory.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable stores its settings, presets, styles, library database, etc. in a default directory. This directory's location depends on your operating system and installation method. It can be changed by using the `--config-dir` option (see [darktable invocation](../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md)).\n"
msgstr "darktable ເກັບຮັກສາການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ, ສະໄຕລ໌, ຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄລບຣາຣີ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ໄວ້ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີມາດຕະຖານ. ສະຖານທີ່ຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງເຈົ້າ. ມັນສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `--config-dir` (ເບິ່ງ [ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ darktable](../special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md)).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/preferences-settings/config-directory.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Linux \n"
msgstr "Linux \n"

#. type: Bullet: '    + '
#: content/preferences-settings/config-directory.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installed via package manager or AppImage: `$HOME/.config/darktable`\n"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກດ ຫຼື AppImage: `$HOME/.config/darktable`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    + '
#: content/preferences-settings/config-directory.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flatpak: `$HOME/.var/app/org.darktable.Darktable/config/darktable`\n"
msgstr "Flatpak: `$HOME/.var/app/org.darktable.Darktable/config/darktable`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    + '
#: content/preferences-settings/config-directory.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "snap: `$HOME/snap/darktable/current/`\n"
msgstr "snap: `$HOME/snap/darktable/current/`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
