#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/a-simple-example.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "a simple lua example"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ lua ແບບງ່າຍໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/a-simple-example.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's start with a simple example that will print some code on the console. Create a file called `luarc` in darktable's [configuration directory](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md) and add the following line to it:\n"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວຢ່າງງ່າຍໆ ທີ່ຈະພິມລະຫັດບາງຢ່າງລົງໃນຄອນໂຊນ. ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ `luarc` ໃນ [ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md) ຂອງ darktable ແລະ ເພີ່ມແຖວຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃສ່:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/a-simple-example.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "print(\"Hello World !\")\n"
msgstr "print(\"ສະບາຍດີຊາວໂລກ !\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/a-simple-example.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start darktable from the console and you will see the sentence \"`Hello World !`\" printed on the console. Nothing fancy but it's a start. \n"
msgstr "ເປີດ darktable ຈາກຄອນໂຊນ ແລ້ວທ່ານຈະເຫັນປະໂຫຍກ \"`Hello World !`\" ພິມອອກມາ. ມັນອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືບໍ່ມີຫຍັງພິເສດ ແຕ່ມັນຄືການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/a-simple-example.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At this point, there is nothing darktable-specific in the script. We simply use Lua's standard print function to print a string. That's nice and all, but we can do better than that. To access the darktable API you first need to `require` it and save the returned object in a variable. Once this is done you can access the darktable API as subfields of the returned object. All of this is documented in darktable's [Lua API](./api.md) reference manual.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ຍັງບໍ່ມີຫຍັງທີ່ເປັນສະເພາະຂອງ darktable ໃນສະຄຣິບ. ພວກເຮົາພຽງແຕ່ໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ print ມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Lua ເພື່ອພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ນັ້ນກໍດີຢູ່, ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດີກວ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ API ຂອງ darktable, ທຳອິດທ່ານຕ້ອງ `require` ມັນ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາໄວ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ. ເມື່ອເຮັດແລ້ວ ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ API ຂອງ darktable ຜ່ານຟີວຍ່ອຍຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນນັ້ນ. ທັງໝົດນີ້ມີລາຍລະອຽດຢູ່ໃນຄູ່ມືອ້າງອີງ [Lua API](./api.md) ຂອງ darktable.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/a-simple-example.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"local darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"darktable.print_error(\"Hello World !\")\n"
msgstr ""
"local darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"darktable.print_error(\"ສະບາຍດີຊາວໂລກ !\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/a-simple-example.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the script and ... nothing happens. The function `darktable.print_error` is just like `print` but will only print the message if you have enabled lua traces by running darktable with \"`darktable -d lua`\" on the command line. This is the recommended way to do traces in a darktable lua script.\n"
msgstr "ລອງໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບແລ້ວ... ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຟັງຊັນ `darktable.print_error` ກໍຄືກັບ `print` ແຕ່ຈະພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ lua traces ໂດຍການສັ່ງ darktable ດ້ວຍ \"`darktable -d lua`\" ໃນຄຳສັ່ງຄອນໂຊນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການເຮັດ traces ໃນສະຄຣິບ lua ຂອງ darktable.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "lua API"
msgstr "lua API"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/api.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable's Lua API is documented in its own manual with a detailed description of all data structures and functions. You can download the API manual from [here](https://www.darktable.org/resources/).\n"
msgstr "Lua API ຂອງ darktable ແມ່ນມີການບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນຄູ່ມືສະເພາະຂອງມັນເອງ ເຊິ່ງມີລາຍລະອຽດຂອງໂຄງສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຟັງຊັນທັງໝົດ. ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດຄູ່ມື API ໄດ້ຈາກ [ທີ່ນີ້](https://www.darktable.org/resources/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lua scripts can be used to define actions for darktable to perform when an event is triggered. One example might be calling an external application during file export in order to apply additional processing steps outside of darktable.\n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ Lua ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດການກະທຳໃຫ້ darktable ດຳເນີນການເມື່ອມີເຫດການໃດໜຶ່ງເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງໜຶ່ງອາດຈະແມ່ນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນພາຍນອກໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນເພີ່ມເຕີມພາຍນອກ darktable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Lua](http://www.lua.org/) is an independent project founded in 1993, providing a powerful, fast, lightweight, embeddable scripting language. Lua is widely used by many open source applications, in commercial programs, and for games programming. darktable uses Lua version 5.4. Describing the principles and syntax of Lua is beyond the scope of this manual. For a detailed introduction see the [Lua reference manual](http://www.lua.org/manual/5.4/manual.html).\n"
msgstr "[Lua](http://www.lua.org/) ແມ່ນໂຄງການອິດສະຫຼະທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນປີ 1993, ໃຫ້ບໍລິການພາສາສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ໄວ, ເບົາບາງ ແລະ ສາມາດຝັງເຂົ້າໃນໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນໄດ້. Lua ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງກວ້າງຂວາງໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໂອເພນຊອດຫຼາຍອັນ, ໃນໂປຣແກຣມທາງການຄ້າ ແລະ ສຳລັບການຂຽນເກມ. darktable ໃຊ້ Lua ເວີຊັນ 5.4. ການອະທິບາຍຫຼັກການ ແລະ ໄວຍາກອນຂອງ Lua ແມ່ນຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດຂອງຄູ່ມືນີ້. ສຳລັບການແນະນຳຢ່າງລະອຽດ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ [ຄູ່ມືອ້າງອີງ Lua](http://www.lua.org/manual/5.4/manual.html).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable comes with a number of [scripts included](darktables-scripts.md). The central orchestrator for scripts is the script manager (see [basic principles](basic-principles.md)).\n"
msgstr "darktable ມາພ້ອມກັບ [ສະຄຣິບຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ](darktables-scripts.md). ຕົວຈັດການຫຼັກສຳລັບສະຄຣິບແມ່ນຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບ (ເບິ່ງ [ຫຼັກການພື້ນຖານ](basic-principles.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following sections will provide you with a brief introduction to how Lua scripts can be used within darktable. The comprehensive documentation on Lua Scripting in darktable can be found in the [darktable lua documentation](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/).\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ການແນະນຳສັ້ນໆກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ Lua ພາຍໃນ darktable. ເອກະສານປະກອບທີ່ສົມບູນກ່ຽວກັບການຂຽນສະຄຣິບ Lua ໃນ darktable ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ [darktable lua documentation](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "printing labeled images"
msgstr "ການພິມລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທີ່ມີປ້າຍສີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first example showed us the very basics of lua and allowed us to check that everything was working properly. Now let's do something a little bit more complex. Let's try to print a list of images that have a \"red\" label attached to them. But first of all, what is an image?\n"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງທຳອິດໄດ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນພື້ນຖານຂອງ lua ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາກວດສອບວ່າທຸກຢ່າງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີ. ບາດນີ້ມາລອງເຮັດສິ່ງທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່ານັ້ນໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ. ມາລອງພິມລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທີ່ມີປ້າຍສີ \"ແດງ\" ຕິດຢູ່. ແຕ່ກ່ອນອື່ນໝົດ, ຮູບພາບແມ່ນຫຍັງ?\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"local darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"local debug = require \"darktable.debug\"\n"
"print(darktable.debug.dump(darktable.database[1]))\n"
msgstr ""
"local darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"local debug = require \"darktable.debug\"\n"
"print(darktable.debug.dump(darktable.database[1]))\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Running the code above will produce a lot of output. We will look at it in a moment, but first let's look at the code itself.\n"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ລະຫັດຂ້າງເທິງຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັດອອກມາຫຼາຍຫຼາຍ. ພວກເຮົາຈະມາເບິ່ງມັນໃນອີກຈັກໜ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ກ່ອນອື່ນມາເບິ່ງທີ່ຕົວລະຫັດກ່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "We know about `require darktable`. Here, we need to separately `require darktable.debug` which is an optional section of the API that provides helper functions to help debug lua scripts.\n"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາຮູ້ຈັກ `require darktable` ແລ້ວ. ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງ `require darktable.debug` ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ເຊິ່ງເປັນສ່ວນເສີມຂອງ API ທີ່ໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໃນການແກ້ໄຂຈຸດບົກພ່ອງ (debug) ຂອງສະຄຣິບ lua.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable.database` is a table provided by the API that contains all images in the library database. Each entry in the database is an image object. Image objects are complex objects that allow you to manipulate your image in various ways (all documented in the `types_dt_lua_image_t` section of the API manual). To display our images, we use `darktable.debug.dump` which is a function that will take anything as its parameter and recursively dump its content. Since images are complex objects that indirectly reference other complex objects, the resulting output is huge. Below is a cut down example of the output.\n"
msgstr "`darktable.database` ແມ່ນຕາຕະລາງທີ່ API ຈັດຫາໃຫ້ ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຮູບພາບທັງໝົດໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ library. ແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນແມ່ນວັດຖຸຮູບພາບ (image object). ວັດຖຸຮູບພາບແມ່ນວັດຖຸທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ໃນຫຼາຍວິທີ (ທັງໝົດມີລາຍລະອຽດໃນສ່ວນ `types_dt_lua_image_t` ຂອງຄູ່ມື API). ເພື່ອສະແດງຮູບພາບຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ `darktable.debug.dump` ເຊິ່ງເປັນຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະຮັບຄ່າໃດກໍໄດ້ເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີ ແລະ ສະແດງເນື້ອໃນຂອງມັນອອກມາທັງໝົດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກຮູບພາບເປັນວັດຖຸທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ ແລະ ອ້າງອີງເຖິງວັດຖຸອື່ນໆ, ຜົນລັດທີ່ໄດ້ຈຶ່ງມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ. ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຜົນລັດທີ່ຖືກຕັດໃຫ້ສັ້ນລົງ.\n"

