#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As we can see, an image has a large number of fields that provide all sort of information about it. Here, we are interested in the \"red\" label. This field is a boolean, and the documentation tells us that it can be written. We now just need to find all images with that field and print them out:\n"
msgstr "ຢ່າງທີ່ພວກເຮົາເຫັນ, ຮູບພາບໜຶ່ງມີຟີວຈຳນວນຫຼາຍທີ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນທຸກປະເພດກ່ຽວກັບມັນ. ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ພວກເຮົາສົນໃຈປ້າຍສີ \"ແດງ\". ຟີວນີ້ເປັນຄ່າ boolean (ຈິງ/ບໍ່ຈິງ), ແລະ ເອກະສານບອກວ່າພວກເຮົາສາມາດຂຽນຄ່າລົງໄປໄດ້. ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງຊອກຫາຮູບທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຟີວນີ້ ແລະ ພິມພວກມັນອອກມາ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"for _,v in ipairs(darktable.database) do\n"
"  if v.red then\n"
"    print(tostring(v))\n"
"  end\n"
"end\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"for _,v in ipairs(darktable.database) do\n"
"  if v.red then\n"
"    print(tostring(v))\n"
"  end\n"
"end\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This code should be quite simple to understand at this point, but it contains a few interesting aspects of lua that are worth highlighting:\n"
msgstr "ລະຫັດນີ້ຄວນຈະເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ງ່າຍໃນຕອນນີ້, ແຕ່ມັນກໍມີບາງແງ່ມຸມທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈຂອງ lua ທີ່ຄວນເນັ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`ipairs` is a standard lua function that will iterate through all numeric indices of a table. We use it here because darktable's database has non-numeric indices which are functions to manipulate the database itself (adding or deleting images, for example).\n"
msgstr "`ipairs` ແມ່ນຟັງຊັນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ lua ທີ່ຈະວົນຊ້ຳ (iterate) ຜ່ານດັດຊະນີຕົວເລກທັງໝົດຂອງຕາຕະລາງ. ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ໃນທີ່ນີ້ເພາະຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ darktable ມີດັດຊະນີທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕົວເລກ ເຊິ່ງເປັນຟັງຊັນສຳລັບຈັດການຖານຂໍ້ມູນເອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບຮູບພາບ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Iterating through a table will return both the key and the value used. It is conventional in lua to use a variable named “`_`” to store values that we don't care about.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການວົນລູບ (iterating) ຜ່ານຕາຕະລາງຈະສົ່ງຄືນທັງຄີ (key) ແລະ ຄ່າ (value) ທີ່ໃຊ້. ຕາມທຳນຽມໃນພ"
"າສາ lua ແມ່ນຈະໃຊ້ຕົວແປທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ “`_`” ເພື່ອເກັບຄ່າທີ່ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ສົນໃຈ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/printing-labeled-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that we use the standard lua function `tostring` here and not the darktable-specific `darktable.debug.dump`. The standard function will return a name for the object whereas the debug function will print the content. The debug function would be too verbose here. Once again, it is a great debug tool but it should not be used for anything else.\n"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດວ່າພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ lua ມາດຕະຖານ `tostring` ໃນທີ່ນີ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນ `darktable.debug.dump`. ຟັງຊັນມາດຕະຖານຈະສົ່ງຄືນຊື່ຂອງວັດຖຸ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຟັງຊັນ debug ຈະພິມເນື້ອໃນອອກມາ. ຟັງຊັນ debug ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປໃນກໍລະນີນີ້. ຢ້ຳອີກຄັ້ງ, ມັນເປັນເຄື່ອງມື debug ທີ່ດີ ແຕ່ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sharing scripts"
msgstr "ການແບ່ງປັນສະຄຣິບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "So far, all of our lua code has been in _luarc_. That's a good way to develop your script but not very practical for distribution. We need to make this into a proper lua module. To do that, we save the code in a separate file (`scp-storage.lua` in this case):\n"
msgstr "ຜ່ານມາ, ລະຫັດ lua ທັງໝົດຂອງພວກເຮົາແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນ _luarc_. ນັ້ນແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ດີໃນການພັດທະນາສະຄຣິບ ແຕ່ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍສະດວກໃນການແຈກຢາຍ. ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນໂມດູນ lua ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ, ພວກເຮົາຈະບັນທຶກລະຫັດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ (ໃນທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນ `scp-storage.lua`):\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"--[[\n"
"SCP STORAGE\n"
"a simple storage to export images via scp\n"
"\n"
"AUTHOR\n"
"Jérémy Rosen (jeremy.rosen@enst-bretagne.fr)\n"
"\n"
"INSTALLATION\n"
"* copy this file in $CONFIGDIR/lua/\n"
"* add the following line in the file $CONFIGDIR/luarc\n"
"  require \"scp-storage\"\n"
"\n"
"USAGE\n"
"* select \"Export via SCP\" in the storage selection menu\n"
"* set the target directory \n"
"* export your images\n"
"\n"
"LICENSE\n"
"GPLv2\n"
"\n"
"]]\n"
"\n"
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"dtutils = require \"lib/dtutils\"\n"
"\n"
"dtutils.check_min_api_version(\"7.0.0\", ...)\n"
"\n"
"local scp_path = darktable.new_widget(\"entry\"){\n"
"  tooltip = \"Complete path to copy to. Can include user and hostname\",\n"
"  text = \"\",\n"
"  reset_callback = function(self) self.text = \"\" end\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_storage(\"scp_export\",\"Export via scp\",\n"
"  function( storage, image, format, filename,\n"
"     number, total, high_quality, extra_data)\n"
"    if not darktable.control.execute(\"scp \"..filename..\" \"..\n"
"      scp_path.text\n"
"    ) then\n"
"      darktable.print_error(\"scp failed for \"..tostring(image))\n"
"    end\n"
"  end,\n"
"  nil, --finalize\n"
"  nil, --supported\n"
"  nil, --initialize\n"
"  darktable.new_widget(\"box\") {\n"
"    orientation = \"horizontal\",\n"
"    darktable.new_widget(\"label\"){ label = \"target SCP PATH \" },\n"
"    scp_path,\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"--[[\n"
"SCP STORAGE\n"
"ບ່ອນເກັບມ້ຽນແບບງ່າຍດາຍເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບຜ່ານ scp\n"
"\n"
"ຜູ້ຂຽນ\n"
"Jérémy Rosen (jeremy.rosen@enst-bretagne.fr)\n"
"\n"
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງ\n"
"* ກັອບປີ້ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ໄປໄວ້ໃນ $CONFIGDIR/lua/\n"
"* ເພີ່ມແຖວລຸ່ມນີ້ໃສ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ $CONFIGDIR/luarc\n"
"  require \"scp-storage\"\n"
"\n"
"ການນຳໃຊ້\n"
"* ເລືອກ \"ສົ່ງອອກຜ່ານ SCP\" ໃນເມນູເລືອກບ່ອນເກັບມ້ຽນ\n"
"* ກໍານົດໂຟນເດີເປົ້າໝາຍ \n"
"* ສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ\n"
"\n"
"ໃບອະນຸຍາດ\n"
"GPLv2\n"
"\n"
"]]\n"
"\n"
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"dtutils = require \"lib/dtutils\"\n"
"\n"
"dtutils.check_min_api_version(\"7.0.0\", ...)\n"
"\n"
"local scp_path = darktable.new_widget(\"entry\"){\n"
"  tooltip = \"ເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມທີ່ຈະກັອບປີ້ໄປ. ສາມາດລວມເອົາຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname)\",\n"
"  text = \"\",\n"
"  reset_callback = function(self) self.text = \"\" end\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_storage(\"scp_export\",\"ສົ່ງອອກຜ່ານ scp\",\n"
"  function( storage, image, format, filename,\n"
"     number, total, high_quality, extra_data)\n"
"    if not darktable.control.execute(\"scp \"..filename..\" \"..\n"
"      scp_path.text\n"
"    ) then\n"
"      darktable.print_error(\"scp ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວສໍາລັບ \"..tostring(image))\n"
"    end\n"
"  end,\n"
"  nil, --finalize\n"
"  nil, --supported\n"
"  nil, --initialize\n"
"  darktable.new_widget(\"box\") {\n"
"    orientation = \"horizontal\",\n"
"    darktable.new_widget(\"label\"){ label = \"ເສັ້ນທາງ SCP ເປົ້າໝາຍ \" },\n"
"    scp_path,\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable will look for scripts (following the normal lua rules) in the standard directories plus `$CONFIGDIR/lua/*.lua`. So our script can be called by simply adding `require \"scp-storage\"` in the _luarc_ file. A couple of extra notes...\n"
msgstr "darktable ຈະຊອກຫາສະຄຣິບ (ຕາມກົດເກົານປົກກະຕິຂອງ lua) ໃນໂຟນເດີມາດຕະຖານ ບວກກັບ `$CONFIGDIR/lua/*.lua`. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ສະຄຣິບຂອງພວກເຮົາສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ງ່າຍໆໂດຍການເພີ່ມ `require \"scp-storage\"` ໃນໄຟລ໌ _luarc_. ໝາຍເຫດເພີ່ມເຕີມບາງຢ່າງ...\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`$CONFIGDIR` represents the darktable [configuration directory](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md).\n"
msgstr "`$CONFIGDIR` ແທນ [ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md) ຂອງ darktable.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The function `dtutils.check_min_api_version` will check compatibility for you. `\"7.0.0\"` is the API version you have tested your script with and the \"`...`\" will turn into your script's name.\n"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ `dtutils.check_min_api_version` ຈະກວດສອບຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ໃຫ້ທ່ານ. `\"7.0.0\"` ແມ່ນເວີຊັນ API ທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ທົດສອບສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ \"`...`\" ຈະກາຍເປັນຊື່ສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure to declare all your functions as `local` so as not to pollute the general namespace.\n"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ປະກາດຟັງຊັນທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານເປັນ `local` ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ໄປລົບກວນ namespace ທົ່ວໄປ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you do not leave debug prints in your code -- `darktable.print_error` in particular allows you to leave debug prints in your final code without disturbing the console.\n"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ປະ debug prints ໄວ້ໃນລະຫັດຂອງທ່ານ -- ໂດຍສະເພາະ `darktable.print_error` ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປະ debug prints ໄວ້ໃນລະຫັດສຸດທ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ໄປລົບກວນຄອນໂຊນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You are free to choose any license for your script but scripts that are uploaded on darktable's website need to be GPLv2.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໃບອະນຸຍາດ (license) ໃດກໍໄດ້ສຳລັບສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານ ແຕ່ສະຄຣິບທີ່ອັບໂຫຼດຂຶ້ນເວັບໄຊທ໌ຂອງ darktable ຕ້ອງເປັນ GPLv2.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/sharing-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have filled all the fields, checked your code, you can upload it to our script page [here](https://github.com/darktable-org/lua-scripts).\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນຄົບທຸກຟີວ ແລະ ກວດສອບລະຫັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດອັບໂຫຼດມັນໄປທີ່ໜ້າສະຄຣິບຂອງພວກເຮົາໄດ້ [ທີ່ນີ້](https://github.com/darktable-org/lua-scripts).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "basic principles"
msgstr "ຫຼັກການພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scripts can register callbacks to perform actions on various darktable events. This callback mechanism is the primary method of triggering lua actions. \n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ callbacks ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການເມື່ອມີເຫດການຕ່າງໆຂອງ darktable ເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ກົນໄກ callback ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີຫຼັກໃນການກະຕຸ້ນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ lua. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The central orchestrator for lua scripts is the _script manager_, which spawns the utility module __scripts__ in the lighttable and loads darktable's bundled scripts. \n"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການຫຼັກສຳລັບສະຄຣິບ lua ແມ່ນ _ຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບ (script manager)_, ເຊິ່ງຈະສ້າງໂມດູນອັດຖະປະໂຫຍດ __scripts__ ໃນແຜງແສງ ແລະ ໂຫຼດສະຄຣິບທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ darktable. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lua scripts can be disabled in [preferences/lua options](../preferences-settings/lua-options.md).\n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ Lua ສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ຕົວເລືອກ lua](../preferences-settings/lua-options.md).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "how darktable loads scripts (and the script manager)"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ darktable ໂຫຼດສະຄຣິບ (ແລະ ຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable treats two kinds of location differently: Files that are _executed_ as Lua code, and directories that are _scanned_ for scripts:\n"
msgstr "darktable ຈັດການສອງສະຖານທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ: ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກ _ປະມວນຜົນ_ ເປັນລະຫັດ Lua, ແລະ ໂຟນເດີທີ່ຖືກ _ສະແກນ_ ເພື່ອຫາສະຄຣິບ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Executed at startup:\n"
msgstr "ປະມວນຜົນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`$DARKTABLE/share/darktable/luarc`: run by darktable itself. This is the entry point that launches the script manager. It serves internal purposes only and should not be edited. $DARKTABLE is the program's installation directory.\n"
msgstr "`$DARKTABLE/share/darktable/luarc`: ຖືກປະມວນຜົນໂດຍ darktable ເອງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເປີດຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບ. ມັນໃຊ້ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງພາຍໃນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນແກ້ໄຂ. $DARKTABLE ແມ່ນໂຟນເດີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໂປຣແກຣມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`[configuration-directory]/luarc`: run by the script manager, if present. This is one way of running your own scripts (see below).\n"
msgstr "`[ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ]/luarc`: ຖືກປະມວນຜົນໂດຍຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບ, ຖ້າມີ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີໜຶ່ງໃນການໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານເອງ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scanned for `.lua` scripts (which then appear in the scripts-module):\n"
msgstr "ສະແກນຫາສະຄຣິບ `.lua` (ເຊິ່ງຈະປາກົດໃນໂມດູນສະຄຣິບ):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`$DARKTABLE/share/darktable/lua-scripts/`: darktable's bundled scripts.\n"
msgstr "`$DARKTABLE/share/darktable/lua-scripts/`: ສະຄຣິບທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ darktable.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`[configuration-directory]/lua/[folder]`: your own scripts (see below).\n"
msgstr "`[ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ]/lua/[folder]`: ສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານເອງ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [configuration directory](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md) is specific to your OS. \n"
msgstr "[ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md) ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງທ່ານ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thus you can __add your own scripts__ as follows:\n"
"* Have the scripts-module pick them up: (recommended)\n"
"    * Place your script e.g. in `[configuration-directory]/lua/user/myscript.lua`\n"
"    * Activate it in the scripts-module by selecting the appropriate folder (in this example \"user\") and clicking the on/off button next to the corresponding script. \n"
"    * Note: For the scripts-module to pick up scripts they will need to be in a _subfolder_ of `configuration-directory/lua`.\n"
"* Use `luarc` (runs at startup automatically)\n"
"    * Either write the code directly into `[configuration-directory]/luarc`. This works, but is not practical for anything beyond a few lines. \n"
"    * Or keep the code in its own file and `require` through `luarc`: E.g. a script present in `[configuration-directory]/lua/userscript.lua` could be loaded by adding `require \"userscript\"` (note that .lua is omitted here).\n"
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ທ່ານສາມາດ __ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານເອງ__ ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"* ໃຫ້ໂມດູນສະຄຣິບກວດພົບພວກມັນ: (ແນະນຳ)\n"
"    * ວາງສະຄຣິບຂອງທ່ານ ຕົວຢ່າງໃນ `[ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ]/lua/user/myscript.lua`\n"
"    * ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນໂມດູນສະຄຣິບ ໂດຍເລືອກໂຟນເດີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນ \"user\") ແລະ ຄລິກປຸ່ມ ເປີດ/ປິດ ຖັດຈາກສະຄຣິບນັ້ນ. \n"
"    * ໝາຍເຫດ: ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂມດູນສະຄຣິບກວດພົບສະຄຣິບ, ພວກມັນຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນ _ໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ_ ຂອງ `configuration-directory/lua`.\n"
"* ໃຊ້ `luarc` (ເຮັດວຽກຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ)\n"
"    * ຂຽນລະຫັດລົງໃນ `[ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ]/luarc` ໂດຍກົງ. ວິທີນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບລະຫັດທີ່ຍາວຫຼາຍ. \n"
"    * ຫຼື ເກັບລະຫັດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຂອງມັນເອງ ແລະ ໃຊ້ `require` ຜ່ານ `luarc`: ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສະຄຣິບໃນ `[ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ]/lua/userscript.lua` ສາມາດໂຫຼດໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ `require \"userscript\"` (ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ .lua ຖືກຕັດອອກ).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "a note on lua-scripts installations from previous darktable versions"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ lua-scripts ຈາກ darktable ເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before version 5.6 darktable's scripts had to be installed manually (see [darktable's scripts](darktables-scripts.md)). \n"
msgstr "ກ່ອນເວີຊັນ 5.6, ສະຄຣິບຂອງ darktable ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (ເບິ່ງ [ສະຄຣິບຂອງ darktable](darktables-scripts.md)). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/basic-principles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remain compatible with such an installation, `require` looks for a script manager in your configuration directory before loading the bundled one: if `[configuration-directory]/lua/tools/script_manager.lua` is present (for example from a manual pre-5.6 installation), _that_ script manager is run instead of the bundled one. In this case the luarc file in the configuration directory is not loaded. \n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ງານຮ່ວມກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບນັ້ນໄດ້, `require` ຈະຊອກຫາຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບໃນໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງທ່ານກ່ອນຈະໂຫຼດອັນທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບໂປຣແກຣມ: ຖ້າມີ `[ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ]/lua/tools/script_manager.lua` (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງກ່ອນເວີຊັນ 5.6), ຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບ _ອັນນັ້ນ_ ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນແທນອັນທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບໂປຣແກຣມ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ໄຟລ໌ luarc ໃນໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າຈະບໍ່ຖືກໂຫຼດ. \n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/building-ui-elements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "building user interface elements"
msgstr "ການສ້າງອົງປະກອບອິນເຕີເຟດຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/building-ui-elements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Our previous example was a bit limited. In particular the use of a preference for the export path wasn't very nice. We can do better than that by adding elements to the user interface in the export dialog.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຂອງພວກເຮົາຍັງມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ. ໂດຍສະເພາະການໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບເສັ້ນທາງການສົ່ງອອກນັ້ນບໍ່ສະດວກປານໃດ. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ດີກວ່ານັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມອົງປະກອບເຂົ້າໃນອິນເຕີເຟດຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/building-ui-elements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "UI elements are created via the `darktable.new_widget` function. This function takes a type of widget as a parameter and returns a new object corresponding to that widget. You can then set various fields in that widget to set its parameters. You will then use that object as a parameter to various functions that will add it to the darktable UI. The following simple example adds a lib in the lighttable view with a simple label:\n"
msgstr "ອົງປະກອບ UI ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຜ່ານຟັງຊັນ `darktable.new_widget`. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຮັບຄ່າປະເພດຂອງ widget ເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນວັດຖຸໃໝ່ທີ່ກົງກັບ widget ນັ້ນ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຟີວຕ່າງໆໃນ widget ນັ້ນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງມັນ. ທ່ານຈະໃຊ້ວັດຖຸນັ້ນເປັນພາຣາມິເຕີໃຫ້ກັບຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນ UI ຂອງ darktable. ຕົວຢ່າງງ່າຍໆຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມ lib ໃນມຸມມອງແຜງແສງພ້ອມກັບປ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມງ່າຍໆ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/building-ui-elements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"local my_label = darktable.new_widget(\"label\")\n"
"my_label.label = \"Hello, world !\"\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_lib(\"test\",\"test\",false,false,{\n"
"    [darktable.gui.views.lighttable] = {\"DT_UI_CONTAINER_PANEL_LEFT_CENTER\",20},\n"
"  },my_label)\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"local my_label = darktable.new_widget(\"label\")\n"
"my_label.label = \"Hello, world !\"\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_lib(\"test\",\"test\",false,false,{\n"
"    [darktable.gui.views.lighttable] = {\"DT_UI_CONTAINER_PANEL_LEFT_CENTER\",20},\n"
"  },my_label)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/building-ui-elements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is a nice syntactic trick to make UI elements code easier to read and write. You can call these objects as functions with a table of key values as an argument. This allows the following example to work. It creates a container widget with two sub-widgets: a label and a text entry field.\n"
msgstr "ມີເຕັກນິກທາງໄວຍາກອນທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລະຫັດອົງປະກອບ UI ອ່ານ ແລະ ຂຽນໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດເອີ້ນວັດຖຸເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນຟັງຊັນໂດຍໃຊ້ຕາຕະລາງຂອງຄ່າ key ເປັນອາກິວເມນ. ອັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ມັນສ້າງ widget ທີ່ເປັນຕົວບັນຈຸ (container) ພ້ອມກັບ widget ຍ່ອຍສອງອັນ: ປ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/building-ui-elements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"local my_widget = darktable.new_widget(\"box\"){\n"
"  orientation = \"horizontal\",\n"
"  darktable.new_widget(\"label\"){ label = \"here => \" },\n"
"  darktable.new_widget(\"entry\"){ tooltip = \"please enter text here\" }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"local my_widget = darktable.new_widget(\"box\"){\n"
"  orientation = \"horizontal\",\n"
"  darktable.new_widget(\"label\"){ label = \"ທີ່ນີ້ => \" },\n"
"  darktable.new_widget(\"entry\"){ tooltip = \"ກະລຸນາປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມໃສ່ບ່ອນນີ້\" }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/building-ui-elements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now that we know that, let's improve our script a bit.\n"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ພວກເຮົາຮູ້ແລ້ວ, ມາປັບປຸງສະຄຣິບຂອງພວກເຮົາອີກໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/building-ui-elements.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"local scp_path = darktable.new_widget(\"entry\"){\n"
"  tooltip = \"Complete path to copy to. Can include user and hostname\",\n"
"  text = \"\",\n"
"  reset_callback = function(self) self.text = \"\" end\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_storage(\"scp_export\",\"Export via scp\",\n"
"  function( storage, image, format, filename,\n"
"     number, total, high_quality, extra_data)\n"
"    if not darktable.control.execute(\"scp \"..filename..\" \"..\n"
"      scp_path.text\n"
"    ) then\n"
"      darktable.print_error(\"scp failed for \"..tostring(image))\n"
"    end\n"
"  end,\n"
"  nil, --finalize\n"
"  nil, --supported\n"
"  nil, --initialize\n"
"  darktable.new_widget(\"box\") {\n"
"    orientation = \"horizontal\",\n"
"    darktable.new_widget(\"label\"){ label = \"target SCP PATH \" },\n"
"    scp_path,\n"
"})\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"local scp_path = darktable.new_widget(\"entry\"){\n"
"  tooltip = \"ເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມທີ່ຈະສຳເນົາໄປຫາ. ສາມາດລວມເອົາຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname)\",\n"
"  text = \"\",\n"
"  reset_callback = function(self) self.text = \"\" end\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_storage(\"scp_export\",\"ສົ່ງອອກຜ່ານ scp\",\n"
"  function( storage, image, format, filename,\n"
"     number, total, high_quality, extra_data)\n"
"    if not darktable.control.execute(\"scp \"..filename..\" \"..\n"
"      scp_path.text\n"
"    ) then\n"
"      darktable.print_error(\"scp ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວສຳລັບ \"..tostring(image))\n"
"    end\n"
"  end,\n"
"  nil, --finalize\n"
"  nil, --supported\n"
"  nil, --initialize\n"
"  darktable.new_widget(\"box\") {\n"
"    orientation = \"horizontal\",\n"
"    darktable.new_widget(\"label\"){ label = \"ເສັ້ນທາງ SCP ປາຍທາງ \" },\n"
"    scp_path,\n"
"})\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable's scripts"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບຂອງ darktable"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "from 5.6 onward"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເວີຊັນ 5.6 ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A collection of scripts is included with darktable. They can be disabled in [preferences > lua](../preferences-settings/lua-options.md). \n"
msgstr "ຊຸດສະຄຣິບຕ່າງໆແມ່ນລວມມາພ້ອມກັບ darktable ແລ້ວ. ພວກມັນສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > lua](../preferences-settings/lua-options.md). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting with darktable 5.6, the lua-scripts are included with the release, so they no longer have to installed separately. \n"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 5.6, lua-scripts ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນເວີຊັນທີ່ປ່ອຍອອກມາ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See [basic principles](basic-principles.md) for an explanation of how darktable loads Lua scripts. \n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ [ຫຼັກການພື້ນຖານ](basic-principles.md) ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບວິທີທີ່ darktable ໂຫຼດສະຄຣິບ Lua. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Documentation for darktable's scripts is available in the [lua docs](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/).\n"
msgstr "ເອກະສານປະກອບສຳລັບສະຄຣິບຂອງ darktable ມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໃນ [lua docs](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "pre 5.6"
msgstr "ກ່ອນເວີຊັນ 5.6"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pre 5.6 the scripts were not bundled and had to be installed using the following instructions. \n"
msgstr "ກ່ອນເວີຊັນ 5.6, ສະຄຣິບບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລວມມານຳ ແລະ ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳແນະນຳຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. \n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Download and Install"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A collection of scripts is available in the [lua-scripts repository](https://github.com/darktable-org/lua-scripts). This also includes the script manager, which makes it easier to enable or disable individual scripts from the GUI. Documentation for these lua scripts is included in the [lua docs](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/).\n"
msgstr "ຊຸດສະຄຣິບຕ່າງໆມີໃຫ້ໃນ [lua-scripts repository](https://github.com/darktable-org/lua-scripts). ອັນນີ້ຍັງລວມເຖິງຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດສະຄຣິບແຕ່ລະອັນຜ່ານ GUI ເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ເອກະສານປະກອບສຳລັບສະຄຣິບ lua ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນລວມຢູ່ໃນ [lua docs](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use these existing scripts in versions before 5.6, they must be installed in darktable. This can in most cases be done within darktable's GUI, but depends on your OS and chosen method of installation. \n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີຢູ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນເວີຊັນກ່ອນ 5.6, ພວກມັນຕ້ອງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໃນ darktable. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຜ່ານ GUI ຂອງ darktable, ແຕ່ກໍຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ ແລະ ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In any case, darktable should be started at least once to set up its directories. The config directories for most installation types are listed on the [configuration directory](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md) page.\n"
msgstr "ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນກໍລະນີໃດ, ຄວນເປີດ darktable ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງເພື່ອສ້າງໂຟນເດີຕ່າງໆຂອງມັນ. ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນໜ້າ [ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__Linux Package, AppImage and Flatpak__\n"
msgstr "__Linux Package, AppImage ແລະ Flatpak__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Lua scripts can be installed using darktable's GUI. Ensure git is installed on your system. If it isn't, use the package manager to install it. In the lighttable view, expand the lua scripts installer module in the lower-left corner. Ensure that select action: install scripts is selected, then click execute. Restart darktable once for the scripts module to appear in the lower-left corner. \n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ Lua ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ GUI ຂອງ darktable. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ git ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ. ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ. ໃນມຸມມອງແຜງແສງ, ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍໂມດູນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບ lua ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເລືອກ action: install scripts, ແລ້ວຄລິກ execute. ເລີ່ມ darktable ໃໝ່ໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂມດູນສະຄຣິບປາກົດຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__Linux Snap Packages__\n"
msgstr "__Linux Snap Packages__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation through darktable's GUI is currently [broken](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/issues/20074), so you will have to take the following approach:\n"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ GUI ຂອງ darktable ຕອນນີ້ກຳລັງ [ມີບັນຫາ](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/issues/20074), ດັ່ງນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ວິທີການດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure git is installed on your system. If it isn't, use the package manager to install it. You will have to download the Lua scripts using git, then create the `luarc` to let darktable load the script-manager. Close darktable, open a terminal and: \n"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ git ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ. ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງດາວໂຫຼດສະຄຣິບ Lua ໂດຍໃຊ້ git, ຈາກນັ້ນສ້າງ `luarc` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ darktable ໂຫຼດຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບ. ປິດ darktable, ເປີດ terminal ແລ້ວພິມ: \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    cd ~/snap/darktable/current\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/darktable-org/lua-scripts.git lua\n"
"    echo 'require \"tools/script_manager\"' >> luarc\n"
msgstr ""
"    cd ~/snap/darktable/current\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/darktable-org/lua-scripts.git lua\n"
"    echo 'require \"tools/script_manager\"' >> luarc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restart darktable twice, and the scripts module should appear in the lower-left corner.\n"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມ darktable ໃໝ່ສອງຄັ້ງ, ແລະ ໂມດູນສະຄຣິບຄວນຈະປາກົດຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__macOS__\n"
msgstr "__macOS__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Lua scripts can be installed by using darktable's GUI. In lighttable view, expand the lua scripts installer module in the lower-left corner. Ensure that select action: install scripts is selected, then click execute. Restart darktable once for the scripts module to appear in the lower-left corner.\n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ Lua ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ GUI ຂອງ darktable. ໃນມຸມມອງແຜງແສງ, ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍໂມດູນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບ lua ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເລືອກ action: install scripts, ແລ້ວຄລິກ execute. ເລີ່ມ darktable ໃໝ່ໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂມດູນສະຄຣິບປາກົດຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively you could use the console. Ensure git is installed on your system. If it isn't, use the package manager to install it. Then open a terminal and:\n"
msgstr "ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄອນໂຊນກໍໄດ້. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ git ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ. ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ. ຈາກນັ້ນເປີດ terminal ແລ້ວພິມ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    cd ~/.config/darktable/\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/darktable-org/lua-scripts.git lua\n"
msgstr ""
"    cd ~/.config/darktable/\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/darktable-org/lua-scripts.git lua\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__Windows__\n"
msgstr "__Windows__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure git is installed on your system. Git can be obtained from [git for windows](https://gitforwindows.org/), or using Windows package manager winget inside a command prompt with `winget install git.git`. If you use the gitforwindows.org distribution, install the Git Bash Shell also as it will aid in debugging the scripts if necessary. \n"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ git ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ. ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດ git ໄດ້ຈາກ [git for windows](https://gitforwindows.org/), ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການແພັກເກັດ Windows (winget) ພາຍໃນ command prompt ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ `winget install git.git`. ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ເວີຊັນຈາກ gitforwindows.org, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ Git Bash Shell ນຳ ເພາະມັນຈະຊ່ວຍໃນການແກ້ໄຂຈຸດບົກພ່ອງ (debugging) ຂອງສະຄຣິບຫາກຈຳເປັນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Lua scripts can now be installed by using darktable's GUI. In lighttable view, expand the lua scripts installer module in the lower-left corner. Ensure that select action: install scripts is selected, then click execute. Restart darktable once for the scripts module to appear in the lower-left corner.\n"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບ Lua ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ GUI ຂອງ darktable. ໃນມຸມມອງແຜງແສງ, ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍໂມດູນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບ lua ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ເລືອກ action: install scripts, ແລ້ວຄລິກ execute. ເລີ່ມ darktable ໃໝ່ໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂມດູນສະຄຣິບປາກົດຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__Updating__\n"
msgstr "__ການອັບເດດ__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To update the script repository, either use the scripts module GUI or open a terminal or command prompt and run the following commands: \n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອອັບເດດຄັງສະຄຣິບ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ GUI ຂອງໂມດູນສະຄຣິບ ຫຼື ເປີດ terminal ຫຼື command prompt ແລ້ວໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__Snap__\n"
msgstr "__Snap__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    cd ~/snap/darktable/current/lua\n"
"    git pull\n"
msgstr ""
"    cd ~/snap/darktable/current/lua\n"
"    git pull\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__Flatpak__\n"
msgstr "__Flatpak__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    cd ~/.var/app/org.darktable.Darktable/config/darktable/lua\n"
"    git pull\n"
msgstr ""
"    cd ~/.var/app/org.darktable.Darktable/config/darktable/lua\n"
"    git pull\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__Linux and MacOS__\n"
msgstr "__Linux ແລະ MacOS__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    cd ~/.config/darktable/lua/\n"
"    git pull\n"
msgstr ""
"    cd ~/.config/darktable/lua/\n"
"    git pull\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktables-scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    cd %LOCALAPPDATA%\\darktable\\lua\n"
"    git pull\n"
msgstr ""
"    cd %LOCALAPPDATA%\\darktable\\lua\n"
"    git pull\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scripting with Lua"
msgstr "ການຂຽນສະຄຣິບດ້ວຍ Lua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable comes with a versatile scripting interface language for functionality enhancement.\n"
msgstr "darktable ມາພ້ອມກັບພາສາອິນເຕີເຟດສະຄຣິບທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມສາມາດໃນການເຮັດວຽກ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "adding a simple shortcut"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມປຸ່ມລັດແບບງ່າຍໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "So far, all our scripts have done things during startup. This is of limited use and doesn't allow us to react to real user actions. To do more advanced things we need to register a function that will be called on a given event. The most common event to react to is a keyboard shortcut.\n"
msgstr "ຜ່ານມາ, ສະຄຣິບທັງໝົດຂອງພວກເຮົາເຮັດວຽກໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ອັນນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຈຳກັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການກະທຳຕົວຈິງຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າກວ່ານັ້ນ ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງລົງທະບຽນຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີເຫດການໃດໜຶ່ງເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ເຫດການທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມ.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"local function hello_shortcut(event, shortcut)\n"
"darktable.print(\"Hello, I just received '\"..event..\n"
"       \"' with parameter '\"..shortcut..\"'\")\n"
"end\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_event(\"hello shortcut\",\n"
"       \"shortcut\",hello_shortcut,\n"
"       \"A shortcut that prints its parameters\")\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"local function hello_shortcut(event, shortcut)\n"
"darktable.print(\"ສະບາຍດີ, ຂ້ອຍຫາກໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບ '\"..event..\n"
"       \"' ພ້ອມກັບພາຣາມິເຕີ '\"..shortcut..\"'\")\n"
"end\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_event(\"hello shortcut\",\n"
"       \"shortcut\",hello_shortcut,\n"
"       \"ຄຳສັ່ງລັດທີ່ສະແດງພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງມັນ\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now start darktable, go to \"preferences > shortcuts > lua > A shortcut that prints its parameters\", assign a shortcut and try it. You should see a nice message printed on the screen.\n"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ໃຫ້ເປີດ darktable, ໄປທີ່ \"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ປຸ່ມລັດ > lua > A shortcut that prints its parameters\", ກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດແລ້ວທົດລອງໃຊ້. ທ່ານຄວນຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມປາກົດຂຶ້ນເທິງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's look at the code in detail. We first define a function that takes two strings as input parameters. The first one is the type of event triggered (\"shortcut\") and the second is the name of the shortcut (\"A shortcut that prints its parameters\"). The function itself calls `darktable.print`, which will print the message as an overlay in the main window.\n"
msgstr "ມາເບິ່ງລະຫັດຢ່າງລະອຽດ. ທຳອິດພວກເຮົາກຳນົດຟັງຊັນທີ່ຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີຂໍ້ຄວາມສອງອັນ. ອັນທຳອິດແມ່ນປະເພດຂອງເຫດການທີ່ຖືກກະຕຸ້ນ (\"shortcut\") ແລະ ອັນທີສອງແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງປຸ່ມລັດ (\"A shortcut that prints its parameters\"). ຕົວຟັງຊັນເອງຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ `darktable.print`, ເຊິ່ງຈະພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມທັບຊ້ອນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once that function is defined, we register it as a shortcut callback. To do that we call `darktable.register_event` which is a generic function for all types of events. We tell it that we are registering an event of type \"shortcut\" with the name \"hello shortcut\", then we give the callback to call and finally, we give the string to use to describe the shortcut in the preferences window.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອກຳນົດຟັງຊັນນັ້ນແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາຈະລົງທະບຽນມັນເປັນ shortcut callback. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນ ພວກເຮົາຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ `darktable.register_event` ເຊິ່ງເປັນຟັງຊັນທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບເຫດການທຸກປະເພດ. ພວກເຮົາບອກມັນວ່າກຳລັງລົງທະບຽນເຫດການປະເພດ \"shortcut\" ດ້ວຍຊື່ \"hello shortcut\", ຈາກນັ້ນກຳນົດ callback ທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນກຳນົດຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ອະທິບາຍປຸ່ມລັດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's try a shortcut that is a little more interactive. This one will look at the images the user is currently interested in (selected or moused-over) and increase their rating:\n"
msgstr "ມາລອງປຸ່ມລັດທີ່ມີການໂຕ້ຕອບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນອີກໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງ. ອັນນີ້ຈະເບິ່ງຮູບພາບທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳລັງສົນໃຈ (ເລືອກໄວ້ ຫຼື ວາງເມົາສ໌ເທິງຮູບ) ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄະແນນໃຫ້ພວກມັນ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_event(\"increase rating\",\"shortcut\",\n"
"  function(event,shortcut)\n"
"    local images = darktable.gui.action_images\n"
"    for _,v in pairs(images) do\n"
"      v.rating = v.rating + 1\n"
"    end\n"
"  end,\"Increase the rating of an image\")\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_event(\"increase rating\",\"shortcut\",\n"
"  function(event,shortcut)\n"
"    local images = darktable.gui.action_images\n"
"    for _,v in pairs(images) do\n"
"      v.rating = v.rating + 1\n"
"    end\n"
"  end,\"Increase the rating of an image\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At this point, most of this code should be self explanatory. Just a couple of notes:\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ລະຫັດສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຄວນຈະເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ມີພຽງແຕ່ບາງໝາຍເຫດ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instead of declaring a function and referencing it, we declare it directly in the call to `darktable.register_event` this is strictly equivalent but slightly more compact.\n"
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ຈະປະກາດຟັງຊັນແລ້ວຈຶ່ງອ້າງອີງເຖິງມັນ, ພວກເຮົາປະກາດມັນໂດຍກົງໃນການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ `darktable.register_event` ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຜົນຄືກັນແຕ່ກະທັດຮັດກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`image.rating` is a field that gives the star rating of any image (between 0 and 5 stars, -1 means rejected).\n"
msgstr "`image.rating` ແມ່ນຟີວທີ່ໃຫ້ຄະແນນຮູບດາວຂອງຮູບພາບໃດໜຶ່ງ (ລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 5 ດາວ, -1 ໝາຍເຖິງຖືກປະຕິເສດ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable.gui.action_images` is a table containing all the images of interest. darktable will act on selected images if any image is selected, and on the image under the mouse if no image is selected. This function makes it easy to follow darktable's UI logic in lua.\n"
msgstr "`darktable.gui.action_images` ແມ່ນຕາຕະລາງທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຮູບພາບທັງໝົດທີ່ສົນໃຈ. darktable ຈະດຳເນີນການກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ຫາກມີການເລືອກ, ແລະ ດຳເນີນການກັບຮູບທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງເມົາສ໌ຫາກບໍ່ມີການເລືອກ. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກຕາມຕັກກະ UI ຂອງ darktable ໃນ lua ເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you select an image and press your shortcut a couple of times, it will work correctly at first but when you have reached five stars, darktable will start showing the following error on the console: \n"
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເລືອກຮູບພາບ ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມລັດສອງສາມຄັ້ງ, ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນຕອນທຳອິດ ແຕ່ເມື່ອຮອດຫ້າດາວແລ້ວ, darktable ຈະເລີ່ມສະແດງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນຄອນໂຊນ: \n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<![CDATA[\n"
"LUA ERROR : rating too high : 6\n"
"stack traceback:\n"
"   [C]: in ?\n"
"   [C]: in ?\n"
"   [C]: in metamethod 'newindex'\n"
"   ./configdir/luarc:10: in function <./configdir/luarc:7>\n"
"   [C]: in ?\n"
"   [C]: in ?\n"
"  ]]>\n"
msgstr ""
"<![CDATA[\n"
"LUA ERROR : rating too high : 6\n"
"stack traceback:\n"
"   [C]: in ?\n"
"   [C]: in ?\n"
"   [C]: in metamethod 'newindex'\n"
"   ./configdir/luarc:10: in function <./configdir/luarc:7>\n"
"   [C]: in ?\n"
"   [C]: in ?\n"
"  ]]>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid " This is lua's way of reporting errors. We have attempted to set a rating of 6 to an image, but a rating can only go as high as 5. It would be trivial to add a check, but let's go the complicated way and catch the error instead:\n"
msgstr " ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີການລາຍງານຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ lua. ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ພະຍາຍາມຕັ້ງຄະແນນເປັນ 6 ໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບ, ແຕ່ຄະແນນສູງສຸດແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ 5. ມັນອາດຈະງ່າຍທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມການກວດສອບ, ແຕ່ມາລອງວິທີທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າໂດຍການດັກຈັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແທນ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable.register_event(\"increase rating\",\"shortcut\",\n"
"  function(event,shortcut)\n"
"    local images = darktable.gui.action_images\n"
"    for _,v in pairs(images) do\n"
"      result,message = pcall(function()\n"
"        v.rating = v.rating + 1\n"
"        end)\n"
"      if not result then\n"
"        darktable.print_error(\"could not increase rating of image \"..\n"
"          tostring(v)..\" : \"..message)\n"
"      end\n"
"    end\n"
"  end,\"Increase the rating of an image\")\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable.register_event(\"increase rating\",\"shortcut\",\n"
"  function(event,shortcut)\n"
"    local images = darktable.gui.action_images\n"
"    for _,v in pairs(images) do\n"
"      result,message = pcall(function()\n"
"        v.rating = v.rating + 1\n"
"        end)\n"
"      if not result then\n"
"        darktable.print_error(\"could not increase rating of image \"..\n"
"          tostring(v)..\" : \"..message)\n"
"      end\n"
"    end\n"
"  end,\"Increase the rating of an image\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/simple-shortcut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`pcall` will run its first argument and catch any exception thrown by it. If there is no exception it will return `true` plus any result returned by the function. If there is an exception it will return `false` and the error message of the exception. We simply test these results and print them to the console.\n"
msgstr "`pcall` ຈະປະມວນຜົນອາກິວເມນທຳອິດ ແລະ ດັກຈັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (exception) ໃດໆທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ `true` ພ້ອມກັບຜົນລັດຈາກຟັງຊັນ. ຫາກມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄືນ `false` ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ພວກເຮົາພຽງແຕ່ກວດສອບຜົນລັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ແລະ ພິມພວກມັນອອກທາງຄອນໂຊນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "exporting images with lua"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບດ້ວຍ lua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "So far we have learned to use lua to adapt darktable to our particular workflow. Let's look now at how to use lua to easily export images to an online service. If you are able to upload an image to a service via the command line then you can use lua to integrate this into darktable's user interface.\n"
msgstr "ຜ່ານມາພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ້ການໃຊ້ lua ເພື່ອປັບ darktable ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ບາດນີ້ມາເບິ່ງວິທີການໃຊ້ lua ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບໄປຍັງບໍລິການອອນລາຍໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ. ຫາກທ່ານສາມາດອັບໂຫຼດຮູບພາບໄປຍັງບໍລິການໃດໜຶ່ງຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງຄອນໂຊນ ທ່ານກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ lua ເພື່ອລວມສິ່ງນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນອິນເຕີເຟດຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງ darktable ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this next example we will use lua to export via `scp`. A new storage type will appear in darktable's UI that will export images to a remote target via the copy mechanism in `ssh`.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ lua ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກຜ່ານ `scp`. ປະເພດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ຈະປາກົດໃນ UI ຂອງ darktable ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບໄປຍັງປາຍທາງທີ່ຢູ່ໄກ ຜ່ານກົນໄກການຄັດລອກໃນ `ssh`.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"darktable.preferences.register(\"scp_export\",\"export_path\",\n"
"  \"string\",\"target SCP path\",\n"
"  \"Complete path to copy to. Can include user and hostname\",\"\")\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_storage(\"scp_export\",\"Export via scp\",\n"
"  function( storage, image, format, filename,\n"
"     number, total, high_quality, extra_data)\n"
"    if not darktable.control.execute(\"scp \"..filename..\" \"..\n"
"      darktable.preferences.read(\"scp_export\",\n"
"         \"export_path\",\"string\")) then\n"
"      darktable.print_error(\"scp failed for \"..tostring(image))\n"
"    end\n"
"end)\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable = require \"darktable\"\n"
"\n"
"darktable.preferences.register(\"scp_export\",\"export_path\",\n"
"  \"string\",\"ເສັ້ນທາງ SCP ເປົ້າໝາຍ\",\n"
"  \"ເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມທີ່ຈະສຳເນົາໄປ. ສາມາດລວມເອົາຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ຊື່ໂຮສ໌ (hostname)\",\"\")\n"
"\n"
"darktable.register_storage(\"scp_export\",\"ສົ່ງອອກຜ່ານ scp\",\n"
"  function( storage, image, format, filename,\n"
"     number, total, high_quality, extra_data)\n"
"    if not darktable.control.execute(\"scp \"..filename..\" \"..\n"
"      darktable.preferences.read(\"scp_export\",\n"
"         \"export_path\",\"string\")) then\n"
"      darktable.print_error(\"scp ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວສຳລັບ \"..tostring(image))\n"
"    end\n"
"end)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable.preferences.register` will add a new preference to darktable's preferences menu, `scp_export` and `export_path` allow us to uniquely identify our preference. These fields are reused when we read the value of the preference. The `string` field tells the lua engine that the preference is a string. It could also be an integer, a filename or any of the types detailed in the API manual relating to `types_lua_pref_type`. We then have the label for the preference in the preference menu, the tooltip when hovering over the value and a default value.\n"
msgstr "`darktable.preferences.register` ຈະເພີ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໃນເມນູການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ darktable, `scp_export` ແລະ `export_path` ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາລະບຸການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ຟີວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ຄືນເມື່ອພວກເຮົາອ່ານຄ່າຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນ. ຟີວ `string` ບອກ lua engine ວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ມັນຍັງສາມາດເປັນຕົວເລກຖ້ວນ, ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຄູ່ມື API ທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບ `types_lua_pref_type`. ຈາກນັ້ນພວກເຮົາມີປ້າຍຊື່ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນເມນູການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip) ເມື່ອວາງເມົາສ໌ເທິງຄ່ານັ້ນ ແລະ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable.register_storage` is the call that actually registers a new storage type. The first argument is a name for the storage type, the second is the label that will be displayed in the UI and last is a function to call on each image. This function has a lot of parameters, but `filename` is the only one we use in this example. It contains the name of a temporary file where the image was exported by darktable's engine.\n"
msgstr "`darktable.register_storage` ແມ່ນຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ລົງທະບຽນປະເພດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ແທ້ໆ. ອາກິວເມນທຳອິດແມ່ນຊື່ສຳລັບປະເພດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ອັນທີສອງແມ່ນປ້າຍຊື່ທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນ UI ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນຟັງຊັນທີ່ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຮູບ. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ມີພາຣາມິເຕີຫຼາຍອັນ, ແຕ່ `filename` ແມ່ນອັນດຽວທີ່ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ຮູບພາບຖືກສົ່ງອອກໂດຍ engine ຂອງ darktable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This code will work but it has a couple of limitations. This is just a simple example after all:\n"
msgstr "ລະຫັດນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ ແຕ່ມັນກໍມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດບາງຢ່າງ. ເພາະວ່າມັນເປັນພຽງຕົວຢ່າງງ່າຍໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use preferences to configure the target path. It would be nicer to add an element to the export UI in darktable. We will detail how to do that in the next section.\n"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (preferences) ເພື່ອກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງປາຍທາງ. ມັນຈະດີກວ່າຖ້າເພີ່ມອົງປະກອບເຂົ້າໃນ UI ການສົ່ງອອກໃນ darktable. ພວກເຮົາຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີການເຮັດສິ່ງນັ້ນໃນສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "We do not check the returned value of `scp`. That command might fail, in particular if the user has not correctly set the preference.\n"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ໄດ້ກວດສອບຄ່າທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາຈາກ `scp`. ຄຳສັ່ງນັ້ນອາດຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This script can't read input from the user. The remote `scp` must use password-less copy -- `scp` can't be provided with a password easily, so we will leave it that way.\n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້. ການໃຊ້ `scp` ໄລຍະໄກຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການຄັດລອກແບບບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານ -- ເນື່ອງຈາກ `scp` ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບລະຫັດຜ່ານໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງປະມັນໄວ້ແບບນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is no message displayed once the example is done, only the progress bar on the lower left side tells the user that the job is complete.\n"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຕົວຢ່າງເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດ, ມີພຽງແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມທີ່ບອກຜູ້ໃຊ້ວ່າວຽກສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/lua/exporting-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use `darktable.control.execute` to call an external program. The normal `os.execute` would block other lua codes from happening.\n"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ `darktable.control.execute` ເພື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມພາຍນອກ. ການໃຊ້ `os.execute` ແບບປົກກະຕິຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລະຫັດ lua ອື່ນໆຖືກຂັດຈັງຫວະ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/darktable-from-lua.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "using darktable from a lua script"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ darktable ຈາກສະຄຣິບ lua"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktable-from-lua.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Warning: This feature is very experimental. It is known that several elements don't yet work in library mode. Careful testing is highly recommended._\n"
msgstr "_ຄຳເຕືອນ: ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທົດລອງ. ເປັນທີ່ຊາບກັນດີວ່າບາງອົງປະກອບຍັງບໍ່ທັນເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ library. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ມີການທົດສອບຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktable-from-lua.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The lua interface allows you to use darktable from any lua script. This will load darktable as a library and provide you with most of the lua API (darktable is configured headless, so the functions relating to the user interface are not available).\n"
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟດ lua ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ darktable ຈາກສະຄຣິບ lua ໃດກໍໄດ້. ອັນນີ້ຈະໂຫຼດ darktable ເປັນ library ແລະ ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ lua API ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ (darktable ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າແບບ headless, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຟັງຊັນທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບອິນເຕີເຟດຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktable-from-lua.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As an example, the following program will print the list of all images in your library:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂປຣແກຣມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະພິມລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດໃນ library ຂອງທ່ານ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/lua/darktable-from-lua.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/env lua\n"
"package = require \"package\"\n"
"package.cpath=package.cpath..\";./lib/darktable/lib?.so\"\n"
"\n"
"dt = require(\"darktable\")(\n"
"\"--library\", \"./library.db\",\n"
"\"--datadir\", \"./share/darktable\",\n"
"\"--moduledir\", \"./lib/darktable\",\n"
"\"--configdir\", \"./configdir\",\n"
"\"--cachedir\",\"cachedir\",\n"
"\"--g-fatal-warnings\")\n"
"\n"
"require(\"darktable.debug\")\n"
"\n"
"for k,v in ipairs(dt.database) do\n"
"   print(tostring(v))\n"
"end\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/env lua\n"
"package = require \"package\"\n"
"package.cpath=package.cpath..\";./lib/darktable/lib?.so\"\n"
"\n"
"dt = require(\"darktable\")(\n"
"\"--library\", \"./library.db\",\n"
"\"--datadir\", \"./share/darktable\",\n"
"\"--moduledir\", \"./lib/darktable\",\n"
"\"--configdir\", \"./configdir\",\n"
"\"--cachedir\",\"cachedir\",\n"
"\"--g-fatal-warnings\")\n"
"\n"
"require(\"darktable.debug\")\n"
"\n"
"for k,v in ipairs(dt.database) do\n"
"   print(tostring(v))\n"
"end\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktable-from-lua.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note the third line that points to the location of the `libdarktable.so` file.\n"
msgstr "ສັງເກດແຖບທີສາມທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຍັງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄຟລ໌ `libdarktable.so`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/darktable-from-lua.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Also note that the call to require returns a function that can be called only once and allows you to set darktable's command line parameter. The `:memory:` parameter to `--library` is useful here if you don't want to work on your personal library.\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ require ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຟັງຊັນທີ່ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງພາຣາມິເຕີຄຳສັ່ງຂອງ darktable ໄດ້. ພາຣາມິເຕີ `:memory:` ສຳລັບ `--library` ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກກັບ library ສ່ວນຕົວຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/lua/calling-from-dbus.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "calling lua from dbus"
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ lua ຈາກ dbus"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/calling-from-dbus.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is possible to send a lua command to darktable via its DBus interface. The method `org.darktable.service.Remote.Lua` takes a single string parameter which is interpreted as a lua command. The command will be executed in the current lua context and should return either nil or a string. The result will be passed back as the result of the DBus method.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງ lua ໄປຍັງ darktable ຜ່ານອິນເຕີເຟດ DBus ຂອງມັນໄດ້. ເມທອດ `org.darktable.service.Remote.Lua` ຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີຂໍ້ຄວາມດຽວ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍເປັນຄຳສັ່ງ lua. ຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນບໍລິບົດ lua ປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ຄວນສົ່ງຄືນເປັນ nil ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຜົນລັດຈະຖືກສົ່ງກັບຄືນເປັນຜົນຂອງເມທອດ DBus.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/lua/calling-from-dbus.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the Lua call results in an error, the DBus method call will return an error `org.darktable.Error.LuaError` with the lua error message as the message attached to the DBus error. \n"
msgstr "ຫາກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ Lua ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ເມທອດ DBus ຈະສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ `org.darktable.Error.LuaError` ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ lua ທີ່ຕິດມາກັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ DBus ນັ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/print/print-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "print view layout"
msgstr "ຜັງການຈັດວາງມຸມມອງການພິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/print-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The central area displays the image layout on the paper (the white area). Some gray borders may be displayed around the image to represent the printable area (the page minus the borders) not filled by the image.\n"
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ກາງຈະສະແດງຜັງການຈັດວາງຮູບພາບເທິງເຈ້ຍ (ພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາວ). ອາດຈະມີຂອບສີເທົາປະກົດຂຶ້ນຮອບໆຮູບພາບ ເພື່ອສະແດງເຖິງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ສາມາດພິມໄດ້ (ໜ້າເຈ້ຍລົບຂອບອອກ) ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕື່ມດ້ວຍຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/print-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [filmstrip](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) below the image allows you to select more images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ແຖບຟິມ (filmstrip)](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) "
"ຢູ່ກ້ອງຮູບພາບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກຮູບພາບເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/print/print-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "overlays"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຊ້ອນທັບ (Overlays)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/print-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the mouse is over the bounding box of an image, its width and height are shown along its top and left, respectively. Margins between the bounding box and the page edge are notated next to the dotted lines extending out from each side of the bounding box. All measurements are shown in the units as chosen in the print settings module.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເມົ້າຢູ່ເທິງກອບຂອງຮູບພາບ, ຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງ ຂອງມັນຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ ແລະ ດ້ານຊ້າຍ ຕາມລຳດັບ. ໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງກອບ ແລະ ຂອບເຈ້ຍຈະຖືກລະບຸໄວ້ຂ້າງເສັ້ນຈ້ຳທີ່ລາກອອກມາຈາກແຕ່ລະດ້ານຂອງກອບຮູບພາບ. ການວັດແທກທັງໝົດຈະສະແດງໃນໜ່ວຍທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນໂມດູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການພິມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/print-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images are inset along one dimension of their bounding box when they do not match the aspect ratio of the box. The overlaid margin measurements should therefore only be used to understand the layout bounds, not the actual printed size of the image.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໄວ້ພາຍໃນຂະໜາດໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງກອບ ເມື່ອພວກມັນບໍ່ກົງກັບອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງກອບ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄ່າການວັດແທກໄລຍະຫ່າງທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບຢູ່ນີ້ຄວນໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເພື່ອເຂົ້າໃຈຂອບເຂດຂອງຜັງການຈັດວາງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂະໜາດຈິງຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະຖືກພິມອອກມາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/print-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[collections](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md)\n"
": Filter the list of images displayed in the lighttable.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການສະສົມ (collections)](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md)\n"
": ກັ່ນຕອງລາຍການຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງໃນ lighttable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/print-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[image information](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md)\n"
": Display image information\n"
msgstr ""
"[ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md)\n"
": ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຮູບພາບ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/print-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[print settings](../module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md)\n"
": Adjust print settings and initiate printing.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການພິມ](../module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md)\n"
": ປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າການພິມ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການພິມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This view allows you to print your images. Because printing is not easy, there are many technical aspects to be taken into account.\n"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດພິມຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກການພິມບໍ່ແມ່ນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ, ຈຶ່ງມີຫຼາຍແງ່ມຸມທາງເຕັກນິກທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "After selecting an image in the [lighttable view](../lighttable/_index.md) you can enter the [print settings](../module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md) module to adjust printer settings and initiate printing.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກຮູບພາບໃນ [ມຸມມອງ lighttable](../lighttable/_index.md) ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ໂມດູນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການພິມ](../module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md) ເພື່ອປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງພິມ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການພິມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module supports the printer's ICC profile, which is somewhat mandatory if you want to obtain a high quality print close to the image displayed on the screen.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ຮອງຮັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC ຂອງເຄື່ອງພິມ, ເຊິ່ງຂ້ອນຂ້າງຈຳເປັນຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຜົນງານການພິມທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງ ແລະ ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງເທິງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/print/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is important to note that ICC profiles provided by the paper and/or printer manufacturers cannot be used on GNU/Linux as they are printer-driver dependent. The darktable print module uses CUPS and there are no ready-to-use ICC profiles available for this driver.\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຄວນຮູ້ຄື ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC ທີ່ຜູ້ຜະລິດເຈ້ຍ ແລະ/ຫຼື ເຄື່ອງພິມ ໃຫ້ມານັ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ GNU/Linux ໄດ້ ເພາະມັນຂຶ້ນກັບໄດຣເວີຂອງເຄື່ອງພິມ. ໂມດູນການພິມຂອງ darktable ໃຊ້ CUPS ແລະ ບໍ່ມີໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC ທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບໄດຣເວີນີ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/print/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Print"
msgstr "ການພິມ"

#. type: Title #
#: content/slideshow/usage.md content/special-topics/darktable-chart/usage.md
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/sigmoid.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/external-raster.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "usage"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/slideshow/usage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The slideshow view is still in an early stage of development with only a basic set of features.\n"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງການສະແດງສະໄລ້ຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງການພັດທະນາ ໂດຍມີພຽງຊຸດຟີເຈີພື້ນຖານເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/slideshow/usage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don't need the auto-advance mode, you could even use the [sticky preview feature](../lighttable/lighttable-modes/full-preview.md) instead.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໂໝດເລື່ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [ຟີເຈີສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງແບບຄ້າງໄວ້](../lighttable/lighttable-modes/full-preview.md) ແທນກໍໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/slideshow/usage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"spacebar             start and stop auto-advance mode which automatically switches\n"
"                     to the next images every five seconds by default.\n"
"\n"
"ESC                  leave slideshow mode and return to lighttable view.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"+ or                 increase delay between each image.\n"
"up arrow \n"
"\n"
"- or                 decrease delay between each image.\n"
"down arrow\n"
"\n"
"left-click or        \n"
"right arrow or       switch to the next image of the collection.\n"
"right shift-key\n"
"\n"
"right-click or       \n"
"left arrow or        switch to the previous image of the collection.\n"
"left shift-key\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"spacebar (ປຸ່ມວ່າງ)   ເລີ່ມ ແລະ ຢຸດໂໝດເລື່ອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເຊິ່ງຈະສະຫຼັບ\n"
"                     ໄປຫາຮູບຖັດໄປທຸກໆຫ້າວິນາທີໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
"\n"
"ESC                  ອອກຈາກໂໝດສະແດງສະໄລ້ ແລະ ກັບໄປຫາຄັງຮູບ (lighttable).\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"+ ຫຼື                 ເພີ່ມໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະຮູບ.\n"
"ລູກສອນຂຶ້ນ \n"
"\n"
"- ຫຼື                 ຫຼຸດໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະຮູບ.\n"
"ລູກສອນລົງ\n"
"\n"
"ຄລິກຊ້າຍ ຫຼື        \n"
"ລູກສອນຂວາ ຫຼື       ສະຫຼັບໄປຫາຮູບຖັດໄປໃນການສະສົມ.\n"
"shift-ຂວາ\n"
"\n"
"ຄລິກຂວາ ຫຼື       \n"
"ລູກສອນຊ້າຍ ຫຼື       ສະຫຼັບໄປຫາຮູບກ່ອນໜ້າໃນການສະສົມ.\n"
"shift-ຊ້າຍ\n"
"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/slideshow/usage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Hint:** To take full advantage of your screen size, put darktable into fullscreen mode by pressing F11 and hide the border-controls by pressing the B key.\n"
msgstr "**ຄຳແນະນຳ:** ເພື່ອໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ darktable ເປັນໂໝດເຕັມໜ້າຈໍໂດຍການກົດ F11 ແລະ ເຊື່ອງຕົວຄວບຄຸມຂອບໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ B.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/slideshow/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The slideshow view allows you to watch a slideshow of your current collection with the associated filtering rules and sort order applied. \n"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງການສະແດງສະໄລ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງສະໄລ້ຂອງຮູບພາບໃນການສະສົມປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ ໂດຍມີການນຳໃຊ້ກົດເກນການກັ່ນຕອງ ແລະ ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/slideshow/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To learn more about how to define the collection and filtering rules, see the section on [collections](../lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md). Select the sort criteria and sort order of the images in the [top panel](../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md).\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີກຳນົດການສະສົມ ແລະ ກົດເກນການກັ່ນຕອງ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງພາກ [ການສະສົມ (collections)](../lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md). ເລືອກເກນການຈັດລຽງ ແລະ ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງຂອງຮູບພາບໃນ [ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ](../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/slideshow/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next section provides more details on the [usage](usage.md) of the slideshow view.\n"
msgstr "ພາກຕໍ່ໄປຈະໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ [ການນຳໃຊ້](usage.md) ມຸມມອງການສະແດງສະໄລ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/slideshow/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Slideshow"
msgstr "ການສະແດງສະໄລ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If all of the required settings in the \"source image\" and \"reference values\" tabs are ready you can move on to the “process” tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດໃນແຖບ \"ຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ\" ແລະ \"ຄ່າອ້າງອີງ\" ພ້ອມແລ້ວ ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍໄປ"
"ທີ່ແຖບ “ປະມວນຜົນ” ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![process](./process/darktable-chart-process.png#w75)\n"
msgstr "![ປະມວນຜົນ](./process/darktable-chart-process.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, you need to tell `darktable-chart` which of the patches represents the gray ramp. In the screenshot displayed above, the gray ramp is positioned in the lower part of the color reference chart, denoted as \"GS00...GS23\".\n"
msgstr "ກ່ອນອື່ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງບອກ `darktable-chart` ວ່າແຖບໃດທີ່ແທນຄ່າຊ່ວງສີເທົາ (gray ramp). ໃນຮູບໜ້າຈໍທີ່ສະແດງຂ້າງເທິງ, ຊ່ວງສີເທົາແມ່ນຕັ້ງຢູ່ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງແຜ່ນອ້າງອີງສີ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກໝາຍວ່າ \"GS00...GS23\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"number of final patches\" input defines how many editable color patches the resulting style will use within the [_color look up table_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-look-up-table.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງໃສ່ຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"ຈຳນວນແຖບສີສຸດທ້າຍ (number of final patches)\" ຈະກຳນົດວ່າສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຈະໃຊ້ແຖບສີທີ່ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຈັກແຖບພາຍໃນໂມດູນ [_ຕາຕະລາງຊອກຫາສີ (color look up table)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-look-up-table.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the “process” button to start the calculation.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ “ປະມວນຜົນ” ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການຄຳນວນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The quality of the result (in terms of average delta-E and maximum delta-E) is displayed below the button. This data shows how closely the resulting style (when applied to the source image) will be able to match the reference values -- the lower the better.\n"
msgstr "ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງຜົນລັບ (ໃນແງ່ຂອງຄ່າ delta-E ສະເລ່ຍ ແລະ delta-E ສູງສຸດ) ແມ່ນສະແດງຢູ່ກ້ອງປຸ່ມ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ (ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ) ຈະສາມາດກົງກັບຄ່າອ້າງອີງໄດ້ຫຼາຍປານໃດ -- ຄ່າຍິ່ງຕ່ຳຍິ່ງດີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you are happy with the result you can click on “export” to save the generated style.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານພໍໃຈກັບຜົນລັດແລ້ວ ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກທີ່ “ສົ່ງອອກ” ເພື່ອບັນທຶກສະໄຕລ໌ (style) ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supply a style name and a style description under which the style will later appear in darktable. `darktable-chart` saves the style as a `.dtstyle` file which can be imported into darktable and shared with others. See [styles](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md).\n"
msgstr "ໃສ່ຊື່ສະໄຕລ໌ ແລະ ຄຳອະທິບາຍສະໄຕລ໌ ເຊິ່ງຊື່ນີ້ຈະປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນ darktable ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. `darktable-chart` ຈະບັນທຶກສະໄຕລ໌ເປັນໄຟລ໌ `.dtstyle` ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໃນ darktable ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນໃຫ້ກັບຄົນອື່ນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງ [ສະໄຕລ໌ (styles)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/process.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The “export raw data as csv” button allows you to save the extracted raw data as a CSV file for debugging purposes or later use. `darktable-chart` offers a command line option to produce a style with the desired number of final patches from a supplied CSV file (see [`darktable-chart`](../program-invocation/darktable-chart.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ “ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນ raw ເປັນ csv” ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານບັນທຶກຂໍ້ມູນ raw ທີ່ດຶງອອກມາເປັນໄຟລ໌ CSV ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງ"
"ໃນການດີບັກ (debugging) ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ງານໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. `darktable-chart` ມີຕົວເລືອກຄຳສັ່ງ "
"(command line) ເພື່ອສ້າງສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນຊ່ອງສີສຸດທ້າຍຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈາກໄຟລ໌ CSV ທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ (ເບິ່ງ "
"[`darktable-chart`](../program-invocation/darktable-chart.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/usage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The tool is organized into three tabs in the upper part and a text output frame in the lower part.\n"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຖືກຈັດລະບຽບເປັນສາມແທັບໃນສ່ວນເທິງ ແລະ ຂອບສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນສ່ວນລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/usage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![usage](./usage/darktable-chart-usage.png#w75)\n"
msgstr "![ການນຳໃຊ້](./usage/darktable-chart-usage.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/usage.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first tab is used to define the source image, the second tab defines the reference (target) and the third tab contains the controls to generate the resulting darktable style.\n"
msgstr "ແທັບທຳອິດໃຊ້ເພື່ອ ກຳນົດຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ແທັບທີສອງກຳນົດຄ່າອ້າງອີງ (ເປົ້າໝາຍ) ແລະ ແທັບທີສາມປະກອບດ້ວຍສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມເພື່ອສ້າງສະໄຕລ໌ darktable ທີ່ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable-chart` is a tool for extracting luminance and color values from images of color reference cards such as IT8.7/1 charts. Its main purpose is to compare a source image (typically a largely unprocessed raw image) to a target image (typically a JPEG image created in-camera) and produce a darktable style that is able to use the luminance and color values of the source image to produce the target image. This style employs the [_tone curve_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md) module, the [_input color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) module, and the [_color look up table_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-look-up-table.md) module for that purpose.\n"
msgstr "`darktable-chart` ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບການດຶງຄ່າລູມິແນນຊ໌ ແລະ ຄ່າສີ ຈາກຮູບພາບຂອງແຜ່ນອ້າງອີງສີ ເຊັ່ນ ແຜ່ນ IT8.7/1. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກຂອງມັນແມ່ນເພື່ອປຽບທຽບຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ (ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນຮູບພາບ raw ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍ) ກັບຮູບພາບເປົ້າໝາຍ (ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນຮູບພາບ JPEG ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນກ້ອງ) ແລະ ສ້າງສະໄຕລ໌ (style) ຂອງ darktable ທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າລູມິແນນຊ໌ ແລະ ຄ່າສີຂອງຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບພາບໃຫ້ຄືກັບເປົ້າໝາຍ. ສະໄຕລ໌ນີ້ຈະນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ (tone curve)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md), ໂມດູນ [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md), ແລະ ໂມດູນ [_ຕາຕະລາງຊອກຫາສີ (color look up table)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-look-up-table.md) ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some cameras offer various film simulation modes of your choice. With the help of `darktable-chart` and the underlying modules you can create styles that replicate these film simulations from within darktable.\n"
msgstr "ກ້ອງບາງລຸ້ນມີໂໝດຈຳລອງຟິມ (film simulation) ຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກ. ດ້ວຍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງ `darktable-chart` ແລະ ໂມດູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ຈຳລອງໂໝດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້ພາຍໃນ darktable.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/making-input-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "making input images for darktable-chart"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າສຳລັບ darktable-chart"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/making-input-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To start with, you need a suitable photo of your color reference card in RAW+JPEG format. It goes beyond the scope of this manual to explain the details of how to take this photo, but in a nutshell you need to make the shot on a sunny day around midday with the light source (the sun) shining at an angle onto the card. You need to avoid any glare in the image. The neutral white color patch in the gray ramp (G00) should end up at the L value specified in the description of your card. Often this is L=92 and requires you to overexpose the shot by about 1/3 EV. Ideally you will make several shots with slightly different exposures and later select the right one in darktable. Make sure that the chart fills up most of the frame. Use a lens with a “normal” focal length (e.g. 50mm equivalent) and stop down a bit to avoid vignetting.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຮູບພາບທີ່ເໝາະສົມຂອງແຜ່ນອ້າງອີງສີຂອງທ່ານໃນຮູບແບບ RAW+JPEG. ມັນເກີນຂອບ"
"ເຂດຂອງຄູ່ມືນີ້ທີ່ຈະອະທິບາຍລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຖ່າຍຮູບນີ້, ແຕ່ເວົ້າສັ້ນໆກໍຄືທ່ານຕ້ອງຖ່າຍໃນມື້ທີ່ມີແສງແດດປະມ"
"ານຕອນທ່ຽງ ໂດຍໃຫ້ແຫຼ່ງແສງ (ດວງອາທິດ) ສ່ອງແສງເປັນມຸມໃສ່ແຜ່ນນັ້ນ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງຫຼີກລ່ຽງແສງສະທ້ອນໃນຮູບພາ"
"ບ. ຊ່ອງສີຂາວທີ່ເປັນກາງໃນແຖບສີເທົາ (G00) ຄວນຈະສິ້ນສຸດຢູ່ທີ່ຄ່າ L ທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງແຜ່ນຂອງທ່າ"
"ນ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຄ່ານີ້ຄື L=92 ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທ່ານຖ່າຍຮູບໃຫ້ສະຫວ່າງເກີນໄປ (overexpose) ປະມານ "
"1/3 EV. ຕາມອຸດົມຄະຕິແລ້ວ ທ່ານຄວນຖ່າຍຮູບຫຼາຍໆໃບດ້ວຍລະດັບແສງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເລັກນ້ອຍ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍເລືອ"
"ກໃບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ darktable. ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າແຜ່ນສີຕື່ມເຕັມພື້ນທີ່ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງເຟຣມ. ໃຊ້ເລນທີ່ມີໄລຍະໂຟ"
"ກັດ “ປົກກະຕິ” (ເຊັ່ນ: ທຽບເທົ່າ 50mm) ແລະ ຫຍັບຮູຮັບແສງລົງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂອບຮູບມືດ "
"(vignetting).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/making-input-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You then open the raw file in darktable and disable most modules, especially [_base curve_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md). Select the standard input matrix in the [_input color profile module_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) and disable gamut clipping. Select “camera white balance” in the [_white balance_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/white-balance.md) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານເປີດໄຟລ໌ raw ໃນ darktable ແລະ ປິດການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ໂດຍສະເພາະແມ່ນ [_ເສັ້"
"ນໂຄ້ງພື້ນຖານ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md). ເລືອກແມັດ"
"ທຣິກນໍາເຂົ້າຕາມມາດຕະຖານໃນ [_ໂມດູນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີນໍາເຂົ້າ_](../../module-reference/processing-"
"modules/input-color-profile.md) ແລະ ປິດການໃຊ້ງານການຕັດຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut clipping). "
"ເລືອກ “ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວຂອງກ້ອງ” ໃນໂມດູນ [_ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວ_](../../module-reference/"
"processing-modules/white-balance.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/making-input-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is a special situation if your camera automatically applies some lens corrections (namely vignetting correction) to the resulting JPEG file. In this case you need to activate the [_lens correction_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md) module in darktable so that raw processing matches the JPEG in this respect. However, since darktable's vignetting correction may not exactly match the in-camera correction, it is better to disable this correction in-camera if possible.\n"
msgstr "ມີກໍລະນີພິເສດ ຖ້າກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານນຳໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂເລນບາງຢ່າງ (ໂດຍສະເພາະການແກ້ໄຂຂອບດຳ) ກັບໄຟລ໌ JPEG ທີ່ໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ທ່ານຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ (lens correction)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md) ໃນ darktable ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນ raw ກົງກັບ JPEG ໃນສ່ວນນີ້. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເນື່ອງຈາກການແກ້ໄຂຂອບດຳຂອງ darktable ອາດຈະບໍ່ກົງກັບການແກ້ໄຂໃນກ້ອງຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ, ມັນຈະດີກວ່າຖ້າທ່ານປິດການແກ້ໄຂນີ້ໃນກ້ອງຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/making-input-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To output your image go to the [export](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md) module in the lighttable.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໂມດູນ [ການສົ່ງອອກ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md) ໃນສ່ວນສະໄລ້ຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/making-input-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You will need to select “Lab” as the output color profile. This color space is not visible in the combobox by default. You first need to enable it by setting `allow_lab_output` to `TRUE` in darktable's configuration file `darktablerc` in the [configuration directory](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). Alternatively, you can start darktable with:\n"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເລືອກ “Lab” ເປັນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາອອກ. ພື້ນທີ່ສີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເຫັນໃນຊ່ອງເລືອກໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທຳອິດທ່ານຕ້ອ"
"ງເປີດໃຊ້ງານມັນໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `allow_lab_output` ເປັນ `TRUE` ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ darktable "
"`darktablerc` ໃນ [ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີການກຳນົດຄ່າ](../../preferences-settings/config-"
"directory.md). ອີກທາງເລືອກໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມ darktable ດ້ວຍ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/making-input-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable --conf allow_lab_output=true\n"
msgstr "darktable --conf allow_lab_output=true\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/making-input-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then select “PFM (float)” as the output format and press “export” to generate the source image file.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກ “PFM (float)” ເປັນຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ກົດ “ສົ່ງອອກ” ເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັ"
"ບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/making-input-images.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can produce the corresponding reference (target) image from the JPEG in a similar way. This time you will need to disable all modules and export with the “Lab” output color profile in “PFM (float)” format.\n"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຮູບພາບອ້າງອີງ (ເປົ້າໝາຍ) ທີ່ກົງກັນຈາກ JPEG ດ້ວຍວິທີທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ໃນຄັ້ງນີ້ ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປິດໂມ"
"ດູນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກດ້ວຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາອອກ “Lab” ໃນຮູບແບບ “PFM (float)”.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/reference-values.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reference values"
msgstr "ຄ່າອ້າງອີງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/reference-values.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The “reference values” tab determines the target values to which the source image must to be modified by the resulting style. You can either supply reference values in the form of measured data of your color reference card (mode “cie/it8 file”), or you can supply a photographic image (mode “color chart image”) much in the same way as described above. This second image must also be supplied in Lab Portable Float Map format. There is no need to supply the chart file again as `darktable-chart` takes the same one as defined under “source image”. You only need to again align the layout grid and the image and potentially adjust the “size” slider.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແຖບ “ຄ່າອ້າງອີງ” ກຳນົດຄ່າເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປ່ຽນໂດຍສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃ"
"ຫ້ຄ່າອ້າງອີງໃນຮູບແບບຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ວັດແທກໄດ້ຈາກແຜ່ນອ້າງອີງສີຂອງທ່ານ (ໂໝດ “cie/it8 file”), ຫຼື ທ່ານສາ"
"ມາດໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບຖ່າຍ (ໂໝດ “color chart image”) ໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງ. ຮູບທີສອ"
"ງນີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຕອບສະໜອງໃນຮູບແບບ Lab Portable Float Map ຄືກັນ. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ແຜ່ນສີອີກຄັ້"
"ງ ເພາະ `darktable-chart` ຈະໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ “ຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ”. ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອ"
"ງຈັດວາງຕາໜ່າງໂໂຄງສ້າງ ແລະ ຮູບພາບໃຫ້ກົງກັນອີກຄັ້ງ ແລະ ອາດຈະປັບຕົວເລື່ອນ “ຂະໜາດ”.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/reference-values.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In a typical use case the second image will be based on a JPEG file produced in-camera. This way you can create a style to simulate the in-camera processing within darktable.\n"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີການນຳໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ, ຮູບທີສອງຈະມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ JPEG ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນກ້ອງ. ວິທີນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສະໄຕລ໌ເພື່ອຈຳລອງການປະມວນຜົນໃນກ້ອງພາຍໃນ darktable ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/reference-values.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the lower text output frame you will see the color values extracted from the available data for each individual color patch. The first column gives the name of the patch, the second and third column show the corresponding color values of the source image in RGB and Lab format, respectively. The fourth column contains the Lab value coming from the reference (or from the chart file if no reference image has been given). Finally, the fifth and sixth columns display how strongly source and reference values deviate in terms of delta-E values.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂອບສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ານລຸ່ມ ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຄ່າສີທີ່ດຶງມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແຖບສີ. ຄໍລຳທຳອິດບອກຊື່ຂອງແຖບສີ, ຄໍລຳທີສອງ ແລະ ທີສາມສະແດງຄ່າສີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບໃນຮູບແບບ RGB ແລະ Lab ຕາມລຳດັບ. ຄໍລຳທີສີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍຄ່າ Lab ທີ່ມາຈາກຄ່າອ້າງອີງ (ຫຼື ຈາກໄຟລ໌ແຜ່ນ ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຮູບພາບອ້າງອີງໃຫ້ມາ). ສຸດທ້າຍ, ຄໍລຳທີຫ້າ ແລະ ທີຫົກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າຄ່າຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຄ່າອ້າງອີງແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍປານໃດໃນແງ່ຂອງຄ່າ delta-E.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "using darktable-chart"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ darktable-chart"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/source-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "source image"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/source-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the “source image” tab you set your source image, which requires two elements. The first element is an input file in Lab Portable Float Map format (extension `.pfm`). The source file represents the largely unmodified data as the camera sees it. Information about how to take photos of a color reference card and produce a `.pfm` output file are described below. The second element is a chart file that contains a formal description of the underlying color reference card's layout (extension `.cht`). Chart files are usually shipped with your color reference card or can be downloaded from the internet.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຖບ “ຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ” ທ່ານຕັ້ງຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງທ່ານ, ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງການສອງອົງປະກອບ. ອົງປະກອບທຳອິດແ"
"ມ່ນໄຟລ໌ນຳເຂົ້າໃນຮູບແບບ Lab Portable Float Map (ນາມສະກຸນ `.pfm`). ໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບແທນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ໄ"
"ດ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງເປັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຕາມທີ່ກ້ອງເຫັນ. ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຖ່າຍຮູບແຜ່ນອ້າງອີງສີ ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກ "
"`.pfm` ແມ່ນໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້. ອົງປະກອບທີສອງແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ແຜ່ນສີ (chart file) ທີ່ບັນຈຸຄຳອະທິບາຍຮູບ"
"ແບບຂອງໂຄງສ້າງແຜ່ນອ້າງອີງສີ (ນາມສະກຸນ `.cht`). ໄຟລ໌ແຜ່ນສີປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມາພ້ອມກັບແຜ່ນອ້າງອີງສີຂອງທ່"
"ານ ຫຼື ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກອິນເຕີເນັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/source-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![source](./source-image/darktable-chart-source.png#w75)\n"
msgstr "![ຕົ້ນສະບັບ](./source-image/darktable-chart-source.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/source-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In real life the photo taken from the color reference card will show some perspective distortions relative to the layout defined in the chart file. For that reason the layout is displayed as a grid over the image and can be modified.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຊີວິດຈິງ, ຮູບທີ່ຖ່າຍຈາກແຜ່ນອ້າງອີງສີຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນການຜິດພ້ຽນທາງທັດສະນະວິໄສ (perspective distortions) ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຮູບແບບການວາງແຜນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ແຜ່ນ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນັ້ນ, ຮູບແບບການວາງແຜນຈຶ່ງຖືກສະແດງເປັນຕາໜ່າງເທິງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/source-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can move the corners of the grid using the mouse to reach best alignment of grid and image.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍມຸມຕ່າງໆຂອງຕາໜ່າງໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕາໜ່າງ ແລະ ຮູບພາບກົງກັນດີທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/darktable-chart/source-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A rectangular frame is displayed for each patch and defines the area from which `darktable-chart` will sample the required input data. You may need to modify the size of these rectangles so that the sampling area is big enough but does not overlap with neighboring patches. Use the “size” slider in the upper right part of the GUI. Higher values lead to smaller sizes.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຟຣມຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຈະຖືກສະແດງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ ແລະ ກຳນົດພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ `darktable-chart` ຈະເກັບຕົວຢ່າງຂໍ້ມູນນ"
"ຳເຂົ້າທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບຂະໜາດຂອງສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຕົວຢ່າງມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ພໍ ແຕ່ບໍ່ຊ້ອນທັບ"
"ກັບຊ່ອງສີຂ້າງຄຽງ. ໃຊ້ຕົວເລື່ອນ “ຂະໜາດ (size)” ໃນສ່ວນເທິງຂວາຂອງ GUI. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດ"
"ນ້ອຍລົງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable's color spaces"
msgstr "ກາມຸດສີຂອງ darktable"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Input images are either RGB files (like JPEGs or TIFFs) or camera RAWs. Both store visual information as a combination of primary colors (e.g. red, green and blue) which together describe a light emission to be recreated by a display.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າອາດຈະເປັນໄຟລ໌ RGB (ເຊັ່ນ JPEGs ຫຼື TIFFs) ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ RAW ຈາກກ້ອງ. ທັງສອງແບບຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການເບິ່ງເຫັນເປັນການປະສົມຂອງສີຫຼັກ (ເຊັ່ນ: ແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ) ເຊິ່ງຮ່ວມກັນອະທິບາຍການປ່ອຍແສງທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍຈໍສະແດງຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following image illustrates this concept.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນແນວຄວາມຄິດນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Spectral decomposition of a light emission into 3 RGB intensities](./color-spaces/spectral-decomposition.png#w100)\n"
msgstr "![ການແຍກສະເປັກຕຳຂອງການປ່ອຍແສງອອກເປັນ 3 ຄວາມເຂັ້ມ RGB](./color-spaces/spectral-decomposition.png#w100)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The left-hand-side of the image depicts a colored light that we need to represent digitally. We can use three ideal color filters to decompose this light into three colored primary lights at different intensities. In order to recreate the original colored light from our ideal decomposition (as illustrated in the center of the image) we simply need to recombine those three primary lights by addition.\n"
msgstr "ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງຮູບສະແດງເຖິງແສງສີທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການແທນຄ່າດ້ວຍລະບົບດິຈິຕອນ. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດໃຊ້ຟິວເຕີສີໃນອຸດົມຄະຕິສາມອັນເພື່ອແຍກແສງນີ້ອອກເປັນແສງສີຫຼັກສາມສີທີ່ມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ເພື່ອສ້າງແສງສີເດີມຄືນໃໝ່ຈາກການແຍກໃນອຸດົມຄະຕິຂອງພວກເຮົາ (ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໃຈກາງຂອງຮູບ), ພວກເຮົາພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງການລວມແສງສີຫຼັກສາມອັນນັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່ດ້ວຍການບວກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It should be possible to reproduce the original colored light by taking a set of white lights at the correct intensities and projecting those lights through appropriately colored filters. This experiment can be performed at home using gels and dimmable white bulbs. This is roughly what old color CRT displays did and is how video projectors still work.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມັນຄວນຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະສ້າງແສງສີຕົ້ນສະບັບຄືນໃໝ່ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຊຸດແສງສີຂາວໃນລະດັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລ"
"ະ ສ່ອງແສງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຜ່ານຟິວເຕີ (filters) ສີທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ການທົດລອງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢູ່ເຮືອນໂດຍໃຊ້ແຜ່ນເຈວ"
"ສີ ແລະ ດອກໄຟສີຂາວທີ່ປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໄດ້. ນີ້ຄືສິ່ງທີ່ຈໍສະແດງຜົນ CRT ສີລຸ້ນເກົ່າເຮັດ ແລະ ເປັນວິທີທີ່ເຄື່ອງສາຍ"
"ໂປຣເຈັກເຕີຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In photography, the initial decomposition step is performed by the color filter array that sits on top of your camera's sensor. This decomposition is not ideal, so it isn't possible to precisely recreate the original emission with simple addition -- some intermediate scaling is required to adjust the three intensities. \n"
msgstr "ໃນການຖ່າຍຮູບ, ຂັ້ນຕອນການແຍກເບື້ອງຕົ້ນແມ່ນຖືກປະຕິບັດໂດຍອາເຣຟິວເຕີສີ (color filter array) ທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງເຊັນເຊີຂອງກ້ອງ. ການແຍກນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບອຸດົມຄະຕິ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງການປ່ອຍແສງເດີມຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນດ້ວຍການບວກແບບງ່າຍໆ -- ຕ້ອງມີການປັບຂະໜາດລະຫວ່າງກາງບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອປັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມທັງສາມ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On screens, the LED bulbs are dimmed proportionally to each intensity, and the emissions of the three lights are physically added to reconstruct the original emission. Digital images store the intensities of these primary lights as a set of three numbers for each pixel, depicted on the right-hand side of the above image as shades of gray.\n"
msgstr "ໃນໜ້າຈໍ, ດອກໄຟ LED ຈະຖືກຫຸດຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຕາມສັດສ່ວນຂອງແຕ່ລະຄວາມເຂັ້ມ, ແລະ ການປ່ອຍແສງຂອງແສງທັງສາມຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນທາງກາຍະພາບເພື່ອສ້າງການປ່ອຍແສງເດີມຄືນໃໝ່. ຮູບພາບດິຈິຕອນຈະເກັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງສີຫຼັກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນຊຸດຕົວເລກສາມຕົວສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຮູບຂ້າງເທິງເປັນເສດສີເທົາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While a set of display intensities can be easily combined to recreate an original light on a screen (for example, if we created a synthetic image in-computer) the set of captured intensities from a sensor needs some scaling in order for the on-screen light addition to reasonably reproduce the original light emission. This means that every set of intensities, expressed as an RGB set, must be linked to a set of filters (or primary LED colors) that define a _color space_ -- any RGB set only makes sense with reference to a color space. \n"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຊຸດຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງການສະແດງຜົນສາມາດລວມກັນໄດ້ງ່າຍເພື່ອສ້າງແສງເດີມຄືນໃໝ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າພວກເຮົາສ້າງຮູບສັງເຄາະໃນຄອມພິວເຕີ), ແຕ່ຊຸດຄວາມເຂັ້ມທີ່ຈັບໄດ້ຈາກເຊັນເຊີແມ່ນຕ້ອງມີການປັບຂະໜາດບາງຢ່າງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການບວກແສງໃນໜ້າຈໍສາມາດສ້າງການປ່ອຍແສງເດີມຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມເຫດສົມຜົນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ທຸກໆຊຸດຂອງຄວາມເຂັ້ມ, ທີ່ສະແດງເປັນຊຸດ RGB, ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບຊຸດຂອງຟິວເຕີ (ຫຼື ສີ LED ຫຼັກ) ທີ່ກຳນົດ _ກາມຸດສີ_ -- ຊຸດ RGB ໃດໆ ຈະມີຄວາມໝາຍກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການອ້າງອີງເຖິງກາມຸດສີເທົ່ານັ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Not only do we need to temper the captured intensities to make them summable again, but if we are to recompose the original light on a display that does not have the same colored filters or primaries as the space in which our RGB set belongs, these intensities need to be rescaled to take into account the differing filters on the display. The mechanism for this scaling is described in _color profiles_, usually stored within `.icc` files.\n"
msgstr "ບໍ່ພຽງແຕ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງປັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມທີ່ຈັບໄດ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນສາມາດລວມກັນໄດ້ອີກຄັ້ງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແຕ່ຖ້າພວກເຮົາຈະສ້າງແສງເດີມຄືນໃໝ່ໃນຈໍສະແດງຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ມີຟິວເຕີສີ ຫຼື ສີຫຼັກດຽວກັນກັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຊຸດ RGB ຂອງພວກເຮົາຢູ່, ຄວາມເຂັ້ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໃໝ່ເພື່ອພິຈາລະນາເຖິງຟິວເຕີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນຈໍສະແດງຜົນ. ກົນໄກສຳລັບການປັບຂະໜາດນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ _ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີ (color profiles)_, ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ `.icc`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: Color is not a physical property of light -- it exists only in the human brain, as a product of the decomposition of a light emission by the cone cells in the retina, again very similar in principle to the above filtering example. An \"RGB\" value should be understood as \"light emissions encoded on 3 channels connected to 3 primaries\", but the primaries themselves may look different from what humans would call \"red\", \"green\" or \"blue\".\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ສີບໍ່ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງແສງ -- ມັນມີຢູ່ແຕ່ໃນສະໝອງຂອງມະນຸດເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເປັນຜົນມາຈາກການແຍກການປ່ອຍແສງໂດຍຈຸລັງຮູບຈວຍໃນຈໍປະສາດຕາ, ເຊິ່ງມີຫຼັກການຄ້າຍຄືກັນກັບຕົວຢ່າງການກັ່ນຕອງຂ້າງເທິງ. ຄ່າ \"RGB\" ຄວນຖືກເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າເປັນ \"ການປ່ອຍແສງທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນ 3 ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ 3 ສີຫຼັກ\", ແຕ່ສີຫຼັກເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເອງອາດຈະເບິ່ງແຕກຕ່າງຈາກສິ່ງທີ່ມະນຸດເອີ້ນວ່າ \"ແດງ\", \"ຂຽວ\" ຫຼື \"ຟ້າ\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The filters described here are overlapping band-pass filters. Since they overlap, summing them back together would not preserve the energy of the original spectrum so (long story short) we need to dial them down with regard to the retina cone response\n"
msgstr "ຟິວເຕີທີ່ອະທິບາຍຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ແມ່ນຟິວເຕີແບບແຖບຜ່ານ (band-pass) ທີ່ຊ້ອນທັບກັນ. ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນຊ້ອນທັບກັນ, ການລວມພວກມັນຄືນເຂົ້າກັນຈະບໍ່ຮັກສາພະລັງງານຂອງສະເປັກຕຳເດີມໄວ້ ດັ່ງນັ້ນ (ສະຫຼຸບສັ້ນໆ) ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງປັບພວກມັນລົງຕາມການຕອບສະໜອງຂອງຈຸລັງຮູບຈວຍໃນຈໍປະສາດຕາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most of darktable's actual image processing takes place in a large RGB \"working profile\" space, with some (mostly older) modules internally working in the CIELab 1976 color space (often just called “Lab”). The final output of the image processing pipeline is once again in an RGB space shaped for either the monitor display or the output file.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ darktable ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນພື້ນທີ່ “ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການເຮັດວຽກ” RGB ຂະໜາດໃຫ"
"ຍ່, ໂດຍມີບາງໂມດູນ (ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນລຸ້ນເກົ່າ) ເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIELab 1976 (ມັກຈະເອີ້ນສັ້ນໆວ່າ “"
"Lab”). ຜົນລັດສຸດທ້າຍຂອງຂະບວນການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບແມ່ນຈະກັບມາຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ RGB ອີກຄັ້ງ ເຊິ່ງຖືກປັບຮູບແບບໃ"
"ຫ້ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບທັງການສະແດງຜົນໃນຈໍພາບ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This process implies that the pixelpipe has two fixed color conversion steps: [_input color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) and [_output color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md). In addition there is the [_demosaic_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md) step for raw images, where the colors of each pixel are reconstructed by interpolation.\n"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊລ (pixelpipe) ມີສອງຂັ້ນຕອນການແປງສີທີ່ຄົງທີ່: [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) ແລະ [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາອອກ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md). ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ຍັງມີຂັ້ນຕອນ [_ການແຍກສີ (demosaic)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md) ສຳລັບຮູບພາບ raw, ເຊິ່ງສີຂອງແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍການປະມານຄ່າ (interpolation).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each module has a position in the pixelpipe that tells you which color space the module lives in:\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະໂມດູນມີຕຳແໜ່ງໃນທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊລທີ່ບອກທ່ານວ່າໂມດູນນັ້ນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນກາມຸດສີໃດ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- up to [_demosaic_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md)\n"
": The raw image information does not yet constitute an \"image\" but merely \"data\" about the light captured by the camera. Each pixel carries a single intensity for one primary color, and camera primaries are very different from primaries used in models of human vision. Bear in mind that some of the modules in this part of the pipe can also act on non-raw input images in RGB format (with full information on all three color channels).\n"
msgstr ""
"- ຈົນຮອດ [_ການແຍກສີ (demosaic)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md)\n"
": ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ raw ຍັງບໍ່ທັນຖືວ່າເປັນ \"ຮູບພາບ\" ແຕ່ເປັນພຽງ \"ຂໍ້ມູນ\" ກ່ຽວກັບແສງທີ່ກ້ອງຈັບໄດ້. ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລຈະມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມດຽວສຳລັບສີຫຼັກໜຶ່ງສີ, ແລະ ສີຫຼັກຂອງກ້ອງແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍຈາກສີຫຼັກທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນແບບຈໍາລອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງມະນຸດ. ໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ ບາງໂມດູນໃນສ່ວນນີ້ຂອງທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນຍັງສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກັບຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ raw ໃນຮູບແບບ RGB (ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນຄົບຖ້ວນທັງສາມຊ່ອງສີ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- between [_demosaic_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md) and [_input color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md)\n"
": Image is in RGB format within the color space of the specific camera or input file.\n"
msgstr ""
"- ລະຫວ່າງ [_ການແຍກສີ (demosaic)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md) ແລະ [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md)\n"
": ຮູບພາບຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ RGB ພາຍໃນກາມຸດສີຂອງກ້ອງສະເພາະ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- between [_input color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) and [_output color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md)\n"
": Image is in the color space defined by the selected working profile (linear Rec. 2020 RGB by default). As darktable processes images in 4x32-bit floating point buffers, we can handle large working color spaces without risking banding or tonal breaks.\n"
msgstr ""
"- ລະຫວ່າງ [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) ແລະ [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາອອກ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md)\n"
": ຮູບພາບຈະຢູ່ໃນກາມຸດສີທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເຮັດວຽກທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ (ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ Rec. 2020 RGB ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່). ເນື່ອງຈາກ darktable ປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບໃນບັບເຟີເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ 4x32-bit, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງສາມາດຈັດການກັບກາມຸດສີເຮັດວຽກຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ່ຽງຕໍ່ການເກີດແຖບສີ (banding) ຫຼື ສີທີ່ບໍ່ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (tonal breaks).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-spaces.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- after [_output color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md)\n"
": Image is in RGB format as defined by the selected display or output ICC profile.\n"
msgstr ""
"- ຫຼັງຈາກ [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາອອກ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md)\n"
": ຮູບພາບຈະຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ RGB ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC ຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນ ຫຼື ຜົນລັບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "rendering intent"
msgstr "ຈຸດປະສົງການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering intent)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If rendering with LittleCMS2 is activated (see [rendering method](./rendering-method.md)) you can define how to handle out-of-gamut colors when converting between color spaces. A selection box in the [export](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md), [_output color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md), and [soft proof](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md) modules gives you a choice of the following rendering intents:\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າການສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍ LittleCMS2 ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ (ເບິ່ງ [ວິທີການສະແດງຜົນ](./rendering-method.md)) ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດວິທີການຈັດການກັບສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກກາມຸດເມື່ອມີການແປງລະຫວ່າງກາມຸດສີ. ກ່ອງເລືອກໃນໂມດູນ [ການສົ່ງອອກ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md), [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາອອກ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md), ແລະ [ການກວດສອບກ່ອນພິມ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md) ຈະໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກຈຸດປະສົງການສະແດງຜົນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"perceptual \t\n"
": Best suited to photographs as it maintains the relative position of colors. This is usually the best choice.\n"
msgstr ""
"ທາງການຮັບຮູ້ (perceptual) \t\n"
": ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຮູບຖ່າຍ ເພາະມັນຮັກສາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງສີໄວ້. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວນີ້ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"relative colorimetric \t\n"
": Out-of-gamut colors are converted to colors having the same lightness, but different saturation. Other colors remain unmodified.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການວັດແທກສີແບບທຽບຖານ (relative colorimetric) \t\n"
": ສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກກາມຸດຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນສີທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ປັບແກ້ດຽວກັນ, ແຕ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຕ່າງກັນ. ສີອື່ນໆຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saturation \t\n"
": Saturation is retained but lightness is slightly changed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ (saturation) \t\n"
": ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ແຕ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"absolute colorimetric \t\n"
": Keep the white point. \n"
msgstr ""
"ການວັດແທກສີແບບສຳບູນ (absolute colorimetric) \t\n"
": ຮັກສາຈຸດສີຂາວໄວ້. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid " darktable employs a fully color managed workflow:\n"
msgstr " darktable ນຳໃຊ້ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຈັດການສີຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/color-management/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Input color specifications are taken from embedded or user-supplied ICC profiles or (in the case of raw files) from a library of camera-specific color matrices.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດສີຂາເຂົ້າແມ່ນມາຈາກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC ທີ່ຝັງມາ ຫຼື ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະໜອງໃຫ້ ຫຼື (ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງໄຟລ໌ raw) ມາຈາກຄັງເກັບເມທຣິກສີສະເພາະຂອງກ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/color-management/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable automatically reads the display profile of your monitor (if properly configured) for accurate on-screen color rendition. Multiple-screen setups are fully supported as long as a system service like colord is in place and properly configured to inform darktable of the correct monitor profile.\n"
msgstr "darktable ຈະອ່ານໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈໍສະແດງຜົນຂອງມໍນິເຕີຂອງທ່ານໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຖ້າຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ) ເພື່ອການສະແດງສີໃນໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍໜ້າຈໍແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນຢ່າງເຕັມສ່ວນ ຕາບໃດທີ່ບໍລິການລະບົບເຊັ່ນ colord ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອແຈ້ງໃຫ້ darktable ຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ມໍນິເຕີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/color-management/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Output files can be encoded in one of darktable's built-in profiles, including sRGB and Adobe RGB, or into a color space supplied by the user as an ICC profile.\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກສາມາດຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃນຕົວຂອງ darktable, ລວມທັງ sRGB ແລະ Adobe RGB, ຫຼື ເຂົ້າໃນກາມຸດສີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-artifacts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "possible color artifacts"
msgstr "ສິ່ງປົນເປື້ອນທາງສີທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-artifacts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are some infrequent situations that still can lead to problematic results unless the user takes some action. Some modules in Lab color space, like [_levels_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/levels.md) and [_monochrome_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/monochrome.md), rely on the fact that the L channels carries all lightness information, with the a and b channels purely representing chroma and hue. Unbounded colors with negative L values are especially problematic to these modules and can lead to black pixel artifacts.\n"
msgstr "ມີບາງສະຖານະການທີ່ພົບບໍ່ເລື້ອຍເຊິ່ງອາດນຳໄປສູ່ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ມີບັນຫາ ນອກຈາກວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງ. ບາງໂມດູນໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ Lab, ເຊັ່ນ [_levels_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/levels.md) ແລະ [_monochrome_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/monochrome.md), ແມ່ນອີງຕາມຄວາມຈິງທີ່ວ່າຊ່ອງ L ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທັງໝົດໄວ້, ໂດຍທີ່ຊ່ອງ a ແລະ b ຈະສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມສົດຂອງສີ (chroma) ແລະ ເສດສີ (hue) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສີທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດທີ່ມີຄ່າ L ເປັນລົບແມ່ນມີບັນຫາເປັນພິເສດສຳລັບໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ແລະ ສາມາດນຳໄປສູ່ການເກີດສິ່ງປົນເປື້ອນເມັດສີດຳ (black pixel artifacts).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-artifacts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It has been found that highly saturated blue light sources in the image frame are likely candidates for pixels with negative L values. If you are engaged in stage photography you should pay close attention to such lights appearing in images.\n"
msgstr "ພົບວ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງສີຟ້າທີ່ມີຄວາມສົດສູງໃນເຟຣມຮູບພາບ ມີໂອກາດທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເມັດສີທີ່ມີຄ່າ L ເປັນລົບ. ຖ້າທ່ານຖ່າຍຮູບການສະແດງເທິງເວທີ ທ່ານຄວນເອົາໃຈໃສ່ເປັນພິເສດຕໍ່ແສງດັ່ງກ່າວທີ່ປະກົດໃນຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-artifacts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to mitigate this issue the [_input color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) module has a gamut clipping option. This option is switched off by default but can be activated if artifacts are observed. Depending on the settings, colors will be confined to one of the available RGB gamuts. In effect black pixel artifacts are prevented at the costs of losing some color dynamics.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນບັນຫານີ້ ໂມດູນ [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) ຈຶ່ງມີຕົວເລືອກການຕັດຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut clipping). ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກປິດໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແຕ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຖ້າສັງເກດເຫັນສິ່ງປົນເປື້ອນ. ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ສີຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດສີ RGB ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງທີ່ມີຢູ່. ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການເກີດເມັດສີດຳໄດ້ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບການສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດບາງຢ່າງຂອງສີ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable's color dimensions"
msgstr "ມິຕິຂອງສີໃນ darktable"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section defines the perceptual properties of color, both conceptually and quantitatively, in order to characterize and quantify the creative and corrective adjustments made to color in darktable.\n"
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງສີ, ທັງໃນທາງແນວຄິດ ແລະ ໃນທາງປະລິມານ, ເພື່ອລະບຸລັກສະນະ ແລະ ວັດແທກການປັບແຕ່ງສີທີ່ສ້າງສັນ ແລະ ການປັບແກ້ສີໃນ darktable.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "definitions"
msgstr "ຄຳນິຍາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Color properties like \"saturation\", \"brightness\" or \"lightness\" have passed into common usage but are largely misused and often used to mean different things. In color science, each of these terms has a precise meaning.\n"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງສີເຊັ່ນ \"ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ (saturation)\", \"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (brightness)\" ຫຼື \"ຄວາມຂາວ-ດຳ (lightness)\" ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ ແຕ່ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ຜິດ ແລະ ມັກຈະໃຊ້ໃນຄວາມໝາຍທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ໃນວິທະຍາສາດເລື່ອງສີ, ແຕ່ລະຄຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຄວາມໝາຍທີ່ຊັດເຈນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two frameworks within which color properties may be analyzed and described:\n"
msgstr "ມີສອງໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ວິເຄາະ ແລະ ອະທິບາຍຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງສີໄດ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A scene-linear, physiological, framework, that mostly focuses on the response of the retina cone cells, using color spaces such as CIE XYZ 1931 or CIE LMS 2006,\n"
msgstr "- ໂຄງສ້າງທາງສະລີລະວິທະຍາແບບຊີ້ນ-ລີເນຍ (scene-linear), ເຊິ່ງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ເນັ້ນໃສ່ການຕອບສະໜອງຂອງຈຸລັງຮັບແສງໃນຈໍປະສາດຕາ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີເຊັ່ນ CIE XYZ 1931 ຫຼື CIE LMS 2006,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A perceptual, psychological, framework that stacks the brain's corrections on top of the retina signal, using color spaces such as CIE Lab 1976, CIE Luv 1976, CIE CAM 2016 and JzAzBz (2017).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງຮ່າງການຮັບຮູ້ທາງຈິດຕະວິທະຍາ ທີ່ນຳເອົາການປັບແກ້ຂອງສະໝອງມາຊ້ອນທັບກັບສັນຍານຈາກຈໍປະສາດຕາ, ໂດຍນ"
"ຳໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ ເຊັ່ນ: CIE Lab 1976, CIE Luv 1976, CIE CAM 2016 ແລະ JzAzBz (2017).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These two frameworks provide us with metrics and dimensions to analyze color and allow us to change some of its properties while preserving others. \n"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງທັງສອງນີ້ໃຫ້ຕົວຊີ້ວັດ ແລະ ມິຕິແກ່ພວກເຮົາເພື່ອວິເຄາະສີ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດບາງຢ່າງຂອງມັນໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາຄຸນສົມບັດອື່ນໆໄວ້. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following dimensions of color are used by darktable:\n"
msgstr "ມິຕິຂອງສີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍ darktable:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hue\n"
": An attribute of visual perception in which an area appears to be similar to one of the colors red, yellow, green, or blue, or to a combination of adjacent pairs of these colors considered in a closed ring. [^1] Hue is a shared property between the perceptual and scene-linear frameworks.\n"
msgstr ""
"hue (ເສດສີ/ສີສັນ)\n"
": ແມ່ນຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງການຮັບຮູ້ດ້ວຍສາຍຕາ ເຊິ່ງພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງປະກົດວ່າຄ້າຍຄືກັບສີໃດໜຶ່ງໃນສີ ແດງ, ເຫຼືອງ, ຂຽວ ຫຼື ຟ້າ, ຫຼື ການປະສົມກັນຂອງຄູ່ສີທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນໃນວົງລໍ້ສີ. [^1] Hue ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງໂຄງສ້າງການຮັບຮູ້ (perceptual) ແລະ ໂຄງສ້າງຊີ້ນ-ລີເນຍ (scene-linear).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"luminance\n"
": The density of luminous intensity with respect to a projected area in a specified direction at a specified point on a real or imaginary surface. [^2] Luminance is a property of scene-referred frameworks, and is expressed by the Y channel of the CIE XYZ 1931 space.\n"
msgstr ""
"luminance (ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ/ຄວາມເຂັ້ມແສງ)\n"
": ແມ່ນຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງຄວາມເຂັ້ມແສງທີ່ສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງເມື່ອທຽບກັບພື້ນທີ່ໃນທິດທາງທີ່ກຳນົດ ຢູ່ຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງເທິງພື້ນຜິວຈິງ ຫຼື ພື້ນຜິວສົມມຸດ. [^2] Luminance ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂຄງສ້າງແບບ scene-referred, ແລະ ຖືກສະແດງອອກໂດຍຊ່ອງ Y ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE XYZ 1931.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"brightness\n"
": An attribute of visual perception according to which an area appears to emit, transmit or reflect more or less light. [^4]\n"
msgstr ""
"brightness (ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ/ຄວາມແຈ້ງ)\n"
": ແມ່ນຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງການຮັບຮູ້ດ້ວຍສາຍຕາ ເຊິ່ງພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງປະກົດວ່າມີການປ່ອຍ, ສົ່ງຜ່ານ ຫຼື ສະທ້ອນແສງອອກມາຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍ. [^4]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lightness\n"
": The brightness of an area judged relative to the brightness of a similarly illuminated area that appears to be white or highly transmitting. [^3] Lightness is the perceptual, non-linear homologue of luminance (roughly equal to the cubic root of luminance Y). Lightness is expressed by the L channel in CIE Lab and Luv 1976 and the J channel in JzAzBz.\n"
msgstr ""
"lightness (ຄວາມຂາວ-ດຳ/ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສຳພັດ)\n"
": ແມ່ນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕັດສິນເມື່ອທຽບກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ອື່ນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແສງຄ້າຍຄືກັນ ເຊິ່ງປະກົດວ່າເປັນສີຂາວ ຫຼື ມີການສົ່ງຜ່ານແສງສູງ. [^3] Lightness ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດການຮັບຮູ້ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ luminance (ມີຄ່າປະມານຮາກຂັ້ນສາມຂອງ luminance Y). Lightness ຖືກສະແດງອອກໂດຍຊ່ອງ L ໃນ CIE Lab ແລະ Luv 1976 ແລະ ຊ່ອງ J ໃນ JzAzBz.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"chroma\n"
": The colorfulness of an area judged as a proportion of the brightness of a similarly illuminated area that appears gray, white or highly transmitting. [^5] _Warning: chroma is not short for chrominance, which is the color part of a video signal (the Cb and Cr channels in YCbCr, for example)._\n"
msgstr ""
"chroma (ຄວາມສົດສີ/ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດສີ)\n"
": ແມ່ນຄວາມສົດຂອງສີໃນພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕັດສິນເປັນສັດສ່ວນກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ອື່ນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແສງຄ້າຍຄືກັນ ເຊິ່ງປະກົດວ່າເປັນສີເທົາ, ສີຂາວ ຫຼື ມີການສົ່ງຜ່ານແສງສູງ. [^5] _ຄຳເຕືອນ: chroma ບໍ່ແມ່ນຄຳຫຍໍ້ຂອງ chrominance, ເຊິ່ງເປັນສ່ວນຂອງສີໃນສັນຍານວິດີໂອ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຊ່ອງ Cb ແລະ Cr ໃນ YCbCr)._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"brilliance\n"
": The brightness of an area judged relative to the brightness of its surroundings. [^6]\n"
msgstr ""
"brilliance (ຄວາມສຸກໃສ/ຄວາມເດັ່ນ)\n"
": ແມ່ນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕັດສິນເມື່ອທຽບກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສິ່ງແວດລ້ອມອ້ອມຂ້າງ. [^6]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saturation\n"
": The colorfulness of an area judged in proportion to its brightness. [^7]\n"
msgstr ""
"saturation (ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ)\n"
": ແມ່ນຄວາມສົດຂອງສີໃນພື້ນທີ່ໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕັດສິນເປັນສັດສ່ວນກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຕົວມັນເອງ. [^7]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"purity\n"
": The distance of the pixel chromaticity from the white point in the _xy_ chromaticity plane. Zero purity means the light is achromatic. High purity, at the other extreme, means the light is laser-like, composed of a single wavelength.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດ (purity)\n"
": ແມ່ນໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອງຄຸນລັກສະນະສີ (chromaticity) ຂອງພິກເຊລ ຈາກຈຸດສີຂາວໃນລະນາບຄຸນລັກສະນະສີ _xy_. ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດເປັນສູນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແສງນັ້ນບໍ່ມີສີ (achromatic). ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດສູງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແສງນັ້ນມີລັກສະນະຄືກັບເລເຊີ, ເຊິ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍຄວາມຍາວຄື້ນດຽວ.\n"

