#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "how AI features work"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This page covers what goes on under the hood: the inference library darktable loads, the execution providers available to it, and how models are stored and activated.\n"
msgstr "ໜ້ານີ້ອະທິບາຍສິ່ງທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນພາຍໃນ: ໄລບຣາຣີການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ darktable ໂຫລດ, ຕົວປະມວນຜົນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້, ແລະ ວິທີການເກັບຮັກສາພ້ອມທັງເປີດໃຊ້ໂມເດວ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the inference runtime"
msgstr "runtime ສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable loads models through [ONNX Runtime](https://onnxruntime.ai/) – a production-grade inference library originally developed at Microsoft and now governed by the [Linux Foundation](https://www.linuxfoundation.org/) – that accepts models in the [ONNX](https://onnx.ai/) open format. ONNX is the de-facto standard for interchanging machine-learning models across frameworks (PyTorch, TensorFlow, etc.) so we can take a model trained in any of them, export it to ONNX, and run it from darktable without carrying its training framework along.\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable ໂຫຼດໂມເດວຜ່ານ [ONNX Runtime](https://onnxruntime.ai/) – ໄລບຣາຣີການລັນ "
"(inference library) ລະດັບການຜະລິດທີ່ພັດທະນາໂດຍ Microsoft ແລະ ຕອນນີ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ການເບິ່ງແຍງຂອ"
"ງ [Linux Foundation](https://www.linuxfoundation.org/) – ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບໂມເດວໃນຮູບແບບ"
"ເປີດ [ONNX](https://onnx.ai/). ONNX ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານຫຼັກສຳລັບການແລກປ່ຽນໂມເດວການຮຽນຮູ້ຂອງເ"
"ຄື່ອງ (machine-learning) ຂ້າມເຟຣມເວີກ (PyTorch, TensorFlow, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ດັ່ງນັ້ນພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງ"
"ສາມາດນຳໂມເດວທີ່ຝຶກມາໃນເຟຣມເວີກໃດກໍໄດ້, ສົ່ງອອກເປັນ ONNX, ແລະ ລັນມັນຈາກ darktable ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້"
"ອງເອົາເຟຣມເວີກທີ່ໃຊ້ຝຶກມັນມານຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Only one ONNX Runtime library is loaded per darktable process. It is picked in this order:\n"
msgstr "ມີພຽງໄລບຣາຣີ ONNX Runtime ດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກໂຫລດຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງຂະບວນການຂອງ darktable. ໂດຍຈະຖືກເລືອກຕາມລຳດັບດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the _ONNX Runtime library_ field in [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) points at a file (or the `DT_ORT_LIBRARY` environment variable does), that library is loaded instead.\n"
msgstr "1. ຖ້າຟີວ _ONNX Runtime library_ ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) ລະບຸໄປທີ່ໄຟລ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງ (ຫຼື ຜ່ານຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ `DT_ORT_LIBRARY`), ໄລບຣາຣີນັ້ນຈະຖືກໂຫລດແທນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Otherwise, the bundled runtime that ships with darktable is loaded from the installation directory.\n"
msgstr "2. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, runtime ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ darktable ຈະຖືກໂຫລດຈາກໂຟນເດີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bundled runtime is CPU-only on Linux, DirectML-enabled on Windows, and CoreML-enabled on macOS. That makes every install functional out of the box. If you want NVIDIA, AMD or Intel GPU acceleration on Linux or Windows, you replace the library with a GPU-enabled build – see [GPU acceleration](./gpu-acceleration/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Runtime ທີ່ໃຫ້ມານຳແມ່ນຮອງຮັບແຕ່ CPU ເທົ່ານັ້ນໃນ Linux, ຮອງຮັບ DirectML ໃນ Windows, ແລະ ຮ"
"ອງຮັບ CoreML ໃນ macOS. ສິ່ງນັ້ນເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງທຸກອັນສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ທັນທີ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການການເລັ່ງຄ"
"ວາມໄວ GPU ຂອງ NVIDIA, AMD ຫຼື Intel ໃນ Linux ຫຼື Windows, ທ່ານຕ້ອງປ່ຽນໄລບຣາຣີດ້ວຍເວີຊັນທີ່"
"ຮອງຮັບ GPU – ເບິ່ງ [ການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວ GPU](./gpu-acceleration/).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "execution providers"
msgstr "ຕົວປະມວນຜົນ (execution providers)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An _execution provider_ (EP) is an ONNX Runtime back-end for a specific hardware accelerator – darktable's _AI acceleration_ preference is this concept. A single ONNX Runtime library can ship with multiple providers; which ones actually work depends on which are compiled into the library and which are available on your system. The preference combo lists only those the currently-loaded library supports:\n"
msgstr ""
"_ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການການປະມວນຜົນ_ (execution provider ຫຼື EP) ແມ່ນສ່ວນຫຼັງບ້ານຂອງ ONNX Runtime ສຳ"
"ລັບຕົວເລັ່ງຮາດແວສະເພາະ – ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _AI acceleration_ ໃນ darktable ກໍຄືແນວຄິດນີ້ເອງ. ໄລບຣ"
"າຣີ ONNX Runtime ອັນດຽວສາມາດມີຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການໄດ້ຫຼາຍອັນ; ອັນໃດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ແທ້ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າອັນໃດຖືກລວ"
"ບລວມເຂົ້າໃນໄລບຣາຣີ ແລະ ອັນໃດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ. ຊ່ອງເລືອກໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະສະແດງພຽງແຕ່ອັນທີ່ໄລບຣາ"
"ຣີທີ່ໂຫຼດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**auto** – let ONNX Runtime pick the best provider at inference time, with CPU as the ultimate fallback. Recommended unless you have a reason to override.\n"
msgstr ""
"**auto** – ໃຫ້ ONNX Runtime ເລືອກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນເວລາລັນ, ໂດຍມີ CPU ເປັນທາງເລືອກສຳຮອ"
"ງສຸດທ້າຍ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ນອກຈາກວ່າທ່ານມີເຫດຜົນທີ່ຈະກຳນົດເອງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**CPU** – always available. Fine for object-mask and occasional denoise/upscale. Slow for interactive work and for upscale at 4x.\n"
msgstr ""
"**CPU** – ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເໝີ. ເໝາະສຳລັບການເຮັດໜ້າກາກວັດຖຸ ແລະ ການ denoise/upscale ເປັນບາງຄັ້ງຄ"
"າວ. ຊ້າສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ ແລະ ສຳລັບການ upscale ທີ່ 4x.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**NVIDIA CUDA** – NVIDIA GPUs on Linux/Windows. Requires a CUDA-enabled ONNX Runtime and the matching CUDA toolkit + cuDNN 9.x on your system.\n"
msgstr ""
"**NVIDIA CUDA** – GPU ຂອງ NVIDIA ໃນ Linux/Windows. ຕ້ອງການ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຮອງຮັ"
"ບ CUDA ແລະ ຊຸດເຄື່ອງມື CUDA ທີ່ກົງກັນ + cuDNN 9.x ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**AMD MIGraphX** – AMD GPUs on Linux. Requires a MIGraphX-enabled ONNX Runtime and a ROCm 6.3+ install. Not supported on Windows.\n"
msgstr ""
"**AMD MIGraphX** – GPU ຂອງ AMD ໃນ Linux. ຕ້ອງການ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ MIGraphX "
"ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ROCm 6.3+. ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນ Windows.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Intel OpenVINO** – Intel integrated and discrete GPUs on Linux/Windows. The OpenVINO runtime is bundled with the installed package – no separate install needed beyond an up-to-date Intel GPU driver.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Intel OpenVINO** – GPU ໃນຕົວ ແລະ ແຍກຂອງ Intel ໃນ Linux/Windows. Runtime ຂອງ "
"OpenVINO ແມ່ນມາພ້ອມກັບແພັກເກັດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ – ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງຫຍັງເພີ່ມເຕີມ ນອກຈາກໄດຣເວີ GPU ຂອງ "
"Intel ທີ່ເປັນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Windows DirectML** – any DirectX-12-capable GPU on Windows. Good fallback when a vendor-specific provider is impractical. Bundled.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Windows DirectML** – GPU ໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຮອງຮັບ DirectX-12 ໃນ Windows. ເປັນທາງເລືອກສຳຮອ"
"ງທີ່ດີເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການສະເພາະຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້. ມາພ້ອມກັບແອັບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Apple CoreML** – Apple Silicon (Neural Engine and GPU) and recent Intel Macs. Bundled.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Apple CoreML** – Apple Silicon (Neural Engine ແລະ GPU) ແລະ ເຄື່ອງ Mac ທີ່ໃຊ້ "
"Intel ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ໆ. ມາພ້ອມກັບແອັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first time a GPU provider runs a given model, it compiles an optimised version of the model graph for your specific hardware. How long this takes varies a lot by provider: CUDA and DirectML are typically a few seconds; AMD MIGraphX can take **5 to 30 minutes** on the first run of each model, depending on the GPU and the model size. Subsequent uses reuse the compiled graph and run at full speed.\n"
msgstr "ຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ຕົວປະມວນຜົນ GPU ລັນໂມເດວໃດໜຶ່ງ, ມັນຈະຄອມໄພລ໌ກຣາຟຂອງໂມເດວທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາໃຫ້ເໝາະກັບຮາດແວຂອງທ່ານ. ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຕົວປະມວນຜົນ: CUDA ແລະ DirectML ມັກຈະໃຊ້ເວລາບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດວິນາທີ; ແຕ່ AMD MIGraphX ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາ **5 ຫາ 30 ນາທີ** ໃນການລັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດຂອງແຕ່ລະໂມເດວ. ການໃຊ້ງານຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປຈະນຳກຣາຟທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ແລ້ວມາໃຊ້ຄືນ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກດ້ວຍຄວາມໄວສູງສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each AI feature is backed by one or more models per [task](./overview/#tasks). A model is a directory containing an ONNX file and a small `config.json` with metadata (name, task, description, licensing information). Models live under:\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ແມ່ນຮອງຮັບດ້ວຍໂມເດວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ [ໜ້າທີ່ (task)](./overview/#tasks). ໂມເດວແມ່ນໂຟນເດີທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ ONNX ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ `config.json` ນ້ອຍໆທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບໂມເດວ (ຊື່, ໜ້າທີ່, ລາຍລະອຽດ, ຂໍ້ມູນລິຂະສິດ). ໂມເດວຖືກເກັບໄວ້ທີ່:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Linux: `~/.local/share/darktable/models/`\n"
msgstr "Linux: `~/.local/share/darktable/models/`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/darktable/models/`\n"
msgstr "macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/darktable/models/`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Windows: `%APPDATA%\\darktable\\models\\`\n"
msgstr "Windows: `%APPDATA%\\darktable\\models\\`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable scans this directory at startup (and whenever you change models in preferences) to discover what is available. Multiple models can be installed for the same task – for denoise, for example, you might have both the NIND-trained and NAFNet-trained options on disk at once. Only one can be _active_ per task at any time; ticking the enabled checkbox on a second model of the same task automatically un-ticks the previously active one. Modules that consume that task load the model currently marked active.\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable ຈະສະແກນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ເມື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ແລະ ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານປ່ຽນໂມເດວໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ) ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາສິ່ງທີ່ມີ"
"ຢູ່. ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໂມເດວຫຼາຍອັນສຳລັບໜ້າທີ່ດຽວກັນໄດ້ – ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສຳລັບການ denoise, ທ່ານອາດຈະມີທັງຕົວເ"
"ລືອກທີ່ຝຶກດ້ວຍ NIND ແລະ NAFNet ຢູ່ໃນດິສກ໌ພ້ອມກັນ. ສາມາດມີພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ _ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່_ ຕໍ່ໜ້າທີ່ໃນແຕ່"
"ລະຄັ້ງ; ການໝາຍໃນຊ່ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນໂມເດວທີສອງຂອງໜ້າທີ່ດຽວກັນຈະຍົກເລີກການໝາຍອັນທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ງານກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້"
"ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໂມດູນທີ່ໃຊ້ໜ້າທີ່ນັ້ນຈະໂຫຼດໂມເດວທີ່ຖືກໝາຍວ່າໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Models are not bundled with darktable. They are distributed as `.dtmodel` packages from the [darktable-ai](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable-ai/releases) companion repository. The [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) tab includes buttons to download the default set directly; for additional per-task models (alternative denoisers, segmentation backbones, etc.), download the `.dtmodel` from the repository's releases page and install it via the _install model_ button in the same tab.\n"
msgstr "ໂມເດວບໍ່ໄດ້ມາພ້ອມກັບ darktable. ພວກມັນຖືກແຈກຢາຍເປັນແພັກເກດ `.dtmodel` ຈາກບ່ອນເກັບ [darktable-ai](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable-ai/releases). ໃນແທັບ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) ຈະມີປຸ່ມໃຫ້ດາວໂຫລດຊຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ; ສຳລັບໂມເດວເພີ່ມເຕີມອື່ນໆ, ທ່ານສາມາດດາວໂຫລດ `.dtmodel` ຈາກໜ້າ releases ຂອງບ່ອນເກັບນັ້ນ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານປຸ່ມ _install model_ ໃນແທັບດຽວກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable uses machine learning models for a handful of image-processing tasks: interactive object masking, denoising, upscaling, etc. This section explains how those features work end-to-end – what runs where, which models exist, how inference is accelerated, and what the user's choices in the [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) actually control.\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable ໃຊ້ໂມເດວການຮຽນຮູ້ຂອງເຄື່ອງສຳລັບວຽກການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ: ການເຮັດໜ້າກາກວັດຖຸແ"
"ບບໂຕ້ຕອບ, ການຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບກວນ (denoising), ການຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດ (upscaling) ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ສ່ວນ"
"ນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວ່າຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດແບບຄົບວົງຈອນ – ອັນໃດລັນຢູ່ໃສ, ມີໂມເດວໃດແດ່, ການລັນຖືກເ"
"ລັ່ງຄວາມໄວແນວໃດ, ແລະ ສິ່ງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI](../../../preferences-settings/"
"ai.md) ນັ້ນຄວບຄຸມຫຍັງແທ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI features are opt-in. They are off by default in a fresh install and can be toggled with a single preference at any time.\n"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ແມ່ນຕ້ອງເລືອກເປີດໃຊ້ເອງ. ພວກມັນຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່ ແລະ ສາມາດເປີດປິດໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI features also have to be present in the darktable binary. The official builds (Linux AppImage, Windows installer, macOS dmg) all include them. Third-party packagers may ship a build without AI support – in that case the _AI_ tab is absent from preferences entirely. Ask your distribution's package maintainer to enable AI support, or use an official build.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ຕ້ອງມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ບີນາຣີ (binary) ຂອງ darktable. ຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງທາງການ (Linux "
"AppImage, Windows installer, macOS dmg) ແມ່ນລວມເອົາຄຸນສົມບັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້ທັງໝົດ. ຜູ້ຈັດເຮັດຊຸດຕິດ"
"ຕັ້ງພາຍນອກອາດຈະສະໜອງຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ບໍ່ມີການຮອງຮັບ AI – ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ແຖບ _AI_ ຈະບໍ່ປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນສ່ວນ"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (preferences) ເລີຍ. ໃຫ້ສອບຖາມຜູ້ດູແລຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງລະບົບ (distribution) ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ເພື່ອ"
"ເປີດການຮອງຮັບ AI ຫຼື ໃຊ້ຊຸດຕິດຕັ້ງທາງການ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "what the AI features do"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ເຮັດຫຍັງໄດ້ແດ່"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tasks"
msgstr "ໜ້າທີ່ (tasks)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A _task_ is a capability slot inside darktable – \"produce a mask around the clicked subject\", \"denoise an RGB image\", and so on. Tasks are decoupled from the model that implements them: multiple competing models can live on disk for the same task (the NIND denoiser, the NAFNet denoiser, an experimental third…), but only one of them is _active_ for that task at any given time, and that's the one darktable's modules consume. Switching active model is a one-click toggle in [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) and requires no changes to any module – the consumer just asks for \"the active denoise model\" and gets whichever you chose.\n"
msgstr ""
"_ໜ້າທີ່ (task)_ ແມ່ນຊ່ອງຄວາມສາມາດພາຍໃນ darktable – \"ສ້າງໜ້າກາກອ້ອມຮອບວັດຖຸທີ່ຄລິກ\", \"ຫຼຸດ"
"ສັນຍານລົບກວນຮູບພາບ RGB\", ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ໜ້າທີ່ຕ່າງໆຈະແຍກອອກຈາກໂມເດວທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ມັນ: ໂມເດວທີ່ແຂ່ງຂັນກັນ"
"ຫຼາຍອັນສາມາດຢູ່ໃນດິສກ໌ສຳລັບໜ້າທີ່ດຽວກັນ (ຕົວຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບກວນ NIND, ຕົວຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບກວນ NAFNet, ອັນທີ"
"ສາມທີ່ເປັນຕົວທົດລອງ…), ແຕ່ຈະມີພຽງອັນດຽວໃນນັ້ນທີ່ _ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່_ ສຳລັບໜ້າທີ່ນັ້ນໃນເວລາໃດໜຶ່ງ, ແລະ ນັ້ນຄືອັນທີ່"
"ໂມດູນຂອງ darktable ຈະນຳໄປໃຊ້. ການປ່ຽນໂມເດວທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ແມ່ນການສະຫຼັບພຽງຄລິກດຽວໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"AI](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆກັບໂມດູນ – ຕົ"
"ວນຳໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຖາມຫາ \"ໂມເດວ denoise ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່\" ແລະ ກໍຈະໄດ້ອັນໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This setup allows for flexibility so the model repository can publish alternative or improved models without darktable needing to know about them ahead of time: pick the model in preferences and every consumer of that task picks it up automatically.\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບ່ອນເກັບໂມເດວສາມາດເຜີຍແຜ່ໂມເດວທາງເລືອກ ຫຼື ໂມເດວທີ່ປັບປຸງໃໝ່ໄດ້ ໂດຍທີ່ darktable ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຮູ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ: ພຽງແຕ່ເລືອກໂມເດວໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລ້ວທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ໃຊ້ໜ້າທີ່ນັ້ນຈະອັບເດດຕາມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable currently exposes four tasks:\n"
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນ darktable ມີສີ່ໜ້າທີ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mask\n"
": Interactive object segmentation. Click on a subject in the darkroom and the model produces a mask around it, vectorised into a group of path shapes that can be edited like any other drawn shape. Used by the [AI object](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/ai-masking.md) drawn-mask shape to select regions without drawing by hand. Powered by models such as SAM 2.1 and SegNext.\n"
msgstr ""
"mask (ໜ້າກາກ)\n"
": ການແຍກສ່ວນວັດຖຸແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ. ພຽງແຕ່ຄລິກໃສ່ວັດຖຸໃນຫ້ອງມືດ ແລ້ວໂມເດວຈະສ້າງໜ້າກາກອ້ອມຮອບມັນ, ປ່ຽນເປັນກຸ່ມຮູບຊົງທີ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຄືກັບການແຕ້ມເອງ. ໃຊ້ໂດຍຮູບຊົງ [AI object](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/ai-masking.md) ເພື່ອເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງແຕ້ມດ້ວຍມື. ຂັບເຄື່ອນດ້ວຍໂມເດວ ເຊັ່ນ SAM 2.1 ແລະ SegNext.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"denoise\n"
": Machine-learning RGB denoise as an alternative to the classical denoise modules. Operates on already demosaiced RGB image data, trained on pairs of noisy and clean images. Removes sensor noise without the blocky or smoothed look that can come from traditional filters. Used by the [neural restore](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md) module's _denoise_ tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"denoise (ລົບສັນຍານລົບ)\n"
": ການລົບສັນຍານລົບໃນຮູບ RGB ດ້ວຍ machine-learning ເພື່ອເປັນທາງເລືອກແທນໂມດູນແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. ເຮັດວຽກກັບຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ RGB ທີ່ຜ່ານການ demosaic ແລ້ວ. ມັນຊ່ວຍລົບສັນຍານລົບໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບເບິ່ງຄືຖືກເບຼີ ຫຼື ເປັນກ້ອນຄືກັບຟິວເຕີທົ່ວໄປ. ໃຊ້ໃນແທັບ _denoise_ ຂອງໂມດູນ [neural restore](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rawdenoise\n"
": Machine-learning denoise applied directly to the raw CFA mosaic before demosaic, with denoise and demosaic combined into a single inference pass. Saved out as a LinearRaw DNG and re-imported, so downstream darkroom processing is unchanged. Useful when sensor noise needs to be addressed before the demosaic algorithm runs. Used by the [neural restore](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md) module's _raw denoise_ tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"rawdenoise (ລົບສັນຍານລົບຈາກໄຟລ໌ Raw)\n"
": ການລົບສັນຍານລົບດ້ວຍ machine-learning ໂດຍກົງໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນ Raw ກ່ອນການ demosaic. ຜົນລັອກຈະຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນ LinearRaw DNG ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນໃນຫ້ອງມືດຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ. ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອຕ້ອງການຈັດການສັນຍານລົບກ່ອນຂະບວນການ demosaic. ໃຊ້ໃນແທັບ _raw denoise_ ຂອງໂມດູນ [neural restore](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"upscale\n"
": 2x and 4x super-resolution, producing plausible detail from low-resolution inputs. Useful for small or cropped images where classical interpolation would blur. Used by the [neural restore](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md) module's _upscale_ tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"upscale (ຂະຫຍາຍຮູບ)\n"
": ການຂະຫຍາຍຮູບ 2 ເທົ່າ ແລະ 4 ເທົ່າ (super-resolution), ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ສົມຈິງຈາກຮູບທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຮູບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ຫຼື ຮູບທີ່ຖືກຕັດ (crop) ເຊິ່ງການຂະຫຍາຍແບບທົ່ວໄປຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບເບຼີ. ໃຊ້ໃນແທັບ _upscale_ ຂອງໂມດູນ [neural restore](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tasks run only when a user triggers them – there is no continuous AI activity in the background, no telemetry, and no cloud component. Everything runs locally on your machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວຽກງານຕ່າງໆຈະເຮັດວຽກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການສັ່ງການຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ – ບໍ່ມີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ AI ຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຢູ່ເບື້ອງ"
"ຫຼັງ, ບໍ່ມີການເກັບກຳຂໍ້ມູນການນຳໃຊ້, ແລະ ບໍ່ມີສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງລະບົບຄລາວ. ທຸກຢ່າງແມ່ນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ"
"ຂອງທ່ານເອງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "a note on accuracy"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຊັດເຈນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Like any machine-learning system, the AI features in darktable are not perfect. Every model has edge cases where its output will look worse than the classical alternative – unusual subjects, extreme exposures, or content far from what the model was trained on. This is intrinsic to how ML works, not a bug: 100% accuracy across all possible inputs is not something any model – ours or anyone else's – can offer.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບລະບົບການຮຽນຮູ້ຂອງເຄື່ອງອື່ນໆ, ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ໃນ darktable ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ສົມບູນແບບ. ທຸກໆໂມເ"
"ດວມີກໍລະນີທີ່ຜົນລັດຂອງມັນຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າແຍ່ກວ່າທາງເລືອກແບບດັ້ງເດີມ – ວັດຖຸທີ່ຜິດປົກກະຕິ, ລະດັບແສງທີ່ສູງຫຼາຍ, "
"ຫຼື ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກສິ່ງທີ່ໂມເດວຖືກຝຶກມາ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນທຳມະຊາດຂອງວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ ML, ບໍ່ແມ່ນບັກ "
"(bug): ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ 100% ໃນທຸກຂໍ້ມູນນຳເຂົ້າທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ໂມເດວໃດໆ – ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຂອງພວກເຮົ"
"າ ຫຼື ຂອງຄົນອື່ນ – ສາມາດໃຫ້ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What the models _can_ offer is consistently good results in the common cases they were designed for. The right mindset is to treat AI features as a tool that's usually better than the classical alternative, and to keep the classical modules available as a fallback on the few images where AI output is not. If you find a case where an AI model produces a noticeably poor result, please consider reporting it so the model can be improved over time.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງທີ່ແບບຈຳລອງ _ສາມາດ_ ມອບໃຫ້ໄດ້ ແມ່ນຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ດີຢ່າງສະໝໍ່າສະເໝີໃນກໍລະນີທົ່ວໄປທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກອອກແບບມ"
"າ. ແນວຄິດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງແມ່ນໃຫ້ຖືວ່າ ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ມັກຈະດີກວ່າທາງເລືອກແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ແລະ ໃຫ້ເກັບບັ"
"ນດາມໍດູນແບບດັ້ງເດີມໄວ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກສຳຮອງ ສຳລັບບາງຮູບພາບທີ່ຜົນອອກຈາກ AI ບໍ່ດີພໍ. ຖ້າທ່ານພົບກໍລະນີທີ່ແບບ"
"ຈຳລອງ AI ໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ບໍ່ດີຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ, ກະລຸນາພິຈາລະນາລາຍງານ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແບບຈຳລອງສາມາດຖືກປັບປຸງໃຫ້"
"ດີຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍໆ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "what darktable does _not_ do"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ darktable _ບໍ່_ ເຮັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable uses _narrow AI_ – small, task-specific models that run on your laptop and do one well-defined job (denoise, mask, upscale). It does **not** use the large generative models that can rewrite photographs – no sky replacement, no inserted objects, no style transfer, no synthesised content of any kind. The full scope is set out in the project's [AI Model Integration Policy](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/wiki/AI-Model-Integration-Policy); the governing principle is **scene integrity**: AI may correct technical defects of the capture, but it may not change what was in front of the camera.\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable ໃຊ້ _AI ແບບແຄບ (narrow AI)_ – ໂມເດວຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງກັບໜ້າທີ່ ເຊິ່ງລັນໃ"
"ນແລັບທັອບຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກໜຶ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຢ່າງດີ (denoise, mask, upscale). ມັນ **ບໍ່ໄດ້** ໃຊ້"
"ໂມເດວການສ້າງ (generative models) ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຮູບຖ່າຍໄດ້ – ບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນທ້ອງຟ້າ, "
"ບໍ່ມີການແຊກວັດຖຸ, ບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນສະໄຕລ໌ຮູບ, ບໍ່ມີເນື້ອຫາທີ່ສັງເຄາະຂຶ້ນມາໃດໆທັງສິ້ນ. ຂອບເຂດທັງໝົດແມ່ນໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົ"
"ດໄວ້ໃນ [ນະໂຍບາຍການຮວມໂມເດວ AI](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/"
"wiki/AI-Model-Integration-Policy) ຂອງໂຄງການ; ຫຼັກການຄຸ້ມຄອງແມ່ນ **ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງສາກ "
"(scene integrity)**: AI ອາດຈະປັບແກ້ຂໍ້ບົກພ່ອງທາງເຕັກນິກຂອງການຖ່າຍຮູບ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງສິ່ງທີ່ຢູ່"
"ຕໍ່ໜ້າກ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Beyond scope, the technical guarantees:\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກຂອບເຂດແລ້ວ, ນີ້ຄືການຮັບປະກັນທາງເຕັກນິກ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**No cloud inference:** Every model runs locally on your CPU or GPU. Nothing about your image is sent off-device.\n"
msgstr "**ບໍ່ມີການປະມວນຜົນເທິງຄລາວ:** ທຸກໂມເດະລັນຢູ່ໃນ CPU ຫຼື GPU ຂອງທ່ານເອງ. ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບໃດໆຖືກສົ່ງອອກນອກເຄື່ອງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**No autonomous edits:** Every AI feature is user-triggered; there's no background AI activity on your library.\n"
msgstr "**ບໍ່ມີການແກ້ໄຂອັດຕະໂນມັດ:** ທຸກຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ຕ້ອງຖືກສັ່ງໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້; ບໍ່ມີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ AI ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງກັບຄໍເລັກຊັນຮູບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**No training:** darktable ships pre-trained models and runs inference only. The [darktable-ai](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable-ai) repository holds the conversion scripts and training notes for anyone who wants to retrain or export a new model.\n"
msgstr "**ບໍ່ມີການເຝິກຝົນ (training):** darktable ມາພ້ອມກັບໂມເດວທີ່ເຝິກຝົນມາແລ້ວ ແລະ ເຮັດພຽງແຕ່ການປະມວນຜົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ບ່ອນເກັບ [darktable-ai](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable-ai) ມີສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ໝາຍເຫດການເຝິກຝົນສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຝິກຝົນໃໝ່ ຫຼື ສົ່ງອອກໂມເດວໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**No automatic updates:** Models are downloaded when you ask for them in preferences; nothing happens in the background.\n"
msgstr "**ບໍ່ມີການອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດ:** ໂມເດວຈະຖືກດາວໂຫລດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ; ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**No analytics:** darktable does not report model use, provider selection, or inference performance anywhere.\n"
msgstr "**ບໍ່ມີການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ:** darktable ບໍ່ລາຍງານການໃຊ້ໂມເດວ, ການເລືອກຕົວປະມວນຜົນ, ຫຼື ປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກໄປບ່ອນໃດເລີຍ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/ai/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI features"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPU acceleration"
msgstr "ການເລັ່ງດ້ວຍ GPU"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enabling GPU acceleration for darktable's AI features is a two-step process:\n"
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ການເລັ່ງດ້ວຍ GPU ສຳລັບຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ຂອງ darktable ແມ່ນມີສອງຂັ້ນຕອນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Install a GPU-capable ONNX Runtime** for your hardware (this page).\n"
msgstr "**ຕິດຕັ້ງ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ GPU** ສຳລັບຮາດແວຂອງທ່ານ (ໜ້ານີ້).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Point darktable at the new library** via [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) – click **detect** to auto-scan standard install locations, or browse to the file by hand.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ກຳນົດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (library) ໃໝ່ໃຫ້ darktable** ຜ່ານ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI](../../../"
"preferences-settings/ai.md) – ຄລິກ **ກວດຫາ (detect)** ເພື່ອສະແກນຫາບ່ອນຕິດຕັ້ງມາດຕະຖາ"
"ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຫຼື ເລືອກຫາໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On Linux, the bundled runtime is CPU-only; on Windows, it uses DirectML; and on macOS, it uses CoreML. So, step 1 only applies if you want NVIDIA, AMD, or Intel GPU acceleration on Linux or Windows. Step 1 has three paths, covered below.\n"
msgstr "ໃນ Linux, runtime ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບໂປຣແກຣມແມ່ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະ CPU; ໃນ Windows, ມັນໃຊ້ DirectML; ແລະ ໃນ macOS, ມັນໃຊ້ CoreML. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1 ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການການເລັ່ງດ້ວຍ GPU ຂອງ NVIDIA, AMD ຫຼື Intel ໃນ Linux ຫຼື Windows. ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1 ມີສາມວິທີ ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bundled providers on Windows (DirectML, any DirectX 12 GPU) and macOS (CoreML, Apple Silicon or recent Intel Mac) have no extra requirements. The Linux/Windows GPU providers below need supported hardware and a few system libraries already in place.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວປະມວນຜົນທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ Windows (DirectML, GPU ໃດໆທີ່ຮອງຮັບ DirectX 12) ແລະ macOS (CoreML, Apple Silicon ຫຼື Intel Mac ລຸ້ນໃໝ່) ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ແຕ່ຕົວປະມວນຜົນ GPU ໃນ Linux/Windows ດ້ານລຸ່ມນີ້ຕ້ອງການຮາດແວທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ໄລບຣາຣີຂອງລະບົບບາງຢ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**NVIDIA (CUDA)**\n"
": Pascal-or-newer GPU (compute capability 6.0+). [NVIDIA driver](https://www.nvidia.com/Download/index.aspx) 525 or later. Plus **one of** [CUDA Toolkit 12.x](https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-12-9-0-download-archive) or [CUDA Toolkit 13.x](https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-downloads) and [cuDNN](https://developer.nvidia.com/cudnn-downloads) 9.x installed on the system. The two CUDA branches have separate ONNX Runtime builds and you need the one that matches the toolkit version installed on your machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"**NVIDIA (CUDA)**\n"
": GPU ລຸ້ນ Pascal ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ (ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການປະມວນຜົນ 6.0+). [NVIDIA driver](https://www.nvidia.com/Download/index.aspx) ເວີຊັນ 525 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ພ້ອມທັງ **ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ** ລະຫວ່າງ [CUDA Toolkit 12.x](https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-12-9-0-download-archive) ຫຼື [CUDA Toolkit 13.x](https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-downloads) ແລະ [cuDNN](https://developer.nvidia.com/cudnn-downloads) 9.x ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນລະບົບ. ທັງສອງເວີຊັນຂອງ CUDA ມີ ONNX Runtime ແຍກກັນ ແລະ ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກອັນທີ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນ toolkit ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": To check what CUDA toolkit you have:\n"
msgstr ": ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານມີ CUDA toolkit ເວີຊັນໃດ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - run `nvcc --version` in a terminal – the `release` line tells you the installed toolkit (e.g. `release 12.6` means CUDA 12 is installed).\n"
": - `nvidia-smi` reports a `CUDA Version:` field at the top, but that is the **maximum** version the driver is capable of running, not what's installed. A machine with driver 580+ might show `CUDA Version: 13.2` while actually having only CUDA 12 installed via `nvcc`.\n"
msgstr ""
": - ລັນ `nvcc --version` ໃນເທີມິນໍ (terminal) – ແຖວ `release` ຈະບອກທ່ານເຖິງຊຸດເຄື່ອງມືທີ່"
"ຕິດຕັ້ງ (ເຊັ່ນ: `release 12.6` ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕິດຕັ້ງ CUDA 12 ແລ້ວ).\n"
": - `nvidia-smi` ຈະລາຍງານຟີວ `CUDA Version:` ຢູ່ສ່ວນເທິງ, ແຕ່ນັ້ນແມ່ນເວີຊັນ **ສູງສຸດ** ທີ່ໄດ"
"ຣເວີສາມາດລັນໄດ້, ບໍ່ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່. ເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີໄດຣເວີ 580+ ອາດຈະສະແດງ `CUDA Version: 13.2` "
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງພຽງແຕ່ CUDA 12 ຜ່ານ `nvcc`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If you have CUDA 12 installed and want to switch to 13, install the CUDA 13 toolkit (in parallel with 12 is fine) and then re-run the ONNX Runtime install script – it picks the build matching the toolkit it finds.\n"
msgstr ""
": ຖ້າທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ CUDA 12 ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນເປັນ 13, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງຊຸດເຄື່ອງມື CUDA 13 (ຕິດຕັ້ງຂະໜານ"
"ກັບ 12 ກໍໄດ້) ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍລັນສະຄຣິບຕິດຕັ້ງ ONNX Runtime ຄືນໃໝ່ – ມັນຈະເລືອກການສ້າງທີ່ກົງກັບຊຸດເຄື່ອ"
"ງມືທີ່ມັນພົບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**AMD (MIGraphX)** _(Linux only)_\n"
": ROCm-supported GPU (Radeon RX 7700-series or newer, Instinct MI100 or newer). [ROCm](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/install-on-linux/en/latest/) 6.x or newer with MIGraphX installed on the system.\n"
msgstr ""
"**AMD (MIGraphX)** _(ສະເພາະ Linux)_\n"
": GPU ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ROCm (Radeon RX 7700-series ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ, Instinct MI100 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ). [ROCm](https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/install-on-linux/en/latest/) 6.x ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ ພ້ອມຕິດຕັ້ງ MIGraphX ໃນລະບົບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Note: the first inference of each model on MIGraphX takes minutes because the model graph is compiled for your specific GPU and then cached on disk – see the [performance notes](./performance-and-troubleshooting/#performance-notes) for details. Once cached, subsequent runs are fast and survive across darktable restarts.\n"
msgstr ""
": ໝາຍເຫດ: ການລັນ (inference) ຄັ້ງທຳອິດຂອງແຕ່ລະໂມເດວໃນ MIGraphX ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍນາທີ ເພາະ"
"ກຣາບຂອງໂມເດວຖືກລວບລວມສຳລັບ GPU ສະເພາະຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນກໍຖືກແຄຊ໌ໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ – ເບິ່ງ [ໝາຍເຫ"
"ດກ່ຽວກັບປະສິດທິພາບ](./performance-and-troubleshooting/#performance-notes) ສຳລັບລາຍ"
"ລະອຽດ. ເມື່ອຖືກແຄຊ໌ແລ້ວ, ການລັນໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆໄປຈະໄວ ແລະ ຍັງຄົງຢູ່ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເລີ່ມ darktable ໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Intel (OpenVINO)**\n"
": Intel iGPU (HD / UHD / Iris Xe) or Arc discrete GPU. [Intel GPU driver](https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/download-center/home.html) with [OpenCL](https://github.com/intel/compute-runtime) (`intel-opencl-icd`) and/or [Level Zero](https://github.com/oneapi-src/level-zero). OpenVINO itself ships in the install package – nothing extra to install.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Intel (OpenVINO)**\n"
": Intel iGPU (HD / UHD / Iris Xe) ຫຼື GPU ແຍກ Arc. [ໄດຣເວີ GPU ຂອງ Intel]"
"(https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/download-center/home.html) ພ້ອມກັບ "
"[OpenCL](https://github.com/intel/compute-runtime) (`intel-opencl-icd`) ແລະ/"
"ຫຼື [Level Zero](https://github.com/oneapi-src/level-zero). OpenVINO ເອງແມ່ນມາພ້ອ"
"ມກັບແພັກເກັດຕິດຕັ້ງ – ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a required system library is missing, the install script will tell you which one and point you at the vendor's install docs. The package still installs; acceleration only kicks in once the missing library is in place.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າຂາດໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຈຳເປັນ, ສະຄຣິບຕິດຕັ້ງຈະບອກທ່ານວ່າແມ່ນອັນໃດ ແລະ ແນະນຳເອກະສານການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ. ແພັກເກດຈະຍັງຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່; ແຕ່ການເລັ່ງຈະເຮັດວຽກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປນັ້ນຄົບຖ້ວນແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "use the install scripts (recommended)"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບຕິດຕັ້ງ (ແນະນຳ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The simplest path: paste one line into a terminal. The script figures out which GPU you have, downloads the matching ONNX Runtime build, verifies it, and installs it under your user account. No root, no source checkout.\n"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດ: ວາງຄຳສັ່ງແຖວດຽວລົງໃນເທີມິນອລ. ສະຄຣິບຈະກວດສອບວ່າທ່ານໃຊ້ GPU ໃດ, ດາວໂຫລດ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ກົງກັນ, ກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃຕ້ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານ. ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສິດ root, ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຈັດການ source code.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Linux:\n"
msgstr "Linux:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/darktable-org/darktable/HEAD/tools/ai/install-ort-gpu.sh | bash\n"
msgstr "curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/darktable-org/darktable/HEAD/tools/ai/install-ort-gpu.sh | bash\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Windows (PowerShell):\n"
msgstr "Windows (PowerShell):\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (powershell)
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/darktable-org/darktable/HEAD/tools/ai/install-ort-gpu.ps1 | iex\n"
msgstr "irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/darktable-org/darktable/HEAD/tools/ai/install-ort-gpu.ps1 | iex\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Linux script needs `bash`, `curl`, `jq`, `tar`, and `unzip` available on `PATH` – if any are missing it tells you which ones up front so the install doesn't fail halfway through. The Windows script needs PowerShell 5.1 or newer (preinstalled on Windows 10+).\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບ Linux ຕ້ອງການ `bash`, `curl`, `jq`, `tar`, ແລະ `unzip` ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ `PATH` – ຖ້າ"
"ຂາດອັນໃດໜຶ່ງ ມັນຈະບອກທ່ານລ່ວງໜ້າ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງລົ້ມເຫຼວໃນລະຫວ່າງທາງ. ສະຄຣິບ Windows ຕ້ອງກາ"
"ນ PowerShell 5.1 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ (ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນ Windows 10+).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have more than one GPU, the script asks which one to target. If your GPU needs system libraries that aren't installed (cuDNN on NVIDIA, MIGraphX on AMD), the script tells you what's missing and where to get it – the install still completes, but acceleration only kicks in once those system libraries are in place.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານມີ GPU ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອັນ, ສະຄຣິບຈະຖາມວ່າຈະເນັ້ນໄປທີ່ອັນໃດ. ຖ້າ GPU ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການໄລບຣາຣີລະບົ"
"ບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ (cuDNN ໃນ NVIDIA, MIGraphX ໃນ AMD), ສະຄຣິບຈະບອກທ່ານວ່າຂາດຫຍັງ ແລະ ຈະໄ"
"ປຫາໄດ້ຈາກໃສ – ການຕິດຕັ້ງຈະຍັງຄົງສຳເລັດ, ແຕ່ການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໄລບຣາຣີລະບົບເຫຼົ່ານັ້"
"ນຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To force a specific execution provider instead of letting the script auto-detect, pass `--ep` (bash) or `-Ep` (PowerShell). Values: `cuda12`, `cuda13`, `rocm`, `migraphx`, `openvino`. Useful when both NVIDIA and Intel GPUs are present and you want a specific one, or when `nvcc` is not installed and the script can't tell whether you have CUDA 12 or CUDA 13 on the system.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຊ້ຕົວປະມວນຜົນສະເພາະແທນທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ສະຄຣິບກວດສອບເອງ, ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຄ່າ `--ep` (bash) ຫຼື `-Ep` (PowerShell). ຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້: `cuda12`, `cuda13`, `rocm`, `migraphx`, `openvino`. ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອມີທັງ NVIDIA ແລະ Intel ແລະ ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເລືອກອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ `nvcc` ແລະ ສະຄຣິບບອກບໍ່ໄດ້ວ່າທ່ານມີ CUDA 12 ຫຼື 13.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the script finishes, restart darktable, open [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md), and click **detect** so darktable picks up the newly-installed runtime. Then choose your provider (CUDA, MIGraphX, OpenVINO) under _AI acceleration_.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສະຄຣິບເຮັດວຽກສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ເປີດ darktable ໃໝ່, ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md), ແລະ ຄລິກ **detect** ເພື່ອໃຫ້ darktable ຮັບຮູ້ runtime ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່. ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອກຕົວປະມວນຜົນຂອງທ່ານ (CUDA, MIGraphX, OpenVINO) ພາຍໃຕ້ _AI acceleration_.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "detect a system-installed ONNX Runtime"
msgstr "ກວດສອບ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃນລະບົບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your distribution already ships a GPU-capable ONNX Runtime (common on Arch, occasionally on Ubuntu/Debian via third-party repos), just click **detect** in the AI preferences tab – darktable looks in standard system locations and configures itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າລະບົບຂອງທ່ານມີ ONNX Runtime ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ GPU ມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ (ພົບເລື້ອຍໃນ Arch, ບາງຄັ້ງໃນ Ubuntu/"
"Debian ຜ່ານຄັງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ), ພຽງແຕ່ຄລິກ **detect** ໃນແຖບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI – "
"darktable ຈະຊອກຫາໃນຕຳແໜ່ງມາດຕະຖານຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "install manually"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the automatic options don't fit (locked-down environment, custom audit, GitHub API rate-limited – see below) you can fetch and place the files yourself. The goal is a `libonnxruntime.so.*` / `onnxruntime.dll` on disk that darktable can be pointed at via the _ONNX Runtime library_ field in AI preferences.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຕົວເລືອກອັດຕະໂນມັດບໍ່ເໝາະສົມ (ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ, ການກວດສອບແບບກຳນົດເອງ, GitHub "
"API ຖືກຈຳກັດອັດຕາການເຂົ້າເຖິງ – ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້) ທ່ານສາມາດໄປເອົາ ແລະ ວາງໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້. ເປົ້າໝ"
"າຍຄືການມີ `libonnxruntime.so.*` / `onnxruntime.dll` ຢູ່ໃນດິສກ໌ ທີ່ darktable ສາມາດຊີ້ໄປ"
"ຫາໄດ້ຜ່ານຟີວ _ໄລບຣາຣີ ONNX Runtime_ ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "where to download"
msgstr "ບ່ອນດາວໂຫລດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Vendor | Source |\n"
"|--------|--------|\n"
"| NVIDIA CUDA 12 | [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/releases/latest) – `onnxruntime-{linux\\|win}-x64-gpu-X.Y.Z.{tgz\\|zip}` |\n"
"| NVIDIA CUDA 13 | [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/releases/latest) – `onnxruntime-{linux\\|win}-x64-gpu_cuda13-X.Y.Z.{tgz\\|zip}` |\n"
"| AMD ROCm 6.x | [PyPI `onnxruntime-rocm`](https://pypi.org/project/onnxruntime-rocm/#files) – `cp312` `manylinux` wheel |\n"
"| AMD ROCm 7.x | [PyPI `onnxruntime-migraphx`](https://pypi.org/project/onnxruntime-migraphx/#files) – `cp312` `manylinux` wheel |\n"
"| Intel OpenVINO (Linux) | [PyPI `onnxruntime-openvino`](https://pypi.org/project/onnxruntime-openvino/#files) – `cp312` `manylinux_2_28_x86_64` wheel |\n"
"| Intel OpenVINO (Windows) | [PyPI `onnxruntime-openvino`](https://pypi.org/project/onnxruntime-openvino/#files) + [PyPI `openvino`](https://pypi.org/project/openvino/#files) – both `cp312` `win_amd64` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| ຜູ້ຜະລິດ | ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ |\n"
"|--------|--------|\n"
"| NVIDIA CUDA 12 | [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/microsoft/"
"onnxruntime/releases/latest) – `onnxruntime-{linux\\|win}-x64-gpu-X.Y.Z."
"{tgz\\|zip}` |\n"
"| NVIDIA CUDA 13 | [GitHub Releases](https://github.com/microsoft/"
"onnxruntime/releases/latest) – `onnxruntime-{linux\\|win}-x64-gpu_cuda13-"
"X.Y.Z.{tgz\\|zip}` |\n"
"| AMD ROCm 6.x | [PyPI `onnxruntime-rocm`](https://pypi.org/project/"
"onnxruntime-rocm/#files) – `cp312` `manylinux` wheel |\n"
"| AMD ROCm 7.x | [PyPI `onnxruntime-migraphx`](https://pypi.org/project/"
"onnxruntime-migraphx/#files) – `cp312` `manylinux` wheel |\n"
"| Intel OpenVINO (Linux) | [PyPI `onnxruntime-openvino`](https://pypi.org/"
"project/onnxruntime-openvino/#files) – `cp312` `manylinux_2_28_x86_64` wheel "
"|\n"
"| Intel OpenVINO (Windows) | [PyPI `onnxruntime-openvino`](https://pypi.org/"
"project/onnxruntime-openvino/#files) + [PyPI `openvino`](https://pypi.org/"
"project/openvino/#files) – ທັງສອງ `cp312` `win_amd64` |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "NVIDIA tarballs/zips are simplest to extract: the library sits under `lib/`. PyPI wheels (`.whl` files are renamed zips) carry the library under `<package>/capi/` along with the `LICENSE` and `ThirdPartyNotices.txt` you should keep next to it. AMD wheels may additionally ship a sibling `<package>.libs/` directory of auditwheel-bundled ROCm libs – when present, that directory must stay alongside `libonnxruntime.so.*` after copying, because the providers' RPATH resolves through a relative `$ORIGIN` reference. Intel on Windows needs DLLs from a second wheel (`openvino`) copied next to `onnxruntime.dll`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ບີບອັດແບບ tarball/zip ຂອງ NVIDIA ແມ່ນແຕກໄຟລ໌ອອກໄດ້ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດ: ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດ (library) ຈະຢູ່"
"ພາຍໃຕ້ `lib/`. ສ່ວນ PyPI wheels (ໄຟລ໌ `.whl` ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ zip ທີ່ປ່ຽນຊື່ໃໝ່) ຈະເກັບຫ້ອງສະໝຸດໄວ້ພ"
"າຍໃຕ້ `<package>/capi/` ພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ `LICENSE` ແລະ `ThirdPartyNotices.txt` ເຊິ່ງທ່ານຄ"
"ວນເກັບໄວ້ຄຽງຂ້າງກັນ. Wheels ຂອງ AMD ອາດຈະມີໂຟນເດີຄູ່ຂະໜານ `<package>.libs/` ຂອງ ROCm "
"libs ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ auditwheel – ຖ້າມີ, ໂຟນເດີນັ້ນຕ້ອງຢູ່ຄຽງຂ້າງ `libonnxruntime.so.*` ຫຼັງຈາກ"
"ກັອບປີ້ແລ້ວ, ເພາະວ່າ RPATH ຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຈະອ້າງອີງຜ່ານ `$ORIGIN`. ສໍາລັບ Intel ໃນ Windows "
"ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ DLLs ຈາກ wheel ທີສອງ (`openvino`) ກັອບປີ້ໄວ້ຄຽງຂ້າງ "
"`onnxruntime.dll`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By convention, place the extracted files under `~/.local/lib/onnxruntime-<ep>/` on Linux or `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\onnxruntime-<ep>\\` on Windows (`<ep>` = `cuda`, `rocm`, `migraphx`, or `openvino`). The **detect** button in AI preferences scans for any `onnxruntime-*` directory under those roots.\n"
msgstr "ຕາມທຳນຽມ, ໃຫ້ວາງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ແຕກອອກໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ `~/.local/lib/onnxruntime-<ep>/` ໃນ Linux ຫຼື `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\onnxruntime-<ep>\\` ໃນ Windows (`<ep>` ຄື `cuda`, `rocm`, `migraphx`, ຫຼື `openvino`). ປຸ່ມ **detect** ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI ຈະສະແກນຫາໂຟນເດີ `onnxruntime-*` ພາຍໃຕ້ເສັ້ນທາງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AMD: alternative source when PyPI's GPU coverage isn't enough"
msgstr "AMD: ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທາງເລືອກເມື່ອ PyPI ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ GPU ບາງລຸ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "PyPI's `onnxruntime-rocm` / `onnxruntime-migraphx` wheels ship HIP kernel binaries for a fixed set of GPU architectures. If your card's `gfx*` ID isn't covered, ONNX Runtime loads but model compilation fails at runtime:\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ wheels ຂອງ `onnxruntime-rocm` / `onnxruntime-migraphx` ຈາກ PyPI ຈະລວມ binary ຂອງ HIP kernel ສຳລັບ GPU ບາງລຸ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າ ID `gfx*` ຂອງກາດຈໍທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບ, ONNX Runtime ຈະໂຫລດໄດ້ ແຕ່ການຄອມໄພລ໌ໂມເດວຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"migraphx_program_compile: Error: ... no kernel image is available\n"
"for execution on the device\n"
msgstr ""
"migraphx_program_compile: Error: ... no kernel image is available\n"
"for execution on the device\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This commonly hits some RDNA 3 iGPUs (e.g. Radeon 780M / gfx1103). Two cheaper workarounds before reinstalling:\n"
msgstr "ບັນຫານີ້ມັກເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບ iGPU ລຸ້ນ RDNA 3 (ເຊັ່ນ Radeon 780M / gfx1103). ນີ້ຄືສອງວິທີແກ້ໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**hide the unsupported GPU** from MIGraphX so it binds to a supported card (find indices with `rocminfo | grep -E \"Marketing Name|gfx\"`):\n"
msgstr "**ເຊື່ອງ GPU ທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ** ຈາກ MIGraphX ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນໄປໃຊ້ກາດທີ່ຮອງຮັບແທນ (ຊອກຫາລຳດັບດ້ວຍ `rocminfo | grep -E \"Marketing Name|gfx\"`):\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "  HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 darktable\n"
msgstr "  HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 darktable\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**override the gfx version** – RDNA 3 is mostly binary-compatible with gfx1100, so the bundled kernels often work:\n"
msgstr ""
"**ຂ້າມ (override) ເວີຊັນ gfx** – RDNA 3 ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນສາມາດເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ໃນລະດັບ binary ກັບ "
"gfx1100, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ kernels ທີ່ມາພ້ອມກັນມັກຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "  HSA_OVERRIDE_GFX_VERSION=11.0.0 darktable\n"
msgstr "  HSA_OVERRIDE_GFX_VERSION=11.0.0 darktable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If neither helps, AMD's own ROCm repository ships builds with broader per-architecture coverage. Browse https://repo.radeon.com/rocm/manylinux/, find the `rocm-rel-X.Y.Z/` directory matching your installed ROCm version, download the `cp312` `onnxruntime_rocm-*.whl`, and extract it the same way as the PyPI wheel.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທັງສອງວິທີບໍ່ໄດ້ຜົນ, ບ່ອນເກັບ ROCm ຂອງ AMD ເອງຈະມີບິວດ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ກວ້າງກວ່າ. ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ https://repo.radeon.com/rocm/manylinux/, ຊອກຫາໂຟນເດີ `rocm-rel-X.Y.Z/` ທີ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນ ROCm ທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ, ດາວໂຫລດ `cp312` `onnxruntime_rocm-*.whl`, ແລະ ແຕກໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍວິທີດຽວກັນກັບ PyPI wheel.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "building AMD from source"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ AMD ຈາກ source code"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When even the AMD repository binaries don't match your system (custom-built ROCm, an unusual distro), build ONNX Runtime against your installed ROCm. From a darktable source checkout:\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໄຟລ໌ binary ຈາກ AMD ຍັງບໍ່ກົງກັບລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ (ເຊັ່ນ ບິວດ໌ ROCm ເອງ), ໃຫ້ສ້າງ ONNX Runtime ໂດຍອ້າງອີງກັບ ROCm ທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້. ຈາກໂຟນເດີ source ຂອງ darktable:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "./tools/ai/install-ort-amd-build.sh\n"
msgstr "./tools/ai/install-ort-amd-build.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Needs `cmake` 3.26+, a C++ compiler, `python3`, and `git`. Takes 10–20 minutes.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງການ `cmake` 3.26 ຂຶ້ນໄປ, ຕົວແປພາສາ C++ (compiler), `python3`, ແລະ `git`. ໃຊ້ເວ"
"ລາປະມານ 10–20 ນາທີ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitHub API rate limit"
msgstr "ການຈຳກັດອັດຕາການໃຊ້ GitHub API"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For CUDA 13, the install script asks `api.github.com` which release is latest. GitHub limits unauthenticated callers to **60 requests per hour per source IP**. On shared NAT (corporate networks, VPNs, cloud VMs) that limit gets exhausted quickly by other users on the same IP, and the script fails with a clear message pointing here.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ CUDA 13, ສະຄຣິບຕິດຕັ້ງຈະສອບຖາມ `api.github.com` ວ່າເວີຊັນໃດໃໝ່ສຸດ. GitHub ຈຳກັດຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບໄວ້ທີ່ **60 ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ຊົ່ວໂມງຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ IP**. ໃນລະບົບເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ IP ຮ່ວມກັນ (ເຄືອຂ່າຍອົງກອນ, VPN) ຂີດຈຳກັດນີ້ອາດຈະໝົດໄວ ແລະ ສະຄຣິບຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວພ້ອມແຈ້ງເຕືອນບັນຫານີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two ways out:\n"
msgstr "ສອງວິທີແກ້ໄຂ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**set `GITHUB_TOKEN`** to any personal access token (no scopes required for public repos) before re-running – raises the limit to 5000 requests/hour authenticated.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ຕັ້ງຄ່າ `GITHUB_TOKEN`** ໃຫ້ເປັນ personal access token ໃດໜຶ່ງ (ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ scope ສໍາ"
"ລັບ public repos) ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລັນໃໝ່ – ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂີດຈຳກັດເປັນ 5000 requests/ຊົ່ວໂມງ ສໍາລັບການຢືນຢັນ"
"ຕົວຕົນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**install manually** – for the CUDA 13 tarball this is `tar xzf` plus a copy. The install script prints the same instructions on failure.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ** – ສໍາລັບ CUDA 13 tarball ແມ່ນໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ `tar xzf` ແລ້ວກັອບປີ້. ສະຄຣິບຕິດຕັ້"
"ງຈະສະແດງຄຳແນະນຳດຽວກັນນີ້ຫາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "PyPI sources (AMD, Intel, NVIDIA CUDA 12) have no published rate limit and are unaffected.\n"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກ PyPI (AMD, Intel, NVIDIA CUDA 12) ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດອັດຕາການໃຊ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "after installing a new ONNX Runtime"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງ ONNX Runtime ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When darktable starts up with a new ONNX Runtime library, the _AI acceleration_ dropdown in AI preferences re-populates with only the providers that library actually advertises. Older selections that are no longer supported are switched to another available GPU provider automatically, or to _auto_ if no GPU is left.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ darktable ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໄລບຣາຣີ ONNX Runtime ໃໝ່, ລາຍການເລືອກ _AI acceleration_ ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI ຈະຖືກອັບເດດສະເພາະຕົວປະມວນຜົນທີ່ໄລບຣາຣີນັ້ນຮອງຮັບແທ້ໆ. ການເລືອກເກົ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບອີກຕໍ່ໄປຈະຖືກປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ GPU ອື່ນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ຫຼື ປ່ຽນເປັນ _auto_ ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ GPU ເຫຼືອຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Between the install and the restart, the dropdown shows a _restart to apply_ hint next to the provider name – a reminder that the currently-loaded runtime is stale.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງແລະການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່, ລາຍການເລືອກ (dropdown) ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ _restart to "
"apply_ ຢູ່ຂ້າງຊື່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ – ເພື່ອເຕືອນວ່າ runtime ທີ່ໂຫລດຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນນັ້ນເກົ່າແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/opencl/scheduling-profile.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "scheduling profile"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຈັດຕາຕະລາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/scheduling-profile.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable can use the CPU and one or several OpenCL capable GPUs. Depending on the relative performance of these devices, users can choose among certain scheduling profiles to optimize performance. This is achieved by setting the configuration parameter [preferences > processing > OpenCL > OpenCL scheduling profile](../../preferences-settings/processing/#opencl), which offers the following choices:\n"
msgstr "darktable ສາມາດໃຊ້ CPU ແລະ GPU ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ OpenCL ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອັນ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງອຸປະກອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຈັດຕາຕະລາງບາງຢ່າງເພື່ອປັບປະສິດທິພາບໃຫ້ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າພານາມິເຕີການກຳນົດຄ່າ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ > OpenCL > ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຈັດຕາຕະລາງ OpenCL](../../preferences-settings/processing/#opencl), ເຊິ່ງມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/scheduling-profile.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"default\n"
": If an OpenCL-capable GPU is found darktable uses it for processing the center image view while the [navigation preview window](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/navigation.md) is processed on the CPU in parallel. This is the preferred setting for systems with a reasonably fast CPU and a moderately fast GPU. The exact allocation of devices to the various pixelpipe types can be finetuned with the “opencl\\_device\\_priority” configuration parameter (see [multiple devices](./multiple-devices.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (default)\n"
": ຫາກກວດພົບ GPU ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ OpenCL, darktable ຈະໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບໃນສ່ວນກາງ ໃນຂະນະ"
"ທີ່ [ໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຢ່າງການນຳທາງ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/"
"navigation.md) ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ CPU ແບບຂະໜານກັນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ມີ "
"CPU ທີ່ໄວພໍສົມຄວນ ແລະ GPU ທີ່ໄວປານກາງ. ການຈັດສັນອຸປະກອນໃຫ້ກັບ pixelpipe ປະເພດຕ່າງໆ ສາມາດປັ"
"ບແຕ່ງລະອຽດໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາຣາມີເຕີ “opencl\\_device\\_priority” (ເບິ່ງ [ອຸປະກອນຫຼາຍອັນ](./"
"multiple-devices.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/scheduling-profile.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"very fast GPU\n"
": With this scheduling profile darktable processes the center image view and the preview window on the GPU sequentially. This is the preferred setting for systems with a GPU that strongly outperforms the CPU.\n"
msgstr ""
"GPU ທີ່ໄວຫຼາຍ (very fast GPU)\n"
": ດ້ວຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການຈັດຕາຕະລາງນີ້, darktable ຈະປະມວນຜົນມຸມມອງຮູບພາບກາງ ແລະ ໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຢ່າງໃນ GPU ຕາມລຳດັບ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ມີ GPU ທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງກວ່າ CPU ຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/scheduling-profile.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"multiple GPUs\n"
": This setting addresses systems with multiple GPUs whose relative performance do **not** differ significantly. Whenever a processing job is started darktable uses any currently idle GPU but not the CPU. Users of systems with a variety of GPUs will need better control on their relative priority. They would be better off selecting the “default” profile and fine-tuning their system with the “opencl\\_device\\_priority” configuration parameter (see [multiple devices](./multiple-devices.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"GPU ຫຼາຍອັນ (multiple GPUs)\n"
": ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ສໍາລັບລະບົບທີ່ມີ GPU ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບ **ບໍ່** ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍ. ເມື່ອໃດກໍ່ຕາມທີ່ມີການເ"
"ລີ່ມວຽກປະມວນຜົນ, darktable ຈະໃຊ້ GPU ໃດກໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ວ່າງຢູ່ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ CPU. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບທີ່ມີ GPU ຫຼາຍແບບ"
"ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ ຈະຕ້ອງການການຄວບຄຸມລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນທີ່ດີກວ່າ. ພວກເຂົາຄວນເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ “default” ແລ"
"ະປັບແຕ່ງລະບົບດ້ວຍພາຣາມີເຕີ “opencl\\_device\\_priority” (ເບິ່ງ [ອຸປະກອນຫຼາຍອັນ](./"
"multiple-devices.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/scheduling-profile.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On first start-up or after any detected change in the GPU configuration of your system darktable tries to identify the best suited profile for you. You can change it at any time in [preferences > processing > OpenCL](../../preferences-settings/processing.md#opencl).\n"
msgstr "ໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ຫຼື ຫຼັງຈາກກວດພົບການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າ GPU ຂອງລະບົບທ່ານ, darktable ຈະພະຍາຍາມລະບຸໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບທ່ານ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນມັນໄດ້ທຸກເວລາໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ > OpenCL](../../preferences-settings/processing.md#opencl).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "setting up OpenCL"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ OpenCL"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The huge diversity of systems and the marked differences between OpenCL vendors and driver versions makes it impossible to give an comprehensive overview of how to setup OpenCL. We only can give you an example, in this case for NVIDIA driver version 542.29.06 on Fedora 39. We hope that this will serve as a basic introduction and will help you to solve any problems specific to your setup.\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມຫຼາກຫຼາຍອັນມະຫາສານຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ຊັດເຈນລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ຜະລິດ OpenCL ແລະ ເວີຊັນໄດເວີ ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ພາບລວມທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ OpenCL. ພວກເຮົາພຽງແຕ່ສາມາດໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງແກ່ທ່ານໄດ້, ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແມ່ນສຳລັບໄດເວີ NVIDIA ເວີຊັນ 542.29.06 ໃນ Fedora 39. ພວກເຮົາຫວັງວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເປັນບົດແນະນຳເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ຈະຊ່ວຍທ່ານແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາທີ່ສະເພາະກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The principle OpenCL function flow is like this:\n"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ OpenCL ໂດຍຫຼັກການແມ່ນເປັນແບບນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable > libOpenCL.so > libnvidia-opencl.so.1 > kernel driver module(s) > GPU`\n"
msgstr "`darktable > libOpenCL.so > libnvidia-opencl.so.1 > ໂມດູນເຄີເນິລໄດເວີ > GPU`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable dynamically loads `libOpenCL.so` -- a system library that must be accessible to the system's dynamic loader (`ld.so`).\n"
msgstr "darktable ຈະໂຫຼດ `libOpenCL.so` ແບບໄດນາມິກ -- ເຊິ່ງເປັນໄລບຣາຣີລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ໄດນາມິກໂຫຼດເດີ (`ld.so`) ຂອງລະບົບເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`libOpenCL.so` reads the vendor-specific information file (`/etc/OpenCL/vendors/nvidia.icd`) to find the library that contains the vendor-specific OpenCL implementation.\n"
msgstr "`libOpenCL.so` ຈະອ່ານໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ (`/etc/OpenCL/vendors/nvidia.icd`) ເພື່ອຊອກຫາໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍການປະຕິບັດ OpenCL ສະເພາະຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The vendor-specific OpenCL implementation comes as a library `libnvidia-opencl.so.1` (which in our case is a symbolic link to `libnvidia-opencl.so.545.29.06`).\n"
msgstr "ການປະຕິບັດ OpenCL ສະເພາະຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດມາໃນຮູບແບບໄລບຣາຣີ `libnvidia-opencl.so.1` (ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີຂອງພວກເຮົາແມ່ນລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ (symbolic link) ທີ່ຊີ້ໄປຫາ `libnvidia-opencl.so.545.29.06`).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`libnvidia-opencl.so.1` needs to talk to the vendor-specific kernel modules `nvidia` and `nvidia_uvm` via device special files `/dev/nvidia0`, `/dev/nvidiactl`, and `/dev/nvidia-uvm`.\n"
msgstr "`libnvidia-opencl.so.1` ຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງສື່ສານກັບໂມດູນເຄີເນິລສະເພາະຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ `nvidia` ແລະ `nvidia_uvm` ຜ່ານໄຟລ໌ອຸປະກອນພິເສດ `/dev/nvidia0`, `/dev/nvidiactl`, ແລະ `/dev/nvidia-uvm`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At system startup the required device special files (`/dev/nvidia*`) need to be created. If this does not happen on your system by default, the easiest way to set them up and make sure all modules are loaded is by installing the `nvidia-modprobe` package.\n"
msgstr "ໃນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ, ໄຟລ໌ອຸປະກອນພິເສດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ (`/dev/nvidia*`) ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າພວກມັນ ແລະ ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໂມດູນທັງໝົດຖືກໂຫຼດແລ້ວ ຄືການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ `nvidia-modprobe`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A user account that needs to make use of OpenCL from within darktable must have read/write access to NVIDIA's device special files. On some systems these files allow world read-write access by default, which avoids permission issues but might be debatable in terms of system security. Other systems restrict the access to a user group, e.g. “video”. In this case your user account has to be member of that group.\n"
msgstr ""
"ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ OpenCL ພາຍໃນ darktable ຕ້ອງມີສິດ ອ່ານ/ຂຽນ ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ອຸປະກອນພິເສດຂອງ "
"NVIDIA. ໃນບາງລະບົບ, ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທຸກຄົນ ອ່ານ-ຂຽນ ໄດ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງບັນຫາເລື່ອ"
"ງສິດອະນຸຍາດ ແຕ່ອາດຈະມີຂໍ້ສົງໄສໃນແງ່ຂອງຄວາມປອດໄພຂອງລະບົບ. ລະບົບອື່ນໆ ອາດຈະຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະເ"
"ພາະກຸ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້, ເຊັ່ນ ກຸ່ມ “video”. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງເປັນສະມາຊິກຂອງກຸ່ມດັ່ງກ່າວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To summarise, the packages that needed to be installed in this specific case were:\n"
msgstr "ສະຫຼຸບແລ້ວ, ແພັກເກດທີ່ຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງໃນກໍລະນີສະເພາະນີ້ແມ່ນ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia\n"
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia-libs\n"
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia-cuda\n"
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia-cuda-libs\n"
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia-power\n"
"akmod-nvidia\n"
"nvidia-settings\n"
"nvidia-modprobe\n"
"nvidia-persistenced\n"
"opencl-headers\n"
"opencl-filesystem\n"
"ocl-icd\n"
"ocd-icd-devel\n"
msgstr ""
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia\n"
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia-libs\n"
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia-cuda\n"
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia-cuda-libs\n"
"xorg-x11-drv-nvidia-power\n"
"akmod-nvidia\n"
"nvidia-settings\n"
"nvidia-modprobe\n"
"nvidia-persistenced\n"
"opencl-headers\n"
"opencl-filesystem\n"
"ocl-icd\n"
"ocd-icd-devel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/setting-up.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On Linux systems you might also want the `clinfo` package giving you a lot of information about your OpenCL system and settings.\n"
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບ Linux ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການແພັກເກດ `clinfo` ນຳອີກ ເຊິ່ງຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບ OpenCL ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/opencl/background.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the background"
msgstr "ຄວາມເປັນມາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/background.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processing high resolution images is a demanding task requiring a modern computer. In terms of both memory and CPU power, getting the best out of a typical 15, 20 or 25 megapixel image can quickly take your computer to its limits.\n"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງແມ່ນວຽກທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄອມພິວເຕີທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ. ທັງໃນແງ່ຂອງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ພະລັງ CPU, ການທີ່ຈະດຶງຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດອອກມາຈາກຮູບພາບຂະໜາດ 15, 20 ຫຼື 25 ລ້ານພິກເຊລ ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານເຮັດວຽກຈົນຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດໄດ້ຢ່າງໄວວາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/background.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable's requirements are no exception. All calculations are performed on 4 x 32bit floating point numbers. This is slower than “ordinary” 8 or 16 bit integer algebra, but eliminates all problems of tonal breaks or loss of information.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂອງ darktable ກໍ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນ. ການຄິດໄລ່ທັງໝົດແມ່ນດຳເນີນການດ້ວຍຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ 4 x "
"32bit. ນີ້ແມ່ນຊ້າກວ່າການຄິດໄລ່ຕົວເລກຖ້ວນ (integer) 8 ຫຼື 16 ບິດແບບ “ທົ່ວໄປ”, ແຕ່ມັນຊ່ວຍກຳຈັດບັນຫ"
"າເລື່ອງການແຕກຂອງໂທນສີ ຫຼື ການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/background.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A great deal of optimization has been undertaken to make darktable as fast as possible. If you run a current version of darktable on a modern computer, you might not notice any “slowness”. However, there are conditions and certain modules where you will feel (or hear from the howling of your CPU fan) how much your poor multi-core processor has to struggle.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ມີການປັບແຕ່ງ (optimization) ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ darktable ໄວທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້. ຫາ"
"ກທ່ານລັນ darktable ເວີຊັນປັດຈຸບັນໃນຄອມພິວເຕີທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ, ທ່ານອາດຈະບໍ່ສັງເກດເຫັນຄວາມ “ຊ້າ”. ແນວໃດ"
"ກໍ່ຕາມ, ຍັງມີບາງເງື່ອນໄຂ ແລະ ບາງໂມດູນທີ່ທ່ານຈະຮູ້ສຶກ (ຫຼື ໄດ້ຍິນສຽງພັດລົມ CPU ຂອງທ່ານດັງແຮງ) ວ່າ ໂປ"
"ເຊດເຊີ multi-core ຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກໜັກຫຼາຍປານໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/background.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "That's where OpenCL comes in. OpenCL allows darktable to take advantage of the enormous power of modern graphics cards. Gamers' demand for highly detailed 3D worlds in modern shooters (as well as cryptocurrency mining) has fostered rapid GPU development. AMD, NVIDIA and Co had to put enormous processing power into their GPUs to meet these demands. The result is modern graphics cards with highly parallelized GPUs that can quickly calculate surfaces and textures at high frame rates.\n"
msgstr "ນັ້ນຄືບ່ອນທີ່ OpenCL ເຂົ້າມາມີບົດບາດ. OpenCL ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ darktable ສາມາດໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກພະລັງອັນມະຫາສານຂອງກາດຈໍທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ. ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງນັກຫຼິ້ນເກມສຳລັບໂລກ 3D ທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດສູງ (ລວມທັງການຂຸດເງິນດິຈິຕອນ) ໄດ້ຊຸກຍູ້ການພັດທະນາ GPU ຢ່າງໄວວາ. AMD, NVIDIA ແລະ ບໍລິສັດອື່ນໆ ຕ້ອງໃສ່ພະລັງການປະມວນຜົນອັນມະຫາສານລົງໃນ GPU ຂອງພວກເຂົາເພື່ອຕອບສະໜອງຄວາມຕ້ອງການເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຄືກາດຈໍທີ່ທັນສະໄໝທີ່ມີ GPU ເຮັດວຽກແບບຂະໜານສູງ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຄຳນວນພື້ນຜິວ ແລະ ລວດລາຍໄດ້ຢ່າງໄວວາດ້ວຍອັດຕາເຟຣມທີ່ສູງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/background.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You are not a gamer and you don't take advantage of that power? Well, then you should at least use it in darktable! For the task of highly parallel floating point calculations modern GPUs are much faster than CPUs. This is especially true when you want to repeat the same few processing steps millions of times. Typical use case: processing high megapixel images.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ແມ່ນນັກຫຼິ້ນເກມ ແລະ ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກພະລັງນັ້ນບໍ? ຖ້າເປັນແບບນັ້ນ, ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍທ່ານກໍຄວນໃຊ້ມັນໃນ darktable! ສຳລັບວຽກການຄຳນວນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມແບບຂະໜານສູງ, GPU ທີ່ທັນສະໄໝແມ່ນໄວກວ່າ CPU ຫຼາຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຍິ່ງເປັນຈິງເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຮັດຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນດຽວກັນຊ້ຳໆຫຼາຍລ້ານຄັ້ງ. ກໍລະນີການນຳໃຊ້ທົ່ວໄປ: ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຈຳນວນພິກເຊລສູງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/background.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that this is separate from GPU acceleration of darktable's [AI features](../ai/overview.md), which run through their own [ONNX Runtime](../ai/how-ai-works.md) execution providers rather than OpenCL – see [AI GPU acceleration](../ai/gpu-acceleration.md) for that setup.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ແຍກອອກຈາກການເລັ່ງດ້ວຍ GPU ສໍາລັບ [ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI](../ai/overview.md) ຂອງ "
"darktable, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກຜ່ານ [ONNX Runtime](../ai/how-ai-works.md) execution "
"providers ຂອງມັນເອງ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນ OpenCL – ເບິ່ງ [ການເລັ່ງ AI ດ້ວຍ GPU](../ai/gpu-"
"acceleration.md) ສໍາລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "possible problems & solutions"
msgstr "ບັນຫາທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ວິທີແກ້ໄຂ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable will detect OpenCL run-time errors automatically. On detecting an error, it will then reprocess everything on the CPU. While this will slow down processing it should not affect the end result.\n"
msgstr "darktable ຈະກວດພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນ OpenCL ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເມື່ອກວດພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ, ມັນຈະກັບໄປປະມວນຜົນທຸກຢ່າງໃນ CPU ໃໝ່. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນຊ້າລົງ ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ຄວນສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຜົນລັບສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There can be various reasons why OpenCL might fail during the initialization phase. OpenCL depends on hardware requirements and on the presence of certain drivers and libraries. In addition all these have to fit in terms of maker, model and revision number. If anything does not fit (e.g. your graphics driver -- loaded as a kernel module -- does not match the version of your `libOpenCL.so`) OpenCL support will likely not be available.\n"
msgstr "ອາດມີຫຼາຍເຫດຜົນທີ່ OpenCL ອາດຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວໃນຊ່ວງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. OpenCL ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຂໍ້ກຳນົດຮາດແວ ແລະ ການມີຢູ່ຂອງໄດເວີ ແລະ ໄລບຣາຣີບາງຢ່າງ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ທຸກຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ທັງໃນແງ່ຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດ, ລຸ້ນ ແລະ ໝາຍເລກການປັບປຸງ. ຖ້າມີສິ່ງໃດໜຶ່ງບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ໄດເວີກາດຈໍຂອງທ່ານ -- ທີ່ໂຫຼດເປັນໂມດູນເຄີເນິລ -- ບໍ່ກົງກັບເວີຊັນຂອງ `libOpenCL.so` ຂອງທ່ານ) ການຮອງຮັບ OpenCL ກໍຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this case, the best thing to do is start darktable from a console with `darktable -d opencl`.\n"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ສິ່ງທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຄວນເຮັດຄືເລີ່ມ darktable ຈາກຄອນໂຊລດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ `darktable -d opencl`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This will give additional debugging output about the initialization and use of OpenCL. First, if you find a line that starts with `[opencl_init] FINALLY ...` that should tell you whether OpenCL support is available for you or not. If initialization failed, look at the messages above for anything that reads like `could not be detected` or `could not be created`. Check if there is a hint about where it failed.\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (debugging) ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ OpenCL. ກ່ອນອື່ນ, ຖ້າທ່ານພົບແຖວທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ `[opencl_init] FINALLY ...` ນັ້ນຈະບອກທ່ານວ່າທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ OpenCL ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລົ້ມເຫຼວ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂ້າງເທິງສຳລັບສິ່ງທີ່ຂຽນປະມານວ່າ `could not be detected` (ກວດບໍ່ພົບ) ຫຼື `could not be created` (ສ້າງບໍ່ໄດ້). ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າມີຂໍ້ແນະນຳວ່າຜິດພາດຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here are a few cases that have been observed in the past:\n"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງກໍລະນີທີ່ເຄີຍພົບໃນອະດີດ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable states that no OpenCL aware graphics card is detected or that the available memory on your GPU is too low and the device is discarded. In that case you might need to buy a new card if you really want OpenCL support.\n"
msgstr "darktable ລະບຸວ່າກວດບໍ່ພົບກາດຈໍທີ່ຮອງຮັບ OpenCL ຫຼື ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ມີໃນ GPU ຂອງທ່ານຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ ແລະ ອຸປະກອນນັ້ນຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຊື້ກາດຈໍໃໝ່ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຮອງຮັບ OpenCL ແທ້ໆ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable finds your `libOpenCL.so` but then tell you that it couldn't get a platform. NVIDIA drivers will often give error code -1001 in this case. This happens because `libOpenCL.so` is only a wrapper library. For the real work further vendor-specific libraries need to be loaded. This has failed for some reason. There is a structure of files in `/etc/OpenCL` on your system that `libOpenCL.so` consults to find these libraries. See if you can find something fishy in there and try to fix it. Often the required libraries cannot be found by your system's dynamic loader. Giving full path names might help.\n"
msgstr "darktable ຊອກຫາ `libOpenCL.so` ຂອງທ່ານພົບ ແຕ່ບອກທ່ານວ່າມັນບໍ່ສາມາດດຶງແພລັດຟອມ (platform) ໄດ້. ໄດເວີ NVIDIA ມັກຈະໃຫ້ລະຫັດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ -1001 ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນຍ້ອນວ່າ `libOpenCL.so` ເປັນພຽງໄລບຣາຣີຫຸ້ມ (wrapper library) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກຕົວຈິງ ຕ້ອງມີການໂຫຼດໄລບຣາຣີສະເພາະຂອງຜູ້ຜະລິດເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ລົ້ມເຫຼວຍ້ອນບາງເຫດຜົນ. ມີໂຄງສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃນ `/etc/OpenCL` ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານທີ່ `libOpenCL.so` ຈະກວດສອບເພື່ອຊອກຫາໄລບຣາຣີເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ລອງກວດເບິ່ງວ່າມີສິ່ງໃດຜິດປົກກະຕິຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມແກ້ໄຂມັນ. ເລື້ອຍໆທີ່ໄດນາມິກໂຫຼດເດີ (dynamic loader) ຂອງລະບົບທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຊອກຫາໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້. ການລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ແບບເຕັມອາດຈະຊ່ວຍໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable states that a context could not be created. This often indicates a version mismatch between the loaded graphics driver and libOpenCL. Check if you have left-over kernel modules or graphics libraries from an older installation and take appropriate action. When in doubt, perform a clean reinstall of your graphics driver. Sometimes, immediately after a driver update, the loaded kernel driver does not match the newly installed libraries. In this case reboot your system before trying again.\n"
msgstr "darktable ລະບຸວ່າບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງສະພາບການ (context) ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ມັກຈະຊີ້ບອກເຖິງເວີຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ກົງກັນລະຫວ່າງໄດເວີກາດຈໍທີ່ໂຫຼດຢູ່ ແລະ libOpenCL. ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າທ່ານມີໂມດູນເຄີເນິລ ຫຼື ໄລບຣາຣີກາດຈໍທີ່ຕົກຄ້າງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນເກົ່າຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ຈັດການໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ. ຖ້າບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ, ໃຫ້ຖອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງໄດເວີກາດຈໍໃໝ່ແບບສະອາດ (clean reinstall). ບາງຄັ້ງ, ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກການອັບເດດໄດເວີ, ໄດເວີເຄີເນິລທີ່ໂຫຼດຢູ່ບໍ່ກົງກັບໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໃໝ່ກ່ອນລອງອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable crashes during startup. This can happen if your OpenCL setup is completely broken or if your driver/library contains a severe bug. If you can't fix it, you can still use darktable with option `--disable-opencl`, which will skip the entire OpenCL initialization step.\n"
msgstr "darktable ຂັດຂ້ອງ (crash) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຖ້າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ OpenCL ຂອງທ່ານເພທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ຖ້າໄດເວີ/ໄລບຣາຣີຂອງທ່ານມີບັກທີ່ຮຸນແຮງ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂມັນໄດ້, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ darktable ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ `--disable-opencl`, ເຊິ່ງຈະຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ OpenCL ທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable fails to compile its OpenCL source files at run-time. In this case you will see a number of error messages looking like typical compiler errors. This could indicate an incompatibility between your OpenCL implementation and darktable's interpretation of the standard. In that case please raise an issue on [github](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/issues/new/choose) and we will try to assist. Please also report if you see significant differences between CPU and GPU processing of an image.\n"
msgstr "darktable ບໍ່ສາມາດແປງຄຳສັ່ງ (compile) ໄຟລ໌ລະຫັດຕົ້ນສະບັບ OpenCL ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ທ່ານຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ເບິ່ງຄືກັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງຕົວແປງຄຳສັ່ງທົ່ວໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຊີ້ບອກເຖິງຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນບໍ່ໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງການປະຕິບັດ OpenCL ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ການຕີຄວາມໝາຍມາດຕະຖານຂອງ darktable. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ ກະລຸນາແຈ້ງບັນຫາໃນ [github](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/issues/new/choose) ແລະ ພວກເຮົາຈະພະຍາຍາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ. ກະລຸນາລາຍງານນຳ ຖ້າທ່ານເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ຊັດເຈນລະຫວ່າງການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບດ້ວຍ CPU ແລະ GPU.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "you have installed a number of OpenCL drivers meant for the same hardware, this will always lead to severe problems and must strictly be avoided. On Windows systems you often have the `Microsoft OpenCLon12` driver installed via the `OpenCL Compatibility Pack`. Inspect and check at [preferences > processing > OpenCL](../../preferences-settings/processing/#opencl).\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງໄດເວີ OpenCL ຫຼາຍອັນສຳລັບຮາດແວດຽວກັນ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາຮຸນແຮງສະເໝີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງຫຼີກລ່ຽງຢ່າງເດັດຂາດ. ໃນລະບົບ Windows, ທ່ານມັກຈະມີໄດເວີ `Microsoft OpenCLon12` ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ `OpenCL Compatibility Pack`. ກວດສອບເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ > OpenCL](../../preferences-settings/processing/#opencl).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/opencl/problems-solutions.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A few emulated-on-CPU implementations of OpenCL also exist, coming as drivers provided by INTEL or AMD. We have observed that they do not provide any speed gain versus the compiler-optimized CPU code. Therefore darktable simply discards these drivers / devices by default.\n"
msgstr "ຍັງມີການປະຕິບັດ OpenCL ແບບຈຳລອງໃນ CPU ບາງຢ່າງ, ເຊິ່ງມາເປັນໄດເວີທີ່ໃຫ້ໂດຍ INTEL ຫຼື AMD. ພວກເຮົາສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຫ້ຄວາມໄວເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເລີຍເມື່ອທຽບກັບລະຫັດ CPU ທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໂດຍຕົວແປງຄຳສັ່ງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ darktable ຈຶ່ງຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ໄດເວີ / ອຸປະກອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/opencl/activate-opencl.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "activating OpenCL in darktable"
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ OpenCL ໃນ darktable"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/activate-opencl.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using OpenCL in darktable requires that your PC is equipped with a suitable graphics card and that it has the required libraries in place. Most modern graphics cards from NVIDIA, Intel or AMD come with full OpenCL support. The OpenCL compiler is normally shipped as part of the proprietary graphics driver and is used as a dynamic library called `libOpenCL.so`. This library must be in a folder where it can be found by your system's dynamic linker.\n"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ OpenCL ໃນ darktable ແມ່ນຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງກາດຈໍທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແລະ ມີໄລບຣາຣີທີ່ຈໍາເປັນຄົບຖ້ວນ. ກາດຈໍທີ່ທັນສະໄໝສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈາກ NVIDIA, Intel ຫຼື AMD ແມ່ນມາພ້ອມກັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ OpenCL ຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ຕົວແປງຄຳສັ່ງ (compiler) ຂອງ OpenCL ຈະຖືກສົ່ງມານຳເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງໄດເວີກາດຈໍທີ່ເປັນກຳມະສິດ ແລະ ຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນໄລບຣາຣີໄດນາມິກທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `libOpenCL.so`. ໄລບຣາຣີນີ້ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ໄດນາມິກລິ້ງເກີ (dynamic linker) ຂອງລະບົບທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/activate-opencl.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When darktable starts, it will first try to find and load `libOpenCL.so` and -- on success -- checks if the available graphics card comes with OpenCL support. A minimally-sufficient amount of graphics memory (1GB+) needs to be available for darktable to take advantage of the GPU. If that check passes, darktable tries to setup its OpenCL environment: a processing context needs to be initialized, a calculation pipeline to be started, OpenCL source code files (extension is `.cl`) needs to be read and compiled and the included routines (OpenCL kernels) need to be prepared for darktable's modules. If all of that completes successfully, the preparation is complete.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ darktable ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາ ແລະ ໂຫຼດ `libOpenCL.so` ກ່ອນ ແລະ -- ຖ້າສຳເລັດ -- ມັນຈະກວດສອບວ່າກາດຈໍທີ່ມີຢູ່ນັ້ນຮອງຮັບ OpenCL ຫຼືບໍ່. darktable ຕ້ອງການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳກາດຈໍ (GPU) ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ (1GB+) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກ GPU. ຖ້າການກວດສອບນັ້ນຜ່ານ, darktable ຈະພະຍາຍາມຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ OpenCL ຂອງມັນ: ຕ້ອງມີການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສະພາບການປະມວນຜົນ, ເລີ່ມທໍ່ການຄຳນວນ, ໄຟລ໌ລະຫັດຕົ້ນສະບັບ OpenCL (ນາມສະກຸນ `.cl`) ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການອ່ານ ແລະ ແປງຄຳສັ່ງ, ແລະ ກິດຈະວັດຕ່າງໆທີ່ລວມຢູ່ນັ້ນ (OpenCL kernels) ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການຈັດຕຽມສຳລັບໂມດູນຂອງ darktable. ຖ້າຂັ້ນຕອນທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳເລັດ, ການຈັດຕຽມກໍຖືວ່າສຳເລັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/activate-opencl.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, OpenCL support is activated in darktable if all the above steps were successful. If you want to de-activate it you can do so in [preferences > processing > OpenCL](../../preferences-settings/processing/#opencl). This configuration parameter is grayed out if the OpenCL initialization failed.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການຮອງຮັບ OpenCL ຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໃນ darktable ຖ້າທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນຂ້າງເທິງສຳເລັດ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ > OpenCL](../../preferences-settings/processing/#opencl). ພານາມິເຕີການກຳນົດຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນສີເທົາ (ກົດບໍ່ໄດ້) ຖ້າການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ OpenCL ລົ້ມເຫຼວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/activate-opencl.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can switch OpenCL support off and on at any time without requiring a restart. Depending on the type of modules you are using, you will notice the effect as a general speed-up during interactive work and export. Most modules in darktable can take advantage of OpenCL but not all modules are demanding enough to make a noticeable difference. In order to feel a real difference, use modules like [_diffuse or sharpen_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md), and [_denoise (profiled)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md).\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປິດ ແລະ ເປີດການຮອງຮັບ OpenCL ໄດ້ທຸກເວລາໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໃໝ່. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບປະເພດຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້, ທ່ານຈະສັງເກດເຫັນຜົນເປັນການເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດວຽກແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ ແລະ ການສົ່ງອອກ. ໂມດູນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນ darktable ສາມາດໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກ OpenCL ໄດ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໂມດູນຈະຕ້ອງການພະລັງງານຫຼາຍພໍທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ສຶກເຖິງຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຢ່າງແທ້ຈິງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນເຊັ່ນ [_ກະຈາຍ ຫຼື ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົມຊັດ (diffuse or sharpen)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md), ແລະ [_ລຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນ (ຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/activate-opencl.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are interested in profiling statistics, you can start darktable with command line parameters `-d opencl -d perf`. After each run of the pixelpipe you will be shown details of processing time for each module plus an even more fine-grained profile for all used OpenCL kernels.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານສົນໃຈສະຖິຕິການປະມວນຜົນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມ darktable ດ້ວຍພານາມິເຕີໃນຄຳສັ່ງ `-d opencl -d perf`. ຫຼັງຈາກການລັນທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊລແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເວລາປະມວນຜົນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂມດູນ ບວກກັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່ານັ້ນສຳລັບ OpenCL kernels ທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/activate-opencl.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apart from the speed-up you should not see any difference in the results between CPU and GPU processing. Except for some rounding errors, the results are designed to be identical. If, for some reason, darktable fails to properly finish a GPU calculation, it will normally detect the failure and automatically (and transparently) fall back to CPU processing.\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກຄວາມໄວທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ ທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນເຫັນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງໃດໆໃນຜົນລັບລະຫວ່າງການປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ CPU ແລະ GPU. ຍົກເວັ້ນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດບາງຢ່າງຈາກການປັດເສດຕົວເລກ, ຜົນລັບຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ຄືກັນ. ຖ້າດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນໃດໜຶ່ງ darktable ບໍ່ສາມາດສຳເລັດການຄຳນວນໃນ GPU ໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວມັນຈະກວດພົບຄວາມລົ້ມເຫຼວນັ້ນ ແລະ ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ CPU ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ແລະ ໂປ່ງໃສ).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/opencl/still-doesnt-work.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenCL still does not run for me"
msgstr "OpenCL ຍັງບໍ່ທັນເຮັດວຽກສຳລັບຂ້ອຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/still-doesnt-work.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As has been mentioned, OpenCL systems come with a huge variety of setups: different GPU manufacturers and models, varying amounts of GPU memory, different drivers, different distributions etc.. \n"
msgstr "ດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວມາແລ້ວ, ລະບົບ OpenCL ມາກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍຫຼາຍ: ຜູ້ຜະລິດ ແລະ ລຸ້ນ GPU ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ປະລິມານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ GPU ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ໄດເວີທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ດິສທຣິບິວຊັນ (distributions) ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/still-doesnt-work.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Many of the potential problems will only appear with very specific combinations of these factors. As the darktable developers only have access to a small fraction of these variations, please understand that we might not be able to fix your specific problem. There is not much we can do if we are unable to reproduce your issue.\n"
msgstr "ບັນຫາຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຈະປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການລວມຕົວຂອງປັດໄຈເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງຫຼາຍ. ເນື່ອງຈາກຜູ້ພັດທະນາ darktable ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ບາງສ່ວນນ້ອຍໆຂອງຄວາມຫຼາກຫຼາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ກະລຸນາເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າພວກເຮົາອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາສະເພາະຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ມັນບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຫຼາຍທີ່ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ຖ້າພວກເຮົາບໍ່ສາມາດຈຳລອງບັນຫາຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/still-doesnt-work.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you are having issues with a specific device (and you have other OpenCL devices available) the first thing to do would be to try disabling just that device -- see [memory & performance tuning](../mem-performance.md#device-specific-opencl-configuration) for more information.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງມີບັນຫາກັບອຸປະກອນສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ (ແລະ ທ່ານມີອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ອື່ນໆທີ່ມີຢູ່) ສິ່ງທຳອິດທີ່ຄວນເຮັດຄືລອງປິດການໃຊ້ງານສະເພາະອຸປະກອນນັ້ນ -- ເບິ່ງ [ການປັບແຕ່ງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ປະສິດທິພາບ](../mem-performance.md#device-specific-opencl-configuration) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/still-doesnt-work.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If nothing else helps, the best option is probably to start darktable with\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ມີວິທີອື່ນຊ່ວຍໄດ້, ທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດອາດຈະແມ່ນການເລີ່ມ darktable ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/still-doesnt-work.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable --disable-opencl`\n"
msgstr "`darktable --disable-opencl`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/still-doesnt-work.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the end there is nothing in darktable that only runs on GPU. Don't let the lack of OpenCL discourage you -- darktable's CPU code is also highly optimized for performance!\n"
msgstr "ໃນທີ່ສຸດແລ້ວ ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງໃນ darktable ທີ່ລັນໄດ້ແຕ່ໃນ GPU ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຢ່າໃຫ້ການຂາດ OpenCL ເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານທໍ້ໃຈ -- ລະຫັດ CPU ຂອງ darktable ກໍຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງເຊັ່ນກັນ!\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "multiple devices"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍອຸປະກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The scheduling of OpenCL devices can be optimized on most systems using the “OpenCL scheduling profile” settings. However, if your system is equipped with more than one GPU, you might want to set the relative device priority manually. To do this you need to select the “default” scheduling profile and change the settings in the “opencl\\_device\\_priority” configuration parameter.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດຕາຕະລາງຂອງອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ສາມາດຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ໃນເກືອບທຸກລະບົບໂດຍໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ “OpenCL "
"scheduling profile”. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຫາກລະບົບຂອງທ່ານມີ GPU ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອັນ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການ"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງອຸປະກອນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ “default” ແລະ "
"ປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນພາຣາມີເຕີ “opencl\\_device\\_priority”.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is important to understand how darktable uses OpenCL devices. Each processing sequence of an image -- to convert an input to the final output using a history stack -- is run in a pixelpipe. There are five different types of pixelpipe in darktable. One type is responsible for processing the center image view (or full view) in darkroom mode, another pixelpipe processes the preview image (navigation window, also required for histograms and more internal stuff relevant for correct output of the full view). Another preview pixelpipe would be required for showing a second darkroom window. There can be one of each of these three pixelpipes running at any time, with the full and preview pixelpipes running in parallel. In addition there can be multiple parallel pixelpipes performing file exports as well as multiple parallel pixelpipes generating thumbnails. If an OpenCL device is available, darktable dynamically allocates it to one specific pixelpipe for one run and releases it afterwards.\n"
msgstr "ມັນສຳຄັນທີ່ຕ້ອງເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າ darktable ໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ແນວໃດ. ແຕ່ລະລຳດັບການປະມວນຜົນຂອງຮູບພາບ -- ເພື່ອແປງຂາເຂົ້າເປັນຜົນລັບສຸດທ້າຍໂດຍການໃຊ້ລາຍການປະຫວັດ -- ແມ່ນຖືກລັນໃນທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊລ (pixelpipe). ມີທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊລຫ້າປະເພດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນ darktable. ປະເພດໜຶ່ງມີໜ້າທີ່ປະມວນຜົນມຸມມອງຮູບພາບກາງ (ຫຼື ມຸມມອງເຕັມ) ໃນໂໝດຫ້ອງມືດ, ອີກທໍ່ໜຶ່ງປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຕົວຢ່າງ (ໜ້າຕ່າງນຳທາງ, ເຊິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບຮີສໂຕແກຣມ ແລະ ສິ່ງອື່ນໆພາຍໃນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງມຸມມອງເຕັມ). ອີກທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນຕົວຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຈະຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງຫ້ອງມືດທີສອງ. ສາມາດມີແຕ່ລະອັນໃນສາມທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນນີ້ລັນໃນເວລາໃດກໍໄດ້, ໂດຍທີ່ທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນເຕັມ ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງລັນໄປພ້ອມໆກັນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ ຍັງສາມາດມີຫຼາຍທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນທີ່ລັນຂະໜານກັນເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ ລວມທັງຫຼາຍທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນທີ່ສ້າງຮູບຍໍ້ (thumbnails). ຖ້າມີອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ຢູ່, darktable ຈະກຳນົດມັນໃຫ້ກັບທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບການລັນໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງ ແລະ ຈະປ່ອຍມັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The computational demand varies significantly depending on the type of pixelpipe being executed. The preview image and thumbnails are low resolution and can be processed quickly, whereas processing the center image view or the second window is more demanding. A full export pixelpipe is more demanding still.\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການໃນການຄຳນວນຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບປະເພດຂອງທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊລທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ. ຮູບພາບຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ຮູບຍໍ້ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳ ແລະ ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໄວ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການປະມວນຜົນມຸມມອງຮູບພາບກາງ ຫຼື ໜ້າຕ່າງທີສອງແມ່ນຕ້ອງການພະລັງຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນການສົ່ງອອກເຕັມຮູບແບບແມ່ນຕ້ອງການພະລັງຫຼາຍກວ່າອີກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The configuration parameter “opencl\\_device\\_priority” holds a string with the following structure:\n"
msgstr ""
"ພາລາມິເຕີການກຳນົດຄ່າ “opencl_device_priority” ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີໂຄງສ້າງດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`a,b,c.../d,e,f.../g,h,i.../j,k,l.../m,n,o...`\n"
msgstr "`a,b,c.../d,e,f.../g,h,i.../j,k,l.../m,n,o...`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each letter represents one specific OpenCL device. There are five fields in the parameter string separated by a slash, each representing one type of pixelpipe. `a,b,c...` defines the devices that are allowed to process the center image (full) pixelpipe. Likewise devices `d,e,f...` can process the preview pixelpipe, devices `g,h,i...` the export pixelpipes, devices `j,k,l...` the thumbnail pixelpipes and finally devices `m,n,o...` preview pixelpipe for the second window. An empty field means that no OpenCL device may serve this type of pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຕົວອັກສອນແທນອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ໜຶ່ງອັນໂດຍສະເພາະ. ມີຫ້າຊ່ອງໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມພານາມິເຕີທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍທັບ (/), ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງແທນທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊລໜຶ່ງປະເພດ. `a,b,c...` ກຳນົດອຸປະກອນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນທໍ່ພິກເຊລຮູບພາບກາງ (ເຕັມ). ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ ອຸປະກອນ `d,e,f...` ສາມາດປະມວນຜົນທໍ່ພິກເຊລຕົວຢ່າງ, ອຸປະກອນ `g,h,i...` ປະມວນຜົນທໍ່ພິກເຊລສົ່ງອອກ, ອຸປະກອນ `j,k,l...` ປະມວນຜົນທໍ່ພິກເຊລຮູບຍໍ້ ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍອຸປະກອນ `m,n,o...` ປະມວນຜົນທໍ່ພິກເຊລຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີສອງ. ຊ່ອງຫວ່າງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບໍ່ມີອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ໃດທີ່ຈະຮັບໃຊ້ທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນປະເພດນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable has an internal numbering system, whereby the first available OpenCL device receives the number 0. All further devices are numbered consecutively. This number, together with the device name, is displayed when you start darktable with `darktable -d opencl`. You can specify a device either by number or by its canonical name (upper/lower case and whitespace do not matter). If you have more than one device with the same name you need to use the device numbers in order to differentiate them.\n"
msgstr "darktable ມີລະບົບໝາຍເລກພາຍໃນ, ໂດຍທີ່ອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ທຳອິດທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບໝາຍເລກ 0. ອຸປະກອນຕໍ່ໆໄປທັງໝົດຈະຖືກໃຫ້ໝາຍເລກລຽງກັນໄປ. ໝາຍເລກນີ້, ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ອຸປະກອນ, ຈະຖືກສະແດງເມື່ອທ່ານເລີ່ມ darktable ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ `darktable -d opencl`. ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດອຸປະກອນໄດ້ທັງດ້ວຍໝາຍເລກ ຫຼື ດ້ວຍຊື່ມາດຕະຖານຂອງມັນ (ຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່/ນ້ອຍ ແລະ ຍະຫວ່າງແມ່ນບໍ່ສຳຄັນ). ຖ້າທ່ານມີຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນ ທ່ານຈໍາເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໝາຍເລກອຸປະກອນເພື່ອແຍກຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງພວກມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A device specifier can be prefixed with an exclamation mark `!`, in which case the device is excluded from processing a given pixelpipe. You can also use an asterisk `*` as a wildcard, representing all devices not previously explicitly mentioned in that group.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວລະບຸອຸປະກອນສາມາດໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍທ້ວງ `!` ໄວ້ທາງໜ້າ, ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນອຸປະກອນຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການປະມວນຜົນທໍ່ພິກເຊລທີ່ກຳນົດ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ດອກຈັນ `*` ເປັນຕົວແທນ (wildcard), ເຊິ່ງແທນອຸປະກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່າວເຖິງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນມາກ່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sequence order within a group matters -- darktable will read the list from left to right and whenever it tries to allocate an OpenCL device to a pixelpipe it will scan the devices in that order, taking the first free device it finds.\n"
msgstr "ລຳດັບພາຍໃນກຸ່ມແມ່ນສຳຄັນ -- darktable ຈະອ່ານລາຍຊື່ຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ ແລະ ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ມັນພະຍາຍາມກຳນົດອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ໃຫ້ກັບທໍ່ພິກເຊລ ມັນຈະກວດສອບອຸປະກອນຕາມລຳດັບນັ້ນ, ແລະ ຈະເລືອກອຸປະກອນທຳອິດທີ່ວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a pixelpipe process is about to be started and all GPUs in the corresponding group are busy, darktable automatically processes the image on the CPU by default. You can enforce GPU processing by prefixing the list of allowed GPUs with a plus sign `+`. In this case darktable will not use the CPU but rather suspend processing until the next permitted OpenCL device is available.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າຂະບວນການທໍ່ພິກເຊລກຳລັງຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ GPU ທັງໝົດໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, darktable ຈະປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບໃນ CPU ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດບັງຄັບໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ GPU ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍບວກ `+` ໄວ້ທາງໜ້າລາຍຊື່ GPU ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ darktable ຈະບໍ່ໃຊ້ CPU ແຕ່ຈະຢຸດການປະມວນຜົນຊົ່ວຄາວຈົນກວ່າຈະມີອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດອັນຕໍ່ໄປວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable's default setting for “opencl\\_device\\_priority” is `*/!0,*/*/*/!0,*`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ darktable ສໍາລັບ “opencl\\_device\\_priority” ແມ່ນ `*/!0,*/*/*/"
"!0,*`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Any detected OpenCL device is permitted to process the center view image. The first OpenCL device (0) is not permitted to process both preview pixelpipes. As a consequence, if there is only one GPU available on your system, the preview pixelpipes will always be processed on the CPU, keeping your single GPU exclusively for the more demanding center image view. This is a reasonable setting for most systems. No such restrictions apply to export and thumbnail pixelpipes.\n"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ໃດໆທີ່ກວດພົບແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບມຸມມອງກາງ. ອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ທຳອິດ (0) ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນທັງສອງທໍ່ພິກເຊລຕົວຢ່າງ. ຜົນກໍຄື, ຖ້າມີ GPU ພຽງອັນດຽວໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ, ທໍ່ພິກເຊລຕົວຢ່າງຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນ CPU ສະເໝີ, ເພື່ອເກັບ GPU ອັນດຽວຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ສຳລັບມຸມມອງຮູບພາບກາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການພະລັງຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ນີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ສົມເຫດສົມຜົນສຳລັບລະບົບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດດັ່ງກ່າວກັບທໍ່ພິກເຊລສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ຮູບຍໍ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The default is a good choice if you have only one device. If you have several devices it forms a reasonable starting point. However, as your devices might have quite different levels of processing power, it makes sense to invest some time optimizing your priority list.\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີຖ້າທ່ານມີພຽງອຸປະກອນດຽວ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີຫຼາຍອຸປະກອນ ມັນກໍເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສົມເຫດສົມຜົນ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເນື່ອງຈາກອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານອາດຈະມີລະດັບພະລັງການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍ, ມັນຈຶ່ງຄຸ້ມຄ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາໃນການປັບແຕ່ງລາຍຊື່ລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here is an example. Let's assume we have a system with two devices, a fast Nvidia Quadro RTX 4000 and a slower GeForce GTX 1050. darktable (started with `darktable -d opencl`) will report the following devices:\n"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງ. ສົມມຸດວ່າພວກເຮົາມີລະບົບທີ່ມີສອງອຸປະກອນ, Nvidia Quadro RTX 4000 ທີ່ໄວ ແລະ GeForce GTX 1050 ທີ່ຊ້າກວ່າ. darktable (ທີ່ເລີ່ມດ້ວຍ `darktable -d opencl`) ຈະລາຍງານອຸປະກອນດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[opencl_init] successfully initialized.\n"
"[opencl_init] here are the internal numbers and names of\n"
"                          OpenCL devices available to darktable:\n"
"[opencl_init]           0       'NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050'\n"
"[opencl_init]           1       'NVIDIA CUDA Quadro RTX 4000'\n"
"[opencl_init] FINALLY: opencl is AVAILABLE on this system.\n"
msgstr ""
"[opencl_init] ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳເລັດ.\n"
"[opencl_init] ນີ້ແມ່ນໝາຍເລກພາຍໃນ ແລະ ຊື່ຂອງ\n"
"                          ອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ darktable:\n"
"[opencl_init]           0       'NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050'\n"
"[opencl_init]           1       'NVIDIA CUDA Quadro RTX 4000'\n"
"[opencl_init] ສຸດທ້າຍ: opencl ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ (AVAILABLE) ໃນລະບົບນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "with the canonical names shown above as `nvidiagforcegtx1050` and `nvidiacudaquadrortx4000`\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍມີຊື່ມາດຕະຖານທີ່ສະແດງຂ້າງເທິງເປັນ `nvidiagforcegtx1050` ແລະ `nvidiacudaquadrortx4000`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, the GeForce GTX 1050 is detected as the first device and the Quadro RTX 4000 as the second. This order will normally not change unless the hardware or driver configuration is modified, but it's better to use device names rather than numbers to be on the safe side.\n"
msgstr "ໃນທີ່ນີ້, GeForce GTX 1050 ຖືກກວດພົບເປັນອຸປະກອນທຳອິດ ແລະ Quadro RTX 4000 ເປັນອຸປະກອນທີສອງ. ປົກກະຕິລຳດັບນີ້ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ ນອກຈາກວ່າຮາດແວ ຫຼື ການກຳນົດຄ່າໄດເວີຈະຖືກແກ້ໄຂ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍດີກວ່າທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ອຸປະກອນແທນໝາຍເລກເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the GTX 1050 is slower than the RTX 4000, an optimized \"opencl\\_device\\_priority\" could look like:\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ GTX 1050 ຊ້າກວ່າ RTX 4000, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"opencl\\_device\\_priority\" ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວອາດຈະເປັນແບບນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`!nvidiagforcegtx1050,*/!nvidiacudaquadrortx4000,*/nvidiacudaquadrortx4000,*/nvidiacudaquadrortx4000,*/!nvidiacudaquadrortx4000`.\n"
msgstr "`!nvidiagforcegtx1050,*/!nvidiacudaquadrortx4000,*/nvidiacudaquadrortx4000,*/nvidiacudaquadrortx4000,*/!nvidiacudaquadrortx4000`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The GTX 1050 is explicitly excluded from processing the center image pixelpipe; this is reserved to “all” other devices (i.e. the RTX 4000). Conversely -- for the preview pixelpipes -- the RTX 4000, so that only the GTX 1050 is permitted to do the work.\n"
msgstr ""
"GTX 1050 ຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຢ່າງຊັດເຈນຈາກການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບໃນສ່ວນກາງ; ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກສະຫງວນໄວ້ໃຫ້ອຸປະກອ"
"ນ “ອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ” (ເຊັ່ນ RTX 4000). ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ -- ສໍາລັບ pixelpipes ຂອງການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າ"
"ງ -- RTX 4000 ຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພຽງແຕ່ GTX 1050 ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/multiple-devices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For file export and thumbnail generation we want all hands on deck. However, darktable should first check whether the RTX 4000 device is free, because it's faster. If it is not free, then all other devices -- in fact only the GTX 1050 -- are checked.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ການສ້າງຮູບຍໍ້ ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, darktable ຄວນກວດສອບກ່ອນວ່າອຸປະກອນ RTX 4000 ວ່າງຫຼືບໍ່, ເພາະມັນໄວກວ່າ. ຖ້າມັນບໍ່ວ່າງ, ອຸປະກອນອື່ນທັງໝົດ -- ເຊິ່ງໃນຄວາມຈິງກໍຄືພຽງແຕ່ GTX 1050 -- ຈະຖືກກວດສອບ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/opencl/how-opencl-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "how OpenCL works"
msgstr "OpenCL ເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/how-opencl-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As you can imagine, the hardware architecture of GPUs can vary significantly. There are different manufacturers, and even different generations of GPUs from the same manufacturer may not be comparable. At the same time GPU manufacturers don't normally disclose all the hardware details of their products to the public. One of the consequences of this is the need to use proprietary drivers under Linux, if you want to take full advantage of your graphics card.\n"
msgstr "ດັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດຈິນຕະນາການໄດ້, ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຮາດແວຂອງ GPU ສາມາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ມີຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ແລະ ເຖິງແມ່ນ GPU ລຸ້ນຕ່າງໆຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດດຽວກັນກໍອາດຈະປຽບທຽບກັນບໍ່ໄດ້. ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ ຜູ້ຜະລິດ GPU ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ເປີດເຜີຍລາຍລະອຽດຮາດແວທັງໝົດຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນໃຫ້ສາທາລະນະຊົນຮູ້. ຜົນທີ່ຕາມມາອັນໜຶ່ງກໍຄື ຄວາມຈໍາເປັນໃນການໃຊ້ໄດເວີທີ່ເປັນກຳມະສິດພາຍໃຕ້ Linux, ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກກາດຈໍຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເຕັມທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/opencl/how-opencl-works.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fortunately an industry consortium lead by The Khronos Group has developed an open, standardized interface called OpenCL, which allows your GPU to be used as a numerical processing device. OpenCL offers a C99-like programming language with a strong focus on parallel computing. An application that wants to use OpenCL will need OpenCL source code that it hands over to a hardware-specific compiler at run-time. This way applications can use OpenCL on different GPU architectures (even at the same time). All of the hardware “secrets” are hidden in this compiler and are normally not visible to the user (or the application). The compiled OpenCL code is loaded onto your GPU and -- with certain API calls -- it is ready to perform calculations for you. \n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຊກດີທີ່ກຸ່ມພັນທະມິດອຸດສາຫະກຳທີ່ນຳໂດຍ The Khronos Group ໄດ້ພັດທະນາອິນເຕີເຟດມາດຕະຖານແບບເປີດທີ່ເ"
"ອີ້ນວ່າ OpenCL, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ GPU ຂອງທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນອຸປະກອນປະມວນຜົນທາງຕົວເລກໄດ້. OpenCL ມີພາ"
"ສາການຂຽນໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ C99 ໂດຍເນັ້ນໜັກໃສ່ການປະມວນຜົນແບບຂະໜານ. ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ "
"OpenCL ຈະຕ້ອງມີ OpenCL source code ເພື່ອສົ່ງໃຫ້ກັບ compiler ທີ່ສະເພາະກັບຮາດແວໃນຂະນະທີ່ລັນໂປ"
"ຣແກຣມ (run-time). ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້, ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສາມາດໃຊ້ OpenCL ໃນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ GPU ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັ"
"ນໄດ້ (ແມ່ນແຕ່ໃນເວລາພ້ອມກັນ). “ຄວາມລັບ” ຂອງຮາດແວທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຊ່ອນໄວ້ໃນ compiler ນີ້ ແລະ ປົກກະຕິ"
"ແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ຫຼື ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ). ລະຫັດ OpenCL ທີ່ຖືກແປແລ້ວຈະຖືກໂຫລດລົງໃນ GPU ຂອ"
"ງທ່ານ ແລະ -- ດ້ວຍການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ API ບາງຢ່າງ -- ມັນກໍ່ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະເຮັດການຄິດໄລ່ໃຫ້ທ່ານ. \n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "memory & performance tuning"
msgstr "ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ການປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບ"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "memory requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processing a Raw image in darktable requires a great deal of system memory. A simple calculation makes this clear: For a 20 megapixel image, darktable requires a 4x32-bit floating point cell to store each pixel, meaning that each full image of this size will require approximately 300MB of memory just to store the image data. In order to actually process this image through a given module, darktable needs at least two buffers (input and output) of this size, with more complex modules potentially requiring several additional buffers for intermediate data. Without further optimization, anything between 600MB and 3GB of memory might be required to store and process image data as the pixelpipe executes. On top of this is darktable's code segment, the code and data of any dynamically-linked system libraries, as well as further buffers that darktable uses to store intermediate states (cache) for quick access during interactive work.\n"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບ Raw ໃນ darktable ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳລະບົບ (RAM) ຫຼາຍ. ຖ້າຄຳນວນງ່າຍໆ: ສຳລັບຮູບພາບຂະໜາດ 20 ລ້ານພິກເຊວ, darktable ຕ້ອງການພື້ນທີ່ 4x32-bit floating point ເພື່ອເກັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຮູບພາບຂະໜາດນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ RAM ປະມານ 300MB ພຽງເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາບ. ໃນການປະມວນຜົນຜ່ານໂມດູນໃດໜຶ່ງ, darktable ຕ້ອງການຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສອງບັບເຟີ (input ແລະ output) ໃນຂະໜາດດຽວກັນ, ແລະ ໂມດູນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າອາດຕ້ອງການບັບເຟີເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລະຫວ່າງກາງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການປັບແຕ່ງ, ອາດຕ້ອງໃຊ້ RAM ລະຫວ່າງ 600MB ຫາ 3GB ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງມີສ່ວນຂອງລະຫັດໂປຣແກຣມ, ໄລບຣາຣີຂອງລະບົບ, ແລະ ບັບເຟີອື່ນໆທີ່ darktable ໃຊ້ເກັບສະຖານະຊົ່ວຄາວ (cache) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All in all, darktable requires _at least_ 4GB of physical RAM plus 4 to 8GB of additional swap space to run but it will perform better the more memory you have.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍລວມແລ້ວ, darktable ຕ້ອງການ RAM ຕົວຈິງ _ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ_ 4GB ບວກກັບພື້ນທີ່ swap ເພີ່ມເຕີມ 4 ຫາ "
"8GB ເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As well as executing on your CPU, many darktable modules also have OpenCL implementations that can take full advantage of the parallel processing offered by your graphics card (GPU). Similarly, the more GPU memory you have, the better darktable will perform.\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກການປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍ CPU ແລ້ວ, ຫຼາຍໂມດູນໃນ darktable ຍັງຮອງຮັບ OpenCL ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ ການປະມວນຜົນແບບຂະໜານຂອງກາດຈໍ (GPU). ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ຖ້າທ່ານມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ GPU ຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ, darktable ກໍຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tiling"
msgstr "ການແບ່ງສ່ວນປະມວນຜົນ (Tiling)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If darktable does not have sufficient memory to process the entire image in one go, modules may choose to use a \"tiling strategy\", wherein the image is split into smaller parts (tiles) which are processed independently, and then stitched back together at the end. While this allows images to be processed with a much smaller memory footprint, it does also come with some down-sides:\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າ darktable ມີໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳບໍ່ພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບທັງໝົດໃນຄັ້ງດຽວ, ໂມດູນຕ່າງໆອາດຈະເລືອກໃຊ້ \"ກົນລະຍຸດການແບ່ງສ່ວນ\" (tiling), ເຊິ່ງຮູບພາບຈະຖືກແບ່ງເປັນສ່ວນນ້ອຍໆ ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນແຍກກັນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງນຳມາຕໍ່ກັນໃນຕອນທ້າຍ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ດ້ວຍໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ໜ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍມີຂໍ້ເສຍບາງຢ່າງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tiling is always slower -- sometimes up to 10x slower, though for some modules the difference is negligible,\n"
msgstr "ການແບ່ງສ່ວນຈະເຮັດວຽກຊ້າກວ່າສະເໝີ -- ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຊ້າກວ່າເຖິງ 10 ເທົ່າ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໃນບາງໂມດູນຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຈະໜ້ອຍຫຼາຍ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tiling is not technically possible for some modules because of the nature of the underlying algorithms\n"
msgstr "ບາງໂມດູນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ການແບ່ງສ່ວນໄດ້ທາງເຕັກນິກ ຍ້ອນລັກສະນະຂອງສູດການຄຳນວນທີ່ໃຊ້\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For most systems, tiling will probably only be used for full-sized image exports, with interactive work in the darkroom being processed more efficiently. For best performance (and avoidance of tiling modes) you should run darktable alongside as few other applications as possible and configure darktable to use as much of your system and GPU memory as you can.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບລະບົບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ການແບ່ງສ່ວນອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະຕອນສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບຂະໜາດເຕັມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ສ່ວນການແຕ່ງຮູບໃນ darkroom ຈະປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ. ເພື່ອປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ (ແລະ ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການແບ່ງສ່ວນ) ທ່ານຄວນເປີດ darktable ໂດຍບໍ່ເປີດແອັບອື່ນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ darktable ໃຊ້ RAM ແລະ GPU ໃຫ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເຮັດໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "performance tuning"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are a number of configuration parameters that can help you to fine-tune your system's performance. Some of these parameters are available in [preferences > processing > CPU / memory](../preferences-settings/processing.md#cpu--memory) and others need to be modified directly in darktable's configuration file (`darktablerc` in the darktable [configuration directory](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md)).\n"
msgstr "ມີຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງລະບົບໄດ້. ບາງຄ່າສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ > CPU / ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ](../preferences-settings/processing.md#cpu--memory) ແລະ ບາງຄ່າຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂໂດຍກົງໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ darktable (`darktablerc` ໃນ [ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section provides some guidance on how to adjust these settings.\n"
msgstr "ພາກນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປັບແຕ່ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "how to test"
msgstr "ວິທີການທົດສອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to determine how much your modifications improve (or not) darktable's performance, you will need one or more sample images to test with, and a method of assessing the speed of the pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າການປັບແຕ່ງຂອງທ່ານຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ darktable ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ບໍ່, ທ່ານຕ້ອງມີຮູບພາບຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ວິທີການວັດແທກຄວາມໄວຂອງທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນ (pixelpipe).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For sample images, you are advised to use some of the more intensive modules, such as [diffuse or sharpen](../module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md) or [denoise (profiled)](../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md). Exports are likely to have more consistent and comparable timings between pipe runs than interactive work (and will also push your hardware more).\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຮູບພາບຕົວຢ່າງ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນທີ່ປະມວນຜົນໜັກໆ ເຊັ່ນ [diffuse or sharpen](../module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md) ຫຼື [denoise (profiled)](../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md). ການທົດສອບດ້ວຍການສົ່ງອອກ (export) ຈະໃຫ້ເວລາທີ່ຄົງທີ່ ແລະ ປຽບທຽບໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າການແຕ່ງຮູບແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to obtain profiling information you need to start darktable from a terminal with `darktable -d opencl -d perf`. If you want more information about tiling you should use `darktable -d opencl -d tiling -d perf`.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນການປະມວນຜົນ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດ darktable ຈາກເທີມິນໍດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ `darktable -d opencl -d perf`. ຖ້າຕ້ອງການຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການແບ່ງສ່ວນ (tiling) ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ `darktable -d opencl -d tiling -d perf`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each time the pixelpipe is processed (when you change module parameters, zoom, pan, export etc.) you will see (in your terminal session) the total time spent in the pixelpipe and the time spent in each of the OpenCL kernels. The most reliable value is the total time spent in the pixelpipe and you should use this to assess your changes.\n"
msgstr "ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນເຮັດວຽກ (ເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ຽນຄ່າໂມດູນ, ຊູມ, ເລື່ອນພາບ, ສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ທ່ານຈະເຫັນເວລາທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ ແລະ ເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຂອງ OpenCL ໃນເທີມິນໍ. ຄ່າທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນເວລາທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ pixelpipe, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອປະເມີນການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: The timings given for each individual module are unreliable when running the OpenCL pixelpipe asynchronously (see _asyncronous mode_ below).\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ເວລາທີ່ສະແດງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂມດູນອາດຈະບໍ່ຊັດເຈນ ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນ OpenCL ແບບບໍ່ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ (ເບິ່ງ _asyncronous mode_ ດ້ານລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To allow for efficient processing with OpenCL it is essential that the GPU is kept busy. Any interrupts or a stalled data flow will add to the total processing time. This is especially important for the small image buffers used during interactive work, which can be processed quickly by a fast GPU. However, even short-term stalls of the pixelpipe can easily become a bottleneck.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ OpenCL ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ, ມັນຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ GPU ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຕະຫຼອດ. ການຂັດຈັງຫວະ ຫຼື ການໄຫຼຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕິດຂັດ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາປະມວນຜົນເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳຄັນຫຼາຍສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍໃນເວລາແຕ່ງຮູບ, ເຊິ່ງ GPU ທີ່ໄວສາມາດເຮັດແລ້ວໄດ້ທັນທີ. ແຕ່ເຖິງແມ່ນການຢຸດສະງັກພຽງເລັກນ້ອຍ ກໍອາດກາຍເປັນບັນຫາຄໍຂວດໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the other hand darktable's performance during file exports is more or less only governed by the speed of the algorithms and the horse-power of your GPU. Short-term stalls will not have a noticeable effect on the total time of an export.\n"
msgstr "ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ darktable ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌ ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມໄວຂອງສູດການຄຳນວນ ແລະ ຄວາມແຮງຂອງ GPU ເປັນຫຼັກ. ການຢຸດສະງັກໄລຍະສັ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຫຼາຍຕໍ່ເວລາທັງໝົດຂອງການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable resources"
msgstr "ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງ darktable"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"darktable resources\" preference (in [preferences > processing > CPU / memory](../preferences-settings/processing.md#cpu--memory)) allows you to choose between four different approaches to allocating your system's resources to darktable. Each of these options controls multiple individual parameters, which are defined independently in `darktablerc` in the darktable [configuration directory](../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). You can amend any of these directly within your darktablerc file to tweak values for your selected resource level, though you cannot add your own custom resource level to the preferences drop-down.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ \"ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງ darktable\" (ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ > CPU / ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ]) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກວິທີການຈັດສັນຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງລະບົບໃຫ້ກັບ darktable ໄດ້ 4 ຮູບແບບ. ແຕ່ລະຕົວເລືອກຈະຄວບຄຸມຫຼາຍພາກສ່ວນ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກກຳນົດແຍກກັນໃນໄຟລ໌ `darktablerc`. ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນໄຟລ໌ darktablerc ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງລະດັບຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້, ແຕ່ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມລະດັບຊັບພະຍາກອນໃໝ່ເຂົ້າໄປໃນລາຍການເລືອກໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each of the four \"darktable resources\" options are defined as follows:\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຕົວເລືອກໃນ 4 ລະດັບຂອງ \"ຊັບພະຍາກອນຂອງ darktable\" ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resource_default=512 8 128 700\n"
"resource_large=700 16 128 900\n"
"resource_small=128 4 64 400\n"
msgstr ""
"resource_default=512 8 128 700\n"
"resource_large=700 16 128 900\n"
"resource_small=128 4 64 400\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "More generally, these can be represented as `resource_level=a b c d` where `a` - `d` are defined as follows:\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ສາມາດສະແດງເປັນ `resource_level=a b c d` ໂດຍທີ່ `a` - `d` ມີຄວາມໝາຍດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"a. system memory for module processing\n"
": The maximum amount of system memory made available for module processing. Lower values force memory-hungry modules to process images with an increasing number of tiles. This number is a fraction of the total amount of system memory, divided by 1024. For example, on a system with 16GB of total system memory the amount assigned by `resource_default` (in GB) is `16 * 512 / 1024`, or 8GB of system RAM.\n"
msgstr ""
"a. ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳລະບົບສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນໂມດູນ\n"
": ຈຳນວນ RAM ສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂມດູນທີ່ກິນ RAM ຫຼາຍຕ້ອງແບ່ງສ່ວນປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຕົວເລກນີ້ແມ່ນສັດສ່ວນຂອງ RAM ທັງໝົດ ຫານດ້ວຍ 1024. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີ RAM 16GB, ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ `resource_default` (ເປັນ GB) ແມ່ນ `16 * 512 / 1024` ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ 8GB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"b. minimum tiling buffer size\n"
": The minimum size of a single tiling buffer, similarly expressed as a fraction of total system memory. For example, on a system with 16GB of total system memory the amount assigned by `resource_default` (in GB) is `16 * 8 / 1024`, or 0.125GB of system RAM. Note that this setting is largely historic and is no longer of much practical use -- you are advised to leave it at its default value.\n"
msgstr ""
"b. ຂະໜາດບັບເຟີຂັ້ນຕ່ຳຂອງການແບ່ງສ່ວນ\n"
": ຂະໜາດຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ (tile), ໂດຍຄິດເປັນສັດສ່ວນຂອງ RAM ທັງໝົດເຊັ່ນກັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີ RAM 16GB, ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ `resource_default` ແມ່ນ 0.125GB. ໝາຍເຫດ: ຄ່ານີ້ເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບເກົ່າ ແລະ ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍໄດ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ -- ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປະໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"c. thumbnail cache memory\n"
": The amount of memory to use for the thumbnail cache. Again, this is expressed as a fraction of total system memory and, on a 16GB system, the amount assigned by `resource_default` is `16 * 128 / 1024`, or 2GB of system RAM.\n"
msgstr ""
"c. ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳແຄຊຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnail cache)\n"
": ຈຳນວນ RAM ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເກັບຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ. ໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີ RAM 16GB, ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ `resource_default` ແມ່ນ 2GB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"d. OpenCL (GPU) memory\n"
": The maximum amount of GPU memory made available for module processing. As with system memory, lower values will force memory-hungry modules to process images with an increasing number of tiles. Your GPU memory will likely also be used by other applications on your system. However, in contrast to system memory, your GPU is not able to take advantage of swap files and it is impossible for darktable to know how much memory is available at a given time. If this parameter is set too high, darktable could be forced to fall back to CPU processing (which will be significantly slower but stable and with correctly processed data) or darktable might crash and even make your system unusable. For this reason, the GPU memory parameter fraction also includes an extra 600MB of headroom in an attempt to avoid over-allocation of memory. For example, on a GPU with 6GB of memory, darktable will use approximately `(6 - 0.6) * 700 / 1024`, or 3.5GB of GPU RAM when using the `resource_default` level.\n"
msgstr ""
"d. ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ OpenCL (GPU)\n"
": ຈຳນວນ RAM ຂອງກາດຈໍສູງສຸດທີ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ຄືກັນກັບ RAM ລະບົບ, ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່ຳຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຕ້ອງແບ່ງສ່ວນປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. RAM ຂອງ GPU ອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍແອັບອື່ນນຳ, ແລະ ຕ່າງຈາກ RAM ລະບົບຄື GPU ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ swap ໄດ້. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າສູງເກີນໄປ, darktable ອາດຈະຕ້ອງກັບໄປໃຊ້ CPU (ເຊິ່ງຊ້າກວ່າຫຼາຍ) ຫຼື ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂປຣແກຣມຄ້າງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄ່ານີ້ຈຶ່ງມີການຫັກອອກ 600MB ເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ກາດຈໍທີ່ມີ RAM 6GB, darktable ຈະໃຊ້ RAM ປະມານ 3.5GB ເມື່ອໃຊ້ລະດັບ `resource_default`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to the resource levels presented in the UI the following options can be set via the command-line (e.g. `darktable --conf resourcelevel=\"notebook\"`). These modes are designed for debugging tiling issues and testing performance of common systems on larger development machines. The following options are provided:\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກລະດັບຊັບພະຍາກອນໃນ UI ແລ້ວ, ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຕັ້ງຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ (command-line) ໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ `darktable --conf resourcelevel=\"notebook\"`). ໂໝດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອ ທົດສອບບັນຫາການແບ່ງສ່ວນ ແລະ ປະສິດທິພາບ. ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີໃຫ້ມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"mini\" (1GB ram, 2MB single buffer, 128MB thumbnail cache, 200MB OpenCL memory)\n"
msgstr "\"mini\" (RAM 1GB, ບັບເຟີດ່ຽວ 2MB, ແຄຊຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ 128MB, RAM OpenCL 200MB)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"notebook\" (4GB ram, 32MB  single buffer, 512MB thumbnail cache, 1GB OpenCL memory)\n"
msgstr "\"notebook\" (RAM 4GB, ບັບເຟີດ່ຽວ 32MB, ແຄຊຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ 512MB, RAM OpenCL 1GB)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"reference\" (8GB ram, 32MB single buffer, 512MB thumbnail cache, 2GB OpenCL memory)\n"
msgstr "\"reference\" (RAM 8GB, ບັບເຟີດ່ຽວ 32MB, ແຄຊຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ 512MB, RAM OpenCL 2GB)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"common2026” (16GB ram, 64MB single buffer, 1GB thumbnail cache, 5.5GB OpenCL memory)\n"
msgstr ""
"\"common2026\" (16GB RAM, 64MB ບັບເຟີດ່ຽວ, 1GB ແຄຊ໌ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ, 5.5GB ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ "
"OpenCL)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tuning GPU memory usage"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ GPU"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to make maximal use of your GPU memory for OpenCL, you have two options:\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ RAM ຂອງກາດຈໍໃຫ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບ OpenCL, ທ່ານມີ 2 ທາງເລືອກ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the \"large\" resource level. For a 6GB card, this will use approximately 5GB of GPU memory, leaving 1GB for the rest of your system. (recommended)\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກລະດັບຊັບພະຍາກອນ \"large\". ສຳລັບກາດຈໍ 6GB, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ RAM GPU ປະມານ 5GB, ແລະ ເຫຼືອໄວ້ 1GB ສຳລັບລະບົບ. (ແນະນຳ)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alter darktablerc to increase the last number (the OpenCL memory fraction) for your selected resource level. For example, increasing the OpenCL memory fraction to 950 would increase the available memory on a 6GB GPU to approximately 5.3GB. (absolutely not recommended)\n"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ darktablerc ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວເລກສຸດທ້າຍ (ສັດສ່ວນ RAM OpenCL) ໃນລະດັບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພີ່ມເປັນ 950 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ RAM ໄດ້ 5.3GB ໃນກາດຈໍ 6GB. (ບໍ່ແນະນຳຢ່າງເດັດຂາດ)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "balanced OpenCL versus CPU tiling"
msgstr "ການຊັ່ງນ້ຳໜັກລະຫວ່າງ OpenCL ກັບ CPU Tiling"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In most cases, running a processing module on a high-powered GPU (the OpenCL codepath) is significantly faster than running the same module using the CPU codepath. However, many users have fast multi-core CPUs with a large amount of system RAM, but a GPU with significantly lower capabilities (typically, integrated graphics with small amounts of dedicated memory). Use of OpenCL code in these cases can lead to excessive tiling, and it is often better to run a module without tiling using the CPU codepath than to attempt to use OpenCL with heavy tiling.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ການປະມວນຜົນຜ່ານ GPU (OpenCL) ຈະໄວກວ່າ CPU ຫຼາຍ. ແຕ່ບາງຄົນມີ CPU ຫຼາຍຄໍ (multi-core) ທີ່ໄວ ແລະ ມີ RAM ຫຼາຍ, ແຕ່ມີ GPU ທີ່ບໍ່ແຮງ (ເຊັ່ນກາດຈໍອອນບອດ). ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ການໃຊ້ OpenCL ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ tiling ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ, ເຊິ່ງການໃຊ້ CPU ປະມວນຜົນແບບບໍ່ຕ້ອງແບ່ງສ່ວນອາດຈະໄວກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While processing the pipeline, darktable attempts to determine which mode will be best for a given module by estimating the expected workloads for both OpenCL and CPU codepaths. In most cases it will prefer the OpenCL codepath even if that would mean tiling the image, since OpenCL is typically much faster than running the CPU code (often as much as 10 times faster if it is a dedicated card).\n"
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການປະມວນຜົນ, darktable ຈະພະຍາຍາມຄຳນວນວ່າວິທີໃດດີທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງ OpenCL ແລະ CPU. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແລ້ວມັນຈະເລືອກ OpenCL ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຕ້ອງແບ່ງສ່ວນ (tiling) ກໍຕາມ, ເພາະ OpenCL ມັກຈະໄວກວ່າ CPU ຫຼາຍ (ບາງຄັ້ງໄວກວ່າເຖິງ 10 ເທົ່າ ຖ້າເປັນກາດຈໍແຍກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the ratio of estimated workloads (CPU vs GPU) is larger than the **advantage hint** (see below), darktable will use the CPU for processing that module, else it will use the GPU.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງການປະມວນຜົນ (CPU ທຽບກັບ GPU) ຫຼາຍກວ່າ **ຄ່າແນະນຳຄວາມໄດ້ປຽບ (advantage hint)**, darktable ຈະໃຊ້ CPU ແທນ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນກໍຈະໃຊ້ GPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "device-specific OpenCL configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ OpenCL ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The default darktable settings deliver a reasonable GPU performance on most systems. However, if you want to try to optimize things further, this section describes the relevant configuration parameters (all of which are set in your darktablerc file).\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ darktable ໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບ GPU ທີ່ດີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງຕື່ມ, ພາກນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່າງໆ (ເຊິ່ງທັງໝົດຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ darktablerc).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most of the OpenCL-related options are managed with a \"per device\" strategy. The configuration parameter for each device looks like:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ OpenCL ຈະຖືກຈັດການແບບ \"ແຍກຕາມອຸປະກອນ\". ຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະມີລັກສະນະດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`cldevice_v6_rusticlamdradeon8060sgraphics=250 0 1 0 0 0.000 0.250`\n"
msgstr "`cldevice_v6_rusticlamdradeon8060sgraphics=250 0 1 0 0 0.000 0.250`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "or, more generally\n"
msgstr "ຫຼື ໃນຮູບແບບທົ່ວໄປ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`cldevice_version_canonicalname=a b c d e f g`\n"
msgstr "`cldevice_version_canonicalname=a b c d e f g`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An entry will be automatically created in darktablerc for each newly-detected device when you launch darktable for the first time, with the correct canonical device name and version number. The parameters `a` - `g` are defined as follows and can be manually edited:\n"
msgstr "ລາຍການຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນ darktablerc ສຳລັບທຸກອຸປະກອນທີ່ກວດພົບ. ຄ່າ `a` - `g` ມີຄວາມໝາຍດັ່ງນີ້ ແລະ ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງເອງໄດ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"a. micro nap\n"
": _default 250_\n"
": In an ideal case you will keep your GPU busy at 100% when processing the pixelpipe. However, if your GPU is also required to update your screen, and darktable is using it at 100%, there may not be sufficient time left for this task. This will usually manifest as jerky GUI updates on panning, zooming or when moving sliders. To resolve this issue darktable can add small pauses into its pixelpipe processing so that the GPU can catch its breath and perform GUI related activities. The \"micro nap\" parameter controls the duration of these pauses in microseconds.\n"
msgstr ""
"a. micro nap (ການຢຸດພັກໄລຍະສັ້ນ)\n"
": _ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 250_\n"
": ປົກກະຕິເຮົາຢາກໃຫ້ GPU ເຮັດວຽກ 100%, ແຕ່ຖ້າ GPU ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສະແດງຜົນໜ້າຈໍນຳ, ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ GUI ຄ້າງ ຫຼື ກະຕຸກ ເວລາຊູມ ຫຼື ເລື່ອນສະໄລເດີ. darktable ຈຶ່ງສາມາດເພີ່ມການຢຸດພັກສັ້ນໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ GPU ມີເວລາໄປຈັດການໜ້າຈໍ. ຄ່ານີ້ມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ໄມໂຄຣວິນາທີ (microseconds).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": On all current systems you are safe with the default value. If you are using multiple devices or you are not using your discrete GPU for drawing on your screen, this value can be set to 0 for all non-desktop devices leading to improved performance.\n"
msgstr ": ສຳລັບລະບົບປັດຈຸບັນ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນປອດໄພແລ້ວ. ຖ້າທ່ານມີກາດຈໍຫຼາຍອັນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ກາດຈໍນັ້ນສະແດງຜົນໜ້າຈໍ, ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"b. pinned memory\n"
": _0 = disable pinned transfer (default); 1 = enforce pinned transfer_\n"
": During tiling huge amounts of memory need to be transferred between host and device. On some devices direct memory transfers to and from an arbitrary host memory region may give a large performance penalty. This is especially noticeable when exporting large images on smaller graphics cards or while using newer modules like [_diffuse or sharpen_](../module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md) or the _guided laplacians_ mode in the [_highlight reconstruction_](../module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"b. pinned memory (ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳແບບຄົງທີ່)\n"
": _0 = ປິດ (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ); 1 = ເປີດ_\n"
": ໃນເວລາແບ່ງສ່ວນປະມວນຜົນ, ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກສົ່ງລະຫວ່າງ RAM ລະບົບ ແລະ GPU ຫຼາຍ. ໃນບາງອຸປະກອນ, ການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍກົງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບຕົກລົງ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຕອນສົ່ງອອກຮູບໃຫຍ່ ດ້ວຍກາດຈໍນ້ອຍ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ໂມດູນໃໝ່ໆ ເຊັ່ນ _diffuse or sharpen_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": There is no safe method or general rule to predict whether or not this parameter will provide a performance benefit, so you will have to experiment for yourself. However, the chance of pinned transfer leading to an improvement is pretty low if your card was manufactured after 2015.\n"
msgstr ": ບໍ່ມີວິທີທີ່ແນ່ນອນທີ່ຈະບອກວ່າເປີດແລ້ວຈະດີຂຶ້ນຫຼືບໍ່, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລອງທົດສອບເອງ. ແຕ່ຖ້າກາດຈໍຜະລິດຫຼັງປີ 2015, ການເປີດຄ່ານີ້ມັກຈະບໍ່ເຫັນຜົນປານໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"c. use OpenCL events\n"
": _1 = use OpenCL events when calling enqueue kernels (default); 0 = don't use_\n"
": This flag controls the use of OpenCL events when calling enqueue kernels.\n"
msgstr ""
"c. use OpenCL events (ໃຊ້ເຫດການ OpenCL)\n"
": _1 = ໃຊ້ (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ); 0 = ບໍ່ໃຊ້_\n"
": ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ OpenCL events ເວລາຮຽກໃຊ້ງານຄຳສັ່ງປະມວນຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"d. asynchronous mode\n"
": _1 = use asynchronous mode; 0 = don't use (default)_\n"
": This flag controls how often darktable blocks the OpenCL pixelpipe to get a status on success/failure of the kernels that have been run. For optimum latency set this to 1, so that darktable runs the pixelpipe asynchronously and tries to use as few interrupts/events as possible. If you experience OpenCL errors like failing kernels, reset the parameter to 0. This will cause darktable to interrupt after each module so that you can more easily isolate any problems. Issues have been reported with some older AMD/ATI cards (like the HD57xx) which can produce garbled output if this parameter is set to 1. If in doubt, leave it at its default of 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"d. asynchronous mode (ໂໝດບໍ່ຊິງໂຄຣໄນ)\n"
": _1 = ເປີດ; 0 = ປິດ (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)_\n"
": ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມວ່າ darktable ຈະກວດສອບສະຖານະການປະມວນຜົນເລື້ອຍປານໃດ. ຕັ້ງເປັນ 1 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວທີ່ສຸດ. ແຕ່ຖ້າພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງ OpenCL ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອ ໃຫ້ກວດສອບຫຼັງຈົບແຕ່ລະໂມດູນ ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຫາສາເຫດຂອງບັນຫາໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"e. disable device\n"
": _0 = enable device; 1 = disable device_\n"
": If darktable detects a malfunctioning device it will automatically mark it as such by setting this parameter to 1. If you have a device that reports a lot of errors you can manually disable it by setting this field to 1. If darktable has disabled the device but you are sure it should be used you can re-enable it by setting this field to 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"e. disable device (ປິດການໃຊ້ງານອຸປະກອນ)\n"
": _0 = ເປີດໃຊ້; 1 = ປິດໃຊ້_\n"
": ຖ້າ darktable ກວດພົບວ່າອຸປະກອນມີບັນຫາ, ມັນຈະຕັ້ງເປັນ 1 ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ. ທ່ານສາມາດປິດເອງໄດ້ຖ້າອຸປະກອນນັ້ນມີບັນຫາເລື້ອຍໆ, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອລອງເປີດໃຊ້ອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"f. advantage hint\n"
": This defines the advantage hint described in the [balanced OpenCL versus CPU tiling](#balanced-opencl-versus-cpu-tiling) section. If you have a fast graphics card with plenty of memory you can safely leave this at its default value of 0.000. However, if you want to adapt this number to your own system, you should use the following process:\n"
"1. Start darktable with the tiling debug option (`darktable -d tiling`) and start editing an image in the darkroom. Open the [_highlight reconstruction_](../module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md) module and use the \"guided laplacians\" method, setting the \"diameter of reconstruction\" to a high value, while ensuring that tiling does not occur (check the debug information in your terminal session while adjusting the slider).\n"
"1. Check the execution times of this module with OpenCL on and off (by running `darktable -d perf` to examine the performance).\n"
"1. Set the \"advantage hint option\" to approximately (CPU execution time / GPU execution time).\n"
msgstr ""
"f. advantage hint (ຄ່າແນະນຳຄວາມໄດ້ປຽບ)\n"
": ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຊັ່ງນ້ຳໜັກລະຫວ່າງ CPU ແລະ GPU. ຖ້າທ່ານມີກາດຈໍແຮງ, ໃຫ້ປະໄວ້ເປັນ 0.000. ແຕ່ຖ້າຢາກປັບແຕ່ງເອງ ໃຫ້ເຮັດດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"1. ເປີດ darktable ດ້ວຍ `darktable -d tiling` ແລ້ວແຕ່ງຮູບໃນ darkroom. ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_highlight reconstruction_] ດ້ວຍວິທີ \"guided laplacians\" ແລະ ປັບຄ່າສູງໆ ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດ tiling.\n"
"2. ກວດສອບເວລາປະມວນຜົນທັງຕອນເປີດ ແລະ ປິດ OpenCL (ດ້ວຍ `darktable -d perf`).\n"
"3. ຕັ້ງຄ່າ advantage hint ໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັບ (ເວລາ CPU / ເວລາ GPU).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"g. shared memory fraction\n"
": Some OpenCL devices don't have dedicated memory but share it with the CPU -- Apple ARM silicon is one example but also onboard devices from Intel, AMD or ARM SOCs. As we want to keep system memory available for caching or CPU codepaths we restrict the amount of all memory used to the given fraction. So with the default of 0.5 and an Apple computer with 16GB of system RAM, OpenCL would be able to make use of 8GB.\n"
msgstr ""
"g. shared memory fraction (ສັດສ່ວນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ)\n"
": ອຸປະກອນບາງຢ່າງ (ເຊັ່ນ Apple ARM ຫຼື ກາດຈໍອອນບອດ) ໃຊ້ RAM ຮ່ວມກັບ CPU. ເຮົາສາມາດກຳນົດສັດສ່ວນ RAM ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ OpenCL ໃຊ້ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າຕັ້ງເປັນ 0.5 ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ມີ RAM 16GB, OpenCL ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ 8GB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: if darktable detects a \"buggy\" device configuration key it will be rewritten back to default values.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ຖ້າ darktable ກວດພົບວ່າຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດພາດ, ມັນຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "id-specific OpenCL configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ OpenCL ແຍກຕາມ ID"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A second device-specific configuration key is also provided, which takes into account both the device name **and** the device id (in case you have two identical devices). In this case, the usual key name `cldevice_version_canonicalname` is followed by `_idX` with X being the device id. For example, if the above example device was referred to as device 0, the second configuration setting would (by default) be `cldevice_v5_quadrortx4000_id0=600`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມີຄີການກຳນົດຄ່າສະເພາະອຸປະກອນອັນທີສອງໃຫ້ມາຄືກັນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະພິຈາລະນາທັງຊື່ອຸປະກອນ **ແລະ** ໄອດີອຸປະກອ"
"ນ (ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເຈົ້າມີອຸປະກອນສອງອັນທີ່ຄືກັນ). ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຊື່ຄີປົກກະຕິ "
"`cldevice_version_canonicalname` ຈະຕາມດ້ວຍ `_idX` ໂດຍທີ່ X ແມ່ນໄອດີຂອງອຸປະກອນ. ຕົວຢ່າ"
"ງ, ຖ້າອຸປະກອນໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງຖືກອ້າງອີງເປັນອຸປະກອນ 0, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີສອງ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ຈະແມ່ນ "
"`cldevice_v5_quadrortx4000_id0=600`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This configuration key currently only has a single parameter defined:\n"
msgstr "ຄ່ານີ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນມີພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າດຽວ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"forced headroom (default 600)\n"
": The amount of memory (in MB) that will **not** be used by darktable during OpenCL processing. This setting is valid if you have more than one hardware device and the [tuned GPU memory](../preferences-settings/processing/#opencl) switch has been switched on.\n"
msgstr ""
"forced headroom (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 600)\n"
": ຈຳນວນ RAM (ເປັນ MB) ທີ່ darktable ຈະ **ບໍ່ໃຊ້** ໃນເວລາປະມວນຜົນ OpenCL. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອມີອຸປະກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ [tuned GPU memory].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If you are certain that no apps (or your OS) make use of the specific device you can set this parameter to 0 for the otherwise-unused device so that darktable will use all of that device's memory.\n"
msgstr ": ຖ້າທ່ານໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າບໍ່ມີແອັບອື່ນໃຊ້ກາດຈໍນັ້ນ, ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ darktable ໃຊ້ RAM ທັງໝົດຂອງກາດຈໍນັ້ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The default of 600MB should be fine for most systems. If you find you run into performance problems due to darktable falling back to CPU, try changing it to 800 or larger.\n"
msgstr ": ຄ່າ 600MB ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ແຕ່ຖ້າ darktable ມັກຈະຫຼຸດໄປໃຊ້ CPU, ໃຫ້ລອງປ່ຽນເປັນ 800 ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "other configuration keys"
msgstr "ຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following additional configuration keys are also available in darktablerc:\n"
msgstr "ຍັງມີຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ darktablerc ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cldevice\\_version\\_canonicalname\\_building\n"
": This option is used when compiling OpenCL kernels and may be provided for performance tuning or to work around bugs. You must remove any existing kernels in order to recompile them with the new options. Provide an empty string to recompile without any options. Remove the setting entirely to recompile with default options.\n"
msgstr ""
"cldevice\\_version\\_canonicalname\\_building\n"
": ໃຊ້ໃນຕອນສ້າງ (compile) OpenCL kernels ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງປະສິດທິພາບ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂບັກ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງລຶບ kernels ເກົ່າອອກກ່ອນເພື່ອສ້າງໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຄ່ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/mem-performance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"opencl\\_mandatory\\_timeout\n"
": _default 400_\n"
": If darktable wants to make use of any OpenCL device it has to reserve it for further usage. If that device is current used darktable will wait up to _opencl\\_mandatory\\_timeout * 5ms_ before it does a fallback to CPU. Increase this value if you would prefer to use OpenCL (because your card is really fast and your CPU is not).\n"
msgstr ""
"opencl\\_mandatory\\_timeout\n"
": _ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 400_\n"
": ເວລາທີ່ darktable ຈະລໍຖ້າເພື່ອຈອງອຸປະກອນ OpenCL ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຫຼຸດໄປໃຊ້ CPU. ຖ້າກາດຈໍຂອງທ່ານແຮງກວ່າ CPU ຫຼາຍ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable's color pipeline"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການຈັດການສີ (Color pipeline) ຂອງ darktable"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most image processing applications come from the 1990s and/or inherit a 1990s workflow. These applications processed images encoded with 8 bit unsigned integers because it was more memory- and computationally-efficient. However, due to the use of an integer format (which implies rounding errors) they had to apply a \"gamma\" (essentially a transfer function applying a power 1/2.2 or 1/2.4 to encode the RGB values) and increase the bit-depth in the low-lights in order to reduce rounding errors there (humans are very sensitive to low-light details). The 8 bit integer formats are also technically limited to the 0-255 range. Anything outside of this range overflows and is clipped to the nearest bound.\n"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນມາຈາກຍຸກປີ 1990 ຫຼື ສືບທອດຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຈາກຍຸກນັ້ນ. ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມ (integer) 8 ບິດ ແບບບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ຍ້ອນວ່າມັນປະຢັດໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໄວ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຍ້ອນການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມ (ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພາດໃນການປັດເສດ), ພວກເຂົາຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ \"ກາມມາ\" (gamma) (ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນຟັງຊັນການສົ່ງຄ່າ ທີ່ໃຊ້ເລກກຳລັງ 1/2.2 ຫຼື 1/2.4 ເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດຄ່າ RGB) ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄວາມລະອຽດບິດໃນສ່ວນມືດ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນຄວາມຜິດພາດໃນການປັດເສດຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ (ຍ້ອນມະນຸດມີຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວຕໍ່ກັບລາຍລະອຽດໃນສ່ວນມືດຫຼາຍ). ຮູບແບບເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມ 8 ບິດ ຍັງຖືກຈຳກັດທາງເຕັກນິກໄວ້ໃນຊ່ວງ 0-255. ສິ່ງໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງນີ້ ຈະເກີດການລົ້ນ ແລະ ຖືກຕັດ (clip) ໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These workflows, using bounded RGB representations and possibly non-linear transforms to encode RGB signals, are called \"display-referred\". They rely on the assumption that the image has been prepared for display at an early stage in the processing pipeline, and embed hard-coded assumptions about the RGB values of black, middle-gray and white. Most of the image-processing algorithms used in these workflows have been tuned around these assumptions. For example, the overlay blending mode expects a middle-gray encoded at 50% (or 128 in integer encoding).\n"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ທີ່ໃຊ້ການແທນຄ່າ RGB ແບບມີຂອບເຂດ ແລະ ອາດຈະໃຊ້ການແປງຄ່າແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນ (non-linear) ເພື່ອເຂົ້າລະຫັດສັນຍານ RGB, ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"ອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ\" (display-referred). ພວກມັນອີງຕາມຂໍ້ສົມມຸດ ທີ່ວ່າຮູບພາບໄດ້ຖືກກະກຽມໄວ້ສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນຕັ້ງແຕ່ຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດໆໃນທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນ, ແລະ ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າ RGB ຂອງສີດຳ, ສີເທົາກາງ ແລະ ສີຂາວໄວ້ຕາຍຕົວ. ສູດການຄຳນວນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ແມ່ນຖືກປັບແຕ່ງຕາມຂໍ້ສົມມຸດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blending mode) ແບບ overlay ຈະຕ້ອງການສີເທົາກາງ ທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ້ທີ່ 50% (ຫຼື 128 ໃນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unfortunately the non-linear scaling, which is mandatory to make the integer encoding work, breaks the natural relationships between pixel values. Hue and saturation change in unpredictable ways, and value relationships between neighbouring pixels are dilated or compressed such that gradients are also altered unpredictably.\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ໜ້າເສຍດາຍ, ການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນ ເຊິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເລກຈຳນວນເຕັມນັ້ນ ເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳພັນທາງທຳມະຊາດລະຫວ່າງຄ່າຂອງພິກເຊວເສຍໄປ. ຄ່າສີ (Hue) ແລະ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ (saturation) ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຄາດເດົາບໍ່ໄດ້, ແລະ ຄວາມສຳພັນຂອງຄ່າລະຫວ່າງພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ບີບອັດ ຈົນເຮັດໃຫ້ການໄລ່ລະດັບສີ (gradients) ປ່ຽນແປງໄປໃນທາງທີ່ຄາດເດົາບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Display-referred pipelines therefore break optical filters (lens blurring or deblurring), alpha compositing (which relies on optical and geometrical definitions of occlusion), colors and gradients (local relationships between chrominance and luminance of pixels). They also don't scale well to HDR images, which led to the development of many questionable local and global tonemapping methods and the infamous 2010s \"HDR look\".\n"
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນແບບອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ ຈຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຟິລເຕີທາງແສງ (ການເບຼີ ຫຼື ການແກ້ເບຼີຂອງເລນ), ການປະສົມພາບແບບອາລຟາ (alpha compositing), ສີ ແລະ ການໄລ່ລະດັບສີ ຜິດພ້ຽນໄປ. ພວກມັນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຮູບພາບ HDR ໄດ້ດີ, ເຊິ່ງນຳໄປສູ່ການພັດທະນາວິທີການ tonemapping ທີ່ແປກໆ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ \"HDR look\" ທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດໃນຊ່ວງປີ 2010.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Modern computers are not tied to the same computational limitations as those from the 1990s, and can work on pixels whose values are completely unbounded (from 0 up to +infinity) and encoded as real numbers (using floating point formats). These possibilities enable what we call a \"scene-referred\" workflow, in which pixels can retain their original radiometric relationships along almost the entire processing pipe. In scene-referred workflow, pixels are prepared for display only at the last stage of the pipeline, in the display transform. This means that the RGB values of the pixels are kept proportional to the intensity of the light emission recorded by the camera on the scene, enabling accurate alpha compositing and optical filter emulations, while also scaling to any dynamic range through the same algorithm (SDR as well as HDR).\n"
msgstr "ຄອມພິວເຕີໃນປັດຈຸບັນບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃນການຄຳນວນຄືກັບໃນຍຸກປີ 1990, ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກັບພິກເຊວ ທີ່ມີຄ່າແບບບໍ່ມີຂອບເຂດ (ຕັ້ງແຕ່ 0 ຈົນເຖິງອະສົງໄຂ) ແລະ ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating point). ຄວາມສາມາດນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ພວກເຮົາເອີ້ນວ່າ \"ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ\" (scene-referred), ເຊິ່ງພິກເຊວສາມາດຮັກສາຄວາມສຳພັນທາງແສງທີ່ແທ້ຈິງໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດຂະບວນການປະມວນຜົນ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້, ພິກເຊວຈະຖືກກະກຽມເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄ່າ RGB ຂອງພິກເຊວຈະຖືກຮັກສາໃຫ້ເປັນສັດສ່ວນກັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງທີ່ກ້ອງບັນທຶກໄດ້ຈາກສາກແທ້ໆ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການປະສົມພາບ ແລະ ການຈຳລອງຟິລເຕີທາງແສງມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ, ພ້ອມທັງຮອງຮັບທຸກຊ່ວງການຮັບແສງ (dynamic range) ດ້ວຍສູດການຄຳນວນດຽວກັນ (ທັງ SDR ແລະ HDR).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "However, scene-referred pipelines lose the convenient fixed values of white, middle-gray and black which characterised display-referred pipelines, and setting these values, according to the scene and to the conditions of shooting, now becomes the responsibility of the user. This requires a more complex user interface.\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ ຈະບໍ່ມີຄ່າຕາຍຕົວຂອງສີຂາວ, ສີເທົາກາງ ແລະ ສີດຳ ຄືກັບໃນແບບອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ, ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສາກ ແລະ ສະພາວະການຖ່າຍພາບ ຈະກາຍເປັນໜ້າທີ່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (UI) ທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Also, because scene-referred values are supposed to be physically-meaningful, pixels cannot have zero intensity. This would mean they have no light at all, and the existence of zero light breaks many physically-accurate algorithms. In fact, white and black mean nothing with regard to the original scene, which is only a collection of luminances at varying intensities. The scene-referred workflow simply aims at remapping some arbitrary scene luminances to what will appear white or black on the output medium.\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຍ້ອນວ່າຄ່າໃນແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກຄວນຈະມີຄວາມໝາຍທາງກາຍະພາບ, ພິກເຊວຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຄວນມີຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມເປັນສູນ. ເພາະມັນໝາຍເຖິງການບໍ່ມີແສງເລີຍ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສູດການຄຳນວນທີ່ອ້າງອີງຕາມກາຍະພາບຫຼາຍຢ່າງຜິດພາດ. ໃນຄວາມເປັນຈິງ, ສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີດຳ ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍຫຍັງເລີຍໃນສາກຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນພຽງການລວມຕົວກັນຂອງແສງ ທີ່ມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມຕ່າງກັນ. ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ ພຽງແຕ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງ ຈາກສາກ ໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ຈະປະກົດເປັນສີຂາວ ຫຼື ສີດຳ ໃນສື່ທີ່ໃຊ້ສະແດງຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Versions of darktable prior to 2.6 had a non-linear display-referred pipeline, assuming that a non-linear transform took place early in the pipe and middle-gray was thereafter encoded as 50%. However, not all modules and filters clipped pixel values above 100%, leaving open the possibility of recovering those values later in the pipe.\n"
msgstr "ເວີຊັນຂອງ darktable ກ່ອນ 2.6 ແມ່ນໃຊ້ລະບົບປະມວນຜົນ (pipeline) ແບບ non-linear display-referred, ໂດຍສົມມຸດວ່າການແປງຄ່າແບບ non-linear ໄດ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນຕອນຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຄ່າສີເທົາກາງ (middle-gray) ຈະຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດເປັນ 50%. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໂມດູນ ແລະ ຟິວເຕີ ທີ່ຈະຕັດຄ່າພິກເຊວ (clip) ທີ່ເກີນ 100% ຖິ້ມ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນການກູ້ຄືນຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃນພາຍຫຼັງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _filmic_ module's view transform, introduced in darktable 2.6, was the first step toward a scene-referred pipeline, and deferred the mandatory, non-linear, display preparation to the end of the pipe, along with the ability to set custom black, gray and white values. The _color balance_ module then introduced a way to deal with a variable definition of middle-gray.\n"
msgstr "ການແປງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນຂອງໂມດູນ _filmic_, ທີ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ມາໃນ darktable 2.6, ແມ່ນບາດກ້າວທຳອິດ ສູ່ທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ, ແລະ ໄດ້ເລື່ອນການກະກຽມການສະແດງຜົນແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນໄປໄວ້ທີ່ຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍ, ພ້ອມທັງໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າສີດຳ, ສີເທົາ ແລະ ສີຂາວ ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ຈາກນັ້ນ ໂມດູນ _color balance_ ກໍໄດ້ເພີ່ມວິທີການຈັດການກັບຄ່າສີເທົາກາງທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting in darktable 3.2, users could choose between two workflows that defined consistent default settings, modules and pipeline order for both _display-referred_ and _scene-referred_ processing.\n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 3.2 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງສອງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ ທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໂມດູນ ແລະ ລຳດັບທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນ ທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບທັງແບບ _ອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ_ ແລະ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In darktable 3.4, a full scene-referred masking and blending option was introduced, allowing masks to be defined for pixel values above 100% and using only unbounded blending operators.\n"
msgstr "ໃນ darktable 3.4, ໄດ້ມີການເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກການເຮັດມາກ (masking) ແລະ ການປະສົມສີ (blending) ແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດກຳນົດມາກສຳລັບຄ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ເກີນ 100% ໄດ້ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຕົວປະຕິບັດການປະສົມສີແບບບໍ່ມີຂອບເຂດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switching to _scene-referred_ is a cognitive leap for most experienced users, who are used thinking in display-referred ways. In a display-referred workflow, it is customary to anchor the white value and let tone adjustments revolve around that point, trying to maximize brightness while avoiding clipping. In a scene-referred workflow, white and black values are fluid and adapted to the output medium. It is advised that users anchor middle-gray (which will be preserved as-is for any output medium) and let the view transform (_filmic_) dilate or contract the dynamic range around that point. Because 10 bit HDR white is 4 times as bright as 8 bit SDR white, any rigid definition of \"white\" becomes irrelevant. But anchoring for middle-gray is actually more convenient, since it keeps the average brightness of the image unchanged through the view transform.\n"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນມາໃຊ້ແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ_ ຖືເປັນການປ່ຽນແປງວິທີຄິດຄັ້ງໃຫຍ່ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີປະສົບການ ທີ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບວິທີຄິດແບບອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ. ໃນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມັກຈະຍຶດຄ່າສີຂາວເປັນຫຼັກ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງໂທນສີຮອບໆຈຸດນັ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດການຕັດ (clipping). ແຕ່ໃນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ, ຄ່າສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີດຳ ຈະມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນ ແລະ ປັບຕາມສື່ທີ່ໃຊ້ສະແດງຜົນ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຍຶດຄ່າສີເທົາກາງເປັນຫຼັກ (ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າໃນທຸກສື່ສະແດງຜົນ) ແລະ ໃຫ້ການແປງຄ່າການສະແດງຜົນ (_filmic_) ຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ບີບຊ່ວງການຮັບແສງຮອບໆຈຸດນັ້ນ. ຍ້ອນວ່າສີຂາວ HDR 10 ບິດ ຈະສະຫວ່າງກວ່າສີຂາວ SDR 8 ບິດ ເຖິງ 4 ເທົ່າ, ການກຳນົດຄ່າ \"ສີຂາວ\" ແບບຕາຍຕົວຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍ. ການຍຶດສີເທົາກາງຈຶ່ງສະດວກກວ່າ ເພາະມັນຊ່ວຍຮັກສາຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສະເລ່ຍຂອງພາບໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່ຕະຫຼອດການແປງຄ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some modules (_levels_, _rgb levels_, _tone curve_, _rgb curve_) are inherently incompatible with a scene-referred workflow, because their graphical interface implicitly suggests RGB values that are bounded within the 0-100% range. While the pixel operations they perform can be used in either scene-referred or display-referred workflows because they are unbounded internally, their controlling interface does not allow pixels to be selected outside of the 0-100% range.\n"
msgstr "ບາງໂມດູນ (ເຊັ່ນ _levels_, _rgb levels_, _tone curve_, _rgb curve_) ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບກັບການເຮັດວຽກແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ ຍ້ອນວ່າສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງພວກມັນຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບຄ່າ RGB ໃນຊ່ວງ 0-100% ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊວພາຍໃນຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບທັງສອງແບບ (ຍ້ອນພາຍໃນບໍ່ມີຂອບເຂດ), ແຕ່ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ການຄວບຄຸມບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງ 0-100% ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Similarly, blending modes such as overlay, linear light, soft light, hard light, darken, brighten, etc. all have hard-coded thresholds that internally expect display-referred non-linear encoding.\n"
msgstr "ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ໂໝດການປະສົມສີ ເຊັ່ນ overlay, linear light, soft light, hard light, darken, brighten, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ລ້ວນແຕ່ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວ້ຕາຍຕົວ ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງການການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນແບບອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In darktable 3.4 and above, hovering the cursor over a module header shows a tooltip detailing the color spaces, ranges and encodings that the module expects, uses and produces. Here are the definitions of the terms used:\n"
msgstr "ໃນ darktable 3.4 ຂຶ້ນໄປ, ເມື່ອວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງຫົວຂໍ້ໂມດູນ ຈະມີຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip) ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບ ພື້ນທີ່ສີ, ຊ່ວງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ທີ່ໂມດູນນັ້ນຕ້ອງການ, ໃຊ້ ແລະ ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຳນິຍາມຂອງຄຳສັບທີ່ໃຊ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"linear\n"
": Pixel values are proportional to the scene radiometric emission, in a way that enables accurate emulation of physical filters.\n"
msgstr ""
"linear (ເປັນເສັ້ນ)\n"
": ຄ່າພິກເຊວເປັນສັດສ່ວນກັບການປ່ອຍແສງໃນສາກແທ້ໆ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຈຳລອງຟິລເຕີທາງກາຍະພາບໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"non-linear\n"
": Pixel values are re-scaled such that low-lights are given a larger encoding range, usually to remap the 18.45% reference middle-gray to a value between 46 and 50%.\n"
msgstr ""
"non-linear (ບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນ)\n"
": ຄ່າພິກເຊວຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໃໝ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສ່ວນມືດມີຊ່ວງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດທີ່ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວແມ່ນເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າສີເທົາກາງ ທີ່ 18.45% ໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 46 ຫາ 50%.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"display-referred\n"
": Pixel values are expected to lie between 0 and 100% of the display range, where 100% is understood to be the luminance of a 20% reflective white surface (the white patch of a Color Checker) and 0% is understood to be the maximum density of the output medium (saturated black ink or minimum LED panel backlighting).\n"
msgstr ""
"display-referred (ອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ)\n"
": ຄ່າພິກເຊວຄວນຈະຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ 0 ຫາ 100% ຂອງການສະແດງຜົນ, ໂດຍທີ່ 100% ໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພື້ນຜິວສີຂາວ ທີ່ສະທ້ອນແສງ 20% (ຊ່ອງສີຂາວໃນ Color Checker) ແລະ 0% ໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມເຂັ້ມສູງສຸດຂອງສື່ສະແດງຜົນ (ເຊັ່ນ ນ້ຳມຶກສີດຳທີ່ອີ່ມຕົວ ຫຼື ແສງພື້ນຫຼັງຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງຈໍ LED).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/color-pipeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scene-referred\n"
": Pixel values are expected to be greater than zero up to +infinity. The meaning of specific pixel values needs to be defined at runtime by the user. Scene-referred values don't automatically imply a linear, radiometrically scaled, encoding.\n"
msgstr ""
"scene-referred (ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ)\n"
": ຄ່າພິກເຊວຄວນຈະມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນໄປຈົນເຖິງອະສົງໄຂ. ຄວາມໝາຍຂອງຄ່າພິກເຊວຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນເວລາເຮັດວຽກ. ຄ່າແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕ້ອງເປັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບ linear ສະເໝີໄປ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/invocation-per-OS.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "invocation per OS"
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຕາມລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/invocation-per-OS.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable` and the other binaries (e.g. `darktable-cltest`) can be executed from the console as follows:\n"
msgstr "`darktable` ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີອື່ນໆ (ເຊັ່ນ `darktable-cltest`) ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຈາກຄອນໂຊລ (console) ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/invocation-per-OS.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Linux\n"
"* Installed as package or snap: `darktable`\n"
"* Flatpak: `flatpak run org.darktable.Darktable`\n"
"     + To run e.g. `darktable-cltest`: `flatpak run --command=darktable-cltest org.darktable.Darktable --arguments-go-here`.\n"
"* AppImage: Navigate to containing folder, then `./darktable.Appimage` (or however you named the file)\n"
"     + To run e.g. `darktable-cltest`: `./darktable.Appimage darktable-cltest`\n"
"     + An additional option to run the various binaries included in darktable (e.g. `darktable-cltest` or `darktable-cli`) is through a symbolic link: \n"
"          * Create a symbolic link to your AppImage and call it e.g. `darktable-cli`.\n"
"          * Then, when calling the AppImage through the symbolic link with `./darktable-cli`, the code inside the package checks if there is a binary file inside the AppImage with a name that matches the symlink name. If so, it will be run instead of the default one.\n"
msgstr ""
"Linux\n"
"* ຕິດຕັ້ງເປັນແພັກເກດ (package) ຫຼື snap: `darktable`\n"
"* Flatpak: `flatpak run org.darktable.Darktable`\n"
"     + ເພື່ອລັນ ເຊັ່ນ `darktable-cltest`: `flatpak run --command=darktable-cltest org.darktable.Darktable --arguments-go-here`.\n"
"* AppImage: ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ໂຟນເດີທີ່ເກັບໄຟລ໌, ແລ້ວລັນ `./darktable.Appimage` (ຫຼື ຕາມຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງໄວ້)\n"
"     + ເພື່ອລັນ ເຊັ່ນ `darktable-cltest`: `./darktable.Appimage darktable-cltest`\n"
"     + ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນການລັນໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີຕ່າງໆ (ເຊັ່ນ `darktable-cltest` ຫຼື `darktable-cli`) ແມ່ນຜ່ານ symbolic link: \n"
"          * ສ້າງ symbolic link ໄປຫາ AppImage ຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຊື່ມັນ ເຊັ່ນ `darktable-cli`.\n"
"          * ຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມື່ອເອີ້ນໃຊ້ AppImage ຜ່ານ symbolic link ດ້ວຍ `./darktable-cli`, ໂຄ້ດພາຍໃນແພັກເກດຈະກວດສອບວ່າມີໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີພາຍໃນ AppImage ທີ່ມີຊື່ກົງກັບຊື່ symlink ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຖ້າມີ, ມັນຈະຖືກລັນແທນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/invocation-per-OS.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Windows\n"
"* Navigate to darktable's program folder: `cd \"\\Program Files\\darktable\\bin\"` then execute `.\\darktable.exe`. \n"
"* The other binaries e.g. `darktable-cltest.exe` are also located in this folder and can be called accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Windows\n"
"* ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ໂຟນເດີໂປຣແກຣມຂອງ darktable: `cd \"\\Program Files\\darktable\\bin\"` ແລ້ວລັນ `.\\darktable.exe`. \n"
"* ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ `darktable-cltest.exe` ກໍຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີນີ້ຄືກັນ ແລະ ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ຕາມນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/invocation-per-OS.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"macOS\n"
"* Execute `/Applications/darktable.app/Contents/MacOS/darktable`.\n"
"* The other binaries e.g. `darktable-cltest` are also located in this folder and can be called accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"macOS\n"
"* ລັນ `/Applications/darktable.app/Contents/MacOS/darktable`.\n"
"* ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ `darktable-cltest` ກໍຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີນີ້ຄືກັນ ແລະ ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ຕາມນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/invocation-per-OS.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Command line options are in any case simply appended. (e.g. `-d common`).\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກສາຍຄຳສັ່ງແມ່ນສາມາດຂຽນຕໍ່ທ້າຍໄດ້ເລີຍ (ເຊັ່ນ `-d common`).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable-chart"
msgstr "darktable-chart"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `darktable-chart` binary is a dedicated utility to create styles out of pairs of images such as RAW+JPEG with in-camera processing. Details about its usage can be found in the [using darktable-chart](../darktable-chart/_index.md) section.\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ລັນ `darktable-chart` ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືສະເພາະສຳລັບການສ້າງສະໄຕລ໌ຈາກຄູ່ຮູບພາບ ເຊັ່ນ RAW+JPEG ທີ່ມີການປະມວນຜົນໃນກ້ອງ. ລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບການນຳໃຊ້ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນພາກ [ການໃຊ້ darktable-chart](../darktable-chart/_index.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable-chart` can either start a GUI or be used as a command-line program.\n"
msgstr "`darktable-chart` ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ທັງແບບມີສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (GUI) ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເປັນໂປຣແກຣມຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ (command-line).\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable-chart\n"
"              [--help]\n"
"              [<input Lab pfm file>]\n"
"              [<cht file>]\n"
"              [<reference cgats/it8 or Lab pfm file>]\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable-chart\n"
"              [--help]\n"
"              [<input Lab pfm file>]\n"
"              [<cht file>]\n"
"              [<reference cgats/it8 or Lab pfm file>]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All parameters are optional, however, if you want to supply the second file name you also need to supply the first one. Starting `darktable-chart` this way opens a special GUI (details can be found in the [using darktable-chart](../darktable-chart/_index.md) section).\n"
msgstr "ພານາມິເຕີທັງໝົດແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກ, ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການລະບຸຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີສອງ ທ່ານກໍຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທຳອິດນຳ. ການເລີ່ມ `darktable-chart` ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ຈະເປີດ GUI ພິເສດ (ລາຍລະອຽດສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນພາກ [ການໃຊ້ darktable-chart](../darktable-chart/_index.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--help`\n"
": Provide usage information and terminate.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--help`\n"
": ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນການນຳໃຊ້ ແລະ ຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<input Lab pfm file>`\n"
": Open the utility with the given file as source image. The input file needs to be in Lab Portable Float Map format.\n"
msgstr ""
"`<input Lab pfm file>`\n"
": ເປີດເຄື່ອງມືດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກຳນົດເປັນຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ Lab Portable Float Map.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<cht file>`\n"
": Specify a chart file describing the layout of the used color reference chart.\n"
msgstr ""
"`<cht file>`\n"
": ລະບຸໄຟລ໌ແຜ່ນ (chart file) ທີ່ອະທິບາຍຮູບແບບການວາງແຜນຂອງແຜ່ນອ້າງອີງສີທີ່ໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<reference cgats/it8 or Lab pfm file>`\n"
": Specify the reference values, either as measured values according to the CGATS standard, or as a reference image in Lab Portable Float Map format.\n"
msgstr ""
"`<reference cgats/it8 or Lab pfm file>`\n"
": ລະບຸຄ່າອ້າງອີງ, ອາດຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ວັດແທກໄດ້ຕາມມາດຕະຖານ CGATS, ຫຼື ເປັນຮູບພາບອ້າງອີງໃນຮູບແບບ Lab Portable Float Map.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively `darktable-chart` can be used as a command line program to generate darktable style files using previously saved CSV files.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼືອີກວິທີໜຶ່ງ `darktable-chart` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເປັນໂປຣແກຣມຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ສະໄຕລ໌ darktable ໂດຍໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ CSV ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable-chart\n"
"              --csv\n"
"              <csv file>\n"
"              <number patches>\n"
"              <output dtstyle file>\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable-chart\n"
"              --csv\n"
"              <csv file>\n"
"              <number patches>\n"
"              <output dtstyle file>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All parameters are mandatory.\n"
msgstr "ພານາມິເຕີທັງໝົດແມ່ນຈໍາເປັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<csv file>`\n"
": A CSV file previously saved from within `darktable-chart`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`<csv file>`\n"
": ໄຟລ໌ CSV ທີ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈາກພາຍໃນ `darktable-chart`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<number of patches>`\n"
": The number of color patches to be used in the color look up table settings of the created style.\n"
msgstr ""
"`<number of patches>`\n"
": ຈຳນວນແຖບສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາຕະລາງຊອກຫາສີຂອງສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-chart.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<output dtstyle file>`\n"
": The name of the style file to be created.\n"
msgstr ""
"`<output dtstyle file>`\n"
": ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ຈະສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "gimp integration"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ gimp"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "GIMP can use darktable to open a Raw file if the darktable executable is on the PATH. If the GIMP user opens a RAW file, then GIMP invokes darktable with some special command line parameters to get a temporary file for GIMP to work with, as follows:\n"
msgstr "GIMP ສາມາດໃຊ້ darktable ເພື່ອເປີດໄຟລ໌ Raw ໄດ້ ຖ້າມີໄຟລ໌ darktable ຢູ່ໃນ PATH ຂອງລະບົບ. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ GIMP ເປີດໄຟລ໌ RAW, GIMP ຈະເອີ້ນໃຊ້ darktable ພ້ອມກັບພາລາມິເຕີສາຍຄຳສັ່ງພິເສດເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວໃຫ້ GIMP ໃຊ້ງານ ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable --gimp [version]\n"
"                 [file <path>]\n"
"                 [thumb <path> <dim>]\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable --gimp [version]\n"
"                 [file <path>]\n"
"                 [thumb <path> <dim>]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In all cases, darktable will report its result to GIMP wrapped in tags like this (where `<res>` depends on the command given):\n"
msgstr "ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ, darktable ຈະລາຍງານຜົນລັອກໃຫ້ GIMP ໂດຍຫໍ່ໄວ້ໃນແທັກ (tags) ແບບນີ້ (ເຊິ່ງ `<res>` ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ):\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<<<gimp\n"
"<res>\n"
"gimp>>>\n"
msgstr ""
"<<<gimp\n"
"<res>\n"
"gimp>>>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Only one of the commands should be present on the command line.\n"
msgstr "ຄວນມີພຽງໜຶ່ງຄຳສັ່ງເທົ່ານັ້ນໃນສາຍຄຳສັ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`version`\n"
": Note that `<res>` is the version of the GIMP API (_not_ the darktable version).\n"
msgstr ""
"`ເວີຊັນ`\n"
": ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ `<res>` ແມ່ນເວີຊັນຂອງ GIMP API (_ບໍ່ແມ່ນ_ ເວີຊັນຂອງ darktable).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`file <path>`\n"
": Starts darktable in darkroom mode with the image from the `<path>` loaded. The user is prevented from switching to another darktable mode. When the user closes the darkroom window, the result is exported as an EXR file to a temporary location. The returned `<res>` is the full path of the exported file. If the image is already in the darktable database, then any edits previously done in darktable will be part of the image exported. Any edits during the GIMP invocation of darktable will not, however, be saved to the database.\n"
msgstr ""
"`file <path>`\n"
": ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ darktable ໃນໂໝດຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom) ໂດຍໂຫລດຮູບພາບຈາກ `<path>`. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ໂໝດອື່ນຂອງ darktable ໄດ້. ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ປິດໜ້າຕ່າງຫ້ອງມືດ, ຜົນລັອກຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກເປັນໄຟລ໌ EXR ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຊົ່ວຄາວ. ຄ່າ `<res>` ທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. ຖ້າຮູບພາບນັ້ນຢູ່ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ darktable ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ເຄີຍເຮັດໃນ darktable ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກນຳ. ແຕ່ການແກ້ໄຂໃດໆໃນຂະນະທີ່ GIMP ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ darktable ຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`thumb <path> <dim>`\n"
": darktable writes a thumbnail JPEG file to a temporary location -- `<path>` is the RAW file path, `<dim>` (in pixels) is is the greater of width or height (in pixels) required for the thumbnail. The original ratio of dimensions is maintained. The returned `<res>` has the following format:\n"
msgstr ""
"`thumb <path> <dim>`\n"
": darktable ຂຽນຮູບຕົວຢ່າງເປັນໄຟລ໌ JPEG ໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຊົ່ວຄາວ -- `<path>` ແມ່ນເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ RAW, `<dim>` (ເປັນພິກເຊວ) ແມ່ນຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດລະຫວ່າງຄວາມກວ້າງ ຫຼື ຄວາມສູງ ທີ່ຕ້ອງການສຳລັບຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ. ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂະໜາດດັ້ງເດີມຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້. ຄ່າ `<res>` ທີ່ສົ່ງກັບມາຈະມີຮູບແບບດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/gimp-integration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - The full path of the exported file on the first line.\n"
": - The width and height of the original file as space-separated integers on the second line. These dimensions are informational and may not be accurate. For Raw files these represent the sensor size.\n"
msgstr ""
": - ເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໃນແຖວທຳອິດ.\n"
": - ຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງຂອງໄຟລ໌ດັ້ງເດີມເປັນຕົວເລກແຍກດ້ວຍຍະຫວ່າງໃນແຖວທີສອງ. ຂະໜາດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອແຈ້ງໃຫ້ຊາບ ແລະ ອາດຈະບໍ່ຊັດເຈນ. ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ Raw ນີ້ຈະໝາຍເຖິງຂະໜາດຂອງເຊັນເຊີ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md content/_index.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable"
msgstr "darktable"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `darktable` binary starts darktable with its GUI and full functionality. This is the standard way to use darktable. The command to run the binary [depends on your OS](../../special-topics/program-invocation/invocation-per-OS.md).\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ `darktable` ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ darktable ດ້ວຍ GUI ແລະ ຟັງຊັນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີມາດຕະຖານໃນການໃຊ້ darktable. ຄຳສັ່ງໃນການລັນໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ [ຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຂອງທ່ານ](../../special-topics/program-invocation/invocation-per-OS.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following command line parameters are available:\n"
msgstr "ມີພາລາມິເຕີສາຍຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable [-d {all,act_on,ai,cache,camctl,camsupport,common,control,\n"
"               dev,expose,fswatch,imageio,input,ioporder,lighttable,lua,\n"
"               masks,memory,nan,opencl,params,perf,pipe,print,pwstorage,\n"
"               signal,sql,tiling,undo,verbose}]\n"
"          [--d-signal <signal>]\n"
"          [--d-signal-act <all,raise,connect,disconnect,print-trace>]\n"
"          [--disable-pipecache]\n"
"          [<input file>|<image folder>]\n"
"          [--version]\n"
"          [--disable-opencl]\n"
"          [--configdir <user config directory>]\n"
"          [--library <library file>]\n"
"          [--datadir <data directory>]\n"
"          [--moduledir <module directory>]\n"
"          [--tmpdir <tmp directory>]\n"
"          [--cachedir <user cache directory>]\n"
"          [--localedir <locale directory>]\n"
"          [--luacmd <lua command>]\n"
"          [--noiseprofiles <noiseprofiles json file>]\n"
"          [--conf <key>=<value>]\n"
"          [-t <num openmp threads>]\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable [-d {all,act_on,ai,cache,camctl,camsupport,common,control,\n"
"               dev,expose,fswatch,imageio,input,ioporder,lighttable,lua,\n"
"               masks,memory,nan,opencl,params,perf,pipe,print,pwstorage,\n"
"               signal,sql,tiling,undo,verbose}]\n"
"          [--d-signal <signal>]\n"
"          [--d-signal-act <all,raise,connect,disconnect,print-trace>]\n"
"          [--disable-pipecache]\n"
"          [<input file>|<image folder>]\n"
"          [--version]\n"
"          [--disable-opencl]\n"
"          [--configdir <user config directory>]\n"
"          [--library <library file>]\n"
"          [--datadir <data directory>]\n"
"          [--moduledir <module directory>]\n"
"          [--tmpdir <tmp directory>]\n"
"          [--cachedir <user cache directory>]\n"
"          [--localedir <locale directory>]\n"
"          [--luacmd <lua command>]\n"
"          [--noiseprofiles <noiseprofiles json file>]\n"
"          [--conf <key>=<value>]\n"
"          [-t <num openmp threads>]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All parameters are optional. In most cases darktable should be started without any additional parameters, in which case darktable uses suitable defaults.\n"
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີທັງໝົດແມ່ນເປັນຕົວເລືອກ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ darktable ຄວນຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ມີພາລາມິເຕີເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ darktable ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`-d {all,act_on,ai,cache,camctl,camsupport,common,control,dev,expose,fswatch,imageio,input,ioporder,lighttable,lua,masks,memory,nan,opencl,params,perf,pipe,print,pwstorage,signal,sql,tiling,undo,verbose}`\n"
": Enable debug output to the terminal. There are several subsystems of darktable and each of them can be debugged separately. You can use this option multiple times if you want to debug more than one subsystem (e.g. `darktable -d opencl -d camctl`) or debug all of them at once (with `-d all`). The `-d common` switch is provided to give information about most relevant subsystems while debugging darktable or if you want to provide a log for reporting a darktable issue. Some debug options (like `-d opencl`) can also provide more verbose output, which can be invoked with the additional option `-d verbose`. The verbose option must be explicitly provided, even when using `-d all`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`-d {all,act_on,ai,cache,camctl,camsupport,common,control,dev,expose,fswatch,imageio,input,ioporder,lighttable,lua,masks,memory,nan,opencl,params,perf,pipe,print,pwstorage,signal,sql,tiling,undo,verbose}`\n"
": ເປີດໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (debug) ໃນເທີມິນອລ (terminal). darktable ມີຫຼາຍລະບົບຍ່ອຍ ແລະ ແຕ່ລະລະບົບສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດແຍກກັນໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງລະບົບຍ່ອຍ (ເຊັ່ນ `darktable -d opencl -d camctl`) ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທັງໝົດພ້ອມກັນ (ດ້ວຍ `-d all`). ຕົວເລືອກ `-d common` ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບຍ່ອຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທີ່ສຸດໃນຂະນະທີ່ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ darktable ຫຼື ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສົ່ງລັອກ (log) ເພື່ອລາຍງານບັນຫາ. ບາງຕົວເລືອກ (ເຊັ່ນ `-d opencl`) ສາມາດສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `-d verbose` ຄວບຄູ່ໄປນຳ. ຕົວເລືອກ verbose ຕ້ອງຖືກລະບຸຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະໃຊ້ `-d all` ກໍຕາມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--d-signal <signal>`\n"
": If `-d signal` or `-d all` is specified, specify the signal to debug using this option. Specify `ALL` to debug all signals or specify signal using its full name. Can be used multiple times.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--d-signal <signal>`\n"
": ຖ້າລະບຸ `-d signal` ຫຼື `-d all`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸສັນຍານ (signal) ທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ. ລະບຸ `ALL` ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທຸກສັນຍານ ຫຼື ລະບຸຊື່ເຕັມຂອງສັນຍານ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--d-signal-act <all,raise,connect,disconnect,print-trace>`\n"
": If `-d signal` or `-d all` is specified, specify the signal action to debug using this option.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--d-signal-act <all,raise,connect,disconnect,print-trace>`\n"
": ຖ້າລະບຸ `-d signal` ຫຼື `-d all`, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸການກະທຳຂອງສັນຍານ (signal action) ທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--disable-pipecache`\n"
": Disable the pixelpipe cache. This option allows only two cachelines per pipe, and should be used for debugging purposes only.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--disable-pipecache`\n"
": ປິດໃຊ້ງານແຄຊ໌ pixelpipe. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີພຽງແຕ່ສອງ cachelines ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ pipe, ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<input file>|<image folder>`\n"
": Optionally supply the name of an image file or folder. If a filename is given darktable starts in darkroom view with that file opened. If a folder is given darktable starts in lighttable view with the content of that folder as the current collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"`<input file>|<image folder>`\n"
": ລະບຸຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ (ທາງເລືອກ). ຖ້າລະບຸຊື່ໄຟລ໌, darktable ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນມຸມມອງຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom) ພ້ອມກັບເປີດໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ. ຖ້າລະບຸໂຟນເດີ, darktable ຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນມຸມມອງແຜງແສງ (lighttable) ໂດຍມີເນື້ອໃນໃນໂຟນເດີນັ້ນເປັນຄໍເລັກຊັນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--version`\n"
": Print the darktable version number, a copyright notice, some other useful information, and then terminate.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--version`\n"
": ສະແດງເລກເວີຊັນຂອງ darktable, ຂໍ້ມູນລິຂະສິດ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດອື່ນໆ ແລ້ວຈົບການເຮັດວຽກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--disable-opencl`\n"
": Prevent darktable from initializing the OpenCL subsystem. Use this option if darktable crashes at startup due to a defective OpenCL implementation.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--disable-opencl`\n"
": ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ darktable ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບຍ່ອຍ OpenCL. ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖ້າ darktable ຄ້າງ ຫຼື ດັບໃນຂະນະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເນື່ອງຈາກການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ OpenCL ມີບັນຫາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--configdir <config directory>`\n"
": Define the directory where darktable stores user-specific configuration. The default paths are listed on the [configuration directory](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--configdir <config directory>`\n"
": ກຳນົດໂຟນເດີທີ່ darktable ໃຊ້ເກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້. ເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນມີລາຍຊື່ຢູ່ໃນໜ້າ [configuration directory](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--library <library file>`\n"
": darktable keeps image information in an sqlite database for fast access. The default location of that database file is file name `library.db` in the directory specified by `--configdir` or the default [configuration directory](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). Use this option to provide an alternative location (e.g. if you want to do some experiments without compromising your original `library.db`). If the database file does not exist, darktable creates it for you. You may also provide `:memory:` as the library file, in which case the database is kept in system memory -- all changes are discarded when darktable terminates.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--library <library file>`\n"
": darktable ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ sqlite ເພື່ອການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ໄວ. ບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `library.db` ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ລະບຸໂດຍ `--configdir` ຫຼື [ໂຟນເດີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອລະບຸບ່ອນເກັບອື່ນ (ເຊັ່ນ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການທົດລອງບາງຢ່າງໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ກະທົບກັບໄຟລ໌ `library.db` ຕົ້ນສະບັບ). ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຢູ່, darktable ຈະສ້າງໃຫ້ໃໝ່. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸເປັນ `:memory:` ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງລະບົບ -- ເຊິ່ງການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດຈະຖືກລຶບຖິ້ມເມື່ອ darktable ປິດລົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Whenever darktable starts, it will lock the library to the current user. It does this by writing the current process identifier (PID) into a lock file `<library file>.lock` next to the library specified. If darktable finds an existing lock file for the library, it will terminate immediately.\n"
msgstr ": ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ darktable ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມັນຈະລັອກຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ປັດຈຸບັນ. ໂດຍການຂຽນໝາຍເລກຂະບວນການ (PID) ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ລັອກ `<library file>.lock` ໄວ້ຂ້າງໆຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ. ຖ້າ darktable ພົບໄຟລ໌ລັອກທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຢຸດການເຮັດວຽກທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--datadir <data directory>`\n"
": Define the directory where darktable finds its runtime data. The default location depends on your installation. Typical locations are `/opt/darktable/share/darktable/` and `/usr/share/darktable/`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--datadir <data directory>`\n"
": ກຳນົດໂຟນເດີທີ່ darktable ໃຊ້ຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ມູນການເຮັດວຽກ. ບ່ອນເກັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ. ບ່ອນເກັບປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ `/opt/darktable/share/darktable/` ແລະ `/usr/share/darktable/`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--moduledir <module directory>`\n"
": darktable has a modular structure and organizes its modules as shared libraries for loading at runtime. This option tells darktable where to look for its shared libraries. The default location depends on your installation. Typical locations are `/opt/darktable/lib64/darktable/` and `/usr/lib64/darktable/`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--moduledir <module directory>`\n"
": darktable ມີໂຄງສ້າງແບບໂມດູນ ແລະ ຈັດລະບຽບໂມດູນເປັນໄລບຣາຣີລວມ (shared libraries) ເພື່ອໂຫລດໃນຂະນະເຮັດວຽກ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບອກໃຫ້ darktable ຮູ້ວ່າຈະໄປຊອກຫາໄລບຣາຣີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຢູ່ໃສ. ບ່ອນເກັບປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ `/opt/darktable/lib64/darktable/` ແລະ `/usr/lib64/darktable/`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--tmpdir <tmp directory>`\n"
": Define where darktable should store its temporary files. If this option is not supplied darktable uses the system default.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--tmpdir <tmp directory>`\n"
": ກຳນົດບ່ອນທີ່ darktable ຄວນເກັບໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຕົວເລືອກນີ້, darktable ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--cachedir <cache directory>`\n"
": darktable keeps a cache of image thumbnails for fast image preview and precompiled OpenCL binaries for fast startup. By default the cache is located in `$HOME/.cache/darktable/`. Multiple thumbnail caches may exist in parallel -- one for each library file.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--cachedir <cache directory>`\n"
": darktable ເກັບແຄຊ໌ຂອງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອການເບິ່ງຮູບທີ່ໄວ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ OpenCL ທີ່ຄອມໄພລ໌ໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເພື່ອການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໄວ. ຕາມປົກກະຕິ ແຄຊ໌ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ `$HOME/.cache/darktable/`. ອາດມີແຄຊ໌ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຫຼາຍອັນຢູ່ພ້ອມກັນ -- ໜຶ່ງອັນຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໄຟລ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--localedir <locale directory>`\n"
": Define where darktable can find its language-specific text strings. The default location depends on your installation. Typical locations are `/opt/darktable/share/locale/` and `/usr/share/locale/`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--localedir <locale directory>`\n"
": ກຳນົດບ່ອນທີ່ darktable ສາມາດຊອກຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມພາສາຕ່າງໆ. ບ່ອນເກັບປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ `/opt/darktable/share/locale/` ແລະ `/usr/share/locale/`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--luacmd <lua command>`\n"
": A string containing lua commands to execute after lua initialization. These commands will be run after your “luarc” file.\n"
": If lua is not compiled-in, this option will be accepted but won't do anything.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--luacmd <ຄຳສັ່ງ lua>`\n"
": ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີຄຳສັ່ງ lua ເພື່ອປະຕິບັດງານຫຼັງຈາກການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ lua. ຄຳສັ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກລັນຫຼັງຈາກໄຟລ໌ “luarc"
"” ຂອງທ່ານ.\n"
": ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ມີການຕິດຕັ້ງ lua ມາໃນຕອນແປໂປຣແກຣມ (compiled-in), ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຖືກຍອມຮັບແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດ"
"ວຽກຫຍັງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--noiseprofiles <noiseprofiles json file>`\n"
": Provide a json file that contains camera-specific noise profiles. The default location depends on your installation. Typical locations are `/opt/darktable/share/darktable/noiseprofile.json` and `/usr/share/darktable/noiseprofile.json`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--noiseprofiles <noiseprofiles json file>`\n"
": ລະບຸໄຟລ໌ json ທີ່ມີໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສັນຍານລົບ (noise) ສະເພາະຂອງກ້ອງ. ບ່ອນເກັບປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ `/opt/darktable/share/darktable/noiseprofile.json` ແລະ `/usr/share/darktable/noiseprofile.json`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--conf <key>=<value>`\n"
": darktable supports a rich set of configuration parameters defined by the user in file `darktablerc`, located in the directory specified by `--configdir` or the default [configuration directory](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). You may temporarily overwrite individual settings on the command line with this option -- these settings will not be stored in `darktablerc` on exit.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--conf <key>=<value>`\n"
": darktable ຮອງຮັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ `darktablerc`. ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງຢ່າງຊົ່ວຄາວຜ່ານສາຍຄຳສັ່ງດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກນີ້ -- ເຊິ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນ `darktablerc` ເມື່ອປິດໂປຣແກຣມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`-t <num openmp threads>`\n"
": limit number of openmp threads to use in openmp parallel sections.\n"
msgstr ""
"`-t <num openmp threads>`\n"
": ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນເທຣດ (threads) ຂອງ openmp ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນສ່ວນການປະມວນຜົນແບບຂະໜານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--dump-pfm MODULE_A,MODULE_B`, `--dump-pipe MODULE_A,MODULE_B`, `--dumpdir DIR`\n"
": These options are provided for debugging darktable's internal processing pipeline. For example, if called with `--dump-pfm demosaic` darktable will dump the input and output of the demosaic module as pfm files. By default the location of these files is defined by the operating system -- some temporary folder reported in the log output -- but you can also explicitly define it via the `--dumpdir` option.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--dump-pfm MODULE_A,MODULE_B`, `--dump-pipe MODULE_A,MODULE_B`, `--dumpdir DIR`\n"
": ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຂະບວນການປະມວນຜົນພາຍໃນຂອງ darktable. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າເອີ້ນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍ `--dump-pfm demosaic`, darktable ຈະສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນ demosaic ເປັນໄຟລ໌ pfm. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ຜ່ານຕົວເລືອກ `--dumpdir`.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable-generate-cache"
msgstr "darktable-generate-cache"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `darktable-generate-cache` binary updates darktable's thumbnail cache. Invoke this program to generate all missing thumbnails in the background when your computer is idle.\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ `darktable-generate-cache` ໃຊ້ອັບເດດແຄຊ໌ (cache) ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງ darktable. ເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປທັງໝົດໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ ເມື່ອຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable-generate-cache` can be called with the following command line parameters:\n"
msgstr "`darktable-generate-cache` ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີສາຍຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable-generate-cache\n"
"              [-h, --help]\n"
"              [--version]\n"
"              [--min-mip <0-8>] [-m, --max-mip <0-8>]\n"
"              [--min-imgid <N>] [--max-imgid <N>]\n"
"              [--core <darktable options>]\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable-generate-cache\n"
"              [-h, --help]\n"
"              [--version]\n"
"              [--min-mip <0-8>] [-m, --max-mip <0-8>]\n"
"              [--min-imgid <N>] [--max-imgid <N>]\n"
"              [--core <darktable options>]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All parameters are optional. If started without parameters `darktable-generate-cache` uses reasonable defaults.\n"
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີທັງໝົດແມ່ນເປັນຕົວເລືອກ. ຖ້າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ມີພາລາມິເຕີ `darktable-generate-cache` ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`-h, --help`\n"
": Display usage information and terminate.\n"
msgstr ""
"`-h, --help`\n"
": ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນວິທີການໃຊ້ ແລະ ຈົບການເຮັດວຽກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--version`\n"
": Display copyright and version information and terminate.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--version`\n"
": ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນລິຂະສິດ ແລະ ເວີຊັນ ແລ້ວຈົບການເຮັດວຽກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--min-mip <0-8>, -m, --max-mip <0-8>`\n"
": darktable can store thumbnails with up to eight different resolution steps for each image. These parameters define the maximum resolution to be generated (defaults to a range of 0-2). There is normally no need to generate all possible resolutions here -- missing ones will be automatically generated by darktable the moment they are needed. When asked to generate multiple resolutions at once, the lower-resolution images are quickly downsampled from the highest-resolution image.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--min-mip <0-8>, -m, --max-mip <0-8>`\n"
": darktable ສາມາດເກັບຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໄດ້ເຖິງແປດລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຮູບ. ພາລາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກຳນົດຄວາມລະອຽດສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສ້າງ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0-2). ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງທຸກຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ -- ສ່ວນທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປຈະຖືກສ້າງໂດຍ darktable ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຕ້ອງການໃຊ້. ເມື່ອຖືກສັ່ງໃຫ້ສ້າງຫຼາຍຄວາມລະອຽດພ້ອມກັນ, ຮູບທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຢ່າງໄວວາຈາກຮູບທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--min-imgid <N>, --max-imgid <N>`\n"
": Specifies the range of internal image IDs from the database to work on. If no range is given, `darktable-generate-cache` will process all images.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--min-imgid <N>, --max-imgid <N>`\n"
": ກຳນົດໄລຍະຂອງ ID ຮູບພາບພາຍໃນຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໄລຍະ, `darktable-generate-cache` ຈະປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-generate-cache.md
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--core <darktable options>`\n"
": All command line parameters following `--core` are passed to the darktable core and handled as standard parameters. See the [`darktable binary`](./darktable.md) section for a detailed description.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--core <darktable options>`\n"
": ພາລາມິເຕີທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງ `--core` ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາພາກສ່ວນຫຼັກ (core) ຂອງ darktable ແລະ ຖືກຈັດການເປັນພາລາມິເຕີມາດຕະຖານ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໃນພາກ [`darktable binary`](./darktable.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable-cli"
msgstr "darktable-cli"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `darktable-cli` binary starts the command line interface variant of darktable which allows images to be exported.\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ລັນ `darktable-cli` ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ darktable ໃນຮູບແບບສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ (command line interface) ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This variant does not open any display -- it works in pure console mode without launching a GUI. This mode is particularly useful for servers running background jobs.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບນີ້ຈະບໍ່ເປີດການສະແດງຜົນໃດໆ -- ມັນເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດຄອນໂຊລລ້ວນໆ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການເປີດ GUI. ໂໝດນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບເຊີບເວີທີ່ລັນວຽກເບື້ອງຫຼັງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable-cli` can be called with the following command line parameters:\n"
msgstr "`darktable-cli` ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍພານາມິເຕີຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darktable-cli [<input file or folder>]\n"
"              [<xmp file>]\n"
"              <output file or folder>\n"
"              [--width <max width>]\n"
"              [--height <max height>]\n"
"              [--hq <0|1|true|false>]\n"
"              [--upscale <0|1|true|false>]\n"
"              [--style <style name>]\n"
"              [--style-overwrite]\n"
"              [--apply-custom-presets <0|1|false|true>]\n"
"              [--out-ext <extension>]\n"
"              [--import <file or dir>]\n"
"              [--library <path>]\n"
"              [--icc-type <type>]\n"
"              [--icc-file <file>]\n"
"              [--icc-intent <intent>]\n"
"              [--verbose]\n"
"              [--help [option]]\n"
"              [--core <darktable options>]\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable-cli [<input file or folder>]\n"
"              [<xmp file>]\n"
"              <output file or folder>\n"
"              [--width <max width>]\n"
"              [--height <max height>]\n"
"              [--hq <0|1|true|false>]\n"
"              [--upscale <0|1|true|false>]\n"
"              [--style <style name>]\n"
"              [--style-overwrite]\n"
"              [--apply-custom-presets <0|1|false|true>]\n"
"              [--out-ext <extension>]\n"
"              [--import <file or dir>]\n"
"              [--library <path>]\n"
"              [--icc-type <type>]\n"
"              [--icc-file <file>]\n"
"              [--icc-intent <intent>]\n"
"              [--verbose]\n"
"              [--help [option]]\n"
"              [--core <darktable options>]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The user must supply an input filename and an output filename. All other parameters are optional.\n"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກ. ພານາມິເຕີອື່ນໆທັງໝົດແມ່ນເປັນທາງເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<input file or folder>`\n"
": The name of the input file or folder (containing images) to be exported. If you wish to process multiple images or multiple folders use the `--import` option instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"`<input file or folder>`\n"
": ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີຂາເຂົ້າ (ທີ່ບັນຈຸຮູບພາບ) ທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍໂຟນເດີ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `--import` ແທນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<xmp file>`\n"
": The optional name of an XMP sidecar file containing the history stack data to be applied during export. If this option is not provided darktable will search for an XMP file that belongs to the given input file(s).\n"
msgstr ""
"`<xmp file>`\n"
": ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ XMP (ເປັນທາງເລືອກ) ທີ່ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນລາຍການປະຫວັດທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຕົວເລືອກນີ້ darktable ຈະຄົ້ນຫາໄຟລ໌ XMP ທີ່ເປັນຂອງໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`<output file or folder>`\n"
": The name of the output file or destination folder. The parameter is mandatory if you use the program on an image folder containing multiple images, and it must point to an existing folder. If the specified path does not point to an existing folder, it is interpreted as a filename. If the path is interpreted as a filename, the export file format is derived from the file extension, unless the `--out-ext` option is present (see below). Note that the file extension is only used to determine the **export format**, which then enforces the actual output extension (e.g. `image.jpeg` sets the format to JPEG, which results in the filename `image.jpg`). You can also use a number of [variables](../variables.md) in the output filename. If you specify output folder it is recommended that you also specify the file format with `--out-ext`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`<output file or folder>`\n"
": ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີປາຍທາງ. ພານາມິເຕີນີ້ແມ່ນຈໍາເປັນຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມກັບໂຟນເດີຮູບພາບທີ່ບັນຈຸຫຼາຍຮູບພາບ, ແລະ ມັນຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຖ້າເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ລະບຸບໍ່ໄດ້ຊີ້ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ມີຢູ່, ມັນຈະຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍວ່າເປັນຊື່ໄຟລ໌. ຖ້າເສັ້ນທາງຖືກຕີຄວາມໝາຍວ່າເປັນຊື່ໄຟລ໌, ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ສົ່ງອອກຈະຖືກກຳນົດຈາກນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌, ນອກຈາກວ່າຈະມີຕົວເລືອກ `--out-ext` (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ). ໝາຍເຫດວ່ານາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸ **ຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກ (export format)** ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈາກນັ້ນຈະບັງຄັບໃຊ້ນາມສະກຸນຂາອອກຕົວຈິງ (ເຊັ່ນ: `image.jpeg` ຈະຕັ້ງຮູບແບບເປັນ JPEG, ເຊິ່ງສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ `image.jpg`). ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ [ຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables)](../variables.md) ຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກ. ຖ້າທ່ານລະບຸໂຟນເດີຂາອອກ ແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານລະບຸຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ດ້ວຍ `--out-ext` ນຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--width <max width>`\n"
": Limit the width of the exported image to the given number of pixels.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--width <max width>`\n"
": ຈຳກັດຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຕາມຈຳນວນພິກເຊລທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--height <max height>`\n"
": Limit the height of the exported image to the given number of pixels.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--height <max height>`\n"
": ຈຳກັດຄວາມສູງຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຕາມຈຳນວນພິກເຊລທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--hq <0|1|true|false>`\n"
": Define whether to use high quality resampling during export (see the [export](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md) module reference for more details). Defaults to true.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--hq <0|1|true|false>`\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຊ້ການສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງໃໝ່ຄຸນນະພາບສູງໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກຫຼືບໍ່ (ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນໂມດູນ [ການສົ່ງອອກ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md)). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ true.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--upscale <0|1|true|false>`\n"
": Define whether allow upscaling during export. Defaults to false.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--upscale <0|1|true|false>`\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດ (upscaling) ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກຫຼືບໍ່. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ false.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--style <style name>`\n"
": Specify the name of a style to be applied during export. If a style is specified, the path to the darktable configuration directory must also be specified (i.e. `--core --configdir ~/.config/darktable`). By default no style is applied.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--style <style name>`\n"
": ລະບຸຊື່ຂອງສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ. ຖ້າລະບຸສະໄຕລ໌, ຕ້ອງລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ darktable ນຳ (ເຊັ່ນ: `--core --configdir ~/.config/darktable`). ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີການນຳໃຊ້ສະໄຕລ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--style-overwrite`\n"
": The specified style overwrites the history stack instead of being appended to it.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--style-overwrite`\n"
": ສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ລະບຸຈະຂຽນທັບລາຍການປະຫວັດ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການຕໍ່ທ້າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--apply-custom-presets <0|1|false|true>`\n"
": Whether to load `data.db` which contains presets and styles. Disabling this option allows you to run multiple instances of `darktable-cli` at the cost of being unable to use the `--style` option. Defaults to true.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--apply-custom-presets <0|1|false|true>`\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໂຫຼດ `data.db` ເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ ແລະ ສະໄຕລ໌ຫຼືບໍ່. ການປິດຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລັນ `darktable-cli` ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຕົວພ້ອມກັນ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ `--style` ໄດ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ true.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--out-ext <extension>`\n"
": Defines the export format to use (e.g. `jpeg`, `tiff`, `openexr`) based on the provided argument string, which can be a common extension (e.g. `jpg`, `tif`, `exr`) or a format (e.g. `jpeg`, `tiff`). The name `--out-ext` is preserved for compatibility with existing scripts, but it is actually used to determine the **format**, not the file extension; the extension, as always, is determined by the format. If specified, this format takes precedence over the one derived from `<output file>`. If the output filename already contains an extension, it is removed **only if** it exactly matches the string passed to `--out-ext`. Otherwise, it is treated as part of the filename (e.g. `output.jpg` with `--out-ext jpeg` results in `output.jpg.jpg`, because `jpg` does not match `jpeg`). Defaults to `jpg` if `<output folder>` is specified.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--out-ext <extension>`\n"
": ກຳນົດຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ (ເຊັ່ນ: `jpeg`, `tiff`, `openexr`) ໂດຍອີງຕາມຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ໃຫ້ມາ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເປັນນາມສະກຸນທົ່ວໄປ (ເຊັ່ນ: `jpg`, `tif`, `exr`) ຫຼື ຮູບແບບ (ເຊັ່ນ: `jpeg`, `tiff`). ຊື່ `--out-ext` ຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີຢູ່, ແຕ່ໃນຄວາມເປັນຈິງແລ້ວມັນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸ **ຮູບແບບ (format)**, ບໍ່ແມ່ນນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌; ສ່ວນນາມສະກຸນນັ້ນ ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຮູບແບບເອງ. ຖ້າລະບຸ, ຮູບແບບນີ້ຈະມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສູງກວ່າຮູບແບບທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກ `<output file>`. ຖ້າຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກມີນາມສະກຸນຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ **ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ** ມັນກົງກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ `--out-ext` ຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ (ເຊັ່ນ: `output.jpg` ທີ່ມີ `--out-ext jpeg` ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ໄດ້ `output.jpg.jpg`, ເພາະວ່າ `jpg` ບໍ່ກົງກັບ `jpeg`). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `jpg` ຖ້າລະບຸ `<output folder>`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--import <file or dir>`\n"
": Specify input file or folder, can be used multiple times. This option cannot be combined with `<input file or folder>`.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--import <file or dir>`\n"
": ລະບຸໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີຂາເຂົ້າ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ `<input file or folder>` ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--library <path>`\n"
": Read the image processing history stack from the specified library database instead of XMP sidecar files.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--library <path>`\n"
": ອ່ານປະຫວັດການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະບຸ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນໄຟລ໌ sidecar XMP.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--icc-type <type>`\n"
": Specify the ICC profile type, which is the same as specifying the \"output profile\" in the [_output color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md) module. Defaults to \"image specified\". Use `--help icc-type` to obtain a list of the supported types. See the _output color profile_ module reference for a more detailed description of the available options.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--icc-type <type>`\n"
": ລະບຸປະເພດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC, ເຊິ່ງຄືກັນກັບການລະບຸ \"output profile\" ໃນໂມດູນ [_output color profile_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/output-color-profile.md). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ \"image specified\". ໃຊ້ `--help icc-type` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການປະເພດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນຄູ່ມືການໃຊ້ໂມດູນ _output color profile_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--icc-file <file>` \n"
": Specify the ICC profile filename. Defaults to an empty filename.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--icc-file <file>` \n"
": ລະບຸຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຫວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--icc-intent <intent>` \n"
": Specify the rendering intent. Defaults to \"image specified\". Use `--help icc-intent` to obtain a list of the supported intents. See [rendering intent](../../special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent) for a more detailed description of the available options.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--icc-intent <intent>` \n"
": ລະບຸຈຸດປະສົງການສະແດງຜົນ (rendering intent). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ \"image specified\". ໃຊ້ `--help icc-intent` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍການທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ເບິ່ງ [rendering intent](../../special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--verbose`\n"
": Enables verbose output.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--verbose`\n"
": ເປີດການສະແດງຜົນລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`--help [option]`\n"
": Prints usage and exits. If `option` is specified, additionally prints usage for the given option.\n"
msgstr ""
"`--help [option]`\n"
": ສະແດງວິທີການໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ອອກຈາກໂປຣແກຣມ. ຖ້າລະບຸ `option`, ຈະສະແດງວິທີການໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບຕົວເລືອກນັ້ນຕື່ມ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "export options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export options for darktable are defined as configuration items, set from within the [export module](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md). There are two ways to alter this configuration when using `darktable-cli`, as described below.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກສຳລັບ darktable ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດເປັນລາຍການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກພາຍໃນ [ໂມດູນການສົ່ງອອກ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md). ມີສອງວິທີໃນການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ `darktable-cli` ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "use the export module"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໂມດູນການສົ່ງອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `darktable-cli` command will use the last format configuration used in the export module, when run in interactive (gui) mode. You may therefore manually set your desired format options in the darktable gui and then run `darktable-cli` to export your files.\n"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ `darktable-cli` ຈະໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໂມດູນການສົ່ງອອກ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກຮູບແບບທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນ GUI ຂອງ darktable ກ່ອນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງໃຊ້ `darktable-cli` ເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກໄຟລ໌.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "pass options on the command-line"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຕົວເລືອກຜ່ານສາຍຄຳສັ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can set any export format configuration option using the following syntax:\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກໃດໆກໍໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "    --core --conf plugins/imageio/format/<FORMAT>/<OPTION>=<VALUE>\n"
msgstr "    --core --conf plugins/imageio/format/<FORMAT>/<OPTION>=<VALUE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "where `<FORMAT>` is the name of the desired output format and `<OPTION>` is any configuration option for that format.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍທີ່ `<FORMAT>` ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ `<OPTION>` ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບຮູບແບບນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An option set in this way will not be permanently stored but will be used just for this run of `darktable-cli`.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຖາວອນ ແຕ່ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ `darktable-cli` ໃນຄັ້ງນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following sections describe the configuration options/values that are available for each export format:\n"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອະທິບາຍຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ/ຄ່າທີ່ມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກ:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "jpeg"
msgstr "jpeg"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`quality`\n"
": The compression quality (`5` - `100`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`quality`\n"
": ຄຸນນະພາບການບີບອັດ (`5` - `100`)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "j2k (jpg2000)"
msgstr "j2k (jpg2000)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`format`\n"
": The format of the output\n"
":  - `0`: J2K\n"
":  - `1`: jp2\n"
msgstr ""
"`format`\n"
": ຮູບແບບຂອງຜົນອອກ\n"
":  - `0`: J2K\n"
":  - `1`: jp2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`preset`\n"
": The DCP mode\n"
": - `0`: Cinema2K, 24 FPS\n"
": - `1`: Cinema2K, 48 FPS\n"
": - `2`: Cinema4K, 24 FPS\n"
msgstr ""
"`preset`\n"
": ໂໝດ DCP\n"
": - `0`: Cinema2K, 24 FPS\n"
": - `1`: Cinema2K, 48 FPS\n"
": - `2`: Cinema4K, 24 FPS\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "exr (OpenEXR)"
msgstr "exr (OpenEXR)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`bpp`\n"
": The bit depth (`16` or `32`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`bpp`\n"
": ຄວາມເລິກບິດ (`16` ຫຼື `32`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`compression`\n"
": The compression type\n"
":  - `0`: uncompressed\n"
":  - `1`: RLE\n"
":  - `2`: ZIPS\n"
":  - `3`: ZIP\n"
":  - `4`: PIZ\n"
":  - `5`: PXR24\n"
":  - `6`: B44\n"
":  - `7`: DWAA\n"
":  - `8`: DWAB\n"
msgstr ""
"`compression`\n"
": ປະເພດການບີບອັດ\n"
":  - `0`: ບໍ່ບີບອັດ\n"
":  - `1`: RLE\n"
":  - `2`: ZIPS\n"
":  - `3`: ZIP\n"
":  - `4`: PIZ\n"
":  - `5`: PXR24\n"
":  - `6`: B44\n"
":  - `7`: DWAA\n"
":  - `8`: DWAB\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "pdf"
msgstr "pdf"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`title`\n"
": The title of the pdf (any character)\n"
msgstr ""
"`title`\n"
": ຊື່ຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງ pdf (ຕົວອັກສອນໃດໆກໍໄດ້)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`size`\n"
": The size of the pdf (`a4`, `a3`, `letter`, `legal`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`size`\n"
": ຂະໜາດຂອງ pdf (`a4`, `a3`, `letter`, `legal`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`orientation`\n"
": the paper orientation of the pdf\n"
":  - `0`: portrait\n"
":  - `1`: landscape\n"
msgstr ""
"`orientation`\n"
": ແນວວາງຂອງເຈ້ຍ pdf\n"
":  - `0`: ແນວຕັ້ງ\n"
":  - `1`: ແນວນອນ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`border`\n"
": The empty space around the pdf; format: size (a number) + unit; examples: 10 mm, 1 inch\n"
msgstr ""
"`border`\n"
": ພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງອ້ອມຮອບ pdf; ຮູບແບບ: ຂະໜາດ (ຕົວເລກ) + ຫົວໜ່ວຍ; ຕົວຢ່າງ: 10 mm, 1 inch\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`dpi`\n"
": The resolution in dots per inch inside the pdf (`1` - `5000`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`dpi`\n"
": ຄວາມລະອຽດເປັນຈຸດຕໍ່ນິ້ວພາຍໃນ pdf (`1` - `5000`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`rotate`\n"
": Whether to rotate the pdf (`0` or `1`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`rotate`\n"
": ໝຸນ pdf ຫຼື ບໍ່ (`0` ຫຼື `1`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`icc`\n"
": Whether to embed an icc profile (`0` or `1`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`icc`\n"
": ຝັງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ icc ຫຼື ບໍ່ (`0` ຫຼື `1`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`bpp`\n"
": The bit depth (`8` or `16`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`bpp`\n"
": ຄວາມເລິກບິດ (`8` ຫຼື `16`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`compression`\n"
": Whether to compress the pdf (`0` or `1`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`compression`\n"
": ບີບອັດ pdf ຫຼື ບໍ່ (`0` ຫຼື `1`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`mode`\n"
": The mode to put the images in the pdf\n"
":  - `0`: normal: just put the images into the pdf\n"
":  - `1`: draft: images are replaced with boxes\n"
":  - `2`: debug: only show the outlines and bounding boxen\n"
msgstr ""
"`mode`\n"
": ໂໝດການວາງຮູບພາບໃນ pdf\n"
":  - `0`: ປົກກະຕິ (normal): ວາງຮູບພາບລົງໃນ pdf ເລີຍ\n"
":  - `1`: ຮ່າງ (draft): ແທນທີ່ຮູບພາບດ້ວຍກ່ອງສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ\n"
":  - `2`: ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (debug): ສະແດງສະເພາະເສັ້ນຂອບ ແລະ ກ່ອງຂອບເຂດ\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "pfm"
msgstr "pfm"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "No options provided.\n"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "png"
msgstr "png"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`compression`\n"
": The compression level (`0` - `9`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`compression`\n"
": ລະດັບການບີບອັດ (`0` - `9`)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ppm"
msgstr "ppm"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tiff"
msgstr "tiff"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`bpp`\n"
": The bit depth (`8`, `16`, `32`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`bpp`\n"
": ຄວາມເລິກບິດ (`8`, `16`, `32`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`compress`\n"
": The compression type\n"
":  - `0`: uncompressed\n"
":  - `1`: deflate\n"
":  - `2`: deflate with predictor\n"
msgstr ""
"`compress`\n"
": ປະເພດການບີບອັດ\n"
":  - `0`: ບໍ່ບີບອັດ\n"
":  - `1`: deflate\n"
":  - `2`: deflate ພ້ອມກັບ predictor\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`compresslevel`\n"
": The compression level (`0` - `9`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`compresslevel`\n"
": ລະດັບການບີບອັດ (`0` - `9`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`shortfile`\n"
": B&W or color image\n"
":  - `0`: write rgb colors\n"
":  - `1`: write grayscale\n"
msgstr ""
"`shortfile`\n"
": ຮູບພາບຂາວດຳ ຫຼື ສີ\n"
":  - `0`: ຂຽນເປັນສີ rgb\n"
":  - `1`: ຂຽນເປັນສີຂີ້ເຖົ່າ (grayscale)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "webp"
msgstr "webp"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`comp_type`\n"
": The compression type\n"
":  - `0`: lossy\n"
":  - `1`: lossless\n"
msgstr ""
"`comp_type`\n"
": ປະເພດການບີບອັດ\n"
":  - `0`: ແບບສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ (lossy)\n"
":  - `1`: ແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ (lossless)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`quality`\n"
": the compression quality (`5` - `100`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`quality`\n"
": ຄຸນນະພາບການບີບອັດ (`5` - `100`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`hint`\n"
": The preferred way to manage the compression\n"
":  - `0`: default\n"
":  - `1`: picture: digital picture, like portrait, inner shot\n"
":  - `2`: photo: outdoor photograph, with natural lighting\n"
":  - `3`: graphic: discrete tone image (graph, map-tile, etc.)\n"
msgstr ""
"`hint`\n"
": ວິທີການທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການຈັດການການບີບອັດ\n"
":  - `0`: ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
":  - `1`: picture: ຮູບພາບດິຈິຕອນ ເຊັ່ນ ຮູບຄົນ, ຮູບຖ່າຍພາຍໃນ\n"
":  - `2`: photo: ຮູບຖ່າຍກາງແຈ້ງ ທີ່ມີແສງທຳມະຊາດ\n"
":  - `3`: graphic: ຮູບພາບທີ່ມີໂທນສີແຍກກັນຊັດເຈນ (ກຣາຟ, ແຜນທີ່ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "copy"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາ"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "xcf"
msgstr "xcf"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "JXL"
msgstr "JXL"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`bpp`\n"
": The bit depth (`8`, `10`, `12`, `16`, `32`)\n"
msgstr ""
"`bpp`\n"
": ຄວາມເລິກບິດ (`8`, `10`, `12`, `16`, `32`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`pixel_type`\n"
": Boolean whether the (16 bit) pixel type is unsigned integer or floating point\n"
":  - `0`: unsigned integer\n"
":  - `1`: floating point\n"
msgstr ""
"`pixel_type`\n"
": ຄ່າ Boolean ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າປະເພດພິກເຊວ (16 ບິດ) ເປັນເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນບວກ ຫຼື ເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating point)\n"
":  - `0`: ເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນບວກ (unsigned integer)\n"
":  - `1`: ເລກທົດສະນິຍົມ (floating point)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`quality`\n"
": Integer (4-100): the quality of the image, roughly corresponding to JPEG quality (100 is lossless)\n"
msgstr ""
"`quality`\n"
": ເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນ (4-100): ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງຮູບພາບ, ທຽບເທົ່າກັບຄຸນນະພາບ JPEG ໂດຍປະມານ (100 ແມ່ນແບບບໍ່ສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`original`\n"
": Boolean whether to encode using the original color profile or the internal XYB one\n"
":  - `0`: internal\n"
":  - `1`: original\n"
msgstr ""
"`original`\n"
": ຄ່າ Boolean ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຈະເຂົ້າລະຫັດໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີດັ້ງເດີມ ຫຼື ຂອງພາຍໃນ XYB\n"
":  - `0`: ພາຍໃນ (internal)\n"
":  - `1`: ດັ້ງເດີມ (original)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`effort`\n"
": Integer between 1-9. Effort with which to encode output; higher is slower (default is 7)\n"
msgstr ""
"`effort`\n"
": ເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນລະຫວ່າງ 1-9. ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມໃນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ; ຄ່າສູງຈະຊ້າກວ່າ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 7)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cli.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`tier`\n"
": Integer between 0-4. Higher value favors decoding speed vs quality (default is 0)\n"
msgstr ""
"`tier`\n"
": ເລກຈຳນວນຖ້ວນລະຫວ່າງ 0-4. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບຄວາມໄວໃນການຖອດລະຫັດທຽບກັບຄຸນນະພາບ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0)\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "purge_non_existing_images.sh"
msgstr "purge_non_existing_images.sh"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find and remove entries from the library database referencing images that no longer exist in the filesystem. You must close darktable before running this script.\n"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ລຶບລາຍການຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງຮູບພາບທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງປິດ darktable ກ່ອນລັນສະຄຣິບນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The script can be called with the following command line parameters:\n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບນີ້ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້ດ້ວຍພາລາມິເຕີສາຍຄຳສັ່ງດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"purge_non_existing_images.sh [-c|--configdir <path>]\n"
"                             [-l|--library <path>]\n"
"                             [-p|--purge]\n"
msgstr ""
"purge_non_existing_images.sh [-c|--configdir <path>]\n"
"                             [-l|--library <path>]\n"
"                             [-p|--purge]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the script with no options to perform a \"dry run\", which generates a report of the missing files without committing any changes to the database.\n"
msgstr "ລັນສະຄຣິບໂດຍບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອເຮັດ \"dry run\", ເຊິ່ງຈະສ້າງລາຍງານໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຫາຍໄປໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The available options are:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີໃຫ້ຄື:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`-c|--configdir <path>`\n"
": Specify the path to the darktable configuration directory to be used by the script. If this option is not provided, the default [configuration directory](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md) location will be used.\n"
msgstr ""
"`-c|--configdir <path>`\n"
": ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ darktable ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂດຍສະຄຣິບ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ, ຈະໃຊ້ [ໂຟນເດີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`-l|--library <path>`\n"
": Specify the path to the library.db database file to be analysed by the script. If this option is not specified, the default library.db file location will be used.\n"
msgstr ""
"`-l|--library <path>`\n"
": ລະບຸເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ library.db ທີ່ຈະວິເຄາະໂດຍສະຄຣິບ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ, ຈະໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ library.db ໃນບ່ອນເກັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`-p|--purge`\n"
": Actually delete any entries in the database that refer to non-existent files. If the option is not provided, a report will be printed without committing any changes to the database.\n"
msgstr ""
"`-p|--purge`\n"
": ລຶບລາຍການໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອ້າງອີງເຖິງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ຈິງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ຈະມີພຽງການສະແດງລາຍງານໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Notes:**\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The script must be run in a unix shell, and the `sqlite3` client must be available in the command search path. For Linux systems, this will normally not be an issue. \n"
msgstr "1. ສະຄຣິບຕ້ອງຖືກລັນໃນ unix shell, ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີ `sqlite3` ຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນທາງຄົ້ນຫາຄຳສັ່ງ. ສຳລັບລະບົບ Linux, ນີ້ມັກຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນບັນຫາ. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For Windows systems, you will normally need the MSYS2 environment to be installed, as described in the [instructions for building darktable in a Windows environment](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/blob/master/packaging/windows/README.md). If you installed darktable using the standard Windows installer package, the location of the script would normally be something like: `C:\\Program Files\\darktable\\share\\darktable\\tools\\purge_non_existing_images.sh`.\n"
msgstr "2. ສຳລັບລະບົບ Windows, ໂດຍປົກກະຕິທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ MSYS2, ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ [ຄຳແນະນຳການສ້າງ darktable ໃນ Windows](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/blob/master/packaging/windows/README.md). ຖ້າທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ darktable ດ້ວຍແພັກເກດມາດຕະຖານ, ບ່ອນເກັບສະຄຣິບມັກຈະແມ່ນ: `C:\\Program Files\\darktable\\share\\darktable\\tools\\purge_non_existing_images.sh`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For macOS systems, the Terminal application provides a shell, and the `sqlite3` client is provided by the operating system by default. If darktable was installed using an application bundle from a dmg image, then the default location for the script would be `/Applications/darktable.app/Contents/Resources/share/darktable/tools/purge_non_existing_images.sh`\n"
msgstr "3. ສຳລັບລະບົບ macOS, ແອັບເປີ້ນ Terminal ມີ shell ໃຫ້ໃຊ້, ແລະ ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການມີ `sqlite3` ມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ. ຖ້າຕິດຕັ້ງ darktable ຜ່ານ dmg, ບ່ອນເກັບສະຄຣິບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະແມ່ນ `/Applications/darktable.app/Contents/Resources/share/darktable/tools/purge_non_existing_images.sh`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/purge_non_existing_images_sh.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The delete operation can't be undone. It is therefore strongly recommended that you take a backup of the database before purging any entries.\n"
msgstr "4. ການລຶບຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ສາມາດເອົາຄືນໄດ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນກ່ອນການລຶບລາຍການໃດໆ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cltest.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable-cltest"
msgstr "darktable-cltest"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cltest.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `darktable-cltest` binary checks if there is a usable OpenCL environment on your system that darktable can use. It emits some debug output that is equivalent to calling `darktable -d opencl` and then terminates.\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ `darktable-cltest` ໃຊ້ກວດສອບວ່າມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ OpenCL ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານທີ່ darktable ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ມັນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ເຊິ່ງທຽບເທົ່າກັບການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ `darktable -d opencl` ແລ້ວຈົບການເຮັດວຽກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cltest.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable-cltest` is called without command line parameters.\n"
msgstr "`darktable-cltest` ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີພາລາມິເຕີສາຍຄຳສັ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "program invocation"
msgstr "ການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cmstest.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable-cmstest"
msgstr "darktable-cmstest"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cmstest.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `darktable-cmstest` binary (Linux only) investigates whether the color management subsystem of your computer is correctly configured and displays some useful information about the installed monitor profile(s).\n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ໄບນາຣີ `darktable-cmstest` (ສະເພາະ Linux) ໃຊ້ກວດສອບວ່າລະບົບການຈັດການສີຂອງຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ແລະ ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈໍພາບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/program-invocation/darktable-cmstest.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`darktable-cmstest` is called without command line parameters.\n"
msgstr "`darktable-cmstest` ຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີພາລາມິເຕີສາຍຄຳສັ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Special Topics"
msgstr "ຫົວຂໍ້ພິເສດ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "midi device support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບອຸປະກອນ MIDI"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "MIDI is a communication protocol used by many electronic musical instruments (\"pianos\"), digital audio studio equipment (\"control surfaces\") and even dedicated \"photo editing keyboards\" like the Loupedeck/Loupedeck+ (but not their later products). Such devices commonly feature sets of keys/buttons and sometimes encoders (knobs/rotors) and faders (sliders). Buttons sometimes feature lights, which makes them ideal for toggling features in darktable, because the lights can reflect the current (on/off) status. Encoders and faders are ideal for use with on-screen sliders in processing modules. They can be \"endless\" (without a start/end point and without any markings on the knob) allowing greater than 360 degrees rotation, and they may be motorized. This is helpful when switching between images or points in the editing history since the \"physical\" position of the encoders/faders always corresponds to the on-screen position. You may also find a ring of LEDs around an encoder that indicates its current value.\n"
msgstr "MIDI ແມ່ນໂປຣໂຕຄໍການສື່ສານທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເຄື່ອງດົນຕີເອເລັກໂຕຣນິກ, ອຸປະກອນສະຕູດິໂອສຽງ ແລະ ແມ່ນແຕ່ \"ຄີບອດແຕ່ງຮູບ\" ເຊັ່ນ Loupedeck. ອຸປະກອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມັກຈະມີປຸ່ມກົດ, ປຸ່ມໝຸນ (encoders) ແລະ ປຸ່ມສະໄລ້ (faders). ປຸ່ມໝຸນແບບ \"endless\" ສາມາດໝຸນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ ເຊິ່ງເໝາະສຳລັບການປັບຄ່າສະໄລເດີໃນ darktable. ບາງລຸ້ນອາດຈະເປັນແບບມໍເຕີ (motorized) ເຊິ່ງຈະປັບຕຳແໜ່ງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄ່າໃນໜ້າຈໍໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "endless encoders; absolute / relative encoding"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມໝຸນແບບໄຮ້ຂີດຈຳກັດ; ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບສຳບູນ / ແບບທຽບຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Besides their physical features, these devices are often highly configurable in how they send data. Encoders can send their \"absolute\" position when they are turned, as a value in the range 0-127. Darktable will send back the current position of the on-screen slider, which a ring of LEDs would show (if present) or a motorized fader would respond to (by moving the knob). If the encoder is endless, it can also be used at different speeds and higher resolution than just the 128 steps, with either many rotations or less than a full rotation required to move the on-screen slider between extremes.\n"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ. ປຸ່ມໝຸນສາມາດສົ່ງຕຳແໜ່ງ \"absolute\" ໃນຊ່ວງ 0-127. darktable ຈະສົ່ງຄ່າກັບໄປຫາອຸປະກອນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄຟ LED ຫຼື ປຸ່ມສະໄລ້ມໍເຕີ ສະແດງຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າເປັນປຸ່ມໝຸນແບບໄຮ້ຂີດຈຳກັດ, ມັນຈະສາມາດປັບຄ່າໄດ້ລະອຽດກວ່າ 128 ຂັ້ນໄດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endless encoders without ring lights might send relative movements which can be accelerated when turning quickly. Different encoding modes can be used, and the device might come with software to configure these options. It is important that all encoders use the same settings and send on the same \"channel\" as the keys (ideally the first: 0 or 1). By default darktable tries to figure out which channel and encoding is used by listening to the first five messages. After starting a session you should slowly turn a knob left/down so that 5 identical one-step-down messages are sent. If this fails the input system can be reset (by pressing Ctrl+Alt+Shift+i) for another try. On success, a toast message will be shown in the middle of the screen displaying the discovered encoding mode -- 127 (\"2s Complement\") and 63 (\"Relative Offset\") are common.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມໝຸນທີ່ບໍ່ມີໄຟວົງແຫວນອາດຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນແບບທຽບຖານ (relative) ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປັບຄວາມໄວຕາມການໝຸນໄດ້. darktable ຈະພະຍາຍາມກວດສອບຮູບແບບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍການຟັງ 5 ຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳອິດ. ເມື່ອເລີ່ມໃຊ້ງານ, ທ່ານຄວນໝຸນປຸ່ມໄປທາງຊ້າຍຊ້າໆ 5 ຄັ້ງ. ຖ້າສຳເລັດ ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ ຮູບແບບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດທີ່ກວດພົບ (ເຊັ່ນ 127 ຫຼື 63).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your device has been successfully configured and connected, you should see messages like \"G#--1 (8) not assigned\" when you press a button (the first is a musical notation code for the \"tone\", the second a numerical representation) or \"CC1,up not assigned\" when adjusting an encoder. You are now ready to assign buttons and encoders to actions. The easiest way to do this for a bunch of them in one go is to press the [visual shortcut mapping](../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md#visual-shortcut-mapping) button (to the left of the preferences button) to enter shortcut visual mapping mode. In this mode, when you hover the mouse over a button or slider, if you then press a key or turn an encoder on the MIDI device, it gets assigned as a shortcut to that widget. You can immediately test it (while staying in mapping mode) by moving the mouse to the middle of the screen (so you don’t accidentally assign it to a different widget) and then repeating the action. Right-click to switch off mapping mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າອຸປະກອນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຄວນຈະເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມເຊັ່ນ \"G#--1 "
"(8) ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດ\" ເມື່ອທ່ານກົດປຸ່ມ (ອັນທຳອິດແມ່ນລະຫັດຕົວໂນດດົນຕີສຳລັບ \"ສຽງ\", ອັນທີສອງແມ່ນຕົວເລກ"
"ແທນຄ່າ) ຫຼື \"CC1,up ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດ\" ເມື່ອມີການປັບຕົວໝຸນ. ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານພ້ອມແລ້ວທີ່ຈະກຳນົດປຸ່ມ ແລະ ຕົວໝຸນໃ"
"ຫ້ກັບການເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງໆ. ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ສຳລັບຫຼາຍໆອັນໃນຄັ້ງດຽວແມ່ນໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ [ການກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດ"
"ແບບເຫັນພາບ](../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md#visual-shortcut-mapping) (ຢູ່ເບື້"
"ອງຊ້າຍຂອງປຸ່ມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ) ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດການກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດແບບເຫັນພາບ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ເມື່ອທ່ານເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ໄປວາ"
"ງໄວ້ເທິງປຸ່ມ ຫຼື ແຖບເລື່ອນ, ຫາກທ່ານກົດປຸ່ມ ຫຼື ໝຸນຕົວໝຸນເທິງອຸປະກອນ MIDI, ມັນຈະຖືກກຳນົດເປັນປຸ່ມລັດໃຫ້ກັບວິ"
"ດເຈັດນັ້ນທັນທີ. ທ່ານສາມາດທົດສອບມັນໄດ້ທັນທີ (ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຢູ່ໃນໂໝດການກຳນົດ) ໂດຍການຍ້າຍເມົາສ໌ໄປໄວ້ກາງ"
"ໜ້າຈໍ (ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດມັນໃຫ້ກັບວິດເຈັດອື່ນໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ) ແລ້ວເຮັດການກະທຳນັ້ນຊ້ຳອີກຄັ້ງ. ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອປິດໂໝ"
"ດການກຳນົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You might also want to assign buttons to duplicate the Ctrl and Shift key functions. For this, you need the full shortcuts dialog (right-click on the shortcuts button or open [preferences](../preferences-settings/_index.md) and go to the [shortcuts](../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md) tab). In the top (\"action\") list, double-click on \"global/modifiers\". Now press the MIDI button you want to assign to Shift. Double click on \"global/modifiers\" again, but this time after assigning a button change the _element_ for the newly created shortcut in the bottom list from \"shift\" to \"ctrl\". Now you can use your MIDI device together with your mouse to access most of the functionality in darktable. After ticking \"enable fallbacks\" in the shortcuts dialog, holding Ctrl while turning an encoder will slow it down by a factor 10, whereas holding Shift speeds it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການກຳນົດປຸ່ມເພື່ອເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ແທນປຸ່ມ Ctrl ແລະ Shift. ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃ"
"ຊ້ໜ້າຕ່າງທາງລັດແບບເຕັມ (ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ປຸ່ມທາງລັດ ຫຼື ເປີດ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ](../preferences-settings/"
"_index.md) ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ແຖບ [ທາງລັດ](../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)). ໃນລາຍການ"
"ດ້ານເທິງ (\"action\"), ໃຫ້ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ \"global/modifiers\". ຈາກນັ້ນ ກົດປຸ່ມ MIDI ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້"
"ອງການກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນ Shift. ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ \"global/modifiers\" ອີກຄັ້ງ, ແຕ່ຄັ້ງນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກກຳນົດປຸ່ມແ"
"ລ້ວ ໃຫ້ປ່ຽນ _element_ ສຳລັບທາງລັດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ໃນລາຍການດ້ານລຸ່ມຈາກ \"shift\" ເປັນ \"ctrl\". "
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນ MIDI ຂອງທ່ານຮ່ວມກັບເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງການເຮັດວຽກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນ "
"darktable ໄດ້. ຫຼັງຈາກໝາຍຕິກ \"enable fallbacks\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທາງລັດ, ການກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃ"
"ນຂະນະທີ່ໝຸນຕົວປັບ (encoder) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຊ້າລົງ 10 ເທົ່າ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການກົດ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັ"
"ນໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Several devices produced by Behringer have LEDs in a circle around their encoder knobs. These use different patterns depending on what slider or combobox they are assigned to:\n"
"- If the slider goes from -1 to +1, only the middle LED will be lit at zero. Moving negative will gradually light up the left side, moving positive will light the right side. \n"
"- If the slider goes from 0-100%, you’ll see more LEDs coming on when moving right, until they are all lit at 100%.\n"
"- Other numeric values will use 1 or 2 LEDs to indicate intermediate values. \n"
"- Dropdowns will use 1 LED for the options that fit on the first turn of the dial and 2 on the second turn.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອຸປະກອນຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ຜະລິດໂດຍ Behringer ມີໄຟ LED ເປັນວົງມົນອ້ອມຮອບປຸ່ມໝຸນ (encoder knobs). ໄຟເຫຼົ່"
"ານີ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບວ່າພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບ slider ຫຼື combobox ໃດ:\n"
"- ຫາກ slider ມີຄ່າແຕ່ -1 ຫາ +1, ຈະມີພຽງໄຟ LED ເຄິ່ງກາງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຮຸ່ງຢູ່ທີ່ຄ່າສູນ. ເມື່ອປັບໄປທາງລົບ "
"ໄຟທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຈະຄ່ອຍໆຮຸ່ງຂຶ້ນ, ເມື່ອປັບໄປທາງບວກ ໄຟທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຈະຮຸ່ງຂຶ້ນ. \n"
"- ຫາກ slider ມີຄ່າແຕ່ 0-100%, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນໄຟ LED ຮຸ່ງຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເມື່ອໝຸນໄປທາງຂວາ, ຈົນກວ່າຈະຮຸ່ງທັງ"
"ໝົດທີ່ 100%.\n"
"- ຄ່າຕົວເລກອື່ນໆ ຈະໃຊ້ໄຟ LED 1 ຫຼື 2 ດວງ ເພື່ອສະແດງຄ່າລະຫວ່າງກາງ. \n"
"- ລາຍການເລືອກ (Dropdowns) ຈະໃຊ້ໄຟ LED 1 ດວງ ສໍາລັບຕົວເລືອກທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຮອບທຳອິດຂອງການໝຸນ ແລະ "
"2 ດວງ ໃນຮອບທີສອງ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "troubleshooting and configuration"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you don’t see any \"not assigned\" toast at the top of your screen when pressing keys or turning knobs, you’ll want to test if any other MIDI applications can see the device. Under Linux you’ll need to have Alsa installed. After plugging in the device, dmesg should show lines like these:\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ເຫັນຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ \"not assigned\" ຢູ່ເທິງສຸດຂອງໜ້າຈໍເມື່ອອັດປຸ່ມ ຫຼື ໝຸນປຸ່ມ, ທ່ານຄວນທົດສ"
"ອບເບິ່ງວ່າແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ MIDI ອື່ນໆ ສາມາດເຫັນອຸປະກອນໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ພາຍໃຕ້ Linux ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ Alsa ຕິ"
"ດຕັ້ງຢູ່. ຫຼັງຈາກສຽບອຸປະກອນເຂົ້າແລ້ວ, dmesg ຄວນຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຄືແນວນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"usb 1-1: new full-speed USB device number 2 using xhci_hcd\n"
"...\n"
"mc: Linux media interface: v0.10\n"
"usbcore: registered new interface driver snd-usb-audio\n"
msgstr ""
"usb 1-1: new full-speed USB device number 2 using xhci_hcd\n"
"...\n"
"mc: Linux media interface: v0.10\n"
"usbcore: registered new interface driver snd-usb-audio\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Darktable uses the simple cross-platform layer PortMidi to access the underlying OS API (Alsa, Core Midi, WinMM). If you are self-compiling, make sure you have included this library.\n"
msgstr "Darktable ໃຊ້ PortMidi ເຊິ່ງເປັນເລເຢີຂ້າມແພລັດຟອມແບບງ່າຍດາຍ ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ API ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ (Alsa, Core Midi, WinMM). ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງຄອມໄພລ໌ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ລວມເອົາໄລບຣາຣີນີ້ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Starting darktable with the debug parameters `-d input` will give additional information. It should try to open up to 10 MIDI devices in the order it finds them. On the command line you might see something like this:\n"
msgstr "ການເປີດ darktable ດ້ວຍ `-d input` ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມເປີດອຸປະກອນ MIDI ໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 10 ອຸປະກອນ ຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ກວດພົບ.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[midi_open_devices] opened midi device 'Arturia BeatStep' via 'MMSystem' as midi0\n"
"[midi_open_devices] opened midi device 'BCR2000' via 'MMSystem' as midi1\n"
"[midi_open_devices] opened midi device 'X-TOUCH MINI' via 'MMSystem' as midi2\n"
msgstr ""
"[midi_open_devices] opened midi device 'Arturia BeatStep' via 'MMSystem' as midi0\n"
"[midi_open_devices] opened midi device 'BCR2000' via 'MMSystem' as midi1\n"
"[midi_open_devices] opened midi device 'X-TOUCH MINI' via 'MMSystem' as midi2\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two issues can arise:\n"
msgstr "ບັນຫາທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນມີ 2 ຢ່າງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "a device you don't want to use might be opened anyway (and potentially cause inappropriate behavior, like starting a fireworks show prematurely -- see [this document](http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:6EcEOjfjiAkJ:gmbh.pyropak.com/docs/downloads/surefire-prologic-digital-controller_rev2010.pdf+&cd=1&hl=en&ct=clnk&gl=us)); or\n"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນທີ່ທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ອາດຈະຖືກເປີດຂຶ້ນມາ (ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ);\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "devices might appear in a different order at the next startup (for example because they are plugged into a different usb port). Since configurations are stored with the device number only, reordering would cause an incorrect layout to be picked up.\n"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນອາດຈະປ່ຽນລຳດັບໃນການເປີດເຄື່ອງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ (ເຊັ່ນ ຍ້ອນການສຽບຊ່ອງ USB ໃໝ່). ເນື່ອງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຖືກເກັບຕາມເລກລຳດັບ, ການປ່ຽນລຳດັບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຜິດພ້ຽນໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can fix which devices to load in a specific location and which ones to skip using the configuration parameter [preferences > miscellaneous > interface > order or exclude midi devices](../preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md#interface). To skip loading the BCR2000 in the above example and to fix the other two devices into the number 0 and 2 slots, you could set this config parameter to \"`BeatStep,dontuse,X-TOUCH,-BCR2000`\". This would leave the BeatStep as device midi0, always leave midi1 unused and would not load the BCR2000 at all, but if any other devices are connected, they would appear as midi3, midi4 and so on. Adding \"`,-`\" at the end would prevent any further devices loading.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດລຳດັບ ຫຼື ຍົກເວັ້ນອຸປະກອນໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ອື່ນໆ > ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ > ລຳດັບ ຫຼື ຍົກເວັ້ນອຸປະກອນ MIDI]. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຕັ້ງເປັນ \"`BeatStep,dontuse,X-TOUCH,-BCR2000`\" ເພື່ອລັອກຕຳແໜ່ງອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໂຫລດ BCR2000.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you just specify the configuration parameter as a single minus sign \"`-`\", no devices will be loaded at all.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງເປັນເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົບ \"`-`\" ພຽງຢ່າງດຽວ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ໂຫລດອຸປະກອນໃດໆເລີຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For devices that use relative encoding as mentioned above, you’d have to perform the slow-turn-left procedure on every start-up, or add the found encoding to the configuration string. For example \"`Loupedeck:127`\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ສໍາລັບອຸປະກອນທີ່ໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບສຳພັດ (relative encoding) ດັ່ງທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງເຮັ"
"ດຂັ້ນຕອນການໝຸນຊ້າຍຊ້າໆ ໃນທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່, ຫຼື ເພີ່ມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດທີ່ພົບລົງໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ "
"\"`Loupedeck:127`\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some MIDI controllers have keys with a light beneath them. These can be used to toggle settings and show the current position by having the light on or off. For this to work, darktable checks periodically (a few times a second) whether, say, the position of an on-screen toggle button has been changed, and sends messages to any linked MIDI device buttons to switch their light on or off. But if an unknown device has unintentionally been connected, this could be undesirable. So by default darktable waits until a \"note\" message is received _from_ a MIDI button before sending any \"note\" light on/off messages _back_ for that (and any lower numbered) button. That way no more buttons are addressed than exist on the device. If you immediately want all button lights to be used (rather than having to press the highest note once for each session) you can specify the number of buttons in the \"order or exclude MIDI devices\" preference, for example, \"`BeatStep:63:16`\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງຄວບຄຸມ MIDI ບາງອັນມີປຸ່ມທີ່ມີໄຟຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ສະແດງສະຖານ"
"ະປະຈຸບັນໂດຍການເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໄຟ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, darktable ຈະກວດສອບເປັນໄລຍະ (ສອງສາມຄັ້ງ"
"ຕໍ່ວິນາທີ) ວ່າ, ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບໃນໜ້າຈໍມີການປ່ຽນແປງຫຼືບໍ່, ແລະ ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມໄປຫາປຸ່ມຂອງອຸປະກອ"
"ນ MIDI ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້ເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໄຟຂອງພວກມັນ. ແຕ່ຖ້າມີອຸປະກອນທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ, ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດ"
"ຈະເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ບໍ່ເພິ່ງປະສົງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ darktable ຈະລໍຖ້າຈົນກວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"note\" _ຈ"
"າກ_ ປຸ່ມ MIDI ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ເປີດ/ປິດ ໄຟ \"note\" _ກັບຄືນ_ ໄປຫາປຸ່ມນັ້ນ (ແລະ ປຸ່ມທີ່ມີໝາຍເລກຕ່"
"ຳກວ່າ). ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ ຈະບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດປຸ່ມເກີນກວ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນອຸປະກອນ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໄຟຂອງທຸກປຸ່ມໃນທັນທີ (ແທ"
"ນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງກົດປຸ່ມທີ່ສູງທີ່ສຸດໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ) ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸຈຳນວນປຸ່ມໃນສ່ວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"order "
"or exclude MIDI devices\", ຕົວຢ່າງ: \"`BeatStep:63:16`\".\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "devices reported to be working"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນທີ່ຢືນຢັນແລ້ວວ່າໃຊ້ງານໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The shortcut mapping system has been most extensively tested with the Behringer devices and contains custom code to deal with their specific features. All other devices are treated as \"generic midi\" and may or may not work (well). If you succeed in getting a MIDI device up and running that hasn't been mentioned below, it would be greatly appreciated if you would provide feedback in order to assist others, if any special steps are required. You could do this either by submitting a documentation [pull request](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/pulls) to amend this page or by [filing an issue](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/issues) containing the necessary information.\n"
msgstr "ລະບົບທາງລັດໄດ້ຖືກທົດສອບຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດກັບອຸປະກອນ Behringer. ສຳລັບອຸປະກອນອື່ນໆ ຈະຖືກມອງເປັນ \"generic midi\" ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີຫຼືບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບແຕ່ລະລຸ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ລຸ້ນອື່ນໄດ້ສຳເລັດ, ສາມາດແບ່ງປັນຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Behringer X-touch Mini / Compact"
msgstr "Behringer X-touch Mini / Compact"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These devices should be in Standard Mode (not MC). Layers A & B are somewhat supported, however, since the device does not send a notification when switching between layers, and since lights (both under buttons and the pattern used around the rotors) are set based on which layer darktable believes is active, everything will only be updated completely after you press or turn something in the \"new\" layer. Default settings are assumed; if any have been changed they can be restored using the [X-Touch Editor](https://www.behringer.com/en/products/0808-AAF)\n"
msgstr "ຄວນຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ Standard Mode (ບໍ່ແມ່ນ MC). ຮອງຮັບ Layer A ແລະ B ໃນລະດັບໜຶ່ງ. ແຕ່ເນື່ອງຈາກອຸປະກອນບໍ່ແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອປ່ຽນ Layer, ໄຟສະແດງຜົນຈະອັບເດດໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ ມີການກົດ ຫຼື ໝຸນປຸ່ມໃນ Layer ນັ້ນໆກ່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Behringer BCR2000 / BCF2000"
msgstr "Behringer BCR2000 / BCF2000"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These machines are highly configurable so there are many settings that could complicate the interaction with darktable's MIDI module. The [BC Manager tool](https://mountainutilities.eu/bcmanager) (available for Windows and MacOS) can be used to configure them. The easiest thing to do is to reset all encoders and buttons to their simplest settings, which can be done (for the BCR2000) using [this file](https://github.com/dterrahe/darktable/files/6539400/bcr2000.all.buttons.and.encoders.zip). You can send it to the machine with BC Manager or (under Linux) with amidi. There's also a global setting called \"Deadtime\" that determines how long the BCR ignores arriving messages after sending out updates. This is to avoid feedback loops, but for darktable it means that it blocks the adjustments sent back immediately after each rotor move. So Deadtime needs to be set to 0.\n"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ຫຼາຍ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ BC Manager ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດ. ສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນແມ່ນຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"Deadtime\" ໃຫ້ເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ darktable ສາມາດສົ່ງຄ່າກັບໄປຫາອຸປະກອນໄດ້ທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກມີການປັບປ່ຽນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arturia Beatstep"
msgstr "Arturia Beatstep"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Individual rotors can be configured to send absolute (0-127) values or changes (+/- 1,2,3,... in different encodings). The recommended setting is Relative #1 for all knobs with Knob Acceleration set to Slow (Off) or Medium. Then put the string `BeatStep:63:16` in [preferences > miscellaneous > interface > order or exclude midi devices](../preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md#interface). This can be configured with [Midi Control Center](https://www.arturia.com/support/downloads&manuals), available for Windows or MacOS.\n"
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງປຸ່ມໝຸນເປັນ Relative #1 ແລະ ຕັ້ງ Knob Acceleration ເປັນ Slow ຫຼື Medium. ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ໃສ່ຄ່າ `BeatStep:63:16` ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອຸປະກອນ MIDI ຂອງ darktable.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Loupedeck / Loupedeck+"
msgstr "Loupedeck / Loupedeck+"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Put the string `Loupedeck:127` in \"preferences > miscellaneous > interface > order or exclude midi devices\".\n"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ໃສ່ຄ່າ `Loupedeck:127` ໃນສ່ວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"ລຳດັບ ຫຼື ຍົກເວັ້ນອຸປະກອນ MIDI\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**@jenshannoschwalm** has provided a layout that can be imported in the shortcuts dialog/tab. It can be found, with documentation, here https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/pull/12829#issuecomment-1320264833\n"
msgstr "**@jenshannoschwalm** ໄດ້ແຈກຍາຍຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (layout) ທີ່ສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ໃນແທັບທາງລັດ ສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ທີ່ລິ້ງໃນ GitHub.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Korg nanoKONTROL2"
msgstr "Korg nanoKONTROL2"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The device should be configured first using the Korg Kontrol Editor application to be in the CC mode and every button should be set to the Note type and Momentary button behavior. To control the lights in the buttons the LED mode should be set to External. It is important to note that the Track and the Marker buttons do not have leds in them.\n"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າຜ່ານ Korg Kontrol Editor ໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນ CC mode, ປຸ່ມທຸກປຸ່ມເປັນແບບ Note ແລະ Momentary. ສ່ວນການຄວບຄຸມໄຟໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ LED mode ເປັນ External.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/midi-device-support.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There is a Kontrol Editor profile available [here](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/files/7603658/note_buttons.zip), which can be loaded using the Windows application to directly configure all these settings to correctly work with darktable.\n"
msgstr "ມີໄຟລ໌ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບ Kontrol Editor ໃຫ້ດາວໂຫລດ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານກັບ darktable ໄດ້ທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/special-topics/variables.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "variables"
msgstr "ຕົວປ່ຽນ (Variables)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/special-topics/variables.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable supports variable substitution in a number of modules and preference settings. For example:\n"
