msgid ""
"![second-window-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/second-window-icon.png#icon) second darkroom window\n"
": Allows the user to display a second image in a separate window. By default, the second window shows the same contents as the main view. When an image is \"pinned\" in the  second window, it will remain unchanged when making module changes, navigating the history stack or opening a different image in the main view. This is especially useful on large screens and multi-monitor setups.\n"
msgstr ""
"![second-window-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/second-window-icon.png#icon) ໜ້າຕ່າງຫ້ອງມືດທີສອງ\n"
": ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະແດງຮູບພາບທີສອງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໜ້າຕ່າງທີສອງຈະສະແດງເນື້ອຫາດຽວກັນກັບມຸມເບິ່ງຫຼັກ. ເມື່ອຮູບພາບຖືກ \"ປັກໝຸດ\" ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີສອງ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງໂມດູນ, ການນຳທາງໃນປະຫວັດ ຫຼື ການເປີດຮູບອື່ນໃນມຸມເບິ່ງຫຼັກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບໜ້າຈໍຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍໜ້າຈໍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![focus-peak-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/focus-peak-icon.png#icon) [focus peaking](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md)\n"
": Toggle focus peaking mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"![focus-peak-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/focus-peak-icon.png#icon) [ຈຸດໂຟກັດສູງສຸດ (focus peaking)](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md)\n"
": ເປີດ/ປິດ ໂໝດສະແດງຈຸດໂຟກັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![color-assessment-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/color-assessment-icon.png#icon) [color assessment](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md)\n"
": Toggle the ISO12646 color assessment view.\n"
msgstr ""
"![color-assessment-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/color-assessment-icon.png#icon) [ການປະເມີນສີ](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md)\n"
": ເປີດ/ປິດ ມຸມເບິ່ງການປະເມີນສີຕາມມາດຕະຖານ ISO12646.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![high-quality-processing-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/high-quality-processing-icon.png#icon) [high quality processing](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/high-quality-processing.md)\n"
": Toggle high quality processing mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"![high-quality-processing-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/high-quality-processing-icon.png#icon) [ການປະມວນຜົນຄຸນນະພາບສູງ](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/high-quality-processing.md)\n"
": ເປີດ/ປິດ ໂໝດການປະມວນຜົນຄຸນນະພາບສູງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![raw-overexposed-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/raw-overexposed-icon.png#icon) [raw overexposed warning](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md)\n"
": Toggle raw overexposed indicators (right-click for options).\n"
msgstr ""
"![raw-overexposed-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/raw-overexposed-icon.png#icon) [ຄຳເຕືອນແສງເກີນໃນ Raw](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md)\n"
": ເປີດ/ປິດ ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ແສງເກີນໃນໄຟລ໌ Raw (ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![clipping-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/clipping-icon.png#icon) [clipping warning](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md)\n"
": Toggle clipping warnings (right-click for options).\n"
msgstr ""
"![clipping-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/clipping-icon.png#icon) [ຄຳເຕືອນສີ/ແສງຂາດ (clipping)](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md)\n"
": ເປີດ/ປິດ ຄຳເຕືອນສ່ວນທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຂາດຫາຍ (ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![softproof-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/softproof-icon.png#icon) [soft proof](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md)\n"
": Toggle softproofing overlays (right-click for options).\n"
msgstr ""
"![softproof-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/softproof-icon.png#icon) [ການຈຳລອງການພິມ (soft proof)](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md)\n"
": ເປີດ/ປິດ ການສະແດງການຈຳລອງສີກ່ອນພິມ (ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![gamut-check-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/gamut-check-icon.png#icon) [gamut check](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/gamut.md)\n"
": Toggle gamut checking (right-click for options).\n"
msgstr ""
"![gamut-check-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/gamut-check-icon.png#icon) [ການກວດສອບຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut)](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/gamut.md)\n"
": ເປີດ/ປິດ ການກວດສອບຂອບເຂດສີທີ່ເກີນການສະແດງຜົນ (ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![guides-overlays-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/guides-overlays-icon.png#icon) [guides & overlays](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md)\n"
": Left-click to switch global guide overlays on/off and right-click to change the guide settings, including the color of all on-image drawing (masks, crop guides etc.)\n"
msgstr ""
"![guides-overlays-icon](./darkroom-view-layout/guides-overlays-icon.png#icon) [ເສັ້ນນຳທາງ ແລະ ສິ່ງຊ້ອນກັນ](../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md)\n"
": ຄລິກຊ້າຍເພື່ອເປີດ/ປິດ ເສັ້ນນຳທາງທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນນຳທາງ, ລວມທັງສີຂອງສິ່ງທີ່ແຕ້ມເທິງຮູບ (ໜ້າກາກ, ເສັ້ນນຳການຄອບຕັດ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/darkroom-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also enable the [filmstrip](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) module at the bottom of the screen to allow you select and interact with the currently selected collection in the [lighttable](../lighttable/_index.md) view.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ແຖບຟິມ (filmstrip)](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) ຢູ່ລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກ ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກກັບຊຸດຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນມຸມເບິ່ງ [lighttable](../lighttable/_index.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The darkroom view is where you develop your images. The center panel contains the image currently being edited.\n"
msgstr "ມຸມເບິ່ງຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom) ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານລ້າງຮູບ ຫຼື ປັບແຕ່ງຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ. ແຜງກາງຈະສະແດງຮູບພາບທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "zoom"
msgstr "ຊູມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Middle-click on the center panel cycle between \"fit to screen\", 1:1 and 2:1 zoom. \n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມກາງເມົາສ໌ເທິງແຜງກາງ ເພື່ອສະລັບລະຫວ່າງ \"ພໍດີກັບໜ້າຈໍ\", ຊູມ 1:1 ແລະ 2:1. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively you can zoom by scrolling with your mouse or touchpad. When the [constrain darkroom zoom between screen fit and 100%](../../preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md#interface) preference is enabled, scroll-wheel and pinch-to-zoom is constrained to the range between screen fit (zoom out) and 100% (zoom in). Hold _Ctrl_ while zooming to temporarily lift the limit and zoom beyond 100%. When the preference is disabled, zoom is never constrained and the additional _Ctrl_ key press is not needed to zoom beyond 100% .\n"
msgstr "ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຊູມໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ທັດສ໌ແພດ (touchpad). ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [ຈຳກັດການຊູມໃນຫ້ອງມືດລະຫວ່າງພໍດີໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ 100%](../../preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md#interface), ການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງ ແລະ ການຈີບນິ້ວຊູມ ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງພໍດີໜ້າຈໍ (ຊູມອອກ) ຫາ 100% (ຊູມເຂົ້າ). ກົດ _Ctrl_ ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະຊູມເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການຈຳກັດຊົ່ວຄາວ ແລະ ຊູມເກີນ 100%. ຫາກປິດການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ການຊູມຈະບໍ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົດ _Ctrl_ ເພື່ອຊູມເກີນ 100%.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the [enable touchpad gestures in darkroom](../../preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md#interface) preference is enabled, then touchpad scroll gestures can be used:\n"
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [ເປີດໃຊ້ທ່າທາງສຳຜັດໃນຫ້ອງມືດ](../../preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md#interface), ທ່ານຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ທ່າທາງການເລື່ອນເທິງທັດສ໌ແພດໄດ້:\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "manage module layouts"
msgstr "ຈັດການຮູບແບບໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage the layout and grouping of processing modules and the quick access panel.\n"
msgstr "ຈັດການຮູບແບບ ແລະ ການຈັດກຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ແຜງການເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![manage module layouts](./manage-module-layouts/manage-module-layouts.png#w100)\n"
msgstr "![manage module layouts](./manage-module-layouts/manage-module-layouts.png#w100)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This maintenance screen can be accessed from the _presets_ menu beside the module search box or module group icons (below the scopes module in the darkroom view). Ctrl+click on the preset menu to open this screen directly.\n"
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງການຈັດການນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກເມນູ _ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ (presets)_ ຂ້າງຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາ ໂມດູນ ຫຼື ໄອຄອນກຸ່ມໂມດູນ (ຢູ່ລຸ່ມໂມດູນ scopes ໃນໜ້າຫ້ອງມືດ). Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ເມນູ ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ເພື່ອເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ໂດຍກົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Settings are automatically saved when you exit the screen. Click _reset_ to abandon any changes made in the current editing session.\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອທ່ານອອກຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້. ຄລິກ _ reset_ ເພື່ອ ຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆທີ່ເຮັດໃນການແກ້ໄຂຄັ້ງນີ້.\n"

