msgid "module controls"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມໂມດູນ"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "global controls"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມລວມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following global controls are available in the top panel of the screen.\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມລວມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນແຜງດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preset\n"
": Select an existing module group preset.\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ (preset): ເລືອກຄ່າກຸ່ມໂມດູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"remove\n"
": Remove the current preset (user-defined presets only).\n"
msgstr "ລຶບ (remove): ລຶບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ປະຈຸບັນ (ສະເພາະອັນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"duplicate\n"
": Duplicate the current preset with a new name. The above example shows a new preset named \"user defined\", which has been created by duplicating the \"modules: default\" preset.\n"
msgstr "ເຮັດສຳເນົາ (duplicate): ເຮັດສຳເນົາຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ປະຈຸບັນດ້ວຍຊື່ໃໝ່. ຕົວຢ່າງ ຂ້າງເທິງສະແດງຊື່ \"user defined\" ເຊິ່ງສ້າງໂດຍການເຮັດສຳເນົາຈາກ \"modules: default\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rename\n"
": Rename the current preset (user-defined presets only). Right-click to bring up a menu that can be used to copy, paste, select all, delete or insert an emoji).\n"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ (rename): ປ່ຽນຊື່ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ (ສະເພາະອັນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ). ຄລິກຂວາ ເພື່ອເປີດເມນູສຳລັບ ຄັດລອກ, ວາງ, ເລືອກທັງໝົດ, ລຶບ ຫຼື ໃສ່ອິໂມຈິ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"new\n"
": Create a new preset containing a minimal list of modules.\n"
msgstr "ໃໝ່ (new): ສ້າງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃໝ່ທີ່ມີລາຍການໂມດູນໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show search line\n"
": Choose whether to display the search bar below the module group icons\n"
msgstr "ສະແດງແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ: ເລືອກວ່າຈະສະແດງແຖບຄົ້ນຫາຢູ່ລຸ່ມໄອຄອນກຸ່ມໂມດູນຫຼືບໍ່\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show quick access panel\n"
": Choose whether to display the quick access panel. If checked, a new entry will appear in the bottom panel to allow you to add or remove widgets.\n"
msgstr "ສະແດງແຜງການເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນ: ເລືອກວ່າຈະສະແດງແຜງການເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນຫຼືບໍ່. ຖ້າເລືອກ, ຈະມີລາຍການໃໝ່ປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບວິດເຈັດໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show all history modules in active group\n"
": Select this to show all modules that are present in the [history stack](../pixelpipe/history-stack.md) within the active group, regardless of whether or not they are actually active.\n"
msgstr "ສະແດງທຸກໂມດູນປະຫວັດໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ: ເລືອກອັນນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ [ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ (history stack)](../pixelpipe/history-stack.md) ພາຍໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ເປີດຢູ່, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າພວກມັນກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"auto-apply this preset\n"
": Module group presets can be automatically applied based on the type of image being worked on. The check box indicates whether this preset currently has any auto-apply rules. Click on the gear icon to amend the auto-apply settings. See [presets](../processing-modules/presets.md) for details.\n"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່ານີ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ: ຄ່າກຸ່ມໂມດູນສາມາດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມປະເພດຂອງຮູບ. ຊ່ອງໝາຍບອກໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າຄ່ານີ້ມີກົດການນຳໃຊ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼືບໍ່. ຄລິກໄອຄອນເຟືອງເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ [ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ (presets)](../processing-modules/presets.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bottom panel of the screen allows you to alter the quick access panel and module groups for the selected preset (user-defined presets only).\n"
msgstr "ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງໜ້າຈໍຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປ່ຽນແປງແຜງການເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນ ແລະ ກຸ່ມໂມດູນສຳລັບ ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ເລືອກ (ສະເພາະອັນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງເອງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"add a group\n"
": Click on the + sign beside the \"module groups\" label to add a new group. \n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມກຸ່ມ: ຄລິກທີ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ + ຂ້າງປ້າຍ \"ກຸ່ມໂມດູນ\" ເພື່ອເພີ່ມກຸ່ມໃໝ່. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"remove a group\n"
": Remove a group by clicking on the X button beside the group name.\n"
msgstr "ລຶບກຸ່ມ: ລຶບກຸ່ມໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ X ຂ້າງຊື່ກຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"add a module/widget\n"
": Add a module to a group, or a widget to the quick access panel, by clicking the + sign below the group name. Select the required module/widget from the displayed list. \n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໂມດູນ/ວິດເຈັດ: ເພີ່ມໂມດູນເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ວິດເຈັດເຂົ້າໃນແຜງເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນ ໂດຍການຄລິກເຄື່ອງໝາຍ + ລຸ່ມຊື່ກຸ່ມ. ເລືອກໂມດູນ/ວິດເຈັດທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈາກລາຍການ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"remove a module/widget\n"
": Remove a module from a group, or a widget from the quick access panel, by clicking the X beside the module/widget name.\n"
msgstr "ລຶບໂມດູນ/ວິດເຈັດ: ລຶບໂມດູນ ຫຼື ວິດເຈັດອອກໂດຍການຄລິກ X ຂ້າງຊື່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"change a group's icon\n"
": Change the icon assigned to a group by clicking on the existing group icon and selecting a new one from the displayed list.\n"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນໄອຄອນກຸ່ມ: ປ່ຽນໄອຄອນຂອງກຸ່ມໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນເດີມແລ້ວເລືອກອັນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"change the group order\n"
": Change the order in which the groups are displayed by clicking on the < and > buttons below the group names.\n"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນລຳດັບກຸ່ມ: ປ່ຽນລຳດັບການສະແດງຜົນຂອງກຸ່ມໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ < ແລະ > ລຸ່ມຊື່ກຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rename a group\n"
": Rename a module group by clicking on the group name and typing. Right-click to bring up a menu that can be used to copy, paste, select all, delete or insert an emoji)\n"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຊື່ກຸ່ມ: ປ່ຽນຊື່ກຸ່ມໂມດູນໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ກຸ່ມແລ້ວພິມໃໝ່. ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອ ໃຊ້ເມນູ ຄັດລອກ, ວາງ, ເລືອກທັງໝົດ, ລຶບ ຫຼື ໃສ່ອິໂມຈິ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processing modules are organized and accessed via the right-hand panel in the darkroom:\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນຖືກຈັດລະບຽບ ແລະ ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານແຖບດ້ານຂວາມືໃນຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![organization](./organization/organization.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![organization](./organization/organization.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the icons at the top of this panel to reveal, from left to right, \n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງແຖບນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງ, ຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ, \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![quick access](./organization/quick-access-panel-icon.png#icon) [quick access panel](./quick-access-panel.md)\n"
": A customizable panel allowing quick access to commonly-used module controls.\n"
msgstr ""
"![quick access](./organization/quick-access-panel-icon.png#icon) [ແຖບເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນ (quick access panel)](./quick-access-panel.md)\n"
": ແຖບທີ່ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງການຄວບຄຸມໂມດູນທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-active-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-active-icon.png#icon) active modules\n"
": A group containing the modules that are currently active in the pixelpipe.  Right-click to show all modules that are present in the [history stack](../pixelpipe/history-stack.md) within the active group, regardless of whether or not they are actually active.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-active-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-active-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ (active modules)\n"
": ກຸ່ມທີ່ປະກອບດ້ວຍໂມດູນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນ pixelpipe. ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອສະແດງໂມດູນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ [ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ (history stack)](../pixelpipe/history-stack.md) ພາຍໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ, ບໍ່ວ່າພວກມັນຈະກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[module groups](./module-groups.md)\n"
": One or more groups of processing modules. These groups are user-defined but some default groupings are provided as presets.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ກຸ່ມໂມດູນ (module groups)](./module-groups.md)\n"
": ກຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນໜຶ່ງກຸ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ກຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແຕ່ກໍມີການຈັດກຸ່ມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບາງຢ່າງໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[presets menu](./manage-module-layouts.md)\n"
": A menu that allows you to access stored module layout presets and create your own (via the \"manage presets..\" option). You can also directly access the \"manage presets\" dialog by Ctrl+clicking on the presets menu.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets menu)](./manage-module-layouts.md)\n"
": ເມນູທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຂອງການວາງຮູບແບບໂມດູນທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ ແລະ ສ້າງຂອງທ່ານເອງ (ຜ່ານຕົວເລືອກ \"ຈັດການຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ..\"). ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໜ້າຕ່າງ \"ຈັດການຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ\" ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໂດຍການ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ທີ່ເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click once on a module group icon (including the active group) to show only the modules in that group. Click a second time to show a list of all modules that are currently active or present in any group.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງໃສ່ໄອຄອນກຸ່ມໂມດູນ (ລວມທັງກຸ່ມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ) ເພື່ອສະແດງສະເພາະໂມດູນໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ. ຄລິກຄັ້ງທີສອງເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໂມດູນທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ມີຢູ່ໃນທຸກກຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can change which widgets appear in the quick access panel and which modules appear in the module groups, by right-clicking the appropriate icon.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງວິດເຈັດທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນແຖບເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນ ແລະ ໂມດູນທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນກຸ່ມໂມດູນ ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄອຄອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "search"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below the module group icons is the search bar, which you can use to access any of the processing modules, regardless of whether they are currently in a group. This option allows you to search by module name, any user-defined [instance name](../processing-modules/multiple-instances.md), as well as pre-defined module tags (for example, the [color calibration rgb](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-balance-rgb.md) module can also be searched using the terms \"hue\", \"contrast\" and \"vibrance\").\n"
msgstr "ລຸ່ມໄອຄອນກຸ່ມໂມດູນແມ່ນແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ, ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນໃດໆກໍໄດ້, ບໍ່ວ່າພວກມັນຈະຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມຫຼືບໍ່ກໍຕາມ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄົ້ນຫາດ້ວຍຊື່ໂມດູນ, [ຊື່ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance name)](../processing-modules/multiple-instances.md) ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ, ລວມທັງແທັກໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂມດູນ [color calibration rgb](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-balance-rgb.md) ຍັງສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳວ່າ \"hue\", \"contrast\" ແລະ \"vibrance\").\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "quick access panel"
msgstr "ແຖບເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The quick access panel allows you to access widgets from a number of processing modules all in one place.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງວິດເຈັດຈາກໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍໆຢ່າງໄດ້ໃນບ່ອນດຽວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![quick-access-panel](./quick-access-panel/quick-access-panel.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![quick-access-panel](./quick-access-panel/quick-access-panel.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The initial set of modules (and widgets) in the panel is determined by the _auto-apply pixel workflow defaults_ setting in [processing preferences](../../preferences-settings/processing.md).\n"
msgstr "ຊຸດໂມດູນ (ແລະ ວິດເຈັດ) ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນໃນແຖບນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ການນຳໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກພິກເຊວແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto-apply pixel workflow defaults)_ ໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດການປະມວນຜົນ](../../preferences-settings/processing.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can add or remove widgets in the panel by: \n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບວິດເຈັດໃນແຖບນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍ: \n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "right-clicking on the ![quick access panel icon](./quick-access-panel/quick-access-panel-icon.png#icon).\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ ![quick access panel icon](./quick-access-panel/quick-access-panel-icon.png#icon).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "right-clicking on the module name.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊື່ໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "using the [manage module layouts](./manage-module-layouts.md) screen.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໜ້າຈໍ [ຈັດການການວາງຮູບແບບໂມດູນ](./manage-module-layouts.md).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ctrl+clicking on a widget in a processing module while in [visual shortcut mapping mode](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md#visual-shortcut-mapping).\n"
msgstr "Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ວິດເຈັດໃນໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ ຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ [ໂໝດການກຳນົດຄີລັດດ້ວຍສາຍຕາ (visual shortcut mapping mode)](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md#visual-shortcut-mapping).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the icon to the left of the module name to enable/disable the module.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງຊື່ໂມດູນເພື່ອ ເປີດ/ປິດ ການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Icons to the right of the module name can be used to:\n"
"* ![reset icon](./quick-access-panel/reset.png#icon) reset the state of the module back to its original condition.\n"
"* ![presets icon](./quick-access-panel/presets.png#icon) open the [presets](../processing-modules/presets.md) menu of the module.\n"
"* ![full version icon](./quick-access-panel/full-version.png#icon) open the full version of the module. \n"
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງຊື່ໂມດູນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອ:\n"
"* ![reset icon](./quick-access-panel/reset.png#icon) ຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນຄືນໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບສູ່ສະພາວະເດີມ.\n"
"* ![presets icon](./quick-access-panel/presets.png#icon) ເປີດເມນູ [ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets)](../processing-modules/presets.md) ຂອງໂມດູນ.\n"
"* ![full version icon](./quick-access-panel/full-version.png#icon) ເປີດໂມດູນໃນເວີຊັນເຕັມ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If any module has [multiple instances](../processing-modules/multiple-instances.md) enabled you will no longer be able to manage that module's widgets through the quick access panel and will have to use the full module interface.\n"
msgstr "ຫາກໂມດູນໃດໜຶ່ງມີການເປີດໃຊ້ [ຫຼາຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (multiple instances)](../processing-modules/multiple-instances.md), ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດການວິດເຈັດຂອງໂມດູນນັ້ນຜ່ານແຖບເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນໄດ້ອີກ ແລະ ຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຜ່ານໜ້າຈໍໂມດູນເຕັມເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/organization/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "organization"
msgstr "ການຈັດລະບຽບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A number of pre-defined module groups are shipped with darktable and are selectable as presets. These are summarized below.\n"
msgstr "darktable ມາພ້ອມກັບກຸ່ມໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ ເຊິ່ງເລືອກໄດ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ (presets). ດັ່ງລາຍລະອຽດລຸ່ມນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All of these presets (with the exception of _modules: deprecated_ and _search only_) also include the quick access panel. All except the _modules: deprecated_ group include the search bar.\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ທັງໝົດ (ຍົກເວັ້ນ _modules: deprecated_ ແລະ _search only_) ຈະລວມເອົາແຜງ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນນຳ. ທຸກກຸ່ມຍົກເວັ້ນ _modules: deprecated_ ຈະມີແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_modules: all_"
msgstr "_modules: all_ (ໂມດູນທັງໝົດ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This preset contains all modules, sorted according to the traditional module groupings used prior to darktable 3.4, as follows:\n"
msgstr "ຄ່ານີ້ລວມເອົາທຸກໂມດູນ, ຈັດລຽງຕາມການຈັດກຸ່ມແບບດັ້ງເດີມທີ່ໃຊ້ກ່ອນ darktable 3.4, ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-basic-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-basic-icon.png#icon) base modules\n"
": The minimal set of modules normally required to render a presentable image.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-basic-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-basic-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນພື້ນຖານ\n"
": ຊຸດໂມດູນຂັ້ນຕ່ຳທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການສ້າງຮູບໃຫ້ເບິ່ງດີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-tone-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-tone-icon.png#icon) tone modules\n"
": Other modules related to tone levels and contrast.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-tone-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-tone-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນໂທນ\n"
": ໂມດູນອື່ນໆທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບລະດັບໂທນສີ ແລະ ຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-color-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-color-icon.png#icon) color modules\n"
": Modules related to color grading and color profiles.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-color-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-color-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນສີ\n"
": ໂມດູນທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບການປັບແຕ່ງສີ (color grading) ແລະ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-correct-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-correct-icon.png#icon) corrective modules\n"
": Modules related to correcting problems such as lens distortions, sensor noise, sharpening, etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-correct-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-correct-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນການແກ້ໄຂ (corrective modules)\n"
": ໂມດູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ການບິດເບືອນຂອງເລນ (lens distortions), ສິ່ງລົບກວນຂອງເຊັນເຊີ (sensor noise), ການເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົມຊັດ (sharpening), ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-effects-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-effects-icon.png#icon) (special) effects modules\n"
": \"Special effect\" modules such as bloom, diffuse or sharpen, etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-effects-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-effects-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນເອັບເຟັກ (ພິເສດ)\n"
": ໂມດູນ \"ເອັບເຟັກພິເສດ\" ເຊັ່ນ: bloom, diffuse or sharpen, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_workflow: scene-referred_ & _workflow: display-referred_"
msgstr "_ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ: ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred)_ & _ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ: ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ (display-referred)_"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These presets define groups of modules relevant to the [scene-referred and display-referred workflows](../pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md#module-order-and-workflows), sorted into groups as shown below:\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets) ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກຳນົດກຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ [ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ ແລະ ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ](../pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md#module-order-and-workflows), ເຊິ່ງຈັດລຽງເປັນກຸ່ມດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-basic-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-basic-icon.png#icon) base modules\n"
": A basic set of modules to adjust the cropping/orientation, adjust the exposure, and apply tone mappings and contrast as appropriate to the workflow.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-basic-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-basic-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນພື້ນຖານ (base modules)\n"
": ຊຸດໂມດູນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ ການຕັດຂອບ/ການວາງແນວ (cropping/orientation), ປັບການຮັບແສງ (exposure), ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າໂທນ (tone mapping) ລວມທັງຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast) ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-color-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-color-icon.png#icon) color modules\n"
": Modules relating to color grading and color saturation.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-color-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-color-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນສີ (color modules)\n"
": ໂມດູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການປັບລະດັບສີ (color grading) ແລະ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ (color saturation).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-correct-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-correct-icon.png#icon) corrective modules\n"
": Modules relating to correcting problems relating to lens distortions, sensor noise, sharpening, retouching, etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-correct-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-correct-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນການແກ້ໄຂ (corrective modules)\n"
": ໂມດູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບ ການບິດເບືອນຂອງເລນ, ສິ່ງລົບກວນຂອງເຊັນເຊີ, ການເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົມຊັດ, ການຕົບແຕ່ງ (retouching), ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-effects-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-effects-icon.png#icon) (special) effects modules\n"
": \"Special effect\" modules such as watermark, framing, vignetting, etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-effects-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-effects-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນເອັບເຟັກ (ພິເສດ)\n"
": ໂມດູນ \"ເອັບເຟັກພິເສດ\" ເຊັ່ນ: ລາຍນ້ຳ (watermark), ການໃສ່ຂອບ (framing), ການເຮັດຂອບມືດ (vignetting), ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_workflow: beginner_"
msgstr "_ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ: ຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (beginner)_"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This preset provides a minimal set of modules targeted as a starting point for beginners. It is suggested that beginners start by copying this minimal preset, and add to it as they gain experience with other modules. \n"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນນີ້ສະໜອງຊຸດໂມດູນຂັ້ນຕ່ຳສຸດເພື່ອເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຜູ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເລີ່ມຈາກການສຳເນົາຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ນີ້, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເພີ່ມໂມດູນອື່ນໆເຂົ້າໄປເມື່ອມີປະສົບການຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-basic-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-basic-icon.png#icon) base modules\n"
": A basic set of modules to adjust the cropping/orientation, adjust the exposure, and apply a basic tone mapping.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-basic-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-basic-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນພື້ນຖານ (base modules)\n"
": ຊຸດໂມດູນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ ການຕັດຂອບ/ການວາງແນວ, ປັບການຮັບແສງ, ແລະ ການກຳນົດຄ່າໂທນພື້ນຖານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-grading-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-grading-icon.png#icon) grading modules\n"
": Modules dealing with creative tone and color grading.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-grading-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-grading-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນປັບລະດັບສີ (grading modules)\n"
": ໂມດູນທີ່ຈັດການກັບການປັບໂທນສີ ແລະ ການປັບລະດັບສີໃນທາງສ້າງສັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![module-group-effects-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-effects-icon.png#icon) (special) effects modules\n"
": \"Special effect\" modules such as retouch, sharpen, watermark, etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"![module-group-effects-icon](./manage-module-layouts/module-group-effects-icon.png#icon) ໂມດູນເອັບເຟັກ (ພິເສດ)\n"
": ໂມດູນ \"ເອັບເຟັກພິເສດ\" ເຊັ່ນ: ການຕົບແຕ່ງ (retouch), ການເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົມຊັດ, ລາຍນ້ຳ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_search only_"
msgstr "_ຄົ້ນຫາເທົ່ານັ້ນ (search only)_"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This preset does not include any module groupings. Modules may only be accessed using the search facility.\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເອົາການຈັດກຸ່ມໂມດູນໃດໆ. ໂມດູນຕ່າງໆສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຄົ້ນຫາເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_modules: deprecated_"
msgstr "_ໂມດູນ: ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານ (deprecated)_"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This preset contains a list of deprecated modules. This is the only way to access deprecated modules for new edits but be warned: these modules will be removed for new edits in the next release of darktable. This group cannot be duplicated and the modules within it cannot be added to user-created groups.\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນນີ້ມີລາຍຊື່ຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີດຽວທີ່ຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂໃໝ່ ແຕ່ຂໍເຕືອນວ່າ: ໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຍ້າຍອອກຈາກການແກ້ໄຂໃໝ່ໃນເວີຊັນຖັດໄປຂອງ darktable. ກຸ່ມນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດສຳເນົາໄດ້ ແລະ ໂມດູນພາຍໃນກຸ່ມນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/organization/module-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Deprecated modules are assigned to this group only temporarily to support a smooth transition to their replacements. After the deprecation period (usually one year), these modules can no longer be used for new edits and are removed from this group. If the group then becomes empty, it will no longer be shown in the presets list.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ໂມດູນທີ່ຖືກຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານຈະຖືກຈັດເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມນີ້ພຽງຊົ່ວຄາວ ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນແປງໄປສູ່ໂມດູນໃໝ່ທີ່ມາແທນ. ຫຼັງຈາກໄລຍະເວລາການຍົກເລີກ (ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນໜຶ່ງປີ), ໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂໃໝ່ໄດ້ອີກ ແລະ ຈະຖືກຍ້າຍອອກຈາກກຸ່ມນີ້. ຫາກກຸ່ມນີ້ວ່າງເປົ່າ, ມັນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃນລາຍຊື່ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each processing module takes its input from the preceding module in the pixelpipe, performs its operation on the image data, and then hands the output to the next module in the pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນຈະຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າຈາກໂມດູນກ່ອນໜ້າໃນ pixelpipe, ທຳການປະມວນຜົນ ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກໄປຫາໂມດູນຖັດໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A module's output data can optionally be reprocessed (combined) with its input data before being handed to the next module. This additional processing step is called _blending_ -- input and output data is reprocessed using algorithms called blending operators or [blend modes](./blend-modes.md).\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນສາມາດເລືອກທີ່ຈະນຳມາປະມວນຜົນໃໝ່ (ລວມ) ກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ ສົ່ງໄປຫາໂມດູນຖັດໄປ. ຂັ້ນຕອນເພີ່ມເຕີມນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ _ການປະສົມ (blending)_ -- ຂໍ້ມູນ ຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດການຄຳນວນທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ [ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend modes)](./blend-modes.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each blend mode is further controlled by the _opacity_ parameter (having a value between 0% and 100%) which defines how much the input and output images contribute to the final result. Typically an opacity of 0% outputs an image which is identical to the input image (the module has no effect) whereas an opacity of 100% delivers the maximum effect of the module.\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະໂໝດການປະສົມຈະຖືກຄວບຄຸມຕື່ມໂດຍພາຣາມີເຕີ _ຄວາມທຶບແສງ (opacity)_ (ມີຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 0% ຫາ 100%) ເຊິ່ງເປັນໂຕບອກວ່າຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ຜົນສຸດທ້າຍຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຄວາມທຶບແສງ 0% ຈະໄດ້ຮູບທີ່ຄືກັນກັບຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ (ໂມດູນບໍ່ມີຜົນ), ໃນຂະນະທີ່ ຄວາມທຶບແສງ 100% ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນຂອງໂມດູນຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This opacity can be the same for every pixel (using the global opacity slider), in which case blending acts uniformly over the entire image. Alternatively the opacity values can vary depending on the properties or location of each pixel. This local modification of opacity is called a _mask_. Masks provide the user with fine control over which parts of an image are affected by a module and to what extent. The user may choose to activate a [drawn mask](./masks/drawn.md), a [parametric mask](./masks/parametric.md) or a [combination](./masks/drawn-and-parametric.md).\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມທຶບແສງນີ້ສາມາດຄືກັນໃນທຸກພິກເຊວ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນຄວາມທຶບແສງລວມ), ເຊິ່ງການປະສົມ ຈະມີຜົນເທົ່າກັນທັງໝົດຮູບ. ຫຼື ຄວາມທຶບແສງອາດຈະຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຄຸນສົມບັດ ຫຼື ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງ ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ. ການປັບຄວາມທຶບແສງສະເພາະບ່ອນແບບນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ _ໜ້າກາກ (mask)_. ໜ້າກາກ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດວ່າສ່ວນໃດຂອງຮູບຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນຈາກໂມດູນ ແລະ ຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລືອກເປີດໃຊ້ [ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ](./masks/drawn.md), [ໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ](./masks/parametric.md) ຫຼື [ແບບລວມກັນ](./masks/drawn-and-parametric.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Blending and masking functionality is controlled via a group of icons located at the bottom of each applicable module.\n"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການປະສົມ ແລະ ໜ້າກາກແມ່ນຄວບຄຸມຜ່ານກຸ່ມໄອຄອນທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງແຕ່ລະໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![mask & blend options](./overview/mask-blend-options.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![mask & blend options](./overview/mask-blend-options.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These icons enable the following masking and blending options, from left to right:\n"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກໜ້າກາກ ແລະ ການປະສົມ ດັ່ງນີ້ (ຈາກຊ້າຍໄປຂວາ):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"off\n"
": Module output is passed to the next module in the pixelpipe without additional reprocessing. No further controls are displayed.\n"
msgstr ""
"off (ປິດ)\n"
": ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາໂມດູນຖັດໄປໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປະມວນຜົນໃໝ່. ບໍ່ມີ ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມອື່ນໆສະແດງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"uniformly\n"
": Input and output images are reprocessed uniformly with the chosen blend mode, where the amount of blending is controlled by a single opacity slider. Additional controls are displayed to allow the blend mode and opacity to be selected. The default is a blend mode of “normal” with an opacity of 100%.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແບບສະເໝີພາບ (uniformly)\n"
": ຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າແລະຂາອອກຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນຄືນໃໝ່ຢ່າງສະເໝີພາບດ້ວຍໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend mode) ທີ່ເລືອ"
"ກ, ໂດຍທີ່ປະລິມານການປະສົມແມ່ນຖືກຄວບຄຸມດ້ວຍ slider ຄວາມທຶບແສງ (opacity) ອັນດຽວ. ຈະມີການສະແ"
"ດງສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອໃຫ້ເລືອກໂໝດການປະສົມ ແລະ ຄວາມທຶບແສງໄດ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນໂໝດການປະສົມແບບ "
"“normal” ໂດຍມີຄວາມທຶບແສງ 100%.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[drawn mask](./masks/drawn.md)\n"
": Reprocessing takes place with the chosen blend mode and an opacity based on pixel location as defined by one or more drawn shapes. Additional controls are displayed to allow mask elements to be drawn. If no mask elements are drawn then all pixels have the same opacity, as defined by the opacity slider.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ](./masks/drawn.md)\n"
": ການປະມວນຜົນໃໝ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍໂໝດການປະສົມທີ່ເລືອກ ແລະ ຄວາມທຶບແສງທີ່ອີງຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງ ພິກເຊວທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ແຕ້ມ. ຈະມີສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມສະແດງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຕ້ມໜ້າກາກ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການແຕ້ມໜ້າກາກ, ທຸກພິກເຊວຈະມີຄວາມທຶບແສງເທົ່າກັນຕາມແຖບເລື່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[parametric mask](./masks/parametric.md)\n"
": Reprocessing takes place with the chosen blend mode and an opacity based on the properties of individual pixels. Additional controls are displayed to allow the opacity to be adjusted on a per-pixel basis, determined by pixel values.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ](./masks/parametric.md)\n"
": ການປະມວນຜົນໃໝ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍໂໝດການປະສົມທີ່ເລືອກ ແລະ ຄວາມທຶບແສງທີ່ອີງຕາມຄຸນສົມບັດ ຂອງແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ. ຈະມີສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມສະແດງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ປັບຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າຂອງພິກເຊວນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[drawn & parametric mask](./masks/drawn-and-parametric.md)\n"
": Reprocessing takes place with the chosen blend mode and an opacity based on a combination of a drawn and parametric mask.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ ແລະ ແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ](./masks/drawn-and-parametric.md)\n"
": ການປະມວນຜົນໃໝ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍໂໝດການປະສົມທີ່ເລືອກ ແລະ ຄວາມທຶບແສງທີ່ເກີດຈາກ ການລວມກັນຂອງໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ ແລະ ແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[raster mask](./masks/raster.md)\n"
": Reprocessing takes place with the chosen blend mode and an opacity based on a mask that was generated by an active module earlier in the pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ໜ້າກາກແບບຣາສເຕີ](./masks/raster.md)\n"
": ການປະມວນຜົນໃໝ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍໂໝດການປະສົມທີ່ເລືອກ ແລະ ຄວາມທຶບແສງທີ່ອີງຕາມໜ້າກາກ ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງໂດຍໂມດູນກ່ອນໜ້າໃນ pixelpipe.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blending options\n"
": Choose which color space to use when calculating the blending mask, and specify whether or not to allow a mask to be generated based on the module's output channels (normally a parametric mask is generated based on the input channels coming into the module). The following options are available:\n"
": - _reset to default blend colorspace_: Use the default color space for the module to specify the parametric mask.\n"
": - _Lab_: Use the Lab color space (where available) to specify the parametric mask.\n"
": - _RGB (display)_: Use the display-referred RGB/HSL color space to specify the parametric mask.\n"
": - _RGB (scene)_: Use the scene-referred RGB/J<sub>z</sub>C<sub>z</sub>h<sub>z</sub> color space to specify the parametric mask.\n"
": - _show output channels_: Show the [parametric mask](./masks/parametric.md) output channel controls, so that the parametric mask can be defined in terms of the module's output channels.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກການປະສົມ (blending options)\n"
": ເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການຄຳນວນໜ້າກາກການປະສົມ, ແລະ ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຫ້ສ້າງໜ້າກາກ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນຫຼືບໍ່ (ປົກກະຕິໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າຈະສ້າງຈາກຊ່ອງ ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ). ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
": - _reset to default blend colorspace_: ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູນເພື່ອ ກຳນົດໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ.\n"
": - _Lab_: ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ Lab (ຖ້າມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້).\n"
": - _RGB (display)_: ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB/HSL ແບບອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ.\n"
": - _RGB (scene)_: ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB/J<sub>z</sub>C<sub>z</sub>h<sub>z</sub> ແບບອ້າງອີງສາກ.\n"
": - _show output channels_: ສະແດງສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກ ເພື່ອກຳນົດໜ້າກາກ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Not all of these blending options are available for every module.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ຈະມີຕົວເລືອກການປະສົມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄົບທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "masking & blending"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໜ້າກາກ ແລະ ການປະສົມ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "mask refinement & additional controls"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງໜ້າກາກ ແລະ ການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When a mask is active, several additional sliders are shown which allow the mask to be further refined.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ໜ້າກາກ, ຈະມີແຖບເລື່ອນເພີ່ມເຕີມປະກົດຂຶ້ນ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ ໜ້າກາກໃຫ້ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"details threshold\n"
": This control allows you to alter the opacity of the mask based on the amount of detail in the image. Use this slider to select either areas with lots of detail (positive values) or areas that are flat and lacking in detail (negative values). The default (zero) effectively bypasses details refinement. This is mostly useful to apply sharpening and blurring effects that ignore out-of-focus (bokeh) regions or to sharpen only blurry parts, preventing over-sharpening of in-focus regions.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເກນລາຍລະອຽດ (details threshold)\n"
": ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປ່ຽນຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງໜ້າກາກຕາມປະລິມານລາຍລະອຽດໃນຮູບ. ໃຊ້ ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ເພື່ອເລືອກບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍ (ຄ່າບວກ) ຫຼື ບໍລິເວນທີ່ລຽບ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດ (ຄ່າລົບ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ສູນ) ຈະຂ້າມການປັບແຕ່ງນີ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດ ຫຼາຍໃນການໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກຄວາມຄົມຊັດ ຫຼື ຄວາມມົວ ໂດຍການຂ້າມບໍລິເວນທີ່ຢູ່ນອກໂຟກັດ (bokeh) ຫຼື ເນັ້ນຄວາມຄົມຊັດສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ມົວ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ສ່ວນທີ່ຊັດຢູ່ແລ້ວຄົມເກີນໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The data used for the detail mask refinement is taken from the demosaic or rawprepare stage in the processing pipeline, not from the module's input (which is used for the other parametric mask criteria). None of the processing modules after demosaic will have any effect on the detail mask and it is not available for non-RAW images.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງໜ້າກາກລາຍລະອຽດແມ່ນມາຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນ demosaic ຫຼື rawprepare ໃນທໍ່ການປະມວນຜົນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາຈາກຂາເຂົ້າຂອງໂມດູນ (ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ກັບ ເກນໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າອື່ນໆ). ໂມດູນໃດໆຫຼັງຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນ demosaic ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ ໜ້າກາກລາຍລະອຽດ ແລະ ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບຮູບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ RAW.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"feathering guide\n"
": Mask feathering smooths a mask such that the mask's edges automatically align with the edges of features in the image. The smoothing is guided either by the module's input or output (before blending), and may happen before or after the mask blurring, depending on what is selected in the “feathering guide” combobox. Feathering is particularly sensitive to the choice of guide image when used with edge-modifying modules (modules for sharpening or blurring an image).\n"
": - _output before blur_: feathering is guided using the _output_ image of the module and takes place _before_ the mask is blurred\n"
": - _input before blur_: feathering is guided using the _input_ image of the module and takes place _before_ the mask is blurred\n"
": - _output after blur_: feathering is guided using the _output_ image of the module and takes place _after_ the mask has been blurred\n"
": - _input after blur_: feathering is guided using the _input_ image of the module and takes place _after_ the mask has been blurred\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວນຳການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງ (feathering guide)\n"
": ການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງຂອງໜ້າກາກ (mask feathering) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງໜ້າກາກກ້ຽງຂຶ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງໜ້າ"
"ກາກຈັດວາງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂອບຂອງສິ່ງຕ່າງໆໃນຮູບພາບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ການເຮັດໃຫ້ກ້ຽງນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກນຳໂດຍຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້"
"າ ຫຼື ຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນ (ກ່ອນການປະສົມ), ແລະ ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນກ່ອນ ຫຼື ຫຼັງການເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າກາກມົວ, ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບສິ່ງ"
"ທີ່ເລືອກໃນລາຍການເລືອກ “feathering guide”. ການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງແມ່ນມີຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວເປັນພິເສດຕໍ່ກັບການເ"
"ລືອກຮູບພາບຕົວນຳ ເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບໂມດູນທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງຂອບ (ໂມດູນສໍາລັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຄົມຊັດ ຫຼື ມົວ).\n"
": - _output before blur_: ການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງແມ່ນຖືກນຳໂດຍຮູບພາບ _ຂາອອກ (output)_ ຂອງໂມດູ"
"ນ ແລະ ເກີດຂຶ້ນ _ກ່ອນ_ ທີ່ໜ້າກາກຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວ\n"
": - _input before blur_: ການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງແມ່ນຖືກນຳໂດຍຮູບພາບ _ຂາເຂົ້າ (input)_ ຂອງໂມດູນ ແ"
"ລະ ເກີດຂຶ້ນ _ກ່ອນ_ ທີ່ໜ້າກາກຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວ\n"
": - _output after blur_: ການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງແມ່ນຖືກນຳໂດຍຮູບພາບ _ຂາອອກ (output)_ ຂອງໂມດູນ "
"ແລະ ເກີດຂຶ້ນ _ຫຼັງຈາກ_ ທີ່ໜ້າກາກຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວແລ້ວ\n"
": - _input after blur_: ການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງແມ່ນຖືກນຳໂດຍຮູບພາບ _ຂາເຂົ້າ (input)_ ຂອງໂມດູນ ແລ"
"ະ ເກີດຂຶ້ນ _ຫຼັງຈາກ_ ທີ່ໜ້າກາກຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວແລ້ວ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"feathering radius\n"
": Adjust the strength of the feathering effect. Feathering works best if the mask's edges already approximately match some edges in the guiding image. The larger the “feathering radius” the better the feathering algorithm can align the mask to more distant edges. If this radius is too large, however, the feathered mask may overshoot (cover regions that the user wants to exclude). Feathering is disabled when the feathering radius is set to 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຂອບຟຸ້ງ (feathering radius)\n"
": ປັບຄວາມແຮງຂອງເອັບເຟັກຂອບຟຸ້ງ. ການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດຫາກຂອບຂອງໜ້າກາກນັ້ນໃກ້ຄຽງກັບບາ"
"ງຂອບໃນຮູບພາບຕົວນຳຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຍິ່ງ “ລັດສະໝີຂອບຟຸ້ງ” ໃຫຍ່ເທົ່າໃດ, ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງກໍ່ຈະສາມາດຈັດວາງ"
"ໜ້າກາກໃຫ້ກົງກັບຂອບທີ່ຢູ່ໄກອອກໄປໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຫາກລັດສະໝີນີ້ໃຫຍ່ເກີນໄປ, ໜ້າກາກທີ່ຟຸ້ງອອກມາອາດຈ"
"ະເກີນຂອບເຂດ (ປົກຄຸມບໍລິເວນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການຍົກເວັ້ນ). ການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານເມື່ອລັດສະໝີຂອບຟຸ້ງຖືກຕັ້"
"ງເປັນ 0.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blurring radius\n"
": Blurring the mask creates a softer transition between blended and unblended parts of an image and can be used to avoid artifacts. The blurring radius slider controls the radius of a gaussian blur applied to the final blend mask. The higher the radius, the stronger the blur (set to 0 for an unblurred mask). Mask blur is always applied after feathering if both kinds of mask adjustment are activated. This allows any resulting sharp edges or artifacts to be smoothed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີຄວາມມົວ (blurring radius)\n"
": ການເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າກາກມົວຈະຊ່ວຍສ້າງການປ່ຽນຜ່ານທີ່ນຸ້ມນວນລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນທີ່ປະສົມ ແລະ ບໍ່ປະສົມ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງສິ່ງແປກປອມ (artifacts). ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ຄວບຄຸມລັດສະໝີຂອງການມົວແບບ Gaussian ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບໜ້າກາກສຸດທ້າຍ. ຍິ່ງລັດສະໝີສູງ ຄວາມມົວກໍຍິ່ງຫຼາຍ (ຕັ້ງເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ມົວ). ຄວາມມົວຂອງໜ້າກາກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກການເຮັດຂອບມົວ (feathering) ສະເໝີ ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ທັງສອງຢ່າງ, ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂອບທີ່ຄົມ ຫຼື ສິ່ງແປກປອມຕ່າງໆເບິ່ງນຽນຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mask opacity\n"
": The strength of the module's effect is determined by the mask's local opacity. Feathering and blurring the mask may reduce the opacity of the original mask. The “mask opacity” slider allows you to readjust the mask opacity to compensate. If the mask opacity is decreased (negative slider values) less opaque parts are affected more strongly. Conversely, if the mask opacity is increased (positive slider values) more opaque parts are affected more strongly. As a consequence, completely opaque portions of the mask always remain opaque and completely transparent portions always remain transparent. This is to ensure that regions that have been fully excluded from or included in a module's effect (by setting the mask's opacity to 0% or 100%) remain fully excluded or included.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງໜ້າກາກ (mask opacity)\n"
": ຄວາມແຮງຂອງເອັບເຟັກໃນໂມດູນແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຄວາມທຶບແສງສະເພາະບ່ອນຂອງໜ້າກາກ. ການເຮັດຂອບຟຸ້ງແລ"
"ະການເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າກາກມົວອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງໜ້າກາກເດີມຫຼຸດລົງ. slider “ຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງໜ້າກາກ"
"” ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງໜ້າກາກຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍໄດ້. ຫາກຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງໜ້າກາກຫຼຸດລົງ (ຄ່"
"າ slider ເປັນລົບ) ສ່ວນທີ່ທຶບແສງໜ້ອຍກວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບແຮງຂຶ້ນ. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຫາກຄວາມທຶບແສງຂ"
"ອງໜ້າກາກເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ (ຄ່າ slider ເປັນບວກ) ສ່ວນທີ່ທຶບແສງຫຼາຍກວ່າຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບແຮງຂຶ້ນ. ຜົນທີ່ຕາມມາຄື, "
"ສ່ວນຂອງໜ້າກາກທີ່ທຶບແສງທັງໝົດຈະຍັງຄົງທຶບແສງຢູ່ສະເໝີ ແລະ ສ່ວນທີ່ໂປ່ງໃສທັງໝົດກໍ່ຈະຍັງຄົງໂປ່ງໃສຢູ່ສະເໝີ. ສິ່ງນີ້"
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບໍລິເວນທີ່ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າທັງໝົດໃນເອັບເຟັກຂອງໂມດູນ (ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄວາມທຶບແສງ"
"ຂອງໜ້າກາກເປັນ 0% ຫຼື 100%) ຈະຍັງຄົງຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນ ຫຼື ລວມເຂົ້າຄືເກົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mask contrast\n"
": This slider increases or decreases the mask contrast. This allows you to adjust the transition between the opaque and transparent parts of the mask.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຄົມຊັດໜ້າກາກ (mask contrast)\n"
": ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast) ຂອງໜ້າກາກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ ທ່ານປັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນທີ່ທຶບແສງ ແລະ ໂປ່ງແສງຂອງໜ້າກາກໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![eye icon](./refinement-controls/icon-eye.png#icon) temporarily switch off mask\n"
": Sometimes it is useful to visualize a module's effect without the mask being active. Click on this icon to temporarily deactivate the mask (the selected blend mode and global opacity remain in effect).\n"
msgstr ""
"![eye icon](./refinement-controls/icon-eye.png#icon) ປິດໜ້າກາກຊົ່ວຄາວ\n"
": ບາງຄັ້ງມັນມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະເບິ່ງຜົນຂອງໂມດູນໂດຍບໍ່ມີໜ້າກາກ. ຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນນີ້ເພື່ອປິດ ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໜ້າກາກຊົ່ວຄາວ (ໂດຍທີ່ໂໝດການປະສົມ ແລະ ຄວາມທຶບແສງລວມຍັງມີຜົນຢູ່).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![mask icon](./refinement-controls/icon-mask.png#icon) display mask\n"
": Click on this icon to display the current mask as a yellow overlay over a black-and-white version of the image. Solid yellow indicates an opacity of 100%; a fully visible gray background image (without yellow overlay) indicates an opacity of 0%.\n"
msgstr ""
"![mask icon](./refinement-controls/icon-mask.png#icon) ສະແດງໜ້າກາກ\n"
": ຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງໜ້າກາກປະຈຸບັນເປັນສີເຫຼືອງຊ້ອນທັບເທິງຮູບແບບຂາວດຳ. ສີເຫຼືອງເຂັ້ມໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມທຶບແສງ 100%; ສ່ວນພື້ນຫຼັງສີເທົາທີ່ເຫັນຊັດເຈນ (ບໍ່ມີສີເຫຼືອງ) ໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມທຶບແສງ 0%.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "example: feathering a drawn mask"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການເຮັດຂອບມົວໃຫ້ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![feathering](./refinement-controls/feathering.png#w100)\n"
msgstr "![feathering](./refinement-controls/feathering.png#w100)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It can be rather tedious to create a drawn mask that precisely covers a particular feature in an image. In this example, we want to enhance the color contrast of the lion sculpture shown in the left image above without affecting the background.\n"
msgstr "ການສ້າງໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມໃຫ້ກວມເອົາວັດຖຸໃດໜຶ່ງຢ່າງຊັດເຈນອາດຈະເປັນເລື່ອງທີ່ໜ້າເບື່ອ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງສີໃຫ້ກັບຮູບປັ້ນສິງໂຕໃນຮູບທາງຊ້າຍ ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ພື້ນຫຼັງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first image above shows the original, unaltered image.\n"
msgstr "1. ຮູບທຳອິດສະແດງຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ປັບແຕ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The second image shows a rough selection of the sculpture created with a drawn mask. Note that the mask is rather fuzzy and does not precisely follow the outline of the lion sculpture.\n"
msgstr "2. ຮູບທີສອງສະແດງການເລືອກຮູບປັ້ນແບບຄ່າວໆດ້ວຍໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ. ຈະເຫັນວ່າໜ້າກາກ ຍັງບໍ່ຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ໄປຕາມຂອບຂອງຮູບປັ້ນສິງໂຕຢ່າງລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The third image shows the effect of adjusting the feathering radius, mask opacity and mask contrast, leading to a well matched mask with little effort. In this example the feathering radius has been adjusted to 50 and a blur radius of 5 was chosen to smooth the mask to some degree. The mask opacity and mask contrast have been increased to 0.3 and 0.5, respectively.\n"
msgstr "3. ຮູບທີສາມສະແດງຜົນຈາກການປັບລັດສະໝີຂອບມົວ, ຄວາມທຶບແສງ ແລະ ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງໜ້າກາກ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ໜ້າກາກທີ່ພໍດີກັບວັດຖຸໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງອອກແຮງຫຼາຍ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ລັດສະໝີຂອບມົວ ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ 50 ແລະ ລັດສະໝີຄວາມມົວເປັນ 5 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໜ້າກາກນຽນຂຶ້ນ. ຄວາມທຶບແສງ ແລະ ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນ 0.3 ແລະ 0.5 ຕາມລຳດັບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The final image above shows the end result, where the color enhancement (via the [_color contrast_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-contrast.md) module) is restricted to only the lion sculpture.\n"
msgstr "4. ຮູບສຸດທ້າຍສະແດງຜົນສຳເລັດ ເຊິ່ງການເພີ່ມສີ (ຜ່ານໂມດູນ [_color contrast_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/color-contrast.md)) ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບຮູບປັ້ນສິງໂຕເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/refinement-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mask feathering works particularly well in this example because the sculpture is well separated from the out-of-focus background. The distinct edge at the border of the sculpture guides the feathering mask adjustment to match the shape of the sculpture.\n"
msgstr "ການເຮັດຂອບມົວໜ້າກາກເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີເປັນພິເສດໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ເພາະຮູບປັ້ນແຍກອອກຈາກພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ ມົວຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. ຂອບທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນຂອງຮູບປັ້ນຈະຊ່ວຍນຳທາງໃນການປັບຂອບມົວໃຫ້ກົງກັບ ຮູບຮ່າງຂອງຮູບປັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "drawn masks"
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the drawn mask feature you can construct a mask by drawing shapes directly onto the image canvas. Shapes can be used alone or in combination. Once a shape has been drawn on an image it can be adjusted, removed, or reused in other modules.\n"
msgstr "ດ້ວຍຄຸນສົມບັດໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໜ້າກາກໂດຍການແຕ້ມຮູບຮ່າງລົງໃນຮູບໂດຍກົງ. ຮູບຮ່າງສາມາດໃຊ້ແຍກກັນ ຫຼື ລວມກັນກໍໄດ້. ເມື່ອແຕ້ມຮູບຮ່າງລົງໃນຮູບແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງ, ລຶບອອກ ຫຼື ນຳໄປໃຊ້ຄືນໃນໂມດູນອື່ນໆໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shapes are stored internally as vectors and are rendered with the required resolution during pixelpipe processing. Shapes are expressed in the coordinate system of the original image and are transformed along with the rest of the image by any active distorting modules in the pipe ([_lens correction_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md), [_rotate and perspective_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md) for example). This means that a shape will always work on the same image area regardless of any modifications that may be subsequently applied. \n"
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງຕ່າງໆຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນເວັກເຕີ ແລະ ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນດ້ວຍຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນລະຫວ່າງ ຂະບວນການ pixelpipe. ຮູບຮ່າງຖືກກຳນົດໃນລະບົບພິກັດຂອງຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຈະຖືກປັບປ່ຽນໄປພ້ອມ ກັບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງຮູບໂດຍໂມດູນທີ່ມີການບິດເບືອນຮູບ (ເຊັ່ນ: [_ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md) ຫຼື [_ການໝຸນ ແລະ ເປີສະເປັກທິບ_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md)). ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຮູບຮ່າງຈະຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເດີມສະເໝີ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆຕາມມາ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The controls required to create and alter drawn masks may be enabled by selecting either the \"drawn mask\" or \"drawn & parametric mask\" icon at the bottom of a module. You can also create and edit shapes using the [mask manager](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການຄວບຄຸມເພື່ອສ້າງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກໄອຄອນ \"ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ (drawn mask)\" ຫຼື \"ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ ແລະ ແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ (drawn & parametric mask)\" ທີ່ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສ້າງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຮູບຮ່າງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າກາກ (mask manager)](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "creating shapes"
msgstr "ການສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a shape by clicking on the appropriate shape icon (from left to right: brush, circle, ellipse, path, gradient, and AI object – the latter if [AI features](../../../special-topics/ai/overview.md) are enabled and a model for the _mask_ task is active).\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຮູບຊົງໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນຮູບຊົງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ (ຈາກຊ້າຍໄປຂວາ: ແປງ, ວົງມົນ, ວົງລີ, ເສັ້ນທາງ, ການ"
"ໄລ່ສີ, ແລະ ວັດຖຸ AI – ຢ່າງຫຼັງສຸດແມ່ນຫາກ ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI](../../../special-topics/"
"ai/overview.md) ແລະ ໂມເດວສຳລັບວຽກ _mask_ ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![shape icons](./drawn/shape-icons.png)\n"
msgstr "![shape icons](./drawn/shape-icons.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This will take you into the creation mode for that shape. Once you have finished drawing your shape you will automatically be taken into edit mode. \n"
msgstr "ນີ້ຈະນຳທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດການສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງນັ້ນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານແຕ້ມຮູບຮ່າງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະປ່ຽນເປັນ ໂໝດແກ້ໄຂໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ctrl+click on the shape icon to continuously draw multiple shapes of the same type -- each time a shape is completed, you will re-enter creation mode for a new instance of that shape. While in continuous creation mode, right-click on the image to stop drawing shapes and enter edit mode.\n"
msgstr "Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ໄອຄອນຮູບຮ່າງເພື່ອແຕ້ມຮູບຮ່າງປະເພດດຽວກັນຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຫຼາຍໆອັນ -- ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ ຮູບຮ່າງໜຶ່ງສຳເລັດ, ທ່ານຈະກັບເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດການສ້າງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດສ້າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຮູບເພື່ອຢຸດການແຕ້ມ ແລະ ເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For all drawn shapes, you can hold Shift while scrolling with the mouse wheel to change the extent of the shape's feathering (the blur at the edge of the shape) and use Ctrl+scroll to change the shape's opacity (how transparent it is). The feathering shape can also be changed by dragging a node on the feathering outline. If the feathering node coincides with a path node, hold Shift when selecting the node to limit selection to feathering nodes. These operations are available in both creation and edit modes (as long as your mouse is over the shape in question).\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບທຸກຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ແຕ້ມ, ທ່ານສາມາດກົດ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ ລະດັບຄວາມມົວຂອງຂອບ (feathering) ແລະ ໃຊ້ Ctrl+ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄວາມທຶບແສງ (opacity) ຂອງຮູບຮ່າງ. ຮູບຮ່າງຂອງຂອບມົວຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກຈຸດ (node) ຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນຂອບມົວ. ຖ້າຈຸດຂອບມົວຊ້ອນທັບກັບຈຸດເສັ້ນທາງ, ໃຫ້ກົດ Shift ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລືອກຈຸດເພື່ອເລືອກສະເພາະຈຸດຂອບມົວ. ການເຮັດວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ທັງໃນໂໝດສ້າງ ແລະ ໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ (ຂໍພຽງແຕ່ເມົາສ໌ຢູ່ເທິງຮູບຮ່າງນັ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, scrolling your mouse up increases the value of the relevant shape parameters. This behavior can be changed in [preferences > darkroom > scroll down to increase mask parameters](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md).\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ຂຶ້ນຈະເປັນການເພີ່ມຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງຮູບຮ່າງ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນ ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຫ້ອງມືດ > ເລື່ອນລົງເພື່ອເພີ່ມພາຣາມີເຕີໜ້າກາກ](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** When used in shape creation mode, the preceding scroll operations will also cause the _default_ feathering or opacity to be changed. The new default values will be used the next time you create a new shape.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນໂໝດສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງ, ການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງດັ່ງກ່າວຈະປ່ຽນຄ່າ _ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ_ ຂອງຂອບມົວ ຫຼື ຄວາມທຶບແສງນຳ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "editing shapes"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂຮູບຮ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the 'show and edit mask elements' icon ![show-and-edit-masks-icon](./drawn/shape-edit.png#icon) to enter shape edit mode. This will show all drawn masks in use by the current module and allow you to edit those shapes. It will also expand the associated group in the [mask manager](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md). Ctrl+click on the same icon to enter restricted edit mode, where certain actions (e.g. dragging a complete shape or changing its size) are blocked. This is particularly useful to avoid costly mistakes when editing path and brush shapes.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນ 'ສະແດງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂອົງປະກອບໜ້າກາກ' ![show-and-edit-masks-icon](./drawn/shape-edit.png#icon) ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດແກ້ໄຂຮູບຮ່າງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງໜ້າກາກທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໂມດູນປະຈຸບັນ ແລະ ໃຫ້ທ່ານແກ້ໄຂ ຮູບຮ່າງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້. ມັນຍັງຈະຂະຫຍາຍກຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນ [ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າກາກ](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md). Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ໄອຄອນດຽວກັນເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ໂໝດແກ້ໄຂແບບຈຳກັດ, ເຊິ່ງບາງການກະທຳ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການລາກຮູບຮ່າງທັງໝົດ ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ) ຈະຖືກບລັອກໄວ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຄວາມຜິດພາດໃນການແກ້ໄຂຮູບຮ່າງແບບເສັ້ນທາງ ແລະ ແປງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click and drag a shape to move it around the image canvas. Clicking on a shape will also select that shape in the mask manager.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກຮູບຮ່າງເພື່ອຍ້າຍມັນໄປມາໃນຮູບ. ການຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບຮ່າງຈະເປັນການເລືອກຮູບຮ່າງນັ້ນ ໃນຕົວຈັດການໜ້າກາກນຳ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "removing shapes"
msgstr "ການລຶບຮູບຮ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While in edit mode right-click on a shape to remove it.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຮູບຮ່າງເພື່ອລຶບມັນອອກ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reusing shapes"
msgstr "ການນຳຮູບຮ່າງມາໃຊ້ຄືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can reuse shapes that you have drawn in other modules. Click on the shapes drop-down (next to the 'show and edit mask elements' button) to choose previously-drawn shapes individually or to use the same group of shapes as used by another module. The following options are available for selection:\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດນຳຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ແຕ້ມໄວ້ໃນໂມດູນອື່ນມາໃຊ້ຄືນໄດ້. ຄລິກໃສ່ລາຍການເລືອກຮູບຮ່າງ (ຂ້າງປຸ່ມ 'ສະແດງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂອົງປະກອບໜ້າກາກ') ເພື່ອເລືອກຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ເຄີຍແຕ້ມໄວ້ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ກຸ່ມຮູບຮ່າງດຽວກັນກັບ ທີ່ໂມດູນອື່ນໃຊ້. ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"add existing shape\n"
": Choose either an individual shape or a group of shapes that you've drawn previously (either within the [mask manager](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md) or from within the drawn mask of another module). If that shape or group is used elsewhere, any changes you make will be reflected everywhere the shape or group is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ມີຢູ່ (add existing shape)\n"
": ເລືອກຮູບຮ່າງໃດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ທ່ານເຄີຍແຕ້ມໄວ້ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະມາຈາກ [ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າກາກ](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md) ຫຼື ຈາກໜ້າກາກຂອງໂມດູນອື່ນ). ຖ້າຮູບຮ່າງ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມນັ້ນຖືກໃຊ້ຢູ່ບ່ອນອື່ນນຳ, ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດ ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ທຸກບ່ອນທີ່ໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use same shapes as\n"
": Add a list of shapes used in another module to the current module's mask. This differs from the previous option in that it creates a new group of shapes, allowing shapes to be added to or removed from the group independently of the module from which they were copied. All shapes that are common to both groups remain linked.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງດຽວກັນກັບ (use same shapes as)\n"
": ເພີ່ມລາຍການຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໂມດູນອື່ນເຂົ້າໃນໜ້າກາກຂອງໂມດູນປະຈຸບັນ. ວິທີນີ້ຕ່າງຈາກວິທີກ່ອນໜ້າ ຄືມັນຈະສ້າງກຸ່ມຮູບຮ່າງໃໝ່ຂຶ້ນມາ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບຮູບຮ່າງອອກຈາກກຸ່ມໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນ ຕໍ່ໂມດູນຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ແຕ່ຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນທັງສອງກຸ່ມຍັງຄົງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "combining and managing shapes"
msgstr "ການລວມ ແລະ ການຈັດການຮູບຮ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [mask manager](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md) module can be used to manage your drawn shapes. This module also allows you to group and combine drawn masks using set operators (union, intersection, difference, exclusion).\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າກາກ](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md) ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ທ່ານແຕ້ມໄດ້. ໂມດູນນີ້ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດກຸ່ມ ແລະ ລວມໜ້າກາກ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງຄະນິດສາດ (union, intersection, difference, exclusion).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "shape distortions"
msgstr "ການບິດເບືອນຂອງຮູບຮ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to ensure a consistent co-ordinate system, when you place a shape on the image, it is actually drawn on the original RAW file. This shape then passes up through the pixelpipe before finally being used by the module and drawn on the screen. This means that, if you have enabled any distorting modules (such as lens correction), drawn shapes may appear distorted on the screen and in the final image. This can lead, for example, to circles being rendered as ellipses and gradient lines becoming curved. If you need to create a more accurate shape (to overcome these distortions) it is recommended that you avoid using the simple shapes (circles / ellipses) in favor of the path shape (which can be drawn using more points, reducing distortions). You can adjust the curve on gradient lines to overcome the simple distortions introduced by lens correction.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມີລະບົບພິກັດທີ່ກົງກັນ, ເມື່ອທ່ານວາງຮູບຮ່າງລົງໃນຮູບ, ແທ້ຈິງແລ້ວມັນຖືກແຕ້ມລົງໃນ ໄຟລ໌ RAW ຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ຮູບຮ່າງນີ້ຈະຜ່ານຂະບວນການ pixelpipe ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ໃນໂມດູນ ແລະ ສະແດງຜົນໃນໜ້າຈໍ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຖ້າທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນທີ່ມີການບິດເບືອນຮູບ (ເຊັ່ນ: ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ), ຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ແຕ້ມອາດຈະປະກົດວ່າບິດເບືອນໃນໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ ໃນຮູບສຸດທ້າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ວົງມົນກາຍເປັນ ວົງຮີ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນໄລ່ສີມີຄວາມໂຄ້ງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າ (ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂການບິດເບືອນນີ້) ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງງ່າຍໆ (ວົງມົນ / ວົງຮີ) ແລ້ວໄປໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງແບບເສັ້ນທາງ (path) ແທນ (ເຊິ່ງສາມາດແຕ້ມດ້ວຍຫຼາຍຈຸດເພື່ອຫຼຸດການບິດເບືອນ). ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຄວາມໂຄ້ງຂອງເສັ້ນໄລ່ສີເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ການບິດເບືອນທີ່ເກີດຈາກໂມດູນແກ້ໄຂເລນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "available shapes"
msgstr "ຮູບຮ່າງທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![drawn-mask-brush](./drawn/brush.png#icon) brush\n"
": Start drawing a brush stroke by left-clicking on the image canvas and moving the mouse while keeping the button pressed. The brush stroke is finalized once you release the mouse button. Scroll the mouse to change the shape size and Shift+scroll to change the feathering (hardness), either before you start drawing or at any time during the operation. Likewise you can use the \"`{`\" and \"`}`\" keys to decrease/increase hardness, and the \"`<`\" and \"`>`\" keys to decrease/increase opacity.\n"
msgstr ""
"![drawn-mask-brush](./drawn/brush.png#icon) ແປງ (brush)\n"
": ເລີ່ມແຕ້ມດ້ວຍແປງໂດຍການຄລິກຊ້າຍໃສ່ຮູບ ແລະ ລາກເມົາສ໌ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້. ເສັ້ນແປງຈະ ສຳເລັດເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ອຍປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌. ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ແລະ Shift+ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄວາມມົວຂອບ (ຄວາມແຂງ), ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ກ່ອນແຕ້ມ ຫຼື ໃນຂະນະທີ່ແຕ້ມກໍໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້ທ່ານ ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ \"`{`\" ແລະ \"`}`\" ເພື່ອຫຼຸດ/ເພີ່ມຄວາມແຂງ, ແລະ ປຸ່ມ \"`<`\" ແລະ \"`>`\" ເພື່ອຫຼຸດ/ເພີ່ມຄວາມທຶບແສງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If you have a graphics tablet with pen pressure sensitivity, darktable can apply the recorded pen pressure to certain attributes of the brush stroke. This operation can be controlled in [preferences > darkroom > pen pressure control for brush masks](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md).\n"
msgstr ": ຖ້າທ່ານມີແທັບເລັດກຣາຟິກທີ່ຮອງຮັບແຮງກົດປາກກາ, darktable ສາມາດນຳແຮງກົດນັ້ນມາໃຊ້ກັບ ບາງຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງເສັ້ນແປງໄດ້. ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ໄດ້ໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຫ້ອງມືດ > ການຄວບຄຸມແຮງກົດປາກກາສຳລັບໜ້າກາກແປງ](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": On lifting the tablet pen or releasing the left mouse button the brush stroke is converted into a number of connected nodes, which define the final shape. A configuration option ([preferences > darkroom > smoothing of brush strokes](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md)) controls how much smoothing is applied. A higher level of smoothing leads to fewer nodes being created – this eases subsequent editing at the expense of lower accuracy.\n"
msgstr ""
": ເມື່ອຍົກປາກກາແທັບເລັດ ຫຼື ປ່ອຍປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ເສັ້ນແປງຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນຈຸດ (nodes) ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ, ເ"
"ຊິ່ງເປັນຕົວ ກຳນົດຮູບຊົງສຸດທ້າຍ. ຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ([ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຫ້ອງມືດ > ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນແປງລຽບ]"
"(../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md)) ຈະຄວບຄຸມວ່າຈະໃຫ້ມີການເຮັດໃຫ້ລຽບຫຼາຍປານໃ"
"ດ. ລະດັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ລຽບທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການສ້າງຈຸດໜ້ອຍລົງ – ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂໃນພາຍຫຼັງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່"
"ກໍ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Nodes and segments of a brush stroke can be modified individually. See the documentation on path shapes (above) for more details. Change the size or hardness of a node by scrolling and Shift+scrolling over a node, respectively.\n"
msgstr ": ຈຸດ ແລະ ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງເສັ້ນແປງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂແຍກກັນໄດ້. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນສ່ວນຮູບຮ່າງແບບເສັ້ນທາງ (ຂ້າງເທິງ). ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ຄວາມແຂງຂອງຈຸດໂດຍການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງ ແລະ Shift+ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງ ເທິງຈຸດນັ້ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Rendering a complex brush shape can consume a significant number of CPU cycles. Consider using the circle, ellipse or path shapes instead where possible.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບຮ່າງແປງທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນອາດຈະໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນ CPU ສູງ. ຖ້າເປັນໄປໄດ້ ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາໃຊ້ວົງມົນ, ວົງຮີ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນທາງແທນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![drawn-mask-circle](./drawn/circle.png#icon) circle\n"
": Click on the image canvas to place the circle. Scroll while hovering over the circle to change its diameter. Scroll while hovering over the circle's border to change the width of the feathering (the same effect as holding Shift while scrolling with the mouse wheel within the main shape).\n"
msgstr ""
"![drawn-mask-circle](./drawn/circle.png#icon) ວົງມົນ (circle)\n"
": ຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບເພື່ອວາງວົງມົນ. ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງໃນຂະນະທີ່ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງວົງມົນເພື່ອປ່ຽນຂະໜາດເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງ. ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເທິງຂອບວົງມົນເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຂອບມົວ (ໃຫ້ຜົນຄືກັບການກົດ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລ້ວເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງພາຍໃນຮູບຮ່າງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![drawn-mask-ellipse](./drawn/ellipse.png#icon) ellipse\n"
": The general principle is the same as for the circle shape. In addition, four nodes are shown on the ellipse line. Click and drag the nodes to adjust the ellipse's eccentricity. Ctrl+click and drag the nodes or use Shift+Ctrl+scroll (with the mouse wheel) to rotate the ellipse. Alt+click within the shape to toggle the gradual decay between equidistant and proportional mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"![drawn-mask-ellipse](./drawn/ellipse.png#icon) ວົງຮີ (ellipse)\n"
": ຫຼັກການທົ່ວໄປຄືກັນກັບວົງມົນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຈະມີ 4 ຈຸດປະກົດຂຶ້ນເທິງເສັ້ນວົງຮີ. ຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກ ຈຸດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອປັບຄວາມຮີ. Ctrl+ຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກຈຸດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ Shift+Ctrl+ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງ ເພື່ອໝຸນວົງຮີ. Alt+ຄລິກ ພາຍໃນຮູບຮ່າງເພື່ອສະລັບໂໝດການຈາງຫາຍຂອງຂອບລະຫວ່າງແບບໄລຍະເທົ່າກັນ (equidistant) ແລະ ແບບຕາມສັດສ່ວນ (proportional).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![drawn-mask-path](./drawn/path.png#icon) path\n"
": Click on the image canvas to place three or more nodes and generate a free-format enclosed shape. Terminate the path by right-clicking after having set the last point. By default, nodes are connected with smooth lines. If you want a node to instead define a sharp corner, you can do so by creating it with Ctrl+click.\n"
msgstr ""
"![drawn-mask-path](./drawn/path.png#icon) ເສັ້ນທາງ (path)\n"
": ຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບເພື່ອວາງ 3 ຈຸດ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງປິດແບບອິດສະຫຼະ. ຈົບເສັ້ນທາງໂດຍການ ຄລິກຂວາຫຼັງຈາກວາງຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຈຸດຕ່າງໆຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນດ້ວຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ນຽນ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງເປັນມຸມແຫຼມ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງຈຸດນັ້ນດ້ວຍ Ctrl+ຄລິກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": In edit mode Ctrl+click on an existing node to convert it from smooth to sharp corners and vice versa. Ctrl+click on one of the line segments to insert an additional node. Right-click on a node to delete it. Take care to ensure that the mouse pointer is over the desired node and the node is highlighted, to avoid accidentally removing the whole path.\n"
msgstr ": ໃນໂໝດແກ້ໄຂ, Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ຈຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງມຸມນຽນກັບມຸມແຫຼມ. Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ ສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນເພື່ອເພີ່ມຈຸດໃໝ່. ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຈຸດເພື່ອລຶບມັນອອກ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງຈຸດ ທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມັນຂຶ້ນແຖບສີກ່ອນ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ລຶບເສັ້ນທາງທັງໝົດໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The size of the completed shape can be modified by scrolling. The same holds true for the width of the border (the area with a gradual opacity decay), which can also be changed with Shift+scroll (with the mouse wheel) from anywhere within the shape. Single nodes as well as path segments can be moved by dragging them with the mouse. If a node is selected by clicking on it, two Bézier handles appear which allow you to modify the curvature of the line (reset to the default curvature by right-clicking on either of the handles). In the image below, the selected node (2) has two handles (4 and 5). Altering the position or length of the handles alters the curvature between node 2 and the adjacent nodes (1 and 3).\n"
msgstr ""
": ຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ສ້າງແລ້ວສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການໝຸນ (scrolling). ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຂ"
"ອບ (ບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີຄວາມທຶບແສງຄ່ອຍໆຈາງລົງ), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ດ້ວຍ Shift+ໝຸນ (ດ້ວຍວົງລໍ້ເມົາສ໌) ຈາກບ່ອນ"
"ໃດກໍ່ໄດ້ພາຍໃນຮູບຊົງ. ແຕ່ລະຈຸດ (nodes) ລວມເຖິງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນທາງ (path segments) ສາມາດຍ້າຍໄດ້ໂ"
"ດຍການລາກດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌. ຫາກຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກເລືອກໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ມັນ, ຈະມີແຂນປັບ Bézier ສອງອັນປະກົດຂຶ້ນ ເຊິ່"
"ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຄວາມໂຄ້ງຂອງເສັ້ນໄດ້ (ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມໂຄ້ງຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ແຂນປັບອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່"
"ງ). ໃນຮູບຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້, ຈຸດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ (2) ມີແຂນປັບສອງອັນ (4 ແລະ 5). ການປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງ ຫຼື ຄວາມຍາວຂອງ"
"ແຂນປັບຈະປ່ຽນຄວາມໂຄ້ງລະຫວ່າງ ຈຸດ 2 ແລະ ຈຸດຂ້າງຄຽງ (1 ແລະ 3).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![Bézier handles](./drawn/bezier.png)\n"
msgstr ": ![ແຂນປັບ Bézier](./drawn/bezier.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Dragging one of the control points on the border adjusts the border width just in that part of the shape.\n"
msgstr ": ການລາກຈຸດຄວບຄຸມອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຢູ່ເທິງຂອບຈະເປັນການປັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຂອບສະເພາະສ່ວນນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Consider fine-tuning paths in restricted edit mode (enabled by Ctrl+clicking on the 'show and edit mask elements' icon). This allows you to adjust single nodes and segments without the risk of accidentally shifting or resizing the whole shape. \n"
msgstr ": ຄວນພິຈາລະນາປັບແຕ່ງເສັ້ນທາງໃນໂໝດແກ້ໄຂແບບຈຳກັດ (ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ໄອຄອນ 'ສະແດງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂອົງປະກອບໜ້າກາກ'). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບແຕ່ລະຈຸດ ແລະ ແຕ່ລະສ່ວນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງ ສ່ຽງຕໍ່ການຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຮູບຮ່າງທັງໝົດໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![drawn-mask-gradient](./drawn/gradient.png#icon) gradient\n"
": The gradient shape is a linear gradient which extends from a given point to the edge of the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"![drawn-mask-gradient](./drawn/gradient.png#icon) ໄລ່ສີ (gradient)\n"
": ຮູບຮ່າງແບບໄລ່ສີແມ່ນການໄລ່ລະດັບແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ ເຊິ່ງຂະຫຍາຍຈາກຈຸດທີ່ກຳນົດໄປຫາຂອບຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Click the image canvas to place the gradient. The central line marks 50% opacity, the dotted lines to the sides indicate 100% and 0% opacity respectively. Between these dotted lines the opacity changes linearly. You can compress/expand the distance between the dotted lines by scrolling with your mouse wheel while pressing Shift. Note that the dotted lines will only appear while hovering over one of the lines with your cursor.\n"
msgstr ": ຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບເພື່ອວາງເສັ້ນໄລ່ສີ. ເສັ້ນກາງໝາຍເຖິງຄວາມທຶບແສງ 50%, ເສັ້ນປະສອງຂ້າງບອກເຖິງ ຄວາມທຶບແສງ 100% ແລະ 0% ຕາມລຳດັບ. ລະຫວ່າງເສັ້ນປະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ຄວາມທຶບແສງຈະປ່ຽນແປງແບບເສັ້ນຊື່. ທ່ານສາມາດບີບ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍໄລຍະຫ່າງລະຫວ່າງເສັ້ນປະໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ Shift ແລະ ເເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າເສັ້ນປະຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງເສັ້ນໃດໜຶ່ງເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The line has two anchor nodes which you can drag to change the rotation of the gradient. You can also set the rotation angle when placing the gradient shape by clicking and dragging to place the shape.\n"
msgstr ": ເສັ້ນມີຈຸດຢຶດສອງຈຸດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດລາກເພື່ອປ່ຽນການໝຸນຂອງການໄລ່ສີ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດມຸມ ການໝຸນໃນຂະນະທີ່ວາງໂດຍການຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Gradient lines can also be curved by scrolling with your mouse while hovering close to the center line. This can be useful to counteract the distortion caused by the [_lens correction_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md) module. \n"
msgstr ": ເສັ້ນໄລ່ສີຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຄ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວາງເມົາສ໌ໃກ້ກັບເສັ້ນກາງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂການບິດເບືອນທີ່ເກີດຈາກໂມດູນ [_ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Depending on the module and the underlying image, using a gradient shape might provoke banding artifacts. You should consider activating the [_dither or posterize_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md) module to alleviate this.\n"
msgstr ": ຂຶ້ນກັບໂມດູນ ແລະ ຮູບພາບ, ການໃຊ້ຮູບຮ່າງໄລ່ສີອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຮອຍແຖບ (banding). ທ່ານ ຄວນພິຈາລະນາເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_dither ຫຼື posterize_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md) ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນບັນຫານີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![drawn-mask-object](./drawn/ai-object.png#icon) AI object _(requires AI features)_ \n"
": An AI-generated mask: instead of drawing the outline by hand, click on the subject and a segmentation model produces the mask for you. Iterate by adding more clicks until the mask covers exactly what you want, then apply it. Requires AI features to be enabled and a model for the _mask_ task active in [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) – see the [AI features overview](../../../special-topics/ai/overview.md) for what runs where.\n"
msgstr ""
"![drawn-mask-object](./drawn/ai-object.png#icon) ວັດຖຸ AI _(ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI)"
"_ \n"
": ໜ້າກາກທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍ AI: ແທນທີ່ຈະແຕ້ມຂອບດ້ວຍມື, ພຽງແຕ່ຄລິກໃສ່ສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລ້ວໂມເດວແຍກສ່ວນ "
"(segmentation model) ຈະສ້າງໜ້າກາກໃຫ້ທ່ານ. ເຮັດຊ້ຳໂດຍການຄລິກເພີ່ມເຕີມຈົນກວ່າໜ້າກາກຈະປົກຄຸມສິ່ງທີ່"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຢ່າງພໍດີ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງນຳໃຊ້ (apply). ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ແລະ ໂມເດວສຳລັບວຽກ _mask_ "
"ຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ AI](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md) – ເບິ່ງ [ພາບລວມ"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI](../../../special-topics/ai/overview.md) ສໍາລັບລາຍລະອຽດວ່າອັນໃດເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃ"
"ສ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - **click** on the subject to add a foreground (positive) prompt point – the model produces a mask around the clicked region.\n"
": - **shift+click** to add a background (negative) point, telling the model \"exclude this area from the mask\". Useful when the mask spills onto a neighbouring object you didn't want.\n"
": - **ctrl+shift+click** to clear all prompt points and start over.\n"
": - **right-click** to apply the mask. The result is vectorized into a group of path shapes and registered with the [mask manager](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md).\n"
msgstr ""
": - **ຄລິກ** ໃສ່ສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອເພີ່ມຈຸດຕົວນຳເບື້ອງໜ້າ (ບວກ) – ໂມເດວຈະສ້າງໜ້າກາກອ້ອມຮອບບໍລິເວນທີ່"
"ຄລິກ.\n"
": - **shift+ຄລິກ** ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຈຸດເບື້ອງຫຼັງ (ລົບ), ເພື່ອບອກໂມເດວວ່າ \"ຍົກເວັ້ນບໍລິເວນນີ້ອອກຈາກໜ້າກາ"
"ກ\". ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອໜ້າກາກກວມໄປຮອດວັດຖຸຂ້າງຄຽງທີ່ທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"
": - **ctrl+shift+ຄລິກ** ເພື່ອລຶບຈຸດຕົວນຳທັງໝົດ ແລະ ເລີ່ມໃໝ່.\n"
": - **ຄລິກຂວາ** ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ໜ້າກາກ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນເວັກເຕີ (vectorized) ເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມຂອງຮູບຊົ"
"ງເສັ້ນທາງ ແລະ ຖືກລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນ [ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າກາກ](../../../module-reference/utility-"
"modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": After applying, the result is _stored_ as a regular path shape – the AI-segmentation output is vectorized into Bézier paths once and persisted in that form. Nodes are editable, the group can be combined with other shapes via set operators, polarity can be reversed, and so on. The AI model is not involved beyond the initial generation, so the mask renders just as cheaply as any other vector shape and works in modules and styles that have no AI dependency.\n"
msgstr ""
": ຫຼັງຈາກນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກ _ເກັບໄວ້_ ເປັນຮູບຊົງເສັ້ນທາງປົກກະຕິ – ຜົນຈາກການແຍກສ່ວນຂອງ AI "
"ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນເວັກເຕີໃນຮູບແບບເສັ້ນທາງ Bézier ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວແລະເກັບໄວ້ໃນຮູບແບບນັ້ນ. ຈຸດ (Nodes) ສາມ"
"າດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້, ກຸ່ມສາມາດຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບຮູບຊົງອື່ນໆ ຜ່ານຕົວດຳເນີນການ (set operators), ສາມາດກັບຂົ້ວ "
"(polarity) ໄດ້, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ. ໂມເດວ AI ຈະບໍ່ມີສ່ວນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນອກເໜືອຈາກການສ້າງໃນຕອນທຳອິດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໜ້"
"າກາກຈຶ່ງປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ໄວ ຄືກັນກັບຮູບຊົງເວັກເຕີອື່ນໆ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ ແລະ ສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອ"
"ງກັບ AI.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": First click on a new image runs the encoder once and caches the result on disk; later clicks reuse the cache (even across restarts) so only the lightweight decoder re-runs per prompt point. Changing any module that distorts or crops the image (crop, rotate and perspective, lens correction, etc.) invalidates the cache and forces a re-encode on the next click.\n"
msgstr ": ການຄລິກຄັ້ງທຳອິດໃນຮູບໃໝ່ຈະທຳການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ (encode) ໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ໌ (cache); ການຄລິກ ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆໄປຈະໃຊ້ແຄຊ໌ເດີມ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະປິດເປີດໂປຣແກຣມໃໝ່) ເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຮັດວຽກໄວຂຶ້ນ. ແຕ່ຖ້າມີການປ່ຽນແປງໂມດູນທີ່ບິດເບືອນ ຫຼື ຕັດຮູບ (ຕັດ, ໝຸນ, ແກ້ໄຂເລນ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ແຄຊ໌ຈະ ຖືກຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃໝ່ໃນການຄລິກຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Tips for better results:** The model selects one visually distinct object at a time. If the first click picks only part of the subject (an arm rather than the whole person, a wheel rather than the whole car), add more clicks on _adjacent_ parts to extend the mask. Clicking on a visually separate area usually switches the model to a new selection rather than extending the current one – when that happens, reset with **ctrl+shift+click** and start over instead of trying to repair the mask with corrections.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ເຄັດລັບເພື່ອຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ດີກວ່າ:** ໂມເດວຈະເລືອກວັດຖຸໜຶ່ງອັນທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ. ຫາກການຄລິກຄັ້ງທຳ"
"ອິດເລືອກພຽງແຕ່ບາງສ່ວນຂອງວັດຖຸ (ເຊັ່ນ ແຂນ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຄົນທັງໝົດ, ຫຼື ລໍ້ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນລົດທັງໝົດ), ໃຫ້ຄລິກ"
"ເພີ່ມໃສ່ສ່ວນ _ທີ່ຢູ່ຕິດກັນ_ ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍໜ້າກາກ. ການຄລິກໃສ່ບໍລິເວນທີ່ແຍກອອກຈາກກັນທາງສາຍຕາ ມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້"
"ໂມເດວປ່ຽນໄປເລືອກອັນໃໝ່ ແທນທີ່ຈະຂະຫຍາຍອັນເກົ່າ – ເມື່ອເກີດເຫດການນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ຣີເຊັດດ້ວຍ "
"**ctrl+shift+ຄລິກ** ແລ້ວເລີ່ມໃໝ່ ແທນທີ່ຈະພະຍາຍາມແກ້ໄຂໜ້າກາກດ້ວຍການປັບແກ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reversing the polarity of a drawn mask "
msgstr "ການກັບຂົ້ວຂອງໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ "

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the \"`+/-`\" button to reverse the polarity of the entire drawn mask. For example, a circular mask will, by default, cause the module to be applied only to the area inside the drawn circle. Reversing its polarity will cause the module to apply to the whole image, _except for_ that circle.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ \"`+/-`\" ເພື່ອກັບຂົ້ວຂອງໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມທັງໝົດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂດຍປົກກະຕິໜ້າກາກ ວົງມົນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂມດູນມີຜົນສະເພາະພາຍໃນວົງມົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າກັບຂົ້ວ, ໂມດູນຈະມີຜົນກັບທັງໝົດຮູບ _ຍົກເວັ້ນ_ ພາຍໃນວົງມົນນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "panning and zooming the image"
msgstr "ການເລື່ອນ ແລະ ຊູມຮູບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While creating or editing a shape, mouse actions are applied to the current shape.  If you need to move or zoom the portion of the image shown in the center view, hold down the 'a' key while dragging the mouse or using the scroll wheel.  While the key is held down, the mouse actions will apply to the entire image rather than the current shape.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສ້າງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຮູບຮ່າງ, ການກະທຳຂອງເມົາສ໌ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ຮູບຮ່າງນັ້ນໆ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການ ຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ຊູມຮູບໃນໜ້າຈໍຫຼັກ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ 'a' ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດປຸ່ມນັ້ນຄ້າງໄວ້, ການກະທຳຂອງເມົາສ໌ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ຮູບທັງໝົດແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຮູບຮ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Masks allow you to limit the effect of a module so that it only applies to certain parts of the image. \n"
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຈຳກັດຜົນກະທົບຂອງໂມດູນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນມີຜົນສະເພາະບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A mask can be regarded as a grayscale image where each pixel has a value between 0 and 1.0 (or between 0% and 100%). This value is the _opacity_ and is used to determine how much a module affects each pixel.\n"
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກສາມາດປຽບທຽບໄດ້ກັບຮູບພາບສີຂາວດຳ (grayscale) ທີ່ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວມີຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 1.0 (ຫຼື 0% ຫາ 100%). ຄ່ານີ້ຄື _ຄວາມທຶບແສງ (opacity)_ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເພື່ອບອກວ່າໂມດູນຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຫຼາຍປານໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following sections explain how to construct masks in darktable.\n"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີການສ້າງໜ້າກາກໃນ darktable.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "parametric masks"
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ (parametric masks)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parametric mask feature offers fine-grained selective control over how individual pixels are masked. It does this by automatically generating an intermediate blend mask from user-defined parameters. These parameters are color coordinates rather than the geometrical coordinates used in drawn masks.\n"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ (parametric mask) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄວບຄຸມການເລືອກພິກເຊວໄດ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດ. ມັນເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການສ້າງໜ້າກາກປະສົມຂຶ້ນມາໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຈາກພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດ. ພາຣາມີເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄືພິກັດຂອງສີ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພິກັດທາງເລຂາຄະນິດຄືກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each data channel of a module (e.g. Lab, RGB) and several virtual data channels (e.g. hue, saturation) you  can construct a per-channel opacity function. Depending on each pixel's value for a given data channel this function calculates a blending factor between 0 and 1 (100%) for that pixel.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສັນຍານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງໂມດູນ (ເຊັ່ນ: Lab, RGB) ແລະ ຊ່ອງສັນຍານຂໍ້ມູນສະເືອນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ໂທນສີ, ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ) ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຟັງຊັນຄວາມທຶບແສງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງໄດ້. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະຄຳນວນຄ່າການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 1 (100%) ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄ່າ ຂອງພິກເຊວນັ້ນໃນຊ່ອງສັນຍານທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each pixel of an image thus has different blending factors for each of its data channels. All blending factors are finally multiplied together (pixel-by-pixel), along with the value of the global opacity slider, to form a complete parametric blend mask for the image.\n"
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບຈຶ່ງມີຄ່າການປະສົມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສັນຍານ. ຄ່າທັງໝົດ ຈະຖືກນຳມາຄູນກັນ (ແບບພິກເຊວຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ), ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າຄວາມທຶບແສງລວມ (global opacity), ເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນໜ້າກາກປະສົມແບບກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ສົມບູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the blend mask has a value of 0 for a given pixel, the input of the module is left unchanged. If the blend mask has a value of 1 (100%) for a pixel, the module has its full effect.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າໜ້າກາກປະສົມມີຄ່າເປັນ 0 ສຳລັບພິກເຊວໃດໜຶ່ງ, ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າຂອງໂມດູນຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ. ຖ້າໜ້າກາກມີຄ່າເປັນ 1 (100%), ໂມດູນຈະມີຜົນເຕັມທີ່.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "channel tabs"
msgstr "ແທັບຊ່ອງສັນຍານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on one of the channel tabs to select a data channel to use to build your mask.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ແທັບຊ່ອງສັນຍານໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອເລືອກຊ່ອງສັນຍານທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສ້າງໜ້າກາກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Modules acting in (_display-referred_) _Lab_ color space have data channels for L, a, b, C (chroma of LCh) and h (hue of LCh). \n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ _Lab_ (_ອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ_) ຈະມີຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ L, a, b, C (ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງ LCh) ແລະ h (ໂທນສີຂອງ LCh). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Modules acting in _display-referred RGB_ color space have data channels for g (gray), R, G, B, H (hue of HSL), S (saturation of HSL), and L (lightness of HSL). \n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ _RGB ອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ_ ຈະມີຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ g (ສີເທົາ), R, G, B, H (ໂທນສີຂອງ HSL), S (ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງ HSL) ແລະ L (ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງ HSL). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Modules acting in _scene-referred RGB_ color space have data channels for g (gray), R, G, B, Jz (luminance component of JzCzhz), Cz (chroma, or saturation, of JzCzhz), and hz (hue of JzCzhz). The g (gray) value is calculated as a weighted average of the R, G & B channels, the exact weightings depending on the working color space being used. The JzCzhz color space is a polar representation of the Jzazbz color space, in the same way that LCh is a polar representation of the Lab space. Like the L in Lab color space, the Jz is a representation of the luminosity of a pixel that aligns with how we perceive brightness. However, the Jzazbz color space is much better for high dynamic range images and is less susceptible to hue shifts than Lab space.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ _RGB ອ້າງອີງສາກ_ ຈະມີຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ g (ສີເທົາ), R, G, B, Jz (ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງ JzCzhz), Cz (ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງ JzCzhz) ແລະ hz (ໂທນສີຂອງ JzCzhz). ຄ່າ g (ສີເທົາ) ແມ່ນຄິດໄລ່ຈາກຄ່າສະເລ່ຍຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກຂອງຊ່ອງ R, G & B. ພື້ນທີ່ສີ JzCzhz ແມ່ນການສະແດງແບບໂພລາ (polar) ຂອງ Jzazbz, ຄືກັນກັບ LCh ທີ່ເປັນແບບໂພລາຂອງ Lab. ຄ່າ Jz ຈະບອກເຖິງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊວທີ່ກົງກັບການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງມະນຸດ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ພື້ນທີ່ສີ Jzazbz ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມກວ່າສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ມີຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກສູງ (HDR) ແລະ ເກີດການຜິດພ້ຽນຂອງສີໜ້ອຍກວ່າ Lab.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_See [Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Color_space) for more details about these color spaces._\n"
msgstr "_ເບິ່ງ [Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Color_space) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ ກ່ຽວກັບພື້ນທີ່ສີເຫຼົ່ານີ້._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two sliders can be shown for each associated data channel: one that works on the _input data_ that the module receives and one that works on the _output data_ that the module produces prior to blending. The sliders for the output data channels are hidden by default and can be shown using the _show output channels_ option in the blending menu.\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດສະແດງແຖບເລື່ອນໄດ້ສອງອັນ: ອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ (input)_ ທີ່ໂມດູນໄດ້ຮັບ ແລະ ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກ (output)_ ທີ່ໂມດູນສ້າງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນການປະສົມ. ແຖບເລື່ອນ ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ ແລະ ສາມາດເປີດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ _ສະແດງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກ (show output channels)_ ໃນເມນູການປະສົມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _boost factor_ slider allows the range of values targeted by the parametric mask sliders to be extended. It may be used in scene referred editing, where luminance values may extend beyond 100%, to target highlights. This slider is only available for channels where it is meaningful.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບເລື່ອນ _ປັດໄຈເສີມ (boost factor)_ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າທີ່ໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ ຕ້ອງການເລືອກໄດ້. ມັນມັກໃຊ້ໃນການແກ້ໄຂແບບອ້າງອີງສາກ ເຊິ່ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງອາດຈະເກີນ 100% ເພື່ອເລືອກສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍ (highlights). ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະບາງຊ່ອງທີ່ຈຳເປັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![input and output sliders](./parametric/input-output-sliders.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![input and output sliders](./parametric/input-output-sliders.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "inspecting data channels & masks"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໜ້າກາກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press the letter C while hovering over a channel's input/output slider to view the input/output image data for that color channel. The center image changes to display that color channel either in gray-scale values or in false colors depending on the setting in [preferences > darkroom > display of individual color channels](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md). \n"
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ C ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງແຖບເລື່ອນຂາເຂົ້າ/ຂາອອກ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບຂອງຊ່ອງສີນັ້ນ. ຮູບຢູ່ກາງຈະປ່ຽນເປັນການສະແດງຊ່ອງສີນັ້ນໃນຮູບແບບສີເທົາ ຫຼື ສີສົມມຸດ (false colors) ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຫ້ອງມືດ > ການສະແດງຜົນແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press the letter M to see the resulting mask for that slider overlaid on the image. \n"
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ M ເພື່ອເບິ່ງໜ້າກາກທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກແຖບເລື່ອນນັ້ນ ຊ້ອນທັບລົງເທິງຮູບ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the mouse pointer leaves the slider the image returns to normal after a short delay. \n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ອອກຈາກແຖບເລື່ອນ, ຮູບຈະກັບຄືນມາເປັນປົກກະຕິຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນບຶດໜຶ່ງ. \n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "linear / log mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດ ເສັ້ນຊື່ / ລໍກາຣິດ (linear / log)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press the letter A while hovering over the a slider to change its display to 'log' mode. This provides more fine control in the shadows. Press A again to toggle back to 'linear' mode.\n"
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ A ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງແຖບເລື່ອນເພື່ອປ່ຽນການສະແດງຜົນເປັນໂໝດ 'log'. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄວບຄຸມສ່ວນເງົາ (shadows) ໄດ້ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນ. ກົດ A ອີກເທື່ອໜຶ່ງເພື່ອ ກັບມາເປັນໂໝດ 'linear'.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "channel input/output sliders"
msgstr "ແຖບເລື່ອນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ/ຂາອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "With each color channel slider you can construct a trapezoidal opacity function. For this purpose there are four markers per slider. Two filled triangles above the slider mark the range of values where opacity is 1. Two open triangles below the slider mark the range values where opacity is 0. Intermediate points between full and zero are given a proportional opacity.\n"
msgstr "ໃນແຕ່ລະແຖບເລື່ອນຊ່ອງສີ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຟັງຊັນຄວາມທຶບແສງແບບຮູບສີ່ແຈພາງ. ຈະມີ 4 ຈຸດໝາຍ ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງແຖບເລື່ອນ: ສາມຫຼ່ຽມທຶບສອງອັນຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຄືຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຄວາມທຶບແສງເປັນ 1 (100%), ສາມຫຼ່ຽມໂປ່ງສອງອັນຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຄືຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຄວາມທຶບແສງເປັນ 0. ຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງກາງ ຈະມີຄວາມທຶບແສງຕາມສັດສ່ວນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The filled triangles, or inside markers, indicate the closed (mostly narrower) edge of the trapezoidal function. The open triangles, or outside markers, indicate the open (mostly wider) edge of the trapezoidal function. The sequence of the markers always remains unchanged: they can touch one another but they cannot switch position.\n"
msgstr "ສາມຫຼ່ຽມທຶບ (ຫຼື ຕົວໝາຍດ້ານໃນ) ບອກເຖິງຂອບທີ່ປິດ (ມັກຈະແຄບກວ່າ) ຂອງຟັງຊັນ. ສາມຫຼ່ຽມໂປ່ງ (ຫຼື ຕົວໝາຍດ້ານນອກ) ບອກເຖິງຂອບທີ່ເປີດ (ມັກຈະກວ້າງກວ່າ). ລຳດັບຂອງຕົວໝາຍ ຈະຄືເກົ່າສະເໝີ: ພວກມັນສາມາດແຕະກັນໄດ້ ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍສະລັບຕຳແໜ່ງກັນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A polarity (+/-) button to the right of each the slider switches between \"range select\" and \"range de-select\" modes, with visual confirmation provided by exchanging the upper and lower triangle markers. These two types of trapezoidal functions are represented graphically in the following images. \n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມຂົ້ວ (+/-) ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງແຕ່ລະແຖບເລື່ອນໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະລັບລະຫວ່າງໂໝດ \"ເລືອກຊ່ວງ (range select)\" ແລະ \"ບໍ່ເລືອກຊ່ວງ (range de-select)\". ທ່ານຈະເຫັນການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍການສະລັບກັນຂອງຕົວໝາຍ ສາມຫຼ່ຽມເທິງ ແລະ ລຸ່ມ. ຮູບແບບຂອງຟັງຊັນທັງສອງສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນດັ່ງຮູບລຸ່ມນີ້: \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**range select**\n"
msgstr "**ເລືອກຊ່ວງ (range select)**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![range select slider](./parametric/blendif_2a.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![range select slider](./parametric/blendif_2a.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![range select graph](./parametric/blendif_2b.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![range select graph](./parametric/blendif_2b.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**range deselect**\n"
msgstr "**ບໍ່ເລືອກຊ່ວງ (range deselect)**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![range deselect slider](./parametric/blendif_3a.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![range deselect slider](./parametric/blendif_3a.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![range deselect graph](./parametric/blendif_3b.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![range deselect graph](./parametric/blendif_3b.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In their default state all markers are at their extreme positions. \n"
msgstr "ໃນສະພາວະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຕົວໝາຍທັງໝົດຈະຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງນອກສຸດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this state a range select function selects the whole range of values giving an “all at 100%” mask. Starting from there one can move the sliders inwards to gradually exclude more and more parts of the image except for the remaining narrow range.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃນສະຖານະນີ້, ຟັງຊັນການເລືອກຊ່ວງຈະເລືອກຄ່າທັງໝົດ ເຊິ່ງຈະໄດ້ໜ້າກາກແບບ “ທັງໝົດຢູ່ທີ່ 100%”. ເລີ່ມຈາກບ່ອ"
"ນນັ້ນ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເລື່ອນ slider ເຂົ້າມາທາງໃນເພື່ອຄ່ອຍໆຍົກເວັ້ນສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງຮູບພາບອອກໄປ ຈົນເຫຼືອພຽງຊ່"
"ວງແຄບໆທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conversely a range de-select function (enabled by toggling the polarity) by default deselects the whole range of values, giving an “all-zero” mask as a starting point. Moving the sliders inwards gradually includes more and more parts of the image except for the remaining narrow range. \n"
msgstr ""
"ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຟັງຊັນການບໍ່ເລືອກຊ່ວງ (ເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍການກັບຂົ້ວ/polarity) ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະບໍ່ເລືອກຄ່າທັງໝົ"
"ດ, ເຊິ່ງຈະໄດ້ໜ້າກາກແບບ “ສູນທັງໝົດ” ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ການເລື່ອນ slider ເຂົ້າມາທາງໃນຈະຄ່ອຍໆລວມເອົາ"
"ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງຮູບພາບ ຍົກເວັ້ນຊ່ວງແຄບໆທີ່ເຫຼືອໄວ້. \n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "pickers"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ (pickers)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the left-hand [picker](../../processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) button you can select a point or area probe from your image. The corresponding values for the real and virtual data channels are then displayed within each color channel slider.\n"
msgstr "ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ [ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ](../../processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຈຸດ ຫຼື ພື້ນທີ່ໃນຮູບ. ຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັບຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຈິງ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນສະເືອນ ຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຖບເລື່ອນຂອງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the right-hand picker button you can automatically set the slider's values based on the selected range. Click and drag to set the parameters for the input slider from the drawn rectangle; Ctrl+click and drag to set the parameters for the output slider.\n"
msgstr "ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີທາງດ້ານຂວາ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຖບເລື່ອນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຊ່ວງທີ່ເລືອກ. ຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບແຖບເລື່ອນຂາເຂົ້າ (input) ຈາກຮູບສີ່ແຈທີ່ແຕ້ມ; Ctrl+ຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບແຖບເລື່ອນຂາອອກ (output).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "invert"
msgstr "ກັບຄ່າ (invert)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the invert button above the sliders to invert the polarity of the entire parametric mask. This differs from the polarity buttons beside the individual sliders which just invert the parameters for the current slider/channel.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມກັບຄ່າ (invert) ທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງແຖບເລື່ອນເພື່ອກັບຂົ້ວຂອງໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າທັງໝົດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ່າງຈາກປຸ່ມຂົ້ວທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງແຕ່ລະແຖບເລື່ອນ ເຊິ່ງຈະກັບຄ່າສະເພາະຊ່ອງນັ້ນໆເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reset"
msgstr "ຄືນຄ່າ (reset)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the reset button above the sliders to revert all parametric mask parameters to their default state.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມຄືນຄ່າ (reset) ທີ່ຢູ່ເທິງແຖບເລື່ອນ ເພື່ອຄືນຄ່າພາຣາມີເຕີທັງໝົດຂອງໜ້າກາກແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "combining drawn & parametric masks"
msgstr "ການລວມໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ ແລະ ແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drawn and parametric masks can be used in combination to form a single mask that can be applied to a module.\n"
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ ແລະ ແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນໜ້າກາກອັນດຽວ ທີ່ຈະນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບໂມດູນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two main elements which control how individual masks are combined: the _polarity_ setting of each individual mask (defined by the plus or minus buttons) and the setting in the “combine masks” combobox.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມີສອງອົງປະກອບຫຼັກທີ່ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການລວມໜ້າກາກແຕ່ລະອັນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ຂົ້ວ (polarity)_ ຂອງແຕ່ລະໜ້າກາກ "
"(ກຳນົດໂດຍປຸ່ມບວກ ຫຼື ລົບ) ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລາຍການເລືອກ “ລວມໜ້າກາກ (combine masks)”.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"combine masks\" combobox contains the following options, defining how the drawn and parametric masks will be combined:\n"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງເລືອກ \"ລວມໜ້າກາກ (combine masks)\" ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ເພື່ອກຳນົດວິທີການລວມ ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ ແລະ ແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exclusive\n"
": A straightforward method of combining masks, exclusive mode multiplies together the individual pixel values from each of the component masks. \n"
msgstr ""
"exclusive (ຄັດອອກ)\n"
": ເປັນວິທີການລວມໜ້າກາກແບບກົງໄປກົງມາ, ໂໝດ exclusive ຈະເອົາຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງແຕ່ລະໜ້າກາກ ມາຄູນເຂົ້າກັນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": For a given pixel, the final mask will have value of 0 if _any_ of the individual masks are 0 at that location and it will only have a value of 1.0 if _all_ masks have a value of 1.0 at that location. \n"
msgstr ": ສຳລັບພິກເຊວໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໜ້າກາກສຸດທ້າຍຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ 0 ຖ້າຫາກມີໜ້າກາກ _ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ_ ມີຄ່າເປັນ 0 ຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນ ແລະ ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ 1.0 ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໜ້າກາກ _ທັງໝົດ_ ມີຄ່າເປັນ 1.0 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Any individual mask can _exclude_ a pixel by setting its value to 0, regardless of what the other masks do. Once a pixel is excluded by a mask there is no way for another mask to include it again.\n"
msgstr ": ໜ້າກາກໃດໜຶ່ງສາມາດ _ຄັດ_ ພິກເຊວອອກໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ 0, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່ໜ້າກາກອື່ນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ. ເມື່ອພິກເຊວຖືກຄັດອອກໂດຍໜ້າກາກໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ, ໜ້າກາກອື່ນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເອົາມັນກັບມາລວມໄດ້ອີກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"inclusive\n"
": Inclusive mode first inverts each individual mask (subtracts its value from 1.0), multiplies the inverted masks together, and finally inverts the combined mask once again. \n"
msgstr ""
"inclusive (ລວມເຂົ້າ)\n"
": ໂໝດ inclusive ຈະທຳການກັບຄ່າ (invert) ແຕ່ລະໜ້າກາກກ່ອນ (ເອົາ 1.0 ຕັ້ງແລ້ວລົບດ້ວຍຄ່າຂອງມັນ), ຈາກນັ້ນເອົາຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ມາຄູນກັນ, ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍກໍກັບຄ່າໜ້າກາກທີ່ລວມແລ້ວຄືນອີກເທື່ອໜຶ່ງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": For a given pixel, the final mask will have a value of 1.0 if _any_ of the individual masks are 1.0 at that location and it will only have a value of 0 if _all_ masks have a value of 0 at that location. \n"
msgstr ": ສຳລັບພິກເຊວໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໜ້າກາກສຸດທ້າຍຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ 1.0 ຖ້າຫາກມີໜ້າກາກ _ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ_ ມີຄ່າເປັນ 1.0 ຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນ ແລະ ຈະມີຄ່າເປັນ 0 ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໜ້າກາກ _ທັງໝົດ_ ມີຄ່າເປັນ 0 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Any individual mask can _include_ a pixel by setting its value to 1.0, regardless of what the other masks do. Once a pixel is fully included by a mask (its value is 1.0) there is no way for another mask to exclude it again.\n"
msgstr ": ໜ້າກາກໃດໜຶ່ງສາມາດ _ລວມ_ ພິກເຊວເຂົ້າໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ 1.0, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າໜ້າກາກອື່ນຈະເປັນແນວໃດ. ເມື່ອພິກເຊວຖືກລວມເຂົ້າຢ່າງສົມບູນໂດຍໜ້າກາກໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ (ຄ່າເປັນ 1.0), ໜ້າກາກອື່ນກໍບໍ່ສາມາດຄັດມັນອອກໄດ້ອີກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exclusive and inclusive inverted modes\n"
": Using the above combination methods alone would still be rather limiting. We gain maximum flexibility by allowing an additional inversion step for each individual mask. This is governed by the polarity buttons that you find close to the individual channels. \n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ exclusive ແລະ inclusive ແບບກັບຄ່າ\n"
": ການໃຊ້ວິທີການລວມຂ້າງເທິງພຽງຢ່າງດຽວອາດຈະມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ. ພວກເຮົາຈະໄດ້ຄວາມຍືດຍຸ່ນສູງສຸດໂດຍ ການເພີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການກັບຄ່າ (inversion) ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະໜ້າກາກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມໂດຍປຸ່ມຂົ້ວ (polarity) ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສັນຍານ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Toggling the polarity button of a mask inverts its values (subtracts the original value from 1.0).\n"
msgstr ": ການກົດປຸ່ມຂົ້ວຂອງໜ້າກາກຈະເປັນການກັບຄ່າຂອງມັນ (ເອົາ 1.0 ລົບດ້ວຍຄ່າເດີມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Finally within the “combine masks” combobox you may select the _exclusive & inverted_ or _inclusive & inverted_ options. Each of these options is equivalent to the _exclusive_ and _inclusive_ modes, respectively, but with a final step that inverts the resulting mask.\n"
msgstr ""
": ສຸດທ້າຍ, ພາຍໃນລາຍການເລືອກ “ລວມໜ້າກາກ”, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ _exclusive & "
"inverted_ (ຍົກເວັ້ນ ແລະ ກັບຄ່າ) ຫຼື _inclusive & inverted_ (ລວມເອົາ ແລະ ກັບຄ່າ). ແຕ່ລະຕົວ"
"ເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນເທົ່າກັບໂໝດ _exclusive_ ແລະ _inclusive_ ຕາມລຳດັບ, ແຕ່ຈະມີຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍຄືການກັ"
"ບຄ່າ (invert) ໜ້າກາກທີ່ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "typical use cases"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"inclusive mode\n"
": For this mode you set the “combine masks” combobox to inclusive mode and make sure that all polarity buttons of all the individual channels and of the drawn mask are set to negative (-). Your starting point is a mask where all pixels have a value of zero (no pixel is selected). You now adjust the parametric mask sliders to bring more and more pixels into the selection or you draw shapes on the canvas to select specific areas of your image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດລວມເອົາ (inclusive mode)\n"
": ສໍາລັບໂໝດນີ້, ໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງລາຍການເລືອກ “ລວມໜ້າກາກ” ເປັນໂໝດ inclusive ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າປຸ່ມຂົ້ວ "
"(polarity) ຂອງທຸກຊ່ອງທາງ (channels) ແລະ ຂອງໜ້າກາກທີ່ແຕ້ມນັ້ນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນລົບ (-). ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ"
"ທ່ານແມ່ນໜ້າກາກທີ່ທຸກພິກເຊວມີຄ່າເປັນສູນ (ບໍ່ມີພິກເຊວໃດຖືກເລືອກ). ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງປັບ slider ຂອງໜ້າກາກພາ"
"ຣາມີເຕີເພື່ອດຶງເອົາພິກເຊວເຂົ້າມາໃນສ່ວນທີ່ເລືອກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ແຕ້ມຮູບຊົງເທິງພາບເພື່ອເລືອກບໍລິເວນສະເພາະທີ່ຕ້ອງກ"
"ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exclusive mode\n"
": In the opposite case you set the “combine masks” combobox to exclusive mode and make sure that all polarity buttons are set to positive (+). Your starting point is a mask with all values at 1.0 (all pixels are selected). You now adjust the parametric mask sliders to exclude parts of your image as needed or directly draw shapes on the canvas to exclude those areas.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຍົກເວັ້ນ (exclusive mode)\n"
": ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງລາຍການເລືອກ “ລວມໜ້າກາກ” ເປັນໂໝດ exclusive ແລະ ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າປຸ່ມຂົ້"
"ວທັງໝົດຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນບວກ (+). ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງທ່ານແມ່ນໜ້າກາກທີ່ມີຄ່າທັງໝົດເປັນ 1.0 (ທຸກພິກເຊວຖືກເລືອກ). ຈາ"
"ກນັ້ນທ່ານຈຶ່ງປັບ slider ຂອງໜ້າກາກພາຣາມີເຕີເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບອອກຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ ຫຼື ແຕ້ມ"
"ຮູບຊົງເທິງພາບໂດຍກົງເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນບໍລິເວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For your convenience the parametric masks GUI provides a toggle button that inverts all channel polarities and toggles between inclusive and exclusive mode in the “combine masks” combobox.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ, ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (GUI) ຂອງໜ້າກາກພາຣາມີເຕີມີປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບທີ່ຈະກັບຂົ້ວຂອງທຸກຊ່ອງທາງ ແລະ ສະ"
"ຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງໂໝດ inclusive ແລະ exclusive ໃນລາຍການເລືອກ “ລວມໜ້າກາກ” ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn-and-parametric.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For novice users it is recommended that you stick to the above two use cases. This means that you should decide beforehand how you want to construct your mask.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພຽງສອງວິທີຂ້າງເທິງນີ້. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານຄວນຕັດສິນໃຈກ່ອນ ວ່າຈະສ້າງໜ້າກາກຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍວິທີໃດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "raster masks"
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກແບບຣາສເຕີ (raster masks)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As described in the previous sections, the final output of a module's mask (the combined effect of any drawn and parametric masks) is a grayscale raster image representing the extent to which the module's effect should be applied to each pixel. This raster image is stored internally for active modules and can be subsequently reused by other modules in the pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr "ດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໃນພາກສ່ວນກ່ອນໜ້າ, ຜົນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງໜ້າກາກໂມດູນ (ຜົນລວມຂອງໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້ມ ແລະ ແບບກຳນົດຄ່າ) ຄືຮູບພາບແບບຣາສເຕີສີເທົາ (grayscale) ທີ່ບອກວ່າຜົນຂອງໂມດູນຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ຮູບຣາສເຕີນີ້ນີ້ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ພາຍໃນສຳລັບໂມດູນທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ຄືນໃນໂມດູນອື່ນໆໃນ pixelpipe ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As with any mask, if the opacity value for a pixel in a raster mask is zero, the module's input is passed through the module unchanged. If the opacity is 1.0 the module has its full effect. For each value between 0 and 1.0 the module's effect is applied proportionally at that location.\n"
msgstr "ຄືກັນກັບໜ້າກາກທົ່ວໄປ, ຖ້າຄ່າຄວາມທຶບແສງຂອງພິກເຊວໃນໜ້າກາກຣາສເຕີເປັນສູນ, ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ ຈະຜ່ານໂມດູນໄປໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ຖ້າເປັນ 1.0 ໂມດູນຈະມີຜົນເຕັມທີ່. ແລະ ສຳລັບຄ່າ ລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 1.0 ຜົນຂອງໂມດູນຈະມີຜົນຕາມສັດສ່ວນໃນຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can choose a raster mask from the combobox. Raster masks can be identified by the name of the module against which they were originally generated.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໜ້າກາກຣາສເຕີໄດ້ຈາກຊ່ອງເລືອກ. ໜ້າກາກຣາສເຕີຈະຖືກລະບຸດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງໂມດູນ ທີ່ສ້າງມັນຂຶ້ນມາໃນຕອນທຳອິດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Raster masks can also be imported from images generated by other applications -- see the [_external raster mask_](../../../../module-reference/processing-modules/external-raster.md) module documentation.\n"
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກຣາສເຕີຍັງສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າຈາກຮູບທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນໄດ້ -- ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໃນ ໂມດູນ [_ໜ້າກາກຣາສເຕີຈາກພາຍນອກ (external raster mask)_](../../../../module-reference/processing-modules/external-raster.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Raster masks are generated as part of a module's internal processing. Once a module's processing is complete its mask then becomes available to subsequent modules in the pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ໜ້າກາກຣາສເຕີຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການປະມວນຜົນພາຍໃນໂມດູນ. ເມື່ອ ໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໜ້າກາກຂອງມັນຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນໂມດູນຖັດໄປໃນ pixelpipe ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This has two implications:\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຄວາມໝາຍສອງຢ່າງຄື:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Raster masks cannot be generated by disabled modules since they do not participate in pixelpipe processing. As soon as you disable a module, its mask is no longer available for use.\n"
msgstr "1. ໂມດູນທີ່ປິດໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງໜ້າກາກຣາສເຕີໄດ້ ເພາະມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມໃນການປະມວນຜົນ pixelpipe. ທັນທີທີ່ທ່ານປິດໂມດູນ, ໜ້າກາກຂອງມັນກໍຈະໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້ອີກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Raster masks are passed _up_ the pixelpipe after module processing -- they can only be used by modules that come later in the pipe than the generating module.\n"
msgstr "2. ໜ້າກາກຣາສເຕີຈະຖືກສົ່ງ _ຂຶ້ນໄປ_ ຕາມ pixelpipe ຫຼັງຈາກການປະມວນຜົນໂມດູນ -- ພວກມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບໂມດູນທີ່ຢູ່ຖັດຈາກໂມດູນທີ່ສ້າງໜ້າກາກນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "masks"
msgstr "ໜ້າກາກ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/ai-masking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI masking"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໜ້າກາກ AI"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/ai-masking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AI masking requires AI features to be enabled in [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md), with a model active for the AI task the specific masking tool uses (each tool below states which one). See the [AI features overview](../../../special-topics/ai/overview.md) for what runs where.\n"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ໜ້າກາກ AI ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ AI](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md), ໂດຍມີໂມເດວທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ສຳລັບວຽກ AI ທີ່ເຄື່ອງມືໜ້າກາກ ນັ້ນໆໃຊ້ (ແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງມືດ້ານລຸ່ມຈະລະບຸວ່າໃຊ້ໂຕໃດ). ເບິ່ງ [ພາບລວມຄຸນສົມບັດ AI](../../../special-topics/ai/overview.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດວ່າອັນໃດເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃສ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/ai-masking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently darktable provides one AI masking tool:\n"
msgstr "ປະຈຸບັນ darktable ມີເຄື່ອງມືໜ້າກາກ AI ຢູ່ໜຶ່ງຢ່າງ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/ai-masking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"AI object\n"
": Uses the _mask_ task. Click on a subject to produce a mask around it; iterate by adding more clicks until it covers exactly what you want. The result is vectorised into a group of path shapes and can be edited like any other drawn shape – see [drawn masks: AI object](./drawn.md#available-shapes) for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວັດຖຸ AI\n"
": ໃຊ້ວຽກ _mask_. ຄລິກໃສ່ສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອສ້າງໜ້າກາກອ້ອມຮອບມັນ; ເຮັດຊ້ຳໂດຍການຄລິກເພີ່ມເຕີມຈົນກວ່າຈ"
"ະປົກຄຸມສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຢ່າງພໍດີ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນເວັກເຕີເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມຂອງຮູບຊົງເສັ້ນທາງ ແລະ ສາມາດແກ້"
"ໄຂໄດ້ຄືກັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ແຕ້ມອື່ນໆ – ເບິ່ງ [ໜ້າກາກທີ່ແຕ້ມ: ວັດຖຸ AI](./drawn.md#available-shapes) ສຳລັ"
"ບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "blend modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend modes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Blend modes define how the input and output of a module are combined (blended) together before the module's final output is passed to the next module in the pixelpipe. \n"
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມຈະກຳນົດວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນຈະຖືກລວມ (ປະສົມ) ເຂົ້າກັນແນວໃດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຜົນສຸດທ້າຍຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາໂມດູນຖັດໄປໃນ pixelpipe. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Classic blending modes, designed for display-referred RGB (constrained to 0-100%), implicitly define a fulcrum at 50% (gray) or 100% (white) in their algorithms, depending on the blend mode. Because scene-referred is not subject to these restrictions, this fulcrum needs to be explicitly defined by the user when performing blending operations in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space. The additional _blend fulcrum_ parameter will be presented to the user when using one of these blend modes in this color space. The effect depends on the operator used. For example, values above the fulcrum might be brightened and values below darkened, or vice versa.\n"
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສົມແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ທີ່ອອກແບບມາສຳລັບ RGB ແບບອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ (ຈຳກັດຢູ່ທີ່ 0-100%) ຈະມີການກຳນົດຈຸດເຄິ່ງກາງ (fulcrum) ໄວ້ທີ່ 50% (ສີເທົາ) ຫຼື 100% (ສີຂາວ) ໃນອັນກໍຣິທຶມ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບໂໝດນັ້ນໆ. ເນື່ອງຈາກການອ້າງອີງສາກ (scene-referred) ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ຈຸດເຄິ່ງກາງນີ້ຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ເອງ ເມື່ອທຳການປະສົມໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\". ພາຣາມີເຕີ _blend fulcrum_ ເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປັບ. ຜົນກະທົບຈະຂຶ້ນກັບ ຕົວດຳເນີນການທີ່ໃຊ້ ເຊັ່ນ: ຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອຈຸດເຄິ່ງກາງອາດຈະສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ ອາດຈະມືດລົງ ຫຼື ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The final output of a module is computed 'per-pixel' as follows:\n"
msgstr "ຜົນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງໂມດູນແມ່ນຄຳນວນ 'ແບບພິກເຊວຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ' ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "final_output = (1.0 - opacity) * module_input + opacity * blended_output\n"
msgstr "final_output = (1.0 - opacity) * module_input + opacity * blended_output\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "where the `blended_output` is a combination of the input and output images, depending on the blend mode (below), and the `opacity` is defined 'per-pixel' by a combination of the mask and global opacity parameter. An opacity of 0% outputs an image that is identical to the input image of the module.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍທີ່ `blended_output` ຄືຜົນລວມຂອງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ ຂຶ້ນກັບໂໝດການປະສົມ (ດ້ານລຸ່ມ), ແລະ `opacity` ຖືກກຳນົດ 'ແບບພິກເຊວຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ' ໂດຍການລວມກັນຂອງໜ້າກາກ ແລະ ຄວາມທຶບແສງລວມ. ຄວາມທຶບແສງ 0% ຈະໄດ້ຮູບທີ່ຄືກັນກັບຮູບຂາເຂົ້າຂອງໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"reverse\" button ![blend-reverse](./blend-modes/blend-reverse.png#icon) effectively reverses the roles of the input and output images in the 'per-pixel' computation:\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ \"ກັບດ້ານ\" ![blend-reverse](./blend-modes/blend-reverse.png#icon) ຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ສະລັບບົດບາດຂອງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ ໃນການຄຳນວນ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "final_output = (1.0 - opacity) * module_output + opacity * blended_input\n"
msgstr "final_output = (1.0 - opacity) * module_output + opacity * blended_input\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "where the `blended_input` is a combination of the output and input images, depending on the blend mode below where _output_ and _input_ image references are reversed. In \"reversed\" blend modes, an opacity of 0% outputs an image that is identical to the _output_ image of the module.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍທີ່ `blended_input` ຄືຜົນລວມຂອງຮູບຂາອອກ ແລະ ຂາເຂົ້າ ໂດຍມີການສະລັບການອ້າງອີງ ລະຫວ່າງ _ຂາອອກ_ ແລະ _ຂາເຂົ້າ_. ໃນໂໝດ \"ກັບດ້ານ\", ຄວາມທຶບແສງ 0% ຈະໄດ້ຮູບທີ່ ຄືກັນກັບຮູບ _ຂາອອກ_ ຂອງໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "normal modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດປົກກະຕິ (normal modes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"normal\n"
": The most commonly used blend mode, \"normal\" simply mixes input and output to an extent determined by the opacity parameter. This mode is commonly used to reduce the strength of a module's effect by reducing the opacity. This is also usually the blend mode of choice when applying a module's effect selectively with masks. This mode is also known as the \"over\" Porter-Duff alpha blending operator (see [alpha compositing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alpha_compositing) for more details).\n"
msgstr ""
"normal (ປົກກະຕິ)\n"
": ເປັນໂໝດທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ, \"normal\" ຈະປະສົມຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ ຕາມຄ່າຄວາມທຶບແສງ. ໂໝດນີ້ມັກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຄວາມແຮງຂອງໂມດູນໂດຍການຫຼຸດຄວາມທຶບແສງລົງ. ແລະ ຍັງເປັນໂໝດຫຼັກ ທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບໜ້າກາກເພື່ອເລືອກບໍລິເວນທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ໂມດູນມີຜົນ. ໂໝດນີ້ຍັງຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າຕົວດຳເນີນການ \"over\" Porter-Duff alpha blending (ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ [alpha compositing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alpha_compositing)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"normal bounded\n"
": _not available in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space_\n"
": This blend mode is the same as “normal”, except that the input and output data are clamped to a particular min/max value range. Out-of-range values are effectively blocked and are not passed to subsequent modules. Sometimes this helps to prevent artifacts. However, in most cases (e.g. highly color-saturated extreme highlights) it is better to let unbound values travel through the pixelpipe to be properly handled later. The “normal” blend mode is therefore usually preferred.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປົກກະຕິແບບຈຳກັດຂອບເຂດ (normal bounded)\n"
": _ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\"_\n"
": ໂໝດການປະສົມນີ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບ “normal”, ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າແລະຂາອອກຈະຖືກບີບ (clamped) ໃຫ້ຢູ່"
"ໃນຊ່ວງຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ/ສູງສຸດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດຈະຖືກສະກັດກັ້ນ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຍັງໂມດູນຖັດໄປ. ບາ"
"ງຄັ້ງສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການເກີດສິ່ງແປກປອມ (artifacts) ໃນພາບ. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ (ເຊັ່ນ "
"ສ່ວນທີ່ຮຸ່ງຫຼາຍທີ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີສູງ) ມັນຈະດີກວ່າທີ່ຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂອບເຂດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຜ່ານ pixelpipe ໄປ ເ"
"ພື່ອໃຫ້ຖືກຈັດການຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໂໝດການປະສົມແບບ “normal” ຈຶ່ງມັກຈະຖືກເລືອກໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກວ່"
"າ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "arithmetic modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດທາງຄະນິດສາດ (arithmetic modes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"addition\n"
": Add together the pixel values of the input and output images, lightening the output. When blending in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space, the pixel values of the output image are multiplied by a value proportional to the \"blend fulcrum\".\n"
msgstr ""
"addition (ການບວກ)\n"
": ເອົາຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກມາບວກກັນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. ເມື່ອປະສົມ ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\", ຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບຂາອອກຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ເປັນສັດສ່ວນກັບ \"blend fulcrum\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"subtract\n"
": Subtract the pixel value of the _output_ from the _input_. When blending in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space, the pixel values of the output image are multiplied by a value proportional to the \"blend fulcrum\". Pixel values less than 0 are set to 0.\n"
msgstr ""
"subtract (ການລົບ)\n"
": ລົບຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບ _ຂາອອກ_ ອອກຈາກຮູບ _ຂາເຂົ້າ_. ເມື່ອປະສົມໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\", ຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບຂາອອກຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າທີ່ເປັນສັດສ່ວນກັບ \"blend fulcrum\". ຄ່າພິກເຊວ ທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ 0 ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ 0.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"multiply\n"
": Multiply the pixel values of the input and output together. When blending in display-referred color spaces, pixel values are between 0 and 1.0, the final output will be clamped and will always be darker. When blending in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space, this value is further multiplied by a value proportional to the \"blend fulcrum\". In this case, values may be greater than 1.0 and therefore brighten the base image. This may have other side-effects, such as updating the white point in the filmic module.\n"
msgstr ""
"multiply (ການຄູນ)\n"
": ຄູນຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກເຂົ້າກັນ. ເມື່ອປະສົມໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີແບບອ້າງອີງການສະແດງຜົນ (ຄ່າຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 1.0), ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດ ແລະ ມືດລົງສະເໝີ. ເມື່ອປະສົມໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\", ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຄູນຕື່ມດ້ວຍຄ່າສັດສ່ວນຂອງ \"blend fulcrum\". ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ຄ່າອາດຈະຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1.0 ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດມີຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການປ່ຽນແປງຈຸດສີຂາວ (white point) ໃນໂມດູນ filmic.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Multiply blending simulates an optical variable density filter, where the density is defined by the output of the module. It has many applications, from blooming and local contrast enhancements (when used with a blur or low-pass filter) to dodging/burning and global contrast enhancements (when used with exposure). The fulcrum sets the output intensity threshold between darkening and brightening (any RGB value below fulcrum will darken).\n"
msgstr ": ການປະສົມແບບຄູນ (Multiply) ຈະຈຳລອງການໃຊ້ຟິວເຕີແສງທີ່ມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມຕ່າງກັນ. ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດ ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ການສ້າງເອັບເຟັກແສງຟຸ້ງ (blooming) ແລະ ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດສະເພາະບ່ອນ (ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຟິວເຕີມົວ ຫຼື low-pass) ໄປຈົນເຖິງການເຮັດ dodging/burning ແລະ ການ ເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດລວມ (ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ exposure). ຄ່າ fulcrum ຈະເປັນໂຕກຳນົດເກນລະຫວ່າງ ຄວາມມືດ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (ຄ່າ RGB ໃດທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ fulcrum ຈະມືດລົງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"divide\n"
": Divide the pixel values of the input by the output. When blending in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space, the pixel values of the output image are multiplied by a value proportional to the \"blend fulcrum\".\n"
msgstr ""
"divide (ການຫານ)\n"
": ຫານຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າດ້ວຍຮູບຂາອອກ. ເມື່ອປະສົມໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\", ຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບຂາອອກຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າສັດສ່ວນຂອງ \"blend fulcrum\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Since this is the inverse of the multiply mode, it will darken where multiply brightens and vice versa. Everything else works in essentially the same way.\n"
msgstr ": ເນື່ອງຈາກນີ້ຄືສ່ວນກັບຂອງໂໝດຄູນ (multiply), ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມືດໃນສ່ວນທີ່ໂໝດຄູນເຮັດໃຫ້ ສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ. ສ່ວນອື່ນໆແມ່ນເຮັດວຽກຄືກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"screen\n"
": _not available in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space_\n"
": Invert the input and output pixel values, multiply those values together and invert the result. This yields approximately the opposite effect to \"multiply\" mode -- the resulting image is usually brighter, and sometimes “washed out” in appearance.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະກຣີນ (screen)\n"
": _ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\"_\n"
": ກັບຄ່າພິກເຊວຂາເຂົ້າແລະຂາອອກ, ເອົາຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມາຄູນກັນ ແລ້ວກັບຄ່າຜົນໄດ້ຮັບອີກຄັ້ງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ກົງກັນຂ້"
"າມກັບໂໝດ \"multiply\" -- ຮູບພາບທີ່ໄດ້ມັກຈະຮຸ່ງຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄື “ສີຈາງ” (washed "
"out).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"average\n"
": Return the arithmetic mean of the input and output pixel values.\n"
msgstr "average (ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ): ໃຫ້ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍເລກຄະນິດຂອງພິກເຊວຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"difference\n"
": Return the absolute difference between the input and output pixel values.\n"
msgstr "difference (ຄວາມຕ່າງ): ໃຫ້ຄ່າຜົນຕ່າງສຳບູນລະຫວ່າງພິກເຊວຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"geometric mean\n"
": Return the square root of the product of the input and output pixel values.\n"
msgstr "geometric mean (ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍເລຂາຄະນິດ): ໃຫ້ຄ່າຮາກຂັ້ນສອງຂອງຜົນຄູນລະຫວ່າງພິກເຊວຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"harmonic mean\n"
": Return the product of the input and output pixel values, multiplied by 2 and divided by their sum.\n"
msgstr "harmonic mean (ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍຮາໂມນິກ): ເອົາຜົນຄູນຂອງພິກເຊວຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກມາຄູນດ້ວຍ 2 ແລ້ວຫານດ້ວຍຜົນບວກຂອງພວກມັນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "contrast enhancing modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast enhancing modes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following modes are not available in the \"RGB (scene)\" blending color space as they rely on an assumption of \"50% mid gray\" which only applies to display-referred and non-linear color spaces.  In addition, they clamp pixel values of *both* input and output images as the underlying math is not valid outside the range 0..1, and can thus cause visible changes *anywhere* in the image.  To avoid these, you will need to ensure that the module's input does not exceed the display-referred range.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ space ສີສຳລັບການປະສົມ \"RGB (scene)\" ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນອີງໃສ່ການສົມມຸດ"
"ຖານຂອງ \"ສີເທົາກາງ 50%\" ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບ space ສີທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ (non-linear) ແລະ ອ້າງອີ"
"ງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ (display-referred) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ພວກມັນຍັງຈຳກັດຄ່າພິກເຊວຂອງ *ທັ"
"ງ* ຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ ເນື່ອງຈາກຄະນິດສາດເບື້ອງຫຼັງແມ່ນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ນອກຊ່ວງ 0..1, ແລະ ອາດ"
"ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ *ທຸກບ່ອນ* ໃນຮູບພາບ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຂາເຂົ້"
"າຂອງໂມດູນບໍ່ເກີນຊ່ວງທີ່ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"overlay\n"
": This mode combines the \"multiply\" and \"screen\" blend modes: The parts of the input where the output is brighter, become brighter; The parts of the image where the output is darker, become darker; Mid-gray is unaffected. This mode is often combined with the [_lowpass_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md) and [_highpass_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md) modules.\n"
msgstr ""
"overlay\n"
": ໂໝດນີ້ລວມເອົາ \"multiply\" ແລະ \"screen\" ເຂົ້າກັນ: ສ່ວນທີ່ຂາອອກສະຫວ່າງກວ່າ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ; ສ່ວນທີ່ຂາອອກມືດກວ່າ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບມືດລົງ; ສ່ວນສີເທົາກາງຈະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. ໂໝດນີ້ມັກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບໂມດູນ [_lowpass_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md) ແລະ [_highpass_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"softlight\n"
": This mode is similar to \"overlay\", except the results are softer and less bright. As with overlay, it is often combined with the [_lowpass_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md) and [_highpass_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md) modules.\n"
msgstr ""
"softlight\n"
": ໂໝດນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ \"overlay\", ແຕ່ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຈະນຸ້ມນວນກວ່າ ແລະ ສະຫວ່າງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ. ມັກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບໂມດູນ [_lowpass_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md) ແລະ [_highpass_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hardlight\n"
": This mode is not related to \"softlight\" in anything but name. Like overlay mode it is a combination of \"multiply\" and \"screen\" modes and has a different effect above and below mid-gray. The results with hardlight blend mode tend to be quite intense and usually need to be combined with a reduced opacity.\n"
msgstr ""
"hardlight\n"
": ໂໝດນີ້ບໍ່ກ່ຽວກັບ \"softlight\" ຍົກເວັ້ນພຽງແຕ່ຊື່. ມັນຄືການລວມກັນຂອງ \"multiply\" ແລະ \"screen\" ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໃນສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງກວ່າ ແລະ ມືດກວ່າສີເທົາກາງ. ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ມັກຈະຮຸນແຮງ ແລະ ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຕ້ອງຫຼຸດຄວາມທຶບແສງລົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງດີຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"vividlight\n"
": This mode is an extreme version of overlay/softlight. Values darker than mid-gray are darkened; Values brighter than mid-gray are brightened. You will probably need to tone down its effect by reducing the opacity\n"
msgstr ""
"vividlight\n"
": ໂໝດນີ້ຄືເວີຊັນທີ່ຮຸນແຮງຂອງ overlay/softlight. ສ່ວນທີ່ມືດກວ່າສີເທົາກາງຈະຖືກເຮັດ ໃຫ້ມືດລົງຫຼາຍ; ສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງກວ່າຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຫຼຸດ ຄວາມທຶບແສງລົງເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜົນກະທົບຂອງມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"linearlight\n"
": This mode is similar to the effect of \"vividlight\".\n"
msgstr "linearlight: ໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ \"vividlight\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pinlight\n"
": This mode performs a darken and lighten blending simultaneously, removing mid-tones. It can result in artifacts such as patches and blotches.\n"
msgstr ""
"pinlight\n"
": ໂໝດນີ້ຈະທຳການປະສົມແບບເຮັດໃຫ້ມືດ (darken) ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຫວ່າງ (lighten) ໄປພ້ອມກັນ, ໂດຍການກຳຈັດໂທນສີກາງອອກ. ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສິ່ງແປກປອມ ເຊັ່ນ ຮອຍດ່າງ ຫຼື ຮອຍດຳ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "color channel modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີ (color channel modes)"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lab channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງສັນຍານ Lab"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following are available for blending in the Lab color space only\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ Lab ເທົ່ານັ້ນ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Lab lightness\n"
": Mix the lightness from the input and output images, while taking the color channels (a and b) unaltered from the input image. In contrast to “lightness” this blend mode does not involve any color space conversion and does not clamp any data. In some cases this blend mode is less prone to artifacts than “lightness”.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lab lightness\n"
": ປະສົມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຈາກຮູບພາບນໍາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຮູບພາບສົ່ງອອກ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮັກສາຊ່ອງສີ (a ແລະ b) ຈາກຮູບ"
"ພາບນໍາເຂົ້າໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ. ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັບ “lightness”, ໂໝດການປະສົມນີ້ບໍ່ມີການແປງພື້ນທີ່ສີ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການຈໍາກັດຊ່"
"ວງຂໍ້ມູນ (clamp). ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ໂໝດການປະສົມນີ້ຈະເກີດມີຮອຍຕຳໜິ (artifacts) ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ “"
"lightness”.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Lab a-channel\n"
": Mix the Lab \"a\" color channel from the input and output images, while taking the other channels unaltered from the input image.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lab a-channel (ຊ່ອງ a ຂອງ Lab)\n"
": ປະສົມສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີ \"a\" ຂອງ Lab ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງຊ່ອງອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Lab b-channel\n"
": Mix the Lab \"b\" color channel from the input and output images, while taking the other channels unaltered from the input image.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lab b-channel (ຊ່ອງ b ຂອງ Lab)\n"
": ປະສົມສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີ \"b\" ຂອງ Lab ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງຊ່ອງອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Lab color\n"
": Mix the Lab color channels (a and b) from the input and output images, while taking the lightness unaltered from the input image. In contrast to “color” this blend mode does not involve any color space conversion and does not clamp any data. In some cases this blend mode is less prone to artifacts than “color”.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lab color\n"
": ປະສົມຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີ Lab (a ແລະ b) ຈາກຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ໂດຍທີ່ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ "
"(lightness) ຈາກຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າແມ່ນບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂໝດ “color”, ໂໝດການປະສົມນີ້ບໍ່ມີກາ"
"ນແປງພື້ນທີ່ສີ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ (clamp). ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ ໂໝດການປະສົມນີ້ມີໂອກາດເກີດສິ່ງລົບກວນ "
"(artifacts) ໜ້ອຍກວ່າໂໝດ “color”.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "RGB channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງສັນຍານ RGB"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following are available when blending in RGB color spaces only.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອປະສົມໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"RGB red channel\n"
": Mix the \"red\" channel from the input and output images, while taking the other channels unaltered from the input image. When blending in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space, the \"red\" channel from the output image is multiplied by a value proportional to the \"blend fulcrum\". \n"
msgstr ""
"RGB red channel (ຊ່ອງສີແດງ)\n"
": ປະສົມສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີ \"ແດງ\" ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ. ເມື່ອປະສົມໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\", ຊ່ອງສີແດງຈາກຂາອອກຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າສັດສ່ວນຂອງ \"blend fulcrum\". \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"RGB green channel\n"
": Mix the \"green\" channel from the input and output images, while taking the other channels unaltered from the input image. When blending in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space, the \"green\" channel from the output image is multiplied by a value proportional to the \"blend fulcrum\". \n"
msgstr ""
"RGB green channel (ຊ່ອງສີຂຽວ)\n"
": ປະສົມສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີ \"ຂຽວ\" ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ. ເມື່ອປະສົມໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\", ຊ່ອງສີຂຽວຈາກຂາອອກຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າສັດສ່ວນຂອງ \"blend fulcrum\". \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"RGB blue channel\n"
": Mix the \"blue\" channel from the input and output images, while taking the other channels unaltered from the input image. When blending in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space, the \"blue\" channel from the output image is multiplied by a value proportional to the \"blend fulcrum\". \n"
msgstr ""
"RGB blue channel (ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ)\n"
": ປະສົມສະເພາະຊ່ອງສີ \"ຟ້າ\" ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ. ເມື່ອປະສົມໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\", ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າຈາກຂາອອກຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າສັດສ່ວນຂອງ \"blend fulcrum\". \n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "HSV channels"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງສັນຍານ HSV"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following are available when blending in the \"RGB (display)\" color space only.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (display)\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"HSV value\n"
": Mix the lightness from the input and output images, while taking color unaltered from the input image. In contrast to “lightness” this blend mode does not involve clamping.\n"
msgstr ""
"HSV value\n"
": ປະສົມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຈາກຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ໂດຍທີ່ຄ່າສີຈາກຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າແມ່ນບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂໝດ “lightness”, ໂໝດການປະສົມນີ້ບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ (clamping).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"HSV color\n"
": Mix the color from the input and output images, while taking lightness unaltered from the input image. In contrast to “color” this blend mode does not involve clamping.\n"
msgstr ""
"HSV color\n"
": ປະສົມສີຈາກຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ໂດຍທີ່ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຈາກຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າແມ່ນບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. "
"ເມື່ອທຽບກັບໂໝດ “color”, ໂໝດການປະສົມນີ້ບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ (clamping).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "others"
msgstr "ອື່ນໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lightness\n"
": Mix lightness from the input and output images, while taking color (chromaticity and hue) unaltered from the input image.\n"
msgstr ""
"lightness (ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ)\n"
": ປະສົມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຈາກຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງສີ (chromaticity ແລະ hue).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"chromaticity\n"
": Mix chromaticity from the input and output images, while taking lightness and hue unaltered from the input image. This blend mode uses RGB ratios, divided by a Euclidean norm.\n"
msgstr ""
"chromaticity (ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີ)\n"
": ປະສົມຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີລະຫວ່າງຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ໂທນສີ. ໂໝດນີ້ໃຊ້ອັດຕາສ່ວນ RGB ຫານດ້ວຍ Euclidean norm.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lighten\n"
": _not available in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space_\n"
": Compare the pixel values of the input and output images, and output the lighter value.\n"
msgstr ""
"lighten (ເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ)\n"
": _ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\"_\n"
": ປຽບທຽບຄ່າພິກເຊວຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ແລ້ວເລືອກເອົາຄ່າທີ່ສະຫວ່າງກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"darken\n"
": _not available in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space_\n"
": Compare the pixel values of the input and output images, and output the darker value.\n"
msgstr ""
"darken (ເຮັດໃຫ້ມືດລົງ)\n"
": _ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\"_\n"
": ປຽບທຽບຄ່າພິກເຊວຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ແລ້ວເລືອກເອົາຄ່າທີ່ມືດກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hue\n"
": _not available in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space_\n"
": Mix hue (color tint) from the input and output images, while taking lightness and chroma unaltered from the input image.\n"
msgstr ""
"hue (ໂທນສີ)\n"
": _ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\"_\n"
": ປະສົມໂທນສີລະຫວ່າງຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ (chroma).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"color\n"
": _not available in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space_\n"
": Mix color (chroma and hue) from the input and output images while taking lightness unaltered from the input image. \n"
msgstr ""
"color (ສີ)\n"
": _ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\"_\n"
": ປະສົມສີ (ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ ແລະ ໂທນສີ) ລະຫວ່າງຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": _Caution: When modules drastically modify hue (e.g. when generating complementary colors) this blend mode can result in strong color noise._\n"
msgstr ": _ຄຳເຕືອນ: ເມື່ອໂມດູນມີການປ່ຽນແປງໂທນສີຢ່າງຮຸນແຮງ, ໂໝດການປະສົມນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ ສິ່ງລົບກວນສີ (color noise) ທີ່ຮຸນແຮງໄດ້._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"coloradjustment\n"
": _not available in the \"RGB (scene)\" color space_\n"
": Some modules act predominantly on the tonal values of an image but also perform some color saturation adjustments (e.g. the [_levels_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/levels.md) and [_tone curve_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md) modules). This blend mode takes the lightness from the module's output and mixes colors from input and output, enabling control over the module's color adjustments.\n"
msgstr ""
"coloradjustment (ການປັບແຕ່ງສີ)\n"
": _ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ \"RGB (scene)\"_\n"
": ບາງໂມດູນເນັ້ນປັບຄ່າໂທນສີຂອງຮູບແຕ່ກໍມີການປັບຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີໄປພ້ອມ (ເຊັ່ນ ໂມດູນ [_levels_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/levels.md) ແລະ [_tone curve_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md)). ໂໝດນີ້ຈະ ເອົາຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຈາກຂາອອກມາໃຊ້ ແລະ ປະສົມສີລະຫວ່າງຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ ຄວບຄຸມການປັບແຕ່ງສີຂອງໂມດູນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/undo-redo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "undo and redo"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ເຮັດຊ້ຳ (undo and redo)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/undo-redo.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While you are editing your image, darktable records all of the modifications you make to that image. This means that it is possible to undo and redo changes to recover a previous editing state. Note that the undo/redo facility is unlimited in the number of steps while editing an image, but is reset each time the darkroom is switched to a new image.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຮູບພາບ, darktable ຈະບັນທຶກທຸກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ທ່ານເຮັດກັບຮູບພາບນັ້ນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ເຮັດຊ້ຳການປ່ຽນແປງເພື່ອເອົາສະພາວະການແກ້ໄຂກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນກັບຄືນມາໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຟັງຊັນ ຍົກເລີກ/ເຮັດຊ້ຳ ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ບໍ່ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຕອນໃນຂະນະທີ່ແກ້ໄຂຮູບພາບໜຶ່ງ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ຫ້ອງມືດຖືກປ່ຽນໄປຫາຮູບພາບໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the anatomy of a processing module"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The basic element of image processing in darktable is the [processing module](../../module-reference/processing-modules/). In order to process a raw image a number of such modules act on the input image in sequence, each performing a different _operation_ on the image data. For those familiar with Adobe Photoshop, the concept of a _processing module_ in darktable is analogous to that of an _adjustment layer_ in that both make an incremental adjustment to the image, building on top of the adjustments that came before.\n"
msgstr "ອົງປະກອບພື້ນຖານຂອງການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບໃນ darktable ແມ່ນ [ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ (processing module)](../../module-reference/processing-modules/). ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບ RAW, ໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າຕາມລຳດັບ, ໂດຍແຕ່ລະໂມດູນຈະປະຕິບັດ _ການເຮັດວຽກ (operation)_ ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ. ສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບ Adobe Photoshop, ແນວຄິດຂອງ _ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ_ ໃນ darktable ແມ່ນຄ້າຍຄືກັບ _adjustment layer_ ທີ່ແຕ່ລະອັນຈະເຮັດການປັບແຕ່ງຮູບພາບເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເທື່ອລະຂັ້ນ, ໂດຍສ້າງທັບຊ້ອນເທິງການປັບແຕ່ງກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Utility modules](../../module-reference/utility-modules/) are also provided by darktable, however these are not directly involved in image processing, instead providing a GUI that allows you to manage your images, tag them, export them etc.\n"
msgstr "[ໂມດູນອັດຖະປະໂຫຍດ (Utility modules)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/) ກໍມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນ darktable ເຊັ່ນກັນ, ແຕ່ໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍກົງກັບການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບ, ແຕ່ຈະເປັນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (GUI) ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການຮູບພາບ, ໃສ່ແທັກ, ສົ່ງອອກ (export) ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every processing module acts independently of the others, but all modules perform their processing in a similar manner:\n"
msgstr "ທຸກໆໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນຈະເຮັດວຽກເປັນອິດສະຫຼະຈາກກັນ, ແຕ່ທຸກໂມດູນຈະປະຕິບັດການປະມວນຜົນໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![module anatomy](./the-anatomy-of-a-module/module-anatomy.png#w100)\n"
msgstr "![module anatomy](./the-anatomy-of-a-module/module-anatomy.png#w100)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Receive the _module input_ from the last executed module and perform an _operation_ on it to produce the _processed output_. This _operation_ is different for every [processing module](../../module-reference/processing-modules/_index.md).\n"
msgstr "1. ຮັບ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ (module input)_ ຈາກໂມດູນທີ່ປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ແລະ ປະຕິບັດ _ການເຮັດວຽກ (operation)_ ເພື່ອສ້າງ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກທີ່ປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ (processed output)_. _ການເຮັດວຽກ_ ນີ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປສຳລັບແຕ່ລະ [ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ](../../module-reference/processing-modules/_index.md).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combine the _module input_ and _processed output_ using a [blending operator](../masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md) to produce the _blended output_. If no blending is performed, the output of this step is the same as the _processed output_.\n"
msgstr "2. ຮວມ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ_ ແລະ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກທີ່ປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ_ ໂດຍໃຊ້ [ຕົວປະສົມ (blending operator)](../masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md) ເພື່ອສ້າງ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກທີ່ປະສົມແລ້ວ (blended output)_. ຫາກບໍ່ມີການປະສົມ, ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະຄືກັນກັບ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກທີ່ປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate a _mask_, which defines an _opacity_ for each pixel in the image. The _opacity_ is later used to control how strongly the module's operation is applied to each part of the image. \n"
msgstr "3. ສ້າງ _ມາດສະກ (mask)_, ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດ _ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ (opacity)_ ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວໃນຮູບພາບ. _ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ_ ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວ່າການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂມດູນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບຫຼາຍໜ້ອຍພຽງໃດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "   You may define your own mask by drawing shapes over the image or by using pixel properties from the _module input_ or _processed output_ (see [masks](../masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md) for details). This mask may be further modified with a global opacity setting, which affects every pixel equally. \n"
msgstr "   ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດມາດສະກຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້ໂດຍການແຕ້ມຮູບຊົງທັບເທິງຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງພິກເຊວຈາກ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ_ ຫຼື _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກທີ່ປະມວນຜົນແລ້ວ_ (ເບິ່ງ [ມາດສະກ (masks)](../masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ). ມາດສະກນີ້ສາມາດຖືກປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສໂດຍລວມ (global opacity), ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ທຸກໆພິກເຊວຢ່າງເທົ່າທຽມກັນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "   If no drawn/parametric mask is used, the output of this step is a mask where every pixel has the same opacity (governed by the global opacity setting). If no opacity is defined (no blending is performed) a global opacity of 1.0 (or 100%) is assumed.\n"
msgstr "   ຫາກບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ການແຕ້ມມາດສະກ ຫຼື ມາດສະກແບບພາຣາມີຕຣິກ, ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຈະເປັນມາດສະກທີ່ທຸກພິກເຊວມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສເທົ່າກັນ (ຄວບຄຸມໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສໂດຍລວມ). ຫາກບໍ່ມີການກຳນົດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ (ບໍ່ມີການປະສົມ), ຈະຖືວ່າຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສໂດຍລວມແມ່ນ 1.0 (ຫຼື 100%).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Combine the _module input_ and _blended output_ pixel-by-pixel using the _mask_ as a mixing operator, to produce the _final output_. Where the mask opacity is 100%, the _final output_ is the _blended output_ for that pixel. Where the mask opacity is 0 the final output is the _module input_ for that pixel. An intermediate opacity combines the _blended output_ and _module input_ proportionally. The _final output_ is passed to the next module for further processing.\n"
msgstr "4. ຮວມ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ_ ແລະ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກທີ່ປະສົມແລ້ວ_ ແບບພິກເຊວຕໍ່ພິກເຊວ ໂດຍໃຊ້ _ມາດສະກ_ ເປັນຕົວປະສົມ, ເພື່ອສ້າງ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກສຸດທ້າຍ (final output)_. ບ່ອນທີ່ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງມາດສະກແມ່ນ 100%, _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກສຸດທ້າຍ_ ກໍຄື _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກທີ່ປະສົມແລ້ວ_ ສຳລັບພິກເຊວນັ້ນ. ບ່ອນທີ່ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງມາດສະກແມ່ນ 0, ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສຸດທ້າຍກໍຄື _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ_ ສຳລັບພິກເຊວນັ້ນ. ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສໃນລະດັບກາງຈະຮວມ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກທີ່ປະສົມແລ້ວ_ ແລະ _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ_ ຕາມສັດສ່ວນ. _ຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກສຸດທ້າຍ_ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາໂມດູນຖັດໄປເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps 2 and 3 are optional and not supported by all modules. For example, the [demosaic](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md) module must be applied to the entire raw file in order to produce a legible image so it does not make sense to mask or blend its output.\n"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 2 ແລະ 3 ເປັນທາງເລືອກ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຮອງຮັບໂດຍທຸກໂມດູນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂມດູນ [demosaic](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md) ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໄຟລ໌ raw ທັງໝົດເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບພາບທີ່ເບິ່ງອອກ, ສະນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ ມາດສະກ ຫຼື ປະສົມ ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-anatomy-of-a-module.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each of the above steps is defined in more detail in subsequent sections.\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນຂ້າງເທິງຖືກກຳນົດລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໆໄປ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the pixelpipe"
msgstr "ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ (pixelpipe)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the history stack"
msgstr "ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ (history stack)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _history stack_ stores the entire editing history for a given image, in the order in which those edits were applied. It is saved to darktable's library database and the image's XMP sidecar file and persists between editing sessions.\n"
msgstr "_ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ (history stack)_ ຈະບັນທຶກປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດຂອງຮູບພາບນັ້ນໆ, ຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ໄດ້ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ມັນຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບຂອງ darktable ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ XMP sidecar ຂອງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງການແກ້ໄຂແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each time a processing module is enabled, disabled, moved or amended a new entry is added to the top of the _history stack_. \n"
msgstr "ທຸກໆຄັ້ງທີ່ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, ປິດໃຊ້, ຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂ, ລາຍການໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າທີ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງ _ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ_. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The history stack can be queried and modified within the [history stack](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md) module in the darkroom.\n"
msgstr "ລຳດັບປະຫວັດສາມາດຖືກກວດສອບ ແລະ ປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ພາຍໃນໂມດູນ [ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ (history stack)](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md) ໃນຫ້ອງມືດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The history stack is not a representation of the order in which the modules are **executed** but the order in which they were **amended**. The execution order is represented by the order of the modules in the right-hand panel.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ລຳດັບປະຫວັດບໍ່ແມ່ນການສະແດງລຳດັບທີ່ໂມດູນຖືກ **ປະມວນຜົນ (executed)** ແຕ່ແມ່ນລຳດັບທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກ **ແກ້ໄຂ (amended)**. ລຳດັບການປະມວນຜົນແມ່ນສະແດງໂດຍລຳດັບຂອງໂມດູນໃນແຖບດ້ານຂວາມື.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the pixelpipe & module order"
msgstr "ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ (pixelpipe) & ລຳດັບໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ordered sequence of [processing modules](../../module-reference/processing-modules/_index.md) operating on an input file to generate an output image is known as the \"pixelpipe\". \n"
msgstr "ລຳດັບຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງ [ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ](../../module-reference/processing-modules/_index.md) ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບພາບຂາອອກແມ່ນເອີ້ນວ່າ \"ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ (pixelpipe)\". \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The order of the pixelpipe is represented graphically by the order in which modules are presented in the user interface -- the pixelpipe starts with a RAW image at the bottom of the module list, and applies the processing modules one by one, piling up layer upon layer of processing from the bottom up, until it reaches the top of the list, where it outputs the fully processed image.\n"
msgstr "ລຳດັບຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບພາບຕາມລຳດັບຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ປະກົດຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ -- ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຮູບພາບ RAW ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງລາຍຊື່ໂມດູນ, ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນເທື່ອລະອັນ, ຊ້ອນກັນຂຶ້ນໄປເທື່ອລະຊັ້ນຈາກລຸ່ມຂຶ້ນເທິງ, ຈົນກວ່າຈະຮອດດ້ານເທິງສຸດຂອງລາຍຊື່, ເຊິ່ງເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ມັນສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບທີ່ປະມວນຜົນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The order in which processing modules are executed exactly matches the order in which the modules appear in darktable's user interface. **Changing the order of the modules in the user interface changes how your image is processed.**\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ລຳດັບທີ່ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນຖືກປະຕິບັດແມ່ນກົງກັບລຳດັບທີ່ໂມດູນປະກົດຢູ່ໃນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງ darktable ທຸກປະການ. **ການປ່ຽນລຳດັບຂອງໂມດູນໃນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະປ່ຽນແປງວິທີການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ.**\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "types of pixelpipe"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processing images can be very resource-intensive. For this reason, darktable includes various types of pixelpipe, optimised for different parts of the system. For example:\n"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບສາມາດໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍ. ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນນີ້, darktable ຈຶ່ງລວມເອົາພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ຫຼາຍປະເພດ, ທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງລະບົບ. ຕົວຢ່າງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The export pixelpipe processes the full-sized image at full quality. This is the slowest type of pixelpipe, but provides the maximum available image quality.\n"
msgstr "- ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ສົ່ງອອກ (export pixelpipe) ຈະປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຂະໜາດເຕັມດ້ວຍຄຸນນະພາບສູງສຸດ. ນີ້ແມ່ນປະເພດພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ທີ່ຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບຮູບພາບສູງສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ມີ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The thumbnail pixelpipe is optimised for speed, since it needs to process multiple small images at the same time without impacting lighttable or filmstrip performance. These optimisations impact image quality, but this is not usually a problem for the small images used in thumbnail generation.\n"
msgstr "- ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ຮູບຫຍໍ້ (thumbnail pixelpipe) ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງເພື່ອຄວາມໄວ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຕ້ອງປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍຫຼາຍຮູບພ້ອມກັນໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ lighttable ຫຼື filmstrip. ການປັບແຕ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄຸນນະພາບຮູບພາບ, ແຕ່ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ແມ່ນບັນຫາສຳລັບຮູບພາບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງຮູບຫຍໍ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The standard darkroom pixelpipe attempts to produce as accurate an image as possible, while also maintaining responsiveness when modifying module parameters. It does this by only processing the pixels that are visible on-screen -- known as the \"region of interest\" (ROI). However, this can mean that the image doesn't accurately reflect the exported file, especially when using modules that rely on the properties of neighboring pixels. This is particularly noticeable in modules that impact local contrast (e.g. _diffuse or sharpen_, _denoise (profiled)_ and _local contrast_) and can mean that the darkroom view appears over-sharpened compared to a full-sized export.\n"
msgstr "- ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ຫ້ອງມືດມາດຕະຖານ (standard darkroom pixelpipe) ພະຍາຍາມສ້າງຮູບພາບໃຫ້ມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້, ພ້ອມທັງຮັກສາການຕອບສະໜອງເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງພາຣາມີຕຣິກຂອງໂມດູນ. ມັນເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການປະມວນຜົນສະເພາະພິກເຊວທີ່ເຫັນຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍເທົ່ານັ້ນ -- ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ສົນໃຈ (region of interest - ROI)\". ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ນີ້ອາດໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຮູບພາບອາດຈະບໍ່ສະທ້ອນເຖິງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໂດຍສະເພາະເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂມດູນທີ່ອາໄສຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງພິກເຊວຂ້າງຄຽງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນໃນໂມດູນທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມຄົມຊັດສະເພາະບ່ອນ (ເຊັ່ນ: _diffuse or sharpen_, _denoise (profiled)_ ແລະ _local contrast_) ແລະ ອາດໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມຸມມອງໃນຫ້ອງມືດເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຄົມຊັດເກີນໄປເມື່ອທຽບກັບການສົ່ງອອກຂະໜາດເຕັມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A cut-down darkroom pixelpipe is used while interacting with some darkroom modules that display the full image with overlays (like _retouch_, _crop_ and _liquify_). This pixelpipe excludes some long-running modules (like _diffuse or sharpen_) in order to improve responsiveness, but can temporarily make the image look under-processed (blurred). This limitation is removed as soon as you move focus to a different module.\n"
msgstr "- ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ຫ້ອງມືດແບບຫຼຸດຮູບແບບ (cut-down darkroom pixelpipe) ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບບາງໂມດູນໃນຫ້ອງມືດທີ່ສະແດງຮູບພາບເຕັມພ້ອມກັບການວາງທັບ (ເຊັ່ນ _retouch_, _crop_ ແລະ _liquify_). ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ນີ້ຈະບໍ່ລວມເອົາບາງໂມດູນທີ່ໃຊ້ເວລາປະມວນຜົນດົນ (ເຊັ່ນ _diffuse or sharpen_) ເພື່ອປັບປຸງການຕອບສະໜອງ, ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບເບິ່ງຄືວ່າປະມວນຜົນບໍ່ສຳເລັດຊົ່ວຄາວ (ມົວ). ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກທັນທີທີ່ທ່ານຍ້າຍຈຸດສົນໃຈ (focus) ໄປຫາໂມດູນອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to overcome the above limitations within the standard darkroom pixelpipe, you can enable [high quality processing mode](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/high-quality-processing.md) in the darkroom view. This mode processes the entire image using the export pixelpipe and only downscales for display at the end of the pipe. This means that the darkroom image will very closely match the exported image, but will significantly degrade responsiveness when interacting with processing modules. You are advised to only use this mode after you have already done most of your processing. Its performance will be significantly improved by using an OpenCL-capable GPU.\n"
msgstr "- ເພື່ອເອົາຊະນະຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂ້າງເທິງພາຍໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ຫ້ອງມືດມາດຕະຖານ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ [ໂໝດການປະມວນຜົນຄຸນນະພາບສູງ](../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/high-quality-processing.md) ໃນມຸມມອງຫ້ອງມືດ. ໂໝດນີ້ຈະປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບທັງໝົດໂດຍໃຊ້ພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ຈະຫຼຸດຂະໜາດເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນເທ່ານັ້ນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຮູບພາບໃນຫ້ອງມືດຈະກົງກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕອບສະໜອງຫຼຸດລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂໝດນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ປະມວນຜົນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງມັນຈະດີຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍຫາກໃຊ້ GPU ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ OpenCL.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module order and workflows"
msgstr "ລຳດັບໂມດູນ ແລະ ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The order in which modules are executed within the pixelpipe has been carefully chosen to give the best output quality. In previous versions of darktable it was not possible to change the module order. However, there are a number of very specific use cases where the movement of some modules within the pixelpipe is advised.\n"
msgstr "ລຳດັບທີ່ໂມດູນຖືກປະຕິບັດພາຍໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄຸນນະພາບຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ໃນເວີຊັນກ່ອນໜ້າຂອງ darktable, ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນລຳດັບໂມດູນໄດ້. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ມີບາງກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງຫຼາຍ ເຊິ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ມີການຍ້າຍບາງໂມດູນພາຍໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "One of the main reasons to change the module order came about with darktable version 3.0, which introduced the new _scene-referred_ way of working. Version 3.2 formalised this by introducing the _display-referred_ and _scene-referred_ workflows, which are controlled by the [preferences > processing > auto-apply pixel workflow defaults](../../../preferences-settings/processing.md) setting. Starting with version 3.6, _scene-referred_ workflow is now the official recommended (and default) way to use darktable.\n"
msgstr "ໜຶ່ງໃນເຫດຜົນຫຼັກໃນການປ່ຽນລຳດັບໂມດູນແມ່ນມາຈາກ darktable ເວີຊັນ 3.0 ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ແນະນຳວິທີການເຮັດວຽກແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred)_ ໃໝ່. ເວີຊັນ 3.2 ໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນທາງການໂດຍການນຳສະເໜີຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ (display-referred)_ ແລະ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred)_, ເຊິ່ງຄວບຄຸມໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ການປະມວນຜົນ > ການນຳໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກພິກເຊວແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ](../../../preferences-settings/processing.md). ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເວີຊັນ 3.6, ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ_ ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳຢ່າງເປັນທາງການ (ແລະ ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ໃນການໃຊ້ darktable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _scene-referred_ workflow attempts to perform as many operations as possible in a linear RGB color space, only compressing the tones to fit the output medium (with a non-linear tone mapping) at the end of the pixelpipe. This has the advantage of being a more physically-realistic space to do transformations than the traditional _display-referred_ workflow, which attempts to perform operations in a non-linear _perceptual_ color space. Honoring the physical realism (rather than the perceptual realism) makes it much easier to produce predictable processing algorithms with a minimum of artifacts.\n"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ_ ພະຍາຍາມປະຕິບັດການຕ່າງໆໃຫ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear RGB color space), ໂດຍຈະບີບອັດໂທນສີໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບສື່ຂາອອກ (ດ້ວຍການກຳນົດຄ່າໂທນແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່) ໃນຕອນທ້າຍຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຂໍ້ດີຄືເປັນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີຄວາມສົມຈິງທາງກາຍະພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ_ ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ, ເຊິ່ງພະຍາຍາມປະຕິບັດການໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີແບບ _ການຮັບຮູ້ (perceptual)_ ທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່. ການໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບຄວາມສົມຈິງທາງກາຍະພາບ (ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຄວາມສົມຈິງຕາມການຮັບຮູ້) ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍໃນການສ້າງອັລກໍຣິທຶມການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຄາດເດົາໄດ້ ແລະ ມີຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນ (artifacts) ຕ່ຳສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following diagram should help you to understand the difference between these workflows:\n"
msgstr "ແຜນວາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກເຫຼົ່ານີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![scene-referred and display-referred modules](./the-pixelpipe-and-module-order/scene-display-workflows.png)\n"
msgstr "![scene-referred and display-referred modules](./the-pixelpipe-and-module-order/scene-display-workflows.png)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Scene-referred_ modules process linear data that is proportional to the amount of light collected by the camera at the scene. The dynamic range of an image in the scene-referred section of the pixelpipe is often larger than that of the display medium. \n"
msgstr "1. ໂມດູນແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ (Scene-referred)_ ຈະປະມວນຜົນຂໍ້ມູນແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ ເຊິ່ງເປັນສັດສ່ວນກັບປະລິມານແສງທີ່ກ້ອງຖ່າຍໄດ້ຈາກສາກຈິງ. ຊ່ວງກວ້າງຂອງສີ (dynamic range) ຂອງຮູບພາບໃນສ່ວນການອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ ມັກຈະກວ້າງກວ່າຊ່ວງຂອງສື່ທີ່ໃຊ້ສະແດງຜົນ. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At some point in the pixelpipe, these pixel values are compressed by a non-linear tone mapping operation into a smaller dynamic range more suitable for display on a monitor or a print.\n"
msgstr "2. ໃນບາງຈຸດຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌, ຄ່າພິກເຊວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກບີບອັດໂດຍການເຮັດວຽກຂອງການກຳນົດຄ່າໂທນ (tone mapping) ແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ຊ່ວງກວ້າງຂອງສີທີ່ນ້ອຍລົງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບການສະແດງຜົນໃນຈໍພາບ ຫຼື ການພິມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The remaining modules operate in the non-linear _display-referred_ section of the pixelpipe to produce the final output image.\n"
msgstr "3. ໂມດູນທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນສ່ວນ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ (display-referred)_ ທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບພາບຂາອອກສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "display-referred workflow"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prior to version 3.0 darktable's workflow was _display-referred_ (auto-apply pixel workflow defaults = \"display-referred\") and this option is still provided as a legacy mode. In this workflow, the [_base curve_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md) or [_filmic rgb_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) module performs tone mapping early in the pixelpipe and most other darktable modules operate on image data in the compressed _display-referred_ space.\n"
msgstr "ກ່ອນເວີຊັນ 3.0, ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ darktable ແມ່ນແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ_ (auto-apply pixel workflow defaults = \"display-referred\") ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຍັງຄົງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປັນໂໝດເກົ່າ (legacy mode). ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກນີ້, ໂມດູນ [_base curve_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md) ຫຼື [_filmic rgb_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) ຈະເຮັດການກຳນົດຄ່າໂທນໃນຊ່ວງຕົ້ນໆຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ ແລະ ໂມດູນອື່ນໆສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຂອງ darktable ຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບໃນພື້ນທີ່ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ_ ທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Selecting the display-referred workflow enables the legacy (pre-darktable-3.0) module order and automatically switches on the [_base curve_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md) module for new images.\n"
msgstr "ການເລືອກຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ລຳດັບໂມດູນແບບເກົ່າ (ກ່ອນ darktable-3.0) ແລະ ຈະເປີດໂມດູນ [_base curve_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຮູບພາບໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pixel data within the _display-referred_ space is non-linear and is not a physically realistic representation of the original scene. This can lead to various artifacts with some modules, hence the creation of the (now default) _scene-referred_ workflow.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນພິກເຊວພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ_ ແມ່ນບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນການສະແດງຜົນທີ່ສົມຈິງທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງສາກເດີມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດນຳໄປສູ່ຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຕ່າງໆກັບບາງໂມດູນ, ຈຶ່ງເປັນເຫດຜົນໃນການສ້າງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ_ (ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "scene-referred workflow"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Scene-referred_ workflow (auto-apply pixel workflow defaults = \"scene-referred\") was introduced as part of darktable 3.0. The module order was entirely rearranged to place the [_filmic rgb_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) and [_base curve_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md) tone mapping modules much later in the pixelpipe. This means that most modules now operate in _linear rgb_ space with only a few modules remaining within the non-linear _display-referred_ space. Within this workflow it is now recommended that the majority of image processing takes place using the modules up to and including [_filmic rgb_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md). Operations in this section of the pixelpipe, being truly linear, are much more physically realistic and produce fewer artifacts.\n"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ_ (auto-apply pixel workflow defaults = \"scene-referred\") ຖືກນຳສະເໜີເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ darktable 3.0. ລຳດັບໂມດູນຖືກຈັດລະບຽບໃໝ່ທັງໝົດເພື່ອວາງໂມດູນການກຳນົດຄ່າໂທນ [_filmic rgb_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) ແລະ [_base curve_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md) ໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນທ້າຍໆຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າໂມດູນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ _linear rgb_ ໂດຍມີພຽງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດໂມດູນທີ່ຍັງຄົງຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ _ອ້າງອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ_ ທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກນີ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນຕ່າງໆຈົນຮອດ ແລະ ລວມເຖິງ [_filmic rgb_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md). ການປະຕິບັດການໃນສ່ວນນີ້ຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌, ເຊິ່ງເປັນແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ແທ້ໆ, ຈະມີຄວາມສົມຈິງທາງກາຍະພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າ ແລະ ສ້າງຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນນ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Selecting the scene-referred workflow enables the _v5.0_ module order and automatically enables the [_exposure_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) and [_filmic rgb_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) modules with some presets designed to act as a reasonable starting point for scene-referred editing.\n"
msgstr "ການເລືອກຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ລຳດັບໂມດູນແບບ _v5.0_ ແລະ ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_exposure_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) ແລະ [_filmic rgb_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນບາງຢ່າງທີ່ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂແບບອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "changing module order"
msgstr "ການປ່ຽນລຳດັບໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It remains highly recommended that users not change the order within the pixelpipe for a number of reasons:\n"
msgstr "ຍັງຄົງມີການແນະນຳຢ່າງເດັດຂາດວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ຄວນປ່ຽນລຳດັບພາຍໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນຫຼາຍປະການ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sequence of modules has been selected with great care in order to give highest output quality. Changes to the sequence often worsen the result rather than improving it.\n"
msgstr "- ລຳດັບຂອງໂມດູນໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຄຸນນະພາບຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສູງສຸດ. ການປ່ຽນແປງລຳດັບມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແຍ່ລົງແທນທີ່ຈະດີຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some processing modules simply don't make sense if they are shifted in the pixelpipe. For example, [_highlight reconstruction_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md) needs to be performed on raw data before [_demosaic_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md), which itself needs to be performed before any [_input color profile_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) can be applied. For this reason it is still not possible to move some of the modules that are placed early in the pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr "- ບາງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນຈະບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດເລີຍຫາກພວກມັນຖືກຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌. ຕົວຢ່າງ: [_highlight reconstruction_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md) ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເຮັດກັບຂໍ້ມູນ raw ກ່ອນ [_demosaic_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md), ເຊິ່ງຕົວມັນເອງກໍຕ້ອງເຮັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ [_input color profile_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/input-color-profile.md) ໃດໆໄດ້. ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນນີ້, ມັນຈຶ່ງຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍບາງໂມດູນທີ່ຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນຕອນຕົ້ນຂອງພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most processing modules are designed to work within a specific color space (see the [color management](../../../special-topics/color-management/_index.md) section for more details). Full flexibility would require modules to support different parallel algorithms depending on the color space they are working in, which would drastically increase complexity.\n"
msgstr "- ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີສະເພາະ (ເບິ່ງພາກສ່ວນ [ການຈັດການສີ (color management)](../../../special-topics/color-management/_index.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ). ການໃຫ້ຄວາມຍືດຍຸ່ນຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂມດູນຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບອັລກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຂຶ້ນກັບພື້ນທີ່ສີທີ່ພວກມັນກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ເຊິ່ງຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຢ່າງມະຫາສານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Despite the general recommendation to leave the pixelpipe order alone, it is possible to move modules within the pixelpipe by holding Ctrl+Shift and dragging and dropping the desired module to a new location. This should only be done by experienced users who understand the impact this will have on the image.\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີຄຳແນະນຳທົ່ວໄປໃຫ້ຮັກສາລຳດັບພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຍ້າຍໂມດູນພາຍໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ໂດຍການກົດ Ctrl+Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລ້ວລາກໂມດູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄປວາງໃນຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນເຮັດໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມີປະສົບການທີ່ເຂົ້າໃຈເຖິງຜົນກະທົບທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບຮູບພາບເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The module order can be manually changed back to either the _v5.0_, _v3.0_ or _legacy_ versions using the [module order](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md) module, which can also be used to define your own custom module order presets.\n"
msgstr "ລຳດັບໂມດູນສາມາດປ່ຽນກັບຄືນໄປເປັນເວີຊັນ _v5.0_, _v3.0_ ຫຼື _legacy_ ໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ລຳດັບໂມດູນ (module order)](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md), ເຊິ່ງຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຂອງລຳດັບໂມດູນຂອງທ່ານເອງໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section describes how to interact with processing module controls.\n"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການເຮັດວຽກກັບການຄວບຄຸມຂອງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sliders offer five different methods of interaction, depending on the level of control you require.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບເລື່ອນມີ 5 ວິທີໃນການເຮັດວຽກ, ຂຶ້ນກັບລະດັບການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"left-click (set)\n"
": Click anywhere in the slider area to set the value. You can also click and drag to change it. You don't have to aim for the triangle or even the line -- you can click anywhere in the entire height of the slider, including the label.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຊ້າຍ (ກຳນົດຄ່າ)\n"
": ຄລິກບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນພື້ນທີ່ແຖບເລື່ອນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າໄດ້. ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລັງໃສ່ຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນ -- ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນຄວາມສູງທັງໝົດຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນ, ລວມທັງປ້າຍຊື່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mouse wheel (adjust)\n"
": Hover over the slider with your mouse, then use your mouse wheel to adjust the value. You can alter the default speed at which the mouse scroll adjusts a slider by scrolling over that slider while in [visual shortcut mapping mode](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md#visual-shortcut-mapping).\n"
msgstr ""
"ລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ (ປັບແຕ່ງ)\n"
": ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງແຖບເລື່ອນ, ແລ້ວໃຊ້ລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄວາມໄວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ການກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ຈະປັບແຖບເລື່ອນໄດ້ ໂດຍການກິ້ງເທິງແຖບເລື່ອນນັ້ນໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ [ໂໝດການກຳນົດຄີລັດດ້ວຍສາຍຕາ](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md#visual-shortcut-mapping).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"keyboard arrow keys (adjust)\n"
": When the slider has focus you can hover over the slider with your mouse, then use your keyboard's arrow keys (←/↓ and →/↑) to adjust the value. In order to give focus to the widget without changing the current value you can right-click, then right-click again.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມລູກສອນເທິງຄີບອດ (ປັບ)\n"
": ເມື່ອ slider ຖືກເລືອກ (focus), ທ່ານສາມາດວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງ slider ແລ້ວໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລູກສອນເທິງຄີບອດ "
"(←/↓ ແລະ →/↑) ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າ. ເພື່ອເລືອກ (focus) widget ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີການປ່ຽນຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄ"
"ລິກຂວາ, ແລ້ວຄລິກຂວາອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"right-click (pop-up edit)\n"
": When your mouse is over a slider right-clicking enables a multi-functional pop-up below the slider for fine control with your mouse or numerical entry using the keyboard.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາ (ປັອບອັບແກ້ໄຂ)\n"
": ເມື່ອເມົາສ໌ຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ເທິງແຖບເລື່ອນ, ການຄລິກຂວາຈະເປີດປັອບອັບອະເນກປະສົງຢູ່ລຸ່ມແຖບເລື່ອນ ເພື່ອການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ລະອຽດດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ການປ້ອນຕົວເລກດ້ວຍຄີບອດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![bauhaus](./module-controls/bauhaus.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![bauhaus](./module-controls/bauhaus.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": A bent line extending from the triangular marker moves with your mouse. The closer your mouse pointer is to the triangular marker the coarser the control you have over the value; the further away from the triangular marker the finer your control. Left-click with your mouse to accept the new value and hide the pop-up.\n"
msgstr ": ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ຕໍ່ອອກມາຈາກເຄື່ອງໝາຍສາມຫຼ່ຽມຈະເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມເມົາສ໌ຂອງທ່ານ. ຍິ່ງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ຢູ່ໃກ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍສາມຫຼ່ຽມຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ, ການຄວບຄຸມກໍຈະຍິ່ງຫຍາບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ; ຍິ່ງຢູ່ຫ່າງອອກໄປ, ການຄວບຄຸມກໍຈະຍິ່ງລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄລິກຊ້າຍເພື່ອຍອມຮັບຄ່າໃໝ່ ແລະ ເຊື່ອງປັອບອັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Alternatively you can type in a new value using your keyboard and commit by hitting the Enter key. You may even supply the new value in the form of an arithmetic expression which darktable will calculate for you -- the previous value is referenced as “x”.\n"
msgstr ""
": ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດພິມຄ່າໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີບອດ ແລະ ຢືນຢັນໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Enter. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃສ່ຄ່າໃໝ່ໃນຮູບແບບ"
"ຂອງນິພົດທາງຄະນິດສາດ ເຊິ່ງ darktable ຈະຄິດໄລ່ໃຫ້ທ່ານ -- ໂດຍຄ່າກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈະຖືກອ້າງອີງເປັນ “x”.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": For most sliders, the minimum and maximum values displayed are known as \"soft limits\" -- they do not represent the minimum/maximum values that you may enter, merely a suggested range of \"normal\" values that most users will not need to exceed. As well as these soft limits, each slider also has \"hard limits\" which may not be exceeded.\n"
msgstr ": ສຳລັບແຖບເລື່ອນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດທີ່ສະແດງແມ່ນເອີ້ນວ່າ \"ຂີດຈຳກັດແບບອ່ອນ (soft limits)\" -- ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍເຖິງຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ/ສູງສຸດທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດປ້ອນໄດ້, ແຕ່ເປັນພຽງຊ່ວງແນະນຳຂອງຄ່າ \"ປົກກະຕິ\" ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເກີນ. ນອກຈາກຂີດຈຳກັດແບບອ່ອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ແຕ່ລະແຖບເລື່ອນຍັງມີ \"ຂີດຈຳກັດແບບແຂງ (hard limits)\" ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດເກີນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You may right-click and type any value up to the hard limits for a given slider. For example, in the [_rotate and perspective_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md) module, the soft limits for angle are -10 to +10 degrees while the hard limits are -180 to +180 degrees; In the [_exposure_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) module, the soft limits for the exposure slider are -3 to +4 EV while the hard limits are -18 to +18 EV. If you try to enter a value beyond the hard limit, it will be automatically be adjusted to the minimum/maximum allowable value.\n"
msgstr ": ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກຂວາ ແລະ ພິມຄ່າໃດໆກໍໄດ້ຈົນຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດແບບແຂງສຳລັບແຖບເລື່ອນນັ້ນໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນໂມດູນ [_rotate and perspective_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md), ຂີດຈຳກັດແບບອ່ອນສຳລັບມຸມແມ່ນ -10 ຫາ +10 ອົງສາ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຂີດຈຳກັດແບບແຂງແມ່ນ -180 ຫາ +180 ອົງສາ; ໃນໂມດູນ [_exposure_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md), ຂີດຈຳກັດແບບອ່ອນສຳລັບແຖບເລື່ອນການຮັບແສງແມ່ນ -3 ຫາ +4 EV ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຂີດຈຳກັດແບບແຂງແມ່ນ -18 ຫາ +18 EV. ຫາກທ່ານພະຍາຍາມປ້ອນຄ່າທີ່ເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດແບບແຂງ, ມັນຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດ/ສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"double-click (reset)\n"
": Double-click on a slider or its label to reset back to the default value. Ctrl+double-click to reset its value back to any auto-applied preset (if one applies for the current image). If controls are grouped together within a tabbed interface, you can double-click on the tab's header label to reset all settings in that tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"ດັບເບິນຄລິກ (ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນໃໝ່)\n"
": ດັບເບິນຄລິກທີ່ແຖບເລື່ອນ ຫຼື ປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງມັນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າກັບຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. Ctrl+ດັບເບິນຄລິກ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າກັບຄືນເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຖ້າມີການນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບພາບປັດຈຸບັນ). ຫາກການຄວບຄຸມຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມຮ່ວມກັນໃນຮູບແບບແທັບ (tab), ທ່ານສາມາດດັບເບິນຄລິກທີ່ປ້າຍຊື່ຫົວຂໍ້ແທັບເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດໃນແທັບນັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition, the speed of mouse-wheel, arrow-key and click+drag adjustments can be altered:\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຄວາມໄວຂອງການປັບດ້ວຍລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌, ປຸ່ມລູກສອນ ແລະ ການຄລິກ+ລາກ ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "hold down the Shift key while adjusting to _increase_ the step size by a factor of 10. \n"
msgstr "- ກົດປຸ່ມ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປັບ ເພື່ອ _ເພີ່ມ_ ຂະໜາດຂັ້ນຕອນຂຶ້ນ 10 ເທົ່າ. \n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "hold down the Ctrl key while adjusting to _decrease_ the step size by a factor of 10.\n"
msgstr "- ກົດປຸ່ມ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປັບ ເພື່ອ _ຫຼຸດ_ ຂະໜາດຂັ້ນຕອນລົງ 10 ເທົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Both of these multipliers can be amended in [preferences > shortcuts](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md) by altering the speed of the fallbacks/value actions.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວຄູນທັງສອງນີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຄີລັດ](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md) ໂດຍການປ່ຽນຄວາມໄວຂອງການຕອບສະໜອງ/ການດຳເນີນການຄ່າ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "comboboxes"
msgstr "ກ່ອງລາຍການ (comboboxes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on a combobox to show a list of available options which you can click to select. Occasionally the selection list will open close to the bottom or top of the screen meaning that only some of the items are visible -- simply scroll with your mouse wheel to bring up the full list. Alternatively, you can also use the mouse wheel and keyboard arrow keys to select an option, or start typing to filter the combobox entries.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ກ່ອງລາຍການເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກເພື່ອເລືອກໄດ້. ບາງຄັ້ງລາຍຊື່ຕົວເລືອກຈະເປີດໃກ້ກັບດ້ານລຸ່ມ ຫຼື ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະເຫັນພຽງບາງລາຍການເທົ່ານັ້ນ -- ໃຫ້ກິ້ງລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ທັງໝົດ. ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ ແລະ ປຸ່ມລູກສອນເທິງຄີບອດເພື່ອເລືອກຕົວເລືອກ, ຫຼື ເລີ່ມພິມເພື່ອຄັດກອງລາຍການໃນກ່ອງລາຍການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As with sliders, you can double-click the combobox or its label to reset back to the default value, or Ctrl+double-click to reset back to any auto-applied preset.\n"
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບແຖບເລື່ອນ, ທ່ານສາມາດດັບເບິນຄລິກທີ່ກ່ອງລາຍການ ຫຼື ປ້າຍຊື່ຂອງມັນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າກັບຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫຼື Ctrl+ດັບເບິນຄລິກ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າກັບຄືນເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Many modules allow parameters to be set using pickers (identified by the ![picker-icon](./module-controls/color-picker.png#icon) icon). Pickers allow you to select sample areas of the image from which to calculate values for module parameters. You can usually choose to select either a \"point\" (a single pixel) or an \"area\" (a rectangular selection of pixels) from the image, although some modules only allow one mode to be used.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍໂມດູນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມີຕຣິກໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກຕົວຢ່າງ (ເຄື່ອງໝາຍດ້ວຍໄອຄອນ ![picker-icon](./module-controls/color-picker.png#icon)). ຕົວເລືອກຕົວຢ່າງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຮູບພາບເພື່ອຄຳນວນຄ່າສຳລັບພາຣາມີຕຣິກຂອງໂມດູນ. ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ທັງແບບ \"ຈຸດ\" (ພິກເຊວດຽວ) ຫຼື \"ພື້ນທີ່\" (ການເລືອກພິກເຊວແບບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ) ຈາກຮູບພາບ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າບາງໂມດູນຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງໂໝດດຽວກໍຕາມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Selecting pixel(s) will cause the appropriate module value(s) to be updated, and may also cause additional visual feedback (for example, overlaying the range of selected pixels on a tone curve).\n"
msgstr "ການເລືອກພິກເຊວຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຖືກອັບເດດ, ແລະ ອາດຈະສະແດງການຕອບສະໜອງທາງສາຍຕາເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການວາງທັບຊ່ວງຂອງພິກເຊວທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ເທິງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate point mode by left-clicking the picker icon and then left-click anywhere on the image to select the pixel from which to calculate values. The selected point will be shown on-screen (with a cross icon) which you can adjust by left-clicking another pixel. Deactivate the picker by left-clicking the picker icon again.\n"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດຈຸດໂດຍການຄລິກຊ້າຍທີ່ໄອຄອນຕົວເລືອກຕົວຢ່າງ ແລ້ວຄລິກຊ້າຍບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ເທິງຮູບພາບເພື່ອເລືອກພິກເຊວທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳນວນຄ່າ. ຈຸດທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງເທິງໜ້າຈໍ (ດ້ວຍໄອຄອນຮູບກາກບາດ) ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຊ້າຍໃສ່ພິກເຊວອື່ນ. ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕົວເລືອກຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍການຄລິກຊ້າຍທີ່ໄອຄອນອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate area mode by either right-clicking or Ctrl+clicking the picker icon and then left-click and drag to select a rectangular area of the image from which to calculate values. The selected area will be shown on-screen as an overlaid rectangle which can be moved by either drawing another rectangle elsewhere or by left-clicking and dragging the corners of the drawn rectangle. Reset the rectangle (to select the whole image) by right-clicking anywhere on the image. Deactivate the picker by right-clicking (or Ctrl+clicking) the picker icon again.\n"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດພື້ນທີ່ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາ ຫຼື Ctrl+ຄລິກ ທີ່ໄອຄອນຕົວເລືອກຕົວຢ່າງ ແລ້ວຄລິກຊ້າຍ ແລະ ລາກເພື່ອເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄຳນວນຄ່າ. ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງເທິງໜ້າຈໍເປັນຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມວາງທັບ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຍ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍການແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມໃໝ່ຢູ່ບ່ອນອື່ນ ຫຼື ໂດຍການຄລິກຊ້າຍ ແລະ ລາກມຸມຂອງຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມທີ່ແຕ້ມໄວ້. ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຄືນໃໝ່ (ເພື່ອເລືອກທັງຮູບພາບ) ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ເທິງຮູບພາບ. ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕົວເລືອກຕົວຢ່າງໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາ (ຫຼື Ctrl+ຄລິກ) ທີ່ໄອຄອນອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In modules where only one mode is available, left-clicking the icon will usually toggle that mode on and off.\n"
msgstr "ໃນໂມດູນທີ່ມີພຽງໂໝດດຽວ, ການຄລິກຊ້າຍທີ່ໄອຄອນປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເປັນການເປີດ ແລະ ປິດໂໝດນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In modules where both modes are available, Ctrl+clicking anywhere on the image will switch modes.\n"
msgstr "ໃນໂມດູນທີ່ມີທັງສອງໂໝດ, ການ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ເທິງຮູບພາບຈະເປັນການສະຫຼັບໂໝດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Module parameters can also be adjusted using keyboard shortcuts. See [preferences > shortcuts](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md) for more information.\n"
msgstr "ພາຣາມີຕຣິກຂອງໂມດູນຍັງສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີລັດ. ເບິ່ງ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຄີລັດ](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "multiple instances"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (multiple instances)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Many of darktable's modules can be applied more than once in the pixelpipe. Each instance of a module behaves independently, taking its input from the module below it in the pixelpipe and delivering its output to the next module.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍໂມດູນຂອງ darktable ສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌. ແຕ່ລະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງໂມດູນຈະເຮັດວຽກເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ, ໂດຍຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າຈາກໂມດູນທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມມັນໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ ແລະ ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂາອອກໄປຫາໂມດູນຖັດໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As with the base instance of a module, all instances can be moved independently within the pixelpipe either by holding Ctrl+Shift while dragging & dropping or by choosing \"move up\" or \"move down\" in the _multiple instances_ drop-down menu.\n"
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ພື້ນຖານຂອງໂມດູນ, ທຸກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ສາມາດຍ້າຍໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະພາຍໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌ ໂດຍການກົດ Ctrl+Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ຫຼື ໂດຍການເລືອກ \"ຍ້າຍຂຶ້ນ (move up)\" ຫຼື \"ຍ້າຍລົງ (move down)\" ໃນເມນູແບບເລື່ອນລົງຂອງ _ຫຼາຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instances can be renamed by Ctrl+clicking on the module name.\n"
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ໄດ້ໂດຍການ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ທີ່ຊື່ໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are many occasions where it makes sense to have a module apply more than once in the pixelpipe. Here are some typical use cases.\n"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍກໍລະນີທີ່ສົມຄວນຈະໃຫ້ໂມດູນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງຄັ້ງໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌. ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງຕົວຢ່າງການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: ' - '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [_exposure_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) module can be used in combination with [masks](../masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md) to lighten or darken parts of an image. A separate instance may be created to modify each masked region of the image.\n"
msgstr "- ໂມດູນ [_exposure_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md) ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [ມາດສະກ (masks)](../masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md) ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ມືດລົງ. ສາມາດສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກມາດສະກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You may wish to handle luma and chroma noise independently. This can be accomplished by generating two instances of your chosen denoising module and using the first one only on luma (by selecting [blend mode](../masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md) “lightness”) and the second one only on chroma (by selecting blend mode “color”).\n"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການຈັດການກັບສິ່ງລົບກວນ (noise) ຂອງ luma ແລະ chroma ແຍກກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້"
"ໂດຍການສ້າງສອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instances) ຂອງໂມດູນຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນທີ່ເລືອກ ແລະ ໃຊ້ອັນທຳອິດສະເພາະກັບ "
"luma (ໂດຍເລືອກ [ໂໝດການປະສົມ](../masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md) ເປັນ “"
"lightness”) ແລະ ອັນທີສອງສະເພາະກັບ chroma (ໂດຍເລືອກໂໝດການປະສົມເປັນ “color”).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Each instance also adds to the workload of your pixelpipe. Generating too many instances – especially of the more demanding modules – will cause noticeable slow-down.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ແຕ່ລະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຈະເພີ່ມພາລະການເຮັດວຽກໃຫ້ກັບ pixelpipe ຂອງທ່ານ. ການສ້າງອິນສະແຕ"
"ນຊ໌ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ – ໂດຍສະເພາະໂມດູນທີ່ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນສູງ – ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງຊ້າລົງຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "managing multiple instances"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຫຼາຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the _multiple instance menu_ in the [module header](./module-header.md) to display a menu with the following options. Right-click on the menu icon to create a new instance directly (same action as clicking on the \"new instance\" option of the menu).\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ _ເມນູຫຼາຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌_ ໃນ [ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນ](./module-header.md) ເພື່ອສະແດງເມນູທີ່ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໄອຄອນເມນູເພື່ອສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ໂດຍກົງ (ການກະທຳດຽວກັບການຄລິກຕົວເລືອກ \"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ (new instance)\" ຂອງເມນູ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"new instance\n"
": Create a new instance of the current module with all of its parameters reset to their default values. The 'instance name' is automatically set to a unique integer so that it can be distinguished from its parent.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ (new instance)\n"
": ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງໂມດູນປັດຈຸບັນ ໂດຍໃຫ້ພາຣາມີຕຣິກທັງໝົດຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. 'ຊື່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌' ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຕົວເລກທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດແຍກອອກຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຫຼັກໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"duplicate instance\n"
": Create a new instance of the current module with all of its parameters inherited from the current instance. As with 'new instance' the 'instance name' is automatically set to a unique integer.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (duplicate instance)\n"
": ສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງໂມດູນປັດຈຸບັນ ໂດຍໃຫ້ພາຣາມີຕຣິກທັງໝົດສືບທອດມາຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ປັດຈຸບັນ. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ 'ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່', 'ຊື່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌' ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຕົວເລກທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"move up/down\n"
": Move the instance up or down in the pixelpipe\n"
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ (move up/down)\n"
": ຍ້າຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ລົງໃນພິກເຊວໄປຣ໌\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"delete\n"
": Remove the current instance. This option is not available if only one instance is present.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລຶບ (delete)\n"
": ລຶບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ປັດຈຸບັນອອກ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຫາກມີພຽງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ດຽວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rename\n"
": Rename the current instance. See the [history stack](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md) section for more details on how the instance name impacts copying and pasting history stacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຊື່ (rename)\n"
": ປ່ຽນຊື່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ປັດຈຸບັນ. ເບິ່ງພາກສ່ວນ [ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ (history stack)](../../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຜົນກະທົບຂອງຊື່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຕໍ່ການສຳເນົາ ແລະ ວາງລຳດັບປະຫວັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Presets allow you to store commonly-used module settings for future use. Some modules already come with pre-defined (internal) presets and you may also define your own (user-defined). Both internal and user-defined presets can be shown by clicking the _presets menu_ in the [module header](./module-header.md).\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆໄວ້ໃຊ້ໃນອະນາຄົດ. ບາງໂມດູນມີຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (ພາຍໃນ) ມາໃຫ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຂອງທ່ານເອງ (ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດ) ໄດ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ. ທັງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ພາຍໃນ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດ ສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ _ເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ_ ໃນ [ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນ](./module-header.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most of the functionality described here applies to processing modules only. However, presets can also be used with some utility modules. When used with utility modules, the functionality to auto-apply or auto-show presets based on image Exif data is not available.\n"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ອະທິບາຍຢູ່ນີ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ກັບໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບໂມດູນອັດຖະປະໂຫຍດບາງຢ່າງໄດ້. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບໂມດູນອັດຖະປະໂຫຍດ, ຟັງຊັນການນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື ການສະແດງຄ່າອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງຮູບພາບຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please note that, for processing modules, the saved preset also includes the active state of the module. You can use this to create your own default settings, which you can activate on-demand. Simply set your desired defaults, disable the module, and save the preset.\n"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາໝາຍເຫດວ່າ, ສຳລັບໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ, ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຍັງລວມເຖິງສະຖານະການເປີດໃຊ້ງານຂອງໂມດູນນັ້ນນຳ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງທ່ານເອງ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການ. ພຽງແຕ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ປິດການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ, ແລ້ວບັນທຶກເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to the individual modules preset menu presets can be managed at [preferences > presets](../../preferences-settings/presets.md).\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຂອງແຕ່ລະໂມດູນແລ້ວ, ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຍັງສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ທີ່ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ](../../preferences-settings/presets.md).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the presets menu"
msgstr "ເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The presets menu will contain one or more of the following entries depending on the presets that are defined or selected for the current module:\n"
msgstr "ເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ ຂຶ້ນກັບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດ ຫຼື ເລືອກໄວ້ສຳລັບໂມດູນປັດຈຸບັນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preset list\n"
": A list of the presets available for the current module. The currently selected preset (if any) is shown in **bold** and with a small check mark beside it. In addition, if the selected preset displays on a submenu, it parent entry is also highlighted in **bold**.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍຊື່ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ\n"
": ລາຍຊື່ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂມດູນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ (ຖ້າມີ) ຈະສະແດງເປັນຕົວ **ໜາ** ແລະ ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກນ້ອຍໆຢູ່ຂ້າງໆ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຫາກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ເລືອກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນເມນູຍ່ອຍ, ລາຍການຫຼັກຂອງມັນກໍຈະຖືກເນັ້ນເປັນຕົວ **ໜາ** ເຊັ່ນກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"edit this preset\n"
": If a preset has been selected, edit the selected preset (see below).\n"
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນນີ້\n"
": ຫາກມີການເລືອກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"delete this preset\n"
": If a preset has been selected, delete the selected preset.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລຶບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນນີ້\n"
": ຫາກມີການເລືອກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ລຶບຄ່າທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"update preset \\[name\\]\n"
": Update the named preset to match the module's current parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ \\[ຊື່\\]\n"
": ອັບເດດຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ລະບຸຊື່ ໃຫ້ກົງກັບພາຣາມີຕຣິກປັດຈຸບັນຂອງໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"store new preset\n"
": Create a new preset using the module's current parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນໃໝ່\n"
": ສ້າງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ພາຣາມີຕຣິກປັດຈຸບັນຂອງໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on a preset name to apply the preset to the current instance of the module. Long-left-click on a preset name to apply the preset but keep the preset list open (so that you can experiment with multiple presets without needing to re-open the menu). Right-click on a preset name to create a new instance of the module and apply the selected preset to it. You can also apply a preset at any time while you are in the darkroom using a keyboard shortcut -- if you have assigned one (see [preferences > shortcuts](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)).\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນເພື່ອຳໃຊ້ມັນກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງໂມດູນ. ຄລິກຊ້າຍຄ້າງໄວ້ທີ່ຊື່ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນເພື່ອຳໃຊ້ແຕ່ຍັງເປີດລາຍຊື່ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຢູ່ (ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດທົດລອງໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເປີດເມນູໃໝ່). ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ຊື່ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນເພື່ອສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງໂມດູນ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນກັບມັນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນໄດ້ທຸກເວລາໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຫ້ອງມືດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີລັດ -- ຫາກທ່ານໄດ້ກຳນົດໄວ້ (ເບິ່ງ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຄີລັດ](../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "creating and editing presets"
msgstr "ການສ້າງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When creating or editing presets, the following dialog is shown:\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ, ໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![new preset](./presets/new_preset.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![new preset](./presets/new_preset.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"name\n"
": The name of the preset. You can create a hierarchy of presets with shared categories by inserting vertical bar characters (\"|\") in the name. For example, \"Nikon|24-70mm, F2.8\" would be displayed as the category \"Nikon\" with a submenu containing \"24-70mm, F2.8\" as well as any other presets whose names start with \"Nikon|\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່\n"
": ຊື່ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ. ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງລຳດັບຊັ້ນຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ມີໝວດໝູ່ຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ໂດຍການໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂີດຕັ້ງ (\"|\") ໃນຊື່. ຕົວຢ່າງ: \"Nikon|24-70mm, F2.8\" ຈະສະແດງເປັນໝວດໝູ່ \"Nikon\" ພ້ອມກັບເມນູຍ່ອຍທີ່ມີ \"24-70mm, F2.8\" ລວມທັງຄ່າອື່ນໆທີ່ມີຊື່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ \"Nikon|\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": A searchable description for the preset (optional)\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ (ທາງເລືອກ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"reset all module parameters to their default values\n"
": Selecting this option will cause all module parameters to be reset to their default values (as if you had simply enabled the module on a new image or clicked the module reset button). This can be used to automatically set certain modules (color calibration, exposure, filmic) based on the Exif properties of the current image rather than setting to hard-coded parameters. Note that this option is not available when editing presets from the [preferences > presets](../../preferences-settings/presets.md) tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມີຕຣິກທັງໝົດຂອງໂມດູນຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
": ການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາຣາມີຕຣິກທັງໝົດຂອງໂມດູນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ຄືກັບວ່າທ່ານຫາກໍ່ເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນກັບຮູບພາບໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນໃໝ່ຂອງໂມດູນ). ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າບາງໂມດູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (color calibration, exposure, filmic) ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄຸນສົມບັດ Exif ຂອງຮູບພາບປັດຈຸບັນ ແທນທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງເປັນພາຣາມີຕຣິກທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ຕາຍຕົວ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຈາກແທັບ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ](../../preferences-settings/presets.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"auto apply this preset to matching images _(processing modules only)_\n"
": Check this box to automatically apply this preset to matching images when they are opened in the darkroom for the first time (you can reapply such automatic presets by Ctrl+clicking on the _reset_ button in the [module header](./module-header.md)). Additional controls will appear to allow you to define which images the preset will be applied to based on image Exif data (see below).\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ກົງກັນ _(ສະເພາະໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ)_\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອຳໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ກົງກັນ ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກເປີດໃນຫ້ອງມືດເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ (ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າອັດຕະໂນມັດດັ່ງກ່າວຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍການ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ທີ່ປຸ່ມ _ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນໃໝ່ (reset)_ ໃນ [ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນ](./module-header.md)). ຈະມີການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມປະກົດຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດວ່າຮູບພາບໃດທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງຮູບພາບ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": For example, if you want a preset to be applied to all images from a specific camera leave all fields at default values except for \"model\". Leave all fields unchanged to auto-apply a preset to all images.\n"
msgstr ": ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນກັບທຸກຮູບພາບຈາກກ້ອງສະເພາະລຸ້ນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ປະທຸກຊ່ອງໄວ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຍົກເວັ້ນຊ່ອງ \"model (ລຸ້ນກ້ອງ)\". ຫາກປະທຸກຊ່ອງໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ ຈະເປັນການນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນກັບທຸກຮູບພາບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The example dialog above sets up following rules: if the lens name matches, the aperture is greater than or equal to f/8 and the focal length is between 24 and 35mm the preset will be automatically applied.\n"
msgstr ": ຕົວຢ່າງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບຂ້າງເທິງຈະຕັ້ງກົດເກນດັ່ງນີ້: ຫາກຊື່ເລນກົງກັນ, ຄ່າຮູຮັບແສງ (aperture) ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ f/8 ແລະ ໄລຍະໂຟກັດ (focal length) ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 24 ຫາ 35mm, ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": _The [image information](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md) module displays the camera model and lens name for each image. Use this to ensure you have the correct spelling._\n"
msgstr ": _ໂມດູນ [ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ (image information)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md) ຈະສະແດງລຸ້ນກ້ອງ ແລະ ຊື່ເລນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຮູບພາບ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານພິມຕົວສະກົດໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If there is more than one preset with matching parameters for a given image, darktable creates a separate module instance for each matching preset, in the order they were defined -- the last preset that was created will be placed after all other instances of the module in the pipeline.\n"
msgstr ": ຫາກມີຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງອັນທີ່ມີພາຣາມີຕຣິກກົງກັບຮູບພາບນັ້ນໆ, darktable ຈະສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງໂມດູນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັນ, ຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ -- ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນອັນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ຫຼັງຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ອື່ນໆທັງໝົດຂອງໂມດູນນັ້ນໃນທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນ (pipeline).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"only show this preset for matching images _(processing modules only)_\n"
": Check this box to automatically show the preset in the preset menu, using the same set of filters.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນນີ້ສະເພາະກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ _(ສະເພາະໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ)_\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະແດງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນໃນເມນູໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊຸດການຄັດກອງດຽວກັນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "filter criteria"
msgstr "ເກນການຄັດກອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following criteria can be used to auto-apply or auto-show presets for processing modules:\n"
msgstr "ເກນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບໃຊ້ ຫຼື ສະແດງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets) ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"model\n"
": A pattern to be matched against the Exif field that describes your camera model; use % as wildcard.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮຸ່ນ (model)\n"
": ຮູບແບບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ທຽບກັບຟິລ Exif ທີ່ອະທິບາຍຮຸ່ນກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານ; ໃຊ້ % ເປັນຕົວແທນ (wildcard).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"maker\n"
": A pattern to be matched against the Exif field that describes the maker of your camera; use % as wildcard.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ຜະລິດ (maker)\n"
": ຮູບແບບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ທຽບກັບຟິລ Exif ທີ່ອະທິບາຍຜູ້ຜະລິດກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານ; ໃຊ້ % ເປັນຕົວແທນ (wildcard).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lens\n"
": A pattern to be matched against the Exif field that describes your lens; use % as wildcard.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລນ (lens)\n"
": ຮູບແບບທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ທຽບກັບຟິລ Exif ທີ່ອະທິບາຍເລນຂອງທ່ານ; ໃຊ້ % ເປັນຕົວແທນ (wildcard).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ISO\n"
": Only apply the preset if the ISO value of your image lies within the given range (shows ∞ if the upper range is unlimited).\n"
msgstr ""
"ISO\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (preset) ຖ້າຫາກຄ່າ ISO ຂອງຮູບພາບຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດທີ່ກຳນົດ (ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ ∞ "
"ຖ້າຂອບເຂດດ້ານເທິງບໍ່ຈຳກັດ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exposure\n"
": Only apply the preset if the exposure time of your image lies within the given range; set + as the upper value to match arbitrarily long exposures.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຮັບແສງ (exposure)\n"
": ປັບໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເວລາການຮັບແສງຂອງຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດ; ຕັ້ງຄ່າ + ເປັນຄ່າສູງສຸດເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບການຮັບແສງທີ່ຍາວນານແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"aperture\n"
": Only apply the preset if the aperture of your image lies within the given range; set f/0 as the lower value to match arbitrarily open apertures; set f/+ as the upper value to match arbitrarily closed apertures.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູຮັບແສງ (aperture)\n"
": ປັບໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຮູຮັບແສງຂອງຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດ; ຕັ້ງຄ່າ f/0 ເປັນຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຮູຮັບແສງທີ່ເປີດກວ້າງແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ; ຕັ້ງຄ່າ f/+ ເປັນຄ່າສູງສຸດເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບຮູຮັບແສງທີ່ແຄບແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"focal length\n"
": Only apply the preset if the focal length of your image lies within the given range (from 0 to 1000).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະໂຟກັດ (focal length)\n"
": ປັບໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອໄລຍະໂຟກັດຂອງຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດ (ຕັ້ງແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 1000).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"format\n"
": Only apply the preset to certain types of image. Check boxes to include files matching these criteria; uncheck boxes to exclude those files. Choose from \"raw\", \"non-raw\", \"HDR\", \"monochrome\" and \"color\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບ (format)\n"
": ປັບໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນກັບບາງປະເພດຂອງຮູບພາບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງເພື່ອລວມໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກົງກັບເກນເຫຼົ່ານີ້; ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍຕິກເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ເລືອກຈາກ \"raw\", \"non-raw\", \"HDR\", \"monochrome\" ແລະ \"color\".\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "managing presets"
msgstr "ການຈັດການຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Both user-defined and internal presets can be viewed and managed from within [preferences > presets](../../../preferences-settings/presets.md).\n"
msgstr "ທັງຄ່າທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນພາຍໃນ ສາມາດເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການໄດ້ຈາກພາຍໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ](../../../preferences-settings/presets.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** If you create a user-defined preset with the same name as a built-in preset, your preset will override the built-in version, which will no longer be accessible.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ຖ້າທ່ານສ້າງຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດເອງທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງມາຈາກໂຮງງານ, ຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຈະຂຽນທັບເວີຊັນທີ່ຕັ້ງມາຈາກໂຮງງານ, ເຊິ່ງຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ອີກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you delete a preset that has the same name as one of the built-in presets, then your user preset will be deleted, and that preset name will no longer appear in the preset menu at all. The next time you start darktable, the corresponding built-in preset will once again become visible.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານລຶບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນກັບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງມາຈາກໂຮງງານ, ຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດເອງຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ, ແລະ ຊື່ນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ປາກົດໃນເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນເລີຍ. ໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ທ່ານເປີດ darktable, ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງມາຈາກໂຮງງານທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະປາກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module naming in the darkroom view"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຊື່ໂມດູນໃນມຸມເບິ່ງຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, if the current parameters of a processing module match those of a saved preset, darktable will attempt to automatically set the name (label) of the module in question, as follows:\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຖ້າພາລາມີເຕີປັດຈຸບັນຂອງໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນກົງກັບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້, darktable ຈະພະຍາຍາມຕັ້ງຊື່ (ປ້າຍຊື່) ຂອງໂມດູນນັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the user has manually amended the name of the module in the current image, the module name will be left unchanged,\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ໂມດູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນຮູບພາບປັດຈຸບັນ, ຊື່ໂມດູນຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the module instance from which the preset was created had a manually-set name, any subsequent module that matches this preset will automatically be given the same name. Note that if this was unintentional, the only way to revert will be to drop and recreate the preset, since the automatic name is a hidden field in the database,\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າໂມດູນຕົ້ນແບບທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນມີຊື່ທີ່ຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ໂມດູນໃດໆຕໍ່ມາທີ່ກົງກັບຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ດຽວກັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຖ້າຫາກເປັນຄວາມຜິດພາດ, ວິທີດຽວທີ່ຈະກັບຄືນໄດ້ຄືການລຶບ ແລະ ສ້າງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນໃໝ່, ເນື່ອງຈາກຊື່ອັດຕະໂນມັດເປັນຟິລທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the module instance from which the preset was created did not have a manually-set name, the name of any subsequent module that matches this preset will be set to the same as the preset name.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າໂມດູນຕົ້ນແບບທີ່ໃຊ້ສ້າງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນບໍ່ມີຊື່ທີ່ຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ຊື່ຂອງໂມດູນໃດໆຕໍ່ມາທີ່ກົງກັບຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຕາມຊື່ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As soon as the module parameters are changed such that it no longer matches a preset, the module's name will be reset.\n"
msgstr "ທັນທີທີ່ພາລາມີເຕີຂອງໂມດູນຖືກປ່ຽນແປງຈົນບໍ່ກົງກັບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ຊື່ຂອງໂມດູນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This functionality can be disabled in [preferences > darkroom > automatically update module name](../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md#modules).\n"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນນີ້ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຫ້ອງມືດ > ອັບເດດຊື່ໂມດູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ](../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md#modules).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module header"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At the top of each processing module is the _module header_. \n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງແຕ່ລະໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນແມ່ນ _ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນ_. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![module header](./module-header/module-header.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![module header](./module-header/module-header.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the module name to expand the module and display the parameters that control its operation.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ໂມດູນເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍໂມດູນ ແລະ ສະແດງພາຣາມີຕຣິກທີ່ຄວບຄຸມການເຮັດວຽກຂອງມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default darktable will only allow one processing module to be expanded at a time -- if you click the header of another module, the previously-opened module's controls are collapsed. If you want to expand more than one module, you may expand further modules by Shift+clicking on the header and all previously expanded modules will remain open. This behaviour can be reversed via a setting in [preferences > darkroom](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md).\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, darktable ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນໄດ້ພຽງເທື່ອລະອັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ -- ຫາກທ່ານຄລິກທີ່ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນອື່ນ, ການຄວບຄຸມຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ເປີດກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈະຖືກຫຍໍ້ລົງ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການຂະຫຍາຍຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງໂມດູນ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍໂມດູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໂດຍການ Shift+ຄລິກ ທີ່ສ່ວນຫົວ ແລະ ທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈະຍັງຄົງເປີດຢູ່. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຫ້ອງມືດ](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Expanding a module does not cause it to be activated. See below for how to activate modules.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ການຂະຫຍາຍໂມດູນບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ. ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມສຳລັບວິທີການເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The module header contains the following controls in order from left to right:\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນປະກອບດ້ວຍການຄວບຄຸມດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ຕາມລຳດັບຈາກຊ້າຍຫາຂວາ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"on/off button\n"
": Click to toggle the module on or off. Some modules are essential for image processing and cannot be disabled (though their parameters may be amended). Similarly, some modules are not applicable for certain types of image and cannot be enabled.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ ເປີດ/ປິດ\n"
": ຄລິກເພື່ອສະຫຼັບການເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ. ບາງໂມດູນມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະສາມາດແກ້ໄຂພາຣາມີຕຣິກຂອງພວກມັນໄດ້ກໍຕາມ). ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ບາງໂມດູນບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບຮູບພາບ ບາງປະເພດ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Ctrl+click on the on/off button to toggle whether the module has focus. The focus state is usually used to activate any overlays that a module places over the image to control its functionality. For example, the [_crop_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md) module only shows the composition and crop guide lines on the image if it has focus. Modules are automatically given focus when expanded.\n"
msgstr ": Ctrl+ຄລິກ ທີ່ປຸ່ມ ເປີດ/ປິດ ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບວ່າໂມດູນນັ້ນຖືກເລືອກ (focus) ຢູ່ຫຼືບໍ່. ສະຖານະການເລືອກມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດການວາງທັບ (overlays) ທີ່ໂມດູນວາງໄວ້ເທິງຮູບພາບເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຟັງຊັນຂອງມັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂມດູນ [_crop_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md) ຈະສະແດງເສັ້ນແນະນຳການຈັດອົງປະກອບ ແລະ ການຕັດຂອບເທິງຮູບພາບກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນຖືກເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໂມດູນຈະຖືກເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຖືກຂະຫຍາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"module name\n"
": The module name consists of a description of the module's operation (which cannot be changed) followed by the module's instance name (which can). By default the first instance of a module has an empty instance name. If you create additional instances, the name of each new instance is initiated with a unique integer. For example, the second created instance of an exposure module will be automatically named `exposure 1`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໂມດູນ\n"
": ຊື່ໂມດູນປະກອບດ້ວຍຄຳອະທິບາຍການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂມດູນ (ເຊິ່ງປ່ຽນແປງບໍ່ໄດ້) ຕາມດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance name) ຂອງໂມດູນ (ເຊິ່ງປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້). ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທຳອິດຂອງໂມດູນຈະບໍ່ມີຊື່. ຫາກທ່ານສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ຊື່ຂອງແຕ່ລະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍຕົວເລກທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີສອງທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຂອງໂມດູນ exposure ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຊື່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດວ່າ `exposure 1`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Ctrl+click on a module's name to manually amend its instance name. \n"
msgstr ": Ctrl+ຄລິກ ທີ່ຊື່ຂອງໂມດູນເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຊື່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mask toggle\n"
": This icon will appear in the header whenever a [mask](../masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md) is active on a module. Hover over the icon to see what type of mask is enabled. Click it to display the current mask as a yellow overlay over a black-and-white version of the image. Solid yellow indicates an opacity of 100%; a fully visible gray background image (without yellow overlay) indicates an opacity of 0%. This toggle button can be disabled in [preferences > darkroom > show mask indicator in module headers](../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md#modules). \n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບມາດສະກ\n"
": ໄອຄອນນີ້ຈະປະກົດໃນສ່ວນຫົວເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ມີ [ມາດສະກ (mask)](../masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md) ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ກັບໂມດູນ. ວາງເມົາສ໌ເທິງໄອຄອນເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າແມ່ນມາດສະກປະເພດໃດທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່. ຄລິກມັນເພື່ອສະແດງມາດສະກປັດຈຸບັນເປັນສີເຫຼືອງວາງທັບເທິງຮູບພາບເວີຊັນຂາວດຳ. ສີເຫຼືອງທຶບສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ 100%; ຮູບພາບພື້ນຫຼັງສີເທົາທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີສີເຫຼືອງວາງທັບ) ສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ 0%. ປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບນີ້ສາມາດປິດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຫ້ອງມືດ > ສະແດງຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ມາດສະກໃນສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນ](../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md#modules). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"multiple instance menu\n"
": This menu allows you to create, delete, move and rename module instances. Right-click on this icon to directly create a new instance of the module. See the [multiple instances](./multiple-instances.md) section for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມນູຫຼາຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌\n"
": ເມນູນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງ, ລຶບ, ຍ້າຍ ແລະ ປ່ຽນຊື່ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງໂມດູນ. ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໄອຄອນນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ຂອງໂມດູນໂດຍກົງ. ເບິ່ງພາກສ່ວນ [ຫຼາຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (multiple instances)](./multiple-instances.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"reset\n"
": Click to reset all module controls to their default values. Ctrl+click to reapply any automatic [presets](./presets.md) for the module -- if no automatic presets are applicable for this module, Ctrl+click will simply reset to default values (same as click).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນໃໝ່\n"
": ຄລິກເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄວບຄຸມທັງໝົດຂອງໂມດູນຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. Ctrl+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ [ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets)](./presets.md) ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດຄືນໃໝ່ສຳລັບໂມດູນ -- ຫາກບໍ່ມີຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບໂມດູນນີ້, ການ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ຈະເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ຄືກັບການຄລິກປົກກະຕິ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"presets menu\n"
": This menu allows you to apply, create and edit module presets. See the [presets](./presets.md) section for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ\n"
": ເມນູນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານນຳໃຊ້, ສ້າງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນຂອງໂມດູນ. ເບິ່ງພາກສ່ວນ [ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets)](./presets.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The visibility of the four icons to the right of the module name can be controlled in [preferences > darkroom > show right-side buttons in processing module headers](../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md#modules).\n"
msgstr "ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງໄອຄອນທັງສີ່ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງຊື່ໂມດູນສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ຫ້ອງມືດ > ສະແດງປຸ່ມດ້ານຂວາມືໃນສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ](../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md#modules).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "curves"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (curves)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [base curve](../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md), [tone curve](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md) and [rgb curve](../../module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md) modules use curves to control the tones in the image. These modules have some common features that warrant separate discussion.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [base curve](../../module-reference/processing-modules/base-curve.md), [tone curve](../../module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md) ແລະ [rgb curve](../../module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md) ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມໂທນສີໃນຮູບພາບ. ໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຮ່ວມກັນບາງຢ່າງທີ່ຄວນຈະສົນທະນາແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![curve](./curves/curve.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![curve](./curves/curve.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "nodes"
msgstr "ຈຸດ (nodes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In their default state, curves are straight lines, defined by two anchor nodes at the top-right and bottom-left of the graph. You can move the nodes to modify the curve or generate new nodes by clicking on the curve. Ctrl+click to generate a new node at the x-location of the mouse pointer and the corresponding y-location of the current curve -- this adds a node without the risk of accidentally modifying the curve. Up to 20 nodes can be defined per curve. To remove a node, click on it and drag it out of the widget area.\n"
msgstr "ໃນສະພາວະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່, ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຈຸດຍຶດສອງຈຸດທີ່ມຸມເທິງຂວາ ແລະ ລຸ່ມຊ້າຍຂອງກຣາບ. ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍຈຸດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອປັບປ່ຽນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ຫຼື ສ້າງຈຸດໃໝ່ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. Ctrl+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອສ້າງຈຸດໃໝ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງ x ຂອງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງ y ທີ່ກົງກັນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໃນປັດຈຸບັນ -- ນີ້ເປັນການເພີ່ມຈຸດໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ຈະໄປປ່ຽນແປງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂດຍບັງເອີນ. ສາມາດກຳນົດຈຸດໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 20 ຈຸດຕໍ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ເພື່ອລຶບຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ຈຸດນັ້ນແລ້ວລາກມັນອອກຈາກພື້ນທີ່ວິດເຈັດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "curve controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following controls are common to two or more of the above processing modules and are therefore discussed separately here. Please see the individual module documentation for discussion of any additional controls.\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນມີຢູ່ໃນສອງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນຂ້າງເທິງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຂໍສົນທະນາແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງແຕ່ລະໂມດູນສຳລັບການສົນທະນາກ່ຽວກັບການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"interpolation method \n"
": _tone curve and rgb curve only_\n"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການຊອກຫາຄ່າລະຫວ່າງຈຸດ (interpolation method) \n"
": _ສະເພາະ tone curve ແລະ rgb curve ເທົ່ານັ້ນ_\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Interpolation is the process by which a continuous curve is derived from a few nodes. As this process is never perfect, several methods are offered that can alleviate some of the issues you may encounter.\n"
msgstr ": Interpolation ແມ່ນຂະບວນການທີ່ສ້າງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງມາຈາກຈຸດ (nodes) ພຽງບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດຈຸດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກຂະບວນການນີ້ບໍ່ເຄີຍສົມບູນແບບ, ຈຶ່ງມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃຫ້ເລືອກເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນບັນຫາບາງຢ່າງທີ່ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _cubic spline_ is, arguably, the most visually pleasing. Since it gives smooth curves, the contrast in the image is better enhanced. However, this method is very sensitive to the nodes' position, and can produce cusps and oscillations when the nodes are too close to each other, or when there are too many of them. This method works best when there are only 4 to 5 nodes, evenly spaced.\n"
msgstr ": - _cubic spline_ ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ເບິ່ງແລ້ວສວຍງາມທີ່ສຸດ. ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນໃຫ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ລຽບນຽນ, ຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃນຮູບພາບຈຶ່ງຖືກປັບປຸງໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ວິທີນີ້ມີຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວຫຼາຍຕໍ່ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດ, ແລະ ອາດສ້າງຈຸດແຫຼມ ຫຼື ການແກວ່ງ (oscillations) ເມື່ອຈຸດຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນເກີນໄປ ຫຼື ມີຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອມີພຽງ 4 ຫາ 5 ຈຸດ ທີ່ມີໄລຍະຫ່າງເທົ່າໆກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _centripetal spline_ is designed specifically to avoid cusps and oscillations but, as a drawback, it will follow the nodes more loosely. It is very robust, no matter the number of nodes and their spacing, but will produce a more faded and dull contrast.\n"
msgstr ": - _centripetal spline_ ຖືກອອກແບບມາໂດຍສະເພາະເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຈຸດແຫຼມ ແລະ ການແກວ່ງ ແຕ່ຂໍ້ເສຍຄືມັນຈະຕິດຕາມຈຸດຕ່າງໆແບບຫຼົມໆກວ່າ. ມັນມີຄວາມທົນທານຫຼາຍ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະມີຈຸດຈຳນວນເທົ່າໃດ ຫຼື ໄລຍະຫ່າງເທົ່າໃດ, ແຕ່ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມຄົມຊັດທີ່ເບິ່ງຈືດຈາງກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _monotonic spline_ is designed specifically to give a monotonic interpolation, meaning that there will be none of the oscillations the cubic spline may produce. This method is most suitable when you are trying to build an analytical function from a node interpolation (for example: exponential, logarithm, power, etc.). Such functions are provided as presets. It is a good trade-off between the two aforementioned methods.\n"
msgstr ": - _monotonic spline_ ຖືກອອກແບບມາໂດຍສະເພາະເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການຊອກຫາຄ່າແບບທິດທາງດຽວ (monotonic), ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີການແກວ່ງຄືກັບທີ່ cubic spline ອາດຈະສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ວິທີນີ້ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອທ່ານພະຍາຍາມສ້າງຟັງຊັນທາງຄະນິດສາດຈາກການຊອກຫາຄ່າລະຫວ່າງຈຸດ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເອັກໂປເນນຊຽວ, ໂລກາຣິດ, ກຳລັງ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ). ຟັງຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃນຮູບແບບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ. ມັນເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີລະຫວ່າງສອງວິທີທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preserve colors\n"
": If a non-linear tone curve is applied to each of the RGB channels individually, then the amount of tone adjustment applied to each color channel may be different, and this can cause hue shifts. The _preserve colors_ combobox provides different methods of calculating the \"luminance level\" of a pixel in order to minimise these shifts. The amount of tone adjustment is calculated based on this luminance value, and then this same adjustment is applied to all three of the RGB channels. Different luminance estimators can affect the contrast in different parts of the image, depending on the characteristics of that image. The user can therefore choose the estimator that provides the best results for the given image. Some of these methods are discussed in detail in the **preserve chrominance** control in the [_filmic rgb_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) module. The following options are available:\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາສີ (preserve colors)\n"
": ຫາກມີການນຳໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີແບບບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ກັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງ RGB ແຍກກັນ, ປະລິມານການປັບໂທນທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ແລະ ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງເນື້ອສີ (hue shifts). ກ່ອງລາຍການ _ຮັກສາສີ_ ຈະມີວິທີການຕ່າງໆໃນການຄຳນວນ \"ລະດັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance level)\" ຂອງພິກເຊວ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການປ່ຽນແປງເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ປະລິມານການປັບໂທນຈະຖືກຄຳນວນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງນີ້, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງນຳໃຊ້ການປັບແບບດຽວກັນກັບທັງສາມຊ່ອງ RGB. ຕົວປະມານຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃນສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງຮູບພາບ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງຮູບພາບນັ້ນ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຶ່ງສາມາດເລືອກຕົວປະມານຄ່າທີ່ໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຮູບພາບນັ້ນໆ. ບາງວິທີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສົນທະນາຢ່າງລະອຽດໃນການຄວບຄຸມ **ຮັກສາຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ (preserve chrominance)** ໃນໂມດູນ [_filmic rgb_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md). ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - _none_\n"
": - _luminance_\n"
": - _max RGB_\n"
": - _average RGB_\n"
": - _sum RGB_\n"
": - _norm RGB_\n"
": - _basic power_\n"
msgstr ""
": - _none (ບໍ່ມີ)_\n"
": - _luminance (ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ)_\n"
": - _max RGB (ຄ່າ RGB ສູງສຸດ)_\n"
": - _average RGB (ຄ່າ RGB ສະເລ່ຍ)_\n"
": - _sum RGB (ຜົນຮວມ RGB)_\n"
": - _norm RGB (ຄ່ານອມ RGB)_\n"
": - _basic power (ກຳລັງພື້ນຖານ)_\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scale for graph \n"
": _tone curve and base curve only_\n"
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕາສ່ວນສຳລັບກຣາບ \n"
": _ສະເພາະ tone curve ແລະ base curve ເທົ່ານັ້ນ_\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The scale allows you to distort the graph display so that certain graphical properties emerge to help you draw more useful curves. Note that the scaling option only affects the curve display, not the actual parameters stored by the module.\n"
msgstr ": ມາດຕາສ່ວນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດບິດເບືອນການສະແດງຜົນຂອງກຣາບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດທາງກຣາບຟິກບາງຢ່າງປະກົດອອກມາ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານແຕ້ມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຕົວເລືອກການປັບມາດຕາສ່ວນມີຜົນສະເພາະຕໍ່ການສະແດງຜົນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີຜົນຕໍ່ພາຣາມີຕຣິກຕົວຈິງທີ່ບັນທຶກໂດຍໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": By default, a “linear” scale is used (scale factor 0), which uses evenly spaced horizontal and vertical axes. Positive values give the graph a logarithmic scale, compressing high values and dilating low values on both the horizontal and vertical axes, so that nodes in lowlights get more space on the graph and can be controlled more precisely.\n"
msgstr ""
": ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈະໃຊ້ສະເກລແບບ “linear” (ຄ່າ scale factor 0), ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ແກນນອນແລະແກນຕັ້ງທີ່ມີໄ"
"ລຍະຫ່າງເທົ່າກັນ. ຄ່າບວກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ກຣາບເປັນສະເກລແບບ logarithmic, ໂດຍການບີບຄ່າສູງແລະຂະຫຍາຍຄ່າ"
"ຕ່ຳທັງໃນແກນນອນແລະແກນຕັ້ງ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຈຸດ (nodes) ໃນສ່ວນມືດ (lowlights) ມີພື້ນທີ່ໃນກຣາບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລ"
"ະ ສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ລະອຽດກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Increasing the 'scale for graph' slider sets the base of the logarithm used to scale the axes. This allows you to control the amount of compression/dilation operated by the scale. If you draw purely exponential or logarithmic functions from identity lines, setting this value defines the base of such functions.\n"
msgstr ": ການເພີ່ມຄ່າແຖບເລື່ອນ 'ມາດຕາສ່ວນສຳລັບກຣາບ' ຈະເປັນການກຳນົດຖານຂອງໂລກາຣິດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການປັບມາດຕາສ່ວນຂອງແກນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄວບຄຸມປະລິມານການບີບອັດ/ການຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍມາດຕາສ່ວນ. ຫາກທ່ານແຕ້ມຟັງຊັນແບບເອັກໂປເນນຊຽວ ຫຼື ໂລກາຣິດບໍລິສຸດຈາກເສັ້ນເອກະລັກ (identity lines), ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນການກຳນົດຖານຂອງຟັງຊັນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "wavelets"
msgstr "ເວບເລັດ (wavelets)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wavelets are used to separate (or _decompose_) an image into a number of distinct _layers_, each containing a different level of detail. After decomposing an image in this way, a module can limit its processing to one or more of these detail layers, and then piece the layers back together again at the end to form its output. This allows us to be surgical about which features in the image we wish to impact when working with a module. \n"
msgstr "ເວບເລັດ (Wavelets) ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກ (ຫຼື _ຍ່ອຍສ່ວນປະກອບ_) ຮູບພາບອອກເປັນ _ຊັ້ນ_ (layers) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນຈະມີລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. ຫຼັງຈາກຍ່ອຍຮູບພາບໃນລັກສະນະນີ້ແລ້ວ, ໂມດູນສາມາດກຳນົດການປະມວນຜົນສະເພາະບາງຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງລວມຊັ້ນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນກັບຄືນເຂົ້າກັນໃນຕອນທ້າຍເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນຜົນຜະລິດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດເລືອກຈັດການກັບລັກສະນະສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງໃນຮູບພາບທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some of the operations that darktable can perform in this way are:\n"
msgstr "ບາງການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ darktable ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ຄື:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "noise removal (in the [_denoise (profiled)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md), [_raw denoise_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/raw-denoise.md) and [_contrast equalizer_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md) modules) \n"
msgstr "ການລົບສິ່ງລົບກວນ (ໃນໂມດູນ [_ລົບສິ່ງລົບກວນ (ຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md), [_ລົບສິ່ງລົບກວນ Raw_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/raw-denoise.md) ແລະ [_ຕົວປັບຄວາມຕ່າງລະດັບແສງ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md)) \n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "contrast adjustment (in the [_contrast equalizer_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md) module)\n"
msgstr "ການປັບຄວາມຕ່າງລະດັບແສງ (ໃນໂມດູນ [_ຕົວປັບຄວາມຕ່າງລະດັບແສງ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md))\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "blurring or removal of unwanted detail (in the [_retouch_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md) module)\n"
msgstr "ການເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວ ຫຼື ການລົບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ (ໃນໂມດູນ [_ຕົບແຕ່ງ (retouch)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md))\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "theory"
msgstr "ທິດສະດີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A wavelet is an oscillating mathematical function that starts and ends at zero. The following diagram shows some simple wavelets of differing sizes.\n"
msgstr "ເວບເລັດ (wavelet) ແມ່ນຟັງຊັນທາງຄະນິດສາດແບບແກ່ວງໄກ ທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດທີ່ສູນ. ແຜນວາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນບາງເວບເລັດແບບງ່າຍໆທີ່ມີຂະໜາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![wavelets-overview](./wavelets/wavelets-overview.png#w50) \n"
msgstr "![wavelets-overview](./wavelets/wavelets-overview.png#w50) \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These wavelet functions are used to scan and decompose an image using a mathematical operation called _convolution_. This picks out details from the image that are on a similar scale to the size of a given wavelet, and builds a number of these detail layers, each corresponding to a different wavelet scale.\n"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນເວບເລັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແກນ ແລະ ຍ່ອຍຮູບພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ການປະຕິບັດທາງຄະນິດສາດທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ _ຄອນໂວລູຊັນ (convolution)_. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເລືອກລາຍລະອຽດຈາກຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃກ້ຄຽງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງເວບເລັດທີ່ກຳນົດ, ແລະ ສ້າງຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຂຶ້ນມາ, ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນຈະກົງກັບຂະໜາດເວບເລັດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following is an example where detail layers have been extracted from the above image. In this case, the images were produced using the [_retouch_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md) module, splitting the image into 8 different layers, and using the module's \"display wavelet scale\" button to visualise each of the detail layers:\n"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດຖືກສະກັດອອກມາຈາກຮູບພາບຂ້າງເທິງ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ, ຮູບພາບຕ່າງໆຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ຕົບແຕ່ງ (retouch)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md), ໂດຍແຍກຮູບພາບອອກເປັນ 8 ຊັ້ນທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ \"ສະແດງສະເກລເວບເລັດ\" ຂອງໂມດູນເພື່ອເບິ່ງແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![wavelets-retouch-gui](./wavelets/clean-retouch.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![wavelets-retouch-gui](./wavelets/clean-retouch.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bars in the _wavelet decompose_ section indicate the layers that have been extracted at different wavelet scales. The darkest rectangle at the left represents the entire image (before decomposition) and the gray boxes each represent one of the decomposed layers. Clicking on the staircase icon below the bar graph enables the layer visualization overlay so that you can see what the currently selected layer looks like. \n"
msgstr "ແຖບໃນສ່ວນ _ຍ່ອຍເວບເລັດ (wavelet decompose)_ ບົ່ງບອກເຖິງຊັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສະກັດອອກມາໃນສະເກລເວບເລັດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ເຂັ້ມທີ່ສຸດຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍແມ່ນຕົວແທນຂອງຮູບພາບທັງໝົດ (ກ່ອນການຍ່ອຍ) ແລະ ກ່ອງສີເທົາແຕ່ລະກ່ອງແມ່ນຕົວແທນຂອງແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນທີ່ຖືກຍ່ອຍອອກມາ. ການຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນຮູບຂັ້ນໄດຢູ່ລຸ່ມກຣາບແຖບ ຈະເປີດການສະແດງຊັ້ນຊ້ອນກັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນວ່າຊັ້ນທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນນັ້ນມີລັກສະນະແນວໃດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Let's take a look at some of the layers generated for the above image.\n"
msgstr "ລອງມາເບິ່ງບາງຊັ້ນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຮູບພາບຂ້າງເທິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At scale #2, the image contains only very fine details, including the model's eyebrows, eye lashes and the pores of his skin. It doesn't include the coarser details of the image, because those details have been extracted to other layers:\n"
msgstr "ທີ່ສະເກລ #2, ຮູບພາບມີພຽງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດຫຼາຍ, ລວມທັງຂົນຄິ້ວ, ຂົນຕາ ແລະ ຮູຂຸມຂົນຂອງນາງແບບ/ນາຍແບບ. ມັນບໍ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຫຍາບກວ່າຂອງຮູບພາບ, ເພາະລາຍລະອຽດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກສະກັດອອກໄປໄວ້ໃນຊັ້ນອື່ນແລ້ວ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![wavelets-layer-scale-2](./wavelets/wavelets-layer-scale-2.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![wavelets-layer-scale-2](./wavelets/wavelets-layer-scale-2.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At scales #5 and #6 we begin to see larger and larger features:\n"
msgstr "ທີ່ສະເກລ #5 ແລະ #6 ພວກເຮົາເລີ່ມເຫັນລັກສະນະທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![wavelets-layer-scale-5](./wavelets/wavelets-layer-scale-5.png#w50) \n"
msgstr "![wavelets-layer-scale-5](./wavelets/wavelets-layer-scale-5.png#w50) \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![wavelets-layer-scale-6](./wavelets/wavelets-layer-scale-6.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![wavelets-layer-scale-6](./wavelets/wavelets-layer-scale-6.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By scale #8 we only see very high-level features such as the overall shape of the model's nose, eye and cheek:\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຮອດສະເກລ #8 ພວກເຮົາເຫັນພຽງແຕ່ລັກສະນະລະດັບສູງຫຼາຍ ເຊັ່ນ ຮູບຮ່າງໂດຍລວມຂອງດັງ, ຕາ ແລະ ແກ້ມຂອງນາຍແບບ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![wavelets-layer-scale-8](./wavelets/wavelets-layer-scale-8.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![wavelets-layer-scale-8](./wavelets/wavelets-layer-scale-8.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "why use wavelets?"
msgstr "ເປັນຫຍັງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເວບເລັດ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Suppose, in the above example, that we wanted to smooth out some of the blotchiness in the model's skin, without losing any of the underlying small-scale texture. Wavelet decomposition makes this a trivial operation - we can simply use the retouch module to apply a Gaussian blur to only the 'blotchy' detail layer(s), leaving all other layers untouched. Once the adjustment is complete, the retouch module simply recombines the adjusted layer with the remaining untouched layers to produce the final image.\n"
msgstr "ສົມມຸດວ່າ, ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອຍດ່າງເທິງຜິວໜັງຂອງນາຍແບບລຽບນຽນຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ສູນເສຍລວດລາຍຂະໜາດນ້ອຍຂອງຜິວ. ການຍ່ອຍເວບເລັດເຮັດໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນເລື່ອງງ່າຍ - ພວກເຮົາພຽງແຕ່ໃຊ້ໂມດູນຕົບແຕ່ງເພື່ອປັບຄວາມມົວແບບ Gaussian ສະເພາະຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ມີ 'ຮອຍດ່າງ', ໂດຍປ່ອຍໃຫ້ຊັ້ນອື່ນໆຄືເກົ່າ. ເມື່ອປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວ, ໂມດູນຕົບແຕ່ງຈະລວມຊັ້ນທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວເຂົ້າກັບຊັ້ນທີ່ເຫຼືອເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນຮູບພາບສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sequence of images below shows (1) The original image; (2) The layer (scale 5) that we wish to blur; and (3) The final image after the scale 5 layer has been blurred and the layers recombined:\n"
msgstr "ລຳດັບຮູບພາບຂ້າງລຸ່ມສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ (1) ຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ; (2) ຊັ້ນ (ສະເກລ 5) ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວ; ແລະ (3) ຮູບພາບສຸດທ້າຍຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຊັ້ນສະເກລ 5 ຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວ ແລະ ລວມຊັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![wavelets-original](./wavelets/wavelets-original.png#w50) \n"
msgstr "![wavelets-original](./wavelets/wavelets-original.png#w50) \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![wavelets-blur-layered](./wavelets/wavelets-blur-layered.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![wavelets-blur-layered](./wavelets/wavelets-blur-layered.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As you can see, the large-scale skin blotches have been removed, but the small-scale details remain untouched.\n"
msgstr "ດັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານເຫັນ, ຮອຍດ່າງຜິວຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຖືກລົບອອກແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ລາຍລະອຽດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍຍັງຄືເກົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "interacting with wavelet scales"
msgstr "ການພົວພັນກັບສະເກລເວບເລັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two methods by which processing modules allow you to modify their operation using wavelet scales.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມີສອງວິທີທີ່ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບແຕ່ງການເຮັດວຽກຂອງພວກມັນໂດຍໃຊ້ wavelet scales.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "wavelet decomposition"
msgstr "ການຍ່ອຍເວບເລັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As discussed above, the _retouch_ module allows you to choose how many detail levels to split your image into. It decomposes the image into separate layers and allows you to perform operations selectively on each individual layer or on the image as a whole:\n"
msgstr "ດັ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ, ໂມດູນ _ຕົບແຕ່ງ (retouch)_ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະແຍກລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຮູບພາບອອກເປັນຈັກຊັ້ນ. ມັນຈະຍ່ອຍຮູບພາບອອກເປັນຊັ້ນໆ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະກັບແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນ ຫຼື ກັບຮູບພາບທັງໝົດ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [_retouch_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md) module documentation for more details.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືໂມດູນ [_ຕົບແຕ່ງ (retouch)_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "spline controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມດ້ວຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (spline)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [_denoise (profiled)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md), [_raw denoise_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/raw-denoise.md) and [_contrast equalizer_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md) modules allow their effects to be applied more or less to each wavelet scale using _splines_.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [_ລົບສິ່ງລົບກວນ (ຕາມໂປຣໄຟລ໌)_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md), [_ລົບສິ່ງລົບກວນ Raw_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/raw-denoise.md) ແລະ [_ຕົວປັບຄວາມຕ່າງລະດັບແສງ_](../../module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md) ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ປັບໃຊ້ຜົນກະທົບຂອງພວກມັນກັບແຕ່ລະສະເກລເວບເລັດຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍ ໂດຍໃຊ້ _ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (splines)_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![spline](./wavelets/clean-spline.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![spline](./wavelets/clean-spline.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, each node in the graph represents a different level of detail in the image, from coarse detail on the left to fine detail on the right. You can raise or lower each of these nodes with your mouse to increase or decrease the module's effect, respectively, on that wavelet scale. \n"
msgstr "ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ແຕ່ລະຈຸດ (node) ໃນກຣາບແມ່ນຕົວແທນຂອງລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໃນຮູບພາບ, ຈາກລາຍລະອຽດຫຍາບຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ ຫາ ລາຍລະອຽດລະອຽດຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາ. ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດແຕ່ລະຈຸດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຜົນກະທົບຂອງໂມດູນໃນສະເກລເວບເລັດນັ້ນໆ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To modify the curve, click slightly above or below the line near to a node and drag up or down. You can change the width of your modification by scrolling with your mouse wheel, which increases or reduces the size of the circle displayed under your mouse pointer. A small circle indicates that the effect of dragging the curve up or down will be isolated mostly to the node being adjusted. A larger circle indicates that the effect will be more broad and will increasingly impact adjacent nodes. When you hover your mouse over the graph, shaded areas indicate the parts of the spline that will be impacted when you attempt to modify the curve.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເໜືອ ຫຼື ໃຕ້ເສັ້ນໃກ້ກັບຈຸດ ແລ້ວລາກຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ລົງ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌, ເຊິ່ງຈະເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຂະໜາດຂອງວົງມົນທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ກ້ອງຕົວກະພິບເມົາສ໌. ວົງມົນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການລາກເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະສົ່ງຜົນສະເພາະຈຸດທີ່ກຳລັງປັບ. ວົງມົນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຜົນກະທົບຈະກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຈຸດຂ້າງຄຽງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງກຣາບ, ເຂດທີ່ມີເງົາຈະບົ່ງບອກເຖິງສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບເມື່ອທ່ານປັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "deprecated modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ (deprecated modules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The darktable team regularly reviews old modules and updates their implementation where issues are found or updated science means that they can be improved. Most of the time we try to update existing modules with new functionality but occasionally that becomes problematic, often due to the overhead of having to maintain multiple versions of the module. In such circumstances a new replacement module is created and the old module becomes _deprecated_.\n"
msgstr "ທີມງານ darktable ຈະກວດສອບໂມດູນເກົ່າໆເປັນປະຈຳ ແລະ ອັບເດດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງພວກມັນເມື່ອພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ ຫຼື ເມື່ອມີວິທະຍາສາດໃໝ່ໆທີ່ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກມັນສາມາດປັບປຸງໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນໄດ້. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ພວກເຮົາຈະພະຍາຍາມອັບເດດໂມດູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວດ້ວຍຟັງຊັນໃໝ່ໆ ແຕ່ບາງຄັ້ງສິ່ງນັ້ນກໍກາຍເປັນບັນຫາ, ມັກຈະມາຈາກພາລະໃນການຕ້ອງຮັກສາໂມດູນຫຼາຍເວີຊັນ. ໃນສະຖານະການດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໂມດູນໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອມາແທນທີ່ ແລະ ໂມດູນເກົ່າຈະກາຍເປັນ _ໂມດູນທີ່ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານ (deprecated)_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Module deprecation follows a fairly standard process: In the release that deprecates a module, that module can no longer be searched or added to custom module groups. It is moved into the read-only _deprecated modules_ group and a message added to the module to warn of its removal and direct the user to a suitable alternative.\n"
msgstr "ການຍົກເລີກໂມດູນຈະດຳເນີນຕາມຂະບວນການມາດຕະຖານ: ໃນເວີຊັນທີ່ຍົກເລີກໂມດູນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໂມດູນນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມໂມດູນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ມັນຈະຖືກຍ້າຍເຂົ້າໄປໃນກຸ່ມ _ໂມດູນທີ່ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານ_ ທີ່ເປັນແບບອ່ານຢ່າງດຽວ ແລະ ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມເພີ່ມໃສ່ໃນໂມດູນເພື່ອເຕືອນເຖິງການຍ້າຍອອກ ແລະ ແນະນຳຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ໄປຫາທາງເລືອກອື່ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "After a year, the module is removed from the _deprecated modules_ group and is then only available for use in old edits (where that module was already active against a given image). Deprecated modules are never fully removed from darktable (in order to retain old edits) but development ceases and you are advised to use supported modules instead if you encounter an issue.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກໜຶ່ງປີ, ໂມດູນຈະຖືກຍ້າຍອອກຈາກກຸ່ມ _ໂມດູນທີ່ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານ_ ແລະ ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂເກົ່າໆ (ບ່ອນທີ່ໂມດູນນັ້ນຖືກໃຊ້ງານກັບຮູບພາບນັ້ນຢູ່ແລ້ວ). ໂມດູນທີ່ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານຈະບໍ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກ darktable ຢ່າງຖາວອນ (ເພື່ອຮັກສາການແກ້ໄຂເກົ່າໄວ້) ແຕ່ການພັດທະນາຈະຢຸດລົງ ແລະ ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນທີ່ຍັງຮອງຮັບຢູ່ແທນ ຫາກທ່ານພົບບັນຫາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For example, modules deprecated in darktable 3.4 will be removed from the _deprecated modules_ group in darktable 3.8 (assuming two major releases each year).\n"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂມດູນທີ່ຖືກຍົກເລີກໃນ darktable 3.4 ຈະຖືກຍ້າຍອອກຈາກກຸ່ມ _ໂມດູນທີ່ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ງານ_ ໃນ darktable 3.8 (ໂດຍສົມມຸດວ່າມີການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນຫຼັກສອງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ປີ).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/darkroom/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Darkroom"
msgstr "ຫ້ອງມືດ (Darkroom)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span class=\"webonly\">![](./darktable-logo.png#w50)</span>\n"
msgstr "<span class=\"webonly\">![](./darktable-logo.png#w50)</span>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable is an open source photography workflow application and raw developer — a virtual lighttable and darkroom for photographers. It manages your digital negatives in a database, lets you view them through a zoomable lighttable and enables you to develop and enhance your raw images.\n"
msgstr ""
"darktable ແມ່ນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈັດການຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກດ້ານການຖ່າຍຮູບແບບໂອເພນຊອດ ແລະ ຕົວພັດທະນາໄ"
"ຟລ໌ raw — ເປັນຄືກັບໂຕະລຳແສງ ແລະ ຫ້ອງມືດສະເມືອນຈິງສຳລັບຊ່າງພາບ. ມັນຈັດການໄຟລ໌ເນກາທີບດີຈີຕອນຂອງ"
"ທ່ານໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງພວກມັນຜ່ານໂຕະລຳແສງທີ່ສາມາດຊູມໄດ້ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດພັດທະນາ ແລ"
"ະ ປັບແຕ່ງຮູບພາບ raw ຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This manual tracks the current __development version__ of darktable. \n"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ຕິດຕາມ __ຮຸ່ນກຳລັງພັດທະນາ__ ປັດຈຸບັນຂອງ darktable. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The source repository for this documentation can be found at [Github](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs.git). Any feedback relating to this documentation can be provided by creating a [ticket](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/issues/new) or a pull request against this repository.\n"
msgstr "ຄັງເກັບຊອດໂຄດ (source repository) ສຳລັບເອກະສານນີ້ ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ [Github](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs.git). ທຸກໆຄຳຄິດເຫັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບເອກະສານນີ້ ສາມາດສົ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍການສ້າງ [ticket](https://github.com/darktable-org/dtdocs/issues/new) ຫຼື ສົ່ງ pull request ມາຍັງຄັງເກັບນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span class=\"webonly\">You can also click on the following links to download the manual in [PDF](darktable_user_manual.pdf) or [epub](darktable_user_manual.epub) format.</span>\n"
msgstr "<span class=\"webonly\">ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຄລິກທີ່ລິ້ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດຄູ່ມືໃນຮູບແບບ [PDF](darktable_user_manual.pdf) ຫຼື [epub](darktable_user_manual.epub) ໄດ້.</span>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This documentation is released under the [GPL 3.0](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.en.html) license.\n"
msgstr "ເອກະສານນີ້ຖືກເຜີຍແຜ່ພາຍໃຕ້ໃບອະນຸຍາດ [GPL 3.0](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.en.html).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "map view layout"
msgstr "ເຄົ້າໂຄງມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These modules are identical to the lighttable view. From top to bottom:\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບມຸມມອງແຜງແສງ. ຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[collections](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md)\n"
": Filter the list of images displayed in the map view.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ຄໍເລັກຊັນ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md)\n"
": ກອງລາຍຊື່ຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງໃນມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here you can find the modules specific to the map view. From top to bottom:\n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາໂມດູນທີ່ເປັນສະເພາະຂອງມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່. ຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[find location](../module-reference/utility-modules/map/find-location.md)\n"
": Search for a place on map.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ຄົ້ນຫາສະຖານທີ່](../module-reference/utility-modules/map/find-location.md)\n"
": ຄົ້ນຫາສະຖານທີ່ເທິງແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[locations](../module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md)\n"
": Manage a hierarchical list of location tags and their corresponding regions on the map.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ສະຖານທີ່](../module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md)\n"
": ຈັດການລາຍການແທັກສະຖານທີ່ແບບລຳດັບຂັ້ນ ແລະ ບໍລິເວນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງເທິງແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[map settings](../module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md)\n"
": Choose the map provider and set up various map display parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຜນທີ່](../module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md)\n"
": ເລືອກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແຜນທີ່ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີການສະແດງຜົນແຜນທີ່ຕ່າງໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[geotagging](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md)\n"
": Apply GPX track data to selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການຕິດແທັກພິກັດພູມສາດ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md)\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນແທຣັກ GPX ກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/map-view-layout.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[filmstrip](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md)\n"
": Drag images from the filmstrip onto the map as described in the map [overview](./overview.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"[ແຖບຟິມ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md)\n"
": ລາກຮູບພາບຈາກແຖບຟິມໄປວາງເທິງແຜນທີ່ ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ [ພາບລວມ](./overview.md) ຂອງແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The map view allows you to see where your geo-tagged images were taken, and to add location information to non-geo-tagged images.\n"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນວ່າຮູບພາບທີ່ຕິດແທັກພິກັດພູມສາດຖືກຖ່າຍຢູ່ໃສ, ແລະ ສາມາດເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່ໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ມີແທັກພິກັດພູມສາດໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The map view shows a world map with the images in the current [collection](../lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md) pinned to their geo-tagged location (if available). This requires that images are tagged with location information. Some newer cameras, including smartphones, are already equipped with GPS receivers. Other cameras may need additional GPS hardware to do this.\n"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່ສະແດງແຜນທີ່ໂລກພ້ອມກັບຮູບພາບໃນ [ຄໍເລັກຊັນ](../lighttable/digital-asset-management/collections.md) ປັດຈຸບັນທີ່ຖືກປັກໝຸດໄວ້ຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງພິກັດພູມສາດ (ຖ້າມີ). ອັນນີ້ຕ້ອງອາໄສຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກຕິດແທັກຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່. ກ້ອງລຸ້ນໃໝ່ບາງລຸ້ນ, ລວມເຖິງສະມາດໂຟນ, ແມ່ນມີຕົວຮັບສັນຍານ GPS ມາພ້ອມແລ້ວ. ກ້ອງອື່ນໆອາດຈະຕ້ອງມີອຸປະກອນເສີມ GPS ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Even if your camera doesn't support this feature, there is an alternative method -- darktable can match the Exif date/time in your image(s) to a separate GPX data tracking file created by a GPS tracker, that has recorded your movements. GPS trackers can be purchased as standalone handheld devices or you can install a GPS tracker app on your smartphone. Location tagging with GPS tracking data can be done using the [geotagging](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md) module, in the lighttable and map views.\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ກໍຍັງມີວິທີອື່ນ -- darktable ສາມາດຈັບຄູ່ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ Exif ໃນຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານກັບໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕາມຂໍ້ມູນ GPX ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍຕົວຕິດຕາມ GPS ເຊິ່ງໄດ້ບັນທຶກການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງທ່ານໄວ້. ຕົວຕິດຕາມ GPS ສາມາດຊື້ໄດ້ເປັນອຸປະກອນມືຖືແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແອັບຕິດຕາມ GPS ເທິງສະມາດໂຟນຂອງທ່ານກໍໄດ້. ການຕິດແທັກສະຖານທີ່ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນຕິດຕາມ GPS ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ການຕິດແທັກພິກັດພູມສາດ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md), ໃນມຸມມອງແຜງແສງ ແລະ ແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "center map view"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່ກາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the center of the map view you will see a world map.\n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງຂອງມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່ ທ່ານຈະເຫັນແຜນທີ່ໂລກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map data is taken from open map sources on the internet. As such, new map data is only available if you are connected to the internet -- darktable keeps a disk cache of previously loaded map data.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນແຜນທີ່ແມ່ນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງແຜນທີ່ແບບເປີດເທິງອິນເຕີເນັດ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ມູນແຜນທີ່ໃໝ່ຈະມີໃຫ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ -- darktable ຈະເກັບແຄຊ໌ຂໍ້ມູນແຜນທີ່ທີ່ເຄີຍໂຫຼດມາກ່ອນໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can navigate within the map using your mouse. Left-click and drag to move the map. Use the scroll-wheel to zoom in and out.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດນຳທາງພາຍໃນແຜນທີ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ຂອງທ່ານ. ຄລິກຊ້າຍແລ້ວລາກເພື່ອຍ້າຍແຜນທີ່. ໃຊ້ລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອຊູມເຂົ້າ ແລະ ອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On-screen controls and displays are available to help you find your way. A navigation area is located on top left of the map -- use this as an alternative to mouse-dragging and scrolling. The scale of the map is displayed at the bottom-left. At the bottom-right you can see the geographical coordinates for the center of the map.\n"
msgstr "ມີຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນເທິງໜ້າຈໍເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຊອກຫາທາງໄດ້. ບໍລິເວນການນຳທາງຈະຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງແຜນທີ່ -- ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ແທນການລາກເມົາສ໌ ແລະ ການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງ. ມາດຕາສ່ວນຂອງແຜນທີ່ແມ່ນສະແດງຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມ. ຢູ່ມຸມຂວາລຸ່ມ ທ່ານສາມາດເຫັນພິກັດທາງພູມສາດສຳລັບຈຸດກາງຂອງແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images that already have geo-location attributes in their metadata are displayed as small icons on the map. Images close to each other are grouped and a count of grouped images is displayed on the bottom-left corner.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະຕຳແໜ່ງພິກັດພູມສາດໃນເມຕາເດຕາຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນໄອຄອນນ້ອຍໆເທິງແຜນທີ່. ຮູບພາບທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນຈະຖືກລວມກຸ່ມ ແລະ ຈຳນວນຮູບໃນກຸ່ມຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to assign geo coordinates to an image, activate the [filmstrip](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) on the lower panel (press Ctrl+F). You can assign a geo location to an image by dragging the image icon from the film-strip and positioning it on the map -- darktable will record the new location (latitude and longitude ) as part of the image metadata. This data will be included in exported images.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອມອບໝາຍພິກັດພູມສາດໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [ແຖບຟິມ](../module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md) ຢູ່ແຜງດ້ານລຸ່ມ (ກົດ Ctrl+F). ທ່ານສາມາດມອບໝາຍສະຖານທີ່ພິກັດພູມສາດໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບໂດຍການລາກໄອຄອນຮູບພາບຈາກແຖບຟິມແລ້ວໄປວາງເທິງແຜນທີ່ -- darktable ຈະບັນທຶກສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່ (ລະຕິຈູດ ແລະ ລອງຈິຈູດ) ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງເມຕາເດຕາຂອງຮູບພາບ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຮູບພາບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to remove location data from an image simply drag it from the map and drop it onto the filmstrip.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເອົາຂໍ້ມູນສະຖານທີ່ອອກຈາກຮູບພາບ ພຽງແຕ່ລາກມັນອອກຈາກແຜນທີ່ແລ້ວໄປວາງໃສ່ແຖບຟິມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images close to each other are grouped under a single image group. You can use the  [map settings](../module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md) module to control the grouping as needed. The number displayed on the bottom left of the thumbnail is the number of images inside the group. A white number means that all images in the group are at exactly the same location, whereas a yellow number means they are not. Use the mouse scroll wheel while hovering over a group of images to scroll through the thumbnails of the images in that group.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມຮູບພາບດຽວກັນ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຜນທີ່](../module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md) ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການລວມກຸ່ມຕາມຕ້ອງການ. ຕົວເລກທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍລຸ່ມຂອງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງແມ່ນຈຳນວນຮູບພາບພາຍໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ. ຕົວເລກສີຂາວໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທຸກຮູບໃນກຸ່ມແມ່ນຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງດຽວກັນຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕົວເລກສີເຫຼືອງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ຕຳແໜ່ງດຽວກັນ. ໃຊ້ລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວາງເມົາສ໌ເທິງກຸ່ມຮູບພາບເພື່ອເລື່ອນເບິ່ງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຮູບພາບໃນກຸ່ມນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Normally, images in the center map view have black borders. If an image is selected in the filmstrip, then the corresponding image on the map will be highlighted with a white border.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຮູບພາບໃນມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່ກາງຈະມີຂອບສີດຳ. ຖ້າຮູບພາບໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກເລືອກໃນແຖບຟິມ, ຮູບທີ່ກົງກັນເທິງແຜນທີ່ກໍຈະຖືກເນັ້ນດ້ວຍຂອບສີຂາວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click+drag to adjust the location of an image. Shift+click to move a complete group of images.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ+ລາກ ເພື່ອປັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບພາບ. Shift+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອຍ້າຍຮູບພາບທັງກຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The left and right panels provide additional controls (see [map view layout](./map-view-layout.md)).\n"
msgstr "ແຜງດ້ານຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາໃຫ້ການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ເບິ່ງ [ເຄົ້າໂຄງມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່](./map-view-layout.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/map/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All image movements in the map view are recorded by darktable. It is possible to undo or redo such changes to recover a previous state. Note that this undo/redo facility is unlimited while moving images but it is reset each time you leave the map view.\n"
msgstr "ທຸກການເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຮູບພາບໃນມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່ແມ່ນຖືກບັນທຶກໂດຍ darktable. ທ່ານສາມາດເລີກເຮັດ ຫຼື ເຮັດຄືນການປ່ຽນແປງດັ່ງກ່າວເພື່ອຍ້ອນກັບສູ່ສະຖານະກ່ອນໜ້າໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄວາມສາມາດໃນການເລີກເຮັດ/ເຮັດຄືນນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳກັດໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍ້າຍຮູບພາບ ແຕ່ມັນຈະຖືກລ້າງໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານອອກຈາກມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/map/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map"
msgstr "ແຜນທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The modules in this reference section are broken down into two distinct types:\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນໃນສ່ວນອ້າງອີງນີ້ຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນສອງປະເພດຄື:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[processing modules](./processing-modules/_index.md)\n"
": Processing modules are used exclusively in the darkroom view. Each module performs a processing operation on the image before passing its output to the next module for further processing. Together this sequence of processing steps forms the [pixelpipe](../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"[ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ (processing modules)](./processing-modules/_index.md)\n"
": ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນແມ່ນໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ແຕ່ລະໂມດູນຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບໄປຍັງໂມດູນຖັດໄປເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນຕໍ່. ລຳດັບການປະມວນຜົນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ລວມກັນເອີ້ນວ່າ [pixelpipe](../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Processing modules have a _Technical information_ section which gives a brief summary of the module (the information can also be seen as a tooltip when hovering over the module name). The following information is shown:\n"
"    * a brief outline of the purpose of the module\n"
"    * an indication of the purpose (e.g. corrective or creative)\n"
"    * the processing color space (e.g. non-linear, Lab)\n"
"    * information about input and output:\n"
"      * color space (e.g. linear, RGB)\n"
"      * display referred or [scene referred workflow](../overview/workflow/process.md#scene-referred-workflow-a-new-approach)\n"
msgstr ""
"  ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນມີສ່ວນ _ຂໍ້ມູນທາງເຕັກນິກ (Technical information)_ ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ບົດສະຫຼຸບໂດຍຫຍໍ້ກ່ຽວກັບໂມດູນ (ຂໍ້ມູນຍັງສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ເປັນຄຳແນະນຳ tooltip ເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງຊື່ໂມດູນ). ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"    * ບົດສະຫຼຸບໂດຍຫຍໍ້ກ່ຽວກັບຈຸດປະສົງຂອງໂມດູນ\n"
"    * ການລະບຸຈຸດປະສົງ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ເພື່ອຄວາມສ້າງສັນ)\n"
"    * ພື້ນທີ່ສີໃນການປະມວນຜົນ (ເຊັ່ນ: non-linear, Lab)\n"
"    * ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການນຳເຂົ້າ (input) ແລະ ການສົ່ງອອກ (output):\n"
"      * ພື້ນທີ່ສີ (ເຊັ່ນ: linear, RGB)\n"
"      * ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກແບບອີງຕາມການສະແດງຜົນ (display referred) ຫຼື [ອີງຕາມສາກ (scene referred)](../overview/workflow/process.md#scene-referred-workflow-a-new-approach)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[utility modules](./utility-modules/_index.md)\n"
": Utility modules may be used in any darktable view. They are not directly involved in processing the pixels of an image but perform other ancillary functions (managing image metadata and tags, editing history, modifying pixel pipeline order, snapshots and duplicates, image export etc.).\n"
msgstr ""
"[ໂມດູນອຸປະກອນເສີມ (utility modules)](./utility-modules/_index.md)\n"
": ໂມດູນອຸປະກອນເສີມສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນທຸກສ່ວນສະແດງຜົນຂອງ darktable. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍກົງກັບການປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບພາບ ແຕ່ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເສີມອື່ນໆ (ຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາດາຕາ ແລະ ແທັກ, ປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂ, ປ່ຽນລຳດັບ pixel pipeline, ການຖ່າຍພາບສະນັບຊັອດ ແລະ ພາບສຳເນົາ, ການສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The two types of modules have a few aspects in common, described below.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທັງສອງປະເພດນີ້ມີບາງສ່ວນທີ່ຄືກັນ ດັ່ງທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each module has a header at the top, normally consisting of the following elements:\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະໂມດູນມີສ່ວນຫົວ (header) ຢູ່ທາງເທິງ, ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິປະກອບດ້ວຍອົງປະກອບດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"module name\n"
": Click on the name to expand or collapse the rest of the module and show/hide its controls.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໂມດູນ\n"
": ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍ ຫຼື ຫຍໍ້ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງໂມດູນ ແລະ ສະແດງ/ເຊື່ອງ ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມຂອງມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"reset parameters button\n"
": This normally appears to the right of the module name and is used to reset the state of the module back to its original condition.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມຣີເຊັດພາຣາມິເຕີ\n"
": ປົກກະຕິຈະປະກົດຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຊື່ໂມດູນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານະຂອງໂມດູນກັບຄືນສູ່ສະພາບເດີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"presets menu\n"
": This normally appears at the far right of the module header. The [presets](../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md) menu is predominantly used in processing modules, but many of the utility modules allow presets to be defined as well. You can also access this menu by right-clicking anywhere on the module header.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ (presets)\n"
": ປົກກະຕິຈະປະກົດຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາສຸດຂອງສ່ວນຫົວໂມດູນ. ເມນູ [ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ (presets)](../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md) ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໃຊ້ໃນໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ, ແຕ່ໂມດູນອຸປະກອນເສີມຫຼາຍອັນກໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້ຄືກັນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເມນູນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ບ່ອນໃດກໍ່ໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processing modules contain additional elements in their module header, as described in the [processing module header](../darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md) section.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນມີອົງປະກອບເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນສ່ວນຫົວ, ດັ່ງທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນ [ສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ](../darkroom/processing-modules/module-header.md).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module resizing"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດໂມດູນ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "utility modules"
msgstr "ໂມດູນອຸປະກອນເສີມ (utility modules)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some utility modules contain lists of information that can grow as more entries are added. To help manage screen real-estate, it is possible to increase or decrease the maximum number of entries that can be displayed before a scroll bar is added. To alter the maximum number of entries, place the mouse over an entry in the list, and hold Shift+Alt while scrolling your mouse wheel. If the list currently contains more entries than this maximum, a scrollbar will appear so that you can access the hidden entries. Alternatively you can click+drag the bottom of the scrollable area with your mouse.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນອຸປະກອນເສີມບາງອັນມີລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໄດ້ເລື້ອຍໆ. ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຈັດການພື້ນທີ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຈຳນວນລາຍການສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີແຖບເລື່ອນ (scroll bar) ປະກົດຂຶ້ນ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈຳນວນລາຍການສູງສຸດ, ໃຫ້ວາງເມົ້າໄວ້ເທິງລາຍການໃນລາຍຊື່, ແລ້ວກົດ Shift+Alt ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນລໍ້ເມົ້າ. ຖ້າລາຍຊື່ມີລາຍການຫຼາຍກວ່າຄ່າສູງສຸດນີ້, ແຖບເລື່ອນຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງລາຍການທີ່ເຊື່ອງຢູ່. ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກແລ້ວລາກສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງພື້ນທີ່ເລື່ອນໄດ້ດ້ວຍເມົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** It is not possible to extend these areas beyond the number of entries currently shown. If you attempt to do so using Shift+Alt+scroll, the maximum number of entries _will_ increase, and a toast message will appear informing you of the new maximum. However, the module itself will not be resized unless its content exceeds this maximum.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ບໍ່ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເກີນກວ່າຈຳນວນລາຍການທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນປະຈຸບັນ. ຖ້າທ່ານພະຍາຍາມເຮັດແນວນັ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ Shift+Alt+ເລື່ອນ, ຈຳນວນລາຍການສູງສຸດ _ຈະ_ ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນບອກຄ່າສູງສຸດໃໝ່. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ຕົວໂມດູນເອງຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຈົນກວ່າເນື້ອຫາຂອງມັນຈະເກີນຄ່າສູງສຸດນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some processing modules contain drawn graphical elements that can take up too much or too little screen space depending on the width of your side panels. These drawing areas usually default to a 16:9 aspect ratio and can be similarly resized by hovering over them and holding Ctrl while scrolling.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນບາງອັນມີອົງປະກອບກຣາຟິກທີ່ອາດຈະກິນພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍເກີນໄປ ຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແຜງດ້ານຂ້າງ. ພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ປົກກະຕິຈະມີອັດຕາສ່ວນ 16:9 ແລະ ສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດໄດ້ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນໂດຍການວາງເມົ້າໄວ້ເທິງພວກມັນແລ້ວກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນລໍ້ເມົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "visibility and ordering"
msgstr "ການສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ການຈັດລຳດັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click in a side panel (outside of any module) to list the available utility modules and toggle their visibility. Drag-and-drop a module to change its position. Select [preferences > general > reset view panels](../preferences-settings/general.md) to reset to default values.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃນແຜງດ້ານຂ້າງ (ນອກບໍລິເວນໂມດູນ) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ໂມດູນອຸປະກອນເສີມທີ່ມີ ແລະ ເປີດ/ປິດ ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງພວກມັນ. ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ໂມດູນເພື່ອປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງ. ເລືອກ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ທົ່ວໄປ > ຣີເຊັດແຜງການສະແດງຜົນ](../preferences-settings/general.md) ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າກັບຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/overview.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please see [mange module layouts](../darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md) for information about how to organize processing modules. Please note that you cannot reorder them without changing how an image is processed. See [the pixelpipe and module order](../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md) for more information.\n"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ [ຈັດການຮູບແບບໂມດູນ](../darkroom/organization/manage-module-layouts.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີຈັດລະບຽບໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນ. ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນລຳດັບຂອງພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ກະທົບຕໍ່ວິທີການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບ. ເບິ່ງ [pixelpipe ແລະ ລຳດັບໂມດູນ](../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

