#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate a frame around the image. \n"
msgstr "ສ້າງກອບອ້ອມຮູບ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The frame consists of a border (with a user-defined color) and a frame line within that border (with a second user-defined color). Various options are available to control the geometry and color of the frame.\n"
msgstr "ກອບປະກອບດ້ວຍຂອບນອກ ( border - ດ້ວຍສີທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດ) ແລະ ເສັ້ນຂອບພາຍໃນຂອບນັ້ນ ( frame line - ດ້ວຍສີທີສອງທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດ). ມີຕົວເລືອກຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຮູບຮ່າງ ແລະ ສີຂອງກອບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"border size\n"
": The size of the frame as a percentage of the underlying full image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດຂອບ\n"
": ຂະໜາດຂອງກອບເປັນເປີເຊັນຂອງຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"aspect\n"
": The aspect ratio of the final module output (i.e. the underlying image plus the frame). Right-click on the slider to enter a custom aspect as a ratio (e.g. \"6:5\").\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ\n"
": ອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບຂອງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສຸດທ້າຍ (ຄື ຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບບວກກັບກອບ). ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ແຖບເລື່ອນເພື່ອປ້ອນອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ (ເຊັ່ນ \"6:5\").\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"orientation\n"
": The orientation of the frame (portrait/landscape). Select 'auto' for darktable to choose the most reasonable orientation based on the underlying image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງ (orientation)\n"
": ທິດທາງຂອງກອບ (ແນວຕັ້ງ/ແນວນອນ). ເລືອກ 'ອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto)' ເພື່ອໃຫ້ darktable ເລືອກທິດທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດຕາມຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"horizontal/vertical position\n"
": Select from a set of pre-defined ratios to control where the underlying image will be positioned on the horizontal/vertical axis. You can also right click and enter your own ratio as \"x/y\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງແນວນອນ/ແນວຕັ້ງ\n"
": ເລືອກຈາກຊຸດອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບເທິງແກນນອນ/ແກນຕັ້ງ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຄລິກຂວາ ແລະ ປ້ອນອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງເຈົ້າເອງເປັນ \"x/y\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"frame line size\n"
": The percentage of the frame line size, relative to the border size at its smallest part.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດເສັ້ນກອບ\n"
": ເປີເຊັນຂອງຂະໜາດເສັ້ນກອບ, ທຽບກັບຂະໜາດຂອບໃນສ່ວນທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"frame line offset\n"
": The position of the frame line, relative to the underlying image. Choose 0% for a frame line that touches the image. Choose 100% for a frame line that touches the outer border.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະຫ່າງເສັ້ນກອບ (frame line offset)\n"
": ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເສັ້ນກອບ, ທຽບກັບຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ເລືອກ 0% ສຳລັບເສັ້ນກອບທີ່ຕິດກັບຮູບ. ເລືອກ 100% ສຳລັບເສັ້ນກອບທີ່ຕິດກັບຂອບນອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"border color / frame line color\n"
": A pair of color selectors which allow the border and frame line colors to be defined. Clicking on the colored field will open a color selector dialog which offers a choice of commonly-used colors, or allows you to define a color in RGB color space. You can also activate a [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) to take a color probe from the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອບ / ສີເສັ້ນກອບ\n"
": ຕົວເລືອກສີຄູ່ໜຶ່ງທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກຳນົດສີຂອງຂອບ ແລະ ເສັ້ນກອບ. ການຄລິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງສີຈະເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງເລືອກສີ ເຊິ່ງມີສີທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ ຫຼື ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກຳນົດສີໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ໄດ້. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ [ຕົວເລືອກສີ (picker)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ເພື່ອເກັບຕົວຢ່າງສີຈາກຮູບໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/framing.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/orientation.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show guides\n"
": Tick the box to show guide overlays whenever the module is activated. Click the icon on the right to control the properties of the guides. See [guides & overlays](../utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md) for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳ (show guides)\n"
": ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງເພື່ອສະແດງເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນເບື້ອງຂວາເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳ. ເບິ່ງ [ເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳ ແລະ ສິ່ງວາງທັບ](../utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/white-balance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "white balance"
msgstr "ສົມດຸນສີຂາວ (white balance)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/white-balance.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": scale raw RGB channels to balance white and help demosaicing.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ປັບອັດຕາສ່ວນຊ່ອງສັນຍານ RGB ຂອງໄຟລ໌ດິບ (raw) ເພື່ອປັບສົມດຸນສີຂາວ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃນການ demosaicing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/white-balance.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/external-raster.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/raw-black-white-point.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/raw-denoise.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/raw-chromatic-aberrations.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input\n"
": linear, raw, scene-referred.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂາເຂົ້າ (input)\n"
": ແບບເສັ້ນ (linear), ໄຟລ໌ຣໍ (raw), ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/white-balance.md
