#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Please note that this module is [deprecated](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) from darktable 3.8 and should no longer be used for new edits. Please use the [_crop_](./crop.md) module to crop the image, the [_rotate and perspective_](./rotate-perspective.md) module to perform rotation and keystone correction, and the [_orientation_](./orientation.md) module to flip the image on the horizontal/vertical axes.**\n"
msgstr "**ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ໂມດູນນີ້ [ເລີກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) ຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 3.8 ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂໃໝ່ອີກ. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_crop_](./crop.md) ເພື່ອຕັດຂອບຮູບ, ໂມດູນ [_rotate and perspective_](./rotate-perspective.md) ເພື່ອໝູນຮູບ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂທັດສະນີຍະພາບ, ແລະ ໂມດູນ [_orientation_](./orientation.md) ເພື່ອປີ້ນຮູບໃນແນວນອນ/ແນວຕັ້ງ.**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Crop, rotate, and correct perspective distortions using on-screen guides.\n"
msgstr "ຕັດຂອບ, ໝູນ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຄວາມບິດບ້ຽວຂອງທັດສະນີຍະພາບ ໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳເທິງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Whenever the user interface of this module is in focus, the full uncropped image will be shown, overlaid with crop handles and optional guiding lines.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນນີ້, ຮູບພາບເຕັມທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັດຂອບຈະສະແດງອອກມາ, ພ້ອມກັບປຸ່ມປັບການຕັດຂອບ ແລະ ເເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![screen controls](./crop-rotate/screen-controls.png#w75)\n"
msgstr "![screen controls](./crop-rotate/screen-controls.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resize the crop by dragging the border and corner handles.\n"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດການຕັດຂອບໂດຍການລາກທີ່ຂອບ ຫຼື ມຸມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move the crop rectangle by clicking and dragging inside the crop area. Constrain movement to the horizontal/vertical axis by holding Ctrl/Shift, respectively while dragging. Commit changes by giving focus to another module.\n"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍກອບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມການຕັດຂອບໂດຍການຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ຕັດຂອບ. ບັງຄັບການຍ້າຍໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນແນວນອນ/ແນວຕັ້ງ ໂດຍການກົດ Ctrl/Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກ. ຢືນຢັນການປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍການໄປໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you intend to use the [_retouch_](./retouch.md) module, you are recommended to use _rotate and perspective_ for rotation and/or keystone correction only, performing creative cropping in the [_crop_](./crop.md) module. This process ensures that the entire image is available for source spots in _retouch_, since the _crop_ module is placed after _retouch_ in the pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_retouch_](./retouch.md), ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ _rotate and perspective_ ສຳລັບການໝູນ ແລະ/ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂທັດສະນີຍະພາບເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ໄປຕັດຂອບໃນໂມດູນ [_crop_](./crop.md) ແທນ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດຍັງຄົງມີໃຫ້ເລືອກເປັນຈຸດຕົ້ນທາງໃນ _retouch_, ເພາະໂມດູນ _crop_ ຢູ່ຫຼັງຈາກ _retouch_ ໃນທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Some of the tools in this module (angle adjustment and perspective distortion correction) require the original image data to be interpolated. For best sharpness results set “lanczos3” as the pixel interpolator in [preferences > processing](../../preferences-settings/processing.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ບາງເຄື່ອງມືໃນໂມດູນນີ້ (ການປັບມຸມ ແລະ ການປັບແກ້ຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຂອງເພີສະເປັກທິບ) ຕ້ອງການ"
"ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບຖືກເຮັດ interpolation. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັດດ້ານຄວາມຄົມຊັດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ “"
"lanczos3” ເປັນຕົວປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊວ (pixel interpolator) ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ "
"(preferences > processing)].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _crop and rotate_ module controls are split between two tabs as follows:\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນໂມດູນ _ຕັດຂອບ ແລະ ໝູນ_ ຈະແຍກອອກເປັນສອງແຖບ ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "main tab"
msgstr "ແຖບຫຼັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flip\n"
": Flip the image on the horizontal, vertical or both axes.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປີ້ນ (flip)\n"
": ປີ້ນຮູບໃນແນວນອນ, ແນວຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ທັງສອງແກນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"angle\n"
": Correct the rotation angle to level an image by setting a numerical value in degrees or using the mouse. To use the mouse, right-click and drag to draw a line along a suitable horizontal or vertical feature. As soon as you release the mouse button the image is rotated so that the line you drew matches the horizontal or vertical axis.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມຸມ (angle)\n"
": ແກ້ໄຂມຸມໝູນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບພາບໄດ້ລະດັບ ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລກເປັນອົງສາ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌. ໃນການໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາ ແລະ ລາກເພື່ອຂີດເສັ້ນຕາມແນວນອນ ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນຮູບ. ເມື່ອທ່ານປ່ອຍປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກໝູນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເສັ້ນທີ່ທ່ານຂີດນັ້ນກົງກັບແກນນອນ ຫຼື ແກນຕັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"keystone\n"
": Correct perspective distortions. This tool is useful, for example, when you shoot a high building from the ground with a short focal length, aiming upwards with your camera. The combobox allows you to select the type of correction you want to use:\n"
": - _vertical_: Limit the correction to vertical lines\n"
": - _horizontal_: Limit the correction to horizontal lines\n"
": - _full_: Correct horizontal and vertical lines at the same time\n"
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂທັດສະນີຍະພາບ (keystone)\n"
": ແກ້ໄຂຄວາມບິດບ້ຽວຂອງທັດສະນີຍະພາບ. ເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດ ເຊັ່ນ ເມື່ອທ່ານຖ່າຍຮູບຕຶກສູງຈາກພື້ນດິນດ້ວຍເລນໄລຍະສັ້ນ ໂດຍການແຫງນກ້ອງຂຶ້ນ. ຊ່ອງເລືອກຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກປະເພດການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຕ້ອງການ:\n"
": - _ແນວຕັ້ງ (vertical)_: ຈຳກັດການແກ້ໄຂສະເພາະເສັ້ນແນວຕັ້ງ\n"
": - _ແນວນອນ (horizontal)_: ຈຳກັດການແກ້ໄຂສະເພາະເສັ້ນແນວນອນ\n"
": - _ທັງໝົດ (full)_: ແກ້ໄຂທັງເສັ້ນແນວນອນ ແລະ ແນວຕັ້ງພ້ອມກັນ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Depending on the selected correction type you will see two or four straight adjustment lines overlaid on your image. Two red circles on each line allow you to modify the line positions with your mouse. Each line additionally carries a “symmetry” button. If activated (and highlighted in red) all movements of the affected line will be mirrored by the opposite line.\n"
msgstr ""
": ອີງຕາມປະເພດການປັບແກ້ທີ່ເລືອກ ທ່ານຈະເຫັນເສັ້ນປັບແກ້ຊື່ສອງ ຫຼື ສີ່ເສັ້ນວາງຊ້ອນເທິງຮູບຂອງທ່ານ. ວົງມົນສີແດ"
"ງສອງວົງໃນແຕ່ລະເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງເສັ້ນດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌ຂອງທ່ານ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ແຕ່ລະເສັ້ນຍັງມີປຸ່ມ “ສົມມາ"
"ດ (symmetry)”. ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ (ແລະ ເປັນສີແດງ) ທຸກການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງເສັ້ນນັ້ນຈະຖືກສະທ້ອນໂດຍເສັ້ນທີ່ຢູ່ກົງກັ"
"ນຂ້າມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": In order to correct perspective distortions, you need to find suitable horizontal and/or vertical features in your image and align the adjustment lines with them. When finished, press the “OK” button located close to the center of the image -- corrections will be applied immediately. You can return to the module and refine your corrections by selecting “correction applied” in the keystone combobox.\n"
msgstr ""
": ເພື່ອປັບແກ້ຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຂອງເພີສະເປັກທິບ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຊອກຫາຈຸດເດັ່ນຕາມແນວນອນ ແລະ/ຫຼື ແນວຕັ້ງທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃ"
"ນຮູບຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວວາງເສັ້ນປັບແກ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບພວກມັນ. ເມື່ອສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ “OK” ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບກາງຮູບ -- ກ"
"ານປັບແກ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ທັນທີ. ທ່ານສາມາດກັບມາທີ່ໂມດູນ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງການແກ້ໄຂຂອງທ່ານຕື່ມໂດຍການເລືອກ “"
"correction applied” ໃນຊ່ອງ keystone.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![keystone set](./crop-rotate/keystone-set.png#w25#inline) ![keystone applied](./crop-rotate/keystone-applied.png#w25#inline)\n"
msgstr "![keystone set](./crop-rotate/keystone-set.png#w25#inline) ![keystone applied](./crop-rotate/keystone-applied.png#w25#inline)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"automatic cropping\n"
": Automatically crop the image to avoid black edges on the image borders. This is useful when rotating the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັດຂອບອັດຕະໂນມັດ (automatic cropping)\n"
": ຕັດຂອບຮູບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂອບສີດຳທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ແຄມຮູບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນເວລາໝູນຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"aspect\n"
": Set the aspect ratio of the crop, constraining the width:height ratio of the crop rectangle to the chosen aspect. Many common numerical ratios are pre-defined. A few special aspect ratios deserve explanation:\n"
": - _freehand_: Crop without any restrictions \n"
": - _original image_: Retain the aspect ratio of the original image\n"
": - _square_: Constrains the aspect ratio to be 1:1\n"
": - _golden cut_: The golden ratio (1.62:1)\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນ (aspect)\n"
": ກຳນົດອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງການຕັດຂອບ, ໂດຍບັງຄັບອັດຕາສ່ວນ ກວ້າງ:ສູງ ຂອງກອບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມໃຫ້ເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ເລືອກ. ມີອັດຕາສ່ວນຕົວເລກທົ່ວໄປທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ແລ້ວຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ອັດຕາສ່ວນພິເສດບາງຢ່າງມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
": - _ຕາມໃຈ (freehand)_: ຕັດຂອບໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃດໆ\n"
": - _ຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ (original image)_: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຮູບເດີມໄວ້\n"
": - _ສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຈັດຕຸລັດ (square)_: ບັງຄັບອັດຕາສ່ວນໃຫ້ເປັນ 1:1\n"
": - _ສັດສ່ວນຄຳ (golden cut)_: ອັດຕາສ່ວນຄຳ (1.62:1)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You can also enter any other ratio after opening the combobox by typing it in the form of “x:y” or as a decimal (e.g. \"0.5\" to apply a ratio of 2:1). \n"
msgstr ""
":ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ້ອນອັດຕາສ່ວນອື່ນໆ ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດຊ່ອງຕົວເລືອກ (combobox) ໂດຍການພິມໃນຮູບແບບ “x:y” "
"ຫຼື ເປັນທົດສະນິຍົມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: \"0.5\" ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນອັດຕາສ່ວນ 2:1). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If you want to add an aspect ratio to the pre-defined drop-down list you can do this by including a line of the form \"`plugins/darkroom/clipping/extra_aspect_ratios/foo=x:y`\" in darktable's configuration file `darktablerc` in the [configuration directory](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). Here “`foo`” defines the name of the new aspect ratio and “`x`” and “`y`” the corresponding numerical values (`x` and `y` must be integers). Note that you can only add new entries for ratios not already present in the drop-down list.\n"
msgstr ""
": ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ (aspect ratio) ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍກ"
"ານເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຮູບແບບ \"`plugins/darkroom/clipping/extra_aspect_ratios/"
"foo=x:y`\" ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ darktable ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `darktablerc` ໃນ [ໂຟນເດີກຳນົດຄ່າ "
"(configuration directory)]. ໃນນີ້ “`foo`” ແມ່ນຊື່ຂອງອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບໃໝ່ ແລະ “`x`” ກັບ "
"“`y`” ແມ່ນຄ່າຕົວເລກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (`x` ແລະ `y` ຕ້ອງເປັນເລກຖ້ວນ). ໝາຍເຫດ: ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມໄດ້ສະເພ"
"າະອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລາຍການເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Finally, the button beside the aspect combobox allows you to switch between portrait and landscape orientation if you have selected a rectangular aspect ratio.\n"
msgstr ": ສຸດທ້າຍ, ປຸ່ມຂ້າງຊ່ອງເລືອກອັດຕາສ່ວນ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ ແນວນອນ ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກອັດຕາສ່ວນແບບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຜືນຜ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** When resizing an image in freehand mode you may retain the currently-set aspect ratio by holding Shift while dragging on any of the resize controls.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປັບຂະໜາດຮູບໃນໂໝດຕາມໃຈ (freehand), ທ່ານສາມາດຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ປັດຈຸບັນ ໂດຍການກົດ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກປຸ່ມປັບຂະໜາດໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "margins tab"
msgstr "ແຖບຂອບ (margins)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These sliders allow you to directly set how much of the image to crop from each side. They are automatically updated if you move or resize the crop area on the image using the mouse.\n"
msgstr "ໂຕເລື່ອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດໄດ້ໂດຍກົງວ່າຈະຕັດຂອບຮູບອອກເທົ່າໃດໃນແຕ່ລະດ້ານ. ພວກມັນຈະຖືກປັບປຸງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຖ້າທ່ານຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປັບຂະໜາດພື້ນທີ່ຕັດຂອບໃນຮູບໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"left\n"
": The percentage of the image that should be cropped from the left side.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊ້າຍ (left)\n"
": ເປີເຊັນຂອງຮູບທີ່ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຈາກເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"right\n"
": The percentage of the image that should be cropped from the right side.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂວາ (right)\n"
": ເປີເຊັນຂອງຮູບທີ່ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຈາກເບື້ອງຂວາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"top\n"
": The percentage of the image that should be cropped from the top.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເທິງ (top)\n"
": ເປີເຊັນຂອງຮູບທີ່ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຈາກດ້ານເທິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop-rotate.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bottom\n"
": The percentage of the image that should be cropped from the bottom.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລຸ່ມ (bottom)\n"
": ເປີເຊັນຂອງຮູບທີ່ຈະຖືກຕັດອອກຈາກດ້ານລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/chromatic-aberrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "chromatic aberrations"
msgstr "ຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນຂອງສີ (chromatic aberrations)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/chromatic-aberrations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": correct chromatic aberrations.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ປັບແກ້ຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນຂອງສີ (ແສງແລບ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/chromatic-aberrations.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/denoise-profiled.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/velvia.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/exposure.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/composite.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/diffuse.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/split-toning.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/enlarge-canvas.md
