#, no-wrap
msgid "[https://discuss.pixls.us/t/any-interest-in-a-film-negative-feature-in-rt/12569/177](https://discuss.pixls.us/t/any-interest-in-a-film-negative-feature-in-rt/12569/177)\n"
msgstr "[https://discuss.pixls.us/t/any-interest-in-a-film-negative-feature-in-rt/12569/177](https://discuss.pixls.us/t/any-interest-in-a-film-negative-feature-in-rt/12569/177)\n"

