#, no-wrap
msgid "[https://discuss.pixls.us/t/input-color-profile-to-use-for-negatives/20271/13](https://discuss.pixls.us/t/input-color-profile-to-use-for-negatives/20271/13)\n"
msgstr "[https://discuss.pixls.us/t/input-color-profile-to-use-for-negatives/20271/13](https://discuss.pixls.us/t/input-color-profile-to-use-for-negatives/20271/13)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** if you want to use the [_tone equalizer_](tone-equalizer.md) with _negadoctor_, you'll need to move the _tone equalizer_ module **after** _negadoctor_ in the [pixelpipe](../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md), since the _tone equalizer_ is not designed to work with negatives.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ [_tone equalizer_](tone-equalizer.md) ຮ່ວມກັບ _negadoctor_, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຍ້າຍໂມດູນ _tone equalizer_ ໄປໄວ້ **ຫຼັງຈາກ** _negadoctor_ ໃນ [ລຳດັບການປະມວນຜົນ](../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md), ເນື່ອງຈາກ _tone equalizer_ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບພາບເນກາຕິບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is strongly recommended that you set the parameters following the order in which they are presented in the GUI. Start by setting the _film stock_, then work through each of the tabs ([_film properties_](#film-properties), [_corrections_](#corrections), [_print properties_](#print-properties)) in order, working from top to bottom in each tab.\n"
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ສະແດງໃນໜ້າຈໍ. ເລີ່ມຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ປະເພດຟີມ_, ຈາກນັ້ນເຮັດວຽກໄປຕາມແຖບຕ່າງໆ ([_ຄຸນສົມບັດຟີມ_](#film-properties), [_ການແກ້ໄຂ_](#corrections), [_ຄຸນສົມບັດການພິມ_](#print-properties)) ໂດຍໄລ່ຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມໃນແຕ່ລະແຖບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When using [pickers](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers), be careful to avoid including dust and scratches, which can skew the data taken from the sampled region.\n"
msgstr "ໃນເວລາໃຊ້ [ເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers), ໃຫ້ລະວັງຢ່າໃຫ້ຕິດຂີ້ຝຸ່ນ ຫຼື ຮອຍຂີດຂ່ວນ ເພາະອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດູດມາຈາກພື້ນທີ່ນັ້ນຜິດພ້ຽນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"film stock\n"
": The first step is to choose \"color\" or \"black and white\" in the _film stock_ drop-down. If you select \"black and white\", any sliders that are only used for color will be hidden from view.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດຟີມ\n"
": ຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດຄືເລືອກ \"ສີ\" ຫຼື \"ຂາວດຳ\". ຫາກທ່ານເລືອກ \"ຂາວດຳ\", ແຖບເລື່ອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ ເລື່ອງສີໂດຍສະເພາະຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "film properties"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດຟີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tab contains a number of basic settings. If, after adjusting these settings, your image is still not quite as you would like it, you can make further adjustments on the [_corrections_](#corrections) tab. These are technical settings, and serve a similar purpose to the _scene_ tab in the [_filmic rgb_](filmic-rgb.md) module, in that they adjust the black and white points and hence define the dynamic range of the negative.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບນີ້ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນຖານຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ຫາກປັບແລ້ວຮູບຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ທ່ານສາມາດ ປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນແຖບ [_ການແກ້ໄຂ_](#corrections). ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທາງເຕັກນິກ ທີ່ມີຈຸດປະສົງຄ້າຍຄືກັບແຖບ _scene_ ໃນໂມດູນ [_filmic rgb_](filmic-rgb.md), ໂດຍເປັນການປັບຈຸດສີດຳ ແລະ ສີຂາວ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຊ່ວງກວ້າງຂອງແສງຂອງຟີມເນກາຕິບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"color of the film base\n"
": Sample an area of the base film stock from your scan. This is the area just outside of the image (an unexposed part of the film). If you are working with black and white negatives, you can leave this slider at its default value (white). If working on color film, click the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) to the right of the color bar, which will create a bounding box covering about 98% of your image. Then, click and drag across an area of your negative which contains only unexposed film stock. This will automatically calculate values for the _D min_ slider(s). It is likely at this point that your image will still look too dark, but you can correct this later.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງພື້ນຟີມ\n"
": ດູດສີຈາກພື້ນທີ່ຂອງເນື້ອຟີມທີ່ສະແກນມາ. ຊຶ່ງແມ່ນບໍລິເວນນອກຮູບ (ສ່ວນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບແສງ). ຫາກເປັນຟີມຂາວດຳ, ທ່ານສາມາດປະຄ່ານີ້ໄວ້ເປັນສີຂາວໄດ້. ຫາກເປັນຟີມສີ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ [ເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ແລ້ວລາກກວມເອົາບໍລິເວນທີ່ເປັນເນື້ອຟີມເປົ່າໆ. ລະບົບຈະຄຳນວນຄ່າ _D min_ ໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຮູບອາດຈະຍັງເບິ່ງມືດຢູ່, ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"D min\n"
": If the _film stock_ is set to \"black and white\", this slider indicates the minimum value corresponding to the unexposed film stock. If the _film stock_ is set to \"color\", this control will consist of 3 separate sliders, one for each of the red, green and blue channels.\n"
msgstr ""
"D min\n"
": ຫາກເລືອກ \"ຂາວດຳ\", ແຖບນີ້ຈະບອກຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງເນື້ອຟີມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບແສງ. ຫາກເລືອກ \"ສີ\", ຈະມີ 3 ແຖບແຍກຕາມຊ່ອງສັນຍານ ສີແດງ, ສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີຟ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"D max\n"
": This slider represents the dynamic range of your film, and it effectively sets the film's white point. Dragging this slider to the left will make the negative brighter. Dragging it to the right will make the negative darker. When adjusting this slider manually, it's a good idea to closely watch your histogram to ensure that you don't clip the highlights (where the histogram has been pushed over too far off the right hand side of the graph). If you click the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) icon (on the right) negadoctor will automatically calculate this value to ensure maximal use of the histogram without clipping. To use the picker, click and drag to draw a rectangle across only the exposed parts of the negative. Don't include the unexposed film stock, as this will skew the result.\n"
msgstr ""
"D max\n"
": ແຖບນີ້ສະແດງເຖິງຊ່ວງກວ້າງຂອງແສງຂອງຟີມ ແລະ ເປັນການກຳນົດຈຸດສີຂາວຂອງຟີມ. ການລາກໄປທາງຊ້າຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ, ລາກໄປທາງຂວາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບມືດລົງ. ຫາກປັບເອງ, ໃຫ້ສັງເກດຮິສໂຕແກຣມບໍ່ໃຫ້ສ່ວນຈຸດສະຫວ່າງຖືກຕັດ (clipping). ຫາກຄລິກ [ເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers), negadoctor ຈະຄຳນວນຄ່າໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໃຫ້ລາກກວມເອົາສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ມີຮູບພາບ ໂດຍບໍ່ລວມສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນເນື້ອຟີມເປົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scan exposure bias\n"
": This slider allows you to set the black point. It is a technical adjustment that ensures a proper zeroing of the RGB values and a spreading of the histogram between [0, 1] values for robustness in the operations that follow. Dragging this to the left will make the negative brighter. Dragging to the right will make the negative darker. When adjusting this slider manually, it's a good idea to closely watch your histogram to ensure that you don't clip the shadows (where the histogram is pushed too far off the left hand side of the graph). If you click the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) negadoctor will automatically calculate any required offset. To use the picker, select a region in the darkest lowlights, or select the entire image without including any unexposed film stock. Double-check the histogram to ensure the left part of it doesn't clip.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຊົດເຊີຍແສງໃນການສະແກນ (scan exposure bias)\n"
": ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຈຸດສີດຳ (black point). ມັນແມ່ນການປັບທາງເຕັກນິກເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຄ່າ "
"RGB ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນສູນຢ່າງເໝາະສົມ ແລະ ມີການກະຈາຍຂອງຮິສໂຕແກຣມລະຫວ່າງຄ່າ [0, 1] ເພື່ອຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳໃນ"
"ຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ. ການເລື່ອນໄປທາງຊ້າຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເນກາທີບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ. ການເລື່ອນໄປທາງຂວາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເ"
"ນກາທີບມືດລົງ. ເມື່ອປັບແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ຄວນເບິ່ງຮິສໂຕແກຣມຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັດສ່ວນ"
"ເງົາ ( shadows) ອອກ (ບ່ອນທີ່ຮິສໂຕແກຣມຖືກດັນອອກໄປທາງຊ້າຍຂອງກຣາຟຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ). ຖ້າທ່ານຄລິກເຄື່ອງ"
"ມືເລືອກສີ [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers)"
", negadoctor ຈະຄຳນວນຄ່າຊົດເຊີຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ໃນສ່"
"ວນທີ່ມືດທີ່ສຸດ, ຫຼື ເລືອກທັງໝົດຮູບໂດຍບໍ່ລວມສ່ວນຂອງຟິມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບແສງ (unexposed film stock). ກວດສອບ"
"ຮິສໂຕແກຣມອີກຄັ້ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າສ່ວນເບື້ອງຊ້າຍບໍ່ຖືກຕັດອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tab contains sliders that allow you to make color cast corrections within both the shadow and highlight regions.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບນີ້ມີແຖບເລື່ອນທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານແກ້ໄຂສີທີ່ຜິດພ້ຽນ (color cast) ທັງໃນສ່ວນເງົາ ແລະ ຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The settings on this tab should not be needed for most well-preserved negatives. It is mostly useful for old and poorly-preserved negatives with a decayed film base that introduces undesirable color casts.\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນແຖບນີ້ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບຟີມທີ່ຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ເປັນຢ່າງດີ. ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບຟີມເກົ່າ ຫຼື ຟີມທີ່ເສື່ອມສະພາບ ຊຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສີຜິດພ້ຽນທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The other case where these color cast corrections may be needed is if the white balance properties of the light used to scan the film negative are significantly different to the light source under which the original film camera took the shot. For example, if you illuminate the film with an LED light, but the original shot was taken under daylight, this may require some additional color cast corrections.\n"
msgstr "ອີກກໍລະນີໜຶ່ງທີ່ອາດຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂນີ້ຄື ເມື່ອແສງທີ່ໃຊ້ສະແກນຟີມມີຄຸນສົມບັດສົມດຸນສີຂາວ ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຫຼາຍຈາກແສງທີ່ໃຊ້ຖ່າຍຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ໄຟ LED ສ່ອງຟີມ ແຕ່ຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບຖ່າຍໃນແສງແດດ, ອາດຈະຕ້ອງມີການປັບແກ້ສີຜິດພ້ຽນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"shadows color cast\n"
": These three sliders allow you to correct for color casts in the shadows by adjusting the _red_, _green_ and _blue_ channels individually. Use the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) to set the sliders automatically by selecting a neutral gray shadow region requiring correction. Because the shadows sliders can also affect color casts in the highlights, it is important to finish setting the shadows sliders before moving on to the highlights sliders.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີເພ້ຽນໃນສ່ວນເງົາ\n"
": ແຖບເລື່ອນທັງສາມນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂສີເພ້ຽນໃນສ່ວນເງົາໄດ້ ໂດຍການປັບຊ່ອງສັນຍານ _ແດງ_, _ຂຽວ_ ແລະ _ຟ້າ_ ແຍກກັນ. ໃຊ້ [ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າແຖບເລື່ອນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ດ້ວຍການເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ເງົາທີ່ເປັນສີເທີກາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂ. ເນື່ອງຈາກແຖບເລື່ອນສ່ວນເງົາສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ສີເພ້ຽນໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງໄດ້, ມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງປັບແຖບເລື່ອນສ່ວນເງົາໃຫ້ສຳເລັດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໄປປັບແຖບເລື່ອນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"highlights white balance\n"
": These three sliders allow you to correct the white balance in the highlights by adjusting the _red_, _green_ and _blue_ channels individually. Use the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) to set the sliders automatically by selecting a neutral gray region in the highlights that is not properly balanced.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄວບາລານໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ\n"
": ແຖບເລື່ອນທັງສາມນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄວບາລານໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງໄດ້ ໂດຍການປັບຊ່ອງສັນຍານ _ແດງ_, _ຂຽວ_ ແລະ _ຟ້າ_ ແຍກກັນ. ໃຊ້ [ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າແຖບເລື່ອນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ດ້ວຍການເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ສີເທີກາງໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນສົມດຸນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "print properties"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດການພິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tab contains settings that mimic the tonal effect of the photochemical papers that would have been used to create the hard copy image if you were not developing the photo digitally. These are creative settings, and serve a similar overall purpose to the creative tone curve settings on the _look_ tab of the [_filmic rgb_](filmic-rgb.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ແທັບນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຈຳລອງເອັບເຟັກໂທນສີຂອງເຈ້ຍເຄມີສຳລັບຮູບ ທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບແບບແຜ່ນພິມ ຫາກເຈົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລ້າງຮູບແບບດິຈິຕອນ. ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບສ້າງສັນ ແລະ ມີຈຸດປະສົງໂດຍລວມຄ້າຍຄືກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ (tone curve) ໃນແທັບ _ລັກສະນະ (look)_ ຂອງໂມດູນ [_filmic rgb_](filmic-rgb.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _print exposure_, _paper black_ and _paper grade_ are analogous to the _slope_, _offset_ and _power_ controls in the [_color balance_](color-balance.md) module (which in turn is based on the ASC CDL standard). These settings define a creative tone curve to enforce your contrast intent after the inversion, at the end of the module. The equation governing this slope/offset/power behaviour is:\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າ _ການຮັບແສງການພິມ_, _ສີດຳຂອງເຈ້ຍ_ ແລະ _ເກຣດຂອງເຈ້ຍ_ ແມ່ນທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຄວບຄຸມ _ຄວາມລາດຊັນ (slope)_, _ຄ່າເບ່ຽງເບນ (offset)_ ແລະ _ກຳລັງ (power)_ ໃນໂມດູນ [_color balance_](color-balance.md) (ເຊິ່ງອີງຕາມມາດຕະຖານ ASC CDL). ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກຳນົດເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີແບບສ້າງສັນ ເພື່ອເນັ້ນຄວາມຕັ້ງໃຈຂອງຄອນທຣາສຫຼັງຈາກການກັບສີ (inversion) ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງໂມດູນ. ສົມຜົນທີ່ຄວບຄຸມພຶດຕິກຳ slope/offset/power ນີ້ຄື:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_RGB_out_ = ( _RGB_in_ × _exposure_ + _black_ ) ᵍʳᵃᵈᵉ\n"
msgstr "_RGB_out_ = ( _RGB_in_ × _exposure_ + _black_ ) ᵍʳᵃᵈᵉ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"paper black (density correction)\n"
": For this slider, select the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) and click and drag to select a region that encompasses only the exposed part of the film negative. If you can see unexposed film stock around the edges of your image, ensure that these areas are excluded from the drawn rectangle when calculating the _paper black_ setting. Paper black represents the density of the blackest silver-halide crystal available on the virtual paper. In the analog development process, this black density always results in non-zero luminance, but the digital pipeline usually expects black to be encoded with a zero RGB value. This slider setting lets you remap paper black to pipeline black via an offset. You can use the picker to select a region of the image that should be mapped to black in the final image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີດຳຂອງເຈ້ຍ (ການແກ້ໄຂຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນ)\n"
": ສຳລັບແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ແລ້ວຄລິກລາກເພື່ອເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກວມເອົາສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກແສງຂອງຟິມເນກາຕີບ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າເຫັນເນື້ອຟິມສ່ວນທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກແສງຢູ່ບໍລິເວນຂອບຮູບ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກແຍກອອກຈາກຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກທີ່ລາກໄວ້ໃນເວລາກຳນົດຄ່າ _ສີດຳຂອງເຈ້ຍ_. ສີດຳຂອງເຈ້ຍສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງຜລຶກຊີວເວີ-ຮາໄລທີ່ດຳທີ່ສຸດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນເຈ້ຍຈຳລອງ. ໃນຂະບວນການລ້າງຮູບແບບອະນາລັອກ, ຄວາມໜາແໜ້ນຂອງສີດຳນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນສະເໝີ, ແຕ່ໃນລະບົບດິຈິຕອນມັກຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສີດຳຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍຄ່າ RGB ເປັນສູນ. ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກຳນົດຄ່າສີດຳຂອງເຈ້ຍໃຫ້ເປັນສີດຳຂອງລະບົບຜ່ານຄ່າເບ່ຽງເບນ (offset). ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີເພື່ອເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ຂອງຮູບທີ່ຄວນຈະກາຍເປັນສີດຳໃນຮູບສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"paper grade (gamma)\n"
": This slider is your gamma (contrast) control, and it defaults to a value of 4. If all has gone well, this value (4) minus the value of D max (from the “film properties” tab) should normally leave you with a value between 2 and 3.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເກຣດຂອງເຈ້ຍ (ແກມມາ) (paper grade (gamma))\n"
": ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ແມ່ນການຄວບຄຸມແກມມາ (ຄວາມຕັດກັນ), ແລະ ມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ 4. ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຄ່ານີ້ "
"(4) ລົບດ້ວຍຄ່າ D max (ຈາກແຖບ “film properties”) ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຄວນຈະໄດ້ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 2 ຫາ "
"3.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"paper gloss (specular highlights)\n"
": This slider is essentially a highlights compression tool. As you drag this slider to the left, you will see in the histogram that the highlight values are being compressed (pushed to the left). Adjust this accordingly, so that your highlights are not clipped in the histogram. You can also use this to simulate a matte photo print with low-contrast highlights.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເງົາຂອງເຈ້ຍ (ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງທີ່ສະທ້ອນແສງ)\n"
": ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືບີບອັດສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ. ເມື່ອເຈົ້າລາກແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ໄປທາງຊ້າຍ, ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນໃນຮິສໂຕແກຣມວ່າຄ່າສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງກຳລັງຖືກບີບອັດ (ຖືກດັນໄປທາງຊ້າຍ). ປັບຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງຂອງເຈົ້າຖືກຕັດ (clipped) ໃນຮິສໂຕແກຣມ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຈຳລອງການພິມຮູບແບບດ້ານ (matte) ທີ່ມີສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງຄອນທຣາສຕ່ຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/negadoctor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"print exposure adjustment\n"
": This slider offers one final opportunity to correct any clipping of the highlights. If you have followed all the previous instructions carefully, you shouldn't need to adjust this setting. Note that you can increase the print exposure while at the same time decreasing the paper gloss, which allows you to brighten the mid-tones without losing any highlights. You can use the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) to select the brightest highlights, or select the entire image without including any unexposed film stock. This will set the exposure so that the brightest part of the selected region is not clipped. Double-check the histogram to make sure that the right part of the histogram doesn't clip.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປັບການຮັບແສງການພິມ\n"
": ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ເປັນໂອກາດສຸດທ້າຍໃນການແກ້ໄຂການຖືກຕັດ (clipping) ຂອງສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ. ຫາກເຈົ້າໄດ້ເຮັດຕາມຄຳແນະນຳກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມການຮັບແສງການພິມໃນຂະນະທີ່ຫຼຸດຄວາມເງົາຂອງເຈ້ຍລົງໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໃຫ້ໂທນກາງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ເສຍລາຍລະອຽດສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ເພື່ອເລືອກສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງທີ່ສຸດ, ຫຼື ເລືອກທັງໝົດຮູບໂດຍບໍ່ລວມເອົາເນື້ອຟິມທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກແສງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກຳນົດການຮັບແສງເພື່ອໃຫ້ສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງທີ່ສຸດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເລືອກບໍ່ຖືກຕັດ. ກວດເບິ່ງຮິສໂຕແກຣມຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າສ່ວນເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຮິສໂຕແກຣມບໍ່ຖືກຕັດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "lowpass"
msgstr "ໂລພາດ (lowpass)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": isolate low frequencies in the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ແຍກຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳໃນຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input\n"
": linear or non-linear, Lab, scene-referred.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂາເຂົ້າ\n"
": ແບບເສັ້ນ (linear) ຫຼື ບໍ່ເປັນເສັ້ນ, Lab, scene-referred.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"output\n"
": special, Lab, scene-referred.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂາອອກ\n"
": ແບບພິເສດ, Lab, scene-referred.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a low pass filter (for example, a Gaussian blur) to the image, while controlling the output contrast and saturation. \n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: Gaussian blur) ກັບຮູບພາບ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄວບຄຸມຄອນທຣາສ ແລະ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີຂອງຜົນລັບ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module is primarily intended to be used in combination with a [blend mode](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md). For example, try using the _local contrast mask_ preset with the _overlay_ blend mode.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [ໂໝດການປະສົມ](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ລອງໃຊ້ preset _local contrast mask_ ຮ່ວມກັບໂໝດການປະສົມ _overlay_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_**Note:** This module performs blurs in Lab color space, which can produce undesirable effects, and is no longer recommended. Instead, use the [contrast equalizer](./contrast-equalizer.md) module for blurring or the [tone equalizer](./tone-equalizer.md) module for dynamic range compression._\n"
msgstr "_**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ໂມດູນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກເບລີໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ Lab ຊຶ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຜົນກະທົບທີ່ບໍ່ເພິ່ງປະສົງ ແລະ ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [contrast equalizer](./contrast-equalizer.md) ສຳລັບການເຮັດໃຫ້ເບລີ ຫຼື ໂມດູນ [tone equalizer](./tone-equalizer.md) ສຳລັບການບີບອັດຊ່ວງກວ້າງຂອງແສງ._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"radius\n"
": The radius of the blur.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີ (radius)\n"
": ລັດສະໝີຂອງການເຮັດໃຫ້ເບລີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"soften with\n"
": The blur algorithm to use:\n"
": - _gaussian blur_: Blur all image channels (L, a, b)\n"
": - _bilateral filter_: Blur the L channel only, while preserving edges\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ເນື້ອນຸ່ມດ້ວຍ\n"
": ສູດຄຳນວນການເຮັດໃຫ້ເບລີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້:\n"
": - _gaussian blur_: ເຮັດໃຫ້ເບລີທຸກຊ່ອງສັນຍານ (L, a, b)\n"
": - _bilateral filter_: ເຮັດໃຫ້ເບລີສະເພາະຊ່ອງສັນຍານ L, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາຂອບພາບໄວ້\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"contrast\n"
": Higher absolute values increase contrast. Lower absolute values reduce contrast. Negative values result in an inverted negative image. A value of zero leads to a neutral plane.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄອນທຣາສ\n"
": ຄ່າສຳບູນທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສ. ຄ່າສຳບູນທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະຫຼຸດຄອນທຣາສ. ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ພາບປີ້ນ (negative image). ຄ່າສູນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ພາບທີ່ຮາບພຽງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"brightness\n"
": Negative values darken the image. Positive values lighten the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (brightness)\n"
": ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບມືດລົງ. ຄ່າບວກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saturation\n"
": The color saturation. Negative values result in complementary colors by inverting the a/b channels. Higher absolute values increase color saturation. Lower absolute values reduce color saturation. A value of zero fully desaturates the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ (saturation)\n"
": ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ສີກົງກັນຂ້າມໂດຍການປີ້ນຊ່ອງສັນຍານ a/b. ຄ່າສຳບູນທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ. ຄ່າສຳບູນທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ. ຄ່າສູນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບເປັນຂາວດຳສະນິດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "(deprecated) basic adjustments"
msgstr "(ຍົກເລີກການນຳໃຊ້) ການປັບແຕ່ງພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": apply usual image adjustments.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ການປັບແຕ່ງຮູບພາບທົ່ວໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Please note that this module is [deprecated](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) from darktable 3.6 and should no longer be used for new edits. Please use the [quick access panel](../../darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md) instead.**\n"
msgstr "**ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າໂມດູນນີ້ໄດ້ [ຍົກເລີກການນຳໃຊ້](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) ຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 3.6 ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ອີກ. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ [ແຜງເຂົ້າເຖິງດ່ວນ](../../darkroom/organization/quick-access-panel.md) ແທນ.**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A convenience module that combines controls from [_exposure_](./exposure.md), [_highlight reconstruction_](./highlight-reconstruction.md), [_color balance_](./color-balance.md) and [_vibrance_](./vibrance.md) into a single module. \n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ລວມເອົາການຄວບຄຸມຈາກຫຼາຍໆໂມດູນມາໄວ້ບ່ອນດຽວກັນເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While this module can provide a quick and convenient way to make simple adjustments to an image, it must be used with care. Normally exposure adjustments should come before [input color profile](./input-color-profile.md) in the pixelpipe, and color adjustments should come after. Because the _basic adjustments_ module combines all of these functions into a single operation in the pixelpipe, it may not play nicely with other modules. Therefore, if you plan to use _basic adjustments_ with other modules, please instead consider using the [_exposure_](exposure.md) + [_base curve_](base-curve.md) / [_tone curve_](tone-curve.md) / [filmic rgb](filmic-rgb.md) + [_color balance_](color-balance.md) modules so that these operations occur in the correct places in the pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງວ່າຈະສະດວກ, ແຕ່ຄວນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ ເພາະມັນລວມຫຼາຍໜ້າທີ່ເຂົ້າໃນຂັ້ນຕອນດຽວຂອງ pixelpipe ເຊິ່ງອາດສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄຸນນະພາບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"black level correction\n"
": Equivalent to black level correction in the [_exposure_](exposure.md) module, this slider defines the threshold at which dark gray values are cut off to pure black. Reducing this can bring some dark colors back into gamut. Increasing this slider may appear to increase the contrast and pop of an image, but it can push dark colors out of gamut, and clipped data cannot be recovered further down the pixel pipe. To control the contrast in the shadows, it is better to use other modules such as [_tone curve_](tone-curve.md) or [_levels_](levels.md), which mitigate these negative impacts further down the pixel pipeline.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການແກ້ໄຂລະດັບສີດຳ (black level correction)\n"
": ກຳນົດລະດັບທີ່ໂທນສີເທີົາມືດຈະຖືກຕັດໃຫ້ເປັນສີດຳສະນິດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exposure\n"
": Adjust exposure compensation. Adding 1 EV of exposure compensation is equivalent to doubling the exposure time in camera, opening the aperture by 1 stop, or doubling the ISO. \n"
msgstr ""
"ການຮັບແສງ (exposure)\n"
": ປັບການຊົດເຊີຍການຮັບແສງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Positive exposure corrections will make the image brighter. As a side effect noise level is increased. Depending on the basic noise level of your camera and the ISO value of your image, positive exposure compensations with up to 1EV or 2EV should still give reasonable results.\n"
msgstr ": ການປັບຄ່າບວກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ນອຍສ໌ (noise) ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Negative exposure corrections will make the image darker. Given the nature of digital images this can not correct for fully blown out highlights but allows you to reconstruct data if only some of the RGB channels are clipped (see the [_highlight reconstruction_](highlight-reconstruction.md) module for information on how to deal with clipped pixels).\n"
msgstr ": ການປັບຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບມືດລົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"highlight compression\n"
": Compress the highlights of the image in order to recover detail.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການບີບອັດສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ (highlight compression)\n"
": ບີບອັດສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງເກີນໄປເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນລາຍລະອຽດຄືນມາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"contrast\n"
": Equivalent to the _contrast_ slider in the [_color balance_](color-balance.md) module, this is used to increase the separation of luminance values around a fulcrum point, in effect making the tone curve steeper. The _middle gray_ slider sets the fulcrum point for the contrast, and any pixels whose luminance matches this middle gray point will be unaffected. Pixels brighter than the middle gray point will become even brighter, and pixels darker than the middle gray point will become even darker.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast)\n"
": ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງອ້ອມຮອບຈຸດໝຸນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preserve colors\n"
": If a non-linear tone curve is applied to each of the RGB channels individually, then the amount of tone adjustment applied to each color channel may be different, and this can cause hue shifts. Therefore, the _preserve colors_ menu provides different methods of calculating the \"luminance level\" of a pixel. The amount of tone adjustment is calculated based on this luminance value, and then this same adjustment is applied to all three of the RGB channels. Different luminance estimators can affect the contrast in different parts of the image, depending on the specific characteristics of that image. The user can therefore choose a particular estimator that provides the best results for the given image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາສີ (preserve colors)\n"
": ວິທີການຕ່າງໆໃນການຄຳນວນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສີຜິດພ້ຽນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"middle gray\n"
": Set the fulcrum point for the _contrast_ slider. This is equivalent to the _contrast fulcrum_ slider on the [_color balance_](color-balance.md) module. If the contrast slider is set to 0 this slider will not have any effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີເທີົາກາງ (middle gray)\n"
": ກຳນົດຈຸດໝຸນສຳລັບການປັບຄວາມຄົມຊັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"brightness\n"
": Equivalent to increasing the _gamma factor_ slider in the [_color balance_](color-balance.md) module. Moving the slider to the right will increase the brightness of the image, with an emphasis on the mid-tones.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (brightness)\n"
": ເພີ່ມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍເນັ້ນທີ່ໂທນສີກາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saturation\n"
": Equivalent to the _output saturation_ slider on the [_color balance_](color-balance.md) module, this slider affects the saturation, or brilliance and intensity of the colors. Moving the slider to the right will increase the amount of color in the image; moving the slider to the left will reduce the amount of color in the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ (saturation)\n"
": ປັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີໃນຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"vibrance\n"
": Accentuate the colors of the image without adding unnatural colors, as it's often the case with the _saturation_ slider. It works by reducing the lightness of already saturated pixels to make the colors more vivid. You can also achieve some interesting effects by combining it with the saturation slider to target more or less saturated areas of the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສົດຂອງສີ (vibrance)\n"
": ເພີ່ມຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີໃນແບບທີ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດກວ່າການໃຊ້ saturation.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"auto\n"
": Automatically adjust the exposure, taking into account the entire image, or use the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) to select a rectangular area of the image -- the exposure will be automatically adjusted based on the selected region. This allows you to prioritise which parts of the image should be well-exposed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto)\n"
": ປັບການຮັບແສງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/basic-adjustments.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clip\n"
": This affects the number of pixels that will be clipped to black or white during the auto-exposure calculation. Moving this slider to the right will allow more pixels to be clipped and increase the contrast; moving this slider to the left will compress the image more and lower the contrast.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕັດແສງ (clip)\n"
": ກຳນົດຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ຈະຖືກຕັດໃຫ້ເປັນສີດຳ ຫຼື ສີຂາວໃນລະຫວ່າງການຄຳນວນອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "liquify"
msgstr "ລິຄວິຟາຍ (liquify)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": distort parts of the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ບິດເບືອນບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move pixels around by applying freestyle distortions to parts of the image using points, lines and curves.\n"
msgstr "ຍ້າຍພິກເຊລໂດຍການບິດເບືອນແບບອິດສະຫຼະໃນບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຈຸດ, ເສັ້ນຊື່ ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As you might want to use source data from any part of the image you will be shown the uncropped image (possibly with the cropping rectangle overlaid as a guide) while the module is active.\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກພາກສ່ວນໃດກໍໄດ້ຂອງຮູບ, ລະບົບຈະສະແດງຮູບແບບເຕັມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັດ (ອາດຈະມີເສັ້ນກອບການຕັດວາງຊ້ອນໄວ້ເປັນແນວທາງ) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each of liquify's tools is based on nodes. A point consists of a single node and a line or curve consists of a sequence of linked nodes defining a path.\n"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືແຕ່ລະຢ່າງໃນລິຄວິຟາຍແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ ໂນດ (nodes). ຈຸດໜຶ່ງຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍໂນດດຽວ, ສ່ວນເສັ້ນຊື່ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະປະກອບດ້ວຍກຸ່ມຂອງໂນດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນເປັນເສັ້ນທາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each instance of the liquify module is limited to a maximum of 100 nodes -- for more nodes, use additional instances. However, please note that the liquify module consumes a lot of system resources.\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະການເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນລິຄວິຟາຍແມ່ນຈຳກັດໂນດສູງສຸດ 100 ໂນດ -- ຫາກຕ້ອງການຫຼາຍກວ່ານັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ ໂມດູນນີ້ເພີ່ມອີກອັນໃໝ່. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າໂມດູນລິຄວິຟາຍໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນລະບົບຂ້ອນຂ້າງຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drag the central point of a node to move the node around. The radius describes the area of the effect (distortion occurs only within this radius). To change the radius drag the handle at the circumference. A strength vector starting from the center describes the direction of the distortion, and its strength is depicted by the length of the vector. Change the vector by dragging its arrow head.\n"
msgstr "ລາກຈຸດສູນກາງຂອງໂນດເພື່ອຍ້າຍມັນໄປມາ. ລັດສະໝີຈະບອກຂອບເຂດຂອງເອັບເຟັກ (ການບິດເບືອນຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ ສະເພາະພາຍໃນລັດສະໝີນີ້). ເພື່ອປ່ຽນລັດສະໝີ ໃຫ້ລາກຈຸດທີ່ຂອບວົງມົນ. ເວກເຕີຄວາມແຮງທີ່ເລີ່ມຈາກສູນກາງ ຈະບອກທິດທາງຂອງການບິດເບືອນ, ແລະ ຄວາມແຮງຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍຄວາມຍາວຂອງເວກເຕີ. ປ່ຽນເວກເຕີໂດຍການລາກຫົວລູກສອນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "points"
msgstr "ຈຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A point consists of a single node and strength vector.\n"
msgstr "ຈຸດໜຶ່ງປະກອບດ້ວຍໂນດດຽວ ແລະ ເວກເຕີຄວາມແຮງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the point icon to activate the point tool and then click on the image to place it. Hold Ctrl while clicking on the point icon to add multiple points without having to click the icon again each time. Right-click to exit creation mode.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນຈຸດເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືຈຸດ ແລ້ວຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບເພື່ອວາງມັນ. ກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະຄລິກໄອຄອນ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຫຼາຍຈຸດໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຄລິກໄອຄອນຊ້ຳ. ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອອອກຈາກໂໝດການສ້າງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "point modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດຂອງຈຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The strength vector of a point has three different modes. These can be toggled by holding Ctrl and clicking on the arrowhead of the strength vector.\n"
msgstr "ເວກເຕີຄວາມແຮງຂອງຈຸດມີສາມໂໝດ. ສາມາດສະຫຼັບໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ແລ້ວຄລິກທີ່ຫົວລູກສອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"linear\n"
": A linear distortion inside the circle, starting from the opposite side of the strength vector and following the vector's direction. This is the default mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແບບເສັ້ນ (linear)\n"
": ການບິດເບືອນແບບເສັ້ນພາຍໃນວົງມົນ, ເລີ່ມຈາກດ້ານກົງກັນຂ້າມຂອງເວກເຕີຄວາມແຮງ ແລະ ໄປຕາມທິດທາງ ຂອງເວກເຕີ. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![linear](./liquify/liquify_ex1.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![linear](./liquify/liquify_ex1.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"radial growing\n"
": The strength vector's effect is radial, starting with a strength of 0% in the center and increasing away from the center. This mode is depicted by an additional circle with the arrow pointing outwards.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂະຫຍາຍອອກຕາມລັດສະໝີ (radial growing)\n"
": ເອັບເຟັກຈະເປັນແບບກະຈາຍອອກ, ເລີ່ມຈາກຄວາມແຮງ 0% ຢູ່ສູນກາງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຫ່າງອອກໄປ. ໂໝດນີ້ສະແດງດ້ວຍວົງມົນເພີ່ມເຕີມພ້ອມລູກສອນຊີ້ອອກຂ້າງນອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![radial growing](./liquify/liquify_ex4.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![radial growing](./liquify/liquify_ex4.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"radial shrinking\n"
": The strength vector's effect is radial, starting with a strength of 100% in the center and decreasing away from the center. This mode is depicted by an additional circle with the arrow pointing inwards.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫົດເຂົ້າຕາມລັດສະໝີ (radial shrinking)\n"
": ເອັບເຟັກຈະເປັນແບບກະຈາຍເຂົ້າ, ເລີ່ມຈາກຄວາມແຮງ 100% ຢູ່ສູນກາງ ແລະ ຫຼຸດລົງເມື່ອຫ່າງອອກໄປ. ໂໝດນີ້ສະແດງດ້ວຍວົງມົນເພີ່ມເຕີມພ້ອມລູກສອນຊີ້ເຂົ້າຂ້າງໃນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![radial shrinking](./liquify/liquify_ex3.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![radial shrinking](./liquify/liquify_ex3.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "feathering"
msgstr "ການເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຟຸ້ງ (feathering)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"default mode\n"
": By default the strength varies linearly from 0% to 100% between the center and the radius of the control point. It is possible to modify the feathering effect by clicking on the center of the circle.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
": ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ ຄວາມແຮງຈະປ່ຽນແປງແບບເສັ້ນຈາກ 0% ຫາ 100% ລະຫວ່າງສູນກາງ ແລະ ລັດສະໝີຂອງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນເອັບເຟັກຂອບຟຸ້ງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ສູນກາງວົງມົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![default](./liquify/liquify_ex1.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![default](./liquify/liquify_ex1.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"feathered mode\n"
": In \"feathered\" mode, two control circles are displayed, which can be modified independently to feather the strength of the effect. Note that clicking the center of the circle again hides the feathering controls but does _not_ return to the default mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຂອບຟຸ້ງ\n"
": ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ວົງມົນຄວບຄຸມສອງອັນຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນ ຊຶ່ງສາມາດປັບແຍກກັນໄດ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງເອັບເຟັກຟຸ້ງ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ການຄລິກສູນກາງວົງມົນອີກຄັ້ງຈະເຊື່ອງການຄວບຄຸມ ແຕ່ _ບໍ່ໄດ້_ ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າກັບໄປໃຊ້ໂໝດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![feathered](./liquify/liquify_ex2.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![feathered](./liquify/liquify_ex2.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "removing points"
msgstr "ການລຶບຈຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A point can be removed by right-clicking on the center of the node.\n"
msgstr "ສາມາດລຶບຈຸດໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ສູນກາງຂອງໂນດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "lines and curves"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນຊື່ ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lines and curves are sequences of points linked together by straight or curved lines. The effect is interpolated by a set of associated strength vectors.\n"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນຊື່ ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂອງຈຸດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ. ເອັບເຟັກຈະຖືກຄຳນວນສະເລ່ຍໂດຍກຸ່ມຂອງເວກເຕີຄວາມແຮງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the appropriate icon to activate the line or curve tool and then click on the image to place a sequence of points forming the path. Right-click anywhere when the last point has been placed in order to finish drawing the line/curve.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເສັ້ນຊື່ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ແລ້ວຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບເພື່ອວາງຈຸດຕ່າງໆ ໃຫ້ເປັນເສັ້ນທາງ. ຄລິກຂວາບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ເມື່ອວາງຈຸດສຸດທ້າຍແລ້ວເພື່ອຈົບການແຕ້ມເສັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hold Ctrl while clicking on the line/curve icon to add multiple lines/curves without having to click the icon again each time. Right-click a second time to exit creation mode after the final line or curve has been completed.\n"
msgstr "ກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະຄລິກໄອຄອນເພື່ອເພີ່ມຫຼາຍເສັ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຄລິກໄອຄອນຊ້ຳ. ຄລິກຂວາເທື່ອທີສອງເພື່ອອອກຈາກໂໝດການສ້າງຫຼັງຈາກແຕ້ມເສັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lines\n"
": ![lines](./liquify/liquify_ex5.png#w50)\n"
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນຊື່\n"
": ![lines](./liquify/liquify_ex5.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curves\n"
": ![curves](./liquify/liquify_ex6.png#w50)\n"
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ\n"
": ![curves](./liquify/liquify_ex6.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ctrl+click on a line or curve segment to add a new control point. Ctrl+right-click on the center of a node to remove a control point.\n"
msgstr "ກົດ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນເພື່ອເພີ່ມຈຸດຄວບຄຸມໃໝ່. ກົດ Ctrl+ຄລິກຂວາ ໃສ່ສູນກາງຂອງໂນດເພື່ອລຶບຈຸດຄວບຄຸມອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click on a segment to remove the shape completely. Ctrl+Alt+click on a segment to change that segment from a line to a curve and vice versa.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນເພື່ອລຶບຮູບຮ່າງນັ້ນອອກທັງໝົດ. ກົດ Ctrl+Alt+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກເສັ້ນຊື່ເປັນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ຫຼື ໃນທາງກັບກັນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "link modes"
msgstr "ໂໝດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ctrl+click on the center of a node to change the way the points of a curve are linked together. There are four modes, which correspond to different ways of handling the steepness of the bezier curve using control handles:\n"
msgstr "ກົດ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ສູນກາງຂອງໂນດເພື່ອປ່ຽນວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງຈຸດໃນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ມີສີ່ໂໝດ ຊຶ່ງກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບວິທີການຈັດການຄວາມຊັນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ bezier ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຂນຄວບຄຸມ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"autosmooth\n"
": This is the default mode, in which control handles are not displayed -- controls are automatically computed to give a smooth curve.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປັບໃຫ້ກົມກືນອັດຕະໂນມັດ (autosmooth)\n"
": ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຊຶ່ງຈະບໍ່ສະແດງແຂນຄວບຄຸມ -- ລະບົບຈະຄຳນວນອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ກົມກືນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cusp\n"
": Control handles can be moved independently. This mode is depicted by a triangle symbol in the node's center.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມຸມແຫຼມ (cusp)\n"
": ແຂນຄວບຄຸມສາມາດຍ້າຍແຍກກັນໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ. ໂໝດນີ້ສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມຢູ່ສູນກາງໂນດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"smooth\n"
": Control handles always give a smooth curve. This mode is depicted by a diamond symbol in the node's center.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກົມກືນ (smooth)\n"
": ແຂນຄວບຄຸມຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງກົມກືນສະເໝີ. ໂໝດນີ້ສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມເຂົ້າໜົມຕັດຢູ່ສູນກາງໂນດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"symmetrical\n"
": Control handles are always moved together. This mode is depicted by a square symbol in the node's center.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສົມມາດ (symmetrical)\n"
": ແຂນຄວບຄຸມຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປພ້ອມກັນສະເໝີ. ໂໝດນີ້ສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຈັດຕຸລັດຢູ່ສູນກາງໂນດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "view and edit nodes"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໂນດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the node tool icon to activate or deactivate the node edit tool. This displays all currently-defined distortion objects and their controls. Alternatively you can right-click on the image at any time for the same effect.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງມືໂນດເພື່ອເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດເຄື່ອງມືແກ້ໄຂໂນດ. ມັນຈະສະແດງວັດຖຸບິດເບືອນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ການຄວບຄຸມຂອງພວກມັນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຮູບຕອນໃດກໍໄດ້ເພື່ອຜົນແບບດຽວກັນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "warps and nodes count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການບິດເບືອນ ແລະ ໂນດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This information field displays the number of warps (individual distortion objects) and nodes currently in use.\n"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະສະແດງຈຳນວນການບິດເບືອນ (ວັດຖຸແຍກແຕ່ລະອັນ) ແລະ ໂນດທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "show guides"
msgstr "ສະແດງເສັ້ນນຳທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/liquify.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tick the box to show guide overlays whenever the module is activated. Click the icon on the right to control the properties of the guides. See [guides & overlays](../utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md) for details.\n"
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງເພື່ອສະແດງເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນເບື້ອງຂວາເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳ. ເບິ່ງ [ເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳ ແລະ ສິ່ງວາງທັບ](../utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "lens correction"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂເລນ (lens correction)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": correct lenses optical flaws.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ບົກພ່ອງທາງແສງຂອງເລນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"processing\n"
": geometric and reconstruction, RGB.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະມວນຜົນ\n"
": ເລຂາຄະນິດ ແລະ ການສ້າງຄືນໃໝ່, RGB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically correct for (or simulate) lens distortion, transverse chromatic aberrations (TCA) and vignetting.\n"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ (ຫຼື ຈຳລອງ) ຄວາມບິດເບືອນຂອງເລນ, ຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຂອງສີ (TCA) ແລະ ຂອບມືດ (vignetting) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can choose to either use lens correction data embedded in your RAW file (where present/supported) or correction data provided by the external [Lensfun library](https://lensfun.github.io/).\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການແກ້ໄຂເລນທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ RAW (ຖ້າມີ/ຮອງຮັບ) ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນການແກ້ໄຂ ທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ [Lensfun library](https://lensfun.github.io/) ຈາກພາຍນອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional controls are also provided for manual vignetting correction, in case the profiles for your lens are insufficient or missing.\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງມີການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂຂອບມືດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເລນຂອງທ່ານ ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that if TCA correction is enabled in this module, also using [_raw chromatic aberrations_](./raw-chromatic-aberrations.md) may cause artifacts from over-correction.\n"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂ TCA ໃນໂມດູນນີ້, ການໃຊ້ [_raw chromatic aberrations_](./raw-chromatic-aberrations.md) ຮ່ວມດ້ວຍອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຈາກການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lensfun correction data"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນການແກ້ໄຂ Lensfun"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your system's Lensfun library has no correction profile for the automatically identified camera/lens combination, the controls for the three photometric parameters (below) are replaced with a warning message. You may try to find the right profile yourself by searching for it in the menu.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າ Lensfun library ໃນລະບົບຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ມີໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການແກ້ໄຂສຳລັບການລວມກັນຂອງກ້ອງ/ເລນທີ່ກວດພົບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ການຄວບຄຸມສຳລັບຄ່າໂຟໂຕເມທຣິກສາມຢ່າງ (ຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້) ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນ. ທ່ານສາມາດລອງຄົ້ນຫາ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນເມນູ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your lens is present in the list but has not been correctly identified, this may require some adjustment within the exiv2 program (see [this post](https://dev.exiv2.org/boards/3/topics/2854) for details). Note that you may need to re-import the images once such adjustments have been made as the lens name is retrieved as part of the import process.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເລນຂອງທ່ານມີຢູ່ໃນລາຍການແຕ່ລະບົບບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ອາດຈະຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງໃນໂປຣແກຣມ exiv2 (ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ [ໂພສນີ້](https://dev.exiv2.org/boards/3/topics/2854)). ໝາຍເຫດ: ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງ ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບຄືນໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກປັບແຕ່ງແລ້ວ ເພາະຊື່ເລນຈະຖືກດຶງມາໃນລະຫວ່າງການນຳເຂົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, only lenses that are directly compatible with your camera's mount are listed and automatically identified. If you are using lenses for a different mount with an adapter (for example a Canon EF lens adapted to a Nikon Z body), then you must run the [`lensfun-add-adapter`](https://lensfun.github.io/manual/latest/lensfun-add-adapter.html) tool to enable those lenses.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ມີພຽງແຕ່ເລນທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງກັບເມົາທ໌ (mount) ຂອງກ້ອງທ່ານເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງ ແລະ ລະບຸອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ເລນຕ່າງເມົາທ໌ຜ່ານອະແດັບເຕີ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເລນ Canon EF ໃສ່ກ້ອງ Nikon Z), ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [`lensfun-add-adapter`](https://lensfun.github.io/manual/latest/lensfun-add-adapter.html) ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານເລນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you can't find your lens, check if it is in the list of [currently supported lenses](https://lensfun.github.io/lenslist/), and try running the [`lensfun-update-data`](https://lensfun.github.io/manual/latest/lensfun-update-data.html) tool. If there is still no matching profile for your lens, a [lens calibration service](https://www.darktable.org/2013/07/have-your-lens-calibrated/) is offered by Torsten Bronger, one of darktable's users. Alternatively you may visit the [Lensfun project](https://lensfun.github.io/calibration/) to learn how to generate your own set of correction parameters. Don't forget to share your profile with the Lensfun team!\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຫາເລນຂອງທ່ານບໍ່ພົບ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງໃນ [ລາຍການເລນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ](https://lensfun.github.io/lenslist/) ແລະ ລອງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [`lensfun-update-data`](https://lensfun.github.io/manual/latest/lensfun-update-data.html). ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ມີໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກົງກັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ [ບໍລິການປັບທຽບເລນ](https://www.darktable.org/2013/07/have-your-lens-calibrated/) ໂດຍ Torsten Bronger ຫຼື ໄປທີ່ [ໂຄງການ Lensfun](https://lensfun.github.io/calibration/) ເພື່ອຮຽນຮູ້ ວິທີສ້າງຄ່າການແກ້ໄຂເອງ. ຢ່າລືມແບ່ງປັນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ກັບທີມງານ Lensfun!\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"correction method\n"
": Choose which method to use to correct distortions. Additional controls will be provided depending on the option selected:\n"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການແກ້ໄຂ\n"
": ເລືອກວິທີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ແກ້ໄຂຄວາມບິດເບືອນ. ການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນຕາມຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເລືອກ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - \"Lensfun database\": Use corrections provided by the Lensfun project.\n"
": - \"embedded metadata\": Use corrections embedded in the metadata of the RAW file. This is only available if supported metadata is found.\n"
": - \"only manual vignette\": Do not perform any automatic correction but provide manual vignette correction.\n"
msgstr ""
": - \"Lensfun database\": ໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງໂຄງການ Lensfun.\n"
": - \"embedded metadata\": ໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ metadata ຂອງໄຟລ໌ RAW. (ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຖ້າມີຂໍ້ມູນຮອງຮັບ).\n"
": - \"only manual vignette\": ບໍ່ໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແຕ່ໃຫ້ປັບຂອບມືດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"corrections\n"
": Choose which corrections (distortion, TCA, vignetting) to apply. Change this from its default \"all\", if your camera has already performed some internal corrections (e.g. vignetting), or if you plan to undertake some corrections with a separate program.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການແກ້ໄຂ\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂໃດ (ຄວາມບິດເບືອນ, TCA, ຂອບມືດ). ປ່ຽນຈາກຄ່າ \"ທັງໝົດ (all)\" ຖ້າກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂບາງຢ່າງມາແລ້ວ ຫຼື ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໄປແກ້ໄຂໃນໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"corrections done\n"
": Occasionally, for a given camera/lens combination, only some of the possible corrections are supported. This message box appears at the bottom of the module to indicate which corrections have actually been applied to the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ສຳເລັດ\n"
": ບາງຄັ້ງ ສຳລັບການລວມກັນຂອງກ້ອງ/ເລນບາງແບບ, ອາດຈະຮອງຮັບການແກ້ໄຂພຽງບາງຢ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ລຸ່ມສຸດເພື່ອບອກວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂໃດແດ່ກັບຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show guides\n"
": Tick the box at the bottom of the module to show guide overlays whenever the module is activated. Click the icon on the right to control the properties of the guides. See [guides & overlays](../utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md) for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເສັ້ນນຳທາງ\n"
": ໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງລຸ່ມສຸດເພື່ອສະແດງເສັ້ນນຳທາງເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ. ຄລິກໄອຄອນທາງຂວາເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມ ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງເສັ້ນນຳທາງ. ເບິ່ງ [ເສັ້ນນຳທາງ ແລະ ສິ່ງວາງຊ້ອນ](../utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lensfun controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມ Lensfun"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following controls are provided for the \"Lensfun\" correction method only:\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບວິທີການແກ້ໄຂແບບ \"Lensfun\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"camera\n"
": The camera make and model as determined by the image's Exif data. You can override this manually and select your camera from a hierarchical menu. Only lenses with correction profiles matching the selected camera will be shown.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກ້ອງ\n"
": ຍີ່ຫໍ້ ແລະ ລຸ້ນຂອງກ້ອງທີ່ລະບຸຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນເອງໄດ້ໂດຍເລືອກຈາກເມນູ. ມີພຽງແຕ່ເລນທີ່ມີໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ກົງກັບກ້ອງທີ່ເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lens\n"
": The lens make and model as determined by the image's Exif data. You can override this manually and select your lens from a hierarchical menu. This is mainly required for pure mechanical lenses, but may also be needed for off-brand / third party lenses.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລນ\n"
": ຍີ່ຫໍ້ ແລະ ລຸ້ນຂອງເລນທີ່ລະບຸຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif. ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນເອງໄດ້ໂດຍເລືອກຈາກເມນູ. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບເລນມືໝຸນ (mechanical) ຫຼື ເລນຄ່າຍອິດສະຫຼະ (third party).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"photometric parameters (focal length, aperture, focal distance)\n"
": Lens corrections depend on certain photometric parameters that are read from the image's Exif data: focal length (for distortion, TCA, vignetting), aperture (for TCA, vignetting) and focal distance (for vignetting). Many cameras do not record focal distance in their Exif data, in which case you will need to set this manually.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າໂຟໂຕເມທຣິກ (ໄລຍະໂຟກັດ, ຮູຮັບແສງ, ໄລຍະຫ່າງໂຟກັດ)\n"
": ການແກ້ໄຂເລນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທີ່ອ່ານມາຈາກ Exif: ໄລຍະໂຟກັດ (ສຳລັບຄວາມບິດເບືອນ, TCA, ຂອບມືດ), ຮູຮັບແສງ (ສຳລັບ TCA, ຂອບມືດ) ແລະ ໄລຍະຫ່າງໂຟກັດ (ສຳລັບຂອບມືດ). ກ້ອງຫຼາຍລຸ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກໄລຍະຫ່າງໂຟກັດ ໃນ Exif, ຊຶ່ງທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You can manually override all automatically selected parameters. Either take one of the predefined values from the drop-down menu or, with the drop-down menu still open, just type in your own value.\n"
msgstr ": ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້. ໂດຍເລືອກຈາກຄ່າທີ່ມີໃຫ້ ຫຼື ພິມຄ່າຂອງທ່ານເອງລົງໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"target geometry\n"
": In addition to correcting lens flaws, this module can change the projection type of your image. Set this combobox to the desired projection type (e.g. \"rectilinear\", \"fisheye\", \"panoramic\", \"equirectangular\", \"orthographic\", \"stereographic\", \"equisolid angle\", \"Thoby fisheye\").  To correct the aspect ratio of an anamorphic lens, use the [_rotate and perspective_](./rotate-perspective.md) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລຂາຄະນິດເປົ້າໝາຍ (target geometry)\n"
": ນອກຈາກການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ບົກພ່ອງຂອງເລນແລ້ວ, ໂມດູນນີ້ຍັງສາມາດປ່ຽນປະເພດການສາຍພາບ (projection "
"type) ຂອງຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້. ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນກ່ອງເລືອກນີ້ເປັນປະເພດການສາຍພາບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"\"rectilinear\", \"fisheye\", \"panoramic\", \"equirectangular\", "
"\"orthographic\", \"stereographic\", \"equisolid angle\", \"Thoby fisheye\")"
". ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບຂອງເລນອະນາມໍຟິກ (anamorphic lens), ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ໝູນ ແລະ ເປສເປັກທີ"
"ບ_](./rotate-perspective.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scale\n"
": Adjust the scaling factor of your image to avoid black corners. Press the auto scale button (to the right of the slider) for darktable to automatically find the best fit.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕາສ່ວນ (scale)\n"
": ປັບອັດຕາສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍຂອງຮູບເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຂອບດຳ. ກົດປຸ່ມປັບອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ທາງຂວາຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນ) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ darktable ຊອກຫາຂະໜາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mode\n"
": The default behavior of this module is to _correct_ lens flaws. Switch this combobox to \"distort\" in order to instead _simulate_ the flaws/distortions of a specific lens (inverted effect).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ\n"
": ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນເພື່ອ _ແກ້ໄຂ_ ຂໍ້ບົກພ່ອງເລນ. ປ່ຽນເປັນ \"distort\" ເພື່ອ _ຈຳລອງ_ ຂໍ້ບົກພ່ອງ/ຄວາມບິດເບືອນ ຂອງເລນສະເພາະ (ຜົນລັບແບບປີ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"TCA override\n"
": Check this box to override the automatic correction parameters for TCA. This will expose the TCA red and TCA blue parameters below. Un-check the box to revert back to automatic corrections.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດ TCA ເອງ\n"
": ໝາຍຕິກບ່ອນນີ້ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຄ່າ TCA ເອງ. ມັນຈະສະແດງຄ່າ TCA ສີແດງ ແລະ ສີຟ້າໃຫ້ປັບ. ຫາກເອົາເຄື່ອງໝາຍອອກ ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ການແກ້ໄຂອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"TCA red; TCA blue\n"
": Override the correction parameters for TCA. You can also use these sliders to manually set the parameters if the lens profile does not include TCA correction. Look out for colored seams at features with high contrast edges and adjust the TCA parameters to minimize those seams.\n"
msgstr ""
"TCA ສີແດງ; TCA ສີຟ້າ\n"
": ປັບແຕ່ງຄ່າການແກ້ໄຂ TCA. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ຫາກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເລນບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນການແກ້ໄຂ TCA. ໃຫ້ສັງເກດຂອບສີທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີຄອນທຣາສສູງ ແລ້ວປັບຄ່າເພື່ອຫຼຸດຂອບສີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** TCA corrections will not be applied to images that have been identified as monochrome (see [developing monochrome images](../../guides-tutorials/monochrome.md) for more information).\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ການແກ້ໄຂ TCA ຈະບໍ່ຖືກໃຊ້ກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກລະບຸວ່າເປັນພາບຂາວດຳ (monochrome) (ເບິ່ງ [ການລ້າງຮູບຂາວດຳ](../../guides-tutorials/monochrome.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The lens correction module will fill in missing data at the borders by repeating the borders' pixels. For strong corrections, this filling can be visible (especially on noisy images). Crop the image if necessary.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ໂມດູນການແກ້ໄຂເລນຈະຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຫາຍໄປຢູ່ຂອບພາບໂດຍການເຮັດຊ້ຳພິກເຊລຂອບ. ຫາກມີການແກ້ໄຂຫຼາຍ, ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ (ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນຮູບທີ່ມີນອຍສ໌ຫຼາຍ). ໃຫ້ຕັດຂອບພາບ (crop) ຫາກຈຳເປັນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "embedded metadata controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມ metadata ທີ່ຝັງມາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following controls are provided for the \"embedded metadata\" correction method only:\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີໄວ້ສຳລັບວິທີການແກ້ໄຂແບບ \"embedded metadata\" ເທົ່ານັ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use latest algorithm\n"
": This control appears for images using an older version of the \"embedded metadata\" correction algorithm. Check this box to irreversibly change to the newer algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ສູດຄຳນວນຫຼ້າສຸດ\n"
": ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ໃຊ້ສູດຄຳນວນການແກ້ໄຂແບບເກົ່າ. ໝາຍຕິກບ່ອນນີ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນເປັນສູດຄຳນວນໃໝ່ (ການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້ອນກັບໄດ້).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following controls can be revealed by clicking the \"fine-tuning\" button:\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"ປັບແຕ່ງລະອຽດ (fine-tuning)\":\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"distortion\n"
": Fine-tune the distortion / chromatic aberration correction.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມບິດເບືອນ (distortion)\n"
": ປັບແຕ່ງລະອຽດການແກ້ໄຂຄວາມບິດເບືອນ / ຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຂອງສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"vignetting\n"
": Fine-tune the vignetting correction.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂອບມືດ (vignetting)\n"
": ປັບແຕ່ງລະອຽດການແກ້ໄຂຂອບມືດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"TCA red\n"
": Fine-tune the red chromatic aberration correction.\n"
msgstr ""
"TCA ສີແດງ\n"
": ປັບແຕ່ງລະອຽດການແກ້ໄຂຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຂອງສີແດງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"TCA blue\n"
": Fine-tune the blue chromatic aberration correction.\n"
msgstr ""
"TCA ສີຟ້າ\n"
": ປັບແຕ່ງລະອຽດການແກ້ໄຂຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຂອງສີຟ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"image scale\n"
": Override the image scaling.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມາດຕາສ່ວນພາບ\n"
": ກຳນົດການຂະຫຍາຍພາບເອງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "manual vignette correction"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂຂອບມືດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full vignetting correction is unavailable or inadequate for many lenses, whether using embedded metadata or the Lensfun database. Click on the \"manual vignetting correction\" button to provide additional adjustments via the following controls.\n"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂຂອບມືດແບບສົມບູນອາດຈະບໍ່ມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບເລນຫຼາຍໆແບບ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ metadata ຫຼື ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Lensfun. ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"manual vignetting correction\" ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ ຜ່ານການຄວບຄຸມດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"strength\n"
": the overall strength of the effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງ (strength)\n"
": ຄວາມແຮງໂດຍລວມຂອງເອັບເຟັກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"radius\n"
": the amount of the image that is unchanged by the correction.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີ (radius)\n"
": ພື້ນທີ່ຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"steepness\n"
": the steepness of the correction effect outside of the radius.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຊັນ (steepness)\n"
": ຄວາມຊັນຂອງເອັບເຟັກການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຢູ່ນອກລັດສະໝີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lens-correction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The effect of the correction can be visualized by clicking on the mask button beside the strength slider.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງຜົນຂອງການແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ ໜ້າກາກ (mask) ທາງຂ້າງແຖບເລື່ອນຄວາມແຮງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "hot pixels"
msgstr "ພິກເຊລທີ່ຜິດປົກກະຕິ (hot pixels)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": remove abnormally bright pixels by dampening them with neighbors.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ລຶບພິກເຊລທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຜິດປົກກະຕິໂດຍການປັບໃຫ້ກົມກືນກັບພິກເຊລຂ້າງຄຽງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"processing\n"
": reconstruction, raw.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະມວນຜົນ\n"
": ການກູ້ຄືນ, ໄຟລ໌ RAW.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically detect and eliminate hot pixels. \n"
msgstr "ກວດຈັບ ແລະ ກຳຈັດ hot pixels ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hot pixels are pixels which have failed to record a light level correctly. Detected hot pixels are replaced by an average of their neighbors.\n"
msgstr "Hot pixels ແມ່ນພິກເຊລທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກລະດັບແສງໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. hot pixels ທີ່ຖືກກວດພົບ ຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍຄ່າສະເລ່ຍຂອງພິກເຊລຂ້າງຄຽງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"threshold\n"
": The minimum brightness for a pixel to be considered a hot pixel candidate.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເກນ (threshold)\n"
": ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຈະຖືວ່າພິກເຊລນັ້ນເປັນກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງ hot pixel.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"strength\n"
": The sensitivity of detection; higher values will fix more pixels by requiring less deviation from their neighbors.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງ (strength)\n"
": ຄວາມໄວໃນການກວດຈັບ; ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະແກ້ໄຂພິກເຊລໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໂດຍການກວດສອບຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຈາກພິກເຊລຂ້າງຄຽງໜ້ອຍລົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"detect by 3 neighbours\n"
": Extend the detection of hot pixels -- regard a pixel as hot if a minimum of only three (instead of four) neighbor pixels deviate by more than the threshold level.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກວດຈັບໂດຍ 3 ພິກເຊລຂ້າງຄຽງ\n"
": ຂະຫຍາຍການກວດຈັບ hot pixels -- ໂດຍຖືວ່າພິກເຊລນັ້ນຜິດປົກກະຕິຫາກມີພິກເຊລຂ້າງຄຽງຢ່າງໜ້ອຍພຽງ 3 ພິກເຊລ (ແທນທີ່ຈະແມ່ນ 4) ທີ່ມີຄ່າຕ່າງກັນເກີນລະດັບເກນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/hot-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mark fixed pixels\n"
": Visually mark the corrected pixels on the image and display a count of hot pixels that have been fixed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍພິກເຊລທີ່ແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ\n"
": ສະແດງເຄື່ອງໝາຍເທິງພິກເຊລທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນຮູບພາບ ແລະ ສະແດງຈຳນວນ hot pixels ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "(deprecated) channel mixer"
msgstr "(ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ) ຕົວປະສົມຊ່ອງສັນຍານ (channel mixer)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": perform color space corrections such as white balance, channels mixing and conversions to monochrome emulating film.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ປັບແກ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ ເຊັ່ນ: ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວ, ການປະສົມຊ່ອງສັນຍານ ແລະ ການປ່ຽນເປັນຮູບຂາວດຳໂດຍຈຳລອງແບບຈາກຟີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Please note that this module is [deprecated](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) from darktable 3.4 and should no longer be used for new edits. Please use the [_color calibration_](./color-calibration.md) module instead.**\n"
msgstr "**ກະລຸນາໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ໂມດູນນີ້ [ຖືກຍົກເລີກ/ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) ຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 3.4 ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂຮູບໃໝ່. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_color calibration_](./color-calibration.md) ແທນ.**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A simple yet powerful tool to manage color channels.  \n"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ງ່າຍແຕ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບໃນການຈັດການຊ່ອງສີ.  \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module accepts red, green and blue channels as an input and provides red, green, blue, gray, hue, saturation and lightness channels as output. It allows you to independently control how much each input channel contributes to each output channel.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ຮັບຊ່ອງສີ ແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ ເປັນຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ສົ່ງຊ່ອງສີ ແດງ, ຂຽວ, ຟ້າ, ເທົາ, ໂທນສີ (hue), ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ (saturation) ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (lightness) ເປັນຂາອອກ. ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ວ່າ ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີຂາເຂົ້າຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີຂາອອກຫຼາຍປານໃດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "RGB matrix multiplication"
msgstr "ການຄູນມາຕຣິກ RGB"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can think of the _channel mixer_ as a type of matrix multiplication between a 3x3 matrix and the input [R G B] values.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄິດວ່າ _channel mixer_ ແມ່ນການຄູນມາຕຣິກຂະໜາດ 3x3 ກັບຄ່າ [R G B] ຂອງຂາເຂົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"┌ R_out ┐     ┌ Rr Rg Rb ┐     ┌ R_in ┐\n"
"│ G_out │  =  │ Gr Gg Gb │  X  │ G_in │\n"
"└ B_out ┘     └ Br Bg Bb ┘     └ B_in ┘\n"
msgstr ""
"┌ R_out ┐     ┌ Rr Rg Rb ┐     ┌ R_in ┐\n"
"│ G_out │  =  │ Gr Gg Gb │  X  │ G_in │\n"
"└ B_out ┘     └ Br Bg Bb ┘     └ B_in ┘\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If, for example, you've been provided with a matrix to transform from one color space to another, you can enter the matrix coefficients into the _channel mixer_ as follows:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າໄດ້ຮັບມາຕຣິກເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສີໜຶ່ງໄປຫາອີກພື້ນທີ່ສີໜຶ່ງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ້ອນຄ່າສຳປະສິດຂອງມາຕຣິກເຂົ້າໃນ _channel mixer_ ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "set the destination to _red_ then set the Rr, Rg & Rb values using the red, green and blue sliders\n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງປາຍທາງ (destination) ເປັນ _red_ ແລ້ວຕັ້ງຄ່າ Rr, Rg & Rb ໂດຍໃຊ້ສະໄລເດີສີແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "set the destination to _green_ then set the Gr, Gg & Gb values using the red, green and blue sliders \n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງປາຍທາງເປັນ _green_ ແລ້ວຕັ້ງຄ່າ Gr, Gg & Gb ໂດຍໃຊ້ສະໄລເດີສີແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ \n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "set the destination to _blue_ then set the Br, Bg & Bb values using the red, green and blue sliders \n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງປາຍທາງເປັນ _blue_ ແລ້ວຕັ້ງຄ່າ Br, Bg & Bb ໂດຍໃຊ້ສະໄລເດີສີແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, _channel mixer_ just copies the input [R G B] channels straight over to the matching output channels. This is equivalent to multiplying by the identity matrix:\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, _channel mixer_ ພຽງແຕ່ສຳເນົາຊ່ອງສີຂາເຂົ້າ [R G B] ໄປຫາຊ່ອງສີຂາອອກທີ່ກົງກັນໂດຍກົງ. ນີ້ເທົ່າກັບການຄູນດ້ວຍມາຕຣິກເອກະລັກ (identity matrix):\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"┌ R_out ┐     ┌ 1  0  0 ┐      ┌ R_in ┐\n"
"│ G_out │  =  │ 0  1  0 │   X  │ G_in │\n"
"└ B_out ┘     └ 0  0  1 ┘      └ B_in ┘\n"
msgstr ""
"┌ R_out ┐     ┌ 1  0  0 ┐      ┌ R_in ┐\n"
"│ G_out │  =  │ 0  1  0 │   X  │ G_in │\n"
"└ B_out ┘     └ 0  0  1 ┘      └ B_in ┘\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As an example use case, the following matrix is useful for taming ugly out-of-gamut blue LED lights by making them more magenta:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້, ມາຕຣິກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຫຼຸດຄວາມສົດຂອງແສງ LED ສີຟ້າທີ່ຫຼຸດຂອບເຂດສີ (out-of-gamut) ໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນອອກໄປທາງສີມ່ວງແດງ (magenta) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"┌  1.00  -0.18  0.18 ┐ \n"
"│ -0.20   1.00  0.20 │\n"
"└  0.05  -0.05  1.00 ┘ \n"
msgstr ""
"┌  1.00  -0.18  0.18 ┐ \n"
"│ -0.20   1.00  0.20 │\n"
"└  0.05  -0.05  1.00 ┘ \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this case it is useful to use a [parametric mask](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md) to limit the effect of the _channel mixer_ to just the problematic colors.\n"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ [ມາສແບບພານາມິຕຣິກ (parametric mask)](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md) ເພື່ອຈຳກັດຜົນກະທົບຂອງ _channel mixer_ ໃຫ້ຢູ່ສະເພາະສີທີ່ມີບັນຫາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A more intuitive take for what the _channel mixer_ sliders do:\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມໝາຍທີ່ເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍກວ່າກ່ຽວກັບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງສະໄລເດີ _channel mixer_:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "for the _red_ destination, adjusting sliders to the right will make the R, G or B areas of the image more red. Moving the slider to the left will make those areas more cyan.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບປາຍທາງ _red_ (ສີແດງ), ການປັບສະໄລເດີໄປທາງຂວາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິເວນ R, G ຫຼື B ຂອງຮູບມີສີແດງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ການຍ້າຍສະໄລເດີໄປທາງຊ້າຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິເວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີສີຟ້າຂຽວ (cyan) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "for the _green_ destination, adjusting sliders to the right will make the R, G or B areas of the image more green. Moving the slider to the left will make those areas more magenta.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບປາຍທາງ _green_ (ສີຂຽວ), ການປັບສະໄລເດີໄປທາງຂວາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິເວນ R, G ຫຼື B ຂອງຮູບມີສີຂຽວຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ການຍ້າຍສະໄລເດີໄປທາງຊ້າຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິເວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີສີມ່ວງແດງ (magenta) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "for the _blue_ destination, adjusting sliders to the right will make the R, G or B areas of the image more blue. Moving the slider to the left will make those areas more yellow.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບປາຍທາງ _blue_ (ສີຟ້າ), ການປັບສະໄລເດີໄປທາງຂວາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິເວນ R, G ຫຼື B ຂອງຮູບມີສີຟ້າຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ການຍ້າຍສະໄລເດີໄປທາງຊ້າຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍລິເວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີສີເຫຼືອງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Another very useful application of the _channel mixer_ is the ability to mix the channels together to produce a grayscale output -- a monochrome image. Use the _gray_ destination, and set the red, green and blue sliders to control how much each channel contributes to the brightness of the output. This is equivalent to the following matrix multiplication:\n"
msgstr "ອີກການນຳໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຂອງ _channel mixer_ ແມ່ນຄວາມສາມາດໃນການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີເຂົ້າກັນເພື່ອສ້າງຜົນອອກເປັນຮູບຂາວດຳ (grayscale). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປາຍທາງເປັນ _gray_, ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະໄລເດີສີແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວ່າແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຂາອອກຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ນີ້ເທົ່າກັບການຄູນມາຕຣິກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"GRAY_out  =   [ r  g  b ]  X  ┌ R_in ┐\n"
"                              │ G_in │\n"
"                              └ B_in ┘\n"
msgstr ""
"GRAY_out  =   [ r  g  b ]  X  ┌ R_in ┐\n"
"                              │ G_in │\n"
"                              └ B_in ┘\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When dealing with skin tones, the relative weights of the three channels will affect the level of detail in the image. Placing more weight on red (e.g. [0.9, 0.3, -0.3]) will make for smooth skin tones, whereas emphasising green (e.g. [0.4, 0.75, -0.15]) will bring out more detail. In both cases the blue channel is reduced to avoid emphasising unwanted skin texture.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຈັດການກັບໂທນສີຜິວ, ນ້ຳໜັກຂອງທັງສາມຊ່ອງສີຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດໃນຮູບ. ການໃຫ້ນ້ຳໜັກກັບສີແດງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: [0.9, 0.3, -0.3]) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜິວເບິ່ງນຽນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການເນັ້ນສີຂຽວ (ເຊັ່ນ: [0.4, 0.75, -0.15]) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ໃນທັງສອງກໍລະນີ, ຊ່ອງສີຟ້າຈະຖືກຫຼຸດລົງເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການເນັ້ນຮອຍເທິງຜິວທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Different types of traditional black and white film have differing sensitivities to red, green and blue colors, and this can be simulated by setting the gray destination coefficients appropriately. The _channel mixer_ module has a number of built-in presets that can be used to achieve this.\n"
msgstr "ຟີມຂາວດຳແບບດັ້ງເດີມແຕ່ລະຊະນິດມີຄວາມໄວຕໍ່ສີແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຈຳລອງໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳປະສິດປາຍທາງ gray ໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ. ໂມດູນ _channel mixer_ ມີຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (presets) ຫຼາຍຢ່າງທີ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອບັນລຸຜົນນີ້ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"destination\n"
": Select the destination channel that will be affected by the slider settings immediately below. The red, green and blue destination channels are used for color mixing as described in the _matrix multiplication_ section above. The gray channel is used for making grayscale images as described in the _monochrome_ section above. It is also possible to define the R, G & B input channels to produce HSL (hue, saturation and lightness) values on the output, although this is a very specialised application.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປາຍທາງ (destination)\n"
": ເລືອກຊ່ອງສີປາຍທາງທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະໄລເດີທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມນີ້. ຊ່ອງສີປາຍທາງ ແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປະສົມສີຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນສ່ວນ _ການຄູນມາຕຣິກ_ ຂ້າງເທິງ. ຊ່ອງສີ gray ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສ້າງຮູບຂາວດຳຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນສ່ວນ _ຂາວດຳ_ ຂ້າງເທິງ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຊ່ອງສີຂາເຂົ້າ R, G & B ເພື່ອສ້າງຄ່າ HSL (ໂທນສີ, ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ) ໃນຂາອອກໄດ້, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນການນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະທາງຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"red\n"
": Defines how much the red input channel should contribute to the selected destination channel.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີແດງ (red)\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າຊ່ອງສີແດງຂາເຂົ້າຄວນສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຊ່ອງສີປາຍທາງທີ່ເລືອກຫຼາຍປານໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"green\n"
": Defines how much the green input channel should contribute to the selected destination channel.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີຂຽວ (green)\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າຊ່ອງສີຂຽວຂາເຂົ້າຄວນສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຊ່ອງສີປາຍທາງທີ່ເລືອກຫຼາຍປານໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/channel-mixer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blue\n"
": Defines how much the blue input channel should contribute to the selected destination channel.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີຟ້າ (blue)\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າຊ່ອງສີຟ້າຂາເຂົ້າຄວນສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຊ່ອງສີປາຍທາງທີ່ເລືອກຫຼາຍປານໃດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "retouch"
msgstr "ຕົບແຕ່ງ (retouch)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": remove and clone spots, perform split-frequency skin editing.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ລຶບ ແລະ ໂຄລນຈຸດຕ່າງໆ, ແກ້ໄຂຜິວແບບແຍກຄວາມຖີ່ (split-frequency).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"processing\n"
": geometric and frequential, RGB.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະມວນຜົນ\n"
": ແບບເລຂາຄະນິດ ແລະ ຄວາມຖີ່, RGB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove unwanted elements from your image by cloning, healing, blurring and filling using drawn shapes.\n"
msgstr "ລຶບອົງປະກອບທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການອອກຈາກຮູບຂອງເຈົ້າ ໂດຍການໂຄລນ (cloning), ການຮັກສາ (healing), ການເບຼີ (blurring) ແລະ ການເຕີມ (filling) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບຊົງທີ່ລາກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module extends the capabilities of the deprecated [_spot removal_](./spot-removal.md) module (equivalent to this module's \"clone\" tool) by including a \"heal\" tool (based on the heal tool from GIMP), as well as \"fill\" and \"blur\" modes. It can also take advantage of [wavelet decomposition](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md), allowing the image to be separated into layers of varying detail (from coarse to fine) which can be selectively retouched before being recombined to produce the output image.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ຂະຫຍາຍຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໂມດູນ [_ການລຶບຈຸດ (spot removal)_](./spot-removal.md) ທີ່ເລີກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ (ເຊິ່ງທຽບເທົ່າກັບເຄື່ອງມື \"ໂຄລນ\" ຂອງໂມດູນນີ້) ໂດຍການເພີ່ມເຄື່ອງມື \"ຮັກສາ (heal)\" (ອີງຕາມເຄື່ອງມື heal ຈາກ GIMP), ພ້ອມທັງໂໝດ \"ເຕີມ (fill)\" ແລະ \"ເບຼີ (blur)\". ມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກ [ການແຍກອົງປະກອບເວັບເລັດ (wavelet decomposition)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md), ເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບສາມາດແຍກອອກເປັນຊັ້ນໆ ທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດຕ່າງກັນ (ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຫຍາບຫາລະອຽດ) ເຊິ່ງສາມາດເລືອກຕົບແຕ່ງແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນໄດ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລວມກັນຄືນເພື່ອສ້າງເປັນຮູບຂາອອກ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "clone and heal"
msgstr "ໂຄລນ ແລະ ຮັກສາ (clone and heal)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cloning allows a part of the image (the _target_) to be hidden by replacing it with an area copied from elsewhere in the image (the _source_). For example, you may wish to remove a small cloud from a blue sky:\n"
msgstr "ການໂຄລນ (cloning) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບ (_ເປົ້າໝາຍ_) ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໂດຍການແທນທີ່ດ້ວຍພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ສຳເນົາມາຈາກບ່ອນອື່ນໃນຮູບ (_ຕົ້ນສະບັບ_). ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການລຶບເມກນ້ອຍໆ ອອກຈາກທ້ອງຟ້າສີຟ້າ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![retouch-original](./retouch/rt-original.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![retouch-original](./retouch/rt-original.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The simplest way to do this is with the _cloning_ tool ![retouch-clone-icon](./retouch/rt-clone-icon.png#icon). The following example uses a circular shape to clone out the cloud using the circle of blue sky beside it:\n"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດຄືການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື _ໂຄລນ_ ![retouch-clone-icon](./retouch/rt-clone-icon.png#icon). ຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃຊ້ຮູບຊົງວົງມົນເພື່ອໂຄລນລຶບເມກອອກ ໂດຍໃຊ້ວົງມົນຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າສີຟ້າທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງໆ ມັນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![retouch-clone](./retouch/rt-clone.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![retouch-clone](./retouch/rt-clone.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In many cases, the edges of the _source_ shape won't precisely match the surroundings of the _target_, leading to unnatural looking results. In this example, the sample of sky we chose as the source was slightly darker than the target, leaving a faint outline of the circular shape used in the cloning process:\n"
msgstr "ໃນຫຼາຍກໍລະນີ, ຂອບຂອງຮູບຊົງ _ຕົ້ນສະບັບ_ ຈະບໍ່ກົມກືນກັບບໍລິເວນອ້ອມຮອບຂອງ _ເປົ້າໝາຍ_ ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຜົນລັບເບິ່ງບໍ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ຕົວຢ່າງທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ເຮົາເລືອກເປັນຕົ້ນສະບັບມີສີເຂັ້ມກວ່າເປົ້າໝາຍເລັກໜ້ອຍ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນຂອບຈາງໆ ຂອງຮູບຊົງວົງມົນທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຂະບວນການໂຄລນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![retouch-clone-nocontrol](./retouch/rt-clone-nocontrol.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![retouch-clone-nocontrol](./retouch/rt-clone-nocontrol.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In such cases, the _heal_ tool ![retouch-heal-icon](./retouch/rt-heal-icon.png#icon) is more appropriate. With this tool, the color and luma of the sample is blended to fit better with the surroundings. In this example, using _heal_ instead of _clone_ produces a much more pleasing result:\n"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, ເຄື່ອງມື _ຮັກສາ (heal)_ ![retouch-heal-icon](./retouch/rt-heal-icon.png#icon) ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມກວ່າ. ດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືນີ້, ສີ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luma) ຂອງຕົວຢ່າງຈະຖືກປະສົມໃຫ້ກົມກືນກັບບໍລິເວນອ້ອມຮອບໄດ້ດີກວ່າ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ການໃຊ້ _ຮັກສາ_ ແທນການ _ໂຄລນ_ ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ໜ້າເພິ່ງພໍໃຈຫຼາຍກວ່າ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![retouch-heal-nocontrol](./retouch/rt-heal-nocontrol.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![retouch-heal-nocontrol](./retouch/rt-heal-nocontrol.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "source and target shapes"
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have chosen _heal_ or _clone_ mode, you must choose the shape you wish to use (_circle_, _ellipse_, _path_ or _brush_ -- see the [drawn masks](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) section for details). The source and target patches will both use the same shape.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລືອກໂໝດ _ຮັກສາ_ ຫຼື _ໂຄລນ_ ແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເລືອກຮູບຊົງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ (_ວົງມົນ_, _ວົງລີ_, _ເສັ້ນທາງ_ ຫຼື _ແປງ_ -- ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໃນສ່ວນ [ໜ້າກາກທີ່ລາກເອງ (drawn masks)](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md)). ແຜ່ນຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍຈະໃຊ້ຮູບຊົງດຽວກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you hover over the image with your mouse, a plus symbol (+) will appear to indicate where the _source_ shape will be placed by default. Your normal mouse cursor will indicate the position of the target shape:\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ໄປເທິງຮູບ, ເຄື່ອງໝາຍບວກ (+) ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນເພື່ອບອກວ່າຮູບຊົງ _ຕົ້ນສະບັບ_ ຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ບ່ອນໃດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສ່ວນເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ປົກກະຕິຂອງເຈົ້າຈະບອກຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບຊົງເປົ້າໝາຍ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![retouch-source-cross](./retouch/rt-source-cross.png)\n"
msgstr "![retouch-source-cross](./retouch/rt-source-cross.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is recommended that you choose the position of the source shape first, followed by the position of the target, as follows:\n"
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບຊົງຕົ້ນສະບັບກ່ອນ, ແລ້ວຕາມດ້ວຍຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເປົ້າໝາຍ ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shift+click to set the position of the source shape in \"relative mode\". The position of the \"plus\" (+) symbol will move to the clicked location and will remain in a fixed position _relative to your cursor_ until you click on the image to begin placing your target shape. If you place subsequent shapes without first changing the target location, the source shape will be placed at the same offset from the target shape as was used for the first stroke.\n"
msgstr "Shift+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບຊົງຕົ້ນສະບັບໃນ \"ໂໝດສຳພັດ (relative mode)\". ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ \"ບວກ\" (+) ຈະຍ້າຍໄປຍັງບ່ອນທີ່ຄລິກ ແລະ ຈະຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງຄົງທີ່ _ທຽບກັບເຄີເຊີຂອງເຈົ້າ_ ຈົນກວ່າເຈົ້າຈະຄລິກເທິງຮູບເພື່ອເລີ່ມວາງຮູບຊົງເປົ້າໝາຍ. ຫາກເຈົ້າວາງຮູບຊົງຕໍ່ໆ ໄປໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍກ່ອນ, ຮູບຊົງຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃນໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກຮູບຊົງເປົ້າໝາຍຄືກັນກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ctrl+Shift+click to change the position of the source shape in \"absolute\" mode. As above, the position of the \"plus\" (+) symbol will move to the clicked location, but will _remain in the same absolute position_ even if you move your mouse. You can then click on the image to begin placing the target shape. If you place subsequent shapes without first changing the target location, exactly the same source position will be used, fixed in the absolute coordinate system of the image.\n"
msgstr "Ctrl+Shift+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບຊົງຕົ້ນສະບັບໃນໂໝດ \"ຄົງທີ່ (absolute)\". ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບຂ້າງເທິງ, ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍ \"ບວກ\" (+) ຈະຍ້າຍໄປບ່ອນທີ່ຄລິກ, ແຕ່ມັນຈະ _ຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງເດີມສະເໝີ_ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າເຈົ້າຈະຍ້າຍເມົາສ໌ກໍຕາມ. ຈາກນັ້ນເຈົ້າສາມາດຄລິກເທິງຮູບເພື່ອເລີ່ມວາງຮູບຊົງເປົ້າໝາຍ. ຫາກເຈົ້າວາງຮູບຊົງຕໍ່ໆ ໄປໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍກ່ອນ, ຕຳແໜ່ງຕົ້ນສະບັບເດີມນັ້ນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຕະຫຼອດ ໂດຍຢຶດຕາມພິກັດຄົງທີ່ຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have placed your source and target shapes on the image, they can be adjusted manually with your mouse.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າວາງຮູບຊົງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍເທິງຮູບແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົວເອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** For _circle_ and _ellipse_ shapes only, you can place both the source and target shapes with a single click-and-drag motion: Click on the desired target location and then drag, releasing your mouse button when you reach the desired source location. This operation does not affect the placement of subsequent shapes.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງ _ວົງມົນ_ ແລະ _ວົງລີ_ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດວາງທັງຮູບຊົງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຄລິກແລ້ວລາກບາດດຽວ: ຄລິກໃສ່ຕຳແໜ່ງເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຕ້ອງການແລ້ວລາກ, ຈາກນັ້ນປ່ອຍປຸ່ມເມົາສ໌ເມື່ອເຖິງຕຳແໜ່ງຕົ້ນສະບັບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ການເຮັດແບບນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການວາງຮູບຊົງໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໆ ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "fill and blur"
msgstr "ເຕີມ ແລະ ເບຼີ (fill and blur)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _clone_ and _heal_ tools both require the use of another part of the image to \"fill in\" the region being hidden. Sometimes there is no suitable sample in the image to use for this purpose. In such cases, the _retouch_ module offers two further options:\n"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື _ໂຄລນ_ ແລະ _ຮັກສາ_ ລ້ວນແຕ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ສ່ວນອື່ນຂອງຮູບເພື່ອ \"ເຕີມເຕັມ\" ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້. ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະບໍ່ມີຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນຮູບທີ່ຈະນຳມາໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງນີ້. ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໂມດູນ _ຕົບແຕ່ງ (retouch)_ ຍັງມີອີກສອງທາງເລືອກ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![retouch-fill-icon](./retouch/rt-fill-icon.png#icon) fill tool\n"
": Fill the drawn region with a selected color.\n"
msgstr ""
"![retouch-fill-icon](./retouch/rt-fill-icon.png#icon) ເຄື່ອງມືເຕີມ (fill)\n"
": ເຕີມສີທີ່ເລືອກລົງໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ລາກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![retouch-blur-icon](./retouch/rt-blur-icon.png#icon) blur tool\n"
": Apply a blur to the drawn region, smoothing out any details.\n"
msgstr ""
"![retouch-blur-icon](./retouch/rt-blur-icon.png#icon) ເຄື່ອງມືເບຼີ (blur)\n"
": ໃຊ້ການເບຼີກັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ລາກໄວ້ ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດນຽນຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These two options are most useful when used together with wavelet decomposition, where they can be used to smooth over features within a selected detail layer.\n"
msgstr "ສອງທາງເລືອກນີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ສຸດເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບການແຍກອົງປະກອບເວັບເລັດ (wavelet decomposition), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຈຸດຕ່າງໆ ໃນຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເລືອກນຽນຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wavelets allow an image to be decomposed into a number of layers each containing varying levels of detail, so that you can work on each detail layer independently and then recombine them at the end. This is particularly useful in portrait photography, where you can deal with skin blotches and blemishes on a coarse layer of detail, leaving the finer skin texture untouched. The [_wavelets_](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md) section provides more information on the decomposition process.\n"
msgstr "ເວັບເລັດ (Wavelets) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮູບສາມາດແຍກອອກເປັນຫຼາຍຊັ້ນ ໂດຍແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນຈະມີລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກັບແຕ່ລະຊັ້ນໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ ແລະ ລວມພວກມັນເຂົ້າກັນໃນຕອນທ້າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນການຖ່າຍຮູບຄົນ (portrait), ເຊິ່ງເຈົ້າສາມາດຈັດການກັບຮອຍດ່າງດຳ ຫຼື ສິວເທິງຜິວໜັງໃນຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຫຍາບ ໂດຍທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາເນື້ອຜິວທີ່ລະອຽດໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ. ສ່ວນ [_ເວັບເລັດ (wavelets)_](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md) ຈະໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຂະບວນການແຍກອົງປະກອບນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This method can be used with the healing tool, for example, to paint over a spot that appears in one of the coarse detail layers, while leaving the hairs in the fine detail layers intact:\n"
msgstr "ວິທີນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບເຄື່ອງມືຮັກສາ (healing) ໄດ້, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ການລະບາຍທັບຈຸດທີ່ປະກົດຢູ່ໃນຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຫຍາບ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາເສັ້ນຜົມໃນຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດໄວ້ໃຫ້ຄືເກົ່າ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![retouch-beard-preserve](./retouch/rt-beard-preserve.jpg#w50)\n"
msgstr "![retouch-beard-preserve](./retouch/rt-beard-preserve.jpg#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It can also be used with the blur tool to even out coarse blotches in the skin, again without impacting the finer details (see the [_wavelets_](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md) section for details on this technique).\n"
msgstr "ມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບເຄື່ອງມືເບຼີເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຮອຍດ່າງດຳທີ່ຫຍາບເທິງຜິວໜັງນຽນຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ (ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບເຕັກນິກນີ້ໃນສ່ວນ [_ເວັບເລັດ (wavelets)_](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![retouch-overview](./retouch/rt-overview.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![retouch-overview](./retouch/rt-overview.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "retouch tools"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຕົບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _retouch tools_ section consists of two items:\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນ _ເຄື່ອງມືຕົບແຕ່ງ_ ປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງລາຍການ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"shapes\n"
": The number after the _shapes_ label indicates how many shapes have been placed on the image, either directly or within a wavelet layer.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງ (shapes)\n"
": ຕົວເລກຫຼັງປ້າຍຊື່ _ຮູບຊົງ_ ບອກໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າໄດ້ວາງຮູບຊົງເທິງຮູບໄປແລ້ວຈັກອັນ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການວາງໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ວາງໄວ້ໃນຊັ້ນເວັບເລັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Click on one of the shape icons to draw a new shape on the image (see [drawn masks](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) for details).\n"
msgstr ": ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນຮູບຊົງອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງເພື່ອລາກຮູບຊົງໃໝ່ເທິງຮູບ (ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໃນ [ໜ້າກາກທີ່ລາກເອງ (drawn masks)](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Ctrl+click on a shape icon to draw multiple shapes continuously (right-click to cancel).\n"
msgstr ": Ctrl+ຄລິກ ທີ່ໄອຄອນຮູບຊົງເພື່ອລາກຫຼາຍຮູບຊົງຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອຍົກເລີກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Click the _show and edit shapes_ ![retouch-shapes-icon](./retouch/rt-shapes-icon.png#icon) button to show and edit any existing shapes for the currently-selected wavelet scale.\n"
msgstr ": ຄລິກປຸ່ມ _ສະແດງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຮູບຊົງ_ ![retouch-shapes-icon](./retouch/rt-shapes-icon.png#icon) ເພື່ອສະແດງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຮູບຊົງທີ່ມີຢູ່ສຳລັບລະດັບເວັບເລັດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"algorithms\n"
": Choose a retouching algorithm (clone, heal, fill or blur). Ctrl+click to change the algorithm used for the currently-selected shape. Shift+click to set the default algorithm (used for new images or when you reset module parameters).\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ (algorithms)\n"
": ເລືອກອັນກໍຣິທຶມການຕົບແຕ່ງ (ໂຄລນ, ຮັກສາ, ເຕີມ ຫຼື ເບຼີ). Ctrl+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. Shift+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອກຳນົດອັນກໍຣິທຶມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບຮູບໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນຄືນ).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "wavelet decompose"
msgstr "ການແຍກອົງປະກອບເວັບເລັດ (wavelet decompose)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _wavelet decompose_ section centres around a bar graph that shows how the image has been decomposed into detail (scale) layers. The key features of the bar graph are:\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນ _ການແຍກອົງປະກອບເວັບເລັດ_ ຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ກຣາຟແທ່ງທີ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າຮູບຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດ (ລະດັບ) ແນວໃດ. ຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກຂອງກຣາຟແທ່ງມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The black square on the left represents the entire image before decomposition.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກສີດຳທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍສະແດງເຖິງຮູບທັງໝົດກ່ອນການແຍກອົງປະກອບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The gray squares show the various wavelet detail layers, with fine details to the left, and coarse details to the right.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກສີເທີສະແດງເຖິງຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດເວັບເລັດຕ່າງໆ, ໂດຍມີລາຍລະອຽດລະອຽດຢູ່ທາງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດຫຍາບຢູ່ທາງຂວາ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The white square on the far right represents the residual image (the remainder of the image after the detail layers have been extracted).\n"
msgstr "ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກສີຂາວທາງຂວາສຸດສະແດງເຖິງຮູບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອ (ຮູບທີ່ເຫຼືອຫຼັງຈາກແຍກຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດອອກໄປແລ້ວ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A light gray dot in a square indicates the currently-selected layer. Click on another square to select a different layer.\n"
msgstr "ຈຸດສີເທີອ່ອນໃນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກບອກເຖິງຊັ້ນທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄລິກທີ່ຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກອື່ນເພື່ອເລືອກຊັ້ນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The light gray bar running along the top indicates which levels of detail are visible at the current zoom level. Zoom in to see finer details.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບສີເທີອ່ອນທີ່ແລ່ນໄປຕາມທາງເທິງສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດໃດແດ່ທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ໃນລະດັບການຊູມປັດຈຸບັນ. ຊູມເຂົ້າເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The triangle at the bottom shows how many layers the image has been decomposed into. Drag the triangle to the right to create more layers. Drag it to the left to decrease the number of layers. By default no wavelet decomposition is performed.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບສາມແຈທາງດ້ານລຸ່ມສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າຮູບຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນຈັກຊັ້ນ. ລາກຮູບສາມແຈໄປທາງຂວາເພື່ອສ້າງຊັ້ນເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ລາກໄປທາງຊ້າຍເພື່ອຫຼຸດຈຳນວນຊັ້ນ. ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີການແຍກອົງປະກອບເວັບເລັດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The triangle at the top shows the current value of the \"merge from\" parameter (see below).\n"
msgstr "ຮູບສາມແຈທາງດ້ານເທິງສະແດງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງພາຣາມິເຕີ \"ລວມຈາກ (merge from)\" (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The orange lines under the squares indicate which layers have retouch edits applied.\n"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນສີສົ້ມກ້ອງຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າຊັ້ນໃດແດ່ທີ່ມີການຕົບແຕ່ງແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The remaining items in this section are:\n"
msgstr "ລາຍການທີ່ເຫຼືອໃນສ່ວນນີ້ຄື:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scales\n"
": Shows how many detail layers the image has been decomposed into. Zero indicates that no wavelet decomposition has been performed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບ (scales)\n"
": ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າຮູບຖືກແຍກອອກເປັນຈັກຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດ. ຄ່າສູນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ມີການແຍກອົງປະກອບເວັບເລັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"current\n"
": Shows which layer is currently selected (also marked with the light gray dot on the bar graph).\n"
msgstr ""
"ປັດຈຸບັນ (current)\n"
": ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າຊັ້ນໃດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ (ເຊິ່ງມີຈຸດສີເທີອ່ອນໝາຍໄວ້ໃນກຣາຟແທ່ງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"merge from\n"
": This setting allows a single edit to be applied to multiple consecutive scales within a group starting from the coarsest scale (excluding the residual image) down to the scale selected. For example, if \"merge from\" is set to 3 and the maximum scale is 5 then all edits that are added to scale 5 will be applied to scales 3, 4 and 5. Edits added to scale 4 will be applied to scales 3 and 4, and edits added to scale 3 will be applied to scale 3 only. If you set _merge from_ to 0, then merging is disabled, and all edits apply only to the scale that they are defined in. Setting _merge from_ to the highest scale available (in this example, 5) also disables merging.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລວມຈາກ (merge from)\n"
": ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂອັນດຽວສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ກັບຫຼາຍລະດັບທີ່ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງກັນພາຍໃນກຸ່ມ ໂດຍເລີ່ມຈາກລະດັບທີ່ຫຍາບທີ່ສຸດ (ບໍ່ລວມຮູບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອ) ລົງມາຈົນເຖິງລະດັບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຫາກ \"ລວມຈາກ\" ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ 3 ແລະ ລະດັບສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 5, ການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລະດັບ 5 ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະດັບ 3, 4 ແລະ 5. ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລະດັບ 4 ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະດັບ 3 ແລະ 4, ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລະດັບ 3 ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບລະດັບ 3 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກເຈົ້າຕັ້ງ _ລວມຈາກ_ ເປັນ 0, ການລວມຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບລະດັບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການຕັ້ງ _ລວມຈາກ_ ເປັນລະດັບສູງສຸດທີ່ມີ (ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຄື 5) ກໍແມ່ນການປິດການລວມເຊັ່ນກັນ.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"           merge_from\n"
"               v\n"
"   0   1   2   3   4   5    scale\n"
"               <-------o    scale 5 edits\n"
"               <---o        scale 4 edits\n"
"               o            scale 3 edits\n"
"           o                scale 2 edits\n"
"       o                    scale 1 edits\n"
msgstr ""
"           merge_from\n"
"               v\n"
"   0   1   2   3   4   5    scale\n"
"               <-------o    scale 5 edits\n"
"               <---o        scale 4 edits\n"
"               o            scale 3 edits\n"
"           o                scale 2 edits\n"
"       o                    scale 1 edits\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![retouch-display-icon](./retouch/rt-display-icon.png#icon) display wavelet scale\n"
": Display the currently-selected wavelet layer on the center image. Selecting this option brings up an additional control -- _preview single scale_.\n"
msgstr ""
"![retouch-display-icon](./retouch/rt-display-icon.png#icon) ສະແດງລະດັບເວັບເລັດ\n"
": ສະແດງຊັ້ນເວັບເລັດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນເທິງຮູບທີ່ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ. ການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມຂຶ້ນມາ -- _ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງລະດັບດຽວ_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preview single scale\n"
": An additional control that allows the black, white and gray points of the wavelet scale preview to be adjusted to make it easier to see. Click the ![auto-levels-icon](./retouch/rt-auto-levels-icon.png#icon) to set these values automatically. This does not affect the module's operation -- only the wavelet scale preview.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງລະດັບດຽວ\n"
": ການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບຈຸດດຳ, ຂາວ ແລະ ເທີ ຂອງການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງລະດັບເວັບເລັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງເຫັນໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄລິກທີ່ ![auto-levels-icon](./retouch/rt-auto-levels-icon.png#icon) ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງໂມດູນ -- ມີຜົນສະເພາະການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງລະດັບເວັບເລັດເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![retouch-cut-icon](./retouch/rt-cut-icon.png#icon) cut\n"
": Cut all shapes from the currently-selected layer and place them into the clipboard.\n"
msgstr ""
"![retouch-cut-icon](./retouch/rt-cut-icon.png#icon) ຕັດ (cut)\n"
": ຕັດຮູບຊົງທັງໝົດຈາກຊັ້ນທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ນຳໄປໄວ້ໃນຄລິບບອດ (clipboard).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![retouch-paste-icon](./retouch/rt-paste-icon.png#icon) paste\n"
": Move the shapes on the clipboard to the currently-selected layer.\n"
msgstr ""
"![retouch-paste-icon](./retouch/rt-paste-icon.png#icon) ວາງ (paste)\n"
": ຍ້າຍຮູບຊົງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຄລິບບອດມາໄວ້ໃນຊັ້ນທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![retouch-hide-icon](./retouch/rt-hide-icon.png#icon) temporarily switch off shapes\n"
": Toggle all shapes (whether on the current layer or not) on or off, temporarily removing the module's effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"![retouch-hide-icon](./retouch/rt-hide-icon.png#icon) ປິດຮູບຊົງຊົ່ວຄາວ\n"
": ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດຮູບຊົງທັງໝົດ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນຊັ້ນປັດຈຸບັນ ຫຼື ບໍ່) ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກເອັບເຟັກຂອງໂມດູນເປັນການຊົ່ວຄາວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![retouch-mask-icon](./retouch/rt-mask-icon.png#icon) display masks\n"
": Show the target shapes associated with the currently-selected layer with a yellow overlay.\n"
msgstr ""
"![retouch-mask-icon](./retouch/rt-mask-icon.png#icon) ສະແດງໜ້າກາກ\n"
": ສະແດງຮູບຊົງເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຊັ້ນທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນດ້ວຍສີເຫຼືອງທັບຊ້ອນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "shapes"
msgstr "ຮູບຊົງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section allows you to modify settings related to the currently-selected shape:\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"shape selected\n"
": Indicates which shape is currently selected, and what type of shape it is.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກ\n"
": ບອກໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າຮູບຊົງໃດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ເປັນຮູບຊົງປະເພດໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"fill mode\n"
": If the _fill_ algorithm has been chosen for the currently-selected shape, choose whether to \"erase\" or fill the selected shape with a chosen \"color\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດການເຕີມ (fill mode)\n"
": ຫາກເລືອກອັນກໍຣິທຶມ _ເຕີມ (fill)_ ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກວ່າຈະ \"ລຶບ (erase)\" ຫຼື ເຕີມຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກດ້ວຍ \"ສີ (color)\" ທີ່ກຳນົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"fill color\n"
": If a _fill mode_ of \"color\" has been chosen, select the color to fill the shape with. You can click to select or enter a custom rgb value or use the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) to take a sample from the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີທີ່ເຕີມ\n"
": ຫາກເລືອກໂໝດການເຕີມເປັນ \"ສີ\", ໃຫ້ເລືອກສີທີ່ຈະເຕີມລົງໃນຮູບຊົງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄລິກເພື່ອເລືອກ ຫຼື ປ້ອນຄ່າ RGB ເອງ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ [ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ເພື່ອເອົາຕົວຢ່າງສີຈາກຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"brightness\n"
": If the _fill_ algorithm has been chosen for the currently-selected shape, fine-tune the color's brightness. This slider also works in \"erase\" mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (brightness)\n"
": ຫາກເລືອກອັນກໍຣິທຶມ _ເຕີມ_ ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ໃຫ້ປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສີໃຫ້ລະອຽດ. ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ຍັງໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນໂໝດ \"ລຶບ\" ອີກດ້ວຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blur type\n"
": If the _blur_ algorithm has been chosen for the currently-selected shape, choose whether to apply a \"gaussian\" or \"bilateral\" blur.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດການເບຼີ\n"
": ຫາກເລືອກອັນກໍຣິທຶມ _ເບຼີ_ ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ການເບຼີແບບ \"ກັອດຊ້ຽນ (gaussian)\" ຫຼື \"ໄບແລັດເທໍໂຣ (bilateral)\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blur radius\n"
": If the _blur_ algorithm has been chosen for the currently-selected shape, choose the radius of the blur.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີການເບຼີ (blur radius)\n"
": ຫາກເລືອກອັນກໍຣິທຶມ _ເບຼີ_ ສຳລັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກລັດສະໝີຂອງການເບຼີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mask opacity\n"
": Alter the opacity of the mask associated with the currently-selected shape. An opacity of 1.0 indicates that the shape is completely opaque and the module's effect is fully applied, whereas a value less than 1.0 indicates that the effect applied by the shape is blended with the underlying image to the degree indicated by the slider.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງໜ້າກາກ (mask opacity)\n"
": ປ່ຽນຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງໜ້າກາກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄ່າຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ 1.0 ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຮູບຊົງນັ້ນທຶບແສງທັງໝົດ ແລະ ເອັບເຟັກຂອງໂມດູນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 1.0 ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເອັບເຟັກທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍຮູບຊົງນັ້ນຈະຖືກປະສົມກັບຮູບດ້ານລຸ່ມຕາມລະດັບທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນແຖບເລື່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/retouch.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While creating or editing a shape, mouse actions are applied to the current shape.  If you need to move or zoom the portion of the image shown in the center view, hold down the 'a' key while dragging the mouse or using the scroll wheel.  While the key is held down, the mouse actions will apply to the entire image rather than the current shape. Holding down the key will also temporarily suppress generating new shapes in continuous-creation mode.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ສ້າງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂຮູບຊົງ, ການກະທຳຂອງເມົາສ໌ຈະມີຜົນກັບຮູບຊົງປັດຈຸບັນ. ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ຊູມສ່ວນໃດສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຮູບທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ 'a' ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ລໍ້ເລື່ອນ (scroll wheel). ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້, ການກະທຳຂອງເມົາສ໌ຈະມີຜົນກັບຮູບທັງໝົດແທນທີ່ຈະມີຜົນກັບຮູບຊົງປັດຈຸບັນ. ການກົດປຸ່ມຄ້າງໄວ້ຍັງຈະຢຸດການສ້າງຮູບຊົງໃໝ່ຊົ່ວຄາວໃນໂໝດການສ້າງແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/global-tonemap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "(deprecated) global tonemap"
msgstr "(ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້) ການປັບໂທນແບບລວມ (global tonemap)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/global-tonemap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Please note that this module is [deprecated](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) from darktable 3.4 and should no longer be used for new edits. Please use the [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) module instead.**\n"
msgstr "**ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ໂມດູລນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກ [ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) ຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 3.4 ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນນຳໃຊ້ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງຮູບໃໝ່. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ໂມດູລ [_ຟິລມິກ RGB (filmic rgb)_](./filmic-rgb.md) ແທນ.**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/global-tonemap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compress the tonal range of an HDR image into the limited tonal range of a typical LDR output file. \n"
msgstr "ບີບອັດຊ່ວງໂໂທນສີຂອງຮູບ HDR ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ຊ່ວງໂໂທນສີທີ່ຈຳກັດຂອງໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກແບບ LDR ທົ່ວໄປ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/global-tonemap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Global tonemap processes each pixel of an HDR image, without taking the local surrounding into account. This is generally faster than local [_tone mapping (deprecated)_](./tone-mapping.md), but might lead to less convincing results with very high-dynamic-range scenes.\n"
msgstr "ການປັບໂທນແບບລວມ (Global tonemap) ຈະປະມວນຜົນແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຂອງຮູບ HDR ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງພື້ນທີ່ອ້ອມຂ້າງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວມັນຈະໄວກວ່າ [_ການປັບໂທນສະເພາະສ່ວນ (ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້) (tone mapping)_](./tone-mapping.md), ແຕ່ອາດຈະໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ບໍ່ສົມຈິງປານໃດສຳລັບສາກທີ່ມີຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກສູງຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/global-tonemap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"operator\n"
": The operator to use. _Reinhard_, _Filmic_ and _Drago_ global tonemap operators are available. Depending on the selected operator, different parameters can be adjusted. \n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວດຳເນີນການ (operator)\n"
": ຕົວດຳເນີນການທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ມີຕົວດຳເນີນການປັບໂທນແບບລວມຄື _Reinhard_, _Filmic_ ແລະ _Drago_. ພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຕົວດຳເນີນການທີ່ເລືອກ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/global-tonemap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Some operators are fully self-adjusting, and do not require specific controls.\n"
msgstr ": ຕົວດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງຈະປັບຄ່າດ້ວຍຕົນເອງທັງໝົດ ແລະ ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຕົວຄວບຄຸມສະເພາະ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/global-tonemap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bias (_Drago_ operator only)\n"
": This parameter influences the contrast of the output image. It is an essential parameter for adjusting the compression of high values and the visibility of details in dark areas. A value of 0.85 is recommended as a starting point.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າບ່ຽງເບນ (bias) (ສະເພາະຕົວດຳເນີນການ _Drago_)\n"
": ພາຣາມີເຕີນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄອນທຣາສຂອງຮູບຂາອອກ. ມັນເປັນພາຣາມີເຕີທີ່ສຳຄັນສຳລັບການປັບການບີບອັດຄ່າແສງສູງ ແລະ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນລາຍລະອຽດໃນສ່ວນມືດ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຄ່າ 0.85.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/global-tonemap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"target (_Drago_ operator only)\n"
": A scale factor to adjust the global image brightness to the brightness of the intended display. It is measured in cd/m, and should match the brightness of your output device. Higher values lead to a brighter image, while lower values lead to a darker image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເປົ້າໝາຍ (target) (ສະເພາະຕົວດຳເນີນການ _Drago_)\n"
": ຕົວຄູນປັບຂະໜາດເພື່ອປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຮູບໂດຍລວມໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ມັນວັດແທກເປັນ cd/m², ແລະ ຄວນໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງອຸປະກອນຂາອອກຂອງເຈົ້າ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບມືດລົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/global-tonemap.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"detail (all operators)\n"
": This parameter controls how much detail is preserved from the original input image and transferred back into the output image after tonemapping.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ (detail) (ທຸກຕົວດຳເນີນການ)\n"
": ພາຣາມີເຕີນີ້ຄວບຄຸມວ່າຈະຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດຈາກຮູບຂາເຂົ້າຕົ້ນສະບັບໄວ້ຫຼາຍປານໃດ ແລະ ສົ່ງຄືນໄປຍັງຮູບຂາອອກຫຼັງຈາກການປັບໂທນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/bloom.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "bloom"
msgstr "ແສງຟຸ້ງ (bloom)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/bloom.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": apply Orton effect for a dreamy ethereal look.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ Orton effect ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບພາບເບິ່ງນຸ່ມນວນຄືກັບຄວາມຝັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/bloom.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a soft bloom effect. \n"
msgstr "ສ້າງຜົນກະທົບແສງຟຸ້ງທີ່ນຸ່ມນວນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/bloom.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module works by blurring the highlights and then blending the result with the original image.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງເບີຼ ແລ້ວນຳມາປະສົມກັບຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/bloom.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_**Note:** This module performs blurs in Lab color space, and is no longer recommended. Instead, use the [tone equalizer](./tone-equalizer.md) module or the [exposure](./exposure.md) module with a [parametric mask](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/parametric.md)._\n"
msgstr "_**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ໂມດູນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ Lab ແລະ ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອີກແລ້ວ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [tone equalizer](./tone-equalizer.md) ແທນ._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/bloom.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"size\n"
": The spatial extent of the bloom effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ (size)\n"
": ຂອບເຂດການກະຈາຍຂອງແສງຟຸ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/bloom.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"threshold\n"
": The threshold for the brightness increase.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (threshold)\n"
": ຄ່າກຳນົດຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມເກີດຜົນກະທົບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/bloom.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"strength\n"
": The strength of the overlighting.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງ (strength)\n"
": ລະດັບຄວາມແຮງຂອງແສງທີ່ຟຸ້ງອອກມາ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-mapping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "(deprecated) tone mapping"
msgstr "(ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ) tone mapping"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-mapping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Please note that this module is [deprecated](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) from darktable 3.4 and should no longer be used for new edits. Please use the [_tone equalizer_](./tone-equalizer.md) module instead.**\n"
msgstr "**ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ໂມດູນນີ້ແມ່ນ [ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) ຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 3.4 ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງໃໝ່. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ_](./tone-equalizer.md) ແທນ.**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-mapping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compress the tonal range of HDR images so that they fit into the limits of an LDR image, using Durand's 2002 algorithm. \n"
msgstr "ບີບອັດຊ່ວງໂທນສີຂອງພາບ HDR ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງພາບ LDR ໂດຍໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມຂອງ Durand ປີ 2002. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-mapping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The underlying algorithm uses a bilateral filter to decompose an image into a coarse base layer and a detail layer. The contrast of the base layer is compressed, while the detail layer is preserved, then both layers are re-combined.\n"
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ໃຊ້ຈະໃຊ້ຟິວເຕີ bilateral ເພື່ອແຍກພາບອອກເປັນຊັ້ນພື້ນຖານທີ່ຫຍາບ ແລະ ຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດ. ຄອນທຣາສຂອງຊັ້ນພື້ນຖານຈະຖືກບີບອັດ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຊັ້ນລາຍລະອຽດຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້, ຈາກນັ້ນຈຶ່ງນຳທັງສອງຊັ້ນມາປະສົມກັນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-mapping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"contrast compression\n"
": The contrast compression level of the base layer. A higher compression will make the image fit a lower dynamic range.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການບີບອັດຄອນທຣາສ\n"
": ລະດັບການບີບອັດຄອນທຣາສຂອງຊັ້ນພື້ນຖານ. ການບີບອັດທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບພໍດີກັບໄດນາມິກເຣນຈ໌ທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-mapping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spatial extent\n"
": The spatial extent of the bilateral filter. Lower values cause the contrast compression to have stronger effects on image details.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂອບເຂດພື້ນທີ່\n"
": ຂອບເຂດພື້ນທີ່ຂອງຟິວເຕີ bilateral. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການບີບອັດຄອນທຣາສສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລາຍລະອຽດຂອງພາບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/soften.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "soften"
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບນຸ້ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/soften.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": create a softened image using the Orton effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ສ້າງພາບທີ່ນຸ້ມນວນໂດຍໃຊ້ເອັບເຟັກ ອໍຕັນ (Orton).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/soften.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a softened image using the [Orton effect](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orton_(photography)).\n"
msgstr "ສ້າງພາບທີ່ນຸ້ມນວນໂດຍໃຊ້ [ເອັບເຟັກ ອໍຕັນ (Orton effect)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orton_(photography)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/soften.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Michael Orton achieved his results on slide film by using two exposures of the same scene, one well exposed and one overexposed. He then used a darkroom technique to blend these two images into a final image where the overexposed image was blurred.\n"
msgstr "Michael Orton ໄດ້ສ້າງຜົນງານນີ້ເທິງຟິມສະໄລ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ການເປີດຮັບແສງສອງຄັ້ງໃນສາກດຽວກັນ, ຄັ້ງໜຶ່ງແສງພໍດີ ແລະ ອີກຄັ້ງໜຶ່ງແສງເກີນ (overexposed). ຈາກນັ້ນລາວໄດ້ໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກຫ້ອງມືດເພື່ອປະສົມສອງພາບນີ້ເຂົ້າກັນເປັນພາບສຸດທ້າຍ ໂດຍທີ່ພາບທີ່ແສງເກີນນັ້ນຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເບຼີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/soften.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module is a near-copy of Orton's analog process into the digital domain.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ແມ່ນການຈຳລອງຂະບວນການອານາລັອກຂອງ Orton ເຂົ້າມາສູ່ລະບົບດິຈິຕອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/soften.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"size\n"
": The size of blur of the overexposed image. The bigger the size, the softer the result.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດ\n"
": ຂະໜາດຂອງການເບຼີໃນພາບທີ່ແສງເກີນ. ຍິ່ງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ຜົນລັດກໍຈະຍິ່ງນຸ້ມນວນຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/soften.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saturation\n"
": The saturation of the overexposed image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ\n"
": ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໃນພາບທີ່ແສງເກີນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/soften.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"brightness\n"
": The brightness (EV) of the overexposed image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ\n"
": ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (EV) ຂອງພາບທີ່ແສງເກີນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/soften.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mix\n"
": How the two images are mixed. 50% represents an equal mix of the well exposed and overexposed images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະສົມ (mix)\n"
": ວິທີການປະສົມສອງພາບເຂົ້າກັນ. 50% ໝາຍເຖິງການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງພາບທີ່ແສງພໍດີ ແລະ ພາບທີ່ແສງເກີນໃນສັດສ່ວນທີ່ເທົ່າກັນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "local contrast"
msgstr "ຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ (local contrast)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": manipulate local and global contrast separately.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ປັບຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ ແລະ ໂດຍລວມແຍກກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enhance the image's local contrast.\n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is achieved using either a _local laplacian_ (default) or _unnormalized bilateral_ filter. Both modes work exclusively on the L channel from Lab. The _local laplacian_ filter has been designed to be robust against unwanted halo effects and gradient reversals along edges.\n"
msgstr "ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງແບບ _local laplacian_ (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ຫຼື _unnormalized bilateral_. ທັງສອງໂໝດເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະໃນຊ່ອງສັນຍານ L ຂອງ Lab. ຕົວຕອງແບບ _local laplacian_ ຖືກອອກແບບມາ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເກີດແສງຟຸ້ງ (halo) ທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ການປີ້ນກັບຂອງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີຕາມຂອບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mode\n"
": Choice of _local laplacian_ filter or _bilateral grid_. The following sections define the controls available for each of these modes.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ\n"
": ເລືອກລະຫວ່າງຕົວຕອງ _local laplacian_ ຫຼື _bilateral grid_. ຫົວຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍ ການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃນແຕ່ລະໂໝດ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "bilateral grid"
msgstr "bilateral grid"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"coarseness\n"
": Adjust the coarseness of the details to be adjusted.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຫຍາບ (coarseness)\n"
": ປັບຄວາມຫຍາບຂອງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຈະຖືກປັບແຕ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"contrast\n"
": Control how strongly the algorithm distinguishes between brightness levels. Increase this parameter for a more contrasty look.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄອນທຣາສ\n"
": ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມແຮງຂອງສູດຄຳນວນໃນການແຍກລະດັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ. ເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງມີຄອນທຣາສສູງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"detail\n"
": Add or remove detail. Higher values increase local contrast.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ (detail)\n"
": ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບລາຍລະອຽດ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "local laplacian"
msgstr "local laplacian"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To understand the parameters of the local laplacian filter, one can think of it as applying a curve to the image, similar to the following graph:\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈພາລາມິເຕີຂອງຕົວຕອງ local laplacian, ໃຫ້ຈິນຕະນາການວ່າມັນຄືການໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (curve) ກັບຮູບພາບ, ຄ້າຍຄືກັບກຣາຟຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![local laplacian curve](local-contrast/local-laplacian-curve.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![local laplacian curve](local-contrast/local-laplacian-curve.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This curve is applied to the image in a way that works locally and avoids halo artifacts.\n"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ກັບຮູບພາບໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະຈຸດ ແລະ ຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເກີດແສງຟຸ້ງ (halo).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The local laplacian mode also supports shadow lifting and highlight compression, similar to the [_shadows and highlights_](shadows-and-highlights.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ໂໝດ local laplacian ຍັງຮອງຮັບການດຶງເງົາ (shadow lifting) ແລະ ການບີບອັດຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ (highlight compression), ຄ້າຍຄືກັບໂມດູນ [_ເງົາ ແລະ ຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ (shadows and highlights)_](shadows-and-highlights.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"detail\n"
": Add or remove detail. Higher values increase local contrast. This inserts an S shaped element in the center of the curve, to increase or decrease local contrast.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ (detail)\n"
": ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບລາຍລະອຽດ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະແຊກອົງປະກອບ ຮູບຊົງໂຕ S ໄວ້ກາງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"highlights\n"
": This affects one end of the S shaped contrast curve, effectively increasing or compressing contrast in the highlights. A low value pulls the highlights down.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ (highlights)\n"
": ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ປາຍດ້ານໜຶ່ງຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂຕ S, ຊຶ່ງຈະເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ບີບອັດຄອນທຣາສໃນສ່ວນຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳຈະດຶງຈຸດສະຫວ່າງລົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"shadows\n"
": Similar to the highlights parameter, this affects the other end of the contrast curve, and increases or decreases contrast in the shadows. A higher value gives more contrast in the shadows. A lower value lifts the shadows and can effectively simulate a fill light. Note that this is done with local manipulation of the image. However, this means that a completely dark image cannot be brightened in this way -- only dark objects in front of bright objects are affected.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເງົາ (shadows)\n"
": ຄ້າຍຄືກັບພາລາມິເຕີຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ປາຍອີກດ້ານໜຶ່ງຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄອນທຣາສໃນສ່ວນເງົາ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະໃຫ້ຄອນທຣາສໃນສ່ວນເງົາຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະດຶງເງົາໃຫ້ສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ສາມາດຈຳລອງແສງເປີດເງົາ (fill light) ໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໂດຍການປັບແຕ່ງສະເພາະສ່ວນ. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຮູບທີ່ມືດສະນິດທັງໝົດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ -- ຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບວັດຖຸທີ່ມືດຢູ່ຕໍ່ໜ້າວັດຖຸທີ່ສະຫວ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mid-tone range\n"
": This controls the extent of the S shaped part of the contrast curve. A larger value makes the S wider, and thus classifies more values as mid-tones and fewer values as highlights and shadows. In higher dynamic range settings it can be useful to reduce this value to achieve stronger range compression, by lowering the contrast in the highlights and the shadows. Note however, that for really strong HDR scenarios this may work best in combination with a [_base curve_](./base-curve.md) that pre-compresses the range, perhaps with an approximately logarithmic curve. The exposure fusion feature in the [_base curve_](./base-curve.md) module may lead to more pleasing results at times, but is also more prone to halo effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ວງໂທນກາງ (mid-tone range)\n"
": ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມຂອບເຂດຂອງສ່ວນຮູບຊົງໂຕ S ໃນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຕ S ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ຊຶ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຈະມີຄ່າສີທີ່ຖືກຈັດເປັນໂທນກາງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ເປັນຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ເງົາໜ້ອຍລົງ. ໃນຮູບທີ່ມີຊ່ວງກວ້າງຂອງແສງສູງ (HDR), ການຫຼຸດຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເປັນປະໂຫຍດເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ການບີບອັດຊ່ວງແສງທີ່ແຮງຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍການຫຼຸດຄອນທຣາສໃນສ່ວນຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ເງົາ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ສຳລັບສະຖານະການ HDR ທີ່ແຮງແທ້ໆ, ມັນອາດຈະໄດ້ຜົນດີທີ່ສຸດຫາກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [_base curve_](./base-curve.md) ທີ່ບີບອັດຊ່ວງແສງມາກ່ອນແລ້ວ. ຟີເຈີ exposure fusion ໃນໂມດູນ [_base curve_](./base-curve.md) ອາດໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ສວຍງາມກວ່າໃນບາງຄັ້ງ ແຕ່ກໍສ່ຽງທີ່ຈະເກີດແສງຟຸ້ງ (halo) ໄດ້ງ່າຍກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/local-contrast.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": This setting can cause banding artifacts in the image if pushed to extreme values. This is due to the way in which darktable computes the fast approximation of the local laplacian filter.\n"
msgstr ": ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາແຖບສີ (banding) ໃນຮູບພາບໄດ້ ຫາກປັບໄປຫາຄ່າທີ່ສູງເກີນໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຈາກວິທີທີ່ darktable ຄຳນວນຄ່າປະມານແບບໄວຂອງຕົວຕອງ local laplacian.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "dither or posterize"
msgstr "ດີເທີ ຫຼື ໂພສເຕີໄຣຊ໌ (dither or posterize)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": reduce banding and posterization effects in output JPEGs by adding random noise, or reduce bit depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ລົດອາການພາບແຕກເປັນຊັ້ນ (banding) ໃນໄຟລ໌ JPEG ໂດຍການເພີ່ມນອຍສ໌ແບບສຸ່ມ, ຫຼື ລົດຄວາມລະອຽດບິດ (bit depth).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"purpose\n"
": corrective, artistic.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດປະສົງ\n"
": ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂ, ເພື່ອສິລະປະ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module eliminates some of the banding artifacts that can result when darktable's internal 32-bit floating point data is transferred into discrete 8-bit or 16-bit integer output format for display or export. It can also be used for creative posterization effects.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ຊ່ວຍກຳຈັດສິ່ງແປກປອມແບບເປັນຊັ້ນ (banding) ທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນ 32-bit floating point ຂອງ darktable ຖືກແປງເປັນ 8-bit ຫຼື 16-bit ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນ ຫຼື ສົ່ງອອກ. ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເອັບເຟັກ posterization ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Although not an inherent problem in any of darktable's modules, some operations may provoke banding if they produce a lightness gradient in the image. To mitigate possible artifacts you should consider activating dithering when using the [_vignetting_](./vignetting.md) or [_graduated density_](./graduated-density.md) modules. This is especially relevant for images with extended homogeneous areas such as cloudless sky. Also watch out for banding artifacts when using a gradient [drawn mask](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn).\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ແມ່ນບັນຫາໂດຍກົງໃນໂມດູນໃດໆຂອງ darktable, ແຕ່ການຈັດການບາງຢ່າງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດແຖບ"
"ສີ (banding) ຖ້າພວກມັນສ້າງການໄລ່ລະດັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໃນຮູບພາບ. ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນສິ່ງແປກປອມທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນ, "
"ທ່ານຄວນພິຈາລະນາເປີດໃຊ້ງານການກະຈາຍເມັດສີ (dithering) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ຂອບພາບມືດ_](./"
"vignetting.md) ຫຼື [_ການໄລ່ລະດັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມ_](./graduated-density.md). ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນເປັ"
"ນພິເສດສຳລັບຮູບພາບທີ່ມີພື້ນທີ່ກວ້າງ ແລະ ມີສີສະເໝີກັນ ເຊັ່ນ: ທ້ອງຟ້າທີ່ບໍ່ມີເມກ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ ໃຫ້ລະວັງສິ່ງແປກປອມ"
"ຂອງແຖບສີເມື່ອໃຊ້ [drawn mask](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn) ແບ"
"ບໄລ່ລະດັບສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing an image dithered into a very low bit depth from some distance (e.g. “Floyd-Steinberg 1-bit b&w”) will give the impression of a homogeneous grayscale image. darktable attempts to mimic this impression when rendering zoomed-out images in the center view, the navigation window and thumbnails. This is accomplished by dithering those images into a higher number of grayscale levels. Note that, as a consequence, the [scopes](../utility-modules/shared/scopes.md) module -- the data for which is derived from the navigation window -- will show this increased number of levels and is therefore not a full match to the output image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເບິ່ງຮູບພາບທີ່ມີການກະຈາຍເມັດສີ (dithered) ໄປສູ່ຄວາມເລິກບິດ (bit depth) ທີ່ຕ່ຳຫຼາຍຈາກໄລຍະຫ່າ"
"ງໃດໜຶ່ງ (ເຊັ່ນ: “Floyd-Steinberg 1-bit b&w”) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເປັນຮູບພາບສີເທົາທີ່ສະເໝີກັນ. "
"darktable ພະຍາຍາມຮຽນແບບການຮັບຮູ້ນີ້ເມື່ອສະແດງພາບທີ່ຖືກຊູມອອກໃນມຸມເບິ່ງກາງ, ໜ້າຕ່າງນຳທາງ ແລະ ຮູ"
"ບນ້ອຍ (thumbnails). ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການກະຈາຍເມັດສີຮູບພາບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນລະດັບສີເທົາທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ. ຂໍໃຫ້ສັງ"
"ເກດວ່າ, ຜົນທີ່ຕາມມາກໍຄື ໂມດູນ [scopes](../utility-modules/shared/scopes.md) -- ເຊິ່ງຂໍ້ມູ"
"ນແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງນຳທາງ -- ຈະສະແດງຈຳນວນລະດັບທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນນີ້ ແລະ ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ກົງກັບຮູບພາບຂາອອກທັ"
"ງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"method\n"
": Choose the dithering method to use. \n"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການ (method)\n"
": ເລືອກວິທີການກະຈາຍເມັດສີ (dithering) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": _Floyd-Steinberg_ (default): Systematically distribute quantization errors over neighboring pixels. This method can be selected with some typical output bit depths. Alternatively, you can select _Floyd-Steinberg auto_, which automatically adapts to the desired output format.\n"
msgstr ""
": _Floyd-Steinberg_ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ): ກະຈາຍຄວາມຜິດພາດຈາກການແປງຄ່າດີຈີຕອນ (quantization "
"errors) ໄປຍັງພິກເຊວຂ້າງຄຽງຢ່າງເປັນລະບົບ. ວິທີນີ້ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ກັບຄວາມເລິກບິດຂາອອກທົ່ວໄປບາງຢ່າງ. "
"ຫຼືທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກ _Floyd-Steinberg auto_, ເຊິ່ງຈະປັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຮູບແບບຂາອອກທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂດຍອັດຕະໂ"
"ນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": _random dithering_: This method just adds some level of randomness to break sharp tonal value bands. \n"
msgstr ""
": _ການກະຈາຍເມັດສີແບບສຸ່ມ (random dithering)_: ວິທີນີ້ພຽງແຕ່ເພີ່ມລະດັບຄວາມສຸ່ມເພື່ອທຳລາຍແຖບສີທີ່ຄົ"
"ມຊັດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": _posterization_: This method quantizes the pixel values into the indicated number of distinct levels per color channel (similar to Floyd-Steinberg) but does not redistribute the quantization errors, producing a [posterization](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Posterization) effect. Selecting two levels per channel produces eight possible output colors, three levels produces 27 colors (3x3x3), and so on. Use other modules affecting colors or tone curves (such as [_tone equalizer_](tone-equalizer.md) or [_color balance rgb_](color-balance-rgb.md)) to fine-tune which pixels produce which posterized colors. You can also use various [blending modes](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md) to control the colors of the result.\n"
msgstr ""
": _ການເຮັດພາບໂປສເຕີ (posterization)_: ວິທີນີ້ຈະແປງຄ່າພິກເຊວໃຫ້ເປັນຈຳນວນລະດັບທີ່ກຳນົດຕໍ່ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອ"
"ງສີ (ຄ້າຍກັບ Floyd-Steinberg) ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ກະຈາຍຄວາມຜິດພາດຄືນໃໝ່, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດເອັບເຟັກ "
"[posterization](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Posterization). ການເລືອກສອງລະດັບຕໍ່"
"ຊ່ອງສີຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີສີຂາອອກທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ 8 ສີ, ສາມລະດັບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີ 27 ສີ (3x3x3), ແລະ ຕໍ່ໆໄປ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂ"
"ມດູນອື່ນໆທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ສີ ຫຼື ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ (ເຊັ່ນ: [_tone equalizer_](tone-equalizer.md) ຫຼື "
"[_color balance rgb_](color-balance-rgb.md)) ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງວ່າພິກເຊວໃດຈະສ້າງສີໂປສເຕີແບບໃ"
"ດ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ [ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blending modes)](../../darkroom/masking-and-"
"blending/blend-modes.md) ຕ່າງໆເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມສີຂອງຜົນລັດໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/dither-or-posterize.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"damping (\"random\" method only)\n"
": Controls the level of added random noise expressed as a damping factor in a 10\\*log 2 basis. A value of -80 is a good fit for 8-bit output formats as it corresponds to a maximum change of one of the 256 possible levels; -160 is a good fit for for 16-bit output.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຫຼຸດທອນ (damping) (ສະເພາະວິທີ \"random\")\n"
": ຄວບຄຸມລະດັບຂອງສັນຍານລົບກວນ (noise) ແບບສຸ່ມທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ ໂດຍສະແດງເປັນຄ່າການຫຼຸດທອນໃນຖານ "
"10\\*log 2. ຄ່າ -80 ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບຮູບແບບຂາອອກ 8 ບິດ ເພາະມັນກົງກັບການປ່ຽນແປງສູງສຸດຂອງໜຶ່ງໃ"
"ນ 256 ລະດັບທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້; -160 ແມ່ນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບຂາອອກ 16 ບິດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowlight-vision.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "lowlight vision"
msgstr "ການເບິ່ງເຫັນໃນບ່ອນແສງໜ້ອຍ (lowlight vision)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowlight-vision.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": simulate human night vision.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ຈຳລອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງມະນຸດໃນຕອນກາງຄືນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowlight-vision.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"processing\n"
": linear, XYZ.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະມວນຜົນ\n"
": linear, XYZ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowlight-vision.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate human lowlight vision. This module can also be used to perform a day-to-night conversion.\n"
msgstr "ຈຳລອງການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂອງມະນຸດໃນບ່ອນແສງໜ້ອຍ. ໂມດູນນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນພາບກາງເວັນເປັນກາງຄືນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowlight-vision.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The idea is to calculate a [scotopic vision](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scotopic_vision) image, which is perceived by the rods rather than the cones in the eyes under low light. Scotopic lightness is then mixed with photopic value (regular color image pixel) using some blending function. This module can also simulate the [Purkinje effect](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purkinje_effect) by adding some blueness to the dark parts of the image.\n"
msgstr "ແນວຄິດຄືການຄຳນວນພາບແບບ [scotopic vision](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scotopic_vision), ຊຶ່ງແມ່ນການເບິ່ງເຫັນຜ່ານຈຸລັງຮູບແທ່ງ (rods) ແທນທີ່ຈະແມ່ນຈຸລັງຮູບຈວຍ (cones) ໃນດວງຕາເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນບ່ອນແສງໜ້ອຍ. ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງແບບ Scotopic ຈະຖືກນຳມາປະສົມກັບຄ່າ photopic (ພິກເຊລສີປົກກະຕິ) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນການປະສົມ. ໂມດູນນີ້ຍັງສາມາດຈຳລອງ [Purkinje effect](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purkinje_effect) ໂດຍການເພີ່ມສີຟ້າລົງໃນສ່ວນທີ່ມືດຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowlight-vision.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module comes with several presets, which can be used to get a better idea of how the module works.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ມາພ້ອມກັບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (presets) ຫຼາຍແບບ, ຊຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈວິທີການເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowlight-vision.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curve\n"
": The horizontal axis represents pixel lightness from dark (left) to bright (right). The vertical axis represents the kind of vision from night vision (bottom) to day vision (top).\n"
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (curve)\n"
": ແກນນອນສະແດງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊລຈາກມືດ (ຊ້າຍ) ຫາ ສະຫວ່າງ (ຂວາ). ແກນຕັ້ງສະແດງຮູບແບບ ການເບິ່ງເຫັນຈາກກາງຄືນ (ລຸ່ມ) ຫາ ກາງເວັນ (ເທິງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lowlight-vision.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blue\n"
": Set the blue hint in shadows (Purkinje effect).\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີຟ້າ (blue)\n"
": ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຟ້າໃນສ່ວນເງົາ (Purkinje effect).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "rgb primaries"
msgstr "ແມ່ສີ RGB (rgb primaries)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": adjustment of the RGB color primaries for color grading.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ການປັບແມ່ສີ RGB ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງສີ (color grading).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the hue and [purity](../../special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md#definitions) of the RGB primary colors (i.e. _which_ red, green and blue they represent), while leaving uncolored (gray) pixels unchanged. In addition to preserving gray pixels, the opponency relationships between the colors are also preserved under this adjustment: If you increase the purity of the blue primary, the opponent yellow's intensity increases to balance things out; If you twist the blue hue toward cyan, the opponent yellow is twisted toward orange.\n"
msgstr "ປັບຄ່າສີ (hue) ແລະ [ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດ (purity)](../../special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md#definitions) ຂອງແມ່ສີ RGB (ໝາຍເຖິງສີແດງ, ສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີຟ້າ ທີ່ພວກມັນເປັນຕົວແທນ), ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮັກສາເມັດສີທີ່ບໍ່ມີສີ (ສີເທີ) ໃຫ້ຄືເກົ່າ. ນອກຈາກການຮັກສາເມັດສີເທີແລ້ວ, ຄວາມສຳພັນແບບກົງກັນຂ້າມລະຫວ່າງສີຕ່າງໆ ກໍຍັງຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ພາຍໃຕ້ການປັບນີ້: ຫາກເຈົ້າເພີ່ມຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງແມ່ສີຟ້າ, ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີເຫຼືອງທີ່ເປັນຄູ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ສົມດຸນ; ຫາກເຈົ້າບິດຄ່າສີຟ້າໄປທາງສີຟ້າຂຽວ (cyan), ສີເຫຼືອງທີ່ເປັນຄູ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມຈະຖືກບິດໄປທາງສີສົ້ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module is essentially a channel mixer (as in the [color calibration](./color-calibration.md) module) but with a different interface. Even though the sliders are named \"red\", \"green\" and \"blue\", all adjustments are global and affect the overall colorimetry of the image, just like a channel mixer does.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ໂດຍພື້ນຖານແລ້ວແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືປະສົມຊ່ອງສັນຍານ (channel mixer) (ຄືກັບໃນໂມດູນ [ການປັບທຽບສີ (color calibration)](./color-calibration.md)) ແຕ່ມີໜ້າຕາການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າແຖບເລື່ອນຈະມີຊື່ວ່າ \"ແດງ\", \"ຂຽວ\" ແລະ \"ຟ້າ\", ແຕ່ການປັບທັງໝົດຈະມີຜົນທົ່ວທັງຮູບ ແລະ ສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄ່າສີໂດຍລວມຂອງຮູບ ຄືກັນກັບທີ່ເຄື່ອງມືປະສົມຊ່ອງສັນຍານເຮັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When applied before the [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) or [_sigmoid_](./sigmoid.md) tone mapping modules _rgb primaries_ can be used to make small adjustments to colorimetry. When applied after the tone mapping modules it may be used to apply creative edits such as tinting.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ກ່ອນໂມດູນ [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) ຫຼື [_sigmoid_](./sigmoid.md), _ແມ່ສີ RGB_ ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຄ່າສີເລັກໆ ໜ້ອຍໆ ໄດ້. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ, ມັນອາດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອການຕົບແຕ່ງແບບສ້າງສັນ ເຊັ່ນການຍ້ອມສີ (tinting).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"red hue\n"
": Shift red towards yellow (positive values) or magenta (negative values)\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສີແດງ\n"
": ປ່ຽນສີແດງໄປທາງສີເຫຼືອງ (ຄ່າບວກ) ຫຼື ສີມ່ວງແດງ (ຄ່າລົບ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"red purity\n"
": The purity of the red primary\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງສີແດງ\n"
": ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງແມ່ສີແດງ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"green hue\n"
": Shift green towards cyan (positive values) or yellow (negative values)\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສີຂຽວ\n"
": ປ່ຽນສີຂຽວໄປທາງສີຟ້າຂຽວ (ຄ່າບວກ) ຫຼື ສີເຫຼືອງ (ຄ່າລົບ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"green purity\n"
": The purity of the green primary\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງສີຂຽວ\n"
": ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງແມ່ສີຂຽວ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blue hue\n"
": Shift blue towards magenta (positive values) or cyan (negative values)\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສີຟ້າ\n"
": ປ່ຽນສີຟ້າໄປທາງສີມ່ວງແດງ (ຄ່າບວກ) ຫຼື ສີຟ້າຂຽວ (ຄ່າລົບ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blue purity\n"
": The purity of the blue primary\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງສີຟ້າ\n"
": ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງແມ່ສີຟ້າ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tint hue\n"
": When applied after tone mapping, this control allows the gray (achromatic) parts of the image to be tinted. When applied before tone mapping, it acts like a white balance control.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສີຍ້ອມ (tint hue)\n"
": ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຫຼັງຈາກການແປງໂທນ (tone mapping), ການຄວບຄຸມນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດຍ້ອມສີສ່ວນທີ່ເປັນສີເທີ (ບໍ່ມີສີ) ຂອງຮູບໄດ້. ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ກ່ອນການແປງໂທນ, ມັນຈະເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຄືກັບການຄວບຄຸມໄວບາລານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-primaries.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tint purity\n"
": The purity of the tint that is applied to the image\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງສີຍ້ອມ\n"
": ຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງສີຍ້ອມທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບ\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tone curve"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນ (tone curve)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": alter an image’s tones using curves.\n"
msgstr ""
"description\n"
": ປັບປ່ຽນໂທນສີຂອງຮູບພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (curves).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A classic digital photography tool to alter the tones of an image's using curves.\n"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືການຖ່າຍພາບດິຈິຕອນແບບດັ້ງເດີມສຳລັບປ່ຽນແປງໂທນສີຂອງພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module is very similar to the [_rgb curve_](./rgb-curve.md) module but works in Lab color space.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັນຫຼາຍກັບໂມດູນ [_rgb curve_](./rgb-curve.md) ແຕ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ Lab.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) to show the picked values on the displayed histogram. Numerical (Lab) values of the input and output (see below) at the selected spot or area are shown at the top left of the graph.\n"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ [ຕົວເລືອກ (picker)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ເພື່ອສະແດງຄ່າທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນຮິສໂຕແກຣມ. ຄ່າຕົວເລກ (Lab) ຂອງຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ) ທີ່ຈຸດ ຫຼື ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເລືອກ ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ດ້ານຊ້າຍເທິງຂອງກຣາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Please refer to the [curves](../../darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md) section for more details about how to modify curves including the **interpolation method**, **scale for graph** and **preserve colors** controls._\n"
msgstr "_ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງສ່ວນ [ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (curves)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີປັບແຕ່ງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ລວມເຖິງຕົວຄວບຄຸມ **ວິທີການແຊກ (interpolation method)**, **ມາດຕາສ່ວນກຣາບ (scale for graph)** ແລະ **ການຮັກສາສີ (preserve colors)**._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"color spaces\n"
": Depending on the desired intent, the tone curve can be applied in one of three color spaces:\n"
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນທີ່ສີ\n"
": ຂຶ້ນກັບຈຸດປະສົງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນໜຶ່ງໃນສາມພື້ນທີ່ສີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _Lab (linked or separated channels)_: Lab is a perceptual color space that is designed to approximate the way humans perceive colors and lightness. It represents color information independently of lightness. In “Lab, separated channels” mode, you are given fully independent control over the luminance (L-channel) and the chrominance (a/b-channels). In “Lab, linked channels” mode, only the luminance (L-channel) control is available. The color saturation correction is automatically computed, for each pixel, from the contrast correction applied to the luminance channel. This works better in cases where a subtle contrast correction is applied, but gives increasingly inaccurate saturation correction as the contrast is more dramatically altered.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _Lab (ຊ່ອງສີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ຫຼື ແຍກກັນ)_: Lab ແມ່ນພື້ນທີ່ສີຕາມການຮັບຮູ້ (perceptual color "
"space) ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບວິທີທີ່ມະນຸດຮັບຮູ້ສີ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ. ມັນສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນສີໂດຍແຍກຈາ"
"ກຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ. ໃນໂໝດ “Lab, separated channels”, ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (L-"
"channel) ແລະ ຄ່າສີ (a/b-channels) ໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ. ໃນໂໝດ “Lab, linked channels"
"”, ຈະມີພຽງແຕ່ການຄວບຄຸມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (L-channel) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ການແກ້ໄຂຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີຈະຖືກຄຳນວນ"
"ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ, ຈາກການປັບຄວາມຕັດກັນທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບຊ່ອງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີໃ"
"ນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີການປັບຄວາມຕັດກັນເລັກນ້ອຍ, ແຕ່ຈະໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຄວາມຕັດກັນຖືກປ່ຽນ"
"ແປງຢ່າງຮຸນແຮງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _XYZ (linked channels)_: XYZ is a linear technical color space designed to link the physiological light response of the human eye to RGB color spaces. As with Lab, it separates lightness from color information, but does so in a way that does not account for the role of the brain's correction in human perception. The “XYZ, linked channels” mode offers an alternative to “Lab, linked channels”, and works by applying the L-channel curve to all three channels in the XYZ color space. Look at [blend mode](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md) “coloradjustment” if you want to tune the strength of automatic chroma scaling. This mode is known to produce a slight hue shift towards yellow.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _XYZ (ຊ່ອງສີທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນ)_: XYZ ແມ່ນພື້ນທີ່ສີທາງເຕັກນິກແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear) ທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອເ"
"ຊື່ອມຕໍ່ການຕອບສະໜອງທາງສະລີລະວິທະຍາຕໍ່ແສງຂອງຕາມະນຸດກັບພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ Lab, ມັນແຍກຄວາມສ"
"ະຫວ່າງອອກຈາກຂໍ້ມູນສີ, ແຕ່ເຮັດໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງບົດບາດຂອງການປະມວນຜົນຂອງສະໝອງໃນການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງ"
"ມະນຸດ. ໂໝດ “XYZ, linked channels” ເປັນທາງເລືອກແທນ “Lab, linked channels”, ແລະ ເຮັ"
"ດວຽກໂດຍການໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຊ່ອງ L ກັບທັງສາມຊ່ອງໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ XYZ. ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ [ໂໝດການປະສົມ](../../"
"darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md) “coloradjustment” ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບ"
"ຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງການປັບຂະໜາດສີ (chroma scaling) ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໂໝດນີ້ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂທນ"
"ສີປ່ຽນໄປທາງສີເຫຼືອງເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _RGB (linked channels)_: RGB is a linear color space designed to capture and display images in additive synthesis. It is related to capture and display media and does not isolate color and lightness information. The “RGB, linked channels” mode works in ProPhoto RGB and applies the L-channel curve to all three channels in the RGB color space. Adding contrast in RGB space is known to desaturate highlights and boost saturation in the shadows, but this has proven to be the most reliable way to edit contrast, and is the standard method used in most software. This mode makes the tone curve module behave in much the same way as the [base-curve](./base-curve.md) module, except that the latter works in camera RGB space.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _RGB (linked channels)_: RGB ແມ່ນພື້ນທີ່ສີແບບລີເນຍ (linear color space) ທີ່ອອກແບບມ"
"າເພື່ອບັນທຶກ ແລະ ສະແດງຜົນຮູບພາບໃນການສັງເຄາະແບບຕື່ມແສງ (additive synthesis). ມັນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ"
"ສື່ການບັນທຶກ ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນ ໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ແຍກຂໍ້ມູນສີ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງອອກຈາກກັນ. ໂໝດ “RGB, "
"linked channels” ເຮັດວຽກໃນ ProPhoto RGB ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ L-channel ກັບທັງສາມຊ່ອງສັນຍ"
"ານໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB. ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast) ໃນພື້ນທີ່ RGB ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ກັນດີວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສີໃນສ່ວນໄຮໄລ້"
"ຈາງລົງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໃນສ່ວນເງົາ, ແຕ່ວິທີນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການພິສູດແລ້ວວ່າເປັນວິທີທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືທີ່ສຸດໃນການແກ້"
"ໄຂຄວາມຄົມຊັດ ແລະ ເປັນວິທີມາດຕະຖານທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນຊອບແວສ່ວນໃຫຍ່. ໂໝດນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ໂມດູນ tone curve ເຮັດວຽກ"
"ໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນກັບໂມດູນ [base-curve](./base-curve.md), ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ໂມດູນຫຼັງຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່"
"ສີ RGB ຂອງກ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Note that the module works in Lab color space in all cases. This means that the middle-gray coordinate is always 50% in the graph, no matter what color space is used. The same applies to the inset histogram displayed in the background of the curve. The controls are converted to the relevant color space before the corrections are applied -- in RGB and XYZ, the middle-gray is therefore remapped from 50% to 18%.\n"
msgstr ": ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ໂມດູນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ Lab ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພິກັດສີເທີົາປານກາງຈະຢູ່ທີ່ 50% ໃນກຣາບສະເໝີ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີໃດກໍຕາມ. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບຮິສໂຕແກຣມທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຈະຖືກແປງເປັນພື້ນທີ່ສີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກ່ອນຈະນຳໃຊ້ການປັບແກ້ -- ໃນ RGB ແລະ XYZ, ສີເທີົາປານກາງຈະຖືກຈັດວາງໃໝ່ຈາກ 50% ເປັນ 18%.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"L-channel curve\n"
": The tone curve in L-channel works on Lightness. To provide a better overview, a lightness histogram is displayed in the module. When working in one of the \"linked channels\" modes, the L-channel curve is the only one available.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຊ່ອງ L (L-channel curve)\n"
": ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນໃນຊ່ອງ L ເຮັດວຽກກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (Lightness). ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ, ຮິສໂຕແກຣມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໂມດູນ. ເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ \"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຊ່ອງສັນຍານ\", ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຊ່ອງ L ຈະເປັນພຽງອັນດຽວທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The horizontal axis represents the lightness of the input image pixels. The vertical axis represents the lightness of the output image pixels. The default straight diagonal line does not change anything. A curve above the default diagonal increases the lightness, whereas a curve below decreases it. An S-like curve will enhance the contrast of the image. You can move the end-points of the default diagonal to change the black and white points and hence alter the overall contrast -- this has the same effect as changing the black and white points in the [_levels_](./levels.md) module.\n"
msgstr ": ແກນນອນແທນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊວພາບຂາເຂົ້າ. ແກນຕັ້ງແທນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊວພາບຂາອອກ. ເສັ້ນທแยງມຸມຊື່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ. ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອເສັ້ນທแยງມຸມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ຢູ່ລຸ່ມຈະຫຼຸດຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ. ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຮູບຕົວ S ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສຂອງພາບ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຍ້າຍຈຸດປາຍຂອງເສັ້ນທແຍງມຸມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈຸດສີດຳ ແລະ ສີຂາວ ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນການປ່ຽນຄອນທຣາສໂດຍລວມ -- ນີ້ໃຫ້ຜົນຄືກັນກັບການປ່ຽນຈຸດສີດຳ ແລະ ສີຂາວໃນໂມດູນ [_levels_](./levels.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"a/b-channel curves\n"
": The curves in the a and b channels work on color values and are available only in the “Lab, separated channels” mode. The horizontal axis represents the color channel value of the input image pixels. The vertical axis represents the color channel value of the output image pixels. Positive a-values correspond to more magenta colors; negative a-values correspond to more greenish colors. Positive b-values correspond to more yellowish colors; negative b-values correspond to more blueish colors.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຊ່ອງ a/b\n"
": ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໃນຊ່ອງ a ແລະ b ຈະເຮັດວຽກກັບຄ່າຂອງສີ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນໂໝດ “Lab, separated "
"channels” ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ແກນນອນສະແດງເຖິງຄ່າຊ່ອງສີຂອງພິກເຊວຮູບພາບຂາເຂົ້າ. ແກນຕັ້ງສະແດງເຖິງຄ່າຊ່ອງສີຂ"
"ອງພິກເຊວຮູບພາບຂາອອກ. ຄ່າ a ທີ່ເປັນບວກຈະກົງກັບສີມ່ວງແດງ (magenta) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ; ຄ່າ a ທີ່ເປັນລົບຈະກົງ"
"ກັບສີຂຽວຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າ b ທີ່ເປັນບວກຈະກົງກັບສີເຫຼືອງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ; ຄ່າ b ທີ່ເປັນລົບຈະກົງກັບສີຟ້າຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The default diagonal straight line does not change anything. Shifting the center of the curve will give the image a color tint: shifting the a-channel upwards gives a magenta tint; shifting the b-channel upwards gives a yellow tint; shifting the a-channel downwards gives a green tint; shifting the b-channel downwards gives a blue tint.\n"
msgstr ": ເສັ້ນທແຍງມຸມຊື່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ. ການເລື່ອນຈຸດກາງຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບມີສີເຈືອ (tint): ການເລື່ອນຊ່ອງ a ຂຶ້ນຈະໃຫ້ສີເຈືອມ່ວງແດງ; ການເລື່ອນຊ່ອງ b ຂຶ້ນຈະໃຫ້ສີເຈືອເຫຼືອງ; ການເລື່ອນຊ່ອງ a ລົງຈະໃຫ້ສີເຈືອຂຽວ; ການເລື່ອນຊ່ອງ b ລົງຈະໃຫ້ສີເຈືອຟ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Increasing/decreasing the steepness of a curve, without shifting its center, will increase/decrease the color saturation of the respective channel. With properly defined curves you can exert fine control on color saturation, depending on the input pixel's colors.\n"
msgstr ": ການເພີ່ມ/ຫຼຸດຄວາມຊັນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ໂດຍບໍ່ເລື່ອນຈຸດກາງ ຈະເປັນການເພີ່ມ/ຫຼຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໃນຊ່ອງສັນຍານນັ້ນໆ. ດ້ວຍການກຳນົດເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໄດ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດ ຂຶ້ນກັບສີຂອງພິກເຊວຂາເຂົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "highlight reconstruction"
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນແຈ້ງ (highlight reconstruction)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": avoid magenta highlights and try to recover highlights colors.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ຫຼີກລ່ຽງສ່ວນແຈ້ງເປັນສີມ່ວງ ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມກູ້ຄືນສີໃນສ່ວນແຈ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Attempt to reconstruct color information for pixels that are clipped in one or more RGB channel.\n"
msgstr "ພະຍາຍາມກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນສີສຳລັບພິກເຊວທີ່ລົ້ນ (clipped) ໃນຊ່ອງສັນຍານ RGB ໃດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຊ່ອງ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "clipping"
msgstr "ແສງລົ້ນ (clipping)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clipping occurs when the amount of captured light exceeds either the capacity of a camera's sensor to record that light (photosite saturation) or the capacity of the Raw file to store it (digital clipping). Once a pixel is clipped we can no longer know the precise brightness of that pixel -- only that it is equal to or greater than the maximum value that pixel can store.\n"
msgstr "ແສງລົ້ນ (Clipping) ເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອປະລິມານແສງທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບເກີນຄວາມສາມາດຂອງເຊັນເຊີກ້ອງທີ່ຈະບັນທຶກແສງນັ້ນໄດ້ (photosite saturation) ຫຼື ເກີນຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ RAW ທີ່ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ (digital clipping). ເມື່ອພິກເຊວລົ້ນແລ້ວ ພວກເຮົາຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຮູ້ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ແນ່ນອນຂອງພິກເຊວນັ້ນໄດ້ອີກ -- ຮູ້ພຽງແຕ່ວ່າມັນມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ພິກເຊວນັ້ນຈະເກັບໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ideally, the photosite saturation point would be the same as the value at which digital clipping occurs (to make maximum use of the camera's dynamic range) but these values often differ between cameras. Darktable uses a camera's \"white point\" to determine whether or not a given channel is clipped. If the white point is set incorrectly for a given camera, this can lead to valid pixels being clipped and can adversely impact the effectiveness of this module.\n"
msgstr "ໃນທາງອຸດົມຄະຕິ, ຈຸດອີ່ມຕົວຂອງ photosite ຄວນຈະເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັບທີ່ເກີດ digital clipping (ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຂອງກ້ອງໄດ້ສູງສຸດ) ແຕ່ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມັກຈະຕ່າງກັນໃນກ້ອງແຕ່ລະລຸ້ນ. Darktable ໃຊ້ \"ຈຸດສີຂາວ (white point)\" ຂອງກ້ອງເພື່ອຕັດສິນວ່າຊ່ອງສັນຍານນັ້ນລົ້ນ ຫຼື ບໍ່. ຫາກຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຸດສີຂາວບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບກ້ອງໃດໜຶ່ງ, ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ພິກເຊວທີ່ປົກກະຕິຖືກຖືວ່າລົ້ນ ແລະ ສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງໂມດູລນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When a camera captures light (using a normal Bayer sensor) each pixel represents a single color (R,G,B), which is then interpolated by the demosaic module to calculate the color of neighboring pixels. The result will often be pixels (in the demosaiced image) that are clipped in some (R,G,B) channels but not others.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອກ້ອງຮັບແສງ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຊັນເຊີແບບ Bayer ປົກກະຕິ) ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຈະແທນຄ່າສີດຽວ (R,G,B), ເຊິ່ງຈາກນັ້ນຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໂດຍໂມດູລເດໂມເຊກ (demosaic) ເພື່ອຄິດໄລ່ສີຂອງພິກເຊວຂ້າງຄຽງ. ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ມັກຈະເປັນພິກເຊວ (ໃນຮູບທີ່ເດໂມເຊກແລ້ວ) ທີ່ລົ້ນໃນບາງຊ່ອງສັນຍານ (R,G,B) ແຕ່ບໍ່ລົ້ນໃນຊ່ອງອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If these pixels are left partially clipped it can result in unrealistic colors appearing in the image. These incorrect colors can then be further skewed by the white balance module, which adjusts the ratios of the R, G, and B channels to account for the overall color of the scene. For example, where only the G channel is clipped (and R and B are close to clipping) the white balance module can cause the R and B channels to be adjusted above the clipping point of the G channel leading to pink highlights that would otherwise have been white.\n"
msgstr "ຫາກພິກເຊວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກປ່ອຍໃຫ້ລົ້ນບາງສ່ວນ ມັນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສີທີ່ບໍ່ສົມຈິງໃນຮູບ. ສີທີ່ຜິດພາດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະເພ້ຍໄປຕື່ມອີກໂດຍໂມດູລສົມດຸນສີຂາວ (white balance), ເຊິ່ງຈະປັບອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຊ່ອງສັນຍານ R, G, ແລະ B ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍສີໂດຍລວມຂອງສາກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ມີພຽງຊ່ອງ G ທີ່ລົ້ນ (ສ່ວນ R ແລະ B ໃກ້ຈະລົ້ນ) ໂມດູລສົມດຸນສີຂາວອາດຈະປັບໃຫ້ຊ່ອງ R ແລະ B ສູງເກີນຈຸດລົ້ນຂອງຊ່ອງ G ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສ່ວນແຈ້ງເປັນສີບົວ ເຊິ່ງຄວາມຈິງແລ້ວຄວນຈະເປັນສີຂາວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The crude method to resolve this is to clip the R and B channels to the clipping point of the G channel (the \"clip highlights\" reconstruction method), but this can result in the loss of valid pixel data that may be useful in highlight reconstruction, and may also cause other artifacts and hue shifts.\n"
msgstr "ວິທີການແບບງ່າຍໆ ໃນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫານີ້ຄືການຕັດຊ່ອງ R ແລະ B ໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັບຈຸດລົ້ນຂອງຊ່ອງ G (ວິທີການກູ້ຄືນແບບ \"clip highlights\"), ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນພິກເຊວທີ່ຍັງໃຊ້ໄດ້ ເຊິ່ງອາດມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນແຈ້ງ, ແລະ ຍັງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຈຸດລົບອື່ນໆ ແລະ ຄ່າສີເພ້ຍ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "highlight reconstruction methods"
msgstr "ວິທີການກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນແຈ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A number of highlight reconstruction methods are provided within this module. These methods all use unclipped channels and/or adjacent pixels to reconstruct the missing data.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູລນີ້ມີວິທີການກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນແຈ້ງຫຼາຍແບບ. ວິທີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທັງໝົດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງສັນຍານທີ່ບໍ່ລົ້ນ ແລະ/ຫຼື ພິກເຊວຂ້າງຄຽງເພື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປຂຶ້ນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"inpaint opposed (default)\n"
": Restore clipped pixels by using an average of adjacent unclipped pixels to estimate the correct color. This works well for the majority of images but may fail where the clipped areas are adjacent to areas of a different color.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເຕີມສ່ວນຂາດແບບກົງກັນຂ້າມ (inpaint opposed) (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)\n"
": ກູ້ຄືນພິກເຊວທີ່ລົ້ນໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍຂອງພິກເຊວຂ້າງຄຽງທີ່ບໍ່ລົ້ນເພື່ອປະເມີນສີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ວິທີນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີກັບຮູບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ແຕ່ອາດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໃນບ່ອນທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ລົ້ນຢູ່ຕິດກັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີສີຕ່າງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"segmentation based\n"
": A more sophisticated algorithm that uses adjacent unclipped pixels to estimate the correct color, by treating each clipped area separately (as an individual segment). The color of each clipped segment is estimated by analysing the color ratios of the adjacent pixels. Pixels that are too dark or appear to be an edge are rejected by the algorithm. If all surrounding pixels are rejected, that segment is reconstructed using the \"inpaint opposed\" method (above). Segments that are close together are often parts of the same object and so can be treated as if they were a single segment.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອີງຕາມການແບ່ງສ່ວນ (segmentation based)\n"
": ອັນກໍຣິດທຶມທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າ ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ພິກເຊວຂ້າງຄຽງທີ່ບໍ່ລົ້ນເພື່ອປະເມີນສີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ໂດຍການຈັດການແຕ່ລະພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ລົ້ນແຍກກັນ (ເປັນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ). ສີຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນທີ່ລົ້ນຈະຖືກປະເມີນໂດຍການວິເຄາະອັດຕາສ່ວນສີຂອງພິກເຊວຂ້າງຄຽງ. ພິກເຊວທີ່ມືດເກີນໄປ ຫຼື ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າເປັນຂອບຈະຖືກປະຕິເສດໂດຍອັນກໍຣິດທຶມ. ຫາກພິກເຊວອ້ອມຂ້າງທັງໝົດຖືກປະຕິເສດ, ສ່ວນນັ້ນຈະຖືກກູ້ຄືນໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີ \"inpaint opposed\" (ຂ້າງເທິງ). ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນມັກຈະເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸດຽວກັນ ແລະ ສາມາດຈັດການຄືກັບວ່າພວກມັນເປັນສ່ວນດຽວກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Segmentation based reconstruction is able to rebuild large areas where all channels are clipped by examining the surrounding gradients. However, you should think of this method more as a way to \"disguise\" clipped areas with something plausible, rather than a way to \"magically\" repair them.\n"
msgstr ": ການກູ້ຄືນແບບອີງຕາມການແບ່ງສ່ວນສາມາດສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ທີ່ຊ່ອງສັນຍານທັງໝົດລົ້ນຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ໄດ້ ໂດຍການກວດສອບການໄລ່ສີອ້ອມຂ້າງ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຈົ້າຄວນຄິດວ່າວິທີນີ້ເປັນການ \"ອຳພາງ\" ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ລົ້ນດ້ວຍບາງສິ່ງທີ່ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າມັນຄວນຈະເປັນ, ຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນການຊ່ອມແຊມພວກມັນແບບ \"ມະຫັດສະຈັນ\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If you see irregular patterns or magenta casts you should reduce the threshold value. After selecting a proper threshold you might also need to modify the candidating value. There is no OpenCL code for the segmentation based mode, so there is a performance penalty when using it.\n"
msgstr ": ຫາກເຈົ້າເຫັນລວດລາຍທີ່ຜິດປົກກະຕິ ຫຼື ສີມ່ວງເພ້ຍ ເຈົ້າຄວນຫຼຸດຄ່າຂີດຈຳກັດ (threshold). ຫຼັງຈາກເລືອກຂີດຈຳກັດທີ່ເໝາະສົມແລ້ວ ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບຄ່າຕົວເລືອກ (candidating) ນຳອີກ. ບໍ່ມີລະຫັດ OpenCL ສຳລັບໂໝດອີງຕາມການແບ່ງສ່ວນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການໃຊ້ງານມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນຊ້າລົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"guided laplacians\n"
": Use an algorithm (derived from the [_diffuse or sharpen_](./diffuse.md) module) to replicate details from valid channels into clipped channels and to propagate color gradients from valid surrounding regions into clipped regions. This is a computationally-intensive method designed for maximum smoothness and seamless blending of the reconstructed regions into their neighborhood, and is designed primarily to reconstruct spotlights and specular reflections. This mode is available for Bayer sensors only.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກາຍເດັດ ລາປລາສຊຽນ (guided laplacians)\n"
": ໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິດທຶມ (ພັດທະນາມາຈາກໂມດູລ [_ການຟຸ້ງ ຫຼື ການເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົມ (diffuse or sharpen)_](./diffuse.md)) ເພື່ອຈຳລອງລາຍລະອຽດຈາກຊ່ອງສັນຍານທີ່ປົກກະຕິໄປຫາຊ່ອງສັນຍານທີ່ລົ້ນ ແລະ ເພື່ອແຜ່ກະຈາຍການໄລ່ສີຈາກພື້ນທີ່ອ້ອມຂ້າງທີ່ປົກກະຕິໄປຫາພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ລົ້ນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີການທີ່ໃຊ້ກຳລັງການປະມວນຜົນສູງ ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຄວາມນຸ່ມນວນສູງສຸດ ແລະ ການປະສົມປະສານທີ່ໄຮ້ຮອຍຕໍ່ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກກູ້ຄືນເຂົ້າກັບພື້ນທີ່ອ້ອມຂ້າງ, ແລະ ອອກແບບມາເປັນຫຼັກເພື່ອການກູ້ຄືນດວງໄຟສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ແສງສະທ້ອນທີ່ເງົາງາມ. ໂໝດນີ້ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະເຊັນເຊີແບບ Bayer ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clip highlights\n"
": Clamp all pixels to the white level (i.e. clip the remaining color channels). This method is most useful in cases where clipped highlights occur in naturally desaturated objects (e.g. clouds).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕັດສ່ວນແຈ້ງ (clip highlights)\n"
": ຕັດພິກເຊວທັງໝົດໃຫ້ຢູ່ທີ່ລະດັບສີຂາວ (ຄື ການຕັດຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີທີ່ເຫຼືອ). ວິທີນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ສຸດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ສ່ວນແຈ້ງທີ່ລົ້ນເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນວັດຖຸທີ່ບໍ່ມີສີສັນຕາມທຳມະຊາດ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເມກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"reconstruct in LCh\n"
": Analyse each pixel with at least one clipped channel and attempt to correct the clipped pixel (in LCh color space) using the values of the other (3 for Bayer or 8 for X-Trans) pixels in the affected sensor block. The reconstructed highlights will still be monochrome, but brighter and with more detail than with “clip highlights”. This method works fairly well with a high-contrast base curve, which renders highlights desaturated. As with _clip highlights_ this method is a good option for naturally desaturated objects.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຄືນໃໝ່ໃນ LCh (reconstruct in LCh)\n"
": ວິເຄາະແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວທີ່ມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຊ່ອງສີທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຂາດຫາຍ (clipped) ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມແກ້ໄຂພິກເຊວນັ້ນ (ໃນ"
"ພື້ນທີ່ສີ LCh) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າຂອງພິກເຊວອື່ນໆ (3 ພິກເຊວສຳລັບ Bayer ຫຼື 8 ພິກເຊວສຳລັບ X-Trans) ໃນບລັອກ"
"ເຊັນເຊີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. ສ່ວນໄຮໄລ້ (highlights) ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ຈະຍັງຄົງເປັນສີດຽວ (monochrome), "
"ແຕ່ຈະສະຫວ່າງກວ່າ ແລະ ມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍກວ່າການໃຊ້ “clip highlights”. ວິທີນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຂ້ອນຂ້າງດີກັ"
"ບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງພື້ນຖານທີ່ມີຄວາມຕັດກັນສູງ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນໄຮໄລ້ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສູງ. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບ _clip "
"highlights_, ວິທີນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກທີ່ດີສຳລັບວັດຖຸທີ່ມີສີຈາງ (desaturated) ຕາມທຳມະຊາດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** When using the highlight reconstruction included with the [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) module it may be better to avoid using this module in _clip highlights_ mode (so that _filmic rgb_ has more information to work with).\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນແຈ້ງທີ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນໂມດູລ [_ຟິລມິກ RGB (filmic rgb)_](./filmic-rgb.md), ອາດຈະດີກວ່າຫາກຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໃຊ້ໂມດູລນີ້ໃນໂໝດ _clip highlights_ (ເພື່ອໃຫ້ _filmic rgb_ ມີຂໍ້ມູນໃນການປະມວນຜົນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"method\n"
": The method used to reconstruct highlights.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການ\n"
": ວິທີການທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນແຈ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clipping threshold\n"
": Pixels above this value are considered to be clipped.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດແສງລົ້ນ (clipping threshold)\n"
": ພິກເຊວທີ່ມີຄ່າສູງກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນແສງລົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clipping mask\n"
": Click the icon beside the slider to visualise what areas of the image are considered to be clipped (the clipping mask). If the clipping mask does not match the [RAW overexposed warning](../utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md), you may need to correct the threshold value.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມາກສ໌ແສງລົ້ນ (clipping mask)\n"
": ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນຂ້າງແຖບເລື່ອນເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າພື້ນທີ່ໃດຂອງຮູບທີ່ຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນແສງລົ້ນ (ມາກສ໌ແສງລົ້ນ). ຫາກມາກສ໌ແສງລົ້ນບໍ່ກົງກັບ [ຄຳເຕືອນແສງລົ້ນຂອງໄຟລ໌ RAW](../utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md), ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງປັບຄ່າຂີດຈຳກັດໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: The clipping mask is also available as a [raster mask](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md) for use in subsequent modules. This can be used, for example, to manage any color cast that remains after highlight reconstruction.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ມາກສ໌ແສງລົ້ນຍັງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປັນ [ມາກສ໌ແບບຣາສເຕີ (raster mask)](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md) ສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນໂມດູລຕໍ່ໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບສີທີ່ເພ້ຍທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອຢູ່ຫຼັງຈາກການກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນແຈ້ງ ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"guided laplacians\" mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດ \"guided laplacians\""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"noise level\n"
": Add Poisson noise (natural photon noise such as you would find in sensor readings) to the clipped regions. For high-ISO images, the valid regions of the image will be noisy, but the reconstructed clipped areas will be smooth, which may look odd. Adding some noise in the reconstruction helps to visually blend the result with the rest of the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບສັນຍານລົບ (noise level)\n"
": ເພີ່ມສັນຍານລົບແບບ Poisson (ສັນຍານລົບຈາກໂຟຕອນທຳມະຊາດ ເຊັ່ນທີ່ພົບໃນການອ່ານຄ່າຈາກເຊັນເຊີ) ເຂົ້າໄປໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ລົ້ນ. ສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ມີຄ່າ ISO ສູງ, ບໍລິເວນທີ່ປົກກະຕິຈະມີສັນຍານລົບ ແຕ່ບໍລິເວນທີ່ກູ້ຄືນມາຈະເບິ່ງນຽນເກີນໄປ ເຊິ່ງອາດເບິ່ງແປກໆ. ການເພີ່ມສັນຍານລົບເຂົ້າໄປໃນການກູ້ຄືນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບກົມກືນກັບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"iterations\n"
": The _guided laplacians_ mode is an iterative process that extrapolates gradients and details from the neighborhood. Each new iteration refines the previous reconstruction but adds more computations that will make the module slower. The default number of iterations should provide reasonable results but you can increase if magenta highlights are not completely recovered -- increase this parameter gradually but carefully, to manage the speed/quality trade-off.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮອບ (iterations)\n"
": ໂໝດ _guided laplacians_ ແມ່ນຂະບວນການແບບເຮັດຊ້ຳທີ່ຄາດຄະເນການໄລ່ສີ ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດຈາກພື້ນທີ່ອ້ອມຂ້າງ. ແຕ່ລະຮອບໃໝ່ຈະປັບປຸງການກູ້ຄືນຄັ້ງກ່ອນໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ກໍຕ້ອງແລກດ້ວຍການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂມດູລເຮັດວຽກຊ້າລົງ. ຈຳນວນຮອບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄວນຈະໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ດີພໍສົມຄວນ ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມໄດ້ຫາກສ່ວນແຈ້ງສີມ່ວງຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການກູ້ຄືນທັງໝົດ -- ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມພາຣາມີເຕີນີ້ຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງເພື່ອຈັດການສົມດຸນລະຫວ່າງຄວາມໄວ ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"inpaint a flat color\n"
": Inpainting a flat color is an algorithmic trick that may help recover magenta highlights in difficult cases (large blown areas) by smoothing RGB ratios. It can be seen as a \"reconstruction booster\" that may reduce the number of iterations required to entirely remove magenta in clipped highlights. However, this also makes the reconstruction less accurate and can lead to non-smooth reconstructed edges and unrelated colors being inpainted (e.g. blue sky or green leaves bleeding into white clouds). Use this setting with caution.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຕີມດ້ວຍສີພື້ນ (inpaint a flat color)\n"
": ການເຕີມດ້ວຍສີພື້ນແມ່ນເຕັກນິກທາງອັນກໍຣິດທຶມທີ່ອາດຊ່ວຍກູ້ຄືນສ່ວນແຈ້ງສີມ່ວງໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຍາກ (ພື້ນທີ່ລົ້ນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່) ໂດຍການປັບອັດຕາສ່ວນ RGB ໃຫ້ນຽນຂຶ້ນ. ມັນປຽບຄືກັບ \"ຕົວເສີມການກູ້ຄືນ\" ທີ່ອາດລົດຈຳນວນຮອບທີ່ຈຳເປັນໃນການລົບສີມ່ວງໃນສ່ວນແຈ້ງທີ່ລົ້ນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງເຮັດໃຫ້ການກູ້ຄືນມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງນ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ ອາດນຳໄປສູ່ຂອບທີ່ບໍ່ນຽນ ແລະ ສີທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຖືກເຕີມເຂົ້າມາ (ເຊັ່ນ: ສີຟ້າຂອງທ້ອງຟ້າ ຫຼື ສີຂຽວຂອງໃບໄມ້ເລືອດເຂົ້າໄປໃນເມກສີຂາວ). ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"diameter of the reconstruction\n"
": The _guided laplacians_ mode uses a multi-scale algorithm that tries to recover details from each scale independently. The _diameter of the reconstruction_ is the largest scale used by the algorithm. Large scales will increase memory consumption as well as runtimes, and may also cause unrelated colors or details to be inpainted in clipped regions. You are advised to use a diameter roughly twice as large as the largest clipped area to be reconstructed. It is also possible that a given diameter may not suit all clipped areas, in which case you should use several instances at different scales and mask the clipped areas accordingly.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງຂອງການກູ້ຄືນ (diameter of the reconstruction)\n"
": ໂໝດ _guided laplacians_ ໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິດທຶມແບບຫຼາຍລະດັບ (multi-scale) ທີ່ພະຍາຍາມກູ້ຄືນລາຍລະອຽດຈາກແຕ່ລະລະດັບແຍກກັນ. _ເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງຂອງການກູ້ຄືນ_ ແມ່ນລະດັບທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດທີ່ອັນກໍຣິດທຶມໃຊ້. ລະດັບທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຈະເພີ່ມການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ ແລະ ເວລາໃນການປະມວນຜົນ, ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ສີ ຫຼື ລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຖືກເຕີມເຂົ້າມາໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ລົ້ນ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງປະມານສອງເທົ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ລົ້ນທີ່ໃຫຍ່ທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຈະກູ້ຄືນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງເປັນໄປໄດ້ວ່າເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງທີ່ກຳນົດອາດຈະບໍ່ເໝາະກັບທຸກພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ລົ້ນ, ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວເຈົ້າຄວນໃຊ້ໂມດູລຫຼາຍໆ ຄັ້ງ (instances) ໃນລະດັບທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ແລະ ໃຊ້ສ້າງມາກສ໌ໃຫ້ກັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ລົ້ນຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"segmentation based\" mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດ \"segmentation based\""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clipping threshold\n"
": Since this controls the locations of pixels that are considered to be clipped, it also changes the size of the resulting segments and the location of the adjacent pixels used for the reconstruction. For accurate adjustment, you can use the exposure module to ensure that no highlights are clipped in the histogram (or the image you see on screen). Then raise the clipping threshold until the highlights are no longer white and slowly lower it again until they look acceptable.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂີດຈຳກັດແສງລົ້ນ (clipping threshold)\n"
": ເນື່ອງຈາກສິ່ງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພິກເຊວທີ່ຖືວ່າລົ້ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຂອງສ່ວນ (segments) ທີ່ໄດ້ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພິກເຊວຂ້າງຄຽງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການກູ້ຄືນນຳ. ເພື່ອການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູລການຮັບແສງ (exposure) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າບໍ່ມີສ່ວນແຈ້ງໃດລົ້ນໃນຮີສໂຕກຣາມ (ຫຼື ຮູບທີ່ເຈົ້າເຫັນເທິງໜ້າຈໍ). ຈາກນັ້ນໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຂີດຈຳກັດແສງລົ້ນຈົນກວ່າສ່ວນແຈ້ງຈະບໍ່ເປັນສີຂາວອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ແລະ ຄ່ອຍໆ ຫຼຸດລົງອີກຄັ້ງຈົນກວ່າພວກມັນຈະເບິ່ງເໝາະສົມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"combine\n"
": The radius at which close segments are combined and considered to be part of the same segment. Increase (to combine more segments) when different parts of the same object have been incorrectly reconstructed to different colors. Decrease (to separate segments) when different objects have been incorrectly reconstructed to the same color. Click on the button beside the slider to see the outlines of the resulting segments.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລວມ (combine)\n"
": ລັດສະໝີທີ່ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັນ ແລະ ຖືວ່າເປັນສ່ວນດຽວກັນ. ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມຄ່າ (ເພື່ອລວມສ່ວນໃຫ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ) ເມື່ອພື້ນທີ່ຕ່າງໆ ຂອງວັດຖຸດຽວກັນຖືກກູ້ຄືນມາເປັນຄົນລະສີຢ່າງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ໃຫ້ຫຼຸດຄ່າ (ເພື່ອແຍກສ່ວນ) ເມື່ອວັດຖຸທີ່ຕ່າງກັນຖືກກູ້ຄືນມາເປັນສີດຽວກັນຢ່າງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມຂ້າງແຖບເລື່ອນເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂອບຂອງສ່ວນທີ່ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"candidating\n"
": Choose whether to prefer choosing candidate pixels (used to obtain color data) with segmentation analysis (high values) or inpaint opposed (low values). Click the button beside the slider to show the segments that are considered to have good candidates.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກຜູ້ສະໝັກ (candidating)\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຈະເນັ້ນການເລືອກພິກເຊວຜູ້ສະໝັກ (ທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສີ) ດ້ວຍການວິເຄາະການແບ່ງສ່ວນ (ຄ່າສູງ) ຫຼື ແບບ inpaint opposed (ຄ່າຕ່ຳ). ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມຂ້າງແຖບເລື່ອນເພື່ອສະແດງສ່ວນທີ່ຖືກຖືວ່າມີຜູ້ສະໝັກທີ່ດີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rebuild\n"
": Choose how to rebuild areas that have all channels clipped. The \"small\" and \"large\" modes are tuned for segment sizes less than 25 and greater than 100 pixels in diameter, respectively. The \"flat\" modes attempt to ignore narrow un-clipped features (powerlines, branches) to avoid gradients. Finally, the \"generic\" modes attempt to find the best settings for each segment.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງຄືນໃໝ່\n"
": ເລືອກວິທີການສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ທຸກຊ່ອງສັນຍານຖືກຕັດ (clipped) ຄືນໃໝ່. ໂໝດ \"ນ້ອຍ\" ແລະ \"ໃຫຍ່\" ແມ່ນຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຂະໜາດສ່ວນທີ່ມີເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງນ້ອຍກວ່າ 25 ແລະ ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 100 ພິກເຊລ ຕາມລຳດັບ. ໂໝດ \"ແປ\" ພະຍາຍາມລະເລີຍລັກສະນະແຄບໆທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕັດ (ສາຍໄຟ, ກິ່ງງ່າ) ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີ. ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໂໝດ \"ທົ່ວໄປ\" ພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"guided laplacians\" mode and filmic's highlight reconstruction"
msgstr "ໂໝດ \"guided laplacians\" ແລະ ການກູ້ຄືນຈຸດສະຫວ່າງຂອງ filmic"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is important to note that the _highlight reconstruction_ module is quite early in the pixel pipeline -- before [_input color profile_](./input-color-profile.md) and the full chromatic adaptation in [_color calibration_](./color-calibration.md) (if you use the _modern chromatic adaptation_ workflow). A common trick to solve clipped highlights is to simply desaturate them to white but, because white is not defined before the full chromatic adaptation and the input color profiling, it is not possible to use this trick here. Technically, there is no color yet at this point in the pipeline, only an arbitrary 3D signal.\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຄວນຈົດຈຳຄື ໂມດູນ _ການກູ້ຄືນຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ_ ແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລຳດັບການປະມວນຜົນພິກເຊລ -- ກ່ອນ [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າ_](./input-color-profile.md) ແລະ ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີຢ່າງເຕັມຮູບແບບໃນ [_ການປັບທຽບສີ_](./color-calibration.md) (ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ _ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີແບບທັນສະໄໝ_). ເຄັດລັບທົ່ວໄປໃນການແກ້ໄຂຈຸດສະຫວ່າງທີ່ຖືກຕັດຄືການຫຼຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໃຫ້ເປັນສີຂາວ ແຕ່ເນື່ອງຈາກສີຂາວ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດກ່ອນການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ ແລະ ການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າ, ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄັດລັບນີ້ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ໄດ້. ທາງດ້ານເຕັກນິກ, ຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີສີເທື່ອໃນຈຸດນີ້ຂອງຂະບວນການ, ມີພຽງແຕ່ສັນຍານ 3D ທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດຂຶ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _guided laplacians_ approach has been designed specifically to be immune to white-balance discrepancies and to avoid any concept or method related to color (so there is no explicit desaturation). It only handles gradients (transitions) in the signal and aims at connecting them smoothly, in order to fill the missing parts. This process is quite heavy though, since it falls into the category of supervised machine learning (gradient-based optimization through multi-scale curvature), which is a sub-branch of artificial intelligence.\n"
msgstr "ວິທີການ _guided laplacians_ ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາໂດຍສະເພາະເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຈາກຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງສົມດຸນສີຂາວ ແລະ ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງແນວຄວາມຄິດ ຫຼື ວິທີການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສີ (ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີການຫຼຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີໂດຍກົງ). ມັນຈັດການພຽງແຕ່ການໄລ່ລະດັບສີ (ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານ) ໃນສັນຍານ ແລະ ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພວກມັນຢ່າງກົມກືນ ເພື່ອຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນທີ່ຫາຍໄປ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ຂ້ອນຂ້າງໜັກໜ່ວງ ເພາະມັນຈັດຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມຂອງການຮຽນຮູ້ຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ (supervised machine learning) ໂດຍການເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຕາມການໄລ່ລະດັບສີ, ຊຶ່ງແມ່ນຂະແໜງຍ່ອຍຂອງປັນຍາປະດິດ (AI).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[_Filmic's highlight reconstruction_](./filmic-rgb.md#reconstruct) uses a simpler color propagation algorithm coupled with a desaturation option that can favor an _achromatic_ reconstruction. Not only does it _know_ about color (because it comes after the full color profiling and chromatic adaptation) but it also uses a simplified and faster version of the algorithm used by the _guided laplacians_ approach. Namely, this variant will not try as hard to restore details and will favor a smooth blur instead.\n"
msgstr "[_ການກູ້ຄືນຈຸດສະຫວ່າງຂອງ Filmic_](./filmic-rgb.md#reconstruct) ໃຊ້ສູດຄຳນວນການກະຈາຍສີທີ່ງ່າຍກວ່າ ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວເລືອກການຫຼຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃນການກູ້ຄືນແບບ _ບໍ່ມີສີ (achromatic)_. ມັນບໍ່ພຽງແຕ່ _ຮັບຮູ້_ ກ່ຽວກັບສີ (ເພາະມັນມາຫຼັງຈາກການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີ ແລະ ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່) ແຕ່ມັນຍັງໃຊ້ສູດຄຳນວນ ລຸ້ນທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ໄວຂຶ້ນກວ່າວິທີ _guided laplacians_. ເວົ້າງ່າຍໆຄື ລຸ້ນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ພະຍາຍາມກູ້ຄືນ ລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ ແຕ່ຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເບລີ (blur) ທີ່ກົມກືນແທນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The filmic reconstruction is good enough for very large clipped patches and offers the benefit of being able to degrade to white as a last resort. It is also better and faster to inpaint solid color into clipped areas, at the expense of details. Its main drawback is that it is not as selective in the source of the colors being inpainted in clipped parts, so it may inpaint unrelated colors.\n"
msgstr "ການກູ້ຄືນແບບ filmic ແມ່ນດີພໍສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກຕັດຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຫຼາຍ ແລະ ມີຂໍ້ດີຄືສາມາດປັບໃຫ້ເປັນສີຂາວໄດ້ ໃນກໍລະນີສຸດທ້າຍ. ມັນຍັງດີກວ່າ ແລະ ໄວກວ່າໃນການເຕີມສີພື້ນລົງໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກຕັດ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກກັບການສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ. ຂໍ້ເສຍຫຼັກຄືມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກແຫຼ່ງທີ່ມາຂອງສີທີ່ຈະນໍາມາເຕີມໄດ້ດີປານໃດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນອາດຈະເຕີມສີທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງລົງໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All in all, you are advised to use the _guided laplacians_ highlight reconstruction mode to:\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍລວມແລ້ວ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ໂໝດການກູ້ຄືນຈຸດສະຫວ່າງແບບ _guided laplacians_ ເພື່ອ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "smooth the boundaries of clipped areas,\n"
msgstr "1. ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກຕັດມີຄວາມກົມກືນ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "recover spotlights and clipped areas of diameter below approximately 256px (on the full-resolution RAW),\n"
msgstr "2. ກູ້ຄືນດວງໄຟ (spotlights) ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກຕັດທີ່ມີເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງຕ່ຳກວ່າປະມານ 256px (ໃນໄຟລ໌ RAW ຄວາມລະອຽດເຕັມ),\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "remove chromatic aberrations, which can occur during [demosaicing](./demosaic.md) (the next module in the pipeline) at the boundary between clipped and valid regions.\n"
msgstr "3. ລຶບຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນຂອງສີ (chromatic aberrations) ທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງ [ການຖອດລະຫັດສີ](./demosaic.md) (ໂມດູນຖັດໄປໃນຂະບວນການ) ຢູ່ບໍລິເວນຮອຍຕໍ່ລະຫວ່າງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຖືກຕັດ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ປົກກະຕິ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you find yourself having to increase the _diameter of reconstruction_ past 512px to get a full recovery from magenta, the best approach is usually to cap the diameter to 512px, do the most you can with this setting, and then enable filmic's highlight reconstruction to finish the work. This will give more bearable run-times with a very similar result.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານພົບວ່າຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ _ເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງການກູ້ຄືນ_ ກາຍ 512px ເພື່ອກູ້ຄືນສີມ່ວງ (magenta) ໃຫ້ສົມບູນ, ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນກຳນົດເສັ້ນຜ່ານສູນກາງໄວ້ທີ່ 512px, ປັບໃຫ້ດີທີ່ສຸດດ້ວຍຄ່ານີ້, ແລ້ວເປີດໃຊ້ການກູ້ຄືນຈຸດສະຫວ່າງ ຂອງ filmic ເພື່ອປິດວຽກ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການປະມວນຜົນບໍ່ຊ້າເກີນໄປ ແລະ ໄດ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "demosaic"
msgstr "ການເດໂມເຊກ (demosaic)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": reconstruct full RGB pixels from a sensor color filter array reading.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ສ້າງພິກເຊວ RGB ເຕັມຮູບແບບຈາກການອ່ານຄ່າອາເຣຕົວຕອງສີ (color filter array) ຂອງເຊັນເຊີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Control how raw files are demosaiced and optionally apply capture sharpening.\n"
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊ (demosaic) ຂອງໄຟລ໌ດິບ ແລະ ເລືອກໃຊ້ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການບັນທຶກ (capture sharpening).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "bayer filters"
msgstr "ຟິວເຕີເບເຢີ (bayer filters)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sensor cells of a digital camera (commonly named \"photosites\") are not color-sensitive -- they are only able to record different levels of lightness. In order to obtain a color image, each cell is covered by a colored filter (red, green or blue) that primarily passes light of that color. This means that each photosite (and therefore each \"pixel\" of the raw image) only contains information about a single color channel.\n"
msgstr "ເຊລຮັບແສງຂອງກ້ອງດິຈິຕອນ (ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປເອີ້ນວ່າ \"ຈຸດຮັບແສງ\" ຫຼື \"photosites\") ບໍ່ມີຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວຕໍ່ສີ -- ພວກມັນສາມາດບັນທຶກໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ລະດັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພາບສີ, ແຕ່ລະເຊລຈະຖືກປິດທັບດ້ວຍຟິວເຕີສີ (ແດງ, ຂຽວ ຫຼື ຟ້າ) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແສງຂອງສີນັ້ນຜ່ານໄປໄດ້. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ແຕ່ລະຈຸດຮັບແສງ (ແລະ ແຕ່ລະ \"ພິກເຊລ\" ຂອງພາບດິບ) ຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຊ່ອງສີດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The array of color filters covering the sensor, known as a color filter array (CFA), is commonly arranged in a mosaic pattern known as a Bayer filter (though other patterns are also used). A demosaic algorithm reconstructs the other color channels by interpolation with data from the neighboring photosites. For further reading see the Wikipedia articles on [demosaicing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demosaicing) and the [Bayer filter](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayer_filter).\n"
msgstr "ຊຸດຂອງຟິວເຕີສີທີ່ປົກຄຸມເຊັນເຊີ, ທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນໃນຊື່ Color Filter Array (CFA), ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນຈັດລຽງໃນຮູບແບບໂມເຊ ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ ຟິວເຕີເບເຢີ (Bayer filter) (ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີຮູບແບບອື່ນນຳໃຊ້ຄືກັນ). ຂັ້ນຕອນການຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊ (demosaic algorithm) ຈະສ້າງຊ່ອງສີອື່ນໆຄືນໃໝ່ ໂດຍການຄຳນວນຫາຄ່າລະຫວ່າງກາງ (interpolation) ຈາກຂໍ້ມູນຂອງຈຸດຮັບແສງຂ້າງຄຽງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ບົດຄວາມ Wikipedia ກ່ຽວກັບ [demosaicing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demosaicing) ແລະ [Bayer filter](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayer_filter).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Darktable offers several demosaic algorithms, each with its own characteristics. The differences between them are often very subtle and might only be visible while pixel-peeping. However, as the program works on a pixel-by-pixel basis and demosaic generates the base data for the other modules, the choice of the algorithm can have a visually significant effect on the quality of very fine details in the image. This can include the appearance of false maze patterns as well as the rendering quality of colored edges.\n"
msgstr "Darktable ມີຫຼາຍຂັ້ນຕອນວິທີ (algorithms) ໃນການຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊ, ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະແບບມີລັກສະນະສະເພາະຕົວ. ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງພວກມັນມັກຈະເລັກນ້ອຍຫຼາຍ ແລະ ອາດຈະເຫັນໄດ້ໃນເວລາຂະຫຍາຍເບິ່ງພິກເຊລເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເນື່ອງຈາກໂປຣແກຣມເຮັດວຽກແບບພິກເຊລຕໍ່ພິກເຊລ ແລະ ການຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊເປັນການສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານໃຫ້ກັບໂມດູນອື່ນໆ, ການເລືອກອັນກໍຣິທຶມຈຶ່ງສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດຫຼາຍໃນພາບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ລວມເຖິງການເກີດຮູບແບບເສັ້ນທີ່ຜິດພ້ຽນ (maze patterns) ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບການສະແດງຜົນຂອງຂອບສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Demosaic interpolation algorithms are often prone to produce artifacts, typically visible as [Moiré patterns](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moire_pattern) when zooming into the image. The chosen algorithm might handle _pre-existing_ Moiré- or Maze-like patterns in the raw data in a better or worse way. In these circumstances _VNG4_ and _LMMSE_ are often more stable.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນຕອນການຄຳນວນແຊກຂໍ້ມູນເດໂມເຊກ (Demosaic interpolation algorithms) ມັກຈະເກີດສິ່ງແປກປອ"
"ມ (artifacts), ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະເຫັນເປັນ [ລວດລາຍມົວເຣ (Moiré patterns)](https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moire_pattern) ເມື່ອຊູມເຂົ້າໄປໃນຮູບ. ອານກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ເລືອກອາດຈະຈັດການກັບ"
"ລວດລາຍມົວເຣ ຫຼື ລວດລາຍທີ່ຄ້າຍກັບເຂົາວົງກົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນຂໍ້ມູນ raw ໄດ້ດີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ດີແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ໃນສະຖານະການ"
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ _VNG4_ ແລະ _LMMSE_ ມັກຈະມີຄວາມສະຖຽນຫຼາຍກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following demosaic algorithms are available for sensors with Bayer filters:\n"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນວິທີການຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຊັນເຊີທີ່ມີຟິວເຕີເບເຢີ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_PPG_ used to be darktable's default demosaic algorithm. It is fast, but other algorithms generally yield better results.\n"
msgstr "_PPG_ ເຄີຍເປັນອັນກໍຣິທຶມມາດຕະຖານຂອງ darktable. ມັນເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວ, ແຕ່ອັນກໍຣິທຶມອື່ນໆໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ດີກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_AMaZE_ and _RCD_ offer better reconstruction of high-frequency content (finer details, edges, stars) but might struggle with color reconstruction overshoots or added noise in areas of low contrast. While _AMaZE_ often retains more high-frequency details it is also more prone to color overshoots than _RCD_. Since _RCD_ now offers similar performance to _PPG_, but with better results, it is now the default algorithm.\n"
msgstr "_AMaZE_ ແລະ _RCD_ ໃຫ້ການສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນຄືນໃໝ່ຂອງເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ສູງ (ລາຍລະອຽດນ້ອຍໆ, ຂອບ, ດາວ) ໄດ້ດີກວ່າ ແຕ່ອາດຈະມີບັນຫາກັບການເກີດສີເກີນ (overshoots) ຫຼື ມີນອຍສ໌ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີຄວາມຕ່າງສີຕ່ຳ. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ _AMaZE_ ມັກຈະຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດຄວາມຖີ່ສູງໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍມີໂອກາດເກີດສີເກີນໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ _RCD_. ເນື່ອງຈາກ _RCD_ ໃນປັດຈຸບັນມີປະສິດທິພາບໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ _PPG_ ແຕ່ໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ມັນຈຶ່ງກາຍເປັນອັນກໍຣິທຶມມາດຕະຖານໃນຕອນນີ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_LMMSE_ is better suited for use on high ISO and noisy images than _AMaZE_ or _RCD_, both of which tend to generate overshooting artifacts when applied to such images. It can also be useful to manage images that exhibit Moiré patterns with other algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"_LMMSE_ ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຄ່າ ISO ສູງ ແລະ ມີສັນຍານລົບກວນ (noise) ຫຼາຍກວ່າ "
"_AMaZE_ ຫຼື _RCD_, ເຊິ່ງທັງສອງມັກຈະສ້າງສິ່ງແປກປອມຈາກການຄຳນວນເກີນ (overshooting "
"artifacts) ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບພາບດັ່ງກ່າວ. ມັນຍັງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຈັດການຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງລວດລາຍມົວເຣ "
"(Moiré patterns) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ກັບອານກໍຣິທຶມອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_VNG4_ is better suited for use on images with low-frequency content (e.g. low contrast regions such as sky or snow-fields). Compared to _AMaZE_ and _RCD_, it causes loss of some details but is very stable for maze artifacts. VNG4 is no longer recommended -- for most images, other algorithms provide better results.\n"
msgstr "_VNG4_ ເໝາະສົມກວ່າສຳລັບພາບທີ່ມີເນື້ອຫາຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ (ເຊັ່ນ: ບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີຄວາມຕ່າງສີຕ່ຳ ເຊັ່ນ ທ້ອງຟ້າ ຫຼື ທົ່ງຫິມະ). ເມື່ອທຽບກັບ _AMaZE_ ແລະ _RCD_, ມັນເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດບາງຢ່າງຫາຍໄປ ແຕ່ມີຄວາມສະຖຽນຫຼາຍຕໍ່ກັບສິ່ງແປກປອມແບບ maze. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ VNG4 ແລ້ວ -- ສຳລັບພາບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ອັນກໍຣິທຶມອື່ນໆໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ດີກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The performance of the demosaic algorithms differs significantly, _AMaZE_ being by far the slowest.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງອັນກໍຣິທຶມຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍ, ໂດຍ _AMaZE_ ແມ່ນເຮັດວຽກຊ້າທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sensors without bayer filters"
msgstr "ເຊັນເຊີທີ່ບໍ່ມີຟິວເຕີເບເຢີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are a few cameras whose sensors do not use a Bayer filter. Cameras with an \"X-Trans\" sensor have their own set of demosaic algorithms. The default algorithm for X-Trans sensors is _Markesteijn 1-pass_, which produces fairly good results. For slightly better quality (at the cost of much slower processing), choose _Markesteijn 3-pass_. Though _VNG_ is faster than _Markesteijn 1-pass_ on some computers, it is prone to artifacts.\n"
msgstr "ມີກ້ອງບາງລຸ້ນທີ່ເຊັນເຊີບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຟິວເຕີເບເຢີ. ກ້ອງທີ່ມີເຊັນເຊີ \"X-Trans\" ຈະມີຊຸດອັນກໍຣິທຶມຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊເປັນຂອງຕົນເອງ. ອັນກໍຣິທຶມມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບເຊັນເຊີ X-Trans ແມ່ນ _Markesteijn 1-pass_, ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ຂ້ອນຂ້າງດີ. ເພື່ອຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນເລັກນ້ອຍ (ແລກກັບການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຊ້າລົງຫຼາຍ), ໃຫ້ເລືອກ _Markesteijn 3-pass_. ເຖິງວ່າ _VNG_ ຈະໄວກວ່າ _Markesteijn 1-pass_ ໃນຄອມພິວເຕີບາງເຄື່ອງ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍມັກຈະເກີດສິ່ງແປກປອມໄດ້ງ່າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Images from monochrome cameras do not require demosaicing, however, since darktable 5.4 they use this module to support [capture sharpening](#capture-sharpen).\n"
msgstr "ພາບຈາກກ້ອງຂາວດຳ (monochrome) ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊ, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 5.4 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ພວກມັນໄດ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບ [ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການບັນທຶກ (capture sharpening)](#capture-sharpen).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "special algorithms"
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມພິເສດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_passthrough (monochrome)_ is only useful for cameras that have had the color filter array physically removed from the sensor (e.g. scratched off). Demosaic algorithms usually reconstruct other color channels by interpolation with data from the neighboring pixels. However, if the color filter array is not present, there is nothing to interpolate, so this algorithm simply sets all the color channels to the same value, resulting in a monochrome image. This method avoids the interpolation artifacts that the standard demosaic algorithms might introduce.\n"
msgstr "_passthrough (monochrome)_ ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບກ້ອງທີ່ຖືກຖອດຊຸດຟິວເຕີສີອອກຈາກເຊັນເຊີແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຂູດອອກ). ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ ອັນກໍຣິທຶມຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊຈະສ້າງຊ່ອງສີອື່ນໆຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍການຄຳນວນຈາກພິກເຊລຂ້າງຄຽງ. ແຕ່ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຊຸດຟິວເຕີສີ, ກໍບໍ່ມີຫຍັງໃຫ້ຄຳນວນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນອັນກໍຣິທຶມນີ້ຈຶ່ງກຳນົດໃຫ້ທຸກຊ່ອງສີມີຄ່າດຽວກັນ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ພາບຂາວດຳ. ວິທີນີ້ຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນສິ່ງແປກປອມຈາກການ interpolation ທີ່ອາດເກີດຈາກອັນກໍຣິທຶມຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊແບບມາດຕະຖານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_photosite_color_ is not meant to be used for image processing. It takes the raw photosite data and presents it as red, blue or green pixels. This is designed for debugging purposes in order to see the raw data and can assist with analysis of errors produced by the other demosaic algorithms.\n"
msgstr "_photosite_color_ ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການປະມວນຜົນພາບ. ມັນຈະເອົາຂໍ້ມູນຈຸດຮັບແສງດິບມາສະແດງເປັນພິກເຊລສີແດງ, ຟ້າ ຫຼື ຂຽວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການກວດສອບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (debugging) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນດິບ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃນການວິເຄາະຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຈາກອັນກໍຣິທຶມຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_monochrome_ is only available for monochrome cameras.\n"
msgstr "_monochrome_ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບກ້ອງຂາວດຳເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "dual demosaic algorithms"
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊແບບຄູ່ (dual demosaic)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some images have areas best demosaiced using an algorithm that preserves high frequency information (like _AMaZE_ or _RCD_) and other areas that might profit from an algorithm more suited to low frequency content (like _VNG4_).\n"
msgstr "ບາງພາບມີບໍລິເວນທີ່ເໝາະກັບການຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊດ້ວຍອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ຮັກສາຂໍ້ມູນຄວາມຖີ່ສູງ (ເຊັ່ນ _AMaZE_ ຫຼື _RCD_) ແລະ ບໍລິເວນອື່ນໆທີ່ອາດຈະໄດ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ເໝາະກັບເນື້ອຫາຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ (ເຊັ່ນ _VNG4_).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In dual demosaic algorithms (e.g. _RCD + VNG4_) the sensor data is demosaiced twice, first by _RCD_, _AMaZE_ or _Markesteijn 3-pass_ and then by _VNG4_. Both sets of demosaiced data are retained for subsequent processing.\n"
msgstr "ໃນອັນກໍຣິທຶມຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊແບບຄູ່ (ເຊັ່ນ _RCD + VNG4_), ຂໍ້ມູນເຊັນເຊີຈະຖືກຖອດລະຫັດສອງຄັ້ງ, ຄັ້ງທຳອິດໂດຍ _RCD_, _AMaZE_ ຫຼື _Markesteijn 3-pass_ ແລະ ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນໂດຍ _VNG4_. ຂໍ້ມູນທັງສອງຊຸດຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເພື່ອປະມວນຜົນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The data from the high frequency algorithm is then analysed for _local data change_ and, using a threshold (there is a bit more of maths involved here), the output image is written pixel-by-pixel for each color channel using data from each demosaic algorithm weighed by the local data change.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກອັນກໍຣິທຶມຄວາມຖີ່ສູງຈະຖືກວິເຄາະຫາ _ການປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະບ່ອນ (local data change)_ ແລະ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄ່າກຳນົດ (threshold), ພາບຜົນລັບຈະຖືກຂຽນແບບພິກເຊລຕໍ່ພິກເຊລ ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກແຕ່ລະອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ຖືກຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນໃນບໍລິເວນນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In general, areas with greater detail are demosaiced by the algorithm best suited to that purpose (_RCD, AMaZe, Markesteijn 3-pass_) and any flat areas (like blue sky) are demosaiced using the second algorithm (_VNG4_).\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປ, ບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຈະຖືກຖອດລະຫັດດ້ວຍອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ເໝາະກັບຈຸດປະສົງນັ້ນ (_RCD, AMaZe, Markesteijn 3-pass_) ແລະ ບໍລິເວນທີ່ຮາບພຽງ (ເຊັ່ນ ທ້ອງຟ້າ) ຈະຖືກຖອດລະຫັດໂດຍໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີສອງ (_VNG4_).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_The 'local data change' is technically implemented as a gaussian-blurred single channel selection mask calculated from a combination of the threshold value and the pixels' luminance._\n"
msgstr "_'ການປ່ຽນແປງຂໍ້ມູນສະເພາະບ່ອນ' ໃນທາງເຕັກນິກແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນໜ້າກາກເລືອກຊ່ອງສີດຽວແບບເບຼີ (gaussian-blurred selection mask) ທີ່ຄຳນວນຈາກການປະສົມລະຫວ່າງຄ່າ threshold ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊລ._\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "selecting the threshold"
msgstr "ການເລືອກຄ່າກຳນົດ (threshold)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An automatically-calculated threshold is difficult to implement. Instead, the \"display blending mask\" button can be used to display the _selection mask_ so you can control the selection of the algorithm manually. The brighter the pixel in the displayed mask, the more the output is taken from the high-frequency algorithm.\n"
msgstr "ການຄຳນວນຄ່າ threshold ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດນັ້ນເຮັດໄດ້ຍາກ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ປຸ່ມ \"ສະແດງໜ້າກາກການປະສົມ (display blending mask)\" ຈຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະແດງ _ໜ້າກາກການເລືອກ_ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມການເລືອກອັນກໍຣິທຶມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ພິກເຊລໃນໜ້າກາກທີ່ສະແດງອອກມາແຮ່ງແຈ້ງເທົ່າໃດ, ຜົນລັບກໍຈະແຮ່ງມາຈາກອັນກໍຣິທຶມຄວາມຖີ່ສູງຫຼາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "capture sharpen"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການບັນທຶກ (capture sharpen)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Capture sharpening recovers details lost due to in-camera or lens blurring, which can be caused by diffraction, the anti-aliasing filter or other sources of gaussian-type blur.\n"
msgstr "Capture sharpening ຊ່ວຍກູ້ຄືນລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ສູນເສຍໄປຍ້ອນການເບຼີຈາກພາຍໃນກ້ອງ ຫຼື ເລນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດເກີດຈາກການຫັກເຫຂອງແສງ (diffraction), ຟິວເຕີລົດຮອຍຢັກ (anti-aliasing filter) ຫຼື ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດການເບຼີແບບ Gaussian ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Capture sharpening is performed inside the demosaic module because some parts of the algorithm require raw CFA data. The sharpening itself is performed on demosaiced RGB data and is available for bayer, xtrans and monochrome sensors.\n"
msgstr "Capture sharpening ຖືກປະມວນຜົນພາຍໃນໂມດູນ demosaic ເພາະບາງສ່ວນຂອງອັນກໍຣິທຶມຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນດິບຈາກ CFA. ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດເອງແມ່ນເຮັດໃນຂໍ້ມູນ RGB ທີ່ຖືກຖອດລະຫັດແລ້ວ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຊັນເຊີ bayer, xtrans ແລະ ຂາວດຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Capture sharpening is not intended to be used as a general sharpening / local contrast enhancing tool. It should instead be understood as a way to increase micro-contrast in structures with lots of detail, and leads to better results for further processing. Excellent examples would be details of surfaces like wood, brick walls, hair etc.\n"
msgstr "Capture sharpening ບໍ່ໄດ້ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດທົ່ວໄປ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຄວາມຕ່າງສີສະເພາະບ່ອນ. ແຕ່ຄວນເຂົ້າໃຈວ່າມັນເປັນວິທີເພີ່ມຄວາມຕ່າງສີລະດັບໄມໂຄຣ (micro-contrast) ໃນໂຄງສ້າງທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສົ່ງຜົນດີຕໍ່ການປະມວນຜົນໃນຂັ້ນຕໍ່ໄປ. ຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ດີແມ່ນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງພື້ນຜິວເຊັ່ນ: ໄມ້, ຝາຈີ່, ເສັ້ນຜົມ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites for optimal results are:\n"
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Decent white balance parameters (same requirement as for [_highlight reconstruction_](./highlight-reconstruction.md) or _demosaic_) -- in very rare cases this could lead to inferior sharpening quality.\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າສົມດຸນສີຂາວ (white balance) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ (ເງື່ອນໄຂດຽວກັນກັບ [_highlight reconstruction_](./highlight-reconstruction.md) ຫຼື _demosaic_) -- ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຫາຍາກຫຼາຍ ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບຄວາມຄົມຊັດຫຼຸດລົງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Low chromatic aberration -- you might want to use the [_raw chromatic aberrations_](./raw-chromatic-aberrations.md) module to reduce problems -- there will still likely be more and stronger halo artifacts.\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມຄາດສີ (chromatic aberration) ຕ່ຳ -- ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_raw chromatic aberrations_](./raw-chromatic-aberrations.md) ເພື່ອລົດບັນຫາ -- ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນອາດຈະເກີດສິ່ງແປກປອມແບບວົງແສງ (halo) ທີ່ຫຼາຍ ແລະ ແຮງກວ່າເກົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Acceptable sensor noise, as noise will generally be amplified by capture sharpening (see _contrast sensitivity_ below).\n"
msgstr "ນອຍສ໌ຂອງເຊັນເຊີຢູ່ໃນລະດັບທີ່ຮັບໄດ້, ເພາະໂດຍທົ່ວໄປນອຍສ໌ຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ capture sharpening (ເບິ່ງ _contrast sensitivity_ ດ້ານລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Capture sharpening works in an iterative process using specialized gaussian kernels using a different sigma (in the range of 0.0 -> 1.5) for every single pixel location.\n"
msgstr "Capture sharpening ເຮັດວຽກແບບຊ້ຳຄືນ (iterative) ໂດຍໃຊ້ gaussian kernels ພິເສດ ທີ່ມີຄ່າຊິກມາ (sigma) ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ (ໃນຊ່ວງ 0.0 -> 1.5) ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຕຳແໜ່ງພິກເຊລ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"method\n"
": The demosaic algorithm to use (see above).\n"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີ (method)\n"
": ອັນກໍຣິທຶມຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານເທິງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"edge threshold (_PPG_ only)\n"
": The threshold for an additional median pass. Defaults to “0” which disables median filtering.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເກນຂອບພາບ (edge threshold) (ສະເພາະ _PPG_)\n"
": ຄ່າເກນສຳລັບການກັ່ນຕອງຄ່າກາງ (median pass) ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ “0” ເຊິ່ງຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ"
"ການກັ່ນຕອງຄ່າກາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"LMMSE refine (_LMMSE_ only)\n"
": Refinement steps for use with the LMMSE demosaic algorithm. Median steps average the output. Refinement steps add some recalculation of red and blue channels. While the refinement options work well for luma noise, they may decrease quality on images with heavy chroma noise.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປັບລະອຽດ LMMSE (ສະເພາະ _LMMSE_)\n"
":ຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບລະອຽດສຳລັບໃຊ້ກັບສູດຄິດໄລ່ demosaic LMMSE. ຂັ້ນຕອນ Median ຈະຫາຄ່າສະເລ່ຍຂອງຜົນໄ"
"ດ້ຮັບ. ຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບລະອຽດຈະເພີ່ມການຄິດໄລ່ຄືນໃໝ່ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຊ່ອງສີແດງ ແລະ ສີນ້ຳເງິນ. ເຖິງວ່າຕົວເລືອກກ"
"ານປັບລະອຽດຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກັບ luma noise, ແຕ່ພວກມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບຫຼຸດລົງໃນຮູບພາບທີ່ມີ "
"chroma noise ຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"color smoothing\n"
": Activate a number of additional color smoothing passes. Defaults to “off”.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດໃຫ້ສີນຸ່ມນວນ (color smoothing)\n"
": ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການເຮັດໃຫ້ສີນຸ່ມນວນເພີ່ມເຕີມຫຼາຍຮອບ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ “ປິດ” (off).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"match greens\n"
": In some cameras the green filters have slightly varying properties. This parameter adds an additional equalization step to suppress artifacts. Available options are “disabled”, “local average”, “full average” and “full and local average”. This option is not shown for X-Trans sensors.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປັບສີຂຽວໃຫ້ກົງກັນ (match greens)\n"
": ໃນກ້ອງບາງລຸ້ນ ຕົວຕອງສີຂຽວອາດຈະມີຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນເລັກນ້ອຍ. ພາລາມິເຕີນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບສົມດຸ"
"ນເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນສິ່ງແປກປອມ. ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີຄື “ປິດ”, “ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍສະເພາະຈຸດ”, “ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍທັງໝົດ” ແລະ “ຄ່າສະ"
"ເລ່ຍທັງໝົດ ແລະ ສະເພາະຈຸດ”. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງສຳລັບເຊັນເຊີ X-Trans.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"dual threshold _(dual demosaic modes only)_\n"
": Set the contrast threshold for dual demosaic modes. Lower values favor the high frequency demosaic algorithm and higher values favor the low frequency algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າກຳນົດແບບຄູ່ (dual threshold) _(ສຳລັບໂໝດ dual demosaic ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)_\n"
": ກຳນົດຄ່າ contrast threshold ສຳລັບໂໝດ dual demosaic. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະເນັ້ນໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມຄວາມຖີ່ສູງ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຈະເນັ້ນໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມຄວາມຖີ່ຕ່ຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"display blending mask _(dual demosaic modes only)_\n"
": Show the blending mask that is used to differentiate between high and low frequency areas (adjusted by the \"switch dual threshold\" parameter). For each pixel, the brighter the mask, the more the module's output is taken from the high frequency demosaic algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງໜ້າກາກການປະສົມ (display blending mask) _(ສຳລັບໂໝດ dual demosaic ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)_\n"
": ສະແດງໜ້າກາກການປະສົມທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຍກລະຫວ່າງບໍລິເວນຄວາມຖີ່ສູງ ແລະ ຕ່ຳ (ປັບໂດຍພາຣາມິເຕີ \"switch dual threshold\"). ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊລ, ໜ້າກາກແຮ່ງແຈ້ງເທົ່າໃດ, ຜົນລັບຂອງໂມດູນກໍຈະແຮ່ງມາຈາກອັນກໍຣິທຶມຄວາມຖີ່ສູງຫຼາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"capture sharpen\n"
": Enable capture sharpening. Selecting this option will enable additional controls (see below) and attempt to auto-calculate the _radius_ and _contrast sensitivity_ based on the current image's raw sensor data (see below).\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການບັນທຶກ (capture sharpen)\n"
": ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ capture sharpening. ການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະເປີດການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ) ແລະ ພະຍາຍາມຄຳນວນ _ລັດສະໝີ (radius)_ ແລະ _ຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວຕໍ່ຄວາມຕ່າງສີ (contrast sensitivity)_ ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຂໍ້ມູນເຊັນເຊີດິບຂອງພາບປັດຈຸບັນ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"iterations (capture sharpen)\n"
": The strength of the effect increases with more iterations. For most images a setting of 8 will be sufficient.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮອບການເຮັດວຽກ (iterations) (capture sharpen)\n"
": ຄວາມແຮງຂອງເອັບເຟັກຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຕາມຈຳນວນຮອບ. ສຳລັບພາບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ 8 ແມ່ນພຽງພໍແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"radius (capture sharpen)\n"
": Defines the mathematics used (sigma) for the special gaussian kernels. Analysis of many images (also from the RawTherapee community) show that, on modern sensors, using a good lens and a high quality demosaicer, a typical radius will be between 0.5 and 0.8.\n"
": To auto-calculate the _radius_ for the current image (based on raw sensor data), click the button on the right of the radius slider. The underlying algorithm has been used for some time with reliable results, though it might fail on images with lots of chroma noise. This calculation works better when the image is fully-zoomed out and uncropped in the darkroom view.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີ (radius) (capture sharpen)\n"
": ກຳນົດຄ່າທາງຄະນິດສາດທີ່ໃຊ້ (sigma) ສຳລັບ gaussian kernels ພິເສດ. ຈາກການວິເຄາະຫຼາຍໆພາບ (ລວມເຖິງຈາກຊຸມຊົນ RawTherapee) ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າ ໃນເຊັນເຊີສະໄໝໃໝ່, ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເລນທີ່ດີ ແລະ ຕົວຖອດລະຫັດໂມເຊທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງ, ລັດສະໝີໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 0.5 ຫາ 0.8.\n"
": ເພື່ອຄຳນວນ _ລັດສະໝີ (radius)_ ສຳລັບພາບປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ອີງຕາມຂໍ້ມູນເຊັນເຊີດິບ), ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນລັດສະໝີ. ອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ໃຊ້ນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ມາໄລຍະໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຜົນລັບທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື, ເຖິງວ່າມັນອາດຈະຜິດພ້ຽນໃນພາບທີ່ມີນອຍສ໌ສີຫຼາຍກໍຕາມ. ການຄຳນວນນີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີກວ່າເມື່ອພາບຖືກຊູມອອກທັງໝົດ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັດຂອບ (uncropped) ໃນມຸມມອງຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Do not manually increase the radius much further than the auto-calculated value, as this will soon lead to halo artifacts.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ຢ່າເພີ່ມລັດສະໝີດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃຫ້ເກີນຄ່າທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ, ເພາະມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສິ່ງແປກປອມແບບວົງແສງ (halo artifacts) ໃນທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"contrast sensitivity (capture sharpen)\n"
": As sensor noise will typically be amplified by capture sharpening, we try to counter this problem by performing an analysis of local variance, luminance and a user-defined threshold. Sharpening is applied only to regions that are considered by this analysis to be safe. This analysis results in a mask that can be visualised by clicking the button to the right of the contrast sensitivity slider.\n"
": For a good default we check the image ISO and sensor readout precision as a starting point.\n"
": Very noisy images will require larger values than default. For very low sensor noise you can decrease the threshold to also improve capture sharpening in very dark parts of the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວຕໍ່ຄວາມຕ່າງສີ (contrast sensitivity) (capture sharpen)\n"
": ເນື່ອງຈາກນອຍສ໌ຂອງເຊັນເຊີມັກຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍ capture sharpening, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງພະຍາຍາມແກ້ບັນຫານີ້ໂດຍການວິເຄາະຄວາມຜັນຜວນສະເພາະບ່ອນ (local variance), ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຄ່າກຳນົດທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ. ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ຜ່ານການວິເຄາະແລ້ວວ່າມີຄວາມປອດໄພເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຜົນຂອງການວິເຄາະນີ້ຈະອອກມາເປັນໜ້າກາກ ທີ່ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນຄວາມອ່ອນໄຫວຕໍ່ຄວາມຕ່າງສີ.\n"
": ສຳລັບຄ່າມາດຕະຖານທີ່ດີ, ພວກເຮົາຈະກວດສອບ ISO ຂອງພາບ ແລະ ຄວາມລະອຽດໃນການອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງເຊັນເຊີເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"
": ພາບທີ່ມີນອຍສ໌ຫຼາຍຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ. ສຳລັບພາບທີ່ມີນອຍສ໌ຕ່ຳຫຼາຍ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົດຄ່າ threshold ລົງເພື່ອປັບປຸງ capture sharpening ໃນສ່ວນທີ່ມືດຫຼາຍຂອງພາບໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"corner boost / sharp center (capture sharpen)\n"
": Most lenses are sharper in the central part than the corners of the image. Increasing the _corner boost_ parameter causes a larger per-pixel radius to be used in the capture sharpen kernels for the image corners. This extra radius is controlled by the _corner boost_ control. Adjusting the _corner boost_ will cause an additional slider (_sharp center_) to appear. This controls the affected area using the distance from the image center. Again, the mask button to the right of the slider allows you to visualize the effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດທີ່ມຸມ / ສູນກາງທີ່ຄົມຊັດ (corner boost / sharp center) (capture sharpen)\n"
": ເລນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດຢູ່ບໍລິເວນກາງພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າມຸມພາບ. ການເພີ່ມພາຣາມິເຕີ _corner boost_ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການໃຊ້ລັດສະໝີຕໍ່ພິກເຊລທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນໃນ capture sharpen kernels ສຳລັບມຸມຂອງພາບ. ລັດສະໝີທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນນີ້ຖືກຄວບຄຸມໂດຍ _corner boost_. ການປັບ _corner boost_ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີແຖບເລື່ອນເພີ່ມເຕີມ (_sharp center_) ສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຄວບຄຸມບໍລິເວນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບໂດຍໃຊ້ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກສູນກາງພາບ. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນ, ປຸ່ມໜ້າກາກເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຫັນເອັບເຟັກທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "presets, styles and copy/paste"
msgstr "ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ, ສະໄຕລ໌ ແລະ ການກັອບປີ້/ວາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Defining demosaic [presets](../../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md) or using demosaic parameters for [styles](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md) or copying/pasting [history stacks](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md) is a bit more tricky than for other modules. Please bear in mind that demosaic works for a range of sensors each offering different algorithms and some specific options. Here are some reminders:\n"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດ [ຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md) ຂອງ demosaic ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ demosaic ສຳລັບ [ສະໄຕລ໌ (styles)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md) ຫຼື ການກັອບປີ້/ວາງ [ລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ (history stacks)](../../module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md) ແມ່ນມີຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນກວ່າໂມດູນອື່ນໆເລັກນ້ອຍ. ກະລຸນາຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າ demosaic ເຮັດວຽກກັບເຊັນເຊີຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະແບບກໍມີອັນກໍຣິທຶມ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກສະເພາະທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນຈື່:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It should always be safe to create an automatic preset that only applies to a specific camera.\n"
msgstr "ມັນມີຄວາມປອດໄພສະເໝີທີ່ຈະສ້າງ preset ອັດຕະໂນມັດ ທີ່ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບກ້ອງໃດໜຶ່ງເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a preset was defined while working on an image with a different sensor than the current image, darktable translates the algorithm as follows:\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າ preset ຖືກກຳນົດໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບພາບທີ່ມີເຊັນເຊີແຕກຕ່າງຈາກພາບປັດຈຸບັນ, darktable ຈະປ່ຽນອັນກໍຣິທຶມດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "bayer sensors fall back to _RCD_\n"
msgstr "ເຊັນເຊີ bayer ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ _RCD_\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "xtrans sensors fall back to _markjestejn_\n"
msgstr "ເຊັນເຊີ xtrans ຈະກັບໄປໃຊ້ _markjestejn_\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "bayer4 sensors always use _vng4_.\n"
msgstr "ເຊັນເຊີ bayer4 ຈະໃຊ້ _vng4_ ສະເໝີ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "dual demosaicing will also be available on bayer and xtrans sensors\n"
msgstr "ການຖອດລະຫັດແບບຄູ່ (dual demosaicing) ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນເຊັນເຊີ bayer ແລະ xtrans ເຊັ່ນກັນ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extra options like _green equalizing_ will only be applied where they are supported by the current sensor.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມເຊັ່ນ _ການປັບສົມດຸນສີຂຽວ (green equalizing)_ ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສະເພາະບ່ອນທີ່ເຊັນເຊີປັດຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In auto-applied presets with capture sharpen enabled, you might want to use the auto-calculated radius (or contrast sensitivity) instead of using hard-coded values. To achieve this, you must set the radius (or contrast sensitivity) to zero before saving the preset. If this preset is then applied to another image, darktable accepts this as a request for these values to be automatically recalculated.\n"
msgstr "ໃນ preset ທີ່ໃຊ້ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍເປີດ capture sharpen ໄວ້, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ລັດສະໝີ (ຫຼື contrast sensitivity) ທີ່ຄຳນວນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ຕາຍຕົວ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າລັດສະໝີ (ຫຼື contrast sensitivity) ເປັນສູນກ່ອນບັນທຶກ preset. ຫາກ preset ນີ້ຖືກນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບພາບອື່ນ, darktable ຈະຖືວ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ຄຳນວນຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Capture sharpening is not enabled by default but you could achieve this by defining an auto-applied preset after setting radius and contrast threshold to zero. You are advised to leave the iterations setting at its default setting of 8, as this leads to good sharpening with very low risk for artifacts when used with an auto-calculated radius.\n"
msgstr "Capture sharpening ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການກຳນົດ preset ທີ່ໃຊ້ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າລັດສະໝີ ແລະ ຄ່າກຳນົດຄວາມຕ່າງສີເປັນສູນ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຮອບການເຮັດວຽກ (iterations) ໄວ້ທີ່ 8 ຕາມຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ, ເພາະມັນໃຫ້ຄວາມຄົມຊັດທີ່ດີ ແລະ ມີຄວາມສ່ຽງຕ່ຳຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະເກີດສິ່ງແປກປອມເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບລັດສະໝີທີ່ຄຳນວນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/demosaic.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is generally safe to auto-apply capture sharpening to images with ISO values below 1000. If you have a good sensor, with low noise even on high ISO values, you might be able to use it for ISOs as high as 3200.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ມັນປອດໄພທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ capture sharpening ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດກັບພາບທີ່ມີຄ່າ ISO ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 1000. ຖ້າເຈົ້າມີເຊັນເຊີທີ່ດີ ແລະ ມີນອຍສ໌ຕ່ຳເຖິງແມ່ນຈະໃຊ້ ISO ສູງ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ເຖິງ ISO 3200.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "contrast equalizer"
msgstr "ໂຕປັບສະເໝີຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast equalizer)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": add or remove local contrast, sharpness, acutance.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄວາມຄົມຊັດສະເພາະສ່ວນ, ຄວາມຄົມ (sharpness), ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງຂອບ (acutance).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"output\n"
": linear, Lab, scene-referred.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂາອອກ (output)\n"
": ແບບເສັ້ນ (linear), Lab, ອ້າງອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust luminance and chroma contrast in the wavelet domain.\n"
msgstr "ປັບຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສົດສີ ໃນໂດເມນເວບເລັດ (wavelet domain).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This versatile module can be used to achieve a variety of effects, including bloom, denoise, clarity, and local contrast enhancement. \n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຜົນກະທົບຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ bloom, ການຫຼຸດນອຍສ໌ (denoise), clarity, ແລະ ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດສະເພາະສ່ວນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It works in the [wavelet](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md) domain and its parameters can be tuned independently for each wavelet detail scale. The module operates in CIE LCh color space and so is able to treat luminosity and chromaticity independently.\n"
msgstr "ມັນເຮັດວຽກໃນໂດເມນ [ເວບເລັດ (wavelet)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md) ແລະ ສາມາດປັບຄ່າແຍກກັນໄດ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດ. ໂມດູນເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE LCh ຊຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດຈັດການຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສົດສີແຍກຈາກກັນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A number of presets are provided, which should help you to understand the capabilities of the module.\n"
msgstr "ມີຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (presets) ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ ຊຶ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈຄວາມສາມາດຂອງໂມດູນນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _contrast equalizer_ module decomposes the image into various detail scales. On each detail scale, you can independently adjust the contrast and denoise splines for lightness (\"luma\") and chromaticity (“chroma”, or color saturation), as well as adjusting the edge-awareness (“edges”) of the wavelet transform. The luma, chroma and edges splines are provided on separate tabs, and some examples of their usage are given in the following sections.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນ _contrast equalizer_ ຈະແຍກສ່ວນຮູບພາບອອກເປັນລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດຕ່າງໆ. ໃນແຕ່ລະລະດັບ, ທ່າ"
"ນສາມາດປັບຄວາມຕັດກັນ (contrast) ແລະ ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບກວນ (denoise splines) ໄດ້ຢ່າງ"
"ເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ ສຳລັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (\"luma\") ແລະ ຄ່າສີ (“chroma”, ຫຼື ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ), ລວມເຖິ"
"ງການປັບການຮັບຮູ້ຂອບພາບ (“edges”) ຂອງການແປງແບບເວຟເລັດ (wavelet transform). ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ "
"luma, chroma ແລະ edges ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃນແຖບແຍກກັນ, ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງບາງສ່ວນຂອງການນຳໃຊ້ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃນຫົວຂໍ້ຕໍ່ໆ"
"ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below the spline graphs is a _mix_ slider, which can be used to adjust the strength of the effect, and even to invert the graph (with negative values). While your mouse is over the spline graph, the curve will be displayed as if the _mix_ slider was set to 1.0, to allow for easier editing. When you move your mouse away, the graph will be re-adjusted to account for the _mix_ slider.\n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ກ້ອງກຣາບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະມີໂຕເລື່ອນ _mix_, ຊຶ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມແຮງຂອງຜົນກະທົບ ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ປີ້ນກຣາບ (ດ້ວຍຄ່າລົບ). ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວາງເມົາສ໌ເທິງກຣາບ, ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະສະແດງຄືກັບວ່າຄ່າ _mix_ ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ 1.0 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. ເມື່ອທ່ານເອົາເມົາສ໌ອອກ, ກຣາບຈະຖືກປັບຄືນຕາມຄ່າຂອງໂຕເລື່ອນ _mix_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the background of the curve you can see a number of alternating light and dark stripes. These represent the levels of detail that are visible at your current zoom scale -- any details without these stripes are too small to be seen your current view. Adjustments made to control points within the striped section _may_ produce a visible effect (depending on the strength of the adjustment). Adjustments outside of the striped region _will not_. Zoom in to see higher levels of detail and make adjustments to the more detailed areas of the image.\n"
msgstr "ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ທ່ານຈະເຫັນແຖບສີແຈ້ງ ແລະ ສີເຂັ້ມສະຫຼັບກັນ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສະແດງເຖິງລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ໃນລະດັບການຊູມປັດຈຸບັນ -- ລາຍລະອຽດໃດທີ່ບໍ່ມີແຖບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນນ້ອຍເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະເຫັນໃນມຸມເບິ່ງປັດຈຸບັນ. ການປັບແຕ່ງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມພາຍໃນສ່ວນທີ່ມີແຖບ _ອາດຈະ_ ສ້າງຜົນກະທົບທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້. ການປັບແຕ່ງຢູ່ນອກເຂດດັ່ງກ່າວ _ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ_. ໃຫ້ຊູມເຂົ້າເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງສ່ວນທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Tip:** if you are having trouble visualising which parts of the curve will affect which details in the image, you can set the [blend mode](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md) to \"difference\". This will make the image go black except for those areas where the output of the module differs from the input. By raising the curve at one of the control points, you will be able to see which details in the image are represented by that point.\n"
msgstr "**ເຄັດລັບ:** ຖ້າທ່ານມີບັນຫາໃນການເບິ່ງວ່າສ່ວນໃດຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ລາຍລະອຽດໃດໃນຮູບ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງ [ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend mode)](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md) ເປັນ \"difference\". ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບກາຍເປັນສີດຳ ຍົກເວັ້ນບໍລິເວນທີ່ຜົນຂອງໂມດູນຕ່າງຈາກຮູບຕົ້ນທາງ. ໂດຍການປັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂຶ້ນຢູ່ຈຸດຄວບຄຸມໃດໜຶ່ງ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່າລາຍລະອຽດໃດໃນຮູບທີ່ຖືກຈັດການໂດຍຈຸດນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "luma tab"
msgstr "ແຖບ luma"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The luma tab allows you to adjust the local contrast in the image's luminance (brightness). Adjustments are represented by a white spline that begins as a horizontal line running across the centre of the graph (indicating that no change will be made). Raise or lower this spline at the left end of the graph to increase or decrease the local contrast of coarse detail in the image. Perform similar adjustments towards the right side of the graph to adjust the local contrast of the fine details in the image. \n"
msgstr "ແຖບ luma ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບຄວາມຄົມຊັດສະເພາະສ່ວນໃນຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຮູບ. ການປັບແຕ່ງຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງສີຂາວ ຊຶ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ແນວນອນຜ່ານກາງກຣາບ (ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ). ປັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນີ້ຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ລົງຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງກຣາບ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຫຍາບ (coarse detail). ແລະ ປັບໄປທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງກຣາບ ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດ (fine details). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you hover the mouse pointer over the graph, a white circle indicates the radius of influence of the mouse pointer -- the size of this circle can be adjusted by scrolling with the mouse wheel. The larger the circle of influence, the more control points will be affected when you adjust the curve. A highlighted region in the background shows what the spline would look like if you pushed the currently-hovered control point all the way to the top or bottom on the graph -- see the screenshot below for examples of these features. For more information see the [wavelets](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md) section.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານວາງເມົາສ໌ເທິງກຣາບ, ຈະມີວົງມົນສີຂາວສະແດງລັດສະໝີທີ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຂອງເມົາສ໌ -- ຂະໜາດຂອງວົງມົນນີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ (scroll). ຍິ່ງວົງມົນໃຫຍ່ເທົ່າໃດ, ຈຸດຄວບຄຸມກໍຈະຖືກປັບໄປພ້ອມກັນຫຼາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ພື້ນທີ່ໄຮໄລ້ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະເປັນແນວໃດ ຖ້າທ່ານດຶງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມນັ້ນໄປຫາເທິງສຸດ ຫຼື ລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງກຣາບ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມຕື່ມ ເບິ່ງພາກສ່ວນ [ເວບເລັດ (wavelets)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/wavelets.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following image shows the default state of the contrast equalizer module before any adjustments have been made:\n"
msgstr "ຮູບລຸ່ມນີ້ສະແດງສະພາວະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູນ contrast equalizer ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການປັບແຕ່ງ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![contrast-equalizer-luma-orig](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-luma-orig.png#w66)\n"
msgstr "![contrast-equalizer-luma-orig](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-luma-orig.png#w66)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Raising the two control points at the right-hand end of the graph will increase the sharpness of the fine details (the eye and feathers of the bird) while leaving coarser details (the rocks in the background) largely unaffected. The example below has been exaggerated to better illustrate the effect.\n"
msgstr "ການປັບຈຸດຄວບຄຸມສອງຈຸດຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາສຸດຂອງກຣາບຂຶ້ນ ຈະເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດ (ຕາ ແລະ ຄົນຂອງນົກ) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຫຍາບກວ່າ (ກ້ອນຫີນໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ) ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຫຼາຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງລຸ່ມນີ້ໄດ້ປັບໃຫ້ເກີນຈິງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນກະທົບໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![contrast-equalizer-luma-high](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-luma-high.png#w66)\n"
msgstr "![contrast-equalizer-luma-high](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-luma-high.png#w66)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Increasing the local contrast can also amplify the luma noise in the image. A second spline located at the bottom of the graph can be used to denoise the selected detail scales. Raise this spline (by clicking just above one of the triangles at the bottom of the graph and dragging the line upwards) to reduce noise at the given wavelet scale. In the example above, the dark denoising spline has been raised at the fine-detail end of the graph.\n"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດສະເພາະສ່ວນຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມນອຍສ໌ (noise) ໃນຮູບໄດ້ນຳ. ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີສອງທີ່ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງກຣາບສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຫຼຸດນອຍສ໌ ໃນລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ເລືອກ. ປັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນີ້ຂຶ້ນ (ໂດຍການຄລິກເທິງຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມແລ້ວລາກຂຶ້ນ) ເພື່ອຫຼຸດນອຍສ໌ໃນລະດັບເວບເລັດນັ້ນ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຫຼຸດນອຍສ໌ສີເຂັ້ມໄດ້ຖືກປັບຂຶ້ນຢູ່ສ່ວນລາຍລະອຽດລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "chroma tab"
msgstr "ແຖບ chroma"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The chroma tab allows the color contrast or saturation to be adjusted at the selected wavelet scales. See the following example:\n"
msgstr "ແຖບ chroma ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປັບຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງສີ ຫຼື ຄວາມສົດສີໃນລະດັບເວບເລັດທີ່ເລືອກ. ເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![contrast-equalizer-chroma-orig](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-chroma-orig.png#w66)\n"
msgstr "![contrast-equalizer-chroma-orig](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-chroma-orig.png#w66)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Say you wanted to bring out the green color of the anthers at the end of the stamen. The pink petals of the flowers are already quite saturated, but using contrast equalizer you can selectively boost the saturation on the small scale of the anthers without impacting the saturation of the petals. By raising the third control point from the right, you can target the saturation of the anthers only:\n"
msgstr "ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເນັ້ນສີຂຽວຂອງເກສອນດອກໄມ້. ກີບດອກສີບົວມີຄວາມສົດສີຫຼາຍຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ດ້ວຍ contrast equalizer ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກເພີ່ມຄວາມສົດສີສະເພາະລາຍລະອຽດນ້ອຍໆຂອງເກສອນ ໂດຍບໍ່ກະທົບຄວາມສົດຂອງກີບດອກ. ໂດຍການປັບຈຸດຄວບຄຸມທີສາມຈາກເບື້ອງຂວາຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເນັ້ນຄວາມສົດຂອງເກສອນໄດ້ໂດຍສະເພາະ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![contrast-equalizer-chroma-high](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-chroma-high.png#w66)\n"
msgstr "![contrast-equalizer-chroma-high](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-chroma-high.png#w66)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As in the luma tab, the chroma tab also has a denoising spline at the bottom of the graph. This can be used to handle chroma noise at different scales within the image. Chroma denoising can generally be more aggressive on larger wavelet scales and has less effect on a smaller scale.\n"
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບແຖບ luma, ແຖບ chroma ກໍມີເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຫຼຸດນອຍສ໌ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງກຣາບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບນອຍສ໌ຂອງສີ (chroma noise) ໃນລະດັບຕ່າງໆ. ການຫຼຸດນອຍສ໌ຂອງສີໂດຍທົ່ວໄປສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຮຸນແຮງກວ່າໃນລະດັບເວບເລັດທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ ແລະ ມີຜົນໜ້ອຍກວ່າໃນລະດັບທີ່ນ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "edge tab"
msgstr "ແຖບ edge"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The basic wavelet _à trous_ transform has been enhanced in the _contrast equalizer_ to be \"edge-aware\", which can help to reduce the gradient reversals and halo artifacts that the basic algorithm can produce. The _edges_ tab does not directly act on the edges in an image; rather it adjusts the edge awareness feature of the wavelet transform. If you have not adjusted the luma or chroma splines, adjusting the edge awareness spline will have no effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການແປງເວຟເລັດແບບ _à trous_ ພື້ນຖານໄດ້ຖືກປັບປຸງໃນ _contrast equalizer_ ໃຫ້ມີການ \"ຮັບຮູ້ຂອ"
"ບພາບ\" (edge-aware), ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການປີ້ນກັບຂອງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີ (gradient "
"reversals) ແລະ ແສງຟຸ້ງອ້ອມຂອບ (halo artifacts) ທີ່ອານກໍຣິທຶມພື້ນຖານອາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ແຖບ "
"_edges_ ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍກົງກັບຂອບໃນຮູບພາບ; ແຕ່ມັນຈະປັບຄຸນສົມບັດການຮັບຮູ້ຂອບພາບຂອງການແປງແບບເວຟ"
"ເລັດ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ປັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ luma ຫຼື chroma, ການປັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ edge awareness ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງເລີ"
"ຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see the sorts of artifacts that the _edges_ curve tries to combat, here is an example taken from the original paper \"Edge-Optimized À-Trous Wavelets for Local Contrast Enhancement with Robust Denoising\" (Hanika, Damertz and Lensch 2011): \n"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນສິ່ງແປກປອມທີ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ _edges_ ພະຍາຍາມແກ້ໄຂ, ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຢ່າງຈາກເອກະສານຕົ້ນສະບັບ "
"\"Edge-Optimized À-Trous Wavelets for Local Contrast Enhancement with Robust "
"Denoising\" (Hanika, Damertz and Lensch 2011): \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![contrast-equalizer-edge](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-edge.png#w75)\n"
msgstr "![contrast-equalizer-edge](./contrast-equalizer/contrast-equalizer-edge.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the image on the left, the edges spline has been reduced to a minimum, effectively disabling the edge awareness and resulting in halos. In the middle image, the edges spline has been increased too much, resulting in gradient reversals. In the image on the right the edges spline has been set somewhere in between the two extremes, resulting in nice clean edges.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຮູບເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ, ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ edges ຖືກຫຼຸດລົງຕ່ຳສຸດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຮັບຮູ້ຂອບຖືກປິດໄປ ແລະ ເກີດວົງແສງ (halos). ໃນຮູບກາງ, ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ edges ຖືກເພີ່ມຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດ gradient reversals. ໃນຮູບເບື້ອງຂວາ, ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ edges ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນລະດັບທີ່ເໝາະສົມລະຫວ່າງສອງຂົ້ວ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂອບທີ່ສະອາດ ແລະ ສວຍງາມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/contrast-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usually the default central position of the spline is a good starting point, but if there are objectionable artifacts around the edges, this control can be helpful in mitigating them. Some experimentation will be required.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ ຕຳແໜ່ງກາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງແມ່ນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີ, ແຕ່ຖ້າມີສິ່ງຜິດປົກກະຕິທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເບິ່ງອ້ອມຂອບຮູບ, ການປັບສ່ວນນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນບັນຫາດັ່ງກ່າວໄດ້. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງທົດລອງປັບເບິ່ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "LUT 3D"
msgstr "ລັດ 3D (LUT 3D)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": perform color space corrections and apply look.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ແກ້ໄຂພື້ນທີ່ສີ ແລະ ໃຊ້ງານຮູບແບບສີ (look).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"processing\n"
": defined by profile, RGB.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະມວນຜົນ\n"
": ກຳນົດໂດຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌, RGB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transform RGB values with a 3D LUT file.\n"
msgstr "ແປງຄ່າ RGB ດ້ວຍໄຟລ໌ 3D LUT.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A 3D LUT is a tridimensional table that is used to transform a given RGB value into another RGB value. It is normally used for film simulation and color grading.\n"
msgstr "3D LUT ແມ່ນຕາຕະລາງສາມມິຕິທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປງຄ່າ RGB ທີ່ກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າ RGB ອື່ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຈຳລອງສີຟີມ ແລະ ການປັບແຕ່ງໂທນສີ (color grading).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module accepts `.cube`, `.3dl`, `.png` (haldclut) and `.gmz` files. Uncompressed 3D LUT data is not saved in the database or the XMP file, but is instead saved to the 3D LUT file path inside the 3D LUT root folder. It is therefore important to back up your 3D LUT folder properly -- sharing an image with its XMP is pointless if the recipient doesn't also have the same 3D LUT file in their own 3D LUT folder.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ `.cube`, `.3dl`, `.png` (haldclut) ແລະ `.gmz`. ຂໍ້ມູນ 3D LUT ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ບີບອັດ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ XMP, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກອ້າງອີງໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຟນເດີ 3D LUT. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງສຳຄັນຫຼາຍທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໂຟນເດີ 3D LUT ຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ -- ການແບ່ງປັນຮູບພາບ ພ້ອມໄຟລ໌ XMP ຈະບໍ່ມີປະໂຫຍດເລີຍ ຫາກຜູ້ຮັບບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ 3D LUT ດຽວກັນຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີຂອງພວກເຂົາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The compressed format `.gmz` is only available when GMIC is installed. This format can hold a full library of LUTs, and LUT data loaded from this type of file _can_ be saved to the database and XMP files.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບບີບອັດ `.gmz` ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ GMIC ແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຮູບແບບນີ້ສາມາດເກັບລວບລວມ LUT ໄດ້ເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນ LUT ທີ່ໂຫຼດມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ປະເພດນີ້ _ສາມາດ_ ບັນທຶກລົງໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ XMP ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: the module clips all values outside of the range [0,1]. You may have to reduce the range of the input before applying.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ໂມດູນຈະຕັດຄ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງ [0,1]. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງຫຼຸດຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າຂາເຂົ້າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ງານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "LUTs are most commonly used in darktable for color grading or film look simulation. For this reason, by default, the module is placed after the [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) module in the pixelpipe and should be applied to a neutral image (without first applying a specific look). While you can find hundreds of free LUTs on the internet, you should note that not all of them are compatible with the darktable environment and workflow -- incompatible LUTs will not produce the advertised look. To limit the risk, a color grading LUT should have been created to work with one of the available \"application color spaces\" (see below), for both the input and the output of the module.\n"
msgstr "LUTs ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນໃຊ້ໃນ darktable ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງສີ ຫຼື ຈຳລອງສີຟີມ. ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນນີ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູນຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ຫຼັງຈາກໂມດູນ [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) ໃນລຳດັບການປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ຄວນໃຊ້ກັບຮູບທີ່ມີສີເປັນກາງ. ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີ LUT ຟຣີຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໃນອິນເຕີເນັດ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງຮັບຊາບວ່າ ບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກອັນຈະເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບ darktable -- LUT ທີ່ບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນຈະບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜົນລັບຕາມທີ່ບອກໄວ້. ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຄວາມສ່ຽງ, LUT ທີ່ໃຊ້ຄວນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ \"ພື້ນທີ່ສີຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ\" ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ທັງຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Camera log LUTs (as F-log or S-Log3) are different to color-grading and film-look-simulation LUTs, and are intended to convert the camera log raw data into something (linear raw data or other color space) that darktable is able to understand. In this case the _LUT 3D_ module should be manually placed between the [_demosaic_](./demosaic) and [_input color profile_](./input-color-profile.md) modules. Once you have done this, you can no longer choose an \"application color space\". The \"input profile\" of input color profile module should be aligned with the output of the LUT. _Please note that this use case has not yet been tested._\n"
msgstr "Camera log LUTs (ເຊັ່ນ F-log ຫຼື S-Log3) ແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງຈາກ LUT ທີ່ໃຊ້ປັບແຕ່ງສີທົ່ວໄປ, ຊຶ່ງມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອແປງຂໍ້ມູນ camera log ໃຫ້ເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ darktable ເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ ໂມດູນ _LUT 3D_ ຄວນຖືກວາງໄວ້ລະຫວ່າງໂມດູນ [_ການຖອດລະຫັດສີ (demosaic)_](./demosaic) ແລະ [_ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າ_](./input-color-profile.md). ເມື່ອເຮັດແນວນີ້ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກ \"ພື້ນທີ່ສີຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ\" ໄດ້. ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າຂອງໂມດູນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າຄວນຈະກົງກັບຜົນລັບຂອງ LUT. _ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຮັບການທົດສອບເທື່ອ._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"file selection\n"
": Choose the 3D LUT file to use. File selection is inactive if the 3D LUT root folder has not been defined in [preferences > processing](../../preferences-settings/processing.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເລືອກໄຟລ໌\n"
": ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ 3D LUT ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້. ການເລືອກໄຟລ໌ຈະໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດໂຟນເດີຫຼັກຂອງ 3D LUT ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ](../../preferences-settings/processing.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"application color space\n"
": A 3D LUT is defined relative to a specific color space. Choose the color space for which the selected 3D LUT file has been built. Cube files are usually related to Rec. 709 while most others are related to sRGB.\n"
msgstr ""
"ພື້ນທີ່ສີຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ\n"
": 3D LUT ຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ສຳພັນກັບພື້ນທີ່ສີສະເພາະ. ໃຫ້ເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ສີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ 3D LUT ນັ້ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນມາ. ໄຟລ໌ Cube ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ Rec. 709 ໃນຂະນະທີ່ໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນກ່ຽວກັບ sRGB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/lut-3D.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"interpolation\n"
": This defines how to calculate output colors when input colors are not exactly on a node of the RGB cube described by the 3D LUT. There are three interpolation methods available: tetrahedral (default), trilinear and pyramid. Usually you won't see any difference between interpolation methods except with smaller sized LUTs.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຄຳນວນຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ (interpolation)\n"
": ສິ່ງນີ້ກຳນົດວິທີການຄຳນວນສີຂາອອກ ເມື່ອສີຂາເຂົ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ຕົກຢູ່ໃນໂນດຂອງ RGB cube ທີ່ LUT ກຳນົດໄວ້. ມີສາມວິທີ: tetrahedral (ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), trilinear ແລະ pyramid. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວທ່ານຈະບໍ່ເຫັນ ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຫຼາຍ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ກັບ LUT ທີ່ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "rgb curve"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ RGB (rgb curve)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": alter an image’s tones using curves in RGB color space.\n"
msgstr ""
"description\n"
": ປັບປ່ຽນໂທນສີຂອງຮູບພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A classic digital photography tool to alter an image's tones using curves.\n"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືການຖ່າຍຮູບດິຈິຕອນແບບຄລາສສິກເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງໂທນສີຂອງຮູບໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module is very similar to the [_tone curve_](./tone-curve.md) module but works in RGB color space.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບໂມດູນ [_ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ (tone curve)_](./tone-curve.md) ແຕ່ເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) on the left to show the picked values in the graph (Ctrl+click or right-click to use the picker in area mode). Numerical (Lab) values of the input and output (see below) at the selected spot or area are shown at the top left of the widget.\n"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ [ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍເພື່ອສະແດງຄ່າທີ່ເລືອກໃນກຣາຟ (Ctrl+ຄລິກ ຫຼື ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີແບບພື້ນທີ່). ຄ່າຕົວເລກ (Lab) ຂອງຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ) ທີ່ຈຸດ ຫຼື ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງວິດເຈັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A second [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) to the right can be used to automatically create new nodes based on the sampled area. Ctrl+click+drag to alter the created nodes to have a positive curve for the selected area; Shift+click+drag to create a negative curve.\n"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມື [ເລືອກສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ອັນທີສອງທາງຂວາສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຈຸດ (nodes) ໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມພື້ນທີ່ຕົວຢ່າງ. Ctrl+ຄລິກ+ລາກ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຈຸດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງບວກສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເລືອກ; Shift+ຄລິກ+ລາກ ເພື່ອສ້າງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງລົບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Please refer to the [curves](../../darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md) section for more details about how to modify curves including the **interpolation method** and **preserve colors** controls._\n"
msgstr "_ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນສ່ວນ [ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (curves)](../../darkroom/processing-modules/curves.md) ກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການປັບແຕ່ງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ລວມທັງການຄວບຄຸມ **ວິທີການຄຳນວນຈຸດ (interpolation method)** ແລະ **ການຮັກສາສີ (preserve colors)**._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mode\n"
": RGB is a linear color space designed to capture and display images in additive synthesis. It is related to the capture and display media and does not isolate color and lightness information in the same way that Lab and XYZ color spaces do. This module works in ProPhoto RGB. Adding contrast in RGB space is known to desaturate highlights and boost saturation in the shadows, but this has been proven to be the most reliable way to edit contrast, and is the standard method in most software\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ (mode)\n"
": RGB ແມ່ນພື້ນທີ່ສີແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ທີ່ອອກແບບມາເພື່ອບັນທຶກ ແລະ ສະແດງຮູບໃນແບບການປະສົມສີແບບບວກ. ມັນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສື່ທີ່ໃຊ້ບັນທຶກ ແລະ ສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ແຍກຂໍ້ມູນສີ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງອອກຈາກກັນຄືກັບພື້ນທີ່ສີ Lab ແລະ XYZ. ໂມດູນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນ ProPhoto RGB. ການເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ເປັນທີ່ຮູ້ກັນວ່າຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງຫຼຸດລົງ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໃນສ່ວນເງົາ, ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ຮັບການພິສູດແລ້ວວ່າເປັນວິທີທີ່ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖືທີ່ສຸດໃນການແກ້ໄຂຄອນທຣາສ ແລະ ເປັນວິທີມາດຕະຖານໃນຊອບແວສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Depending on the desired intent you can apply the RGB curve in two different modes\n"
msgstr ": ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄວາມຕັ້ງໃຈທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ RGB ໄດ້ໃນສອງໂໝດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - _RGB, linked channels_: Apply the L-channel curve to all three channels in the RGB color space.\n"
": - _RGB, independent channels_: R, G and B curves can be adjusted independently.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _RGB, ຊ່ອງສັນຍານທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັນ (linked channels)_: ນຳໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຊ່ອງ L ກັບທັງສາມຊ່ອງສັນຍານໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB.\n"
": - _RGB, ຊ່ອງສັນຍານທີ່ເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ (independent channels)_: ສາມາດປັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ R, G ແລະ B ແຍກກັນໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/rgb-curve.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"compensate middle gray\n"
": Select this to change the histogram display in the module. This option does not alter the processing but may assist when editing the curve.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊົດເຊີຍສີເທີກາງ\n"
": ເລືອກສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນການສະແດງຜົນຮິສໂຕແກຣມໃນໂມດູນ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງການປະມວນຜົນ ແຕ່ອາດຈະຊ່ວຍໃນເວລາແກ້ໄຂເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "AgX"
msgstr "AgX"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": applies a tone mapping curve. inspired by Blender's AgX tone mapper.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ (tone mapping). ໄດ້ຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈມາຈາກ AgX tone mapper ຂອງ Blender.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transform the colors and tonal range of an image to fit a display.\n"
msgstr "ແປງສີ ແລະ ຊ່ວງໂທນຂອງຮູບພາບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຈໍສະແດງຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The primary innovation of the AgX module is an advanced color handling method that ensures a natural and film-like appearance, preventing the oversaturation artifacts common with simpler tone mapping techniques. It is derived from the display transform of the same name, used in the [Blender 3D modeler](https://www.blender.org/) by T. J. Sobotka, Eary_Chow, Sakari Kapanen and others.\n"
msgstr "ນະວັດຕະກຳຫຼັກຂອງໂມດູນ AgX ແມ່ນວິທີການຈັດການສີທີ່ກ້າວໜ້າ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນໃຫ້ຮູບພາບເບິ່ງເປັນທຳມະຊາດ ແລະ ຄືກັບຟິມ, ຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນອາການສີອີ່ມຕົວເກີນ (oversaturation artifacts) ທີ່ມັກເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບເຕັກນິກການຈຳລອງໂທນສີແບບທຳມະດາ. ມັນໄດ້ຮັບການສືບທອດມາຈາກການແປງການສະແດງຜົນໃນຊື່ດຽວກັນ ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ [Blender 3D modeler](https://www.blender.org/) ໂດຍ T. J. Sobotka, Eary_Chow, Sakari Kapanen ແລະ ຜູ້ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Modules placed before _AgX_ in the pipeline operate in [scene-referred](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#scene-referred-workflow) space. Modules after _AgX_ work in [display-referred](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#display-referred-workflow) space.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ວາງໄວ້ກ່ອນ _AgX_ ໃນຂະບວນການ (pipeline) ຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ [ອີງຕາມສາກ (scene-referred)](../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#scene-referred-workflow). ສ່ວນໂມດູນຫຼັງຈາກ _AgX_ ຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ [ອີງຕາມຈໍສະແດງຜົນ (display-referred)](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#display-referred-workflow).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can automatically enable _AgX_ in new images by setting the value of [preferences > processing > auto-apply pixel workflow defaults](../../preferences-settings/processing.md#image-processing) to 'scene-referred (AgX)'.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ _AgX_ ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຮູບພາບໃໝ່ ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການປະມວນຜົນ > ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂະບວນການພິກເຊວອັດຕະໂນມັດ](../../preferences-settings/processing.md#image-processing) ໃຫ້ເປັນ 'scene-referred (AgX)'.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"primaries\" are the defining feature of AgX and the core of how it handles color. They determine the basic color appearance of the image _before_ the tone mapping curve is applied. For precise definitions of the color terms used in this section, please refer to [_darktable's color dimensions_](../../special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md).\n"
msgstr "\"ສີຫຼັກ (primaries)\" ແມ່ນຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນຂອງ AgX ແລະ ເປັນຫົວໃຈສຳຄັນຂອງການຈັດການສີ. ພວກມັນກຳນົດລັກສະນະສີພື້ນຖານຂອງຮູບພາບ _ກ່ອນ_ ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ. ສຳລັບຄຳນິຍາມທີ່ຊັດເຈນຂອງຄຳສັບສີທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນພາກນີ້, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງທີ່ [_ມິຕິຂອງສີໃນ darktable_](../../special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The core challenge in fitting a scene's wide dynamic range into a display's narrower range is managing color across the entire tonal scale. Without tone mapping, transitions would be abrupt, and lead to color distortions:\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທ້າທາຍຫຼັກໃນການບີບອັດຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກທີ່ກວ້າງຂອງສາກ ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບຊ່ວງທີ່ແຄບກວ່າຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນ ແມ່ນການຈັດການສີໃນທຸກລະດັບໂທນ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ, ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ສີຜິດພ້ຽນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![no tone mapping](agx/sweep_no_tone_mapping.jpg#w75)\n"
msgstr "![ບໍ່ມີການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ](agx/sweep_no_tone_mapping.jpg#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A simple per-channel curve often causes colorful objects to shift to pure, unnatural-looking primary or secondary colors as their intensity changes -- an effect sometimes called the \"Notorious 6\":\n"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງແບບແຍກແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ (per-channel) ມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ວັດຖຸທີ່ມີສີສັນປ່ຽນໄປເປັນສີຫຼັກ ຫຼື ສີຮອງທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດ ເມື່ອຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງປ່ຽນໄປ -- ເຊິ່ງເປັນຜົນກະທົບທີ່ບາງຄັ້ງເອີ້ນວ່າ \"Notorious 6\":\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![naive per-channel processing](agx/sweep_n6.jpg#w75)\n"
msgstr "![ການປະມວນຜົນແບບແຍກຊ່ອງສີທຳມະດາ](agx/sweep_n6.jpg#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The primaries controls in _AgX_ work to prevent this by building a custom color space for the tone curve. By adjusting the primaries _before_ the curve is applied, _AgX_ creates a more graceful \"path to white,\" allowing colors to desaturate and shift hue in a way that looks more natural and believable. This process influences the color rendering across the entire tonal range to create a cohesive final image:\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມສີຫຼັກໃນ _AgX_ ເຮັດວຽກເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນສິ່ງນີ້ໂດຍການສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ສີສະເພາະສຳລັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ. ດ້ວຍການປັບສີຫຼັກ _ກ່ອນ_ ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ, _AgX_ ຈະສ້າງ \"ເສັ້ນທາງສູ່ສີຂາວ\" ທີ່ນຸ່ມນວນກວ່າ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສີລຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ ແລະ ປ່ຽນຄ່າສີ (hue) ໃນແບບທີ່ເບິ່ງເປັນທຳມະຊາດ ແລະ ໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື. ຂະບວນການນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງສີໃນທຸກລະດັບໂທນ ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບພາບສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ມີຄວາມກົມກືນກັນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![naive per-channel processing](agx/sweep_agx.jpg#w75)\n"
msgstr "![ການປະມວນຜົນແບບ AgX](agx/sweep_agx.jpg#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"only use one display transform\n"
": Never use _AgX_ together with another display transform module (i.e. [_sigmoid_](./sigmoid.md), [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) or [_base curve_](./base-curve.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ການແປງການສະແດງຜົນພຽງອັນດຽວເທົ່ານັ້ນ\n"
": ຫ້າມໃຊ້ _AgX_ ຮ່ວມກັບໂມດູນແປງການສະແດງຜົນອື່ນໆ (ເຊັ່ນ: [_sigmoid_](./sigmoid.md), [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) ຫຼື [_base curve_]( ./base-curve.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"adjust for the mid-tones first\n"
": By default, the module preserves middle gray. Before using _AgX_, you should first use the [_exposure_](./exposure.md) module to adjust the mid-tones to your liking.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປັບແຕ່ງໂທນສີກາງກ່ອນ\n"
": ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໂມດູນຈະຮັກສາຄ່າສີເທີົາກາງ (middle gray). ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ _AgX_, ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_ການຮັບແສງ (exposure)_](./exposure.md) ເພື່ອປັບໂທນສີກາງໃຫ້ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການກ່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [recommended workflow](#recommended-workflow) for using this module is provided at the end of this page.\n"
msgstr "ມີຄຳແນະນຳ [ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ແນະນຳ](#recommended-workflow) ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້ຢູ່ທ້າຍໜ້ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The module's controls are divided into three categories:\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມຂອງໂມດູນຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນສາມປະເພດ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tone mapping controls (input range and the curve)\n"
