#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Throughout this module's documentation, references will be made to other tone mappers, namely [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) and [_sigmoid_](./sigmoid.md). This is to support users already familiar with those modules, however, familiarity with these modules is not required to use _AgX_.\n"
msgstr "ໃນເອກະສານຂອງໂມດູນນີ້, ຈະມີການອ້າງອີງເຖິງເຄື່ອງມືຈຳລອງໂທນສີອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ [_filmic rgb_](./filmic-rgb.md) ແລະ [_sigmoid_](./sigmoid.md). ນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອຊ່ວຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍກັບໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນກໍສາມາດໃຊ້ _AgX_ ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Due to the complex nature of this module, related controls are grouped together in collapsible sections, and the controls are distributed over two tabs.\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນຂອງໂມດູນນີ້, ການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັນຈຶ່ງຖືກຈັດເປັນກຸ່ມໃນສ່ວນທີ່ສາມາດຍຸບໄດ້, ແລະ ປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນສອງແຖບ (tabs).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the settings tab"
msgstr "ແຖບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (settings)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The settings tab holds the most commonly-used controls.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບການຕັ້ງຄ່າປະກອບດ້ວຍການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "input exposure range"
msgstr "ຊ່ວງການຮັບແສງຂາເຂົ້າ (input exposure range)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This section provides controls similar to those of the _filmic rgb_ module, allowing you to set the black and white points. The selected exposure range will then be projected into the [0, 1] range using a logarithmic transformation. This means that each 1 EV stop of dynamic range corresponds to an equal distance along the curve's horizontal axis. The mid-gray point is situated proportionally on this axis between the selected extremes. After this initial projection, the data will be further processed by the curve (below).\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ມີການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບໂມດູນ _filmic rgb_, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຈຸດສີດຳ ແລະ ສີຂາວໄດ້. ຊ່ວງການຮັບແສງທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກປ່ຽນໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ [0, 1] ໂດຍໃຊ້ການແປງແບບລໍກາຣິດ (logarithmic transformation). ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແຕ່ລະ 1 EV ຂອງຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກຈະມີໄລຍະຫ່າງເທົ່າກັນໃນແກນນອນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ຈຸດສີເທີົາກາງຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນໃນແກນນີ້ລະຫວ່າງຈຸດສູງສຸດ ແລະ ຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ເລືອກ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນຕໍ່ໂດຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"white relative exposure\n"
": Set the white point. Any value above this will be clipped to 1. Use the picker to automatically set this value.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຮັບແສງສຳພັນສີຂາວ (white relative exposure)\n"
": ກຳນົດຈຸດສີຂາວ. ຄ່າໃດໆທີ່ສູງກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັດ (clipped) ໃຫ້ເປັນ 1. ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ (picker) ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"black relative exposure\n"
": Set the black point. Any value below this will be clipped to 0. Use the picker to automatically set this value.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຮັບແສງສຳພັນສີດຳ (black relative exposure)\n"
": ກຳນົດຈຸດສີດຳ. ຄ່າໃດໆທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັດ (clipped) ໃຫ້ເປັນ 0. ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ (picker) ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"dynamic range scaling\n"
": Apply a safety margin when using pickers to select the white and black relative exposure.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປັບຂະໜາດຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກ (dynamic range scaling)\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ໄລຍະຄວາມປອດໄພ (safety margin) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮັບແສງສຳພັນສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີດຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"auto tune levels\n"
": Select the auto tune picker icon to set both the white and black relative exposures at the same time (same as clicking both pickers above).\n"
": The _read exposure_ (camera icon) button does not analyze the contents of the image, like the pickers do. Instead, it estimates the black and white relative exposures based on the settings in the [_exposure_](./exposure.md) module. If there are several instances of _exposure_, the button will read the settings from the first enabled, unmasked instance. If all instances are masked, the first instance will be used.\n"
": Using the button only makes sense if the input to _AgX_ is actually influenced by the exposure module -- that is, if the _exposure_ module comes before _AgX_ in the pipeline (which is normally the case). This allows you to take into account any in-camera exposure compensation, in-camera highlight preservation (if supported by darktable), and manual adjustments. The mechanism is similar to that used by _filmic rgb_, but is not applied automatically.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປັບລະດັບອັດຕະໂນມັດ (auto tune levels)\n"
": ເລືອກໄອຄອນເຄື່ອງມືປັບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີດຳພ້ອມກັນ.\n"
": ປຸ່ມ _ອ່ານການຮັບແສງ (read exposure)_ (ໄອຄອນກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບ) ຈະບໍ່ວິເຄາະເນື້ອໃນຂອງຮູບພາບຄືກັບເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ. ແຕ່ມັນຈະປະເມີນຄ່າສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີດຳ ໂດຍອີງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໂມດູນ [_ການຮັບແສງ (exposure)_](./exposure.md). ຖ້າມີໂມດູນການຮັບແສງຫຼາຍອັນ, ມັນຈະອ່ານຄ່າຈາກອັນທຳອິດທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີໜ້າກາກ (unmasked). ຖ້າທຸກອັນມີໜ້າກາກ, ມັນຈະໃຊ້ອັນທຳອິດ.\n"
": ການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າຂອງ _AgX_ ຖືກສົ່ງມາຈາກໂມດູນການຮັບແສງ -- ນັ້ນຄື ໂມດູນ _exposure_ ຕ້ອງຢູ່ກ່ອນ _AgX_ ໃນລຳດັບການເຮັດວຽກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານນຳເອົາການຊົດເຊີຍແສງໃນກ້ອງ, ການຮັກສາສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງໃນກ້ອງ, ແລະ ການປັບແຕ່ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງມາຄິດໄລ່ນຳ. ກົນໄກນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ _filmic rgb_ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "basic curve parameters"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the following discussion, the parts of the tone curve are identified as follows:\n"
" - The _pivot_ is the point on the curve around which contrast is adjusted (the point of highest contrast)\n"
" - The _shoulder_ is the higher bend of the curve (the highlights)\n"
" - The _toe_ is the lower bend of the curve (the shadows)\n"
" - The _contrast_ is the slope of the curve (steeper curve = higher contrast)\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃນການອະທິບາຍຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີມີຊື່ເອີ້ນດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
" - _ຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot)_ ແມ່ນຈຸດເທິງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງທີ່ໃຊ້ປັບຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (ຈຸດທີ່ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດສູງສຸດ)\n"
" - _ສ່ວນບ່າ (shoulder)_ ແມ່ນສ່ວນໂຄ້ງດ້ານເທິງຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື highlights)\n"
" - _ສ່ວນປາຍ (toe)_ ແມ່ນສ່ວນໂຄ້ງດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (ສ່ວນເງົາ ຫຼື shadows)\n"
" - _ຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast)_ ແມ່ນຄວາມຊັນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຊັນຫຼາຍ = ຄວາມຄົມຊັດສູງ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you do not understand these terms from the definitions, it may be helpful to [show the curve](#show-curve) while adjusting the related controls and observe the effect.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ເຂົ້າໃຈຄຳສັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ມັນອາດຈະຊ່ວຍໄດ້ຖ້າທ່ານເປີດ [ສະແດງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ (#show-curve)] ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປັບການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຜົນກະທົບທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pivot relative exposure\n"
": Sets the input value of the pivot point (the point in the tonal range where the contrast will be highest), in EV relative to mid-gray. Since contrast is normally highest around the pivot, this slider allows you to choose which part of the input tonal range should have the most contrast. The corresponding color picker adjusts only this slider, but not _pivot target output_ (below). You may be tempted to use it as a brightness control (moving the pivot towards black, without modifying its output value, will brighten the image, while moving it towards white will darken the image), but the _pivot target output_ is better suited for that, as it directly influences brightness, without changing the point of highest contrast.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຮັບແສງສຳພັນຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot relative exposure)\n"
": ກຳນົດຄ່າຂາເຂົ້າຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ (ຈຸດໃນຊ່ວງໂທນສີທີ່ຈະມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດສູງສຸດ), ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ EV ສຳພັນກັບສີເທີົາກາງ. ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມຄົມຊັດມັກຈະສູງສຸດຢູ່ບໍລິເວນຈຸດໝຸນ, ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ຈຶ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າສ່ວນໃດຂອງຊ່ວງໂທນສີຄວນມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ. ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະປັບສະເພາະແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ປັບ _ຄ່າອອກເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot target output)_. ທ່ານອາດຈະຢາກໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (ການຍ້າຍຈຸດໝຸນໄປຫາສີດຳຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍ້າຍໄປຫາສີຂາວຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບມືດລົງ), ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ _pivot target output_ ຈະເໝາະສົມກວ່າ ເພາະມັນສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນຈຸດທີ່ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດສູງສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": When adjusting the _black/white relative exposure_ values, the _pivot relative exposure_ will be maintained for as long as possible. This will cause it to move along the x-axis, as the preserved quantity is the exposure value _relative to mid-gray_, and its position on the x-axis depends on the endpoints of that axis (the black and white relative exposure values). If an adjustment would cause the pivot input to fall outside the exposure boundaries, it will be forced inside the available range.\n"
msgstr ": ເມື່ອປັບຄ່າ _ການຮັບແສງສຳພັນສີດຳ/ຂາວ_, ຄ່າ _ການຮັບແສງສຳພັນຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ_ ຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ໃຫ້ໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມແກນ X, ເພາະຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ແມ່ນຄ່າການຮັບແສງ _ສຳພັນກັບສີເທີົາກາງ_, ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນໃນແກນ X ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດຂອງແກນນັ້ນ. ຖ້າການປັບແຕ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຈຸດໝຸນຫຼຸດອອກນອກຂອບເຂດການຮັບແສງ, ມັນຈະຖືກບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຊ່ວງທີ່ມີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pivot target output\n"
": Sets the target output linear value (power) for the tone selected by the pivot's input. The value is indicated on the y-axis of the curve. Note that the scale of the y-axis is not uniform, and depends on the _curve y gamma_, described in the section [advanced curve parameters](#advanced-curve-parameters). The corresponding color picker adjusts both _pivot relative exposure_ (the point of highest contrast) and _pivot target output_, attempting to preserve the average brightness of the selected region.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າອອກເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot target output)\n"
": ກຳນົດຄ່າອອກແບບລີເນຍ (ພະລັງງານ) ສຳລັບໂທນສີທີ່ເລືອກໂດຍຈຸດໝຸນຂາເຂົ້າ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແກນ Y ຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ສັງເກດວ່າຂະໜາດຂອງແກນ Y ຈະບໍ່ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ ແລະ ຂຶ້ນກັບຄ່າ _curve y gamma_ ທີ່ອະທິບາຍໃນສ່ວນ [ພາຣາມິເຕີເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂັ້ນສູງ (#advanced-curve-parameters)]. ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະປັບທັງ _pivot relative exposure_ ແລະ _pivot target output_ ເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສະເລ່ຍຂອງບໍລິເວນທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more predictable results, you are advised to use the color pickers on uniform areas, as sudden tonal transitions in the selected area will cause the average values to change drastically, leading to fluctuations in both pivot input and output.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນທີ່ຄາດເດົາໄດ້, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ມີສີສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ, ເພາະການປ່ຽນໂທນສີຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ເລືອກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍປ່ຽນແປງຢ່າງຮຸນແຮງ ແລະ ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ຄ່າຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຂາອອກຂອງຈຸດໝຸນຜັນຜວນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"contrast\n"
": Sets the slope of the curve at the pivot point. This value is scaled internally to maintain a consistent final (linear) output contrast, compensating for changes to both the dynamic range and the _curve y gamma_ setting.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast)\n"
": ກຳນົດຄວາມຊັນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດໝຸນ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດພາຍໃນເພື່ອຮັກສາຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນອອກ (ແບບລີເນຍ) ໃຫ້ສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ, ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໃນຊ່ວງໄດນາມິກ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _curve y gamma_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"shoulder power / toe power\n"
": These sliders determine how fast the contrast drops as the curve approaches black or white. Higher values result in a sharper bend, maintaining contrast for longer before a more abrupt roll-off. If the overall contrast is not sufficient to reach the black and/or white point, either or both ends of the curve may become \"inverted,\" rendering these controls ineffective. Should this occur, a warning icon will appear next to the affected slider(s). Hovering over the warning provides a tooltip with suggested actions, and, if the _show curve_ section is expanded (below), the affected part of the curve will be highlighted in yellow.\n"
msgstr ""
"ພະລັງງານສ່ວນບ່າ / ພະລັງງານສ່ວນປາຍ (shoulder power / toe power)\n"
": ແຖບເລື່ອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກຳນົດວ່າຄວາມຄົມຊັດຈະລຸດລົງໄວປານໃດເມື່ອເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເຂົ້າໃກ້ສີດຳ ຫຼື ສີຂາວ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນໂຄ້ງຫັກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຮັກສາຄວາມຄົມຊັດໄດ້ດົນກວ່າກ່ອນທີ່ຈະລຸດລົງຢ່າງກະທັນຫັນ. ຖ້າຄວາມຄົມຊັດໂດຍລວມບໍ່ພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະໄປເຖິງຈຸດສີດຳ ຫຼື ສີຂາວ, ປາຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງອາດຈະ \"ປີ້ນກັບ (inverted)\", ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຄວບຄຸມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນ. ຖ້າເກີດເຫດການນີ້, ໄອຄອນເຕືອນຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນຂ້າງແຖບເລື່ອນ. ເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງຄຳເຕືອນ ມັນຈະສະແດງຄຳແນະນຳວິທີແກ້ໄຂ, ແລະ ຖ້າສ່ວນ _ສະແດງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ_ ຖືກເປີດຢູ່, ສ່ວນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈະຖືກສະແດງເປັນສີເຫຼືອງ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "show curve"
msgstr "ສະແດງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expand the _show curve_ section to display a plot of the curve. This can be a useful tool to learn about curve behavior by observing the effect of related controls, or when investigating issues such as loss of detail or \"curve inversion\" (see the _toe power / shoulder power_ control above). The plot is not interactive -- it simply illustrates the effect of the sliders.\n"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍສ່ວນ _ສະແດງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ_ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງກຣາບຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຮຽນຮູ້ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ໂດຍການສັງເກດຜົນກະທົບຈາກການປັບຄວບຄຸມຕ່າງໆ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອກວດສອບບັນຫາຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ ຫຼື \"ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງປີ້ນກັບ\". ກຣາບນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໂຕ້ຕອບໄດ້ (ປັບບໍ່ໄດ້) -- ມັນພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງຜົນຈາກແຖບເລື່ອນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The x-axis shows the selected input exposure range, measured in EV, with all values relative to mid-gray (indicated by the 0 EV mark).\n"
msgstr "ແກນ X ສະແດງຊ່ວງການຮັບແສງຂາເຂົ້າທີ່ເລືອກ, ວັດແທກເປັນ EV, ໂດຍທຸກຄ່າຈະສຳພັນກັບສີເທີົາກາງ (ສະແດງດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ 0 EV).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The y-axis shows the linear output value, with 18% representing mid-gray. The scaling of the y-axis is not linear -- horizontal grid lines help visualize this non-linearity. The degree of non-linearity is governed by a gamma value (default: 2.2). More information on the gamma is provided in the description of the [advanced curve parameters](#advanced-curve-parameters).\n"
msgstr "ແກນ Y ສະແດງຄ່າອອກແບບລີເນຍ, ໂດຍ 18% ແທນຄ່າສີເທີົາກາງ. ຂະໜາດຂອງແກນ Y ບໍ່ແມ່ນແບບລີເນຍ -- ເສັ້ນຕາໜ່າງແນວນອນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຫັນຄວາມບໍ່ເປັນລີເນຍນີ້. ລະດັບຄວາມບໍ່ເປັນລີເນຍແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຄ່າ gamma (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 2.2). ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ gamma ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ [ພາຣາມິເຕີເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂັ້ນສູງ (#advanced-curve-parameters)].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The curve has 5 important points:\n"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງມີ 5 ຈຸດທີ່ສຳຄັນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _black and white points_ are at the left and right edges of the graph, respectively; their final linear output values can be controlled by the _target black_ and _target white_ sliders (see [advanced curve parameters](#advanced-curve-parameters)).\n"
msgstr "_- ຈຸດສີດຳ ແລະ ສີຂາວ_ ຢູ່ທີ່ຂອບເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຂວາຂອງກຣາບຕາມລຳດັບ; ຄ່າອອກສຸດທ້າຍຂອງພວກມັນສາມາດຄວບຄຸມໄດ້ດ້ວຍແຖບເລື່ອນ _ສີດຳເປົ້າໝາຍ (target black)_ ແລະ _ສີຂາວເປົ້າໝາຍ (target white)_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _pivot_ is the point around which the curve is built, indicated by a dot. By default, it maps mid-gray to mid-gray. You may move this point to match your main subject using the provided picker.\n"
msgstr "_- ຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot)_ ແມ່ນຈຸດທີ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນອ້ອມຮອບ, ສະແດງດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ມັນຈະຈັບຄູ່ສີເທີົາກາງໃຫ້ເປັນສີເທີົາກາງ. ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍຈຸດນີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຕົວແບບຫຼັກຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເລືອກສີ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _toe and shoulder starting points_ define where the curve transitions from a linear section to the compressed toe (shadows) and shoulder (highlights). By default, these are set to the pivot point.\n"
msgstr "_- ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສ່ວນປາຍ ແລະ ສ່ວນບ່າ_ ກຳນົດບ່ອນທີ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງປ່ຽນຜ່ານຈາກສ່ວນລີເນຍໄປຫາສ່ວນປາຍທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດ (ສ່ວນເງົາ) ແລະ ສ່ວນບ່າ (ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ). ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຈຸດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ຈຸດໝຸນ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "advanced curve parameters"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂັ້ນສູງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"shoulder start\n"
": Defines the point where the linear portion of the curve ends and the shoulder begins. Keeping the value at 0% allows the smooth transition to start at the pivot. Higher values push the transition point up towards the chosen _target white_. This may result in hard clipping, which can lead to a loss of detail in the highlights.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສ່ວນບ່າ (shoulder start)\n"
": ກຳນົດຈຸດທີ່ສ່ວນລີເນຍຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງສິ້ນສຸດ ແລະ ສ່ວນບ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ທີ່ 0% ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢ່າງນຸ່ມນວນຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດໝຸນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະດັນຈຸດປ່ຽນຜ່ານຂຶ້ນໄປຫາ _ສີຂາວເປົ້າໝາຍ_. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຕັດແສງຢ່າງຮຸນແຮງ (hard clipping) ແລະ ສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"target white\n"
": The upper bound that the curve converges to. This can be used to limit the maximum output luminance.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີຂາວເປົ້າໝາຍ (target white)\n"
": ຂອບເຂດດ້ານເທິງທີ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະໄປເຖິງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອຈຳກັດຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສູງສຸດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"toe start\n"
": Defines the point where the linear portion of the curve ends and the toe begins. Keeping the value at 0% allows the smooth transition to start at the pivot. Higher values push the transition point down towards the chosen _target black_. This may result in hard clipping, which can lead to a loss of detail in the shadows.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສ່ວນປາຍ (toe start)\n"
": ກຳນົດຈຸດທີ່ສ່ວນລີເນຍຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງສິ້ນສຸດ ແລະ ສ່ວນປາຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ທີ່ 0% ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢ່າງນຸ່ມນວນຢູ່ທີ່ຈຸດໝຸນ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະດັນຈຸດປ່ຽນຜ່ານລົງໄປຫາ _ສີດຳເປົ້າໝາຍ_. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຕັດແສງຢ່າງຮຸນແຮງໃນສ່ວນມືດ ແລະ ສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດໃນສ່ວນເງົາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"target black\n"
": The lower bound that the curve converges to. This can be used to create a faded analog look, similar to the _lift_ control in the _look_ section or the _global offset_ in [_color balance rgb_](./color-balance-rgb.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີດຳເປົ້າໝາຍ (target black)\n"
": ຂອບເຂດດ້ານລຸ່ມທີ່ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະໄປເຖິງ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອສ້າງລັກສະນະພາບແບບຈາງໆ (faded analog look), ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການຄວບຄຸມ _lift_ ຫຼື _global offset_ ໃນໂມດູນອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"keep the pivot on the diagonal\n"
": Automatically adjusts _curve y gamma_ in an attempt to ensure the curve remains S-shaped, as long as the contrast setting is high enough. It works much like _auto adjust hardness_ in _filmic rgb_. While the checkbox is ticked, _curve y gamma_ cannot be adjusted manually, and is hidden.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາຈຸດໝຸນໄວ້ໃນແນວສະແຢງ (keep the pivot on the diagonal)\n"
": ປັບຄ່າ _curve y gamma_ ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຍັງເປັນຮູບຕົວ S, ຕາບໃດທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຄົມຊັດຍັງສູງພໍ. ມັນເຮັດວຽກຄ້າຍຄືກັບ _ປັບຄວາມແຂງອັດຕະໂນມັດ_ ໃນ _filmic rgb_. ເມື່ອເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້, ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດປັບ _curve y gamma_ ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ ແລະ ມັນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curve y gamma\n"
": Shifts the representation of the pivot along the y-axis without changing its output luminance. This is an internal parameter of the algorithm and does not need to match your display's gamma. Its purpose is mainly to enable you to keep the S-shape of the curve, thereby ensuring that the _shoulder power_ and _toe power_ controls remain effective. Manual adjustments are disabled while _keep the pivot on the diagonal_ is enabled.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າແກມມາຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໃນແກນ Y (curve y gamma)\n"
": ຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຈຸດໝຸນຕາມແກນ Y ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຂໍ້ມູນອອກ. ນີ້ແມ່ນພາຣາມິເຕີພາຍໃນຂອງອັລກໍຣິທຶມ ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບຄ່າແກມມາຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນ. ຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກແມ່ນເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຮັກສາຮູບຮ່າງຕົວ S ຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຄວບຄຸມສ່ວນບ່າ ແລະ ສ່ວນປາຍຍັງຄົງມີປະສິດທິພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"look\" controls define how the image is processed after the tone mapping operation. This means that they are _display-referred_ operations, and can result in clipping, so use them carefully.\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມ \"ລັກສະນະພາບ (look)\" ກຳນົດວິທີການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບຫຼັງຈາກການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພວກມັນເປັນການປະມວນຜົນແບບ _ອີງຕາມຈໍສະແດງຜົນ (display-referred)_, ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຕັດແສງ (clipping) ໄດ້, ສະນັ້ນຄວນໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"slope\n"
": Multiplies the output values by this factor. Black is not affected (since it has a value of 0). Values above 1 brighten the image and increase contrast, whereas those below 1 darken the image and reduce contrast.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຊັນ (slope)\n"
": ຄູນຄ່າອອກດ້ວຍປັດໄຈນີ້. ສີດຳຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ (ເພາະມັນມີຄ່າເປັນ 0). ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ 1 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 1 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບມືດລົງ ແລະ ລຸດຄວາມຄົມຊັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lift\n"
": Shifts values up or down. Only blacks are fully affected, with the effect gradually reduced for brighter tones. Whites are not affected if _slope_ is at its default value of 1. Negative values crush shadows, whereas positive values can produce a faded look.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຍົກລະດັບ (lift)\n"
": ຍ້າຍຄ່າຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ລົງ. ສີດຳຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ, ແລະ ຜົນກະທົບຈະຄ່ອຍໆລຸດລົງໃນໂທນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງກວ່າ. ສີຂາວຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຖ້າຄ່າ _slope_ ເປັນ 1. ຄ່າລົບຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນເງົາມືດຂຶ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າບວກຈະສ້າງລັກສະນະພາບແບບຈາງໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"brightness\n"
": Applies a power function (gamma adjustment) to the image. The black and white points are not affected. Values above 1 will raise the mid-tones, opening up shadows, whereas those below 1 will darken the mid-tones and compress shadows.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (brightness)\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນຍົກກຳລັງ (ການປັບແກມມາ) ໃຫ້ກັບຮູບພາບ. ຈຸດສີດຳ ແລະ ສີຂາວຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າ 1 ຈະຍົກໂທນສີກາງຂຶ້ນ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເງົາສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 1 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂທນສີກາງມືດລົງ ແລະ ບີບອັດສ່ວນເງົາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saturation\n"
": Controls color intensity by adjusting the image's chroma. For a precise definition of chroma vs. saturation, please see [_darktable's color dimensions_](../../special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions.md). A value of zero makes the image monochrome.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ (saturation)\n"
": ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີໂດຍການປັບຄ່າ chroma ຂອງຮູບພາບ. ຄ່າເປັນສູນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບກາຍເປັນສີຂາວດຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preserve hue\n"
": The tone mapping curve, being a per-channel curve, introduces color shifts, with color tending towards the primary (red, green and blue) and secondary (yellow, cyan and magenta) colors in the highlights. At a value of 0%, these color shifts are retained. By raising this slider, the input hues (those before the tone curve) can be partially or fully restored.\n"
": Note that the input hues themselves are affected by the \"primaries manipulations\" that are performed [before tone mapping](#before-tone-mapping), and the final hues are affected by the \"primaries manipulations\" that are applied [after tone mapping](#after-tone-mapping). For a detailed description of the order of the operations, see [technical details](#technical-details) below.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາຄ່າສີ (preserve hue)\n"
": ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຈຳລອງໂທນສີແບບແຍກຊ່ອງສີມັກຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສີປ່ຽນໄປ, ໂດຍສີມັກຈະປ່ຽນໄປຫາສີຫຼັກ (ແດງ, ຂຽວ, ຟ້າ) ແລະ ສີຮອງ (ເຫຼືອງ, ຟ້າອ່ອນ, ມ່ວງແດງ) ໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ. ທີ່ຄ່າ 0%, ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງສີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້. ໂດຍການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້, ຄ່າສີຂາເຂົ້າ (ກ່ອນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ) ຈະຖືກກູ້ຄືນມາບາງສ່ວນ ຫຼື ທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the primaries tab"
msgstr "ແຖບສີຫຼັກ (primaries)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _primaries_ tab controls are similar to, but more extensive than, those of the collapsible _primaries_ section in the [_sigmoid_](./sigmoid.md#primaries) module:\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນແຖບ _ສີຫຼັກ (primaries)_ ຈະຄ້າຍຄືກັບໂມດູນ [_sigmoid_](./sigmoid.md#primaries) ແຕ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນກວ່າ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"disable adjustments\n"
": Turns off all manipulation of primaries. You are not advised to tick this checkbox for actual processing -- it is intended more as a learning tool for quick comparisons. For a starting point without adjustments that can be fine-tuned manually, use the _unmodified_ configuration.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປິດການປັບແຕ່ງ (disable adjustments)\n"
": ປິດການຈັດການສີຫຼັກທັງໝົດ. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ໃນການປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບແທ້ -- ມັນມີໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງມືໃນການຮຽນຮູ້ ຫຼື ປຽບທຽບຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"reset primaries\n"
": Clicking this button reveals a pop-up menu to apply one of the built-in sets of primaries, without altering any of the other settings.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າສີຫຼັກໃໝ່ (reset primaries)\n"
": ການຄລິກປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະສະແດງເມນູໃຫ້ເລືອກຊຸດສີຫຼັກທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໃນຕົວ ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base primaries\n"
": Defines which color space is used as the basis of the _AgX_ processing space. The attenuation and rotation controls below are applied relative to this space. For especially problematic colors, you may find that wider spaces provide better control.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີຫຼັກພື້ນຖານ (base primaries)\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າພື້ນທີ່ສີໃດຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ປະມວນຜົນຂອງ _AgX_.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "before tone mapping"
msgstr "ກ່ອນການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ (before tone mapping)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The controls in this group affect the operations performed before the tone mapping curve is applied.\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນກຸ່ມນີ້ຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນກ່ອນຈະນຳໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"red/green/blue attenuation\n"
": Controls the amount of desaturation applied to the primary color. This adjusts the rate of the color's shift towards white as its intensity increases. Lower values result in a slower shift and more pronounced hue changes, at the risk of artifacts. The saturation of all colors will be reduced, regardless of luminosity, but this can be reversed for shadows and mid-tones using the _purity boost_ sliders in the [after tone mapping](#after-tone-mapping) section, the overall effect being a desaturation of highlights.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການລຸດຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ (red/green/blue attenuation)\n"
": ຄວບຄຸມປະລິມານການລຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີຫຼັກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປັບອັດຕາການປ່ຽນຂອງສີໄປຫາສີຂາວເມື່ອຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສີປ່ຽນໄປຫາສີຂາວຊ້າລົງ ແຕ່ອາດສ່ຽງຕໍ່ການເກີດສິ່ງປົນເປື້ອນໃນຮູບພາບ (artifacts).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"red/green/blue rotation\n"
": Rotates the hue angle of the primary color. This affects the direction of the hue shift for colors as their intensity changes. For example, rotating red can influence whether it bends towards yellow or magenta.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການໝຸນສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ (red/green/blue rotation)\n"
": ໝຸນມຸມຄ່າສີ (hue) ຂອງສີຫຼັກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ທິດທາງການປ່ຽນຂອງຄ່າສີເມື່ອຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງແສງປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "after tone mapping"
msgstr "ຫຼັງການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ (after tone mapping)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The controls in this group affect the processing performed after tone mapping. Use them as artistic controls to help you achieve the desired final look.\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນກຸ່ມນີ້ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການປະມວນຜົນຫຼັງຈາກການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ. ໃຊ້ພວກມັນເປັນການຄວບຄຸມທາງສິລະປະເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ລັກສະນະພາບສຸດທ້າຍຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"reverse all\n"
": Ticking this checkbox will hide the other controls in the group, and adjust processing settings as if the _master_ reversal sliders, discussed below, were set to 100%, the _purity boost_ parameters to match the values of the corresponding _attenuation_ sliders, and the _reverse rotation_ parameters to mirror the values set with the _rotation_ sliders. The values of the hidden sliders will be retained, but not used for processing. Unchecking the checkbox will make them visible, and their settings effective, again.\n"
": The checkbox is intended to simplify the user interface (users may wish to create presets with the checkbox ticked), and for quick \"what-if\" checks.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປີ້ນກັບທັງໝົດ (reverse all)\n"
": ການເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ຈະເຊື່ອງການຄວບຄຸມອື່ນໆໃນກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ປັບການປະມວນຜົນໃຫ້ຄືກັບວ່າແຖບເລື່ອນ _master_ ຖືກຕັ້ງໄວ້ທີ່ 100%. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເບິ່ງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"set from above\n"
": Clicking the button will _copy_ the values of the sliders from the [before tone mapping](#before-tone-mapping) section, and set the _master_ controls to 100%, producing the same visual effect as ticking _reverse all_. However, this only provides a starting point -- the sliders will not be hidden, and may be adjusted to taste.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກດ້ານເທິງ (set from above)\n"
": ຄລິກປຸ່ມນີ້ເພື່ອ _ຄັດລອກ_ ຄ່າຈາກສ່ວນ [ກ່ອນການຈຳລອງໂທນສີ] ມາໃຊ້ໃນສ່ວນນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"master purity boost, master rotation reversal\n"
": These are multipliers that affect the individual red/green/blue controls below, allowing you to globally increase or decrease their effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຫຼັກ, ການປີ້ນການໝຸນຫຼັກ (master purity boost, master rotation reversal)\n"
": ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວຄູນທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການຄວບຄຸມສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ ແຕ່ລະອັນດ້ານລຸ່ມ, ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຸດຜົນກະທົບໃນພາບລວມໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"red/green/blue purity boost\n"
": Restores color purity _after_ the tone curve is applied. Higher values make the image look more colorful and chroma-laden, but can introduce artifacts if pushed too far. When combined with _attenuation_ (above), the net effect is a selective desaturation of highlights (since the purity boost does not fully recover purity in highlights, due to them being strongly desaturated by the tone mapping process).\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເພີ່ມຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ (red/green/blue purity boost)\n"
": ກູ້ຄືນຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງສີ _ຫຼັງຈາກ_ ນຳໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນສີ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບມີສີສັນສົດໃສຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"red/green/blue reverse rotation\n"
": Reverses the initial primary rotation after the tone curve. This offers a final control over the rendered hues. This can be used to partly or fully reverse the hue shifts introduced by the corresponding rotation sliders, mostly in the shadows and mid-tones. Since the curve is applied per-channel, it is subject to the \"Notorious 6\" shifts, which mostly affect highlights.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປີ້ນການໝຸນສີ ແດງ/ຂຽວ/ຟ້າ (red/green/blue reverse rotation)\n"
": ປີ້ນການໝຸນສີຫຼັກທີ່ເຮັດໄວ້ໃນຕອນຕົ້ນ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມຄ່າສີສຸດທ້າຍໃຫ້ໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The module provides built-in presets, based on Blender, and on the _smooth_ preset of the _sigmoid_ module. When adjusting primaries starting from those presets, you will need to take the following into account:\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ມີຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets) ທີ່ອີງຕາມ Blender ແລະ preset ແບບ _smooth_ ຂອງໂມດູນ _sigmoid_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In Blender, the rotation of primaries is not reversed, and purity is restored using values different from those used for attenuation. Therefore, the corresponding _blender-like_ and _scene-referred default_ presets of _AgX_ come with _master purity boost = 100%, master rotation reversal = 0%_. This means that, although the per-channel rotation reversal sliders are set up for complete reversal, they have no effect. You can turn them on gradually by raising the _master rotation reversal_ control, and, once that is no longer set to 0%, adjust the individual channel sliders according to taste.\n"
msgstr "ໃນ Blender, ການໝຸນສີຫຼັກຈະບໍ່ຖືກປີ້ນກັບ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ preset ແບບ _blender-like_ ຈຶ່ງຕັ້ງຄ່າ _master rotation reversal = 0%_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the _sigmoid_ module's _smooth_ preset, rotations are always completely reversed, but purity is not boosted at all by default. Therefore, the corresponding _AgX_ presets, also called _smooth_, set _master purity boost = 0%, master rotation reversal = 100%_. The per-channel purity boost sliders are set to completely reverse the attenuation, but are effectively disabled by the master slider. The per-channel rotation reversal sliders mirror the settings of the reversal slider, and are fully enabled by the master control.\n"
msgstr "ໃນ preset ແບບ _smooth_ ຂອງ _sigmoid_, ການໝຸນຈະຖືກປີ້ນກັບທັງໝົດ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ມີການເພີ່ມຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You are, of course, free to create your own presets with your favorite combination of master and per-channel controls (for example, having the master reversal controls at 100% and the per-channel controls set to your preferred values).\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງ preset ຂອງຕົນເອງໄດ້ຕາມຄວາມມັກ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "selective tuning for mid-tones and highlights"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງສະເພາະສ່ວນສຳລັບໂທນສີກາງ ແລະ ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is important to note that using the primaries controls, the properties of the S-curve (lower contrast in highlights), and per-channel application of the curve together make it possible to apply different adjustments to mid-tones and highlights, even though this may not be evident at the first glance.\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຄວນຮູ້ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ການຄວບຄຸມສີຫຼັກ ຮ່ວມກັບຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຮູບຕົວ S ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໂທນສີກາງ ແລະ ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງແຍກກັນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Per-channel S-curves have the property of desaturating highlights, independently of the _attenuation_ control. This means you _can_ reverse the attenuation (restore saturation) for mid-tones using _purity boost_, but not so for highlights.\n"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ S-curve ແບບແຍກຊ່ອງສີມີຄຸນສົມບັດໃນການລຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Another property of per-channel S-curves is the skewing of bright colors mentioned above: the \"Notorious 6\". _AgX_ cleverly uses this effect to exaggerate hue shifts introduced using the rotation of primaries. For example, a red primary rotated a few degrees towards green (yellow) will turn ever so slightly yellow, and this can be reversed later using the _red reverse rotation_ slider, if desired. However, for brighter tones, the \"Notorious 6\" shift will skew the slightly yellow-tinted red more towards yellow, allowing you to obtain orange sunsets instead of pink ones. The reverse rotation will not recover this additional skew fully. To control how much _additional_ skew you want to allow, use the _preserve hue_ slider in the [look](#look) section.\n"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງແມ່ນການບິດເບືອນຂອງສີທີ່ສະຫວ່າງ (Notorious 6). _AgX_ ໃຊ້ຜົນກະທົບນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງການປ່ຽນຄ່າສີທີ່ສວຍງາມ ເຊັ່ນ ການເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບຕາເວັນຕົກດິນເປັນສີສົ້ມແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນສີບົວ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "recommended workflow"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ແນະນຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following workflow is recommended when using this module:\n"
msgstr "ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1.   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set overall exposure for the mid-tones using the _exposure_ module. Alternatively, use _contrast_ and _toe / shoulder power_ to fill the output tonal range.\n"
msgstr "1. ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮັບແສງໂດຍລວມສຳລັບໂທນສີກາງໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ _exposure_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1.   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a preset as a starting point. If darktable is set to apply a scene-referred workflow by default (see [preferences > processing > auto-apply pixel workflow defaults](../../preferences-settings/processing.md#image-processing)), the module will apply reasonable defaults automatically. In other cases (for example, when using the legacy display-referred workflow or if the workflow preference is set to \"none\"), manually select the preset _blender-like|base_ or _smooth|base_ for best results. The _punchy_ presets are more contrasty and colorful.\n"
msgstr "2. ເລືອກ preset ເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຖ້າ darktable ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ scene-referred ມັນຈະນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1.   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the _auto tune levels_ picker to set the desired exposure range.\n"
msgstr "3. ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື _auto tune levels_ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຊ່ວງການຮັບແສງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1.   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the pivot on the subject using the picker next to _pivot relative exposure_ (optional) -- this ensures that contrast is maximized around the selected area.\n"
msgstr "4. (ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ) ຕັ້ງຈຸດໝຸນ (pivot) ໄວ້ທີ່ຕົວແບບຫຼັກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄວາມຄົມຊັດສູງສຸດຢູ່ບໍລິເວນນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1.   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move the _pivot target output_ slider to adjust the brightness of the pivot point (optional).\n"
msgstr "5. (ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ) ປັບແຖບເລື່ອນ _pivot target output_ ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຈຸດໝຸນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1.   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the _contrast_.\n"
msgstr "6. ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (_contrast_).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1.   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust _toe_ and _shoulder power_ to set contrast in shadows and highlights, respectively (optional).\n"
msgstr "7. (ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ) ປັບ _toe_ ແລະ _shoulder power_ ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃນສ່ວນເງົາ ແລະ ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1.   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, if desired, you may add \"drama\" by adjusting the controls in the [look](#look) section --  add _brightness_, set overall _saturation_, and adjust colors with _preserve hue_.\n"
msgstr "8. ສຸດທ້າຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມຄວາມໂດດເດັ່ນໂດຍການປັບການຄວບຄຸມໃນສ່ວນ [ລັກສະນະພາບ (look)].\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please also note the following:\n"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາສັງເກດເພີ່ມເຕີມດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The provided presets (with the exception of _unmodified base primaries_) provide carefully tuned primaries. When starting out, it is best to rely on those settings. Adjusting them, based on individual taste and/or special lighting conditions (e.g. LED lights, stage lighting) is part of a more advanced workflow.\n"
msgstr "- preset ທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້ໄດ້ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງສີຫຼັກມາຢ່າງດີແລ້ວ. ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unless [high quality processing](../utility-modules/darkroom/high-quality-processing.md) is enabled, the effect of adjusting the primaries cannot be judged properly, especially with highly saturated colors and narrow-spectrum light sources like LEDs.\n"
msgstr "- ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ [ການປະມວນຜົນຄຸນນະພາບສູງ], ທ່ານອາດຈະເຫັນຜົນຂອງການປັບສີຫຼັກບໍ່ຊັດເຈນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Don't forget that the _AgX_ module is just another tone mapper. As flexible as it is, it is not intended to solve all image processing tasks related to color and contrast, many of which will be better resolved by using other modules.\n"
msgstr "- ຢ່າລືມວ່າ _AgX_ ກໍເປັນພຽງເຄື່ອງມືຈຳລອງໂທນສີອັນໜຶ່ງ. ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂທຸກບັນຫາຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "additional options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following additional options are \"hidden\" by default but can be toggled by manually editing your `darktablerc` file while darktable is closed.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຖືກ \"ເຊື່ອງ\" ໄວ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແຕ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ `darktablerc`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"3 tab\" mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດ \"3 ແຖບ\""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For people with small screens, where vertical screen-space is at a premium, an optional \"3 tab\" mode is provided in order to reduce the need to scroll the module. This mode moves [the plot of the curve](#show-curve) and [advanced curve parameters](#advanced-curve-parameters) from the _settings_ tab into a dedicated _curve_ tab, and duplicates some other controls from the [settings tab](#the-settings-tab) for convenience.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ມີໜ້າຈໍຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ, ໂໝດ \"3 ແຖບ\" ຈະຊ່ວຍລຸດການເລື່ອນໜ້າຈໍ ໂດຍການຍ້າຍກຣາບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໄປໄວ້ໃນແຖບສະເພາະ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can enable this mode by setting `plugins/darkroom/agx/enable_curve_tab=TRUE` in `darktablerc`. When set to `FALSE`, all curve controls appear on the _settings_ tab as normal.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `plugins/darkroom/agx/enable_curve_tab=TRUE` ໃນ `darktablerc`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "disabling curve warnings"
msgstr "ປິດການເຕືອນຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The warnings documented within the [basic curve parameters](#basic-curve-parameters) section can be disabled by setting `plugins/darkroom/agx/enable_curve_warnings=FALSE` in `darktablerc`.\n"
msgstr "ສາມາດປິດຄຳເຕືອນໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ `plugins/darkroom/agx/enable_curve_warnings=FALSE`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "always expand the \"look\" section"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍສ່ວນ \"ລັກສະນະພາບ\" ໄວ້ຕະຫຼອດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, the _look_ controls are placed inside a [collapsible section](#look). If you want to keep them visible at all times, you can set `plugins/darkroom/agx/look_always_visible=TRUE` in `darktablerc`.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສ່ວນ _look_ ສະແດງຢູ່ຕະຫຼອດ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ `plugins/darkroom/agx/look_always_visible=TRUE`.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "technical details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດທາງເຕັກນິກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following is a detailed description of the steps taken when processing with the _AgX_ module. This section is provided as a reference for interested readers, but is not required to use the module.\n"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນຄຳອະທິບາຍລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນຂອງໂມດູນ _AgX_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Linear, scene-referred data arrives in the pipe's working space, defined in the [_input color profile_](./input-color-profile.md) module (e.g. Rec 2020)\n"
msgstr "1. ຂໍ້ມູນແບບລີເນຍ ແລະ scene-referred ເຂົ້າມາໃນພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ (ເຊັ່ນ Rec 2020).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If needed, data is converted to the selected \"base\" space\n"
msgstr "2. ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ, ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກແປງເປັນພື້ນທີ່ \"base\" ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Colors that are out-of-gamut for the \"base\" space (RGB triplets that have any negative component in that space) are \"slid\" into gamut (in-gamut colors are not modified, though it is possible that a previously out-of-gamut color \"lands on top of\" an in-gamut color). The _sigmoid_ module performs a similar operation, but the method is different.\n"
msgstr "3. ສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດ (out-of-gamut) ຈະຖືກດຶງໃຫ້ກັບເຂົ້າມາໃນຂອບເຂດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An input matrix is calculated and applied, based on the RGB attenuation and primaries rotation values. This desaturates the colors (mixing channels into each-other) and rotates the primaries. This is the same as with _sigmoid_.\n"
msgstr "4. ຄຳນວນ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ເມທຣິກຂາເຂົ້າ ເພື່ອລຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ ແລະ ໝຸນສີຫຼັກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The HSV representation is calculated from the inset+rotated RGB. The hue (H) will be used later to restore the hue according to the _look / preserve hue_ slider.\n"
msgstr "5. ຄຳນວນຄ່າ HSV ເພື່ອເກັບຄ່າ hue ໄວ້ໃຊ້ໃນການກູ້ຄືນສີໃນພາຍຫຼັງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each component (RGB channel), the same processing steps are executed independently (but, since the desaturation (primaries attenuation) mixes channels into each-other, this means that with respect to the original color, the processing is not independent at all):\n"
msgstr "6. ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ (RGB) ຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນແຍກກັນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log encoding is applied: for input x, log2(x) is calculated (_x_ would be the value of the red, green or blue channel)\n"
msgstr "ມີການນຳໃຊ້ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບລັອກ: ສຳລັບຄ່າຂາເຂົ້າ x, log2(x) ຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ (x ແມ່ນຄ່າຂອງຊ່ອງສີແດງ, ສີຂຽວ ຫຼື ສີຟ້າ)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The log value is scaled and shifted according to the selected exposure parameters, so the selected black point becomes 0, the white point 1, and the value corresponding to mid-gray (18%) ends up on the x-axis of the curve in a ratio _black relative exposure : white relative exposure_ (by default, 10 : 6.5, or at about 0.61)\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າລັອກ (log value) ຖືກປັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ເຄື່ອນຍ້າຍຕາມພະລາມິເຕີການຮັບແສງທີ່ເລືອກ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ຈຸດດຳທີ່ເລືອກກາຍເປັນ 0, ຈຸດຂາວເປັນ 1, ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັບສີເທົາກາງ (18%) ຈະໄປຢູ່ເທິງແກນ x ຂອງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໃນອັດຕາສ່ວນ _ການຮັບແສງທຽບເທົ່າສີດຳ : ການຮັບແສງທຽບເທົ່າສີຂາວ_ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10 : 6.5, ຫຼື ປະມານ 0.61)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The curve is applied. This produces an output that is considered to be encoded according to the _gamma_. This can be considered as data ready to be displayed on a monitor using the specified gamma value (the gamma is only used for processing, and does not have to match the gamma of the display used for editing, or that of the output color space).\n"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ສ້າງຜົນການສະແດງອອກ (output) ທີ່ຖືວ່າຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດຕາມ _ແກມມາ (gamma)_. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດຖືວ່າເປັນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ພ້ອມຈະສະແດງຜົນເທິງຈໍພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າແກມມາທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ (ແກມມາແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປະມວນຜົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົງກັບແກມມາຂອງຈໍພາບທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ ຫຼື ແກມມາຂອງບໍລິເວນສີທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _look_ is applied in pure display-referred mode, like legacy editing of gamma-encoded images, and similar to editing sRGB JPGs in traditional editors. Except for _saturation_, these are also per-channel operations:\n"
msgstr "7. ນຳໃຊ້ _look_ ໃນໂໝດ display-referred.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "first the _slope_ and the _lift_\n"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມຈາກ _slope_ ແລະ _lift_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "then the _brightness_\n"
msgstr "ຕາມດ້ວຍ _brightness_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "finally the _saturation_\n"
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ _saturation_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each channel, the gamma-encoded data is linearized by applying `linear = gamma_encoded ^ gamma` (so it is scene-referred 0..1, but the encoding is linear, like always in darktable's pipeline; mid-gray is at 0.18)\n"
msgstr "8. ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກັບມາເປັນແບບລີເນຍຄືເກົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The HSV representation of the result is calculated. The resulting hue (from the H component) and the original hue are mixed together according to the _preserve hue_ setting to produce the final hue. This does not guarantee complete preservation of color, as the \"original\" hue was already recorded after the input matrix, and after this mix, the output matrix (see the next step) modifies colors again.\n"
msgstr "9. ຄຳນວນຄ່າ HSV ແລະ ປະສົມຄ່າສີ (hue) ເພື່ອຮັກສາສີຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The output matrix is applied to each channel, which:\n"
msgstr "10. ນຳໃຊ້ເມທຣິກຂາອອກກັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ, ເຊິ່ງຈະ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "performs the rotation reversal (this is a difference with _sigmoid_: the latter always completely reverses the rotation, in _AgX_, reversal is up to the user)\n"
msgstr "ເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ປີ້ນກັບການໝູນ (ສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນຂໍ້ແຕກຕ່າງກັບ _sigmoid_: ເຊິ່ງຢ່າງຫຼັງຈະປີ້ນກັບການໝູນທັງໝົດສະເໝີ, ແຕ່ໃນ _AgX_, ການປີ້ນກັບແມ່ນຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "applies the purity boost (just like _sigmoid_)\n"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ການເພີ່ມຄວາມບໍລິສຸດຂອງສີ (purity boost).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "converts the result back into the pipe working space.\n"
msgstr "ແປງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບກັບຄືນສູ່ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຂອງ pipeline.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/agx.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a deep dive into the theory and development behind AgX, the primary resource is the discussion thread on Blender Artists: [Feedback & Development - Filmic - Baby Step to a v2](https://blenderartists.org/t/feedback-development-filmic-baby-step-to-a-v2/1361663/).\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບທິດສະດີ ແລະ ການພັດທະນາ AgX, ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ Blender Artists.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tone equalizer"
msgstr "ຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ (tone equalizer)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": relight the scene as if the lighting was done directly on the scene.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ປັບແສງຂອງສາກໃໝ່ ຄືກັບວ່າການຈັດແສງນັ້ນໄດ້ເຮັດໂດຍກົງຢູ່ໃນສາກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dodge and burn while preserving local contrast.\n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຫຼຸດແສງ (Dodge and burn) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _tone equalizer_ module replaces the need for other tone-mapping modules such as the [_shadows and highlights_](./shadows-and-highlights.md), [_tone curve_](./tone-curve.md), [_zone system (deprecated)_](./zone-system.md), and similar modules. It works in linear RGB space and utilizes a user-defined mask to guide the dodging and burning adjustments, helping to preserve local contrast within the image.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ _ຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ_ ມາແທນທີ່ຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນການໃຊ້ໂມດູນ tone-mapping ອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ [_ເງົາ ແລະ ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ_](./shadows-and-highlights.md), [_ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນ_](./tone-curve.md), [_zone system (ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ)_](./zone-system.md), ແລະ ໂມດູນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ມັນເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ ແລະ ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບມາກສ໌ (mask) ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ ເພື່ອເປັນແນວທາງໃນການປັບເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຫຼຸດແສງ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍຮັກສາຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນພາຍໃນພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following diagram describes how the tone equalizer works:\n"
msgstr "ແຜນວາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![tone-equalizer-mask](./tone-equalizer/tone-equalizer-overview.png#w100)\n"
msgstr "![ມາກສ໌ຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ](./tone-equalizer/tone-equalizer-overview.png#w100)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a monochrome [_guided mask_](#masking-tab) that divides the input image into regions of similar luminosity. The resulting mask should blur the fine details within the image so that pixels within each region are all treated similarly, preserving local contrast.\n"
msgstr "1. ສ້າງ [_ມາກສ໌ນຳທາງ (guided mask)_](#masking-tab) ແບບຂາວດຳ ເຊິ່ງຈະແບ່ງພາບຂາເຂົ້າອອກເປັນສ່ວນໆທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ. ມາກສ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຄວນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນເບຼີລົງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພິກເຊວໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຖືກຈັດການໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນ ເຊິ່ງເປັນການຮັກສາຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the sliders in the [_simple_](#simple-tab) tab or the equalizer graph in the [_advanced_](#advanced-tab) tab to alter the brightness of the underlying image, based on the brightness of the mask. Exposure can also be adjusted by scrolling with the mouse while hovering the cursor over the preview image (see [_cursor indicator/control_](#cursor-indicatorcontrol) for details).\n"
msgstr "2. ປັບຕົວເລື່ອນໃນແຖບ [_ແບບງ່າຍ (simple)_](#simple-tab) ຫຼື ກຣາບອີຄວາໄລເຊີໃນແຖບ [_ຂັ້ນສູງ (advanced)_](#advanced-tab) ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພາບ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງມາກສ໌. ການເປີດຮັບແສງຍັງສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ (scroll wheel) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ວາງເຄີເຊີ (cursor) ໄວ້ເທິງພາບຕົວຢ່າງ (ເບິ່ງ [_ການສະແດງ/ຄວບຄຸມດ້ວຍເຄີເຊີ_](#cursor-indicatorcontrol) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "   In the simple tab, each slider corresponds to a single brightness zone (EV) in the mask, which can be raised or lowered to adjust the exposure of the image where the mask's brightness lies in that zone. Similarly, in the equalizer tab, the horizontal axis of the graph corresponds to the brightness level of the mask, and the vertical axis specifies the required exposure adjustment to pixels where the mask matches that brightness level. \n"
msgstr "   ໃນແຖບແບບງ່າຍ, ຕົວເລື່ອນແຕ່ລະອັນຈະກົງກັບໂຊນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (EV) ດຽວໃນມາກສ໌, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປັບຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ລົງເພື່ອປັບການເປີດຮັບແສງຂອງພາບໃນຈຸດທີ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງມາກສ໌ຢູ່ໃນໂຊນນັ້ນ. ໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນ, ໃນແຖບອີຄວາໄລເຊີ, ແກນນອນຂອງກຣາບຈະກົງກັບລະດັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງມາກສ໌, ແລະ ແກນຕັ້ງຈະກຳນົດການປັບການເປີດຮັບແສງທີ່ຕ້ອງການສຳລັບພິກເຊວທີ່ມາກສ໌ມີລະດັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງນັ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exposure of each pixel of the input image is adjusted using the mask and the equalizer graph. For each pixel, the module looks up the brightness of the mask at that point, finds the matching brightness on the horizontal axis of the equalizer graph, and increases or decreases the exposure accordingly (using the vertical axis of the graph). \n"
msgstr "3. ການເປີດຮັບແສງຂອງແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວຂອງພາບຂາເຂົ້າຈະຖືກປັບໂດຍໃຊ້ ມາກສ໌ ແລະ ກຣາບອີຄວາໄລເຊີ. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ, ໂມດູນຈະເບິ່ງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງມາກສ໌ຢູ່ຈຸດນັ້ນ, ຊອກຫາຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ກົງກັນໃນແກນນອນຂອງກຣາບອີຄວາໄລເຊີ, ແລະ ເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດການເປີດຮັບແສງຕາມນັ້ນ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ແກນຕັ້ງຂອງກຣາບ). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is important that the mask separates the image into regions of similar brightness, and that a suitable amount of blur is applied within those regions. This means that all of the pixels in each region will have their exposure adjusted similarly, without adversely affecting local contrast. Examine your image beforehand to identify which regions you wish to dodge and burn, and use the controls on the [_masking_](#masking-tab) tab to ensure that those areas are reasonably separated in tone within the final mask. This will allow those regions to be adjusted independently.\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງສຳຄັນຄື ມາກສ໌ຕ້ອງແຍກພາບອອກເປັນສ່ວນໆທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ, ແລະ ຕ້ອງມີການເບຼີໃນປະລິມານທີ່ເໝາະສົມພາຍໃນສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າພິກເຊວທັງໝົດໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຈະມີການປັບການເປີດຮັບແສງໃນລັກສະນະດຽວກັນ, ໂດຍບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ. ໃຫ້ກວດສອບພາບຂອງເຈົ້າກ່ອນເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າສ່ວນໃດທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດແສງ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມໃນແຖບ [_ການເຮັດມາກສ໌ (masking)_](#masking-tab) ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກແຍກໂທນສີອອກຈາກກັນຢ່າງເໝາະສົມໃນມາກສ໌ສຸດທ້າຍ. ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The controls of the _tone equalizer_ module are divided between three tabs. \n"
msgstr "ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຂອງໂມດູນ _ຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ_ ຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນສາມແຖບ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"display exposure mask\n"
": Click on the icon to the right of this label to show/hide the module's guided mask over the top of the image. This control is available in all three tabs.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງມາກສ໌ການເປີດຮັບແສງ\n"
": ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງປ້າຍກຳກັບນີ້ເພື່ອສະແດງ/ເຊື່ອງມາກສ໌ນຳທາງຂອງໂມດູນເທິງພາບ. ຕົວຄວບຄຸມນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນທັງສາມແຖບ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "simple tab"
msgstr "ແຖບແບບງ່າຍ (simple tab)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tab splits the brightness of the guided mask into nine zones (from --8 to 0 EV) and allows you to alter each zone independently. This is a simplified interface and is used to generate the same tone adjustment curve as shown in the [_advanced_](#advanced-tab) tab.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບນີ້ຈະແບ່ງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງມາກສ໌ນຳທາງອອກເປັນ 9 ໂຊນ (ຕັ້ງແຕ່ --8 ຫາ 0 EV) ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປັບແຕ່ລະໂຊນໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ. ນີ້ແມ່ນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແບບງ່າຍ ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງການປັບໂທນແບບດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ສະແດງໃນແຖບ [_ຂັ້ນສູງ_](#advanced-tab).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"--8 EV ... 0 EV\n"
": Each slider adjusts the exposure of all pixels where the _guided mask_ has the given brightness. If the mask's histogram is evenly spread over the entire tonal range, sliders towards the top generally affect the shadows, whereas sliders towards the bottom generally affect the highlights. You can check the spread of the histogram within the [_advanced_](#advanced-tab) tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"--8 EV ... 0 EV\n"
": ຕົວເລື່ອນແຕ່ລະອັນຈະປັບການເປີດຮັບແສງຂອງພິກເຊວທັງໝົດທີ່ _ມາກສ໌ນຳທາງ_ ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງນັ້ນໆ. ຫາກຮິສໂຕແກຣມຂອງມາກສ໌ກະຈາຍຕົວຢ່າງສະເໝີກັນທົ່ວທຸກຊ່ວງໂທນ, ຕົວເລື່ອນທາງດ້ານເທິງໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ສ່ວນເງົາ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຕົວເລື່ອນທາງດ້ານລຸ່ມຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກວດສອບການກະຈາຍຕົວຂອງຮິສໂຕແກຣມໄດ້ໃນແຖບ [_ຂັ້ນສູງ_](#advanced-tab).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "advanced tab"
msgstr "ແຖບຂັ້ນສູງ (advanced tab)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tab allows you to control the same intensity levels as in the simple tab, though here they are represented as control points on a curve. Behind the curve is a histogram representing the intensity levels of the _guided mask_ (not the underlying image). If the histogram is too bunched up, this means your mask doesn't have a good spread of intensity levels, which makes it harder to independently control the brightness of the different parts of your image. It is therefore recommended that the histogram be adjusted so that it extends the entire range, covering as many control points as possible for maximum flexibility. You can adjust the mask using the controls in the [_masking_](#masking-tab) tab.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຄວບຄຸມລະດັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນແບບດຽວກັນກັບໃນແຖບແບບງ່າຍ, ແຕ່ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ຈະສະແດງເປັນຈຸດຄວບຄຸມເທິງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ. ທາງຫຼັງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຈະມີຮິສໂຕແກຣມທີ່ສະແດງລະດັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນຂອງ _ມາກສ໌ນຳທາງ_ (ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂອງພາບຫຼັກ). ຫາກຮິສໂຕແກຣມສຸມຕົວຢູ່ບ່ອນດຽວຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ, ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມາກສ໌ຂອງເຈົ້າບໍ່ມີການກະຈາຍລະດັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນທີ່ດີ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຍາກໃນການຄວບຄຸມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສ່ວນຕ່າງໆໃນພາບແຍກກັນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງແນະນຳໃຫ້ປັບຮິສໂຕແກຣມໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍອອກໄປທົ່ວທຸກຊ່ວງ, ໃຫ້ກວມເອົາຈຸດຄວບຄຸມໃຫ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດເພື່ອຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນສູງສຸດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປັບມາກສ໌ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມໃນແຖບ [_ການເຮັດມາກສ໌_](#masking-tab).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click+drag the control points on the curve to adjust the brightness of all pixels where the mask has the given intensity. If the mask's histogram is evenly spread over the entire tonal range, control points to the left will generally affect the shadows, and control points to the right will generally affect the highlights. Moving a single control point will also affect control points on either side to ensure the curve remains smooth. This behaviour can be adjusted using the _curve smoothing_ control.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກຈຸດຄວບຄຸມເທິງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເພື່ອປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊວທັງໝົດທີ່ມາກສ໌ມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂຸ້ນນັ້ນໆ. ຫາກຮິສໂຕແກຣມຂອງມາກສ໌ກະຈາຍຕົວຢ່າງສະເໝີກັນ, ຈຸດຄວບຄຸມທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ສ່ວນເງົາ, ແລະ ຈຸດຄວບຄຸມທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ. ການຍ້າຍຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຈຸດດຽວຍັງຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຈຸດຂ້າງຄຽງເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຍັງຄົງນຸ້ມນວນ. ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມ _ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນຸ້ມນວນ (curve smoothing)_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curve smoothing\n"
": Control how the curve is interpolated between control points. Move the slider to the right to make the transitions between the control points more gradual, but beware that going past about 0.6 can introduce some instability (oscillations) in the curve due to mathematical constraints. Move the slider to the left for a more well-behaved curve, but beware that this can result in harsher tonal transitions that may damage local contrast.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນຸ້ມນວນ\n"
": ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການແຊກ (interpolation) ລະຫວ່າງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມ. ເລື່ອນຕົວເລື່ອນໄປທາງຂວາເພື່ອໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະຫວ່າງຈຸດຄວບຄຸມມີຄວາມຄ່ອຍເປັນຄ່ອຍໄປຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າຫາກເກີນ 0.6 ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງບໍ່ຄົງທີ່ (ເກີດການແກວ່ງ) ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທາງຄະນິດສາດ. ເລື່ອນຕົວເລື່ອນໄປທາງຊ້າຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງເປັນລະບຽບກວ່າ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່ານີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານໂທນສີແຂງເກີນໄປ ແລະ ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນເສຍຫາຍໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mask exposure compensation\n"
": Adjust the mask's histogram to the left or right. If you have used the _exposure_ module to adjust the image brightness, you may need to offset that adjustment by using this slider to re-centre the mask's histogram. Click on the wand icon to the right of the slider to set the exposure compensation such that the average of the mask's histogram will coincide with the central --4EV control point. The slider can then be fine-tuned as required.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຊົດເຊີຍການເປີດຮັບແສງຂອງມາກສ໌\n"
": ປັບຮິສໂຕແກຣມຂອງມາກສ໌ໄປທາງຊ້າຍ ຫຼື ຂວາ. ຫາກເຈົ້າໄດ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ _ການເປີດຮັບແສງ (exposure)_ ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພາບ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງຊົດເຊີຍການປັບນັ້ນໂດຍການໃຊ້ຕົວເລື່ອນນີ້ເພື່ອຈັດວາງຮິສໂຕແກຣມຂອງມາກສ໌ໃຫ້ຢູ່ຈຸດກາງຄືເກົ່າ. ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນໄມ້ກາຍະສິດທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງຕົວເລື່ອນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊົດເຊີຍ ໃຫ້ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍຂອງຮິສໂຕແກຣມຂອງມາກສ໌ກົງກັບຈຸດຄວບຄຸມກາງ --4EV. ຈາກນັ້ນສາມາດປັບຕົວເລື່ອນໃຫ້ລະອຽດໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mask contrast compensation\n"
": Dilate (spread out) or compress the mask's histogram. The wand icon to the right of the slider will propose a reasonable starting point, which can then be fine-tuned to optimize the spread of the histogram under the tone equalizer control points.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຊົດເຊີຍຄອນທຣາສຂອງມາກສ໌\n"
": ຂະຫຍາຍ (ແຜ່ອອກ) ຫຼື ບີບອັດຮິສໂຕແກຣມຂອງມາກສ໌. ໄອຄອນໄມ້ກາຍະສິດທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງຕົວເລື່ອນຈະສະເໜີຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດປັບໃຫ້ລະອຽດຕື່ມເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮິສໂຕແກຣມກະຈາຍຕົວໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດພາຍໃຕ້ຈຸດຄວບຄຸມຂອງຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "masking tab"
msgstr "ແຖບການເຮັດມາກສ໌ (masking tab)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tab contains controls for adjusting the guided mask. \n"
msgstr "ແຖບນີ້ມີຕົວຄວບຄຸມສຳລັບປັບມາກສ໌ນຳທາງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The purpose of the guided mask is to separate out areas with different tonal ranges so that they can be independently brightened or darkened by the tone equalizer. The masking filters are designed to allow sharp edges between these areas to be preserved, while blurring details within a given tonal range, so that the brightness can be adjusted without adversely impacting local contrast. Ideally the mask histogram shown in the _advanced_ tab should be spread out across all of the control points. \n"
msgstr "ຈຸດປະສົງຂອງມາກສ໌ນຳທາງຄືການແຍກພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີຊ່ວງໂທນສີຕ່າງກັນ ອອກເປັນສ່ວນໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບແຈ້ງ ຫຼື ມືດໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະດ້ວຍຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ. ຟິວເຕີການເຮັດມາກສ໌ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດຮັກສາຂອບທີ່ຄົມຊັດລະຫວ່າງພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດພາຍໃນຊ່ວງໂທນນັ້ນເບຼີລົງ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຕໍ່ຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ. ຕາມທີ່ເໝາະສົມແລ້ວ ຮິສໂຕແກຣມຂອງມາກສ໌ທີ່ສະແດງໃນແຖບ _ຂັ້ນສູງ_ ຄວນຈະກະຈາຍຕົວໄປທົ່ວທຸກຈຸດຄວບຄຸມ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When setting up the guided mask you will need to strike a balance between obtaining a smooth blur within tonal regions (to preserve local contrast) and preservation of the boundaries between those regions. Some experimentation will be required to find the best settings. Often the key controls to adjust are the _exposure/contrast compensation_ sliders at the bottom of the module.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າມາກສ໌ນຳທາງ ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງຊອກຫາຄວາມສົມດຸນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດໃຫ້ການເບຼີນຸ້ມນວນພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ໂທນສີ (ເພື່ອຮັກສາຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ) ແລະ ການຮັກສາຂອບເຂດລະຫວ່າງພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ອາດຈະຕ້ອງມີການທົດລອງເພື່ອຊອກຫາການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ສ່ວນຫຼາຍຕົວຄວບຄຸມຫຼັກທີ່ຕ້ອງປັບຄືຕົວເລື່ອນ _ການຊົດເຊີຍການເປີດຮັບແສງ/ຄອນທຣາສ_ ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Displaying the guided mask while making these adjustments will help you to understand these controls and better judge the quality of the mask.\n"
msgstr "ການສະແດງມາກສ໌ນຳທາງໃນຂະນະທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຂົ້າໃຈຕົວຄວບຄຸມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ສາມາດຕັດສິນຄຸນນະພາບຂອງມາກສ໌ໄດ້ດີກວ່າເກົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"luminance estimator\n"
": Choose the method by which the luminance of a pixel will be estimated when mapping it to a mask intensity value (default _RGB euclidean norm_).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄາດຄະເນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance estimator)\n"
": ເລືອກວິທີທີ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊວຈະຖືກຄາດຄະເນເມື່ອຈັບຄູ່ກັບຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງມາກສ໌ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄື _RGB euclidean norm_).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preserve details\n"
": Choose the smoothing algorithm used to blur the mask: \n"
" - _no:_ Do not smooth the mask (the effect is the same as using normal tone curves). When the module is used to compress dynamic range, this option can cause compression of local contrast. This can be useful when increasing (local and global) contrast.\n"
" - _guided filter:_ Use the original guided filter algorithm to blur the mask while attempting to preserve edges. One of the limitations of this algorithm is that the guided filter is exposure-sensitive, meaning that shadows tend to be blurred more than highlights. Note that this limitation can sometimes be an asset: if one wants to lighten shadows a lot, the guided filter can provide very good local contrast preservation.\n"
" - _average guided filter:_ Use this option in cases where the effect of the guided filter is too strong. In this mode, a geometric mean is taken between the output of the original _guided filter_ algorithm and the output given by the _no_ option. \n"
" - _eigf (default):_ The _exposure-independent guided filter_ solves the problem of the original _guided filter_, in that it makes the degree of blurring independent of the exposure. This means the degree of blurring applied to the highlights and the shadows regions should be about the same. This improved algorithm is now the default option.\n"
" - _averaged eigf:_ This option takes the geometric mean between the _eigf_ mask and the mask generated by the _no_ option, and is useful in cases where the degree of blurring in the mask needs to be mitigated.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ເລືອກອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຮັດໃຫ້ນຸ້ມນວນທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອເບຼີມາກສ໌: \n"
" - _no:_ ບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ມາກສ໌ນຸ້ມນວນ (ເອັບເຟັກຈະຄືກັບການໃຊ້ເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນປົກກະຕິ). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂມດູນເພື່ອບີບອັດໄດນາມິກເຣນຈ໌, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນຖືກບີບອັດນຳ. ນີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສ (ທັງສະເພາະສ່ວນ ແລະ ໂດຍລວມ).\n"
" - _guided filter:_ ໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ guided filter ດັ້ງເດີມເພື່ອເບຼີມາກສ໌ໃນຂະນະທີ່ພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຂອບ. ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຄື ມັນໄວຕໍ່ການເປີດຮັບແສງ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສ່ວນເງົາມັກຈະຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ເບຼີຫຼາຍກວ່າສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າບາງຄັ້ງຂໍ້ຈຳກັດນີ້ກໍເປັນຂໍ້ດີ: ຫາກຕ້ອງການປັບເງົາໃຫ້ແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍໆ, guided filter ສາມາດຮັກສາຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນໄດ້ດີຫຼາຍ.\n"
" - _average guided filter:_ ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ເອັບເຟັກຂອງ guided filter ແຮງເກີນໄປ. ໃນໂໝດນີ້, ຈະມີການຫາຄ່າສະເລ່ຍເລຂາຄະນິດລະຫວ່າງຜົນລັດຂອງ guided filter ດັ້ງເດີມ ກັບຜົນລັດຈາກຕົວເລືອກ _no_.\n"
" - _eigf (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ):_ _exposure-independent guided filter_ ຈະແກ້ບັນຫາຂອງ guided filter ດັ້ງເດີມ ໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ລະດັບການເບຼີບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບການເປີດຮັບແສງ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າລະດັບການເບຼີທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ສ່ວນເງົາຈະໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ. ອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ປັບປຸງໃໝ່ນີ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
" - _averaged eigf:_ ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຫາຄ່າສະເລ່ຍເລຂາຄະນິດລະຫວ່າງມາກສ໌ _eigf_ ແລະ ມາກສ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຈາກຕົວເລືອກ _no_, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຕ້ອງການຫຼຸດລະດັບການເບຼີໃນມາກສ໌ລົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"filter diffusion\n"
": By default this is set to a value of 1, meaning that the filtering algorithm is run once on the input image to produce the blurred monochrome mask.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການກະຈາຍຟິວເຕີ (filter diffusion)\n"
": ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ທີ່ 1, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າອັນກໍຣິທຶມຟິວເຕີຈະເຮັດວຽກຄັ້ງດຽວກັບພາບຂາເຂົ້າເພື່ອສ້າງມາກສ໌ຂາວດຳທີ່ເບຼີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If you increase this to 2, the filtering algorithm will be run once on the input image to produce an intermediate mask, and then a second time on the intermediate mask. As a result, the final mask will be more blurred than when using a single iteration. Progressively higher values will diffuse the mask even further. However, because the mask filtering algorithm is run multiple times, each iteration will increase the processing time.\n"
msgstr ": ຫາກເຈົ້າເພີ່ມເປັນ 2, ອັນກໍຣິທຶມຟິວເຕີຈະເຮັດວຽກຄັ້ງທຳອິດກັບພາບຂາເຂົ້າເພື່ອສ້າງມາກສ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວ, ແລະ ເຮັດວຽກຄັ້ງທີສອງກັບມາກສ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວນັ້ນ. ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຄື ມາກສ໌ສຸດທ້າຍຈະເບຼີຫຼາຍກວ່າການເຮັດວຽກພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນເລື້ອຍໆຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມາກສ໌ກະຈາຍຕົວຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເພາະອັນກໍຣິທຶມຟິວເຕີມາກສ໌ຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກຫຼາຍຮອບ, ແຕ່ລະຮອບທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເວລາໃນການປະມວນຜົນເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນນຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"smoothing diameter\n"
": This controls how much of the surrounding image to take into account when calculating the mask's blur at a particular point, defined as a percentage of the length of the image's longer side (default 5%). With lower values, the transition between darker and lighter areas of the mask will be more pronounced. As the value is increased, transitions become smoother/softer. For the default _exposure-independent guided filter (eigf)_, you should typically use blurring radii around 1-10%. With the original _guided filter_, blurring radii around 1-25% will typically yield better results.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນຜ່າສູນກາງຄວາມນຸ້ມນວນ\n"
": ນີ້ຄວບຄຸມວ່າຈະເອົາພາບບໍລິເວນອ້ອມຂ້າງມາພິຈາລະນາຫຼາຍປານໃດໃນການຄິດໄລ່ການເບຼີຂອງມາກສ໌ໃນແຕ່ລະຈຸດ, ໂດຍກຳນົດເປັນເປີເຊັນຂອງຄວາມຍາວດ້ານທີ່ຍາວທີ່ສຸດຂອງພາບ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 5%). ຫາກຄ່ານ້ອຍ, ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານລະຫວ່າງພື້ນທີ່ມືດ ແລະ ແຈ້ງຂອງມາກສ໌ຈະເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ. ເມື່ອເພີ່ມຄ່າ, ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານຈະນຸ້ມນວນຂຶ້ນ. ສຳລັບ _eigf_ ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຄວນໃຊ້ລັດສະໝີການເບຼີປະມານ 1-10%. ສ່ວນ _guided filter_ ດັ້ງເດີມ, ລັດສະໝີປະມານ 1-25% ມັກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ດີກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"edges refinement/feathering\n"
": Higher values force the mask to follow high contrast edges more closely. Lower values give smoother gradients, but may introduce halos. If required, feathering can be set to values as high as 10,000.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປັບແຕ່ງຂອບ/ການເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຟຸ້ງ (feathering)\n"
": ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມາກສ໌ຕິດຕາມຂອບທີ່ມີຄອນທຣາສສູງໄດ້ແນບນຽນຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳລົງຈະໃຫ້ການໄລ່ສີທີ່ນຸ້ມນວນກວ່າ, ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂອບຟຸ້ງ (halos). ຫາກຈຳເປັນ, ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ feathering ໄດ້ສູງເຖິງ 10,000.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mask quantization\n"
": Apply a degree of posterization to the mask, so that it tends to centre round a few discrete levels. In some cases, this may be useful to help separate out areas of your image into distinct masking levels.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດໃຫ້ມາກສ໌ເປັນຂັ້ນ (mask quantization)\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ການເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເປັນຂັ້ນ (posterization) ກັບມາກສ໌, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສຸມຕົວຢູ່ອ້ອມລະດັບທີ່ແຍກກັນຊັດເຈນບາງລະດັບ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ນີ້ອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຊ່ວຍແຍກພື້ນທີ່ຂອງພາບອອກເປັນລະດັບມາກສ໌ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "cursor indicator/control"
msgstr "ການສະແດງ/ຄວບຄຸມດ້ວຍເຄີເຊີ (cursor indicator/control)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the _tone equalizer_ module is enabled and expanded, you can move the mouse pointer over the preview image to show a cursor that displays information about the pixel under the pointer. When this cursor is shown, the mouse wheel can be used to brighten or darken the areas of your image that match the mask intensity level at that point. This provides a convenient way to quickly brighten or darken specific parts of the image.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໂມດູນ _ຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ_ ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ຂະຫຍາຍອອກ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ໄປເທິງພາບຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອສະແດງເຄີເຊີທີ່ບອກຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບພິກເຊວຢູ່ໃຕ້ເຄີເຊີນັ້ນ. ເມື່ອເຄີເຊີນີ້ສະແດງຂຶ້ນ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອປັບໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ຂອງພາບແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ມືດລົງ ຕາມລະດັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງມາກສ໌ຢູ່ຈຸດນັ້ນ. ນີ້ເປັນວິທີທີ່ສະດວກໃນການປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສ່ວນຕ່າງໆໃນພາບໄດ້ຢ່າງໄວວາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![tone-equalizer-simple](./tone-equalizer/tone-equalizer-cursor.png#w25)\n"
msgstr "![ເຄີເຊີຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ](./tone-equalizer/tone-equalizer-cursor.png#w25)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the cross-hairs indicate the position of the pixel under the cursor\n"
msgstr "- ເສັ້ນກາກບາດບອກຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງພິກເຊວຢູ່ໃຕ້ເຄີເຊີ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the text label shows the intensity of the guided mask at that point, in EV\n"
msgstr "- ປ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມສະແດງຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງມາກສ໌ນຳທາງຢູ່ຈຸດນັ້ນ ເປັນໜ່ວຍ EV\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "the shade of the outer circle indicates the intensity of the mask at that point\n"
msgstr "- ສີຂອງວົງມົນຊັ້ນນອກບອກລະດັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງມາກສ໌ຢູ່ຈຸດນັ້ນ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "if the tone equalizer has brightened or darkened pixels matching this mask intensity, the magnitude of the adjustment is indicated by an arc on the left-hand-side. The longer the arc, the greater the brightness adjustment,\n"
msgstr "- ຫາກຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນໄດ້ມີການປັບໃຫ້ພິກເຊວທີ່ກົງກັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມມາກສ໌ນີ້ແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ມືດລົງ, ປະລິມານການປັບຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຢູ່ທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍ. ຍິ່ງເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຍາວ, ການປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງກໍຍິ່ງຫຼາຍ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "if there has been an exposure adjustment, the shade of the inner circle indicates the amount of brightening or darkening, relative to the mask's intensity at that point (as indicated by the outer gray circle). That is to say, if the pixel under the crosshairs has been brightened, the inner circle will be a lighter shade of gray than the outer circle; if the pixel has been darkened, the inner circle will be a darker shade of gray than the outer circle.\n"
msgstr "- ຫາກມີການປັບການເປີດຮັບແສງ, ສີຂອງວົງມົນຊັ້ນໃນຈະບອກປະລິມານການປັບແຈ້ງ ຫຼື ມືດ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງມາກສ໌ຢູ່ຈຸດນັ້ນ (ທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍວົງມົນສີເທີົາຊັ້ນນອກ). ກໍຄືວ່າ ຫາກພິກເຊວໃຕ້ກາກບາດຖືກປັບໃຫ້ແຈ້ງຂຶ້ນ, ວົງມົນຊັ້ນໃນຈະເປັນສີເທີົາທີ່ແຈ້ງກວ່າວົງມົນຊັ້ນນອກ; ຫາກພິກເຊວຖືກປັບໃຫ້ມືດລົງ, ວົງມົນຊັ້ນໃນຈະເປັນສີເທີົາທີ່ມືດກວ່າວົງມົນຊັ້ນນອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you need to move or zoom the portion of the image shown in the center view while the module is expanded, hold down the 'a' key while dragging the mouse or using the scroll wheel.  As long as the key is held down, mouse actions adjust the viewport rather than adjusting the tone curve.\n"
msgstr "ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ຊູມສ່ວນຂອງພາບທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນມຸມມອງກາງໃນຂະນະທີ່ໂມດູນຖືກຂະຫຍາຍອອກ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ 'a' ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ລໍ້ເມົາສ໌. ຕາບໃດທີ່ປຸ່ມນີ້ຍັງຖືກກົດຄ້າງໄວ້, ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງເມົາສ໌ຈະເປັນການປັບມຸມມອງ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການປັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງໂທນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/tone-equalizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _tone equalizer_ comes with several presets that can use used to compress shadows and highlights. Each comes in two variants, using either the guided filter (gf) or the exposure-independent guided filter (eigf). The variants using the guided filter tend to preserve local contrast in the shadows better those that use the exposure-independent guided filter, but at the price of reducing the local contrast in the highlights. Either of these variants may lead to better results, depending on the image. In both cases, the presets preserve middle-gray, so you shouldn't need to adjust the global exposure after activating the tone equalizer.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ _ຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ_ ມາພ້ອມກັບຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets) ຫຼາຍແບບ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອບີບອັດເງົາ ແລະ ສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງ. ແຕ່ລະແບບຈະມີສອງລຸ້ນຍ່ອຍ ຄືໃຊ້ guided filter (gf) ຫຼື exposure-independent guided filter (eigf). ລຸ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ guided filter ມັກຈະຮັກສາຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນໃນເງົາໄດ້ດີກວ່າ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງແລກມາກັບການຫຼຸດຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນໃນສ່ວນສະຫວ່າງລົງ. ລຸ້ນໃດຈະໃຫ້ຜົນດີກວ່ານັ້ນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບແຕ່ລະພາບ. ໃນທັງສອງກໍລະນີ, presets ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຮັກສາສີເທີົາປານກາງໄວ້, ດັ່ງນັ້ນເຈົ້າຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບການເປີດຮັບແສງໂດຍລວມໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວປັບສົມດຸນໂທນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "highpass"
msgstr "ໄຮພາດ (highpass)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": isolate high frequencies in the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳອະທິບາຍ\n"
": ແຍກຄວາມຖີ່ສູງໃນຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A high pass filter. \n"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງຄວາມຖີ່ສູງ (high pass filter). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module is primarily intended to be used in combination with a [_blend mode_](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md). For example, try using the module with a blend mode of \"soft light\" for high pass sharpening.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງຫຼັກເພື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [_ໂໝດການປະສົມ (blend mode)_](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md). ຕົວຢ່າງ: ລອງໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້ຮ່ວມກັບໂໝດການປະສົມ \"soft light\" ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບຄົມຊັດແບບໄຮພາດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_**Note:** This module performs blurs in Lab color space, which can result in undesirable effects, and is no longer recommended. Instead, use the [contrast equalizer](./contrast-equalizer.md) module for fine sharpness or the [local contrast](./local-contrast.md) module for general sharpness._\n"
msgstr ""
"_**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ໂມດູນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ Lab, ເຊິ່ງອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບທີ່ບໍ່ເພິ່ງປະສົງ, ແລ"
"ະ ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [contrast equalizer](./contrast-equalizer.md) ສຳລັ"
"ບຄວາມຄົມຊັດລະອຽດ ຫຼື ໂມດູນ [local contrast](./local-contrast.md) ສຳລັບຄວາມຄົມຊັດທົ່ວໄປແ"
"ທນ._\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Module Controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sharpness\n"
": The sharpness of the filter\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (sharpness)\n"
": ຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງຕົວຕອງ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/highpass.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"contrast boost\n"
": The contrast boost\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສ (contrast boost)\n"
": ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຕ່າງລະດັບສີ\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "crop"
msgstr "ຕັດຂອບ (crop)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": change the framing.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ປ່ຽນການຈັດເຟຣມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Crop an image using on-screen guides.\n"
msgstr "ຕັດຂອບຮູບໂດຍໃຊ້ເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳເທິງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module appears later in the pipeline than the deprecated [_crop and rotate_](./crop-rotate.md) module, meaning that the full image can remain available for source spots in the [_retouch_](./retouch.md) module. For best results, you are advised to use the [_rotate and perspective_](./rotate-perspective.md) module to perform rotation and perspective correction (if required), and then perform final creative cropping with this module.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ປະກົດຂຶ້ນໃນລຳດັບທໍ່ປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຫຼັງກວ່າໂມດູນ [_crop and rotate_](./crop-rotate.md) ທີ່ເລີກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຮູບພາບເຕັມຍັງຄົງມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຈຸດຕົ້ນທາງໃນໂມດູນ [_retouch_](./retouch.md). ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນດີທີ່ສຸດ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_rotate and perspective_](./rotate-perspective.md) ເພື່ອໝູນຮູບ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂທັດສະນີຍະພາບ (ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ), ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງມາຕັດຂອບຂັ້ນສຸດທ້າຍດ້ວຍໂມດູນນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Whenever this module is in focus, the full uncropped image will be shown, overlaid with crop handles and optional guiding lines.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນນີ້, ຮູບພາບເຕັມທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັດຂອບຈະສະແດງອອກມາ, ພ້ອມກັບປຸ່ມປັບການຕັດຂອບ ແລະ ເສັ້ນຄຳແນະນຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![screen controls](./crop/screen-controls.png#w75)\n"
msgstr "![screen controls](./crop/screen-controls.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resize the crop by dragging the border and corner handles. During resizing, the dimensions (in pixels) and aspect ratio of the crop are shown in the center of the crop area.\n"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດການຕັດຂອບໂດຍການລາກທີ່ຂອບ ຫຼື ມຸມ. ໃນລະຫວ່າງການປັບຂະໜາດ, ຂະໜາດ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ) ແລະ ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງການຕັດຂອບຈະສະແດງຢູ່ກາງພື້ນທີ່ຕັດຂອບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _crop_ module controls are split into two sections as follows:\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນໂມດູນ _ຕັດຂອບ_ ຈະແຍກອອກເປັນສອງສ່ວນ ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "crop settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຕັດຂອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"aspect\n"
": Set the aspect ratio of the crop, constraining the width:height ratio of the crop rectangle to the chosen aspect. Many common numerical ratios are pre-defined. A few special aspect ratios deserve explanation:\n"
": - _freehand_: Crop without any restrictions\n"
": - _original image_: Retain the aspect ratio of the original image\n"
": - _square_: Constrains the aspect ratio to be 1:1\n"
": - _golden cut_: The golden ratio (1.62:1)\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນ (aspect)\n"
": ກຳນົດອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງການຕັດຂອບ, ໂດຍບັງຄັບອັດຕາສ່ວນ ກວ້າງ:ສູງ ຂອງກອບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມໃຫ້ເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ເລືອກ. ມີອັດຕາສ່ວນຕົວເລກທົ່ວໄປທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ແລ້ວຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ອັດຕາສ່ວນພິເສດບາງຢ່າງມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
": - _ຕາມໃຈ (freehand)_: ຕັດຂອບໂດຍບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໃດໆ\n"
": - _ຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ (original image)_: ຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຮູບເດີມໄວ້\n"
": - _ສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຈັດຕຸລັດ (square)_: ບັງຄັບອັດຕາສ່ວນໃຫ້ເປັນ 1:1\n"
": - _ສັດສ່ວນຄຳ (golden cut)_: ອັດຕາສ່ວນຄຳ (1.62:1)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You can also enter any other ratio after opening the combobox by typing it in the form of \"x:y\" or as a decimal (e.g. \"0.5\" to apply a ratio of 2:1).\n"
msgstr ": ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປ້ອນອັດຕາສ່ວນອື່ນໆໄດ້ໂດຍການພິມໃນຮູບແບບ \"x:y\" ຫຼື ເປັນທົດສະນິຍົມ (ເຊັ່ນ \"0.5\" ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ອັດຕາສ່ວນ 2:1).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The button beside the aspect combobox allows you to switch between portrait and landscape orientation if you have selected a rectangular aspect ratio.\n"
msgstr ": ປຸ່ມຂ້າງຊ່ອງເລືອກອັດຕາສ່ວນ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ ແນວນອນ ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກອັດຕາສ່ວນແບບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຜືນຜ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/crop.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If you want to add an aspect ratio to the pre-defined drop-down list you can do this by including a line of the form \"`plugins/darkroom/clipping/extra_aspect_ratios/foo=x:y`\" in darktable's configuration file `darktablerc` in the [configuration directory](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). Here \"`foo`\" defines the name of the new aspect ratio and “`x`” and “`y`” the corresponding numerical values (`x` and `y` must be integers). Note that you can only add new entries for ratios not already present in the drop-down list. You can not use fractions as the actual crop size, however you can for the name. For example, if you want an aspect ratio of 1.91:1, add the following to your darktablerc file: `plugins/darkroom/clipping/extra_aspect_ratios/1.91:1=191:100`\n"
msgstr ""
": ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ (aspect ratio) ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ກ່ອນແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເ"
"ຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມແຖວໃນຮູບແບບ \"`plugins/darkroom/clipping/extra_aspect_ratios/"
"foo=x:y`\" ໃນໄຟລ໌ກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ darktable ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ `darktablerc` ໃນ [configuration "
"directory](../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). ໃນທີ່ນີ້ \"`foo`\" ແມ່"
"ນການກຳນົດຊື່ຂອງອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບໃໝ່ ແລະ “`x`” ກັບ “`y`” ແມ່ນຄ່າຕົວເລກທີ່ກົງກັນ (`x` ແລະ `y` ຕ້ອງເ"
"ປັນເລກຖ້ວນ). ໝາຍເຫດ ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມໄດ້ສະເພາະອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລາຍການເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເ"
"ລກເສດສ່ວນເປັນຂະໜາດຕັດຕົວຈິງໄດ້, ແຕ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຊື່ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການອັດຕາສ່ວນ 1.91:1, ໃ"
"ຫ້ເພີ່ມສິ່ງນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ darktablerc ຂອງທ່ານ: `plugins/darkroom/clipping/"
"extra_aspect_ratios/1.91:1=191:100`\n"

