#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A fully-featured color-space correction, white balance adjustment and channel mixer module.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ຄົບເຄື່ອງສຳລັບການປັບແກ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ, ການປັບຄວາມສົດດຸນສີຂາວ ແລະ ການປະສົມຊ່ອງສັນຍານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This simple yet powerful module can be used in the following ways:\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນທີ່ງ່າຍແຕ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນວິທີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To adjust the white balance ([chromatic adaptation](#white-balance-in-the-chromatic-adaptation-transformation-cat-tab)), working in tandem with the [_white balance_](./white-balance.md) module. Here, the _white balance_ module makes some initial adjustments (required for the [_demosaic_](./demosaic.md) module to work effectively), and the _color calibration_ module then calculates a more perceptually-accurate white balance after the input color profile has been applied.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວ ([ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ](#white-balance-in-the-chromatic-adaptation-transformation-cat-tab)), ໂດຍເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບໂມດູນ [_white balance_](./white-balance.md). ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ໂມດູນ _white balance_ ຈະເຮັດການປັບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ (ເຊິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບໂມດູນ [_demosaic_](./demosaic.md)), ແລະ ຈາກນັ້ນໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ຈະຄຳນວນຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມການຮັບຮູ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ input color profile ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As a simple RGB [channel mixer](#channel-mixing), adjusting the R, G and B output channels based on the R, G and B input channels, to perform cross-talk color-grading.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເປັນ [ຕົວປະສົມຊ່ອງສັນຍານ](#channel-mixing) RGB ແບບງ່າຍໆ, ໂດຍປັບຊ່ອງຂາອອກ R, G ແລະ B ອີງຕາມຊ່ອງຂາເຂົ້າ R, G ແລະ B, ເພື່ອເຮັດການປັບໂທນສີແບບ cross-talk.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To adjust the [color saturation and brightness](#brightness-and-colorfulness-tabs) of the image, based on the relative strength of the R, G and B channels of each pixel.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບ [ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ](#brightness-and-colorfulness-tabs) ຂອງຮູບພາບ, ອີງຕາມຄວາມແຮງທີ່ສຳພັນກັນຂອງຊ່ອງສີ R, G ແລະ B ຂອງແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To produce a [grayscale output](#gray-tab) based on the relative strengths of the R, G and B channels, in a way similar to the response of black and white film to a light spectrum.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງ [ຜົນອອກເປັນຮູບຂາວດຳ](#gray-tab) ອີງຕາມຄວາມແຮງທີ່ສຳພັນກັນຂອງຊ່ອງ R, G ແລະ B, ໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບການຕອບສະໜອງຂອງຟີມຂາວດຳຕໍ່ກັບສະເປັກຕຳຂອງແສງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To improve the color accuracy of the input color profile using a [color checker](#extracting-settings-using-a-color-checker) chart.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງສີຂອງ input color profile ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຜ່ນ [ທຽບສີ (color checker)](#extracting-settings-using-a-color-checker).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "White Balance in the Chromatic Adaptation Transformation (CAT) tab"
msgstr "ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວໃນແຖບການປ່ຽນແປງເພື່ອປັບຕົວຕາມສີ (CAT)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chromatic adaptation aims to predict how all surfaces in the scene would look if they had been lit by another illuminant. What we actually want to predict, though, is how those surfaces would have looked if they had been lit by the same illuminant as your monitor, in order to make all colors in the scene match the change of illuminant. White balance, on the other hand, aims only at ensuring that whites and grays are really neutral (R = G = B) and doesn’t really care about the rest of the color range. White balance is therefore only a partial chromatic adaptation.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ (Chromatic adaptation) ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອຄາດການວ່າພື້ນຜິວທັງໝົດໃນສາກຈະເບິ່ງຄືແນວໃ"
"ດ ຖ້າພວກມັນຖືກສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງດ້ວຍແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ (illuminant) ອື່ນ. ແຕ່ສິ່ງທີ່ພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງການຄາດການແທ້"
"ໆແມ່ນ ພື້ນຜິວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະເບິ່ງຄືແນວໃດຖ້າພວກມັນຖືກສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງດ້ວຍແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງອັນດຽວກັບຈໍມໍນິເຕີຂອງທ່ານ, "
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສີທັງໝົດໃນສາກກົງກັບການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ. ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວ "
"(White balance) ມີຈຸດປະສົງພຽງແຕ່ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າສີຂາວ ແລະ ສີເທົາມີຄວາມເປັນກາງແທ້ໆ (R = G "
"= B) ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ສົນໃຈສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງຊ່ວງສີ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວຈຶ່ງເປັນພຽງສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ"
"ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chromatic adaptation is controlled within the Chromatic Adaptation Transformation (CAT) tab of the _color calibration_ module. When used in this way the _white balance_ module is still required as it needs to perform a basic white balance operation (connected to the input color profile values). This technical white balancing (\"camera reference\" mode) is a flat setting that makes grays lit by a standard D65 illuminant look achromatic, and makes the demosaicing process more accurate, but does not perform any perceptual adaptation according to the scene. The actual chromatic adaptation is then performed by the _color calibration_ module, on top of those corrections performed by the _white balance_ and _input color profile_ modules. The use of custom matrices in the _input color profile_ module is therefore discouraged. Additionally, the RGB coefficients in the _white balance_ module need to be accurate in order for this module to work in a predictable way.\n"
msgstr "ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີແມ່ນຖືກຄວບຄຸມພາຍໃນແຖບ Chromatic Adaptation Transformation (CAT) ຂອງໂມດູນ _color calibration_. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນວິທີນີ້ ໂມດູນ _white balance_ ຍັງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ ເພາະມັນຕ້ອງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ປັບຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວຂັ້ນພື້ນຖານ. ການປັບສົມດຸນສີຂາວທາງເຕັກນິກນີ້ (ໂໝດ \"camera reference\") ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບພຽງໆ ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ສີເທົາທີ່ຖືກສ່ອງດ້ວຍແສງ D65 ມາດຕະຖານເບິ່ງເປັນກາງ ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການ demosaicing ຖືກຕ້ອງຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດການປັບຕົວຕາມການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງສາກ. ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີແທ້ໆ ຈະຖືກເຮັດໂດຍໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ຢູ່ເທິງການປັບແກ້ຂອງໂມດູນ _white balance_ ແລະ _input color profile_. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ custom matrices ໃນໂມດູນ _input color profile_. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຄ່າສຳປະສິດ RGB ໃນໂມດູນ _white balance_ ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂມດູນນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _color calibration_ and _white balance_ modules can be automatically applied to perform chromatic adaptation for new edits by setting the chromatic adaptation workflow option ([preferences > processing > auto-apply chromatic adaptation defaults](../../preferences-settings/processing.md)) to \"modern\". If you prefer to perform all white balancing within the _white balance_ module, a \"legacy\" option is also provided. Neither option precludes the use of other modules (such as [_color balance RGB_](./color-balance-rgb.md)) for creative color grading further along the pixel pipeline.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ແລະ _white balance_ ສາມາດຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອປັບຕົວຕາມສີສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂໃໝ່ ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກລະບົບການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ ([preferences > processing > auto-apply chromatic adaptation defaults](../../preferences-settings/processing.md)) ເປັນ \"modern\". ຖ້າເຈົ້າມັກປັບຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວທັງໝົດພາຍໃນໂມດູນ _white balance_, ກໍມີຕົວເລືອກ \"legacy\" ໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ທັງສອງຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຫ້າມການໃຊ້ໂມດູນອື່ນໆ (ເຊັ່ນ [_color balance RGB_](./color-balance-rgb.md)) ສຳລັບການປັບໂທນສີເພື່ອການສ້າງສັນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, _color calibration_ performs chromatic adaptation by:\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, _color calibration_ ຈະເຮັດການປັບຕົວຕາມສີໂດຍ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reading the RAW file's Exif data to fetch the scene white balance set by the camera,\n"
msgstr "ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງໄຟລ໌ RAW ເພື່ອດຶງຄ່າຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວຂອງສາກທີ່ຕັ້ງໂດຍກ້ອງ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "adjusting this setting using the camera reference white balance from the _white balance_ module,\n"
msgstr "ປັບການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າອ້າງອີງຈາກກ້ອງ (camera reference) ຈາກໂມດູນ _white balance_,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "further adjusting this setting with the input color profile in use (standard matrix only).\n"
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຕື່ມອີກດ້ວຍ input color profile ທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່ (ສະເພາະມາດຕະຖານ matrix ເທົ່ານັ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For consistency, the _color calibration_ module's default settings always assume that the standard matrix is used in the _input color profile_ module -- any non-standard settings in this module are ignored. However, _color calibration_'s defaults can read any auto-applied preset in the _white balance_ module.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຄວາມສະໝ່ຳສະເໝີ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ຈະສົມມຸດສະເໝີວ່າໃຊ້ standard matrix ໃນໂມດູນ _input color profile_ -- ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານໃນໂມດູນນັ້ນຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ _color calibration_ ສາມາດອ່ານ preset ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນໂມດູນ _white balance_ ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is also worth noting that, unlike the _white balance_ module, _color calibration_ can be used with [masks](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md). This means that you can selectively correct different parts of the image to account for differing light sources.\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນຮູ້ຄື, ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກໂມດູນ _white balance_, ໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ [masks](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/_index.md) ໄດ້. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກປັບແກ້ສະເພາະບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບ ເພື່ອຈັດການກັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To achieve this, create an instance of the _color calibration_ module to perform global adjustments using a mask to exclude those parts of the image that you wish to handle differently. Then create a second instance of the module reusing the mask from the first instance (inverted) using a [raster mask](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md).\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ instance ຂອງໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າໂດຍລວມ ໂດຍໃຊ້ mask ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນສ່ວນຂອງຮູບທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈັດການຕ່າງອອກໄປ. ຈາກນັ້ນສ້າງ instance ທີສອງຂອງໂມດູນ ໂດຍໃຊ້ mask ເດີມຈາກອັນທຳອິດ (ແບບກັບດ້ານ) ໂດຍໃຊ້ [raster mask](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/raster.md).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "CAT tab workflow"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກໃນແຖບ CAT"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The default illuminant and color space used by the chromatic adaptation are initialised from the Exif metadata of the RAW file \"as set in camera\".\n"
msgstr "ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ສີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ ຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງໄຟລ໌ RAW \"ຕາມທີ່ຕັ້ງໃນກ້ອງ\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternatively you can use the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) (to the right of the color patch) to select a neutral color from the image or, if one is unavailable, select the entire image. In this case, the algorithm finds the average color within the chosen area and sets that color as the illuminant. This method relies on the \"gray-world\" assumption, which predicts that the average color of a natural scene will be neutral. This method will not work for artificial scenes, for example those with painted surfaces.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼື ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [ຕົວເລືອກສີ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) (ທາງຂວາຂອງແຜ່ນສີ) ເພື່ອເລືອກສີທີ່ເປັນກາງຈາກຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ຖ້າບໍ່ມີ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກທັງຮູບ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ຂັ້ນຕອນວິທີຈະຊອກຫາສີສະເລ່ຍພາຍໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ເລືອກ ແລະ ຕັ້ງສີນັ້ນເປັນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ. ວິທີນີ້ອີງຕາມສົມມຸດຕິຖານ \"gray-world\", ເຊິ່ງຄາດຄະເນວ່າສີສະເລ່ຍຂອງສາກທຳມະຊາດຈະເປັນກາງ. ວິທີນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຜົນສຳລັບສາກທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ສາກທີ່ມີພື້ນຜິວທີ່ຖືກທາສີ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select \"_as shot in camera_\" to restore the camera defaults and re-read the RAW Exif.\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກ \"_as shot in camera_\" ເພື່ອຄືນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງກ້ອງ ແລະ ອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The color patch shows the color of the currently calculated illuminant projected into sRGB space. The aim of the chromatic adaptation algorithm is to turn this color into pure white, which does not necessarily means shifting the image toward its _perceptual_ opponent color. If the illuminant is properly set, the image will be given the same tint as shown in the color patch when the module is disabled.\n"
msgstr "ແຜ່ນສີຈະສະແດງສີຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ ເຊິ່ງຖືກສາຍເຂົ້າສູ່ພື້ນທີ່ sRGB. ຈຸດປະສົງຂອງຂັ້ນຕອນວິທີການປັບຕົວຕາມສີຄືການປ່ຽນສີນັ້ນໃຫ້ເປັນສີຂາວບໍລິສຸດ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເປັນການປ່ຽນສີຮູບພາບໄປຫາສີກົງກັນຂ້າມຕາມການຮັບຮູ້ສະເໝີໄປ. ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຮູບພາບຈະມີໂທນສີຄືກັບທີ່ສະແດງໃນແຜ່ນສີເມື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To the left of the color patch is the _CCT_ (correlated color temperature) approximation. This is the closest temperature, in kelvin, to the illuminant currently in use. In most image processing software it is customary to set the white balance using a combination of temperature and tint. However, when the illuminant is far from daylight, the CCT becomes inaccurate and irrelevant, and the CIE (International Commission on Illumination) discourages its use in such conditions. The CCT reading informs you of the closest CCT match found:\n"
msgstr "ທາງດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງແຖບສີແມ່ນຄ່າປະມານ _CCT_ (correlated color temperature). ນີ້ແມ່ນອຸນຫະພູມທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດ, ໃນຫົວໜ່ວຍ ເຄນວິນ (kelvin), ກັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ຢູ່. ໃນຊອບແວປະມວນຜົນຮູບພາບສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ມັນເປັນເລື່ອງປົກກະຕິທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວໂດຍໃຊ້ການປະສົມປະສານຂອງອຸນຫະພູມ (temperature) ແລະ ສີຍ້ອມ (tint). ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເມື່ອແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງຢູ່ຫ່າງໄກຈາກແສງກາງເວັນ, CCT ຈະກາຍເປັນຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ແລະ CIE (ຄະນະກໍາມະການລະຫວ່າງປະເທດວ່າດ້ວຍການສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງ) ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ມັນໃນສະພາບການດັ່ງກ່າວ. ຄ່າ CCT ທີ່ອ່ານໄດ້ຈະແຈ້ງໃຫ້ທ່ານຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບ CCT ທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດທີ່ພົບ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the CCT is followed by \"_(daylight)_\", this means that the current illuminant is close to an ideal daylight spectrum ± 0.5 %, and the CCT figure is therefore meaningful. In this case, you are advised to use the \"_D (daylight)_\" illuminant.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຄ່າ CCT ຕາມດ້ວຍ \"_(daylight)_\", ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນໃກ້ຄຽງກັບສະເປັກຕຣ"
"ຳຂອງແສງເວັນໃນອຸດົມຄະຕິ ± 0.5 %, ແລະ ຄ່າ CCT ຈຶ່ງມີຄວາມໝາຍ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳໃຫ້"
"ໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ \"_D (daylight)_\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the CCT is followed by \"_(black body)_\", this means that the current illuminant is close to an ideal black body (Planckian) spectrum ± 0.5 %, and the CCT figure is therefore meaningful. In this case, you are advised to use the \"_Planckian (black body)_\" illuminant.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຄ່າ CCT ຕາມດ້ວຍ \"_(black body)_\", ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນໃກ້ຄຽງກັບສະເປັກ"
"ຕຣຳຂອງວັດຖຸດຳ (Planckian) ໃນອຸດົມຄະຕິ ± 0.5 %, ແລະ ຄ່າ CCT ຈຶ່ງມີຄວາມໝາຍ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ທ່ານ"
"ໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ \"_Planckian (black body)_\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the CCT is followed by \"_(invalid)_\", this means that the CCT figure is meaningless and wrong, because we are too far from either a daylight or a black body light spectrum. In this case, you are advised to use the _custom_ illuminant. The chromatic adaptation will still perform as expected (see the note below), so the \"_(invalid)_\" tag only means that the current illuminant color is not accurately tied to the displayed CCT. This tag is nothing to be concerned about -- it is merely there to tell you to stay away from the daylight and planckian illuminants because they will not behave as you might expect.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ CCT ຕາມດ້ວຍ \"_(invalid)_\", ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຕົວເລກ CCT ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍ ແລະ ຜິດ, ເພາະວ່າມັນຢູ່ຫ່າງໄກເກີນໄປຈາກທັງແສງກາງເວັນ ຫຼື ສະເປັກຕຣຳແສງວັດຖຸດຳ. ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນ, ທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ _custom_ (ກຳນົດເອງ). ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ (chromatic adaptation) ຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ (ເບິ່ງໝາຍເຫດຂ້າງລຸ່ມ), ດັ່ງນັ້ນແທັກ \"_(invalid)_\" ພຽງແຕ່ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສີຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໃນປະຈຸບັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຜູກພັນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງກັບ CCT ທີ່ສະແດງ. ແທັກນີ້ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຕ້ອງກັງວົນ -- ມັນມີໄວ້ພຽງເພື່ອບອກໃຫ້ທ່ານຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ daylight ແລະ planckian ເພາະວ່າພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຄາດໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When one of the above illuminant detection methods is used, the module checks where the calculated illuminant sits using the two idealized spectra (daylight and black body) and chooses the most accurate spectrum model to use in its _illuminant_ parameter. The user-interface will change accordingly:\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ວິທີການກວດຫາແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງຂ້າງເທິງ, ໂມດູນຈະກວດສອບວ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ນັ້ນຕັ້ງຢູ່ບ່ອນໃດ ໂດຍໃຊ້ສອງສະເປັກຕຣຳໃນອຸດົມຄະຕິ (daylight ແລະ black body) ແລະ ເລືອກຮູບແບບສະເປັກຕຣຳທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງທີ່ສຸດເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນພາຣາມິເຕີ _illuminant_. ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (user-interface) ຈະປ່ຽນແປງໄປຕາມນັ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A temperature slider will be provided if the detected illuminant is close to a _D (daylight)_ or _Planckian (black body)_ spectrum, for which the CCT is meaningful.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບເລື່ອນອຸນຫະພູມຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ ຖ້າກວດພົບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບສະເປັກຕຣຳ _D (daylight)_ ຫຼື _Planckian (black body)_, ເຊິ່ງ CCT ມີຄວາມໝາຍ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hue and chroma sliders in CIE 1976 Luv space are offered for the _custom_ illuminant, which allows direct selection of the illuminant color in a perceptual framework without any intermediate assumption.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບເລື່ອນສີ (Hue) ແລະ ຄວາມສົດ (Chroma) ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE 1976 Luv ແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ _custom_, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເລືອກສີຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນໂຄງສ້າງການຮັບຮູ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການສົມມຸດຕິຖານໃດໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Internally, the illuminant is represented by its absolute chromaticity coordinates in CIE xyY color space. The illuminant selection options in the module are merely interfaces to set up this chromaticity from real-world relationships and are intended to make this process faster. It does not matter to the algorithm if the CCT is tagged \"invalid\" -- this just means that the relationship between the CCT and the corresponding xyY coordinates is not physically accurate. Regardless, the color set for the illuminant, as displayed in the patch, will always be honored by the algorithm.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ພາຍໃນ, ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງຖືກສະແດງໂດຍພິກັດຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີ (chromaticity coordinates) ສົມບູນໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE xyY. ຕົວເລືອກການເລືອກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໃນໂມດູນເປັນພຽງສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີນີ້ນຈາກຄວາມສຳພັນໃນໂລກຕົວຈິງ ແລະ ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການນີ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ. ມັນບໍ່ສຳຄັນຕໍ່ອັລກໍຣິທຶມຫາກ CCT ຖືກແທັກວ່າ \"invalid\" -- ນີ້ພຽງແຕ່ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄວາມສຳພັນລະຫວ່າງ CCT ແລະ ພິກັດ xyY ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງນັ້ນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ສີທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ, ຕາມທີ່ສະແດງໃນແຖບສີ, ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍອັລກໍຣິທຶມສະເໝີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When switching from one illuminant to another, the module attempts to translate the previous settings to the new illuminant as accurately as possible. Switching from any illuminant to _custom_ preserves your settings entirely, since the _custom_ illuminant is a general case. Switching between other modes, or from _custom_ to any other mode, will not precisely preserve your settings from the previous mode due to rounding errors.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອປ່ຽນຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໜຶ່ງໄປເປັນອີກອັນໜຶ່ງ, ໂມດູນຈະພະຍາຍາມປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໃໝ່ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້. ການປ່ຽນຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໃດໆໄປເປັນ _custom_ ຈະຮັກສາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານໄວ້ທັງໝົດ, ເພາະວ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ _custom_ ແມ່ນກໍລະນີທົ່ວໄປ. ການປ່ຽນລະຫວ່າງໂໝດອື່ນໆ, ຫຼື ຈາກ _custom_ ໄປຫາໂໝດອື່ນ, ຈະບໍ່ຮັກສາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານຈາກໂໝດກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງແນ່ນອນ ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການປັດເສດຕົວເລກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Other hard-coded _illuminants_ are available (see below). Their values come from standard CIE illuminants and are absolute. You can use them directly if you know exactly what kind of light bulb was used to illuminate the scene and if you trust your camera's input profile and reference (D65) coefficients to be accurate. Otherwise, see [_caveats_](#caveats) below.\n"
msgstr "ມີ _ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ_ ອື່ນໆ ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃຫ້ເລືອກ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ). ຄ່າຂອງພວກມັນມາຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງມາດຕະຖານ CIE ແລະ ເປັນຄ່າສົມບູນ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ຢ່າງແນ່ນອນວ່າໃຊ້ດອກໄຟປະເພດໃດໃນການສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງສາກ ແລະ ຖ້າທ່ານໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າຂອງກ້ອງ ແລະ ຄ່າສຳປະສິດອ້າງອີງ (D65) ຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [_ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ_](#caveats) ທາງລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "CAT tab controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນແທັບ CAT"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"adaptation\n"
": The working color space in which the module will perform its chromatic adaptation transform and channel mixing. The following options are provided:\n"
msgstr ""
"adaptation (ການປັບຕົວ)\n"
": ພື້ນທີ່ສີເຮັດວຽກທີ່ໂມດູນຈະໃຊ້ໃນການແປງການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ (chromatic adaptation transform) ແລະ ການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີ. ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - _Linear Bradford (1985)_: This is accurate for illuminants close to daylight and is compatible with the ICC v4 standard, but produces out-of-gamut colors for more difficult illuminants.\n"
": - _CAT16 (2016)_: This is the default option and is more robust in avoiding imaginary colors while working with large gamut or saturated cyan and purple. It is more accurate than the Bradford CAT in most cases.\n"
": - _Non-linear Bradford (1985)_: This can sometimes produce better results than the linear version but is unreliable.\n"
": - _XYZ_: This is the least accurate method and is generally not recommended except for testing and debugging purposes.\n"
": - _none (disable)_: Disable any adaptation and use the pipeline working RGB space.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _Linear Bradford (1985)_: ມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບແສງກາງເວັນ ແລະ ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບມາດຕະຖານ ICC v4, ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດສີ (out-of-gamut) ສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ຍາກກວ່າ.\n"
": - _CAT16 (2016)_: ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ມີຄວາມທົນທານກວ່າໃນການຫຼີກລ່ຽງສີທີ່ສົມມຸດ (imaginary colors) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບຂອບເຂດສີທີ່ກວ້າງ ຫຼື ສີຟ້າຂຽວ (cyan) ແລະ ສີມ່ວງທີ່ອີ່ມຕົວສູງ. ມັນມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າ Bradford CAT ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່.\n"
": - _Non-linear Bradford (1985)_: ບາງຄັ້ງອາດໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ດີກວ່າແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear) ແຕ່ບໍ່ມີຄວາມໜ້າເຊື່ອຖື.\n"
": - _XYZ_: ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ ຍົກເວັ້ນເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງການທົດສອບ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ.\n"
": - _none (disable)_: ປິດການປັບຕົວໃດໆ ແລະ ໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ເຮັດວຽກຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"illuminant\n"
": The type of illuminant assumed to have lit the scene. Choose from the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"illuminant (ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ)\n"
": ປະເພດຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ສົມມຸດວ່າໄດ້ສ່ອງແສງໃຫ້ສາກ. ເລືອກຈາກຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - _same as pipeline (D50)_: Do not perform chromatic adaptation in this module instance but just perform channel mixing, using the selected _adaptation_ color space.\n"
": - _CIE standard illuminant_: Choose from one of the CIE standard illuminants (daylight, incandescent, fluorescent, equi-energy, or black body), or a non-standard \"LED light\" illuminant. These values are all pre-computed -- as long as your camera sensor is properly profiled, you can just use them as-is. For illuminants that lie near the Planckian locus, an additional \"temperature\" control is also provided (see below).\n"
": - _custom_: If a neutral gray patch is available in the image, the color of the illuminant can be selected using the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers), or can be manually specified using hue and saturation sliders (in LCh perceptual color space). The color swatch next to the picker shows the color of the calculated illuminant used in the CAT compensation.\n"
": - _as shot in camera_: Calculate the illuminant based on the white balance settings provided by the camera.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _same as pipeline (D50)_: ບໍ່ເຮັດການປັບຕົວຕາມສີໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງໂມດູນນີ້ ແຕ່ໃຫ້ເຮັດພຽງແຕ່ການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ _adaptation_ ທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"
": - _CIE standard illuminant_: ເລືອກຈາກໜຶ່ງໃນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງມາດຕະຖານ CIE (ແສງກາງເວັນ, ຫລອດໄຟມີໄສ້, ຫລອດຟລູອໍເຣດເຊນ, ພະລັງງານເທົ່າກັນ, ຫຼື ວັດຖຸດຳ), ຫຼື ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ \"LED light\" ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນມາດຕະຖານ. ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຄຳນວນໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າທັງໝົດ -- ຕາບໃດທີ່ເຊັນເຊີກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານມີໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ມັນໄດ້ທັນທີ. ສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ Planckian, ຈະມີການຄວບຄຸມ \"ອຸນຫະພູມ\" ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃຫ້ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ).\n"
": - _custom_: ຖ້າມີແຖບສີເທົາກາງ (neutral gray) ໃນຮູບ, ສີຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers), ຫຼື ສາມາດກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນສີ ແລະ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ (ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີການຮັບຮູ້ LCh). ຕົວຢ່າງສີຂ້າງ picker ຈະສະແດງສີຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຊົດເຊີຍ CAT.\n"
": - _as shot in camera_: ຄຳນວນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໂດຍອີງໃສ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວທີ່ມາຈາກກ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"temperature\n"
": Adjust the color temperature of the illuminant. Move the slider to the right to assume a more blue illuminant, which will make the white-balanced image appear warmer/more red. Move the slider to the left to assume a more red illuminant, which makes the image appear cooler/more blue after compensation.\n"
msgstr ""
"temperature (ອຸນຫະພູມ)\n"
": ປັບອຸນຫະພູມສີຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ. ເລື່ອນແຖບໄປທາງຂວາເພື່ອສົມມຸດແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ມີສີຟ້າຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບທີ່ປັບຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວແລ້ວເບິ່ງອຸ່ນຂຶ້ນ/ແດງຂຶ້ນ. ເລື່ອນແຖບໄປທາງຊ້າຍເພື່ອສົມມຸດແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ມີສີແດງຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບພາບເບິ່ງເຢັນລົງ/ຟ້າຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນຫຼັງຈາກການຊົດເຊີຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": This control is only provided for illuminants that lie near the Planckian locus and provides fine-adjustment along that locus. For other illuminants the concept of \"color temperature\" doesn't make sense, so no temperature slider is provided.\n"
msgstr ": ການຄວບຄຸມນີ້ມີໃຫ້ສະເພາະແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງ Planckian ແລະ ໃຫ້ການປັບແຕ່ງລະອຽດຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງນັ້ນ. ສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງອື່ນໆ, ແນວຄິດເລື່ອງ \"ອຸນຫະພູມສີ\" ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ມີແຖບເລື່ອນອຸນຫະພູມໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hue\n"
": For custom white balance, set the _hue_ of the illuminant color in LCh color space (derived from CIE Luv space).\n"
msgstr ""
"hue (ສີ)\n"
": ສຳລັບຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ _hue_ ຂອງສີແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ LCh (ມາຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE Luv).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"chroma\n"
": For custom white balance, set the _chroma_ (or saturation) of the illuminant color in LCh color space (derived from CIE Luv space).\n"
msgstr ""
"chroma (ຄວາມສົດສີ)\n"
": ສຳລັບຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ _chroma_ (ຫຼື ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ) ຂອງສີແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ LCh (ມາຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE Luv).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gamut compression\n"
": Most camera sensors are slightly sensitive to invisible UV wavelengths, which are recorded on the blue channel and produce \"imaginary\" colors. Once corrected by the input color profile, these colors will end up out of gamut (that is, it may no longer be possible to represent certain colors as a valid [R,G,B] triplet with positive values in the working color space) and produce visual artifacts in gradients. The chromatic adaptation may also push other valid colors out of gamut, at the same time pushing any already out-of-gamut colors even further out of gamut.\n"
": _Gamut compression_ uses a perceptual, non-destructive, method to attempt to compress the chroma while preserving the luminance as-is and the hue as close as possible, in order to fit the whole image into the gamut of the pipeline working color space. One example where this feature is very useful is for scenes containing blue LED lights, which are often quite problematic and can result in ugly gamut clipping in the final image.\n"
msgstr ""
"gamut compression (ການບີບອັດຂອບເຂດສີ)\n"
": ເຊັນເຊີກ້ອງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີຄວາມໄວຕໍ່ຄວາມຍາວຄື້ນ UV ທີ່ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເຫັນເລັກນ້ອຍ, ເຊິ່ງຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນຊ່ອງສີຟ້າ ແລະ ສ້າງສີ \"ສົມມຸດ\". ເມື່ອຖືກແກ້ໄຂໂດຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າ, ສີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດສີ (ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງບາງສີເປັນຄ່າ [R,G,B] ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງດ້ວຍຄ່າບວກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ) ແລະ ສ້າງສິ່ງລົບກວນທາງສາຍຕາ (artifacts) ໃນການໄລ່ສີ. ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີອາດຈະຍູ້ສີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງອື່ນໆອອກນອກຂອບເຂດສີ, ໃນຂະນະດຽວກັນກໍຍູ້ສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດສີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃຫ້ອອກໄປໄກກວ່າເກົ່າ.\n"
": _Gamut compression_ ໃຊ້ວິທີການທາງການຮັບຮູ້ທີ່ບໍ່ທຳລາຍຂໍ້ມູນ ເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມບີບອັດຄວາມສົດສີ (chroma) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຮັກສາຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance) ໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ ແລະ ຮັກສາສີ (hue) ໃຫ້ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດສີຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສີເຮັດວຽກຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງໜຶ່ງທີ່ຟີເຈີນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍແມ່ນສຳລັບສາກທີ່ມີໄຟ LED ສີຟ້າ, ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະມີບັນຫາ ແລະ ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຕັດຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut clipping) ທີ່ບໍ່ສວຍງາມໃນຮູບສຸດທ້າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clip negative RGB from gamut\n"
": Remove any negative RGB values (set them to zero). This helps to deal with bad black level as well as the blue channel clipping issues that may occur with blue LED lights. This option is destructive for color (it may change the hue) but ensures a valid RGB output no matter what. It should never be disabled unless you want to take care of the gamut mapping manually and understand what you are doing. In that case, use the _black level correction_ in the _exposure_ module to get rid of any negative RGB (RGB means light, which is energy, and which should always be a positive quantity), then increase the _gamut compression_ until no solid black patches remain in the image. Proper denoising may help getting rid of odd RGB values too. Note that this approach may still be insufficient to recover some deep and luminous shades of blue.\n"
msgstr ""
"clip negative RGB from gamut (ຕັດຄ່າ RGB ທີ່ເປັນລົບອອກຈາກຂອບເຂດສີ)\n"
": ລຶບຄ່າ RGB ທີ່ເປັນລົບອອກ (ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນສູນ). ນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃນການຈັດການກັບລະດັບສີດຳທີ່ບໍ່ດີ ລວມທັງບັນຫາການຕັດຊ່ອງສີຟ້າທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນກັບໄຟ LED ສີຟ້າ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເປັນການທຳລາຍຂໍ້ມູນສີ (ມັນອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງສີ/hue) ແຕ່ຮັບປະກັນວ່າຈະໄດ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ RGB ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງບໍ່ວ່າຈະເກີດຫຍັງຂຶ້ນ. ມັນບໍ່ຄວນຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານ ຍົກເວັ້ນທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການການຈັບຄູ່ຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut mapping) ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແລະ ເຂົ້າໃຈສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງເຮັດ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ _black level correction_ ໃນໂມດູນ _exposure_ ເພື່ອກຳຈັດ RGB ທີ່ເປັນລົບ (RGB ໝາຍເຖິງແສງ, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນພະລັງງານ, ແລະ ຄວນເປັນປະລິມານບວກສະເໝີ), ຈາກນັ້ນເພີ່ມ _gamut compression_ ຈົນກວ່າຈະບໍ່ມີແຖບສີດຳເຂັ້ມເຫຼືອຢູ່ໃນຮູບ. ການລົດສິ່ງລົບກວນ (denoising) ທີ່ເໝາະສົມອາດຊ່ວຍກຳຈັດຄ່າ RGB ທີ່ຜິດປົກກະຕິໄດ້ຄືກັນ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າວິທີນີ້ອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະກູ້ຄືນສີຟ້າບາງເສດສີທີ່ເຂັ້ມ ແລະ ສະຫວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note 1**: It has been reported that some OpenCL drivers don't play well when negative RGB values are present in the pixel pipeline, because many pixel operators use logarithms and power functions (_filmic_, _color balance_, all the CIE Lab <-> CIE XYZ color space conversions), which are not defined for negative numbers. Although the inputs are sanitized before sensitive operations, it is not enough for some OpenCL drivers, which will output isolated `NaN` (Not a Number) values. These `NaN` values may be subsequently spread by local filters (blurring and sharpening operations, like _sharpness_, _local contrast_, _contrast equalizer_, _low pass_, _high pass_, _surface blur_, and _filmic_ highlights reconstruction), resulting in large black, gray or white squares.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ 1**: ມີລາຍງານວ່າໄດຣເວີ OpenCL ບາງຕົວເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ໄດ້ດີເມື່ອມີຄ່າ RGB ທີ່ເປັນລົບຢູ່ໃນພິກເຊວໄພພ໌ລາຍ, ເພາະວ່າຕົວປະຕິບັດການພິກເຊວຫຼາຍຕົວໃຊ້ລໍກາຣິດ (logarithms) ແລະ ຟັງຊັນເລກກຳລັງ (_filmic_, _color balance_, ການແປງພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE Lab <-> CIE XYZ ທັງໝົດ), ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບເລກລົບ. ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າຈະຖືກກວດສອບກ່ອນການດຳເນີນການທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍຍັງບໍ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບໄດຣເວີ OpenCL ບາງຕົວ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງຄ່າ `NaN` (Not a Number). ຄ່າ `NaN` ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກແຜ່ກະຈາຍໂດຍຟິວເຕີທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (ການເຮັດໃຫ້ມົວ ແລະ ການເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົມຊັດ ເຊັ່ນ _sharpness_, _local contrast_, _contrast equalizer_, _low pass_, _high pass_, _surface blur_, ແລະ _filmic_ highlights reconstruction), ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ເກີດສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມສີດຳ, ເທົາ ຫຼື ຂາວຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In all these cases, you **must** enable the \"clip negative RGB from gamut\" option in the _color calibration_ module.\n"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທັງໝົດ, ທ່ານ **ຕ້ອງ** ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ \"clip negative RGB from gamut\" ໃນໂມດູນ _color calibration_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note 2**: A common case for failure of the color algorithms in _color calibration_ (especially the gamut compression) is pixels that have a luminance value of 0 (Y channel of the CIE 1931 XYZ space), but non-zero chromaticity values (X and Z channels of the CIE 1931 XYZ space). This case is a numerical oddity that matches no physical reality (a pixel with no luminance should have no chromaticity either), will produce a division by zero in xyY and Yuv color spaces, and will create `NaN` RGB values as a result. This issue is **not** corrected inside _color calibration_ because it is a symptom of a bad input profiling and/or a bad black point level, and needs to be addressed manually either by adjusting the input color profile with the channel mixer or in the _exposure_ module's _black level correction_.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ 2**: ກໍລະນີທົ່ວໄປທີ່ອັລກໍຣິທຶມສີໃນ _color calibration_ (ໂດຍສະເພາະ gamut compression) ເຮັດວຽກຜິດພາດ ແມ່ນພິກເຊວທີ່ມີຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance) ເປັນ 0 (ຊ່ອງ Y ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE 1931 XYZ), ແຕ່ມີຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີ (chromaticity) ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ (ຊ່ອງ X ແລະ Z ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE 1931 XYZ). ກໍລະນີນີ້ນແມ່ນຄວາມຜິດປົກກະຕິທາງຕົວເລກທີ່ບໍ່ກົງກັບຄວາມເປັນຈິງທາງຟີຊິກ (ພິກເຊວທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງກໍບໍ່ຄວນມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີ), ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດການຫານດ້ວຍສູນໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ xyY ແລະ Yuv, ແລະ ຈະສ້າງຄ່າ RGB ເປັນ `NaN`. ບັນຫານີ້ **ບໍ່ໄດ້** ຖືກແກ້ໄຂພາຍໃນ _color calibration_ ເພາະວ່າມັນເປັນອາການຂອງການເຮັດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າທີ່ບໍ່ດີ ແລະ/ຫຼື ລະດັບຈຸດສີດຳທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍການປັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າດ້ວຍ channel mixer ຫຼື ໃນ _black level correction_ ຂອງໂມດູນ _exposure_.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "CAT warnings"
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນ CAT"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The chromatic adaptation in this module relies on a number of assumptions about the earlier processing steps in the pipeline in order to work correctly, and it can be easy to inadvertently break those assumptions in subtle ways. To help you to avoid these kinds of mistakes, the _color calibration_ module will show warnings in the following circumstances.\n"
msgstr "ການປັບຕົວຕາມສີໃນໂມດູນນີ້ອາໄສສົມມຸດຕິຖານຫຼາຍຢ່າງກ່ຽວກັບຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃນໄພພ໌ລາຍເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລະ ມັນງ່າຍທີ່ຈະທຳລາຍສົມມຸດຕິຖານເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ. ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຫຼີກລ່ຽງຄວາມຜິດພາດເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນໃນສະຖານະການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the _color calibration_ module is set up to perform chromatic adaptation but the _white balance_ module is not set to \"camera reference\", warnings will be shown in both modules. These errors can be resolved either by setting the _white balance_ module to \"camera reference\" or by disabling chromatic adaptation in the _color calibration_ module. Note that some sensors may require minor corrections within the _white balance_ module in which case these warnings can be ignored.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ເຮັດການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ ແຕ່ໂມດູນ _white balance_ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ \"camera reference\", ຄຳເຕືອນຈະສະແດງໃນທັງສອງໂມດູນ. ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງໂມດູນ _white balance_ ເປັນ \"camera reference\" ຫຼື ໂດຍການປິດການປັບຕົວຕາມສີໃນໂມດູນ _color calibration_. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າເຊັນເຊີບາງຕົວອາດຕ້ອງການການແກ້ໄຂເລັກນ້ອຍພາຍໃນໂມດູນ _white balance_ ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດລະເລີຍຄຳເຕືອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If two or more instances of _color calibration_ have been created, each attempting to perform chromatic adaptation, an error will be shown on the second instance. This could be a valid use case (for instance where masks have been set up to apply different white balances to different non-overlapping areas of the image) in which case the warnings can be ignored. For most other cases, chromatic adaptation should be disabled in one of the instances to avoid double-corrections.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າມີການສ້າງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງ _color calibration_ ສອງອັນ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ໂດຍແຕ່ລະອັນພະຍາຍາມເຮັດການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ, ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີສອງ. ນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ບ່ອນທີ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າໜ້າກາກ (masks) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນກັບພື້ນທີ່ຕ່າງໆທີ່ບໍ່ທັບຊ້ອນກັນຂອງຮູບ) ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດລະເລີຍຄຳເຕືອນໄດ້. ສຳລັບກໍລະນີອື່ນໆສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄວນປິດການປັບຕົວຕາມສີໃນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການແກ້ໄຂຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "    By default, if an instance of the _color calibration_ module is already performing chromatic adaptation, each new instance you create will automatically have its adaptation set to \"none (bypass)\" to avoid this \"double-correction\" error.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຖ້າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຂອງໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ກຳລັງເຮັດການປັບຕົວຕາມສີຢູ່ແລ້"
"ວ, ແຕ່ລະອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໃໝ່ທີ່ທ່ານສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າການປັບຕົວເປັນ \"none (bypass)\" ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່"
"ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກການ \"ແກ້ໄຂຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ\" (double-correction).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The chromatic adaptation modes in _color calibration_ can be disabled by either setting the _adaptation_ to \"none (bypass)\" or setting the _illuminant_ to \"same as pipeline (D50)\" in the CAT tab.\n"
msgstr "ໂໝດການປັບຕົວຕາມສີໃນ _color calibration_ ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _adaptation_ ເປັນ \"none (bypass)\" ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າ _illuminant_ ເປັນ \"same as pipeline (D50)\" ໃນແທັບ CAT.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These warnings are intended to prevent common and easy mistakes while using the automatic default presets in the module in a typical RAW editing workflow. When using custom presets and some specific workflows, such as editing film scans or JPEGs, these warnings can and should be ignored.\n"
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຄວາມຜິດພາດທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ງ່າຍ ແລະ ເລື້ອຍໆໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນໂມດູນໃນຂະບວນການແກ້ໄຂ RAW ທົ່ວໄປ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າກຳນົດເອງ ແລະ ບາງຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະ ເຊັ່ນ: ການແກ້ໄຂຮູບສະແກນຟິມ ຫຼື JPEG, ຄຳເຕືອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດ ແລະ ຄວນໄດ້ຮັບການລະເລີຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced users can disable module warnings in [preferences > processing > show warning messages](../../preferences-settings/processing.md).\n"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງສາມາດປິດຄຳເຕືອນໂມດູນໄດ້ໃນ [preferences > processing > show warning messages](../../preferences-settings/processing.md).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "channel mixing"
msgstr "channel mixing (ການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The remainder of this module is a standard channel mixer, allowing you to adjust the output R, G, B, colorfulness, brightness and gray of the module based on the relative strengths of the R, G and B input channels.\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງໂມດູນນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວປະສົມຊ່ອງສີມາດຕະຖານ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຄ່າຂາອອກ R, G, B, ຄວາມສົດສີ (colorfulness), ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (brightness) ແລະ ສີເທົາ (gray) ຂອງໂມດູນ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຄວາມເຂັ້ມສຳພັດຂອງຊ່ອງສີຂາເຂົ້າ R, G ແລະ B.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel mixing is performed in the color space defined by the _adaptation_ control on the [CAT tab](#cat-tab-controls). For all practical purposes, these CAT spaces are particular RGB spaces tied to human physiology and proportional to the light emissions in the scene, but they still behave in the same way as any other RGB space. The use of any of the CAT spaces can make the channel mixer tuning process easier, due to their connection with human physiology, but it is also possible to mix channels in the RGB working space of the pipeline by setting the _adaptation_ to \"none (bypass)\". To perform channel mixing in one of the _adaptation_ color spaces without chromatic adaptation, set the _illuminant_ to \"same as pipeline (D50)\".\n"
msgstr "ການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີຈະຖືກດຳເນີນການໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍການຄວບຄຸມ _adaptation_ ໃນ [ແທັບ CAT](#cat-tab-controls). ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ, ພື້ນທີ່ສີ CAT ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ສະເພາະທີ່ຜູກພັນກັບລະບົບການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງມະນຸດ ແລະ ເປັນສັດສ່ວນກັບການປ່ອຍແສງໃນສາກ, ແຕ່ພວກມັນຍັງເຮັດວຽກໃນແບບດຽວກັນກັບພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ອື່ນໆ. ການໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີ CAT ໃດໜຶ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການປັບແຕ່ງຕົວປະສົມຊ່ອງສີງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ເນື່ອງຈາກຄວາມສຳພັນຂອງພວກມັນກັບລະບົບການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງມະນຸດ, ແຕ່ກໍຍັງສາມາດປະສົມຊ່ອງສີໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍໄດ້ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _adaptation_ ເປັນ \"none (bypass)\". ເພື່ອປະສົມຊ່ອງສີໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ _adaptation_ ອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ _illuminant_ ເປັນ \"same as pipeline (D50)\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: The actual colors of the CAT or RGB primaries used for the channel mixing, projected to sRGB display space, are painted in the background of the RGB sliders, so you can get a sense of the color shift that will result from your altered settings.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ສີທີ່ແທ້ຈິງຂອງສີຫຼັກ CAT ຫຼື RGB ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີ, ເມື່ອຖືກຈຳລອງລົງໃນພື້ນທີ່ສະແດງຜົນ sRGB, ຈະຖືກລະບາຍໄວ້ໃນພື້ນຫຼັງຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນ RGB, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນພາບລວມຂອງການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງສີທີ່ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel mixing is a process that defines a boosting/muting factor for each channel as a ratio of all the original channels. Instead of entering a single flat correction that ties the output value of a channel to its input value (for example, `R_output = R_input × correction`), the correction to each channel is dependent on the input of _all_ of the channels for each pixel (for example, `R_output = R_input × R_correction + G_input × G_correction + B_input × B_correction`). Thus a pixel's channels contribute to each other (a process known as \"cross-talk\") which is equivalent to rotating the primary colors of the color space in 3D. This is, in effect, digital simulation of physical color filters.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີ (Channel mixing) ແມ່ນຂັ້ນຕອນການກຳນົດຄ່າການເພີ່ມ/ຫຼຸດ ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີໂດຍເປັນອັດຕ"
"າສ່ວນຂອງຊ່ອງສີດັ້ງເດີມທັງໝົດ. ແທນທີ່ຈະໃສ່ຄ່າການແກ້ໄຂແບບດຽວທີ່ຜູກມັດຄ່າຂາອອກຂອງຊ່ອງສີກັບຄ່າຂາເຂົ້າຂອງມັ"
"ນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `R_output = R_input × correction`), ການແກ້ໄຂໃນແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີຈະຂຶ້ນກັບຄ່າຂາເຂົ້າຂ"
"ອງ _ທຸກ_ ຊ່ອງສີສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `R_output = R_input × R_correction + "
"G_input × G_correction + B_input × B_correction`). ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຊ່ອງສີຂອງພິກເຊວຈຶ່ງມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ"
"ເຊິ່ງກັນ ແລະ ກັນ (ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"cross-talk\") ເຊິ່ງທຽບເທົ່າກັບການໝູນສີຫຼັກຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສີໃນຮູບແບບ "
"3 ມິຕິ. ໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ, ນີ້ແມ່ນການຈຳລອງດ້ວຍລະບົບດີຈີຕອນຂອງແຜ່ນຕອງສີທາງກາຍະພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Although rotating primary colors in 3D is ultimately equivalent to applying a general hue rotation, the connection between the RGB corrections and the resulting perceptual hue rotation is not directly predictable, which makes the process non-intuitive. \"R\", \"G\" and \"B\" should be taken as a mixture of 3 lights that we dial up and down, not as a set of colors or hues. Also, since RGB tristimulus does not decouple luminance and chrominance, but is an additive lighting setup, the \"G\" channel is more strongly tied to human luminance perception than the \"R\" and \"B\" ones. All pixels have a non-zero G channel, which implies that any correction to the G channel is likely to affect all pixels.\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າການໝຸນສີຫຼັກໃນ 3 ມິຕິຈະທຽບເທົ່າກັບການໝຸນສີ (hue) ໂດຍລວມ, ແຕ່ຄວາມສຳພັນລະຫວ່າງການແກ້ໄຂ RGB ແລະ ການໝຸນສີທີ່ຮັບຮູ້ໄດ້ນັ້ນບໍ່ສາມາດຄາດເດົາໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະບວນການນີ້ບໍ່ເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ງ່າຍ (non-intuitive). \"R\", \"G\" ແລະ \"B\" ຄວນຖືກມອງວ່າເປັນການປະສົມຂອງແສງ 3 ແສງທີ່ພວກເຮົາປັບຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ລົງ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນເປັນຊຸດຂອງສີ ຫຼື ເສດສີ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ RGB tristimulus ບໍ່ໄດ້ແຍກຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance) ແລະ ສີ (chrominance) ອອກຈາກກັນ, ແຕ່ເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແສງແບບບວກ (additive lighting), ຊ່ອງ \"G\" ຈຶ່ງມີຄວາມຜູກພັນກັບການຮັບຮູ້ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງມະນຸດຫຼາຍກວ່າຊ່ອງ \"R\" ແລະ \"B\". ທຸກໆພິກເຊວມີຊ່ອງ G ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ, ເຊິ່ງໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການແກ້ໄຂໃດໆຕໍ່ຊ່ອງ G ມີແນວໂນ້ມທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ພິກເຊວທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The channel mixing process is therefore tied to a physical interpretation of the RGB tristimulus (as additive lights), which makes it well-suited for primary color grading and illuminant corrections, and blends the color changes smoothly. However, trying to understand and predict it from a perceptual point of view (luminance, hue and saturation) is going to fail and is discouraged.\n"
msgstr "ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຂະບວນການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີຈຶ່ງຜູກພັນກັບການຕີຄວາມໝາຍທາງຟີຊິກຂອງ RGB tristimulus (ເປັນແສງແບບບວກ), ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ມັນເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງສີຫຼັກ (color grading) ແລະ ການແກ້ໄຂແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ, ແລະ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງສີເປັນໄປຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ການພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າໃຈ ແລະ ຄາດເດົາມັນຈາກມຸມມອງຂອງການຮັບຮູ້ (ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ, ສີ ແລະ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ) ຈະບໍ່ປະສົບຜົນສຳເລັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຮັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: The \"R\", \"G\" and \"B\" labels on the channels of the color spaces in this module are merely conventions formed out of habit. These channels do not necessarily look \"red\", \"green\" and \"blue\", and users are advised against trying to make sense out of them based on their names. This is a general principle that applies to _any_ RGB space used in any application.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ປ້າຍກຳກັບ \"R\", \"G\" ແລະ \"B\" ໃນຊ່ອງສີຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສີໃນໂມດູນນີ້ເປັນພຽງຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຕາມຄວາມເຄີຍຊິນ. ຊ່ອງສີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເບິ່ງເປັນສີ \"ແດງ\", \"ຂຽວ\" ແລະ \"ຟ້າ\" ສະເໝີໄປ, ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳບໍ່ໃຫ້ພະຍາຍາມຕີຄວາມໝາຍຂອງພວກມັນໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຊື່. ນີ້ແມ່ນຫຼັກການທົ່ວໄປທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB _ໃດໆ_ ໃນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃດກໍຕາມ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "R, G and B tabs"
msgstr "ແທັບ R, G ແລະ B"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At its most basic level, you can think of the R, G and B tabs of the _color calibration_ module as a type of matrix multiplication between a 3x3 matrix and the input [R G B] values. This is in fact very similar to what a matrix-based ICC color profile does, except that the user can input the matrix coefficients via the darktable GUI rather than reading the coefficients from an ICC profile file.\n"
msgstr "ໃນລະດັບພື້ນຖານທີ່ສຸດ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄິດວ່າແທັບ R, G ແລະ B ຂອງໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ເປັນການຄູນເມທຣິກຊ໌ລະຫວ່າງເມທຣິກຊ໌ 3x3 ແລະ ຄ່າຂາເຂົ້າ [R G B]. ແທ້ຈິງແລ້ວ ມັນຄ້າຍຄືກັນຫຼາຍກັບສິ່ງທີ່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີ ICC ທີ່ອີງໃສ່ເມທຣິກຊ໌ເຮັດ, ຍົກເວັ້ນຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດໃສ່ຄ່າສຳປະສິດເມທຣິກຊ໌ຜ່ານ GUI ຂອງ darktable ແທນທີ່ຈະອ່ານຄ່າສຳປະສິດຈາກໄຟລ໌ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "select the _R_ tab and then set the Rr, Rg & Rb values using the R, G and B input sliders\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກແທັບ _R_ ຈາກນັ້ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ Rr, Rg & Rb ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນຂາເຂົ້າ R, G ແລະ B\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "select the _G_ tab and then set the Gr, Gg & Gb values using the R, G and B input sliders\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກແທັບ _G_ ຈາກນັ້ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ Gr, Gg & Gb ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນຂາເຂົ້າ R, G ແລະ B\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "select the _B_ tab and then set the Br, Bg & Bb values using the R, G and B input sliders\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກແທັບ _B_ ຈາກນັ້ນຕັ້ງຄ່າ Br, Bg & Bb ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນຂາເຂົ້າ R, G ແລະ B\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, the mixing function in _color calibration_ just copies the input [R G B] channels straight over to the matching output channels. This is equivalent to multiplying by the identity matrix:\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຟັງຊັນການປະສົມໃນ _color calibration_ ຈະພຽງແຕ່ຄັດລອກຊ່ອງສີຂາເຂົ້າ [R G B] ໄປຍັງຊ່ອງສີຂາອອກທີ່ກົງກັນໂດຍກົງ. ນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຄູນດ້ວຍເມທຣິກຊ໌ເອກະລັກ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a more intuitive understanding of how the mixing sliders on the R, G and B tabs behave, consider the following:\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນວ່າແຖບເລື່ອນການປະສົມໃນແທັບ R, G ແລະ B ເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ, ໃຫ້ພິຈາລະນາດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "for the _R_ destination channel, adjusting sliders to the right will make the R, G or B areas of the image more \"red\". Moving the slider to the left will make those areas more \"cyan\".\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຊ່ອງສີປາຍທາງ _R_, ການປັບແຖບເລື່ອນໄປທາງຂວາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ R, G ຫຼື B ຂອງຮູບມີຄວາມເປັນສີ \"ແດງ\" ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ການເລື່ອນແຖບໄປທາງຊ້າຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີຄວາມເປັນສີ \"ຟ້າຂຽວ (cyan)\" ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "for the _G_ destination channel, adjusting sliders to the right will make the R, G or B areas of the image more \"green\". Moving the slider to the left will make those areas more \"magenta\".\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຊ່ອງສີປາຍທາງ _G_, ການປັບແຖບເລື່ອນໄປທາງຂວາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ R, G ຫຼື B ຂອງຮູບມີຄວາມເປັນສີ \"ຂຽວ\" ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ການເລື່ອນແຖບໄປທາງຊ້າຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີຄວາມເປັນສີ \"ມ່ວງແດງ (magenta)\" ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "for the _B_ destination channel, adjusting sliders to the right will make the R, G or B areas of the image more \"blue\". Moving the slider to the left will make those areas more \"yellow\".\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຊ່ອງສີປາຍທາງ _B_, ການປັບແຖບເລື່ອນໄປທາງຂວາຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ R, G ຫຼື B ຂອງຮູບມີຄວາມເປັນສີ \"ຟ້າ\" ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ການເລື່ອນແຖບໄປທາງຊ້າຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນມີຄວາມເປັນສີ \"ເຫຼືອງ\" ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "R, G and B tab controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນແທັບ R, G ແລະ B"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following controls are shown for each of the R, G and B tabs:\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຖືກສະແດງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະແທັບ R, G ແລະ B:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input R/G/B\n"
": Choose how much the input R, G and B channels influence the output channel relating to the tab concerned.\n"
msgstr ""
"input R/G/B\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຊ່ອງສີຂາເຂົ້າ R, G ແລະ B ມີອິດທິພົນຫຼາຍປານໃດຕໍ່ຊ່ອງສີຂາອອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບແທັບນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"normalize channels\n"
": Select this checkbox to normalize the coefficients to try to preserve the overall brightness of this channel in the final image as compared to the input image.\n"
msgstr ""
"normalize channels (ປັບຊ່ອງສີໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ)\n"
": ເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອປັບຄ່າສຳປະສິດໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ ເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍລວມຂອງຊ່ອງສີນີ້ໃນຮູບສຸດທ້າຍເມື່ອທຽບກັບຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "brightness and colorfulness tabs"
msgstr "ແທັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (brightness) ແລະ ຄວາມສົດສີ (colorfulness)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The brightness and colorfulness (color saturation) of pixels in an image can also be adjusted based on the R, G and B input channels. This uses the same basic algorithm that the [_filmic rgb_](filmic-rgb.md) module uses for tone mapping (which preserves RGB ratios) and for mid-tones saturation (which massages them).\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສົດສີ (ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ) ຂອງພິກເຊວໃນຮູບສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຊ່ອງສີຂາເຂົ້າ R, G ແລະ B. ນີ້ໃຊ້ອັລກໍຣິທຶມພື້ນຖານດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ໂມດູນ [_filmic rgb_](filmic-rgb.md) ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຈັບຄູ່ໂທນສີ (tone mapping) (ເຊິ່ງຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນ RGB) ແລະ ສຳລັບຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີໂທນກາງ (mid-tones saturation).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"saturation algorithm\n"
": This control allows you to upgrade the saturation algorithm to the new 2021 version, for edits produced prior to darktable 3.6 -- it will not appear for edits that already use the latest version.\n"
msgstr ""
"saturation algorithm (ອັລກໍຣິທຶມຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ)\n"
": ການຄວບຄຸມນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດອັບເກຣດອັລກໍຣິທຶມຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວເປັນເວີຊັນໃໝ່ 2021 ສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ເຮັດກ່ອນ darktable 3.6 -- ມັນຈະບໍ່ປາກົດສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ໃຊ້ເວີຊັນລ້າສຸດຢູ່ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "colorfulness tab controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນແທັບຄວາມສົດສີ (colorfulness)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input R/G/B\n"
": Adjust the color saturation of pixels, based on the R, G and B channels of those pixels. For example, adjusting the _input R_ slider will affect the color saturation of pixels containing a lot of \"R\" more than pixels containing only a small amount of \"R\".\n"
msgstr ""
"input R/G/B\n"
": ປັບຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີຂອງພິກເຊວ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຊ່ອງສີ R, G ແລະ B ຂອງພິກເຊວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການປັບແຖບເລື່ອນ _input R_ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີຂອງພິກເຊວທີ່ມີ \"R\" ຫຼາຍ ກວ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ມີ \"R\" ພຽງເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"normalize channels\n"
": Select this checkbox to try to keep the overall saturation constant between the input and output images.\n"
msgstr ""
"normalize channels (ປັບຊ່ອງສີໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ)\n"
": ເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວໂດຍລວມໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຮູບຂາອອກ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "brightness tab controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນແທັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (brightness)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input R/G/B\n"
": Adjust the brightness of certain colors in the image, based on the R, G and B channels of those colors. For example, adjusting the _input R_ slider will affect the brightness of colors containing a lot of R channel much more than colors containing only a small amount of R channel. When darkening/brightening a pixel, the ratio of the R, G and B channels for that pixel is maintained, in order to preserve the hue.\n"
msgstr ""
"input R/G/B\n"
": ປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງບາງສີໃນຮູບ ໂດຍອີງໃສ່ຊ່ອງສີ R, G ແລະ B ຂອງສີເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການປັບແຖບເລື່ອນ _input R_ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງສີທີ່ມີຊ່ອງ R ຫຼາຍກວ່າສີທີ່ມີຊ່ອງ R ພຽງເລັກນ້ອຍ. ເມື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ພິກເຊວມືດລົງ/ສະຫວ່າງຂຶ້ນ, ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຊ່ອງ R, G ແລະ B ສຳລັບພິກເຊວນັ້ນຈະຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ ເພື່ອຄົງຄ່າສີ (hue) ໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"normalize channels\n"
": Select this checkbox to try to keep the overall brightness constant between the input and output images.\n"
msgstr ""
"normalize channels (ປັບຊ່ອງສີໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ)\n"
": ເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍລວມໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່ລະຫວ່າງຮູບຂາເຂົ້າ ແລະ ຮູບຂາອອກ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "gray tab"
msgstr "ແທັບສີເທົາ (gray)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Another very useful application of _color calibration_ is the ability to mix the channels together to produce a grayscale output -- a monochrome image. Select the _gray_ tab, and set the R, G and B sliders to control how much each channel contributes to the brightness of the output. This is equivalent to the following matrix multiplication:\n"
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ງານທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຂອງ _color calibration_ ແມ່ນຄວາມສາມາດໃນການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີເຂົ້າກັນເພື່ອສ້າງຜົນໄດ້ຮັບເປັນສີເທົາ (grayscale) -- ຮູບພາບຂາວດຳ (monochrome). ເລືອກແທັບ _gray_, ແລະ ຕັ້ງແຖບເລື່ອນ R, G ແລະ B ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວ່າແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມຫຼາຍປານໃດຕໍ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງຂາອອກ. ນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການຄູນເມທຣິກຊ໌ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When dealing with skin tones, the relative weights of the three channels will affect the level of detail in the image. Placing more weight on R (e.g. [0.9, 0.3, -0.3]) will make for smooth skin tones, whereas emphasising G (e.g. [0.4, 0.75, -0.15]) will bring out more detail. In both cases the B channel is reduced to avoid emphasising unwanted skin texture.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຈັດການກັບໂທນສີຜິວ, ນ້ຳໜັກສຳພັດຂອງທັງສາມຊ່ອງສີຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດໃນຮູບ. ການໃຫ້ນ້ຳໜັກກັບ R ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [0.9, 0.3, -0.3]) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂທນສີຜິວລຽບນຽນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ການເນັ້ນ G (ຕົວຢ່າງ: [0.4, 0.75, -0.15]) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຫັນລາຍລະອຽດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ໃນທັງສອງກໍລະນີ, ຊ່ອງ B ຈະຖືກລົດລົງເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເນັ້ນຜິວສຳຜັດທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "gray tab controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນແທັບສີເທົາ (gray)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input R/G/B\n"
": Choose how much each of the R, G and B channels contribute to the gray level of the output. The image will only be converted to monochrome if the three sliders add up to some non-zero value. Adding more B will tend to bring out more details, adding more R will tend to smooth skin tones.\n"
msgstr ""
"input R/G/B\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ R, G ແລະ B ມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມຫຼາຍປານໃດຕໍ່ລະດັບສີເທົາຂອງຂາອອກ. ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນຂາວດຳກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອແຖບເລື່ອນທັງສາມລວມກັນແລ້ວມີຄ່າທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ. ການເພີ່ມ B ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນມີແນວໂນ້ມທີ່ຈະດຶງລາຍລະອຽດອອກມາຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ການເພີ່ມ R ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນມີແນວໂນ້ມທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂທນສີຜິວລຽບນຽນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"normalize channels\n"
": Select this checkbox to try to keep the overall brightness constant as the sliders are adjusted.\n"
msgstr ""
"normalize channels (ປັບຊ່ອງສີໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ)\n"
": ເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມຮັກສາຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍລວມໃຫ້ຄົງທີ່ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປັບແຖບເລື່ອນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "area color mapping"
msgstr "area color mapping (ການຈັບຄູ່ສີຕາມພື້ນທີ່)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unfortunately, the color temperature of the illuminating light often changes slightly between shots, even within the same series captured in the same conditions. This can be the result of a cloud passing by the sun in natural light, or a different ratio between colored bounce light and main light. Each image will still need some individual fine-tuning if you want a perfectly even look over the whole series, and this can be both time-consuming and frustrating.\n"
msgstr "ແຕ່ໜ້າເສຍດາຍ, ອຸນຫະພູມສີຂອງແສງທີ່ສ່ອງສະຫວ່າງມັກຈະປ່ຽນແປງເລັກນ້ອຍລະຫວ່າງການຖ່າຍແຕ່ລະຮູບ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະຢູ່ໃນຊຸດດຽວກັນທີ່ຖ່າຍໃນສະພາບດຽວກັນກໍຕາມ. ນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນຜົນມາຈາກເມກທີ່ຜ່ານດວງອາທິດໃນແສງທຳມະຊາດ, ຫຼື ອັດຕາສ່ວນທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນລະຫວ່າງແສງສະທ້ອນທີ່ມີສີ ແລະ ແສງຫຼັກ. ແຕ່ລະຮູບຍັງຄົງຕ້ອງມີການປັບແຕ່ງລະອຽດເປັນລາຍຮູບ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ທັງໝົດຊຸດເບິ່ງຄືກັນຢ່າງສົມບູນ, ແລະ ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເສຍເວລາ ແລະ ໜ້າເບື່ອ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Area color mapping allows you to define a target chromaticity (hue and chroma) for a particular region of the image (the control sample), which you then match against the same target chromaticity in other images. The control sample can either be a critical part of your subject that needs to have constant color, or a non-moving and consistently-lit surface over your series of images.\n"
msgstr "Area color mapping ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີເປົ້າໝາຍ (ສີ ແລະ ຄວາມສົດສີ) ສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງຂອງຮູບ (ຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມ), ເຊິ່ງຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດນຳໄປຈັບຄູ່ກັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີເປົ້າໝາຍດຽວກັນໃນຮູບອື່ນໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມອາດຈະເປັນສ່ວນສຳຄັນຂອງວັດຖຸທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີສີຄົງທີ່, ຫຼື ເປັນພື້ນຜິວທີ່ບໍ່ເຄື່ອນທີ່ ແລະ ໄດ້ຮັບແສງຄົງທີ່ຕະຫຼອດຊຸດຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two ways of setting the target chromaticity for your control sample:\n"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີເປົ້າໝາຍສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມຂອງທ່ານ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "if you know or expect an arbitrary color for the control sample (for example, a gray card, a color chart, a product or a logo of a specified color), you can set its L, h and c values directly, in Lch derived from CIE Lab 1976 space,\n"
msgstr "1. ຖ້າທ່ານຮູ້ ຫຼື ຄາດຫວັງສີໃດໜຶ່ງສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ແຜ່ນສີເທົາ, ແຜ່ນທຽບສີ, ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ຫຼື ໂລໂກ້ທີ່ມີສີສະເພາະ), ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ L, h ແລະ c ຂອງມັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ, ໃນ Lch ທີ່ມາຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE Lab 1976,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "if you simply want to match the development of your reference image, set the _area mode_ to _measure_, then enable the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) (to the right of the color patch) and draw a rectangle over your control sample. The _input_ column will then be updated with the L, h, c values of the control sample before the color correction, and the _target_ column will show the resulting L, h, c values of the control sample after the current calibration setting is applied.\n"
msgstr "2. ຖ້າທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ກົງກັບການແຕ່ງຮູບອ້າງອີງຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ _area mode_ ເປັນ _measure_, ຈາກນັ້ນເປີດໃຊ້ [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) (ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງແຖບສີ) ແລະ ແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມໃສ່ຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມຂອງທ່ານ. ຈາກນັ້ນຄໍລຳ _input_ ຈະຖືກອັບເດດດ້ວຍຄ່າ L, h, c ຂອງຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມກ່ອນການແກ້ໄຂສີ, ແລະ ຄໍລຳ _target_ ຈະສະແດງຄ່າ L, h, c ທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການປັບທຽບປະຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you reset the L, h, c values, the default value is a neutral color at 50% lightness (middle-gray) -- this can be useful to quickly set the average white balance of any image. If you want to match the control sample against neutral gray, you only need to reset the chroma slider because the lightness and hue settings have no effect on chromaticity for neutral grays.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຣີເຊັດຄ່າ L, h, c, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນສີກາງຢູ່ທີ່ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ 50% (ສີເທົາກາງ) -- ນີ້ສາມາດມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວສະເລ່ຍຂອງຮູບໃດໜຶ່ງຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັບຄູ່ຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມກັບສີເທົາກາງ, ທ່ານພຽງແຕ່ຕ້ອງຣີເຊັດແຖບເລື່ອນ chroma ເພາະວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ສີ (hue) ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີສຳລັບສີເທົາກາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that the target value is not reset when you reset the module itself, but is stored indefinitely in darktable's configuration and will be available on next launch as well as for the next image you develop. Additionally, the position of the selected rectangle is also stored for ease of use when applying the picked correction value to multiple similar images (see below under \"match the target\"), though you may redraw the rectangle if the position of the target object changes between images.\n"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຄ່າເປົ້າໝາຍຈະບໍ່ຖືກຣີເຊັດເມື່ອທ່ານຣີເຊັດຕົວໂມດູນເອງ, ແຕ່ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຕະຫຼອດໄປໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງ darktable ແລະ ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນການເປີດຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ ລວມທັງສຳລັບຮູບຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ທ່ານແຕ່ງ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມທີ່ເລືອກກໍຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເພື່ອຄວາມສະດວກໃນການນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອນຳຄ່າການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ເລືອກໄປໃຊ້ກັບຮູບທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນຫຼາຍຮູບ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມຫົວຂໍ້ \"match the target\"), ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າທ່ານອາດຈະແຕ້ມຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມໃໝ່ໄດ້ຖ້າຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວັດຖຸເປົ້າໝາຍປ່ຽນແປງລະຫວ່າງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _take channel mixing into account_ option lets you choose where the target is sampled. If disabled, the target color is measured immediately after the _CAT_ (Chromatic Adaptation Transform) step, which takes place before any channel mixing. This means that if you have a calibrated profile in effect within the channel mixer, this profile will be discarded. If enabled, the target color is measured after the _CAT_ and the channel mixing steps, including any calibrated profile. This is the recommended option for most use cases.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ _take channel mixing into account_ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກບ່ອນທີ່ຈະເກັບຕົວຢ່າງເປົ້າໝາຍ. ຖ້າປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ສີເປົ້າໝາຍຈະຖືກວັດແທກທັນທີຫຼັງຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນ _CAT_ (Chromatic Adaptation Transform), ເຊິ່ງເກີດຂຶ້ນກ່ອນການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີໃດໆ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຖ້າທ່ານມີໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ປັບທຽບແລ້ວມີຜົນຢູ່ໃນ channel mixer, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນີ້ຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ. ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ສີເປົ້າໝາຍຈະຖືກວັດແທກຫຼັງຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນ _CAT_ ແລະ ການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີ, ລວມທັງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ປັບທຽບໃດໆ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບກໍລະນີການໃຊ້ງານສ່ວນໃຫຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: If you are defining your target from a gray patch, you should know that the gray patch on color checkers is never entirely neutral. For example, Datacolor Spyder has a slightly warm gray (hue = 20°, chroma = 1.2) while X-Rite pre-2014 has a colder but more neutral gray (hue = 240°, chroma = 0.3) and X-Rite post-2014 is almost perfectly neutral (hue = 133°, chroma = 0.2). In general, it is not desirable to match the control sample against a perfectly neutral gray target, and it is actually wrong to do so when using gray cards and color checkers as a control sample.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ຖ້າທ່ານກຳລັງກຳນົດເປົ້າໝາຍຈາກແຖບສີເທົາ (gray patch), ທ່ານຄວນຮູ້ວ່າແຖບສີເທົາໃນແຜ່ນ"
"ທຽບສີ (color checkers) ບໍ່ເຄີຍມີຄວາມເປັນກາງທັງໝົດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: Datacolor Spyder ຈະມີສີເທົາທີ່ອອ"
"ກໂທນອຸ່ນເລັກນ້ອຍ (hue = 20°, chroma = 1.2), ໃນຂະນະທີ່ X-Rite ລຸ້ນກ່ອນປີ 2014 ຈະມີສີເທົາທີ່ເຢັ"
"ນກວ່າແຕ່ມີຄວາມເປັນກາງຫຼາຍກວ່າ (hue = 240°, chroma = 0.3) ແລະ X-Rite ລຸ້ນຫຼັງປີ 2014 ຈະມີຄ"
"ວາມເປັນກາງເກືອບສົມບູນ (hue = 133°, chroma = 0.2). ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ, ມັນບໍ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ຈະປັບຕົວຢ່າງ"
"ຄວບຄຸມໃຫ້ກົງກັບເປົ້າໝາຍສີເທົາທີ່ເປັນກາງຢ່າງສົມບູນ, ແລະ ມັນກໍເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ຜິດທີ່ຈະເຮັດແນວນັ້ນເມື່ອໃຊ້ແຜ່ນສີເທົາ "
"(gray cards) ແລະ ແຜ່ນທຽບສີເປັນຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you open a new image, the _area mode_ is automatically reset to _correction_. Using the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) attached to the color patch, you can then directly reselect your control sample in the new image. The proper illuminant settings required for the control sample to match the memorized target chromaticity will be automatically computed, and the setting will be updated in the same operation.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເປີດຮູບໃໝ່, _area mode_ ຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດເປັນ _correction_ ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໂດຍການໃຊ້ [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບແຖບສີ, ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມຂອງທ່ານໃນຮູບໃໝ່ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມກົງກັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະຖືກອັບເດດໃນການດຳເນີນການດຽວກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _take channel mixing into account_ option will need to be set the same as when the measurement of the target was performed to ensure consistent results. Note that the target matching only defines the illuminant settings used in the Chromatic Adaptation Transform -- it does not alter the channel mixer settings, since the calibration is handled in the color checker calibration tool. However, the channel mixer settings can be used or discarded in the computation of the illuminant settings, depending on this option.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ _take channel mixing into account_ ຈະຕ້ອງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຄືກັນກັບຕອນທີ່ເຮັດການວັດແທກເປົ້າໝາຍເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການຈັບຄູ່ເປົ້າໝາຍພຽງແຕ່ກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນ Chromatic Adaptation Transform -- ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ channel mixer, ເພາະວ່າການປັບທຽບແມ່ນຖືກຈັດການໃນເຄື່ອງມືການປັບທຽບແຜ່ນສີ. ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ channel mixer ສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ ຫຼື ລະເລີຍໃນການຄຳນວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ, ຂຶ້ນກັບຕົວເລືອກນີ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "step 3: deactivate color mapping"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 3: ປິດການໃຊ້ງານການຈັບຄູ່ສີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The settings you configured in _step 1_ are \"sticky\" -- they will stay active until you manually turn them off by resetting _lightness_ to 50 and _chroma_ to 0. Until then, _every_ time you use this module (even after closing and restarting darktable), those settings will affect the results of an auto-whitebalance operation. To remind you that color mapping is active, especially while the section is collapsed, the heading will change from \"area color mapping\" to \"area color mapping (active)\" whenever _chroma_ is nonzero or _lightness_ is other than 50.\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດໃນ _ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ 1_ ແມ່ນ \"ຄົງຄ້າງ\" -- ພວກມັນຈະຍັງຄົງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະປິດຕົວມັນເອງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໂດຍການຣີເຊັດ _lightness_ ເປັນ 50 ແລະ _chroma_ ເປັນ 0. ຈົນກວ່າຈະຮອດເວລານັ້ນ, _ທຸກໆຄັ້ງ_ ທີ່ທ່ານໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະປິດ ແລະ ເປີດ darktable ໃໝ່), ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງການເຮັດຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເພື່ອເຕືອນທ່ານວ່າການຈັບຄູ່ສີກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນຂະນະທີ່ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຖືກຍໍ້ໄວ້, ຫົວຂໍ້ຈະປ່ຽນຈາກ \"area color mapping\" ເປັນ \"area color mapping (active)\" ເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ _chroma_ ບໍ່ແມ່ນສູນ ຫຼື _lightness_ ບໍ່ແມ່ນ 50.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Perfectly matching your control sample against the target chromaticity may still not yield a similar perceptual result, even if the numbers are exactly the same. The ratio of lightness between the control sample and its surrounding, as well as the color contrasts at play in the frame, will alter the perception of colors in ways that are very difficult to model. To build an intuition of this problem, see the [gray strawberries illusion](https://www.sciencealert.com/in-spite-of-what-your-eyes-tell-you-these-strawberries-aren-t-red).\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ການຈັບຄູ່ຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມກັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີເປົ້າໝາຍຢ່າງສົມບູນແບບອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທາງການຮັບຮູ້ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຕົວເລກຈະຄືກັນຢ່າງແນ່ນອນກໍຕາມ. ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕົວຢ່າງຄວບຄຸມ ແລະ ສິ່ງອ້ອມຂ້າງ, ລວມທັງຄວາມຄົມຊັດຂອງສີໃນເຟຣມ, ຈະປ່ຽນແປງການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງສີໃນຮູບແບບທີ່ຍາກທີ່ຈະສ້າງແບບຈຳລອງໄດ້. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈບັນຫານີ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ [ພາບລວງຕາໝາກສະຕໍເບີຣີສີເທົາ](https://www.sciencealert.com/in-spite-of-what-your-eyes-tell-you-these-strawberries-aren-t-red).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "extracting settings using a color checker"
msgstr "ການສະກັດຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ແຜ່ນທຽບສີ (color checker)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Since the channel mixer is essentially an RGB matrix (similar to the [_input color profile_](./input-color-profile.md) used for RAW images) it can be used to improve the color accuracy of the input color profile by computing ad-hoc color calibration settings.\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກ channel mixer ເປັນເມທຣິກຊ໌ RGB ໂດຍພື້ນຖານ (ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [_input color profile_](./input-color-profile.md) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຮູບ RAW) ມັນຈຶ່ງສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງສີຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາເຂົ້າໂດຍການຄຳນວນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການປັບທຽບສີສະເພາະກິດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These computed settings aim to minimize the color difference between the scene reference and the camera recording in a given lighting situation. This is equivalent to creating a generic ICC color profile but here, the profile is instead stored as module settings that can be saved as presets or styles, to be shared and reused between images. Such profiles are meant to complement and refine the generic input profile but do not replace it.\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຈຸດປະສົງເພື່ອລົດຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງສີລະຫວ່າງສາກອ້າງອີງ ແລະ ການບັນທຶກຂອງກ້ອງໃນສະພາວະແສງທີ່ກຳນົດ. ນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີ ICC ທົ່ວໄປ ແຕ່ໃນທີ່ນີ້, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນທີ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກເປັນ presets ຫຼື styles ເພື່ອແບ່ງປັນ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຄືນລະຫວ່າງຮູບພາບ. ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ດັ່ງກ່າວມີໄວ້ເພື່ອເສີມ ແລະ ປັບແຕ່ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າທົ່ວໄປ ແຕ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າມາແທນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This feature can assist with:\n"
msgstr "ຟີເຈີນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍໃນເລື່ອງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "handling difficult illuminants, such as low [CRI](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Color_rendering_index) light bulbs, for which a mere white balancing will never suffice,\n"
msgstr "ການຈັດການກັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ຍາກ, ເຊັ່ນດອກໄຟທີ່ມີຄ່າ [CRI](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Color_rendering_index) ຕ່ຳ, ເຊິ່ງພຽງແຕ່ການປັບຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວຈະບໍ່ພຽງພໍ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "digitizing artworks or commercial products where an accurate rendition of the original colors is required,\n"
msgstr "ການແປງຜົນງານສິລະປະ ຫຼື ຜະລິດຕະພັນທາງການຄ້າໃຫ້ເປັນດິຈິຕອນ ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງການການສະແດງສີເດີມທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "neutralizing a number of different cameras to the same ground-truth, in multi-camera photo sessions, in order to obtain a consistent base look and share the color editing settings with a consistent final look,\n"
msgstr "ການເຮັດໃຫ້ກ້ອງທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍຕົວມີຄ່າເປັນກາງຕາມຄວາມເປັນຈິງດຽວກັນ, ໃນການຖ່າຍຮູບດ້ວຍກ້ອງຫຼາຍຕົວ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ລຸກ (look) ພື້ນຖານທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແກ້ໄຂສີເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ສອດຄ່ອງກັນ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "obtaining a sane color pipeline from the start, nailing white balance and removing any bounced-light color cast at once, with minimal effort and time.\n"
msgstr "ການໄດ້ຮັບໄພພ໌ລາຍສີທີ່ດີຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ການກຳຈັດສີທີ່ຜິດເພ້ຍຈາກແສງສະທ້ອນ (color cast) ໃນບາດດຽວ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມ ແລະ ເວລາໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "supported color checker targets"
msgstr "ແຜ່ນທຽບສີ (color checker) ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users are not currently permitted to use custom targets, but a limited number of verified color checkers (from reputable manufacturers) are supported:\n"
msgstr "ໃນປະຈຸບັນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ແຕ່ມີແຜ່ນທຽບສີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການກວດສອບແລ້ວຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງ (ຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດທີ່ມີຊື່ສຽງ) ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "X-Rite / Gretag MacBeth Color Checker 24 (pre- and post-2014),\n"
msgstr "X-Rite / Gretag MacBeth Color Checker 24 (ລຸ້ນກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງປີ 2014),\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Datacolor SpyderCheckr 24 (pre- and post-2018),\n"
msgstr "Datacolor SpyderCheckr 24 (ລຸ້ນກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງປີ 2018),\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Datacolor SpyderCheckr 48 (pre- and post-2018),\n"
msgstr "Datacolor SpyderCheckr 48 (ລຸ້ນກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງປີ 2018),\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Datacolor SpyderCheckr Photo.\n"
msgstr "Datacolor SpyderCheckr Photo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users are discouraged from obtaining cheap, off-brand, color targets as color constancy between batches cannot possibly be asserted at such prices. Inaccurate color checkers will only defeat the purpose of color calibration and possibly make things worse.\n"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແຜ່ນທຽບສີລາຄາຖືກ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີຍີ່ຫໍ້ ເພາະວ່າຄວາມຄົງທີ່ຂອງສີລະຫວ່າງແຕ່ລະຊຸດບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບປະກັນໄດ້ໃນລາຄາດັ່ງກ່າວ. ແຜ່ນທຽບສີທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຈຸດປະສົງຂອງການປັບທຽບສີເສຍໄປ ແລະ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ທຸກຢ່າງຮ້າຍແຮງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "IT7 and IT8 charts are not supported since they are hardly portable and not practical for use on-location for ad-hoc profiles. These charts are better suited for creating generic color profiles, undertaken using a standard illuminant, for example with [Argyll CMS](https://github.com/beku/Argyll-Releases).\n"
msgstr "ແຜ່ນສີ IT7 ແລະ IT8 ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ ເພາະວ່າພວກມັນພົກພາໄດ້ຍາກ ແລະ ບໍ່ສະດວກໃນການນຳໃຊ້ໃນສະຖານທີ່ຈິງສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສະເພາະກິດ. ແຜ່ນສີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເໝາະສົມກວ່າສຳລັບການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີທົ່ວໄປ ໂດຍໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງມາດຕະຖານ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ການໃຊ້ [Argyll CMS](https://github.com/beku/Argyll-Releases).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: X-Rite changed the formula of their pigments in 2014 and Datacolor in 2018, which slightly altered the color of the patches. Both formulas are supported in darktable, but you should be careful to choose the correct reference for your target. If in doubt, try both and choose the one that yields the lowest average delta E after calibration.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: X-Rite ໄດ້ປ່ຽນສູດເມັດສີໃນປີ 2014 ແລະ Datacolor ໃນປີ 2018, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ສີຂອງແຖບສີປ່ຽນແປງເລັກນ້ອຍ. ທັງສອງສູດແມ່ນຮອງຮັບໃນ darktable, ແຕ່ທ່ານຄວນລະມັດລະວັງໃນການເລືອກການອ້າງອີງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງທ່ານ. ຖ້າບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈ, ໃຫ້ລອງທັງສອງແລ້ວເລືອກອັນທີ່ໃຫ້ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ delta E ຕ່ຳສຸດຫຼັງຈາກການປັບທຽບ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "prerequisites"
msgstr "ເງື່ອນໄຂເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In order to use this feature you will need to take a test shot of a supported color checker chart, on-location, under appropriate lighting conditions:\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຟີເຈີນີ້ນ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບທົດສອບຂອງແຜ່ນທຽບສີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ໃນສະຖານທີ່ຈິງ, ພາຍໃຕ້ສະພາວະແສງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "frame the chart in the center 50% of the camera's field, to ensure that the image is free of vignetting,\n"
msgstr "ຈັດວາງແຜ່ນສີໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນບໍລິເວນ 50% ກາງຂອງເຟຣມກ້ອງ, ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າຮູບພາບບໍ່ມີຂອບມືດ (vignetting),\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ensure that the main light source is far enough from the chart to give an even lighting field over the surface of the chart,\n"
msgstr "ຮັບປະກັນວ່າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງຫຼັກຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກແຜ່ນສີພຽງພໍ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແສງສະຫວ່າງສະເໝີກັນທົ່ວພື້ນຜິວຂອງແຜ່ນສີ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "adjust the angle between the light, chart and lens to prevent reflections and gloss on the color patches,\n"
msgstr "ປັບມຸມລະຫວ່າງແສງ, ແຜ່ນສີ ແລະ ເລນ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການສະທ້ອນ ແລະ ຄວາມເງົາໃນແຖບສີ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "for the best quality profile you should capture an image with the appropriate brightness. To achieve this, take a few bracketed images (between -1 and +1 EV) of your color checker and load them into darktable, ensuring that all modules between _color calibration_ and _output color profile_ are disabled. Choose the image where the white patch has a brightness L of 94-96% in CIE Lab space or a luminance Y of 83-88% in CIE XYZ space (use the [global color picker](../utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md)). This step is not strictly necessary -- alternatively you can take a single image and apply the exposure compensation as recommended in the profile report.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບດີທີ່ສຸດ, ທ່ານຄວນຖ່າຍຮູບທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ໃຫ້ຖ່າຍຮູບຫຼາຍໆຊ໊ອດ (ລະຫວ່າງ -1 ຫາ +1 EV) ຂອງແຜ່ນທຽບສີຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ໂຫຼດພວກມັນເຂົ້າໃນ darktable, ໂດຍຮັບປະກັນວ່າໂມດູນທັງໝົດລະຫວ່າງ _color calibration_ ແລະ _output color profile_ ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ. ເລືອກຮູບທີ່ແຖບສີຂາວມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ L ຢູ່ທີ່ 94-96% ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE Lab ຫຼື ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ Y ຢູ່ທີ່ 83-88% ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ CIE XYZ (ໃຊ້ [global color picker](../utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md)). ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ -- ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຖ່າຍຮູບດຽວແລ້ວໃຊ້ການຊົດເຊີຍແສງ (exposure compensation) ຕາມທີ່ແນະນຳໃນລາຍງານໂປຣໄຟລ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the lighting conditions are close to a standard D50 to D65 illuminant (direct natural light, no colored bounced light), the color checker shot can be used to produce a generic profile that will be suitable for any daylight illuminant with only a slight adjustment of the white balance.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າສະພາວະແສງໃກ້ຄຽງກັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງມາດຕະຖານ D50 ຫາ D65 (ແສງທຳມະຊາດໂດຍກົງ, ບໍ່ມີແສງສະທ້ອນທີ່ມີສີ), ຮູບຖ່າຍແຜ່ນທຽບສີສາມາດຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທົ່ວໄປທີ່ຈະເໝາະສົມສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງກາງເວັນໃດໆ ໂດຍການປັບຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວເລັກນ້ອຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the lighting conditions are peculiar and far from standard illuminants, the color checker shot will be only usable as an ad-hoc profile for images taken in the same lighting conditions.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າສະພາວະແສງມີຄວາມພິເສດ ແລະ ຫ່າງໄກຈາກແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງມາດຕະຖານ, ຮູບຖ່າຍແຜ່ນທຽບສີຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ເປັນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສະເພາະກິດສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ຖ່າຍໃນສະພາວະແສງດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The settings used in color calibration depend on the chosen CAT space and on any color settings defined earlier in the pipe within the _white balance_ and _input color profile_ modules. As such, the results of the profiling (e.g. the RGB channel mixing coefficients) are valid only for a rigid set of _CAT space_, _white balance_ and _input color profile_ settings. If you wish to create a generic style with your profile, don't forget that you will need to include the settings from these modules as well.\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການປັບທຽບສີແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບພື້ນທີ່ CAT ທີ່ເລືອກ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າສີໃດໆທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃນໄພພ໌ລາຍພາຍໃນໂມດູນ _white balance_ ແລະ _input color profile_. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຂອງການເຮັດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຄ່າສຳປະສິດການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີ RGB) ຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຊຸດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _CAT space_, _white balance_ ແລະ _input color profile_ ທີ່ແນ່ນອນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງຮູບແບບ (style) ທົ່ວໄປດ້ວຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານ, ຢ່າລືມວ່າທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງລວມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກໂມດູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຂົ້າໄປນຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the following process to create your profile preset/style:\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຂະບວນການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ preset/style ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable the [_lens correction_](./lens-correction.md) module to correct any vignetting that might mislead the calibration,\n"
msgstr "1. ເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_lens correction_](./lens-correction.md) ເພື່ອແກ້ໄຂຂອບມືດ (vignetting) ທີ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການປັບທຽບຜິດພາດ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the bottom of the _color calibration_ module, click on the arrow near the _calibrate with a color checker_ label, to show the controls,\n"
msgstr "2. ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູນ _color calibration_, ຄລິກທີ່ລູກສອນໃກ້ກັບປ້າຍ _calibrate with a color checker_, ເພື່ອສະແດງການຄວບຄຸມ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pick the correct model and manufacturer of your color checker from the _chart_ drop-down,\n"
msgstr "3. ເລືອກລຸ້ນ ແລະ ຜູ້ຜະລິດແຜ່ນທຽບສີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຈາກເມນູເລື່ອນລົງ _chart_,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the image preview, an overlay of the chart's patches will appear. Drag the corners of the chart so that they match the visual references (dots or crosses) around the target, to compensate for any perspective distortion,\n"
msgstr "4. ໃນສ່ວນສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຮູບ, ຈະມີແຜນຜັງແຖບສີປາກົດຂຶ້ນ. ລາກມຸມຂອງແຜນຜັງໃຫ້ກົງກັບຈຸດອ້າງອີງ (ຈຸດ ຫຼື ກາກະບາດ) ອ້ອມຮອບເປົ້າໝາຍ, ເພື່ອຊົດເຊີຍການບິດເບືອນຂອງມຸມມອງ (perspective distortion),\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the _refresh_ button to compute the profile,\n"
msgstr "5. ຄລິກປຸ່ມ _refresh_ ເພື່ອຄຳນວນໂປຣໄຟລ໌,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the _Profile quality report_. If it is \"good\", you can click on the _validation_ button. If not, try changing the optimization strategy and refresh the profile again.\n"
msgstr "6. ກວດສອບ _Profile quality report_ (ລາຍງານຄຸນນະພາບໂປຣໄຟລ໌). ຖ້າມັນເປັນ \"good\", ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກປຸ່ມ _validation_. ຖ້າບໍ່, ໃຫ້ລອງປ່ຽນກົນລະຍຸດການປັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ (optimization strategy) ແລ້ວຄລິກ refresh ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອີກຄັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '7. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save the profile in a preset or style, or simply copy & paste the module settings to all of the images taken under the same lighting conditions, from within the lighttable view or filmstrip.\n"
msgstr "7. ບັນທຶກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃນ preset ຫຼື style, ຫຼື ພຽງແຕ່ຄັດລອກ ແລະ ວາງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນໃສ່ຮູບທັງໝົດທີ່ຖ່າຍພາຍໃຕ້ສະພາວະແສງດຽວກັນ, ຈາກໃນໜ້າ lighttable ຫຼື filmstrip.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** You don't _need_ to use the standard matrix in the _input color profile_ module when performing a calibration, but be aware that the \"as shot in camera\" default white balance will not work properly with any other profile, and that you will need to always use the same input profile whenever you reuse such calibration settings.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ທ່ານບໍ່ _ຈຳເປັນ_ ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເມທຣິກຊ໌ມາດຕະຖານໃນໂມດູນ _input color profile_ ເມື່ອເຮັດການປັບທຽບ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ \"as shot in camera\" ຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອື່ນ, ແລະ ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າດຽວກັນສະເໝີເມື່ອໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ທ່ານນຳການຕັ້ງຄ່າການປັບທຽບດັ່ງກ່າວມາໃຊ້ຄືນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reading the profile report"
msgstr "ການອ່ານລາຍງານໂປຣໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The profile report helps you to assess the quality of the calibration. The settings in color calibration are only a \"best fit\" optimization and will never be 100% accurate for the whole color spectrum. We therefore need to track \"how inaccurate\" it is in order to know whether we can trust this profile or not.\n"
msgstr "ລາຍງານໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປະເມີນຄຸນນະພາບຂອງການປັບທຽບ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນການປັບທຽບສີເປັນພຽງການປັບໃຫ້ \"ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ (best fit)\" ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ 100% ສຳລັບທຸກສະເປັກຕຣຳສີ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງຕິດຕາມວ່າ \"ມັນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼາຍປານໃດ\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູ້ວ່າພວກເຮົາສາມາດເຊື່ອຖືໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນີ້ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bad profiles can happen and will do more harm than good if used.\n"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ດີສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະສົ່ງຜົນເສຍຫຼາຍກວ່າຜົນດີຖ້ານຳມາໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "delta E and the quality report"
msgstr "delta E ແລະ ລາຍງານຄຸນນະພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [CIE delta E 2000](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Color_difference#CIEDE2000) (ΔE) is used as a perceptual metric of the error between the reference color of the patches and the color obtained after each step of calibration:\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າ [CIE delta E 2000](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Color_difference#CIEDE2000) (ΔE) ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານການວັດແທກການຮັບຮູ້ "
"(perceptual metric) ຂອງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດລະຫວ່າງສີອ້າງອີງຂອງແຖບສີ ແລະ ສີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຫຼັງຈາກແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງກ"
"ານປັບທຽບ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ΔE = 0 means that there is no error -- the obtained color is exactly the reference color. Unfortunately, this will never happen in practice.\n"
msgstr ""
"ΔE = 0 ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ -- ສີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນກົງກັບສີອ້າງອີງຢ່າງສົມບູນ. ແຕ່ຫນ້າເສຍດາຍ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີວັ"
"ນເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນທາງປະຕິບັດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ΔE = 2.3 is defined as the Just Noticeable Difference (JND).\n"
msgstr ""
"ΔE = 2.3 ຖືກກຳນົດວ່າເປັນ ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ເລີ່ມສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ (Just Noticeable Difference - "
"JND).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ΔE < 2.3 means that the average observer will not be able to tell the difference between the expected reference color and the obtained color. This is a satisfactory result.\n"
msgstr ""
"ΔE < 2.3 ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຜູ້ສັງເກດການທົ່ວໄປຈະບໍ່ສາມາດບອກຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງສີອ້າງອີງທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ແລະ ສີທີ່"
"ໄດ້ຮັບ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຜົນລັດທີ່ໜ້າພໍໃຈ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ΔE > 2.3 means that the color difference between the expected reference and the obtained color is noticeable for the average observer. This is unsatisfactory but sometimes unavoidable.\n"
msgstr ""
"ΔE > 2.3 ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຂອງສີລະຫວ່າງສີອ້າງອີງທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ ແລະ ສີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ ແມ່ນສັງເກດເຫັນໄດ້ໂດ"
"ຍຜູ້ສັງເກດການທົ່ວໄປ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າພໍໃຈແຕ່ບາງຄັ້ງກໍຫຼີກເວັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The quality report tracks the average and maximum ΔE at the input of the module (before anything is done), after the chromatic adaptation step (white balance only), and at the output of the module (white balance and channel mixing). At each step, the ΔE should be lower than at the previous step, if everything goes as planned.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍງານຄຸນນະພາບຈະຕິດຕາມຄ່າ ΔE ສະເລ່ຍ ແລະ ສູງສຸດ ຢູ່ທີ່ຂາເຂົ້າຂອງໂມດູນ (ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມເຮັດຫຍັງ), ຫຼັງ"
"ຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນການປັບຕົວຕາມສີ (ສະເພາະຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວ), ແລະ ຢູ່ທີ່ຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນ (ຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວ ແລ"
"ະ ການປະສົມຊ່ອງສີ). ໃນແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນຕອນ, ຄ່າ ΔE ຄວນຈະຕ່ຳກວ່າຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນ ຖ້າທຸກຢ່າງເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ວາງ"
"ແຜນໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "profile data"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນໂປຣໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The data generated by the profiling process comprises the RGB 3×3 matrix and the detected illuminant. These are expressed in the CAT _adaptation_ space defined in the _CAT_ tab and are provided in case you want to export these coefficients to other software. If the detected illuminant is _daylight_ or _black body_, the matrix should be fairly generic and reusable for other _daylight_ and _black body_ illuminants with the addition of a small white balance adjustment.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈາກຂັ້ນຕອນການສ້າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ປະກອບດ້ວຍເມທຣິກ RGB 3x3 ແລະ ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ກວດພົບ. ສິ່ງ"
"ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ການປັບຕົວ CAT _adaptation_ ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນແຖບ _CAT_ ແລະ ມີໃຫ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່າ"
"ນຕ້ອງການສົ່ງອອກຄ່າສຳປະສິດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄປຍັງຊອບແວອື່ນ. ຖ້າແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ກວດພົບແມ່ນ _daylight_ ຫຼື "
"_black body_, ເມທຣິກນັ້ນຄວນຈະເປັນແບບທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໄດ້ກັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ "
"_daylight_ ແລະ _black body_ ອື່ນໆ ໂດຍການປັບຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວເພີ່ມເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "normalization values"
msgstr "ຄ່າການປັບໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ (normalization values)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the settings that you should define, as-is, for the _exposure_ and _black level correction_ parameters in the [_exposure_](./exposure.md) module, in order to obtain the lowest possible error in your profile. This step is optional and is useful only when the utmost precision is required, but beware that it can produce negative RGB values that will be clipped at various points in the pipeline.\n"
msgstr "ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ທ່ານຄວນກຳນົດ, ຕາມທີ່ບອກ, ສຳລັບພາຣາມິເຕີ _exposure_ ແລະ _black level correction_ ໃນໂມດູນ [_exposure_](./exposure.md), ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງທ່ານ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ ແລະ ມີປະໂຫຍດສະເພາະເມື່ອຕ້ອງການຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງສູງສຸດ, ແຕ່ໃຫ້ລະວັງວ່າມັນສາມາດສ້າງຄ່າ RGB ທີ່ເປັນລົບ ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກຕັດອອກໃນຈຸດຕ່າງໆຂອງໄພພ໌ລາຍ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "overlay"
msgstr "ແຜນຜັງທັບຊ້ອນ (overlay)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![color checker](./color-calibration/color-checker.png#w75)\n"
msgstr "![color checker](./color-calibration/color-checker.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The chart overlay displays a disc in the center of each color patch, which represents the expected reference value of that patch, projected into the display RGB space. This helps you to visually assess the difference between the reference and the actual color without having to bother with ΔE values. This visual clue will be reliable only if you set the _exposure_ module as instructed in the _normalization values_ of the profile report.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຜັງສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນຊ້ອນທັບ (chart overlay) ຈະສະແດງຮູບວົງມົນຢູ່ໃຈກາງຂອງແຕ່ລະແຖບສີ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງຄ່າ"
"ອ້າງອີງທີ່ຄາດໄວ້ຂອງແຖບນັ້ນ ໂດຍສາຍເຂົ້າໄປໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ຂອງການສະແດງຜົນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປະເມີນຄວາມ"
"ແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງສີອ້າງອີງ ແລະ ສີຕົວຈິງໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕາ ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກັງວົນກັບຄ່າ ΔE. ຄຳແນະນຳທາງສາຍຕານີ້"
"ຈະເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າໂມດູນ _exposure_ ຕາມທີ່ແນະນຳໃນ _ຄ່າການປັບໃຫ້ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ_ "
"(normalization values) ຂອງລາຍງານໂປຣໄຟລ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once the profile has been calibrated, some of the square patches will be crossed in the background by one or two diagonals:\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ຮັບການປັບທຽບແລ້ວ, ບາງແຖບສີຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມຈະມີເສັ້ນທະແຍງມຸມໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ສອງເສັ້ນຕັດຜ່ານໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "patches that are not crossed have ΔE < 2.3 (JND), meaning they are accurate enough that the average observer will be unable to notice the deviation,\n"
msgstr ""
"ແຖບສີທີ່ບໍ່ມີຮອຍກາກະບາດທັບ ມີຄ່າ ΔE < 2.3 (JND), ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງພຽງພໍທີ່ຜູ້ສັງເກດການທົ່ວ"
"ໄປຈະບໍ່ສັງເກດເຫັນຄວາມຜິດພ້ຽນ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "patches crossed with one diagonal have 2.3 < ΔE < 4.6, meaning that they are mildly inaccurate,\n"
msgstr ""
"ແຖບສີທີ່ມີຮອຍຂີດທັບໜຶ່ງເສັ້ນ ມີຄ່າ 2.3 < ΔE < 4.6, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນມີຄວາມບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເລັກນ້ອຍ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "patches crossed with two diagonals have ΔE > 4.6 (2 × JND), meaning that they are highly inaccurate.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແຖບສີທີ່ມີຮອຍກາກະບາດທັບ (ສອງເສັ້ນ) ມີຄ່າ ΔE > 4.6 (2 x JND), ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນມີຄວາມບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສູ"
"ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This visual feedback will help you to set up the optimization trade-off to check which colors are more or less accurate.\n"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳທາງສາຍຕານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າການປັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ ເພື່ອກວດສອບວ່າສີໃດມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "enhancing the profile"
msgstr "ການເສີມປະສິດທິພາບໂປຣໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because any calibration is merely a \"best fit\" optimization (using a weighted least-squares method) it is impossible to have all patches within our ΔE < 2.3 tolerance. Some compromise will therefore be required.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກການປັບທຽບໃດໆກໍຕາມແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ການປັບຄ່າໃຫ້ \"ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ\" (ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີກຳລັງສອງນ້ອຍສຸດແບບ"
"ຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກ - weighted least-squares method) ມັນຈຶ່ງເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ທຸກແຖບສີຢູ່ພາຍໃນເກນ ΔE "
"< 2.3. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ຈຶ່ງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຍອມຮັບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດບາງສ່ວນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _optimize for_ parameter allows you to define an optimization strategy that attempts to increase the profile accuracy in some colors at the expense of others. The following options are available:\n"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີ _optimize for_ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດກົນລະຍຸດການປັບໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມ ທີ່ພະຍາຍາມເພີ່ມຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃນບາງສີ ໂດຍຍອມເສຍຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງໃນສີອື່ນໆ. ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_none_: Don't use an explicit strategy but rely on the implicit strategy defined by the color checker manufacturer. For example, if the color checker has mostly low-saturation patches, the profile will be more accurate for less-saturated colors.\n"
msgstr "_none_: ບໍ່ໃຊ້ກົນລະຍຸດທີ່ຊັດເຈນ ແຕ່ອາໄສກົນລະຍຸດທີ່ຜູ້ຜະລິດແຜ່ນທຽບສີກຳນົດໄວ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າແຜ່ນທຽບສີມີແຖບສີທີ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຕ່ຳເປັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າສຳລັບສີທີ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວໜ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_neutral colors_: Give priority to grays and less-saturated colors. This is useful for desperate cases involving cheap fluorescent and LED lightings, having low CRI. However, it may increase the error in highly-saturated colors more than not having any profile.\n"
msgstr ""
"_ສີທີ່ເປັນກາງ (neutral colors)_: ໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບສີເທົາ ແລະ ສີທີ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຕ່ຳ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳ"
"ລັບກໍລະນີທີ່ຈັດການໄດ້ຍາກ ເຊັ່ນ: ແສງໄຟຟລູອໍເຣສເຊນ ແລະ ແອລອີດີ ລາຄາຖືກ ທີ່ມີຄ່າ CRI ຕ່ຳ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາ"
"ມ, ມັນອາດຈະເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນສີທີ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສູງຫຼາຍກວ່າການບໍ່ມີໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເລີຍ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_saturated colors_: Give priority to primary colors and highly-saturated colors. This is useful in product and commercial photography, to get brand colors right.\n"
msgstr "_saturated colors_: ໃຫ້ນ້ຳໜັກຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບສີຫຼັກ (primary colors) ແລະ ສີທີ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສູງ. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຖ່າຍຮູບຜະລິດຕະພັນ ແລະ ທາງການຄ້າ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ສີຂອງແບຣນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_skin and soil colors_, _foliage colors_, _sky and water colors_: Give priority to the chosen hue range. This is useful if the subject of your images is clearly defined and has a typical color.\n"
msgstr ""
"_ສີຜິວ ແລະ ດິນ_, _ສີໃບໄມ້_, _ສີທ້ອງຟ້າ ແລະ ນ້ຳ_: ໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນກັບຊ່ວງໂທນສີທີ່ເລືອກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້"
"າຫົວຂໍ້ຂອງຮູບພາບຂອງທ່ານຖືກກຳນົດຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ ແລະ ມີສີທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_average delta E_: Attempt to make the color error uniform across the color range and minimize the average perceptual error. This is useful for generic profiles.\n"
msgstr "_average delta E_: ພະຍາຍາມເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງສີສະເໝີກັນທົ່ວທຸກຊ່ວງສີ ແລະ ລົດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທາງການຮັບຮູ້ສະເລ່ຍໃຫ້ຕ່ຳທີ່ສຸດ. ນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທົ່ວໄປ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_maximum delta E_: Attempt to minimize outliers and large errors, at the expense of the average error. This can be useful to get highly saturated blues back into line.\n"
msgstr "_maximum delta E_: ພະຍາຍາມລົດຄ່າທີ່ຜິດປົກກະຕິ (outliers) ແລະ ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ໂດຍຍອມເສຍຄ່າຂໍ້ຜິດພາດສະເລ່ຍ. ນີ້ສາມາດມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ສີຟ້າທີ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສູງກັບມາຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "No matter what you do, strategies that favor a low average ΔE will usually have a higher maximum ΔE, and vice versa. Also, blues are always the more challenging color range to get correct, so the calibration usually falls back to protecting blues at the expense of everything else, or everything else at the expense of blues.\n"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະເຮັດແນວໃດ, ກົນລະຍຸດທີ່ເນັ້ນໃຫ້ຄ່າ ΔE ສະເລ່ຍຕ່ຳ ມັກຈະມີຄ່າ ΔE ສູງສຸດທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ໃນທາງກົງ"
"ກັນຂ້າມກໍເຊັ່ນກັນ. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ສີຟ້າແມ່ນຊ່ວງສີທີ່ທ້າທາຍທີ່ສຸດໃນການປັບໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການປັບທຽບມັກຈະຕ້ອງເ"
"ລືອກລະຫວ່າງການຮັກສາສີຟ້າໄວ້ໂດຍຍອມເສຍສີອື່ນໆ, ຫຼື ຮັກສາສີອື່ນໆໂດຍຍອມເສຍສີຟ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ease of obtaining a proper calibration depends on the quality of the scene illuminant (daylight and high CRI illuminants should always be preferred), the quality of the primary _input color profile_, the _black point compensation_ set in the _exposure_ module, but first and foremost on the mathematical properties of the camera sensor's filter array.\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມງ່າຍໃນການໄດ້ຮັບການປັບທຽບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄຸນນະພາບຂອງແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງຂອງສາກ (ຄວນເລືອກແສງກາງເວັນ ແລະ ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງທີ່ມີ CRI ສູງ), ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງ _input color profile_ ຫຼັກ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ _black point compensation_ ໃນໂມດູນ _exposure_, ແຕ່ສິ່ງທີ່ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດທາງຄະນິດສາດຂອງອາເຣຟິວເຕີ (filter array) ຂອງເຊັນເຊີກ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "profile checking"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບໂປຣໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is possible to use the _color space check_ button (first on the left, at the bottom of the module) to perform a single ΔE computation of the color checker reference against the output of the _color calibration_ module. This can be used in the following ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ _ກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ສີ_ (color space check) (ປຸ່ມທຳອິດທາງຊ້າຍ, ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູ"
"ນ) ເພື່ອຄຳນວນ ΔE ຄັ້ງດຽວຂອງແຜ່ນທຽບສີອ້າງອີງກັບຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນ _color calibration_. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມ"
"າດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນຮູບແບບດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To check the accuracy of a profile calculated in particular conditions against a color checker shot in different conditions.\n"
msgstr "1. ເພື່ອກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຄຳນວນໃນສະພາວະໃດໜຶ່ງ ທຽບກັບຮູບຖ່າຍແຜ່ນທຽບສີໃນສະພາວະທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To evaluate the performance of any color correction performed earlier in the pipe, by setting the _color calibration_ parameters to values that effectively disable it (CAT _adaptation_ to _none_, everything else set to default), and just use the average ΔE as a performance metric.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປະເມີນປະສິດທິພາບຂອງການແກ້ໄຂສີໃດໆທີ່ເຮັດມາກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ໃນລຳດັບການປະມວນຜົນ, ໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາລາມິເຕີ"
"ຂອງ _color calibration_ ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ປິດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງມັນ (ຕັ້ງ CAT _adaptation_ ເປັນ "
"_none_, ສ່ວນອື່ນໆຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ແລະ ໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າ ΔE ສະເລ່ຍເປັນມາດຕະການວັດແທກປະສິດທິພາ"
"ບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ability to use standard CIE illuminants and CCT-based interfaces to define the illuminant color depends on sound default values for the standard matrix in the _input color profile_ module as well as reasonable RGB coefficients in the _white balance_ module.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໃຊ້ແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ CIE ມາດຕະຖານ ແລະ ອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ອີງຕາມ CCT ເພື່ອກຳນົດສີຂອງແຫຼ່ງ"
"ກຳເນີດແສງ ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງເມທຣິກມາດຕະຖານໃນໂມດູນ _input color profile_ ລວມ"
"ເຖິງຄ່າສຳປະສິດ RGB ທີ່ເໝາະສົມໃນໂມດູນ _white balance_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some cameras, most notably those from Olympus and Sony, have unexpected white balance coefficients that will always make the detected CCT invalid even for legitimate daylight scene illuminants. This error most likely comes from issues with the standard input matrix, which is taken from the Adobe DNG Converter.\n"
msgstr "ກ້ອງບາງລຸ້ນ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຈາກ Olympus ແລະ Sony, ມີຄ່າສຳປະສິດຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວທີ່ບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ CCT ທີ່ກວດພົບບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (invalid) ສະເໝີ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປັນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງກາງເວັນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງກໍຕາມ. ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດນີ້ນ່າຈະມາຈາກບັນຫາຂອງເມທຣິກຊ໌ຂາເຂົ້າເຮົ້າມາດຕະຖານ, ເຊິ່ງນຳມາຈາກ Adobe DNG Converter.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is possible to alleviate this issue, if you have a computer screen calibrated for a D65 illuminant, using the following process:\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດບັນເທົາບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້, ຖ້າທ່ານມີໜ້າຈໍຄອມພິວເຕີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການປັບທຽບສຳລັບແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດແສງ D65, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂະບວນການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Display a white surface on your screen, for example by opening a blank canvas in any photo editing software you like\n"
msgstr "1. ສະແດງພື້ນຜິວສີຂາວໃນໜ້າຈໍຂອງທ່ານ, ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໂດຍການເປີດໜ້າເປົ່າຫວ່າງໃນຊອບແວແຕ່ງຮູບໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານມັກ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a blurry (out of focus) image of that surface with your camera, ensuring that you don't have any \"parasite\" light in the frame, you have no clipping, and are using an aperture between f/5.6 and f/8,\n"
msgstr "2. ຖ່າຍຮູບທີ່ມົວ (ບໍ່ໂຟກັດ) ຂອງພື້ນຜິວນັ້ນດ້ວຍກ້ອງຂອງທ່ານ, ໂດຍຮັບປະກັນວ່າບໍ່ມີແສງລົບກວນອື່ນໆໃນເຟຣມ, ບໍ່ມີການຕັດແສງ (clipping), ແລະ ໃຊ້ຮູຮັບແສງລະຫວ່າງ f/5.6 ຫາ f/8,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open the image in darktable and extract the white balance by using the [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) tool in the _white balance_ module on the center area of the image (non-central regions might be subject to chromatic aberrations). This will generate a set of 3 RGB coefficients.\n"
msgstr "3. ເປີດຮູບໃນ darktable ແລະ ສະກັດຄ່າຄວາມສົມດຸນສີຂາວໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [picker](../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) ໃນໂມດູນ _white balance_ ບໍລິເວນໃຈກາງຂອງຮູບ (ບໍລິເວນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໃຈກາງອາດຈະມີຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນຂອງສີ). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງຊຸດຂອງຄ່າສຳປະສິດ RGB 3 ຄ່າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-calibration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Save a preset](../../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md#creating-and-editing-presets) for the _white balance_ module with these coefficients and auto-apply it to any color RAW image created by the same camera.\n"
msgstr "4. [ບັນທຶກເປັນ preset](../../darkroom/processing-modules/presets.md#creating-and-editing-presets) ສຳລັບໂມດູນ _white balance_ ດ້ວຍຄ່າສຳປະສິດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ແລະ ຕັ້ງໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດກັບຮູບ RAW ສີໃດໆທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍກ້ອງລຸ້ນດຽວກັນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/scale-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "scale pixels"
msgstr "ປັບຂະໜາດພິກເຊວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/scale-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": module for setting pixel aspect ratio  useful for certain sensor types and anamorphic desqueeze.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ໂມດູນສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າອັດຕາສ່ວນພິກເຊວ ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບເຊັນເຊີບາງປະເພດ ແລະ ການດຶງພາບອະນາມໍຟິກ (anamorphic desqueeze).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/scale-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some cameras (such as the Nikon D1X) have rectangular instead of the usual square sensor cells. Without correction this would lead to distorted images. This module applies the required scaling.\n"
msgstr "ກ້ອງບາງລຸ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ Nikon D1X) ມີເຊັນເຊີເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈສາກແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຮູບສີ່ແຈສະເໝີຄືທົ່ວໄປ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີການປັບແກ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບຜິດພ້ຽນ. ໂມດູນນີ້ຈະເຮັດການປັບຂະໜາດຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/scale-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "darktable detects images that need correction using their Exif data and automatically activates this module where required.\n"
msgstr "darktable ຈະກວດສອບພາບທີ່ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປັບແກ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ແລະ ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຈຳເປັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/scale-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For other images, the module can also be used to de-squeeze the image when using anamorphic lenses.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບພາບອື່ນໆ, ໂມດູນນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຶງພາບ (de-squeeze) ເມື່ອໃຊ້ເລນອະນາມໍຟິກ (anamorphic lenses).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/scale-pixels.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pixel aspect ratio\n"
": Aspect ratio of the pixels. Values greater than 1 stretch the image horizontally, values less than 1 stretch the image vertically.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນພິກເຊວ\n"
": ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງພິກເຊວ. ຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1 ຈະຢືດພາບໃນແນວນອນ, ຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍກວ່າ 1 ຈະຢືດພາບໃນແນວຕັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "blurs"
msgstr "ການເຮັດໃຫ້ເບີຼ (blurs)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": simulate physically-accurate lens and motion blurs.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ຈຳລອງການເບີຼຈາກເລນ ແລະ ການເຄື່ອນໄຫວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate physically-accurate blurs in scene-referred RGB space.\n"
msgstr "ຈຳລອງການເບີຼທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມຫຼັກຟີຊິກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ແບບ scene-referred.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "blur types"
msgstr "ປະເພດການເບີຼ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Three types of blur are provided:\n"
msgstr "ມີສາມປະເພດການເບີຼໃຫ້ເລືອກ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_lens blur_: Simulates a lens diaphragm with a configurable number of blades and blade curvature to create synthetic bokeh.\n"
msgstr "1. _ເບີຼຈາກເລນ (lens blur)_: ຈຳລອງໄດອາແຟຣມຂອງເລນເພື່ອສ້າງໂບເກ້ (bokeh) ແບບສັງເຄາະ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_motion blur_: Simulates the effect of camera motion with a configurable path.\n"
msgstr "2. _ເບີຼຈາກການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (motion blur)_: ຈຳລອງຜົນກະທົບຈາກການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຂອງກ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_gaussian blur_: This is not really an optical blur but can be used for denoising or for creative effects using [blend modes](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/blend-modes.md)\n"
msgstr "3. _Gaussian blur_: ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການລຸດສັນຍານລົບ ຫຼື ສ້າງຜົນກະທົບທາງສິລະປະ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A diagram at the top of the module shows the shape of the blurring operator (known as the [_point spread function_](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point_spread_function)). The module will turn each luminous point from the scene into a blot shaped like the displayed blurring operator, with the size of the blot defined by the _blur radius_.\n"
msgstr "ແຜນວາດດ້ານເທິງສະແດງຮູບຮ່າງຂອງການເບີຼ (Point Spread Function).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blur radius\n"
": The spreading size of the blur.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລັດສະໝີການເບີຼ (blur radius)\n"
": ຂະໜາດການກະຈາຍຂອງການເບີຼ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"blur type\n"
": Choose between the different blur variants (above).\n"
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດການເບີຼ (blur type)\n"
": ເລືອກຮູບແບບການເບີຼຕ່າງໆ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "controls specific to lens blur"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມສະເພາະສຳລັບການເບີຼຈາກເລນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"diaphragm blades\n"
": The number of blades that the diaphragm is composed of. Older lenses used typically 5 or 7 blades, newer lenses typically use 9 or 11 blades. In any case, real lenses have an odd number of blades and any number greater than 11 blades comes very close to producing a perfect disc. If you degenerate the diaphragm settings with the _concavity_ to create a star or an asterisk, this control defines how many branches it has.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນໃບໄດອາແຟຣມ (diaphragm blades)\n"
": ຈຳນວນແຜ່ນໃບຂອງຮູຮັບແສງ ທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ຮູບຮ່າງຂອງໂບເກ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"concavity\n"
": - a concavity of 1 ensures the diaphragm is a [regular convex polygon](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regular_polygon#Regular_convex_polygons) (triangle, pentagon, heptagon, etc.).\n"
": - a concavity greater than 1 but lower than `number of blades - 1` turns the shape into a star.\n"
": - a concavity greater than `number of blades - 1` but lower than `number of blades` turns the shape into an asterisk, when decreasing _linearity_ below 1.\n"
": - a concavity greater than or equal to `number of blades` degenerates the shape into a \"burst pattern\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເວົ້າ (concavity)\n"
": - ຄ່າຄວາມເວົ້າທີ່ 1 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດອະແຟຣມ (diaphragm) ເປັນ [ຮູບຫຼາຍຫຼ່ຽມນູນປົກກະຕິ](https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regular_polygon#Regular_convex_polygons) (ຮູບສາມຫຼ່ຽມ, ຫ້າຫຼ່"
"ຽມ, ເຈັດຫຼ່ຽມ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ).\n"
": - ຄ່າຄວາມເວົ້າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1 ແຕ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ `ຈຳນວນໃບໄດອະແຟຣມ - 1` ຈະປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງໃຫ້ເປັນຮູບດາວ.\n"
": - ຄ່າຄວາມເວົ້າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ `ຈຳນວນໃບໄດອະແຟຣມ - 1` ແຕ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ `ຈຳນວນໃບໄດອະແຟຣມ` ຈະປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່"
"າງໃຫ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງໝາຍດອກຈັນ (asterisk), ເມື່ອຫຼຸດຄ່າ _linearity_ ລົງຕ່ຳກວ່າ 1.\n"
": - ຄ່າຄວາມເວົ້າທີ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ `ຈຳນວນໃບໄດອະແຟຣມ` ຈະປ່ຽນຮູບຮ່າງໃຫ້ເປັນ \"ລວດລາຍແສງກະຈ"
"າຍ\" (burst pattern).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"linearity\n"
": - a linearity of 0 creates a disc, no matter the number of blades or the concavity.\n"
": - a linearity of 1 makes all the outer bounds of the shape straight.\n"
": - a linearity between 0 and 1 makes the outer bounds of the shape more or less curved.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່ (linearity)\n"
": ຄ່າ 0 ຈະສ້າງຮູບວົງມົນ, ຄ່າ 1 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂອບຂອງຮູບຮ່າງເປັນເສັ້ນຊື່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rotation\n"
": Allows the shape to be rotated with respect to its center -- mostly useful with a small number of blades, when a particular orientation is needed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການໝຸນ (rotation)\n"
": ໝຸນຮູບຮ່າງຂອງການເບີຼອ້ອມຮອບຈຸດສູນກາງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "controls specific to motion blur"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມສະເພາະສຳລັບການເບຼີແບບເຄື່ອນໄຫວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"direction\n"
": The orientation of the motion's path in angular degrees. 0° is horizontal motion.\n"
msgstr ""
"ທິດທາງ (direction)\n"
": ການກຳນົດທິດທາງຂອງເສັ້ນທາງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ເປັນອົງສາ. 0° ແມ່ນການເຄື່ອນທີ່ໃນແນວນອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curvature\n"
": The curvature of the motion. Zero produces a straight line, a negative value produces a concave curvature, a positive value produces a convex curvature.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມໂຄ້ງ\n"
": ຄວາມໂຄ້ງຂອງການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ. ສູນຈະສ້າງເສັ້ນຊື່, ຄ່າລົບຈະສ້າງຄວາມໂຄ້ງແບບຍຸບເຂົ້າ (concave), ຄ່າບວກຈະສ້າງຄວາມໂຄ້ງແບບໂນນອອກ (convex).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"offset\n"
": Shifts along the motion path following its curve. This is useful to select a portion of the curved path that is symmetrical, which produces a coma shape (example 1: direction = -45°, curvature = +2, offset = +0.5 ; example 2 : direction = -45°, curvature = +1, offset = +1).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຊົດເຊີຍ (offset)\n"
": ການເລື່ອນໄປຕາມເສັ້ນທາງການເຄື່ອນທີ່ຕາມເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂອງມັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເລືອກສ່ວນຂອງເສັ້ນທາງໂຄ້"
"ງທີ່ມີຄວາມສົມມາດ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສ້າງຮູບຮ່າງແບບຫາງດາວ (coma shape) (ຕົວຢ່າງ 1: direction = -45"
"°, curvature = +2, offset = +0.5 ; ຕົວຢ່າງ 2: direction = -45°, curvature = "
"+1, offset = +1).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module is implemented using a \"naive\" convolution, which is a slow algorithm. Faster approaches are available (using FFT) but not yet implemented. The GPU implementation, through OpenCL, should hide this issue somewhat. In any case, the runtime of the module will increase with the square of the blur radius.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນນີ້ຖືກພັດທະນາໂດຍໃຊ້ຄອນໂວນູຊັນແບບ \"ພື້ນຖານ\" (naive convolution), ເຊິ່ງເປັນອານກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ຊ້"
"າ. ຍັງມີວິທີທີ່ໄວກວ່າ (ໂດຍໃຊ້ FFT) ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້. ການເຮັດວຽກຜ່ານ GPU ໂດຍໃຊ້ OpenCL ອ"
"າດຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນບັນຫານີ້ໄດ້ບາງສ່ວນ. ແຕ່ໃນທຸກກໍລະນີ, ເວລາໃນການປະມວນຜົນຂອງໂມດູນຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຕາມກຳລັງສ"
"ອງຂອງລັດສະໝີຄວາມມົວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The blurring process does not take scene depth and depth-of-field into account, but blurs the whole image as a flat object. It is therefore not suitable for creating fake depth-of-field. Using darktable's general masking will only partially work to isolate the foreground of an image, since it will still be blurred into the background.\n"
msgstr "ຂະບວນການເບຼີນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຄຳນຶງເຖິງຄວາມເລິກຂອງສາກ ແລະ ໄລຍະຊັດ (depth-of-field), ແຕ່ຈະເບຼີທັງຮູບພາບຄືກັບວັດຖຸພຽງໆ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການສ້າງໄລຍະຊັດແບບປອມ. ການໃຊ້ການມາສ (masking) ທົ່ວໄປຂອງ darktable ຈະຊ່ວຍແຍກສ່ວນໜ້າຂອງຮູບໄດ້ພຽງບາງສ່ວນເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ເພາະວ່າມັນຈະຍັງມີການເບຼີກືນເຂົ້າໄປໃນສ່ວນຫຼັງຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tips and tricks"
msgstr "ເຄັດລັບ ແລະ ເທັກນິກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/blurs.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All images are usually (even a tiny bit) noisy. If you blur only a part of the image, the blurred region will look suspiciously clean compared to the rest of the image. It is therefore a good idea to add a bit of noise on top of the blurred part to blend it with the rest, using either the [grain](./grain.md) or the [censorize](./censorize.md) modules.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບທັງໝົດປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມີສິ່ງລົບກວນ (noise) ຢູ່ສະເໝີ (ແມ່ນແຕ່ພຽງເລັກນ້ອຍ). ຖ້າເຈົ້າເບຼີພຽງແຕ່ບາງສ່ວນຂອງຮູບ, ເຂດທີ່ເບຼີນັ້ນຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າສະອາດເກີນໄປເມື່ອທຽບກັບສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງຮູບ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ມັນຈຶ່ງເປັນຄວາມຄິດທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມ noise ເຂົ້າໄປເລັກນ້ອຍຢູ່ເທິງສ່ວນທີ່ເບຼີ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນກືນເຂົ້າກັບສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອ ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [grain](./grain.md) ຫຼື [censorize](./censorize.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "(deprecated) spot removal"
msgstr "(ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ) ການລົບຈຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": remove sensor dust spots.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ລົບຈຸດຝຸ່ນຈາກເຊັນເຊີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"processing\n"
": geometric, raw.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະມວນຜົນ\n"
": ເລຂາຄະນິດ, ໄຟລ໌ດິບ (raw).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Please note that this module is [deprecated](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) from darktable 3.6 and should no longer be used for new edits. Please use the \"cloning\" tool in the [_retouch_](./retouch.md) module instead.**\n"
msgstr "**ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ໂມດູນນີ້ແມ່ນ [ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ](../../darkroom/processing-modules/deprecated.md) ຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 3.6 ແລະ ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງໃໝ່. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື \"cloning\" ໃນໂມດູນ [_retouch_](./retouch.md) ແທນ.**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Correct areas of an image (the target) using details from another area of the image (the source).\n"
msgstr "ປັບແກ້ພື້ນທີ່ຂອງພາບ (ເປົ້າໝາຍ) ໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍລະອຽດຈາກພື້ນທີ່ອື່ນຂອງພາບ (ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module uses some of the shapes that are available for [drawn masks](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) (circles, ellipses and paths), and the user interface is similar. \n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ໃຊ້ຮູບຊົງບາງຢ່າງທີ່ມີໃນ [ມາກສ໌ທີ່ແຕ້ມເອງ](../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) (ວົງມົນ, ວົງມົນຮີ ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງ), ແລະ ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກໍຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use this module, first select the desired shape by clicking the corresponding shape icon (Ctrl+click to enable continuous shape creation mode). Next, you may optionally choose the source for the correction by using Shift+Ctrl+click or Shift+click on the image canvas to choose absolute or relative mode, respectively (see below). Finally click on the canvas to choose the area to be healed (the target area). A cross is displayed where the source area will be positioned.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້, ກ່ອນອື່ນໃຫ້ເລືອກຮູບຊົງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນຮູບຊົງ (Ctrl+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອເປີດໂໝດສ້າງຮູບຊົງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ). ຕໍ່ໄປ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບການປັບແກ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ Shift+Ctrl+ຄລິກ ຫຼື Shift+ຄລິກ ເທິງພາບເພື່ອເລືອກໂໝດສຳບູນ (absolute) ຫຼື ໂໝດສຳພັນ (relative) ຕາມລຳດັບ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ). ສຸດທ້າຍ, ຄລິກເທິງພາບເພື່ອເລືອກພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການປັບແກ້ (ພື້ນທີ່ເປົ້າໝາຍ). ເຄື່ອງໝາຍກາກບາດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ພື້ນທີ່ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຕັ້ງຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The source positioning has two modes\n"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນມີສອງໂໝດ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"absolute mode\n"
": Before placing a shape on the image canvas, Shift+Ctrl+click on the desired position for the source. From this point on, all new shapes will have their source created at the same absolute position (in image co-ordinates). \n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດສຳບູນ (absolute mode)\n"
": ກ່ອນຈະວາງຮູບຊົງເທິງພາບ, Shift+Ctrl+ຄລິກ ເທິງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ. ຈາກຈຸດນີ້ເປັນຕົ້ນໄປ, ຮູບຊົງໃໝ່ທັງໝົດຈະມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຕຳແໜ່ງສຳບູນດຽວກັນ (ໃນພິກັດຂອງພາບ). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"relative mode\n"
": Before placing a shape on the image canvas, Shift+click on the desired position for the source. The current shape will have the source created at that position and subsequent shapes will have their source created at the same position, _relative to the target shape_.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດສຳພັນ (relative mode)\n"
": ກ່ອນຈະວາງຮູບຊົງເທິງພາບ, Shift+ຄລິກ ເທິງຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປັນແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ. ຮູບຊົງປັດຈຸບັນຈະມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນ ແລະ ຮູບຊົງຕໍ່ໆໄປຈະມີແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຕຳແໜ່ງດຽວກັນ _ເມື່ອທຽບກັບຮູບຊົງເປົ້າໝາຍ_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "After creation the source and target areas of each shape can be shifted independently until the result matches your expectations. An arrow points from the source area of each shape to its target.\n"
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສ້າງແລ້ວ, ພື້ນທີ່ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງສາມາດເລື່ອນແຍກກັນໄດ້ຈົນກວ່າຜົນລັດຈະເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ລູກສອນຈະຊີ້ຈາກພື້ນທີ່ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງໄປຫາເປົ້າໝາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the shape-specific controls to adjust each shape's size, border width, and other attributes.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຕົວຄວບຄຸມສະເພາະຮູບຊົງເພື່ອປັບຂະໜາດ, ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຂອບ ແລະ ຄຸນລັກສະນະອື່ນໆຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click on a shape to delete it.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາເທິງຮູບຊົງເພື່ອລົບມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/spot-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module is equivalent to the \"cloning\" tool in the [_retouch_](./retouch.md) module; see the description of the cloning tool for additional details and examples.  If _spot removal_ produces unsatisfactory results, you may want to try the \"heal\" tool in _retouch_ instead.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບເຄື່ອງມື \"cloning\" ໃນໂມດູນ [_retouch_](./retouch.md); ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງເຄື່ອງມື cloning ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ແລະ ຕົວຢ່າງ. ຫາກ _ການລົບຈຸດ_ ໃຫ້ຜົນລັດທີ່ບໍ່ໜ້າເພິ່ງພໍໃຈ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະລອງໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື \"heal\" ໃນ _retouch_ ແທນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "haze removal"
msgstr "ການລົດໝອກຄັວນ (haze removal)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": remove fog and atmospheric hazing from images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ລົບໝອກ ແລະ ຄວາມມົວຈາກບັນຍາກາດອອກຈາກຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically reduce the effect of dust and haze in the atmosphere. This module may also be employed more generally to give images a color boost specifically in low-contrast regions of the image.\n"
msgstr "ລົດຜົນກະທົບຂອງຝຸ່ນ ແລະ ໝອກຄັວນໃນບັນຍາກາດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໂມດູລນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນລັກສະນະທົ່ວໄປເພື່ອເພີ່ມສີສັນໃຫ້ກັບຮູບ ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ມີຄອນທຣາສຕ່ຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Haze absorbs light from objects in the scene but it is also a source of diffuse background light. The haze removal module first estimates, for each image region, the amount of haze in the scene. It then removes the diffuse background light according to its local strength and recovers the original object light.\n"
msgstr "ໝອກຄັວນຈະດູດຊຶມແສງຈາກວັດຖຸໃນສາກ ແຕ່ມັນກໍເປັນແຫຼ່ງກຳເນີດຂອງແສງພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ຟຸ້ງກະຈາຍ. ໂມດູລການລົດໝອກຄັວນຈະປະເມີນປະລິມານໝອກຄັວນໃນແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຂອງຮູບກ່ອນ. ຈາກນັ້ນມັນຈະລົບແສງພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ຟຸ້ງກະຈາຍອອກຕາມຄວາມແຮງຂອງມັນໃນແຕ່ລະພື້ນທີ່ ແລະ ກູ້ຄືນແສງຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງວັດຖຸ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting both of the module's controls to unity maximizes the amount of haze removal but is also likely to produce some artifacts. Removing the atmospheric light entirely may render the image flat and result in an unnatural looking style. Optimal values are typically below unity and are rather image dependent, but also a matter of personal aesthetic preferences.\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຄວບຄຸມທັງສອງຂອງໂມດູລໄວ້ທີ່ຄ່າສູງສຸດ (unity) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການລົດໝອກຄັວນມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ ແຕ່ກໍອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດຈຸດລົບ (artifacts) ໄດ້. ການລົບແສງບັນຍາກາດອອກທັງໝົດອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບເບິ່ງແບນ ແລະ ເບິ່ງບໍ່ເປັນທຳມະຊາດ. ຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່າສູງສຸດ ແລະ ຂຶ້ນກັບຮູບແຕ່ລະຮູບ ລວມທັງຄວາມມັກສ່ວນຕົວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: While this module does increase contrast, is not intended for this purpose, and will fail on many images that do not contain actual haze. To increase contrast on non-hazy images, you can use [_local contrast_](./local-contrast.md), [_diffuse or sharpen_](./diffuse.md), or use the 4-ways tab in [_color balance rgb_](./color-balance-rgb.md) (reduce the shadows and lift luminance).\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໂມດູລນີ້ຈະເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສ, ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງນັ້ນ, ແລະ ຈະໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຜົນກັບຮູບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີໝອກຄັວນແທ້ໆ. ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄອນທຣາສໃນຮູບທີ່ບໍ່ມີໝອກ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ [_ຄອນທຣາສສະເພາະສ່ວນ (local contrast)_](./local-contrast.md), [_ການຟຸ້ງ ຫຼື ການເຮັດໃຫ້ຄົມ (diffuse or sharpen)_](./diffuse.md), ຫຼື ໃຊ້ແຖບ 4-ways ໃນ [_ສົມດຸນສີ RGB (color balance rgb)_](./color-balance-rgb.md) (ຫຼຸດສ່ວນເງົາ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"strength\n"
": The amount of haze removal. At unity, the module removes 100 percent of the detected haze up to the specified distance. Negative values increase the amount of haze in the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມແຮງ (strength)\n"
": ປະລິມານການລົດໝອກຄັວນ. ທີ່ຄ່າສູງສຸດ (unity), ໂມດູລຈະລົບໝອກຄັວນທີ່ກວດພົບອອກ 100 ເປີເຊັນ ຕາມໄລຍະທາງທີ່ກຳນົດ. ຄ່າລົບຈະເພີ່ມປະລິມານໝອກຄັວນໃນຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/haze-removal.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"distance\n"
": Limit the distance up to which haze is removed. For small values, haze removal is restricted to the foreground of the image. Haze is removed from the entire image if the distance parameter is set to unity. If the _strength_ is negative the distance control has no effect.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະທາງ (distance)\n"
": ຈຳກັດໄລຍະທາງທີ່ຈະລົດໝອກຄັວນ. ສຳລັບຄ່າທີ່ນ້ອຍ, ການລົດໝອກຄັວນຈະຖືກຈຳກັດຢູ່ສະເພາະສ່ວນໜ້າ (foreground) ຂອງຮູບ. ໝອກຄັວນຈະຖືກລົບອອກຈາກທັງຮູບຫາກຕັ້ງພາຣາມີເຕີໄລຍະທາງໄວ້ທີ່ຄ່າສູງສຸດ (unity). ຫາກຄ່າ _ຄວາມແຮງ_ ເປັນລົບ, ຕົວຄວບຄຸມໄລຍະທາງຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຜົນໃດໆ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "color harmonizer"
msgstr "color harmonizer (ຕົວປະສານສີ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": harmonize colors toward a selected palette in perceptual space.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍລະອຽດ\n"
": ປະສານສີໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບພາເລັດສີທີ່ເລືອກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີການຮັບຮູ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"purpose\n"
": creative color grading.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດປະສົງ\n"
": ການປັບແຕ່ງສີແບບສ້າງສັນ (creative color grading).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"processing\n"
": darktable UCS / JCH (perceptual).\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປະມວນຜົນ\n"
": darktable UCS / JCH (perceptual).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The color harmonizer reduces chromatic dissonance by pushing hues toward a selected color palette.\n"
"This palette is defined by a set of hue angles called harmony nodes.\n"
"Colors that are \"off-palette\" are gently pulled toward the nearest node; colors already on a node are left unchanged.\n"
"A per-node saturation multiplier can additionally boost or reduce the colorfulness of colors near each node.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວສ້າງຄວາມກົມກຽວຂອງສີ ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຄວາມຂັດແຍ່ງຂອງສີ ໂດຍການດັນເນື້ອສີໃຫ້ເຂົ້າຫາຊຸດສີທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້.\n"
"ຊຸດສີນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍກຸ່ມຂອງມຸມເນື້ອສີ ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ ໂນດຄວາມກົມກຽວ (harmony nodes).\n"
"ສີທີ່ \"ຢູ່ນອກຊຸດສີ\" ຈະຖືກດຶງເຂົ້າຫາໂນດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດຢ່າງນຸ້ມນວນ; ສ່ວນສີທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂນດຢູ່ແລ້ວ ຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"
"ຕົວຄູນຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໃນແຕ່ລະໂນດ ຍັງສາມາດຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄວາມສົດຂອງສີ ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບແຕ່ລະໂນດໄດ້ຕື່ມອີກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"harmony rule\n"
": Select one of the harmony rules. All node positions are offsets from the anchor hue. Angles are in degrees.\n"
msgstr ""
"harmony rule (ກົດເກນຄວາມປະສານ)\n"
": ເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນກົດເກນຄວາມປະສານ. ຕຳແໜ່ງໂນດທັງໝົດແມ່ນຄ່າອັອຟເຊັດ (offsets) ຈາກສີຫຼັກ (anchor hue). ມຸມມີຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນອົງສາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    | Rule | Nodes | &nbsp; Node positions &nbsp; | Character |\n"
"    |------| :-------: |----------------|-----------|\n"
"    | **Monochromatic** | 1 | 0° | Single hue family |\n"
"    | **Analogous** | 3 | 0°, −30°, +30° | Adjacent neighbors; naturalistic, cohesive |\n"
"    | **Analogous complementary** | 4 | 0°, −30°, +30°, +180° | Analogous triad plus its opposite |\n"
"    | **Complementary** | 2 | 0°, +180° | Direct opposites; maximum contrast |\n"
"    | **Split complementary** | 3 | 0°, +150°, +210° | Anchor plus both neighbors of its complement |\n"
"    | **Dyad** | 2 | −30°, +30° | Anchor is symmetry axis, not a node |\n"
"    | **Triad** | 3 | 0°, +120°, +240° | Evenly spaced; balanced, colorful |\n"
"    | **Tetrad** | 4 | −30°, +30°, +150°, +210°  &nbsp;| Two dyad pairs; anchor is symmetry axis, not a node |\n"
"    | **Square** | 4 | 0°, +90°, +180°, +270° | Four equally spaced hues |\n"
"    | **Custom** | 2–4 | Freely placed | User-defined node positions |\n"
msgstr ""
"    | ກົດເກນ | ໂນດ | &nbsp; ຕຳແໜ່ງໂນດ &nbsp; | ລັກສະນະ |\n"
"    |------| :-------: |----------------|-----------|\n"
"    | **ສີດຽວ (Monochromatic)** | 1 | 0° | ກຸ່ມໂທນສີດຽວ |\n"
"    | **ສີຂ້າງຄຽງ (Analogous)** | 3 | 0°, −30°, +30° | ສີທີ່ຢູ່ຕິດກັນ; ເປັນທຳມະຊາດ, ກົມກື"
"ນ |\n"
"    | **ສີຂ້າງຄຽງຮ່ວມກັບສີກົງກັນຂ້າມ** | 4 | 0°, −30°, +30°, +180° | ສີສາມເສົ້າຂ້າງຄຽງບວກ"
"ກັບສີກົງກັນຂ້າມ |\n"
"    | **ສີກົງກັນຂ້າມ (Complementary)** | 2 | 0°, +180° | ສີທີ່ຢູ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມໂດຍກົງ; ຄວາມຕັດກັ"
"ນສູງສຸດ |\n"
"    | **ສີກົງກັນຂ້າມແບບແຍກ (Split complementary)** | 3 | 0°, +150°, +210° | ສີຫຼັກບວ"
"ກກັບສີຂ້າງຄຽງຂອງສີກົງກັນຂ້າມ |\n"
"    | **ສີຄູ່ສົມມາດ (Dyad)** | 2 | −30°, +30° | ສີຫຼັກເປັນແກນສົມມາດ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນໂນດ |\n"
"    | **ສີສາມເສົ້າ (Triad)** | 3 | 0°, +120°, +240° | ໄລຍະຫ່າງເທົ່າກັນ; ສົມດຸນ, ມີສີສັນ "
"|\n"
"    | **ສີສີ່ເສົ້າແບບຄູ່ (Tetrad)** | 4 | −30°, +30°, +150°, +210°  &nbsp;| ສີຄູ່ສົມມາດສ"
"ອງຄູ່; ສີຫຼັກເປັນແກນສົມມາດ |\n"
"    | **ສີສີ່ເສົ້າແບບຈະຕຸລັດ (Square)** | 4 | 0°, +90°, +180°, +270° | ສີ່ໂທນສີທີ່ມີໄລຍະຫ່າ"
"ງເທົ່າກັນ |\n"
"    | **ກຳນົດເອງ (Custom)** | 2–4 | ວາງໄດ້ຢ່າງອິດສະຫຼະ | ຕຳແໜ່ງໂນດທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດເອງ |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "    **Note on dyad and tetrad:** the anchor hue sets the symmetry axis of the pattern, not the position of a node. The palette is symmetric around the anchor. This matches the vectorscope harmony guide overlay.\n"
msgstr ""
"    **ໝາຍເຫດສຳລັບ dyad ແລະ tetrad:** ໂທນສີຫຼັກ (anchor hue) ຈະກຳນົດແກນສົມມາດຂອງລວດລ"
"າຍ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໂນດ. ຊຸດສີຈະມີຄວາມສົມມາດອ້ອມຮອບສີຫຼັກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະກົງກັບຜັງແນະນຳຄວາມກົມກືນໃນເວັກເ"
"ຕີສະໂຄບ (vectorscope).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![infer-from-image](./color-harmoinzer/infer-from-image.png#icon) infer from image *(standard modes only)*\n"
": Analyses the preview image's chroma-weighted hue histogram and automatically selects the harmony\n"
"rule and anchor hue that best fit the image's existing color distribution — i.e. the combination\n"
"that already covers the most chromatic energy and therefore requires the least correction.\n"
msgstr ""
"![infer-from-image](./color-harmoinzer/infer-from-image.png#icon) ວິເຄາະຈາກຮູບພ"
"າບ *(ສະເພາະໂໝດມາດຕະຖານ)*\n"
": ວິເຄາະຮິສໂຕແກຣມໂທນສີແບບຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກດ້ວຍຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີຂອງຮູບພາບຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ເລືອກກົດເກນຄວາມກົມກືນ\n"
"ລວມເຖິງໂທນສີຫຼັກທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດກັບການກະຈາຍສີທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງຮູບພາບ — ນັ້ນຄື ການປະສົມປະສານ\n"
"ທີ່ກວມເອົາພະລັງງານສີຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງການການແກ້ໄຂໜ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"anchor hue\n"
": The primary hue from which all node positions are derived (not shown in *custom* mode). Expressed\n"
"as a normalized value displayed in degrees. An eyedropper ![eye-dropper](./color-harmonizer/eye-dropper.png#icon)  is available to sample a color directly\n"
"from the image.\n"
"The color swatch strip below the slider shows the actual node colors for quick visual feedback.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂທນສີຫຼັກ (anchor hue)\n"
": ໂທນສີຫຼັກທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນຕົ້ນກຳເນີດຂອງຕຳແໜ່ງໂນດທັງໝົດ (ບໍ່ສະແດງໃນໂໝດ *custom*). ສະແດງເປັນຄ່າ\n"
"ມາດຕະຖານໃນຮູບແບບອົງສາ. ມີເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີ ![eye-dropper](./color-harmonizer/eye-"
"dropper.png#icon) ເພື່ອສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງສີ\n"
"ຈາກຮູບພາບໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"ແຖບຕົວຢ່າງສີຢູ່ລຸ່ມແຖບເລື່ອນຈະສະແດງສີຈິງຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຜົນໄດ້ທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"vectorscope two-way sync\n"
": When enabled (default), any change to the harmony rule, anchor hue, or custom node positions is\n"
"immediately reflected in the vectorscope harmony overlay, and changes made in the vectorscope, i.e. changing the overlayed rule or rotating the overlay, are\n"
"reflected back in the module. Disable to make adjustments without disturbing the vectorscope\n"
"display. If enabled, using the module will automatically switch the scopes module to show the vectorscope.\n"
msgstr ""
"vectorscope two-way sync (ການຊິງຄ໌ສອງທາງກັບ vectorscope)\n"
": ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ), ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆຕໍ່ກົດເກນຄວາມປະສານ, ສີຫຼັກ, ຫຼື ຕຳແໜ່ງໂນດກຳນົດເອງ ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນ vectorscope harmony overlay ທັນທີ, ແລະ ການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເຮັດໃນ vectorscope ເຊັ່ນ: ການປ່ຽນກົດເກນ ຫຼື ການໝຸນແຜນຜັງ, ຈະຖືກສະທ້ອນກັບຄືນມາຍັງໂມດູນ. ປິດໃຊ້ງານເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໂດຍບໍ່ລົບກວນການສະແດງຜົນຂອງ vectorscope. ຖ້າເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ການໃຊ້ໂມດູນຈະປ່ຽນແຖບ scopes ໃຫ້ສະແດງ vectorscope ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![import-from-vectorscope](./color-harmonizer/import-from-vectorscope.png#icon) import from vectorscope *(standard modes only)*\n"
": Imports the harmony rule and anchor hue currently configured in the vectorscope panel, then\n"
"switches the histogram panel to the vectorscope view.\n"
msgstr ""
"![import-from-vectorscope](./color-harmonizer/import-from-"
"vectorscope.png#icon) ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ *(ສະເພາະໂໝດມາດຕະຖານ)*\n"
": ນຳເຂົ້ານຳກົດເກນຄວາມກົມກືນ ແລະ ໂທນສີຫຼັກທີ່ກຳລັງຕັ້ງຄ່າຢູ່ໃນແຜງເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ (vectorscope), ຈາກ"
"ນັ້ນ\n"
"ຈະປ່ຽນແຜງຮິສໂຕແກຣມເປັນມຸມເບິ່ງເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"nodes *(custom mode only)*\n"
": Number of active harmony nodes in custom mode (2–4). Only the first N node rows are shown and\n"
"active; the others are hidden.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ (nodes) *(ສະເພາະໂໝດກຳນົດເອງ)*\n"
": ຈຳນວນໂນດຄວາມກົມກືນທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໃນໂໝດກຳນົດເອງ (2–4 ໂນດ). ສະເພາະແຖວຂອງໂນດ N ທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈ"
"ະຖືກສະແດງ ແລະ\n"
"ໃຊ້ງານ; ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"node hue sliders *(custom mode only)*\n"
": One row per active node. Each row shows a color swatch and a hue slider with an eyedropper. The\n"
"hue slider sets the node position on the hue wheel (0°–360°). Use the eyedropper to sample a\n"
"desired hue directly from the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແຖບເລື່ອນໂທນສີຂອງໂນດ *(ສະເພາະໂໝດກຳນົດເອງ)*\n"
": ໜຶ່ງແຖວຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂນດທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ. ແຕ່ລະແຖວຈະສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງສີ ແລະ ແຖບເລື່ອນໂທນສີພ້ອມກັບເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີ. \n"
"ແຖບເລື່ອນໂທນສີຈະກຳນົດຕຳແໜ່ງໂນດໃນວົງລໍ້ສີ (0°–360°). ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີເພື່ອສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ\n"
"ໂທນສີທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈາກຮູບພາບໂດຍກົງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Effect controls"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມຜົນກະທົບ (Effect controls)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pull strength\n"
": Colours will be shifted depending on their proximity to the nodes. The shift is strongest for pixels between nodes,\n"
"and weakest (or zero) for pixels exactly on a node.\n"
msgstr ""
"pull strength (ແຮງດຶງ)\n"
": ສີຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກປ່ຽນໄປໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບຄວາມໃກ້ຊິດຂອງພວກມັນກັບໂນດ. ການປ່ຽນສີຈະແຮງທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງໂນດ,\n"
"ແລະ ອ່ອນທີ່ສຸດ (ຫຼື ເປັນສູນ) ສຳລັບພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂນດພໍດີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Note: pull strength scales the **hue** correction only. The saturation correction (per-node saturation multipliers) is applied independently, at full strength regardless of this slider.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ໝາຍເຫດ: ແຮງດຶງ (pull strength) ຈະປັບສະເພາະການແກ້ໄຂ **ໂທນສີ (hue)** ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສ່ວນ"
"ການແກ້ໄຂຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ (ຕົວຄູນຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວແຕ່ລະໂນດ) ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະດ້ວຍຄວາມເຂັ້ມເຕັມທີ່ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pull width\n"
": Scales the width of each node's attraction zone.\n"
msgstr ""
"pull width (ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແຮງດຶງ)\n"
": ປັບຂະໜາດຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງເຂດດຶງດູດຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**< 1 (narrow):** quick decay; only hues very close to a node\n"
"are attracted. The rest of the hue wheel is barely touched. Useful for images already close to\n"
"harmonic, or when precise, surgical correction of specific hues is needed.\n"
msgstr "**< 1 (ແຄບ):** ການລົດລົງຢ່າງໄວ; ມີພຽງແຕ່ສີທີ່ໃກ້ກັບໂນດຫຼາຍໆເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກດຶງດູດ. ສ່ວນອື່ນໆຂອງວົງລໍ້ສີຈະແທບບໍ່ຖືກແຕະຕ້ອງ. ມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ມີຄວາມປະສານກັນດີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຫຼື ເມື່ອຕ້ອງການການແກ້ໄຂສີສະເພາະຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**= 1 (default):** medium decay — clean zone separation with smooth transitions.\n"
msgstr ""
"**= 1 (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ):** ການຫຼຸດທອນປານກາງ — ແຍກໂຊນສີໄດ້ຊັດເຈນພ້ອມກັບການປ່ຽນຜ່ານທີ່ນຸ່ມນວນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**> 1 (wide):** no decay; all pixels are\n"
"attracted noticeably regardless of how far they are from a node. Useful to suppress colors outside the target harmony.\n"
msgstr ""
"**> 1 (ກວ້າງ):** ບໍ່ມີການຫຼຸດຜ່ອນ; ທຸກໆພິກເຊວຈະຖືກດຶງດູດຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ\n"
"ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າພວກມັນຈະຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກໂນດ (node) ຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການກົດສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກກຸ່ມສີທີ່ປະສານກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Increasing pull width never displaces pixels that are already exactly on a harmony node — their angular distance to the nearest node is zero, so their hue shift is always zero.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ການເພີ່ມຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງການດຶງ (pull width) ຈະບໍ່ມີວັນປ່ຽນຕຳແໜ່ງພິກເຊວທີ່ມີສີກົງກັບໂນດຄວາມກົມກືນ"
"ຢູ່ແລ້ວ — ເພາະໄລຍະຫ່າງທາງອົງສາຂອງພວກມັນກັບໂນດທີ່ໃກ້ທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນສູນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນການປ່ຽນໂທນສີຈຶ່ງເປັນສູນສະເ"
"ໝີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"neutral color protection\n"
": Shields low-chroma pixels from correction.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປ້ອງກັນສີກາງ (neutral color protection)\n"
": ປ້ອງກັນພິກເຊວທີ່ມີຄວາມສົດຂອງສີຕ່ຳ (low-chroma) ບໍ່ໃຫ້ຖືກແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    The slider sets how aggressively\n"
"    low-chroma pixels are exempted: low values protect only near-absolute grays; high values extend\n"
"    protection to muted and pastel tones. Even at the maximum, vivid colors remain largely unaffected.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ກຳນົດລະດັບການຍົກເວັ້ນ\n"
"    ພິກເຊວທີ່ມີຄວາມເຂັ້ມສີຕ່ຳ: ຄ່າຕ່ຳຈະປ້ອງກັນສະເພາະສີເທົາທີ່ເກືອບສົມບູນ; ຄ່າສູງຈະຂະຫຍາຍ\n"
"    ການປ້ອງກັນໄປຍັງໂທນສີທີ່ຈາງ ແລະ ສີພາສເທລ. ແມ່ນແຕ່ຢູ່ທີ່ຄ່າສູງສຸດ, ສີທີ່ສົດໃສກໍຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຫຼາ"
"ຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Default: 0.50.\n"
msgstr "    ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0.50.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"smoothing\n"
": This smooths the spatial transitions at zone boundaries — visible as subtle\n"
"colour steps in smooth gradients like skies or skin when adjacent regions fall in different\n"
"attraction zones.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດໃຫ້ນຸ່ມນວນ (smoothing)\n"
": ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານທາງພື້ນທີ່ຢູ່ຂອບເຂດຂອງໂຊນສີນຸ່ມນວນຂຶ້ນ — ເຊິ່ງອາດເຫັນເປັນ\n"
"ຂັ້ນສີເລັກນ້ອຍໃນການໄລ່ລະດັບສີທີ່ນຸ່ມນວນ ເຊັ່ນ ທ້ອງຟ້າ ຫຼື ຜິວໜັງ ເມື່ອພື້ນທີ່ຂ້າງຄຽງຕົກຢູ່ໃນ\n"
"ໂຊນການດຶງສີທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    The blur sigma scales with both this slider and the current pull width: wider attraction zones\n"
"    span larger hue ranges and generate larger corrections, which can produce sharper spatial\n"
"    boundaries when pixels near each other fall on opposite sides of a zone midpoint.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ຊິກມາຄວາມມົວ (blur sigma) ຈະປັບຂະໜາດຕາມທັງແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ ແລະ ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງການດຶງໃນປັດຈຸບັ"
"ນ: ເຂດດຶງດູດທີ່ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ\n"
"    ຈະກວມເອົາຊ່ວງສີສັນ (hue) ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ສ້າງການປັບແກ້ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດສ້າງຂອບເຂດທາງພື້ນ"
"ທີ່\n"
"    ທີ່ຄົມຊັດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອພິກເຊວທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັນຕົກຢູ່ຄົນລະດ້ານຂອງຈຸດເຄິ່ງກາງເຂດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**0 (default, off):** transitions are handled purely by the Gaussian interpolation in hue space.\n"
"Maximum detail is preserved. Recommended for most uses.\n"
msgstr ""
"**0 (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ປິດ):** ການປ່ຽນຜ່ານຈະຖືກຈັດການໂດຍການແທນຄ່າແບບ Gaussian ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ (hue space).\n"
"ຮັກສາລາຍລະອຽດໄວ້ໄດ້ສູງສຸດ. ແນະນຳສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**0.1–0.5:** subtle spatial averaging to reduce colour noise in smooth areas.\n"
msgstr ""
"**0.1–0.5:** ການສະເລ່ຍທາງພື້ນທີ່ແບບເບົາບາງເພື່ອຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບຂອງສີໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ລຽບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**> 1.0:** broad spatial blending; can create a painterly effect but may bleed corrections\n"
"across image edges.\n"
msgstr "**> 1.0:** ການປະສົມປະສານພື້ນທີ່ໃນວົງກວ້າງ; ສາມາດສ້າງຜົນກະທົບແບບຮູບແຕ້ມ ແຕ່ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂສີເປື້ອນ ຂ້າມຂອບຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Saturation section *(collapsible)*"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວ (Saturation) *(ສາມາດພັບໄດ້)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"One row per active harmony node. Each row shows a color swatch (the node's hue) and a saturation\n"
"multiplier slider.\n"
msgstr "ໜຶ່ງແຖວຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງໂນດສີທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ. ແຕ່ລະແຖວຈະສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງສີ (ຄ່າສີຂອງໂນດ) ແລະ ໂຕເລື່ອນສຳລັບຄູນຄວາມສົດຂອງສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"node saturation sliders\n"
": Saturation multiplier for colors near the corresponding harmony node.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຕເລື່ອນຄວາມສົດຂອງໂນດ\n"
": ຕົວຄູນຄວາມສົດສຳລັບສີທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບໂນດສີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**100 % (default):** saturation is unchanged.\n"
msgstr "**100 % (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ):** ຄວາມສົດຂອງສີບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**< 100 %:** desaturates colors near this node, proportionally to their Gaussian proximity.\n"
msgstr "**< 100 %:** ຫຼຸດຄວາມສົດຂອງສີທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ໂນດນີ້, ຕາມສັດສ່ວນຄວາມໃກ້ຄຽງແບບ Gaussian.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**> 100 %:** boosts saturation near this node.\n"
msgstr "**> 100 %:** ເພີ່ມຄວາມສົດຂອງສີທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ໂນດນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    The effect is weighted by the pixel's Gaussian proximity to the node and further\n"
"    modulated by **neutral color protection** so near-achromatic pixels are spared. At the node itself\n"
"    (maximum weight) the saturation is multiplied by exactly the slider value.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ເອັບເຟັກຖືກຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກໂດຍຄວາມໃກ້ຄຽງແບບ Gaussian ຂອງພິກເຊວຫາໂນດ ແລະ ຖືກປັບປ່ຽນຕື່ມອີກ\n"
"    ໂດຍ **ການປ້ອງກັນສີກາງ** ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພິກເຊວທີ່ເກືອບບໍ່ມີສີ (near-achromatic) ບໍ່ຖືກກະທົບ. ຢູ່ທີ່ຕົວໂນ"
"ດເອງ\n"
"    (ນ້ຳໜັກສູງສຸດ) ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຈະຖືກຄູນດ້ວຍຄ່າຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນພໍດີ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage guide"
msgstr "ຄຳແນະນຳການໃຊ້ງານ"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Basic workflow"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກພື້ນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the module is first activated it is in a neutral state and so there will be no visible change in the image.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂມດູນນີ້ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ມັນຈະຢູ່ໃນສະພາວະປົກກະຕິ (neutral) ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ໃນຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Set the anchor hue.** Use the eyedropper to pick the dominant or most important color in\n"
"the scene — a sky, a garment, a skin tone — or drag the slider manually while watching the\n"
"swatch strip.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ຕັ້ງສີຫຼັກ (anchor hue).** ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີເພື່ອເລືອກສີທີ່ເດັ່ນ ຫຼື ສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດໃນ\n"
"ສາກ — ທ້ອງຟ້າ, ເຄື່ອງນຸ່ງ, ສີຜິວ — ຫຼື ລາກແຖບເລື່ອນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນຂະນະທີ່ເບິ່ງ\n"
"ແຖບຕົວຢ່າງສີ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Choose a harmony rule.** For portraiture, *complementary* (subject vs. background) or\n"
"*analogous* (warm tones) are natural starting points. For landscapes, *triad* or *split\n"
"complementary* often work well. Enable *vectorscope two-way sync* (under the harmony rule\n"
"heading) to see the palette on the vectorscope while you choose.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ເລືອກກົດຄວາມກົມກືນ (harmony rule).** ສຳລັບການຖ່າຍພາບຄົນ, *ສີກົງກັນຂ້າມ (complementary)"
"* (ຕົວແບບ vs. ສາກຫຼັງ) ຫຼື\n"
"*ສີໃກ້ຄຽງ (analogous)* (ໂທນອຸ່ນ) ແມ່ນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີ. ສຳລັບພາບທິວທັດ, *ສາມເສົາຫຼັກ (triad)* ຫຼື "
"*ສີກົງກັນຂ້າມ\n"
"ແບບແຍກ (split complementary)* ມັກຈະໃຊ້ໄດ້ດີ. ເປີດໃຊ້ *ການຊິງຄ໌ສອງທາງກັບເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ* (ພາ"
"ຍໃຕ້ຫົວຂໍ້ກົດຄວາມກົມກືນ)\n"
"ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຈານສີໃນເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Raise pull strength.** Start around 0.2–0.3. The effect is graduated.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ເພີ່ມຄວາມແຮງຂອງການດຶງ (pull strength).** ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນປະມານ 0.2–0.3. ເອັບເຟັກຈະຄ່ອຍໆສະແດງ"
"ຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Adjust pull width if needed.** If many off-palette hues are not moving enough, widen the\n"
"zones. If you want to correct only specific hue ranges without touching the rest, narrow them. The result may be very subtle if the image already has an inherent harmony and the module is set to match. In this case, setting both strength and width to their maximum values and then reducing them gradually may be a more effective strategy.\n"
msgstr "**ປັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແຮງດຶງ (pull width) ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ.** ຖ້າຫາກສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຈານສີຍັງບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງພໍ, ໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍເຂດໃຫ້ກວ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂສະເພາະຊ່ວງສີໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍບໍ່ໃຫ້ກະທົບສ່ວນອື່ນ, ໃຫ້ປັບໃຫ້ແຄບລົງ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບອາດຈະເຫັນບໍ່ຊັດເຈນ ຖ້າຮູບພາບມີຄວາມປະສານຂອງສີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງຄວາມແຮງ ແລະ ຄວາມກວ້າງໃຫ້ສູງສຸດ ແລ້ວຄ່ອຍໆຫຼຸດລົງອາດຈະເປັນວິທີທີ່ໄດ້ຜົນກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Use neutral color protection to taste.** Raise it for images with many desaturated tones\n"
"(architecture, faded film looks) to exempt pastels and muted tones from correction.\n"
msgstr "**ໃຊ້ການປ້ອງກັນສີກາງຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ.** ເພີ່ມຄ່າມັນສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ມີໂທນສີຈາງຫຼາຍ (ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, ແນວຟີມເກົ່າໆ) ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນສີພັດສະເຕນ ແລະ ສີທີ່ມົວຈາກການແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Use the saturation section for palette polishing.** Once the hue pull is set, open the\n"
"saturation section to boost or calm chroma per node — e.g. boost the warm nodes and desaturate\n"
"the cool ones for a cinematic split-tone look.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ໃຊ້ສ່ວນຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຈານສີ.** ເມື່ອຕັ້ງການດຶງສີສັນ (hue pull) ແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ເປີດ\n"
"ສ່ວນຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດຄວາມສົດຂອງສີຕາມແຕ່ລະໂນດ — ເຊັ່ນ: ເພີ່ມໂນດໂທນອຸ່ນ ແລະ ຫຼຸດຄວາມອີ່ມຕົ"
"ວ\n"
"ຂອງໂນດໂທນເຢັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ລັກສະນະການແຍກໂທນແບບຮູບເງົາ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom harmony mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດການປະສານສີແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use *custom* when none of the geometric rules match the image's intended palette.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ *ກຳນົດເອງ (custom)* ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີກົດທາງເລຂາຄະນິດໃດທີ່ກົງກັບຈານສີທີ່ຕ້ອງການຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set the harmony rule to *custom*. The previous rule's node positions are copied as a starting\n"
"point.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງກົດຄວາມກົມກືນເປັນ *ກຳນົດເອງ (custom)*. ຕຳແໜ່ງໂນດຂອງກົດກ່ອນໜ້າຈະຖືກສຳເນົາມາເປັນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້"
"ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use *nodes* to select how many palette targets you need (2–4).\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ *ໂນດ (nodes)* ເພື່ອເລືອກຈຳນວນເປົ້າໝາຍຈານສີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ (2–4).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Drag each node's hue slider or use its eyedropper to position nodes at the desired palette\n"
"hues.\n"
msgstr "ເລື່ອນໂຕເລື່ອນສີຂອງແຕ່ລະໂນດ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືດູດສີເພື່ອວາງຕຳແໜ່ງໂນດຕາມຄ່າສີທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Raise pull strength to pull off-palette colors toward the custom nodes.\n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄວາມແຮງການດຶງເພື່ອດຶງສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຈານສີໃຫ້ເຂົ້າມາຫາໂນດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Custom nodes are synced to the vectorscope as free-floating angle markers (the vectorscope shows\n"
"no standard rule name for custom palettes).\n"
msgstr "ໂນດທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຈະຖືກຊິງຄ໌ກັບ vectorscope ເປັນຕົວໝາຍມຸມແບບອິດສະຫຼະ (vectorscope ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຊື່ກົດເກນມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບຈານສີທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Working with the vectorscope"
msgstr "ການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ vectorscope"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With *vectorscope two-way sync* enabled, the vectorscope overlays the harmony guide on the\n"
"image's color distribution. Colors inside the guide arcs are on-palette; colors outside are\n"
"being corrected. Use this to verify the pull is moving in the intended direction.\n"
"Aside from using the hue slider the anchor hue can be moved by scrolling with the cursor over the vectorscope.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ *ການຊິງຄ໌ສອງທາງກັບເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ*, ເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບຈະສະແດງຜັງຄວາມກົມກືນຊ້ອນທັບກັບ\n"
"ການກະຈາຍສີຂອງຮູບ. ສີທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນເສັ້ນໂຄ້ງຂອງຜັງແມ່ນຢູ່ໃນຈານສີ; ສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກແມ່ນ\n"
"ກຳລັງຖືກປັບແກ້. ໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າການດຶງສີກຳລັງໄປໃນທິດທາງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"
"ນອກຈາກການໃຊ້ແຖບເລື່ອນສີສັນແລ້ວ, ສີຫຼັກຍັງສາມາດຍ້າຍໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌ເທິງເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/processing-modules/color-harmonizer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To start from a palette already set in the vectorscope panel, click the *import from vectorscope*\n"
"button (![import-from-vectorscope](./color-harmonizer/import-from-vectorscope.png#icon)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກຈານສີທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ແລ້ວໃນແຜງເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມ *ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ*\n"
"(![import-from-vectorscope](./color-harmonizer/import-from-"
"vectorscope.png#icon)).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Module Reference"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືອ້າງອີງໂມດູນ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "session"
msgstr "ເຊດຊັນ (session)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set a session jobcode to allow the creation of a new film roll.\n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າລະຫັດງານ (jobcode) ຂອງເຊດຊັນເພື່ອສ້າງມ້ວນຟິມໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A session is a sequence of exposures taken in tethering mode and placed into a single film roll. A new session means the creation of a new film roll. \n"
msgstr "ເຊດຊັນ ແມ່ນລຳດັບຂອງການຖ່າຍຮູບໃນໂໝດ tethering ແລະ ຖືກຈັດເກັບໄວ້ໃນມ້ວນຟິມດຽວກັນ. ເຊດຊັນໃໝ່ໝາຍເຖິງການສ້າງມ້ວນຟິມໃໝ່. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/session.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The session module allows you to set a jobcode, which can be used to create your new film roll. See [preferences > import > session options](../../../preferences-settings/import.md) for details about how to create new film rolls using the `$(JOBCODE)` variable in the session module.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນເຊດຊັນ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງລະຫັດງານ (jobcode) ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງມ້ວນຟິມໃໝ່ຂອງທ່ານ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ນຳເຂົ້າ > ຕົວເລືອກເຊດຊັນ](../../../preferences-settings/import.md) ກ່ຽວກັບວິທີສ້າງມ້ວນຟິມໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ `$(JOBCODE)` ໃນໂມດູນເຊດຊັນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tethering"
msgstr "ການຖ່າຍຮູບຜ່ານສາຍ (tethering)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/camera-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "camera settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າກ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/camera-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up an image capture job. \n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າງານການຖ່າຍຮູບ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/camera-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This can include sequence, bracket and delayed captures. You are also able to control other camera settings such as focus mode, aperture, shutter speed, ISO and white balance.\n"
msgstr "ນີ້ສາມາດລວມເຖິງການຖ່າຍຮູບແບບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ (sequence), ການຖ່າຍແບບຄ່ອມແສງ (bracket) ແລະ ການຖ່າຍແບບຕັ້ງເວລາ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຄວບຄຸມການຕັ້ງຄ່າກ້ອງອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ໂໝດໂຟກັດ, ຮູຮັບແສງ, ຄວາມໄວຊັດເຕີ, ISO ແລະ ໄວທ໌ບາລານ (white balance).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/live-view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "live view"
msgstr "ໄລຟ໌ວິວ (live view)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/live-view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Control your camera's live view mode. \n"
msgstr "ຄວບຄຸມໂໝດໄລຟ໌ວິວຂອງກ້ອງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/tethering/live-view.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Functionality such as focus control, rotation, guides and overlays are supported.\n"
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ການຄວບຄຸມໂຟກັດ, ການໝຸນຮູບ, ເສັ້ນນຳສາຍຕາ (guides) ແລະ ການສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທັບຊ້ອນ (overlays).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "actions on selection"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເລືອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform actions on images that have been selected in the lighttable view.\n"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນມຸມມອງ lighttable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The module controls are spread over two tabs for manipulating the image files and the related metadata.\n"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໃນໂມດູນແບ່ງອອກເປັນສອງແທັບ ສຳລັບຈັດການໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ແລະ Metadata ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "images tab"
msgstr "ແທັບຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"remove\n"
": Remove the selected images from the darktable library without deleting them. Removed images can no longer be viewed or edited within darktable but the image files remain on the filesystem along with any XMP sidecar files. As darktable keeps the XMP files up-to-date with your latest development history, you can fully restore your work later by re-importing the images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເອົາອອກ\n"
": ເອົາຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກອອກຈາກຫໍສະໝຸດ darktable ໂດຍບໍ່ລົບໄຟລ໌. ຮູບທີ່ຖືກເອົາອອກຈະເບິ່ງ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂໃນ darktable ບໍ່ໄດ້ ແຕ່ໄຟລ໌ຈະຍັງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງພ້ອມໄຟລ໌ XMP. ເຈົ້າສາມາດກູ້ຄືນວຽກໄດ້ໂດຍການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບຄືນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"delete / delete (trash)\n"
": Remove the selected images from the darktable library and remove any associated XMP sidecar files from the filesystem. If no duplicates of a removed image remain in the darktable library, the image file itself is also deleted. You can control whether this action irrevocably deletes the files or attempts to put them into your system's trash bin with a configuration item in [preferences > security](../../../preferences-settings/security.md). A second configuration item in the same tab allows you to control whether or not to be prompted before deleting images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລົບ / ລົບ (ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ)\n"
": ເອົາຮູບທີ່ເລືອກອອກຈາກຫໍສະໝຸດ ແລະ ລົບໄຟລ໌ XMP ລວມທັງໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບອອກຈາກເຄື່ອງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ລົບຖາວອນ ຫຼື ເອົາໄປໄວ້ໃນຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຄວາມປອດໄພ](../../../preferences-settings/security.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"move\n"
": Physically move selected images (the image files plus all associated XMP sidecars) to another folder on the filesystem. If an image with the given filename already exists in the target folder the source image will not be moved. After the move the target folder becomes the selected collection if the source folder is empty. If a collection is manually selected during a move, then darktable will not change the selection.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍ\n"
": ຍ້າຍຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ (ໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ແລະ XMP) ໄປຫາໂຟນເດີອື່ນ. ຖ້າມີຮູບຊື່ດຽວກັນຢູ່ປາຍທາງແລ້ວ ຈະບໍ່ມີການຍ້າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"copy\n"
": Physically copy selected images (the image file plus all associated XMP sidecars) to another folder on the filesystem. If an image with the given filename already exists in the target folder it will not be overwritten – instead a new duplicate will be generated with the same history stack as the source image. After the copy the target folder becomes the selected collection. If a collection is manually selected during a copy, then darktable will not change the selection.\n"
msgstr ""
"copy\n"
": ສຳເນົາຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ (ໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ລວມທັງໄຟລ໌ XMP ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທັງໝົດ) ໄປຍັງໂຟນເດີອື່ນໃນລະບົບຈັດເກັບໄ"
"ຟລ໌. ຖ້າມີໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຊື່ດຽວກັນຢູ່ໃນໂຟນເດີປາຍທາງແລ້ວ ມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຂຽນທັບ – ແຕ່ຈະມີການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ສຳເນົາໃໝ່ທີ່ມີລຳດັ"
"ບປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂຄືກັນກັບຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ຫຼັງຈາກສຳເນົາແລ້ວ ໂຟນເດີປາຍທາງຈະກາຍເປັນຄໍເລັກຊັນທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ. ຖ້"
"າມີການເລືອກຄໍເລັກຊັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການສຳເນົາ, darktable ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງການເລືອກນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"create hdr\n"
": Create a high dynamic range image from the selected images, and add the result to the library as a new image in DNG format. Images need to be properly aligned, which implies that they have been taken on a sturdy tripod. You can also generate HDRs with programs like Luminance HDR, and later import them into darktable for further processing. Note that darktable can only create HDR images from raw files.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ HDR\n"
": ສ້າງຮູບພາບ HDR ຈາກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຜົນໄດ້ຮັບເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດເປັນໄຟລ໌ DNG. ຮູບພາບຄວນຈະຖືກຖ່າຍດ້ວຍຂາຕັ້ງກ້ອງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕຳແໜ່ງກົງກັນ. darktable ສາມາດສ້າງ HDR ໄດ້ຈາກໄຟລ໌ RAW ເທົັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"duplicate\n"
": Create duplicates of the selected images within darktable. Duplicate images share the same image file, but each duplicate has its own XMP sidecar file and a separate entry in darktable's library database. This allows you to test different edits on the same image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສຳເນົາ (duplicate)\n"
": ສ້າງສຳເນົາຮູບພາບພາຍໃນ darktable. ຮູບທີ່ສຳເນົາມາຈະໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຮູບດຽວກັນ ແຕ່ມີໄຟລ໌ XMP ແຍກກັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າທົດລອງແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຫຼາຍແບບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rotation\n"
": Perform a clockwise or counter-clockwise rotation on the selected images. A third button can be used to reset the image rotation to the value stored in the image's Exif data. This feature is directly linked to the [_orientation_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/orientation.md) processing module -- adjustments made here are automatically converted into a history stack item for that module.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການໝູນຮູບ\n"
": ໝູນຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກໄປຕາມເຂັມ ຫຼື ທວນເຂັມໂມງ. ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືນໃໝ່ຕາມຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍກົງກັບໂມດູນ [_orientation_](../../../module-reference/processing-modules/orientation.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"copy locally\n"
": Create local copies of the selected images on the local drive. These copies will then be used when the original images are not accessible (see [local copies](../../../overview/sidecar-files/local-copies.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງ (copy locally)\n"
": ສ້າງສຳເນົາຮູບພາບໄວ້ໃນໄດຣຟ໌ຂອງເຄື່ອງ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນເວລາທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"resync local copy\n"
": Synchronize the XMP sidecar of the local copy of each selected image with the copy in external storage, and remove the local copies. Note that if a local copy has been modified and the external storage is not accessible the local copy will not be deleted (see [local copies](../../../overview/sidecar-files/local-copies.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊິງຄ໌ສຳເນົາໃນເຄື່ອງຄືນໃໝ່\n"
": ຊິງຄ໌ໄຟລ໌ XMP ຈາກເຄື່ອງກັບໄປຫາບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກ ແລະ ລົບສຳເນົາໃນເຄື່ອງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"group\n"
": Create a new group from the selected images (see [image grouping](../../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈັດກຸ່ມ\n"
": ສ້າງກຸ່ມໃໝ່ຈາກຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ungroup\n"
": Remove the selected images from their group (see [image grouping](../../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/grouping.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກການຈັດກຸ່ມ\n"
": ເອົາຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກອອກຈາກກຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "metadata tab"
msgstr "ແທັບ Metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"metadata type checkboxes\n"
": Choose the types of metadata (ratings, tags, metadata, colors, geo tags) that you want to operate on. \n"
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງໝາຍເລືອກປະເພດ Metadata\n"
": ເລືອກປະເພດ Metadata (ຄະແນນ, ແທັກ, ສີ, ພິກັດພູມສາດ) ທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຈັດການ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"copy\n"
": Copy the chosen types of metadata from the selected image onto the clipboard. If you have more than one image selected, or no images selected, then this button is unavailable.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາ\n"
": ສຳເນົາ Metadata ຈາກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນ ຄລິບບອດ (clipboard).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"paste\n"
": Paste any metadata in the clipboard onto the selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວາງ\n"
": ວາງ Metadata ຈາກຄລິບບອດໃສ່ຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clear\n"
": Clear the chosen types of metadata from the selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລ້າງຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
": ລ້າງ Metadata ປະເພດທີ່ເລືອກອອກຈາກຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mode\n"
": When pasting metadata onto images, this option controls whether the metadata on the clipboard should be merged with the existing metadata (_merge_), or should replace it entirely (_overwrite_).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ\n"
": ເມື່ອວາງ Metadata, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ ລວມເຂົ້າກັນ (_merge_) ຫຼື ຂຽນທັບທັງໝົດ (_overwrite_).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"refresh exif\n"
": Refresh the Exif data from the source file. Warning: this may overwrite some tags and metadata that you have altered in darktable (such as star ratings).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດ Exif ໃໝ່\n"
": ໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຈາກໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນສະບັບຄືນໃໝ່. ຄຳເຕືອນ: ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະຂຽນທັບຂໍ້ມູນບາງຢ່າງທີ່ເຈົ້າໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງໃນ darktable ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"monochrome\n"
": Flag the image as monochrome, meaning that it will receive any monochrome-specific workflow treatment that is offered by the processing modules. Refer to the [developing monochrome images](../../../guides-tutorials/monochrome.md) section for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"ພາບຂາວດຳ (monochrome)\n"
": ໝາຍຮູບພາບໃຫ້ເປັນແບບຂາວດຳ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການຈັດການສະເພາະພາບຂາວດຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/selected-image.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"color\n"
": Remove the monochrome flag from the image so that it will receive the default workflow treatment that is normally used when developing color photos.\n"
msgstr ""
"ພາບສີ\n"
": ເອົາເຄື່ອງໝາຍຂາວດຳອອກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບພາບຖືກຈັດການແບບພາບສີປົກກະຕິ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/select.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "selection"
msgstr "ການເລືອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/select.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select images in the lighttable according to simple criteria.\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກຮູບພາບໃນ lighttable ຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂງ່າຍໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/select.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select all\n"
": Select all images in the current collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກທັງໝົດ\n"
": ເລືອກທຸກຮູບພາບໃນຄໍເລັກຊັນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/select.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select none\n"
": De-select all images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ເລືອກເລີຍ\n"
": ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກທຸກຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/select.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"invert selection\n"
": Select all images in the current collection that are not currently selected.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະຫຼັບການເລືອກ\n"
": ເລືອກຮູບພາບທັງໝົດໃນຄໍເລັກຊັນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກໃນຕອນນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/select.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select film roll\n"
": Select all images in the current collection that are in the same film roll as the currently-selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຟິມໂຣລ\n"
": ເລືອກທຸກຮູບພາບໃນຄໍເລັກຊັນທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຟິມໂຣລດຽວກັນກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/select.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select untouched\n"
": Select all images in the current collection that have not yet been developed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຮູບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນແກ້ໄຂ\n"
": ເລືອກທຸກຮູບພາບໃນຄໍເລັກຊັນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຜ່ານການປັບແຕ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "(deprecated) lua scripts installer"
msgstr "(ເລີກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ) ຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບ lua"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "after 5.6"
msgstr "ຫຼັງເວີຊັນ 5.6"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lua scripts are bundled with darktable and do not need to be installed anymore.\n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ Lua ຖືກລວມມາກັບ darktable ແລ້ວ ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງອີກຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "before 5.6"
msgstr "ກ່ອນເວີຊັນ 5.6"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As described in [lua scripts](../../../lua/_index.md), darktable provides powerful scripting capabilities to extend its functionality and integrate with other software. Many such scripts are already available. The Lua script installer module helps to install them without the need for manual configuration. The first time it is run, instructions are displayed in the module.\n"
msgstr "ຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໃນ [ສະຄຣິບ lua](../../../lua/_index.md), darktable ມີຄວາມສາມາດໃນການໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍການເຮັດວຽກ. ໂມດູນຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບ Lua ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນໄດ້ງ່າຍໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າເອງ. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ຈະມີຄຳແນະນຳສະແດງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the module to be able to install the scripts, you will need to have git installed and available on your path. You can get it from [git-scm.com](https://git-scm.com/).\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບໄດ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງມີ git ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ. ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກ [git-scm.com](https://git-scm.com/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The officially supported scripts are documented [here](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/).\n"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຮອງຮັບຢ່າງເປັນທາງການມີເອກະສານຢູ່ [ທີ່ນີ້](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/lua-scripts-installer.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The module can be disabled with an option in [preferences > lua options](../../../preferences-settings/lua-options.md).\n"
msgstr "ສາມາດປິດໂມດູນນີ້ໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຕົວເລືອກ lua](../../../preferences-settings/lua-options.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "scripts"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _scripts_ module is created by the _script manager_ and lets you start, stop, configure, install and update darktable's Lua scripts directly from the lighttable. See [basic principles](../../../lua/basic-principles.md) for an explanation of how the script manager loads scripts.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ _ສະຄຣິບ_ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລີ່ມ, ຢຸດ, ຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ອັບເດດສະຄຣິບ Lua ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກ lighttable. ເບິ່ງ [ຫຼັກການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ](../../../lua/basic-principles.md) ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຕົວຈັດການສະຄຣິບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Since darktable 5.6 a collection of scripts is [bundled](../../../lua/darktables-scripts.md) with the program, so this module is available without any manual installation. Documentation for the individual bundled scripts is available in the [lua docs](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/).\n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 5.6 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ສະຄຣິບຕ່າງໆ ຖືກ [ລວມມາ](../../../lua/darktables-scripts.md) ກັບໂປຣແກຣມແລ້ວ. ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງແຕ່ລະສະຄຣິບໄດ້ໃນ [lua docs](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installing or updating scripts requires [git](https://git-scm.com/) to be installed and available on your path.\n"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ອັບເດດສະຄຣິບຕ້ອງມີ [git](https://git-scm.com/) ຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The module can be disabled in [preferences > Lua options](../../../preferences-settings/lua-options.md) by disabling Lua scripts. \n"
msgstr "ສາມາດປິດໂມດູນນີ້ໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຕົວເລືອກ Lua](../../../preferences-settings/lua-options.md) ໂດຍການປິດການໃຊ້ງານສະຄຣິບ Lua. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The __action__ dropdown at the top of the module switches between three views: _start/stop scripts_, _configure_ and _install/update scripts_. The module remembers the last selected view.\n"
msgstr "ເມນູ __ການດຳເນີນການ (action)__ ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງສາມາດສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງສາມມຸມມອງ: _ເລີ່ມ/ຢຸດສະຄຣິບ_, _ຕັ້ງຄ່າ_ ແລະ _ຕິດຕັ້ງ/ອັບເດດສະຄຣິບ_.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "start/stop scripts"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມ/ຢຸດສະຄຣິບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lists the scripts contained in the selected folder, each preceded by an on/off button used to start or stop it.\n"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ສະຄຣິບໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ເລືອກ, ໂດຍມີປຸ່ມ ເປີດ/ປິດ ເພື່ອເລີ່ມ ຫຼື ຢຸດສະຄຣິບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"folder\n"
": Select which group of scripts to display. The bundled scripts are grouped into _contributed_, _examples_, _official_ and _tools_. Scripts placed in `[configuration directory]/lua/FOLDER/file.lua` can be selected here. See [basic principles](../../../lua/basic-principles.md) on how darktable loads added scripts. \n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີ\n"
": ເລືອກກຸ່ມສະຄຣິບທີ່ຈະສະແດງ. ສະຄຣິບທີ່ລວມມານຳຈະຖືກແບ່ງເປັນ _contributed_, _examples_, _official_ ແລະ _tools_. ເບິ່ງ [ຫຼັກການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ](../../../lua/basic-principles.md) ກ່ຽວກັບການໂຫຼດສະຄຣິບ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"page navigation\n"
": When a folder holds more scripts than fit on a single page, use the _<_ and _>_ buttons to move between pages. The current position is shown as \"page x of y\". The number of scripts shown per page is set in the _configure_ view.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປ່ຽນໜ້າ\n"
": ຫາກມີສະຄຣິບຫຼາຍ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ _<_ ແລະ _>_ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນໜ້າ. ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນສະຄຣິບຕໍ່ໜ້າໄດ້ໃນມຸມມອງ _ຕັ້ງຄ່າ_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"script buttons\n"
": Each entry shows the script's name preceded by an on/off button. Click it to start or stop that script. A started script stays active for the current session and is started again automatically the next time darktable runs.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມສະຄຣິບ\n"
": ແຕ່ລະລາຍການຈະມີຊື່ສະຄຣິບ ແລະ ປຸ່ມ ເປີດ/ປິດ. ສະຄຣິບທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ຈະຖືກເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປທີ່ເປີດ darktable.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "configure"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scripts per page\n"
": Set how many lines are shown per page, between 5 and 20 (default 10).\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບຕໍ່ໜ້າ\n"
": ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຈະສະແດງຕໍ່ໜ້າ, ລະຫວ່າງ 5 ຫາ 20 (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"change number of buttons\n"
": Apply the value selected above. The button list updates immediately; no restart is required.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປ່ຽນຈຳນວນປຸ່ມ\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ເລືອກຂ້າງເທິງ. ລາຍຊື່ປຸ່ມຈະອັບເດດທັນທີໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເລີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "install/update scripts"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ/ອັບເດດສະຄຣິບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This view is split into three sections.\n"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງນີ້ແບ່ງອອກເປັນສາມສ່ວນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__update scripts__\n"
msgstr "__ອັບເດດສະຄຣິບ__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scripts to update\n"
": Select an installed script collection to update. The bundled scripts appear here as _lua-scripts_; any additional scripts you have added are listed by their folder name.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະຄຣິບທີ່ຈະອັບເດດ\n"
": ເລືອກກຸ່ມສະຄຣິບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"update scripts\n"
": Pull the latest version of the selected collection from its git repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັບເດດສະຄຣິບ\n"
": ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດຈາກ git repository.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__add more scripts__\n"
msgstr "__ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບເພີ່ມເຕີມ__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"URL to download additional scripts from\n"
": Enter the URL of a git repository that contains the scripts you want to add.\n"
msgstr ""
"URL ສຳລັບດາວໂຫຼດສະຄຣິບ\n"
": ປ້ອນ URL ຂອງ git repository ທີ່ມີສະຄຣິບທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"new folder to place scripts in\n"
": Enter a name for the folder the scripts will be cloned into (created under `lua/` in your [configuration directory](../../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີໃໝ່ສຳລັບເກັບສະຄຣິບ\n"
": ປ້ອນຊື່ໂຟນເດີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເກັບສະຄຣິບ (ຈະຖືກສ້າງໄວ້ໃຕ້ `lua/` ໃນ [ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ](../../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"install additional scripts\n"
": Clone the repository into the folder named above. Once installed, the scripts appear under that folder name in the _start/stop scripts_ view.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕັ້ງສະຄຣິບເພີ່ມເຕີມ\n"
": ຄລອນ (Clone) repository ເຂົ້າໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ລະບຸ. ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ, ສະຄຣິບຈະປາກົດໃນມຸມມອງ _ເລີ່ມ/ຢຸດສະຄຣິບ_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "__disable scripts__\n"
msgstr "__ປິດການໃຊ້ງານສະຄຣິບ__\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"enable \"disable scripts\" button\n"
": A safety check that must be ticked before the _disable scripts_ button becomes active, to prevent it from being clicked by accident.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ \"ປິດການໃຊ້ງານສະຄຣິບ\"\n"
": ເປັນການກວດສອບຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ຕ້ອງໝາຍເລືອກກ່ອນປຸ່ມ _ປິດການໃຊ້ງານສະຄຣິບ_ ຈະເຮັດວຽກ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການກົດໂດຍບັງເອີນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/scripts.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"disable scripts\n"
": Renames the `luarc` file in your [configuration directory](../../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md) to `luarc.disabled`. Note that in the bundled installation (5.6 onwards) this does _not_ stop the bundled scripts from loading (see this [issue](https://github.com/darktable-org/lua-scripts/issues/701)). They are loaded independently of your `luarc`. To actually prevent the Lua scripts from running, use the _disable Lua scripts_ option in [preferences > lua options](../../../preferences-settings/lua-options.md) instead. (To undo the rename, manually rename change `luarc.disabled` back to `luarc`.)\n"
msgstr ""
"ປິດການໃຊ້ງານສະຄຣິບ\n"
": ປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ `luarc` ເປັນ `luarc.disabled`. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າຕັ້ງແຕ່ເວີຊັນ 5.6 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຢຸດສະຄຣິບທີ່ລວມມານຳ. ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານຢ່າງແທ້ຈິງ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ _ປິດການໃຊ້ງານສະຄຣິບ Lua_ ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຕົວເລືອກ lua](../../../preferences-settings/lua-options.md) ແທນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add images to the darktable library, optionally copying them from another location on the filesystem or from a connected camera.\n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຮູບພາບເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ darktable, ໂດຍສາມາດເລືອກສຳເນົາພວກມັນຈາກບ່ອນອື່ນໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ຈາກກ້ອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See [supported file formats](../../../overview/supported-file-formats.md) for more information.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ [ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ](../../../overview/supported-file-formats.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following buttons are shown in the module's UI by default:\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນ UI ຂອງໂມດູນໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[add to library](#add-to-library)\n"
": Add existing images to the darktable library without copying or moving files. If you only add a single image to the library it will be automatically loaded in the darkroom.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ](#add-to-library)\n"
": ເພີ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ darktable ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການສຳເນົາ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌. ຖ້າເຈົ້າເພີ່ມພຽງຮູບດຽວ ມັນຈະຖືກໂຫຼດເຂົ້າໃນຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[copy & import](#copy--import)\n"
": Create copies of images from the filesystem and then add those copies to the darktable library.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ສຳເນົາ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າ](#copy--import)\n"
": ສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງຮູບພາບຈາກລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ແລ້ວເພີ່ມສຳເນົາເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ darktable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When a camera is detected, a new section will appear in the module for that device. If you hover your mouse over the camera label, a tooltip will display information about the camera (model, firmware version etc.)\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອກວດພົບກ້ອງ, ສ່ວນໃໝ່ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນໃນໂມດູນສຳລັບອຸປະກອນນັ້ນ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງປ້າຍຊື່ກ້ອງ, ຈະມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບກ້ອງສະແດງຂຶ້ນ (ລຸ້ນ, ເວີຊັນເຟີມແວ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Depending on the capabilities of the camera, the following additional buttons may be displayed:\n"
msgstr "ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຄວາມສາມາດຂອງກ້ອງ, ປຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ອາດຈະຖືກສະແດງ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mount camera\n"
": Mount the camera for exclusive use by darktable. This button only appears if the camera is not currently mounted and is not locked by another process.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ້ອງ (mount camera)\n"
": ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ້ອງເພື່ອໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບ darktable. ປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອກ້ອງຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລັອກໂດຍໂປຣແກຣມອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[copy & import from camera](#copy--import-from-camera)\n"
": Create copies of images from the connected camera and then add those images to the darktable library. This button only appears if the camera is currently mounted.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ສຳເນົາ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກກ້ອງ](#copy--import-from-camera)\n"
": ສ້າງສຳເນົາຂອງຮູບພາບຈາກກ້ອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ ແລ້ວເພີ່ມຮູບພາບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ darktable. ປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອກ້ອງຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[tethered shoot](../../../../tethering/_index.md)\n"
": Open the tethering view so that you can take images with your connected camera using darktable. This button only appears if the camera is currently mounted.\n"
msgstr ""
"[ການຖ່າຍຮູບແບບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (tethered shoot)](../../../../tethering/_index.md)\n"
": ເປີດມຸມມອງການຖ່າຍຮູບແບບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດຖ່າຍຮູບດ້ວຍກ້ອງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ darktable. ປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອກ້ອງຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"unmount camera\n"
": Unmount the camera and release it for use by other applications. This button only appears if the camera is currently mounted.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ້ອງ (unmount camera)\n"
": ຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກ້ອງ ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອື່ນສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້. ປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອກ້ອງຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module parameters"
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີຂອງໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the \"parameters\" label or the expander button beside it to display the following additional options.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ປ້າຍຊື່ \"ພາລາມິເຕີ\" ຫຼື ປຸ່ມຂະຫຍາຍທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງໆ ເພື່ອສະແດງຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All parameters are retained from one session to the next and can be saved as module presets.\n"
msgstr "ພາລາມິເຕີທັງໝົດຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດບັນທຶກເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ (presets) ຂອງໂມດູນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ignore exif rating\n"
": Check this option to ignore any rating stored within the image's Exif data and instead use a hard-coded value (below).\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມີນເສີຍການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ Exif\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອເມີນເສີຍການໃຫ້ຄະແນນໃດໆ ທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ແທນ (ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"initial rating\n"
": Initial star rating (from 0 to 5) to use for all newly-imported images (default 1).\n"
msgstr ""
"ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ\n"
": ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນດາວເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ແຕ່ 0 ຫາ 5) ສຳລັບທຸກຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາໃໝ່ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apply metadata\n"
": Check this option to automatically set metadata fields and/or tags at import time (see below).\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ Metadata\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຟິວ Metadata ແລະ/ຫຼື ແທັກ ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເວລານຳເຂົ້າ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"metadata\n"
": If the \"apply metadata\" box is checked, a list of the _visible_ metadata fields is presented for completion (see [metadata editor](../shared/metadata-editor.md) for details). Any populated strings are automatically added to the imported images. You can also choose from any presets saved within the metadata editor module.\n"
msgstr "ເມຕາດາຕາ: ຖ້າຫາກກ່ອງ \"ນຳໃຊ້ເມຕາດາຕາ\" ຖືກໝາຍເລືອກ, ລາຍຊື່ຂອງຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາດາຕາທີ່_ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ_ຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນ (ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໄດ້ຢູ່ [ຕົວແກ້ໄຂເມຕາດາຕາ](../shared/metadata-editor.md)). ທຸກໆຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ປ້ອນລົງໄປຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຮູບພາບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກຈາກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໂມດູນຕົວແກ້ໄຂເມຕາດາຕາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Double-click on a label to reset the corresponding field. Double-click on the \"metadata presets\" label to reset all fields.\n"
msgstr ": ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ປ້າຍຊື່ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຟິວນັ້ນຄືນໃໝ່. ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ \"Metadata ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ\" ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າທຸກຟິວຄືນໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If [preferences > storage > create XMP files](../../../preferences-settings/storage.md#xmp-sidecar-files) is set to \"never\", an additional column \"from XMP\" is presented so that you can choose to prevent the import of metadata from XMP files.\n"
msgstr ": ຖ້າ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການຈັດເກັບ > ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ XMP](../../../preferences-settings/storage.md#xmp-sidecar-files) ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ \"ບໍ່ເຄີຍ\", ຈະມີຖັນ \"ຈາກ XMP\" ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນມາ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກປ້ອງກັນການນຳເຂົ້າ Metadata ຈາກໄຟລ໌ XMP ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tags\n"
": If you want to add further tags by default when importing images, you can provide them here as a comma separated list. As with metadata you can also choose from any presets saved within the [tagging](../shared/tagging.md) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແທັກ\n"
": ຫາກເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມແທັກເພີ່ມເຕີມເມື່ອນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດລະບຸພວກມັນໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້ໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເລືອກຈາກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນໂມດູນ [ການຕິດແທັກ](../shared/tagging.md) ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "import dialog"
msgstr "ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມການນຳເຂົ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each of the three import buttons (add to library, copy & import, copy & import from camera) uses a similar dialog for the import process, described in this section.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມນຳເຂົ້າທັງສາມ (ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ, ສຳເນົາ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າ, ສຳເນົາ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກກ້ອງ) ຈະໃຊ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ, ເຊິ່ງອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນສ່ວນນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following example screenshot is taken from the \"add to library\" button:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງພາບໜ້າຈໍຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນມາຈາກປຸ່ມ \"ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ\":\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![import-dialog](./import/import-dialog.png#w100)\n"
msgstr "![import-dialog](./import/import-dialog.png#w100)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "common functionality"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນການເຮັດວຽກທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "places and folders"
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The import dialog is intended to allow you to set up common import locations, to make subsequent imports as simple as possible. When you first open the dialog, darktable attempts to add some common locations (home, pictures, mounted devices) to the places pane. You can add new places to the list by clicking on the \"+\" button and you can remove places from the list by clicking on the \"--\" button. If you wish to restore a default location that you have deleted, you can do this with the reset button.\n"
msgstr "ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມການນຳເຂົ້າຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າສະຖານທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າທີ່ໃຊ້ເປັນປະຈຳ. ເມື່ອເປີດຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, darktable ຈະເພີ່ມສະຖານທີ່ທົ່ວໄປ (home, pictures, ອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່) ໃຫ້ເອງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ \"+\" ແລະ ລົບອອກດ້ວຍປຸ່ມ \"--\". ຫາກຕ້ອງການກູ້ຄືນສະຖານທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ reset.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you choose a place, the folder tree is automatically populated (into the folders pane) from the root directory of the selected place. You can then navigate the folder tree and select a folder for import. The last selected place/folder is automatically reloaded the next time you open the dialog.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເລືອກສະຖານທີ່, ລາຍຊື່ໂຟນເດີຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກໂຟນເດີທີ່ຕ້ອງການນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້. ສະຖານທີ່/ໂຟນເດີຫຼ້າສຸດຈະຖືກຈື່ໄວ້ສຳລັບການເປີດຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the example screenshot above, you can see that a \"place\" has been created for the root of the Photos folder and a sub-folder within that structure has been selected. This is the recommended workflow for the import process -- you should not have to create new places very often.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, ມີການສ້າງ \"ສະຖານທີ່\" ສຳລັບໂຟນເດີ Photos ແລະ ເລືອກໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍໄວ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນວິທີການທີ່ແນະນຳ -- ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່ເລື້ອຍໆ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have selected a folder, the files pane will automatically be populated with a list of the files found in that folder. By default, all files in the chosen folder are selected.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເລືອກໂຟນເດີແລ້ວ, ລາຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທຸກໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຟນເດີນັ້ນຈະຖືກເລືອກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can view thumbnails for any of the images by clicking on the ![eye icon](./import/eye-icon.png#icon) icon. In addition, buttons are available at the bottom of the screen to select \"all\" files or \"none\".\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເບິ່ງຮູບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ (thumbnails) ໄດ້ໂດຍຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນ ![eye icon](./import/eye-icon.png#icon). ນອກນີ້ ຍັງມີປຸ່ມ \"ທັງໝົດ (all)\" ຫຼື \"ບໍ່ເລືອກ (none)\" ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you are happy with your selection, press Enter or click on the button at the bottom-right of the screen to import (this button will be named differently depending on the type of import being performed).\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເລືອກແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດ Enter ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມຢູ່ມຸມຂວາລຸ່ມເພື່ອການນຳເຂົ້າ (ຊື່ປຸ່ມຈະປ່ຽນໄປຕາມປະເພດການນຳເຂົ້າ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Escape or click the \"cancel\" button to exit without importing.\n"
msgstr "ກົດ Escape ຫຼື ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"ຍົກເລີກ (cancel)\" ເພື່ອອອກໂດຍບໍ່ນຳເຂົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "common options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following additional options are common to all import dialogs:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນທຸກປ່ອງຢ້ຽມການນຳເຂົ້າ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"recursive directory\n"
": Check this option to import images in the selected folder _and all subfolders_. It is recommended that you not use this option to import a large number of images at the same time. The import process causes darktable to generate thumbnails for all of the imported images, but in the end it will only be able to keep the most recent in its cache. It is therefore better to import images in smaller chunks to avoid the performance penalty this imposes.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີແບບຊ້ອນກັນ (recursive)\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກເພື່ອການນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ເລືອກ _ແລະ ໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດ_. ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບພາບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍພ້ອມກັນ ເພາະ darktable ຕ້ອງສ້າງຮູບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສຳລັບທຸກຮູບ ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງຊ້າ. ຄວນແບ່ງນຳເຂົ້າເປັນກຸ່ມນ້ອຍໆ ຈະດີກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ignore non-raw images\n"
": Check this option if there are non-RAW images in the same folder that you do not wish to import. This option is usually used where the camera stores RAW+JPEG and you only want to work on the RAW files, leaving the JPEG images untouched.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມີນເສີຍຮູບພາບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ RAW\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກຫາກມີຮູບພາບທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ RAW ໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການນຳເຂົ້າ. ມັກໃຊ້ໃນກໍລະນີຖ່າຍ RAW+JPEG ແລ້ວຕ້ອງການແກ້ໄຂສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ RAW.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "add to library"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"add to library\" button allows you to add one or more existing images to the darktable library from the local filesystem. This process does not copy or move images but merely adds their details to the library database and creates XMP sidecar files for them.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ \"ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ\" ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເພີ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໃນ darktable. ຂະບວນການນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສຳເນົາ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍຮູບພາບ ແຕ່ຈະເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ XMP sidecar ໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select only new images\n"
": Tick this box to restrict the _initial_ selection (when the dialog is loaded) to only those images that have not already been loaded into the darktable library. If you attempt to reload existing images into the darktable library, data for those images will be reloaded from the XMP sidecar files. A button is also available at the bottom of the dialog to select only \"new\" images for the currently-selected folder.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກສະເພາະຮູບພາບໃໝ່\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບົບເລືອກສະເພາະຮູບພາບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຫໍສະໝຸດ. ຫາກນຳເຂົ້າຮູບເດີມຊ້ຳ, ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກໂຫຼດຄືນມາຈາກໄຟລ໌ XMP sidecar. ຍັງມີປຸ່ມ \"ໃໝ່ (new)\" ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມເພື່ອເລືອກສະເພາະຮູບໃໝ່ໃນໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** \"Add to library\" does not create duplicates of your image files in a separate folder structure but processes them in-situ. The \"add to library\" process simply adds details of those images to darktable's library database (and creates an XMP sidecar file if applicable) allowing the images to be viewed and developed.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** \"ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ\" ບໍ່ໄດ້ສ້າງສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບ ແຕ່ຈະຈັດການຢູ່ບ່ອນເດີມ. ມັນພຽງແຕ່ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ darktable (ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ XMP) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂຮູບໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This means that if you delete images from disk after having added them, darktable cannot access them any more. Moreover, darktable does not watch for changes in the filesystem. Any new images will not be shown until they are explicitly imported.\n"
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ ຖ້າເຈົ້າລົບຮູບພາບອອກຈາກດິສກ໌, darktable ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງພວກມັນໄດ້ອີກ. ນອກນີ້ darktable ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ຮູບໃໝ່ໃດໆ ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຂຶ້ນຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການນຳເຂົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "copy & import"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This option copies images from another location on your filesystem (including mounted storage devices) and then adds the copied images to the darktable library. Using this option, if an existing XMP sidecar file is available for the image, it will _not_ be read or copied and a new XMP will be created.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະສຳເນົາຮູບພາບຈາກບ່ອນອື່ນ ແລ້ວເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ darktable. ຫາກໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ໄຟລ໌ XMP ເດີມ (ຖ້າມີ) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກອ່ານ ຫຼື ສຳເນົາມາ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ XMP ໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following additional options are available to control the file and directory naming of the copied files. By default, only the \"import job\" option is shown -- click on the \"naming rules\" label or the expander icon beside it to show additional options:\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມການຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໄດ້. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະສະແດງສະເພາະ \"ງານການນຳເຂົ້າ (import job)\" -- ໃຫ້ຄລິກໃສ່ \"ກົດເກນການຕັ້ງຊື່ (naming rules)\" ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"import job\n"
": The name of the import job (populated into the `$(JOBCODE)` variable).\n"
msgstr ""
"ງານການນຳເຂົ້າ\n"
": ຊື່ຂອງງານການນຳເຂົ້າ (ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນຕົວປ່ຽນ `$(JOBCODE)`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"override today's date\n"
": Enter a valid date/time (in `YYYY-MM-DD[Thh:mm:ss]` format) if you want to override the current date/time used when expanding the variables `$(YEAR)`, `$(MONTH)`, `$(DAY)`, `$(HOUR)`, `$(MINUTE)` and `$(SECONDS)`. Leave the field empty otherwise.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນທັບວັນທີມື້ນີ້\n"
": ປ້ອນວັນທີ/ເວລາ (ຮູບແບບ `YYYY-MM-DD[Thh:mm:ss]`) ຫາກຕ້ອງການຂຽນທັບວັນທີ/ເວລາປັດຈຸບັນໃນຕົວປ່ຽນຕ່າງໆ. ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ປະຊ່ອງນີ້ໄວ້ວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"base filmroll's directory\n"
": The base directory part of the naming pattern (default `$(PICTURES_FOLDER)/Darktable`). Click on the icon beside the input field to choose a directory manually.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງຟິມໂຣລ\n"
": ສ່ວນຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `$(PICTURES_FOLDER)/Darktable`). ຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນຂ້າງໆ ເພື່ອເລືອກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"filmroll name\n"
": The sub directory part of the naming pattern (default `$(YEAR)$(MONTH)$(DAY)_$(JOBCODE)`).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ຟິມໂຣລ\n"
": ສ່ວນຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `$(YEAR)$(MONTH)$(DAY)_$(JOBCODE)`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"keep original filename\n"
": Check this box to keep the original filename instead of using the pattern below when importing.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາຊື່ໄຟລ໌ເດີມ\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກເພື່ອຮັກສາຊື່ໄຟລ໌ເດີມແທນການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"file naming pattern\n"
": The file name part of the naming pattern (default `$(YEAR)$(MONTH)$(DAY)_$(SEQUENCE).$(FILE_EXTENSION)`).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌\n"
": ສ່ວນຂອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ `$(YEAR)$(MONTH)$(DAY)_$(SEQUENCE).$(FILE_EXTENSION)`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"keep this window open\n"
": Keep the window open after the import is complete, allowing multiple imports but with different naming options.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເປີດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມນີ້ໄວ້\n"
": ເປີດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໄວ້ຫຼັງຈາກການນຳເຂົ້າສຳເລັດ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳເຂົ້າໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຊື່ທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most of these options can also be set in [preferences > import](../../../../preferences-settings/import.md). See this section for more information about the available variables.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການນຳເຂົ້າ](../../../../preferences-settings/import.md). ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "copy & import from camera"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າຈາກກ້ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/import.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This option copies files from a connected camera to the local filesystem and then adds the copied images to the darktable library. It provides the same naming options as the \"copy & import\" dialog but does not allow places or folders to be selected.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ຈາກກ້ອງໄປຫາລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໃນເຄື່ອງ ແລ້ວເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຫໍສະໝຸດ. ມັນມີຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຊື່ຄືກັນກັບ \"ສຳເນົາ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າ\" ແຕ່ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເລືອກສະຖານທີ່ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "styles"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ (styles)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create named styles from selected images' [history stacks](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/history-stack.md) and apply styles to selected images. \n"
msgstr "ສ້າງຊື່ຮູບແບບ (style) ຈາກປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂຂອງຮູບພາບ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຮູບແບບນັ້ນກັບຮູບອື່ນໆ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Styles can either be created within this panel or in the [history stack](../darkroom/history-stack.md) module in the darkroom.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງ Style ໄດ້ໃນແຜງນີ້ ຫຼື ໃນໂມດູນປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂໃນຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A list of all available styles is displayed in the module. A search field above the list allows you to locate a style by name or description. This module also allows styles to be edited and deleted.\n"
msgstr "ລາຍຊື່ Style ທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໂມດູນນີ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາ, ແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ລົບ Style ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Double-click on a style name to apply that style to all selected images.  A style may also be applied to all selected images by pressing a shortcut key assigned to it (see [preferences > shortcuts](../../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)) while in the lighttable or darkroom view.\n"
msgstr "ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ Style ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ມັນກັບທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hover over the style name with your mouse to view a preview of the first selected image with that style applied.\n"
msgstr "ເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງຊື່ Style ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຮູບພາບເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ Style ນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove all styles by clicking on the module's reset button.\n"
msgstr "ລົບ Style ທັງໝົດອອກໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ reset ຂອງໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please note that styles also include the active state of each module. You can use this to create your own default settings, which you can then activate on-demand. Simply set your desired defaults for each module, disable the module, and save the style.\n"
msgstr "Style ລວມເຖິງສະຖານະການເປີດ/ປິດຂອງແຕ່ລະໂມດູນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງເຈົ້າເອງໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A large selection of \"camera\" styles is provided with darktable. These styles are designed to approximate the out-of-camera JPEG look for supported camera models and can be found within this module under the \"darktable camera styles\" style group. You can automatically apply these styles on import using the companion Lua script [official/camera style](https://docs.darktable.org/lua/stable/lua.scripts.manual/scripts/official/apply_camera_style/).\n"
msgstr "ມີ Style \"ກ້ອງ (camera)\" ຫຼາຍແບບໃຫ້ເລືອກເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ພາບທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງກັບ JPEG ຈາກກ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hide preview\n"
": Use this checkbox to hide the preview on the tooltip entirely. This can be useful on slower computers, where rendering the preview may take additional time.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອງຕົວຢ່າງ\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກເພື່ອເຊື່ອງພາບຕົວຢ່າງ ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"create duplicate\n"
": When applying a style to images, tick this box to create a duplicate of each image before applying the chosen style to that duplicate. Disable this option to apply the chosen style directly to the selected images. Beware that in this case any existing history stack is overwritten (depending on the mode -- see below) and cannot be recovered.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງສຳເນົາ\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກເພື່ອສ້າງສຳເນົາຮູບພາບກ່ອນນຳໃຊ້ Style. ຫາກບໍ່ເລືອກ, ມັນຈະນຳໃຊ້ Style ກັບຮູບເດີມທັນທີ ແລະ ອາດຂຽນທັບປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂເດີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mode\n"
": As with the [history stack](./history-stack.md) module, this combobox allows you to either \"append\" the style to the current history stack or to \"overwrite\" the history stack of the target image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ \"ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (append)\" ຫຼື \"ຂຽນທັບ (overwrite)\" ປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"create\n"
": Create new style(s) using the history stack of the selected image(s). For each selected image a style creation window is shown. You must supply a unique name for each new style and you can also add an optional description.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ້າງ\n"
": ສ້າງ Style ໃໝ່ຈາກປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂຂອງຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຊື່ Style ໃຫ້ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You will be provided with the option to select which history stack items you want to include in the created style. For any module, you may also choose to \"reset\" that module's parameters -- this will cause the module to be included in the style but with all controls set to their initial (default) state (as if you had clicked the module reset button).\n"
msgstr ": ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະເອົາຂັ້ນຕອນການແກ້ໄຂໃດແດ່ເຂົ້າໃນ Style ໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The panel supports a hierarchical view, meaning that you can create categories using the pipe symbol “|” as a separator. For example “print|tone curve +0.5 EV” will create a \"print\" category with a style of \"tone curve +0.5 EV\" below it.\n"
msgstr ""
": ແຜງນີ້ຮອງຮັບການເບິ່ງແບບລຳດັບຊັ້ນ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໝວດໝູ່ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍທໍ່ “|” ເປັນຕົວ"
"ຂັ້ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ “print|tone curve +0.5 EV” ຈະສ້າງໝວດໝູ່ \"print\" ທີ່ມີສະໄຕລ໌ \"tone "
"curve +0.5 EV\" ຢູ່ລຸ່ມມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You can cancel the creation process by pressing the Cancel button or pressing the Esc key on your keyboard.\n"
msgstr ": ເຈົ້າສາມາດຍົກເລີກການສ້າງໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ Cancel ຫຼື ກົດ Esc.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"edit\n"
": Select \"edit\" to bring up a dialog which allows you to include or exclude specific items from the stack of an existing style. Check the “duplicate” option if you want to create a new style, instead of overwriting the existing one, in which case you will need to provide a unique name for the new style.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂ\n"
": ເລືອກ \"ແກ້ໄຂ\" ເພື່ອເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລວມ ຫຼື ແຍກລາຍການສະເພາະອອກຈາກລຳດັບ"
"ຂອງສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ໝາຍຕິກເອົາຕົວເລືອກ “ສ້າງຊ້ຳ (duplicate)” ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການສ້າງສະໄຕລ໌ໃໝ່ ແທນທີ່ຈະຂ"
"ຽນທັບອັນເກົ່າ, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຊື່ໃໝ່ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"remove\n"
": Delete the selected style, without any further prompt.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລົບ\n"
": ລົບ Style ທີ່ເລືອກອອກທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"import\n"
": Import a previously saved style. Styles are stored as XML files with the extension `.dtstyle`. If a style with the same name already exists, you will be asked if you wish to overwrite.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າ\n"
": ນຳເຂົ້າ Style ທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ (ໄຟລ໌ `.dtstyle`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export\n"
": Save the selected style to disk as a `.dtstyle` file. This allows styles to be published and shared with other users.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງອອກ\n"
": ບັນທຶກ Style ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງເປັນໄຟລ໌ `.dtstyle` ເພື່ອແບ່ງປັນໃຫ້ຜູ້ນື່ອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"preferences...\" option in the presets menu allows you to adjust the following settings:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ \"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ...\" ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປັບແຕ່ງສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/styles.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preview size\n"
": Set the size of the preview on the tooltip. The available options are: default and large.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດພາບຕົວຢ່າງ\n"
": ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດຂອງພາບຕົວຢ່າງ: ແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ແບບໃຫຍ່.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "history stack"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ (history stack)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manipulate the history stack of one or more selected images.\n"
msgstr "ຈັດການລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຂອງພາບທີ່ເລືອກໜຶ່ງພາບ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"selective copy...\n"
": Copy parts of the history stack from the selected image. A dialog will appear, from which you will be able to select which history stack items you want to copy. For any module, you may also choose to \"reset\" that module's parameters -- this will cause the module to be copied but with all controls set to their initial (default) state (as if you had clicked the module reset button).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄັດລອກແບບເລືອກ (selective copy...)\n"
": ຄັດລອກບາງສ່ວນຂອງລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຈາກພາບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຈະມີກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມປາກົດຂຶ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກລາຍການໃນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄັດລອກ. ສຳລັບໂມດູນໃດໆ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກ \"reset\" ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງໂມດູນນັ້ນ -- ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໂມດູນຖືກຄັດລອກໄປ ແຕ່ຕົວຄວບຄຸມທັງໝົດຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (ຄືກັບວ່າເຈົ້າໄດ້ກົດປຸ່ມ reset ຂອງໂມດູນນັ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If more than one image is selected, the history stack is taken from the image that was selected first. Double-click on a history item to copy that item only and immediately close the dialog.\n"
msgstr ": ຖ້າມີການເລືອກຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງພາບ, ລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຈະຖືກດຶງມາຈາກພາບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກເປັນອັນດັບທຳອິດ. ຄລິກສອງບາດໃສ່ລາຍການປະຫວັດເພື່ອຄັດລອກສະເພາະລາຍການນັ້ນ ແລະ ປິດກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"copy\n"
": Copy the complete history stack from the selected image. If more than one image is selected, the history stack is taken from the image that was selected first.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄັດລອກ (copy)\n"
": ຄັດລອກລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດຈາກພາບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຖ້າມີການເລືອກຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງພາບ, ລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຈະຖືກດຶງມາຈາກພາບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກເປັນອັນດັບທຳອິດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Information relating to internal display encoding and mask management is considered unsafe to automatically copy to other images and will therefore not be copied when using this button.\n"
msgstr ": ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການເຂົ້າລະຫັດການສະແດງຜົນພາຍໃນ ແລະ ການຈັດການມາກສ໌ ຖືກຖືວ່າບໍ່ປອດໄພທີ່ຈະຄັດລອກໄປຍັງພາບອື່ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ພວກມັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຄັດລອກເມື່ອໃຊ້ປຸ່ມນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The following modules are excluded from the _copy_ operation:\n"
msgstr ": ໂມດູນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກການດຳເນີນການ _ຄັດລອກ_:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - [_orientation_](../../processing-modules/orientation.md)\n"
": - [_lens correction_](../../processing-modules/lens-correction.md)\n"
": - [_raw black/white point_](../../processing-modules/raw-black-white-point.md)\n"
": - [_rotate pixels_](../../processing-modules/rotate-pixels.md)\n"
": - [_scale pixels_](../../processing-modules/scale-pixels.md)\n"
": - [_white balance_](../../processing-modules/white-balance.md)\n"
": - deprecated modules\n"
msgstr ""
": - [_orientation_](../../processing-modules/orientation.md)\n"
": - [_lens correction_](../../processing-modules/lens-correction.md)\n"
": - [_raw black/white point_](../../processing-modules/raw-black-white-point.md)\n"
": - [_rotate pixels_](../../processing-modules/rotate-pixels.md)\n"
": - [_scale pixels_](../../processing-modules/scale-pixels.md)\n"
": - [_white balance_](../../processing-modules/white-balance.md)\n"
": - ໂມດູນທີ່ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ແລ້ວ (deprecated)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You can override all of these exclusions by using \"selective paste...\" and choosing which modules to paste to the target image(s).\n"
msgstr ": ເຈົ້າສາມາດຍົກເລີກການຍົກເວັ້ນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ \"selective paste...\" (ວາງແບບເລືອກ) ແລະ ເລືອກວ່າຈະວາງໂມດູນໃດລົງໃນພາບເປົ້າໝາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"selective paste...\n"
": Paste parts of a copied history stack onto all selected images. As with the selective copy button, a dialog appears from which you may choose the items to paste (or \"reset\") from the copied history stack, and then choose to \"append\" to or \"overwrite\" the history stack of the target image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວາງແບບເລືອກ (selective paste...)\n"
": ວາງບາງສ່ວນຂອງລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຄັດລອກມາລົງໃນທຸກພາບທີ່ເລືອກ. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບປຸ່ມຄັດລອກແບບເລືອກ, ຈະມີກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມປາກົດຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກລາຍການທີ່ຈະວາງ (ຫຼື \"reset\") ຈາກລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຄັດລອກມາ, ແລ້ວເລືອກວ່າຈະ \"append\" (ເພີ່ມຕໍ່ທ້າຍ) ຫຼື \"overwrite\" (ຂຽນທັບ) ລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຂອງພາບເປົ້າໝາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": A copied history stack can have multiple instances of the same module (with the same name or different names) and pasting behaves differently for these entries depending whether you use the \"overwrite\" or \"append\" button: \n"
msgstr ": ລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຄັດລອກມາອາດມີໂມດູນດຽວກັນຫຼາຍອັນ (ທີ່ມີຊື່ຄືກັນ ຫຼື ຕ່າງກັນ) ແລະ ການວາງຈະມີພຶດຕິກຳທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບວ່າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ \"overwrite\" ຫຼື \"append\": \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - The \"overwrite\" button will delete the history of the destination image before adding every module instance from the copied history stack. Using the \"select all\" actions in both the \"selective copy...\" and \"selective paste...\" controls will precisely duplicate the copied history stack to the destination image(s) (including any duplicate occurrences).\n"
msgstr ": - ປຸ່ມ \"overwrite\" (ຂຽນທັບ) ຈະລຶບປະຫວັດຂອງພາບປາຍທາງອອກທັງໝົດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມທຸກໂມດູນຈາກລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຄັດລອກມາ. ການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ \"select all\" (ເລືອກທັງໝົດ) ທັງໃນ \"selective copy...\" ແລະ \"selective paste...\" ຈະເປັນການເຮັດສຳເນົາລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂໄປຍັງພາບປາຍທາງໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ (ລວມທັງໂມດູນທີ່ປາກົດຊ້ຳ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - The \"append\" button will take each module from the copied history stack and if there is a module in the destination image with the same name, it will be replaced and added to the top of the history stack. If there is no such module, a new instance will be created and added to the top of the history stack. If a module has multiple instances in either history stack, only the last occurence of that module will be added.\n"
msgstr ": - ປຸ່ມ \"append\" (ເພີ່ມຕໍ່ທ້າຍ) ຈະນຳແຕ່ລະໂມດູນຈາກລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຄັດລອກມາ ແລະ ຖ້າມີໂມດູນໃນພາບປາຍທາງທີ່ມີຊື່ຄືກັນ, ມັນຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແທນ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປທາງເທິງສຸດຂອງລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີໂມດູນນັ້ນ, ມັນຈະສ້າງໂມດູນໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປທາງເທິງສຸດ. ຖ້າໂມດູນໃດໜຶ່ງມີຫຼາຍອັນໃນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ, ຈະມີພຽງອັນຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງໂມດູນນັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"paste\n"
": Paste all items of a copied history stack onto all selected images. This has the same behavior as the \"append\" button in the \"selective paste...\" controls. This behavior also applies when using copy and paste keyboard shortcuts.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວາງ (paste)\n"
": ວາງທຸກລາຍການຂອງລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຄັດລອກມາລົງໃນທຸກພາບທີ່ເລືອກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີພຶດຕິກຳຄືກັບປຸ່ມ \"append\" ໃນຕົວຄວບຄຸມ \"selective paste...\". ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ຍັງໃຊ້ກັບການໃຊ້ຄີລັດຄັດລອກ ແລະ ວາງ ນຳອີກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatic module presets are only added to an image when it is first opened in the darkroom or its history stack is discarded. If you use the \"overwrite\" mode to paste history stack entries to images that haven't previously been opened in the darkroom, then the next time that image is opened in the darkroom automatic presets will be applied to the image. It may therefore seem as if the \"overwrite\" behavior did not accurately duplicate the existing history stack, but in this case, those automatic modules were added after the paste action.\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າຕັ້ງລ່ວງໜ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດ (Automatic module presets) ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນພາບກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອພາບນັ້ນຖືກເປີດໃນຫ້ອງມືດເປັນຄັ້ງທຳອິດ ຫຼື ລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ໂໝດ \"overwrite\" ເພື່ອວາງລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂລົງໃນພາບທີ່ບໍ່ເຄີຍເປີດໃນຫ້ອງມືດມາກ່ອນ, ເມື່ອເປີດພາບນັ້ນໃນຫ້ອງມືດຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ ຄ່າຕັ້ງລ່ວງໜ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບພາບ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ມັນອາດຈະເບິ່ງຄືວ່າ \"overwrite\" ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດສຳເນົາລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແຕ່ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້, ໂມດູນອັດຕະໂນມັດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າຫຼັງຈາກການວາງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"append\" mode allows you to later reconstruct your pre-existing history stack (because previous history items are retained in the stack of the destination image). However, with the \"overwrite\" mode all previous edits are irrevocably lost.\n"
msgstr "ໂໝດ \"append\" ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດກູ້ຄືນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ມີມາກ່ອນໜ້າໄດ້ (ເນື່ອງຈາກລາຍການປະຫວັດກ່ອນໜ້າຍັງຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນລຳດັບຂອງພາບປາຍທາງ). ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ດ້ວຍໂໝດ \"overwrite\", ການແກ້ໄຂກ່ອນໜ້າທັງໝົດຈະສູນເສຍໄປຢ່າງຖາວອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"compress history\n"
": Compress the history stack of the selected image. If any module appears multiple times in the history stack, these occurrences will be _compressed_ into a single step in the history. _Beware: this action can not be undone!_\n"
msgstr ""
"ບີບອັດປະຫວັດ (compress history)\n"
": ບີບອັດລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຂອງພາບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຖ້າມີໂມດູນໃດປາກົດຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກ _ບີບອັດ_ ໃຫ້ເຫຼືອພຽງຂັ້ນຕອນດຽວໃນປະຫວັດ. _ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ: ການກະທຳນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຍົກເລີກໄດ້!_\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"discard history\n"
": Physically delete the history stack of the selected images. _Beware: this action can not be undone!_\n"
msgstr ""
"ຖິ້ມປະຫວັດ (discard history)\n"
": ລຶບລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຂອງພາບທີ່ເລືອກອອກຢ່າງຖາວອນ. _ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ: ການກະທຳນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຍົກເລີກໄດ້!_\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"load sidecar file\n"
": Open a dialog box which allows you to import the history stack from a selected XMP file. The imported history stack is used to _completely replace_ the current history stack(s) of the selected image(s). _Caution: this operation can not be undone!_\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ sidecar\n"
": ເປີດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໂຕ້ຕອບທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂ (history stack) ຈາກໄຟລ໌ XMP ທີ່ເລືອກ. ປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອ _ແທນທີ່ທັງໝົດ_ ຂອງປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ. _ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ: ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດກັບຄືນໄດ້!_\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Images that were exported by darktable typically contain the full history stack if the file format supports embedded metadata (see the [export](../shared/export.md) module for details of this feature and its limitations). You can load an exported image as a sidecar file in the same way as you can with an XMP file. This feature allows you to recover all parameter settings if you have accidentally lost or overwritten the XMP file. All you need is the source image, typically a raw, and the exported file.\n"
msgstr ": ຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກໂດຍ darktable ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະມີປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດ ຖ້າຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຮອງຮັບການຝັງຂໍ້ມູນ Metadata (ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ [ສົ່ງອອກ](../shared/export.md)). ເຈົ້າສາມາດໂຫຼດຮູບພາບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວເປັນໄຟລ໌ sidecar ໄດ້ຄືກັນກັບໄຟລ໌ XMP. ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກູ້ຄືນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັງໝົດໄດ້ ຫາກເຈົ້າເຮັດໄຟລ໌ XMP ເສຍ ຫຼື ຂຽນທັບໂດຍບັງເອີນ. ສິ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການມີພຽງແຕ່ຮູບພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບ (RAW) ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"write sidecar files\n"
": Write XMP sidecar files for all selected images. The filename is generated by appending “.xmp” to the name of the underlying input file.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂຽນໄຟລ໌ sidecar\n"
":ຂຽນໄຟລ໌ sidecar XMP ສຳລັບຮູບພາບທັງໝົດທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ. ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍການເພີ່ມ “.xmp” ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ"
"ຊື່ຂອງໄຟລ໌ນໍາເຂົ້າຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": By default darktable generates and updates sidecar files automatically whenever you work on an image and change the history stack. You can disable automatic sidecar file generation in [preferences > storage](../../../preferences-settings/storage.md). This can be useful when you are running multiple versions of darktable (so that edits in each version do not conflict with one another) however, in general, disabling this feature is not recommended.\n"
msgstr ": ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ darktable ຈະສ້າງ ແລະ ອັບເດດໄຟລ໌ sidecar ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ເຈົ້າແກ້ໄຂຮູບພາບ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປິດການສ້າງໄຟລ໌ sidecar ອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ການຈັດເກັບ](../../../preferences-settings/storage.md). ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອເຈົ້າໃຊ້ darktable ຫຼາຍເວີຊັນພ້ອມກັນ (ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ) ແຕ່ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປິດຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "timeline"
msgstr "ທາມລາຍ (timeline)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "View your images by the date/time they were taken.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຮູບພາບຂອງເຈົ້າຕາມວັນທີ/ເວລາທີ່ຖ່າຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![timeline](./timeline/timeline.png)\n"
msgstr "![timeline](./timeline/timeline.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the lighttable filemanager view, you can show/hide the timeline module in the bottom panel with the shortcut Ctrl+F. \n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດ ເປີດ/ເຊື່ອງ ໂມດູນ timeline ໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄີລັດ Ctrl+F. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Within the timeline, you can show the next and previous dates by scrolling your mouse; Ctrl+scroll to zoom in/out.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວັນທີຖັດໄປ ຫຼື ກ່ອນໜ້າ; Ctrl+ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ ເພື່ອ ຊູມເຂົ້າ/ອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/lighttable/timeline.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also use the timeline to select images by date range by clicking and dragging your mouse.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ timeline ເພື່ອເລືອກຮູບຕາມຊ່ວງເວລາໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກແລ້ວລາກເມົາສ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Export selected images.\n"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When used in the darkroom view, the currently-edited image will be exported if no other images are selected in the filmstrip.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນມຸມມອງຫ້ອງມືດ (darkroom), ຮູບພາບທີ່ກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຮູບອື່ນຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ໃນແຖບຟິມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Files can be exported to a file on disk, email, various online storage locations, a web album, or a book template. \n"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ສາມາດຖືກສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງໄຟລ໌ໃນດິສກ໌, ອີເມວ, ແຫຼ່ງເກັບຂໍ້ມູນອອນລາຍຕ່າງໆ, ເວັບອະລະບ້ຳ, ຫຼື ແມ່ແບບປຶ້ມ. \n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "storage options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"target storage\n"
": The type of location to store your selected images. A number of different back-ends are implemented, including file on disk, LaTeX book template and various web albums. Depending on the selected target, you will be asked to provide additional information, such as filenames or account name and password.\n"
msgstr ""
"ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປາຍທາງ\n"
": ປະເພດຂອງສະຖານທີ່ທີ່ຈະເກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ມີຫຼາຍລະບົບຮອງຮັບ ລວມທັງໄຟລ໌ໃນດິສກ໌, ແມ່ແບບປຶ້ມ LaTeX ແລະ ເວັບອະລະບ້ຳຕ່າງໆ. ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບປາຍທາງທີ່ເລືອກ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ຊື່ບັນຊີ ແລະ ລະຫັດຜ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"filename template\n"
": Define the folder and file to which the image will be exported. This can be automatically generated using several pre-defined variables. For example, `$(SEQUENCE)` in a template records sequence number of the image exported to the target. See the [variables](../../../special-topics/variables.md) section for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແມ່ແບບຊື່ໄຟລ໌\n"
": ກຳນົດໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຮູບອອກໄປ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, `$(SEQUENCE)` ໃນແມ່ແບບຈະບັນທຶກລຳດັບຂອງຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄປຍັງປາຍທາງ. ເບິ່ງສ່ວນ [ຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables)](../../../special-topics/variables.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"output directory selector\n"
": The button beside the filename template entry opens a dialog to select the parent directory for export.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂາອອກ\n"
": ປຸ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ຂ້າງຊ່ອງແມ່ແບບຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ຈະເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງເພື່ອເລືອກໂຟນເດີຫຼັກສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"on conflict\n"
": Choose what to do if the generated filename conflicts with an existing file on export:\n"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງ\n"
": ເລືອກສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເຮັດຖ້າຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄປຊ້ຳກັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນຕອນສົ່ງອອກ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _create unique filename_: Automatically choose a unique new file name by appending an integer to name of the conflicting file.\n"
msgstr ": - _ສ້າງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ຊ້ຳໃຜ_: ເລືອກຊື່ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍການຕື່ມຕົວເລກໃສ່ທ້າຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _overwrite_: Automatically overwrite existing files. This option will present you with a confirmation dialog in order to protect you from accidental data loss -- you can disable this in [preferences > security > ask before exporting in overwrite mode](../../../preferences-settings/security.md). _**Note:** This dialog is not presented per-file but as a one-off confirmation before the export job starts._ \n"
msgstr ": - _ຂຽນທັບ_: ຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງຢືນຢັນເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເສຍຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ -- ທ່ານສາມາດປິດສິ່ງນີ້ໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຄວາມປອດໄພ > ຖາມກ່ອນການສົ່ງອອກໃນໂໝດຂຽນທັບ](../../../preferences-settings/security.md). _**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ໜ້າຕ່າງຢືນຢັນນີ້ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງທຸກໄຟລ໌ ແຕ່ຈະສະແດງຄັ້ງດຽວກ່ອນເລີ່ມວຽກສົ່ງອອກ._ \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _overwrite if changed_: Automatically overwrite existing files if the last export timestamp stored in darktable's database does not match the last changed date/time on the existing file.\n"
msgstr ": - _ຂຽນທັບຖ້າມີການປ່ຽນແປງ_: ຂຽນທັບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຖ້າເວລາການສົ່ງອອກຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ darktable ບໍ່ກົງກັບ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງຫຼ້າສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _skip_: Do not export images where the destination filename already exists.\n"
msgstr ": - _ຂ້າມ_: ບໍ່ສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບຖ້າຊື່ໄຟລ໌ປາຍທາງມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "format options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຮູບແບບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"file format\n"
": Choose the file format for the exported image. Additional options will appear (below) depending on the selected format.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌\n"
": ເລືອກຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກ. ຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມຈະປະກົດຂຶ້ນ (ດ້ານລຸ່ມ) ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຮູບແບບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"quality\n"
": The quality of the exported file. Higher values lead to larger file sizes. The default quality (95) is a good setting for very high quality exports (e.g. for archiving or printing purposes). If you need a good compromise between size and quality (e.g. for online image display or uploads) you should consider a value of “90” instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນນະພາບ\n"
": ຄຸນນະພາບຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ. ຄ່າທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ. ຄຸນນະພາບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (95) ແມ່ນການຕັ້"
"ງຄ່າທີ່ດີສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກຄຸນນະພາບສູງຫຼາຍ (ເຊັ່ນ: ເພື່ອການເກັບມ້ຽນ ຫຼື ການພິມ). ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄວາມສົມດຸ"
"ນລະຫວ່າງຂະໜາດ ແລະ ຄຸນນະພາບ (ເຊັ່ນ: ສຳລັບການສະແດງຮູບອອນລາຍ ຫຼື ການອັບໂຫຼດ) ທ່ານຄວນພິຈາລະນາ"
"ໃຊ້ຄ່າ “90” ແທນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bit depth\n"
": The number of bits used for each color channel. More bits means less posterization/color banding.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເລິກບິດ (bit depth)\n"
": ຈຳນວນບິດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ. ບິດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນໝາຍເຖິງການເກີດແຖບສີ (color banding) ໜ້ອຍລົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"compression\n"
": The type of compression to use.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການບີບອັດ\n"
": ປະເພດຂອງການບີບອັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"compression level\n"
": For export formats where _compression_ can be specified, the _compression level_ specifies how much compression to apply. The higher the level, the more the data will be compressed, at the cost of more CPU cycles.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບການບີບອັດ\n"
": ສຳລັບຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ສາມາດລະບຸ _ການບີບອັດ_ ໄດ້, _ລະດັບການບີບອັດ_ ຈະກຳນົດວ່າຈະບີບອັດຫຼາຍປານໃດ. ຍິ່ງລະດັບສູງ, ຂໍ້ມູນກໍຈະຖືກບີບອັດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ, ແຕ່ກໍຕ້ອງໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນ CPU ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"b&w image\n"
": For TIFF export format, it is possible to save a monochrome image. This setting controls whether the resulting file encodes the shades of gray as separate RGB channels, or as a single grayscale channel. The latter option will result in smaller files.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຂາວດຳ\n"
": ສຳລັບຮູບແບບການສົ່ງອອກ TIFF, ສາມາດບັນທຶກເປັນຮູບຂາວດຳໄດ້. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຄວບຄຸມວ່າໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄດ້ຈະເກັບລະດັບສີເທົາເປັນຊ່ອງ RGB ແຍກກັນ, ຫຼື ເປັນຊ່ອງສີເທົາ (grayscale) ດຽວ. ຕົວເລືອກຫຼັງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "global options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"set size\n"
": Choose how to measure the maximum size of your exported image\n"
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຂະໜາດ\n"
": ເລືອກວິທີວັດແທກຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງຮູບທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _in pixels (for file)_: Enter the maximum width and height in pixels. \n"
msgstr ": - _ເປັນພິກເຊວ (ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌)_: ປ້ອນຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງສູງສຸດເປັນພິກເຊວ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _in cm (for print)_: Enter the maximum width and height in cm and define the image's dpi. The equivalent size in pixels will be automatically calculated.\n"
msgstr ": - _ເປັນ ຊມ (ສຳລັບພິມ)_: ປ້ອນຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງສູງສຸດເປັນ ຊມ ແລະ ກຳນົດ dpi ຂອງຮູບ. ຂະໜາດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າເປັນພິກເຊວຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _in inch (for print)_: Enter the maximum width and height in inches and define the image's dpi. The equivalent size in pixels will be automatically calculated.\n"
msgstr ": - _ເປັນນິ້ວ (ສຳລັບພິມ)_: ປ້ອນຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງສູງສຸດເປັນນິ້ວ ແລະ ກຳນົດ dpi ຂອງຮູບ. ຂະໜາດທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າເປັນພິກເຊວຈະຖືກຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _by scale (for file)_: Enter a multiplier to specify by how much the exported image should be scaled compared to the input image. For example, entering a value of 0.5 will result in an output image with half the width and height (in pixels) of the original image.\n"
msgstr ": - _ຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນ (ສຳລັບໄຟລ໌)_: ປ້ອນຕົວຄູນເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຮູບທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກຄວນຖືກປັບຂະໜາດເທົ່າໃດເມື່ອທຽບກັບຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ການປ້ອນຄ່າ 0.5 ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຮູບທີ່ໄດ້ມີຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງ (ເປັນພິກເຊວ) ເປັນເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຮູບເດີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"dpi\n"
": If units of cm or inches are chosen, set the dpi of the output image. The dpi will also be stored in the Exif data of the exported image. It will be automatically set to 300 if \"in pixels\" or \"by scale\" is chosen.\n"
msgstr ""
"dpi\n"
": ຖ້າເລືອກຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ ຊມ ຫຼື ນິ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ dpi ຂອງຮູບຂາອອກ. dpi ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກນຳ. ມັນຈະຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ 300 ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຖ້າເລືອກ \"ເປັນພິກເຊວ\" ຫຼື \"ຕາມອັດຕາສ່ວນ\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"max size\n"
": Set the maximum width and height of the exported image(s) in pixels, cm or inches (depending on the selected unit) -- zero means that no constraint will be set on that dimension. Exported images will be constrained so as not to exceed either of these values, while retaining the correct aspect ratio. Set both to zero to export with the original dimensions (after cropping). If the entered values exceed the original dimensions darktable will either export with the original dimensions or upscale the image, depending on the \"allow upscaling\" parameter.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດ\n"
": ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງສູງສຸດຂອງຮູບທີ່ຈະສົ່ງອອກເປັນພິກເຊວ, ຊມ ຫຼື ນິ້ວ (ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຫົວໜ່ວຍທີ່ເລືອກ) -- ສູນໝາຍເຖິງບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດຂະໜາດໃນດ້ານນັ້ນ. ຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະຖືກຈຳກັດບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີນຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຕັ້ງທັງສອງເປັນສູນເພື່ອສົ່ງອອກດ້ວຍຂະໜາດເດີມ (ຫຼັງຈາກຕັດຂອບ). ຖ້າຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າເກີນຂະໜາດເດີມ, darktable ຈະສົ່ງອອກດ້ວຍຂະໜາດເດີມ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍຮູບໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ (upscale), ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບພະລາມິເຕີ \"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍພາບ\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"allow upscaling\n"
": Set to “yes” to perform an upscaling step if the user-defined maximum width and height exceed the original dimensions of the image. If set to “no” the exported image's dimensions will not exceed the dimensions of the original image (after cropping). This uses the [pixel interpolator](../../../preferences-settings/processing.md) set in preferences; for higher-quality super-resolution upscaling using an AI model, see the [neural restore](./neural-restore.md) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ (allow upscaling)\n"
": ຕັ້ງເປັນ “ແມ່ນ” ເພື່ອດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນການຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ ຫາກຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງສູງສຸດທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດໄວ້"
"ເກີນຂະໜາດເດີມຂອງຮູບ. ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ “ບໍ່”, ຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈະບໍ່ເກີນຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບເດີມ (ຫຼັງຈາກຕັດຂ"
"ອບ). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ [ຕົວແຊກພິກເຊວ (pixel interpolator)](../../../preferences-settings/"
"processing.md) ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ; ສຳລັບການຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນແບບຄວາມລະອຽດສູງພິເສດໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວແບບ "
"AI, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໂມດູນ [ການຟື້ນຟູດ້ວຍປະສາດທຽມ (neural restore)](./neural-restore.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"high quality resampling\n"
": Set this to 'yes' to perform high quality resampling on the image. The image will be processed in full resolution and only downscaled at the very end. This can sometimes result in better quality, but will always be slower.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການປັບຂະໜາດຄຸນນະພາບສູງ\n"
": ຕັ້ງເປັນ 'ແມ່ນ (yes)' ເພື່ອເຮັດການປັບຂະໜາດ (resampling) ຄຸນນະພາບສູງກັບຮູບ. ຮູບຈະຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນຄວາມລະອຽດເຕັມ ແລະ ຈະຖືກຫຼຸດຂະໜາດລົງໃນຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບາງຄັ້ງອາດຈະໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບທີ່ດີກວ່າ, ແຕ່ຈະເຮັດວຽກຊ້າກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"store masks\n"
": Store masks as additional layers (for TIFF format) or channels (for EXR and XCF formats) in the exported image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເກັບຮັກສາໜ້າກາກ (masks)\n"
": ເກັບຮັກສາໜ້າກາກເປັນເລເຢີເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ສຳລັບຮູບແບບ TIFF) ຫຼື ເປັນຊ່ອງສີ (ສຳລັບຮູບແບບ EXR ແລະ XCF) ໃນຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"profile\n"
": The output color profile. Select “image settings” if you want the settings in the [_output color profile_](../../processing-modules/output-color-profile.md) module of the individual images to be respected.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌\n"
": ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂາອອກ. ເລືອກ “ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບ” ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ລະບົບອີງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໂມດູນ [_ໂປຣໄຟ"
"ລ໌ສີຂາອອກ_](../../processing-modules/output-color-profile.md) ຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"intent\n"
": This option lets you define the intent -- the way in which darktable will handle out-of-gamut colors. See [rendering intent](../../../special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent) for a more detailed description of the available options.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດປະສົງ (intent)\n"
": ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຈຸດປະສົງ -- ວິທີທີ່ darktable ຈະຈັດການກັບສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດສີ (out-of-gamut). ເບິ່ງ [rendering intent](../../../special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent) ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍລະອຽດຂອງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"style\n"
": Choose a [style](../lighttable/styles.md) which darktable will combine with the existing history stack to generate the output image. These history items are only added temporarily -- the original history stack is not overwritten. You can use this feature to add processing steps and parameters that you want to be applied specifically to images before export. For example you may define a style that adds a stronger level of sharpening when you produce scaled-down JPEG files for the internet or add a certain level of exposure compensation to all of your output images. \n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບ (style)\n"
": ເລືອກ [ຮູບແບບ (style)](../lighttable/styles.md) ທີ່ darktable ຈະນຳໄປລວມກັບລຳດັບປະຫວັດທີ່ມີຢູ່ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຂາອອກ. ລາຍການປະຫວັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າຊົ່ວຄາວເທົ່ານັ້ນ -- ປະຫວັດເດີມຈະບໍ່ຖືກຂຽນທັບ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຟີເຈີນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ພະລາມິເຕີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບຮູບກ່ອນການສົ່ງອອກ. ຕົວຢ່າງ ທ່ານອາດຈະກຳນົດຮູບແບບທີ່ເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃຫ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນເມື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ JPEG ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສຳລັບອິນເຕີເນັດ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມການຊົດເຊີຍແສງໃນລະດັບໃດໜຶ່ງໃຫ້ກັບຮູບຂາອອກທັງໝົດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mode\n"
": When applying a style during export this option defines whether the history stack items of that style replace the original history stack of the image or are appended to it. Technically speaking, in append mode history stack items of the style will constitute separate instances of the respective modules on top of any existing ones (see also [multiple instances](../../../darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md)). As a consequence the original history stack will remain in effect with the new items being applied in addition. This way you can apply an overall adjustment (e.g. exposure) to a number of exported images while respecting the settings of each individual image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ\n"
": ເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຮູບແບບໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະກຳນົດວ່າລາຍການໃນລຳດັບປະຫວັດຂອງຮູບແບບນັ້ນຈະໄປແທນທີ່ລຳດັບປະຫວັດເດີມຂອງຮູບ ຫຼື ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມຕໍ່ທ້າຍ. ໃນທາງເຕັກນິກ, ໃນໂໝດເພີ່ມຕໍ່ທ້າຍ (append mode), ລາຍການປະຫວັດຂອງຮູບແບບຈະສ້າງເປັນອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (instance) ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຂອງໂມດູນນັ້ນໆ ເທິງໂມດູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ (ເບິ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ [ຫຼາຍອິນສະແຕນຊ໌](../../../darkroom/processing-modules/multiple-instances.md)). ຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ຄືລຳດັບປະຫວັດເດີມຍັງມີຜົນຢູ່ ແລະ ມີລາຍການໃໝ່ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້ ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ການປັບແຕ່ງລວມ (ເຊັ່ນ ການຮັບແສງ) ໃຫ້ກັບຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"start export\n"
": Press this button to start a background job to export all selected images. A bar at the bottom of the left hand panel displays the progress of the export job. Furthermore a notification message pops up reporting the completion of each individual export. You may click on the pop-up to make it disappear. You may abort the export job by clicking on the \"x\" icon located close to the progress bar. \n"
msgstr ""
"ເລີ່ມການສົ່ງອອກ\n"
": ກົດປຸ່ມນີ້ເພື່ອເລີ່ມການສົ່ງອອກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກທັງໝົດເປັນວຽກເບື້ອງຫຼັງ. ແຖບຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງແຜງຊ້າຍມືຈະສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການສົ່ງອອກ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຈະມີຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນປະກົດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອການສົ່ງອອກແຕ່ລະຮູບສຳເລັດ. ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກໃສ່ປັອບອັບນັ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຫາຍໄປ. ທ່ານສາມາດຍົກເລີກວຽກສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນ \"x\" ທີ່ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບແຖບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"multi-preset export\n"
": Expanding this section allows you to easily export each of the selected images with several different presets in a single export run. For example, you may wish to export each image in multiple sizes at the same time for use in a website. Simply create a preset for each type of export you wish to make, ensuring that the file path settings for each preset is unique (so that the exported images don't overwrite one another). Select the desired presets and press the \"start export\" button as normal.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການສົ່ງອອກແບບຫຼາຍຄ່າລ່ວງໜ້າ\n"
": ການຂະຫຍາຍສ່ວນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສົ່ງອອກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກແຕ່ລະຮູບດ້ວຍຄ່າລ່ວງໜ້າ (preset) ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນຫຼາຍອັນໃນຄັ້ງດຽວ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການສົ່ງອອກແຕ່ລະຮູບໃນຫຼາຍຂະໜາດພ້ອມກັນເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນເວັບໄຊ. ພຽງແຕ່ສ້າງຄ່າລ່ວງໜ້າສຳລັບການສົ່ງອອກແຕ່ລະປະເພດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ໂດຍກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌ຂອງແຕ່ລະຄ່າລ່ວງໜ້ານັ້ນບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນ (ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໄປຂຽນທັບກັນ). ເລືອກຄ່າລ່ວງໜ້າທີ່ຕ້ອງການແລ້ວກົດປຸ່ມ \"ເລີ່ມການສົ່ງອອກ\" ຕາມປົກກະຕິ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Images that are selected but currently hidden (because they are members of a collapsed group) will not be exported.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກແຕ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໃນປັດຈຸບັນ (ເນື່ອງຈາກຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ຖືກຫຍໍ້ໄວ້) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "metadata preferences"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The “preferences…” option in the presets menu brings up a dialog where you can configure what metadata to include in exported files:\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ “ຄຸນສົມບັດ…” (preferences) ໃນເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets) ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ທ່ານສາມາ"
"ດຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ (metadata) ທີ່ຈະລວມເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![metadata config](./export-selected/metadata-config.png#w66)\n"
msgstr "![ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ](./export-selected/metadata-config.png#w66)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parameters entered into this dialog are saved along with other export parameters to user presets and the last entered values are retained when darktable is closed. \n"
msgstr "ພະລາມິເຕີທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າໃນໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ຮ່ວມກັບພະລາມິເຕີການສົ່ງອອກອື່ນໆໃນຄ່າລ່ວງໜ້າຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນຫຼ້າສຸດຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເມື່ອປິດ darktable. \n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "general settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The left-hand-side of this dialog allows you to choose which groups of metadata are to be exported with the image. The following options are available:\n"
msgstr "ດ້ານຊ້າຍມືຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກວ່າກຸ່ມຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາໃດທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໄປພ້ອມກັບຮູບ. ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exif data\n"
": Export the source image's Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນ Exif\n"
": ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"metadata\n"
": Export metadata defined in the [metadata editor](../shared/metadata-editor.md) module. Only metadata fields that are tagged as _visible_ and are not tagged as _private_ will be exported.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ\n"
": ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນໂມດູນ [ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ](../shared/metadata-editor.md). ສະເພາະຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກໝາຍວ່າ _ສະແດງ (visible)_ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍວ່າ _ສ່ວນຕົວ (private)_ ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"geo tags\n"
": Export geo tags.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແທັກພູມສັນຖານ\n"
": ສົ່ງອອກແທັກພູມສັນຖານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tags\n"
": Export tags  created in the [tagging](../shared/tagging.md) module (to `Xmp.dc.Subject`). Three additional options can also be selected:\n"
": - _private tags_: Export private tags\n"
": - _synonyms_: Export tag synonyms\n"
": - _omit hierarchy_: Only export the last part of hierarchical tags\n"
msgstr ""
"ແທັກ\n"
": ສົ່ງອອກແທັກທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນໂມດູນ [ການຕິດແທັກ](../shared/tagging.md) (ໄປຍັງ `Xmp.dc.Subject`). ສາມາດເລືອກຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ສາມຢ່າງ:\n"
": - _ແທັກສ່ວນຕົວ_: ສົ່ງອອກແທັກສ່ວນຕົວ\n"
": - _ຄຳໄວພົດ (synonyms)_: ສົ່ງອອກຄຳໄວພົດຂອງແທັກ\n"
": - _ບໍ່ເອົາລຳດັບຂັ້ນ_: ສົ່ງອອກສະເພາະສ່ວນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງແທັກທີ່ມີລຳດັບຂັ້ນ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"hierarchical tags\n"
": Export hierarchical tags (to `Xmp.lr.Hierarchical Subject`)\n"
msgstr ""
"ແທັກແບບລຳດັບຂັ້ນ\n"
": ສົ່ງອອກແທັກແບບລຳດັບຂັ້ນ (ໄປຍັງ `Xmp.lr.Hierarchical Subject`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"develop history\n"
": Export the entire development history (history stack and shapes) where supported (e.g. JPEG, JPEG2000, TIFF). The development history will be stored as XMP tags within the output file. This information can later be used to reconstruct the parameters and settings that were used to produce the exported image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂ\n"
": ສົ່ງອອກປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດ (ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ ແລະ ຮູບຊົງ) ໃນບ່ອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ (ເຊັ່ນ JPEG, JPEG2000, TIFF). ປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນແທັກ XMP ພາຍໃນໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກ. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງເພື່ອສ້າງຄືນພະລາມິເຕີ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Caution:** For various reasons embedding XMP tags into output files may fail without notice, e.g. if certain size limits are exceeded. Users are therefore advised to not rely on this feature for their backup strategy. To back up your data always make sure to save your input (raw) file as well as all of darktable's XMP sidecar files.\n"
msgstr "**ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ:** ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນຕ່າງໆ ການຝັງແທັກ XMP ເຂົ້າໃນໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກອາດຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວໂດຍບໍ່ມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ເຊັ່ນ ຖ້າເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງຂະໜາດບາງຢ່າງ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຄວນເພິ່ງພາຟີເຈີນີ້ສຳລັບກົນລະຍຸດການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ເພື່ອສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບວ່າໄດ້ບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າ (raw) ພ້ອມກັບໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ XMP ທັງໝົດຂອງ darktable ໄວ້ສະເໝີ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "per metadata settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາແຍກຕາມລາຍການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The right-hand-side of this dialog allows you to define formulas to populate image metadata. The formulas defined here have priority over the settings in the left-hand-side of the dialog. The first column identifies the entry to be edited. The second column allows you to define how to calculate the value for that metadata entry using a formula. \n"
msgstr "ດ້ານຂວາມືຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດສູດເພື່ອຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງຮູບ. ສູດທີ່ກຳນົດຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ຈະມີບຸລິມະສິດເໜືອກວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢູ່ດ້ານຊ້າຍມືຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງ. ຖັນທຳອິດລະບຸລາຍການທີ່ຈະແກ້ໄຂ. ຖັນທີສອງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດວິທີຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເມຕານັ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ສູດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [variables](../../../special-topics/variables.md) section for details of the variables you can use in your metadata formula. Press Enter to validate the formula. Leave the formula empty to prevent a given metadata entry from being exported (`Exif.GPSInfo.GPSVersionID` in the above example). \n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງສ່ວນ [ຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables)](../../../special-topics/variables.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນສູດຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ. ກົດ Enter ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນສູດ. ປະສູດໄວ້ວ່າງເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ສົ່ງອອກຂໍ້ມູນເມຕານັ້ນ (`Exif.GPSInfo.GPSVersionID` ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the “--” icon to remove a metadata entry from the list and the “+” icon to add a new one from a predefined list of available metadata tags.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ໄອຄອນ “--” ເພື່ອລຶບລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາອອກຈາກລາຍຊື່ ແລະ ໃຊ້ໄອຄອນ “+” ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ຈາກລາ"
"ຍຊື່ແທັກຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາທີ່ມີໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the \"add\" button to add a metadata entry to the list.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ \"ເພີ່ມ (add)\" ເພື່ອເພີ່ມລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The formulas allow you virtually define all the metadata you need to qualify your images in tagging and export the values in the XMP or IPTC tags of your choice. The exported tags can be different from one export to the next depending on the destination of the images. Tags and Categories are displayed separately in image information.\n"
msgstr "ສູດຕ່າງໆຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳລັບຮູບພາບໃນການຕິດແທັກ ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກຄ່າໃນແທັກ XMP ຫຼື IPTC ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ແທັກທີ່ສົ່ງອອກສາມາດແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບປາຍທາງຂອງຮູບ. ແທັກ ແລະ ໝວດໝູ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງແຍກກັນໃນຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Remember that a tag set up as a category is never exported._\n"
msgstr "_ຢ່າລືມວ່າແທັກທີ່ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນໝວດໝູ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ._\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tips"
msgstr "ເຄັດລັບ"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To prevent a specific metadata field from being exported, add it to the list and leave the formula empty.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ສົ່ງອອກຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາສະເພາະອັນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ ແລະ ປະສູດໄວ້ວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To force a specific exif metadata field to be exported when exif export is disabled, add it to the list and enter `=` into the formula.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ສົ່ງອອກຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ exif ສະເພາະອັນໃດໜຶ່ງໃນຂະນະທີ່ປິດການສົ່ງອອກ exif ຢູ່, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມມັນເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ ແລະ ປ້ອນ `=` ໃສ່ໃນສູດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"example 1\n"
": A first level tag called places is set as a category, and is followed by four levels of information (or keywords): country, region, city and location (e.g. `places|France|Nord|Lille|rue Nationale`). Each level can be retrieved (when it is defined) by one of the variables `$(CATEGORY0(places))`, `$(CATEGORY1(places))`, `$(CATEGORY2(places))` and `$(CATEGORY3(places))`. In this example, the returned values are \"France\", \"Nord\", \"Lille\" and \"rue Nationale\", respectively. These keywords can also be retrieved as simple tags using the variable `$(TAGS)`. The last keyword level defined (the leaf) is displayed in [image information](../shared/image-information.md), here \"rue Nationale\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ 1\n"
": ແທັກລະດັບທຳອິດທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ places ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນໝວດໝູ່, ແລະ ຕາມດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ (ຫຼື ຄຳສຳຄັນ) ສີ່ລະດັບ: ປະເທດ, ພາກພື້ນ, ເມືອງ ແລະ ສະຖານທີ່ (ເຊັ່ນ `places|France|Nord|Lille|rue Nationale`). ແຕ່ລະລະດັບສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນມາໄດ້ (ເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດໄວ້) ດ້ວຍຕົວປ່ຽນໃດໜຶ່ງຄື `$(CATEGORY0(places))`, `$(CATEGORY1(places))`, `$(CATEGORY2(places))` ແລະ `$(CATEGORY3(places))`. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້, ຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ຄື \"France\", \"Nord\", \"Lille\" ແລະ \"rue Nationale\" ຕາມລຳດັບ. ຄຳສຳຄັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຍັງສາມາດດຶງມາເປັນແທັກທົ່ວໄປໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນ `$(TAGS)`. ຄຳສຳຄັນລະດັບສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນ [ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ](../shared/image-information.md), ໃນທີ່ນີ້ແມ່ນ \"rue Nationale\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"example 2\n"
": A first level tag called creator is followed by the name of the photographer, both set as categories: `creator|firstname lastname`. The formula copyrights (`$(YEAR) $(CATEGORY0(creator))`) builds the text associated with image rights. Here, [image information](../shared/image-information.md) displays \"creator: firstname lastname\" as categories. Neither creator nor \"firstname lastname\" appear in the tags list and they are not exported as simple tags.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ 2\n"
": ແທັກລະດັບທຳອິດທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ creator ຕາມດ້ວຍຊື່ຂອງຊ່າງພາບ, ເຊິ່ງທັງສອງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນໝວດໝູ່: `creator|firstname lastname`. ສູດລິຂະສິດ (`$(YEAR) $(CATEGORY0(creator))`) ຈະສ້າງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບສິດຂອງຮູບພາບ. ໃນທີ່ນີ້, [ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ](../shared/image-information.md) ຈະສະແດງ \"creator: firstname lastname\" ເປັນໝວດໝູ່. ທັງ creator ແລະ \"firstname lastname\" ຈະບໍ່ປະກົດໃນລາຍການແທັກ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກເປັນແທັກທົ່ວໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/export.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** tagging is not appropriate to define free text metadata, like a title or a description, which may be specific to each image. Use the [metadata editor](../shared/metadata-editor.md) for this type of information.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ການຕິດແທັກບໍ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບການກຳນົດຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມອິດສະຫຼະ ເຊັ່ນ ຫົວຂໍ້ ຫຼື ຄຳອະທິບາຍ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະສະເພາະເຈາະຈົງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຮູບ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ](../shared/metadata-editor.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນປະເພດນີ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "recently used collections"
msgstr "ຄໍເລັກຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ຫວ່າງໆນີ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Display a list of recently used collections generated by the [collections](./collections.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍການຄໍເລັກຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ຫວ່າງໆນີ້ ເຊິ່ງສ້າງໂດຍໂມດູນ [ຄໍເລັກຊັນ](./collections.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on an entry to reopen the selected collection. This also updates the collections module with the appropriate filter criteria and rules.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ລາຍການໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອເປີດຄໍເລັກຊັນທີ່ເລືອກຄືນໃໝ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງຈະອັບເດດໂມດູນຄໍເລັກຊັນດ້ວຍເງື່ອນໄຂການກັ່ນຕອງ ແລະ ກົດເກນທີ່ເໝາະສົມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"preferences...\" option in the presets menu allows you to adjust the behavior of the recent collections module as follows:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ \"ຄ່າກຳນົດ...\" ໃນເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບພຶດຕິກຳຂອງໂມດູນຄໍເລັກຊັນທີ່ໃຊ້ຫວ່າງໆນີ້ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"number of recent collections to be stored\n"
": The number of recent collections to store and display in the recent collections module (default 10)\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຄໍເລັກຊັນຫວ່າງໆນີ້ທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້\n"
": ຈຳນວນຄໍເລັກຊັນຫວ່າງໆນີ້ທີ່ຈະບັນທຶກ ແລະ ສະແດງໃນໂມດູນຄໍເລັກຊັນຫວ່າງໆນີ້ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/recent-collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"prefer a history button in the collections module\n"
": Set whether you prefer to use this module or the history button in the [collections](./collections.md) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມັກໃຊ້ປຸ່ມປະຫວັດໃນໂມດູນຄໍເລັກຊັນ\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າທ່ານມັກຈະໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມປະຫວັດໃນໂມດູນ [ຄໍເລັກຊັນ](./collections.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "neural restore"
msgstr "ການຟື້ນຟູດ້ວຍລະບົບປະສາດທຽມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply AI-powered restoration to selected images: raw denoise, RGB denoise, and 2x / 4x upscaling. Available in both the lighttable and darkroom views as a panel with a tabbed task picker, an interactive before/after preview, and a process button that runs the chosen task on every selected image. Outputs go to a new file – the original image is never modified.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ການຟື້ນຟູດ້ວຍພະລັງ AI ໃຫ້ກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ: ການຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບໄຟລ໌ດິບ (raw denoise), ຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບ "
"RGB, ແລະ ການຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ 2x / 4x. ມີໃຫ້ທັງໃນມຸມມອງ lighttable ແລະ darkroom ເປັນແຜງທີ່ມີ"
"ຕົວເລືອກວຽກແບບແທັບ, ການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງກ່ອນ/ຫຼັງແບບໂຕ້ຕອບ, ແລະ ປຸ່ມປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການຕາມວຽກທີ່"
"ເລືອກໃນທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ – ຮູບເດີມຈະບໍ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂເລີຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AI features this module drives are configured in [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md); see the [AI features overview](../../../special-topics/ai/overview.md) for what these tasks do and don't do.\n"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI ທີ່ໂມດູນນີ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ AI](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md); ເບິ່ງ [ພາບລວມຄຸນສົມບັດ AI](../../../special-topics/ai/overview.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດວ່າຍັງສາມາດເຮັດຫຍັງໄດ້ ແລະ ເຮັດຫຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Neural restore can be significantly sped up with [GPU acceleration](../../../special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md).\n"
msgstr "ການຟື້ນຟູດ້ວຍລະບົບປະສາດທຽມສາມາດເລັ່ງໃຫ້ໄວຂຶ້ນໄດ້ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍດ້ວຍ [ການເລັ່ງດ້ວຍ GPU](../../../special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you can use this module:\n"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Enable AI features** in [AI preferences](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md). The master switch is off in a fresh install.\n"
msgstr "**ເປີດໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ AI** ໃນ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ AI](../../../preferences-settings/ai.md). ສະວິດຫຼັກຈະຖືກປິດໄວ້ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Activate a model for each task you want to use.** In the same preferences tab, tick the _enabled_ column for one model per task – `rawdenoise` for the raw denoise tab, `denoise` for the denoise tab, `upscale` for the upscale tab. If no model is enabled for the current tab, the preview area shows _model not available_ and the process button refuses to run.\n"
msgstr ""
"**ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວແບບສຳລັບແຕ່ລະວຽກທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ.** ໃນແທັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນ, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກໃນຖັນ _ເປີດໃຊ້ "
"(enabled)_ ສຳລັບໜຶ່ງຕົວແບບຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງວຽກ – `rawdenoise` ສຳລັບແທັບຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບໄຟລ໌ດິບ, `denoise` "
"ສຳລັບແທັບຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບ, `upscale` ສຳລັບແທັບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີຕົວແບບໃດຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບແທັບປັດຈຸບັ"
"ນ, ພື້ນທີ່ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຈະຂຶ້ນວ່າ _ບໍ່ມີຕົວແບບ_ ແລະ ປຸ່ມປະມວນຜົນຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switching tabs without an active model for the new task is harmless – the module just disables itself for that tab until you enable one.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການສະຫຼັບແທັບໂດຍບໍ່ມີຕົວແບບທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ສຳລັບວຽກໃໝ່ແມ່ນບໍ່ມີອັນຕະລາຍ – ໂມດູນພຽງແຕ່ຈະປິດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງມັນ"
"ເອງສຳລັບແທັບນັ້ນ ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວແບບໃດໜຶ່ງ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tabs"
msgstr "ແທັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The notebook at the top of the module selects the task to run.\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນເລືອກແທັບຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໂມດູນແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລືອກວຽກທີ່ຈະປະມວນຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"raw denoise\n"
": AI denoise applied early in the raw pipeline. The exact stage depends on the sensor:\n"
msgstr ""
"raw denoise (ຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນຈາກໄຟລ໌ດິບ)\n"
": ການຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນດ້ວຍ AI ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ໃນໄລຍະທຳອິດຂອງຂະບວນການປະມວນຜົນໄຟລ໌ດິບ. ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນ່ນອນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບເຊັນເຊີ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - **Bayer sensors** are denoised directly on the CFA mosaic, with denoise and demosaic combined into a single inference pass. The result is saved as a Bayer CFA DNG.\n"
": - **X-Trans sensors** (and any other non-Bayer colour CFA the Bayer model can't handle) are demosaicked first by darktable's pipeline, then the AI denoiser operates on the resulting linear Rec.2020 RGB image. The result is saved as a LinearRaw DNG.\n"
msgstr ""
": - **ເຊັນເຊີ Bayer** ຈະຖືກຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນໂດຍກົງໃນຮູບແບບ CFA mosaic, ໂດຍການຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນ ແລະ ການຖອດລະຫັດສີ (demosaic) ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນການປະມວນຜົນຄັ້ງດຽວ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນ Bayer CFA DNG.\n"
": - **ເຊັນເຊີ X-Trans** (ແລະ ສີ CFA ອື່ນໆທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ Bayer ທີ່ໂມເດວ Bayer ຈັດການບໍ່ໄດ້) ຈະຖືກຖອດລະຫັດສີກ່ອນໂດຍ darktable, ຈາກນັ້ນ AI denoiser ຈະເຮັດວຽກເທິງຮູບພາບ linear Rec.2020 RGB ທີ່ໄດ້. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບຈະຖືກບັນທຶກເປັນ LinearRaw DNG.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Either output can be re-imported into darktable as a regular raw – downstream darkroom processing is unchanged.\n"
msgstr ""
": ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບໃດໜຶ່ງສາມາດນຳກັບເຂົ້າມາໃນ darktable ເປັນໄຟລ໌ດິບປົກກະຕິ – ການປະມວນຜົນໃນ darkroom "
"ຕໍ່ໄປຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": **Limitations.** Monochrome sensors are not currently supported – the available raw-denoise models are trained on colour-CFA data and have no monochrome equivalent yet. Use _denoise_ in neural restore module on a monochrome image instead.\n"
msgstr ""
": **ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດ.** ເຊັນເຊີແບບ Monochrome (ສີດຽວ) ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບໃນຕອນນີ້ – ຕົວແບບຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບໄຟລ໌"
"ດິບທີ່ມີຢູ່ຖືກເຝິກຝົນດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນ colour-CFA ແລະ ຍັງບໍ່ມີຕົວແບບ monochrome ທີ່ທຽບເທົ່າເທື່ອ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ "
"_denoise_ ໃນໂມດູນການຟື້ນຟູດ້ວຍປະສາດທຽມກັບຮູບ monochrome ແທນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _strength_ – linear blend between the source raw (0%) and the AI-denoised output (100%) at the raw sensor level. Lower values let some of the original noise back in, in direct proportion.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _ຄວາມແຮງ (strength)_ – ການປະສົມແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ລະຫວ່າງໄຟລ໌ດິບຕົ້ນສະບັບ (0%) ແລະ ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ຫຼຸດ"
"ສັນຍານລົບດ້ວຍ AI (100%) ຢູ່ທີ່ລະດັບເຊັນເຊີດິບ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຈະປ່ອຍໃຫ້ສັນຍານລົບເດີມບາງສ່ວນກັບຄືນມາຕາມສັ"
"ດສ່ວນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"denoise\n"
": Machine-learning RGB denoise applied to the already-demosaicked and mostly-edited image; writes a TIFF.\n"
msgstr ""
"denoise (ຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນ)\n"
": ການຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນ RGB ດ້ວຍລະບົບການຮຽນຮູ້ຂອງເຄື່ອງຈັກ (Machine-learning) ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບທີ່ຖອດລະຫັດສີແລ້ວ ແລະ ຜ່ານການແກ້ໄຂສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແລ້ວ; ໂດຍຈະບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ TIFF.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _strength_ – at 100% the output is the full AI model result. Lower values do not just blend back the source – the difference between source and denoised is decomposed into wavelet (DWT) detail bands and the higher-frequency texture is brought back selectively, so you recover grain and surface detail without re-introducing the colour noise the model removed.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _ຄວາມແຮງ (strength)_ – ທີ່ 100% ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນມາຈາກຕົວແບບ AI ທັງໝົດ. ຄ່າທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນ"
"ພຽງການປະສົມກັບຕົ້ນສະບັບຄືນ – ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຜົນທີ່ຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບແລ້ວຈະຖືກແຍກອອກເປັ"
"ນແຖບລາຍລະອຽດ wavelet (DWT) ແລະ ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ສູງຈະຖືກນຳກັບມາສະເພາະບາງສ່ວນ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານໄ"
"ດ້ເມັດສີ (grain) ແລະ ລາຍລະອຽດພື້ນຜິວຄືນມາ ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສັນຍານລົບຂອງສີທີ່ຕົວແບບລຶບອອກໄປນັ້ນກັບຄືນມ"
"າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"upscale\n"
": Super-resolution to 2x or 4x the input pixel dimensions. Writes a TIFF at the upscaled size. 4x on a high-resolution image is memory-hungry; tile processing is enabled automatically to keep peak memory bounded, at the cost of some extra processing time.\n"
msgstr ""
"upscale (ເພີ່ມຂະໜາດ)\n"
": ການເພີ່ມຄວາມລະອຽດສູງເປັນ 2 ເທົ່າ ຫຼື 4 ເທົ່າ ຂອງຂະໜາດພິກເຊວເດີມ. ຈະບັນທຶກເປັນໄຟລ໌ TIFF ຕາມຂະໜາດທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ການເພີ່ມ 4 ເທົ່າ ໃນຮູບທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດສູງຈະໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຫຼາຍ; ລະບົບຈະເປີດການປະມວນຜົນແບບແຍກສ່ວນ (tile processing) ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການໃຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະໃຊ້ເວລາປະມວນຜົນເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເລັກໜ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _scale_ – output magnification factor applied to each side of the image (_2x_ or _4x_). _2x_ doubles the width and height, producing four times as many pixels overall; _4x_ quadruples each side, producing sixteen times as many. Larger factors are slower and need more GPU memory.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _ຂະໜາດ (scale)_ – ຄ່າການຂະຫຍາຍຂາອອກທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ກັບແຕ່ລະດ້ານຂອງຮູບ (_2x_ ຫຼື _4x_). "
"_2x_ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄວາມກວ້າງ ແລະ ຄວາມສູງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນສອງເທົ່າ, ເຊິ່ງສ້າງພິກເຊວໂດຍລວມຫຼາຍກວ່າເກົ່າສີ່ເທົ່າ; "
"_4x_ ຈະເພີ່ມແຕ່ລະດ້ານເປັນສີ່ເທົ່າ, ເຊິ່ງສ້າງພິກເຊວຫຼາຍກວ່າເກົ່າສິບຫົກເທົ່າ. ຄ່າທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຈະເຮັດວຽກຊ້າກວ່"
"າ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ GPU ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": **Note:** 4x upscaling is significantly more demanding on the model than 2x, since it must invent 16x as many pixels of new detail as the original. Fine textures and high-frequency content may be less convincing than at 2x – use 2x when it meets your resolution requirements.\n"
msgstr ""
": **ໝາຍເຫດ:** ການຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ 4x ແມ່ນຕ້ອງການຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍກວ່າ 2x ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ, ເນື່ອງຈາກ"
"ມັນຕ້ອງສ້າງພິກເຊວລາຍລະອຽດໃໝ່ຫຼາຍກວ່າຕົ້ນສະບັບເຖິງ 16 ເທົ່າ. ພື້ນຜິວທີ່ລະອຽດ ແລະ ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ມີຄວາມຖີ່ສູງອ"
"າດຈະເບິ່ງບໍ່ສົມຈິງເທົ່າກັບ 2x – ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ 2x ເມື່ອມັນກົງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "where the tasks sit in your workflow"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງວຽກຕ່າງໆໃນຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_raw denoise_ and _denoise_ both remove sensor noise – the difference is **at which point in the workflow** you decide to apply them, and you normally use one _or_ the other, not both:\n"
msgstr ""
"_raw denoise_ ແລະ _denoise_ ທັງສອງລ້ວນແຕ່ລຶບສັນຍານລົບຂອງເຊັນເຊີ – ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງແມ່ນ **ຢູ່ທີ່ຂັ້"
"ນຕອນໃດໃນຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກ** ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກຈະນຳໃຊ້ພວກມັນ, ແລະ ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວທ່ານຄວນເລືອກໃຊ້ຢ່າງໃດຢ່າ"
"ງໜຶ່ງ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນທັງສອງຢ່າງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reach for **raw denoise** when you already know the shot is noisy (high ISO, deep push, low light) and haven't started editing. It removes noise at the source, on the raw data, which is where a model can remove it most cleanly – so it gives the strongest result on difficult captures. You commit to it up front and then edit the cleaned DNG.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ **raw denoise** ເມື່ອທ່ານຮູ້ແລ້ວວ່າຮູບນັ້ນມີສັນຍານລົບຫຼາຍ (ISO ສູງ, ດຶງແສງຫຼາຍ, ແສງໜ້ອຍ) ແລ"
"ະ ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເລີ່ມການແກ້ໄຂ. ມັນຈະລຶບສັນຍານລົບຢູ່ທີ່ຕົ້ນກຳເນີດ, ໃນຂໍ້ມູນໄຟລ໌ດິບ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຈຸດທີ່ຕົວແບບສາມາດລຶ"
"ບມັນອອກໄດ້ສະອາດທີ່ສຸດ – ສະນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ຖ່າຍມາຍາກ. ທ່ານເລືອກໃຊ້ມັນກ່ອນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງ"
"ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ DNG ທີ່ສະອາດແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "reach for **denoise** when you have already developed an image and noise is bothering you in the _result_. It cleans the noise you can actually see in your finished edit, without making you redo that edit.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ **denoise** ເມື່ອທ່ານໄດ້ແຕ່ງຮູບສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ແລະ ສິ່ງລົບກວນມາລົບກວນໃນ _ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ_. ມັນຈະເຮັດຄວາມສະອາດສິ່ງລົບກວນທີ່ທ່ານເຫັນໃນຮູບທີ່ແຕ່ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ໂດຍບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານຕ້ອງໄປເລີ່ມແຕ່ງຮູບໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"raw denoise – _before_ darkroom editing\n"
": Operates on the source raw (Bayer CFA, or X-Trans / non-Bayer demosaicked to linear Rec.2020) and writes a DNG. The intended workflow is:\n"
msgstr ""
"raw denoise – _ກ່ອນ_ ການແກ້ໄຂໃນ darkroom\n"
": ເຮັດວຽກກັບໄຟລ໌ດິບຕົ້ນສະບັບ (Bayer CFA, ຫຼື X-Trans / non-Bayer ທີ່ແປງເປັນ linear "
"Rec.2020) ແລະ ຂຽນເປັນໄຟລ໌ DNG. ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ແນະນຳຄື:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": 1. select the noisy raw in lighttable;\n"
": 2. run _raw denoise_ – the output DNG is grouped with the source;\n"
": 3. open the new DNG and edit it normally.\n"
msgstr ""
": 1. ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ດິບທີ່ມີສັນຍານລົບໃນ lighttable;\n"
": 2. ດຳເນີນການ _raw denoise_ – ໄຟລ໌ DNG ທີ່ໄດ້ຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມໄວ້ກັບຕົ້ນສະບັບ;\n"
": 3. ເປີດໄຟລ໌ DNG ໃໝ່ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂມັນຕາມປົກກະຕິ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": As it works with the original sensor data it removes noise most cleanly, before demosaic spreads it across the colour channels. It is the AI counterpart to the classical [raw denoise](../../processing-modules/raw-denoise.md) module – both operate on the raw CFA data before demosaic. The original raw file stays untouched.\n"
msgstr ""
": ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນເຮັດວຽກກັບຂໍ້ມູນເຊັນເຊີເດີມ, ມັນຈຶ່ງລຶບສັນຍານລົບໄດ້ສະອາດທີ່ສຸດ, ກ່ອນທີ່ການແປງສັນຍານ "
"(demosaic) ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສັນຍານລົບກະຈາຍໄປຕາມຊ່ອງສີຕ່າງໆ. ມັນແມ່ນຄູ່ຮ່ວມ AI ຂອງໂມດູນ [raw "
"denoise](../../processing-modules/raw-denoise.md) ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ – ທັງສອງເຮັດວຽກກັບຂໍ້ມູ"
"ນ raw CFA ກ່ອນການແປງສັນຍານ. ໄຟລ໌ດິບຕົ້ນສະບັບຈະບໍ່ຖືກແຕະຕ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"denoise – _late_ in the workflow, _after_ darkroom editing\n"
": Exports your image through the full darkroom pipeline (every active module is applied) and then runs the AI denoiser on the result, writing a TIFF. The intended workflow is:\n"
msgstr ""
"denoise – _ທ້າຍ_ ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກ, _ຫຼັງຈາກ_ ການແກ້ໄຂໃນ darkroom\n"
": ສົ່ງອອກຮູບຂອງທ່ານຜ່ານຂະບວນການ darkroom ທັງໝົດ (ທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້) ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງດຳເນີນການ"
"ຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບດ້ວຍ AI ໃສ່ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ, ແລະ ຂຽນເປັນໄຟລ໌ TIFF. ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ແນະນຳຄື:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": 1. develop the image up to and including the step that switches the pipeline from _scene-referred_ to _display-referred_ space ([_filmic rgb_](../../processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md), [_sigmoid_](../../processing-modules/sigmoid.md) or [_AgX_](../../processing-modules/agx.md)) and any display-referred colour grading – the point where the noise visible to the viewer has emerged;\n"
": 2. run _denoise_ – the output is a TIFF with the edit so far baked in, plus noise cleaned up;\n"
": 3. continue editing the TIFF if you want to add sharpening, local adjustments, output sizing, etc., or deliver it directly.\n"
msgstr ""
": 1. ປັບແຕ່ງຮູບຈົນຮອດຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ປ່ຽນຈາກ _scene-referred_ ໄປຫາ _display-referred_ "
"([_filmic rgb_](../../processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md), [_sigmoid_](../../"
"processing-modules/sigmoid.md) ຫຼື [_AgX_](../../processing-modules/agx.md)) ແລ"
"ະ ການປັບແຕ່ງສີແບບ display-referred ໃດໆ – ເຊິ່ງເປັນຈຸດທີ່ສັນຍານລົບທີ່ຜູ້ຊົມເຫັນໄດ້ປະກົດອອກມາ;\n"
": 2. ດຳເນີນການ _denoise_ – ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ TIFF ທີ່ລວມເອົາການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດໄວ້ແລ້ວ, ພ້ອມທັງລຶບສັ"
"ນຍານລົບອອກ;\n"
": 3. ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ TIFF ຕໍ່ ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດ, ປັບແຕ່ງສະເພາະຈຸດ, ປັບຂະໜາດຂາອອກ, ແລ"
"ະ ອື່ນໆ, ຫຼື ສົ່ງມອບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ເລີຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": This cleans exactly the noise visible in your finished edit, without redoing any work – your edit is baked into the TIFF and you carry on from there. The trade-off: the noise is already shaped by the whole pipeline, so on a very noisy capture _raw denoise_ gives a cleaner result. The TIFF is fully editable – a clean midpoint, not necessarily the last stop.\n"
msgstr ""
": ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະລຶບສັນຍານລົບທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ໃນການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ສຳເລັດແລ້ວຂອງທ່ານພໍດີ, ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກໃໝ່ – ການແກ້ໄຂຂອ"
"ງທ່ານຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນ TIFF ແລ້ວ ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ຈາກນັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ແລກປ່ຽນ: ສັນຍານລົບໄດ້ຖືກປັບປ່ຽນໂດ"
"ຍຂະບວນການທັງໝົດແລ້ວ, ສະນັ້ນສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ມີສັນຍານລົບຫຼາຍໆ _raw denoise_ ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ສະອາດກວ່າ. ໄຟລ໌ "
"TIFF ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່ – ເປັນຈຸດເຄິ່ງທາງທີ່ສະອາດ, ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍສະເໝີໄປ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"upscale – _last step before delivery_\n"
": Runs the full darkroom pipeline, then enlarges the result 2x or 4x and writes a TIFF. The intended workflow is:\n"
msgstr ""
"upscale – _ຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍກ່ອນສົ່ງມອບ_\n"
": ດຳເນີນການຜ່ານຂະບວນການ darkroom ທັງໝົດ, ຈາກນັ້ນຂະຫຍາຍຜົນໄດ້ຮັບເປັນ 2x ຫຼື 4x ແລະ ຂຽນເປັນໄ"
"ຟລ໌ TIFF. ຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ແນະນຳຄື:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": 1. finish your edit, including any sharpening and grading;\n"
": 2. run _upscale_ at the chosen factor – the output is a TIFF at the upscaled size;\n"
": 3. use the output for print or large-format display.\n"
msgstr ""
": 1. ແກ້ໄຂຮູບໃຫ້ສຳເລັດ, ລວມທັງການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດ ແລະ ການປັບສີ;\n"
": 2. ດຳເນີນການ _upscale_ ຕາມຄ່າທີ່ເລືອກ – ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ TIFF ຕາມຂະໜາດທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍແລ້ວ;\n"
": 3. ໃຊ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບນັ້ນເພື່ອການພິມ ຫຼື ການສະແດງຜົນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Don't upscale early in the workflow: any subsequent denoise, sharpening or grading would then operate on the synthesised pixels rather than the originals, and the output quality suffers. Typical uses are enlarging a small crop for a large print, or pulling a low-resolution source up to web-deliverable size.\n"
msgstr ": ຢ່າໃຊ້ upscale ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດຂອງການເຮັດວຽກ: ເພາະການຫຼຸດສິ່ງລົບກວນ, ການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດ ຫຼື ການປັບສີຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຈະເຮັດວຽກເທິງພິກເຊວທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນພິກເຊວຕົ້ນສະບັບ, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຄຸນນະພາບຫຼຸດລົງ. ການໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນການຂະຫຍາຍຮູບທີ່ຄຣັອບມາໜ້ອຍໆເພື່ອການພິມຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ຫຼື ການເພີ່ມຂະໜາດຮູບທີ່ມີຄວາມລະອຽດຕ່ຳເພື່ອໃຊ້ເທິງເວັບ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "preview"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below the tab controls is a split before/after preview of a small patch of the currently-displayed image. Drag the divider to wipe between the original (left) and the AI-restored output (right). The preview is generated on demand by clicking the preview area; it uses the same model and settings the process button would use, so it's a faithful guide to what the final output will look like.\n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ລຸ່ມສ່ວນຄວບຄຸມແທັບແມ່ນການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງແບບແບ່ງສ່ວນ ກ່ອນ/ຫຼັງ ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ນ້ອຍໆໃນຮູບທີ່ກຳລັງສະແດງ. ລາກເສັ້ນແບ່ງເພື່ອເບິ່ງຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງຮູບເດີມ (ຊ້າຍ) ແລະ ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ຟື້ນຟູດ້ວຍ AI (ຂວາ). ຕົວຢ່າງຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງ; ມັນຈະໃຊ້ໂມເດວ ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ປຸ່ມປະມວນຜົນຈະໃຊ້, ສະນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງເປັນຕົວຊີ້ບອກທີ່ຊັດເຈນວ່າຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສຸດທ້າຍຈະອອກມາເປັນແນວໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To choose a different patch of the image, click the picker button (to the right of _process_) and then click within the preview widget – the preview re-generates centred on the point you clicked.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເລືອກສ່ວນອື່ນຂອງຮູບ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກປຸ່ມເລືອກ (ເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງ _ປະມວນຜົນ_) ແລ້ວຄລິກພາຍໃນວິດເຈັດສະແດງຕົວ"
"ຢ່າງ – ຕົວຢ່າງຈະຖືກສ້າງໃໝ່ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ຈຸດທີ່ທ່ານຄລິກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hover over the preview to get a 2x magnified tooltip view, useful for evaluating per-pixel noise / detail behaviour.\n"
msgstr "ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອເບິ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມແນະນຳທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍ 2 ເທົ່າ, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການປະເມີນສິ່ງລົບກວນ ຫຼື ລາຍລະອຽດໃນລະດັບພິກເຊວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _process_ button runs the active task on every currently-selected image, in turn. Progress is reported in the status bar; each finished image lands in the output folder and (if _add to the current collection_ is enabled) is imported into the database automatically.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ _ປະມວນຜົນ (process)_ ຈະຣັນວຽກທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດຢູ່ໃສ່ທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ຕາມລຳດັບ. ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຈະຖືກລາຍງານໃນແຖບສະຖານະ; ແຕ່ລະຮູບທີ່ສຳເລັດຈະຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນໂຟນເດີຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ ແລະ (ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ _ເພີ່ມໃສ່ຄໍເລັກຊັນປັດຈຸບັນ_) ຈະຖືກນຳເຂົ້າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If no model is active for the current task, the button refuses to run (the preview shows _model not available_). If the model is active but its execution provider fails to initialise – or fails on one specific image at runtime – the affected image is skipped with a message in the status bar, and the rest of the batch continues.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍ່ມີຕົວແບບໃດເຮັດວຽກສຳລັບວຽກປັດຈຸບັນ, ປຸ່ມຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກ (ຕົວຢ່າງຈະສະແດງວ່າ _ບໍ່ມີຕົວແບບ_). ຫາກຕົວ"
"ແບບເຮັດວຽກແຕ່ຕົວປະມວນຜົນບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ – ຫຼື ຜິດພາດກັບຮູບໃດໜຶ່ງໃນຂະນະເຮັດວຽກ – ຮູບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະ"
"ທົບຈະຖືກຂ້າມໄປພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນແຖບສະຖານະ, ແລະ ຮູບອື່ນໆໃນຊຸດຈະດຳເນີນການຕໍ່.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "output parameters"
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The collapsible _output parameters_ section controls how the result is written to disk. Settings apply to whichever task is currently active.\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນ _ພາຣາມິເຕີຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ_ ທີ່ສາມາດຫຍໍ້ໄດ້ ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວິທີການບັນທຶກຜົນໄດ້ຮັບລົງໃນດິສກ໌. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະນຳໃຊ້ກັບວຽກໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ກຳລັງເປີດໃຊ້ຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bit depth _(denoise and upscale only)_\n"
": Bit depth of the output TIFF (_8 bit_, _16 bit_, _32 bit (float)_).\n"
"profile _(denoise and upscale only)_\n"
": Colour profile embedded in the output TIFF. _image settings_ uses the working profile of the source image. The other entries match the standard export dialog.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມເລິກບິດ (bit depth) _(ສະເພາະ denoise ແລະ upscale)_\n"
": ຄວາມເລິກບິດຂອງໄຟລ໌ TIFF ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ (_8 ບິດ_, _16 ບິດ_, _32 ບິດ (ລອຍຕົວ)_).\n"
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ (profile) _(ສະເພາະ denoise ແລະ upscale)_\n"
": ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ໃນ TIFF ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບ. _ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບ_ ຈະໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເຮັດວຽກຂອງຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ຕົວເລືອກອື່ນໆແມ່ນກົງກັບປ່ອງຢ້ຽມສົ່ງອອກມາດຕະຖານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preserve wide-gamut colors _(denoise only)_\n"
": When on, pixels whose colour falls outside sRGB gamut pass through the model unchanged – wide-gamut colours are preserved exactly, but those specific pixels are not denoised. When off, every pixel is denoised but wide-gamut colours may be clipped to sRGB.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮັກສາສີທີ່ມີ gamut ກວ້າງ _(denoise ເທົ່ານັ້ນ)_\n"
": ເມື່ອເປີດ, ພິກເຊວທີ່ມີສີຢູ່ນອກ gamut ຂອງ sRGB ຈະຜ່ານຕົວແບບໄປໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ – ສີ gamut ກວ້າງຈະ"
"ຖືກຮັກສາໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ, ແຕ່ພິກເຊວສະເພາະເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບ. ເມື່ອປິດ, ທຸກໆພິກເຊວຈະຖືກຫຼຸດສັນຍານລົບ "
"ແຕ່ສີ gamut ກວ້າງອາດຈະຖືກຕັດໃຫ້ຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດ sRGB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"add to the current collection\n"
": Import the output into darktable automatically when it's written. The new image is grouped with the source image so they appear together in darktable.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໃສ່ຄໍເລັກຊັນປັດຈຸບັນ\n"
": ນຳເຂົ້າຜົນໄດ້ຮັບເຂົ້າໃນ darktable ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອບັນທຶກສຳເລັດ. ຮູບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມໄວ້ກັບຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກມັນປາກົດຢູ່ຮ່ວມກັນໃນ darktable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"output folder\n"
": Where the output file is written. Supports darktable variables – `$(FILE_FOLDER)` (the default) writes next to the source image. Use the folder-icon button to pick a directory.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີຂາອອກ\n"
": ບ່ອນທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກຖືກບັນທຶກ. ຮອງຮັບຕົວປ່ຽນຂອງ darktable – `$(FILE_FOLDER)` (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ) ຈະ"
"ບັນທຶກໄວ້ຂ້າງຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ. ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມໄອຄອນໂຟນເດີເພື່ອເລືອກໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "performance"
msgstr "ປະສິດທິພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/neural-restore.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Processing time depends on the AI acceleration backend, the image resolution, and the task. Raw denoise and 4x upscale are the most demanding. The first inference run after starting darktable also pays a one-time graph-compilation cost – see [GPU acceleration](../../../special-topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md), [how AI works](../../../special-topics/ai/how-ai-works.md), and [performance notes](../../../special-topics/ai/performance-and-troubleshooting.md) for the details.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເວລາປະມວນຜົນແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບລະບົບເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວ AI, ຄວາມລະອຽດຂອງຮູບ, ແລະ ວຽກທີ່ເຮັດ. Raw denoise "
"ແລະ 4x upscale ແມ່ນຕ້ອງການຊັບພະຍາກອນຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ. ການປະມວນຜົນຄັ້ງທຳອິດຫຼັງຈາກເປີດ darktable ຈ"
"ະມີການເສຍເວລາໃນການລວບລວມກຣາບພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວ – ເບິ່ງ [ການເລັ່ງດ້ວຍ GPU](../../../special-"
"topics/ai/gpu-acceleration.md), [AI ເຮັດວຽກແນວໃດ](../../../special-topics/ai/"
"how-ai-works.md), ແລະ [ໝາຍເຫດກ່ຽວກັບປະສິດທິພາບ](../../../special-topics/ai/"
"performance-and-troubleshooting.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "collections"
msgstr "ຊຸດສະສົມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter the images shown in the lighttable view and filmstrip panel using image attributes. This set of filtered images is known as a _collection_.\n"
msgstr "ກັ່ນຕອງຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ ແລະ ແຜງແຖບຟິມ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງຮູບ. ກຸ່ມຮູບທີ່ຖືກກັ່ນຕອງນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ _ຊຸດສະສົມ (collection)_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Importing images into darktable stores information about them (filename, path, Exif data, data from XMP sidecar files etc.) in darktable's library database. A collection may be defined by applying filtering rules to these attributes, thus creating a subset of images to display in the lighttable view and the filmstrip module.\n"
msgstr "ການນຳຮູບພາບເຂົ້າສູ່ darktable ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຮູບ (ຊື່ໄຟລ໌, ເສັ້ນທາງ, ຂໍ້ມູນ Exif, ຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ XMP ແລະອື່ນໆ) ໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບຂອງ darktable. ຊຸດສະສົມສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ກົດເກນການກັ່ນຕອງກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້, ເພື່ອສ້າງກຸ່ມຮູບຍ່ອຍທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ ແລະ ໂມດູນແຖບຟິມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The default collection is based on the _film roll_ attribute and displays all images of the last imported or selected film roll.\n"
msgstr "ຊຸດສະສົມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນອີງຕາມຄຸນລັກສະນະ _ມ້ວນຟິມ (film roll)_ ແລະ ຈະສະແດງຮູບພາບທັງໝົດຂອງມ້ວນຟິມທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ເລືອກຫຼ້າສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sort order of the listed collections (ascending/descending) can be toggled by clicking ![collect-sort-order-icon](./collections/collect-sort-order.png#icon).\n"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງຂອງຊຸດສະສົມໃນລາຍການ (ຈາກນ້ອຍໄປຫຼາຍ/ຈາກຫຼາຍໄປນ້ອຍ) ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກ ![collect-sort-order-icon](./collections/collect-sort-order.png#icon).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "filtering attributes"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະການຕອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The images in a collection can be filtered using the following image attributes:\n"
msgstr "ຮູບພາບໃນຊຸດສະສົມສາມາດຖືກກັ່ນຕອງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງຮູບດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"film roll\n"
": The name of the film roll to which the image belongs (which is the same as the name of the folder in which the image resides). Ctrl+Shift+click on a film roll to switch to the corresponding folder. Right-click to remove the contents of the film roll from the darktable library or tell darktable that its location has changed in the file system.\n"
msgstr ""
"ມ້ວນຟິມ\n"
": ຊື່ຂອງມ້ວນຟິມທີ່ຮູບພາບນັ້ນຢູ່ (ເຊິ່ງກໍຄືຊື່ຂອງໂຟນເດີທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຮູບນັ້ນເກັບໄວ້). Ctrl+Shift+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ມ້ວນຟິມເພື່ອປ່ຽນໄປຫາໂຟນເດີທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອລຶບເນື້ອຫາຂອງມ້ວນຟິມອອກຈາກຄັງຮູບຂອງ darktable ຫຼື ບອກ darktable ວ່າບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"folder\n"
": The folder (file path) where the image file is located. Click on a folder to include the contents of that folder and all sub-folders in the collection; Shift+click to include only the images in the selected folder; Ctrl+click to show only the images from any sub-folders; Ctrl+Shift+click to switch to the corresponding film roll. Right-click on a folder name to remove its contents from the darktable library or tell darktable that its location has changed in the file system.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີ\n"
": ໂຟນເດີ (ເສັ້ນທາງໄຟລ໌) ທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບຕັ້ງຢູ່. ຄລິກໃສ່ໂຟນເດີເພື່ອລວມເນື້ອຫາຂອງໂຟນເດີນັ້ນ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໃນຊຸດສະສົມ; Shift+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອລວມສະເພາະຮູບພາບໃນໂຟນເດີທີ່ເລືອກ; Ctrl+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອສະແດງສະເພາະຮູບພາບຈາກໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍ; Ctrl+Shift+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອປ່ຽນໄປຫາມ້ວນຟິມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊື່ໂຟນເດີເພື່ອລຶບເນື້ອຫາອອກຈາກຄັງຮູບຂອງ darktable ຫຼື ບອກ darktable ວ່າບ່ອນເກັບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"filename\n"
": The image's filename.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ໄຟລ໌\n"
": ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tag\n"
": Any tag that is attached to the image. Untagged images are grouped under the \"not tagged\" entry. When activated, a hierarchical list of known tags is displayed\n"
msgstr ""
"ແທັກ\n"
": ແທັກໃດໆທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບພາບ. ຮູບທີ່ບໍ່ມີແທັກຈະຖືກຈັດກຸ່ມໄວ້ໃນລາຍການ \"ບໍ່ມີແທັກ (not tagged)\". ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ລາຍການແທັກທີ່ມີລຳດັບຂັ້ນຈະຖືກສະແດງອອກມາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"title\n"
": The image's metadata “title” field.\n"
msgstr ""
"title\n"
": ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ “ຫົວຂໍ້” ຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"description\n"
": The image's metadata “description” field.\n"
msgstr ""
"description\n"
": ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ “ຄຳອະທິບາຍ” ຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"creator\n"
": The image's metadata “creator” field.\n"
msgstr ""
"creator\n"
": ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ “ຜູ້ສ້າງ” ຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"publisher\n"
": The image's metadata “publisher” field.\n"
msgstr ""
"publisher\n"
": ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ “ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່” ຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rights\n"
": The image's metadata “rights” field.\n"
msgstr ""
"rights\n"
": ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ “ລິຂະສິດ” ຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"notes\n"
": The image's metadata \"notes\" field.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
": ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ \"ໝາຍເຫດ (notes)\" ໃນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"version name\n"
": The image's metadata \"version name\" field.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊື່ເວີຊັນ\n"
": ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ \"ຊື່ເວີຊັນ (version name)\" ໃນຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rating\n"
": The image's star rating\n"
msgstr ""
"ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ\n"
": ຄະແນນດາວຂອງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"color label\n"
": Any color label attached to the image (\"red\", \"yellow\", \"green\", \"blue\", \"purple\").\n"
msgstr ""
"ປ້າຍສີ\n"
": ປ້າຍສີໃດໆທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບພາບ (\"ແດງ\", \"ເຫຼືອງ\", \"ຂຽວ\", \"ຟ້າ\", \"ມ່ວງ\").\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"geotagging\n"
": The geo location of the image (see [locations](../map/locations.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຕິດແທັກພູມສັນຖານ\n"
": ຕຳແໜ່ງທາງພູມສາດຂອງຮູບພາບ (ເບິ່ງ [ສະຖານທີ່](../map/locations.md)).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "times"
msgstr "ເວລາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"capture date\n"
": The date the photo was taken, in the format `YYYY:MM:DD`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີຖ່າຍ\n"
": ວັນທີທີ່ຮູບຖືກຖ່າຍ, ໃນຮູບແບບ `YYYY:MM:DD`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"capture time\n"
": The date & time the photo was taken, in the format `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເວລາຖ່າຍ\n"
": ວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາທີ່ຮູບຖືກຖ່າຍ, ໃນຮູບແບບ `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"import time\n"
": The date/time the file was imported, in the format `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເວລານຳເຂົ້າ\n"
": ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ, ໃນຮູບແບບ `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"modification time\n"
": The date/time the file was last changed, in the format `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເວລາແກ້ໄຂ\n"
": ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງຫຼ້າສຸດ, ໃນຮູບແບບ `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export time\n"
": The date/time the file was last exported, in the format `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເວລາສົ່ງອອກ\n"
": ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຖືກສົ່ງອອກຫຼ້າສຸດ, ໃນຮູບແບບ `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"print time\n"
": The date/time the file was last printed, in the format `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເວລາພິມ\n"
": ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ໄຟລ໌ຖືກພິມຫຼ້າສຸດ, ໃນຮູບແບບ `YYYY:MM:DD hh:mm:ss`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "capture details"
msgstr "ລາຍລະອຽດການຖ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"camera\n"
": The Exif data entry describing the camera make and model.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກ້ອງ\n"
": ຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ທີ່ບອກຍີ່ຫໍ້ ແລະ ລຸ້ນຂອງກ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lens\n"
": The description of the lens, as derived from Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລນ\n"
": ຄຳອະທິບາຍຂອງເລນ, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"aperture\n"
": The aperture, as derived from Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູຮັບແສງ\n"
": ຄ່າຮູຮັບແສງ, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exposure\n"
": The shutter speed, as derived from Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຮັບແສງ\n"
": ຄວາມໄວຊັດເຕີ, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exposure bias\n"
": The exposure bias, as derived from Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າຊົດເຊີຍແສງ\n"
": ຄ່າການຊົດເຊີຍແສງ, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"focal length\n"
": The focal length, as derived from Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄລຍະໂຟກັດ\n"
": ໄລຍະໂຟກັດ, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ISO\n"
": The ISO, as derived from Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ISO\n"
": ຄ່າ ISO, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"aspect ratio\n"
": The aspect ratio of the image, including any cropping within darktable.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ\n"
": ອັດຕາສ່ວນຂອງຮູບພາບ, ລວມທັງການຕັດຂອບ (cropping) ພາຍໃນ darktable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"white balance\n"
": The white balance, as derived from Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສົມດຸນແສງສີຂາວ\n"
": ຄ່າສົມດຸນແສງສີຂາວ, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flash\n"
": Whether flash was used or not, as derived from the Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແຟລດ\n"
": ບອກວ່າໄດ້ໃຊ້ແຟລດຫຼືບໍ່, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exposure program\n"
": The exposure program, as derived from Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣແກຣມການຮັບແສງ\n"
": ໂປຣແກຣມທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຮັບແສງ, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"metering mode\n"
": The metering mode, as derived from Exif data.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດວັດແສງ\n"
": ໂໝດການວັດແສງ, ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ Exif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"group\n"
": Choose specific group(s) of imagee\n"
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມ\n"
": ເລືອກກຸ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ເຈາະຈົງ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"local copy\n"
": Show files that are, or are not copied locally.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສຳເນົາພາຍໃນ\n"
": ສະແດງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີ ການສຳເນົາໄວ້ໃນເຄື່ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"history\n"
": Choose images whose history stacks have been altered or not.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປະຫວັດ\n"
": ເລືອກຮູບພາບທີ່ລຳດັບປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"module\n"
": Filter based on the processing modules that have been applied to the image.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນ\n"
": ກັ່ນຕອງຕາມໂມດູນການປະມວນຜົນທີ່ໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"module order\n"
": Choose images with \"v5.0\", \"v3.0\", \"legacy\" or \"custom\" module orders.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລຳດັບໂມດູນ\n"
": ເລືອກຮູບພາບທີ່ມີລຳດັບໂມດູນແບບ \"v5.0\", \"v3.0\", \"legacy (ດັ້ງເດີມ)\" ຫຼື \"custom (ຕາມໃຈ)\".\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "defining filter criteria"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດເງື່ອນໄຂການກັ່ນຕອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The top line of the module can be used to define filter criteria for your collection as follows:\n"
msgstr "ແຖວເທິງສຸດຂອງໂມດູນສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອກຳນົດເງື່ອນໄຂການກັ່ນຕອງສຳລັບຊຸດສະສົມຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"image attribute\n"
": The combobox on the left allows you to choose which [attribute](#filtering-attributes) to use to filter your collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນລັກສະນະຮູບ\n"
": ກ່ອງລາຍການທາງຊ້າຍຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຊ້ [ຄຸນລັກສະນະ](#filtering-attributes) ໃດເພື່ອກັ່ນຕອງຊຸດສະສົມຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"search pattern\n"
": In the text field to the right of the attribute combobox, you can write a matching pattern. This pattern is compared against all database entries with the selected attribute. The filtering mechanism detects a match if any image's attribute contains the pattern in its full text. You may use `%` as wildcard character. The collection will be limited to only the matching images. Leave the text field empty to match all images having that attribute. Where applicable, a tooltip will appear if you hover over the attribute or search pattern to provide additional information.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບການຄົ້ນຫາ\n"
": ໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທາງຂວາຂອງກ່ອງລາຍການຄຸນລັກສະນະ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂຽນຮູບແບບທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄົ້ນຫາ. ຮູບແບບນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໄປປຽບທຽບກັບທຸກລາຍການໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ເລືອກ. ກົນໄກການກັ່ນຕອງຈະຖືວ່າກົງກັນຖ້າຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງຮູບໃດໜຶ່ງມີຂໍ້ຄວາມນັ້ນຢູ່. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ `%` ເປັນຕົວແທນ (wildcard). ຊຸດສະສົມຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໃຫ້ເຫຼືອສະເພາະຮູບທີ່ກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ປະຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໄວ້ວ່າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບທຸກຮູບທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະນັ້ນ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີ, ຈະມີຄຳແນະນຳ (tooltip) ປະກົດຂຶ້ນຖ້າທ່ານເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປຈໍ້ໃສ່ຄຸນລັກສະນະ ຫຼື ຮູບແບບການຄົ້ນຫາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Attributes with numerical or date/time attributes can be used in combination with comparative and range operators. Use `<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=`, `<>`, or `=` to select images with attributes less than, less than or equal, greater than, greater than or equal, not equal, or equal to the given value, respectively. An expression in the form `[from;to]` can be used to select using a range of values.\n"
msgstr ": ຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ມີຄ່າເປັນຕົວເລກ ຫຼື ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວດຳເນີນການປຽບທຽບ ແລະ ຊ່ວງຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຊ້ `<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=`, `<>`, ຫຼື `=` ເພື່ອເລືອກຮູບທີ່ມີຄຸນລັກສະນະ ໜ້ອຍກວ່າ, ໜ້ອຍກວ່າຫຼືເທົ່າກັບ, ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ຫຼາຍກວ່າຫຼືເທົ່າກັບ, ບໍ່ເທົ່າກັບ, ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບ ຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດ ຕາມລຳດັບ. ການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ `[ຈາກ;ຫາ]` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລືອກຕາມຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select by value\n"
": As well as defining filter criteria using a search pattern, you can also manually choose from a list of values (for the chosen attribute) taken from the currently-matching set of images. Making such a selection will automatically populate the \"search pattern\" field.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຕາມຄ່າ\n"
": ນອກຈາກການກຳນົດເງື່ອນໄຂການກັ່ນຕອງດ້ວຍຮູບແບບການຄົ້ນຫາແລ້ວ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກຈາກລາຍການຄ່າ (ສຳລັບຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ເລືອກ) ທີ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກກຸ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ກົງກັນໃນປັດຈຸບັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ການເລືອກແບບນີ້ຈະຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ຊ່ອງ \"ຮູບແບບການຄົ້ນຫາ\" ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The box below the _search pattern_ will list values for the selected attribute that are present in the currently-selected images. This list is continuously updated as you type. You may also choose a sorting criteria by scrolling through the list and double-clicking.\n"
msgstr ": ກ່ອງທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງ _ຮູບແບບການຄົ້ນຫາ_ ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຄ່າສຳລັບຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ເລືອກ ເຊິ່ງມີຢູ່ໃນຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກປັດຈຸບັນ. ລາຍການນີ້ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເລື້ອຍໆໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານພິມ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກເງື່ອນໄຂການຈັດລຽງໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນເບິ່ງລາຍການ ແລະ ດັບເບິນຄລິກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If you enable single-click mode (see [preferences > lighttable](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md)) you can select with a single-click rather than double-click. This mode also allows you to select a range of values with the mouse. This only works for numerical and date-time attributes.\n"
msgstr ": ຖ້າທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດຄລິກບາດດຽວ (ເບິ່ງ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ໂຕະແສງ](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md)) ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເລືອກດ້ວຍການຄລິກພຽງບາດດຽວແທນການດັບເບິນຄລິກ. ໂໝດນີ້ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກຊ່ວງຂອງຄ່າດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌ໄດ້. ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະຕົວເລກ ແລະ ວັນທີ-ເວລາ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "combining multiple filters"
msgstr "ການລວມຫຼາຍຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can combine multiple filters together to create more complex collections of images using a series of rules. A rule is a combination of a filter criteria along with a logical operation that defines how that criteria is combined with any previous rules.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລວມຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຫຼາຍອັນເຂົ້າກັນ ເພື່ອສ້າງຊຸດສະສົມຮູບພາບທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ຊຸດຂອງກົດເກນ. ກົດເກນແມ່ນການລວມກັນຂອງເງື່ອນໄຂການກັ່ນຕອງ ພ້ອມກັບຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງຕັກກະສາດ ເຊິ່ງກຳນົດວ່າເງື່ອນໄຂນັ້ນຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບກົດເກນກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນແນວໃດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the ![collect-expander-icon](./collections/collect-expander.png#icon) button (to the right of the search field) to open a menu with the following options:\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ ![collect-expander-icon](./collections/collect-expander.png#icon) (ທາງຂວາຂອງຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາ) ເພື່ອເປີດເມນູທີ່ມີຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clear this rule\n"
": Remove the current rule, or reset it if this is the only rule defined.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລ້າງກົດເກນນີ້\n"
": ລຶບກົດເກນປັດຈຸບັນອອກ, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ຖ້ານີ້ແມ່ນກົດເກນດຽວທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"narrow down search\n"
": Add a new rule, which is combined with the previous rule(s) in a logical AND operation. An image is only retained as part of the collection if it also fulfills the new criteria.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳກັດການຄົ້ນຫາໃຫ້ແຄບລົງ\n"
": ເພີ່ມກົດເກນໃໝ່, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບກົດເກນກ່ອນໜ້າດ້ວຍຕົວດຳເນີນການ \"AND (ແລະ)\". ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນຊຸດສະສົມກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອມັນກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂໃໝ່ນຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"add more images\n"
": Add a new rule, which is combined with the previous rule(s) in a logical OR operation. Images that fulfill the new criteria are added to the collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຮູບພາບຕື່ມ\n"
": ເພີ່ມກົດເກນໃໝ່, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບກົດເກນກ່ອນໜ້າດ້ວຍຕົວດຳເນີນການ \"OR (ຫຼື)\". ຮູບພາບທີ່ກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຊຸດສະສົມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exclude images\n"
": Add a new rule, which is combined with the previous rule(s) in a logical EXCEPT operation. Images that fulfill the new criteria are removed from the collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເວັ້ນຮູບພາບ\n"
": ເພີ່ມກົດເກນໃໝ່, ເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບກົດເກນກ່ອນໜ້າດ້ວຍຕົວດຳເນີນການ \"EXCEPT (ຍົກເວັ້ນ)\". ຮູບພາບທີ່ກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂໃໝ່ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຊຸດສະສົມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The logical operators defining how rules are combined are indicated with icons to the right of each added rule: AND by the ![collect-and-icon](./collections/collect-and.png#icon) symbol, OR by the ![collect-or-icon](./collections/collect-or.png#icon) symbol, and EXCEPT by the ![collect-except-icon](./collections/collect-except.png#icon) symbol. Click on any of these icons to change the logical operation for that rule.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງຕັກກະສາດທີ່ກຳນົດວ່າກົດເກນຕ່າງໆຈະລວມກັນແນວໃດ ແມ່ນສະແດງດ້ວຍໄອຄອນທາງຂວາຂອງແຕ່ລະກົດເກນທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ: AND ແທນດ້ວຍສັນຍະລັກ ![collect-and-icon](./collections/collect-and.png#icon), OR ແທນດ້ວຍສັນຍະລັກ ![collect-or-icon](./collections/collect-or.png#icon), ແລະ EXCEPT ແທນດ້ວຍສັນຍະລັກ ![collect-except-icon](./collections/collect-except.png#icon). ຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນໃດໜຶ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງຕັກກະສາດສຳລັບກົດເກນນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "updating the folder path of moved images"
msgstr "ການອັບເດດເສັ້ນທາງໂຟນເດີຂອງຮູບທີ່ຖືກຍ້າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While it is best to not touch imported files behind darktable's back, this module can help you to recover from situations when you have moved or renamed image folders after importing them. The collections module has a feature that allows you to update darktable's library database with the new folder location. The process is as follows:\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປັນການດີທີ່ສຸດທີ່ບໍ່ຄວນໄປແຕະຕ້ອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າແລ້ວໂດຍທີ່ darktable ບໍ່ຮູ້, ແຕ່ໂມດູນນີ້ສາມາດຊ່ວຍທ່ານແກ້ໄຂສະຖານະການເມື່ອທ່ານຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນຊື່ໂຟນເດີຮູບພາບຫຼັງຈາກນຳເຂົ້າແລ້ວ. ໂມດູນຊຸດສະສົມມີຟີເຈີທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານອັບເດດຖານຂໍ້ມູນຄັງຮູບຂອງ darktable ດ້ວຍຕຳແໜ່ງໂຟນເດີໃໝ່. ຂັ້ນຕອນມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set the _image attribute_ combobox to \"folder\" or \"film roll\".\n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າກ່ອງລາຍການ _ຄຸນລັກສະນະຮູບ_ ເປັນ \"ໂຟນເດີ (folder)\" ຫຼື \"ມ້ວນຟິມ (film roll)\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The original film roll or folder name will be displayed with ~~strikethrough~~ formatting to emphasize that it can not be located.\n"
msgstr "ຊື່ມ້ວນຟິມ ຫຼື ໂຟນເດີເດີມຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍຮູບແບບ ~~ຂີດຂ້າ~~ ເພື່ອເນັ້ນວ່າບໍ່ສາມາດຊອກຫາຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click on the folder or film roll name, select \"update path to files...\", and then select the new location of the folder.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊື່ໂຟນເດີ ຫຼື ມ້ວນຟິມ, ເລືອກ \"ອັບເດດເສັ້ນທາງຫາໄຟລ໌... (update path to files...)\", ແລ້ວເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງໃໝ່ຂອງໂຟນເດີ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "returning to a previous collection"
msgstr "ການກັບຄືນໄປຫາຊຸດສະສົມກ່ອນໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can return to a previously-defined collection by clicking on the history button at the bottom of the module or using the [recently used collections](./recent-collections.md) module -- see the [preferences](#preferences) section for more details.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດກັບຄືນໄປຫາຊຸດສະສົມທີ່ເຄີຍກຳນົດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້າ ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມປະຫວັດຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູນ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [ຊຸດສະສົມທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ](./recent-collections.md) -- ເບິ່ງສ່ວນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ](#preferences) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"preferences...\" option in the presets menu allows you to adjust the behavior of the collections module as follows:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ \"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ... (preferences...)\" ໃນເມນູທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບພຶດຕິກຳຂອງໂມດູນຊຸດສະສົມໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"do not set the 'uncategorized' entry for tags\n"
": Do not set the 'uncategorized' category for tags that do not have children (default off).\n"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງລາຍການ 'ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັດໝວດໝູ່' ສຳລັບແທັກ\n"
": ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງໝວດໝູ່ 'ບໍ່ໄດ້ຈັດໝວດໝູ່' ສຳລັບແທັກທີ່ບໍ່ມີແທັກຍ່ອຍ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນປິດ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tag case sensitivity\n"
": Set whether tags should be case sensitive or not -- without the `sqlite` ICU extension this will only apply to the 26 latin letters (default insensitive).\n"
msgstr ""
"ການແຍກຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ຂອງແທັກ\n"
": ກຳນົດວ່າແທັກຄວນແຍກຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ຫຼືບໍ່ -- ຖ້າບໍ່ມີສ່ວນເສີມ `sqlite` ICU ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບຕົວອັກສອນລາຕິນ 26 ຕົວ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນບໍ່ແຍກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"number of collections to be stored\n"
": Set the number of recent collections to show in the history popup (if present).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຊຸດສະສົມທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້\n"
": ກຳນົດຈຳນວນຊຸດສະສົມຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນປັອບອັບປະຫວັດ (ຖ້າມີ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"number of folder levels to show in lists\n"
": The number of folder levels to show in film roll names, starting from the right (default 1).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນລະດັບໂຟນເດີທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນລາຍການ\n"
": ຈຳນວນລະດັບໂຟນເດີທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນຊື່ມ້ວນຟິມ, ໂດຍເລີ່ມນັບຈາກທາງຂວາ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sort film rolls by\n"
": Sort film rolls by one of the following options:\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈັດລຽງມ້ວນຟິມຕາມ\n"
": ຈັດລຽງມ້ວນຟິມຕາມໜຶ່ງໃນຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"folder name\" (path)\n"
msgstr "\"ຊື່ໂຟນເດີ\" (ເສັ້ນທາງ)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"display name\" (the roll label shown in the list)\n"
msgstr "\"ຊື່ທີ່ສະແດງ\" (ປ້າຍຊື່ມ້ວນຟິມທີ່ສະແດງໃນລາຍການ)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collections.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"import time\" (the date the film rolls were first imported, default)\n"
msgstr "\"ເວລານຳເຂົ້າ\" (ວັນທີທີ່ມ້ວນຟິມຖືກນຳເຂົ້າຄັ້ງທຳອິດ, ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage tags attached to images.\n"
msgstr "ຈັດການແທັກທີ່ຕິດກັບຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tags provide a means of adding information to images using a keyword dictionary. You can also manage tags as a hierarchical tree, which can be useful when their number becomes large.\n"
msgstr "ແທັກຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃສ່ຮູບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ວັດຈະນານຸກົມຄຳສຳຄັນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຈັດການແທັກໃນຮູບແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້ຕາມລຳດັບຂັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍເມື່ອມີຈຳນວນແທັກຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tags are physically stored in [XMP sidecar files](../../../overview/sidecar-files/_index.md) as well as in darktable's library database and can be included in [exported](./export.md) images.\n"
msgstr "ແທັກຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ [ໄຟລ໌ XMP sidecar](../../../overview/sidecar-files/_index.md) ແລະ ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຫ້ອງສະໝຸດຂອງ darktable, ແລະ ສາມາດລວມເຂົ້າໃນຮູບທີ່ [ສົ່ງອອກ](./export.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following definitions assume that you have set up a single tag named \"`places|France|Nord|Lille`\".\n"
msgstr "ຄຳນິຍາມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຕັ້ງແທັກດຽວທີ່ມີຊື່ວ່າ \"`places|France|Nord|Lille`\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"tag\n"
": A tag is a descriptive string that may be attached to an image. A tag can be a single term or a sequence of connected terms forming a path, separated by the pipe symbol. For example, \"`places|France|Nord|Lille`\" defines a single tag, where each term in the path forms a smaller subset of those before it. You can attach as many tags to an image as you like.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແທັກ (tag)\n"
": ແທັກແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມອະທິບາຍທີ່ອາດຈະຖືກຕິດໃສ່ກັບຮູບ. ແທັກສາມາດເປັນຄຳດຽວ ຫຼື ເປັນລຳດັບຂອງຄຳທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັນເປັນເສັ້ນທາງ, ໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍ pipe (|). ຕົວຢ່າງ: \"`places|France|Nord|Lille`\" ແມ່ນການກຳນົດແທັກດຽວ, ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ລະຄຳໃນເສັ້ນທາງຈະເປັນກຸ່ມຍ່ອຍຂອງຄຳທີ່ມາກ່ອນ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດແທັກໃສ່ຮູບໄດ້ຫຼາຍເທົ່າທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You can assign properties (name, private, category, synonyms and image order) to a tag.\n"
msgstr ": ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດ (ຊື່, ສ່ວນຕົວ, ໝວດໝູ່, ຄຳໄວພົດ ແລະ ລຳດັບຮູບ) ໃຫ້ກັບແທັກໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": You can use tag names to define [collections](./collections.md) that are displayed, processed, and exported in a _durable_ [custom sort](./collection-filters.md#custom-sort) order, which does not change when other collections (containing some of the same images) are reordered.\n"
msgstr ": ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຊື່ແທັກເພື່ອສ້າງ [ຄໍເລັກຊັນ](./collections.md) ທີ່ສະແດງ, ປະມວນຜົນ ແລະ ສົ່ງອອກຕາມລຳດັບ [ການຈັດລຽງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ](./collection-filters.md#custom-sort) ແບບ _ຖາວອນ_, ເຊິ່ງຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງເມື່ອຄໍເລັກຊັນອື່ນໆ (ທີ່ມີບາງຮູບຄືກັນ) ຖືກຈັດລຽງໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"node\n"
": Any path that forms part of a tag is a node. In the above example, \"`places`\", \"`places|France`\", \"`places|France|Nord`\" and \"`places|France|Nord|Lille`\" are all nodes. In the hierarchical tree view, the nodes form the branches and leaves of the tree.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂນດ (node)\n"
": ເສັ້ນທາງໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແທັກແມ່ນເອີ້ນວ່າ ໂນດ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, \"`places`\", \"`places|France`\", \"`places|France|Nord`\" ແລະ \"`places|France|Nord|Lille`\" ລ້ວນແຕ່ແມ່ນໂນດ. ໃນມຸມມອງຕົ້ນໄມ້ຕາມລຳດັບຂັ້ນ, ໂນດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເປັນກິ່ງງ່າ ແລະ ໃບຂອງຕົ້ນໄມ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"free node\n"
": Any node that is not explicitly defined as a tag is called a free node. In the above example, \"`places`\", \"`places|France`\" and \"`places|France|Nord`\" are all free nodes. You cannot set any properties, except “name”, for a free node and you cannot add a free node to an image. See the “multiple tags” section below for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໂນດອິດສະຫຼະ (free node)\n"
": ໂນດໃດໆທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດເປັນແທັກຢ່າງຊັດເຈນຈະຖືກເອີ້ນວ່າ ໂນດອິດສະຫຼະ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຂ້າງເທິງ, "
"\"`places`\", \"`places|France`\" ແລະ \"`places|France|Nord`\" ລ້ວນແຕ່ແມ່ນໂນດອິດສ"
"ະຫຼະ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄຸນສົມບັດໃດໆ, ຍົກເວັ້ນ “ຊື່”, ສຳລັບໂນດອິດສະຫຼະ ແລະ ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມໂນດອິດສະຫຼະ"
"ລົງໃນຮູບໄດ້. ເບິ່ງສ່ວນ “ຫຼາຍແທັກ” ທາງລຸ່ມສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"category\n"
": Any tag can be flagged by the user as being a “category”.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໝວດໝູ່ (category)\n"
": ທຸກແທັກສາມາດຖືກໝາຍໂດຍຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃຫ້ເປັນ “ໝວດໝູ່” ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "multiple tags"
msgstr "ແທັກຫຼາຍອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The above definitions considered a simple example – a single tag and its properties. Consider instead the scenario where the following four pipe-delimited tags are each separately defined in darktable.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄຳນິຍາມຂ້າງເທິງນັ້ນແມ່ນພິຈາລະນາຈາກຕົວຢ່າງງ່າຍໆ – ແທັກດຽວ ແລະ ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງມັນ. ລອງພິຈາລະນາສະຖາ"
"ນະການທີ່ແທັກທັງສີ່ທີ່ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍທໍ່ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດແຍກກັນໃນ darktable.\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"places|France|Nord|Lille\n"
"places|France|Nord\n"
"places|France\n"
"places|England|London\n"
msgstr ""
"places|France|Nord|Lille\n"
"places|France|Nord\n"
"places|France\n"
"places|England|London\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this case the nodes are\n"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ນີ້ ໂນດຕ່າງໆແມ່ນ\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"places\n"
"places|France\n"
"places|France|Nord\n"
"places|France|Nord|Lille\n"
"places|England\n"
"places|England|London\n"
msgstr ""
"places\n"
"places|France\n"
"places|France|Nord\n"
"places|France|Nord|Lille\n"
"places|England\n"
"places|England|London\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The only free nodes are \"`places`\" and \"`places|England`\". Both of these free nodes are also (by implication) categories.\n"
msgstr "ໂນດອິດສະຫຼະມີພຽງແຕ່ \"`places`\" ແລະ \"`places|England`\". ທັງສອງໂນດອິດສະຫຼະນີ້ຍັງເປັນໝວດໝູ່ (ໂດຍທາງອ້ອມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can attach any of these tags to any image. Any tags attached to an image, except category tags, can be included when that image is [exported](./export.md).\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດແທັກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃສ່ຮູບໃດກໍໄດ້. ແທັກທຸກອັນທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບ, ຍົກເວັ້ນແທັກໝວດໝູ່, ສາມາດຖືກລວມເຂົ້າເມື່ອຮູບນັ້ນຖືກ [ສົ່ງອອກ](./export.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you attach the \"`places|France|Nord|Lille`\" tag to an image, the \"`places|France|Nord`\" and \"`places|France`\" tags are also implicitly attached to that image (you don’t need to attach them manually). Note that this is only true here because those additional tags have been separately defined -- the \"`places`\" node is not included because it is a \"free node\" (not a tag).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຕິດແທັກ \"`places|France|Nord|Lille`\" ໃສ່ຮູບ, ແທັກ "
"\"`places|France|Nord`\" ແລະ \"`places|France`\" ກໍຈະຖືກຕິດໃສ່ຮູບນັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ທ່າ"
"ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ). ໝາຍເຫດວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນຈິງໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ ເນື່ອງຈາກແທັກເພີ່ມເຕີມເຫຼົ່ານັ້"
"ນໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດແຍກໄວ້ແລ້ວ -- ສ່ວນໂນດ \"`places`\" ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າ ນຳ ເພາະມັນເປັນ \"ໂນດອິດສ"
"ະຫຼະ\" (ບໍ່ແມ່ນແທັກ).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module sections"
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![tagging-overview](./tagging/tagging-overview.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![ພາບລວມການໃສ່ແທັກ](./tagging/tagging-overview.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The tagging module consists of two sections\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນການໃສ່ແທັກປະກອບມີສອງສ່ວນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The upper _attached tags_ section (with the _attach/detach_ buttons under it)\n"
msgstr "1. ສ່ວນ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່_ ດ້ານເທິງ (ພ້ອມປຸ່ມ _ຕິດ/ຖອດ_ ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The lower _tag dictionary_ section (with the _new/import.../export..._ buttons under it)\n"
msgstr "2. ສ່ວນ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_ ດ້ານລຸ່ມ (ພ້ອມປຸ່ມ _ໃໝ່/ນຳເຂົ້າ.../ສົ່ງອອກ..._ ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "attached tags section"
msgstr "ສ່ວນແທັກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _attached tags_ section displays tag(s) attached to image(s), where those images are\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່_ ຈະສະແດງແທັກທີ່ຕິດກັບຮູບ, ເຊິ່ງຮູບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນແມ່ນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "under your mouse cursor (if hovering over an image in the lighttable view); or\n"
msgstr "- ຢູ່ກ້ອງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ (ຫາກວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງຮູບໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ); ຫຼື\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "currently selected (if not hovering over an image)\n"
msgstr "- ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ໃນຂະນະນັ້ນ (ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງຮູບ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically generated darktable tags (with names starting “`darktable|`”) cannot be selected.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແທັກ darktable ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ທີ່ມີຊື່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ “`darktable|`”) ບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At the bottom of the _attached tags_ section are the following buttons, from left to right:\n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງສ່ວນ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່_ ຈະມີປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆ ດັ່ງນີ້, ຈາກຊ້າຍໄປຂວາ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"attach\n"
": If a tag is selected in the _tag dictionary_ section, attach this tag to the selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕິດ (attach)\n"
": ຫາກມີການເລືອກແທັກໃນສ່ວນ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_, ໃຫ້ນຳແທັກນີ້ໄປຕິດໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"detach\n"
": If a tag is selected in the _attached tags_ list, detach that tag from the selected images. A tag can also be detached if you right click on the tag name and select _detach_ from the pop-up menu.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຖອດ (detach)\n"
": ຫາກມີການເລືອກແທັກໃນລາຍການ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່_, ໃຫ້ຖອດແທັກນັ້ນອອກຈາກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດຖອດແທັກໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊື່ແທັກ ແລ້ວເລືອກ _ຖອດ (detach)_ ຈາກເມນູ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![check-icon](./tagging/check-icon.png#icon) hidden tags\n"
": Choose whether to view any hidden tags that darktable has automatically attached to the selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນຕິກ](./tagging/check-icon.png#icon) ແທັກທີ່ຊ່ອນຢູ່\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຈະສະແດງແທັກທີ່ຊ່ອນຢູ່ ເຊິ່ງ darktable ໄດ້ຕິດໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![sort-icon](./tagging/sort-icon.png#icon) sort\n"
": Choose whether to sort the _attached tags_ list alphabetically or by the count shown in brackets next to the tag (this count indicates how many of the selected images have that tag attached to them).\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນຈັດລຽງ](./tagging/sort-icon.png#icon) ຈັດລຽງ\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຈະຈັດລຽງລາຍການ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່_ ຕາມຕົວອັກສອນ ຫຼື ຕາມຈຳນວນທີ່ສະແດງໃນວົງເລັບຂ້າງແທັກ (ຈຳນວນນີ້ບອກວ່າຮູບທີ່ເລືອກມີຈັກຮູບທີ່ມີແທັກນັ້ນຕິດຢູ່).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![minus-icon](./tagging/minus-icon.png#icon) parents\n"
": Choose whether or not to show the parent categories of the tag.\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນລົບ](./tagging/minus-icon.png#icon) ໂນດຫຼັກ (parents)\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຈະສະແດງໝວດໝູ່ຫຼັກຂອງແທັກນັ້ນ ຫຼື ບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can adjust the height of the _attached tags_ window by holding Ctrl and scrolling with your mouse wheel.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຄວາມສູງຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່_ ໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລະ ເລື່ອນລໍ້ເມົາສ໌.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "tag dictionary section"
msgstr "ສ່ວນວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _tag dictionary_ section displays all of the tags that are available in darktable's database. At the top of the _tag dictionary_ section is a text box where tag names can be entered. Below this is a list of available tags, which may also include indicator symbols to the left of the tag names. The meanings of these symbols are as follows:\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_ ຈະສະແດງແທັກທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງ darktable. ຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງສ່ວນນີ້ແມ່ນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບພິມຊື່ແທັກ. ຖັດລົງມາແມ່ນລາຍການແທັກທີ່ມີ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍບົ່ງບອກຢູ່ທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍຂອງຊື່ແທັກ. ຄວາມໝາຍຂອງເຄື່ອງໝາຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "a check mark [✓] indicates that the tag is attached to all of the selected images\n"
msgstr ""
": ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກ [✓] ບົ່ງບອກວ່າແທັກນັ້ນຖືກຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບພາບທັງໝົດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "a minus sign [--] indicates that the tag is attached to at least one of the selected images. If the symbol is next to a node name in the hierarchical _tree_ view, it means that one of the child tags under that node is attached to at least one of the selected images.\n"
msgstr "- ເຄື່ອງໝາຍລົບ [-] ບົ່ງບອກວ່າແທັກນັ້ນຕິດຢູ່ກັບຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຫາກເຄື່ອງໝາຍຢູ່ຂ້າງຊື່ໂນດໃນມຸມມອງ _ຕົ້ນໄມ້_ ຕາມລຳດັບຂັ້ນ, ມັນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແທັກຍ່ອຍພາຍໃຕ້ໂນດນັ້ນມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນທີ່ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "if no indicator symbol is present, this means that the tag is not attached to any of the selected images, or that the node has no child tags attached to any of the selected images.\n"
msgstr "- ຫາກບໍ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍໃດໆ, ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າແທັກນັ້ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບໃດໆທີ່ເລືອກເລີຍ, ຫຼື ໂນດນັ້ນບໍ່ມີແທັກຍ່ອຍທີ່ຕິດກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the hierarchical _tree_ view, a name in italics represents either a free node or a category.\n"
msgstr "ໃນມຸມມອງ _ຕົ້ນໄມ້_ ຕາມລຳດັບຂັ້ນ, ຊື່ທີ່ເປັນຕົວເນີ້ງໝາຍເຖິງ ໂນດອິດສະຫຼະ ຫຼື ໝວດໝູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Below the _tag dictionary_ list are the following buttons, from left to right:\n"
msgstr "ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງລາຍການ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_ ຈະມີປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆ ດັ່ງນີ້, ຈາກຊ້າຍໄປຂວາ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"new\n"
": Create a new tag, using the name that has been entered into the text entry box at the top of the _tag dictionary_ section.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃໝ່ (new)\n"
": ສ້າງແທັກໃໝ່ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ທີ່ພິມໄວ້ໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມດ້ານເທິງຂອງສ່ວນ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"import...\n"
": Import tags from a Lightroom keyword file.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳເຂົ້າ...\n"
": ນຳເຂົ້າແທັກຈາກໄຟລ໌ຄຳສຳຄັນຂອງ Lightroom.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export...\n"
": Export all tags to a Lightroom keyword file.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສົ່ງອອກ...\n"
": ສົ່ງອອກແທັກທັງໝົດເປັນໄຟລ໌ຄຳສຳຄັນຂອງ Lightroom.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![plus-icon](./tagging/plus-icon.png#icon) suggestions\n"
": Show a list of suggested keywords based on the keywords already associated with the selected images (see the [preferences](#preferences) section). CAUTION: This view queries the database so might be slow.\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນບວກ](./tagging/plus-icon.png#icon) ຄຳແນະນຳ\n"
": ສະແດງລາຍການຄຳສຳຄັນທີ່ແນະນຳ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຄຳສຳຄັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຮູບທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ: ມຸມມອງນີ້ຈະສອບຖາມຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![list-tree-icon](./tagging/list-tree-icon.png#icon) list/tree\n"
": Toggle the display of tags between the straight _list_ view and hierarchical _tree_ view.\n"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນລາຍການ/ຕົ້ນໄມ້](./tagging/list-tree-icon.png#icon) ລາຍການ/ຕົ້ນໄມ້\n"
": ສະຫຼັບການສະແດງຜົນແທັກລະຫວ່າງມຸມມອງ _ລາຍການ_ ແບບລຽງກັນ ແລະ ມຸມມອງ _ຕົ້ນໄມ້_ ຕາມລຳດັບຂັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can adjust the height of the _tag dictionary_ window by holding Ctrl while scrolling with your mouse wheel.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຄວາມສູງຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_ ໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ ແລະ ເລື່ອນລໍ້ເມົາສ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following sections describe the operations that can be performed with tags.\n"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການຕ່າງໆທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ກັບແທັກ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "text entry"
msgstr "ການປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The text entry box (shown under the _attach_/_detach_ buttons) has multiple purposes.\n"
msgstr "ກ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງປຸ່ມ _ຕິດ_/_ຖອດ_) ມີໄວ້ເພື່ອຫຼາຍຈຸດປະສົງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the _tag dictionary_ list is in _list_ view mode (rather than _tree_ view mode), then typing the first few characters of a tag will bring up a list of suggestions. You can then scroll down with the arrow keys and press Enter to select one of the suggestions. Pressing Enter a second time will attach it to the selected images. You can also edit the name of the tag before pressing Enter -- in this case the tag will be created if it doesn't already exist in the database.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກລາຍຊື່ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ (tag dictionary)_ ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດມຸມມອງແບບ _ລາຍຊື່_ (ແທັນທີ່ຈະເປັນແບບ "
"_ຕົ້ນໄມ້_), ການພິມຕົວອັກສອນທຳອິດຂອງແທັກຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຄຳແນະນຳ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດເລື່ອນລົງດ້ວຍປຸ່ມລູກ"
"ສອນ ແລະ ກົດ Enter ເພື່ອເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນຄຳແນະນຳນັ້ນ. ການກົດ Enter ເທື່ອທີສອງຈະເປັນການຕິດແທັກນັ້ນໃສ່ຮູບ"
"ທີ່ເລືອກ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຊື່ຂອງແທັກກ່ອນກົດ Enter -- ໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ແທັກຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຫາກມັນຍັງບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຖານ"
"ຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Typing some partial text into the text entry box allows you filters the set of tags shown in the _tag dictionary_ window to those whose name or synonym matches the entered text. Press Enter to attach a tag with the entered name to the selected images. If that tag name does not yet exist in the database, it will be created before being attached.\n"
msgstr "- ການພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມບາງສ່ວນໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຈະຊ່ວຍກັ່ນຕອງແທັກທີ່ສະແດງໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_ ໃຫ້ເຫຼືອສະເພາະແທັກທີ່ມີຊື່ ຫຼື ຄຳໄວພົດກົງກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ພິມ. ກົດ Enter ເພື່ອຕິດແທັກຕາມຊື່ນັ້ນໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ. ຫາກຊື່ແທັກນັ້ນຍັງບໍ່ມີໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ມັນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກ່ອນແລ້ວຈຶ່ງນຳໄປຕິດໃສ່.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pop-up menu entry “copy to entry” can be used to copy a selected tag to the text entry box. You can then edit this name and press Enter to create a new tag with that name, making it easy to create multiple tags with similar names.\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການເມນູປັອບອັບ “ສຳເນົາໄປຫາຊ່ອງປ້ອນ (copy to entry)” ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສຳເນົາແທັກທີ່ເລືອກໄປຫາຊ່"
"ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ຈາກນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຊື່ນີ້ ແລະ ກົດ Enter ເພື່ອສ້າງແທັກໃໝ່ດ້ວຍຊື່ນັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຕໍ່ກ"
"ານສ້າງຫຼາຍແທັກທີ່ມີຊື່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "create tag"
msgstr "ສ້າງແທັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to create a new tag:\n"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການສ້າງແທັກໃໝ່:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Import a text file_. You can import one or more text files in the Lightroom tagging file format. You can also export your tags, edit the exported file, then re-import it. The import function updates existing tags and creates new tags as required. If you change the name of a tag in an imported file, it will be treated as a new tag.\n"
msgstr "- _ນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ_. ທ່ານສາມາດນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ແທັກຂອງ Lightroom. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດສົ່ງອອກແທັກຂອງທ່ານ, ແກ້ໄຂໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ, ແລ້ວນຳເຂົ້າມາໃໝ່. ຟັງຊັນນຳເຂົ້າຈະອັບເດດແທັກທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ສ້າງແທັກໃໝ່ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ. ຫາກທ່ານປ່ຽນຊື່ແທັກໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າ, ມັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນແທັກໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Import already-tagged images_. This method does not offer any flexibility to change tag names or categories during the import process.\n"
msgstr "- _ນຳເຂົ້າຮູບທີ່ຕິດແທັກແລ້ວ_. ວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ແທັກ ຫຼື ໝວດໝູ່ໄດ້ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນຳເຂົ້າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Use the “create tag” sub-menu_. A tag can be created manually, under an existing one (hierarchical) or at the root level.\n"
msgstr ""
"_ໃຊ້ເມນູຍ່ອຍ “ສ້າງແທັກ”_. ແທັກສາມາດຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ພາຍໃຕ້ແທັກທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ (ຕາມລຳດັບຊັ້ນ) ຫຼື ຢູ່ລ"
"ະດັບຮາກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Use the “set as a tag“ sub-menu_. You can set a free node (e.g. ”`places|England`”) as a tag so that it gets implicitly attached to all images tagged with its sub-tags (e.g. ”`places|England|London`”).\n"
msgstr ""
"_ໃຊ້ເມນູຍ່ອຍ “ຕັ້ງເປັນແທັກ”_. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງໂນດອິດສະຫຼະ (ເຊັ່ນ: ”`places|England`”) ໃຫ້ເປັນແທັ"
"ກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນຖືກຕິດໃສ່ທຸກຮູບທີ່ຖືກແທັກດ້ວຍແທັກຍ່ອຍຂອງມັນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"”`places|England|London`”).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Type into the text box and press the “new” button_ or the Enter key. Hierarchical tags are created using the pipe symbol “`|`” to separate nodes. Note that the entered tag is also attached to any selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"_ພິມລົງໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ “ໃໝ່” (new)_ ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມ Enter. ແທັກແບບລຳດັບຊັ້ນ "
"(hierarchical tags) ແມ່ນສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ສັນຍາລັກ “`|`” ເພື່ອແຍກແຕ່ລະຂັ້ນ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າແທັກທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້"
"າໄປຈະຖືກຕິດໃສ່ກັບຮູບພາບໃດໆທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ຄືກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A number of tags are automatically generated by darktable when certain actions are undertaken. For example, the tags “`darktable|exported`” and “`darktable|styles|your_style`” can be used to identify images that have been exported and had styles applied, respectively.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແທັກຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍ darktable ເມື່ອມີການດຳເນີນການບາງຢ່າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ແທັ"
"ກ “`darktable|exported`” ແລະ “`darktable|styles|your_style`” ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຮູບທີ່"
"ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ ແລະ ຮູບທີ່ໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ສະໄຕລ໌ຕາມລຳດັບ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "edit/rename tag"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ/ປ່ຽນຊື່ແທັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _tag dictionary_ can be maintained via the \"edit...\" and \"change path...\" items in the right-click pop-up menu.\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_ ສາມາດຈັດການໄດ້ຜ່ານລາຍການ \"ແກ້ໄຂ...\" ແລະ \"ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ...\" ໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"edit...\" operation allows you to change the name of a tag, though you cannot change which node it belongs to (you cannot use the pipe \"|\" symbol in the tag name field). The command is aborted if you try to enter a tag name that already exists. You can set the _private_ and _category_ flags and define _synonyms_ for the tag (see below). These attributes are recorded in the `XMP-dc Subject` and `XMP-lr Hierarchical Subject` metadata entries, respectively. You can control which tags are included in exports by changing settings in the [export](./export.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ \"ແກ້ໄຂ...\" ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປ່ຽນຊື່ແທັກໄດ້, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນໂນດທີ່ມັນສັງກັດຢູ່ໄດ້ (ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ pipe \"|\" ໃນຊ່ອງຊື່ແທັກ). ຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກຫາກທ່ານພະຍາຍາມປ້ອນຊື່ແທັກທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ສ່ວນຕົວ (private)_ ແລະ _ໝວດໝູ່ (category)_ ພ້ອມທັງກຳນົດ _ຄຳໄວພົດ (synonyms)_ ໃຫ້ກັບແທັກໄດ້. ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ `XMP-dc Subject` ແລະ `XMP-lr Hierarchical Subject`. ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມວ່າແທັກໃດຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນການສົ່ງອອກໄດ້ໂດຍການປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນໂມດູນ [ສົ່ງອອກ](./export.md).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A tag set as “private” is, by default, not exported.\n"
msgstr "ແທັກທີ່ຕັ້ງເປັນ “ສ່ວນຕົວ (private)” ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແລ້ວຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A tag set as “category” is not exported in `XMP-dc Subject`. However it is exported in `XMP-lr Hierarchical Subject` as this XMP metadata holds the organization of your tags.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແທັກທີ່ຕັ້ງເປັນ “ໝວດໝູ່ (category)” ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກໃນ `XMP-dc Subject`. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມັນຈະຖືກສົ່"
"ງອອກໃນ `XMP-lr Hierarchical Subject` ເນື່ອງຈາກຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ XMP ນີ້ເກັບຮັກສາການຈັດລະບຽບຂອງ"
"ແທັກຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "“synonyms” enrich the tag information and are mainly used to assist search engines. For example “juvenile”, “kid” or “youth” can be set as synonyms of “child”. Synonyms can also be used to translate tag names to other languages.\n"
msgstr ""
"“ຄຳໄວພົດ (synonyms)” ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນແທັກສົມບູນຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍເຄື່ອງມືຄົ້ນຫາ. ຕົວຢ່າງ “"
"juvenile”, “kid” ຫຼື “youth” ສາມາດຕັ້ງເປັນຄຳໄວພົດຂອງ “child”. ຄຳໄວພົດຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແປຊື່"
"ແທັກເປັນພາສາອື່ນໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"change path...\" operation is only available in the _tree_ view mode, and it shows the number of tagged images which would be impacted by a change to the name of this node. The change path window lets the user change the full path of the node, including the nodes to which it belongs (nodes can be specified using the pipe \"`|`\" symbol). This operation is powerful, but please take care as it can have a significant impact on the metadata of your images. The operation is aborted if the requested change causes a conflict with an existing tag.\n"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ \"ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງ...\" ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະໃນໂໝດມຸມມອງ _ຕົ້ນໄມ້_ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແລະ ມັນຈະສະແດງຈຳນວນຮູບທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກການປ່ຽນຊື່ໂນດນີ້. ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມຂອງໂນດ, ລວມທັງໂນດຫຼັກທີ່ມັນສັງກັດຢູ່ (ສາມາດກຳນົດໂນດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ pipe \"| \"). ການເຮັດວຽກນີ້ແມ່ນມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ, ແຕ່ກະລຸນາລະມັດລະວັງເພາະມັນອາດຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບຂອງຮູບ. ຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກຫາກການປ່ຽນແປງນັ້ນໄປຂັດແຍ້ງກັບແທັກທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A quick way to organize the tag structure is to drag and drop the nodes. In the _tree_ view mode, you can drag any node and drop it on top of any other node. The first node and its descendants, if any, become descendants of the second node. Dragging over a node automatically opens that node (to avoid opening a node, drag over the node selection indicator instead). To place a node at the root level, drag it onto the top of the tagging window. If the requested change causes a conflict with an existing tag, the operation is aborted.\n"
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ໄວໃນການຈັດລະບຽບໂຄງສ້າງແທັກຄືການລາກ ແລະ ວາງໂນດ. ໃນໂໝດມຸມມອງ _ຕົ້ນໄມ້_, ທ່ານສາມາດລາກໂນດໃດໜຶ່ງໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງໂນດອື່ນໄດ້. ໂນດທຳອິດ ແລະ ໂນດຍ່ອຍຂອງມັນ (ຖ້າມີ) ຈະກາຍເປັນໂນດຍ່ອຍຂອງໂນດທີສອງ. ການລາກຜ່ານໂນດຈະເປັນການເປີດໂນດນັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການເປີດໂນດ, ໃຫ້ລາກຜ່ານເຄື່ອງໝາຍເລືອກໂນດແທນ). ເພື່ອວາງໂນດໄວ້ໃນລະດັບເທິງສຸດ, ໃຫ້ລາກມັນໄປໄວ້ດ້ານເທິງສຸດຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມແທັກ. ຫາກການປ່ຽນແປງນັ້ນຂັດແຍ້ງກັບແທັກທີ່ມີຢູ່, ຄຳສັ່ງຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "attach tag"
msgstr "ຕິດແທັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are a number of ways to attach an existing tag to a group of selected images:\n"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການຕິດແທັກທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃສ່ກຸ່ມຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "click on a tag in the _tag dictionary_ window to select it, then click on the _attach_ button.\n"
msgstr "- ຄລິກໃສ່ແທັກໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_ ເພື່ອເລືອກມັນ, ແລ້ວກົດປຸ່ມ _ຕິດ (attach)_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "right-click on a tag in the _tag dictionary_ window, to show a pop-up menu, then select the “attach tag” menu item.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ແທັກໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ _ພົດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_ (tag dictionary) ເພື່ອສະແດງເມນູປັອບອັບ, ຈາກນັ້ນເລືອ"
"ກລາຍການເມນູ “ຕິດແທັກ” (attach tag).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "double-click on a tag in the _tag dictionary_ window.\n"
msgstr "- ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ແທັກໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກ_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "right-click on a tag shown in the _attached tags_ view to show a pop-up menu. If some of the selected images do not currently have that tag, the \"attach tag to all\" menu item can be used to attach that tag to all the selected images.\n"
msgstr "- ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ແທັກທີ່ສະແດງໃນມຸມມອງ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່_. ຫາກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກບາງຮູບຍັງບໍ່ມີແທັກນັ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ລາຍການເມນູ \"ຕິດແທັກໃສ່ທັງໝົດ\" ເພື່ອຕິດແທັກນັ້ນໃສ່ທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Type into the text box and press the \"new\" button or the Enter key. This will create the tag if it doesn't already exist, and attach it to the selected images.\n"
msgstr "- ພິມໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ແລະ ກົດປຸ່ມ \"ໃໝ່\" ຫຼື ກົດ Enter. ນີ້ຈະສ້າງແທັກ (ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ມີ) ແລະ ຕິດໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press Ctrl+T to open a small text box at the bottom of the central view of the lighttable. Type in the name of a tag and press Enter. The tag will be created if it doesn't exist, and attached to all the selected images.\n"
msgstr "- ກົດ Ctrl+T ເພື່ອເປີດກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມນ້ອຍໆຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງມຸມມອງກາງຂອງໂຕະແສງ. ພິມຊື່ແທັກ ແລະ ກົດ Enter. ແທັກຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ (ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ມີ) ແລະ ຕິດໃສ່ທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drag an image or group of images and drop it onto the desired tag.\n"
msgstr "- ລາກຮູບ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຮູບແລ້ວໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງແທັກທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When hovering over the images in the lighttable you can check which tags are attached to the image, either by looking at the _attached tags_ window in the _tagging_ module, or in the _tags_ attribute in the [image information](./image-information.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງຮູບໃນໂຕະແສງ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດເບິ່ງໄດ້ວ່າແທັກໃດຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບແດ່ ໂດຍການເບິ່ງທີ່ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຢູ່_ ໃນໂມດູນ _ການໃສ່ແທັກ_ ຫຼື ໃນສ່ວນຄຸນລັກສະນະ _ແທັກ_ ໃນໂມດູນ [ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ](./image-information.md).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "detach tag"
msgstr "ຖອດແທັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to remove a tag from a group of selected images:\n"
msgstr "ມີຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການລຶບແທັກອອກຈາກກຸ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "click on a tag in the _attached tag_ window of the _tagging_ module to select the tag, then click on the _detach_ button.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ແທັກໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດ (attached tag)_ ຂອງໂມດູນ _ການຕິດແທັກ (tagging)_ ເພື່ອເລືອກແທັກ, ຈາກນັ້ນຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມ _ຖອນອອກ (detach)_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "double-click on a tag in the _attached tag_ window.\n"
msgstr "ດັບເບິລຄລິກໃສ່ແທັກໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດ_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "right-click on a tag in the _attached tag_ window, to show a pop-up menu, and select \"detach\".\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ແທັກໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດ_ ເພື່ອສະແດງເມນູປັອບອັບ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ \"ຖອນອອກ (detach)\".\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "delete tag"
msgstr "ລຶບແທັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is possible to completely remove a tag from all images (whether selected or not) and delete the tag from the database. Because this could impact a large number of images, a warning will be displayed indicating how many images currently have this tag attached. Take this warning seriously as there is no way to undo this action (except by restoring your database and/or XMP sidecar files from a backup). A tag in _tag dictionary_ window can be deleted in the following ways:\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລຶບແທັກອອກຈາກທຸກຮູບພາບ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່) ແລະ ລຶບແທັກນັ້ນອອກຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖາວອນ. ເນື່ອງຈາກການກະທຳນີ້ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ຮູບພາບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ລະບົບຈະສະແດງຄຳເຕືອນເພື່ອບອກວ່າ ມີຈັກຮູບພາບທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ແທັກນີ້ຢູ່. ຂໍໃຫ້ລະມັດລະວັງກັບຄຳເຕືອນນີ້ ເພາະບໍ່ມີວິທີການກັບຄືນການກະທຳໄດ້ (ຍົກເວັ້ນການກູ້ຄືນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ຊາຍຄາ XMP ຈາກບ່ອນສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ). ແທັກໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ຄັງແທັກ (tag dictionary)_ ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້ດ້ວຍວິທີດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "right-click on a tag in the _tag dictionary_ window, to show a pop-up menu, and choose \"delete tag\".\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ແທັກໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ຄັງແທັກ_ ເພື່ອສະແດງເມນູປັອບອັບ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ \"ລຶບແທັກ (delete tag)\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "right-click on a branch node in the _tag dictionary_ window, to show a pop-up menu, and choose \"delete node\" to delete the selected node together with any child nodes.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (node) ໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ _ຄັງແທັກ_ ເພື່ອສະແດງເມນູປັອບອັບ, ແລ້ວເລືອກ \"ລຶບໂນດ (delete node)\" ເພື່ອລຶບໂນດທີ່ເລືອກພ້ອມກັບໂນດລູກທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "import / export"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າ / ສົ່ງອອກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The “import” button allows you to choose a text file (which must comply with the Lightroom tag text file format) and import its content. If a tag in the imported file already exists, its properties will be updated, otherwise a new tag will be created.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ “ນຳເຂົ້າ (import)” ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມ (ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງເປັນໄປຕາມຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ແທັກຂອງ "
"Lightroom) ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າເນື້ອຫາຂອງມັນ. ຫາກແທັກໃນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງມັນຈະຖືກອັບເດ"
"ດ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນແທັກໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The “export” button exports your entire tag dictionary into a text file of your choice (Lightroom tag text file format).\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ “ສົ່ງອອກ (export)” ຈະສົ່ງອອກວັດຈະນານຸກົມແທັກທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານໄປເປັນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ "
"(ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ແທັກຂອງ Lightroom).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "copy tag to clipboard"
msgstr "ສຳເນົາແທັກໄປໄວ້ໃນຄລິບບອດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is possible to copy a single selected tag to the clipboard from both _attached tags_ and _tag dictionary_ sections by using the pop-up menu entry \"copy to clipboard\".\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສຳເນົາແທັກດ່ຽວທີ່ເລືອກໄປໄວ້ໃນຄລິບບອດໄດ້ ທັງຈາກສ່ວນ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດ_ ແລະ _ຄັງແທັກ_ ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເມນູປັອບອັບ \"ສຳເນົາໄປໄວ້ໃນຄລິບບອດ (copy to clipboard)\".\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "find tag"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາແທັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you right-click on a tag name in the _attached tags_ section and click _find tag_, then the _tag dictionary_ will show all matching tags.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊື່ແທັກໃນສ່ວນ _ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດ_ ແລ້ວຄລິກ _ຄົ້ນຫາແທັກ (find tag)_, ຈາກນັ້ນ _ຄັງແທັກ_ ຈະສະແດງທຸກແທັກທີ່ກົງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "keyboard"
msgstr "ຄີບອດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following keys can be used within the tagging module:\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ພາຍໃນໂມດູນການຕິດແທັກ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Tab key can be used to navigate between the _attached tags_ view, the text entry box, and the _tag dictionary_ view. Pressing Tab from within the text entry field selects the first matching tag in the _tag dictionary_ view (if any).\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ Tab ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອຍ້າຍໄປມາລະຫວ່າງ ສ່ວນສະແດງແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດ, ຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ແລະ ສ່ວນສະແດງຄັງແທັກ. ການກົດ Tab ຈາກພາຍໃນຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຈະເປັນການເລືອກແທັກທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນໃນຄັງແທັກ (ຖ້າມີ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Down arrow key is equivalent to the Tab key, when pressed while inside the text entry field.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລູກສອນລົງ ມີຄ່າເທົ່າກັບປຸ່ມ Tab ເມື່ອກົດໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shift+Tab does the same as the Tab key but navigates in the opposite direction. Pressing Shift+Tab from within the text entry field selects the first user tag in the _attached tags_ view (if any).\n"
msgstr "Shift+Tab ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບປຸ່ມ Tab ແຕ່ເປັນການຍ້າຍໄປໃນທິດທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ. ການກົດ Shift+Tab ຈາກພາຍໃນຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຈະເປັນການເລືອກແທັກຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຳອິດໃນສ່ວນແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດ (ຖ້າມີ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Enter key can be used within the _tag dictionary_ view to attach the selected tag, keeping focus on the attached tag (similar to when a tag is attached using the mouse).\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ Enter ສາມາດໃຊ້ພາຍໃນຄັງແທັກເພື່ອຕິດແທັກທີ່ເລືອກ, ໂດຍຍັງຄົງຈຸດໂຟກັດໄວ້ທີ່ແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດ (ຄືກັນກັບການຕິດແທັກດ້ວຍເມົ້າ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pressing Shift+Enter from within the _tag dictionary_ view returns focus to the text entry field.\n"
msgstr "ການກົດ Shift+Enter ຈາກພາຍໃນຄັງແທັກ ຈະເປັນການສົ່ງຈຸດໂຟກັດກັບຄືນໄປທີ່ຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Delete / BackSpace keys can be used within the _attached tags_ view to detach the selected tag.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ Delete / BackSpace ສາມາດໃຊ້ພາຍໃນສ່ວນແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດ ເພື່ອຖອນແທັກທີ່ເລືອກອອກ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/navigation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "navigation"
msgstr "ການນຳທາງ (navigation)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To see the images bearing a particular tag in the _tag dictionary_ window, right-click on the tag name and choose \"go to tag collection\" in the resulting pop-up menu. This opens a collection in the [collections](./collections.md) module showing all images containing this tag. You can also select other tags in the _collections_ module by double-clicking on the collection for the other tag.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຮູບພາບທີ່ມີແທັກໃດໜຶ່ງໂດຍສະເພາະໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມຄັງແທັກ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊື່ແທັກແລ້ວເລືອກ \"ໄປທີ່ກຸ່ມຮູບພາບຂອງແທັກ (go to tag collection)\" ໃນເມນູປັອບອັບ. ນີ້ຈະເປີດກຸ່ມຮູບພາບໃນໂມດູນ [ກຸ່ມຮູບພາບ (collections)](./collections.md) ເຊິ່ງສະແດງທຸກຮູບພາບທີ່ມີແທັກນີ້. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກແທັກອື່ນໆໃນໂມດູນກຸ່ມຮູບພາບໄດ້ໂດຍການດັບເບິລຄລິກໃສ່ກຸ່ມຮູບພາບຂອງແທັກອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To return to the collection that was selected before opening a tag collection select the \"go back to work\" item from the pop-up menu. This will allow you to return to the original collection, as long as you haven't selected any other collections in the meantime.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອກັບຄືນໄປຫາກຸ່ມຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດກຸ່ມຮູບພາບຂອງແທັກ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກລາຍການ \"ກັບຄືນໄປເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ (go back to work)\" ຈາກເມນູປັອບອັບ. ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກັບຄືນໄປຫາກຸ່ມຮູບພາບເດີມໄດ້, ຕາບໃດທີ່ທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກກຸ່ມຮູບພາບອື່ນໃນລະຫວ່າງນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"preferences…\" option in the presets menu brings up a dialog where you can tweak the behavior of the tag suggestions list. The tag suggestions list comprises two parts, with the best-matched tags on one side and the most-recently-attached tags on the other. The following options are available:\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ \"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ… (preferences…)\" ໃນເມນູພຣີເຊັດຈະເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງໂຕ້ຕອບທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິ"
"ກຳຂອງລາຍຊື່ຄຳແນະນຳແທັກໄດ້. ລາຍຊື່ຄຳແນະນຳແທັກປະກອບມີສອງສ່ວນ, ໂດຍມີແທັກທີ່ກົງກັນທີ່ສຸດຢູ່ດ້ານໜຶ່ງ ແລະ "
"ແທັກທີ່ຖືກຕິດຫຼ້າສຸດຢູ່ອີກດ້ານໜຶ່ງ. ມີຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"suggested tags level of confidence\n"
": Level of confidence used to include the tag in the suggestions list (default 50):\n"
": - 0: display all associated tags,\n"
": - 99: match tags with a 99% confidence level,\n"
": - 100: this is essentially an unreachable level of confidence and so returns no matching tags. Use 100% to disable the best-matched tag suggestion list (faster).\n"
msgstr ""
"ລະດັບຄວາມໝັ້ນໃຈຂອງແທັກທີ່ແນະນຳ\n"
": ລະດັບຄວາມໝັ້ນໃຈທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການລວມແທັກເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການແນະນຳ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 50):\n"
": - 0: ສະແດງທຸກແທັກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ,\n"
": - 99: ຈັບຄູ່ແທັກທີ່ມີລະດັບຄວາມໝັ້ນໃຈ 99%,\n"
": - 100: ນີ້ແມ່ນລະດັບຄວາມໝັ້ນໃຈທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດບັນລຸໄດ້ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ມີແທັກທີ່ກົງກັນ. ໃຊ້ 100% ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານລາຍການແນະນຳແທັກທີ່ກົງກັນທີ່ສຸດ (ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກໄວຂຶ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/tagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"number of recently attached tags\n"
": Number of recently attached tags to include in the suggestions list (default 20). A value of \"-1\" can be used to disable the most-recently-attached suggestions list.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດຫຼ້າສຸດ\n"
": ຈຳນວນແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ຈະລວມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການແນະນຳ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 20). ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າ \"-1\" ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານລາຍການແນະນຳແທັກທີ່ຕິດຄັດຫຼ້າສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "collection filters"
msgstr "ຕົວຕອງຄໍເລັກຊັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter the _collection_ of images displayed in the lighttable view and filmstrip panel using image attributes, optionally pinning filters to the [top panel](../../../overview/user-interface/top-panel.md) for quick access.\n"
msgstr "ຕອງ _ຄໍເລັກຊັນ_ ຂອງຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງໃນ lighttable ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have defined a _collection_ of images with the [collections](./collections.md) module, the collection filters module allows you to define additional filters and sort criteria. For example, you might wish to show all images in a given folder using the collections module and then define additional quick filters to narrow-down by star rating and/or color label.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເຈົ້າກຳນົດຄໍເລັກຊັນແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວຕອງເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເຊັ່ນ: ຕອງຕາມດາວ ຫຼື ປ້າຍສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about the image attributes you can select, please see the documentation for the [collections](./collections.md/#filtering-attributes) module.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໃນເອກະສານຂອງໂມດູນ [ຄໍເລັກຊັນ](./collections.md/#filtering-attributes).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that only a subset of filters is currently implemented -- more will be added in future versions of darktable.\n"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ປະຈຸບັນມີພຽງບາງຕົວຕອງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ -- ຈະມີເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນອະນາຄົດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "default settings"
msgstr "ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, three filters ([range rating](#range-rating), [color label](#color-labels) and [text search](#text-search) are defined within this module. By default these filters select all images (i.e. show images with any star rating or color label) and are all pinned to the top panel for quick access. This default setting is also available as the \"initial setting\" preset.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ມີສາມຕົວຕອງຄື: ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ, ປ້າຍສີ ແລະ ການຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "adding new filters"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To add a new filter to the module, click on the \"new rule\" button and select an image attribute to use.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"ກົດເກນໃໝ່ (new rule)\" ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຕົວຕອງໃໝ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you use multiple filters, the first item on the filter header allows you to define how the filter is combined with the previous one.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຕົວຕອງ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກວິທີການລວມພວກມັນເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and\n"
": Narrow down search. An image is only retained if it also fulfills the new criteria.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແລະ (and)\n"
": ຈຳກັດການຄົ້ນຫາໃຫ້ແຄບລົງ. ຮູບພາບຕ້ອງມີຄຸນສົມບັດຄົບທຸກຢ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"or\n"
": Add more images. Images from the _collection_ that fulfill the new criteria are added.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື (or)\n"
": ເພີ່ມຮູບພາບຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ຫາກຮູບພາບມີຄຸນສົມບັດຢ່າງໃດຢ່າງໜຶ່ງຈະຖືກສະແດງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"and not\n"
": Exclude images. Images that fulfill the new criteria are removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນ (and not)\n"
": ຍົກເວັ້ນຮູບພາບ. ຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດຕາມນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: The and/or/not operators have a defined order of precedence such that \"not\" is executed first, then \"and\" and finally \"or\". This means, for example, that if you define complex filters like \"A and B or C and not D\" these will be implemented as \"(A and B) or (C and (not D))\".\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ລຳດັບການເຮັດວຽກແມ່ນ \"not\" ກ່ອນ, ຕາມດ້ວຍ \"and\" ແລະ ສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນ \"or\".\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "removing or deactivating filters"
msgstr "ການລົບ ຫຼື ປິດການໃຊ້ງານຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can remove or temporarily deactivate a specific filter using the buttons on the right of the filter header (see screenshots in the following sections). If a filter is pinned to the top panel, you will need to unpin it before removing or deactivating.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດລົບ ຫຼື ປິດຕົວຕອງໄດ້ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຫົວຂໍ້ຕົວຕອງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "pinning into the top toolbar"
msgstr "ການປັກໝຸດໄວ້ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືດ້ານເທິງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pin button on the right of the filter header allows you to pin a filter to the top panel. To avoid unwanted actions, pinned filters can't be removed or deactivated.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມປັກໝຸດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເອົາຕົວຕອງໄປໄວ້ໃນແຖບດ້ານເທິງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໄວ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "resetting filters"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຕອງຄືນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clicking on the module reset button will remove all un-pinned filters and reset all others to their default values. If you want to also remove the pinned filters, you can Ctrl+click on the reset button.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ reset ເພື່ອລົບຕົວຕອງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ປັກໝຸດ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຕອງອື່ນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "returning to a previous set of filters"
msgstr "ການກັບໄປຫາຊຸດຕົວຕອງກ່ອນໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can return to a previously-defined set of filters by clicking on the history button at the bottom of the module and selecting from the resulting list.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກັບໄປໃຊ້ຊຸດຕົວຕອງທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ກ່ອນໜ້າໄດ້ໂດຍຄລິກປຸ່ມປະຫວັດ (history) ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "filter widgets"
msgstr "ວິດເຈັດຕົວຕອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A number of filter widgets have been created for use within this module. Since some of these widgets use non-standard interfaces, their usage is explained in the following sections:\n"
msgstr "ມີວິດເຈັດຕົວຕອງຫຼາຍແບບໃຫ້ເລືອກໃຊ້ ເຊິ່ງບາງອັນມີວິທີໃຊ້ສະເພາະດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following image shows the color labels widget, set to filter images having yellow or green color labels:\n"
msgstr "ຮູບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງວິດເຈັດປ້າຍສີ ທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຕອງສະເພາະຮູບທີ່ມີປ້າຍສີເຫຼືອງ ຫຼື ສີຂຽວ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![color filter](./collection-filters/color-filter.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![color filter](./collection-filters/color-filter.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can interact with this filter widget as follows:\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ງານວິດເຈັດນີ້ໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on a color label to include images with that label\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ປ້າຍສີ ເພື່ອສະແດງຮູບທີ່ມີປ້າຍສີນັ້ນ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ctrl+click on a color label to include images without that label\n"
msgstr "Ctrl+ຄລິກໃສ່ປ້າຍສີ ເພື່ອສະແດງຮູບທີ່ບໍ່ມີປ້າຍສີນັ້ນ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click or Ctrl+click on the gray icon to act on all color labels simultaneously\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ ຫຼື Ctrl+ຄລິກ ໃສ່ໄອຄອນສີເຖົາ ເພື່ອຈັດການທຸກປ້າຍສີພ້ອມກັນ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the last button to define how to handle the selection of multiple color labels. Select ![and](./collection-filters/color-filter-and.png#icon) (and) to filter images having _all_ of the selected color labels; Select ![or](./collection-filters/color-filter-or.png#icon) (or) to filter images with _at least one_ of the selected color labels.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມສຸດທ້າຍເພື່ອ ກຳນົດວິທີຈັດການກັບການເລືອກປ້າຍສີຫຼາຍອັນ. ເລືອກ ![and](./collection-filters/color-filter-and.png#icon) (ແລະ) ເພື່ອ ກັ່ນຕອງຮູບພາບທີ່ມີປ້າຍສີທີ່ເລືອກ _ທັງໝົດ_; ເລືອກ ![or](./collection-filters/color-filter-or.png#icon) (ຫຼື) ເພື່ອ ກັ່ນຕອງຮູບພາບທີ່ມີ _ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ_ ຂອງປ້າຍສີທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "rating"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the classic rating selection widget that used to be shown in darktable's top panel by default.\n"
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນວິດເຈັດການເລືອກໃຫ້ຄະແນນແບບດັ້ງເດີມ ທີ່ເຄີຍສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຜງດ້ານເທິງຂອງ darktable ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![rating filter](./collection-filters/rating-filter.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ](./collection-filters/rating-filter.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This widget is composed of a pair of comboboxes. The combobox on the right (always visible) is used to choose a number of stars, plus some additional options (\"all\", \"unstarred only\", \"rejected only\", \"all except rejected\"). The combobox to the left (only shown when a star rating is chosen in the right-hand combobox) is used to choose an operator (<, <=, =, >, >=, ≠).\n"
msgstr ""
"ວິດເຈັດນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍກ່ອງລາຍການ (combobox) ຄູ່ໜຶ່ງ. ກ່ອງລາຍການທາງເບື້ອງຂວາ (ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນຕະຫຼອ"
"ດ) ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລືອກຈຳນວນດາວ, ບວກກັບບາງຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ (\"ທັງໝົດ\", \"ສະເພາະທີ່ບໍ່ມີດາວ\", "
"\"ສະເພາະທີ່ຖືກປະຕິເສດ\", \"ທັງໝົດຍົກເວັ້ນທີ່ຖືກປະຕິເສດ\"). ກ່ອງລາຍການທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ (ຈະສະແດງເມື່ອ"
"ມີການເລືອກຄະແນນດາວໃນກ່ອງເບື້ອງຂວາເທົ່ານັ້ນ) ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລືອກຕົວດຳເນີນການ (<, <=, =, >, >=, "
"≠).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "range rating"
msgstr "ຊ່ວງການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This new widget also allows you to select images by star rating, this time using a new \"range\" widget. The following image shows the widget with ratings of 2-4 stars selected.\n"
msgstr "ວິດເຈັດໃໝ່ນີ້ຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກຮູບພາບຕາມຄະແນນດາວ, ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິດເຈັດ \"ຊ່ວງ (range)\" ແບບໃໝ່. ຮູບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນວິດເຈັດທີ່ມີການເລືອກຄະແນນ 2-4 ດາວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![range rating filter](./collection-filters/range-rating-filter.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊ່ວງການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ](./collection-filters/range-rating-filter.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can choose a new range of ratings to filter by clicking and dragging over the widget's interface. You can also access pre-defined ranges by right-clicking and selecting from the popup menu. The number of applicable images is also shown against each entry in this menu.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ວງຄະແນນໃໝ່ເພື່ອການກັ່ນຕອງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກແລ້ວລາກເທິງໜ້າຕ່າງຂອງວິດເຈັດ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາ ແລະ ເລືອກຈາກເມນູປັອບອັບ. ຈຳນວນຮູບພາບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ຂ້າງແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນເມນູນີ້.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "range filters for numeric attributes"
msgstr "ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊ່ວງສຳລັບຄຸນລັກສະນະຕົວເລກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Numeric attributes (aperture, exposure, focal length, iso, aspect ratio) are filtered using a widget that shows a histogram of the number of images available depending on the value of the given attribute (similar to the [_timeline_](../lighttable/timeline.md) in the lighttable view).\n"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະຕົວເລກ (ຮູຮັບແສງ, ການຮັບແສງ, ໄລຍະໂຟກັດ, iso, ອັດຕາສ່ວນພາບ) ຖືກກັ່ນຕອງໂດຍໃຊ້ວິດເຈັດທີ່ສະແດງຮິສໂຕແກຣມຂອງຈຳນວນຮູບພາບທີ່ມີຢູ່ ຕາມຄ່າຂອງຄຸນລັກສະນະນັ້ນໆ (ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ [_ທາມລາຍ (timeline)_](../lighttable/timeline.md) ໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For example, the following image shows the widget when used for selecting by aperture:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຮູບຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງວິດເຈັດເມື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການເລືອກຕາມຮູຮັບແສງ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![aperture range filter](./collection-filters/aperture-range-filter.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊ່ວງຮູຮັບແສງ](./collection-filters/aperture-range-filter.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As with the range rating filter, you can select a range of values to filter by clicking and dragging on the widget. You can also access predefined ranges by right-clicking and selecting from the popup menu. The number of applicable images is also shown against each entry in this menu.\n"
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊ່ວງການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ວງຄ່າເພື່ອການກັ່ນຕອງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກແລ້ວລາກເທິງວິດເຈັດ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ວງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາ ແລະ ເລືອກຈາກເມນູປັອບອັບ. ຈຳນວນຮູບພາບທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ຂ້າງແຕ່ລະລາຍການໃນເມນູນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also use the \"min\" and \"max\" text entry fields in the main module interface to manually define the bounds of the selection.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"ຕ່ຳສຸດ (min)\" ແລະ \"ສູງສຸດ (max)\" ໃນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ໂມດູນຫຼັກ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຂອງການເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "date attributes"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະວັນທີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As with numeric and rating range filters, date/time filters are represented using a \"range\" widget. You can select a range of values by clicking and dragging on the widget, and use the right-click menu for more options.\n"
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊ່ວງຕົວເລກ ແລະ ການໃຫ້ຄະແນນ, ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງວັນທີ/ເວລາ ຈະຖືກສະແດງໂດຍໃຊ້ວິດເຈັດ \"ຊ່ວງ\". ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຊ່ວງຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກແລ້ວລາກເທິງວິດເຈັດ, ແລະ ໃຊ້ເມນູຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![date range filter](./collection-filters/capture-date-filter.png#w33)\n"
msgstr "![ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊ່ວງວັນທີ](./collection-filters/capture-date-filter.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also use the \"min\" and \"max\" text entry fields in the main module interface to manually define the bounds of the selection (right-click for more options).\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"ຕ່ຳສຸດ\" ແລະ \"ສູງສຸດ\" ໃນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ໂມດູນຫຼັກ ເພື່ອກຳນົດຂອບເຂດຂອງການເລືອກດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ (ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The date/time format used by this module is `YYYY:MM:DD HH:MM:SS` (only the year values are mandatory).\n"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ໂມດູນນີ້ໃຊ້ແມ່ນ `YYYY:MM:DD HH:MM:SS` (ມີພຽງແຕ່ຄ່າປີເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈຳເປັນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The keyword `now` is allowed in the max field (to define the current date/time).\n"
msgstr "ຄຳສຳຄັນ `now` ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນຊ່ອງສູງສຸດ (ເພື່ອລະບຸວັນທີ/ເວລາ ປັດຈຸບັນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also use \"relative\" date/time values by preceding text entries with `+` or `-`. This allows you to set the maximum or minimum bound of the range relative to the other bound. As an example if you set the min value to `-0000:01` and the max value to `2022:04:15`, this will select images taken during the month before April 15th 2022.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຄ່າ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ແບບ \"ສຳພັດ\" ໄດ້ໂດຍການໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `+` ຫຼື `-` ນຳໜ້າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຂອບເຂດສູງສຸດ ຫຼື ຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງຊ່ວງ ໃຫ້ສຳພັດກັບຂອບເຂດອີກດ້ານໜຶ່ງ. ຕົວຢ່າງ ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດເປັນ `-0000:01` ແລະ ຄ່າສູງສຸດເປັນ `2022:04:15`, ມັນຈະເລືອກຮູບທີ່ຖ່າຍໃນຊ່ວງໜຶ່ງເດືອນກ່ອນວັນທີ 15 ເມສາ 2022.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "filename"
msgstr "ຊື່ໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The filename filter allows you to search images by their filename and/or extension. You can either enter the name or extension (with the leading `.`) manually or use the right-click menu to select.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄົ້ນຫາຮູບພາບດ້ວຍຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ/ຫຼື ນາມສະກຸນ. ທ່ານສາມາດປ້ອນຊື່ ຫຼື ນາມສະກຸນ (ທີ່ມີເຄື່ອງໝາຍ `.` ນຳໜ້າ) ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເມນູຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Within the extension field, you can also use the keywords `RAW` (to select all handled RAW file extensions), `NOT RAW` (to select all non-RAW file extensions), `LDR` (to select low-dynamic-range extensions) or `HDR` (to select high-dynamic-range extensions).\n"
msgstr "ໃນຊ່ອງນາມສະກຸນ, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສຳຄັນ `RAW` (ເພື່ອເລືອກນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ RAW ທັງໝົດ), `NOT RAW` (ເພື່ອເລືອກນາມສະກຸນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ RAW ທັງໝົດ), `LDR` (ເພື່ອເລືອກນາມສະກຸນທີ່ມີລະດັບສີຕ່ຳ) ຫຼື `HDR` (ເພື່ອເລືອກນາມສະກຸນທີ່ມີລະດັບສີສູງ).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "camera, lens"
msgstr "ກ້ອງ, ເລນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The camera and lens filters are presented text entry fields into which you can enter text to filter by. Alternatively, you can right-click on the text box to see a list of cameras or lenses to select from.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງກ້ອງ ແລະ ເລນ ຈະສະແດງເປັນຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດພິມເພື່ອການກັ່ນຕອງໄດ້. ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ກ້ອງ ຫຼື ເລນ ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "duplicates"
msgstr "ຮູບທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This filter allows you to narrow down the collection to images that contain either at least one duplicate or exclusively duplicates. Filtering for only duplicates makes it easy to work with duplicates without touching the originals.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈຳກັດຊຸດສະສົມໃຫ້ເຫຼືອພຽງຮູບທີ່ມີຮູບຊ້ຳຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ ຫຼື ມີສະເພາະຮູບທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ. ການກັ່ນຕອງສະເພາະຮູບຊ້ຳເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍໃນການເຮັດວຽກກັບຮູບຊ້ຳໂດຍບໍ່ໄປແຕະຕ້ອງຮູບຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "text search"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can search images using any of their text properties (path, filename, filmroll, tags, metadata, camera, maker) using the text search filter. The search is performed \"on-the-fly\" and the widget is dimmed during the search process.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຮູບພາບໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດຂໍ້ຄວາມໃດໜຶ່ງ (ເສັ້ນທາງ, ຊື່ໄຟລ໌, ມ້ວນຟິມ, ແທັກ, ຂໍ້ມູນເມຕາ, ກ້ອງ, ຜູ້ຜະລິດ) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງການຄົ້ນຫາຂໍ້ຄວາມ. ການຄົ້ນຫາຈະເຮັດວຽກແບບທັນທີ ແລະ ວິດເຈັດຈະມືດລົງໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການຄົ້ນຫາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default darktable performs a \"fuzzy\" search (wildcards are automatically added to the start and the end of the text). If you want to search for an exact match, you can enclose it with double-quotes (`\"match this exactly\"`).\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ darktable ຈະຄົ້ນຫາແບບ \"ໃກ້ຄຽງ (fuzzy)\" (ຕົວແທນ wildcard ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ທາງໜ້າ ແລະ ທາງຫຼັງຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ). ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຄົ້ນຫາແບບກົງກັນທຸກຕົວອັກສອນ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃສ່ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຄຳເວົ້າສອງອັນຄອບໄດ້ (`\"ຄົ້ນຫາຄຳນີ້ແທ້ໆ\"`).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "sorting"
msgstr "ການຈັດລຽງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bottom part of the module allows you to define the sort order of the images when displayed in the lighttable and filmstrip views. As with the filter criteria, you can add multiple rules to this section. However, only the first-selected sort criteria is pinned to the top panel (this cannot be unpinned).\n"
msgstr "ສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງຂອງຮູບພາບເມື່ອສະແດງໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ ແລະ ແຖບຟິມ (filmstrip). ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບເງື່ອນໄຂການກັ່ນຕອງ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມກົດເກນຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃສ່ໃນສ່ວນນີ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ມີພຽງແຕ່ເງື່ອນໄຂການຈັດລຽງທຳອິດທີ່ເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກປັກໝຸດໄວ້ທີ່ແຜງດ້ານເທິງ (ອັນນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຖອນໝຸດອອກໄດ້).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As with filter criteria, the history button allows you to access any previously-used sort criteria.\n"
msgstr "ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັນກັບເງື່ອນໄຂການກັ່ນຕອງ, ປຸ່ມປະຫວັດຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງເງື່ອນໄຂການຈັດລຽງທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The button to the right of the attribute selection allows you to choose whether to sort that criteria in ascending or descending order.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມທາງຂວາຂອງການເລືອກຄຸນລັກສະນະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກວ່າຈະຈັດລຽງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂນັ້ນຈາກນ້ອຍໄປຫາຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ຈາກຫຼາຍໄປຫານ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "custom sort"
msgstr "ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting the sort order to \"custom sort\" presents images in any sequence you define. Images are initally ordered by an image property (import order, image capture time, file name, etc.) but you can then incrementally alter \"custom sort\" sequences by dragging-and-dropping images within the lighttable view. Be careful: an erroneous drag-and-drop can easily ruin one or more painstakingly-created image sequences.\n"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງເປັນ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ຈະສະແດງຮູບພາບໃນລຳດັບໃດກໍໄດ້ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດ. ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຮູບພາບຈະຖືກລຽງຕາມຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຮູບ (ລຳດັບການນຳເຂົ້າ, ເວລາຖ່າຍຮູບ, ຊື່ໄຟລ໌, ແລະອື່ນໆ) ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນລຳດັບ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ໄດ້ໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງຮູບພາບພາຍໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ. ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ: ການລາກ ແລະ ວາງທີ່ຜິດພາດສາມາດທຳລາຍລຳດັບຮູບພາບທີ່ທ່ານອຸດສາຫະສ້າງມາໄດ້ງ່າຍໆ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "warnings"
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please bear the following warnings in mind when using custom sort\n"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາຈື່ຄຳເຕືອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເມື່ອໃຊ້ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "\"Undo\" does not reverse drag-and-drop resequencing.\n"
msgstr "\"ຍົກເລີກ (Undo)\" ບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້ອນຄືນການຈັດລຳດັບໃໝ່ດ້ວຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drag-and-drop resequencing is _always_ enabled in lighttable filemanager and in the filmstrip, but any resulting changes _are invisible_ if \"custom sort\" is not currently in effect.\n"
msgstr "ການຈັດລຳດັບໃໝ່ດ້ວຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ແມ່ນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ _ຕະຫຼອດ_ ໃນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໂຕະແສງ ແລະ ໃນແຖບຟິມ, ແຕ່ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆທີ່ເກີດຂຶ້ນ _ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນ_ ຖ້າ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure any image you drag is _not selected_ unless you want to reposition the entire currently-selected set.\n"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຮູບທີ່ທ່ານລາກນັ້ນ _ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກຢູ່_ ນອກຈາກວ່າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງກຸ່ມຮູບທັງໝົດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Aim your \"drops\" accurately: verify the correct target is _highlighted_ before dropping!\n"
msgstr "ວາງໃຫ້ຖືກເປົ້າໝາຍ: ກວດສອບວ່າເປົ້າໝາຍທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຖືກ _ເນັ້ນ (highlight)_ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະວາງ!\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom sort positions are lost if images are removed from darktable or their tags are detached or deleted (since sort order is not stored in an image's [sidecar file](../../../overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md)).\n"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈຈະເສຍໄປ ຖ້າຮູບພາບຖືກລົບອອກຈາກ darktable ຫຼື ແທັກຂອງພວກມັນຖືກຖອນອອກ ຫຼື ລຶບຖິ້ມ (ເນື່ອງຈາກລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ [ໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ (sidecar file)](../../../overview/sidecar-files/sidecar.md) ຂອງຮູບ).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do not use \"custom sort\" for tag-based collections that specify a wild-card (\"\\*\" or \"%\") expression.\n"
msgstr "ຢ່າໃຊ້ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ສຳລັບຊຸດສະສົມທີ່ອີງຕາມແທັກ ເຊິ່ງມີການລະບຸຕົວແທນ (\"\\*\" ຫຼື \"%\").\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "    When a wild-card tag expression does not resolve to a _single_ tag, drag-and-drop operates only on the sequence of the first matching tag. If that tag is attached to a source image, that image is resequenced. If the same tag is also attached to the target image, the drop occurs there; if not, resequenced images appear at the top or bottom of the collection's \"custom sort\". If the first matching tag is not attached to a source image, the image is not repositioned. The \"tag case sensitivity\" preference is also relevant here: \"insensitive\" treats \"%\" (but not \"\\*\") as a string-match wild card. The global sequence is not affected in any of these cases.\n"
msgstr "    ເມື່ອການໃຊ້ຕົວແທນໃນແທັກບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸເຖິງແທັກ _ດຽວ_, ການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ຈະເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະກັບລຳດັບຂອງແທັກທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຖ້າແທັກນັ້ນຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບຕົ້ນທາງ, ຮູບນັ້ນຈະຖືກຈັດລຳດັບໃໝ່. ຖ້າແທັກດຽວກັນນັ້ນຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບເປົ້າໝາຍນຳ, ການວາງຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ; ຖ້າບໍ່ແມ່ນ, ຮູບທີ່ຖືກຈັດລຳດັບໃໝ່ຈະປະກົດຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງ ຫຼື ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ຂອງຊຸດສະສົມ. ຖ້າແທັກທຳອິດທີ່ກົງກັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດຢູ່ກັບຮູບຕົ້ນທາງ, ຮູບນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຖືກຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ \"ການແຍກຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່ຂອງແທັກ\" ກໍມີສ່ວນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໃນນີ້: \"ບໍ່ແຍກ\" ຈະຖືວ່າ \"%\" (ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ \"\\*\") ເປັນຕົວແທນຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ກົງກັນ. ລຳດັບໂດຍລວມ (global sequence) ຈະບໍ່ຖືກກະທົບໃນກໍລະນີເຫຼົ່ານີ້.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "which custom sort sequence?"
msgstr "ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈອັນໃດ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The collection type determines which [image sequence](../../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md) drag-and-drop changes. If the collection's selection criteria includes _tag_, then a _tag-based_ \"custom sort\" sequence is altered. Otherwise, the _global_ \"custom sort\" sequence is altered. Collection filters (even if tag-based) do not influence which sequence is changed by drag-and-drop.\n"
msgstr "ປະເພດຂອງຊຸດສະສົມຈະເປັນຕົວກຳນົດວ່າ [ລຳດັບຮູບພາບ](../../../lighttable/digital-asset-management/sequence.md) ໃດທີ່ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງດ້ວຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ. ຖ້າເງື່ອນໄຂການເລືອກຂອງຊຸດສະສົມລວມມີ _ແທັກ_, ລຳດັບ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" _ທີ່ອີງຕາມແທັກ_ ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ລຳດັບ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" _ໂດຍລວມ_ ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊຸດສະສົມ (ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະອີງຕາມແທັກກໍຕາມ) ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງດ້ວຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When \"custom sort\" is in effect, dragged-and-dropped images are immediately presented in their new (tag-based or global) \"custom sort\" sequence.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ມີຜົນ, ຮູບພາບທີ່ຖືກລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນລຳດັບ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ໃໝ່ (ແບບອີງຕາມແທັກ ຫຼື ແບບລວມ) ທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "what to drag, where to drop?"
msgstr "ລາກອັນໃດ, ວາງໃສ່ໃສ?"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While viewing a collection in filemanager or the filmstrip, you may drag any hovered-over (highlighted) image to any other image in the displayed collection. Empty space before, between, or after images is not a recognized drop target.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເບິ່ງຊຸດສະສົມໃນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ແຖບຟິມ, ທ່ານສາມາດລາກຮູບໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຖືກເນັ້ນ (highlight) ໄປຫາຮູບອື່ນໃນຊຸດສະສົມທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່. ພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງກ່ອນໜ້າ, ລະຫວ່າງກາງ, ຫຼື ຫຼັງຮູບພາບ ບໍ່ຖືວ່າເປັນເປົ້າໝາຍໃນການວາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You may relocate a single image (unselected or single selection) or a selected set of images by dragging one of them to the desired position as follows:\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງຮູບດຽວ (ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກ ຫຼື ເລືອກອັນດຽວ) ຫຼື ຊຸດຂອງຮູບທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ ໂດຍການລາກຮູບໃດໜຶ່ງໃນນັ້ນໄປຫາຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When _sort order_ is \"ascending\" the dragged image/set will be placed _before_ the image you drop it on to.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ _ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງ_ ເປັນ \"ຈາກນ້ອຍໄປຫາຫຼາຍ (ascending)\", ຮູບ/ຊຸດຮູບທີ່ລາກມາ ຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ _ກ່ອນໜ້າ_ ຮູບທີ່ທ່ານວາງໃສ່.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When _sort order_ is \"descending\" the dragged image/set will be placed _after_ the image you drop it on to.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອ _ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງ_ ເປັນ \"ຈາກຫຼາຍໄປຫານ້ອຍ (descending)\", ຮູບ/ຊຸດຮູບທີ່ລາກມາ ຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ _ຫຼັງຈາກ_ ຮູບທີ່ທ່ານວາງໃສ່.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Abort an accidental drag by dropping the dragged image _outside_ of the thumbnail display. If all peripheral panels are hidden, then drop the dragged image on _itself_. If multiple images were selected, the entire selected set will be relocated to that spot.\n"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການລາກທີ່ບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈໂດຍການວາງຮູບທີ່ລາກມາໄວ້ _ຂ້າງນອກ_ ຂອງສ່ວນສະແດງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnail). ຖ້າແຜງອ້ອມຂ້າງທັງໝົດຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້, ໃຫ້ວາງຮູບທີ່ລາກມານັ້ນໃສ່ _ຕົວມັນເອງ_. ຖ້າມີຮູບຫຼາຍອັນຖືກເລືອກໄວ້, ທັງໝົດທີ່ເລືອກຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປທີ່ນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the \"dropped on\" image is subsequently resequenced, filtered out, or even deleted, the dropped image(s) remain where the \"dropped on\" image was located.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າຮູບທີ່ຖືກ \"ວາງໃສ່\" ຖືກຈັດລຳດັບໃໝ່, ຖືກກັ່ນຕອງອອກ, ຫຼື ແມ່ນແຕ່ຖືກລຶບອອກໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ຮູບທີ່ຖືກວາງລົງໄປຈະຍັງຄົງຢູ່ບ່ອນທີ່ຮູບທີ່ຖືກ \"ວາງໃສ່\" ເຄີຍຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "which image is last (or, in descending sort, first)?"
msgstr "ຮູບໃດເປັນຮູບສຸດທ້າຍ (ຫຼື ຮູບທຳອິດ ໃນການຈັດລຽງຈາກຫຼາຍໄປຫານ້ອຍ)?"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An image dropped after the last image on lighttable is regarded as dropped _on the last image_, thus positioned before it.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບທີ່ຖືກວາງໄວ້ຫຼັງຈາກຮູບສຸດທ້າຍໃນໂຕະແສງ ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າວາງ _ໃສ່ຮູບສຸດທ້າຍ_, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້າຮູບນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To change the last image in an \"ascending\" \"custom sort\" display, drop it on the existing last image, then drag-and-drop that last image on its intended replacement.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຮູບສຸດທ້າຍໃນການສະແດງຜົນ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ແບບ \"ຈາກນ້ອຍໄປຫາຫຼາຍ\", ໃຫ້ວາງຮູບໃສ່ຮູບສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ມີຢູ່, ແລ້ວລາກຮູບສຸດທ້າຍນັ້ນໄປວາງໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ຈະມາແທນທີ່ມັນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you expect to use a \"descending\" sort, do the opposite to change the first image.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ການຈັດລຽງແບບ \"ຈາກຫຼາຍໄປຫານ້ອຍ\", ໃຫ້ເຮັດແບບກົງກັນຂ້າມເພື່ອປ່ຽນຮູບທຳອິດ.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "suggested process"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ແນະນຳ"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you intend to present a collection in more than one \"custom sort\" sequence or if some images in a collection are included in other collections to be displayed with a different global \"custom sort\", then tag-based collections should be used.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕັ້ງໃຈຈະສະແດງຊຸດສະສົມໃນລຳດັບ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງແບບ ຫຼື ຖ້າບາງຮູບໃນຊຸດສະສົມຖືກລວມຢູ່ໃນຊຸດສະສົມອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ແບບລວມທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ຄວນໃຊ້ຊຸດສະສົມທີ່ອີງຕາມແທັກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For tag-based \"custom sort\" only:\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ\" ທີ່ອີງຕາມແທັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set _sort by_ to the image attribute and _sort order_ (ascending or descending) you want as your tag's initial sequence,\n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ຈັດລຽງໂດຍ (sort by)_ ຕາມຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງຮູບ ແລະ _ລຳດັບການຈັດລຽງ (sort order)_ (ຈາກນ້ອຍໄປຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ຈາກຫຼາຍໄປນ້ອຍ) ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ເປັນລຳດັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແທັກ,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select the images to be sequenced, and\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກຮູບພາບທີ່ຈະຈັດລຳດັບ, ແລະ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "in the right-hand panel at _tagging_ (bottom half) add a new tag or click on an existing tag.\n"
msgstr "ໃນແຜງທາງຂວາມື ທີ່ສ່ວນ _ການຕິດແທັກ (tagging)_ (ສ່ວນລຸ່ມ) ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມແທັກໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຄລິກໃສ່ແທັກທີ່ມີຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The tag is now attached to the selected images in the displayed sequence. Note the tag's increased image count.\n"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ແທັກໄດ້ຖືກຕິດໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ສະແດງແລ້ວ. ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າຈຳນວນຮູບໃນແທັກນັ້ນເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change _collections_ selection crierion to \"tag\" and choose the newly-applied tag. Note that the newly-tagged images are shown.\n"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນເງື່ອນໄຂການເລືອກ _ຊຸດສະສົມ (collections)_ ເປັນ \"ແທັກ (tag)\" ແລະ ເລືອກແທັກທີ່ຫາກໍນຳໃຊ້. ສັງເກດເຫັນວ່າຮູບທີ່ຕິດແທັກໃໝ່ຈະຖືກສະແດງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Long-distance drags are difficult because neither _filemanager_ nor _filmstrip_ scroll while you drag. Try to fit drag sources and targets onto the same screen by maximizing the the window and scrolling the display. If that's not sufficient:\n"
msgstr "ການລາກໃນໄລຍະໄກແມ່ນເຮັດໄດ້ຍາກ ເພາະທັງ _ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌_ ແລະ _ແຖບຟິມ_ ຈະບໍ່ເລື່ອນໜ້າຈໍໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານລາກ. ພະຍາຍາມໃຫ້ຮູບຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍດຽວກັນໂດຍການຂະຫຍາຍໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ໃຫຍ່ສຸດ ແລະ ເລື່ອນການສະແດງຜົນ. ຖ້າຍັງບໍ່ພໍ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "increase the number of images displayed (thus shrinking thumbnails) or\n"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຈຳນວນຮູບທີ່ສະແດງ (ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງນ້ອຍລົງ) ຫຼື\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "hide images between drag source and drop target using _collection filters_ (e.g. by ranges of \"datetime captured\" or \"image id\").\n"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອງຮູບພາບລະຫວ່າງຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ເປົ້າໝາຍ ໂດຍໃຊ້ _ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຊຸດສະສົມ_ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຕາມຊ່ວງຂອງ \"ວັນທີເວລາທີ່ຖ່າຍ\" ຫຼື \"ໄອດີຮູບພາບ\").\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rearrange the images as you desire:\n"
msgstr "ຈັດລຽງຮູບພາບໃໝ່ຕາມທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clear any active selection (_selection_ > _select none_).\n"
msgstr "ລຶບການເລືອກທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ທັງໝົດ (_ການເລືອກ (selection)_ > _ບໍ່ເລືອກ (select none)_).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set _sort by_ > \"custom sort\" so you can verify your changes immediately.\n"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ _ຈັດລຽງໂດຍ (sort by)_ > \"ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ (custom sort)\" ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ທັນທີ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/collection-filters.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remember the **[warnings](#warnings)** above as you drag-and-drop.\n"
msgstr "ຢ່າລືມ **[ຄຳເຕືອນ](#warnings)** ດ້ານເທິງໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານລາກ ແລະ ວາງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "scopes"
msgstr "ຂອບເຂດການວັດແທກ (scopes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module provides various graphical depictions of the developed image's light levels or [chromaticity](../../../special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions/#definitions).\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ໃຫ້ການສະແດງຜົນໃນຮູບແບບກຣາຟິກຕ່າງໆ ຂອງລະດັບແສງຂອງຮູບທີ່ຖືກແຕ່ງແລ້ວ ຫຼື [ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສີ (chromaticity)](../../../special-topics/color-management/color-dimensions/#definitions).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![scopes module](./scopes/scopes.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![ໂມດູນ scopes](./scopes/scopes.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hover the mouse over the module to reveal buttons that can be used to adjust the display. The buttons on the left-hand-side are used to choose the display mode, from left-to-right: vectorscope, waveform, split (waveform/vectorscope), rgb parade and histogram. The buttons on the right-hand-side control how the plot for the current scope is drawn.\n"
msgstr "ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂມດູນເພື່ອສະແດງປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆທີ່ໃຊ້ປັບການສະແດງຜົນ. ປຸ່ມທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍມືແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລືອກໂໝດການສະແດງຜົນ, ຈາກຊ້າຍໄປຂວາ: vectorscope, waveform, split (waveform/vectorscope), rgb parade ແລະ histogram. ປຸ່ມທາງເບື້ອງຂວາມືໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມວິທີການແຕ້ມກຣາບຂອງຂອບເຂດປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The height of the scopes module can be changed by clicking-and-dragging on the bottom edge or by holding down Shift+Alt while scrolling the mouse. The visibility of the module can be toggled with a keyboard shortcut (default Ctrl+Shift+H).\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມສູງຂອງໂມດູນ scopes ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກແລ້ວລາກທີ່ຂອບລຸ່ມ ຫຼື ໂດຍການກົດ Shift+Alt ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌. ການສະແດງ/ຊ່ອນ ໂມດູນສາມາດສະຫຼັບໄດ້ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ Ctrl+Shift+H).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The scopes module is at the top of the right-hand panel by default but can be moved to the left-hand panel with [preferences > miscellaneous > position of the scopes module](../../../preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md).\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໂມດູນ scopes ຈະຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງແຜງເບື້ອງຂວາມື ແຕ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍໄປໄວ້ແຜງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍມືໄດ້ດ້ວຍ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ອື່ນໆ > ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໂມດູນ scopes](../../../preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For performance reasons, scopes are calculated from the image preview (the image displayed in the [navigation](../darkroom/navigation.md) module) rather than the higher quality image displayed in the center view. The preview is calculated at a lower resolution and may use shortcuts to bypass more time-consuming image processing steps. Hence the display may not accurately represent fine detail in the image, and may deviate in other ways from the final developed image.\n"
msgstr "ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບ, scopes ຈະຖືກຄຳນວນຈາກຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (ຮູບທີ່ສະແດງໃນໂມດູນ [ການນຳທາງ](../darkroom/navigation.md)) ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຮູບທີ່ມີຄຸນນະພາບສູງກວ່າທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ກາງຈໍ. ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຖືກຄຳນວນດ້ວຍຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າ ແລະ ອາດຈະໃຊ້ວິທີການທາງລັດເພື່ອຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນການປະມວນຜົນຮູບທີ່ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ການສະແດງຜົນອາດຈະບໍ່ສະແດງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ລະອຽດອ່ອນຂອງຮູບໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ, ແລະ ອາດຈະແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຮູບທີ່ແຕ່ງສຳເລັດແລ້ວໃນບາງຈຸດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "histogram"
msgstr "ຮິສໂຕແກຣມ (histogram)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![histogram](./scopes/histogram.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![ຮິສໂຕແກຣມ](./scopes/histogram.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The histogram shows the distribution of pixels by lightness for each color channel.\n"
msgstr "ຮິສໂຕແກຣມສະແດງການກະຈາຍຂອງພິກເຊວຕາມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The horizontal axis runs from 0% to 100% lightness for each channel. The vertical axis gives the count of pixels having the given lightness.\n"
msgstr "ແກນນອນສະແດງຈາກ 0% ຫາ 100% ຂອງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ. ແກນຕັ້ງສະແດງຈຳນວນພິກເຊວທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງນັ້ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In its default state, data for all three RGB color channels is displayed. The red, green and blue colored buttons on the right-hand-side can be used to toggle the display of each color channel.\n"
msgstr "ໃນສະຖານະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທັງສາມຊ່ອງສີ RGB ຈະຖືກສະແດງ. ປຸ່ມສີແດງ, ສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີຟ້າ ທາງເບື້ອງຂວາມືສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເປີດ/ປິດ ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first button on the right-hand-side toggles between logarithmic and linear rendering of the vertical axis (pixel count) data.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມທຳອິດທາງເບື້ອງຂວາມືແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງການສະແດງຜົນແບບລໍກາຣິດ (logarithmic) ແລະ ແບບເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear) ຂອງຂໍ້ມູນແກນຕັ້ງ (ຈຳນວນພິກເຊວ).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "waveform"
msgstr "ເວຟຟອມ (waveform)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![waveform scope (horizontal)](./scopes/waveform.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![waveform scope (ແນວນອນ)](./scopes/waveform.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The waveform scope shows similar data to the histogram, but allows you to view that data in a spatial context.\n"
msgstr "ສະໂຄບຮູບແບບຄື້ນ (waveform scope) ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບຮິສໂຕແກຣມ, ແຕ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນໃນບໍລິບົດທາງພື້ນທີ່ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the \"standard\" horizontal waveform, the horizontal axis of the waveform represents the horizontal axis of the image -- the right-hand side of the waveform represents the right-hand side of the image and the left-hand side of the waveform represents the left-hand side of the image.\n"
msgstr "ໃນ waveform ແນວນອນ \"ມາດຕະຖານ\", ແກນນອນຂອງ waveform ຈະແທນແກນນອນຂອງຮູບ -- ດ້ານຂວາຂອງ waveform ແທນດ້ານຂວາຂອງຮູບ ແລະ ດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງ waveform ແທນດ້ານຊ້າຍຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The vertical axis represents the distribution of pixels by lightness for each channel -- the dotted line at the top represents 100% lightness (values above this may be clipped), the dotted line in the middle represents 50% lightness, and the bottom of the waveform represents 0% lightness. \n"
msgstr "ແກນຕັ້ງສະແດງການກະຈາຍຂອງພິກເຊວຕາມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ -- ເສັ້ນປະດ້ານເທິງແທນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ 100% (ຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຖືກຕັດ), ເສັ້ນປະຢູ່ກາງແທນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ 50%, ແລະ ສ່ວນລຸ່ມສຸດຂອງ waveform ແທນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ 0%. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The brightness of each point on the waveform represents the number of pixels at the given position (the horizontal axis) having the given lightness (the vertical axis). The brighter the point, the more pixels at that position have that lightness.\n"
msgstr "ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງແຕ່ລະຈຸດເທິງ waveform ແທນຈຳນວນພິກເຊວໃນຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນໆ (ແກນນອນ) ທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງນັ້ນໆ (ແກນຕັ້ງ). ຈຸດທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍເທົ່າໃດ, ກໍຍິ່ງມີພິກເຊວໃນຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນທີ່ມີຄວາມສະຫວ່າງນັ້ນຫຼາຍເທົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As with the histogram, you can selectively display each of the red, green, and blue channels, by clicking on the appropriate buttons.\n"
msgstr "ຄືກັນກັບຮິສໂຕແກຣມ, ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກສະແດງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ ແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ປຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first button on the right-hand-side toggles the display between horizontal (above) and vertical (below) mode:\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມທຳອິດທາງເບື້ອງຂວາມືແມ່ນໃຊ້ສະຫຼັບການສະແດງຜົນລະຫວ່າງໂໝດແນວນອນ (ດ້ານເທິງ) ແລະ ແນວຕັ້ງ (ດ້ານລຸ່ມ):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![waveform scope (vertical)](./scopes/waveform-vertical.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![waveform scope (ແນວຕັ້ງ)](./scopes/waveform-vertical.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the vertical waveform, the vertical axis of the plot represents the vertical axis of the image, and the horizontal axis represents the distribution of pixels by lightness. The vertical waveform can be useful for portrait-format images, or simply to understand an image in a different way.\n"
msgstr "ໃນ waveform ແນວຕັ້ງ, ແກນຕັ້ງຂອງກຣາບຈະແທນແກນຕັ້ງຂອງຮູບ, ແລະ ແກນນອນຈະແທນການກະຈາຍຂອງພິກເຊວຕາມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ. waveform ແນວຕັ້ງມີປະໂຫຍດສຳລັບຮູບພາບແນວຕັ້ງ (portrait), ຫຼື ພຽງແຕ່ເພື່ອທຳຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈຮູບໃນມຸມມອງອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See [Of Histograms and Waveforms](https://www.darktable.org/2013/12/of-histograms-and-waveforms/) for more on darktable's waveform scope.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ [Of Histograms and Waveforms](https://www.darktable.org/2013/12/of-histograms-and-waveforms/) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ waveform scope ຂອງ darktable.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "rgb parade"
msgstr "rgb parade"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![rgb parade (horizontal)](./scopes/parade.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![rgb parade (ແນວນອນ)](./scopes/parade.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The RGB parade scope shows the same data as the waveform, but with the red, green, and blue channels presented side-by-side.\n"
msgstr "RGB parade scope ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນດຽວກັນກັບ waveform, ແຕ່ສະແດງຊ່ອງສີແດງ, ສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີຟ້າ ຄຽງຂ້າງກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As with the waveform, clicking the button on the right-hand-side of the module toggles between horizontal (above) and vertical (below) mode:\n"
msgstr "ຄືກັນກັບ waveform, ການຄລິກປຸ່ມທາງເບື້ອງຂວາມືຂອງໂມດູນຈະສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງໂໝດແນວນອນ (ດ້ານເທິງ) ແລະ ແນວຕັ້ງ (ດ້ານລຸ່ມ):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![rgb parade (vertical)](./scopes/parade-vertical.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![rgb parade (ແນວຕັ້ງ)](./scopes/parade-vertical.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The RGB parade can be useful for matching the intensities of the red, green, and blue channels. It can also help to understand the differences between, and individual qualities of, each channel.\n"
msgstr "RGB parade ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການປັບຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງຊ່ອງສີແດງ, ສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີຟ້າ ໃຫ້ສົມດຸນກັນ. ມັນຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໃຈຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງ ແລະ ຄຸນລັກສະນະສະເພາະຂອງແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງສີ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "vectorscope"
msgstr "ເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ (vectorscope)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![vectorscope](./scopes/vectorscope.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![vectorscope](./scopes/vectorscope.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The vectorscope shows [chromaticity](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chromaticity) without regard to either lightness or spatial data. \n"
msgstr "ເວກເຕີສະໂຄບ (vectorscope) ສະແດງ [ໂຄຣມາຕິຊິຕີ (chromaticity)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chromaticity) ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ຂໍ້ມູນທາງພື້ນທີ່. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The distance from the center of the graph represents chroma and the angle represents hue. Areas of the graph are colored depending on the chromaticity of the color to which they correspond in the image. The graph represents color \"volume\" by rendering the more frequently used colors in lighter tones.\n"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງຈາກສູນກາງຂອງກຣາບແທັນຄ່າ Chroma (ຄວາມສົດຂອງສີ) ແລະ ມຸມແທັນຄ່າ Hue (ເນື້ອສີ). ພື້ນທີ່ຂອງກຣາບຈະມີສີຕາມຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີທີ່ກົງກັບໃນຮູບ. ກຣາບສະແດງ \"ປະລິມານ\" ຂອງສີໂດຍການສະແດງສີທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍໆໃນໂທນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The graph includes a \"hue ring\" representing the maximum chroma of each hue (in bounded RGB) of the current histogram profile. The RGB primary/secondary colors are marked by circles around the edge of the hue ring.\n"
msgstr "ກຣາບປະກອບມີ \"ວົງແຫວນເນື້ອສີ (hue ring)\" ທີ່ສະແດງຄ່າ chroma ສູງສຸດຂອງແຕ່ລະເນື້ອສີ (ໃນຂອບເຂດ RGB) ຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮິສໂຕແກຣມປັດຈຸບັນ. ສີຫຼັກ/ສີຮອງ RGB ຖືກໝາຍໄວ້ດ້ວຍວົງມົນອ້ອມຂອບຂອງວົງແຫວນເນື້ອສີ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "split (waveform/vectorscope)"
msgstr "ແບບແບ່ງ (waveform/vectorscope)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![split](./scopes/split.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![ແບບແບ່ງ](./scopes/split.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shows a combined mode with the waveform on the left and the vectorscope on the right. The available controls are as described for the individual modes.\n"
msgstr "ສະແດງໂໝດລວມໂດຍມີ waveform ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ ແລະ vectorscope ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຂວາ. ການຄວບຄຸມທີ່ມີແມ່ນເປັນໄປຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນແຕ່ລະໂໝດ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "color harmony and additional vectorscope controls"
msgstr "ຄວາມກົມກືນຂອງສີ ແລະ ການຄວບຄຸມ vectorscope ເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The vectorscope provides some additional controls beyond those provided by the other modes, which deserve separate discussion. Hovering over the scopes module while in vectorscope mode shows the following additional buttons:\n"
msgstr "ເວກເຕີສະໂຄບມີການຄວບຄຸມເພີ່ມເຕີມບາງຢ່າງນອກເໜືອຈາກໂໝດອື່ນໆ, ເຊິ່ງຄວນຄ່າແກ່ການສົນທະນາແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ການວາງເມົ້າໄວ້ເທິງໂມດູນສະໂຄບໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໂໝດເວກເຕີສະໂຄບ ຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![vectorscope-options](./scopes/vectorscope-options.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![ຕົວເລືອກ vectorscope](./scopes/vectorscope-options.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the second-to-right-most button to toggle the chroma scale between linear and logarithmic mode.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມທີສອງຈາກເບື້ອງຂວາເພື່ອສະຫຼັບມາດຕາສ່ວນ chroma ລະຫວ່າງໂໝດເສັ້ນຊື່ (linear) ແລະ ໂໝດລໍກາຣິດ (logarithmic).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the right-most button to toggle the color space of the vectorscope between [CIELUV](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CIELUV), [JzAzBz](https://www.osapublishing.org/oe/fulltext.cfm?uri=oe-25-13-15131&id=368272) or [RYB](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RYB_color_model) -- as previously mentioned, these color spaces exclude any luminosity component in this module. The CIELUV graph will be faster to calculate, and is a well-known standard, though JzAzBz may be more perceptually accurate.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມຂວາສຸດເພື່ອສະຫຼັບພື້ນທີ່ສີຂອງ vectorscope ລະຫວ່າງ [CIELUV](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CIELUV), [JzAzBz](https://www.osapublishing.org/oe/fulltext.cfm?uri=oe-25-13-15131&id=368272) ຫຼື [RYB](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RYB_color_model) -- ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວມາແລ້ວ, ພື້ນທີ່ສີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ລວມສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໃນໂມດູນນີ້. ກຣາບ CIELUV ຈະຄຳນວນໄດ້ໄວກວ່າ ແລະ ເປັນມາດຕະຖານທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກກັນດີ, ແຕ່ JzAzBz ອາດຈະມີຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຕາມການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງສາຍຕາຫຼາຍກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, along the right-hand edge of the module are a series of buttons that allow the selected color harmony indicator to be overlaid on the vectorscope graphic when in RYB color space. For example, the following shows the \"triad\" color harmony:\n"
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ຢູ່ຂອບເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງໂມດູນຈະມີປຸ່ມຊຸດໜຶ່ງທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດສະແດງຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄວາມກົມກືນຂອງສີທີ່ເລືອກ ຊ້ອນລົງເທິງກຣາບ vectorscope ເມື່ອຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RYB. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນການສະແດງຄວາມກົມກືນຂອງສີແບບ \"triad\":\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![vectorscope-ch-triad](./scopes/vectorscope-ch-triad.png#w50)\n"
msgstr "![vectorscope-ch-triad](./scopes/vectorscope-ch-triad.png#w50)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rotate the display of the overlaid harmony guides by hovering over the scopes module and scrolling with the mouse scroll wheel. Hold Ctrl while scrolling to rotate more slowly. Hold Shift while scrolling to change the area covered by the guide overlays.\n"
msgstr "ໝູນການສະແດງຜົນຂອງເສັ້ນນຳທາງຄວາມກົມກືນໂດຍການວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງໂມດູນ scopes ແລະ ເລື່ອນລໍ້ເມົາສ໌. ກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນເພື່ອໝູນໃຫ້ຊ້າລົງ. ກົດ Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນເພື່ອປ່ຽນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເສັ້ນນຳທາງກວມເອົາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The type and position of the chosen harmony guides is saved alongside each image's editing data (in the XMP file and database) so can be restored whenever you return to the image for further editing.\n"
msgstr "ປະເພດ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເສັ້ນນຳທາງຄວາມກົມກືນທີ່ເລືອກ ຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນການແກ້ໄຂຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບ (ໃນໄຟລ໌ XMP ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນມາໄດ້ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານກັບມາແກ້ໄຂຮູບນັ້ນຄືນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A full description of how to use this functionality is out of scope of this reference section, however, the following overview gives a basic guide as to how to use this mode to improve the color harmonies within the image.\n"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍແບບເຕັມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການໃຊ້ງານຟັງຊັນນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມຢູ່ໃນພາກອ້າງອີງນີ້, ແຕ່ພາບລວມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຄຳແນະນຳເບື້ອງຕົ້ນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການໃຊ້ໂໝດນີ້ເພື່ອປັບປຸງຄວາມກົມກືນຂອງສີພາຍໃນຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the [global color picker](../darkroom/global-color-picker.md), take live samples of the key colored areas of the image. The choice of these is purely artistic, depending on the feeling you wish to convey. Choose (in the global color picker) to display the chosen samples on the RYB vectorscope.\n"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ [ຕົວເລືອກສີທົ່ວໂລກ](../darkroom/global-color-picker.md) ເພື່ອເກັບຕົວຢ່າງສີຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສີຫຼັກຂອງຮູບ. ການເລືອກສີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບສິລະປະ ແລະ ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສື່ສານ. ເລືອກ (ໃນຕົວເລືອກສີທົ່ວໂລກ) ເພື່ອສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງສີທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນເທິງ RYB vectorscope.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the color harmony type that you wish to implement (or the closest to the actual distribution of picked live samples). Rotate (with Ctrl+scroll) until the picked samples fall roughly inside (or near) the harmony guides.\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດຄວາມກົມກືນຂອງສີທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ (ຫຼື ປະເພດທີ່ໃກ້ຄຽງທີ່ສຸດກັບການກະຈາຍຂອງສີທີ່ເລືອກມາ). ໝູນ (ດ້ວຍ Ctrl+ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌) ຈົນກວ່າຕົວຢ່າງສີທີ່ເລືອກຈະຕົກຢູ່ພາຍໃນ (ຫຼື ໃກ້ຄຽງ) ເສັ້ນນຳທາງຄວາມກົມກືນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If some of the picked samples fall outside of the guide lines, perform manipulations of the image's colors until they fall within the guides. You can use any processing module to achieve this but multiple masked instances of [_color balance rgb_](../../processing-modules/color-balance-rgb.md) usually provide the best results.\n"
msgstr "ຫາກມີບາງສີທີ່ເລືອກຕົກຢູ່ຂ້າງນອກເສັ້ນນຳທາງ, ໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງສີຂອງຮູບຈົນກວ່າພວກມັນຈະຕົກຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດຂອງເສັ້ນນຳທາງ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນໃດກໍໄດ້ເພື່ອເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້, ແຕ່ການໃຊ້ [_color balance rgb_](../../processing-modules/color-balance-rgb.md) ຫຼາຍໆອັນຮ່ວມກັບໜ້າກາກ (mask) ມັກຈະໃຫ້ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bear in mind that these controls are provided as a basic guide to achieving color harmony -- do not try to force colors into the guides at the expense of the overall look of the image. For some useful examples of how to use this functionality, please see the [pull request](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/pull/13275) that implemented the original change.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍໃຫ້ຈື່ໄວ້ວ່າການຄວບຄຸມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກໃຫ້ໄວ້ເພື່ອເປັນແນວທາງພື້ນຖານໃນການສ້າງຄວາມກົມກືນຂອງສີ -- ຢ່າພະຍາຍາມບັງຄັບສີໃຫ້ເຂົ້າຫາເສັ້ນນຳທາງຈົນເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບລວມຂອງຮູບເບິ່ງບໍ່ດີ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດກ່ຽວກັບວິທີໃຊ້ງານຟັງຊັນນີ້, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ [pull request](https://github.com/darktable-org/darktable/pull/13275) ທີ່ໄດ້ນຳສະເໜີການປ່ຽນແປງຕົ້ນສະບັບ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The hue ring is not a [gamut check](../darkroom/gamut/), as a color can be within the hue ring, yet out of gamut due to its darkness/lightness.\n"
msgstr "ວົງແຫວນເນື້ອສີບໍ່ແມ່ນ [ການກວດສອບຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut check)](../darkroom/gamut/), ເພາະສີອາດຈະຢູ່ພາຍໃນວົງແຫວນເນື້ອສີ ແຕ່ອາດຈະຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດສີ (out of gamut) ຍ້ອນຄວາມມືດ/ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງມັນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When adjusting an image based upon a color checker, faster and more accurate results will come from using [calibrate with a color checker](../../processing-modules/color-calibration/#extracting-settings-using-a-color-checker) in the _color calibration_ module.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອປັບແຕ່ງຮູບໂດຍອີງຕາມແຜ່ນສີທົດສອບ (color checker), ການໃຊ້ [ຄາລິເບຣດດ້ວຍແຜ່ນສີທົດສອບ](../../processing-modules/color-calibration/#extracting-settings-using-a-color-checker) ໃນໂມດູນ _color calibration_ ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນທີ່ໄວ ແລະ ຖືກຕ້ອງກວ່າ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The vectorscope does not have a \"skin tone line\", which is a flawed generalization rather than a universal standard.\n"
msgstr "ເວກເຕີສະໂຄບບໍ່ມີ \"ເສັ້ນໂທນສີຜິວ\", ເຊິ່ງເປັນການສະຫຼຸບແບບລວມໆທີ່ຜິດພາດ ຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນມາດຕະຖານສາກົນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The vectorscope represents a colorimetric encoding of an image, which inevitably diverges from a viewer's perception of the image.\n"
msgstr "ເວກເຕີສະໂຄບສະແດງເຖິງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຕາມຫຼັກການວັດແທກສີຂອງຮູບພາບ, ເຊິ່ງຫຼີກລ່ຽງບໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ຈະມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງຈາກການຮັບຮູ້ຂອງຜູ້ເບິ່ງຕໍ່ຮູບພາບນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "exposure adjustment"
msgstr "ການປັບແຕ່ງແສງ (exposure adjustment)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The histogram, waveform, and RGB parade scopes can be used to directly alter the _exposure_ and _black level_ of the [_exposure_](../../processing-modules/exposure.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ຮິສໂຕແກຣມ, waveform, ແລະ RGB parade ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າ _exposure_ (ການຮັບແສງ) ແລະ _black level_ (ລະດັບສີດຳ) ຂອງໂມດູນ [_exposure_](../../processing-modules/exposure.md) ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the histogram, click towards the right-hand side of the histogram and then drag right to increase or drag left to decrease the exposure. In a similar manner you can control the black level by clicking and dragging in the left-hand side.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຮິສໂຕແກຣມ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກໄປທາງເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງຮິສໂຕແກຣມ ແລ້ວລາກໄປທາງຂວາເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລາກໄປທາງຊ້າຍເພື່ອຫຼຸດຄ່າ exposure. ໃນທາງດຽວກັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມລະດັບສີດຳໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍມື.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For horizontal waveform and RGB parade, drag the upper portion of the scope up/down to increase/decrease exposure. Drag the lower portion up/down to increase/decrease the black level.\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ waveform ແນວນອນ ແລະ RGB parade, ໃຫ້ລາກສ່ວນເທິງຂອງ scope ຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ/ຫຼຸດ ຄ່າ exposure. ລາກສ່ວນລຸ່ມຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ/ຫຼຸດ ລະດັບສີດຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For vertical waveform and RGB parade scopes, the corresponding regions are to the right (exposure) and left (black level).\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບ waveform ແນວຕັ້ງ ແລະ RGB parade, ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຢູ່ທາງຂວາ (exposure) ແລະ ທາງຊ້າຍ (ລະດັບສີດຳ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also scroll in the appropriate area -- rather than dragging -- to adjust exposure and black point.\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ການເລື່ອນລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ -- ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການລາກ -- ເພື່ອປັບ exposure ແລະ ຈຸດສີດຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, you can override the default adjustment behavior as follows:\n"
msgstr "ສຸດທ້າຍ, ທ່ານສາມາດຂ້າມຜ່ານພຶດຕິກຳການປັບແຕ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "hold Ctrl+Shift while adjusting to override the soft limits (e.g. to significantly overexpose the image)\n"
msgstr "ກົດ Ctrl+Shift ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປັບເພື່ອຂ້າມຂີດຈຳກັດອ່ອນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເພື່ອດຶງແສງຮູບໃຫ້ເກີນໄປຫຼາຍໆ)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "hold Ctrl while adjusting to fine-tune the adjustment. Alternatively, right-click to enter a precise value for the adjustment\n"
msgstr "ກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປັບເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ລະອຽດຂຶ້ນ. ຫຼື ຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອປ້ອນຄ່າທີ່ແນ່ນອນສຳລັບການປັບແຕ່ງ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "double-click on the desired area to reset to the original value\n"
msgstr "ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພື່ອຣີເຊັດເປັນຄ່າເດີມ\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "histogram profile"
msgstr "ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮິສໂຕແກຣມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image data is converted to the _histogram profile_ before the scope data is calculated. You can choose this profile by right-clicking on the [soft-proof](../darkroom/soft-proof.md) or [gamut check](../darkroom/gamut.md) icons in the bottom module and then selecting the profile of interest. When soft-proof or gamut check is enabled, the scope is shown in the soft proof profile.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບຈະຖືກແປງເປັນ _ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮິສໂຕແກຣມ_ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຄຳນວນຂໍ້ມູນ scope. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ນີ້ໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ໄອຄອນ [ການກວດສອບສີກ່ອນພິມ (soft-proof)](../darkroom/soft-proof.md) ຫຼື [ການກວດສອບຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut check)](../darkroom/gamut.md) ໃນໂມດູນດ້ານລຸ່ມ ແລ້ວເລືອກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ soft-proof ຫຼື gamut check, scope ຈະສະແດງໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ soft-proof.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/scopes.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the scopes module runs at the end of the preview pixelpipe, it receives data in display color space. If you are using a display color space that is not \"well behaved\" (this is common for a device profile), then colors that are outside of the gamut of the display profile may be clipped or distorted.\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກໂມດູນ scopes ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງຂະບວນການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງ, ມັນຈຶ່ງໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຂອງການສະແດງຜົນ (display color space). ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ເປັນມາດຕະຖານ (ເຊິ່ງມັກພົບໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງອຸປະກອນ), ສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈໍສະແດງຜົນອາດຈະຖືກຕັດ ຫຼື ຜິດພ້ຽນໄປ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "geotagging"
msgstr "ການຕິດແທັກພູມສັນຖານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import and apply GPX track data to a selection of images.\n"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນເສັ້ນທາງ GPX ກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module is common to the [lighttable](../../../lighttable/_index.md) and [map](../../../map/_index.md) views. The map view provides an enhanced mode that allows you to preview the position of the images along the GPS tracks while adjusting the images' date/time offset and time zone.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ມີໃຊ້ທັງໃນມຸມມອງ [ໂຕະແສງ](../../../lighttable/_index.md) ແລະ [ແຜນທີ່](../../../map/_index.md). ມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່ໃຫ້ໂໝດທີ່ພິເສດກວ່າ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບພາບຕາມເສັ້ນທາງ GPS ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປັບຄ່າການຊົດເຊີຍ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ແລະ ເຂດເວລາຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "workflow overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A GPS receiver calculates its current position based on information it receives from satellites, and records it in a GPX file together with the current date and time. The Exif data of the images also contains a time stamp defined by the camera settings. The _geotagging_ module takes the time stamp of the image, looks up the position in the GPX file at that time, and stores the appropriate coordinates (latitude/longitude/elevation) in its database and the image's XMP sidecar file.\n"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງຮັບສັນຍານ GPS ຈະຄິດໄລ່ຕຳແໜ່ງປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍອີງຕາມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈາກດາວທຽມ, ແລະ ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ GPX ພ້ອມກັບວັນທີ ແລະ ເວລາປັດຈຸບັນ. ຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງຮູບພາບກໍມີການບັນທຶກເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງກ້ອງ. ໂມດູນ _ການຕິດແທັກພູມສັນຖານ_ ຈະນຳເອົາເວລາຂອງຮູບພາບໄປກວດສອບຫາຕຳແໜ່ງໃນໄຟລ໌ GPX ໃນເວລານັ້ນ, ແລ້ວເກັບຄ່າພິກັດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ (ເສັ້ນຂະໜານ/ເສັ້ນແວງ/ຄວາມສູງ) ໄວ້ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ໃນໄຟລ໌ຄູ່ XMP ຂອງຮູບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two problems may occur during this process:\n"
msgstr "ອາດມີສອງບັນຫາເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In contrast to GPS devices, most cameras don't record the time accurately.\n"
msgstr "ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກອຸປະກອນ GPS, ກ້ອງສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ບັນທຶກເວລາຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The time stored in the Exif data does not include the time zone. Most people set their camera to local time, whereas GPS devices store the time in the UTC (Universal Time, Coordinated, i.e. Greenwich (London)) time zone. If the time zones of the camera and GPX file differ, than the related location will be wrong.\n"
msgstr "ເວລາທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ບໍ່ໄດ້ລວມເອົາເຂດເວລາ. ຄົນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຕັ້ງເວລາກ້ອງຕາມເວລາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ອຸປະກອນ GPS ເກັບເວລາໃນເຂດເວລາ UTC (ເວລາສາກົນ). ຖ້າເຂດເວລາຂອງກ້ອງ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ GPX ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ກໍຈະຜິດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your image already shows the correct date/time and carries the UTC time stamp, you can directly apply the GPX track file without further adjustments.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າຮູບຂອງທ່ານສະແດງ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ມີເວລາ UTC ຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ເສັ້ນທາງ GPX ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງປັບແຕ່ງຫຍັງຕື່ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Otherwise follow the following process to correlate the time of the images and GPS track files\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອປັບເວລາຂອງຮູບພາບໃຫ້ກົງກັບໄຟລ໌ເສັ້ນທາງ GPS\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fix the camera time setting for a single image by manually entering the correct date/time for that image into the _date/time_ field. A good way to do this accurately is to take a photograph of a reliable time source. This can be any precise clock or, even better, the time displayed on your GPS device (bearing in mind that GPS devices normally _show_ the local time, even though they _store_ universal time). The difference (offset) between the time entered and the time stored in the image's Exif data will be shown in the _date/time offset_ field.\n"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງເວລາຂອງກ້ອງສຳລັບຮູບດຽວ ໂດຍການປ້ອນ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງລົງໃນຊ່ອງ _ວັນທີ/ເວລາ_. ວິທີທີ່ດີໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ຊັດເຈນຄື ຖ່າຍຮູບແຫຼ່ງເວລາທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້. ອາດຈະເປັນໂມງທີ່ທ່ຽງຕົງ ຫຼື ດີກວ່ານັ້ນຄື ເວລາທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ເທິງອຸປະກອນ GPS ຂອງທ່ານ (ຢ່າລືມວ່າປົກກະຕິອຸປະກອນ GPS ຈະ _ສະແດງ_ ເວລາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າມັນຈະ _ເກັບ_ ເວລາສາກົນກໍຕາມ). ສ່ວນຕ່າງ (offset) ລະຫວ່າງເວລາທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າ ແລະ ເວລາທີ່ເກັບໃນຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງຮູບ ຈະຖືກສະແດງໃນຊ່ອງ _ການຊົດເຊີຍວັນທີ/ເວລາ_.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Press the _lock_ button to lock the calculated offset in the module.\n"
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ _ລັອກ (lock)_ ເພື່ອລັອກຄ່າເລື່ອນທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ໄວ້ໃນໂມດູນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select all of the images you wish to adjust and click _apply offset_ to apply the calculated offset to those images.\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກຮູບທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງ ແລ້ວກົດ _ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນ (apply offset)_ ເພື່ອນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ໃສ່ຮູບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the camera time zone is not UTC, set the time zone in the _camera time zone_ field.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເຂດເວລາຂອງກ້ອງບໍ່ແມ່ນ UTC, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເຂດເວລາໃນຊ່ອງ _ເຂດເວລາກ້ອງ (camera time zone)_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the time setting corrected, you can now apply GPX tracking data using the _apply GPX track file_ button.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການຕິດຕາມ GPX ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ _ນຳໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕາມ GPX (apply GPX track file)_.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module controls (common)"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໂມດູນ (ທົ່ວໄປ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"date/time\n"
": This field is initialized with the date/time read from the first selected image (format `yyyy:mm:dd hh:mm:ss`) and can be modified to correct the date/time for that image. The individual date/time fields can be altered by scrolling over them with your mouse. If any field reaches its limit, the neighboring fields are automatically updated. For example, if you go over 60 on the minute field, the hour field will automatically be incremented. It is also possible to use milliseconds in this module if you enable [preferences > lighttable > show image time with milliseconds](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີ/ເວລາ\n"
": ຊ່ອງນີ້ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ອ່ານຈາກຮູບທຳອິດທີ່ເລືອກ (ຮູບແບບ `yyyy:mm:dd hh:mm:ss`) ແລະ ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອປັບປຸງ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບຮູບນັ້ນ. ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໂດຍການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ໃສ່ພວກມັນ. ຖ້າຊ່ອງໃດໜຶ່ງຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດ, ຊ່ອງຂ້າງຄຽງຈະຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າທ່ານປັບກາຍ 60 ໃນຊ່ອງນາທີ, ຊ່ອງຊົ່ວໂມງຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເອງ. ນອກນັ້ນ ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຫົວໜ່ວຍມີລີວິນາທີໃນໂມດູນນີ້ໄດ້ ຫາກທ່ານເປີດໃຊ້ [ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ໂຕະແສງ > ສະແດງເວລາຂອງຮູບເປັນມີລີວິນາທີ](../../../preferences-settings/lighttable.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"original date/time\n"
": The original date/time of the image is shown here for reference.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ຕົ້ນສະບັບ\n"
": ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ຕົ້ນສະບັບຂອງຮູບຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ນີ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"date/time offset\n"
": The calculated difference between the original date/time and that keyed in the _date/time_ field. If the calculated difference is greater than 9999 days 23 hours 59 minutes and 59 seconds, the offset is invalidated.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າເລື່ອນ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ\n"
": ຄ່າຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ລະຫວ່າງ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ຕົ້ນສະບັບ ແລະ ຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນໃສ່ໃນຊ່ອງ _ວັນທີ/ເວລາ_. ຖ້າຄ່າຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງທີ່ຄຳນວນໄດ້ນັ້ນຫຼາຍກວ່າ 9999 ວັນ 23 ຊົ່ວໂມງ 59 ນາທີ ແລະ 59 ວິນາທີ, ຄ່າເລື່ອນນັ້ນຈະຖືວ່າໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lock button\n"
": If the lock button is activated, the offset value is frozen. If you subsequently change the selected image(s), the new image date/time is updated using the locked offset. This allows you to apply the same offset to multiple groups of images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມລັອກ\n"
": ຖ້າປຸ່ມລັອກຖືກເປີດໃຊ້, ຄ່າເລື່ອນຈະຖືກຢຸດໄວ້ຄົງທີ່. ຫາກທ່ານປ່ຽນການເລືອກຮູບໃນພາຍຫຼັງ, ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ຂອງຮູບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນທີ່ລັອກໄວ້ນັ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນດຽວກັນກັບຮູບຫຼາຍໆກຸ່ມໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apply offset button\n"
": Apply the offset to selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນ\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apply date/time button\n"
": It is sometimes useful to be able to set the absolute date/time for an image, for example where this information is missing. This button allows you to apply the date/time entered in the _date/time_ field to the selected images, without considering the previous value. You can use Ctrl+Z to undo any unwanted changes.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມນຳໃຊ້ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ\n"
": ບາງຄັ້ງມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ແນ່ນອນໃຫ້ກັບຮູບ, ຕົວຢ່າງ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຫາຍໄປ. ປຸ່ມນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານນຳໃຊ້ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າໃນຊ່ອງ _ວັນທີ/ເວລາ_ ໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຄ່າເກົ່າ. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Ctrl+Z ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"camera time zone\n"
": Select the camera's time zone. Start typing to show a list of permitted values.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຂດເວລາຂອງກ້ອງ\n"
": ເລືອກເຂດເວລາຂອງກ້ອງ. ເລີ່ມພິມເພື່ອສະແດງລາຍການຄ່າທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apply GPX track file (lighttable view only)\n"
": Apply a GPX track file. Click the corresponding button and navigate to the GPX file. You can use Ctrl+Z to undo any unwanted changes. Within the file chooser window, the preview button lists the tracks of the selected GPX file along with the following information: track name, start and end date/time (local time), number of track points and number of selected images that will be geotagged.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕາມ GPX (ສະເພາະມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ)\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຕິດຕາມ GPX. ກົດປຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ ແລະ ເລືອກໄປຫາໄຟລ໌ GPX. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Ctrl+Z ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ. ພາຍໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມເລືອກໄຟລ໌, ປຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງຈະສະແດງລາຍການເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໄຟລ໌ GPX ທີ່ເລືອກ ພ້ອມກັບຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງນີ້: ຊື່ເສັ້ນທາງ, ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດ (ເວລາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ), ຈຳນວນຈຸດຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ຈຳນວນຮູບທີ່ເລືອກທີ່ຈະຖືກໃສ່ຂໍ້ມູນພິກັດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module controls (map view)"
msgstr "ການຄວບຄຸມໂມດູນ (ມຸມມອງແຜນທີ່)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"GPX file\n"
": The path of the GPX file selected.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄຟລ໌ GPX\n"
": ເສັ້ນທາງຂອງໄຟລ໌ GPX ທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"track list\n"
": This table shows the start date/time of each track, along with the number of track points and the number of matching images. When a check button is activated, the related track is displayed on the map. A check button in the table header allows you to select or de-select all of the tracks at once. Hover over a row with your mouse to display the start and end times both in local time (LT) and UTC. To reset the map zoom and show the complete set of tracks, double-click on a track in the list, or single-click on the track list header. You can also assign a keyboard shortcut ([preferences > shortcuts > utility modules > geotagging > view entire track](../../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)).\n"
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການເສັ້ນທາງ\n"
": ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສະແດງ ວັນທີ/ເວລາ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງແຕ່ລະເສັ້ນທາງ, ພ້ອມກັບຈຳນວນຈຸດຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ຈຳນວນຮູບທີ່ກົງກັນ. ເມື່ອຕິກເລືອກປຸ່ມ, ເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກສະແດງເທິງແຜນທີ່. ປຸ່ມຕິກໃນຫົວຂໍ້ຕາຕະລາງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກທຸກເສັ້ນທາງພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງໃສ່ແຖວໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອສະແດງເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດ ທັງໃນເວລາທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (LT) ແລະ UTC. ເພື່ອຣີເຊັດການຊູມແຜນທີ່ ແລະ ສະແດງເສັ້ນທາງທັງໝົດ, ໃຫ້ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ເສັ້ນທາງໃນລາຍການ ຫຼື ຄລິກຄັ້ງດຽວໃສ່ຫົວຂໍ້ລາຍການເສັ້ນທາງ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດໄດ້ ([ຄ່າກຳນົດ > ປຸ່ມລັດ > ໂມດູນອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກ > ການໃສ່ພິກັດ > ເບິ່ງເສັ້ນທາງທັງໝົດ](../../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preview images\n"
": If checked, the matching images are displayed on the map along the visible tracks.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຮູບ\n"
": ຖ້າຕິກເລືອກ, ຮູບທີ່ກົງກັນຈະຖືກສະແດງເທິງແຜນທີ່ຕາມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ເຫັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"select images\n"
": If you don't wish to apply an offset to all of the selected images, but only to the matching images, use this button to select images. If you don't want to lose the current offset you may want to lock it before changing the selection.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຮູບ\n"
": ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກທັງໝົດ, ແຕ່ຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ສະເພາະຮູບທີ່ກົງກັນ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມນີ້ເພື່ອເລືອກຮູບ. ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນປັດຈຸບັນຫາຍໄປ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງລັອກມັນໄວ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນການເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"counts\n"
": A count of the number of matching images and the number selected is displayed to the right of the _select images_ button.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນ\n"
": ຈຳນວນຮູບທີ່ກົງກັນ ແລະ ຈຳນວນຮູບທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງຂ້າງຂວາຂອງປຸ່ມ _ເລືອກຮູບ_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apply geo-location\n"
": This button is displayed when the offset is null. The _apply geo-location_ button applies the GPX data to matching images on selected tracks.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ພິກັດພູມສາດ\n"
": ປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຄ່າເລື່ອນເປັນສູນ. ປຸ່ມ _ນຳໃຊ້ພິກັດພູມສາດ (apply geo-location)_ ຈະນຳໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນ GPX ໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ກົງກັນໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apply offset and geo-location\n"
": This button is displayed once an offset has been entered. As a reminder, the _apply offset_ button applies the offset to all selected images. Unlike _apply offset_, the _apply offset and geo-location_ button applies the offset _and the GPX data_ to matching images on selected tracks.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນ ແລະ ພິກັດພູມສາດ\n"
": ປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີການປ້ອນຄ່າເລື່ອນເຂົ້າໄປ. ເພື່ອເປັນການເຕືອນ, ປຸ່ມ _ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນ_ ຈະນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນໃສ່ທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ. ແຕ່ຕ່າງຈາກ _ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນ_, ປຸ່ມ _ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນ ແລະ ພິກັດພູມສາດ_ ຈະນຳໃຊ້ທັງຄ່າເລື່ອນ _ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນ GPX_ ໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ກົງກັນໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/geotagging.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use Ctrl+Z to undo any unwanted changes (twice in case of _apply offset and geo-location_).\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Ctrl+Z ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ (ກົດສອງຄັ້ງໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ _ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່າເລື່ອນ ແລະ ພິກັດພູມສາດ_).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "focus peaking"
msgstr "ການເນັ້ນຈຸດໂຟກັດ (focus peaking)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Identify which parts of the image contain high contrast details such as edges and textures, which are usually a useful guide to sharpness and therefore focus.\n"
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າສ່ວນໃດຂອງຮູບມີລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ມີຄວາມຄົມຊັດສູງ ເຊັ່ນ ຂອບ ແລະ ພື້ນຜິວ, ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະເປັນຕົວຊ່ວຍໃນການເບິ່ງຄວາມຄົມຊັດ ແລະ ຈຸດໂຟກັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the module by clicking on the ![focus-peaking-icon](./focus-peaking/focus-peaking-icon.png#icon) icon. The sharpest parts of the image will be highlighted with a yellow, green and blue overlay:\n"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ໄອຄອນ ![focus-peaking-icon](./focus-peaking/focus-peaking-icon.png#icon). ສ່ວນທີ່ຄົມຊັດທີ່ສຸດຂອງຮູບຈະຖືກເນັ້ນດ້ວຍສີເຫຼືອງ, ສີຂຽວ ແລະ ສີຟ້າ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Focus peaking works by filtering out most of the image noise, measuring the intensity gradients in the image and calculating average and standard deviation statistics. When the gradient of an edge differs significantly from the mean, the associated pixels are marked with a \"heat map\" indicating how sharp the edge is.\n"
msgstr "Focus peaking ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍການກັ່ນຕອງສິ່ງລົບກວນ (noise) ອອກຈາກຮູບ, ວັດແທກຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງການໄລ່ລະດັບສີໃນຮູບ ແລະ ຄິດໄລ່ສະຖິຕິຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ ແລະ ຄ່າຜັນປ່ຽນມາດຕະຖານ. ເມື່ອການໄລ່ລະດັບສີຂອງຂອບແຕກຕ່າງຈາກຄ່າສະເລ່ຍຢ່າງມີໄນສຳຄັນ, ພິກເຊວທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກໝາຍດ້ວຍ \"ແຜນທີ່ຄວາມຮ້ອນ (heat map)\" ເພື່ອບອກວ່າຂອບນັ້ນຄົມຊັດປານໃດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_yellow_ represents a large (6σ) jump in gradient, indicating a very sharp edge.\n"
msgstr ""
"_ສີເຫຼືອງ_ ແທນການກະໂດດຂັ້ນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ (6σ) ໃນກຣາດຽນ, ເຊິ່ງຊີ້ບອກເຖິງຂອບທີ່ຄົມຊັດຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_green_ represents a medium (4σ) jump in gradient, indicating a reasonably sharp edge.\n"
msgstr ""
"_ສີຂຽວ_ ແທນການກະໂດດຂັ້ນຂະໜາດກາງ (4σ) ໃນກຣາດຽນ, ເຊິ່ງຊີ້ບອກເຖິງຂອບທີ່ຄົມຊັດປານກາງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_blue_ represents a small (2σ) jump in gradient, indicating a slightly sharp edge.\n"
msgstr ""
"_ສີຟ້າ_ ແທນການກະໂດດຂັ້ນຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ (2σ) ໃນກຣາດຽນ, ເຊິ່ງຊີ້ບອກເຖິງຂອບທີ່ຄົມຊັດເລັກນ້ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** While the algorithm in this module generally does a good job of locating the sharpest parts of an image, it does not necessarily detect _whether_ an image is sharp. Additionally, as it uses local contrast to detect sharpness, it will also highlight the edges of dark objects against bright backgrounds (and vice versa) even if those edges are blurred. Because it runs at the end of the pixelpipe, it may also detect the results of any sharpening you have performed within darktable.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າລະບົບໃນໂມດູນນີ້ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີໃນການຊອກຫາສ່ວນທີ່ຄົມຊັດທີ່ສຸດຂອງຮູບ, ແຕ່ມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າມັນຈະກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າຮູບນັ້ນຄົມຊັດ _ແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່_. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນໃຊ້ຄວາມຄົມຊັດສະເພາະຈຸດເພື່ອຫາຄວາມຄົມ, ມັນຍັງຈະເນັ້ນຂອບຂອງວັດຖຸສີເຂັ້ມທີ່ຕັດກັບພື້ນຫຼັງສີສະຫວ່າງ (ແລະ ກົງກັນຂ້າມ) ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຂອບເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະເບີກໍຕາມ. ເພາະວ່າມັນເຮັດວຽກໃນຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍຂອງ pixelpipe, ມັນອາດຈະກວດພົບຜົນຂອງການເພີ່ມຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃດໆທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ເຮັດພາຍໃນ darktable ນຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following example image was taken with a wide aperture to give a shallow depth of field, and you can see how the camera has focused on the chinese character written on the second red lantern along from the front. There are also stems of the pink flowers that fall within the area of acceptable sharpness around the focal plane, and these have also been marked up with yellow and green.\n"
msgstr "ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກຖ່າຍດ້ວຍຮູຮັບແສງກວ້າງເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີໄລຍະຊັດຕື້ນ (shallow depth of field), ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ວ່າກ້ອງໄດ້ໂຟກັດໃສ່ຕົວອັກສອນຈີນທີ່ຂຽນຢູ່ເທິງໂຄມໄຟສີແດງອັນທີສອງນັບຈາກດ້ານໜ້າ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນຍັງມີກ້ານດອກໄມ້ສີບົວທີ່ຢູ່ໃນໄລຍະຄວາມຄົມຊັດທີ່ຍອມຮັບໄດ້ອ້ອມຮອບລະນາບໂຟກັດ, ແລະ ສ່ວນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ກໍຖືກໝາຍດ້ວຍສີເຫຼືອງ ແລະ ສີຂຽວນຳ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/focus-peaking.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![focus-peaking-overview](./focus-peaking/focus-peaking-overview.png#w75)\n"
msgstr "![ພາບລວມການເນັ້ນຈຸດໂຟກັດ](./focus-peaking/focus-peaking-overview.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "metadata editor"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit the metadata of selected images.\n"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບ (metadata) ຂອງຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Metadata is freeformat text (title, description, creator, publisher, rights etc.) that describes your images.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມຮູບແບບອິດສະຫຼະ (ຫົວຂໍ້, ລາຍລະອຽດ, ຜູ້ສ້າງ, ຜູ້ເຜີຍແຜ່, ລິຂະສິດ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ທີ່ອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບຮູບຂອງທ່ານ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"reset\n"
": Delete visible metadata (see below) from the selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຣີເຊັດ\n"
": ລຶບຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບທີ່ເຫັນຢູ່ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ) ອອກຈາກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"metadata entry fields\n"
": A separate entry field is displayed for each visible metadata item, containing its current value (if any). Press Ctrl+Enter to insert a new line in a field. Double-click on a field's label to delete the contents of that field.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບ\n"
": ຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈະຖືກສະແດງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບທີ່ເຫັນຢູ່, ເຊິ່ງບັນຈຸຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງມັນ (ຖ້າມີ). ກົດ Ctrl+Enter ເພື່ອຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ. ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອລຶບເນື້ອໃນໃນຊ່ອງນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": When several images are selected that have differing values for a given field, the module displays \"_\\<leave unchanged\\>_\" for that field -- if you choose to apply changes, these fields will not be changed. If you right-click on such a field, the different values are listed at the end of the contextual menu. Select one of those values to apply that value to all of the selected images.\n"
msgstr ": ເມື່ອເລືອກຮູບຫຼາຍຮູບທີ່ມີຄ່າແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃດໜຶ່ງ, ໂມດູນຈະສະແດງ \"_\\<ປ່ອຍໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ\\>_\" ສຳລັບຊ່ອງນັ້ນ -- ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງ, ຊ່ອງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກປ່ຽນ. ຫາກທ່ານຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊ່ອງດັ່ງກ່າວ, ຄ່າຕ່າງໆຈະຖືກສະແດງລາຍການຢູ່ທ້າຍເມນູ. ເລືອກຄ່າໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ຄ່ານັ້ນກັບທຸກຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Hold Ctrl while scrolling with your mouse to increase the height of a field's entry box.\n"
msgstr ": ກົດ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມສູງຂອງກ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"apply\n"
": Apply new settings from the metadata entry fields to the selected images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້\n"
": ນຳໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ຈາກຊ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບໃສ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You may use the keyboard to navigate and apply changes while any of the metadata entry boxes have focus, as follows:\n"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄີບອດເພື່ອໄປມາ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນຂະນະທີ່ກ່ອງປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບໃດໜຶ່ງກຳລັງຖືກເລືອກຢູ່ ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Tab key saves the current field and moves the cursor to the next field. When the last field is reached, the Tab key returns focus to the first field.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ Tab ຈະບັນທຶກຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນປັດຈຸບັນ ແລະ ເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີໄປຊ່ອງຖັດໄປ. ເມື່ອຮອດຊ່ອງສຸດທ້າຍ, ປຸ່ມ Tab ຈະກັບຄືນມາທີ່ຊ່ອງທຳອິດ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shift+Tab works the same as Tab, but in the opposite direction.\n"
msgstr "Shift+Tab ເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບ Tab, ແຕ່ໄປໃນທິດທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Enter key saves the current field without moving the cursor.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມ Enter ຈະບັນທຶກຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນປັດຈຸບັນໂດຍບໍ່ເລື່ອນເຄີເຊີ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"preferences\" option in the presets menu brings up a dialog where you can configure what metadata tags to display and how they are handled within darktable. For each metadata item, two check boxes allow you to restrict how metadata is handled as follows:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ \"ຄ່າກຳນົດ\" ໃນເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ຈະເປີດປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າແທັກຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບທີ່ຈະສະແດງ ແລະ ວິທີການຈັດການໃນ darktable. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບ, ຈະມີສອງຊ່ອງຕິກໃຫ້ທ່ານຈຳກັດວິທີການຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"visible\n"
": Show or hide this metadata field. Hidden fields are not included in exported images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ (visible)\n"
": ສະແດງ ຫຼື ຊ່ອນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບນີ້. ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກຊ່ອນຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"private\n"
": Keep this metadata field private. Private fields are not included in exported images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຕົວ (private)\n"
": ເກັບຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບນີ້ໄວ້ເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ. ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນຕົວຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນຮູບທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The display name of a metadata field can be changed by clicking on it. Drag-and-drop the rows to change the display order.\n"
msgstr "ຊື່ທີ່ສະແດງຂອງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໃສ່ມັນ. ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ແຕ່ລະແຖວເພື່ອປ່ຽນລຳດັບການສະແດງຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To add new metadata fields to the module, press the \"+\" button at the bottom of the dialog. This will allow you to search for the tags you want to add in a new dialog. Tags can be added by either double-clicking on a tag name or pressing the \"add\" button. Press \"done\" to update the metadata editor with the new tags. Exif tags which are added in the editor are read from the image file on [import](../lighttable/import.md). For already imported images they can be read using [refresh exif](../lighttable/selected-image.md#metadata-tab) on selected images.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບໃໝ່ໃສ່ໂມດູນ, ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ \"+\" ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມຂອງປ່ອງຢ້ຽມ. ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄົ້ນຫາແທັກທີ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມໃນປ່ອງຢ້ຽມໃໝ່. ສາມາດເພີ່ມແທັກໄດ້ໂດຍການດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ແທັກ ຫຼື ກົດປຸ່ມ \"ເພີ່ມ (add)\". ກົດ \"ສຳເລັດ (done)\" ເພື່ອອັບເດດຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນກຳກັບດ້ວຍແທັກໃໝ່. ແທັກ Exif ທີ່ເພີ່ມໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂຈະຖືກອ່ານຈາກໄຟລ໌ຮູບຕອນ [ນຳເຂົ້າ](../lighttable/import.md). ສຳລັບຮູບທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າມາແລ້ວ, ສາມາດອ່ານພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ [ໂຫຼດ exif ໃໝ່ (refresh exif)](../lighttable/selected-image.md#metadata-tab) ໃນຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "All tags in this module are available for display in the [image information](./image-information.md) module, updating in the [import](../lighttable/import.md) module and filtering in the [collections](./collections.md) module.\n"
msgstr "ທຸກແທັກໃນໂມດູນນີ້ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ [ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ](./image-information.md), ອັບເດດໃນໂມດູນ [ນຳເຂົ້າ](../lighttable/import.md) ແລະ ກັ່ນຕອງໃນໂມດູນ [ຄໍເລັກຊັນ](./collections.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/metadata-editor.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The field values can be used in [variable substitution](../../../special-topics/variables.md) using the full case-sensitive Xmp tag name as the variable name (e.g. `Xmp.iptc.location`).\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າໃນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນ [ການແທນທີ່ຕົວປ່ຽນ](../../../special-topics/variables.md) ໂດຍໃຊ້ຊື່ແທັກ Xmp ເຕັມ (ທີ່ຈຳແນກຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ-ໃຫຍ່) ເປັນຊື່ຕົວປ່ຽນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: `Xmp.iptc.location`).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "image information"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Display information embedded within an image's Exif data as well as a number of additional data fields defined by darktable.\n"
msgstr "ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຝັງຢູ່ໃນຂໍ້ມູນ Exif ຂອງຮູບ ພ້ອມທັງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ darktable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When hovering with the mouse over image thumbnails, the displayed data is automatically updated to show information about the image currently under the mouse cursor.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງໄວ້ເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສະແດງຈະຖືກອັບເດດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຮູບທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງເຄີເຊີເມົາສ໌ໃນຂະນະນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When several images are selected and the focus is not on a single image, the module only displays information that is the same for all images. If any fields differ between the images, the text \"_\\<various values\\>_\" is displayed instead.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການເລືອກຮູບຫຼາຍຮູບ ແລະ ຈຸດໂຟກັດບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ທີ່ຮູບດຽວ, ໂມດູນຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄືກັນສຳລັບທຸກຮູບ. ຫາກມີຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃດແຕກຕ່າງກັນ, ຂໍ້ຄວາມ \"_\\<ຫຼາຍຄ່າ\\>_\" ຈະຖືກສະແດງແທນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "While you are in the lighttable view, you can double-click on the _filmroll_ field for a given image to show all images in that image's film roll.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານຢູ່ໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ, ທ່ານສາມາດດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ຊ່ອງ _ມ້ວນຟີມ (filmroll)_ ຂອງຮູບໃດໜຶ່ງ ເພື່ອສະແດງຮູບທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ໃນມ້ວນຟີມດຽວກັນນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The “preferences…” option in the presets menu brings up a dialog with a list of all fields that are available for display.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກ “ຄຸນສົມບັດ…” (preferences) ໃນເມນູຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ກ່ອນ (presets) ຈະສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງພ້ອມກັບລາຍ"
"ຊື່ຂອງທຸກຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ເລືອກສະແດງຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The _visible_ checkbox allows you to choose which fields to display. You can also drag and drop one row at a time to change the display order.\n"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງຕິກ _ສະແດງ (visible)_ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະສະແດງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນໃດແດ່. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ແຕ່ລະແຖວເພື່ອປ່ຽນລຳດັບການສະແດງຜົນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/image-information.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "These preferences can be saved as module presets. Press the module's reset button to make all available information visible and displayed in its default order.\n"
msgstr "ຄ່າກຳນົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດບັນທຶກເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຂອງໂມດູນໄດ້. ກົດປຸ່ມຣີເຊັດຂອງໂມດູນເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ່ຢູ່ສະແດງອອກມາ ແລະ ຈັດລຽງຕາມລຳດັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "shared"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The filmstrip can be used to quickly switch between images. The images shown are the same as those displayed in the lighttable view and are defined by the currently-selected collection.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບຟິມ (filmstrip) ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງຮູບພາບໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ. ຮູບພາບທີ່ສະແດງແມ່ນຮູບດຽວກັນກັບທີ່ສະແດງໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ ແລະ ຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຊຸດສະສົມທີ່ເລືອກໃນປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![filmstrip](./filmstrip/filmstrip.png)\n"
msgstr "![ແຖບຟິມ](./filmstrip/filmstrip.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The filmstrip can be switched on and off using the shortcut Ctrl+F. The height of the filmstrip panel can be changed by clicking and dragging its top border.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບຟິມສາມາດເປີດ ແລະ ປິດໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດ Ctrl+F. ຄວາມສູງຂອງແຜງແຖບຟິມສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກຂອບດ້ານເທິງຂອງມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quickly navigate through the images in the filmstrip by scrolling with the mouse. Increase scroll speed with Shift+scroll. Change the height of the filmstrip with Ctrl+scroll or by clicking+dragging the top of the panel. Change the [custom sort](./collection-filters.md#custom-sort) order of images by dragging and dropping image thumbnails.\n"
msgstr "ເລື່ອນເບິ່ງຮູບພາບໃນແຖບຟິມໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວໂດຍການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌. ເພີ່ມຄວາມໄວໃນການເລື່ອນດ້ວຍ Shift+ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌. ປ່ຽນຄວາມສູງຂອງແຖບຟິມດ້ວຍ Ctrl+ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌ ຫຼື ໂດຍການຄລິກ+ລາກສ່ວນເທິງຂອງແຜງ. ປ່ຽນລຳດັບ [ການຈັດລຽງຕາມໃຈ](./collection-filters.md#custom-sort) ຂອງຮູບພາບໂດຍການລາກ ແລະ ວາງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the darkroom, the image currently being processed is selected and highlighted. Click on or hover over a different image on the filmstrip with your mouse in order to act on it with a keyboard shortcut _without changing the image being processed_. Double-click on an image to open it for editing.\n"
msgstr "ໃນຫ້ອງມືດ, ຮູບພາບທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນຢູ່ຈະຖືກເລືອກ ແລະ ເນັ້ນໃຫ້ເຫັນ. ຄລິກ ຫຼື ເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປຈໍ້ໃສ່ຮູບອື່ນໃນແຖບຟິມ ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການກັບມັນດ້ວຍປຸ່ມລັດຄີບອດ _ໂດຍບໍ່ປ່ຽນຮູບທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນຢູ່_. ດັບເບິນຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບເພື່ອເປີດມັນຂຶ້ນມາແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you wish to select multiple images in the filmstrip, click to select the first image followed by either Ctrl+click to select or de-select further images, or Shift+click to select a range of images.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການເລືອກຮູບພາບຫຼາຍອັນໃນແຖບຟິມ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກເລືອກຮູບທຳອິດ ແລ້ວໃຊ້ Ctrl+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອເລືອກ ຫຼື ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກຮູບອື່ນໆ, ຫຼື Shift+ຄລິກ ເພື່ອເລືອກຮູບເປັນຊ່ວງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following shortcuts can be used to select images in the filmstrip:\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລືອກຮູບພາບໃນແຖບຟິມ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+A` selects all images in the filmstrip\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+A` ເລືອກຮູບພາບທັງໝົດໃນແຖບຟິມ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+Shift+A` deselects all images\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+Shift+A` ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກຮູບພາບທັງໝົດ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+I` inverts the current selection\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+I` ສະຫຼັບການເລືອກ (ອັນທີ່ເລືອກເປັນບໍ່ເລືອກ, ອັນທີ່ບໍ່ເລືອກເປັນເລືອກ)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following shortcuts can be used to perform operations on the selected images\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການກັບຮູບພາບທີ່ເລືອກ\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Ctrl+X` copies the settings of the of the last changed module to all selected images\n"
msgstr "`Ctrl+X` ຄັດລອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ປ່ຽນແປງຫຼ້າສຸດໄປຫາຮູບທີ່ເລືອກທັງໝົດ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the lighttable's [history stack](../lighttable/history-stack.md) module documentation for more information about the copy and paste functionality.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງເອກະສານຂອງໂມດູນ [ລຳດັບປະຫວັດ (history stack)](../lighttable/history-stack.md) ໃນໂຕະແສງ ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ງານຄັດລອກ ແລະ ວາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/shared/filmstrip.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The filmstrip image under the cursor can be pinned to the [second darkroom window](../../../darkroom/darkroom-view-layout/#bottom-panel) by assigning a shortcut to [utility modules > filmstrip > pin in second window](../../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md).\n"
msgstr "ຮູບໃນແຖບຟິມທີ່ຢູ່ກ້ອງຕົວຊີ້ ສາມາດປັກໝຸດໄວ້ທີ່ [ໜ້າຕ່າງຫ້ອງມືດທີສອງ](../../../darkroom/darkroom-view-layout/#bottom-panel) ໄດ້ໂດຍການກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດໃຫ້ກັບ [ໂມດູນອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກ > ແຖບຟິມ > ປັກໝຸດໃນໜ້າຕ່າງທີສອງ](../../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "print settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການພິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage settings for the [print view](../../../print/_index.md) and initiate printing.\n"
msgstr "ຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳລັບມຸມມອງການພິມ ແລະ ເລີ່ມການພິມ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "printer"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງພິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"printer\n"
": Select one of the installed printers.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຄື່ອງພິມ\n"
": ເລືອກເຄື່ອງພິມທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"media\n"
": The type of media loaded on the printer (Plain Paper, Luster Photo Paper, etc.).\n"
msgstr ""
"ສື່/ເຈ້ຍ\n"
": ປະເພດເຈ້ຍທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນເຄື່ອງພິມ (ເຈ້ຍທຳມະດາ, ເຈ້ຍຮູບພາບ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"profile\n"
": The printer's ICC profile for the loaded paper. This is the profile specific to the printer and paper. This profile is the last color space transformation applied to the image whose goal is to create a high quality print.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌\n"
": ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ICC ຂອງເຄື່ອງພິມສຳລັບເຈ້ຍທີ່ໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"intent\n"
": The print rendering intent (“perceptual”, “relative colorimetric”, “saturation” or “absolute colorimetric”). See [rendering intent](../../../special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"intent\n"
": ຮູບແບບການຖ່າຍທອດສີໃນການພິມ (perceptual, relative colorimetric, saturation ຫຼື "
"absolute colorimetric). ເບິ່ງ [rendering intent](../../../special-topics/color-"
"management/rendering-intent.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"black point compensation\n"
": Whether to adjust the black point of the output profile, which is often lighter than the input profile. This should be “on” when the _intent_ is set to “relative colorimetric”.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຊົດເຊີຍຈຸດດຳ (black point compensation)\n"
": ຈະປັບຈຸດດຳຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂາອອກຫຼືບໍ່, ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະແຈ້ງກວ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂາເຂົ້າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຄວນ “ເປີດ” ເມື່ອ _ຈຸດປະສົ"
"ງ (intent)_ ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ “relative colorimetric”.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "page"
msgstr "ໜ້າເຈ້ຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"paper size\n"
": The size of the paper on which to print.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດເຈ້ຍ\n"
": ຂະໜາດຂອງເຈ້ຍທີ່ຈະພິມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"orientation\n"
": Portrait or landscape (note that darktable chooses the best fit by default).\n"
msgstr ""
"ແນວວາງ\n"
": ລວງຕັ້ງ ຫຼື ລວງນອນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"units\n"
": The unit to use for setting the margins: “mm”, “cm”, or “inch”.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫົວໜ່ວຍ (units)\n"
": ຫົວໜ່ວຍທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອບ: “ມມ”, “ຊມ”, ຫຼື “ນິ້ວ”.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"margins\n"
": Set each margin separately, or all together by clicking on the middle “lock” button.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຂອບ (margins)\n"
": ຕັ້ງແຕ່ລະຂອບແຍກກັນ, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງພ້ອມກັນທັງໝົດໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ “ລັອກ” ຢູ່ເຄິ່ງກາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"display grid\n"
": Select the grid size using the entry field (expressed in the currently selected unit). Tick the option to display the grid on the canvas.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງເສັ້ນຕາຕະລາງ\n"
": ຕັ້ງຂະໜາດ ແລະ ສະແດງເສັ້ນຕາຕະລາງເທິງໜ້າເຈ້ຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"snap to grid\n"
": Help setting the image areas by snapping them to the grid for proper alignment.\n"
msgstr ""
"ດູດຕິດເສັ້ນຕາຕະລາງ (snap to grid)\n"
": ຊ່ວຍຈັດວາງຮູບພາບໃຫ້ກົງກັບເສັ້ນຕາຕະລາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"borderless mode required\n"
": Indicates whether the printer borderless mode is to be activated. This item is activated when the user's margins are smaller than the printer hardware margins. Note that it is only an indicator as it does not activate the borderless mode automatically.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງການໂໝດໄຮ້ຂອບ\n"
": ບົ່ງບອກວ່າຕ້ອງເປີດໂໝດພິມໄຮ້ຂອບຫຼືບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "image layout"
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"image width/height\n"
": This information field displays the actual image width and height (given with the selected units) on the paper.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງ/ຄວາມສູງ ຂອງຮູບ\n"
": ສະແດງຂະໜາດແທ້ຈິງຂອງຮູບທີ່ຈະພິມລົງເທິງເຈ້ຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"scale factor\n"
": This information field displays the scaling of the image to fit on the paper. If this value is less than 1 the image is down-scaled, otherwise it is up-scaled. This is an important factor to watch -- a value that is too large (up-scale) may result in a low quality print. The corresponding dpi (dots per inch) is also displayed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ອັດຕາສ່ວນການຂະຫຍາຍ\n"
": ສະແດງການປັບຂະໜາດຮູບໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບເຈ້ຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"alignment\n"
": Select the alignment of the image on its area.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດວາງ\n"
": ເລືອກຕຳແໜ່ງການວາງຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"new image area button\n"
": Create a new image area. Drag and drop on the canvas to place it. If the option snap to grid is activated the area can be easily aligned to the grid lines. An image can be placed into this area by dragging it from the filmstrip and dropping it on the new area.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ຮູບໃໝ່\n"
": ສ້າງພື້ນທີ່ສຳລັບວາງຮູບພາບໃໝ່ເທິງໜ້າເຈ້ຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"delete image area button\n"
": Remove the currently selected image area from the composition.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມລົບພື້ນທີ່ຮູບ\n"
": ເອົາພື້ນທີ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clear layout button\n"
": Remove all the image areas leaving the canvas empty.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມລ້າງການຈັດວາງ\n"
": ລົບພື້ນທີ່ຮູບທັງໝົດອອກເພື່ອໃຫ້ໜ້າເຈ້ຍວ່າງເປົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following four fields represent the position of currently selected area on the page -- the top/left corner on the first line and the width/height of the area on the second line.\n"
msgstr "ສີ່ຊ່ອງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ສະແດງຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ຮູບທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When hovering an image area its position and size are displayed. It is also possible to grab the side and corner of the area to change the size or to drag the whole area to change its position.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປວາງເທິງພື້ນທີ່ຮູບ, ຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຈະຖືກສະແດງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The page layout can be recorded using a preset.\n"
msgstr "ການຈັດວາງໜ້າເຈ້ຍສາມາດບັນທຶກເປັນ preset ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"profile\n"
": The export profile to use. This profile is the entry point used for the next transformation using the printer's ICC profile. Usually it is better to prefer a large gamut (e.g. Adobe RGB) rather than a smaller one (e.g. sRGB).\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌\n"
": ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສົ່ງອອກທີ່ຈະໃຊ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"intent\n"
": The rendering intent to use when exporting the image. For more information see [rendering intent](../../../special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດປະສົງ (intent)\n"
": ຮູບແບບການຈັດການສີໃນການສົ່ງອອກຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"style\n"
": Choose a style to apply when exporting the image -- defaults to “none”. See the [export](../shared/export.md) module for a more detailed discussion of applying a style during export.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະໄຕລ໌ (style)\n"
": ເລືອກສະໄຕລ໌ທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້ເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກຮູບ -- ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ “ບໍ່ມີ”. ເບິ່ງໂມດູນ [ສົ່ງອອກ (export)](../"
"shared/export.md) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການນຳໃຊ້ສະໄຕລ໌ໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mode\n"
": Whether the chosen style should be appended to the existing history stack or replace it completely. See the [export](../shared/export.md) module for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຈະໃຫ້ Style ທີ່ເລືອກໄປຕໍ່ທ້າຍ ຫຼື ຂຽນທັບປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "print button"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມພິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/print-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When clicked, the images are first exported using the selected options, then composed on the page and finally sent to the printer.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຄລິກ, ຮູບພາບຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກຕາມຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເລືອກ, ຈັດວາງໃນໜ້າເຈ້ຍ ແລະ ສົ່ງໄປຍັງເຄື່ອງພິມ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/print/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "print"
msgstr "ພິມ"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "global color picker"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກສີທົ່ວໄປ (global color picker)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take color samples from the current darkroom image, display their values in multiple ways and compare colors from different locations. \n"
msgstr "ເກັບຕົວຢ່າງສີຈາກພາບໃນຫ້ອງມືດປັດຈຸບັນ, ສະແດງຄ່າສີໃນຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ ແລະ ປຽບທຽບສີຈາກຕຳແໜ່ງຕ່າງໆ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The color picker is activated by pressing the [picker](../../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) icon. The module's parameters will remain in effect until you leave the darkroom mode.\n"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກສີຈະຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍການກົດໄອຄອນ [picker](../../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers). ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງໂມດູນຈະຍັງຄົງມີຜົນຈົນກວ່າເຈົ້າຈະອອກຈາກໂໝດຫ້ອງມືດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Besides the global color picker described here, many darktable modules (e.g. [_tone curve_](../../processing-modules/tone-curve.md)) also contain local pickers which are used to set individual module parameters. You should be aware that these two forms of picker do not always work in the same color space. The global color picker works in the histogram color space and takes its samples after the complete pixelpipe has been processed. Local pickers run in the color space of the module in which they are activated and reflect the input or output data of that module within the pixelpipe.\n"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກຕົວເລືອກສີທົ່ວໄປທີ່ອະທິບາຍຢູ່ນີ້, ຫຼາຍໂມດູນໃນ darktable (ເຊັ່ນ [_tone curve_](../../processing-modules/tone-curve.md)) ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກສີສະເພາະ (local pickers) ເຊິ່ງໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງແຕ່ລະໂມດູນ. ເຈົ້າຄວນຮູ້ວ່າຕົວເລືອກສີທັງສອງແບບນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີດຽວກັນສະເໝີໄປ. ຕົວເລືອກສີທົ່ວໄປເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຮິສໂຕແກຣມ ແລະ ເກັບຕົວຢ່າງຫຼັງຈາກຂະບວນການປະມວນຜົນ (pixelpipe) ທັງໝົດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ສ່ວນຕົວເລືອກສີສະເພາະຈະເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຂອງໂມດູນທີ່ມັນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ ແລະ ສະທ້ອນເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນຂາເຂົ້າ ຫຼື ຂາອອກຂອງໂມດູນນັ້ນພາຍໃນ pixelpipe.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can right-click on the sampled color values to copy them to the clipboard.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຄ່າສີທີ່ເກັບຕົວຢ່າງມາເພື່ອຄັດລອກໄປຍັງຄລິບບອດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the global color picker runs at the end of the preview pixelpipe, it receives data in display color space then converts it to histogram color space. If you are using a display color space which is not \"well behaved\" (this is common for a device profile), then colors that are outside of the gamut of the display profile will clip or distort.\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກຕົວເລືອກສີທົ່ວໄປເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຕອນທ້າຍຂອງຂະບວນການປະມວນຜົນ (pixelpipe) ຕົວຢ່າງ, ມັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຈໍສະແດງຜົນ ແລ້ວແປງເປັນພື້ນທີ່ສີຮິສໂຕແກຣມ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີຈໍສະແດງຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ມາດຕະຖານ (ເຊັ່ນ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອຸປະກອນບາງຊະນິດ), ສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດສີຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈໍສະແດງຜົນຈະເກີດການເກີນຂອບເຂດ (clip) ຫຼື ຜິດພ້ຽນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hover over any of the color values to show a tooltip containing more detailed information about the picked color or live color sample. This information includes RGB and Lab values as well as an approximate color name. An attempt is also made to detect skin tones and provide an appropriate description. Skin tone detection needs proper Lightness scaling (44 to 48% for African and 58 to 64% for all others) and neutral white balance.\n"
msgstr "ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງຄ່າສີໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອສະແດງທູລທິບ (tooltip) ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບສີທີ່ເລືອກ ຫຼື ຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດ (live sample). ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ລວມມີຄ່າ RGB ແລະ Lab ພ້ອມທັງຊື່ສີໂດຍປະມານ. ລະບົບຍັງພະຍາຍາມກວດຈັບສີຜິວ ແລະ ໃຫ້ຄຳອະທິບາຍທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ການກວດຈັບສີຜິວຕ້ອງການການປັບສະເກລຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (Lightness) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (44 ຫາ 48% ສຳລັບຄົນອາຟຣິກາ ແລະ 58 ຫາ 64% ສຳລັບກຸ່ມອື່ນໆ) ແລະ ສົມດຸນສີຂາວທີ່ເປັນກາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"point/area mode\n"
": The global color picker can be activated in point or area mode with the [picker](../../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers) icon. In point mode only a small spot under your cursor is taken as a sample. In area mode darktable samples the area within a drawn rectangle.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຈຸດ/ພື້ນທີ່ (point/area mode)\n"
": ຕົວເລືອກສີທົ່ວໄປສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນໂໝດຈຸດ ຫຼື ພື້ນທີ່ ດ້ວຍໄອຄອນ [picker](../../../darkroom/processing-modules/module-controls.md#pickers). ໃນໂໝດຈຸດ, ຈະມີພຽງຈຸດນ້ອຍໆກ້ອງເຄີເຊີເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກເກັບຕົວຢ່າງ. ໃນໂໝດພື້ນທີ່, darktable ຈະເກັບຕົວຢ່າງພາຍໃນຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມທີ່ເຈົ້າແຕ້ມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mean/min/max\n"
": If samples are taken in area mode, darktable will calculate mean, minimum and maximum color channel values. This combobox allows you to select which of those are displayed. For obvious statistical reasons mean, min and max are identical for the single sample of point mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ/ຕ່ຳສຸດ/ສູງສຸດ (mean/min/max)\n"
": ຖ້າເກັບຕົວຢ່າງໃນໂໝດພື້ນທີ່, darktable ຈະຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ, ຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດຂອງຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີ. ລາຍການເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກວ່າຈະສະແດງຄ່າໃດ. ດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນທາງສະຖິຕິ, ຄ່າສະເລ່ຍ, ຕ່ຳສຸດ ແລະ ສູງສຸດ ຈະຄືກັນໃນການເກັບຕົວຢ່າງແບບຈຸດດຽວ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"color swatch / color values\n"
": A color swatch representing the sampled point or area is displayed alongside numerical values. Clicking on the swatch will toggle on/off a much larger swatch for easier viewing.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງສີ / ຄ່າສີ (color swatch / color values)\n"
": ຕົວຢ່າງສີທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງຈຸດ ຫຼື ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ສຸ່ມຕົວຢ່າງ ຈະຖືກສະແດງພ້ອມກັບຄ່າຕົວເລກ. ການຄລິກໃສ່ຕົວຢ່າງສີຈະເປັນກ"
"ານເປີດ/ປິດ ຕົວຢ່າງສີທີ່ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": The global color picker works in display RGB color space, though you may choose (by selecting from the drop-down) to translate these numerical values into another color space. Beware that values in other color spaces are approximated here -- depending on the display color profile there may be some deviations from the actual values.\n"
msgstr ": ຕົວເລືອກສີທົ່ວໄປເຮັດວຽກໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີ RGB ຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນ, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກ (ຈາກລາຍການເລືອກ) ເພື່ອແປງຄ່າຕົວເລກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນພື້ນທີ່ສີອື່ນ. ຈົ່ງລະວັງວ່າຄ່າໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີອື່ນໆແມ່ນເປັນພຽງຄ່າປະມານ -- ຂຶ້ນກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນ, ອາດຈະມີຄວາມຄາດເຄື່ອນຈາກຄ່າຕົວຈິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"live samples\n"
": The sampled colors (in either area or point mode) can be stored as live samples by pressing the \"add\" button. A color swatch and numerical values will be shown for each stored sample. You can change the numerical value (mean, min, max) and color space to display.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດ (live samples)\n"
": ສີທີ່ເກັບຕົວຢ່າງມາ (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນໂໝດພື້ນທີ່ ຫຼື ຈຸດ) ສາມາດເກັບໄວ້ເປັນຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ \"add\". ແຖບສີ ແລະ ຄ່າຕົວເລກຈະສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ເກັບໄວ້. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນຄ່າຕົວເລກ (ສະເລ່ຍ, ຕ່ຳສຸດ, ສູງສຸດ) ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ສີທີ່ຈະສະແດງໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": Newly created live samples are not locked. If you change your image processing those changes will be reflected in the live samples. This can be used to see how an altered parameter affects different parts of the image. Clicking on a live sample's color swatch locks it and a lock symbol is displayed. Further image changes will then no longer affect the sample. You can use this to compare two live samples by locking just one of them, thus providing a before and after comparison.\n"
msgstr ": ຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລັອກ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າປ່ຽນການປະມວນຜົນພາບ, ການປ່ຽນແປງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະສະທ້ອນໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າພາຣາມິເຕີທີ່ປ່ຽນໄປນັ້ນສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ສ່ວນຕ່າງໆຂອງພາບແນວໃດ. ການຄລິກໃສ່ແຖບສີຂອງຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດຈະເປັນການລັອກມັນ ແລະ ສັນຍາລັກຮູບກະແຈຈະປາກົດຂຶ້ນ. ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ການປ່ຽນແປງພາບຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຕົວຢ່າງນັ້ນອີກ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດສອງອັນໄດ້ໂດຍການລັອກອັນໜຶ່ງໄວ້, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນການປຽບທຽບກ່ອນ ແລະ ຫຼັງການແກ້ໄຂ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": If you hover the mouse over the \"delete\" button of one of the live sample entries, the selected region for that sample will be highlighted in the image preview.\n"
msgstr ": ຖ້າເຈົ້າວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງປຸ່ມ \"ລຶບ\" ຂອງລາຍການຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດໃດໜຶ່ງ, ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເລືອກສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງນັ້ນຈະຖືກເນັ້ນໃນພາບຕົວຢ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": To update a live sample, first right-click on it to copy the selected live sample color to the primary sample -- an icon ![save icon](.global-color-picker/save-icon.png#icon) is shown on the live sample to indicate that editing is in progress. Next, make any desired new color selection on the primary sample -- it is not necessary to click the picker to start the new color selection, but you can still use the picker to alter the picker mode (point or area). Note that using the picker to select the existing (point/area) picker mode will cancel the edit.  Finally, to save the new color selection, right-click on _any_ live sample to update that sample (it does not have to be the originally selected live sample). The save icon will be removed once the update has been made.\n"
msgstr ": ເພື່ອອັບເດດຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດ, ກ່ອນອື່ນໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ມັນເພື່ອຄັດລອກສີຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດທີ່ເລືອກໄປຍັງຕົວຢ່າງຫຼັກ -- ໄອຄອນ ![save icon](.global-color-picker/save-icon.png#icon) ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດເພື່ອບອກວ່າກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການແກ້ໄຂ. ຕໍ່ມາ, ເລືອກສີໃໝ່ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃນຕົວຢ່າງຫຼັກ -- ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຄລິກທີ່ຕົວເລືອກສີເພື່ອເລີ່ມການເລືອກສີໃໝ່, ແຕ່ເຈົ້າກໍຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກສີເພື່ອປ່ຽນໂໝດ (ຈຸດ ຫຼື ພື້ນທີ່) ໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າການໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກສີເພື່ອເລືອກໂໝດທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຈະເປັນການຍົກເລີກການແກ້ໄຂ. ສຸດທ້າຍ, ເພື່ອບັນທຶກການເລືອກສີໃໝ່, ໃຫ້ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດ _ໃດກໍໄດ້_ ເພື່ອອັບເດດຕົວຢ່າງນັ້ນ (ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນຕອນທຳອິດ). ໄອຄອນບັນທຶກຈະຖືກເອົາອອກເມື່ອການອັບເດດສຳເລັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"display samples on image/vectorscope\n"
": When this checkbox is ticked, live sample locations are visually indicated on the image and the vectorscope view of the [scopes](../shared/scopes.md#vectorscope) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງສີໃນພາບ/ເວັກເຕີສະໂຄບ (display samples on image/vectorscope)\n"
": ເມື່ອໝາຍໃສ່ຊ່ອງນີ້, ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຕົວຢ່າງສີສົດຈະຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນໃນພາບ ແລະ ໃນມຸມມອງ vectorscope ຂອງໂມດູນ [scopes](../shared/scopes.md#vectorscope).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/global-color-picker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"restrict scope to selection\n"
": When this checkbox is ticked, only the values of the selected area or point are taken into account by the regular and waveform views of the [scopes](../shared/scopes.md) module. This allows you to see what tonal values are present in the selected area. When using a picker in a processing module, this option restricts the scope to the picked area from the processing module instead of the global color picker.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳກັດສະໂຄບສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ເລືອກ (restrict scope to selection)\n"
": ເມື່ອໝາຍໃສ່ຊ່ອງນີ້, ຈະມີພຽງຄ່າຂອງພື້ນທີ່ ຫຼື ຈຸດທີ່ເລືອກເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຖືກນຳມາຄິດໄລ່ໃນມຸມມອງປົກກະຕິ ແລະ waveform ຂອງໂມດູນ [scopes](../shared/scopes.md). ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເຫັນວ່າໂທນສີໃດມີຢູ່ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເລືອກ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກສີໃນໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນ, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຈຳກັດສະໂຄບໃຫ້ຢູ່ສະເພາະພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ເລືອກຈາກໂມດູນນັ້ນ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນຕົວເລືອກສີທົ່ວໄປ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "color assessment"
msgstr "ການປະເມີນສີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assess colors and brightness in your image under neutral viewing conditions to avoid perceptual issues.\n"
msgstr "ປະເມີນສີ ແລະ ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໃນພາບຂອງເຈົ້າພາຍໃຕ້ສະພາວະການເບິ່ງທີ່ເປັນກາງ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາທາງດ້ານການຮັບຮູ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When developing an image, the way we perceive brightness, contrast and saturation is influenced by the surrounding ambient conditions. If an image is displayed against a dark background, this can have a number of adverse effects on our perception of that image:\n"
msgstr "ໃນເວລາແຕ່ງພາບ, ວິທີທີ່ພວກເຮົາຮັບຮູ້ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ, ຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast) ແລະ ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີ ແມ່ນໄດ້ຮັບອິດທິພົນຈາກສະພາວະແວດລ້ອມອ້ອມຂ້າງ. ຖ້າພາບຖືກສະແດງເທິງພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ມືດ, ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບທາງລົບຕໍ່ການຮັບຮູ້ພາບນັ້ນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exaggeration of the perceived exposure makes the image seems brighter than it really is. This is nicely illustrated by the [Adelson checkerboard shadow effect](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Checker_shadow_illusion).\n"
msgstr "ການຮັບຮູ້ການຮັບແສງທີ່ເກີນຈິງ ເຮັດໃຫ້ພາບເບິ່ງຄືວ່າສະຫວ່າງກວ່າຄວາມເປັນຈິງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນຢ່າງຊັດເຈນໂດຍ [Adelson checkerboard shadow effect](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Checker_shadow_illusion).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A decrease in the perceived saturation in the image makes the colors seem less rich than they really are (the Hunt effect).\n"
msgstr "ການຮັບຮູ້ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີໃນພາບທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງ ເຮັດໃຫ້ສີເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຈືດກວ່າຄວາມເປັນຈິງ (Hunt effect).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '-   '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A decrease in the perceived contrast in the image makes the tones seem flatter than they really are (Bartleson-Breneman effect 3)\n"
msgstr "ການຮັບຮູ້ຄວາມຄົມຊັດໃນພາບທີ່ຫຼຸດລົງ ເຮັດໃຫ້ໂທນສີເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຮາບພຽງກວ່າຄວາມເປັນຈິງ (Bartleson-Breneman effect 3)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The end result is that the final image can end up being too dark and overly-processed in terms of contrast and color saturation. To avoid this, the _color assessment_ module in the darktroom places a grey and white frame around the image to help the user better assess the colors in the image\n"
msgstr "ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນພາບທີ່ແຕ່ງແລ້ວອາດຈະມືດເກີນໄປ ແລະ ຖືກປັບຄວາມຄົມຊັດ ຫຼື ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງສີຫຼາຍເກີນຄວນ. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນສິ່ງນີ້, ໂມດູນ _color assessment_ ໃນຫ້ອງມືດຈະວາງຂອບສີເທົາ ແລະ ສີຂາວໄວ້ອ້ອມພາບ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປະເມີນສີໃນພາບໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![color-assessment-overview](./color-assessment/color-assessment-overview.png#w75)\n"
msgstr "![color-assessment-overview](./color-assessment/color-assessment-overview.png#w75)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the color assessment button ![bulb-icon](./color-assessment/bulb-icon.png#icon) is selected in the bottom panel, the image is zoomed out so that a thick mid-gray border appears around the image to act as a reference against which to compare the image's tones. A thinner white border is placed immediately around the image to give the eyes a basis for comparison when looking at parts of the image that are meant to be a bright white.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເລືອກປຸ່ມປະເມີນສີ ![bulb-icon](./color-assessment/bulb-icon.png#icon) ໃນແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມ, ພາບຈະຖືກຍໍ້ລົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂອບສີເທົາກາງທີ່ໜາປາກົດຂຶ້ນອ້ອມພາບ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນບ່ອນອ້າງອີງໃນການປຽບທຽບໂທນສີຂອງພາບ. ຂອບສີຂາວທີ່ບາງກວ່າຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ຮອບພາບທັນທີ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາຍຕາມີພື້ນຖານໃນການປຽບທຽບເມື່ອເບິ່ງສ່ວນຂອງພາບທີ່ຄວນຈະເປັນສີຂາວສະຫວ່າງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Although the color assessment mode provides a mid-gray surrounding to the image, it is recommended that you also set your user interface (in [preferences > general](../../../preferences-settings/general.md)) to one of the \"grey\" themes. These themes are designed to provide a user interface that is close to middle gray (it is actually slightly darker to allow better contrast with the text in the user interface). When one of these themes is used together with the color assessment mode, this will help to avoid the above perception issues.\n"
msgstr "ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າໂໝດປະເມີນສີຈະໃຫ້ສະພາວະອ້ອມຂ້າງເປັນສີເທົາກາງແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ທົ່ວໄປ](../../../preferences-settings/general.md)) ໃຫ້ເປັນໜຶ່ງໃນຮູບແບບ (themes) \"grey\" (ສີເທົາ). ຮູບແບບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີສີໃກ້ຄຽງກັບສີເທົາກາງ (ຄວາມຈິງແລ້ວມັນຈະມືດກວ່ານ້ອຍໜຶ່ງເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນຕົວໜັງສືໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ). ເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຮ່ວມກັບໂໝດປະເມີນສີ, ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫາທາງດ້ານການຮັບຮູ້ທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Color assessment mode can also be toggled by pressing Ctrl+B.\n"
msgstr "ໂໝດປະເມີນສີຍັງສາມາດເປີດ/ປິດໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດ Ctrl+B.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The total size of the grey and white frame and the relative size of the white frame may be adjusted by right-clicking ![bulb-icon](./color-assessment/bulb-icon.png#icon). This will bring up a control panel with two slider controls:\n"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດລວມຂອງຂອບສີເທົາ ແລະ ສີຂາວ ລວມທັງຂະໜາດທຽບເທົ່າຂອງຂອບສີຂາວ ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກຂວາທີ່ ![bulb-icon](./color-assessment/bulb-icon.png#icon). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງແຖບຄວບຄຸມທີ່ມີແຖບເລື່ອນສອງຕົວ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"total border width relative to screen\n"
": Adjust the size of the combined grey and white border. Increase to grow the total border (and shrink the image). Decrease shrink the border (and grow the image).\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຂອບລວມທຽບກັບໜ້າຈໍ\n"
": ປັບຂະໜາດຂອງຂອບສີເທົາ ແລະ ສີຂາວທີ່ລວມກັນ. ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂອບໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ (ແລະ ພາບຈະນ້ອຍລົງ). ຫຼຸດລົງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂອບນ້ອຍລົງ (ແລະ ພາບຈະໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/color-assessment.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"white border ratio\n"
": Adjust the white border relative to the screen. Increase this slider to enlarge the the white border. Decrease to shrink the white border. The image size will remain unaffected.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສັດສ່ວນຂອບສີຂາວ\n"
": ປັບຂອບສີຂາວທຽບກັບໜ້າຈໍ. ເລື່ອນເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍຂອບສີຂາວ. ເລື່ອນຫຼຸດລົງເພື່ອຍໍ້ຂອບສີຂາວ. ຂະໜາດຂອງພາບຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "guides & overlays"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວ & ການວາງຊ້ອນ (guides & overlays)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A number of commonly-used compositional guides can be overlaid on your image while you are editing. These can be enabled either globally (all the time) or locally (when certain modules are active).\n"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວໃນການຈັດອົງປະກອບພາບທີ່ນິຍົມໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ ສາມາດນຳມາຊ້ອນເທິງພາບຂອງເຈົ້າໃນຂະນະທີ່ແກ້ໄຂ. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງແບບທົ່ວໄປ (ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ) ຫຼື ແບບສະເພາະບ່ອນ (ເມື່ອໂມດູນໃດໜຶ່ງເຮັດວຽກ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Other darkroom functionality also draws colored overlay lines on the image (for example, drawn masks). An option is also provided to change the color of those overlays (see below).\n"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນອື່ນໆໃນຫ້ອງມືດກໍມີການແຕ້ມເສັ້ນສີຊ້ອນເທິງພາບເຊັ່ນກັນ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: drawn masks). ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກໃນການປ່ຽນສີຂອງເສັ້ນຊ້ອນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "global guides"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid " Left-click the ![guides-overlays-icon](./guides-overlays/guides-overlays-icon.png#icon) icon in the bottom bar to globally display guide overlays. The overlays will remain switched on until you click the button a second time to switch them off. \n"
msgstr " ຄລິກຊ້າຍທີ່ໄອຄອນ ![guides-overlays-icon](./guides-overlays/guides-overlays-icon.png#icon) ໃນແຖບດ້ານລຸ່ມເພື່ອສະແດງເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວແບບທົ່ວໄປ. ເສັ້ນຊ້ອນຈະຍັງຄົງເປີດຢູ່ຈົນກວ່າເຈົ້າຈະຄລິກປຸ່ມນັ້ນອີກເທື່ອໜຶ່ງເພື່ອປິດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid " Right-click the icon to show the settings dialog (see below).\n"
msgstr " ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໄອຄອນເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "local guides"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວສະເພາະບ່ອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A more common use is to switch the guides on only when a specific module is activated. The following control is added by default to all modules that crop/distort the image (currently [crop](../../processing-modules/crop.md), [crop and rotate](../../processing-modules/crop-rotate.md), [orientation](../../processing-modules/orientation.md), [framing](../../processing-modules/framing.md), [liquify](../../processing-modules/liquify.md), [lens correction](../../processing-modules/lens-correction.md) and [rotate and perspective](../../processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md)):\n"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍກວ່າແມ່ນການເປີດເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວສະເພາະເມື່ອໂມດູນໃດໜຶ່ງຖືກເປີດໃຊ້. ຕົວຄວບຄຸມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃນທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການຕັດ/ບິດເບືອນພາບ (ເຊັ່ນ: [crop](../../processing-modules/crop.md), [crop and rotate](../../processing-modules/crop-rotate.md), [orientation](../../processing-modules/orientation.md), [framing](../../processing-modules/framing.md), [liquify](../../processing-modules/liquify.md), [lens correction](../../processing-modules/lens-correction.md) ແລະ [rotate and perspective](../../processing-modules/rotate-perspective.md)):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![local-controls](./guides-overlays/local-controls.png#w25)\n"
msgstr "![local-controls](./guides-overlays/local-controls.png#w25)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tick the box to show guide overlays whenever the module is active. Click the icon on the right to show the settings dialog (see below).\n"
msgstr "ໝາຍໃສ່ຊ່ອງເພື່ອສະແດງເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ໂມດູນນັ້ນກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ. ຄລິກໄອຄອນທາງດ້ານຂວາເພື່ອສະແດງກ່ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "global guide overlay settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please note that, while you can choose to switch guide overlays on and off either globally or locally, the following settings are stored globally and cannot be set independently for each module.\n"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ, ເຖິງແມ່ນເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວໄດ້ທັງແບບທົ່ວໄປ ຫຼື ແບບສະເພາະບ່ອນ, ແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ແບບທົ່ວໄປ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂມດູນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"type\n"
": The type of compositional guide lines to display.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປະເພດ (type)\n"
": ປະເພດຂອງເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວໃນການຈັດອົງປະກອບທີ່ຈະສະແດງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flip\n"
": Some guides are asymmetrical. This option allows you to flip such guides horizontally/vertically.\n"
msgstr ""
"ກັບດ້ານ (flip)\n"
": ເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວບາງຢ່າງຈະບໍ່ສົມມາດ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກັບດ້ານເສັ້ນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຕາມລວງນອນ ຫຼື ລວງຕັ້ງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"horizontal lines, vertical lines, subdivisions\n"
": When the _grid_ overlay type is selected, set the parameters of the grid.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເສັ້ນນອນ, ເສັ້ນຕັ້ງ, ສ່ວນຍ່ອຍ (horizontal lines, vertical lines, subdivisions)\n"
": ເມື່ອເລືອກປະເພດເສັ້ນຊ່ວຍແນວແບບ _grid_ (ຕາຕະລາງ), ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງຕາຕະລາງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"overlay color\n"
": The color of the overlay lines. Note that this impacts _any_ lines that are drawn directly over the image, for example, drawn masks.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສີຂອງເສັ້ນຊ້ອນ (overlay color)\n"
": ສີຂອງເສັ້ນທີ່ວາງຊ້ອນ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຕໍ່ເສັ້ນ _ໃດໆກໍຕາມ_ ທີ່ຖືກແຕ້ມລົງເທິງພາບໂດຍກົງ, ເຊັ່ນ: drawn masks.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/guides-overlays.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"contrast\n"
": The contrast between the lightest and darkest parts of any overlays -- usually, the contrast between the \"on\" and \"off\" parts of dashed lines.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຄົມຊັດ (contrast)\n"
": ຄວາມຄົມຊັດລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນທີ່ສະຫວ່າງທີ່ສຸດ ແລະ ມືດທີ່ສຸດຂອງເສັ້ນຊ້ອນ -- ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນຄວາມຄົມຊັດລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນ \"on\" ແລະ \"off\" ຂອງເສັ້ນປະ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "module order"
msgstr "ລຳດັບໂມດູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change the order of the [processing modules](../../processing-modules/_index.md) in the darkroom using presets.\n"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນລຳດັບຂອງ [ໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນ](../../processing-modules/_index.md) ໃນຫ້ອງມືດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າຕັ້ງລ່ວງໜ້າ (presets).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When processing an image, the active modules are applied in a specific order, which is shown in the right-hand panel of the darkroom view. This module provides information about the current ordering of the processing modules in the [pixelpipe](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md). The name of the currently-selected preset is shown in the module header (or \"custom\" if the user has manually modified the order). The following presets are available for selection.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອປະມວນຜົນພາບ, ໂມດູນທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ຕາມລຳດັບສະເພາະ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຖບເບື້ອງຂວາຂອງມຸມມອງຫ້ອງມືດ. ໂມດູນນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລຳດັບປັດຈຸບັນຂອງໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນໃນ [pixelpipe](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md). ຊື່ຂອງຄ່າຕັ້ງລ່ວງໜ້າທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່ປັດຈຸບັນຈະສະແດງໃນສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນ (ຫຼື \"custom\" ຖ້າຜູ້ໃຊ້ປັບລຳດັບເອງ). ມີຄ່າຕັ້ງລ່ວງໜ້າໃຫ້ເລືອກດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"v5.0 RAW\n"
": This is the default module order for [scene-referred](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#scene-referred-workflow) RAW development workflow in darktable 5.0 and later. \n"
msgstr ""
"v5.0 RAW\n"
": ນີ້ແມ່ນລຳດັບໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການແຕ່ງໄຟລ໌ RAW ແບບ [scene-referred](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#scene-referred-workflow) ໃນ darktable 5.0 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"v5.0 JPEG\n"
": This is the default module order for JPEG development in darktable 5.0 and later.\n"
msgstr ""
"v5.0 JPEG\n"
": ນີ້ແມ່ນລຳດັບໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການແຕ່ງໄຟລ໌ JPEG ໃນ darktable 5.0 ແລະ ເວີຊັນຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"v3.0 RAW\n"
": This is the default module order for [scene-referred](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#scene-referred-workflow) RAW development workflow between darktable 3.0 and darktable 4.8. \n"
msgstr ""
"v3.0 RAW\n"
": ນີ້ແມ່ນລຳດັບໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການແຕ່ງໄຟລ໌ RAW ແບບ [scene-referred](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#scene-referred-workflow) ລະຫວ່າງ darktable 3.0 ຫາ darktable 4.8. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"v3.0 JPEG\n"
": This is the default module order for JPEG development between darktable 3.0 and darktable 4.8.\n"
msgstr ""
"v3.0 JPEG\n"
": ນີ້ແມ່ນລຳດັບໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບການແຕ່ງໄຟລ໌ JPEG ລະຫວ່າງ darktable 3.0 ຫາ darktable 4.8.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"legacy\n"
": This module order is used for the legacy [display-referred](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#display-referred-workflow) workflow. You will also see this order displayed for any images you previously edited in darktable prior to version 3.0.\n"
msgstr ""
"legacy (ແບບເກົ່າ)\n"
": ລຳດັບໂມດູນນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ [display-referred](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md/#display-referred-workflow) ແບບດັ້ງເດີມ. ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນລຳດັບນີ້ໃນພາບໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ເຄີຍແຕ່ງໃນ darktable ເວີຊັນກ່ອນ 3.0.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"custom\n"
": The user has manually modified the module order.\n"
msgstr ""
"custom (ກຳນົດເອງ)\n"
": ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ປັບປ່ຽນລຳດັບໂມດູນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** changing the order of modules in the pixelpipe is not a cosmetic change to the presentation of the GUI -- it has real consequences to how the image will be processed. Please do not change the order of the modules unless you have a specific technical reason and understand why this is required from an image processing perspective. \n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ການປ່ຽນລຳດັບຂອງໂມດູນໃນ pixelpipe ບໍ່ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ການປ່ຽນແປງໜ້າຕາຂອງໂປຣແກຣມ -- ມັນສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບໂດຍກົງຕໍ່ວິທີການປະມວນຜົນພາບ. ກະລຸນາຢ່າປ່ຽນລຳດັບຂອງໂມດູນ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ເຈົ້າມີເຫດຜົນທາງເຕັກນິກສະເພາະ ແລະ ເຂົ້າໃຈຢ່າງຖ່ອງແທ້ວ່າເປັນຫຍັງມັນຈຶ່ງຈຳເປັນໃນການປະມວນຜົນພາບ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/module-order.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information about changing module order please refer to [the pixelpipe & module order](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md).\n"
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການປ່ຽນລຳດັບໂມດູນ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງ [the pixelpipe & module order](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/image-info-line.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "image information line"
msgstr "ແຖວຂໍ້ມູນພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/image-info-line.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Display information about the current image in a darkroom panel. \n"
msgstr "ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບພາບປັດຈຸບັນໃນແຖບຫ້ອງມືດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/image-info-line.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The contents of this line can be set in [preferences > darkroom](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md). See the [variables](../../../special-topics/variables.md) section for information about the variables that can be used here. You can also insert a newline with `$(NL)`.\n"
msgstr "ເນື້ອໃນຂອງແຖວນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຫ້ອງມືດ](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md). ເບິ່ງສ່ວນ [ຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables)](../../../special-topics/variables.md) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຕົວປ່ຽນທີ່ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່ດ້ວຍ `$(NL)`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/image-info-line.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The image information line can be displayed in the top, bottom, left or right panel depending on an additional configuration item in [preferences > darkroom](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md).\n"
msgstr "ແຖວຂໍ້ມູນພາບສາມາດສະແດງໄດ້ທັງແຖບ ດ້ານເທິງ, ດ້ານລຸ່ມ, ດ້ານຊ້າຍ ຫຼື ດ້ານຂວາ ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຫ້ອງມືດ](../../../preferences-settings/darkroom.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/navigation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Zoom and pan the current image.\n"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍ ແລະ ເລື່ອນເບິ່ງພາບປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/navigation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The navigation panel (displayed on the top left hand side of the darkroom) shows a full preview of the current image with a rectangle showing the area that is currently visible in the central panel. You can interact with this module using your mouse in the same way as you can interact with the main image (scroll to zoom in/out, middle-click to cycle through zoom levels, click+drag to pan). Alternatively, the current zoom scale is displayed in a combobox to the bottom-right of the preview -- click to choose from a number of common zoom levels or type a number to set the zoom level manually.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບການນຳທາງ (ສະແດງຢູ່ທາງເທິງຊ້າຍຂອງຫ້ອງມືດ) ຈະສະແດງພາບຕົວຢ່າງທັງໝົດຂອງພາບປັດຈຸບັນ ໂດຍມີຮູບສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມສະແດງພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກຳລັງເບິ່ງຢູ່ໃນແຖບກາງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ໂຕ້ຕອບກັບໂມດູນນີ້ໄດ້ຄືກັບການໂຕ້ຕອບກັບພາບຫຼັກ (ເລື່ອນລູກກິ້ງເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍ/ຍໍ້, ຄລິກເມົາສ໌ກາງເພື່ອສະຫຼັບລະດັບການຂະຫຍາຍ, ຄລິກ+ລາກເພື່ອເລື່ອນພາບ). ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ລະດັບການຂະຫຍາຍປັດຈຸບັນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍການເລືອກທາງລຸ່ມຂວາຂອງພາບຕົວຢ່າງ -- ຄລິກເພື່ອເລືອກລະດັບການຂະຫຍາຍທົ່ວໄປ ຫຼື ພິມຕົວເລກເພື່ອຕັ້ງລະດັບການຂະຫຍາຍດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/navigation.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The navigation panel can be toggled on/off with a keyboard shortcut (Ctrl+Shift+N by default).\n"
msgstr "ແຖບການນຳທາງສາມາດເປີດ/ປິດໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄີລັດ (Ctrl+Shift+N ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "soft proof"
msgstr "ຊອຟຕ໌ພຣູຟ (soft proof)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "View your image rendered using a selected color profile.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງພາບຂອງເຈົ້າທີ່ຖືກສະແດງໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the ![soft proof](./soft-proof/soft-proof-icon.png#icon) icon to activate the soft proof display mode on your image. This allows you to preview your image rendered using a printer profile to see how colors will end up on the final print. You can also activate soft proof with the keyboard shortcut Ctrl+S. A message “soft proof\" on the bottom left of your image tells you that you are in soft proof display mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໄອຄອນ ![soft proof](./soft-proof/soft-proof-icon.png#icon) ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດສະແດ"
"ງຜົນ soft proof ໃຫ້ກັບຮູບຂອງທ່ານ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງຮູບທີ່ສະແດງຜົນໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເຄື່ອງພິມ ເ"
"ພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າສີຈະອອກມາແນວໃດໃນການພິມສຸດທ້າຍ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ soft proof ໄດ້ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມ "
"Ctrl+S. ຂໍ້ຄວາມ “soft proof\" ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍລຸ່ມຂອງຮູບ ບອກໃຫ້ທ່ານຮູ້ວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນໂໝດສະແດງຜົນ "
"soft proof.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click on the icon to open a dialog with the following configuration parameters. For each of these parameters, the list of available profiles is read from `$DARKTABLE/share/darktable/color/out` (where `$DARKTABLE` represents darktable's installation directory) and `color/out` in the darktable [configuration directory](../../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). Note that these `color/out` directories are not created by the darktable install; if you need to use one, you must create it yourself.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໄອຄອນເພື່ອເປີດກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ມີພາຣາມິເຕີຕັ້ງຄ່າດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະພາຣາມິເຕີ, ລາຍຊື່ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີແມ່ນຖືກອ່ານມາຈາກ `$DARKTABLE/share/darktable/color/out` (ບ່ອນທີ່ `$DARKTABLE` ແທນບ່ອນຕິດຕັ້ງ darktable) ແລະ `color/out` ໃນ [configuration directory](../../../preferences-settings/config-directory.md). ໝາຍເຫດວ່າໂຟນເດີ `color/out` ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍການຕິດຕັ້ງ darktable; ຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການໃຊ້, ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງສ້າງມັນຂຶ້ນເອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"display profile\n"
": Set the color profile for the display. The option “system display profile” is the preferred setting when working with a calibrated display. The profile is taken either from your system's color manager or from your X display server. The method darktable uses to detect your system display profile can be changed in [preferences > miscellaneous](../../../preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md). For more information see the [display profile](../../../special-topics/color-management/display-profile.md) section.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສະແດງຜົນ (display profile)\n"
": ຕັ້ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີສຳລັບການສະແດງຜົນ. ຕົວເລືອກ “ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງລະບົບ” ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ແນະນຳເ"
"ມື່ອເຮັດວຽກກັບໜ້າຈໍທີ່ຜ່ານການຄາລິເບຣດແລ້ວ. ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກດຶງມາຈາກຕົວຈັດການສີຂອງລະບົບ ຫຼື ຈາກ X "
"display server ຂອງທ່ານ. ວິທີທີ່ darktable ໃຊ້ໃນການກວດຫາໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງລະບົບ ສາມາ"
"ດປ່ຽນແປງໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ເບັດເຕະເລັດ (preferences > miscellaneous)](../../../"
"preferences-settings/miscellaneous.md). ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງສ່ວນ [ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ການສະແດ"
"ງຜົນ (display profile)](../../../special-topics/color-management/display-"
"profile.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"preview display profile\n"
": Set the color profile for the preview image if you are using a second window.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈໍສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງ (preview display profile)\n"
": ຕັ້ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີສຳລັບພາບຕົວຢ່າງ ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງໃຊ້ປ່ອງຢ້ຽມທີສອງ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"intent\n"
": Set the rendering intent for your display -- only available if rendering with LittleCMS2 is activated. See [rendering intent](../../../special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md) for a list of available options. This option appears twice -- once for the \"display profile\" and once for the \"preview display profile\".\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມຈຳນົງໃນການສະແດງຜົນ (intent)\n"
": ຕັ້ງຄ່າ rendering intent ສຳລັບຈໍສະແດງຜົນ -- ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການສະແດງຜົນດ້ວຍ LittleCMS2 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ເບິ່ງ [rendering intent](../../../special-topics/color-management/rendering-intent.md) ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປາກົດສອງຄັ້ງ -- ຄັ້ງໜຶ່ງສຳລັບ \"display profile\" ແລະ ອີກຄັ້ງສຳລັບ \"preview display profile\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"softproof profile\n"
": Set the color profile for soft proofing. Typically these profiles are supplied by your printer or generated during printer profiling.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຊອຟຕ໌ພຣູຟ (softproof profile)\n"
": ຕັ້ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີສຳລັບການເຮັດ soft proofing. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະໄດ້ມາຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດເຄື່ອງພິມ ຫຼື ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການເຮັດໂປຣໄຟລ໌ເຄື່ອງພິມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/soft-proof.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"histogram profile\n"
": Set the color profile of the histogram. None of the available options are ideal, however, \"system display profile\" is probably the _least bad_ setting, since all other profiles are derived from the display color space and at least the values will conform to what you see on screen.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຮິສໂຕແກຣມ (histogram profile)\n"
": ຕັ້ງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີຂອງຮິສໂຕແກຣມ. ບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກໃດທີ່ສົມບູນແບບ, ແຕ່ \"system display profile\" ອາດຈະເປັນຄ່າທີ່ _ດີທີ່ສຸດ_ ເທົ່າທີ່ມີ, ເນື່ອງຈາກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆແມ່ນຖືກດັດແປງມາຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສີຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍຄ່າຕ່າງໆກໍຈະສອດຄ່ອງກັບສິ່ງທີ່ເຈົ້າເຫັນເທິງໜ້າຈໍ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/high-quality-processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "high quality processing"
msgstr "ການປະມວນຜົນຄຸນນະພາບສູງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/high-quality-processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Process the image in the darkroom view using \"high quality mode\", so that the displayed image reflects the appearance of a full-sized export.\n"
msgstr "ປະມວນຜົນພາບໃນມຸມມອງຫ້ອງມືດໂດຍໃຊ້ \"ໂໝດຄຸນນະພາບສູງ\", ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພາບທີ່ສະແດງອອກມາສະທ້ອນເຖິງລັກສະນະຂອງພາບທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຈາກການສົ່ງອອກ (export) ຂະໜາດເຕັມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/high-quality-processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate this mode by clicking the ![high quality processing icon](./high-quality-processing/high-quality-processing-icon.png#icon) icon at the bottom of the darkroom view.\n"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດນີ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໄອຄອນ ![high quality processing icon](./high-quality-processing/high-quality-processing-icon.png#icon) ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງມຸມມອງຫ້ອງມືດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/high-quality-processing.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that while this mode provides the most accurate representation of the processed image, it also results in significant performance degradation. Please see the [types of pixelpipe](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md#types-of-pixelpipe) section for a full discussion.\n"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ເຖິງແມ່ນໂໝດນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ພາບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງທີ່ສຸດ, ແຕ່ມັນກໍສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກຫຼຸດລົງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງສ່ວນ [ປະເພດຂອງ pixelpipe](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/the-pixelpipe-and-module-order.md#types-of-pixelpipe) ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດທັງໝົດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/gamut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "gamut check"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut check)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/gamut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highlight areas of the image that may exhibit gamut clipping.\n"
msgstr "ເນັ້ນສ່ວນຂອງພາບທີ່ອາດຈະມີສ່ວນເກີນຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut clipping).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/gamut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the ![gamut-icon](./gamut/gamut-icon.png#icon) icon to activate the gamut check display mode for your image. This function highlights, in cyan, all pixels that are out of gamut with respect to the selected softproof profile. You can also activate gamut check with the keyboard shortcut Ctrl+G. A message “gamut check” on the bottom left of your image tells you that you are in gamut check display mode. Gamut check and [soft proof](./soft-proof) are mutually exclusive modes.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໄອຄອນ ![gamut-icon](./gamut/gamut-icon.png#icon) ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ໂໝດສະແດງຜົນການກວດສ"
"ອບ gamut ສຳລັບຮູບຂອງທ່ານ. ຟັງຊັນນີ້ຈະເນັ້ນພິກເຊວທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ນອກ gamut ດ້ວຍສີຟ້າອ່ອນ (cyan) ເມື່ອທຽບ"
"ກັບໂປຣໄຟລ໌ softproof ທີ່ເລືອກ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບ gamut ໄດ້ດ້ວຍປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມ "
"Ctrl+G. ຂໍ້ຄວາມ “gamut check” ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍລຸ່ມຂອງຮູບ ບອກໃຫ້ທ່ານຮູ້ວ່າທ່ານກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນໂໝດສະແດງຜົນກາ"
"ນກວດສອບ gamut. ການກວດສອບ gamut ແລະ [soft proof](./soft-proof) ແມ່ນໂໝດທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້"
"ຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/gamut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click on the icon to open a dialog with configuration parameters -- these are the same as for the [soft proof](./soft-proof.md) option.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໄອຄອນເພື່ອເປີດກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕັ້ງຄ່າ -- ພາຣາມິເຕີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບຕົວເລືອກ [soft proof](./soft-proof.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/gamut.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You might also like to consider using the [clipping warning](./clipping.md), which also provides under- and over-exposure warnings as well as a gamut check similar to that offered by this module.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າອາດຈະພິຈາລະນາການໃຊ້ [clipping warning](./clipping.md), ເຊິ່ງໃຫ້ທັງຄຳເຕືອນການຮັບແສງໜ້ອຍເກີນໄປ ແລະ ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ, ລວມທັງການກວດສອບຂອບເຂດສີທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັບສິ່ງທີ່ໂມດູນນີ້ມີໃຫ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "snapshots"
msgstr "ພາບຖ່າຍສະນັບຊັອດ (snapshots)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Store development snapshots and compare with the current edit.\n"
msgstr "ເກັບພາບຖ່າຍສະນັບຊັອດໃນຂະນະແຕ່ງພາບ ແລະ ປຽບທຽບກັບການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Snapshots can be taken at any point in the development process and later overlaid onto the current center view or shown side-by-side. This allows you to undertake a comparison (by default left=snapshot, right=active edit) while you are tuning parameters of a module. It can also be combined with the [history stack](./history-stack.md) module to compare a snapshot against different stages of development. \n"
msgstr "ສະນັບຊັອດສາມາດຖ່າຍໄດ້ໃນທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນຂອງການແຕ່ງພາບ ແລະ ສາມາດນຳມາຊ້ອນເທິງມຸມມອງກາງປັດຈຸບັນ ຫຼື ສະແດງແບບຂ້າງກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າປຽບທຽບພາບໄດ້ (ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຊ້າຍ=ສະນັບຊັອດ, ຂວາ=ການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນ) ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງປັບພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງໂມດູນ. ມັນຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບໂມດູນ [ລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ](./history-stack.md) ເພື່ອປຽບທຽບສະນັບຊັອດກັບຂັ້ນຕອນຕ່າງໆຂອງການແຕ່ງພາບ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To take a snapshot, click on the _take snapshot_ button. Above the button you will see a list of the snapshots that have been taken for this editing session. The name of each snapshot reflects the name of the module selected in the history stack and its position at the time the snapshot was taken. You can choose your own label for a snapshot by Ctrl+clicking on the snapshot name -- this will be displayed after the module name, separated with a bullet.\n"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຖ່າຍສະນັບຊັອດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກທີ່ປຸ່ມ _take snapshot_. ທາງເທິງປຸ່ມເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນລາຍຊື່ສະນັບຊັອດທີ່ຖືກຖ່າຍໄວ້ໃນການເຮັດວຽກຄັ້ງນີ້. ຊື່ຂອງແຕ່ລະສະນັບຊັອດຈະສະທ້ອນເຖິງຊື່ໂມດູນທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນໃນຕອນທີ່ຖ່າຍ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ປ້າຍຂອງເຈົ້າເອງໄດ້ໂດຍການ Ctrl+click ໃສ່ຊື່ສະນັບຊັອດ -- ຊື່ນັ້ນຈະຖືກສະແດງຕໍ່ຈາກຊື່ໂມດູນ ແລະ ຂັ້ນດ້ວຍຈຸດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the name of a snapshot to show it.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ສະນັບຊັອດເພື່ອສະແດງມັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "At all times, an arrow containing the letter \"S\" is displayed to indicate which side of the image is the snapshot and which is the current edit.\n"
msgstr "ຈະມີລູກສອນທີ່ມີຕົວອັກສອນ \"S\" ສະແດງຢູ່ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ ເພື່ອບອກວ່າເບື້ອງໃດຂອງພາບແມ່ນສະນັບຊັອດ ແລະ ເບື້ອງໃດແມ່ນການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can pan or zoom the image while using the snapshot view using your keyboard or mouse. To pan with the mouse you will need to hold the \"a\" key while clicking and dragging (this key can be configured in [preferences > shortcuts > views > darkroom > force pan & zoom with mouse](../../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)).\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລື່ອນ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍພາບໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ວິວສະນັບຊັອດໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີບອດ ຫຼື ເມົາສ໌. ເພື່ອເລື່ອນພາບດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌ ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງກົດປຸ່ມ \"a\" ຄ້າງໄວ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກ (ປຸ່ມນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໃນ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຄີລັດ > ມຸມມອງ > ຫ້ອງມືດ > force pan & zoom with mouse](../../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the name of the snapshot again to disable the overlay and return to your editing session. Click the module's reset button to remove all existing snapshots. \n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ສະນັບຊັອດອີກເທື່ອໜຶ່ງເພື່ອປິດການວາງຊ້ອນ ແລະ ກັບໄປຫາການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄລິກປຸ່ມລ້າງຄ່າ (reset) ຂອງໂມດູນເພື່ອລຶບສະນັບຊັອດທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can restore a snapshot to the current history stack (which will replace the history stack of the current image with the stack taken from that snapshot) by clicking the ![restore-snapshot icon](./snapshots/restore-snapshot.png#icon) icon to the right of the snapshot name.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດກູ້ຄືນສະນັບຊັອດໄປຍັງລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນ (ເຊິ່ງຈະປ່ຽນແທນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຂອງພາບປັດຈຸບັນດ້ວຍລຳດັບທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກສະນັບຊັອດນັ້ນ) ໂດຍການຄລິກໄອຄອນ ![restore-snapshot icon](./snapshots/restore-snapshot.png#icon) ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງຊື່ສະນັບຊັອດ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "overlay view"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງແບບວາງຊ້ອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, selecting a snapshot enables a split view between the saved snapshot image and the current state of the processed image. You can control the position of the split-line by clicking and dragging the line with your mouse. If you hover over the split-line with your mouse, a small rotation icon will appear on the center of the line. Click this icon to change between vertical and horizontal split view -- the positions of the snapshot and current image will be rotated anti-clockwise allowing you to choose whether they appear to the top, bottom, left or right of the screen. \n"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ການເລືອກສະນັບຊັອດຈະເປີດມຸມມອງແບບແບ່ງຈໍລະຫວ່າງພາບສະນັບຊັອດທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ ແລະ ສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງພາບທີ່ປະມວນຜົນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເສັ້ນແບ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກ ແລະ ລາກເສັ້ນນັ້ນດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌. ຖ້າເຈົ້າວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງເສັ້ນແບ່ງ, ໄອຄອນການໝຸນນ້ອຍໆຈະປາກົດຢູ່ກາງເສັ້ນ. ຄລິກໄອຄອນນີ້ເພື່ອສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງການແບ່ງຈໍແບບລວງຕັ້ງ ແລະ ລວງນອນ -- ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງສະນັບຊັອດ ແລະ ພາບປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກໝຸນທວນເຂັມໂມງ ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະໃຫ້ພວກມັນປາກົດຢູ່ ທາງເທິງ, ລຸ່ມ, ຊ້າຍ ຫຼື ຂວາ ຂອງໜ້າຈໍ. \n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "side-by-side view"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງແບບຂ້າງກັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can toggle a side-by-side snapshot view by clicking on the ![sidebyside-snapshot icon](./snapshots/sidebyside-snapshot.png#icon) icon to the right of the _take snapshot_ button.\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດເປີດ/ປິດມຸມມອງສະນັບຊັອດແບບຂ້າງກັນໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ ![sidebyside-snapshot icon](./snapshots/sidebyside-snapshot.png#icon) ທາງດ້ານຂວາຂອງປຸ່ມ _take snapshot_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Selecting a snapshot then splits the center viewport into two equal panels, one showing the snapshot and one showing the current state of the processed image. The dividing line can not be moved and any click without \"a\" rotates the layout -- switching between showing the snapshot to the left, below, right, or above the current image.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອເລືອກສະນັບຊັອດ, ມຸມມອງກາງຈະຖືກແບ່ງອອກເປັນສອງສ່ວນເທົ່າກັນ, ສ່ວນໜຶ່ງສະແດງສະນັບຊັອດ ແລະ ອີກສ່ວນສະແດງສະຖານະປັດຈຸບັນຂອງພາບ. ເສັ້ນແບ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດຍ້າຍໄດ້ ແລະ ການຄລິກໃດໆໂດຍບໍ່ກົດປຸ່ມ \"a\" ຈະເປັນການໝຸນຮູບແບບການວາງ -- ສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງການສະແດງສະນັບຊັອດຢູ່ ທາງຊ້າຍ, ທາງລຸ່ມ, ທາງຂວາ ຫຼື ທາງເທິງ ຂອງພາບປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/snapshots.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** Snapshots are retained for the duration of your darktable session. This means that you can also use snapshots to compare with another image. Just navigate to that image and enable the snapshot view as normal. When you do this, an arrow appears in the snapshot name to indicate it was not taken from the current image -- hover over the name with your mouse to see the originating image name in a tooltip.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ສະນັບຊັອດຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ຕະຫຼອດໄລຍະເວລາການໃຊ້ງານ darktable ໃນຄັ້ງນັ້ນ. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ສະນັບຊັອດເພື່ອປຽບທຽບກັບພາບອື່ນໄດ້ຄືກັນ. ພຽງແຕ່ເລື່ອນໄປຫາພາບນັ້ນ ແລະ ເປີດມຸມມອງສະນັບຊັອດຕາມປົກກະຕິ. ເມື່ອເຮັດແບບນີ້, ລູກສອນຈະປາກົດໃນຊື່ສະນັບຊັອດເພື່ອບອກວ່າມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ມາຈາກພາບປັດຈຸບັນ -- ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງຊື່ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊື່ພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບໃນທູລທິບ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/duplicate-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "duplicate manager"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການພາບສຳເນົາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/duplicate-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "View and create multiple versions of the current image. Each version can be edited independently without affecting other versions -- all versions use the same underlying image file, but the editing history of each version is stored in its own independent XMP sidecar file. \n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ ແລະ ສ້າງພາບຫຼາຍເວີຊັນຈາກພາບດຽວກັນ. ແຕ່ລະເວີຊັນສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນເອກະລາດໂດຍບໍ່ກະທົບຕໍ່ເວີຊັນອື່ນ -- ທຸກເວີຊັນໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ພາບຕົ້ນສະບັບດຽວກັນ, ແຕ່ປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂຂອງແຕ່ລະເວີຊັນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ XMP sidecar ຂອງມັນເອງ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/duplicate-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The duplicate manager lists each version of the current darkroom image along with its preview thumbnail. Hold down the left mouse button on a thumbnail to temporarily show that version in the center view. Double-click to switch to that version and edit it. \n"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການພາບສຳເນົາຈະລາຍຊື່ແຕ່ລະເວີຊັນຂອງພາບໃນຫ້ອງມືດປັດຈຸບັນ ພ້ອມກັບຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnail). ກົດເມົາສ໌ຊ້າຍຄ້າງໄວ້ເທິງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອສະແດງເວີຊັນນັ້ນໃນມຸມມອງກາງຊົ່ວຄາວ. ຄລິກສອງບາດເພື່ອສະຫຼັບໄປຍັງເວີຊັນນັ້ນ ແລະ ເລີ່ມແກ້ໄຂ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/duplicate-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The buttons at the bottom of the module allow you to create new duplicates of the current image. You can either create a 'virgin' version (with an empty history stack) using the \"original\" button or an exact duplicate of the current edit using the \"duplicate\" button.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງໂມດູນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງພາບສຳເນົາໃໝ່ຂອງພາບປັດຈຸບັນ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດສ້າງເວີຊັນ 'ບໍລິສຸດ' (ທີ່ບໍ່ມີປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂ) ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ \"original\" ຫຼື ສ້າງສຳເນົາທີ່ຄືກັບການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນທຸກປະການໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ \"duplicate\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/duplicate-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A version number is displayed to the right of each thumbnail. Click in the area below the version number to enter a description against that version of the image. This description is stored in the _version name_ metadata tag, which can also be edited within the [metadata editor](../shared/metadata-editor.md) module in the lighttable view.\n"
msgstr "ເລກເວີຊັນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງຂວາຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ. ຄລິກໃສ່ພື້ນທີ່ກ້ອງເລກເວີຊັນເພື່ອໃສ່ຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບເວີຊັນນັ້ນຂອງພາບ. ຄຳອະທິບາຍນີ້ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນແທັກເມຕາດາ _version name_, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໃນໂມດູນ [metadata editor](../shared/metadata-editor.md) ໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ (lighttable).\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "mask manager"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການມາກສ໌ (mask manager)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage all drawn masks and shapes for the current image.\n"
msgstr "ຈັດການມາກສ໌ທີ່ແຕ້ມຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຮູບຊົງທັງໝົດສຳລັບພາບປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![mask manager](./mask-manager/mask-manager.png#w25)\n"
msgstr "![mask manager](./mask-manager/mask-manager.png#w25)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module can be used to create, rename, edit and delete shapes. You can alter the shapes in a drawn mask, group shapes together, and combine them using set operators.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງ, ປ່ຽນຊື່, ແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ລຶບຮູບຊົງ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງຮູບຊົງໃນມາກສ໌ທີ່ແຕ້ມຂຶ້ນ, ຮວມຮູບຊົງເຂົ້າກັນເປັນກຸ່ມ, ແລະ ປະສົມພວກມັນເຂົ້າກັນໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງເຊັດ (set operators).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The top line of the mask manager panel contains buttons that can be used to create new shapes. These are the same as in the [drawn mask](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) interface of the processing modules.\n"
msgstr "ແຖວທາງເທິງຂອງແຖບຕົວຈັດການມາກສ໌ປະກອບມີປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບຊົງໃໝ່. ປຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຄືກັນກັບໃນສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ [drawn mask](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) ຂອງໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The panel below these buttons displays a list of all masks and individual shapes defined for the current image.\n"
msgstr "ແຖບທີ່ຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມຂອງປຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຂອງມາກສ໌ທັງໝົດ ແລະ ຮູບຊົງແຕ່ລະອັນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບພາບປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Groups of shapes forming a drawn mask are displayed with a headline in the form \"group <module_name>\" to indicate the module in which they are used, with the constituent shapes listed below. The list of mask groups is followed by a list of all individual shapes that have been generated in the context of the current image (which also repeats the shapes that are part of a group). If a shape is in use by any drawn masks this is indicated by a symbol to the right of the shape name.\n"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ປະກອບເປັນມາກສ໌ຈະຖືກສະແດງດ້ວຍຫົວຂໍ້ໃນຮູບແບບ \"group <ຊື່_ໂມດູນ>\" ເພື່ອບອກວ່າພວກມັນຖືກໃຊ້ໃນໂມດູນໃດ, ໂດຍມີຮູບຊົງສ່ວນປະກອບລາຍຊື່ອຍູ່ທາງລຸ່ມ. ຖັດຈາກລາຍຊື່ກຸ່ມມາກສ໌ແມ່ນລາຍຊື່ຮູບຊົງແຕ່ລະອັນທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນພາບປັດຈຸບັນ (ເຊິ່ງຈະມີຮູບຊົງທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງກຸ່ມລວມຢູ່ນຳ). ຖ້າຮູບຊົງໃດຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍມາກສ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງ, ຈະມີສັນຍາລັກສະແດງຢູ່ທາງຂວາຂອງຊື່ຮູບຊົງນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default each shape receives an automatically generated name, consisting of the shape type (\"brush\", \"circle\", \"ellipse\", \"path\", \"gradient\") and an automatically-incremented integer. You can rename a shape by double-clicking on its current name. It is a good habit to give shapes and groups meaningful names, especially if you intend to reuse the same selection in different masks.\n"
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງຈະໄດ້ຮັບຊື່ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ປະກອບດ້ວຍປະເພດຮູບຊົງ (ເຊັ່ນ: \"brush\", \"circle\", \"ellipse\", \"path\", \"gradient\") ແລະ ຕົວເລກລຳດັບ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປ່ຽນຊື່ຮູບຊົງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກສອງບາດໃສ່ຊື່ປັດຈຸບັນ. ມັນເປັນນິໄສທີ່ດີທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຊື່ຮູບຊົງ ແລະ ກຸ່ມໃຫ້ມີຄວາມໝາຍ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ສ່ວນທີ່ເລືອກດຽວກັນນັ້ນຊ້ຳໃນມາກສ໌ອື່ນໆ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If any shape has a reduced opacity this will be shown to the right of the shape name. An icon representing the chosen [set operator (mode)](#set-operators-modes) is shown to the left (except for the first shape in a group, which has no prior shape to be combined with).\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າຮູບຊົງໃດມີການຫຼຸດຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ (opacity), ມັນຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງຂວາຂອງຊື່ຮູບຊົງ. ໄອຄອນທີ່ສະແດງເຖິງ [ຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງເຊັດ (ໂໝດ)](#set-operators-modes) ທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງຢູ່ທາງຊ້າຍ (ຍົກເວັ້ນຮູບຊົງທຳອິດໃນກຸ່ມ, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ມີຮູບຊົງກ່ອນໜ້ານັ້ນໃຫ້ປະສົມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on a shape name to show the selected shape on the image canvas with all of its controls, allowing you to edit the properties of just that shape. This is especially useful where there are many overlapping shapes within a mask, making it difficult to select the right one with the mouse. Similarly if you select a shape on-screen from within the mask controls of a processing module, that shape will also be selected in the mask manager.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຮູບຊົງເພື່ອສະແດງຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກເທິງພາບ ພ້ອມກັບຕົວຄວບຄຸມທັງໝົດຂອງມັນ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຮູບຊົງນັ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຮູບຊົງຊ້ອນກັນຫຼາຍໆອັນໃນມາກສ໌ດຽວ, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ຍາກໃນການເລືອກອັນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌. ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າເລືອກຮູບຊົງເທິງໜ້າຈໍຈາກພາຍໃນຕົວຄວບຄຸມມາກສ໌ຂອງໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນ, ຮູບຊົງນັ້ນກໍຈະຖືກເລືອກໃນຕົວຈັດການມາກສ໌ຄືກັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click on a shape name to show a menu containing additional options (explained below).\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊື່ຮູບຊົງເພື່ອສະແດງເມນູທີ່ມີຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ (ອະທິບາຍຢູ່ທາງລຸ່ມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** darktable retains all shapes that have ever been defined for the current image unless you explicitly remove them. If you choose to include develop history when exporting an image, all defined shapes will be exported with the image. Beware that if the list of shapes is very long the space required to store those shapes might exceed the size limit of certain file formats. This can cause XMP tag creation to fail during export.\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ:** darktable ຈະເກັບຮັກສາທຸກຮູບຊົງທີ່ເຄີຍກຳນົດໄວ້ສຳລັບພາບປັດຈຸບັນ ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ເຈົ້າຈະລຶບພວກມັນອອກເອງ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າເລືອກທີ່ຈະລວມປະຫວັດການແຕ່ງພາບເມື່ອສົ່ງອອກພາບ, ທຸກຮູບຊົງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງອອກໄປພ້ອມກັບພາບ. ຈົ່ງລະວັງວ່າຖ້າລາຍຊື່ຮູບຊົງຍາວຫຼາຍ, ພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຮູບຊົງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນອາດຈະເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງບາງຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌, ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການສ້າງແທັກ XMP ລົ້ມເຫຼວໃນລະຫວ່າງການສົ່ງອອກ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "masks & groups"
msgstr "ມາກສ໌ & ກຸ່ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drawn masks are constructed by adding a group of shapes to the image in the order that they are listed (from bottom to top -- the same order as processing modules are displayed). Each shape adjusts the existing mask using one of five logical set operators (see below). Because order is important it is also possible to move shapes up and down the list via the right-click menu.\n"
msgstr "ມາກສ໌ທີ່ແຕ້ມຂຶ້ນແມ່ນຖືກສ້າງໂດຍການເພີ່ມກຸ່ມຂອງຮູບຊົງລົງໃນພາບຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ພວກມັນຖືກລາຍຊື່ໄວ້ (ຈາກລຸ່ມຂຶ້ນເທິງ -- ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບລຳດັບການສະແດງຂອງໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນ). ແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງຈະປັບມາກສ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໂດຍໃຊ້ໜຶ່ງໃນຫ້າຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງໂລຊິກ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ). ເນື່ອງຈາກລຳດັບເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນ, ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດຍ້າຍຮູບຊົງຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ລົງໃນລາຍຊື່ໄດ້ຜ່ານເມນູຄລິກຂວາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the name of a group in the mask manager to expand that group, showing a list of its constituent shapes -- the corresponding shapes will be shown on the center image. Similarly if you choose to show a drawn mask from within a processing module, the corresponding group will be expanded within the mask manager.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກໃສ່ຊື່ຂອງກຸ່ມໃນຕົວຈັດການມາກສ໌ເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍກຸ່ມນັ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະສະແດງລາຍຊື່ຮູບຊົງທີ່ເປັນສ່ວນປະກອບ -- ຮູບຊົງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກສະແດງເທິງພາບຢູ່ກາງຈໍ. ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ຖ້າເຈົ້າເລືອກສະແດງມາກສ໌ຈາກພາຍໃນໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນ, ກຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກໍຈະຖືກຂະຫຍາຍອອກໃນຕົວຈັດການມາກສ໌.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click on a group name to display a menu with options to add new or existing shapes to the group, or to clean up unused shapes. You can also choose to delete the group.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊື່ກຸ່ມເພື່ອສະແດງເມນູທີ່ມີຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອເພີ່ມຮູບຊົງໃໝ່ ຫຼື ຮູບຊົງທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຂົ້າໃນກຸ່ມ, ຫຼື ເພື່ອລ້າງຮູບຊົງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້. ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດເລືອກລຶບກຸ່ມນັ້ນໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click on any of the constituent shapes to control how that shape contributes to the overall group mask as follows:\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຮູບຊົງສ່ວນປະກອບໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວ່າຮູບຊົງນັ້ນຈະສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ມາກສ໌ໂດຍລວມຂອງກຸ່ມແນວໃດ ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"remove from group\n"
": Remove the shape from the current mask.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເອົາອອກຈາກກຸ່ມ (remove from group)\n"
": ເອົາຮູບຊົງອອກຈາກມາກສ໌ປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use inverted shape\n"
": Invert the polarity of the selected shape.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ຮູບຊົງແບບກັບດ້ານ (use inverted shape)\n"
": ກັບດ້ານ (invert) ຄ່າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mode\n"
": Choose how this shape will be combined with the preceding mask by selecting one of the five set operators defined below. The currently-selected mode is highlighted with a check mark.\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ (mode)\n"
": ເລືອກວິທີທີ່ຮູບຊົງນີ້ຈະປະສົມກັບມາກສ໌ກ່ອນໜ້າ ໂດຍການເລືອກໜຶ່ງໃນຫ້າຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງເຊັດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ. ໂໝດທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່ປັດຈຸບັນຈະຖືກໝາຍດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍຖືກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"move up/down\n"
": Move the shape up or down the list.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຍ້າຍຂຶ້ນ/ລົງ (move up/down)\n"
": ຍ້າຍຮູບຊົງຂຶ້ນ ຫຼື ລົງໃນລາຍຊື່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also create your own groups using existing shapes by selecting the shapes you wish to group, right-clicking them and choosing \"group the forms\".\n"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດສ້າງກຸ່ມຂອງເຈົ້າເອງໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບຊົງທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ໂດຍການເລືອກຮູບຊົງທີ່ຕ້ອງການຮວມກຸ່ມ, ຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ພວກມັນ ແລ້ວເລືອກ \"group the forms\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expand the _properties_ section to change the properties (_opacity_, _size_, _rotation_, _feather_, _hardness_) of the currently selected shape(s).\n"
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍສ່ວນ _properties_ (ຄຸນສົມບັດ) ເພື່ອປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດ (ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສ, ຂະໜາດ, ການໝຸນ, ຄວາມຟຸ້ງ, ຄວາມແຂງ) ຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a _group_ is selected, the soft limits of the sliders are automatically adjusted in an attempt to prevent irreversible distortions (where some of the shapes are clamped at their extreme values but others can still be adjusted, so that reversing the move does not return all shapes to their previous configuration). However, like any soft limits, these can be overridden (forced) if you are happy to accept the consequences.\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າເລືອກ _ກຸ່ມ_, ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງແຖບເລື່ອນຈະຖືກປັບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການບິດເບືອນທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນໄດ້ (ບ່ອນທີ່ບາງຮູບຊົງຖືກຕັດຢູ່ຄ່າສູງສຸດແຕ່ບາງຮູບຊົງຍັງປັບໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການຢ້ອນກັບການກະທຳບໍ່ໄດ້ຄືເກົ່າ). ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດບັງຄັບເກີນຂີດຈຳກັດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄດ້ ຖ້າເຈົ້າຍອມຮັບຜົນທີ່ຈະຕາມມາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a pen (e.g. Wacom) is detected, some additional options are also displayed to control how it is used by darktable:\n"
msgstr "ຖ້າກວດພົບປາກກາ (ເຊັ່ນ: Wacom), ຈະມີຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມສະແດງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ມັນຖືກໃຊ້ໃນ darktable:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pressure\n"
": Controls how the pressure reading of a graphics tablet impacts newly generated [drawn mask](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) brush strokes. You can control the brush width, hardness and opacity. “Absolute” control means that the pressure reading directly defines the attribute with a value between 0% and 100%. “Relative” means that the pressure reading adjusts the attribute between zero and the pre-defined default value (default off).\n"
msgstr ""
"ແຮງກົດ (pressure)\n"
": ຄວບຄຸມວ່າການອ່ານຄ່າແຮງກົດຂອງແທັບເລັດກຣາບຟິກ ມີຜົນກະທົບແນວໃດຕໍ່ກັບການລາກເສັ້ນແປງ [ໜ້າກາກແບບແຕ້"
"ມ (drawn mask)](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ"
"ໃໝ່. ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຄວາມກວ້າງ, ຄວາມແຂງ ແລະ ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງແປງໄດ້. ການຄວບຄຸມແບບ “ສຳບູນ "
"(Absolute)” ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄ່າແຮງກົດຈະກຳນົດຄຸນລັກສະນະນັ້ນໂດຍກົງດ້ວຍຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 0% ຫາ 100%. “ສຳພັ"
"ນ (Relative)” ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າຄ່າແຮງກົດຈະປັບຄຸນລັກສະນະລະຫວ່າງສູນ ຫາ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ (ປິດໂດຍເລີ່"
"ມຕົ້ນ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"smoothing\n"
": Sets the level for smoothing of [drawn mask](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md) brush strokes. Stronger smoothing leads to fewer nodes and easier editing at the expense of lower accuracy.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເຮັດໃຫ້ລຽບ (smoothing)\n"
": ຕັ້ງລະດັບຄວາມລຽບຂອງເສັ້ນຫົວແປງ [drawn mask](../../../darkroom/masking-and-blending/masks/drawn.md). ການເຮັດໃຫ້ລຽບຫຼາຍຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ມີຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (nodes) ໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ແຕ່ຈະສູນເສຍຄວາມແມ່ນຍຳ.\n"

#. type: Title #
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "set operators (modes)"
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງເຊັດ (ໂໝດ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set operators are used to define how grouped shapes are combined. In the following examples (with the exception of \"sum\") we will use a mask that combines a gradient followed by a path, to demonstrate the effect of each set operator when applied to the path shape:\n"
msgstr "ຕົວດຳເນີນການທາງເຊັດຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອບອກວ່າຮູບຊົງໃນກຸ່ມຈະປະສົມກັນແນວໃດ. ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ (ຍົກເວັ້ນ \"sum\") ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ສີຫຼ່ຽມໄລ່ລະດັບ (gradient) ຕາມດ້ວຍເສັ້ນທາງ (path), ເພື່ອສະແດງຜົນຂອງແຕ່ລະຕົວດຳເນີນການເມື່ອນຳໃຊ້ກັບຮູບຊົງເສັ້ນທາງ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "![gradient](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex1.png#w33#inline) ![path](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex2.png#w33#inline)\n"
msgstr "![gradient](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex1.png#w33#inline) ![path](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex2.png#w33#inline)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As a convention in the following explanations we say that a pixel is \"selected\" in a mask or shape if it has an opacity greater than zero.\n"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃນຄຳອະທິບາຍຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນ: ພິກເຊວທີ່ຖືກ \"ເລືອກ\" ໃນມາກສ໌ ຫຼື ຮູບຊົງ ຄືພິກເຊວທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຫຼາຍກວ່າສູນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sum (default for brush shapes)\n"
": The shape adds to the existing mask by increasing its opacity by the opacity of the drawn shape. This allows multiple shapes (e.g. brush strokes) with low opacity to be layered on top of one another to increase the strength of the overall mask (e.g. for dodge and burn operations). The resulting opacity of a given pixel is the sum of the opacity of the individual shapes that intersect with that pixel, up to a maximum of 100%.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຜົນຮວມ (sum) (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຫົວແປງ)\n"
": ຮູບຊົງຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນມາກສ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໂດຍການເພີ່ມຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຕາມຄ່າຂອງຮູບຊົງທີ່ແຕ້ມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຫຼາຍຮູບຊົງ (ເຊັ່ນ ເສັ້ນຫົວແປງ) ທີ່ມີຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຕ່ຳສາມາດວາງຊ້ອນກັນເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງມາກສ໌ໂດຍລວມ (ເຊັ່ນ ໃນການເຮັດ dodge and burn). ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສສຸດທ້າຍຂອງພິກເຊວແມ່ນຜົນຮວມຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງແຕ່ລະຮູບຊົງທີ່ທັບກັນ, ແຕ່ບໍ່ເກີນ 100%.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"union (default for non-brush shapes)\n"
": The shape adds to the existing mask in such a way that the resulting mask contains the pixels that are _either_ selected in the existing mask _or_ in the added shape. In overlapping areas the maximum value is taken:\n"
msgstr ""
"ຢູນຽນ (union) (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຮູບຊົງທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນຫົວແປງ)\n"
": ຮູບຊົງຈະເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນມາກສ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນແບບທີ່ມາກສ໌ໃໝ່ຈະລວມພິກເຊວທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ _ບໍ່ວ່າຈະ_ ໃນມາກສ໌ເກົ່າ _ຫຼື_ ໃນຮູບຊົງທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃໝ່. ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ທັບກັນ ຈະເອົາຄ່າສູງສຸດ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![union](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex3.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![union](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex3.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"intersection\n"
": The shape adds to the existing mask in such a way that the resulting mask contains only pixels that are selected in _both_ the existing mask _and_ the added shape. In overlapping areas the minimum value is used. In the given example we use this operator to “imprint” the path with a gradient:\n"
msgstr ""
"intersection\n"
": ຮູບຊົງຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໜ້າກາກທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ໃນລັກສະນະທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ໜ້າກາກຜົນລັດມີພຽງແຕ່ພິກເຊວທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ໃນ "
"_ທັງສອງ_ ຄື: ໜ້າກາກທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ _ແລະ_ ຮູບຊົງທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ. ໃນສ່ວນທີ່ທັບຊ້ອນກັນ, ຄ່າຕໍ່າສຸດຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້. "
"ໃນຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ໃຫ້ມານີ້, ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ຕົວດຳເນີນການນີ້ເພື່ອ “ປະທັບຕາ” (imprint) ເສັ້ນທາງດ້ວຍການໄລ່ສີ "
"(gradient):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![intersection](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex4.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![intersection](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex4.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"difference\n"
": In the non-overlapping area the existing mask is unchanged. In the resulting mask, pixels are selected only if they are selected in the existing mask but _not_ in the added shape. This set operator can be chosen if you want to “cut out” a region from within an existing selection:\n"
msgstr ""
"ສ່ວນຕ່າງ (difference)\n"
": ໃນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ບໍ່ທັບຊ້ອນກັນ ໜ້າກາກທີ່ມີຢູ່ຈະບໍ່ປ່ຽນແປງ. ໃນໜ້າກາກທີ່ໄດ້, ພິກເຊວຈະຖືກເລືອກກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອພວກມັນຖືກເລືອກ"
"ໃນໜ້າກາກທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແຕ່ _ບໍ່ໄດ້_ ຖືກເລືອກໃນຮູບຊົງທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ. ຕົວດຳເນີນການຊຸດນີ້ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງກ"
"ານ “ຕັດ” ເຂດໃດໜຶ່ງອອກຈາກການເລືອກທີ່ມີຢູ່:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![difference](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex5.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![difference](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex5.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"exclusion\n"
": The resulting mask selects all pixels that are selected in the existing mask and not in the added shape or vice versa. This is equivalent to an “exclusive or”:\n"
msgstr ""
"ການຍົກເວັ້ນ (exclusion)\n"
": ໜ້າກາກທີ່ໄດ້ຈະເລືອກທຸກພິກເຊວທີ່ຖືກເລືອກໃນໜ້າກາກທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເລືອກໃນຮູບຊົງທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ ຫຼື ໃນທາງ"
"ກັບກັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ “exclusive or”:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/mask-manager.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": ![exclusion](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex6.png#w33)\n"
msgstr ": ![exclusion](./mask-manager/mask-manager_ex6.png#w33)\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "raw overexposed warning"
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນ raw ໄດ້ຮັບແສງຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highlight areas of the image where color channels of the raw input file are clipped. \n"
msgstr "ເນັ້ນສ່ວນຂອງພາບທີ່ຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີຂອງໄຟລ໌ raw ຂາເຂົ້າເກີດສ່ວນເກີນ (clipped). \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clipped color channels imply an overexposed image with loss of information in the affected areas. Some of this information may be recoverable using the [_highlight reconstruction_](../../processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md), [_color reconstruction_](../../processing-modules/color-reconstruction.md) or [_filmic rgb_](../../processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md) modules.\n"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດໝາຍເຖິງພາບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບແສງຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ (overexposed) ແລະ ມີການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນໃນສ່ວນນັ້ນ. ຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນອາດຈະກູ້ຄືນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນ [_highlight reconstruction_](../../processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md), [_color reconstruction_](../../processing-modules/color-reconstruction.md) ຫຼື [_filmic rgb_](../../processing-modules/filmic-rgb.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click on the ![raw overexposed](./raw-overexposed/raw-overexposed-icon.png#icon) icon to show/hide the warning overlay. Right-click on the icon to open a dialog containing the following configuration parameters. \t\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ ![raw overexposed](./raw-overexposed/raw-overexposed-icon.png#icon) ເພື່ອສະແດງ/ເຊື່ອງເສັ້ນເຕືອນ. ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໄອຄອນເພື່ອເປີດກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕັ້ງຄ່າ ທີ່ມີພາຣາມິເຕີດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: \t\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mode\n"
": Choose how to mark clipped areas:\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດ (mode)\n"
": ເລືອກວິທີໝາຍສ່ວນທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _mark with CFA color_: Display a pattern of the respective primary colors (red, green, and blue) to indicate which color channels are clipped. \n"
msgstr ": - _mark with CFA color_: ສະແດງລວດລາຍຂອງສີຫຼັກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ (ແດງ, ຂຽວ, ຟ້າ) ເພື່ອບອກວ່າຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີໃດທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _mark with solid color_: Mark clipped areas with a user defined solid color (see below) independent of the affected color channels. \n"
msgstr ": - _mark with solid color_: ໝາຍສ່ວນທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດດ້ວຍສີດຽວທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ກຳນົດ (ເບິ່ງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ) ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນວ່າເປັນຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີໃດ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ": - _false color_: Set clipped color channels to zero in the affected areas.\n"
msgstr ": - _false color_: ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊ່ອງສັນຍານສີທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດໃຫ້ເປັນສູນໃນສ່ວນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"color scheme\n"
": Choose the solid color for the _mark with solid color_ mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບສີ (color scheme)\n"
": ເລືອກສີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນໂໝດ _mark with solid color_.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/raw-overexposed.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clipping threshold\n"
": Set the threshold defining what values are considered to be overexposed. You can safely leave this slider at its default value of 1.0 (white level) in most cases. \n"
msgstr ""
"ເກນສ່ວນເກີນ (clipping threshold)\n"
": ຕັ້ງຄ່າເກນເພື່ອບອກວ່າຄ່າໃດທີ່ຖືວ່າໄດ້ຮັບແສງຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ເຈົ້າສາມາດປະແຖບເລື່ອນນີ້ໄວ້ທີ່ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 1.0 (ລະດັບສີຂາວ) ໄດ້ໃນເກືອບທຸກກໍລະນີ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "View and modify the [history stack](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/history-stack.md) of the current darkroom image.\n"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂ [ລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ](../../../darkroom/pixelpipe/history-stack.md) ຂອງພາບໃນຫ້ອງມືດປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "This module lists every change of state (activate/de-activate/move/change parameters) for all processing modules that have been modified for the current image. Select a point in the stack to return to that point in the development history of the image. Shift+click an item in the history stack to expand that module in the right-hand module panel without changing the current edit.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນນີ້ຈະລາຍຊື່ທຸກການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງສະຖານະ (ການເປີດ/ປິດ, ການຍ້າຍ, ການປ່ຽນພາຣາມິເຕີ) ສຳລັບທຸກໂມດູນປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຖືກປັບແຕ່ງໃນພາບປັດຈຸບັນ. ເລືອກຈຸດໃດໜຶ່ງໃນລຳດັບເພື່ອຢ້ອນກັບໄປຫາຂັ້ນຕອນນັ້ນໃນປະຫວັດການແຕ່ງພາບ. Shift+click ໃສ່ລາຍການໃນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອຂະຫຍາຍໂມດູນນັ້ນໃນແຖບໂມດູນເບື້ອງຂວາ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Caution:** If you select a module in the history stack and then make further modifications to the image, all edits above the currently selected step will be discarded. It is easy to lose development work on an image in this way! You can usually use Ctrl+Z to undo such changes.\n"
msgstr "**ຂໍ້ຄວນລະວັງ:** ຖ້າເຈົ້າເລືອກໂມດູນໃດໜຶ່ງໃນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ ແລ້ວເຮັດການປັບແຕ່ງພາບເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ເລືອກນັ້ນຈະຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ. ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ງ່າຍທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການແຕ່ງພາບທີ່ເຮັດມາກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ສູນເສຍໄປດ້ວຍວິທີນີ້! ເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ Ctrl+Z ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງດັ່ງກ່າວໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is safe to quit the program, leave the darkroom mode, or switch to another image after having selected some earlier state in the history stack module. When returning to that image you will find the history stack panel in the state where you left it.\n"
msgstr "ມັນປອດໄພທີ່ຈະປິດໂປຣແກຣມ, ອອກຈາກໂໝດຫ້ອງມືດ ຫຼື ສະຫຼັບໄປຍັງພາບອື່ນ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ໄດ້ເລືອກຂັ້ນຕອນໃດໜຶ່ງໃນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂໄວ້. ເມື່ອກັບມາທີ່ພາບນັ້ນ ເຈົ້າຈະເຫັນແຖບລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະທີ່ເຈົ້າປະໄວ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hover the mouse over an item in the history stack to show a tooltip with details of all changes that were made in that module compared to its previous or default state. This can help you to track down adjustments that were made unintentionally.\n"
msgstr "ວາງເມົາສ໌ໄວ້ເທິງລາຍການໃນລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂເພື່ອສະແດງທູລທິບ (tooltip) ທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດໃນໂມດູນນັ້ນ ເມື່ອທຽບກັບສະຖານະກ່ອນໜ້າ ຫຼື ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າກວດສອບການປັບແຕ່ງທີ່ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click “compress history stack” to generate the shortest history stack that reproduces the current image. This causes all edits above the currently-selected step to be discarded. If any module appears multiple times in the remainder of the stack, these will be _compressed_ into a single step in the history.\n"
msgstr ""
": ຄລິກ “ບີບອັດລຳດັບປະຫວັດ” (compress history stack) ເພື່ອສ້າງລຳດັບປະຫວັດການແກ້ໄຂທີ່ສັ້ນທີ່ສຸດເພື່"
"ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ຜົນຮູບພາບປະຈຸບັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດທີ່ຢູ່ເໜືອຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ເລືອກໃນປະຈຸບັນຖືກຍົກເລີກ. ຖ້າມີໂມດູ"
"ນໃດໜຶ່ງປະກົດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍຄັ້ງໃນສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງລຳດັບ, ພວກມັນຈະຖືກ _ບີບອັດ_ ໃຫ້ເປັນຂັ້ນຕອນດຽວໃນປະຫວັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click \"compress history stack\" while holding the Ctrl key to truncate the history stack without compressing it i.e. discard all modules above the currently selected one but leaving the remainder of the history stack unchanged.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກ \"ບີບອັດລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂ\" ໃນຂະນະທີ່ກົດປຸ່ມ Ctrl ຄ້າງໄວ້ ເພື່ອຕັດລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂໂດຍບໍ່ມີການບີບອັດ, ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງແມ່ນ ຖິ້ມທຸກໂມດູນທີ່ຢູ່ທາງເທິງຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ເລືອກ ແຕ່ປະສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອຂອງລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the \"reset parameters\" button in the module header to discard the entire history stack and reactivate any default modules. This can also be achieved by selecting the \"original image\" history item and clicking \"compress history stack\".\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກປຸ່ມ \"ລ້າງຄ່າພາຣາມິເຕີ\" (reset parameters) ໃນສ່ວນຫົວຂອງໂມດູນເພື່ອຖິ້ມລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂທັງໝົດ ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ໂມດູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄືນໃໝ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການເລືອກລາຍການ \"original image\" ແລ້ວຄລິກ \"compress history stack\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The button to the right of the \"compress history stack\" button allows you to create a new style from the history stack of the current image, which can then be applied to other images. Use the first line of the popup dialog window to name your style and the second to add a searchable description. You will be prompted to choose which of the modules from the current history stack to include in the style.\n"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມທີ່ຢູ່ທາງຂວາຂອງປຸ່ມ \"compress history stack\" ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສ້າງຮູບແບບ (style) ໃໝ່ຈາກລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂຂອງພາບປັດຈຸບັນ, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບພາບອື່ນໆໄດ້. ໃຊ້ແຖວທຳອິດຂອງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເພື່ອຕັ້ງຊື່ຮູບແບບ ແລະ ແຖວທີສອງເພື່ອໃສ່ຄຳອະທິບາຍທີ່ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້. ເຈົ້າຈະຖືກຖາມໃຫ້ເລືອກວ່າຈະເອົາໂມດູນໃດແດ່ຈາກລຳດັບການແກ້ໄຂປັດຈຸບັນເຂົ້າໄວ້ໃນຮູບແບບນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/history-stack.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once created, styles can be managed and applied to other images with the lighttable's [styles](../lighttable/styles.md) module.  You can also assign shortcut keys to your styles (see [preferences > shortcuts](../../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)) and apply the associated style to all selected images by pressing the shortcut key whenever you are in the lighttable or darkroom view.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອສ້າງແລ້ວ, ຮູບແບບສາມາດຈັດການ ແລະ ນຳໄປໃຊ້ກັບພາບອື່ນໆໄດ້ດ້ວຍໂມດູນ [styles](../lighttable/styles.md) ໃນໂຕະແສງ (lighttable). ເຈົ້າຍັງສາມາດກຳນົດຄີລັດໃຫ້ກັບຮູບແບບຂອງເຈົ້າໄດ້ (ເບິ່ງ [ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ > ຄີລັດ](../../../preferences-settings/shortcuts.md)) ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ຮູບແບບດັ່ງກ່າວກັບທຸກພາບທີ່ເລືອກໂດຍການກົດຄີລັດ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ຢູ່ໃນມຸມມອງໂຕະແສງ ຫຼື ຫ້ອງມືດ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "clipping warning"
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນສ່ວນເກີນ (clipping warning)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Highlight areas of the image that may exhibit luminance or gamut clipping.\n"
msgstr "ເນັ້ນສ່ວນຂອງພາບທີ່ອາດຈະມີສ່ວນເກີນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance) ຫຼື ສ່ວນເກີນຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "When an image is sent to a display device, each pixel is normally represented as a set of 3 numbers, representing the intensity of the red, green and blue primary colors in the output color space. Because the output color space is usually closely related to hardware with physical limitations, there is a maximum permitted value for the [R,G,B] channels, representing the maximum available intensity for that color space. Similarly, there is also a minimum value below which pixel values will be mapped to zero. When we try to convert from a larger color space to the final output color space, any values exceeding this maximum will be clamped to the maximum value, and any values below the minimum will be clamped to zero. This process is called \"clipping\" and it will lead to lost detail, or \"incorrect\" colors for any pixels with clipped channels.\n"
msgstr "ເມື່ອພາບຖືກສົ່ງໄປຍັງອຸປະກອນສະແດງຜົນ, ແຕ່ລະພິກເຊວໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະຖືກແທນດ້ວຍຊຸດຕົວເລກ 3 ຄ່າ, ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມເຂັ້ມຂອງສີຫຼັກ ແດງ, ຂຽວ ແລະ ຟ້າ ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາອອກ. ເນື່ອງຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາອອກມັກຈະມີຄວາມກ່ຽວພັນກັບຮາດແວທີ່ມີຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທາງກາຍະພາບ, ຈຶ່ງມີຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບຊ່ອງສັນຍານ [R,G,B], ເຊິ່ງສະແດງເຖິງຄວາມເຂັ້ມສູງສຸດທີ່ມີໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີນັ້ນ. ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ກໍມີຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດເຊິ່ງຄ່າພິກເຊວທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່ານັ້ນຈະຖືກປ່ຽນເປັນສູນ. ເມື່ອພວກເຮົາພະຍາຍາມແປງຈາກພື້ນທີ່ສີທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າໄປເປັນພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາອອກສຸດທ້າຍ, ຄ່າໃດໆທີ່ເກີນຄ່າສູງສຸດນີ້ຈະຖືກຕັດໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັບຄ່າສູງສຸດ, ແລະ ຄ່າໃດໆທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດຈະຖືກຕັດໃຫ້ເປັນສູນ. ຂະບວນການນີ້ເອີ້ນວ່າ \"clipping\" ແລະ ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສູນເສຍລາຍລະອຽດ ຫຼື ໄດ້ສີທີ່ \"ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ\" ສຳລັບພິກເຊວໃດໆທີ່ມີຊ່ອງສັນຍານທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click the ![clipping warning](./clipping/clipping-icon.png#icon) icon to enable the clipping warning.\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນ ![clipping warning](./clipping/clipping-icon.png#icon) ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ຄຳເຕືອນສ່ວນເກີນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two ways in which a pixel might become clipped when represented in the output color space.\n"
msgstr "ມີສອງວິທີທີ່ພິກເຊວອາດຈະກາຍເປັນສ່ວນເກີນ (clipped) ເມື່ອຖືກສະແດງໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາອອກ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_luminance clipping_: This can occur when a pixel is too bright to be represented in the output color space. The pixel luminance is calculated as a weighted average of the [R,G,B] channels. If this average exceeds the maximum allowed value, it is an indication of over-exposure. The overall luminance of a pixel can also be too dark to be represented by an [R,G,B] value in the output color space, in which case it will simply be shown as black. We normally deal with luminance clipping by carefully adjusting tone mappings and exposure levels.\n"
msgstr "_ສ່ວນເກີນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ (luminance clipping)_: ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໄດ້ເມື່ອພິກເຊວສະຫວ່າງເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາອອກ. ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງພິກເຊວແມ່ນຖືກຄິດໄລ່ເປັນຄ່າສະເລ່ຍຖ່ວງນ້ຳໜັກຂອງຊ່ອງສັນຍານ [R,G,B]. ຖ້າຄ່າສະເລ່ຍນີ້ເກີນຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ, ມັນຄືສັນຍານຂອງການໄດ້ຮັບແສງຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ (over-exposure). ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍລວມຂອງພິກເຊວກໍອາດຈະມືດເກີນໄປທີ່ຈະແທນດ້ວຍຄ່າ [R,G,B] ໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາອອກ, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນີ້ມັນຈະສະແດງເປັນສີດຳ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ພວກເຮົາຈະຈັດການກັບສ່ວນເກີນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍການປັບການຈັບຄູ່ໂທນສີ (tone mappings) ແລະ ລະດັບການຮັບແສງຢ່າງລະມັດລະວັງ.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_gamut clipping_: The output color space defines a set of primary colors that, mixed together in certain ratios, produce the final output color. However, there are only so many colors that can be produced by mixing together a combination of those three primary colors. Highly saturated colors in particular can be difficult to represent, especially for pixels that are very bright or very dark. If there is no set of positive [R,G,B] values that can represent a given color at a given level of brightness, we say that the color is \"out of gamut\", and we need to settle for another color instead that _can_ be represented by permitted [R,G,B] values within the color space. We can handle gamut clipping by being careful not to over-saturate colors in the highlights and shadows, and possibly by using some color grading/color mapping techniques.\n"
msgstr "_ສ່ວນເກີນຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut clipping)_: ພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາອອກກຳນົດຊຸດສີຫຼັກທີ່ເມື່ອປະສົມກັນໃນສັດສ່ວນໃດໜຶ່ງແລ້ວ ຈະສ້າງເປັນສີຂາອອກສຸດທ້າຍ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ມີສີພຽງຈຳນວນໜຶ່ງເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ຈາກການປະສົມສີຫຼັກທັງສາມນີ້. ໂດຍສະເພາະສີທີ່ມີຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວສູງອາດຈະສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ຍາກ, ໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບພິກເຊວທີ່ສະຫວ່າງຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ມືດຫຼາຍ. ຖ້າບໍ່ມີຊຸດຄ່າ [R,G,B] ທີ່ເປັນບວກທີ່ສາມາດແທນສີໃດໜຶ່ງໃນລະດັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງນັ້ນໄດ້, ພວກເຮົາຈະເອີ້ນວ່າສີນັ້ນ \"ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດ (out of gamut)\", ແລະ ພວກເຮົາຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສີອື່ນແທນທີ່ _ສາມາດ_ ສະແດງໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄ່າ [R,G,B] ທີ່ອະນຸຍາດພາຍໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີນັ້ນ. ພວກເຮົາສາມາດຈັດການກັບສ່ວນເກີນຂອບເຂດສີໄດ້ໂດຍການລະວັງບໍ່ໃຫ້ສີອີ່ມຕົວເກີນໄປໃນສ່ວນໄຮໄລ້ (highlights) ແລະ ເງົາ (shadows), ແລະ ອາດຈະໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກການເກຣດສີ/ການຈັບຄູ່ສີຊ່ວຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The \"clipping warning\" module is used to highlight those pixels that cannot be accurately represented in the output color space, either due to luminance or gamut clipping. Prior to darktable 3.4, the clipping highlighted any pixels that exceeded the maximum allowed value on any of the [R,G,B] channels, or that had been completely crushed to black. From darktable 3.4 onwards, the clipping warning indicator has some additional modes to help you to differentiate between luminance and gamut clipping, so that you can make better decisions about how to address any issues.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ \"clipping warning\" ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອເນັ້ນພິກເຊວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດສະແດງຜົນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາອອກ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນຍ້ອນສ່ວນເກີນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ຫຼື ສ່ວນເກີນຂອບເຂດສີ. ກ່ອນ darktable 3.4, ການເຕືອນຈະເນັ້ນພິກເຊວໃດໆທີ່ເກີນຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃນຊ່ອງສັນຍານ [R,G,B] ໃດໜຶ່ງ, ຫຼື ທີ່ຖືກບີບຈົນກາຍເປັນສີດຳສະນິດ. ຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 3.4 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄຳເຕືອນສ່ວນເກີນມີໂໝດເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຈົ້າແຍກແຍະລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນເກີນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ສ່ວນເກີນຂອບເຂດສີ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັດສິນໃຈໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນກ່ຽວກັບວິທີແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the clipping warning runs at the end of the preview pixelpipe, it receives data in display color space then converts it to histogram color space. If you are using a display color space that is not \"well behaved\" (this is common for a device profile), then colors that are outside of the gamut of the display profile will clip or distort.\n"
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກຄຳເຕືອນສ່ວນເກີນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ຕອນທ້າຍຂອງຂະບວນການປະມວນຜົນ (pixelpipe) ຕົວຢ່າງ, ມັນຈະໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນ ແລ້ວແປງເປັນພື້ນທີ່ສີຮິສໂຕແກຣມ. ຖ້າເຈົ້າໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ສີຈໍສະແດງຜົນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ມາດຕະຖານ (ເຊິ່ງພົບເລື້ອຍໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ອຸປະກອນ), ສີທີ່ຢູ່ນອກຂອບເຂດຂອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈໍສະແດງຜົນຈະເກີດການເກີນຂອບເຂດ (clip) ຫຼື ຜິດພ້ຽນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The clipping warning module, described here, warns you about clipping caused by image processing and the limitations of the output color space. It should not be confused with the following similar tools:\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນຄຳເຕືອນສ່ວນເກີນທີ່ອະທິບາຍຢູ່ນີ້ ຈະເຕືອນເຈົ້າກ່ຽວກັບສ່ວນເກີນທີ່ເກີດຈາກການປະມວນຜົນພາບ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສີຂາອອກ. ມັນບໍ່ຄວນຖືກສັບສົນກັບເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [raw overexposed warning](./raw-overexposed.md) indicates where pixels in the original raw file are clipped due to physical limitations in the dynamic range of the camera sensor. This module highlights information that was permanently lost at the point of image capture, and you need to deal with it as best you can using highlight recovery techniques.\n"
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນ [raw overexposed warning](./raw-overexposed.md) ບົ່ງບອກເຖິງຈຸດທີ່ພິກເຊວໃນໄຟລ໌ raw ຕົ້ນສະບັບເກີດສ່ວນເກີນຍ້ອນຂໍ້ຈຳກັດທາງກາຍະພາບຂອງຊ່ວງການຮັບແສງ (dynamic range) ຂອງເຊັນເຊີກ້ອງ. ໂມດູນນີ້ຈະເນັ້ນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສູນເສຍໄປຢ່າງຖາວອນໃນຕອນທີ່ຖ່າຍພາບ, ແລະ ເຈົ້າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຈັດການກັບມັນໃຫ້ດີທີ່ສຸດໂດຍໃຊ້ເຕັກນິກການກູ້ຄືນໄຮໄລ້ (highlight recovery).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [gamut check](./gamut.md) module also provides information about clipping arising from image processing. It is based on the external littleCMS library, and is more or less equivalent to the _full gamut_ mode in the clipping warning module. The downsides of the gamut check module are that it doesn't allow you to distinguish between clipping caused by luminance and gamut mapping, and it is much slower than the clipping warning indicator.\n"
msgstr "ໂມດູນ [gamut check](./gamut.md) ກໍໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບສ່ວນເກີນທີ່ເກີດຈາກການປະມວນຜົນພາບເຊັ່ນກັນ. ມັນອີງໃສ່ໄລບຣາຣີພາຍນອກ littleCMS, ແລະ ມີຄວາມໃກ້ຄຽງກັບໂໝດ _full gamut_ ໃນໂມດູນຄຳເຕືອນສ່ວນເກີນ. ຂໍ້ເສຍຂອງໂມດູນ gamut check ແມ່ນມັນບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຈົ້າແຍກແຍະລະຫວ່າງສ່ວນເກີນທີ່ເກີດຈາກຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ການຈັບຄູ່ຂອບເຂດສີ, ແລະ ມັນເຮັດວຽກຊ້າກວ່າຕົວຊີ້ບອກຄຳເຕືອນສ່ວນເກີນຫຼາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Right-click on the clipping icon to show the following options:\n"
msgstr "ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໄອຄອນສ່ວນເກີນເພື່ອສະແດງຕົວເລືອກດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"clipping preview mode\n"
": Choose the type of clipping that you want to highlight:\n"
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງສ່ວນເກີນ (clipping preview mode)\n"
": ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງສ່ວນເກີນທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເນັ້ນ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - _any RGB channel_: Provides an over-clipping indication if any one of the three [R,G,B] channels exceeds the maximum permitted value for the histogram color space, or an under-clipping indication if the three [R,G,B] channels are too dark and are all forced to black. This was the default mode prior to darktable version 3.4.\n"
": - _luminance only_: Indicates any pixels that are clipped because their luminance falls outside of the range set in the \"upper threshold\" and \"lower threshold\" sliders. If this happens, it generally means that tone mapping or exposure settings have been poorly set\n"
": - _saturation only_: Indicates where over-saturated colors have pushed one or more of the [R,G,B] channels towards a value outside the permitted range of the histogram color space, even though the overall luminance of the pixel may lie within acceptable limits. This means that the pixel's color is impossible to represent in the histogram color space, and can arise from poorly set gamut mapping or saturation settings,\n"
": - _full gamut_: Shows a combination of the three previous options. This is the default mode from darktable 3.4 onwards, and it gives the most complete indication of potentially problematic pixels.\n"
msgstr ""
": - _any RGB channel_: ໃຫ້ການບົ່ງບອກສ່ວນເກີນຂາເທິງ (over-clipping) ຖ້າຊ່ອງໃດໜຶ່ງໃນ [R,G,B] ເກີນຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດສຳລັບພື້ນທີ່ສີຮິສໂຕແກຣມ, ຫຼື ບົ່ງບອກສ່ວນເກີນຂາລຸ່ມ (under-clipping) ຖ້າທັງສາມຊ່ອງມືດເກີນໄປ ແລະ ຖືກບີບໃຫ້ເປັນສີດຳ. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກ່ອນ darktable ເວີຊັນ 3.4.\n"
": - _luminance only_: ບົ່ງບອກພິກເຊວໃດໆທີ່ເກີນຂອບເຂດຍ້ອນຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນແຖບເລື່ອນ \"upper threshold\" ແລະ \"lower threshold\". ຖ້າສິ່ງນີ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການຈັບຄູ່ໂທນສີ ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຮັບແສງຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍ່ດີ.\n"
": - _saturation only_: ບົ່ງບອກຈຸດທີ່ສີອີ່ມຕົວເກີນໄປໄດ້ດັນຊ່ອງສັນຍານ [R,G,B] ໃດໜຶ່ງໃຫ້ຢູ່ນອກຊ່ວງທີ່ອະນຸຍາດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສີຮິສໂຕແກຣມ, ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຄວາມສະຫວ່າງໂດຍລວມຂອງພິກເຊວອາດຈະຢູ່ໃນເກນທີ່ຍອມຮັບໄດ້. ນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສີຂອງພິກເຊວນັ້ນເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້ທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນພື້ນທີ່ສີຮິສໂຕແກຣມ, ແລະ ອາດເກີດຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຈັບຄູ່ຂອບເຂດສີ ຫຼື ຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວທີ່ບໍ່ດີ.\n"
": - _full gamut_: ສະແດງການລວມກັນຂອງສາມຕົວເລືອກກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ນີ້ແມ່ນໂໝດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຕັ້ງແຕ່ darktable 3.4 ເປັນຕົ້ນມາ, ແລະ ມັນໃຫ້ການບົ່ງບອກທີ່ສົມບູນທີ່ສຸດກ່ຽວກັບພິກເຊວທີ່ອາດມີບັນຫາ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"color scheme\n"
": By default, the indicator marks pixels with _red_ where the upper threshold is exceeded (over-clipping) and with _blue_ where the lower threshold is breached (under-clipping). This color scheme can be changed to _black & white_ or _purple & green_ for \"over & under\" indicators, which may be useful to improve visibility for some images.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບແບບສີ (color scheme)\n"
": ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຕົວຊີ້ບອກຈະໝາຍພິກເຊວດ້ວຍສີ _ແດງ_ ບ່ອນທີ່ເກີນເກນຂາເທິງ (over-clipping) ແລະ ດ້ວຍສີ _ຟ້າ_ ບ່ອນທີ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າເກນຂາລຸ່ມ (under-clipping). ຮູບແບບສີນີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນເປັນ _ຂາວດຳ_ ຫຼື _ມ່ວງຂຽວ_ ສຳລັບຕົວຊີ້ບອກ \"over & under\", ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເບິ່ງໃຫ້ຊັດເຈນຂຶ້ນໃນບາງພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lower threshold\n"
": Expressed in EV relative to the white point (which is nominally EV = 0). If the [R,G,B] channels all fall below this value, an under-clipping indicator is shown warning that the pixel may be end up being crushed to black. Use the following reference to set this threshold, depending on your intended output medium:\n"
msgstr ""
"ເກນຂາລຸ່ມ (lower threshold)\n"
": ສະແດງເປັນຄ່າ EV ທຽບກັບຈຸດສີຂາວ (ເຊິ່ງໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນ EV = 0). ຖ້າຊ່ອງສັນຍານ [R,G,B] ທັງໝົດຕ່ຳກວ່າຄ່ານີ້, ຕົວຊີ້ບອກສ່ວນເກີນຂາລຸ່ມຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອເຕືອນວ່າພິກເຊວນັ້ນອາດຈະຖືກບີບໃຫ້ເປັນສີດຳ. ໃຊ້ຄ່າອ້າງອີງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອຕັ້ງເກນ, ຂຶ້ນກັບສື່ຂາອອກທີ່ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການ:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
": - _8-bit sRGB_ clips blacks at --12.69 EV\n"
": - _8-bit Adobe RGB_ clips blacks at --19.79 EV\n"
": - _16-bit sRGB_ clips blacks at --20.69 EV\n"
": - _fine art matte prints_ typically produce black at --5.30 EV\n"
": - _color glossy prints_ typically produce black at --8.00 EV\n"
": - _black & white glossy prints_ typically produce black at --9.00 EV\n"
msgstr ""
": - _8-bit sRGB_ ຕັດສີດຳທີ່ --12.69 EV\n"
": - _8-bit Adobe RGB_ ຕັດສີດຳທີ່ --19.79 EV\n"
": - _16-bit sRGB_ ຕັດສີດຳທີ່ --20.69 EV\n"
": - _fine art matte prints_ (ການພິມແບບດ້ານ) ປົກກະຕິໃຫ້ສີດຳທີ່ --5.30 EV\n"
": - _color glossy prints_ (ການພິມສີແບບເງົາ) ປົກກະຕິໃຫ້ສີດຳທີ່ --8.00 EV\n"
": - _black & white glossy prints_ (ການພິມຂາວດຳແບບເງົາ) ປົກກະຕິໃຫ້ສີດຳທີ່ --9.00 EV\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"upper threshold\n"
": How close a pixel should be to the upper limit before being flagged by the clipping warning, expressed as a percentage (default 98%). In the case of gamut checks, this controls how close the saturation of the pixel is allowed to get to the limits of the color space's gamut before a clipping indication is flagged.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເກນຂາເທິງ (upper threshold)\n"
": ພິກເຊວຄວນເຂົ້າໃກ້ຂີດຈຳກັດສູງສຸດຫຼາຍປານໃດກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກໝາຍໂດຍຄຳເຕືອນສ່ວນເກີນ, ສະແດງເປັນເປີເຊັນ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ 98%). ໃນກໍລະນີຂອງການກວດສອບຂອບເຂດສີ (gamut checks), ອັນນີ້ຈະຄວບຄຸມວ່າຄວາມອີ່ມຕົວຂອງພິກເຊວເຂົ້າໃກ້ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງຂອບເຂດສີຂອງພື້ນທີ່ສີນັ້ນຫຼາຍປານໃດ ກ່ອນທີ່ຕົວຊີ້ບອກສ່ວນເກີນຈະຖືກໝາຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/darkroom/clipping.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note**: This clipping indication may not be optimal if you want to inspect _where_ data is clipped, in which case use the [highlight reconstruction clipping mask](../../processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md#common-controls).\n"
msgstr "**ໝາຍເຫດ**: ການບົ່ງບອກສ່ວນເກີນນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ດີທີ່ສຸດຖ້າເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການກວດສອບວ່າຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຕັດຢູ່ _ບ່ອນໃດ_, ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ [highlight reconstruction clipping mask](../../processing-modules/highlight-reconstruction.md#common-controls) ແທນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "locations"
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່ຕ່າງໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create areas or locations and organize them as hierarchical tags. \n"
msgstr "ສ້າງເຂດພື້ນທີ່ ຫຼື ສະຖານທີ່ ແລະ ຈັດລະບຽບພວກມັນເປັນແທັກແບບລຳດັບຊັ້ນ. \n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A location is shown as a shape on the map when selected. Initially each location is represented as a square or circle and can be changed to a rectangle or ellipse by adjusting the shape's width and/or height.\n"
msgstr "ສະຖານທີ່ທີ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງເປັນຮູບຊົງໃນແຜນທີ່ ເຊັ່ນ: ຮູບວົງມົນ ຫຼື ສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A location can also be created from an OpenStreetMap region (city/country) polygon. To achieve this, first make sure the _max polygon points_ parameter is large enough (some country polygons use more than 150,000 points). Then select the desired location in the [find location](./find-location.md) module. When the corresponding region shape is displayed, a polygon symbol becomes available in the \"shape\" control (see below). Select it to create the new location.\n"
msgstr "ສາມາດສ້າງສະຖານທີ່ຈາກຂອບເຂດເມືອງ ຫຼື ປະເທດໃນ OpenStreetMap ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each location is stored as tag entry under the geotagging collection in the [collections](../shared/collections.md) module. The pipe “|” character can be used to insert a new level (a group of locations).\n"
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະສະຖານທີ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ເປັນລາຍການແທັກພາຍໃຕ້ການຮວບຮວມ geotagging ໃນໂມດູນ [ການຮວບຮວມ "
"(collections)](../shared/collections.md). ເຄື່ອງໝາຍທໍ່ “|” ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອແຊກລະດັບໃໝ່ (ກຸ່"
"ມຂອງສະຖານທີ່).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"shape\n"
": Select the circle or rectangle symbol to choose the default shape for new locations. A polygon symbol is available when a shape is displayed by the [find location](./find-location.md) module.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຊົງ (shape)\n"
": ເລືອກຮູບຊົງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່ (ວົງມົນ ຫຼື ສີ່ຫຼ່ຽມ).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"new location / new sub-location\n"
": When no location is selected you can use the _new location_ button to create a location at root level. When a location is selected use the _new sub-location_ button to create a sub-location within the selected location.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່ / ສະຖານທີ່ຍ່ອຍໃໝ່\n"
": ໃຊ້ສ້າງສະຖານທີ່ໃໝ່ໃນລະດັບຫຼັກ ຫຼື ລະດັບຍ່ອຍ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show all\n"
": Show or hide all locations that lie within the visible area of the current map.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງທັງໝົດ\n"
": ສະແດງ ຫຼື ເຊື່ອງທຸກສະຖານທີ່ໃນບໍລິເວນທີ່ເຫັນຢູ່ເທິງແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "actions on the locations list"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການໃນລາຍຊື່ສະຖານທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"click\n"
": Select or de-select a location. If the location is not currently visible on the map, the map is automatically centered on that location.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກ\n"
": ເລືອກ ຫຼື ບໍ່ເລືອກສະຖານທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ctrl+click\n"
": Edit the name of the location. Press Enter to save changes or Esc to close the editing window without saving.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+ຄລິກ\n"
": ແກ້ໄຂຊື່ສະຖານທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"right-click\n"
": Open a sub-menu which allows you to:\n"
": - Edit the name of the location.\n"
": - Delete the location.\n"
": - Update the filmstrip -- the filmstrip will be populated with all images in the selected location.\n"
": - Switch to the lighttable view and show a collection that contains all images in the selected location.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກຂວາ\n"
": ເປີດເມນູຍ່ອຍເພື່ອ: ແກ້ໄຂຊື່, ລົບ, ອັບເດດຮູບໃນແຖບຮູບ (filmstrip) ຫຼື ສະຫຼັບໄປເບິ່ງໃນ lighttable.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "actions on locations in the map"
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການກັບສະຖານທີ່ໃນແຜນທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "_Note: The following actions have no effect on polygon locations._\n"
msgstr "_ໝາຍເຫດ: ການດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບສະຖານທີ່ແບບ polygon._\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"click and drag\n"
": Move the location shape to a new position on the map.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກແລ້ວລາກ\n"
": ຍ້າຍຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຮູບຊົງສະຖານທີ່ໃນແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ctrl+click or Ctrl+Shift+click\n"
": Move an image or a group of images and place them inside a location shape.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+ຄລິກ ຫຼື Ctrl+Shift+ຄລິກ\n"
": ຍ້າຍຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ກຸ່ມຮູບພາບໄປໄວ້ໃນຮູບຊົງສະຖານທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mouse scroll\n"
": When inside a location shape (but not over an image), increase or decrease the size of that shape.\n"
": When hovering over an image, cycle through the thumbnails of images located at that position on the map.\n"
": When outside a location shape (and not over an image) zoom the map in or out.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌\n"
": ປັບຂະໜາດຮູບຊົງ, ເລື່ອນເບິ່ງຮູບໃນຕຳແໜ່ງນັ້ນ ຫຼື ຊູມແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Shift+scroll\n"
": Increase or decrease the width of the location shape.\n"
msgstr ""
"Shift+ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌\n"
": ປັບຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຮູບຊົງສະຖານທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ctrl+scroll\n"
": Increase or decrease the height of the location shape.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ctrl+ເລື່ອນເມົາສ໌\n"
": ປັບຄວາມສູງຂອງຮູບຊົງສະຖານທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/locations.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"click on a location shape\n"
": Select a different location when the _show all_ checkbox is selected.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກໃສ່ຮູບຊົງສະຖານທີ່\n"
": ເລືອກສະຖານທີ່ອື່ນ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "map settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຜນທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select preferred map data from various providers. Some will provide additional layers (satellite view etc.) which you can toggle.\n"
msgstr "ເລືອກແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນແຜນທີ່ຈາກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕ່າງໆ. ບາງແຫ່ງມີແຜນທີ່ແບບດາວທຽມໃຫ້ເລືອກ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"map source\n"
": Choose the provider to source map information from.\n"
msgstr ""
"ແຫຼ່ງແຜນທີ່\n"
": ເລືອກຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂໍ້ມູນແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"max polygon points\n"
": The [find location](./find-location.md) module doesn't display polygons with more points than this for performance reasons. Usually a country polygon has between 50,000 and 150,000 points.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຈຸດ polygon ສູງສຸດ\n"
": ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນຈຸດເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງຊ້າ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"show OSD\n"
": Choose whether to display the OSD controls at the top-left of the center view.\n"
msgstr ""
"ສະແດງ OSD\n"
": ເລືອກວ່າຈະສະແດງປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມ OSD ຢູ່ມຸມຊ້າຍເທິງຫຼືບໍ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"filtered images\n"
": Check this box to display only the images from the current collection (those shown in the filmstrip) in the center view. Un-check the box to display all images in the current library, where those images have associated GPS data. You can also toggle this option by pressing Ctrl+S.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບທີ່ຜ່ານການຕອງ\n"
": ໝາຍເລືອກເພື່ອສະແດງສະເພາະຮູບໃນຄໍເລັກຊັນປັດຈຸບັນ. ຫາກບໍ່ເລືອກຈະສະແດງທຸກຮູບໃນຫໍສະໝຸດທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ GPS.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"max images\n"
": The maximum number of thumbnails to display on the map.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນຮູບສູງສຸດ\n"
": ຈຳນວນຮູບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນແຜນທີ່.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"group size factor\n"
": Increase or decrease the size of area that causes images to be grouped.\n"
msgstr ""
"ປັດໄຈຂະໜາດກຸ່ມ\n"
": ປັບຂະໜາດພື້ນທີ່ໃນການຈັດກຸ່ມຮູບພາບ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"min images per group\n"
": The minimum number of images that need to be placed in the same position in order to automatically create an image group for them.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຮູບຕ່ຳສຸດຕໍ່ກຸ່ມ\n"
": ຈຳນວນຮູບຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ລະບົບຈັດກຸ່ມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/map-settings.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"thumbnail display\n"
": Define what information to show on the map display\n"
": - _thumbnails_: Display image thumbnails along with a counter.\n"
": - _count_: Just display the number of images (to free space on the map). Hover over the number of images to show the corresponding thumbnail(s). A count-only marker behaves the same way as a normal image thumbnail, in terms of color coding, scrolling, drag and drop etc.\n"
": - _none_: Show nothing.\n"
": You can also cycle through these options by pressing Shift+S.\n"
msgstr ""
"ການສະແດງຮູບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ\n"
": ເລືອກຮູບແບບການສະແດງ: ຮູບຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ, ສະເພາະຕົວເລກ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສະແດງ.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/find-location.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "find location"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາສະຖານທີ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/find-location.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Search for a location on the map. You must be connected to the internet to use this feature.\n"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາສະຖານທີ່ໃນແຜນທີ່. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/find-location.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use this module, type in a place name or address, press Enter and a list of results will be shown. Click on an item in the list and the map will zoom to that location. An outline covering that location or a pin pointing at the location will be displayed.\n"
msgstr "ພິມຊື່ສະຖານທີ່ ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ ແລ້ວກົດ Enter. ເມື່ອຄລິກໃສ່ລາຍຊື່, ແຜນທີ່ຈູຊູມໄປຫາບ່ອນນັ້ນ.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/find-location.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An outline (polygon) can be used to create a user location. Check the _max polygon points_ parameter in the [map settings](./map-settings.md) module to ensure that sufficient points are available for a polygon to be displayed.\n"
msgstr "ສາມາດໃຊ້ຂອບເຂດ (polygon) ເພື່ອສ້າງສະຖານທີ່ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້.\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/module-reference/utility-modules/map/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "map"
msgstr "ແຜນທີ່"
